stringFiles[19] = new StringFile("bfnq2");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_1", "You have done well. Our friends throughout the palace are in your debt. I should like very much to introduce you to Jabba himself... once you have performed one final task.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_10", "No. Only Romo Vax knows the traitor's name - and he won't give it up until someone, meaning you, comes to help him. You see, Romo has amassed some huge gambling debts in other systems? that he'll never be able to pay. Now, Romo is in the Jundland Wastes hiding from a bounty hunter.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_11", "Romo told me that the traitor had a name and that I could learn the name if I sent someone to save his life. You see, he's amassed some enormous gambling debts in other systems, which he'll never be able to pay, and they've sent a bounty hunter to kill him. He called to me from the Jundland Wastes - where he is now hiding.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_12", "What do you want me to do?");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_13", "Go to Romo Vax and protect him from the bounty hunter. Then talk to Vax and learn everything you can about the traitor. I will contact you with further instructions then.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_14", "Not bad. That bounty hunter had no idea who he was dealing with.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_15", "Who is the traitor in Jabba's palace?");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_16", "Why was the bounty hunter after you?");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_17", "He is named Enic Yunga and he is probably somewhere near Bestine - on his way to meet his contacts.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_18", "When I was touring the casinos, his girlfriend fell in love with me. Poor girl - I had to leave her behind.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_19", "Where in Bestine?");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_2", "That sounds good. What task?");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_20", "You sure about the girl? Bib told me you gamble too much.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_21", "I don't know where in Bestine - but it's your best bet. You should go there now. I need to get back to traveling. There will certainly be more bounty hunters and thugs to plague me. Being a man in my position is no easy business. Good bye! And, again - thanks for saving me.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_22", "You call me a liar?! LISTEN: She was young, she was beautiful, and she was in love with me, and she was a girl, and she wanted me because I'm a big winner at the casino and her boyfriend COULDN'T HANDLE IT! Good Bye!");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_23", "No! Hutt enforcer! No! You DIE! You DIE!");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_24", "The traitor should have a data disc on him. This will reveal the location of his contacts to you.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_26", "Encryption broken. That was easy! Here you go. I hope to see you again sometime.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_27", "Good. Now I want to know who this traitor was planning to meet. Examine the data disc and find the coordinates for his rendezvous. Go there and eliminate his contacts.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_28", "Search these traitors for their orders. I want you to bring their official orders back to me at the palace as soon as you find them.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_29", "Good work! Jabba will be very pleased. Speaking of which - I wish to give you this letter of introduction. I am too busy to introduce you to Jabba myself... but he will be expecting you, and he will be eager to speak with you.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_3", "Why not introduce me to Jabba now?");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_4", "Someone is out to betray Jabba. Our good friend Romo Vax has sent word of a traitor in our midst.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_5", "Because if you complete this next task properly, I assure you - Jabba will be most impressed. You see - your job is to root out a traitor... one who operates right under our noses. Our good friend Romo Vax has told me that the traitor exists - but nothing else.");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_6", "Where do I find Romo Vax?");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_7", "Do you know who the traitor is?");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_8", "What did Vax tell you about the traitor?");
stringFiles[19].addEntry("bnq2_9", "You will find Romo Vax hiding in the Jundland Wastes. Seems that he has run up some bad debts on other systems and is being pursued by a bounty hunter.");

stringFiles[20] = new StringFile("bib_newbie_quest_1");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib1", "My agents tell me that you're good.  I'm looking for someone who can handle some heavy work.  Do you think you can handle it?");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib10", "Fine.  Come back when you are prepared to show Jabba your skills.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib11", "I assume you're ready to go to work.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib12", "Good work so far.  Now, Valarian has sent some thugs out to see if they can clean up the mess the Tuskens made.  Don't let them find our friend.  They're not welcome here.  Make sure they get the message.  Understood?");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib13", "Excellent.  Now go find our friend.  He's left me his location and I'm uploading it to your datapad.  Bring him back unharmed.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib14", "I'm very busy.  And I believe you have something to do right now.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib15", "Sorry, I meant to warn you about that last bounty hunter.  No matter, you think well on your feet.  I'm depositing some money into your account.  Relax for a while, and then come back here.  I'll have another task for you when you're ready.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib16", "Finally you've arrived.  Take us to Jabba at once, and don't let anything happen to the master.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib17", "I'll deal with those thugs.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib18", "You can count on me.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib19", "Sorry, I'll get back to work.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib2", "Absolutely.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib20", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib21", "Jabba's visitor is dead!  You have failed the master.  We are most disappointed in you.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib22", "I'm sorry.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib23", "Sorry?  You're sorry?  Leave this place now, and return only when you're ready to prove yourself.  Jabba has no time for those who can't manage a simple escort through the desert.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib3", "I want to meet Jabba the Hutt.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib4", "Good.  One of Jabba's trusted lieutenants was on his way here when he was waylaid by sandpeople.  They have destroyed his landspeeder.  Go make sure that he is ok, and deal with the Tuskens.  Do you understand?");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib5", "Those sand people are Bantha Fodder.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib6", "I'm not sure I'm up to this.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib7", "We shall see about that.  Their location is now marked on your datapad and you should have a waypoint to find the landspeeder.  Go, now, and do my bidding.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib8", "If you do your job well then I will introduce you to Jabba later.  For now, there are many things that need to be done.  Are you ready to work?");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib9", "Ok.");
stringFiles[20].addEntry("bib_24", "I don't have any work for you right now.  Come back later.");

stringFiles[21] = new StringFile("bib_newbie_quest_2");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_1", "Jabba's visitor says to give you his thanks.  You've done good work for us so far, are you ready to do some more?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_10", "Jabba likes to keep up-to-date on local shipping schedules.  Of course, shipping companies don't like to share that information.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_11", "I see.  So am I supposed to steal some shipping information?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_12", "Why does Jabba want shipping information?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_13", "He's already sold it to a man in Mos Eisley, who is waiting for it now.  So do you want the job or not?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_14", "Can I meet Jabba now?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_15", "No, Jabba is busy.  You should be busy, too.  Are you ready to work?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_16", "What's in it for me?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_17", "Jabba is generous to his friends.  Get the information and you will be well paid.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_18", "Ok, I'll do it.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_19", "Will you introduce me to Jabba if I do this for you?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_2", "So you've come back.  Are you ready for another mission now?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_20", "I don't have time to do this right now.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_21", "No, Jabba is not to be bothered.  But I will let you into the Audience chamber if you are successful.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_22", "Ok, it's a deal.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_23", "What's in the Audience Chamber?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_24", "I can't help you with this right now.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_25", "Jabba's Audience chamber is where the Palace's most most important guests are entertained.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_26", "Okay, I'll do it.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_27", "I can't help you with this right now.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_28", "What are you doing wasting time?  Jabba wants that shipping information.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_29", "I changed my mind.  I don't have time to do this mission.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_3", "Yes, I am ready.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_30", "On my way!");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_31", "Good job!  Deliver those discs to Sirad Far in the Mos Eisley Cantina.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_32", "I thought I told you to take those disks to Sirad Far?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_33", "Oh, right.  On my way.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_34", "I couldn't find him.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_35", "You can find him at the Mos Eisley Cantina.  Take the discs to him now!");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_36", "Sirad Far, you're under arrest! Come with us.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_37", "Not again.  I won't go! Somebody help me, please!");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_38", "Bib Fortuna sent you?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_39", "Yes.  Are you the contact?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_4", "No, not right now.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_40", "Do I know you?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_41", "Yes.  He told me he'd be sending someone.  You have to find those thugs.  I'm going to add a waypoint to your datapad.  This was the last place they were seen.  Kill them and take the shipping information Bib needs!");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_42", "Back off with the attitude.  I'm a friend.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_43", "I'll get them.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_44", "You're awfully friendly for someone I don't know.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_45", "If that's the way you want to be then talk to someone else.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_46", "Heh, I know better than to think Bib would send someone incompetent.  Good luck. ");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_47", "Ah, you have returned with my shipping information.  Good job.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_48", "I'll let the guards know to allow you into the main Audience chamber.  Enjoy the entertainment, but don't bother Jabba if you know what is good for you. Speak to Ephant Mon if you need more things to do.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_49", "Can I enter the Audience chamber now?");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_5", "Good.  Our contact at Notsub shipping has informed me that the stolen documents he delivers to us on a regular basis were stolen by Valarian's thugs.  Go talk to him and find out where the thugs went.  I want that information back in my hands!  Our contact will meet you at the location I've marked on your datapad.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_6", "Ok, on my way.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_7", "I don't have time for that now.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_8", "Come see me when you're ready to work.");
stringFiles[21].addEntry("bfnq2_9", "What's the mission?");

stringFiles[22] = new StringFile("bib_newbie_quest_3");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq31", "You have done well. Our friends throughout the palace are in your debt. I should like very much to introduce you to Jabba himself... once you have performed one final task.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq310", "No. Only Romo Vax knows the traitor's name - and he won't give it up until someone, meaning you, comes to help him. You see, Romo has amassed some huge gambling debts in other systems... that he'll never be able to pay. Now, Romo is in the Jundland Wastes hiding from a bounty hunter.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq311", "Romo told me that the traitor had a name... and that I could learn the name if I sent someone to save his life. You see, he's amassed some enormous gambling debts in other systems, which he'll never be able to pay, and they've sent a bounty hunter to kill him. He called to me from the Jundland Wastes - where he is now hiding.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq312", "What do you want me to do?");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq313", "Go to Romo Vax and protect him from the bounty hunter. Then talk to Vax and learn everything you can about the traitor. I will contact you with further instructions then.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq314", "Not bad. That bounty hunter had no idea who he was dealing with.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq315", "Who is the traitor in Jabba's palace?");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq316", "Why was the bounty hunter after you?");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq317", "He is named Enic Yunga and he is probably somewhere near Bestine - on his way to meet his contacts.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq318", "When I was touring the casinos, his girlfriend fell in love with me. Poor girl - I had to leave her behind.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq319", "Where in Bestine?");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq32", "That sounds good. What task?");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq320", "You sure about the girl? Bib told me you gamble too much.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq321", "I don't know where in Bestine... but it's your best bet. You should go there now. I need to get back to traveling. There will certainly be more bounty hunters and thugs to plague me. Being a man in my position is no easy business. Good bye! And, again... thanks for saving me.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq322", "You call me a liar?! LISTEN: She was young, she was beautiful, and she was in love with me, and she was a girl, and she wanted me because I'm a big winner at the casino and her boyfriend COULDN'T HANDLE IT! Good Bye!");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq323", "No! Hutt enforcer! No! You DIE! You DIE!");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq324", "The traitor should have a data disc on him. Find it and take it to our friend Beek at the Third Sun Hotel in Bestine. He will decode the disc.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq325", "Bib Fortuna told me to expect you. You have the disc? Let me have it.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq326", "Encryption broken. That was easy! Here you go. I hope to see you again sometime.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq327", "Good. Now I want to know who this traitor was planning to meet. Examine the data disc and find the coordinates for his rendezvous. Go there and eliminate his contacts.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq328", "Search these traitors for their orders. I want you to bring their official orders back to me at the palace as soon as you find them.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq329", "Good work! Jabba will be very pleased. Speaking of which - I wish to give you this letter of introduction. I am too busy to introduce you to Jabba myself... but he will be expecting you, and he will be eager to speak with you.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq33", "Why not introduce me to Jabba now?");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq34", "Someone is out to betray Jabba. Our good friend Romo Vax has sent word of a traitor in our midst.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq35", "Because if you complete this next task properly, I assure you - Jabba will be most impressed. You see - your job is to root out a traitor... one who operates right under our noses. Our good friend Romo Vax has told me that the traitor exists - but nothing else.");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq36", "Where do I find Romo Vax?");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq37", "Do you know who the traitor is?");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq38", "What did Vax tell you about the traitor?");
stringFiles[22].addEntry("bfq39", "You will find Romo Vax hiding in the Jundland Wastes. Seems that he has run up some bad debts on other systems and is being pursued by a bounty hunter.");

