stringFiles[56].addEntry("you_are_right", "That's the correct answer.  Very good job.  Would you like another question?");
stringFiles[56].addEntry("you_are_weakest_link", "Ugh.  That wrong answer physically pained me.  Perhaps you could try harder?  Or is this really the best you can do?  Well, let's try again shall we?");
stringFiles[56].addEntry("you_are_wrong", "You missed that one.  I thought you'd know it.  Again?");
