stringFiles[57] = new StringFile("celebrity/lok_engineer");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("ask_about_defenses", "I wanted to ask you about the security at the pirate base.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("color_defense", "Tell me about the color spectrum.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("defenses", "Can you tell me more about this system's backdoor?");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("good_luck", "Well, take care. If you need to ask me about the defenses again, I'll be here. I hope you give those pirates what they deserve.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("go_away_dude", "Nobody. And you like your fingers attached to your hands, you'll just leave it at that.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("hate_pirates", "Why do you hate them?");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("hello", "Something I can help you with?  I don't seem to recall your face, but I'm getting a little long in the tooth.  Do we know each other?");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("i_know_jinkins", "Ah, yes! Jinkins. A brilliant engineer. I'm not sure why he sticks with those Lok Revenants, though. He could have made a fortune as a starship designer, but he's been loyal to Nym since before the Battle of Naboo. But, if Jinkins sent you, then I'm sure I know why. You want to know about the Sulfur Lake Pirates and the engineering work I did for them.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("i_will_help", "I'll deal with them.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("jinkins_sent_me", "No. But I'm a friend of Jinkin's.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("just_a_guy", "Just someone who's been stuck on Lok for too long, but you can call me Choster. It seems I've seen a thousand fringers just like you wandering this wasteland. You sure we haven't met?");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("math_defense", "Tell me about the math problems.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("more_questions", "Did you want to ask me something else?");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("other_defense", "Tell me about the Tatooine jokes.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("pirates_fired", "After I set up their systems, the Sulfur morons decided that it would be easier, and maybe safer, to kill me instead of pay me. I barely escaped their bloodthirsty veermok with my life.  I had to change my name and find an image designer to give me a new face. But I don't forget or forgive being betrayed. I came back here to hide on Lok, waiting for a chance to repay them.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("pirate_artist", "In my youth, I tried to make my fortune by forging famous holopaintings. I wasn't very successful, but I did learn basic facts about the color wheel. The color spectrum includes both primary and secondary colors, and there are opposing colors on the color wheel. Red is the opposite of green, for example. The security system's AI seemed fascinated with the color wheel, so you might do a little research on that.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("pirate_joker", "A few years back, I was stranded on Tatooine. I was befriended by a Rodian drunk who liked to tell really terrible jokes. The jokes always involved Tatooine native species, like Jawas or dewbacks. The jokes were just awful... How do you get a one-armed Jawa out of a tree? Wave. I tried to purge the jokes from my brain by transferring them to the AI. If the system asks you a joke, just pick the most obvious punch line.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("security_system", "I established the safeguards on their security system. It's not too dangerous, but does keep visitors out of the back room. Anyone who wants to enter needs to punch in a series of codes, which only the pirates know. But I did leave a backdoor: I gave the security system a rudimentary AI that will ask three questions to anyone who doesn't have the code.  ");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("sequential_numbers", "Well, at the time I was very intrigued by sequential numbers. If you're presented with a string of numbers, like 1, 3, 5, and 7, what comes next?  Nine of course.  That's just a simple odd number sequence.  The sequence the AI uses might be a bit harder, but it could also be as easy as 1-2-3.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("sulfur_lake_pirates", "The Sulfur Lake Pirates aren't the brightest pirate band on Lok. First, they named themselves after the lake where they have their hidden lair. When they realized that every other group on Lok knew where they were holed up, the Sulfur crew hired me to set up some defenses. We eventually had a... falling out. There's no band of thieves that I hate more.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("talk_engineer", "What kind of work did you do?");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("talk_pirates", "Tell me about the pirates.");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("which_defense", "If you don't have the access code, the security system is programmed to ask you three questions. The system's AI is a little... independent. It changes the questions periodically, so I don't know what they are, exactly. But, I only programmed it with knowledge in three fields: color spectrums, math, and Tatooine humor. Do you want to know more about these areas?");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("which_defense_2", "About the colors spectrum, the math problems, or the Tatooine jokes?");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("who_are_you", "I don't think so.  Who are you?");
stringFiles[57].addEntry("who_are_you_2", "Who are you?");

stringFiles[58] = new StringFile("celebrity/lok_gambler");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("begin_game", "Ok, I've picked my card.  Which one are you going to go with?");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("begin_game_five_wins", "Well, you're pretty good.  I'll play another hand if you want, or you can ask me some questions...");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("bet_how_much", "How much you wanna bet?  Can't play without credits you know.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("bet_made_10", "I'll bet 10 credits.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("bet_made_5", "I'll bet 5 credits.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("bet_made_50", "I'll bet 50 credits.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("bounty_hunter", "Bounty Hunter.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("explain_game", "We'll play Desert Draw. The game is simple. Just six cards. I pick one of mine and hold it behind my back, then you pick one of yours and then we compare them to see who wins. Simple, eh?");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("explain_rules", "We each have three cards. A Bounty Hunter, the Sarlacc, and a Thermal Detonator.  I pick one, you pick one, then we compare.  Bounty Hunter beats a Thermal Detonator. Thermal Detonator beats a Sarlacc, and Sarlacc beats the Bounty Hunter. It's really just that simple. Wanna try a hand?");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("games_first", "I won't say anything until we've played some cards.  You ready?");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("game_description", "It's called Desert Draw.  It's really simple.  We each have three cards, we both pick a card and show them at the same time. The winner gets the credits.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("game_rules", "How do we know who wins?");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("good_luck", "Good luck.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("hard_drive_loc", "Well, once you get inside, you'll find four corridors leading from the central room. The computer room is to the west, I think.  Somewhere in there you'll find your memory module.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("hard_drive_where", "Where's the memory module?");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("imggcu_loc", "Heh, you know about those, eh?  Unfortunately, I don't know where they store 'em. But, if the Imperials are getting ready to ship the IMGGCUs off of Lok, the explosives are probably stored in a locker or crate, awaiting transport. You'll have to look around a bit, I'm sure.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("imggcu_where", "Where are the IMGGCUs?");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("lab_info", "The lab, eh?  Yeah, I know about it.  It's pretty well-guarded. Rather than rely on General Otto and his goons, the Imperials in charge of the lab hired mercenaries to protect it. They're all blood thirsty and will shoot on sight. The scientists shouldn't give you too much trouble, but there might be other dangers...");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("lab_stuff", "From what I hear, the lab is a secret weapons project. The scientists there are researching high-end explosives. Really dangerous stuff. Blow you outta your boots, or knock a building offa its foundation. I'm sure that's why Nym wants into the lab. It's incredibly well-guarded. Even a bunch of storm commandoes couldn't bust in, I'd wager. Aside from the dangerous mercs that are crawling all over the base, the lab is patrolled by droidekas. ");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("leaving", "I'll be going now.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("no_games", "No, I don't want to play.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("no_thanks", "No thanks.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("nym_rules", "I like Nym. He's helped me out of a few scrapes over the years. He even bought up all my markers in the galaxy. Now, I'm in his pocket, but it's better than being dead.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("nym_sent_you", "I've been expecting you. Nym was supposed to send someone to meet me days ago. But, before I give you any information, let's play a game.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("other_dangers", "What other dangers?");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("other_dangers_info", "Well, I hear they're doing some other, illegal experiments in that base. Creating monsters that will rip your arms off and beat you to death with them. Or so the rumors go.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("play_again", "Let's play again.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("play_a_game", "Sure, let's play.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("play_game", "Interested in wagering a little cash?  Maybe making some money?  I have a game that's perfect. Wanna hear about it?");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("sarlacc", "Sarlacc.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("sure", "Let's play.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("sure_lets_play", "Ok, I'm game.  Let's do it.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("talk_nym", "Tell me about Nym.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("tell_me_more", "Tell me about the Imperial Lab.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("tell_me_something", "What can you tell me right now?");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("thermal_detonator", "Thermal Detonator.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("tie", "We both picked the same card. It's a tie.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("too_bad", "That's too bad.  You might have made some money.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("what_game", "Tell me about the game.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("you_lose_bh", "My Sarlacc eats your Bounty Hunter!  You lose.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("you_lose_s", "My Thermal Detonator blows up your Sarlacc!  I win!  You lose.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("you_lose_td", "My Bounty Hunter disarms the Thermal Detonator.  You lose!");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("you_win_bh", "Your Bounty Hunter disarms my Thermal Detonator.  Stang!");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("you_win_s", "Stang! Your Sarlacc swallows my Bounty Hunter.  You win.");
stringFiles[58].addEntry("you_win_td", "Your Thermal Detonator blows up my Sarlacc.  You win.");

stringFiles[59] = new StringFile("celebrity/lok_hacker");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("bad_joke", "No such thing?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("brown", "It's brown!  Hah! I knew that one.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("cant_solve", "I can't answer these riddles.  Who built this thing? Can you help me answer these questions?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("codec", "Let's do the network reset.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("codec_2", "Ok, let's reset the network.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("color_codes", "It says, On a color wheel, this color is the opposite of blue...  What does that mean?  What's a color wheel?  And what's the opposite of blue?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("defender", "Let's break the defender chip.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("defender_2", "Let's deal with the defender chip.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("doors_open", "I've already sliced the doors open.  Don't you remember helping me?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("explain", "Great. I need to reroute the access commands, reset the security network, and break the defender chip. But I have to answer one question before I can complete each task. I can give you the questions in any order.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("faulk", "My name is Faulk. I was hired by Borvo the Hutt on Naboo to gather information on the Sulfur Lake Pirates. He's convinced the pirates have hijacked some of his weapons shipments. I've been hiding out in this cave for weeks, waiting for a chance to slice into their network and grab all the data I can find. All this commotion has given me the opening I need, but I can't get past the final safeguards!");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("going_away", "You're too upset about this. I'm leaving.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("go_man_go", "Well don't waste time!  Get in there!");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("hacking", "I'm trying to slice through the pirates' security system. The system itself is really basic, but the final safeguard includes three questions that I need to answer. The questions don't have anything to do with the pirates or computers. I'm totally lost.  ");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("helpful", "Sure.  What are the questions?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("help_me_hack", "Aargh!  Can you help me with this thing?  I've found a back door to this security system, but the AI program keeps asking me these stupid questions! Can you lend me your brain?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("jerk", "Fine!  Who needs ya?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("joke", "What do you call a womprat that can lift a bantha?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("math_problem", "It says, Finish this number pair sequence... 1-2, 3-6, 4-24, 5-120, 6-?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("nine", "It's nine.  I'm sure of it.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("not_funny", "That's not even funny!");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("orange", "It's orange. I'm sure of it.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("punchline", "Sir!");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("purple", "I'm pretty sure it's purple.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("rewire", "Let's reroute the access commands.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("rewire_2", "Now let's reroute the access commands.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("right", "Oh.  Right.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("right_answer", "That's it!  Good thing you know your math.  All right, what now?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("right_color", "Great!  You must have studied art or something.  I'd have never gotten that.  Now what?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("right_joke", "Ugh...that's terrible.  What kind of...nevermind.  Let's do the next one.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("seven_twenty", "It's multiplying. 720.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("success", "That did it!  It's open!");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("two_twenty", "Uh...220.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("what_are_you_doing", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("what_do_you_need", "Tell me what you need.");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("who_are_you", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("wrong_answer", "I don't think so...");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("wrong_color", "Apparently that wasn't it...");
stringFiles[59].addEntry("wrong_joke", "To get to the other side!");

stringFiles[60] = new StringFile("celebrity/luke_skywalker");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_1", "There's something familiar about your face...");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_10", "Mostly it just means people trying to kill me.  I don't think I like infamous very much.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_11", "Almost nothing surprises me anymore.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_2", "Are you sure?  You seem awfully familiar.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_3", "I might be.  Who's asking?");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_4", "What did they tell you?  That I'm a hero?  It's been a little overblown, but yeah, I was there at the Battle of Yavin.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_5", "Famous?  I don't see how I could be famous.  Infamous maybe.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_6", "I'm sure I'll remember it sooner or later.  Stick around and I'll let you know.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_7", "Yeah, maybe that's it.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_8", "There was a lot more to it than just me.  Lots of my friends died that day.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("npc_9", "Thanks.  I appreciate it.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("player_1", "Me?  No, I'm not from around here.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("player_10", "You'd be surprised...");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("player_2", "Are you Luke Skywalker?");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("player_3", "Maybe, but I don't think we've met before.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("player_4", "You've confused me with someone else.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("player_5", "I have some friends in the Alliance...");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("player_6", "You're famous.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("player_7", "I hear you took out the Death Star personally.");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("player_8", "It's an honor, sir...");
stringFiles[60].addEntry("player_9", "Well, that's better than being famous.");

stringFiles[61] = new StringFile("celebrity/mara_jade");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_1", "I've got things to do, so if you want to talk make it quick.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_10", "Not unless you keep it up.  Get out of my sight and live a while longer.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_11", "I don't generally kill dumb animals, but you're making it difficult to keep that rule.  No more talking.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_2", "My name is Mara Jade.  That is all you need to know.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_3", "I'm just fine on my own.  Don't you have anything better to do than bother me?");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_4", "Unless you weren't planning to live long I suggest you knock off the questions.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_5", "I recommend finding something else to do then.  It would be safer for you.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_6", "It's not your concern.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_7", "Sorry, I don't talk to fools.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_8", "I'll just be on my way then.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("npc_9", "I pity people like you.  Or I would if I cared.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("player_1", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("player_10", "Safer?");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("player_2", "Do you need any help?");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("player_3", "But who are you really?");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("player_4", "Are you with the alliance?");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("player_5", "Am I bothering you?");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("player_6", "No, not really.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("player_7", "Sorry.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("player_8", "You're awfully touchy.");
stringFiles[61].addEntry("player_9", "Are you going to kill me?");

stringFiles[62] = new StringFile("celebrity/megan_drlar");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_1", "Who do you work for?  Speak up!");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_10", "My guys are here to collect salvage, but don't think that means they're pushovers.  They'll take you down if I give the word.  Got it?");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_11", "Me too.  Talk to you later if you live that long.");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_2", "Well, that can get you killed.  Do you know what there is around here?");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_3", "I don't need to hear it.  As long as you're not here to stop me.");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_4", "Heh.  From collecting my due.  My salvage team is gonna reap the rewards of this stuff.");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_5", "Good, cause I wouldn't have let you.  And neither would my team.");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_6", "Money.  Parts of the Death Star that fell to the planet.  They're worth a lot to the right bidders.  And they're all mine, so stay out of my way and stay out of my people's way.");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_7", "That debris is worth cold hard credits and I intend to cash out.   Just stay out of the way, all right?");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_8", "Pieces of the Death Star.  They're ours for the taking.");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("npc_9", "That's right.  I run a tight group here.  We're gonna make a bundle.");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("player_1", "I'm here on my own.");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("player_10", "I'm done.");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("player_2", "I'm part of a group...");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("player_3", "Jungle?");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("player_4", "Debris?");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("player_5", "Stop you from what?");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("player_6", "I'm not.");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("player_7", "What stuff?");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("player_8", "Salvage team?");
stringFiles[62].addEntry("player_9", "Your team?");

stringFiles[63] = new StringFile("celebrity/mon_mothma");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_1", "Hello.  And welcome.  Is there something I can do for you?");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_10", "Then you're safe for now.  Try not to ask too many questions in the future.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_11", "Then I hope we are allies.  ");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_2", "Anytime.  Just let me know if you need anything.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_3", "My name is Mon Mothma.  I don't think you would have heard of me.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_4", "I'm not surprised.  I try to stay out of the public eye for the most part.  Comes with the job.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_5", "Some people know my name.  Some know my occupation.  Hopefully you aren't a threat to me, I'd hate for us to be enemies.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_6", "Good.  Now I must get back to work.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_7", "Thank you again.  I'm going to blush.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_8", "Many people would die if I simply gave that information to everyone who asked.  I won't tell you just yet, but maybe if I get to know you better.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("npc_9", "Sometimes.  But there are so many things happening so quickly right now that it's becoming easier and harder at the same time.  I know, that doesn't make much snese does it?");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("player_1", "That's nice, but no thanks.  I'm fine.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("player_10", "I know you and what you do.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("player_2", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("player_3", "Ok, will do.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("player_4", "You're sweet.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("player_5", "I don't think so.");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("player_6", "Mon Mothma?  I have heard of you!");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("player_7", "What is your job?");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("player_8", "Do you find it difficult to stay hidden?");
stringFiles[63].addEntry("player_9", "I just know your name.");

stringFiles[64] = new StringFile("celebrity/morag");
stringFiles[64].addEntry("npc_1", "I am the Tulgah Witch!");
stringFiles[64].addEntry("npc_2", "Whatever I please!");
stringFiles[64].addEntry("npc_3", "I am, fool!");
stringFiles[64].addEntry("player_1", "What do you do?");
stringFiles[64].addEntry("player_2", "What's a Tulgah?");

stringFiles[65] = new StringFile("celebrity/muftak");
stringFiles[65].addEntry("npc_1", "I'm just here to have a drink.");
stringFiles[65].addEntry("npc_2", "No thanks.");
stringFiles[65].addEntry("npc_3", "I don't think so.");
stringFiles[65].addEntry("player_1", "How bout some friendly chatter?");
stringFiles[65].addEntry("player_2", "Buy me a drink?");

stringFiles[66] = new StringFile("celebrity/nym");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("first_time_hello", "I don't know who you are or why you're here, and I don't really care. I assume you want some work, just like every other fringer who wanders into my stronghold. But just because you're tough enough to survive on my planet doesn't mean you're ready to join the Lok Revenants. I only take the meanest mercenaries into my crew. You gotta prove yourself before I'll even think about giving you any assignments. In the interest of keeping the peace, I'll let you stick around. But step out of line, and I'll send a blaster bolt through your brain. ");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("get_to_it_chief", "Well, get back to work!");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("go_lab", "Get outta here, then. Bring me back what I asked for, and we'll do some business.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("go_to_officer", "Tell him I sent you, and he should squawk.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("hello_again", "Well, well, you're back. Need something else?");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("help_others", "I'm not going to take a chance on you until you earn Jinkins' trust and Kole's respect. Better get to work.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("ill_go_lab", "I'm going into the lab, and nothing can stop me.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("ill_see_jinkins", "Let me talk to Jinkins.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("ill_see_kole", "I'll go talk to Kole.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("ill_see_officer", "I'll go talk to this guy.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("imggcu", "What is it you need from the research lab?");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("imperial_bribe", "What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("jinkins_is", "Jinkins? He's the best engineer this side of Corellia. Anything I can blow up, he can put back together.   ");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("jinkins_quest_info", "Jinkins has some information about a crashed starship carrying an Imperial droid. It could be useful to us. Ask him about it.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("jinkins_story", "What can I do for Jinkins?");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("koles_story", "What kind of help does Kole need?");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("kole_is", "Kole's my Chadra-Fan first mate and co-pilot. Rescued me from more than one assassination attempt, so watch your back and keep your hands where Kole can see 'em. We've been working together since before the Battle of Naboo. There isn't anyone I trust more.  ");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("kole_quest_info", "Kole's interested in an Imperial mining facility on Lok. He'll give you more information about it.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("lab_info", "There are two things I want: First, I want all the research the scientists have done. Just grab a memory unit from one of the lab's computers. Second, I need some Imperial Military Grade Grenade Casing Units. The Imps call them IMGGCUs. There should be a stash of them somewhere in that base.  Bring me the memory unit and the IMGGCUs, and I'll make sure you're well-paid.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("now_drive", "Good, but I still need the memory module.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("now_imggcu", "Nice job, but I still need the grenade casing units. Bring me the IMGGCUs.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("quest_info", "You're persistent, I'll give you that. I might have work for someone too stupid to know when to give up, and you look like you fit that description. There's an Imperial research facility on Lok that my spies think is filled with experimental weapons. I want whatever that base is building. You'll need help from Jinkins and Kole if you want to pull this off.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("quest_info_again", "Like I said, I'm looking for someone who can bust into an Imperial research facility. ");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("quienne_esta", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("retired_officer", "You might be able to help both of us out by talking to a friend of mine, an informant who might have some information about the research facility and its defenses. If you can stand talkin' to an immoral slug, I'll give you directions to his favorite hangout.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("something_funny_jinkins", "Good. Just remember that we're watching you. Put a leg outta line, and I'll cut it off.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("something_funny_kole", "Don't make him mad. He hasn't killed anyone in two weeks and I think he's gettin' bored.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("tell_me_again", "Tell me again what you need from me...");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("tell_me_quest", "I'm looking for work.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("wheres_drive", "Have you found that memory module yet?  That should be your top priority now.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("wheres_imggcu", "Get your hands on those IMGGCUs. I need the grenade casings to start causing some serious trouble here on Lok.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("who_is_jinkins", "Tell me about Jinkins.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("who_is_kole", "Who is Kole?");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("working_on_it", "No, I'm still working on that.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("youre_done", "I appreciate the work you did for us.  You're still in my good graces, so feel free to roam around on Lok.  ");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("your_the_best", "Great work. Kole and Jinkins can vouch for you, and now you've done your part for me. Feel free to visit the stronghold whenever you need supplies. Just don't bring along any trouble, and you'll always be welcome here.");
stringFiles[66].addEntry("yo_es_nym", "I'm Nym, captain of the Lok Revenants. We're the largest pirate crew on Lok, and I'll crush anyone who claims different.  ");

stringFiles[67] = new StringFile("celebrity/prefect_talmont");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_1", "What is it that you want?");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_10", "No!  On the entire planet!");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_11", "Thank you for the kind words.  I'll remember them if I ever have to arrest you.");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_2", "It's called a title.  That's what you get when you're respected at your job.");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_3", "I'm in charge of security here on Tatooine. ");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_4", "Criminals?  Whatever do you mean?");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_5", "It means keeping the streets safe for citizens like yourself.");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_6", "I don't have time for fools like you.");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_7", "Perhaps you should get a job first.");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_8", "Jabba is a respected businessman, and I shall hear no more of this slander.");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("npc_9", "I don't even know who that is.");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("player_1", "What is a prefect anyway?");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("player_10", "Well, you're doing a great job.");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("player_2", "What is it that you do here?");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("player_3", "If you're so respected why are you stuck here on Tatooine?");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("player_4", "Maybe I should get a title.");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("player_5", "Why don't you do something about the criminals?");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("player_6", "What exactly does that entail?");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("player_7", "What about Jabba the Hutt?");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("player_8", "What about Lady Valarian?");
stringFiles[67].addEntry("player_9", "Just in Bestine?");

stringFiles[68] = new StringFile("celebrity/ruwan_tokai");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_1", "I'm the technician here.  Did you bring my parts?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_10", "I think you've done a pretty good job of confusing yourself.");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_11", "Forget it.  I'll get a Wookiee to do it next time.  At least they don't talk back.");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_2", "The parts I ordered!  Did you bring them or not?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_3", "You do know what parts are right?  Machine parts?  Metal and gears?  Make stuff work?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_4", "Do you know what 'bring' means?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_5", "Oh dear...you do know what a machine is right?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_6", "Great.  What use are you to me then?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_7", "Forget it.  You're not the delivery guy.  Sorry.  Thought you were someone else.");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_8", "Which part of the sentence confused you then?  Did.  You.  Bring.  My.  Parts?  Forget it....(sigh)");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("npc_9", "Then don't play dumb.  Where are my parts?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("player_1", "What parts?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("player_10", "Machine?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("player_2", "I don't know what you mean?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("player_3", "Well...no.");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("player_4", "I'm not the deliver--");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("player_5", "I know what parts are.");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("player_6", "Machine parts?");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("player_7", "Yeah, I know...");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("player_8", "Don't get smart.");
stringFiles[68].addEntry("player_9", "You have me confused with--");

stringFiles[69] = new StringFile("celebrity/scholar_szingo");
stringFiles[69].addEntry("npc_1", "What is it that you want?");
stringFiles[69].addEntry("npc_2", "Truly I have studied more than any Marauder in history.");
stringFiles[69].addEntry("npc_3", "I am the chief advisor to King Terak, the mighty ruler of the Marauders.");
stringFiles[69].addEntry("player_1", "Are you really a scholar?");
stringFiles[69].addEntry("player_2", "Who do you work for?");

stringFiles[70] = new StringFile("celebrity/wald");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_1", "Welcome to Watto's Junk Shop.  What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_10", "You don't?  I thought everyone had heard about that.");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_11", "Well, what can I say.  I've had an amazing life.");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_2", "Watto had some unexpected business back on his home planet.  I'm running things while he's away.");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_3", "My name is Wald.  I grew up here on Tatooine.");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_4", "I went into business with Watto many years ago.  Now I run the store when he's away.");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_5", "I was here when Anakin Skywalker won the Pod Races!");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_6", "Suit yourself.  If you'd rather deal with the Toydarian that's your business.");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_7", "Suspicious?  You think I'd hurt my own business partner?  Actually...that's not a bad idea...");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_8", "Mostly it means sitting here counting junk while no one comes in to buy things.  Pretty dull really...");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("npc_9", "No.  You just have to know how to handle him, really.");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("player_1", "Where's Watto?");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("player_10", "That's amazing!");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("player_2", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("player_3", "Well, I'll wait for him to come back.");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("player_4", "That sounds awfully suspicious.");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("player_5", "Really?  Why are you working here?");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("player_6", "You've been here that long?");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("player_7", "What does that mean really?");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("player_8", "Why would you work with Watto?  Isn't he mean?");
stringFiles[70].addEntry("player_9", "Wow.  I have no idea what you're talking about.");

