stringFiles[81].addEntry("new_city_citizen_other_body", "Welcome to %TU, citizen!Congratulations, you have become a fully enfranchised citizen of the city of %TU and are now subject to the benefits and rights accorded such a status.  As a citizen of the city you have the ability to vote in local issues as well as in the weekly mayoral election.  If you are a politician, you are now able to run for election yourself.  You may also now be appointed to the city Militia.We thank you for joining our family,Mayor %TT");
