stringFiles[85].addEntry("bodyshot1", "/bodyshot1 <target>: This ranged attack targets an opponent's body in order to damage their Health pool.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("bodyshot2", "/bodyshot2 <target>: This advanced ranged attack targets an opponent's body in order to damage their Health pool.  This is more powerful than Body Shot 1.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("bodyshot3", "/bodyshot3 <target>: This powerful ranged attack targets an opponent's body in order to devastate their Health pool.  This is the most powerful Body Shot attack.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("bodyslam", "/bodyslam: Unable to find a target, you pull a stuffed animal from your pack and bodyslam it! TAKE THAT!/bodyslam self: You pick yourself up and throw yourself on the ground./bodyslam target: You try to pick up (target name) and bodyslam (him, her, or it).");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("boggle", "/boggle: You boggle at that concept./boggle self: You boggle at yourself. What were you thinking?!/boggle target: You boggle at (target name). What did (he, she or it) just say?");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("bonk", "/bonk: Bonk! bOnk! BoNk!/bonk self: You bonk yourself on the head. Look at all the birdies!!/bonk target: You bonk (target name) on the head. What were they thinking?!");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("boogie", "/boogie: Get down! You boogie-woogie-oogie./boogie self: You tell yourself it's time to boogie./boogie target: You tell (target name) that you are going to boogie.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("boostmorale", "/boostmorale: This very powerful Squad Leader ability allows the Squad Leader to boost the morale of their troopers by re-distributing all party wounds evently among all of its members.  This ability takes a heavy toll on the Squad Leader's Action and Mind pools.  Use the /setboostmorale <message> command to set the message the Squad Leader shouts when this ability is used.  The Squad Leader must be the leader of the group for this to work.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("bored", "/bored: Bored!/bored self: You go stir-crazy from boredom./bored target: You tell (target name) that you are bored of (him, her, or it).");
