stringFiles[85].addEntry("cheek", "/cheek: You turn your head and expose your cheek looking for a kiss./cheek self: You point to your cheek indicating where to kiss./cheek target: You give (target name) a tender kiss on the cheek.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("cheer", "/cheer: You cheer wildly./cheer self: You cheer for yourself! YAY ME!!/cheer target: YAY!! You cheer for (target name).");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("chestpound", "/chestpound: You pound on your chest!/chestpound self: You pound on your chest, daring anyone to take you on./chestpound target: You pound your chest. Will (target name) take you on?");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("chestpuff", "/chestpuff: You puff up your chest and attempt to look imposing./chestpuff self: You chest-puff and pump up your own ego a bit./chestpuff target: You realize that (target name) is just chest-puffing and let (him, her, or it) know that (he, she or it) full of hot air.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("choppedliver", "/choppedliver: You wonder what is wrong with you. Are you chopped liver?/choppedliver self: What am I? Chopped liver?/choppedliver target: You ask (target name) if you are chopped liver?");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("chortle", "/chortle: You chortle./chortle self: With a series of nasally snorts, you chortle to yourself./chortle target: You chortle uncontrollably at the sight of (target name).");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("chuckle", "/chuckle: You chuckle./chuckle self: You chuckle to yourself./chuckle target: You chuckle politely at (target name).");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("cityban", "/cityban <target>: Prevents a player from being able to buy travel tickets at the city shuttleport and prevents them from entering public civic structures like cloning facilities and the city hall.  You may only use this command if you are a militia member.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("citypardon", "/citypardon <target>: Removes the ban state from a person in your city.  You may only use this command if you are a militia member.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("citywarn", "/citywarn <target>: Warns the target to leave the city in 30 seconds or be attacked.  Players made attackable with this command cannot defend themselves, but are only attackable up to the city limits.  You may only use this command if you are a militia member.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_map", "If the Politician is a Mayor, he can register his city on the planetary map and register the city's civic buildings with the /find command.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_spec_cloning", "The cost of clone insurance in a city with the 'Clone Lab' specialization is reduced by 20%.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_spec_doctor", "Medical healing is 10% more effective in a 'Medical Center'.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_spec_entertainer", "Entertainer healing is 10% more effective in an 'Entertainment District'.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_spec_industry", "Crafting done in a 'Manufacturing Center' earns a 10% bonus to prototype assembly results, significantly reducing the chance of failures.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_spec_master_healing", "A 'Scientific Society' gains the bonuses of both the 'Medical Center' and 'Entertainment District' specializations.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_spec_master_manufacturing", "An 'Industrial Society' gains the bonuses of both the 'Manufacturing Center' and 'Research Center' specializations.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_spec_missions", "Missions taken in a city with an 'Improved Job Market' grant a 15% increase to their rewards.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_spec_research", "Any experimentation done within a 'Research Center' is enhanced.  A 15% bonus to the final result roll is added during the experimentation phase of crafting.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_spec_sample_rich", "A sample rich city has a lot of highly accessable surface resources for manual collection.  The sample rich city bestows a 20% bonus to sample sizes and a 10% bonus to extraction skill checks during resource collection using a survey tool.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("city_spec_stronghold", "A 'Stronghold' has trained its militia members to the peak of their abilities in the methods of tactical defense.  Militia members in a 'Stronghold' get a 50 point bonus to all defense rolls against other players.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("clap", "/clap: You clap your hands together./clap self: You give yourself a hand./clap target: You clap for (target name).");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("claw", "/claw: You hiss and bare your claws./claw self: You remove a file from your pack and begin to sharpen your claws./claw target: You claw at (target name).");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("close", "/close: You close your eyes for a moment./close self: You close your eyes for a moment, thinking./close target: You close your eyes, unwilling to look at (target name).");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("closeeyes", "/closeeyes:  You close your eyes for a moment./closeeyes self:  You close your eyes for a moment, thinking./closeeyes target:  You close your eyes, unwilling to look at (target name).");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("colorlights", "/colorlights: Performs a series of colored light effects.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("comb", "/comb: Looking for something? You comb the area./comb self: You comb your hair. There! Perfect!/comb target: You comb (target name)'s hair.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("combarea", "/combarea:  Looking for something? You comb the area./combarea self:  There you are!/combarea target:  You comb the area searching for (target name).");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("combattarget", "/combattarget:  Type /combattarget while on an attackable target to maintain that as what you will be attacking, regardless of what else you target afterwards.  This is very useful for healing other party members while fighting creatures or players.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("combhair", "/combhair:  You claw at the knots in your hair in desperate need of a comb./combhair self:  You comb your hair. There! Perfect!/combhair target:  You comb (target name)'s hair.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("comfort", "/comfort: You comfort everyone and let them know it will be OK./comfort self: You subtly drop the hint that you could use some comforting./comfort target: You comfort (him, her, or it).");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("con", "/con");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("conceal", "/conceal: This command allows you to apply a camouflage kit to become far less detectable by NPCs and creatures while in the concealed state.  This can be used on other players.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("concealshot", "/concealshot <target>: This ranged sneak attack, if successful, will damage your target without them knowing where the attack came from.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("confusionshot", "/confusionshot <target>: This ranged attack is designed to confuse its target, and can stun and dizzy its target as well.");
