stringFiles[85].addEntry("corpse", "/corpse: Using this command with a corpse targeted will move the corpse closer to you.  If it is not your corpse, you will need /consent from the player who died.");
stringFiles[85].addEntry("cough", "/cough: *COUGH* *COUGH*/cough self: *cough* *ahem* You hack out a stifled cough. Trying to tell someone something?/cough target: You cough in (his, her, or its) face.");
