stringFiles[85].addEntry("jstart1", "/jstart1: This command triggers a discharge from your weapon capacitor to recharge your target's shields. You must have a friendly player-controlled ship as your target, be close in proximity, and have at least a 50% charge in your weapon capacitor.");
