stringFiles[107] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_artist01");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_artist01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_21666bd5", "If you've come about that overdue rent, fear not. I've got a work of art that's being featured in the Bestine Museum. I'm sure my windfall is not far behind.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_22e081ab", "Wait... I remember you. You asked about my artwork recently. I guess if you want to hear it again, there's no harm to me.In my paintings, I bring to life the image of a single plant in each of my paintings. These are mostly plants I've encountered in youth when I was more of a traveller. My work is painterly, yet accurately depicts its subject.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_378506ca", "Wait... I remember you. You mentioned that once before. Guess there's no harm in saying it again.In my paintings, I bring to life the image of a single plant in each of my paintings. These are mostly plants I've encountered in youth when I was more of a traveller. My work is painterly, yet accurately depicts its subject.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_40f54223", "That's why I'm here. The Bestine Museum is looking to feature another work of art.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_4a276e66", "Calm down. I was just passing by.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_506f2192", "Are you from the debt collector? I've barely a few credits to my name at the moment, so you'll get nothing from me. Begone.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_62dd13f8", "Just wait and see... my time has come. You'll see. Soon I'll be famous all across the galaxy. Well, maybe not on Dantooine... but no one there really matters anyway.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_7afc26f5", "Yes, I'll pay... I'll pay. Wait a minute... who are you? Look, I'm busy. I don't really have time to talk right now.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_908359f7", "Oh... well then let me tell you about my work. In my paintings, I bring to life the image of a single plant in each of my paintings. These are mostly plants I've encountered in youth when I was more of a traveller. My work is painterly, yet accurately depicts its subject.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_b7a88f36", "Are you here to collect a debt? No fear... I've got a work of art that's being featured in the Bestine Museum. It can't be long before riches follow. Oh, you're not here about money... well, even better.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_c061a6db", "Actually, I'm here about your artwork. The Bestine Museum is looking to feature a work of art.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_e60617b5", "Oh. Okay then. I apologize. It's just that... well, no point in going into the dirty little details. Let's just forget the whole thing.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_e7133472", "Good luck with that.");
stringFiles[107].addEntry("s_f58736af", "Oh... well... why didn't you say so earlier. In my paintings, I bring to life the image of a single plant in each of my paintings. These are mostly plants I've encountered in youth when I was more of a traveller. My work is painterly, yet accurately depicts its subject.");

stringFiles[108] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_artist02");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_artist02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_1fa7f38", "Didn't you already ask me about that? Oh well...I always wanted to design buildings, but never had the motivation to take the steps necessary to actually become an architect. Instead, I do paintings of buildings. Not quite the same thing, but I find it satisfying.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_2d2a7797", "You should be proud.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_3a6247ed", "How exciting! I've been involved in such things before and always enjoy the opportunity. I always wanted to design buildings, but never had the motivation to take the steps necessary to actually become an architect. Instead, I do paintings of buildings. Not quite the same thing, but I find it satisfying.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_4823f472", "Hello Friend. Slow down a bit and enjoy the day.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_5722b971", "Hello. Sit and have a drink with me.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_59b34fc5", "Actually that's what I'm here to talk about. They wish to feature another work of art.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_5b1a751", "Yet another opportunity! I always wanted to design buildings, but never had the motivation to take the steps necessary to actually become an architect. Instead, I do paintings of buildings. Not quite the same thing, but I find it satisfying.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_5b1aeaab", "Hello. Did you know I have a painting in the Bestine Museum? It's true. I'm trying to be humble, but I've never been so proud of myself.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_707098b5", "Er... um... on second thought, maybe I'd be better off drinking alone.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_8f58f4f9", "Thank you. I encourage you to go see my painting. I did mention that it's in the Bestine Museum, yes?");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_9467cd8b", "Wait, didn't we already... I mean... ah nevermind.I always wanted to design buildings, but never had the motivation to take the steps necessary to actually become an architect. Instead, I do paintings of buildings. Not quite the same thing, but I find it satisfying.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_96628254", "Tell me  about your artwork. The Bestine Museum wishes to maybe feature it.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_c062519", "Sit, friend, and listen to my grand exploits. Well, grand to me nonetheless. I've recent been honored by having a painting featured in the Bestine Museum. You should journey there and see it.");
stringFiles[108].addEntry("s_f0611875", "Okay, hand me a bottle of whatever you're drinking.");

stringFiles[109] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_artist03");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_artist03) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_1054ba24", "Greetings friends. Have you heard about the time I crossed the Dune Sea without drinking even a single drop of water? Ha...who needs water when you've got a good Corellian ale!");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_14cd5816", "Oh, well then have you heard about the time I single-handedly defeated an entire unit of stormtroopers? It's true... they're really terrible at sabacc.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_1eebe4c5", "Do you get the feeling we've done this before?Anyway, as someone who enjoys exploring this waste of a planet, I've sometimes used painting as a journal of sorts to memorialize things I've seen. Those that truly made an impression on me and are unique to Tatooine.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_3e426694", "Yeah, you've mentioned it before.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_46c7e15a", "Say no more. As someone who enjoys exploring this waste of a planet, I've sometimes used painting as a journal of sorts to memorialize things I've seen. Those that truly made an impression on me and are unique to Tatooine.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_77b94789", "Greetings friends. Have you heard about the time I tricked an underling of Jabba into giving me his money? Who needs a bank account with all the gullible thugs Jabba employs.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_77eb5b90", "Have we talked about this already? You want to hear it again? Okay.As someone who enjoys exploring this waste of a planet, I've sometimes used painting as a journal of sorts to memorialize things I've seen. Those that truly made an impression on me and are unique to Tatooine.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_9700d1c6", "Er yeah. Anyway the Bestine Museum is looking for their next work of art to feature.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_a9fe5eb6", "Hello. Have you heard about the time one of my paintings was featured in the Bestine Museum? That time is now! I encourage you to rush to Bestine and see for yourself.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_ae2d8845", "Oh sure. Closest thing this planet has to an art museum. Though, have you heard about the time I tried to open an art gallery for Tusken Raiders? Ends up they really don't like art. Or maybe it was just me... I'm not sure.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_b53cc4bf", "How could I not leap at the chance yet again! Well, as someone who enjoys exploring this waste of a planet, I've sometimes used painting as a journal of sorts to memorialize things I've seen. Those that truly made an impression on me and are unique to Tatooine.");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_c53bdfa0", "All the way over in Bestine?");
stringFiles[109].addEntry("s_ead5e0b4", "The Bestine Museum is looking for more art to feature.");

stringFiles[110] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_artist04");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_artist04) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_179635e7", "Kahfr does not understand why you are saying that. Kahfr thinks perhaps you've been wandering the Dune Sea for too long.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_17cd5bb6", "You must experience Kahfr's painting. Kahfr's artwork graces the walls of the Museum in Bestine. Kahfr is a great artist!");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_28823813", "Then listen to what I have to say. The Bestine Museum is looking for art to exhibit.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_3b52499e", "Oh, well... if you're busy, I'll leave you alone.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_40f271aa", "You ask Kahfr again? Always Kahfr must repeat herself.Kahfr's art is the art of people. Faces. Right now Mon Calamari faces. Taken out of context, a person's face can be quite abstract. This is what Kahfr does.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_6589745", "You speak really well too.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_71aaaca6", "Why do you bother Kahfr? Kahfr is a great artist and is very busy.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_7766385", "Kahfr is impressed by your understanding. Kahfr thanks you and bids you farewell. Though Kahfr wonders if this is sarcasm...");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_8bc4905a", "The Bestine Museum is looking for another work of art to feature. Perhaps yours again?");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_8d0668a2", "Kahfr is a great artist! Kahfr's artwork graces the walls of the Museum in Bestine. You must experience Kahfr's painting.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_bf1648b1", "Kahfr thinks you've asked that before. But Kahfr does not mind.Kahfr's art is the art of people. Faces. Right now Mon Calamari faces. Taken out of context, a person's face can be quite abstract. This is what Kahfr does.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_cf179f96", "Kahfr is interested. Kahfr has long expected such an honor as is her due. Kahfr's art is the art of people. Faces. Right now Mon Calamari faces. Taken out of context, a person's face can be quite abstract. This is what Kahfr does.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_d4ede5f2", "Do not bother Kahfr? Kahfr is a great artist and is very busy. You must go now.");
stringFiles[110].addEntry("s_df8872ca", "Kahfr is again interested. Kahfr would rather such an honor not pass her by. Kahfr's art is the art of people. Faces. Right now Mon Calamari faces. Taken out of context, a person's face can be quite abstract. This is what Kahfr does.");

stringFiles[111] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_artist05");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_artist05) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_2e785872", "Good for you.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_3671ce2c", "Greetings my friend. Times are good. I have a painting being featured at the Bestine Museum.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_4af78c89", "Truly?! Perhaps they would like my paintings. I do still life paintings. Usually, just of plants in the wild, because... well... those don't cost anything. I guess that could be considered a landscape painting, but I don't paint much more than just the plant.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_55a9443f", "Truly?! Perhaps they would like another of my paintings. I do still life paintings. Usually, just of plants in the wild, because... well... those don't cost anything. I guess that could be considered a landscape painting, but I don't paint much more than just the plant.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_74b54572", "Indeed. I'm hoping to earn enough money to travel once again. I'd like to see more of the galaxy if I can.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_991f684c", "You return to hear about my paintings again? Wouldn't it be easier to just go see the one at the Bestine Museum?I do still life paintings. Usually, just of plants in the wild, because... well... those don't cost anything. I guess that could be considered a landscape painting, but I don't paint much more than just the plant.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_9fc7f9c5", "Well, perhaps I can help. The Bestine Museum is looking for a work of art to exhibit.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_b31048ea", "Greetings. I'm afraid I have little to offer you as I am but an impoverished artist.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_b5220a73", "Not even that. I'm scraping together every bit I can just to purchase my painting supplies. At this rate I'll be stuck in this sand ball forever.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_c8bc2cfd", "Well met. I'm afraid I have little to offer you as I am but an impoverished artist.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_c93140c8", "The Bestine Museum is looking for another work of art to feature.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_d29b30b8", "Well met friend. Times are good. I have a painting being featured at the Bestine Museum.");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_eaf3bb47", "Not even a credit or two?");
stringFiles[111].addEntry("s_f4165153", "Seems like we've done this already. Once before. Once again? Very well.I do still life paintings. Usually, just of plants in the wild, because... well... those don't cost anything. I guess that could be considered a landscape painting, but I don't paint much more than just the plant.");

stringFiles[112] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_artist06");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_artist06) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_1433b9d4", "My eyes are open. I see you for what you are.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_21352168", "If you wish to have your eyes opened with new visions of the world around you, then your first step should be to go to the Bestine Museum and see my painting on display there.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_23697fe2", "And naturally they desire another of mine. I paint common subjects in abstraction. My goal isn't to replicate the look of my subjects, but rather to use their shapes to find higher art. For me, the petals of a flower are simply organic shapes used in my composition.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_29026317", "And they are considering mine? Glorious! I paint common subjects in abstraction. My goal isn't to replicate the look of my subjects, but rather to use their shapes to find higher art. For me, the petals of a flower are simply organic shapes used in my composition.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_30df2fe8", "And that's as a painter, I surely hope. But it's a good start... that is, if you're truly looking and not just humoring me.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_32722caf", "Er... okay. Anyway, the Bestine Museum is looking for a work of art to exhibit.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_3a301702", "I expanded my mind once... was really hung over the next day.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_54e93392", "Don't close yourself off... there's more to see than what your eyes tell you.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_582eefe3", "Right... we've already gone over this as you would know if you weren't so closed off.I paint common subjects in abstraction. My goal isn't to replicate the look of my subjects, but rather to use their shapes to find higher art. For me, the petals of a flower are simply organic shapes used in my composition.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_66605741", "Forgotten me already? You were just here. Truly, you move through the world with your mind closed.I paint common subjects in abstraction. My goal isn't to replicate the look of my subjects, but rather to use their shapes to find higher art. For me, the petals of a flower are simply organic shapes used in my composition.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_7154d52c", "Arrgh... not with Corellian ale or spice! Open yourself to news ways of experiencing the galaxy. Don't just blindly follow your feet. Truly see to truly know.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_8a659170", "Expand you mind, my friend. There's more to see than what your eyes tell you.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_a13d05db", "Yes, and the Bestine Museum is also looking for another work of art to feature.");
stringFiles[112].addEntry("s_bf3a373", "Open your eyes! New visions of the world are all around you. If nothing else, you should be to go to the Bestine Museum and see my painting on display there.");

stringFiles[113] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_capitol01");
stringFiles[113].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_capitol01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[113].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[113].addEntry("s_8819f19f", "The governor is appointing someone to work closely with her on a new project. Currently, the only two candidates eligible are Victor Visalis, Officer of Defense and Sean Trenwell, Director of Commerce. You'll probably have to speak with the governor for more information about the voting process and further details. Unfortunately, I have to get back to work. ");
stringFiles[113].addEntry("s_90ce1297", "No, thank you.");
stringFiles[113].addEntry("s_c82e9a2f", "Yes, please.");
stringFiles[113].addEntry("s_da5842cb", "Another election should be coming up in the following months. I wonder who will win and what effects it will have on the city of Bestine. You should probably keep an eye out for upcoming announcements.");
stringFiles[113].addEntry("s_edaf838a", "That's a pity. Okay, then. Have a good day!");
stringFiles[113].addEntry("s_f9dda042", "You look a little lost. Or have you come to the capitol to vote in the upcoming election? Confused? You haven't heard of the changes to Bestine? I thought everyone had heard of it! Must be an outsider. Oh well! Do you want to hear about it?");

stringFiles[114] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_capitol02");
stringFiles[114].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_capitol02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[114].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[114].addEntry("s_bdbf995f", "The capitol is buzzing about the new election! I'm glad you've come! I hope you're going to vote. The eligible candidates are Victor Visalis and Sean Trenwell. The governor is collecting votes, and the winner will work closely with her on a new project. You should go talk with her.");
stringFiles[114].addEntry("s_d18211cb", "The Empire has taken a new direct standing against the people. I really hope the poor folk won't be too oppressed by the changes. We'll have to see what happens.");

stringFiles[115] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_capitol03");
stringFiles[115].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_capitol03) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[115].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[115].addEntry("s_4fc77052", "It's really quiet around here when there isn't an election going on. Well... it's quiet, at least, for us volunteers. You should come back when an election is going on. I should be at the University, studying. I'm not that good of a student. Oh well!");
stringFiles[115].addEntry("s_a65103f5", "All this talk about the new election. It's so boring! I should have volunteered at the museum instead! Ugh! You haven't heard about the election? You're lucky. The governor is taking votes so you need to speak with her. I'm going to take a break now...");

stringFiles[116] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_capitol04");
stringFiles[116].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_capitol04) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[116].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[116].addEntry("s_2fcca84c", "Do you think I'll make the next election? I have so many good ideas for Bestine. Listen to them... actually, I'm not going to tell you. You may steal my ideas and run for office. You think you're pretty smart, huh?");
stringFiles[116].addEntry("s_754d87ee", "I guess I didn't make the cut. Like many of the politicians here, I too wanted to work with the governor on her new project. Now, it's between Victor Visalis and Sean Trenwell. I guess they deserve it. Speak with the governor for more details. I really must get back to work.");

stringFiles[117] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor01");
stringFiles[117].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[117].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[117].addEntry("s_a886b683", "If you care about the state of Bestine, then you should vote for one of the new candidates. You can go to the capitol and speak with the governor for more information. The winner of the election will reflect on Bestine, so choose wisely.");
stringFiles[117].addEntry("s_b1225bbd", "I hear there's been way too many attacks on Bestine by the Sand People. It's really hurting our economy.");

stringFiles[118] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor02");
stringFiles[118].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[118].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[118].addEntry("s_f74566b1", "Maybe voting for Sean Trenwell wasn't such a good idea. I heard some pretty nasty rumors about him. He seems to be blinded by money. But really, who isn't?");
stringFiles[118].addEntry("s_f9db7bbe", "Bestine really doesn't need heightened defenses. I'm going to vote for Sean Trenwell, Director of Commerce in the upcoming election. We could really use more merchants around here. What do you think? I really think you should vote. The governor is taking votes at the capitol.");

stringFiles[119] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor03");
stringFiles[119].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor03) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[119].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[119].addEntry("s_848f500b", "Victor Visalis did well in office, I think. Well... other than hunting down rebels with his newly-hired band of troopers. It was pretty horrible for a while. But, what can ya do? This is an Imperial city after all.");
stringFiles[119].addEntry("s_cd086fbf", "Merchants? A Museum? Historians?! C'mon! What we really need is added defense against Tusken Raiders! In the upcoming election, my vote is for Victor Visalis, Officer of Defense. You should vote too. Go ask the governor at the capitol for more information.");

stringFiles[120] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor04");
stringFiles[120].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor04) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[120].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[120].addEntry("s_156c9c13", "I never really got around to voting. I'm too scared to even go out sometimes. The Sand People raids are really getting to me. I need to do some shopping... if you'll excuse me.");
stringFiles[120].addEntry("s_e4577019", "Victor or Sean? Defense or Commerce? Oh! I didn't see you there. I'm trying to decide for whom I should vote in the upcoming election. The more votes, the better. I suggest you talk with the governor at the capitol for more information.");

stringFiles[121] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor05");
stringFiles[121].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor05) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[121].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[121].addEntry("s_a3f92c54", "I've heard that Sean Trenwell funded the establishment of the new market place with his own fortune. Maybe you should check the new market place out. I hear the merchants there are searching for rare objects... coins, bones or something like that.");
stringFiles[121].addEntry("s_a65f8ef3", "As a crafter, I'm going to vote for the Director of Commerce, Sean Trenwell. I definitely need more business and, with his influence, more merchants will be brought in, naturally bringing out more buyers. I really think you should vote. Talk with the governor at the capitol for more information regarding the election.");

stringFiles[122] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor06");
stringFiles[122].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor06) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[122].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[122].addEntry("s_c3f5586a", "If Victor Visalis wins this election, a higher degree of defense will be added. The Tusken Raiders are getting restless and may launch an attack soon. I really fear for the city of Bestine. You look... confused. Talk with the governor at the capitol. She knows all the details.");
stringFiles[122].addEntry("s_e63228d2", "The museum holds frequent contests. I bought a painting that had been on showcase last month. It's really beautiful!");

stringFiles[123] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor07");
stringFiles[123].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor07) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[123].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[123].addEntry("s_3626560c", "Visalis is on our side. If he wins the election, more Imperial Troops will be recruited and sent to Bestine. I hear the Tusken Raiders are getting restless. You should vote. The governor is taking them over at the capitol. Oh-break is over. Move along, citizen.");
stringFiles[123].addEntry("s_49709fbf", "We're clenching our fists tighter around the Rebel Alliance. Soon, they won't be in existence. They're nothing but trouble. You should stay away from them.");

stringFiles[124] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor08");
stringFiles[124].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor08) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[124].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[124].addEntry("s_71b4d773", "If Victor Visalis wins the election, he'll recruit more Imperial Troops to guard Bestine. Do you think I can make the cut? I'd really love the chance to show the Empire what I'm worth! The election? You haven't heard? Oh. Well, go to the capitol and talk with the governor. She knows everything!");
stringFiles[124].addEntry("s_ba912d0c", "I'm going to try and make it. Make the cut for the Empire, that is. I really want to be a trooper. I think I'd make a good one. Join the Empire!");

stringFiles[125] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor09");
stringFiles[125].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor09) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[125].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[125].addEntry("s_3415564", "I visit the museum every day. I'm hoping that one of my paintings will be on display there. Others could then purchase copies of my painting and hang them up in their houses. How exciting! I have to practice...");
stringFiles[125].addEntry("s_44776715", "I'm an artist and will definitely vote for Sean Trenwell. I hear he's personally funding the museum so they can hold frequent contests! I really hope one of my paintings will be on display at the museum. I'm definitely going to win! You need to vote as well. Please talk with the governor at the capitol for more information.");

stringFiles[126] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor10");
stringFiles[126].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor10) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[126].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[126].addEntry("s_3fb4ad13", "We need a library or someplace where we can learn about the history of Bestine. It's really not known as well as say the history of Mos Eisley. I think that'll be my goal. To teach everyone about history.");
stringFiles[126].addEntry("s_9a864cde", "I'm really curious about the history of Bestine. If Sean Trenwell wins, I'm going to volunteer my efforts to uncover the mysteries surrounding this city. He really cares about Bestine and would do well in the new role if he wins the election. You should really take the time to vote at the capitol. Talk with the governor. She knows all the details.");

stringFiles[127] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor11");
stringFiles[127].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor11) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[127].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[127].addEntry("s_7f471bf9", "I'm here to investigate the background story of Victor Visalis. He's running as the Officer of Defense in the upcoming election. I have a bad feeling bout him. Every politician has a bad side, some horrible story in their past. Anyway, you need to vote at the capitol. Talk with the governor for more information.");
stringFiles[127].addEntry("s_e2e56485", "There are some really weird things going on. I think the Empire is becoming more and more strict with who and what come out of Bestine. Between you and me, anyone who's sympathetic with the Rebels should be careful. I've seen too many singled out and executed nowadays.");

stringFiles[128] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_rumor12");
stringFiles[128].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_rumor12) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[128].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[128].addEntry("s_5028a3e0", "Have you ever seen a Jedi before? I did the other day. He seemed kinda... odd. He was an apprentice, I think, and he was showing off his light saber to someone else. You wouldn't believe it but, out of nowhere he was attacked by bounty hunters... troopers even! He got away, thankfully. I bet he'll be more careful next time.");
stringFiles[128].addEntry("s_9a4ad400", "There's something more to Sean Trenwell than meets the eye. I'm looking into his past to see what skeletons he's hiding. He's running as the Director of Commerce in the upcoming election. Hopefully, he won't win. But then again, I'm not too fond of Victor Visalis either. You need to vote and find out for yourself. Talk with the governor at the capitol.");

stringFiles[129] = new StringFile("conversation/bestine_stone_merchant");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (bestine_stone_merchant) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_1cb401b5", "I'll keep searching!");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_211ab5b4", "I'll give you the carved stone.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_2b5e768f", "I guess so. I'll look for some.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_38d8cf30", "I'll give you the smooth stone.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_4242e25b", "Probably. Bye!");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_8762f9f", "I'm in the business of collecting rare stones. Unfortunately, I haven't had much business lately. I guess I should find another business.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_8c741032", "I'm going to keep it.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_98e55c89", "I may have the stones you are looking for.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_9e6e06eb", "You will? Too bad I don't know where they are. I heard a rumor that Victor Visalis may know. He's over at the capitol. He doesn't usually talk about things other than the election. Maybe if he won the election... oh well. If you ever find any, I'm here.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_af25c425", "Yes, I do. I have a smooth stone.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_af35650e", "I have a smooth stone.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_b04b4ef5", "Alright. If you have any stones, be sure to come back!");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_b6e7bea1", "Yes, I do. I have a carved stone.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_b6f71f8a", "I have a carved stone.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_bb2c2468", "Thank you! Here, I'll give you this. We'll say you bought it from me by giving me the stone. It's rare so guard it closely.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_cc49587f", "Wow! That's just what I'm looking for! I can take it off your hands if you want. I need to test every one very carefully. So what do you say? Which one do you want to give me?");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_d7a9bace", "Oh... okay. Well, if you decide you'd rather get it off your hands, feel free to seek me out! I'll surely buy them off you.");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_e21cea57", "You do?! What kind of stones?");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_eaee4954", "No, just looking around. See ya later!");
stringFiles[129].addEntry("s_f56c7c9f", "Do you have more stones for me?");

stringFiles[130] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_assistant");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_assistant) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_114e560", "Actually, he just told me to come get the codes.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_255de7f7", "Not much. This is a genetic research facility, but I'm an engineering assistant. I don't know much about that stuff. But it would seem that when that earthquake hit, it somehow released the creatures from their cages.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_25e7c7e7", "Thank you for delivering the codes to the engineer. You've been a great help.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_33eb85b5", "Sure, I will take the codes to the engineer.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_457410bd", "No problem. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_49ef3c27", "Really? That would be fantastic! Here, the codes are on this datapad. You should be able to find him near the reactor. Thank you so much for your help.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_4b2c2992", "Yes, I need to try and get back to the reactor room myself.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_72510ac3", "I'm sure you'll get there somehow. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_761ee240", "I'll take the codes to the engineer for you.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_7dfa7256", "Thank you for killing those creatures. They've escaped from their cages and they're out of control.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_80dc0120", "What is the favor?");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_81b17df9", "I see. Well, good-bye.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_82bc35bf", "Can you tell me anything about those monsters?");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_89ca9e86", "The engineer told me to come get the codes from you.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_950188fd", "Assistant? I was told to get some codes from you?");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_aa495893", "OK, I understand. If you get a chance, please come back.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_ae1d4fd6", "Please take the codes to the engineer. Thank you very much for your help.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_b5c70166", "Please take the codes to the engineer. If you need to get into the engineering area, use the code 51892. Thank you very much for your help.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_b856cb2e", "Really? Would you take them back to him? They are on this datapad. Thank you so much.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_bbbd5d0f", "Yes, I hope so. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_be849f7b", "I have these computer codes that I need to get to the engineer, but the creatures attacked me before I could get back to him. I wonder if you could bring the codes to him for me?");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_bf513acb", "Oh, hey, you're back. I wonder if I could ask you for a favor?");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_c251c56d", "Really? That would be fantastic! Here, the codes are on this datapad. You should be able to find him near the reactor. If the door to the engineering room is locked, the code 51892 will get you in. Thank you so much for your help.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_c3bd7233", "I have the computer codes that the head engineer needs to get the reactor back online. I was on my way back to the engineering room, but I can't possibly make it there with all these creatures loose.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_d8a95d57", "Yes, I have these computer codes that the head engineer needs, but I was attacked by these creatures. Here, the codes are on this datapad. Please take them to him.");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_ea2d9bb0", "What is it that you're doing here?");
stringFiles[130].addEntry("s_eeaf9e0b", "Sorry, I don't have time right now.");

stringFiles[131] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_construction");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_construction) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_134aacec", "I'm sure you'll think of some way.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_1d440dae", "No, thank you. If you have a chance, you might want to go check out the main engineering area. It looks like the power core might be damaged or offline. If the door is locked, the code 51892 will get you in. Good luck!");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_1df6adfc", "Thank goodness you got here in time! That spider was going to kill me. I thought for sure I was a goner. How can I ever repay you?");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_23041b9a", "If you have a chance, you might want to go check out the main engineering area. It looks like the power core might be damaged or offline. If the door is locked, the code 51892 will get you in.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_2453dda8", "I understand. Thanks again for killing those spiders.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_355bc632", "What were you doing in here anyway?");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_4136c2df", "Thank you very much.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_457410bd", "No problem. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_575de8f1", "Thanks again for killing those spiders. I'm getting out of here as soon as the way is clear.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_5fe23666", "OK. Good-bye then.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_67f9970", "If you have a chance, you might want to go check out the main engineering area. It looks like the power core might be damaged or offline. If the door is locked, the code 51892 will get you in. Good-bye, and good luck!");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_75118515", "I was working on excavating this passage when the earthquake hit. Not long after, the spiders attacked. Now I just want to get out of here. ");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_82e89d37", "OK. I will try to check it out.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_add15db6", "I will if I have time.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_c1d58076", "Good-bye, and good luck!");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_c30b797d", "Yea, I'm getting out of here too. ");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_d8420164", "Alright. Thanks again for killing those spiders.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_dc2d689c", "Thanks again for killing those spiders. If you need to get to the engineering area, the code 51892 will get you in.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_de8e8527", "No, thank you. Good-bye, friend!");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_e4b06f76", "There's no need. I'm glad you're alright.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_eb771a95", "Actually, I don't have much to give you. Perhaps I'll think of something later.");
stringFiles[131].addEntry("s_fc129e0e", "Well I'm only interested in getting out of here now.  I'll do that as soon as I get my wits back.");

stringFiles[132] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_crazyguy");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_crazyguy) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_1300ed43", "What warning? I forgot. Oh well, as long as you remember.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_14b63e24", "Yes! I see you are... the truth. When you leave... we all can go. But I must tell you...");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_1c4a552c", "No, who is not here. That is... the problem. I think? Are you ...who?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_1c8bddbb", "What is it?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_20413fbf", "I'm sorry, I guess I just don't get it. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_23bcaf58", "Never alone... never alone...");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_28eb431a", "There are some that think that... namely you.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_3157939", "You're loony as a peko bird. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_3a0e3163", "How many? 32281... monsters... 32281... monsters.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_3e250a", "No... no one. No one does. No one anymore.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_40626e0f", "That's what I say too. Except I'm... staying here.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_469eaf3a", "No, not going on... going in, and when you've done that... we all go out.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_4e52ced2", "Hey, I remember you... but I've never seen you before.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_51edfa93", "Then maybe you aren't... who you are. So long then.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_524005c4", "Yes! Yes you are! I see you... now you must go!");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_564ba87", "I swear, if you don't tell me what's going on...");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_5d16248c", "Yes, I'm here. Now what is going on?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_5d995d79", "Life is not all about... rhyming. And soon it will be over.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_64bc92a0", "Go where? Tell me what's happening!");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_68d073fe", "Keep what in mind? Was it something important? Oh well.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_6b830d", "Um... thanks for the warning.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_70a572af", "I don't have time for this. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_72870486", "Unfortunately... we all get it. Very soon.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_74fbbad2", "Look around... do you see it? That's, uh... what is?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_7b11e13b", "Ah, I'm glad you're back. Now go.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_7d4e91e1", "Yes, I am. I think.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_7d4f8520", "Yes, yes. Keep going. That way. No, wait. That way.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_80c190c3", "*gurk* Why... you're here? Did they send you? I see that you're here.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_91c86ae2", "For the monsters... 32281 is it. You see, 32281... monsters. There are 32281 monsters.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_9499432", "Still crazy as ever I see.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_9c653067", "See what? I don't...");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_a64c5d9e", "Of course you have, I was here just a bit ago.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_a8cf80a2", "I'm sorry, I don't understand. Good-bye");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_a9f69fb7", "Go? You want me to leave?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_b18aca61", "What isn't happening? You, that's what... why? Go now.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_bc3d132b", "No, no. All I have is time, until it ends.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_be321a24", "Ok, ok. I'm going.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_c182d8fb", "Sorry, I don't talk with crazy people. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_c875e4f0", "Did I? I don't remember. Ok then, good-bye.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_cc90aebb", "Good idea. I can't take any more of this.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_d166b780", "Go? No, I want you to leave... in there!");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_d3b52482", "There is no leaving. Not now since... oh, you're here?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_d5e04dc5", "That's what I just said. I don't understand you.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_d87072f3", "Go in? Go out? What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_daa5a74d", "Ok, you seem distracted. I'll leave you alone.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_e1fbb5ed", "In where? Into that opening back there?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_e34d6272", "Is who here? Start making sense!");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_e5f4a149", "Please don't hurt me. I was just leaving.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_e7953fb5", "What is the matter with you?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_eb2f9960", "HELP! HELP! Are you here?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_f0a82cfa", "I think you've told me enough already.");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_f6dd63d", "Did who send me? What's going on here?");
stringFiles[132].addEntry("s_fd7a670e", "Right... I'll try to, um... keep that in mind.");

stringFiles[133] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_engineertech");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_engineertech) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_1615f465", "It looks like the security grid is offline too. I don't know how that will effect the sentry droids, but the security doors are probably locked down. Without a special key you wouldn't be able to get much further into the complex.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_235c610d", "That earthquake we just had knocked out our power reactor. The backup system came online, but we're rapidly losing power throughout the complex.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_27707b65", "No, I haven't gotten the datapad yet.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_2c2921ad", "Were you able to find my apprentice? Did you get the datapad?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_30c757f6", "What else has been affected?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_347a730", "Unfortunately, that means that the power to our containment system failed. No doubt you've probably seen some pretty fearsome creatures wandering around.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_3d90816", "Blast, the coolant pump is offline too. We'll need to get that... oh, what are you doing here?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_428087e9", "What's happening here?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_4c14f9fb", "Yes, I hope so too.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_4fe2bd07", "And thank you for yours. Good luck to you!");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_56fde3ca", "I'm trying to help secure the facility.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_5933b1d0", "I could easily make you a key to get you past the first security door, but I would ask you to do something for me first.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_5afc1718", "Alright, good luck!");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_5fe76a83", "You've wandered into a bad spot I'm afraid. That earthquake knocked out our power reactor and we're rapidly losing power throughout the complex.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_6569e789", "We could certainly use the help, that's for sure. That earthquake knocked out our power reactor and we're rapidly losing power throughout the complex.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_69a2ad00", "Well, alright. Good-bye then.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_75c607ac", "My assistant has some computer codes that we need to restart the reactor. If you bring me his datapad with those codes, I will gladly make you a security key.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_76e305ae", "Come back as soon as you find it, and I'll get you a key for that security door.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_884784be", "I see. Thank you for your help.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_8c024a43", "We've got things under control here now. You'd better go see if anyone else needs help. Thanks again.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_8e26cc3d", "Well, I hope you get it fixed. Good bye.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_926a3bb3", "Sounds pretty bad. I'll leave you alone.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_94350653", "Alright, well thanks anyway. But don't forget that you won't be able to go much farther into the facility without a key to disable that security door.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_9541ca42", "Actually, now that you mention it, there is. We have the materials here to repair the reactor, but I can't bring it online without the computer codes. My assistant currently has the codes on his datapad, but I don't know where he is.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_99c2fa91", "I just sort of wandered in, I guess.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_9d6ccb86", "I'm just leaving.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_a3101911", "Why, uh... yes it is! Here are the codes! And as promised, here is a key that will let you past the first security door.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_a767cb3c", "Is there anything that I can do to help?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_a7b6a9c7", "I'm supposed to give this datapad to you.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_aa71d09d", "I need to you to find my assistant, and bring his datapad back here to me. If you can get me those codes, I'll see if I can wire you a key that will let you through the first security door.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_b3d8b98a", "Alright, I'll come back when I've found your assistant.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_b78f009b", "Alright. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_b8cdda4", "Thanks again for your help. And good luck to you!");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_bf0dd8c0", "I'm sorry. I've got to go.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_c1eda1a3", "I'll give it a try anyway. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_c8edf6a4", "Oh yes! The computer codes! Now we will be able to get the reactor back online. In exchange for your help, let me give you this key. Since the lockdown is in effect, it will let you get past the first security door.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_cd2b08bc", "Thank you for the key.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_d2de343f", "What is it you would have me do?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_d4b22fda", "Oh, you're back. We're still trying to get the reactor back online. Not much progress yet, I'm afraid.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_d7f1b726", "I'll see what I can do, but I'm not making any promises.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_da5959ed", "Is this the datapad that you're talking about?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_dc2e08dd", "OK, what do you need me to do?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_dd67013", "What does that mean?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_df0aaba0", "Only the first door?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_e61f6f04", "Thank you very much. Come back with the codes and I'll make you a security key.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_eb038dde", "Where could I get one of those keys?");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_f4e8ce21", "OK, thanks for stopping by.");
stringFiles[133].addEntry("s_f8f36834", "All of the security doors have different locking algorithms. I've had to work on that first door before, so I'm pretty familiar with how it works. However, once you're though there, you're on your own.");

stringFiles[134] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_herald_02");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_herald_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_16124dd5", "This is not an official order, but rather a simple reconnaissance assignment. We're concerned about one of our agents stationed on Yavin IV. I'll give you some more details if you take the assignment. Do you accept?");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_373c8ad", "So what is it you want me to do?");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_40cc2c96", "Alright, but I suggest that you return when you get a chance. As a loyal servant of the Empire, I'm sure that you do not want to displease your superiors.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_41db0c1b", "Unless you have official Imperial business, I suggest that you move along.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_657f5904", "No, I will decline.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_66a4dded", "I don't have time for menial tasks, sorry.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_678d7eec", "So how do I find the facility?");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_86248d8c", "Most excellent. Your superiors will be pleased. Now for the details. We have had an agent stationed on Yavin IV for a while now. He was tasked with observing a hidden Geonosian bio-genetics facility.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_87f743f", "Alright, but I suggest you reconsider. As a loyal servant of the Empire, I'm sure that you don't want to displease your superiors.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_8d4bd762", "Yes, I will accept.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_8f9bb5cc", "When you do, we will send a team to the bio-genetics facility to deal with the traitorous Geonosians. Good luck on your assignment.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_9288900f", "I understand.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_9326b612", "I will see if I can find your missing agent.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_978ff349", "We want you to travel to Yavin IV, find the hidden bio-genetics laboratory, and see what happened to our agent. Unfortunately we do not know specifically where the compound is.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_9c1f1aa9", "Ah, excellent. I'm glad that you're here. I have an assignment that I need to delegate, and you look like you would be prefect for the task.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_c6f4650", "The agent is supposed to report in at regular intervals but we have not heard from him in quite a while. We suspect that he might have been kidnapped by the Geonosians, who may be now working in league with the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_d029dd34", "What is it that you would have me do?");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_d736fda3", "Please continue.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_edb238bc", "Go on.");
stringFiles[134].addEntry("s_ee774a3d", "Our missing agent is the only one who knew exactly where it is. Why don't you go to the Mining Outpost on Yavin IV to try and get some leads. See if the locals there have seen or noticed anything out of the ordinary.");

stringFiles[135] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_herald_03");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_herald_03) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_1711fd92", "I didn't catch everything that they were saying, but I did hear something about an Imperial agent overseeing a bio-genetics research facility. And something about... Geo, uh... Geonosians, yea. That's it.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_1b751405", "Thanks for the information. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_2991cadd", "I'm really not sure. It got a little loud in here and I couldn't make out what they were saying, but one of them looked really mad. If you ask me something big is about to go down.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_2b10b66c", "Did they mention where the facility is?");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_3d816e72", "No, they didn't. In fact, I don't even think they know where it is exactly, except for on Yavin IV. Sounds like it's a big secret, but they said something about asking the locals. Something about a Mining Outpost, too.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_569d6129", "Hello. You are sympathetic to the Rebellion are you not? I have information that may be of interest to you if you are willing to hear it.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_5ea784e0", "My pleasure. If it sounds like something you want to look into, you might like to ask around that Mining Outpost on Yavin IV yourself.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_7fd67d96", "Well, a couple of Imperial types were in here not long ago, and I overheard their conversation. It sounded like they were talking about something going down on Yavin IV.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_8ae9c189", "Sure, sure, I understand. I'll still be here if you get a chance to come back.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_9e41444d", "Did they say what was happening?");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_a5ee5a5b", "My pleasure. Take care!");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_b3ba542c", "I'm sorry, but I've got to go.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_c2f063ae", "Sure, tell me what you know.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_d6d8b3ab", "No, they didn't. In fact, I don't even think they know where it is exactly. Sounds like it's a big secret, but they said something about asking the locals. Something about a Mining Outpost, too.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_e35ee05f", "I don't have time now, I'm sorry.");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_ededde72", "Hello. How are you doing today?");
stringFiles[135].addEntry("s_f8365ece", "What else did they say?");

stringFiles[136] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_herald_dealer");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_herald_dealer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_113ae28f", "I'd like to go take a look at this mountain.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_12f0f46", "I told 'em no. Hardly anythin' unusual ever happened around here. But if I had seen then what I've seen now, I would have changed my answer.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_14b834bb", "What kind of strange things have been going on?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_188c477d", "So long, stranger.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_1945c2e", "Came straight back here obviously. I know better than to stick my head into odd caves that may or may not exist. Trouble is... no one here believes me. They all think it was just my eyes playin' tricks.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_1f5ef4a0", "Am I a seedy character?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_1fc825af", "Those people are right. You're nuts.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_253d6dd2", "Why don't you tell me about those strange folk?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_2608508b", "Oh... well, sorry. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_2688b2a3", "Well, I'll tell you something that struck me as curious. No one else around here really believes me though. They think I'm crazy...");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_2b7c5c5a", "No, I don't have anything, sorry.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_321d898b", "What do you mean by strange folk?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_3dc0cd9d", "Being a mining outpost, we've always had a couple of seedy characters hanging around, but usually looking for work or somethin'. Now they're just all over the place. Asking lots of questions sometimes, too.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_4399b8ac", "Frankly, I don't think much better of you. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_46aee9", "You've been there? Did you find that mountain? Did you see the cave? I'm not crazy am I?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_490e56dd", "You don't say? Good-bye.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_520ae1e7", "You're right, there was a cave there.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_52beeae8", "Yes, I have a few things you might be interested in.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_53fdb2c3", "Sorry, this story is boring. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_551304d2", "Alright, let's see what you have.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_5b67bd", "Well, not long ago we had an earthquake or somthin' nearby. Some thought it was an explosion, but either way, stuff like that is important to a miner. So I went over to check it out... see if there was any damage to any equipment...");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_5c031163", "Well I don't think much of you, either. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_61f5ac3", "OK, tell me please.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_674fdb0a", "Had you seen anything unusual?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_6ecc5ef7", "What was it that you saw?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_72308e43", "Wow. What did you do?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_7828a8aa", "What kind of questions are they asking?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_827f01ce", "Sometimes they ask about all that debris. Sometimes they ask questions about mining. I do remember some of those Imperials asking us if we'd seen anything unusual.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_83b0842f", "Well, I saw a cave in the mountain. But not a natural cave, someone put that cave there on purpose. The weird thing, though, is that I didn't see the cave there when I looked the first time. Then when I turned away and looked back, it was gone again.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_85f5abed", "What kind of questions have people been asking?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_86db3ca8", "Darn right I did. Turns out the quake was centered near a small mountain. We never did start any mining there as there was nothin' worth digging up. But I checked out the mountain anyway. And that's when the weird thing happened...");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_894992c6", "I think that I've been to this place that you're talking about.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_8a046130", "I knew it! Wait 'til I tell everyone. Now they'll know I'm not crazy! Did you find any relics that I might be able to buy from you?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_8d32acbf", "Did you find anything?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_93f3969d", "I'm sorry, I didn't see anything.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_9c48be16", "You're obviously crazy.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_a70cda4", "At the time, no I hadn't. Hardly anythin' unusual ever happened around here. But if I had seen then what I had seen now, I would definately had told 'em.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_aa4a4ec4", "Who has been asking questions?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_ac44ebc8", "Several people. Some folk coming in from Tatooine on the shuttle. Some Imperial types. I know they're Imperial because they wear those flashy uniforms.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_b1be0157", "Do you not usually have that sort of people around here?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_b9c59c4a", "Sure, here is the location of the mountain. You go check it out yourself, then everyone will know that I'm not seein' things. If do find it, bring back any relics or junk you might come across. I'll buy it from you for proof!");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_bbf0856c", "Ever since all that debris came raining down we've had all sorts through here. Thugs, gangsters, adventurers, Imperials, and probably some from that rebellion, too. We used to be just a quiet mining outpost.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_c0036582", "What did you tell them?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_ca3bfa0f", "Eh... you don't look much like a miner, but then again we've been getting several strange folk comin' through this outpost of late. Several strange things goin' on 'round here too. Some funny times these days if you ask me.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_ce4b0ac8", "Well, that's OK. At least I have your word to back me up. Thanks for checking it out for me.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_d78255c2", "That's very interesting. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_e00ac98e", "What happened?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_e13e9abc", "Tell me about the strange things that have been going on.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_e4e38e80", "Sorry, I've got to go. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_e998f1ae", "I dunno. Probably.");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_ec4e1fe", "Well if you don't believe me, why don't you go check it out yourself. Here, I'll give you the location of the cave. Go see it with your own eyes. If do find it, bring back any relics or junk you might come across. I'll buy it from you for proof!");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_ec7227cf", "Did you find that mountain? Did you see the cave? I'm not crazy am I?");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_f2d5ae08", "No! It can't be. I know that I'm not crazy!");
stringFiles[136].addEntry("s_f51b07ff", "What kind of questions?");

stringFiles[137] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_random");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_0", "How... how did this happen? There's no way. It's impossible.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_1", "They've all escaped, most of them anyway. Those monsters are vicious and deadly. We're lucky to be alive!");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_10", "Spiders... klik-niks... I never want to see another one as long as I live. I'll have nightmares for the rest of my life as it is.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_11", "Dead... they're all dead. I saw them. I saw them get killed by those... things we made.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_12", "I just want to leave. I want to get out of here, but those creatures are roaming the halls. They'll kill me for sure.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_13", "I'm glad you're here. Can you help me? Can you help us get out? Can you kill those things? Please!");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_14", "There's just no way. If I find out who is responsible for this, I swear...");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_15", "Be careful. Ever since that earthquake, parts of the ceiling have started caving in. Some rooms are blocked off by debris.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_16", "Where did that Imperial Inspector go? Everything was working fine until he came snooping around.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_17", "The tremor we just had must have scrambled our security circuits. The sentry droids are attacking anything that moves now!");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_18", "It's all gone wrong. There's chaos everywhere! We've got to get out of here!");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_19", "I hope everyone else is OK. I keep feeling tremors. It seems like the entire complex is ready to collapse at any moment.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_2", "I'm scared... so scared. My friends and co-workers... killed.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_20", "That massive quake. It must have damaged the holo-generators. We have got to get this place under control as quickly as possible.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_3", "I remember... an earthquake. Or was it an attack? It's all so blurry now, but I can still hear it in my head.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_4", "Did you feel the earthquake? I think that's what started all this. We should have built extra precautions, but we never expected... this.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_5", "Who knew that those creations we were working on would be so violent. Powerful, yes... but it seems they almost enjoyed killing...");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_6", "There was an Imperial officer running around a while ago, but I haven't seen him since that huge blast. I wonder where he went.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_7", "The blast... the screams... the noise. I can't get them out of my head. It's driving me crazy.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_8", "Monsters... we made monsters. I never knew... never knew they were so... so capable.");
stringFiles[137].addEntry("phrase_9", "Have you seen them yet? If you see them, run away... as fast as you can. It's the only way to stay alive.");

stringFiles[138] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_scientist_generic_01");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_scientist_generic_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_1e9bb201", "I'll see what I can do.");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_28b15c94", "No! We've got to.... help them... got to...");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_295ff7c4", "No, they won't last... please help them...");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_2ebb30d8", "Thank you... thank you. Please help them.");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_431dec6f", "Can we get them out?");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_432d5b3d", "I'll try to find help. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_4d153d91", "No, I can't. I'm sorry.");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_4d2b85dc", "Help them... in Lab Two. They're locked in, with those monsters!");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_4f78511c", "Sorry, I can't help.");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_6157f01f", "The others, in Lab Two. They're locked in, with those monsters!");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_6cabcaaf", "You'll need the code! 11380... that should open the door. Please go help them!");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_7014bfc2", "Please help them... they're trapped in Lab Two. There are monsters in there!");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_7c08824f", "Please get them out. The code 11380 should open the door. Please help them.");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_9acbce38", "Help them. Help them!");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_a1480651", "We've got to help them! They're trapped in there!");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_a5b3f77", "I'm sure they'll be alright.");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_c6a7e0ad", "No... they'll be dead. Unless we can help. Will you help them?");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_cc366e42", "Relax, I'm here to help.");
stringFiles[138].addEntry("s_e2ab2c6d", "Help who? Who's trapped?");

stringFiles[139] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_scientist_generic_02");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_scientist_generic_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_138d31dc", "Alright. I'll do what I can to help.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_1efc7a3c", "Thank you for helping us. When you're ready, you can unlock the security door to the cage area with the code 52577.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_25dab86a", "Thank you. Many thanks indeed. But there are still more of those creatures. You must help us kill them.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_3cfc62f2", "It's OK. I'm can help.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_4a7c5f71", "I'm sorry that you've decided not to help us.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_5f8b04be", "I hope that you're right, but I doubt it.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_729e1a36", "Good luck, my friend. Please hurry, I think there may still be some workers trapped in the main cage area with those monsters.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_7394ff2a", "If that is the case, then we are all dead.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_787513b2", "Don't worry. I can handle it.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_8da0f5e3", "Sorry. You're on your own.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_a31ce3f3", "I'm sure you'll find some way to deal with it.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_ab3423ac", "Oh, thank you. We are all in your debt. Many of the creatures have been locked inside the main cage area, but someone needs to go in there and finish them off. You can unlock the security door with the code 52577.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_c0da7db8", "Yes, unfortunately we did create this problem. But now it has gotten out of control, and the lives of everyone in this complex are in the balance. Won't you please help us?");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_f2a471b5", "Forget it. It's your problem. You deal with it.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_f89f44ba", "I will take care of the creatures. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_fe7a5e25", "I do hope so. Please hurry, I think there may still be some workers trapped in the main cage area with those monsters.");
stringFiles[139].addEntry("s_ff058355", "I changed my mind. I will kill the creatures.");

stringFiles[140] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_scientist_generic_03");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_scientist_generic_03) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_3a1a4e80", "My fault... it's all my fault. I've killed them... I locked them in. They don't know the code...");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_5a0551a4", "I should have done something... too late now.");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_5b104c75", "What is the code?");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_611a9cf7", "All of this. These creatures... shouldn't have made them so powerful... I was too confident. But I locked them in... with the code...");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_64f42fb0", "These creatures... the cages. Shouldn't have made them so powerful. Should have made the cages stronger. But I locked them in... with the code...");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_87bb58ec", "Calm down. What is your fault?");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_95fa4e8", "Yes, it probably is. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_a55d1241", "No... no it won't be. And it's all my fault. I've killed everyone.");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_aed85251", "The code... 92126. They're locked in... and they're going to die... and it's all my fault... my fault.");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_b4e9b11d", "Relax. It will be OK.");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_b5665d3a", "They're locked in... they don't know the code... 92126. They're going to die... all my fault.");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_e82d7c74", "What are you babbling about?");
stringFiles[140].addEntry("s_fda0157f", "All my fault... This is all my fault...");

stringFiles[141] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_scientist_geonosian");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_scientist_geonosian) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_30d18e8f", "Be careful... terrible creature... locked in... 78660...");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_3b597458", "No, no. But that's OK... I was trying to salvage data from... what's left of the computers. This was... all I could get... before the monsters attacked. You take it... put it to good use...");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_4c6bb27a", "OK, I'll take it.");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_52a88e99", "Thank you, I will.");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_5d99d708", "It's... terrible... it's locked in... 78660...");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_71f20c60", "Wait, wait... Take this... I was trying to salvage data from... what's left of the computers. This was... all I could get... before the monsters attacked... Put it to good use...");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_720b306c", "Stop blathering. You'll live.");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_7ddd5bf5", "No, I doubt that. But it's OK... I was trying to salvage data from... what's left of the computers. This was... all I could get... before the monsters attacked. You take it... put it to good use...");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_a59fc522", "Thank... thank you for rescuing me, but... I've been hurt... I don't know... if I can make it out...");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_ab9b9023", "I hope you make it. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[141].addEntry("s_f612da3", "Hang in there, you'll be alright.");

stringFiles[142] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_scientist_human");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_scientist_human) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_1c8bddbb", "What is it?");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_259e4732", "I'll make sure they're OK.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_2f286865", "Oh hey, I'm glad you came back. I'm getting ready to get out of here, but before I go, I have something that I wanted to give you...");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_37a3f14d", "Alright, but they may be in serious trouble. Thank you anyway for all your help.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_3c5b4784", "Hey now. Don't I get something for saving your life?");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_4136c2df", "Thank you very much.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_46b9a9b7", "On second thought, it's not necessary.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_4c5806c8", "I hope so.  If you can, please check on my collegues in Genetics Lab One. If they were still in there when the doors locked down they might be in trouble. You can unlock the door with the code 86332 if necessary.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_5044c295", "No problem at all. If you can, please check on my collegues in Genetics Lab One. If they were still in there when the doors locked down they might be in trouble. You can unlock the door with the code 86332 if necessary.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_6fc909ee", "You go on ahead. I'm just going to rest here for a moment. Don't forget, if you need to get into Genetics Lab One, you can use the code 86332.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_7516dec7", "That's not necessary. You don't need to give me anything.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_7e89fa19", "Oh, well yes, I suppose I do have something here. Let me see if I can find it.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_91b03aa5", "No, you're right. Here we go. A long time ago, we had plans to build weapons in case our experiments ever got out of control. We never got around to building them, and I guess now it's too late. Someone like yourself should be able to make use of this.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_976331da", "It's my pleasure. Be careful, and good luck.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_a2a14f83", "We'll see if I get a chance.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_a643bebd", "No, I want you to have it. A long time ago, we had plans to build weapons in case our experiments ever got out of control. We never got around to building them, and I guess now it's too late. Someone like yourself should be able to make use of this.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_b076c975", "Since you're here, could you please check on my colleagues in Genetics Lab One. If they were still in there when the doors locked down they might be in trouble. You can unlock the door with the code 86332 if necessary.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_b479c40b", "Yes, you seem to have killed quite a few of those creatures. I'll try to make my way out. Before I go, though, I may have something you might could use...");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_ba27cb12", "Oh, thank you so much! Thank you for saving my life. I just want to get out of here. I want to get away.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_c28dc6ef", "No, thank you. That's not necessary.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_ce30b8e3", "Oh, yes, here it is. A long time ago, we had plans to build weapons in case our experiments ever got out of control. We never got around to building them, and I guess now it's too late. Someone like yourself should be able to make use of this.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_d080da0e", "Thank you. Oh, wait a minute. Before you go I have something maybe that you can use. Just a moment and let me find it...");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_dc4694a0", "It should be safe for you to leave now.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_e2c55073", "No, no, I insist. A long time ago, we had plans to build weapons in case our experiments ever got out of control. We never got around to building them, and I guess now it's too late. Someone like yourself should be able to make use of this.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_e79d7d15", "Sure, it might come in handy.");
stringFiles[142].addEntry("s_f891f03f", "Thank you so much. I appreciate it.");

stringFiles[143] = new StringFile("conversation/biogenic_securitytech");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (biogenic_securitytech) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_164b2134", "We recently experienced some type of seismic event. It seems to have wrecked havoc with our security and containment systems. Many of my security officers have died as a result.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_18376ecf", "Alright, just be sure to stay out of the way.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_19aa7018", "No, I'm going to stay here and try to get the security system back online. Just go and help the others. I'm sure they're in trouble.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_1a87eec", "No, don't come back. Just turn around and forget you ever saw this place.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_1ea74b0a", "Can you tell me more about the escaped creatures?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_2066c897", "Actually, I could use some help, but if you're going further into the compound, you'll need a code to get through that security door. Punch in the code 12872 and you can get through. There are some things you should watch out for though.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_28594fa2", "I'd like to see more of this complex. Is there anything I should know?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_2ba5e1a3", "I'm sorry. What seems to be going on here?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_2ea369ee", "Alright. I'll do my best.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_3605064", "Yes, good. Just turn around and forget that you ever saw this place.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_367aaeab", "Sorry to bother you.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_3f226fbc", "I'd better go in and check on things. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_4a0eda9c", "OK. I'll be on my way then. Thank you.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_4abac946", "Fine, just stay out of my way.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_4bf538ac", "Can you tell me about the sentry droids again?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_4e67874f", "Can you tell me about the escaped creatures again?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_5147321f", "No, I was just leaving. Thanks for your help.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_54c04cd6", "These creatures have been modified to become very powerful. When the earthquake hit, our containment system went down, and now they are able to leave their cages and roam the halls. That is about all I know.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_55b3a778", "Nevermind that. What's going on here?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_5b2ec95c", "Sith spit. That must mean the holo-generator is offline. Add one more thing to the list of what's gone wrong.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_6738bb52", "Many of the experiments in this compound revolve around genetically mutating certain creatures. The earthquake that we experienced recently seems to have shut down out containment systems.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_6c0c46c5", "On second thought, I'd better just leave it to you.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_6dcc098c", "Just punch in the code 12872 to get through the security door.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_6e7f3aa6", "OK. What would you like for me to do?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_71d4af18", "Oh, yes. Is there anything else that I can do for you?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_7397bf4e", "Remember, I don't recommend it. But if you want to get through the security door, punch in the code 12872.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_77c97efc", "Do you need a hand in getting it under control?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_7cb640f8", "The first thing that we need to do is to kill any of those mutant creatures that might have escaped. Then we'll have a good chance of getting this place back under control.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_7df9e17e", "Aargh. More of those foul creatures have escaped. Wait a minute, how did you get in here?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_802edca9", "No problem. Now please go take care of those creatures.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_83dc19a", "What kind of things do I need to watch out for?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_8913cdec", "With our security system down, the droids' targeting protocol will be offline. They are likely to shoot at anything and everything that moves. They are positioned in halls throughout the complex.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_8cd04dbf", "Can you tell me more about the sentry droids?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_914ffdda", "Specifically, you will need to be aware of the sentry droids, and any creatures that might have escaped from their cages.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_9749167c", "I'm sorry, but I am very busy. What do you need?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_9d06ecb3", "Leave me alone.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_a35c0e94", "Well, the hole in the mountain was unlocked, so...");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_a57fff7e", "What was the code to get through the security door again?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_b49b50a8", "Well, firstly you'll need a code to get through that security door. Punch in the code 12872 and you can get through. Once you get in, there are some things you should watch out for though.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_bdace841", "What kind of failure exactly?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_c9c438be", "What of those creatures you mentioned earlier?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_d14c9940", "The same way that I'm leaving. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_d7b11a2", "Through a large opening in the side of a hill.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_d8be16a3", "Best of luck to you, friend. And be careful.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_db64ccb5", "Sound like you have your hands full. I'll leave you alone.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_e32d6faf", "Are you coming with me?");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_e4c5332b", "It's your funeral. You'll need to punch in the code 12872 to get through that security door. Just make sure none of those creatures gets in here before I get security back online.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_e8b00610", "Well, you look busy. I'll come back later.");
stringFiles[143].addEntry("s_f6349bd9", "The security in our facility here has suffered a catastrophic failure. We're doing our best to get it under control.");

stringFiles[144] = new StringFile("conversation/boba_fett");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (boba_fett) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_1122d80a", "Can you tell me again about the Death Watch?");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_262c1b3f", "I don't usually give my opinion to barves like you, but in this case I'll make an exception.  All I have to say is, the Mandalorians are dead and nobody is bringin' them back. Now go.");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_3c8497c", "You're back again?  Didn't we already have this discussion?");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_4386e081", "I've no time for the likes of you. I have more pressing matters to deal with.");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_4c801419", "Are you sure that's all there is to it?");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_515da73f", "Can't somebody else do it?");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_58de331a", "Mind your business. The Hutt wants this Death Watch and their leader dead before they cut into his business.  My informants tell me they're cutting a deal with Black Sun even as we speak.");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_6ad7d226", "You won't make any friends around here by passing on what's sure to be a lucrative job like this.");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_76956672", "The experience itself will be its own reward.  Don't come to me or the Hutt looking for a hand out, you're likely to end up on the wrong end of a blaster if you keep that up.");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_783590a2", "Do I get a reward for completing this mission?");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_8e66f1ea", "Another of Jabba's little toys... You may want to make yourself useful by checking something out when you get a chance. You're of no use wandering around the palace aimlessly. There's a rumor that Death Watch operatives can be found on Endor somewhere in the northwestern area of the planet.");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_ab11aabd", "Okay. Anything else you can tell me?");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_d586da5f", "The Death Watch can be a formidable opponent and shouldn't be taken lightly. Be careful fighting against them.");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_f215b084", "Sounds like you've dealt with them before.");
stringFiles[144].addEntry("s_f959107f", "The experience itself will be its own reward.  Don't come to me or the Hutt looking for a handout -- you're likely to end up on the wrong end of a blaster if you keep that up.");

stringFiles[145] = new StringFile("conversation/chassis_npc");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (chassis_npc) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_2f553ea8", "(BUY SHIP CHASSIS)");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_3310c404", "You don't have anything to sell me. ");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_37386aa2", "You need to procure a set of chassis blueprints from a Shipwright. Once you have the blueprints, you must come to a chassis dealer to have the chassis built to your specifications. ");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_37f48153", "I'll be here.");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_42d3759c", "I'll come back later.");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_93a92e8", "How do I assemble a ship?");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_94e3013f", "(SELL COMPONENTS)");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_9ed93871", "Hello. I can construct a ship chassis for you if you are holding a set of chassis blueprints.");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_aae81853", "Let's see what you have to sell...");
stringFiles[145].addEntry("s_bcb592f", "Let me see if you have any blueprints I can work with...");

stringFiles[146] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3lcoordinator");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3lcoordinator) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_10e4e113", "What is all this Dead Eye business?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_19d2e135", "Interesting. Please continue.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_19d54dc3", "Back so soon? I'm still trying to break the encryption on this disk. It's going to take me some time. In the mean time, go and speak with the Tactical Officer. You can find him in the Combat Guild in this city. I'm sure he has plenty that needs to be done.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_1b4eff7e", "I'm happy to hear you say that, now is as good a time as any! We have an Information Officer who we have stationed in Commerce Guild of this city. Find the Commerce Guild and speak to the Information Officer there and ask him to fill you on all that has happened so far.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_1f81bc3c", "These people are incredibly suspicious so you'll need to be very convincing. If they suspect you they won't hesitate to attack. If that happens, then I'm afraid we'll have to start over and try it again. Are you prepared to take on this task?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_1fd11fc5", "They are so cautious that caravans have been known to zig zag and circle for hours before finally heading to their destination unless things are completely safe. Simple observation won't tell us anything, so we need you to pose as a member of their organization and try to gather information about where that caravan is headed. We need hard information; disks, papers, whatever you can find. As you can imagine, this will be dangerous.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_20ad68cd", "It's a pleasure seeing you again, thank you for coming! Actually, I'm not surprised considering you have been in the middle of this whole Dead-Eye situation from the beginning. Your work so far has been top-notch and you haven't failed us yet. Would you be willing to accept another mission?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_20eec74a", "I need to do something else right now.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_223c5db", "Great, once you get all filled in on the details feel free to come back and see me. I'm not quite finished with what I'm working on but I think I may need to call upon your top notch talents once again.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_26b400f9", "Pose as one of them and do whatever you can to get your hands on some hard data about that caravan. Things like papers, manifests or disks. Come back as soon as you find something. Be careful and remember to think like a thug. If things go bad, you'll have no choice but to fight. Should that happen, come back and we can try it again.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_28de3a91", "Enough details, I'm ready to go.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_2c127c6b", "Oh, well that's too bad. I'd hoped we'd found another person we could rely on for help in our time of need. I hope you change your mind later on. If you do, please let me know.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_315ff574", "I can't make it there right now.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_36142d2b", "I can't do this right now.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_37281366", "I understand. I wouldn't want you to take on this mission unless you are completely prepared. Come back when you are ready.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_4148ae14", "I look forward to meeting the Colonel.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_448b1792", "Have you been to see Colonel Veers yet? You probably don't want to keep him waiting. Anyway, was there something I can help you with right now?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_458473c9", "Good. I'm sure there will be some heavy action when you get there, so you may want to bring some loyal friends if you're not much of a fighter.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_45cbfb7d", "Well that's a shame. If you change your mind, please let me know.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_4724fd7d", "He's using land vehicles to traffic the flora to and from the storehouses with a complex system of lookouts scattered along the routes. If any trouble is spotted, the caravans are alerted and they use a different route. It's all very organized. The intelligence I just analyzed reveals the location of all the lookouts on the planet and it indicates a caravan is to make a delivery today. Predicting the caravan's destination is simply impossible. This is where you come in.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_4aecac09", "Oh, well that's too bad. I'd thought we'd found another person we could rely on for help in our time of need. I hope you change your mind later on. If you do, please let me know.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_4ba81cc8", "Ah good, you're back! I've finished analyzing the data from our most recent intelligence and it looks pretty promising. I think we are ready to proceed with our plan. I'll need you to go undercover. If you're successful you probably won't need to fire a single shot. If you fail, that's a different story and we're back to square one. Do you have any questions?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_4ca03ddb", "How so?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_4e122a6b", "I understand. You must be a very busy person. We haven't forgotten about what you did for us last time and we don't want to put you out. We really could use your help though, so if you change your mind come back and see me. I could use a person who can get results.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_52cc7bda", "Are you sure that waypoint was correct?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_6837ec87", "Oh it's you again! I didn't expect to see you so soon. Unfortunately, I'm still crunching some data right now. Why don't you go and speak with our Information Officer. You can find him in the Commerce Guild in this city. Get all details from him about our current situation and by the time you're done with that, I should be done analyzing this data.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_6922db62", "I'd like to get involved.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_70df24d2", "I thought you'd say that. You've made a big impression and Colonel Veers himself has flown into our headquarters there to oversee the operation. He said he wanted to speak with you personally about it. I've added a waypoint to your datapad with the location of the off-world headquarters. I'd head there at once so you don't keep him waiting. ");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_740fcda6", "That's too bad, I was hoping I could count on your support with this. The offer still stands if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_7b9e2f5e", "Can I have another waypoint?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_80af7773", "Got any advice for me?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_86f67673", "These people are incredibly suspicious so you'll need to be very convincing. If they suspect you they won't hesitate to attack. If that happens, then I'm afraid we'll have to start over and try it again. ");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_87b694b0", "Let me take a moment to fill you in. Dead Eye is the code name for what was an Imperial research project. It is a pharmaceutical that grants the user deadly aim. It can make even the greenest recruit a potential threat. It was developed by a scientist named Dr. Vacca. The situation looks sort of grim for us right now but we aren't without hope. That's where you come in.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_8824a3ee", "I'm happy to hear you say that, now is as good a time as any! We have an Information Officer stationed in the Commerce Guild of this city. Find the Commerce Guild and speak to the Information Officer there and ask him to fill you on all that has happened so far.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_882bc6e0", "Well, how did things go?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_8ee9343e", "Ran into trouble did you? Well there are plenty of lookouts out there still. Here is the location of another one. Come back as soon as you find any sort of hard data about that caravan and maybe we can determine where it was heading. Good luck to you!");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_976a6f0", "Great! A lot has happened since we last spoke. I don't have time to go over all of the details with you right now. Go and speak with our Information Officer and listen to what he has to say. You can find him in the Commerce Guild Hall in this city.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_9fd43ddf", "Greetings citizen, I don't believe we've worked together before. If you haven't heard, we've been having some serious problems with the Dead Eye project. Now is as good a time as any to get involved and help us out. What do you say?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_a3ea7bf6", "I'm sorry to hear that. Come back later if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_a6f2327f", "What were the details of the mission again?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_ad11a99b", "As I'm sure you know various underworld organizations have all but cornered the market on this Alderaanian Flora. As to be expected, Jabba the Hutt has come out ahead in this game and he seems to be the one doing the most business. This flora is enormously valuable so obviously Jabba's rivals are taking every opportunity to hijack any shipments they come across. Knowing this, Jabba is using a decentralized system of storage and transport to cut down on losses.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_b4f92479", "What are the details of this mission?");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_bc0e9972", "Nothing for right now, thanks.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_c3194680", "You have a lot of nerve showing your face around here. Now move along before I call for back up!");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_c4ae7e31", "I'd love to help out again.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_cd603241", "I thought that it was correct. I'll update your datapad again just to be safe.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_cf35e3d5", "A direct approach might get you killed. You'll need to get friendly with them first and then maybe they will trust you and open up. Think like a thug. Thugs are generally greedy, selfish, out for themselves. They like things like drinking, gambling, cheating, carousing; that sort of thing.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_d55f2579", "I'm ready to go.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_d819b34e", "I'm not able to do this now.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_e08167af", "Well, it's always a pleasure to see you! We've made some progress in putting a stop to Dead Eye thanks to you. You are to be commended. I don't have anything else I need from you right now. You might ask our Tactical Officer at the Combat Guild if he still needs helping tracking down and destroying those warehouses.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_eae61031", "Great! I've uploaded the location of one of their lookouts to your datapad. Pose as one of them and do whatever you can to get your hands on some hard data about that caravan. Things like papers, manifests or disks. Come back as soon as you find something. Be careful and remember to think like a thug. If things go bad, you'll have no choice but to fight. Should that happen, come back and we can try it again.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_ecae16e7", "Ok, carry on. You should probably leave soon though.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_efdb954e", "Ok, go on.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_f35aaa26", "I'm up for anything.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_f595b0cb", "Ok, I'll go see what he has to say.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_fa0fdb09", "Great to see you again. Those disks you acquired have been of great help to our Tactical Officer. He'll be able to assign as many assault missions as you can take, but there is something of more importance if you're up for it.");
stringFiles[146].addEntry("s_fec795", "Excellent work! To be honest, I didn't think you could pull it off. You must have done some real smooth talking! I'll start analyzing the disk right away but it is going to take some time. Why don't you go and speak with the Tactical Officer, I believe he has something for you to do. You can find him in the Combat Guild of this city.");

stringFiles[147] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3lgeneralveers");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3lgeneralveers) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_1a6ba35a", "Good. Here's the location of the facility. Reduce it to rubble and destroy any traitors there you find. The destruction of this facility will seriously hamper their efforts to find an Alderaanian Flora alternative. This is not an easy mission, so you may want to recruit some help to destroy it. ");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_1cfbefd4", "So you're the one we've been hearing so much about. I wanted to personally thank you for doing such a commendable job. The Empire needs more Soldiers like you. Thanks to your efforts we were able to find one of their research facilities. Destroying this facility would strike a serious blow against them and could significantly hamper their efforts. We need that facility destroyed and I think you're just the person for the job. Can I count on you?");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_2977a9a3", "I'm not able to do this now");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_2cdb5dd0", "I can not do this right now");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_370a3d89", "What's the matter, don't know how to follow orders? Why haven't you destroyed the facility yet?");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_4461239", "I hope you realize that we don't take look kindly on failure. I'll overlook it this one time. If you wish to try it again some time in the future, you let me know.");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_4d8cedd4", "I don't have time to talk right now, I'm waiting for someone.");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_6be1cd6b", "I wasn't able to located the facility");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_92d64a93", "I'll get on it right now.");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_a486253d", "Get to it and don't leave anything standing!");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_b02864c6", "Perhaps our data was faulty. I've uploaded some fresh intel to your datapad.");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_bea4597", "Great work taking out that research facility that really hit them where it counts! If you continue your service to the Empire in this manner, I see great things in your future.");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_efae2d69", "What? This is not acceptable! Perhaps you are not as good as the stories I've been hearing about you. Get out of my sight.");
stringFiles[147].addEntry("s_fdba7430", "You can count on me.");

stringFiles[148] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3linfoofficer");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3linfoofficer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_159911f5", "Tell me more.");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_1bf8e6d", "Was there anything else?");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_3259a3bc", "Why don't you go back and speak with the coordinator. He was analyzing some data that had to do with discovering the locations of these hidden research facilities. He's probably finished by now and he probably has some work for you to do so go back and talk to him.");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_36b24b81", "Oh, well I didn't mean to bore you. If you ever want a recap of what is going on, just let me know. You may want to go and see if the coordinator is ready for you. ");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_4372123c", "What's the current situation?");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_65f79c5d", "Scum of the galaxy or not, you have to admire the intelligence work of underworld organizations. They learned of the importance of this flora well in advance of anyone else and took it upon themselves to corner the market. If we track who is buying the flora and where it is being shipped, that will lead us to their research facilities.");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_7b8e8204", "I've heard enough.");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_a318edbd", "Won't Dead Eye just fizzle out eventually?");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_a9479d34", "Hello there. I'd be happy to share information with you about what has transpired and the plan of action we've drawn up for dealing with this messy situation.");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_c326ad8f", "Well another way we can hinder the production of Dead Eye is hitting their stores of the Alderaanian Flora directly. If we can get to the flora before they do, that is that much less of the serum that can be made and used against us and that much less they can experiment with to find an alternative flora. I think the coordinator has other more immediate plans for you right now though.");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_ccc29df2", "The situation was bad and now it has gotten worse. If you haven't heard already, Dr. Vacca has made the decision to side with the enemy. They are now starting the production and testing of the Dead Eye serum in many hidden research facilities. The enemy is even making the prototype available to their followers.");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_d3ee0e7f", "One hurdle they have not been able to overcome is the fact that the Dead Eye serum requires flora that only grew on Alderaan. Needless to say, the supplies of that flora are finite and very limited. This is one fact that we will use to our advantage.");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_d6199fa3", "Vacca won't give up so easily.  As soon as the supply of Alderaanian Flora is gone, Dead Eye is no more so they are set on finding an alternative. They have set up a number of secret research facilities to produce the Dead Eye serum and more importantly for them, to find a substitute for the rare flora. However some recent developments have come to light that may make tracking down these facilities easier then they expect.");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_e6eebf47", "So what can I do to help?");
stringFiles[148].addEntry("s_eb1ac0f9", "Hello there. I'm a little busy at the moment. If you're looking for work, perhaps you should seek out the Coordinator in this city. He may have something for you to do.");

stringFiles[149] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3ltactofficer");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3ltactofficer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_18c581cc", "Ok, suit yourself then. Come back any time you feel like helping me get rid of these stores of Alderaanian Flora.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_1b5eac32", "Good! Jabba has warehouses of that flora all over the Galaxy. As we find them, we are sending volunteers out to destroy them and confiscate the flora. I've added a waypoint to your datapad for a warehouse we've located close by. Go destroy it and confiscate any flora you find. I'll reward you for any Alderaanian Flora that you turn in.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_1c693828", "I hear that you've been working with the coordinator lately to try to put a stop to this whole Dead Eye thing. Good for you! Another way we can hamper the production of Dead Eye is by attacking their store houses directly. The more Alderaanian Flora we can keep out of their hands, the better. Would you be willing to help us out in this matter?");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_1cb2157b", "I'm ready to take out another warehouse");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_1f281089", "That's what I like to hear. There's a waypoint in your datapad for another warehouse we've found. Go get it!");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_268282e6", "Hmm, that's odd. Maybe we already took care of that one. Here, I've given you a waypoint for another warehouse we need taken out. Good luck to you!");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_2c01da39", "If you haven't completed the Coordinator's tasks, you should return to him. If you have, we know of more warehouses you can assault. Either way, you can hand me any Alderaanian Flora you have and I will happily reward you for it.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_2e791c9d", "I can't complete this mission.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_38f00205", "Quit standing around then and move it.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_3c57b03", "Why haven't you destroyed that warehouse? Is something the matter?");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_3d82703f", "Well I appreciate the offer of help anyway. If you want to try it again later, come back and let me know.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_4e9f338", "I need to take care of other things right now.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_4fcdc5b8", "Thanks. You can hand in flora for a reward, or keep it for yourself. Either way, we have more warehouses to take down if you're willing.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_5166bfb2", "I'm not interested in that right now.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_688721b0", "Sorry, I'll get right now it.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_6a582260", "Are you a moisture farmer or something? I guess we all can't be soldiers. Well I appreciate the offer of help anyway. If you want to try it again later, come back and let me know.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_743c9f18", "You still haven't destroyed that warehouse. Why is that?");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_83258fb0", "What? Don't have the stomach for it? Come back when you've had a chance to settle your nerves.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_958a6a44", "You've been a real hero lately, people have been buzzing about your work. If you're looking for something to do, there's plenty more warehouses to take care of! And I'm still offering a reward for turning in any Alderaanian Flora you come across.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_ba1a3080", "Nothing's wrong, never mind.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_e40779f7", "Well quit standing around! There's work to be done!");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_e4daff30", "I'm not going to be able to help you right now.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_ed0f23a8", "Excellent! I've uploaded another waypoint to your datapad. Go destroy the warehouse and collect the flora.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_f2fe6350", "I was not able to find the warehouse.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_f64d217f", "I'm sorry I can't talk right now. I'm very busy. This Dead Eye situation is getting out of control and I have my hands full. Rather then chit-chatting, how about you lend a hand already? Go and talk to the coordinator and make yourself useful.");
stringFiles[149].addEntry("s_f96e5eed", "I'd be happy to help.");

stringFiles[150] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3sharedcaravanleader");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3sharedcaravanleader) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_1dde12ed", "Are you the one I'm waiting on? Transporting this much... umm cargo... over land is dangerous. There are a lot of people that would love to hijack this shipment. With us being broke down; it's only a matter of time before they find us.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_29e36db9", "I'm just passing through.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_302369bd", "That's none of your business. If you're not here to do the repairs, get lost!");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_48566ef9", "What's in it for me?");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_8264ab67", "Thank the stars! Here's the part we need to get fixed. Repair that anti-gravity unit and let me know when you're finished. Then we can all get out of here and forget this whole mess ever happened.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_869e12b2", "Why are you still here? We have work to do so we can get moving and I don't need you bothering us. Get lost!");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_93eb6764", "Yes, here it is.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_b22dadc9", "Listen. This cargo is immensely valuable to Jabba. You make these repairs and I'll give you a disk that explains everything. You turn that in and I'm sure they will give you a big reward for helping make this delivery a success.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_b4c62ef2", "Well what are you waiting for, get to it! You're in as much danger as us just sitting out here in the open. The quicker that part is repaired, the better it will be for all of us.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_b5f15b19", "Not yet.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_ca41d9fd", "Well you'll keep on passing through then if you know what's good for you. There's nothing to see here.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_d3ba3662", "So is that part repaired yet?");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_da681077", "What are you transporting?");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_e0d207ec", "Didn't your mother ever tell you not to talk to strangers? Keep on moving the way you were headed and forget anything you've seen here.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_e2c11475", "Take this disc. It gives our new ETA and all the gritty details of this debacle of an operation. Most importantly, it explains I'm not at fault. I don't want this breakdown to tarnish my reputation. I'd rather die than to survive a hijacking and have to face Jabba. He'd hold me personally responsible for the loss of the cargo I'm sure! And don't get any ideas about reading that disk. That's all classified info and it's all encoded.");
stringFiles[150].addEntry("s_f3da7c8a", "Yes, I'm here to make the repairs.");

stringFiles[151] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3sharedlookout");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3sharedlookout) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_1c8bddbb", "What is it?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_1cace673", "Oh...");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_1d45a1b2", "You too huh? Well it's great we have something in common! Too bad we don't have cards or we could have us a game. Say, what's your favorite Sabacc variant?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_24813e89", "Well, a little fun never hurt no one. It ain't right stayin' so focused on work all the time. You need to learn to lighten up.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_2b3ee988", "Sorry. I'm not good at that sort of thing");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_2c2f4605", "I'm feeling lazy. Why can't you do it?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_2fe8f4b5", "Those guys are always getting lost. I'll upload their last known location to your datapad again.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_3029f004", "Listen pal, I don't know who you are but you better get lost. Strangers make me nervous and when I get nervous, it makes me want to start shootin' if ya know what I mean. Now beat it!");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_33d80544", "Anyone workin' for the big guy would know the answer to that or would know better not to ask!");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_39c1d4f4", "Err... Yeah I'm great at fixing things.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_41d587bc", "Oh come on! It won't take ya any time to do and with that repair kit it will be so easy a Wookiee could do it! You need to help us out here; we'll all end up as rancor kibble if something happens to this shipment, don't make me beg!");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_43af83df", "What do you do for fun?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_46c66c6d", "I love playing Sabacc.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_48a4f87f", "Don't you know it! If I had better luck, I'd play it for a livin'. It would probably less risky then this line of work.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_4957d505", "I'm more of a Lugjack person.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_4ae032b9", "Now we're talkin'! That's a good philosophy to stick too. The pay's not bad but the kick-backs you get from making Jabba happy, that's what makes it all worth it.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_4e7b2666", "I can't leave this camp! Jabba wants me planted here to keep an eye on our over-land shipping routes. The last thing we need is to lose a valuable shipment to the likes of Valerian or the Alkharans. But if that part isn't fixed, that's just what's going to happen! Those guys are stranded out there and its only a matter of time before someone sees them. Lots of people want to get their hands on that cargo.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_4fe0cc64", "Wow, you must be good! I can't keep up with all that constant rule changin'.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_5b9f69a4", "Yes, lots of money to be made at that game.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_5d8182f2", "I collect weapons. The bigger the better.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_6273debb", "You're a chatty one. Then again, it gets a little lonely bein' out here so it's nice to have someone to chat with. But let's just keep it to small talk okay?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_68196cce", "Weapon collector huh? That's too rich a hobby for someone like me. Nah, a reliable blaster is really all I need.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_69fbc643", "Sure, sounds easy enough.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_70614d9f", "I come on behalf of Valerian.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_74476a3d", "Yeah I hear you there. Do this, do that, go here, blah blah blah. It all gets old, ya know?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_74f0143a", "Ya talkin' to me? Who sent ya?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_789d30e1", "There's more then one way to play?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_7d2ae36c", "You're a real sport. That caravan's deliverin' an important shipment but one of our speeders had a breakdown and lost one of its anti-gravity units. Take this repair kit and get that speeder up and running. They'll give you a disk explainin' their status and their new ETA. Just be careful you don't lose it! Even though it is encoded, it contains a lot of sensitive information. If you lose the disk, not getting paid would be the least of your worries.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_7eb4d42", "Fine.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_82fdf085", "So, can ya go and make those repairs then?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_8591381a", "Why do you think you can fool me into thinkin' you're someone you ain't? Now I have no choice but to kill ya!");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_869a3fda", "Yeah, I'm on my way there right now.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_8aa225b4", "Did you hear anything about the caravan in this area?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_8c75fac0", "What!? I mean... I hope she's doing ok and all... Uh... Never mind.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_8cf78df2", "Hey, shouldn't you be out making those repairs? We have to get that caravan moving pronto!");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_8dccb521", "Who said anythin' about a caravan? I'm starting to think maybe you're not on the up and up here asking things like that.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_90b36308", "Whatever makes me the most money.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_93295f8c", "One of them huh? Well that's not game for me.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_a31bb6a5", "Random Sabacc.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_ab11e3a9", "The regular kind of Sabacc.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_b1f8b064", "I'm sorry I thought you were someone else.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_b3049ce7", "Enough chit chat. What do you know about the caravan?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_b4e5d3ef", "I wasn't able to find the caravan.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_b6a2f31", "You're darn right you're sorry and I am someone else. In fact, lets just say ya never saw me okay? That would be better for both of us. Got it? Now get out of here before you wind up with a nice blaster hole in your head!");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_bb54f6cc", "None of your business.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_bcb9ba12", "What do you know about Alderaanian flora?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_be39516b", "Yeah, there's lots of different rule variations used throughout the galaxy. You don't know as much about the game as I thought. Now I really wish we had some cards, you sound like easy money to me.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_c6ca8aca", "Ya do? I can't give ya anything, what I have is mine. But take a rest if ya need it. So what sort of work do you do do?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_c8af5b42", "You better watch your step kiddo.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_da6c5185", "I told you, I'm not mechanically inclined.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_dbe291a4", "Alkhara sent me.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_e0ec2153", "The regular kind huh? Hehe, alright then.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_e1e1e0ac", "Whatever Jabba asks me to do.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_e6e3a9f7", "So... What do you like to do for fun?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_e9a05b92", "I'm in sort of a jam right now. You wouldn't happen to be good at fixin' things would ya? One of the speeders in our caravan has a busted 100-GU anti-gravity unit and it ain't goin' no where until it gets repaired. Jabba's got a lot of money tied up in this shipment so I'm sure he'd pay ya well for your trouble!");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_e9f1af41", "Well get on it already!");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_efba54e2", "I like gamblin'. Mostly Sabacc, ya know? I stay away from those Lugjack machines. Ya may as well be throwin' credits into the Sarlacc Pit playin' that game. That's a game for old women and clueless nobles who can't appreciate the subtleties of a real man's game. You like Sabacc?");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_eff5d25", "Say. There's something I need to ask you.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_f33a89f5", "Games are a foolish waste of time.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_f513f012", "You're a real sport. This is a really important shipment and if it's lost, Jabba will have all our heads. Take this repair kit and get that part fixed. They'll give you an encoded disk that explains their status. Just deliver that disk and I'm sure you'll be paid well. Just don't lose it! Even though it is encoded, I'd hate to be you if you let it fall into the wrong hands.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_f9883674", "I work for Jabba.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_fac80094", "Really? That's mighty... fine...");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_fcb2a3f3", "I like dancing and reading poetry.");
stringFiles[151].addEntry("s_fdb57c0", "The twin suns take ya, you're exasperating! Listen, I trust you and you look smart enough to figure out what is supposed to go where on a simple part. Aside from the shipment, there are lives on the line here and some of the guys in that caravan owe me a lot of money. Are ya sure ya won't reconsider, I'm beggin' ya here?");

stringFiles[152] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3wcoolguy");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3wcoolguy) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_4c3cd444", "I'd like to finish what I started.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_62241cb7", "What's going on?");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_6428dedb", "I can't complete this mission right now.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_83b68081", "Not yet. I'm working on it.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_9ebad40b", "We're trying to find an alternative to Alderaanian Flora for the Dead Eye process and have a number of research stations working on the problem. If we succeed we will be able to continue to make Dead Eye. If we can't, Dead Eye will be useless once the current stores of Alderaanian Flora are exhausted.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_a3621ded", "I'm sorry, but we are very busy right now. If you want to help, you should go find one of our Coordinators.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_a4053724", "Did you complete the mission yet?");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_a85b1da", "It is so nice to meet you. Your bravery so far has generated quite a bit of conversation in the ranks. Are you ready to do more for the Alliance?");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_bb33eb73", "Datapad troubles? That happens. I'll upload a new waypoint to your pad. Good luck.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_c0e4cb7a", "Excellent. We have a number of research stations that are coming under attack from the Empire. I've uploaded a waypoint to your datapad. Head out there and stop the attackers. It will be a hard fight. You might need help.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_c500ae34", "The Rebellion owes you a debt of thanks. If we are able to finish this research, we will be able to replace the Alderaanian Flora with a suitable alternative and bring Dead Eye to our troops. While the Tactical Officers might have more missions to collect flora, we have asked all of you that we can. You have my personal thanks. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_cc92be25", "I'm sorry to hear that. These stations are constantly coming under attack, so come back if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_cf3aed9b", "Good luck then. Come back when you're done.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_d1ae6871", "I don't have time for this now.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_d768eb98", "What is the enemy doing?");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_dc616180", "I need to get a new assignment, that last one had a bad waypoint.");
stringFiles[152].addEntry("s_f3080e5", "They have discovered our research stations and have been launching constant attacks against them. They are hoping to hinder our research to the point that Dead Eye will fail.");

stringFiles[153] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3wcoordinator");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3wcoordinator) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_19d2e135", "Interesting. Please continue.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_19d54dc3", "Back so soon? I'm still trying to break the encryption on this disk. It's going to take me some time. In the mean time, go and speak with the Tactical Officer. You can find him in the Combat Guild in this city. I'm sure he has plenty that needs to be done.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_1b4eff7e", "I'm happy to hear you say that, now is as good a time as any! We have an Information Officer who we have stationed in Commerce Guild of this city. Find the Commerce Guild and speak to the Information Officer there and ask him to fill you on all that has happened so far.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_1f81bc3c", "These people are incredibly suspicious so you'll need to be very convincing. If they suspect you they won't hesitate to attack. If that happens, then I'm afraid we'll have to start over and try it again. Are you prepared to take on this task?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_1fd11fc5", "They are so cautious that caravans have been known to zig zag and circle for hours before finally heading to their destination unless things are completely safe. Simple observation won't tell us anything, so we need you to pose as a member of their organization and try to gather information about where that caravan is headed. We need hard information; disks, papers, whatever you can find. As you can imagine, this will be dangerous.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_20eec74a", "I need to do something else right now.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_26b400f9", "Pose as one of them and do whatever you can to get your hands on some hard data about that caravan. Things like papers, manifests or disks. Come back as soon as you find something. Be careful and remember to think like a thug. If things go bad, you'll have no choice but to fight. Should that happen, come back and we can try it again.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_28de3a91", "Enough details, I'm ready to go.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_315ff574", "I can't make it there right now.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_36142d2b", "I can't do this right now.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_37281366", "I understand. I wouldn't want you to take on this mission unless you are completely prepared. Come back when you are ready.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_45cbfb7d", "Well that's a shame. If you change your mind, please let me know.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_4724fd7d", "He's using land vehicles to traffic the flora to and from the storehouses with a complex system of lookouts scattered along the routes. If any trouble is spotted, the caravans are alerted and they use a different route. It's all very organized. The intelligence I just analyzed reveals the location of all the lookouts on the planet and it indicates a caravan is to make a delivery today. Predicting the caravan's destination is simply impossible. This is where you come in.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_4aecac09", "Oh, well that's too bad. I'd thought we'd found another person we could rely on for help in our time of need. I hope you change your mind later on. If you do, please let me know.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_4ba81cc8", "Ah good, you're back! I've finished analyzing the data from our most recent intelligence and it looks pretty promising. I think we are ready to proceed with our plan. I'll need you to go undercover. If you're successful you probably won't need to fire a single shot. If you fail, that's a different story and we're back to square one. Do you have any questions?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_4ca03ddb", "How so?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_4f6ac618", "Good. He'll give you a status report. By the time you return from the Commerce Guild Hall I should have updated intel on our next move. See you soon.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_52cc7bda", "Are you sure that waypoint was correct?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_62241cb7", "What's going on?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_6837ec87", "Oh it's you again! I didn't expect to see you so soon. Unfortunately, I'm still crunching some data right now. Why don't you go and speak with our Information Officer. You can find him in the Commerce Guild in this city. Get all details from him about our current situation and by the time you're done with that, I should be done analyzing this data.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_6922db62", "I'd like to get involved.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_740fcda6", "That's too bad, I was hoping I could count on your support with this. The offer still stands if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_75565d5a", "Any hints?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_7b9e2f5e", "Can I have another waypoint?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_86f67673", "These people are incredibly suspicious so you'll need to be very convincing. If they suspect you they won't hesitate to attack. If that happens, then I'm afraid we'll have to start over and try it again. ");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_882bc6e0", "Well, how did things go?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_8d99c71a", "I see you're back. Good job. Everyone's talking about how you were able to break into that relay station and send the Princess' message. Quite a feat. I haven't been fully briefed yet, but I hear Vacca's made his decision. Whichever side he picks, things are going to get interesting. You want to stick around and help? We could use you.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_8ee9343e", "Ran into trouble did you? Well there are plenty of lookouts out there still. Here is the location of another one. Come back as soon as you find any sort of hard data about that caravan and maybe we can determine where it was heading. Good luck to you!");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_a3ea7bf6", "I'm sorry to hear that. Come back later if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_a6f2327f", "What were the details of the mission again?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_a97e415d", "I thought you'd say that. You've made a big impression and the Princess has decided to oversee the operation herself. She said she wanted to speak with you personally about it. I've added a waypoint to your datapad with the location of the off-world headquarters. I'd head there at once so you don't keep her waiting.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_ad11a99b", "As I'm sure you know various underworld organizations have all but cornered the market on this Alderaanian Flora. As to be expected, Jabba the Hutt has come out ahead in this game and he seems to be the one doing the most business. This flora is enormously valuable so obviously Jabba's rivals are taking every opportunity to hijack any shipments they come across. Knowing this, Jabba is using a decentralized system of storage and transport to cut down on losses.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_afa4d099", "Hello.  I don't recall if we've worked together before. No matter, if you're loyal to the ideals of freedom and against the tyranny of the Empire, we can use you. And now is as good a time as any to get involved and help us out. Are you interested?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_afc313e6", "I'll do what I can to help.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_b4f92479", "What are the details of this mission?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_bc0e9972", "Nothing for right now, thanks.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_c9282e23", "Have you been to see the Princess yet? You probably don't want to keep her waiting. Anyway, was there something I can help you with right now?");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_cd603241", "I thought that it was correct. I'll update your datapad again just to be safe.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_cf35e3d5", "A direct approach might get you killed. You'll need to get friendly with them first and then maybe they will trust you and open up. Think like a thug. Thugs are generally greedy, selfish, out for themselves. They like things like drinking, gambling, cheating, carousing; that sort of thing.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_d55f2579", "I'm ready to go.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_d819b34e", "I'm not able to do this now.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_d8988a1e", "Oh, well that's too bad. I we'd found another person we could rely on for help in our time of need. I hope you change your mind later on. If you do, please let me know.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_dcc13dd0", "You haven't heard? Let me take a moment to fill you in. Dead Eye is the code name for what was an Imperial research project. It is a pharmaceutical that grants the user deadly aim. It can make even the greenest recruit a potential threat. It was developed by a scientist named Dr. Vacca. The situation looks sort of grim for us right now but we aren't without hope. That's where you come in.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_e0227bd9", "Excellent! If you do as well as last time, we will definitely come out on top. I haven't been briefed on the details so you'll have to go speak with the Information Officer, he'll fill you in. You can find him in the Commerce Guild Hall in this city.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_e19d057c", "Don't you have anything better to do then to harrass a law abiding citizen? Get lost!");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_e2c3d142", "Good to see you again. Thanks to your efforts we stand a good chance of finding an alternative source of flora for Dead Eye. You're to be commended. I don't have anything else I need from you right now, but you might ask our Tactical Officer at the Combat Guild if he still needs helping tracking down and destroying those warehouses.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_eae61031", "Great! I've uploaded the location of one of their lookouts to your datapad. Pose as one of them and do whatever you can to get your hands on some hard data about that caravan. Things like papers, manifests or disks. Come back as soon as you find something. Be careful and remember to think like a thug. If things go bad, you'll have no choice but to fight. Should that happen, come back and we can try it again.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_ecae16e7", "Ok, carry on. You should probably leave soon though.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_efdb954e", "Ok, go on.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_f35aaa26", "I'm up for anything.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_f595b0cb", "Ok, I'll go see what he has to say.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_fa0fdb09", "Great to see you again. Those disks you acquired have been of great help to our Tactical Officer. He'll be able to assign as many assault missions as you can take, but there is something of more importance if you're up for it.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_fb75278f", "I understand. You must be a very busy person. We haven't forgotten about what you did for us last time and we don't want to put you out. We really could use your help though. Come back if you change your mind and see me. I'm sure we can use your talents.");
stringFiles[153].addEntry("s_fec795", "Excellent work! To be honest, I didn't think you could pull it off. You must have done some real smooth talking! I'll start analyzing the disk right away but it is going to take some time. Why don't you go and speak with the Tactical Officer, I believe he has something for you to do. You can find him in the Combat Guild of this city.");

stringFiles[154] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3winfoofficer");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3winfoofficer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_159911f5", "Tell me more.");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_36b24b81", "Oh, well I didn't mean to bore you. If you ever want a recap of what is going on, just let me know. You may want to go and see if the coordinator is ready for you. ");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_4372123c", "What's the current situation?");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_5adb0095", "It will unless we can produce an alternative. We have already set up a number of small research facilities where we are trying to find an alternative. If it works, and we are not hindered by the opposition, we should be able to keep Dead Eye up and running. If we don't find an alternative, Dead Eye will be useless once the current supply of Alderaanian Flora runs out. If we can even get our hands on the current supply.");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_708aa59f", "I was told you would be arriving. I don't have much time and there's much to do, so I'll try to make this briefing quick.");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_7b8e8204", "I've heard enough.");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_80cfbf07", "What do we do?");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_8bb9b684", "Scum of the galaxy or not, you have to admire the intelligence work of the underworld organizations. They learned of the importance of this flora well in advance of anyone else and took it upon themselves to corner the market.");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_a318edbd", "Won't Dead Eye just fizzle out eventually?");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_a43858ea", "We sent briefings to the Coordinators on some potential ways to get our hands on some of the stockpiles of the flora. Go talk with the Coordinator and he'll assign you a mission.");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_c91c8c81", "The situation is good. The message Princess Leia sent to Vacca did the trick. He's  given us a prototype Dead Eye schematic. You can requisition one from any of our Recruiters, but you'll need some science skills to use it. It's nearly ready for use, though there are a few technical hurdles we must overcome.");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_e695be09", "One hurdle we have not been able to overcome is the fact that the Dead Eye serum requires flora that only grew on Alderaan. Needless to say, the supplies of that flora are finite and very limited.");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_e6eebf47", "So what can I do to help?");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_eb1ac0f9", "Hello there. I'm a little busy at the moment. If you're looking for work, perhaps you should seek out the Coordinator in this city. He may have something for you to do.");
stringFiles[154].addEntry("s_f971a76c", "We'll have to get it from them quickly. Without even a small supply we won't be able to replicate an alternative and all this work will have been for nothing.");

stringFiles[155] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3wtactofficer");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3wtactofficer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_1b5eac32", "Good! Jabba has warehouses of that flora all over the Galaxy. As we find them, we are sending volunteers out to destroy them and confiscate the flora. I've added a waypoint to your datapad for a warehouse we've located close by. Go destroy it and confiscate any flora you find. I'll reward you for any Alderaanian Flora that you turn in.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_1b8e1fa4", "I've got some business I need to take care of first.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_1cb2157b", "I'm ready to take out another warehouse");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_1f281089", "That's what I like to hear. There's a waypoint in your datapad for another warehouse we've found. Go get it!");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_268282e6", "Hmm, that's odd. Maybe we already took care of that one. Here, I've given you a waypoint for another warehouse we need taken out. Good luck to you!");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_29fae614", "Alright, come back any time you feel like helping me find more of these stores of Alderaanian Flora.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_2e791c9d", "I can't complete this mission.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_38f00205", "Quit standing around then and move it.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_3c57b03", "Why haven't you destroyed that warehouse? Is something the matter?");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_3d82703f", "Well I appreciate the offer of help anyway. If you want to try it again later, come back and let me know.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_5166bfb2", "I'm not interested in that right now.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_688721b0", "Sorry, I'll get right now it.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_6a582260", "Are you a moisture farmer or something? I guess we all can't be soldiers. Well I appreciate the offer of help anyway. If you want to try it again later, come back and let me know.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_743c9f18", "You still haven't destroyed that warehouse. Why is that?");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_83258fb0", "What? Don't have the stomach for it? Come back when you've had a chance to settle your nerves.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_885ae409", "Ok, suit yourself then. Come back any time you feel like helping find more stores of Alderaanian Flora.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_8d1b9304", "I wasn't able to find the warehouse.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_acadf21d", "If you haven't completed the Coordinator's tasks, you should return to him. If you have, we know of more warehouses you can assault anytime. Either way, you can hand me any Alderaanian Flora you have and I will happily reward you for it.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_b8e8976a", "You're the one the Coordinator sent to help out? I see. Well, if you're here you must be doing something right. Right now our biggest issue is getting a hold of this Alderaanian Flora. Without it Dead Eye is just so much space garbage. We need people to go out and strike at these underworld storehouses and recover as much as we can.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_ba1a3080", "Nothing's wrong, never mind.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_ddef5a7b", "There's plenty more warehouses to take care of if you're still interested! Otherwise, maybe the coordinator has something else he needs done. Either way if you have any Alderaanian Flora you'd like to dispose of, I will happily reward you for it.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_e40779f7", "Well quit standing around! There's work to be done!");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_e4daff30", "I'm not going to be able to help you right now.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_f2fe6350", "I was not able to find the warehouse.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_f64d217f", "I'm sorry I can't talk right now. I'm very busy. This Dead Eye situation is getting out of control and I have my hands full. Rather then chit-chatting, how about you lend a hand already? Go and talk to the coordinator and make yourself useful.");
stringFiles[155].addEntry("s_f96e5eed", "I'd be happy to help.");

stringFiles[156] = new StringFile("conversation/coa3wvacca");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (coa3wvacca) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_11b13f7a", "Right now we have some stores of Alderaanian Flora, but my home planet was the last place it grew. Once it runs out Dead Eye will be useless.");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_11d4164", "What's the status of Dead Eye?");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_6d583b5", "It wasn't because of Rebel activity. It was a whim. A cold, heartless, whim of Grand Moff Tarkin. He wanted a demonstration of the Empire's power, so he killed an entire planet. I now know the truth, so I couldn't work for them anymore.");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_8e697de4", "Oh. Hello. I'm sorry, but they really don't want me to talk to anyone not associated with the project. You understand.");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_913b747e", "You're the one who sent me the message from the Princess. I really have to thank you. I was deluding myself for far too long about the Empire. I'm glad I was able to give Dead Eye to the Rebellion .");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_96405da8", "What was the reason?");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_b2b7f750", "What can be done?");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_ba517076", "After reading the message from Princess Leia I realized that I had blinded myself to the evils of the Empire. After further communications I had my eyes opened to the real reason Alderaan was destroyed.");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_bbc96393", "Why did you choose the Rebellion?");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_be18866d", "Ah, you're the one who is helping us fight the Empire for Dead Eye.");
stringFiles[156].addEntry("s_d24fb27", "If we can find an alternative flora resource, we can try to make another version. We have a number of research stations scattered about a number of planets testing various samples.");

stringFiles[157] = new StringFile("conversation/combat_quest_p3");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (combat_quest_p3) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_1b62f30b", "Our scouting missions have revealed some very crucial information about possible enemy encampments right here on Dathomir!  We are not certain of the exact locations and our intelligence tells us that the enemy is constantly on the move attempting to elude detection.We must seek out these encampments and capture whatever leadership may lie within.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_206a4b9b", "I understand.  Farewell.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_2a5da4e9", "If you and a friend decide to take this task on together, I will make sure that both of you receive your training as long as you both participate.I would not have you risk your precious life for nothing in return.Which part of this mission are you interested in (you can also perform both tasks if you wish).");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_2c9f72e9", "I have nothing for you to do right now.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_3804b036", "Then you must power down the shield generator and eliminate at least 5 of the enemy's troops afterwards.  You will fail this mission if you perish any time after the shield comes down but before the commander is captured.  You must then also ensure that the commander somehow makes it back to this village for interrogation.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_43c7c81c", "What information do you have?");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_476f5295", "It looks like you're already helping someone else in the village.  See me again later when you're ready to give me your undivided attention.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_50cdfefd", "Very well.  Come back to see me if you're still interested in helping us to bring a swift end to this evil that has befallen our village.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_51775d2e", "A yes.  This encryption is rather simple.  I have added the waypoint information to your datapad.  I suspect you may find some enemy activity around that area, so be careful.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_527934ce", "It's that easy, huh?");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_54db1a8e", "Very well.  Goodbye.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_5604a3fb", "I'm afraid I don't have the time right now.  Good luck though.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_5d6c3f37", "I want to turn in this waypoint datadisk...");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_5ee8eee8", "You've already helped the village out enough for now.  Come see me again when we're ready to get on with our preparations.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_6c565018", "Sorry, I'm not interested in learning more about Melee Accuracy.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_7481097c", "Well, not really.  First of all we need to know the exact frequency code for the specific shield you wish to power down in order to configure the remote control device.   Each shield has its own frequency code.We have gotten reports that many of the enemy's soldiers carry datadisks with frequency codes on them.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_822aed71", "We've gained some critical information about the enemy, thanks to the efforts of you and your friends. The time for our attack has come.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_8767a129", "What about my reward, if I work with someone else?");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_97bc1b9", "Then you must join a group with someone who powered down the shield generator, and eliminate at least 5 of the enemy's troops after the shield comes down.  You must then also capture the base commander and safely return him to me for questioning.  You will not receive credit for this mission if you are not the one who returns the commander to me.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_9bd673a6", "Tell me about capturing the camp's commander...");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_a48b66a0", "I will fight for you!");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_ab0e6060", "Attack? Well, I have this appointment, you see...");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_ae1194d7", "If you return such a data disk to me, I will give you a remote control device configured with the proper frequency to power down the shield.If however, one of your companions here at the village already has a remote control device for a given enemy camp, it might be wiser to simply help them instead.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_b8a984d3", "I'm afraid I can't offer much in return, but I can put in a good word with Noldan, so that he might allow you to train Melee Accuracy.  Will you still assist me?  Keep in mind that if you're helping me, you won't be able to do any other work here in the village until later.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_c012ae2b", "Very well.  Here is a remote control configured with the frequency code on the datapad.   Good luck");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_d403b674", "I want to turn in these frequency codes...");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_dd3cd5d7", "And I guess I'm supposed to find these datadisks?");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_de9f3fb3", "Tell me about powering down the shield generator...");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_e4a148f5", "Excellent!We have learned that the camps are protected by heavy weaponry as well as an impervious repulsor shield.  Our scouts tell us that the shield generator being used by the enemy is an Old Republic style model for which we know the exact specifications.  This allows us to configure remote control devices to power down the shield.");
stringFiles[157].addEntry("s_f3864fa4", "Tell me what I need to do again...");

stringFiles[158] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_imperial_dark_trooper");
stringFiles[158].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_imperial_dark_trooper) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[158].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[158].addEntry("s_5036d464", "Public relations program override. Weapons: disengage.");
stringFiles[158].addEntry("s_9cea209b", "You must return to your unit and retrieve the code.");
stringFiles[158].addEntry("s_a0b913c2", "Imperial recruitment protocol phase one. Input code.");
stringFiles[158].addEntry("s_c7770eea", "(Guess a number)");
stringFiles[158].addEntry("s_dacdfa1f", "Where's your owner?!");
stringFiles[158].addEntry("s_dd12949d", "That number was incorrect. Public relations program override. Weapons: disengage.");
stringFiles[158].addEntry("s_eb9887db", "I don't know the code.");

stringFiles[159] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_imperial_tier3");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_imperial_tier3) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_107391a2", "Hmmm, where have I heard that before?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_12c769cf", "So we are to try to split the alliance between Nym and the Rebellion?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_14060a1c", "I've seen worse - and I've seen better, too. If you want to stay with Black Epsilon, you'll need more skills.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_1474f13c", "What did the order say?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_18509eaa", "That is something I will be the judge of. It says in your record that you served under Prisk Kith'Vys. Usually he is a good judge of talent but I am not so sure about his choice this time. What do you have to say for yourself, pilot?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_1969477d", "What would this new problem be?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_19be2c59", "You got yourself a fine soldier.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_1bf62740", "It's so simple. We start a fight between the Hutts and Nym. The Hutts do our dirty work for us and suddenly it becomes too expensive for Nym to operate in this system. He cannot afford to fight with both the Empire and Hutts.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_1c0f4063", "%TU. What kind of name is that?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_1c74e041", "Do you think they will find out it was us?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_1d2c73ce", "What if he tries to get revenge?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_1dab174a", "See, you do still have something to learn from me. What is it you are interested in?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_1e26f934", "Correct! And after you capture the ship we will need you to stir up Nym's gang a bit with some Hutt broadcasts. Then you will be traveling with the retrofitted vessel in order to destroy some of Nym's fighters.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_1f1da1b8", "Do I look like I want to hear excuses from you? Get out of here! And don't come back until the job is done.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_22f895e3", "Glad you asked. First we are going to need one of the Hutt's smuggler ships. You will capture that ship for us. We will retrofit that vessel with a special sensor jammer that will increase its signature, masking other ships flying with it.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_24a3fa0c", "Who's that?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_24f21f71", "Ah, I see. With the enlarged signature it will appear that the Hutt vessel is destroying Nym's men.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_26b0b5d1", "I would be rather shocked if they didn't already know. I don't like Nym or the Hutts, but never assume that either group is stupid. The thing is that it doesn't matter. There is so much bad blood between the two groups that all they really needed was an excuse to start fighting. All they needed was a little push.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_271e95b3", "So does the Emperor. Our goals will be to first take one of Nym's transport ships. They usually have detailed records of shipping lanes and that sort of thing in the Lok system. Once we have that we can find out where Nym's military forces are and hammer them with everything we got. Go capture and inspect me one of those transports.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_27e5eff7", "Don't thank me yet. I haven't thrown you any curveballs - until now. Prepare to head for Lok.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_28d87347", "Reports are you've been working against the Empire... assisting the Rebel Alliance.  Well?  What do you have to say for yourself?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_2b261439", "You're just full of questions. But I suppose you are on the need-to-know list. Apparently there is a loose alliance between the Rebels and Nym that was forged by some Rebel officer. In exchange for Nym's help the Rebels are giving him a portion of the salvage. Fortunately for us, the deal is contingent on Nym not taking extensive losses.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_2c7b60e", "Did we find out how Nym and the Rebellion are working together?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_2dd8b42", "System balance programming sounds cool.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_2e69b8ed", "You've got a job to do, maggot.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_2ef3848a", "I don't quite follow you.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_30b6b17c", "Why should I give you a second shot? ");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_31dd2d63", "It won't happen again.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_36900273", "Let me use small words so you can understand. Lok is Nym's base of power. Nym was helping the Rebellion. The Empire cannot allow Nym to flaunt it's authority like that. We are going to punish Nym.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_38be6beb", "What am I going to do with you?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_3af86b40", "We caused some cracks that will grow in time, but I think if we hit it one more time we can break it apart now.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_3f4fdcbd", "I'd like to learn about special forces training.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_3f9b3561", "Is that what I asked you to do?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_424f249d", "OK %TU - you're up. We just received word that one of our salvage transports was hit hard and left for dead. We have reason to believe that it was hit by a joint force of Nym's men and Rebels Alliance starfighters.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_44750833", "So you want me to get you a Hutt smuggler?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_47132c0f", "What! Don't think about it too hard.  You will damage what little you have left of your brain. And you are going to need it in order to learn some new skills. What would you like me to teach you?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_4c47ba68", "I didn't think so. This time, there better not be any mistakes. Get going.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_50e8d95e", "That's what you call 'loyalty'?  You don't know the meaning of the word, maggot.  If you ever want to fly for the Imperial Navy again, you'd better re-evaluate some of your past decisions.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_53126084", "Did I say you could ask questions? I will explain it all in good time and I can do without your comments. Anyway, it would seem that Nym and the Rebellion have decided to work together in harrying Imperial forces while grabbing as much salvage as they can.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_586a7d64", "So you can be silent when required. That is a good thing. Nym is a pirate chief from the Lok system. We have known for a long time that he sympathized with the Rebellion but, as long as he stayed out of the way, we didn't care. It looks like he has had a policy change.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_5eb7a1e3", "I am ready and willing, sir.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_62ccc48d", "It sure is. 'Nothing better than accomplishing your goal and not having to pay any of the costs. Not only do we start breaking the bridge between Nym and the Rebels, but we also get to eliminate some Hutts in the process. I love it when a plan comes together.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_64d5bea6", "Nice work.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_657cb9bd", "Are you sure about Nym's lack of resolve?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_66ebf9d3", "You earn your gold star for the day. Get out to that freighter, assist it with any repairs it might need, and escort it back to port. We can question the pilot and check its computer logs to see if we can get a lock on the emissary's ship. Dismissed.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_6cef5164", "So you made it back in one piece. I would have thought the Hutts would be serving you for dinner right now. You don't know how glad that I am you survived.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_6d0b02b", "The order simply read, 'Obey this man as you would obey me'. As far as I can tell it is completely legit. Then that Insurgent fellow told me that I was to transfer you over to his command immediately.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_72418db3", "Why would Nym care about losses?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_726bfa38", "Of course it was. Smash you enemies and all that. We didn't join Black Epsilon so we could take part in peace-keeping missions. I think that there is still something you can learn from me. Do you have anything in mind?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_73c4833", "That's what you said the last time. Get back up there. Put your money where your mouth is.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_765d3767", "I'm loyal to the Empire!");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_77f35957", "Know anything about advanced starship components?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_799d2952", "Maybe you've got what it takes, after all.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_7af5dab4", "Sounds like a job for local security to handle.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_7bcc420b", "Keep moving, puke.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_7bef2106", "Storm Squadron has done the brunt of the work already in this system, but they are in the process of being reassigned. Not to mention that a new threat has emerged and High Command thinks that we are just the right people to take care of it.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_7c05dd60", "How do we get those two factions to start fighting?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_7fe8c9bb", "Yeah, how ABOUT those vessels? You could use a lesson in respect. But for now I'll teach you about Imperial technology. And later, you'll  get a mission - if you ask nicely.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_823cc9e1", "Mm, you think? Get back out there.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_847e468b", "I wasn't really risking all that much... just you. If you failed then I would have simply started over with another angle. I took a minimal risk and received maximum gain, that is what being a great leader is all about. Now you are in need of training, are you not?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_84bc2cb6", "I must admit I sort of enjoyed that one.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_84ce496b", "Are you kidding? I wrote the book. Let's get started; come back when you're ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_85e02cc1", "That is where the freighter comes in. Nym's men will not take orders from any member of the Rebellion regardless of the agreement. But they will follow anyone who Nym tells them too. In this case the only member of the Rebellion that we can see Nym having his men follow is this emissary. So if the freighter was hit by a joint attack of Rebels and Nym's men, then it was probably lead by the emissary.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_883481e3", "Because I'll get the job done right.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_8bbc7303", "Intelligence doesn't believe that Nym approached the Rebellion. He is far too cautious for that. Reports from the inside suggest that a Rebel emissary met with Nym, and the pirate chief took such a liking to this Rebel that he agreed to help out. We figure if this emissary is eliminated, then Nym will back out of the agreement.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_8c751827", "Why don't we just directly assault Nym's forces?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_8ccf2f5f", "You don't look like you could pilot a pair of shoes, much less a starship. Get out of here.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_8dcf50f", "We will figure out how to split Nym and the Rebels, I assure you. But right now we need to focus on you. In order for you to be any use at all to me, you are going to need some training. Normally, I would just tell you what I want you to learn and you would learn it. But I am feeling generous so I am going to let you decide where you think you need the most work.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_8eaae252", "You think you're ready to play with grownups? Get out of here; your mama's waiting for you.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_8efde2ae", "Yes, sir.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_900f01d1", "What?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_91cf92a7", "From now on, you'll be reporting to someone named Insurgent. And I thought YOU had a ridiculous name the first time we met.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_91e2ca48", "In this matter I would have to say yes. If nothing else Nym will probably remove his direct support of the Rebellion for the time being. And without Nym's support the Rebels once again find themselves at a major disadvantage. I think that the local security forces can handle the rest of the operation in Yavin.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_9b5a6b23", "He asked for me by name?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_9be798dc", "I don't have time for you, maggot. If you are interested in becoming a good pilot, I suggest you lose your current unit and transfer to the Black Epsilon.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_9c5ae9a", "Second time's the charm.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_9d2d47d4", "Your call. I'll give you the intel, and when you're feeling up to it, maybe I'll give you another mission.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_a1314746", "Because I am. Regardless, I am happy to report that our operation seems to have been a complete success. The Hutts are furious with Nym and are basically attacking his ships on sight. Nym's men are putting up a good defense but the Hutts are not under the same constraints as Nym.  They are just tossing men at him in order to get revenge.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_a1b009ed", "Apparently, Storm Squadron hit him pretty hard in the Lok system and he is still attempting to recover from that blow. We are currently working on ways to exploit his current timidness, because we feel that will be the key to causing the split.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_a4f70dc9", "This is why we pay you to fly and not to think. A direct assault on Nym will have the desired effect but could also be costly for us as well. That is just the sort of advantage that the Rebels are waiting for. Sometimes the direct, kick down the door approach works just fine. But if you are going to learn anything from me, learn this...it is always better to have someone else do your dirty work for you.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_a5d90aff", "It was harder than it looked.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_a6944d2", "Thank you sir, it was tough but I pulled through.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_adc23ed9", "How about advanced capability TIE vessels?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_af020de3", "Where can we find the emissary?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_b200234c", "I think my mission was successful.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_b622a494", "Not in my book it isn't. Who sent you? I need soldiers! And this is what I get.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_b695af6b", "So you do. Well it is a good thing that we don't judge success on what you think. Fortunately we have both the operations plan and the Rebel officer.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_b6b25f13", "Yes, sir!");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_b713f64f", "I think you're being sarcastic.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_b779a3", "Sounds like a beautiful thing, sir.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_b93b0c31", "Sir, I was told to report to you for my new assignment.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_bc65ef6a", "I am surprised. You are a little brighter than you look..not much, but a little. If all goes well Nym's forces will retaliate on the Hutts, who will simply think that Nym has double-crossed them.  And they in turn, will respond with force.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_bd1d7bf2", "I told you that subtlety is lost on you. Regardless, I am happy to report that our operation seems to have been a complete success. The Hutts are furious with Nym and are basically attacking his ships on sight. Nym's men are putting up a good defense, but the Hutts are not under the same constraints as Nym.  They're just tossing men at him in order to get revenge.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_c0cca856", "I think I will. Now beat it!");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_c18b617e", "I have absolutely no idea. He showed up here today and tossed an Imperial order on my desk. And wouldn't you know it that order was signed by the Emperor himself.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_c65e1fa7", "I don't know what he wants with you and frankly I wasn't about to ask. There was something about him that made me feel real uneasy. Regardless he told me that you were to meet him at the Imperial Outpost on Dantooine and then jumped in his ship and took off. I suggest that you don't keep him waiting. I get the feeling that he isn't someone who likes to be kept waiting. You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_c6844d2a", "Should have known.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_c82eaa27", "Either improve your standing with the Empire, or shoot yourself in the head.  I don't care which you choose... either option will earn my forgiveness.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_c9015929", "Why am I heading to Lok?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_cd445db2", "I like the sound of that.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_cf274903", "Maybe they have the right idea when they start taking potshots at you. This mission is critical, soldier: don't blow it.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_d0f9703", "So what is this have to do with that transport?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_d1e44f54", "Ah, so the freighter might have some clue as to where the emissary went.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_d2e23af2", "What's my next assignment?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_d32315a8", "'Blew it' doesn't begin to describe this scenario. It's time for you to do your job, soldier.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_d3306841", "You have done a man's work today. Without the emissary, the Rebels do not have the only man in this operation that Nym trusts. This combined with the heavy fighting with the Hutts is sure to cause an impassable rift between the two.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_d547e29b", "Prisk Kith'Vys told me to report to you for my new assignment.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_d8a7505", "The Rebels had another idea.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_d8db54f6", "Send me back out there!");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_d9391333", "Good philosophy.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_daab08d3", "You catch on quick. Our first task is to locate a Rebel officer or spy and try to find out about their joint operation. If we can discover how the two forces are working together we can figure out how best to break their alliance. You are to take patrol inside the Yavin system and perform scans of the zone until you can find a ranking member of the Rebel Alliance. Capture and inspect that ship to see if they have the information we are looking for.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_daaff7a", "Well %TU, I've had about enough of you. Time to hand you off.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_dbb3a834", "Um, no.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_dd4ea40c", "That felt good, didn't it? I can just imagine Nym squirming in his Stronghold. Probably cursing the day that emissary convinced him to help the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_ddfa7bdb", "Why do I get the feeling that you are mocking me?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_e3bbe83c", "While you are up there, do not be surprised if we contact you again. This operation will involve careful timing and precise actions. Do not fail me.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_e6e69be4", "I blew it. I know.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_ea45b3c5", "Oh, no! I didn't think of that. Big, bad Nym is coming to get me. If you are afraid of making enemies you should have become a moisture farmer. You are an Imperial pilot in the Imperial Navy, most of the galaxy already hates you. What is one more? Punish them before they punish you, that's what I say.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_ecd826ee", "I thought their alliance was shattered.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_ecfe85ae", "Lucky me. Listen up. As you probably know the Empire has been running salvage operations in this system. Unfortunately, we are not the only ones who have taken an interest in the wreckage of the Death Star. We have to deal with pirates, on top of members of the Rebel Alliance trying to get their hands on top secret technologies.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_f00894a4", "Glad you think so. Your opinion matters to me. Let's do this, and when you're done, maybe you'll be ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_f2993921", "[wait]");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_f7a9cb6c", "You risked all your effort and planning on a hunch?");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_fd236a42", "A good one.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_fdbdc3c3", "It better not. Get back to your ship.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_fdda16c7", "OK, junior, new mission. We have careful reviewed all of the data that you somehow managed to provide us, and we believe that we have a course of action that will cause Nym to withdraw his aid to the Rebellion in this sector.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_fe5bcaa2", "How did I know that you were going to say that? Remember how I mentioned that there were other pirates at work in this system? Of course you don't. Hutts, man...Hutts are also working on salvaging as much as they can get their hands on. It would appear that they have a deal with Nym and the Rebels not to get in each other's way. Well, that is about to change.");
stringFiles[159].addEntry("s_ff9d26dd", "You treasonous worm.  How dare you even show your face.");

stringFiles[160] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_imperial_tier4");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_imperial_tier4) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_1138832b", "I have another little job that I want you to address. My instincts were correct. I was right to tell you to search that area.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_11c1ca52", "You have the authority to choose to obey a Grand Admiral? Insurgent, who are you?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_147257b1", "You have simply done what I told you to do in order to assist me in tracking down my targets. I never intended you to have to face them in combat, but it would seem that I do not have any other choice.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_14c18bea", "It's not true!");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_14c473a", "I think that information should be helpful.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_15b3b360", "Who else would garner such attention from the Emperor? I must say that he is very pleased with the outcome. Now that the Jedi are no more, the remaining Velocity should be fairly simple to clean up.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_1b4ddba3", "Now, we cannot take the risk that Nej'a will change his staging location. The Empire has waited for many years to bring this criminal to justice... today is that day. Remember he is very dangerous, destroy him quickly. Good luck, %NU.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_1c6fdb34", "Excellent. You're clear to leave.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_1d2760a0", "So, you seem to have made a fan. I can tell by your look that you do not have any idea what I am talking about. I have just received orders from High Command that you are being transferred.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_1d3e1b08", "Then do it.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_1d658537", "They're quite good, aren't they?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_1d8537b", "Hmm, well what is it you want me to do?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_1f6db0c9", "Save your stories for children.  If you ever want to fly for the Imperial Navy again, you'll improve your standing with the Empire.  Until then, don't talk to me.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_1fff2e", "Yes, once we find them they must be killed. We think that they are attempting to build power, either to help the Rebellion or for their own reasons. That is why they have the Velocity working for them.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_229e4f7a", "Why are you so interested in who hired these mercenaries?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_22d9230a", "Then what could you possibly learn from it?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_2313ac9e", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_23c3015a", "I have spoken with the Emperor and he has told me many things about those I seek. It is on his command that you are to capture and protect this freighter so I can investigate it.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_241c37e7", "Try not to be disappointed. We are going to be doing the Emperor's bidding, after all. Once you have located the Velocity officer, inspect the vessel for anything that might be used to further my investigation.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_244c9eec", "I will see if that is true.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_253224d8", "You're a long way from home, pilot. Why have you come?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_2751f674", "If you say so. But I would suggest that you not start counting your victory quite yet. If this was an easy operation, I would not be involved.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_27b64a53", "I will explain that shortly. Once we find them they must be killed. We think that they are attempting to build power, either to help the Rebellion or for their own reasons. That is why they have the Velocity working for them.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_291ab9fa", "Again with a question whose answer you are not ready for. I suggest you simply focus on finding me any information that an officer can produce. If you pay attention, I am sure all will be revealed in time. Now you had best get on with my patrol. I am not well known for my patience.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_2934bbe1", "I do have need for a skilled pilot but I have no interest in babysitting. I would suggest that you go work on your skills a bit more and maybe you will hear from me.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_29b41abf", "Very true. While I am looking into the latest information that you have brought to me, feel free to take some duty missions or...do whatever you wish. Frankly I don't care which, just as long as you become available when I need you again.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_2afc3f27", "You have done very well and it would seem that your skills are improving. I will assist you in your quest for pilot perfection, when man and machine become almost one. What skill would you like to learn? Once you have made your choice, I have a very important task that requires immediate attention.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_2b6c0655", "Improvement!? You cannot improve perfection.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_2d7994ed", "How do you know that?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_2e6aa8f3", "The unseen sometimes can tell you far more than what is right in front of your eyes. You can learn to see things that others cannot with the proper training and lets just leave it at that. What I did learn was that our targets went to the one place I cannot follow...Dathomir.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_2f35ade3", "I hope so. My targets are criminals that have eluded Imperial justice since the days of the Old Republic. The Emperor has been searching for them for a very long time, finally discovered a lead with these Velocity mercenaries, and sent me to deal with these criminals.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_2f76570d", "What does that mean, do you think?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_2fa1f209", "Fine. If that is the way it is.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_30f28d53", "Or maybe it's not mercenaries you're fighting.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_31cfa803", "They have gone to the one place I cannot follow. They have gone to the Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_33b79521", "Why would the Emperor concern himself with criminals?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_340f88e7", "And I will make you even more potent. Despite your claim that you are perfection personified, your approach needs some polish. When you are working for me you will gain that polish.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_34120baf", "Of course. Another task that has need for a good pilot is to cull the smuggling aspects of the Velocity mercenaries. It would seem that they are moving the supplies stolen from us to other systems. We need someone to break their supply lines and capture the vessels carrying these goods. The Empire wants its property back.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_34acb72a", "Because it has been forbidden for me to follow them there. I do not know why I am not allowed to follow my prey, but I do not question those orders. It will be up to you to finish the job that was started so long ago.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_3573ecdf", "I have my...sources. But you can rest assured that the vessel is currently on autopilot and should be an easy target. It probably will have auto defenses on but for a skilled pilot like yourself those should be nothing. I would like to examine that freighter and see if it contains any clues about my targets whereabouts.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_35dc12ce", "Good. I will have need for a talented pilot very shortly and I think that you might just do very well. You are still a little rough around the edges but I can take care of that. With my help you should become an acceptable pilot.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_35e6e0c7", "That is what I like most about you. You are all business. If there isn't anything else I would like to get on with my investigation.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_361de446", "So where did they go?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_362907ef", "I don't have time to deal with you right now. How about you come back when you actually know how to pilot a ship? Of course, I probably won't talk to you then either...but it would be a start.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_362a48e0", "Anything else?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_36a4e374", "Yes, I am.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_37e2608d", "I do not fear danger.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_3bdff7cb", "What is it you require of me?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_3e9d32e0", "What about the orders I recovered from the Velocity?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_3f2bae5b", "That pretty much confirms my suspicion. The Velocity are in the Dathomir system, which means the targets are as well. We will get those orders you recovered decoded and see if they lead us any closer to our prey.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_3f68df7d", "Sounds easy enough.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_40cb88ec", "I don't understand. How is that useful information?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_40d40fc4", "It's been difficult.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_410ca3d8", "You are catching on, good. Now no more talk. Go get me that freighter and bring it back to me. I have wasted more than enough of my time dealing with your ego. I really hope that you don't run into any unforeseen problems out there. Go!");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_415093c5", "Yes, it would seem that those were not quite as important as I originally thought they would be. From what I understand of the code it simply told the Velocity to continue their operations in this system until they were told otherwise.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_41f35a20", "Insurgent isn't your real name, is it?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_42c52a5", "I still don't see how this helps us.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4349156c", "I can escort those ships, no problem.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_43d39a86", "I was almost certain they were, but the unique nature of Dathomir makes it a little hard to completely detect these things. It doesn't matter now though. We have a confirmation. Also, the ground crew has reported in and there are no signs of any vessels landing on Dathomir recently so I think it is safe to assume the targets are still in space. On a humorous note, the ground crew asked when they could expect to be picked up.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_450797b1", "I wish I could join you out there.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_453c3282", "If you are not in the military, who are you?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_47e47c9e", "Very well. I will wait until you need me again.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_47ffecb6", "What does that have to do with me taking on more responsibility?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4854758d", "I would like to request a mission.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_493aef07", "I would need more time and information about our targets.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_49805f81", "Can I hear the briefing again?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4af031d3", "It's brutal up there.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4b6d4db", "Nial Declann? Grand Admiral Nial Declann!");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4c99c2f5", "We have Neja' Bertolo! Those orders you brought back to me have finally been decoded and they have Nej'a all over them. He also made a most fatal flaw of placing his coordinates in those orders. Apparently he wanted his men to be able to reach him if he was needed.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4c9ca3b6", "I don't understand. What do you mean?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4d7b8699", "Should I just go out there and ask them or do you actually have a plan?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4e718340", "Ah, a kindred spirit. It will be a pleasure.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4e7e870d", "What exactly will I be doing for you?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4ecc8830", "Who are your ultimate targets?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_4faccfdf", "I have need of your abilities yet again. It would seem that you are now even more important to this operation than ever before.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_50b309d4", "Too good, if you ask me.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_50bf402f", "It is quite simple. You will be going where I say, when I say, and you will  be doing WHAT I say. Until that time comes, you have no need to know, so let us just keep it that way. For now, I was simply interested in meeting my new pilot face-to-face. I have seen what I need, that is all. Come back and see me a little later. Perhaps I will have something for you then.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_516e76a2", "Then I will have to track the targets down.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_520cdd79", "Shouldn't you be out on assignment? I have no use for someone who cannot finish what they start.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_556fb99a", "So much more than you could possibly imagine. They have great knowledge and skill. What they might have lost with youth, I am sure they gained in experience. Do not discount them simply because of their age.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_579dbb01", "Wouldn't it make more sense to launch a full scale attack on them?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_588da3c3", "I would like to learn about droid intelligence theory.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_592140", "The first obviously means that only the smart man can deal with danger.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_596bf3ab", "Excellent. I take it that it is time for me to do my thing?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_5a23ab6f", "What did you find, Insurgent?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_5babb29c", "What was it you found?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_5bea4bf3", "It doesn't matter that you do not know what is going on. All that matters is that I have some direction. When the time comes, I will point you in that direction and together we will find what I am after. For now I will leave you to your own devices. You can continue to take some duty missions from me or go on leave, it really doesn't matter to me. Once I figure out my next move I will let you know.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_5bea5f9", "Your sources? What does that mean?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_5d0255cb", "Keep trying, %NU. You're doing the Emperor's work.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_5e2181b5", "I take it they are to be killed?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_5e4d41df", "All in good time. You are not quite ready for that challenge yet. The next task would be protecting the interests of the Emperor in this system. The Velocity mercenaries have been attacking Imperial military freighters, most likely in order to increase their own combat capability. We need escorts to protect our freighters from these attacks.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_5f1f6bbe", "Very well, here is your skill. And now I have another little job that I want taken care of. My instincts about searching the area that the transmission originated from have paid off.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_5fb89d5e", "I doubt if these particular people had any problems convincing the Velocity to work for them. They can be very persuasive when they need to be. I would be surprised if the Velocity is being paid, which is why they attack our supply freighters...in order to pay for their operations.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_61ee3818", "Traitor?!");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_622b4f74", "Once the team is searching the surface, you will begin searching space. I completely expect that they took a number of their Velocity lackies along with them. Find the Velocity and they will lead us to our targets. There is no where else they can run. Let's get this operation under way. Good luck, %NU.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_62c2e765", "I haven't told them anything. They will either make it to the prison, be eaten by a Rancor, or perhaps worse. They do not matter to me now. All that does matter is catching our prey. We will begin decoding these orders and see where they lead us. Until then feel free to take some duty missions or go on leave. When you are ready for your next step, we will hunt them down.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_630c41d4", "Doesn't sound like he is all that smart.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_63378cc1", "They wiped the databanks, cleared out the logs, and destroyed the flight recorder but they left behind traces of themselves all over the vessel. It was those traces which have pointed me in the direction of where they went.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_644e6e82", "No, I am not part of Black Epsilon, although I have used their pilots several times in the past and have always been more than satisfied with the results. And do not call me sir. I have no military rank.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_6465b813", "I bet I could figure it out.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_64a73278", "Do you want me to retrieve the vessel?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_6560cc1a", "I would like to learn about heavy starship components.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_657816d", "You really haven't told me anything.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_65da4fa5", "I'm curious about this smuggler. See what you can find out. Let me know what he's carrying.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_67a8d328", "The freighter you brought back told me everything. Those three used it to help leave the system after your operation started to put the heat on them. They sent the transmission, wiped all the databanks, boarded their fighters, and left the system.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_68d65b58", "We should capture one of the Velocity and make him tell us what it means.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_690701a5", "We have Neja' Bertolo! My men have finally decoded the orders you brought back to me. They have Nej'a all over them. He also made a terrible mistake by putting his coordinates in those orders. Apparently, he wanted his men to be able to reach him if he was needed.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_69231042", "Having the authority to ignore a Grand Admiral's order is very different than actually using that authority. Just because someone can do something doesn't always mean that they should. I am Insurgent and I am but a humble servant of the Emperor. Now, I suggest you do not keep the Nial waiting. While I might be able to get away with it you most certainly cannot.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_6a0fad7b", "Don't act surprised.  A person doesn't just ACCIDENTALLY work for the Rebel Alliance to overthrow the Empire.  Now get lost, we have no use for your kind.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_6a902b99", "Glad you asked! I have formulated a patrol based on the Velocity fighter movements that I believe will take you close enough to recognize a Velocity officer's vessel with short-range scanning. Follow the patrol route and find me an officer.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_6af70645", "So they are on the freighter?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_6b6c3181", "Where did they go?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_6b9c2fb8", "I understand. I would like to take a duty mission.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_6d6d19f4", "With the Emperor's blessing, I am unstoppable.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_6d9530c5", "Transferred? Who am I being transferred to this time?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_6f6fe7c5", "You may call me Insurgent. And let us just say that I have the Emperor's best interests at heart and leave it at that.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_7017e938", "It'll get done.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_707841db", "It took me a little while but I managed to find the source of the transmission. There is a freighter that appears to be on autopilot flying on the outskirts of the system that sent the signal. I have it on very good authority that my targets were on board that vessel shortly before it sent the signal.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_735e94f9", "So you must be %NU. I have been watching your progress for sometime now.  I must say that I am very impressed, although there ARE a number of areas where you could use improvement... but we will get to that later.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_74052171", "I have formulated a patrol route that I need you to follow. While on this patrol, you will scan the region for signs of a Velocity officer's vessel. I am hoping that an officer will have valuable information that will allow us to dig deeper into uncovering who they are working for.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_7423a2e5", "Sorry, Insurgent. Force of habit.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_74f79dbe", "There is very little need for us to do that. They have left me a very large clue without even knowing they did. Instead of trying to figure out what the message actually said I am going to be looking into where the message originated from.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_77729b2", "Cry me a river. I thought you were tough?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_78026113", "It is quite simple. You will be going where I say, when I say, and doing what I say. Until that time comes you have no need to know, so let us just keep it that way. For now I was just simply interested in meeting the pilot who would be working for me face to-face. I have seen what I need, that is all. Come back and see me a little later, perhaps I will have something for you then.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_79bf4ef1", "I see. Must be a military thing. Usually, members of Black Epsilon are not quite so rigid, which is why I like using them. Despite that, I still believe you will do. Now back to the matter at hand. We need to find out more about the Velocity. I want to know everything I can about their operations in this system, especially who they are working for.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_79d6c690", "The second means that the Velocity should continue their assault on the Empire.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_7a5034fe", "Your zeal is much appreciated but if everything goes according to my plan we will not have to get our hands dirty in that fashion. All you need to do is to follow a patrol route that I have formulated based off of the mercenary movements and use short range scans to locate a Velocity officer.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_7dd5c9b5", "Perhaps. Like I said, I have my own theories on what those code phrases mean. But it is not so much what was in the message, but rather where the message was from that interested me. The message originated from deep in the Dantooine system. I believe that will be a good place for me to start my search. For now, you are on stand by. You can take some more duty missions or go on leave. When we are both ready, we will continue.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_7ef4aae8", "Understood, Insurgent. I will retrieve their freighter in one piece.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_7fc0dbf6", "No, Insurgent. I will wait until you need me again.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_80bab111", "Yes, it is. There is a freighter that appears to be on autopilot flying on the outskirts of the system that sent the signal. I have it on very good authority that my targets were on board that vessel shortly before it sent the signal.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_817cf33", "Who is Nial Declann?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_81995254", "Normally I would only give missions to my own pilots, but I'm a little short-handed and I have several elective duty missions available. Would you like to hear a briefing?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_81b729d2", "This is very important, %TU. More important than you realize.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_828612f", "The Empire does a lot of good in this system. It provides work for people who need it. It's important that the equilibrium not be disturbed. Take good care of those freighters.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_828cdbfa", "I'm still in pursuit.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_83502a2", "The enemy of the Emperor must be destroyed!");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_83a5b2ca", "Sorry, Insurgent. So how will I find this officer?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_83af3aa0", "I cannot use someone like you. I am only looking for highly skilled pilots and you don't make the cut. Perhaps you should return to your commanding officer.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_8406a42d", "These mercenaries are very good - and very motivated. I'm not surprised to hear that you've run into difficulties, but I still don't want to hear any excuses. You are supposed to be better.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_84fad79c", "Too bad. Good bye, %NU. Nice work out there.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_85e8b1c4", "I figured that is who we were after.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_8778fe46", "What I want to know is who you are?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_87d7e908", "I know.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_87f2bc56", "You have to fight like you've never fought before. Do you understand me?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_8a63a671", "It took me a little while but I managed to find the source of the transmission. There is a freighter that appears to be on autopilot flying on the outskirts of the system that sent the signal. I have it on very good authority that my targets were on board that vessel shortly before it sent the signal. I require that freighter.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_8ba804b8", "Very well; here is your skill. And now I have another little job that I want you to address. My instincts were correct. I was right to tell you to search that area.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_8c64bf19", "Indeed. And the time is at hand for you to prove just how deadly you can be. I want to know as much as we can about the Velocity mercenary operation in this system. More than anything, I want to know who hired them.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_8fd1ce47", "The Velocity mercenaries have been targeting Imperial ships, as you know. They've left several ships adrift most likely to be picked up at a later time. We need a pilot to meet those ships, assist with repairs, and bring those valuable craft safely back to Imperial hands.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_8fe70af3", "This will not take me very long.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_90422eb5", "Good luck.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_912bb601", "My targets have eluded Imperial justice since the days of the Old Republic. They are all veterans of the Clone Wars. The Emperor himself has declared that they are to be hunted down and killed in order to neutralize their threat. These are very dangerous men.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9205783d", "What should I do if I locate the officer?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_929e4e42", "How should I proceed?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_92c25c6d", "It is more of that coded phrasing but I am quite certain I have figured out the code, or at least the general meaning behind the orders. I will tell you more about this once I am certain.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9301eff1", "I will.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_94a6034a", "It is I who thank you. It is very rare to meet a competent pilot who can think for themselves. I wish you the best with your new assignment.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_953d9a9c", "It is. Now get on with the patrol. I am in a hurry to get this information and I have never been well known for patience.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_95c4c876", "So noted. What will I be doing for you?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_95dd869a", "It must be expensive to pay for an entire mercenary outfit.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_96219092", "Maybe they're getting better.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_966e7d64", "You have great potential, but you still have much to learn before I can make use of your talents. I have a few odd jobs that I need taken care of. If you wish I can give you one of these duty missions. Or would you like to hear the briefing again?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_98338b18", "Sure. I'll get those ships.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_993596a8", "Now that I have more training, I am pretty sure I am unstoppable.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_996a0939", "Be wary, %NU. I am surprised that the Velocity have not already destroyed this freighter. I think that when you capture the vessel they will attack in force. But that shouldn't be anything you cannot handle. The Emperor's bless be on you.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_99bb69ca", "Shooting down mercenaries? That's not business; that's pleasure.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_99f23e5f", "Be warned that the vessel probably has automatic defenses but since it is just a freighter I doubt they will be any issue for you. Keep your eyes open though, if the Velocity meant to destroy the ship and haven't yet, your taking it will draw them out in a hurry. Good luck, pilot.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9a8ac7e9", "I'm counting on you. Do not fail.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9bad275c", "You've never had a more important mission, %NU. You MUST succeed.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9c7a221c", "We will begin decoding these orders and see where they lead us. Until then feel free to take some duty missions or go on leave. When you are ready for your next step, we will hunt them down. The time is drawing very near now.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9caa883f", "Very well, come back to me if you decide differently.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9ce82616", "I thought I told you to simply refer to me as Insurgent! I cannot use someone who is incapable of even obeying the simplest of orders.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9d071495", "I just need another shot.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9d4fc33d", "I didn't assume that it would. One last thing though. I am surprised that the Velocity have not destroyed the vessel, although it is possible that they just haven't gotten around to it yet. I would guess that if their intention was to destroy the ship they will come swarming once you take it.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9e9b2154", "I don't see where the fun in that is but if it is as the Emperor will...");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9ec3be5d", "I will do so. Thank you for allowing me to assist you in your assignment.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9ed0c023", "You really don't have any business here or with me. Since you don't belong here, why don't you just move along quietly?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9f02cebc", "That is what you are going to do. We cannot take the risk that Nej'a will change his staging location. The Empire has waited for many years to bring this criminal to justice... today is that day. Remember he is very dangerous, destroy him quickly. Good luck, %NU.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9f2ab4a0", "First, we need to make sure they have not taken shelter on the planets surface. I have arranged for a drop ship to send a scan team to the planets surface to begin a sweep of the surface. Of course, once that team is on the surface they will not be able to leave, but they don't know that and there is no reason to tell them.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_9f7da911", "The Empire will prevail. You're clear to leave. Better luck this time.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_a2d93e75", "What is it I will be doing for you?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_a41ab42f", "The freighter's passengers left shortly before the transmission was sent and I must admit I am surprised that freighter has not been destroyed. Perhaps the Velocity are being slack in their duty, or perhaps it is a trap. Either way I care not. You are to recover that freighter for me.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_a476ea3d", "Ready and willing, sir.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_a4d2d2a4", "Very amusing. I had hoped that the stories about your ego were exaggerations, but I can see now that they were right on the mark. To be honest, I do not really care what you think of yourself, as long as you do your job.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_a4f727f1", "Of course, I have my own theories on what those phrases mean but I am very intrigued to find out what you think they mean.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_a67cea0d", "Whose authority?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_a6916467", "I suggest you simply focus on finding me any information that an officer can produce. If you pay attention, I am sure all will be revealed in time. Now you had best get on with my patrol. I am not well known for my patience.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_a74ee1d8", "I appreciate the work you have done for me in the past but really have nothing more for you to do. Unless you would be interested in some duties that I still need help with.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_a84b9540", "I never assumed that the likes of you would. That is why I think you will at least stand a chance in bringing my targets to justice as my stand in.  ");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_a8fbb11", "Really? Perhaps you have learned to read between the lines. The Emperor is most pleased with the outcome of this situation. You have done very well.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_aa1396ab", "That is a risk I am willing to let you take. One way or the other get me that freighter. Show me the vaunted skill you are constantly claiming your possess. Good luck to you, %NU.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ae99b26e", "So what am I am going to be doing?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_af6c1480", "An officer. Check.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b19d5f06", "Just because I might be lax on the discipline does not mean that I will tolerate any lip from the likes of you. I suggest you do your best to stay in my good graces. ");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b2b5f713", "The Clone Wars? What threat could these old criminals possibly be?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b2f1386a", "I will crush our enemies.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b2fb027c", "No. They evacuated the vessel for parts unknown before the message was sent. I am highly surprised that the Velocity did not destroy the freighter, or perhaps they just haven't gotten around to it yet. You must get me that freighter.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b3155267", "A new group of mercenaries, calling themselves the Velocity, have moved into the Dantooine system. I have reason to believe that they are connected to my ultimate targets but more investigation will be needed in order to confirm that suspicion. But for now I need someone to start reducing the numbers of these Velocity mercenaries to a more manageable level.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b31fa56c", "I can handle that.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b3a57003", "What makes you think that I would share any of my secrets with you? We are not friends. You are a tool and I will use you in any way that I see fit. A craftsman does not explain what he is doing to his wrench, does he? Be thankful for what I do tell you.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b3f97e26", "I get the feeling that soon you will have to. Of course, that will not happen until I can have a chance to look into this new information you brought to me.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b456d97d", "It's good work. The Emperor will appreciate your efforts.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b4712f35", "I'm afraid not.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b4876691", "What is your command, my lord?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b4a065ba", "A fanatic and a skeptic. What other surprises do you have in store for me? Do not bother to answer that question. I am sure I will find out in time. For now, it is enough that you do what I say without question. I will have need of you later, but for now you may go. Come back to me when you think you are ready to undertake my task.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b52941c3", "Now it is time to put your training to good use. The time has come for us to find out more about who these Velocity mercenaries are. I have my suspicious about who is pulling their strings but I must be certain before I act.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b5e3a1", "What can that tell you?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b66c783f", "Get lost, %TU.  I don't want to be seen talking to you.  Before you know it, people will think that I am a traitor, too.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b8088c9b", "Why can you not follow them?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b881db2e", "I hate smugglers. I'll take that job.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b8896d92", "And how do you expect to find this officer? Just fly up into space and hope that one is waiting for you? You are eager enough but you should think before you speak up.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b94e3a35", "Your mission's not yet complete.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_b9c73c6d", "I am ready for whatever you need me to do.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_bb26b12d", "Who is it you are actually looking for?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_bb5f90b1", "You mean you didn't know for certain that they would be there?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_bbed80fc", "They won't last for long.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_bde3268d", "Of course. Good luck.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_be6c531e", "Clone wars? So our feared enemies are a bunch of old men?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_beb66be", "What duty mission would you like to undertake?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_beec51b5", "As long as you work for me, you will go where I say, when I say, and you will do what I tell you to do. Until that time comes you have no need to know, so let us just keep it that way. For now, I was simply interested in meeting my new pilot face-to-face. I have seen what I need, that is all. Come back and see me a little later. Perhaps I will have something for you then.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_bfe54df0", "I would like elite TIE guard training.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c0036582", "What did you tell them?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c06cf370", "I am but a simple instrument of the Empire.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c0bee78", "I have the feeling that you will do just fine. The Emperor's blessing be on you, %NU.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c0dc404f", "I always do my job.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c17d1a82", "I would like to learn about experimental TIE vessels.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c19cc229", "Three. Nej'a Bertolo, Onli Shi'en, and Tiberus Anderlock. Every one a very dangerous individual. They were my targets and now they are yours. You are going to have to be the one to finally bring about their demise.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c1ece7d0", "Yes, Lord Insurgent. I will not fail you.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c4a2f234", "Completely understood, Insurgent.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c4c33621", "I've never seen mercenaries that good!");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c610ccb7", "I have been ordered to have you moved under Nial Declann's command. I am not very used to taking orders from one quite so low but since I am through with you I see no reason to fight him on this. You are to report to Theed palace and present yourself to Nial immediately.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c82e9a2f", "Yes, please.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_c93f02d5", "It is quite simple. You will be going where I say, when I say, and doing what I say. Until that time comes you have no need to know, so let us just keep it that way. For now I was just simply interested in meeting the pilot who would be working for me face to face. I have seen what I need, that is all. Come back and see me a little later, perhaps I will have something for you then.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ca2b4f36", "I can capture one and we can 'question' him together.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ca6d4505", "No, %NU. You don't need my help. We would do well together, but you are the one for the job. You can do this. Focus your mind. ");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ca776e30", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_cafb4d3", "My targets are criminals that have eluded Imperial justice since the days of the Old Republic. The Emperor has been searching for them for a very long time, finally discovered a lead with these Velocity mercenaries, and sent me to deal with these criminals.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_cb55c240", "I have formulated a patrol route that I need you to follow. While on this patrol you will scan the region for signs of a Velocity officer's vessel. I am hoping that an officer will contain valuable information that will allow us to dig deeper into uncovering who they are working for.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_cbf9f5e7", "You are doing well, Pilot. Are you ready for your next assignment?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_cc949f12", "First, I think it is time for me to better explain what my mission is. I am afraid that I am going to have to place much of my responsibility on your shoulders because of circumstances out of my control. It will become far more dangerous for you from here on out.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ccefd6f4", "It would be better if we had a live captive.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_cd02ac28", "I could use the help.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_cdcb7b73", "Are you with Black Epsilon, sir?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ce9d7377", "It is the Emperor's prerogative who he takes favor with.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_cf2329c0", "You mean, WHEN you locate the officer. Naturally, I want you to inspect the officer for any information that we can use to help us track down the people who hired the mercenaries. I could care less about the Velocity...I just want the ones who hired them. Now get on with your patrol. I am not known to be a patient man.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d129b116", "What! Those were Jedi?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d1579156", "You may call me Insurgent. And let us just say that, much like you, I only have the Emperor's best interests at heart. I, too, live only to serve.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d26b0750", "The last thing we want to do is to make it readily known that these three have survived for so long. It would be nearly impossible to conduct a large scale operation without drawing unwanted attention, especially from the Rebellion. If the Rebellion got word of these three they would most certainly reach out and try to offer their support. As far as the rest of the galaxy is concerned these three died during the Clone Wars.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d26d7ae1", "I don't think I will take a duty mission at this time.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d2794755", "One and the same. One of the original members of the twelve Grand Admirals of the Imperial Fleet, member of the High Council, and personal favorite to the Empire. Overall a very unpleasant man. But it is never wise to make enemies when one can avoid it, which is why you are going to report to him immediately.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d2ae8b94", "How tough can they be?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d4500734", "You have done very well. There are not many people in this entire galaxy who can out-pilot one Jedi much less three.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d460a728", "While I am looking into the latest information that you have brought to me, feel free to take some duty missions or...do whatever you wish. Frankly I don't care which, just as long as you become available when I need you again.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d56d9c26", "What were in the orders from the Velocity?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d7e41231", "Good luck. I'll be watching you.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d7fc6920", "He didn't expect us to be able to find him in Dathomir. His lack of vision will be his undoing, but it is unwise to question his intelligence. He is a formidable foe and he will be made even more so now that he is cornered.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d832aba0", "Are you having any luck?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_d9059da1", "Hmmm...then where did the criminals go?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_da6d3376", "Yes. The vessel is unmanned, but I think it may still contain what I am looking for. Be warned that the vessel probably has automatic defenses, but since it is just a freighter I doubt they will be any issue for you. Keep your eyes open though:  If the Velocity meant to destroy the ship and haven't yet, your taking it will draw them out in a hurry. Good luck, pilot.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_dbfcbbf", "Haven't I already been doing your job?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_dcc126b1", "Just doing my job.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_dcdce64", "Listen to me. Our targets must be stopped. They are our greatest enemy! They have the potential to be a major thorn in the side of the Empire unless we take care of them now.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_dce56ebd", "I've been expecting you. And you are late. There is much to be done. Are you ready?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_dd67013", "What does that mean?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e031ecbb", "That is why I like using Black Epsilon pilots. Always thinking unlike your standard neolithic naval pilot. You are correct in your assumption that Insurgent is not my real name. Of course, if you attempt to find out my real name I will be forced to kill you and neither of us want that.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e08f9706", "The message was essentially all in code. There isn't much chance that we will actually be able to find out what it actually told the Velocity. It contained a few phrases, such as, 'the enlightened walks with rancors' and 'keep the skeletons walking the path of misdirection'. Basically if you do not already know what the code words mean you probably will never find out what is being said.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e0aca724", "One has to look beyond the words of the message itself. The transmission originated from deep in the Dantooine system, so that is a place to start my search. Also it is a good bet that this message came from whoever hired the Velocity, since the message does appear to be instructions of some sort.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e1d956f4", "Once you locate the officer, search his vessel for any information that will progress my investigation forward. Now, get on with that patrol. I am not well known for my patience.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e244a0f9", "Or it could be a trap.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e37138ed", "That is the way it is. I suggest you show some caution when recovering that freighter. I am surprised that the Velocity have not destroyed it already but I would imagine that you taking it will cause them some distress. Make sure that you get that freighter back to me intact. You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e3a57b46", "Now it is time to put your training to good use. The time has come for us to find out more about who these Velocity mercenaries are. I have my suspicious about who is pulling their strings, but I must be certain before I act.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e3d62b89", "Understood. I will leave you to your work.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e3e51927", "I've read your report. I know how good you are. These mercenaries are surprisingly resilient, if they can fight you off.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e477225c", "Who are your targets?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e4de90b3", "I don't need your help! I know how to fly.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e5dc0118", "The transmission originated from deep in the Dantooine system, so that is a place to start my search. Also it is a good bet that this message came from whoever hired the Velocity, since the message does appear to be instructions of some sort.  For now I will leave you to your own devices. You can continue to take some duty missions from me or go on leave, it really doesn't matter to me. Once I figure out my next move I will let you know.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e705e25f", "Good work, %NU. You managed to gather me some information that might turn out to be very important. I believe that this will lead us on the right direction.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e7575630", "I need to find out more about the Velocity and more specifically who hired them. As I said before, I have a good idea as to who their benefactor is, but I have never liked following hunches. You are going to get that information for me.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e76b9ab1", "I know what to do; I just need to do it.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e7e4fdc5", "Do not put to much faith into words, even if they come from the Emperor. Action is the only true way of gaining power and the Emperor only respects people of action. Keep that in mind.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e8da36ce", "You could say that. There are three of them. Nej'a Bertolo, Onli Shi'en, and Tiberus Anderlock. Every one a very dangerous individual. They were my targets and now they are yours. You are going to have to be the one to finally bring about their demise.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_e93d5171", "Then it shall be done.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ea248fbf", "If it is the Emperor's will, than I shall do so.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ea47a197", "The freighter you recovered told me much more than was intended. My targets were careful but not careful enough. Their mercenaries force really made a mistake by not destroying that freighter after it sent its final transmission.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_eba35f17", "When do I leave?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ebbe675b", "No problem. Just point in the right direction.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ed88b4e2", "Then it shall be yours.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_edc55445", "I gave this job to you for a reason. You're my best pilot. Do you have  the guts to go back out there?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_f1d64636", "Ah, yes. I am even more deadly than before!");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_f2f68275", "All in good time. Right now I have a job that may not require any crushing of anyone. Of course, that is a best case scenario and when has anything gone according to that?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_f4749d1d", "Impressive resume. This might actually be a challenge.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_f74915b8", "How many of these criminals are there?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_f83729d0", "I can do better.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_f8880079", "Welcome back. We have the orders you retrieved from the Velocity in our possession and I will be investigating the freighter shortly. So far, you have performed better than I expected you to be able to.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_f8b02865", "What do I do?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_f97238d8", "It is quite simple. You will be going where I say, when I say, and doing what I say. Until that time comes you have no need to know, so let us just keep it that way. For now I was just simply interested in meeting the pilot who would be working for me face-to-face. I have seen what I need, that is all. Come back and see me a little later, perhaps I will have something for you then.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_fad3519e", "What do you need me to do, si... Insurgent?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_fc7e0cf7", "So, when do you want me to finish him off?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_fd2777e5", "Ah, one of those. I have worked with people like you in the past and I haven't had any difficulties. I just require that you keep your mind on the task at hand and do not let your fervor cloud your judgment. As long as you are able to do that, we shall not have any problems.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_fd6077a1", "What was in the message?");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_fde2347a", "I would highly suggest that you only refer to him as Grand Admiral or better yet...sir. He is one of twelve top navy men in the entire galaxy and a definite favorite of the Emperor, though I have never quite figured out why...perhaps one day. Regardless, I have accepted his transfer and suggest you get to Theed in a hurry.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_fe20f03e", "Wait! I still want to know is who you are.");
stringFiles[160].addEntry("s_ffcc3ac9", "Let us just say that these are 'special' criminals who at one time threatened the Emperor. After this much time we finally have a chance to deal out justice on them and cannot allow them to escape again. Do you understand?");

stringFiles[161] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_imperial_trainer_1");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_imperial_trainer_1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_10499a33", "Why trust me?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1091c96a", "I'm done for now.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_11816971", "Alright. I support the Empire. What can I do to help?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_11bb9c43", "I was told you are looking for a pilot.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_11c38900", "I have discovered that the Rebels are training X-Wing cadets in Corellian space. The Rebels are quickly working to recruit new pilots to their cause. Destroying the cadets will cripple that effort. Corellian citizens will think twice about signing up if the Rebels can't even protect their young and inexperienced.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_12d7f011", "This is a serious operation, hon. Get a drink and chill out. Come back when you want to try this thing again.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1345d43f", "Excellent. You seem to understand what it takes to work with Black Epsilon. Our superiors will be pleased. Here's a little payment for the operation.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_13bbdfe7", "I'm not so sure about this...");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_13e807c3", "[Destroy Duty] I'm interested in hunting more B-Wing Prototypes.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_15588832", "I need some time to study the B-Wing operational logs.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_15799d85", "For the Emperor.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_15d6b9a5", "Ground ops is working on the sabotage plan and I haven't received word from Black Epsilon regarding new space operations. For now, I have a few duties you can work on while we wait.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_16a81f", "Well, sweetie - after you find the starport, and use the starship terminal to launch into space, you'll need to finish your mission... I thought we were clear on that, hon.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_192ddc14", "Are you going to train me?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1930ad3a", "And Black Epsilon is that dagger?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_19ff301f", "What kind of training?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1acdc4ba", "No, I'd rather not.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1adbadc4", "I'm ready.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1bf00a8", "When the Emperor desires to resolve a problem and the overt use of force is not politically feasible, he calls upon us. Black Epsilon.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1ca122f0", "What's on the transport?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1cca067", "It's a little big...");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1d0a2959", "Hah, that's what you think! It's your choice, but you may not get this chance again. I suggest that you take it while you can.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1d1dfdd3", "Just remember that sometimes you need to shoot first to survive. Our superiors are pleased that we've proceeded this far in our operation. Here is your payment plus a bonus. I also had a TIE pilot flight suit made for you.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1d646fae", "Oh is that a fact? I don't want to hire someone with a lot of baggage. If you're too hot with CorSec you can look elsewhere.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1f78cffa", "How do I join Black Epsilon?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_1ff4247a", "I will not fail.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_219f04cc", "For the Emperor, indeed. Here is your pay for the B-Wing mission. I've also gotten a hold of a TIE pilot helmet. Unfortunately, these standard issue helmets are not suited to meet your, uh... cranial proportions. Nevertheless, you've done an admirable job and Black Epsilon has taken note of your success.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_23580c13", "Here is your pay for the B-Wing mission. I've also gotten a hold of a TIE pilot helmet. Unfortunately, these standard issue helmets are not suited to meet your, uh... cranial proportions.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_240aee17", "Just remember that sometimes you need to shoot first to survive. Our superiors are pleased that we've proceeded this far in our operation. Here is your payment plus a bonus. I also had a double bandolier made for you.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_25042a7a", "I will not fail you.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_2559ccf6", "Welcome back, babe. Glad to see you're still with us.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_27c9aa85", "Mmm, all worked up and ready for another go. I like that. As it happens, I do have another assignment for you.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_28490f70", "I ran into some trouble, but I'm ready to try again.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_28d99e75", "Come back when you want to try again.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_293e6269", "Did you take out the B-Wing prototype?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_29e5ec7", "I'd like to request a mission.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_2c9c30a0", "Can you train me?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_2d4c3812", "When I get back, I expect some answers.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_2d5d4bf0", "I'm interested in a duty.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_2db4d111", "Then don't waste my time.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_2df5ef77", "Go meet up with that transport and escort it to safety. Report back to me when you've done the job.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_2e48b5f1", "It's no secret that Imperial pilots utilize some of the best starfighter tactics the galaxy has ever seen.  I can get you started on the road to mastering these uniquely Imperial procedures.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_2ea86030", "Duty missions are open ended assignments. They end when you choose to end them. For example, if I assign you the task of hunting B-Wing prototypes, you can destroy as many as you want. You can end the duty any time from the mission entry in your datapad. Perform duties to earn additional pay and experience.  Once you've received enough experience, I can teach you new skills.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_2efb24e9", "You're an Imperial pilot? Too bad you're already assigned to another unit. I'd be sure you'd make a fine addition to the Epsilon. What brings you here?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_2fb75072", "Swear? That seems a little extreme.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_32ab69ab", "This sounds excessive...");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_32c46e00", "Where should I go?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_32fca1d6", "Whatever. Does this job pay?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_334f003c", "Nothing to it. Now, you owe me some answers.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_33a8fcd8", "I can, hon, but I'm not going to... not yet.  I need you to do some things for me first.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_33d3f25d", "Hon, you are really shaping up to be a fine agent. Keep sharp. I'll have more work for you soon.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_34089768", "Sounds like a fun job.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_34ac7110", "If someone shoots at me, I shoot back.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_34d65199", "Hey cutey. I see you made it back in one piece. I've already heard the news. You managed to take out an entire Rebel security patrol. Nice work. Here's your payment.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3599ff41", "Pilot, you've exceeded my expectations. Black Epsilon was right to recruit you. With any luck, the Emperor's plans for this system will be fulfilled within the year. Come back when you are ready for more work.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_36eb0383", "Took out enough of them to send a message.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_386d47c9", "I'm more interested in the pay than the politics.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_38909ce3", "You can count on it.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3ac44381", "Failure at this point is only going to encourage the Rebels to invest further in experimental ship designs. You need to get back up there and bag a B-Wing. Show the Rebels that technology isn't going to be their salvation.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3b421b4c", "When the mission is over, and you're all safe and sound, go to the nearest space station. You'll need to get landing clearance from the space station - so comm the station commander and tell her you'd like to land.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3b6083ca", "Don't get too confident. The B-Wing is apparently one tough bofa treat. Blasters, missiles, good sensors and visibility. Outmaneuver her and you'll win. Our superiors think this assignment is a gamble, but I put in a good word for you. Don't let me down.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3bcb2c4a", "Imperial Intelligence has already captured extensive documentation on the ship's design, so we don't need to capture a working prototype. We'd prefer to simply send a message to the Rebellion: 'We know your secrets and they don't scare us one bit'.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3c26f38a", "What is Black Epsilon doing here?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3c33e829", "Report back to me when you're done and we'll talk about the next step.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3ddbe3ce", "Excellent. Let me know when you've done it.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3e77e17d", "I appreciate all you have done for me but I am ready to move on.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3e8986a7", "You aren't exactly doing a good job of reassuring me.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_3e935b51", "Suit yourself, hon. Come and visit again sometime.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_407c41b9", "They work through me and only me. The less you know, the less you tell when you get caught.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_41d4922", "As I was saying. The Emperor can't order a direct invasion of Corellia. He needs a politically acceptable reason to make a move. My job is to provide that reason.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_41e7fbb3", "That would be the point, dear. The destruction of a small Rebel force should stir things up a bit. The Rebels will probably start flying more patrols, putting up a more obvious presence. Exactly the kind of thing we need to betray Corellian neutrality. If anyone questions you, say you defended yourself against a hostile force while on patrol duty.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_423667ed", "Fine, I will swear. I swear to serve the Emperor, to uphold his law, and to do his will without fail.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_42a16c5f", "Some very nasty and very illegal explosive devices. We need to get them planet-side so our ground ops team can wire up a little demonstration of Rebel fanaticism.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_42dfe6db", "Indeed. The Empire rarely enlists non-Humans as pilots, and so we are poorly prepared to equip someone such as yourself. But do not be discouraged. Your current standing in the Imperial Navy is a testament to your abilities.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_4358efe9", "Where is my ship?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_438b2349", "So far you've been flying a basic TIE.  The normal TIE is quite a bit more complicated than that.  For one thing, you'll find that you can install better components on it... better weapons, better armor, and so on.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_43fe629", "Oh and be careful. I'd hate to see that cute face get a scratch.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_444df4b9", "You can learn about Imperial technology, TIE weapons, Imperial operations, or astromech management.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_45c1b2ad", "Here's your money for that last job. You know, hon, Black Epsilon is a political organization. We want members who understand the delicate balance of galactic power. I'm starting to have doubts about our...compatibility.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_46405dbf", "You've exceeded my expectations. Black Epsilon was right to recruit you. Come back when you are ready for more work.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_4738e99f", "How do I find a space station?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_485d8416", "Yes...it did feel right.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_48f07357", "No, I'm not a killer.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_4acb4a79", "How perceptive! Yes, I am a Zabrak. The Imperial policies don't apply to me or anyone with the agency.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_4afb3952", "A minor skirmish between an Imperial pilot and a Rebel patrol isn't exactly the kind of thing that will motivate Corellia to run to the Empire. Particularly not when the Empire loses. I want total carnage. Bait the Rebels into attacking you and smash them.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_4b074298", "Come back when you're done with your mission. You can abort your mission if you want to start over.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_4b5d9495", "Alright. What's the job?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_4bb6ea28", "Your ship is parked at a starport. I've given you the control codes for a basic TIE fighter by uploading them to your personal datapad. Check your datapad to review your ship status whenever you'd like, sweetie.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_4d31f286", "Are you going to train me now?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_4dc7104e", "Good, I have plenty of work for you. Pirate activity in the area is still fairly high. There are plenty of pirates to hunt or you could help escort transports moving supplies.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_4ecd165f", "So now I'm an Imperial Pilot? Just like that?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_506c3428", "You know your history, I'm impressed! Yes, the Mandalorians tried to build an empire through war alone and were ultimately defeated. They didn't understand manipulation. To achieve victory you sometimes have to offer the embrace of peace while holding a hidden dagger.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_51db72fc", "We need to make sure that we keep their military power in check while they increase their activity. Stirring up the chuba nest isn't going to do any good if the Rebels end up fortifying Corellia.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_53c3dd52", "Well, aren't you a cute one. My name is Hakasha Sireen. Is there something I can do for you?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_540bd789", "Apparently the Rebels are testing a new prototype starfighter called the B-Wing. It's a heavy assault fighter, loaded with weapons and layered in armor. B-Wing prototypes have been spotted in the Corellian system. We want you to find one and destroy it.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_54328ce3", "I won't swear to serve the Emperor.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_549eddbe", "Grounded?!");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_54eaa333", "For the Emperor, indeed. You've done an admirable job and Black Epsilon has taken note of your success. Here is your pay for the B-Wing mission. I've also gotten a hold of a TIE pilot helmet. It's pretty menacing, should make you feel more the part for these operations.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_55f35dd9", "I'm always up for a challenge.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_56b5e7e6", "Black Epsilon has authorized me to give you special instruction. Field training that will make you a more effective agent.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_577aca95", "I'm interested in weapons.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_593d4b61", "I understand you're angry but...");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_593de03f", "You're grounded, sweetie.  Reports are you turned on the Empire.  You haven't been fighting for the Rebel Alliance, have you?  Please don't tell me it's true!");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_59a0de2a", "First you need to go to the starport. Once you get there, you will need to go inside and look for a 'starship terminal.' They tend to be in the big main area right past the foyer. When you find a terminal, use it to 'launch' your ship into space.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_5a48897a", "Hey there, hon. Ready to talk business?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_5bd69df6", "What do you need me to do?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_5c5f5b06", "Not just yet, %NU.  You still have a few more assignments to complete before I'll train you.  Now, I promised to answer questions for you... so what do you want to know?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_5da44265", "I want some training.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_5dd3c672", "Report back to me when you've taken out the prototype ship. Good luck, hon.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_5e109aee", "So you should be. There are very few active primary operatives in Black Epsilon. The Emperor himself is putting his faith and trust in you. I suppose it isn't necessary for me to say that failure would be punished harshly.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_5e3cf461", "I'm interested in Imperial technology.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_5ebce168", "Actually, I'd like to do this later.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_614b71f0", "I see...");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_62027e5", "I'm a supporter of the Empire. What can I do to help?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_62ce5e6e", "Hiya hon. It's very sweet of you to come back for a visit but you no longer work for me. You should go see Prisk.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_6372912d", "He's toast. Not such a tough ship after all.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_644da0b1", "Then I suppose I don't have a choice.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_64a94075", "Ah, no...it's a tough ship.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_659a2365", "My pay?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_665a7735", "I am honored.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_66f5a5c0", "Glory for Emperor Palpatine! Go celebrate your promotion and come back when you're ready to get started on the next phase of your development.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_67b99efb", "Aren't we the tough one? So what do you want to know?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_67ded17", "When do I get to meet these superiors?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_67e76bed", "Yes, please. I really need a new ship.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_683cce3a", "It is about time you sought a greater commitment to the Empire.  Seek out an Imperial Recruiter to join.  Keep in mind - even as a covert operative - you could be opening yourself to attack when you least expect it.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_6942389e", "And you've earned it!  I'll make a deal with you, %NU.  Do just one more assignment for me, and I'll train you to be a better starfighter pilot.  Are you up for a challenge?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_6a128385", "What is a duty?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_6a750265", "Good. That kind of confidence is what I'm looking for. I represent an agency interested in seeing the Imperial presence in this region of space increased. I think you can help me achieve that goal.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_6d2bb136", "I suppose you have a point.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_6f5dc45e", "Good to hear it. Let me know when the job is done.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_6fb821bb", "Oh, hon, you're no fun. Do this job and you'll get your answers. I'll have more work for you, too. Obviously one little incident won't be enough to achieve our goals. Come back and talk to me when you've killed the Rebels.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_702795f8", "That's all you have to say about it?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_70edc281", "Why would the Empire work with a Zabrak?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_710daa61", "I don't need any training.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_71df5543", "No luck with the Rebels eh?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_727f229", "Corellia has declared neutrality in the so called 'Galactic Civil War.' At the same time, they are host to a wide range of Rebel operations, including the protection of known collaborators. The Emperor doesn't like this situation.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_72fd1d8c", "So I heard. More unfortunate casualties. I'm glad to see you didn't hesitate in eliminating them.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7469594f", "Sorry, hon.  There's nothing I can do until you improve your standing with the Empire.  You need to prove you're still on our side!");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_747c5a79", "Ah, like Mandalore.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_761039fa", "I want to enlist with the ground forces");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7839f2d4", "Consider them dead.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_786f3cf7", "I want to study something else.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_78dd7bba", "Look on the bright side, at least I won't make you call me 'sir'. Shall we get down to business?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7912ee34", "Yeah, sorry, hon. IF you get caught. Come back when you are ready for the next step in our operation.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_79ab4bbe", "[Escort Duty] I'm interested in escorting transports.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7a80cd06", "I'm ready for the next step in the operation.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7b9b2577", "Swear to the Emperor? I can't do that.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7bff5a7f", "You don't have the experience for training, yet.  Perform some more duties.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7c1600a", "What's the next step?  I'm ready.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7c7f3198", "This doesn't make sense. The Empire has a policy against hiring non-humans and you're a Zabrak.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7c8aca1b", "Good choice.  Report back when you are ready for an assignment.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7dad1c0c", "So what do you want to know?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7e4287eb", "All in good time, hon. Show me you're serious and then we can share all the dirty little secrets.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7f8a87c", "Alright, report back to me when you are ready.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_7f96a397", "On second thought. No thanks.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_801033a0", "Destroy it? Why not capture it?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_80d8485c", "I'm on it.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_81a6747", "Before the destruction of the Death Star, we primarily operated in the Outer Rim, softening new worlds for Imperial expansion. Since the rise of the Rebellion, we have been recalled to the Core Worlds.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_82040511", "After a fashion. There's plenty of me to reveal later. I want you to fly a patrol in low orbit near Coronet. Use an Imperial TIE fighter. Show the flag. Most importantly, attract the attention of the Rebels. The Rebellion is a violent terrorist organization. They won't be able to resist a lone TIE strutting about in enemy territory. When they move in to shoot you down, eliminate them.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_83980c8d", "Listen to the lesson, then you'll get the job. I want to make sure you understand the delicacy of the situation.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_83dc5be7", "Here is your pay for the B-Wing mission. I've also gotten a hold of a TIE pilot helmet. It looks pretty menacing, should make you feel more the part for these operations.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_8417be65", "Actually, I'm interested in keeping my skin.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_845e6ef5", "I swear to serve the Emperor, to uphold his law, and to do his will without fail.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_8467c710", "Ok");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_85dd7d6c", "How do I get back?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_86c66182", "What's the next step?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_87f86e3e", "What agency do you work for?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_885decf4", "My boys in ground ops say they received the package. Good work. They're going to be moving forward with the dirtier side of the plan soon.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_8879f039", "Which means?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_88da6887", "I ran into some trouble.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_88ffee3a", "Report back to me when you are ready for some work.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_8b179721", "That's all I have to say for now. Swear to the Emperor, prove your loyalty to the Empire, and then we can get personal.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_8b4aa06c", "If the Navy invades, other planets loyal to the Empire might turn to the Rebellion. The Emperor built his great Galactic Empire through a deft mix of politics and war. Sometimes, hon, the former is preferable to the latter.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_8cf0a3be", "I don't want to hear it. This operation is critical, so we have another transport coming in. Make sure this one arrives.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_8dec57cb", "Glad to see you came with your game face on, because we're going to up the ante. We've got a transport coming into the system soon carrying some delicate cargo. I need you to meet this transport and escort it safely to near Coronet orbit.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_8fdf4d92", "I need to figure out what went wrong.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_9265da40", "Sounds like the right move, then.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_9288900f", "I understand.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_92a51c16", "Does this job pay?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_943c7ba6", "I'd like training.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_95797708", "Hey babe. Did you deal with those annoying little Rebel trainees?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_95d0bcb3", "Your attack on the Rebel patrol was very successful. The attack looked like a failed act of Rebel aggression. Popular support for the Rebellion on Corellia is faltering. The Rebels suspect something's up, so they're starting to beef up their operations.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_9644818a", "Just like that. Sure, there's usually the years of formal officer education, the background checks, the certification trials...a mess, really. We can dispense with the formal stuff. The way I see it, you'll either do what I say and prove you have what it takes, or you'll die.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_96682689", "Tell me about the job.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_96c066fe", "I need to think about a better plan of attack, first.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_97d43fda", "I get the idea.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_995b811", "A brilliant plan.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_9e6137e3", "I think I recognize you. You're on a wanted list I think... I can't work with known members of criminal organizations.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_9f128498", "No doubt about that! What else can I tell you about?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_a074ac18", "The trainees shouldn't be a match for you, but their instructors might. You are going to have to hunt them down in the Corellian system. Intelligence has not yet been able to locate their training grounds but there are reports of a Rebel station somewhere in the system. Might be a good start. Be on guard and don't worry if one escapes and reports you. The Empire is fully justified in destroying terrorist training grounds found within its jurisdiction.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_a37bb512", "As you know, Corellia has been officially neutral in the galactic civil war. Despite this declaration of neutrality and some deft political maneuvering on behalf of the Corellian leadership, a strong Rebel sentiment has taken hold here. Rumor has it that Princess Leia Organa herself is operating a command center in the area.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_a45281b6", "It is excessive. Local civilian support for the Rebellion will be crushed. The Corellian government will be forced to take measures to stop Rebel aggression. The Rebels will plead innocence, all the while the vids report Imperial casualties.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_a4c65e0b", "With just a little more training, you could be using better weapons.  Missiles can really help to swing the battle your way, and this skill can allow you to use some good ones.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_a57e647c", "I'm interested in astromech management.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_a60c6c26", "Hey hon, glad you stopped in. Word just came down from the Black Epsilon command group: we're moving forward with the next phase of our operation. They want you to be the primary operative.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_a65a372a", "They are all that way. The helm contains an inertial dampening system that helps prevent blackouts during tactical maneuvers as well as various optical systems that integrate with the standard TIE flight interface.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_a8d68602", "The majority of Imperial military operations are handled by the Navy and the Army. Both are massive, bureaucratic organizations. They destroy their enemies utterly, but sometimes a lighter touch is needed.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_aac65592", "I feared as much. I hate to lose someone with your obvious...talents, but the Emperor is in need of pilots with your skill. Prisk Kith'Vys has mentioned that he could use a good pilot, so I suggested you. He is roaming around here somewhere, just tell him that I sent you. Don't be fooled by his gruff, straightforward manner...he is really just a softy. Keep safe cutie.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ac893f3a", "I'm here for a job, not a political science lesson.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ae56cee4", "If this was a normal job, I might agree. It isn't a normal job. I need someone I know I can trust. The agency I work for is very interested in the loyalty of its employees.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_afc85a31", "Don't worry, cutey, I still believe in you.  You'll be back in no time!");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_afec2e39", "Welcome back. You might like to know that I have mentioned your name to one of my superiors and he is most interested in meeting you. But I would highly recommend that you do not go until you feel yourself ready to take the next step.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_aff8083e", "And I'd like to give you one, but I'm afraid that I don't have anything you can do right now. Why don't you try speaking with your commanding officer?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b00eaf8", "Getting a weak stomach, hon? This is a war and in war there are casualties. If destroying that barracks brings full Imperial occupation to this system and shuts down Rebel operations here, more Imperial lives will have been saved in the long run.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b016fdf8", "It's your choice, but I recommend you take training while you have the chance.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b0f32222", "Black Epsilon has calculated thousands of permutations on this scenario. The numbers don't lie. This will be a key move in bringing Corellia fully into the civil war on the side of the Empire.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b1097fe", "Then don't waste my time, hon.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b1f72a19", "Here you are. Try not to lose this one.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b1fa2372", "You're going to kill your own troops?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b224e12", "It was a close fight, but I came out on top.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b2e9f062", "Black Epsilon demands results. You have failed to bring those results. If you can't bring yourself to do this job, there are others who will.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b4d32046", "Did you eliminate the B-Wing prototype?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b789ed1e", "I'm interested in a duty mission.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b7b2ca97", "We're going to destroy the barracks of the 72nd Imperial Army Division, based in Coronet. The explosives are of Mon Cal manufacture...extremely rare. Since the Mon Cal are open supporters of the Rebellion, it will look very much like a Rebel operation.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_bb310cb", "I gave you a test and you passed. You killed for the Emperor without worrying about the consequences. To be a member of Black Epsilon, you must apply your will totally and act without the burden of conscience. We do what others can not.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_be86775e", "Doesn't sound like anything I'm not used to.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_bf5586b8", "Sorry, I don't deal with Rebels.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c006779f", "What do you need, hon? You've got your assignment, and the control device for your ship is set up in your datapad.  You need to go to the Starport and access the starship terminal to launch into space.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c023d5a9", "I've heard these rumors before.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c0c1f033", "If you want to stay alive, no. Report back to me when you've done the job.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c1024ba1", "I'm sure you would, hon. As it so happens, I do have some elective duty missions, if you're interested.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c10b8471", "Just like that. I am not big on ceremony so we are not going to worry about that much. I am authorized to grant you a basic TIE. If you want we can smash a bottle of corellian wine against it but I figure that would be a waste of good wine. The way I see it, you'll either do what I say and prove you have what it takes, or you'll die. ");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c168cb82", "Oh you are an ambitious one, %NU, I'll give you that.  But I need you to move on to the next step in the operation now.  There'll be plenty of time for training later.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c261b36a", "So you're a spy.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c261cfae", "No problem.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c4031ec5", "Business it is then. I can issue you a new TIE fighter, but only the basic model. Are you sure that is what you want?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c602907a", "I will not fail the Empire.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c6aae4cb", "Cranial proportions?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c6d9f61", "I'd like to study that in detail.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c722467d", "Don't hesitate too long. The ship will be arriving in the system shortly.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c782972e", "For now, that's all the motivation I need. Later, I'll want to know you see things our way. Come back when you are ready to work on the next step in our operation.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c7c75ec4", "Right to the point. I like that. Yeah, it pays. Imperial credits and the opportunity for our relationship to get... closer. Of course, all of this depends upon your discretion. Tell someone about the job and you'll be paid with a different kind of currency.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c81a8a32", "Black Epsilon is one such tool. The Emperor wisely does not invest all of his trust in a single agent. Should we fail, others would eliminate us and take our place. Thus we do not fail.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_c890222b", "I can't believe you failed the escort. This operation is crucial. We don't have much of the explosive to spare!");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ca2a7f20", "I...well you see...I sort of lost my ship.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ca3b3777", "Hon, you already are a part of Black Epsilon. You swore to the Emperor and you've shown your loyalty.  Your position with the agency is assured. Of course, if I discover that you intend to betray us, your life will be forfeit.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_cae1bdcf", "Well, aren't you a cute one. But unless you're a pilot, I'm afraid there's not much I can do for you.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_cc282429", "Nice to see you again hon. Are you here for business or pleasure?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ccf66c81", "Go on then.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_cd5427a6", "Maybe you should think about what it means to be a supporter of the Empire. Have a good evening, hon.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ce07308a", "The Emperor is willing to lay aside minor prejudice to work with talented individuals. I have long since proven my worth. You, on the other hand, have much to prove.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_cf202613", "I think you'll find loyal service to the Emperor is very rewarding.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_d0803d68", "Good idea. Let me know when you're ready to get back up there and try again.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_d0a7527e", "I'm sure you have, hon. So you'll also be aware that the Emperor disapproves of this harboring of criminal activity and, naturally, wishes to put an end to it. The problem is that Corellia is a politically valuable world. Any overt move to take the planet by force would alienate her people and push her further towards Rebel ideology.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_d1613a21", "You want me to kill them?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_d2d78159", "Now is not the time to second guess your masters. The fulfillment of our goals is within reach. Remember your oath. The Emperor has willed this and has foreseen a favorable outcome.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_d2e23af2", "What's my next assignment?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_d537ac2e", "So witnessed. Congratulations, hon, you've made a very wise decision. For this operation, you'll need legitimate credentials. From now on, your ID will indicate your status as a Pilot Initiate in the Imperial Navy. My agency will ensure that the Navy records reflect this...half truth.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_d742dc00", "Now, hon... just what sort of trouble have you gotten yourself into?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_d80177b5", "Sorry, I'm not interested in helping the Empire.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_da237511", "I take my job seriously, babe. Get back out there and do it right this time.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_da3e5ec3", "Then why recruit me?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_dc63dc1a", "Never mind, I don't want any training after all.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_dd5ca133", "I was attacked by a CorSec patrol during the mission.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_dd67013", "What does that mean?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_de514757", "Few would swear to the Emperor and then kill in his name insincerely. The Emperor knew that in your heart you desired to strike out at your enemies. Your actions prove your loyalty.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_df75425", "Primary operative?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_df76b2e8", "Imperial astromech functionality is typically built into a rugged navicomputer, rather than those annoying sorts of astromech units that the Rebel Alliance relies on.  I can teach you how to utilize some of the basic functionality of the droid interface to normalize your shields, overload your weapons, and that sort of thing.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_df871c0b", "Don't worry about CorSec. I can handle the heat.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_e1ea9c75", "Why doesn't the Emperor just invade?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_e3bb98c5", "The Rebels still have prototype B-Wings in the system. Black Epsilon is paying agents a bounty for any that are destroyed. It helps our cause and it's a good way to hone your combat skills.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_e574a24f", "The destruction of the prototype ship and all of the other trouble we've been causing should put the Rebels on high alert. A few more little pushes and they'll make the mistake we need to justify a full Imperial occupation of Corellia.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_e749e2cd", "What is this agency?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_e99f26f3", "We are a division of the Imperial Navy, but no record in the Imperial Archive on Coruscant would indicate our existence. We serve the will of the Emperor directly and silently. When political necessity requires a war, we create war. When it requires peace, we silence those who oppose peace.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_eb66b332", "See that you don't. Report back to me when you've successfully completed the operation.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ec3c3e1d", "Sounds easy.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ee39efb1", "Give me credits and I give you results. Nothing else matters.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ee63dfa9", "Report back to me when you would like a new duty or mission.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_eec1eeb4", "You still have some work for me to do before I will train you. Okay, hon? Why don't you just finish up with what I am asking you to do? Then we will get you all trained up.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ef85b67c", "That makes sense.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f02cd84d", "Very well. Take care hon.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f09f78be", "I love it when you talk like that. The destruction of the prototype ship and all of the other trouble we've been causing should put the Rebels on high alert. A few more little pushes and they'll make the mistake we need to justify a full Imperial occupation of Corellia.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f0dfde7f", "So you claim, yet you killed. In time you will come to realize the righteousness of your actions.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f0fc751b", "Being a supporter is commendable, but for this job I need to know you're loyal. You must swear obedience to the Emperor. Do it now, or walk away.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f1f8a5ca", "How do you know I'm sincere?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f4547ad0", "Your ship navigation system will automatically create a 'launch waypoint' when you take off. Fly back to this point when your mission is over. However, if you're looking for a particular space station - open your space zone map. You'll find one there!");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f498906e", "Don't worry, if we get the Rebels stirred up enough, I'm sure they'll ship in the big guns. That's what we want, after all. A big move by the Rebels would justify a big counter move by the Empire.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f6629a2e", "Don't you mean IF I get caught?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f85e6621", "There is nothing more that I can teach you hon. You need to move on in order to grow.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f866da28", "Babe, I don't trust anyone.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f8b02865", "What do I do?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_f93af369", "You're a pilot? Interesting... Yes, I'm looking to hire a pilot. The job isn't easy and you'll have to work with minimal information. You'll be shot at. Probably have to kill some people, too. Sure you want this kind of work?");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_fa187bb6", "They weren't much of a challenge.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_fad19320", "But, I...");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_fb05d4a4", "It's a promotion. Black Epsilon feels you've shown sufficient loyalty and skill to be elevated in rank. You'll be in charge of flying mission critical operations in this region. You may work directly with other agents of the Emperor.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_fb13007f", "I'm interested in Imperial operations.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_fb5547eb", "We still have several key transports moving through the region on a regular basis. Most are ferrying operational supplies for us, but some are carrying equipment for other Imperial agencies. Black Epsilon will pay for every transport you escort safely.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_fbd7d1ba", "I think you'll like this mission, hon. You get to test your mettle against some new Rebel technology. Real cutting edge stuff, too.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_fe85123f", "Black Epsilon...");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ff1e8d6a", "I mean on Corellia.");
stringFiles[161].addEntry("s_ffba9145", "I think I can take one out.");

stringFiles[162] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_imperial_trainer_2");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_imperial_trainer_2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_116d8b3b", "What sort of task.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_16439d46", "All in a days work.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_17780ca7", "What is the purpose of this craft?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_1946850", "One of the scanning vessels received odd signals from a Nebula in the system. There are possible Rebel craft in the area, but the interference from the Nebula make it difficult to confirm.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_1a0f022", "[DESTROY] I'm looking to dust a few Rebels.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_1bbb820a", "About Alderaan....");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_1d1f03a8", "I am ready to take off.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_1d40157", "No, you are to kill him.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_1ff4247a", "I will not fail.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_2517a327", "The Imperial Navy is tied up with other tasks at the moment.  Black Epsilon can accomplish with one craft what would take them ten.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_25457635", "Good, that is all.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_25c6e073", "No, I have other matters to attend to.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_25edc644", "There will be a lone fighter passing near one of the outer asteroid belts.  This fighter will be unmanned though the piloting droid will put up a fight.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_26912e4b", "What should I do with the crew?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_2c4789b", "Understood.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_2ee19e18", "Eager and to the point, I like that. I willing to give you a test run. If you succeed I think that I might have an opening in my squad for you. If you fail...well you will be dead and I won't lose any sleep over it. There is a Hidden Dagger heavy transport entering the system that needs to be eliminated.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_2fa7f312", "You must survive.  TechOps is installing a powerful communications jammer in your craft.  This jammer will allow the attacking forces to communicate with each other to avoid suspicion, but will prevent communications from their base. ");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_329f7488", "Remember, you must stay within range of the ambush point.  We will provide you with a location that will disrupt their hyperspace jumps, it is all the help you will get from us.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_345e676a", "To the Empire it is a very big deal. To show their appreciation, here is a bonus payment. Take some time off and enjoy that bonus. When you are ready come back and see me for some more work.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_37680b25", "Let me try again. You won't be disappointed.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_38d28ac2", "Stay focused.  The fallback plan is to destroy this freighter outright if your assault fails.  We do not have any craft available for a rescue, so don't expect one.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_392fc531", "Well done. Consider yourself part of my squad. I do not have time for idle chatter %NU, so are you prepared for your next assignment?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_395e48e8", "Then return when speaking with me will not be such an inconvenience.  I will not look forward to you wasting more of my time.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_3ab6a9ed", "We need you to escort one of our scanning vessels on its rounds.  As you can imagine both smugglers and Rebels alike would love to see these craft out of commission.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_3dc996d2", "Darmin will be travelling in a YT-1300 named the 'Nerfs Pride', and will likely have an armed escort.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_3e38e6a0", "[ESCORT] I wish to assist the local security forces.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_3ec7906d", "Yes, of course you don't.  Nevertheless, you cannot be trusted to fly for the Imperial Navy.  Not after what you did.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_3f764ef1", "Excellent choice.  The Empires advanced craft are worth the effort required to master them.  I have a critical task that you can apply your new-found skills to.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_42aa1748", "Do not waste my time with inane requests. If you want a mission, go speak to your own commanding officer.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_4391b2de", "You would hate to ruin my mood by speaking with me, so why don't we end our conversation here.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_4854758d", "I would like to request a mission.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_4a5ef35b", "The crew has been accounted for.  Just get the program uploaded.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_4cc1cf3b", "This attack must proceed as planned.  Survive for as long as you can and keep their communications down.  Black Epsilon and your Emperor are counting on you.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_4ea4b48d", "Black Epsilon does not wish the Rebels to have any local allies here.  We will use the ship, properly scuttled, to implicate foul play at the hands of the Rebels.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_50b5b468", "The Rebels are flying in a diplomat named Darmin Lerspri, supposedly an Alderaanian official of some sort who happened to be off world when it was destroyed.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_52841755", "They will likely have an escort.  This escort must be neutralized.  Then target the freighter's engines to disable them.  After they are down, move into position, and upload an autopilot override program that TechOps is outfitting your craft with now.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_584a90f8", "You've done an excellent job for me, %NU.  I can see that you are ready for more training.  What are you interested in learning?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_59894e66", "It was nothing. He deserved what he got.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_5b204877", "What can I do?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_5bfd4371", "Fine. Have it your way. Get out there and prove yourself worthy of being in my squad. Capture that Hidden Dagger freighter.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_5ffdd434", "I need a hyperdrive!");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_60a52374", "I would like to think that you are more skilled at flying than you are at military protocol. However, I do have some duty missions that need tending to. I'll save the important missions for my good pilots.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_62b8eb46", "I thought you wanted pilots, not assassins?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_63e01bb7", "How can you fail such a simple task? Get back in space and complete your mission.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_683cbf70", "The Hidden Daggers were a minor band of highly skilled Assassins founded by a disavowed Flail Cutthroat Lieutenant.  They were never well known, taking only small bounties and have since degenerated into a band of thugs and pirates.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_69d014bc", "What Intelligence do we have on the target?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_6a1562ad", "What do you want?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_6d3be6aa", "What is the task?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_6ed7de92", "What must I do?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_7090182", "What?!");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_71d84d34", "A future in the Imperial Navy, you mean.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_74f9775d", "I do not have time for pleasantries, pilot. Why have you come?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_79375065", "Dismissed, aye sir!");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_79813bfb", "Black Epsilon command wants you to intercept a freighter and inspect their cargo.  You are looking for a Personnel Dossier on Rebel agents working in the Coronet area.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_798fbe2", "[ESCORT] I will assist as a merchant escort.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_7a33d3dc", "What will be my involvement?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_7ca4fcb8", "What sort of surprise?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_82fd8660", "I wish to learn about intermediate starship component use.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_83993cf3", "It seems you are an enemy of the Empire after all.  Did you think we would not know of this little... indiscretion?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_83bf02e8", "What sort of back up will I have?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_83c3790d", "How will I do this?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_88523765", "What should I do with the freighter?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_8abe1dd0", "See that you don't.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_8bf01045", "I'll take the mission.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_8db61bfa", "Not all tasks can be fit for the history books, but perhaps this one may.  The Rebels are flying in a diplomat named Darmin Lerspri, supposedly an Alderaanian official of some sort who happened to be off world when it was destroyed.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_8e613fca", "The Rebels barely know how to pilot their ships. It is no big deal.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_8f26747e", "Prove your devotion to the Empire.  If you improve your standing with the Empire, you may have a future after all.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_908955bc", "This is a reconnaissance flight then?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_91f63d81", "Can you estimate the strength of his escort?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_96e86218", "Good luck %NU, take no prisoners.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_98840984", "Indeed.  There has been a squad of Rebel bombers sighted in the system. Black Epsilon has been tasked with their destruction.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_9a117462", "It's about time that you returned. I have an assignment for you and it cannot wait.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_9b4e084a", "I wish to learn about reactor engineering algorithms.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_9cca1500", "Why is the ambush important?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_9d2c9b0a", "Do you have more enemy fighter squads to put out of commission?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_9d62faa2", "%TU, is it?  I hear you are a wanted woman.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_9d96ae32", "I have reviewed your ship logs and must say that I am surprised that the Rebels decided to attack you. Regardless you handled yourself with utmost skill and ruthlessness. Nice work.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_9edd30bf", "Hakasha sent me.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_9f952cc3", "Excellently done. Maybe you are not as worthless as I first thought. This dossier is sure to have many interesting facts that the Inquisition is sure to enjoy. Here is your payment for services rendered. Return to me when you are ready for more work.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_a335f4ff", "Apparently he was some sort of nerf herder on his native Alderaan.  The ships name is not of concern.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_a70cef5", "You destroy and entire squad of Rebel bombers and all you say is...all in a days work? I am liking you more and more each day. Here is your commission for taking those bombers out. Take some time to yourself and when you are ready come back for some more work.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_a872e9f9", "I wish to learn about regular Imperial training.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_aa457e5d", "This will not be a simple ordeal.  If Black Epsilon just wanted them destroyed, we would have dispatched the Navy.  We need this vessel captured.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_ae8492d2", "You already have orders to carry out. Your time is my time, so quit wasting it or you may find yourself out of time.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_af154d31", "Yes, of course you don't.  Nevertheless, you cannot be trusted to fly for the Imperial Navy.  Not that I am surprised. I have long argued against the inclusion of females in the military.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_af16cd74", "It is a decoy to lure you specifically.  They intend to ambush you, and Black Epsilon intends to let them.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_b0ab6617", "Pilots I have.  But I do not want this man to even set foot on Corellia. So I need an assassin.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_b51a649", "Do I get to baby-sit another freighter?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_b5a3714a", "I will not have these bombers reach their objective.  Get up there and destroy them.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_b69b5bf4", "I honestly didn't expect you to survive this one. Yet again you prove to be a very resourceful pilot. Thanks to your efforts, the bomber squadron has been destroyed and security brought to the system.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_b76e5165", "That is between you, the freighter, and the cold reaches of space.  Dismissed!");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_bae9fe80", "You have failed to dispose of Darmin, get back up there before he can land.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_bc90f6c5", "However inept they may be, they did manage to acquire some information about the 'Rebel' attack of the 72nd Army Barracks.  They are transporting this information to the Rebels here on Corellia now.  This cannot be allowed to happen.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_bd5df827", "[DESTROY] I wish to assist in anti-pirate patrols.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_be3a7e31", "That is all I have for you.  Speak with Haymir Rendundi for more duties. He is currently stationed at Imperial command on Yavin 4. Keep your nose clean and do your duty.  Haymir isn't nice like me and will be all over you if you mess up. Or are you here for more duties?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_be505897", "I wish to learn about advanced TIE combat craft.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_c2b7ea3a", "It seems females such as yourself are too unreliable to be trustworthy agents for the Empire after all.  Did you think we would not know of this little... indiscretion?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_c4179a5d", "Indeed. The Empire always rewards those who go above and beyond. Here is a small token of our appreciation for your service. Enjoy it and come back to me when you are ready for more work.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_c52a69c1", "There has been a squad of Rebel bombers sighted in the system. Black Epsilon has been tasked with their destruction.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_c71a5ce3", "How does that explain you gawking like a fool?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_c8516ab0", "Why do we need them captured?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_c914798f", "Indeed, droid management is important. Your droid is almost as vital as your blaster. I have another mission lined up for you, so get your droid prepared.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_cb86c1fc", "'Nerfs Pride'?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_cc4d7ea", "Yes, and you will be afforded the opportunity to use that knowledge.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_ccf466b2", "That is correct.  You do need a hyperdrive if you're going to be of use to me.  I suggest you purchase a better ship immediately.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_ceafaf0b", "Do you have a task for me?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_cf473cb7", "We are not here to discuss a dead and wasted planet, stay focused!");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_cfb9fb6e", "You are back already? Do you have anything to report or are you just here wasting my time?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_d1f1fea2", "You will have none.  If you are half as good as you are confidant, you might live long enough to get out of this.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_d335136f", "Yes I am.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_d4374209", "[Hand over dossier]");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_d6508432", "I am to capture this man?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_d6dfa36e", "Shouldn't a straightforward assault be handled by the Navy?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_d9391d4a", "Your tour with me is just about finished, but I have one final task.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_dbd8c729", "I am ready.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_dbf39d2a", "Your face is familiar to me, but I can't remember why. You're probably wanted for something, I'm sure.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_dc33e486", "Downing local pirates will make the Empire look favorable to the citizens of this sector.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_e17fc7e4", "Leave no survivors. The Emperor does not look favorably on mercy or weakness.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_e2d5b9eb", "Blast it! Next time you mess up and fail, stay dead! I don't have any time for pilots who don't know when to zig when they should have zagged.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_e67a0734", "You have more potential than I was expecting. Darmin will no longer be a thorn in the side of the Empire, thanks to your...intervention.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_e71f0d40", "You would hate to ruin my mood by speaking with me friend, so why don't we end our conversation here.  If you have Imperial interests at heart, perhaps it is Hakasha Sireen you are seeking.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_e7f16de3", "Who are these Hidden Daggers?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_e8db34a5", "Trade is the lifeblood of the Corellian system. This task will give us high visibility with those whose loyalty we aim to sway.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_e978ca6b", "Not exactly.  The Rebels have taken note of your activities in this system and are setting up a little surprise for you.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_eb835e9e", "No, this is a burrow mite hunt.  I KNOW they are in there, and I want you to dig them out.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_ecb17e60", "I don't know what you mean");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_ee11d13c", "Since you appear to have run out of useful things to do, take some duties to keep you busy.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_eea972b1", "By such narrow minded thinking, all humans would be loyal followers of the Empire. Bothawui remains neutral as always, though many clans have openly sided with the Rebels, my clan has found the Imperial coffers deep enough for our loyalties.  I am sure one such as you can understand.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_f016912e", "I expect only a couple fighters.  What you should be more concerned with is the local fighter wing here on Corellia.  We do not know of their base yet, so they may be scrambled while we remain unaware.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_f0c8febb", "We have discovered the location of their fighter wing headquarters.  When they scramble the ships to destroy you, Black Epsilon will launch its own attack on their undefended base.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_f35be898", "Let's not get ahead of ourselves, %NU.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_f37f3d1a", "Why do we want them destroyed?");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_f3d4db20", "I have a priority task to accompany this assignment.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_f4f691ae", "Indeed.  I am ready for a mission.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_f4fd144d", "They will not be able to resist attacking you.  Ambush is their favorite tactic knowing that a direct assault is futile.  Show them what it means cross with Black Epsilon.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_f7df921b", "%TU, is it?  I hear you are a wanted man.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_f87e5fe8", "I believed that Bothawui had sided with the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_fc007f1", "You would hate to ruin my mood by speaking with me friend, so why don't we end our conversation here.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_fd8878bc", "I fully expect you to die. You are still expendable in my book so consider this a test.");
stringFiles[162].addEntry("s_fe284208", "What's wrong?  Were the mean Rebels too much for you?  Get up there and finish them.");

stringFiles[163] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_privateer_retired_corsec_beggar");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_privateer_retired_corsec_beggar) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_11d6eac4", "The Empire kicked down the doors to CorSec and confiscated starships, weapons... even our sidearms! Can you believe it? And last, but not least, they raided our pension funds.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_17b4bc37", "Good. Who needs you, anyway?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_19104f66", "(Give 100 credits)");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_1a2b4bd6", "You have proof of this?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_1aea5dd4", "What difference does it make?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_1af6e3a2", "Um. Yeah. I can't talk right now.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_1c18efb1", "Excuse me. Can you spare a credit for an old veteran CorSec pilot?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_1c7c9ce0", "The Empire froze CorSec retirement funds and forced out everyone with any sort of spot on their record! They say we're Rebels! Ridiculous.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_1ca480f5", "You're crazy.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_1eecbc00", "Unfair!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_1f7981ec", "Nobody important. You fly for the Empire, huh?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_2313ac9e", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_264b3207", "You said it!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_2683bb8f", "How is the Empire responsible?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_2812a379", "Thank you! Times have been really tough since the Empire started losing the war! CorSec's turned upside-down... RSF's been turned upside-down... there's no way for a pilot to make a decent living anymore!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_2992b933", "Get a job.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_2a27a72e", "Back when I was flying 'sports, we weren't allowed to fly for more than two days straight. Now that's all over! Pilots are pressed into constant service and they're falling asleep at the controls. Equipment doesn't get adequate downtime, so accidents are up a thousand percent!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_2a33c404", "What? No pension for you?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_34556faa", "Well you just try it yourself! Ride the shuttles for a while. Better yet - take a 'sport to some exotic place like Dantooine. You'll see what I mean!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_34f6c18f", "I plan to fly for the Empire.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_3541bf7", "That's what I thought. Get out of here.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_366389b9", "The Empire has nothing to do with the RSF!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_3daae2ee", "Do I know you?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_3e8d294c", "Are you?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_3f5509de", "Oh yes! The public-relations folks will tell ya different - but CorSec and the RSF are now fully, one-hundred percent, and unashamedly under the Emperor's thumb!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_428087e9", "What's happening here?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_4294df70", "Oh no? ");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_455169a0", "Travel is not restricted.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_46663cbe", "Upside-down?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_47744716", "I find that hard to believe.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_49eaf107", "Nope. Can't help you.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_4b74e148", "It's a sore spot for me because I happen to hate the Empire for what it's done to me and my friends at CorSec! You know what I'm talking about?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_4e213b9f", "Ha! Ha! Ha! That's a laugh!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_4f68d18f", "I've seen a bunch of Imperial types coming and going from the hotel up the street. You guys having some sort of convention?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_4fbbd27f", "I had a job. Used to fly for CorSec. Now I'm out on the street because of the Empire!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_5034aab7", "I don't respect beggars.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_54fb5f5d", "Not now, maybe... but you mark my words! The Empire is an evil force in the galaxy. Don't let it trap you.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_558fa93c", "Oh nothing. Nothing you would believe, at least! The Empire has stomped its way into CorSec and has taken control of everything. They... and I would guess you... are running CorSec and the RSF into the ground!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_55b16c5b", "You should be ashamed of yourself!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_55b16c62", "Yes. Hate the Empire.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_576d00c5", "You've got a lot to learn, my friend.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_591c9c49", "Really? You have no idea... do you?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_5b204877", "What can I do?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_63520a89", "I would urge you to quit.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_67f5202c", "Oh! Thank you very much!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_6a6e024a", "The Empire kicked down the doors to CorSec and confiscated starships, weapons... even our side-arms! Can you believe it? And last, but not least, they raided our pension funds.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_6ce3ead6", "The Empire has forced all planetary governments to abandon the safety regulations for pilots, shuttles and interplanetary transports!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_757d93fb", "Yes I do.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_763e6d5", "Make the right choice, friend. Don't help the Empire. Fight for freedom instead!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_77258083", "Do you now? That's a terrible shame. Just terrible...");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_78ae72a2", "You have a lot to learn, my friend.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_78b67180", "Relax, old man.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_79ec01f7", "You're probably behind it all...");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_7c3dc1ab", "Because they're going crazy trying to freeze people's assets, inspect communications, and restrict travel.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_7eee531", "A hard road, my friend... but I respect the choice. If I were only younger, I would go with you and sign up!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_8252a913", "What makes you think the Empire is losing?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_82f0aea5", "Hmph.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_87f655c5", "Can you spare some credits, my friend?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_892ffb49", "You here for the rally?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_8be640b8", "Sure.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_8f4bce76", "I plan to join the Alliance Navy.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_958a863c", "How do they justify that?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_968710ca", "You do? That's good. Very good. You're still young enough to do something about it, eh?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_9756c395", "What? What are you talking about?! Get out of here! I don't need this grief!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_97aef052", "Of course I'm right!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_9df7e4c2", "No. I don't.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_9f2e17a3", "Figured as much.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_a761aa1e", "Figured as much!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_b21356c8", "No. Why?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_b25e0684", "Nobody. Just an out-of-work CorSec pilot. Forced into retirement by your superiors. How do you like that?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_b93aa42e", "Then be careful...");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_b9b4cdf3", "We got a notice from the Empire stating that all secure CorSec funds were frozen for inspection. Something about us being tied in with the Alliance.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_bab29e60", "Yeah! Crazy like a durni! Get out of here!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_baf2d521", "I've seen Imperials coming and going from the hotel down the street. You want to tangle with them?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_bb54f6cc", "None of your business.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_c30cfa8b", "Well, it should! And you should have more respect!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_c3c03121", "Are you kidding me? Space pirates, the so-called 'Smugglers Alliance' is a deathtrap! Pilots don't last longer than a few weeks. If you don't get locked up by one of my pals in CorSec, or blown up by a TIE patrol... likely one of your 'friends' will do you in for a profit!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_c45af70d", "Imperial efficiency, of course!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_c4d665ba", "I don't believe you.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_c8291538", "Maybe I should become a space pirate?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_ca776e30", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_cb58d836", "You are very kind.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_cbc9bfc1", "You know... I really shouldn't say any more. You've got your choices to make now. Good luck!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_cdc41c9f", "Yeah, right.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_cf3b2658", "I have nothing to do with it.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_d79019d0", "But shuttle times are much shorter now!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_daa001f6", "Who cares?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_db730888", "No. Nobody knows me.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_de0c6e64", "CorSec is still fully independent!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_e28320c1", "(Give 25 credits)");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_e3717de2", "Maybe you're right.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_e529f302", "And... so...?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_e5ddc8b8", "Mark my words! The wages of piracy... are death.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_eb4e939", "Of course I do!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_ec3ffcdb", "Begone with you! I don't need this sort of grief!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_ed52be64", "Yes. I know.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_ed8c4da8", "And do you know why?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_f06b7dcf", "All right. Tell me.");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_f2319d89", "Why you! Get out of here! I don't deserve this grief!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_f2841236", "Because you're aiding the Rebellion?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_f2dc9195", "Forget it!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_f52972fb", "Heh. Not anymore. Not thanks to the Empire!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_f6046c2a", "That's a lie!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_f8411238", "Believe what you will. It's your funeral!");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_f95334", "What rally?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_ff607592", "What's it to you?");
stringFiles[163].addEntry("s_ff739c7e", "It doesn't bother me, old man!");

stringFiles[164] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_privateer_tier3");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_privateer_tier3) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_1001fca4", "Of course they do! We've already discussed the problem. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_10d3e04", "Yeah, but how?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_13ad0318", "I just need to finish what I started.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_148bc3dc", "You mean the pirates.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_15be2c5c", "Well %NU, it's time for you to go.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_18439671", "Yes. It's like they had classified information or something.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_191d4365", "How about that? I guess those pirates aren't so tough after all.  Come on, let's get you a new skill.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_191e8e9e", "Especially since they weren't expecting it! They thought they owned us. Boy were they wrong!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_192771db", "It's OK! Just ran into a few problems.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_199af81e", "Hey, I've seen those guys at work! They're good!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_19b25af3", "We've got a CorSec ship out there. We want to transfer all those weapons and personnel to a ship that hangs lower in the planet's ozone layer.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_1ca5111b", "I'm not interested in any long, drawn-out trial.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_1cab7ef2", "Need anything from me? Can I help?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_1d231c8f", "You better have something good to say.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_1df277de", "Maybe they've realized we're not so bad after all.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_1f325741", "Pfft.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_1fa985de", "Well, either they took advantage of the situation, and decided to commandeer the vehicle, or they were in on the Black Suns' plans.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_1fc81cc9", "Not necessarily. We just need to be smart.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_202eca31", "Makes sense.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_212383c4", "Engine malfunction?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_215042ad", "Then get back out there and fight!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_2313ac9e", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_24f6863f", "I'm the one getting shot at! I think I have a right to shout!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_25c1d490", "How about advanced techniques?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_25d2c630", "You sound like my mom.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_27244a5b", "Ha.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_2836e6b5", "OK.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_28670323", "All right then! Now let's FOCUS. Black Suns + pirates > us. We need to change that equation.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_287bd3e4", "Think they'll be surprised?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_2a37df4a", "The problem is that the pirates know about our every move.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_2b85ccf3", "Now just because we're rescuing them, that doesn't mean we're off the clock. These guys are still criminals. And now that the Black Suns are out of the picture, our arrangement with them is null and void. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_2cdd8e6", "Hopefully THEY'LL think I'm an idiot too.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_2f9db7a", "Maybe.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_3269c6d", "Not really.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_33360d50", "What have you got in mind?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_355b403f", "Or telepathic.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_359bb23b", "Every report I get these days is a bad one. Do me a favor and bring me some GOOD news, would ya? Get back to work!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_36069595", "Sure did. Those poor guards.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_3675602", "We've got a disabled pirate ship, floating dead above the planet.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_36f54748", "I sure do. Listen, you're good. And I put my good pilots to work. I think it's time for us to send a message.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_38e3a35a", "That explains it.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_3aef69fa", "Once we've got our problem solved, we're going to move into position. Here's the sign. Ready?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_3b154409", "How about special warships?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_3ca5a892", "Well, what do pirates need to do their jobs?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_3ca83562", "The Black Suns only pretended to leave. They were just waiting for the right time to strike!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_3d3852ed", "Went bye-bye. How should I know? Look, the bottom line is, there are guys up there who are sucking air through a straw. They won't last much longer. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_3dd7f9c6", "So what we're going to do it lay low. Play possum.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_3dda8c36", "They told us so themselves. And I know these guys. They've been around for a long time.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_3f1a5798", "Yep. Surprised?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_416e437c", "Our best bet is to hit the weaker group. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_423a90e7", "Get out to the Dantooine System, we will have an operative up there to set up the operation.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_42880861", "Okay...");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_43aecff6", "What do I do when I get him?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_43feb101", "I THINK THEY DID!!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_442e44f0", "I think you're an idiot!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_44a12a06", "How about advanced starship component use?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_44cf2770", "If they are, tell them I'll be happy to explain it to them. In person.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_44d4901e", "I think things are going our way.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_44d57431", "How can that be?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_45e3cf78", "They TRIED to. He made it, thanks to you.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_467f5524", "To those double-crossing pirates, that's who.  ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_4831750e", "I guess all the other pirates are out to lunch.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_4aa060bb", "Buck up! What kind of soldier are you?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_4cd655f5", "You're going to love this.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_4d0823a4", "Me too. We work well together, I think. But now you'll be reporting to Adwan Turoldine, and he's one of the best. Currently he's working undercover in the cantina at the Mining Outpost of Dantooine.  Take care not to blow his cover!  See you around, %NU.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_4ec92de8", "What happened to our arrangement with the other pirates?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_5141a2c2", "Good. Get back out there.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_51db29e8", "We can't get out of this without you.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_529d94c9", "Because there is no way we're going to be able to beat the Black Suns! ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_53213682", "I think we've got one. But we're going to have to be tricky.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_537e4c85", "This would never have happened, if they hadn't taken advantage of our trusting nature. So it's payback time. I want you to go after the captain who radioed in for help. He's the guy who started this whole thing.  ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_53faf560", "You want me to kill him.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_544a2184", "As long as they're working together, they're unstoppable. We need to break this alliance, quick.  ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_545738f9", "I bet it's the latter.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_55c00fb4", "Well how about THEM apples?!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_57bdf799", "My pleasure. From now on you'll  be reporting to Adwan Turoldine. You'll like him, I think. Currently he's working undercover in the cantina at the Mining Outpost of Dantooine.  Take care not to blow his cover!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_587cb454", "I'm OK.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_5904df36", "100%.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_5991827d", "Bingo. Word is, they're expecting a weapons shipment in the Dathomir System. I'd like you to find the freighter ship and confiscate their cargo. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_5bf2f9e5", "I can't believe they're asking US for help.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_5d9d0e58", "I'm still on the job.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_5dc82348", "Good.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_5e2a2bb1", "Sounds good.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_5ec3d0ab", "You sure did. But you know what to do, right?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_5f3b7a4", "Nah! Something much more low-tech.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_61b78d18", "Psst! I think you took a wrong turn somewhere. Your boss is waiting for you.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_61e91afa", "%TU. Good to meet you. I'm Commander Ramna. How are you liking Lok so far?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_62241cb7", "What's going on?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_626f9f67", "Sure did! Surprise!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_657871b9", "Ran into a little bit of trouble up there.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_66691f62", "The ship was carrying a virus that infected your ship's computer system. It gave the pirates a window into all CorSec communications.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_671470cf", "It's almost like they KNEW I was going to be there.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_67d280da", "He would have done the same for me.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_67e6df55", "Okay.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_68f733fc", "As long as they're working together, they're unstoppable. We need to break this alliance, quick. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_6b7449f8", "Maybe after that whole fiasco with the Black Suns, they realized we're not so bad after all.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_6b7c6e79", "Of course they did! We've already discussed the problem. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_6c251948", "You got it.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_6dc79733", "As a matter of fact, I do. OK. First of all, we know for a fact that the pirates DID know about your movements.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_6ddb0d47", "I hit them.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_705da14d", "Sorry to hear that.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_71b6239a", "We've got a CorSec ship out there. We want to transfer all those weapons and personnel to a ship that hangs lower in the planet's atmosphere.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_727409be", "Not yet. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_73d80fb", "The Black Suns have been on our backs for a while, but they're finally starting to back off and things are back to normal. But I do have an assignment for you.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7426e000", "No!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_74f40f1d", "We've got engineers working on the problem as we speak.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7546ce62", "The Black Suns are scrambling. They don't know what hit them! ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_75bc266c", "They sure will. But listen to me. The only way this plan can work is if they think we're not on to them. So act normal - especially over coms.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7600e908", "Well it wasn't exactly our idea!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_77b0e9f8", "No. I can do it.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_785dc9dc", "It felt good to turn around and kick those Black Suns where it counts.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_798f8f83", "They need weapons.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7aa63d3c", "You can intercept him in the Endor system. Good luck.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7afb0972", "Whatever happened to the pirate code?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7b3d8608", "Pretty annoying, eh?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7bec018d", "That's what we get for trying to help out a bunch of grubby pirates!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7c722941", "Oh boy. We have really got a problem on our hands now! I need skilled pilots. Let's continue your training. What's next for you?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7d0ca743", "Ready to give it another shot?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7d4eaca7", "I don't know.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_7d83809c", "Well I'm SOMEBODY'S mom! Go on, get back out there!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_80c0a2c4", "Ha is right. And now we're going to press our advantage. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_81e58210", "OK, OK. You've got a right to be angry. Give me a chance to speak, will ya? ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_8335bee5", "I'd like it more if I had something to do.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_841d27db", "Why?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_868a3d1c", "I bet you're right.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_87f3112e", "Thanks for everything.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_88451b48", "How about system balance programming?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_89196a3b", "Is that engineer working on it?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_8af6aa3e", "Give up, I guess.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_8dd36524", "Sure. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_8e42f486", "So I should arrest them?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_8e67895a", "Please. You're upsetting me.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_8e888943", "You better believe he is.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_8f418b3a", "We were IDIOTS to trust those pirates.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_8fcc3b5a", "Oh for crying out loud.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_90422eb5", "Good luck.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9089ef38", "So, we don't want to make any aggressive moves - not until we have some semblance of privacy.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9143af03", "You're sure they're pirates?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_956853f", "OK. Well you're up to speed on everything that's happened so far, right? The hole in our comlink system, all that?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_97c1c260", "Nice work up there. That engineer's going to be a big help to us. He may not WANT to help us, but that's too bad. He'll be busy for a while. Meanwhile, let's get you back to your studies.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9a672aca", "They'll think it's a sign of a retreat.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9aac04b2", "Remember that pirate ship, the one that was floating dead over Corellia?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9af2e537", "Remember the pirate ship you rescued?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9b2b6284", "They're not THAT kind of pirates, smart guy.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9c4357e6", "Well, apparently the ship was carrying some kind of computer virus. It infected your ship's communication system, basically creating an open channel. The pirates can listen in to all of our communications. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9d1ce696", "Hey %NU! What gives? I thought we had a plan.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9d1e1c8d", "As long as they can hear us, they've got the upper hand. So let's face facts and give up.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9e0c4569", "That's what I thought. See ya around.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9f123cf0", "I like it, though there's no place like Corellia.  So listen. You're reporting to me now. Let's get you up to speed.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9f8d6da8", "So it's true! The pirates and Black Suns ARE working together.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_9ff4de20", "When I tell you to take patrol, that's your cue. Take the patrol as ordered, but at the end of it, you'll be in position for a massive attack.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_a0e7bdff", "Well then we just have to be better. Are you going to calm down, or do I have to give you a smack?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_a1fbb23f", "We don't want to make any aggressive moves - not until the comlink's patched.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_a26f4215", "OK. I'm counting on you.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_a5e6e5e7", "Yep.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_a6198527", "Sounds like you've got a mission for me.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_a6b16355", "Planning what? I'm still confused about what just happened.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_a8412b0", "Those pirates knew right where to find you...");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_a8806358", "So we understand each other?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_aa4936a9", "All right! No need to shout!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_aca5b8fe", "OK. Just keep doing it until it's done.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_acce8ddf", "I noticed! Those were the Black Suns. They didn't leave after all!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_ad728136", "They MUST be desperate, to ask for our help.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_ad973bd9", "Yeah.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_aeb32a6f", "Something like that. The life-support systems are failing; they're desperate. They've asked us to reel them in.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_af180142", "Tricky!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_af22b9b2", "I guess so.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b08d0506", "The only surprising thing is that it took them this long to join forces. If we're going to beat these guys, we're going to have to think smart.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b26e36ad", "If you're not a privateer, you sure as heck ARE lost. Get moving.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b2e340f6", "What's that?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b427b7ce", "I thought we took care of that problem!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b4ebb4b3", "In the meantime, what we're going to do is lay low. Play possum.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b52f3018", "To who?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b53ef7a5", "What is this? What are you doing here?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b5f15b19", "Not yet.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b754dde0", "Obviously! Did you see how fast those prisoners took control of that ship?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b8b1e69c", "Hit me.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_b95fcaf8", "Your plan worked.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_bc0a2234", "Oh! Right. I forgot.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_bc375f79", "Got it.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_bf7ad2b4", "I blew it.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_c0786e56", "Ha! Well DONE, %NU! We showed those Black Suns who's boss, didn't we? I wish I could have seen the look on their faces when you blasted them! Come on; it's time for another lesson.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_c123e137", "This would never have happened, if they hadn't taken advantage of our trusting nature. So it's payback time. I want you to go after the captain who radioed in for help. He's the guy who started this whole thing. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_c261cfae", "No problem.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_c2675d2d", "We need to press our advantage.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_c402784e", "See you soon.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_c4d60644", "I'll say.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_c69ddd08", "And that prison ship?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_c816ccac", "Hey listen, we've ALL got work to do.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_c8ea3e2b", "They cleaned my clock.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_ca158be9", "Or vice versa.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_cc075a69", "You sure did. We've messed up their plans, but good. And now we're going to press our advantage. ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_cc4b75d1", "Not bad.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_cc93ce57", "OK. I'll get them.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_ccf2f65c", "You lost, buddy?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_cd445db2", "I like the sound of that.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_cfd01162", "Don't say that! You just had a setback. It's nothing to worry about. The REAL mistake would be giving up.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d11614d5", "Are you working with the pirates or something?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d24a2285", "Will do.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d2ab8937", "Then we're out of luck.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d30b5c72", "Nah.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d33d4e93", "No kidding.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d4866d33", "Exactly.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d4c80032", "My pleasure. Where can I find this guy?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d4f6cbf2", "Oh yeah? Well maybe I can help you with your problem. We've got a disabled pirate ship, floating dead above the planet.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d5206411", "It's not fixed?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d590d63c", "WHAT?!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d714b5a0", "Nope. Sure wasn't. But it's our problem now. The Black Suns must have brokered some kind of deal with the pirates.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d7bf7b44", "A pegleg and a parrot?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d8ec7fac", "I DON'T CARE!!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_d9cced1f", "Absolutely.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_dcc126b1", "Just doing my job.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_ddb75eb1", "HAS he fixed it yet?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_dde9d959", "Don't really care if they are. I'll see you when you get back.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_de4a941c", "OK, but how?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_dfe0e1a2", "What's going on up there?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_e1260dbe", "Yeah. Well, we underestimated their interest in this area.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_e26f7766", "If the Black Suns think we're giving up, they'll relax. Feel like they've won. And a relaxed enemy is easy to beat.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_e48d5a", "I need to transfer out of this unit.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_ea60e7f", "I just want a freaking solution!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_edb238bc", "Go on.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_eeb1457d", "What HAPPENED up there?! Those guys handed me my hat!");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_ef2c1d07", "Dead in the water! ");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_f0b69eb", "Any ideas about what to do next?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_f313dc31", "They didn't exactly roll over and die. They went after that CorSec officer, after all.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_f37012cf", "Golly! That didn't work out the way we planned it.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_f436768c", "They must have been planning this all along.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_f50b28e8", "I don't want to talk about it. I just want to accomplish something, for a change.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_f61487ff", "What do you think?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_f798d511", "Sheesh. Who knows? Doesn't matter now. All of a sudden we're looking at an enemy who's stronger than ever.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_f89feda0", "You THINK?!!?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_f9b4dab6", "The engineer you brought back? He's the guy who designed the original virus. I figure, he broke it, he can fix it too.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_faab88c", "So what are we going to do?");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_fc05d09", "Tricky if it works, stupid if it doesn't. We'll see. Listen, for now, we're going to just lay low. We've got a CorSec ship out there. We want to transfer all those weapons and personnel to a ship that hangs lower in the planet's ozone layer.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_fc33d4d3", "Done! See me when you're ready. We've got work to do.");
stringFiles[164].addEntry("s_fcf4d778", "How?");

stringFiles[165] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_privateer_tier4");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_privateer_tier4) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_10c8ee3d", "That's one way to put it.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_13811ca0", "What about the Hidden Daggers?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_14d7da55", "Why don't you tell her yourself?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_1516ae92", "I think you need to keep moving.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_1683f2af", "Says me.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_182c692f", "Maybe your plan is no good!");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_18f260b3", "The Hidden Daggers are still testing us. I'm always looking for pilots willing to fly sorties against their ships.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_1aceb53", "You're clear to leave.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_1b5769c8", "Just here for more work?  Sure you are.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_1b8d65e2", "Loud and clear - SIR.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_1c8bddbb", "What is it?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_1e264713", "It'll be the easiest assignment you've ever had - unless those Black Suns show up. And if they DO show up, I'll need you out there. How does that sound to you?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_1faa7ff3", "I want to know what's going on out there. But I don't want to actively pursue the Black Suns - yet. They'll come to us soon enough. In the meantime, I want you to patrol Dantooine space.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_208869a4", "So. We've got a situation here.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_20ef9c42", "Mission accomplished.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_218fee99", "That's the idea.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_24c9bb66", "We'll find out.  You'll find your first mark in the Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_24f79cb0", "I'm glad you're back, too. Here. I want to give you your duty pay.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_2794eddd", "I want to learn exotic vessels.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_291ab969", "I want to learn expert techniques.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_2b122b72", "You'll have the element of surprise. The Daggers think we're focused on the Suns. They won't see you coming.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_2dc3ccb7", "They're assassins, aren't they?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_2de6d84d", "Mmm.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_2e256f44", "You should be.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_2eb9ea1f", "Grand Admiral Nial Declann is stationed in Theed Palace on Naboo. Going to see him is not an entirely bad thing. Having a Grand Admiral's support for the CorSec would go a long way in ensuring that the Empire doesn't decide to move into our system. Also, I understand that there are many things that the Empire can teach a pilot such as yourself.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_2f41692c", "I've got it under control.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_317c39a8", "Exactly. And between CorSec and the Daggers, I think we're the stronger group. So let's just  take them out once and for all. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_32f5282f", "What brings you to the CorSec, pilot? You'd better not be wasting my time.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_351090c2", "Hey, you don't like it here, you can find yourself another job. But as long as you're reporting to me, you'll do WHAT I say, WHEN I say it. Do you read me?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_35d00365", "Not this guy. He's one of a kind. But I'm getting ahead of myself. We haven't even found this guy yet. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_362a48e0", "Anything else?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_3839d57f", "Your duty pay.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_392b269e", "Why would the Alliance be asking for CorSec pilots?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_39547224", "More on that later. For now, I just want you to take care of those Black Sun fighters in Dantooine. Can I count on you?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_39b10484", "I won't force you. If you don't want to do it, I will tell them you're injured. Of course, if you do choose to obey the order, it will most certainly not reflect in any way on your career here at the CorSec.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_3a5c85dc", "Tell me more about the Imperial order.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_3d991214", "There's always work to do here at CorSec. I have a few elective duty missions. Take a look and let me give you a briefing.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_3eecd6e9", "Then I'll cut to the chase. I'm sending you on an assassination mission.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_3f1b21c2", "I want those Black Suns out of here too.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_3f570be0", "Oh that's right. I forgot.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_40c0cfc0", "He's a leader. If he's out of the picture, they'll become disorganized. And that can only help us.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_42836ce6", "They're tough. I don't think those guys have exactly packed their bags and left.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_4345fa87", "So are we. I want you to take a break. Catch your breath. See me when you're ready for another assignment. In the meantime, here's your duty pay.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_4376ab12", "Black Suns are here to stay.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_47120e86", "No. You just need to give me another chance.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_47441fe", "I'd bet on it.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_475b4478", "No; not yet. For now, I want you to work with several of my fighters to push back a Black Sun attack in Dantooine. They are moving on our position now.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_483d677f", "Here you go. Come see me when you're ready for your next mission.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_497bdf7a", "I did my best; that's all.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_4b924eb9", "Sure is. Bring it back in.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_4cda51e6", "I thought we WERE dealing with them.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_4d147f07", "All right then. Well stick with me. I think I've found a way for us to solve this Hidden Daggers problem, once and for all.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_4de5d7c6", "But I'm not interested in getting myself killed.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_4e33510b", "Nicely put.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_4e60c8d4", "So should I obey the Empire?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_50a82bc3", "How much time do I have?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_535a48bf", "Is that right?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_55127f07", "Tell me more about the Alliance's request.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_575d94fc", "They're blasting me to bits up there.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_5812b51a", "What about that Imperial order?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_5ace999c", "Don't have to ask me twice. Get going.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_5afdd10d", "There's a Black Sun Vehement somewhere in the Dantooine System. We're searching for his coordinates now. Once we've located him, I'll want you to take him out. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_5c48dd80", "Let me take a shot at those Hidden Daggers.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_5c522568", "Yes, of course.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_5d4c8449", "I think I can help that mining transport.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_5d88d407", "I'll see you around, %TU.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_5dec8b83", "You've earned it.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_6020d1e0", "It's not something we talk about much, but the CorSec has pretty close ties to the Alliance. This isn't the first time that the Alliance has asked for help from our organization. Of course, the CorSec denies any knowledge of this and officially claims that any member caught helping the Alliance is a rogue agent.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_6160d176", "This is a request - and that's unusual. Usually, when they want something from us, they issue an order. I make it a point never to force any of my pilots to obey any order issued by the Empire, but we do try to make a good show of it. But this order was sent by a Grand Admiral of the Imperial fleet. I think if we ignore this one, we'll regret it later.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_61d7c289", "Absolutely. I'll be watching.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_621643f5", "Have you ever assassinated anybody?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_62241cb7", "What's going on?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_62b7e5d1", "Do you think I should help the Alliance?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_631ae8ac", "It's time for you to make a decision. I have received two requests for CorSec's best pilot. And as far as I'm concerned, that's you. It's strange that I received both of these within a few hours of each other. Usually when that happens, it means that the two are related. But apparently not this time.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_642269cb", "Take some time, get it fixed. The situation's under control for now. Come see me when you're ready for another assignment. In the meantime, here's your duty pay.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_66147141", "Regrouping.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_66a2d521", "What can you tell me about the request from the Alliance?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_6862706c", "No good.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_6c2be16f", "I cannot make that decision for you. Each of us must decide our own path. Be thankful for this choice, because not everyone in the galaxy has that luxury. If you decide that you want to help the Empire head to Theed Palace and report in to Admiral Declann. Good luck.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_6ce4e96f", "Right.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_6e4a17c", "Absolutely. I've got your duty pay. I wish I could give you more. You're doing a great job.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_6ead851d", "Could mean trouble.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_7177c3f2", "Who is Grand Admiral Nial Declann?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_71857d84", "Don't bother explaining. I'm mad. I just want to fight.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_72be4afa", "Tell me about the Alliance's request.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_734b72d7", "I'm not here to argue with you. I'm here to get you to do your job. So do it.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_73c89b2b", "You earned it.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_746fc787", "I know you're upset. You've got every right to be. But you helped us. Now we know what we're up against.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_74fdf9dc", "So they won't be available to help the assassins?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_76de5e9c", "I didn't come to this post looking for easy.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_770b1869", "My ship's a mess.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_784ca15", "There's always work to do here at CorSec. Unfortunately for you, that work is reserved for CorSec pilots. If you're looking for action, you're going to have to go through your own contacts.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_78c79a4f", "You sent me on a suicide mission!");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_796d4688", "There's always work to do here at CorSec. Are you ready to take a duty, or do you need me to debrief you?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_7aa801dc", "Let me get that mining craft. The last thing we need is another pirate clan, moving in.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_7bbc6fc1", "Who am I killing?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_7c181033", "Be safe.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_7e6d012f", "We were splitting our time between the two groups. But now we've struck a real blow against the Suns, they'll need a little time to regroup. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_80409644", "How's it looking? Do you need more pilots?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_80d8485c", "I'm on it.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_81b27773", "Oops. Sorry.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_82288395", "I hope you're right.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_846dc537", "Here. This is for you.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_847048c5", "Tell her I'm on my way.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_873be682", "I agree. Take care of it as quickly as you can.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_87b9d75b", "Can I give it another shot?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_87d7e908", "I know.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_8807601", "I want you to join forces with several of my other pilots. We need to mount a coordinated attack against these guys. I'll warn you now, it won't be easy.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_88d56cda", "I don't think that'll be easy. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_89368a2f", "OK. I'll see you soon.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_89bbd3f9", "I cannot tell you what you should do. All I can say is that your decision will not hurt your position in the Corsec in any way. This is strictly a volunteer assignment. But you could learn a lot from this guy. It's up to you. If you want to help the Alliance, go to Doaba Guerfel and speak to Admiral Willham Burke. Dismissed, pilot.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_8caf8c64", "OK. I'm giving you another chance.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_8f8ce354", "Well you sent those pirates a message. Now we'll just have to wait and see what kind of message they send back. In the meantime, there's work to do.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_8fb8c9f2", "It's yours. Now let's get you up to speed. Things have been going well against the Black Suns so far.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_93c94bdf", "Sounds like you've got work for me.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_96047adb", "Watch yourself up there.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_963212ec", "OK...");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_9696df79", "I'm glad to be back here in one piece.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_979d1baf", "You! Always with the crazy plans!");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_982697df", "That was rougher than I expected.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_982fd0ec", "Last thing - I've just received a report that Hutt pirates are attacking a civilian mining craft. Those miners won't make it out alive without us. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_9b4653d9", "It says that if we have any pilots who are interested they should seek out Admiral Burke in Doaba Guerfel on Corellia. Any support we can offer will be most appreciated.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_9f15ecc0", "I'll do more than talk, if you give me that kind of attitude. Beat it.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_a12be3e7", "Says who?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_a490d2c6", "Alright.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_a5f9f5fc", "They're going to blast ALL of us to bits, if you don't get back up there.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_a603fe55", "It's a good idea, from their point of view. They can send their flunkies in first.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_a6167ed7", "I'm assassinating...an assassin?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_a6caaf6b", "Is that Black Sun Transport still up there?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_a85a848e", "You talking to me?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_a87e8cba", "They'll appreciate the escort. Good luck.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_a8aac5df", "That's quite an argument.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_a9f9363a", "I wonder why they need assassins.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_aa048a4e", "We? What WE? I was the only one getting painted up there!");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_aa5afe64", "Oh yeah? What's the plan?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_aab2440f", "Excellent. I can use it.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_aadef2a1", "I don't think you need to check your closets before you go to sleep at night, if that's what you mean. My guess is, the Black Suns like these alliances. This time, they're partnering with real pros.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_add3fe59", "Not much. I need you to leave immediately.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_af153b90", "Is that my mission?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_b26194cb", "What are you doing here?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_b5d3394c", "Mission failure, %TU.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_b6570fbb", "Pilots under my command don't make excuses. They make kills. Get back up there.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_b679efe", "See that you do.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_b779f640", "The Black Suns have noticed our activities. They're getting ready to mount a full attack, I think. But we'll be ready.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_b9f936b3", "Always. But there's no heavy lifting involved. I want you to just take a patrol.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_ba3977c", "With a capital T. Let's see what we're dealing with.  We've got intel on the locations of several Hidden Dagger ships in the Dathomir System. We need to take them out. And I think you're the pilot for the job.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_bb1b5c31", "Ready for your duty pay?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_bb3bc739", "I could use a refresher. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_bc0e2727", "It's what they pay me for. And this plan isn't so crazy. We're just going to deal with the Hidden Daggers, once and for all.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_bc808f0b", "One of the leaders of the Hidden Daggers.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_bc944dc4", "I want to learn droid intelligence theory.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_bd3e62ad", "For now, I want you to join forces with my other CorSec fighters. We need your help.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_be7682ed", "Where does it say I have to go?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_be78b6f8", "Ah, %TU, good to see you. I wish I had time to give you a warmer welcome, but I'm afraid you have to get started right away. Allow me to give you a briefing.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_be919187", "Commander Ramna tells me you distinguished yourself.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_bf7ca96d", "Neither do I. But until they make a move, it's business as usual. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_c08d38c9", "Exactly. Don't know why the flunkies haven't figured that one out yet. The Suns must pay well.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_c09d4fa5", "But another Black Sun will just step into his shoes!");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_c13ffa70", "It would seem that Admiral Burke is looking for pilots from the CorSec to assist the Alliance in a highly sensitive operation. Not surprisingly, he makes no mention of what that operation is to be. But he does mention that I should only send the best, which means that it is highly dangerous.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_c1e97adf", "You won't be making any friends up there, that's for sure. Just keep your eyes open, and you'll be all right. Report back to me when you're through.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_c1ff5062", "I'm looking for a mission. Do you have any?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_c56e5a39", "I hope you don't forget ME when we start working together.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_c5a03378", "I need you to give it another shot. This is important.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_c5f93f4", "He is one of the most powerful men in the Imperial Navy. When he speaks, people listen. I have never seen a Grand Admiral issue an order to our corps before, so it must be something important.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_c71818a8", "This time I'll take care of them.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_c81aa963", "Nice work, %TU. That wasn't easy.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_ca51315f", "Always.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_cad40f33", "Where can I find Admiral Burke?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_cc4b75d1", "Not bad.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_cce691a5", "I don't think you need to check your closets before you go to sleep at night, if that's what you mean. The Suns just need hired guns. But these are professionals; we can't take them lightly. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_cd2c7c7", "What does the order from the Empire say?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_cd9ca17f", "The Black Suns are mounting an attack. They are moving on our position now.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_ce57a3fe", "That's right. It's possible that they're working with the Black Suns.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_d0fd857b", "I'll take it.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_d1be90a9", "What's the plan?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_d2a15608", "So I have to go and help the Empire?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_d3f6b302", "Just give me a shot.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_d4c1c824", "You're doing a great job so far. I have a plan. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_d55f2579", "I'm ready to go.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_d5f02c52", "Better get to work. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_d6593a09", "Neither do I. That's why I'm sending you. You're the best.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_d9cced1f", "Absolutely.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_da33670a", "Eventually, we're going to mount a full attack against the Black Suns. But first, we're going to isolate them. The Suns have been busy, building alliances.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_db8b8333", "You're a good pilot. You're only going to get better - as long as you keep studying. Pick a skill.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_df5cb938", "Commander Ramna's looking for you.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_dffc2e23", "Now let's get you up to speed. Things have been going well against the Black Suns so far.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_e16cb1fa", "I want to learn heavy starship component use.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_e20b6ab5", "Have you ever heard of the Hidden Daggers?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_e53904e6", "You're quite a pilot, %TU. I'll see you soon.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_e796f3ec", "Come see me when you're ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_e807e589", "And what are we going to do?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_e8d7e137", "I'm flattered. ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_eb363f92", "Time is wasting, %TU. Ready for your next assignment?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_ed52d8f6", "They're still a threat, no doubt about it. But we've found a way to deal with them, thanks to you. So we're hitting the Suns from below. Now it may be time to hit them from above.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_ed86e89f", "Do I need to find another pilot?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_ef2b1c74", "Stick with it. You'll be earning some real money soon. You've got a real future ahead of you.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_f0a6575a", "Hah! So much for those Hidden Daggers! ");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_f0f1c03e", "See you around.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_f2a6dda8", "Do you mean to tell me I'm going to assassinate an assassin?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_f4176967", "What did you have in mind?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_f50bf532", "Who sent them?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_f69ff117", "What will I be facing up there?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_f7f133e1", "Get out of my sight.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_fb7fd141", "We've also got a Black Sun Transport up there. I could use your help in bringing it back to base. It may be carrying some useful information.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_fbe69616", "That's it? That's all I have to do?");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_fbff7add", "The request came in from the Alliance - an Admiral Willham Burke sent it. And oddly enough, the order came in from Imperial High Command. It is signed Grand Admiral Nial Declann. It is very rare that we have any communication with the Imperial Navy, much less a Grand Admiral.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_fc9e5d39", "Don't we all! We're making headway. For now, though, take a break. Here's your duty pay. Take it down to the cantina. They'll like the color of your money.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_fcab4be0", "Good idea.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_fee63808", "Then, of course, you've got your basic civic-duty assignments. A mining transport is moving through Dathomir space. They need an escort; the Daggers are always interested in transports.");
stringFiles[165].addEntry("s_ff224692", "It's done. That's all that matters.");

stringFiles[166] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_privateer_trainer");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_privateer_trainer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_133a724d", "Are you going to train me after this?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_1418de80", "Of course");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_15502961", "Nothing to worry about here, sir.  CorSec has the area well secured.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_198b5a97", "I've given you the control codes to a basic ship. The codes are visible in your datapad. Open your personal datapad, and review your ship status before you launch.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_1a1a36a3", "Completely out of the question with your history.  You're going to have to clean up your act before you can join CorSec.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_1a7f1a1b", "Yes I am. What duty missions are available?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_1c76874e", "I was attacked!");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_1fc4c648", "Very well.  Please review this information and report back to me when you are ready to continue your work for CorSec!");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_221daf73", "Escorting Merchants");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_257f178d", "It was a snap.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_27d40413", "Maybe next time then.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_28435d2", "Tell you what, %NU.  Kill that pirate leader and YES, I will train you.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_2883b989", "Not right now, thanks.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_2b418533", "Perhaps you'll turn your life around, decide to be a part of the solution instead of a part of the problem.  When you're ready to help enforce the law instead of breaking it, come see me.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_2bbff5e2", "When you're finished with your first mission - fly back to the 'launch waypoint' that we automatically add to your datapad. Communicate with the space station and indicate that you want to land.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_2c6a1c50", "I'm sorry, but I'm afraid it's completely out of the question with your history.  You're going to have to clean up your act before you can join CorSec.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_2f9db7a", "Maybe.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_333f5da9", "What are you doing talking to me?  Isn't there somewhere you're supposed to be?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_342d1bdf", "It's completely out of the question with your history.  If you want to work for CorSec then you're going to have to clean up your act.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_3557fc9f", "Nothing to it.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_360d8728", "No thanks");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_36adcd36", "What?  Are you sure?  You'd make an excellent candidate.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_370822d1", "Yes");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_3f62bf0", "Right, those merchants rely on us to provide them with safe passage through the Corellia system.  Just keep escorting them through.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_40061f60", "CorSec is Corellia's local Security force.  As you know, Corellia is officially neutral in the Galactic Civil War... or at least as neutral as a world can be in this day and age.  We provide defense and law enforcement for the entire Corellian system.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_40617d3", "Indeed.  Do you have your own ship?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_429077be", "You're never going to make a dent in the frequency of piracy in the Corellia system until you take out their leader!  Now get back out there and destroy the leader's ship!");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_457a7010", "No");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_46ea46ad", "We're quite satisfied with your level of performance.  I think it's time you learned a bit more, though.  Now tell me, what area of knowledge are you most interested in?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_4801be96", "So, you were ambushed as you ran that patrol.  We need to hit them hard to send a message... make an example out of them.  I'm going to send you in to run that scum out of the system. I am uploading some possible waypoints into your nav computer, destroy any Black Sun you find.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_4906b993", "What is CorSec?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_4a1d2431", "Yes, I'm ready.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_4e95069b", "You're going to need a ship, if you're going to fly for CorSec.  I'll add the Ship Control Codes to your datapad for you.  It's not a great ship, but it will get you around.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_4ffb02bd", "Go to the starport. Inside the starport you will find a number of 'starship terminals.' Interface with the terminals in order to launch your starship.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_5091cb8e", "Ah... no I don't.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_580337ba", "Very well, then please move along.  I am very busy.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_5b8a384b", "I'm sorry, unless you are a member of the CorSec, there's very little that I can do for you. You may want to try speaking to your own contacts if you're looking for a mission.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_5cdbbd1f", "What happened to you?  Never mind, never mind.  Get back out there and finish that patrol.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_5e4ebfca", "And when I'm done?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_5e6c7400", "You are definitely ready to move up.  So tell me, what area interests you the most?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_60c4f974", "Where do I go?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_6106187c", "What is a duty mission?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_614b71f0", "I see...");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_6276c98", "No, but how about some training?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_63a61222", "We don't let just anyone join.  There'll be a background check of course.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_64b308bc", "That's ridiculous!");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_68660d24", "I need to take care of some things first.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_698d80f7", "Sorry, but you don't look like a pilot to me.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_7396ebcf", "Not at all.  We can't have thugs and ne'er-do-wells joining CorSec.  We're here to provide security for the citizens of Corellia!  Now, this will only take a moment... Ah... You've got a pretty clean record here.  I can assure you that it'd improve once you're flying for CorSec! Are you ready to begin?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_746a1bed", "Ok.  Bye.  Come see me if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_7df39542", "This will only take a moment... Oh... Wow!  You've got an excellent track record.  I guess you've tangled with your share of criminals and thugs in your day. Are you ready to begin?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_80a724aa", "Well now, I think that does it. Are you ready for your first assignment?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_8358aeb7", "Very well.  Let me know if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_844a124b", "Piracy in this system has increased 17 percent since you signed-up!  This is inexcusable!  Now get out there and complete that patrol!");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_8523e1fc", "I'm interested in basic training.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_898027d6", "Don't worry, this will only take a moment... Ah... You've got a pretty clean record here.  I can assure you that it will improve once you're flying for CorSec! Are you ready to begin?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_8acaf405", "Positive.  I don't want to join CorSec");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_8b451c3f", "All right.  But you'd better clean up your act if you ever change your mind.  We can't have CorSec members with your kind of history.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_8b8a1542", "That's bad news, but this is just the reason why CorSec is needed!  Go back out there and take out those pirates.  Defending this system from pirates and killers is all up to us.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_8e1ed7f0", "Enough of this!  Every time we send you out, you find more pirates.  We need to go straight to the source of the problem:  Their leader.  I know you're up to this:  Go find the pirate's leader and take him out.  Let the rest of them go to the outer rim if they want easy prey.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_8e5b619a", "Oh no, not quite so fast, %NU.  You complete a few more assignments and then we'll see about getting you some training!");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_90ec63e0", "Yes, I do.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_926359dd", "Excellent job taking out those pirates.  No doubt, this won't be the end of them.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_95d0a1f6", "An assignment?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_964fb39a", "Just to be sure that's the last of them, we need you to run another patrol.  It's a little longer than the last one, but you already know how crafty those criminals can be.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_984b22b", "I don't think so");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_9e417b37", "The Pirate Leaders");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_9e5f75be", "You've got your assignment and the control device for your ship in your datapad.  Go to the Starport and access the terminal to launch into space.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_a48c20c8", "What's on your mind, officer? Thinking about performing some duty missions?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_a78a4ac3", "What do I do now?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_a927c891", "What's next?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_af22b9b2", "I guess so.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_af264a19", "I love being a starfighter pilot.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_b06e1df9", "Don't worry, this will only take a moment.  We do need to ensure you're not some sort of criminal... Ah... Well according to this you haven't exactly been the most law abiding citizen on Corellia... Are you certain you want to join CorSec?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_b7fc5e5d", "I'm interested in droid interface basics.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_bdd269be", "What ship?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_be5a7539", "This will only take a moment... Ah... Well according to this you've run into a problem with the law.  Are you certain you want to join CorSec?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_c06c7aa9", "I'm interested in basic fighters.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_c1ff5062", "I'm looking for a mission. Do you have any?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_c35e70d2", "Nothing right now.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_c697d2d5", "Certainly. Just come speak with me again when you're ready.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_c8c21783", "In that case, move along.  We're very busy here.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_c91ba06e", "Not just yet, %NU.  I have just a few more things for you to do before you get any training from me.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_c9f74b42", "Greetings, citizen.  Keep your nose clean and we won't have any trouble.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_cc53ba8f", "Alright, your first assignment is to run a simple patrol.  From time to time pirates move into the area and harass merchants in our system. Just run this simple patrol and make sure there's no criminal activity going on.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_cd44e585", "Listen, something important has come up.  The captain wants to speak to you right away!  Go speak to Captain Rikkh in the next room.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_cda1bb94", "Yes. You have your first mission, now. You'll need to fly into space to complete it. Start by launching your starship at the starport.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_cebaf0db", "You're right.  No sooner do we eliminate one leader than another shows up.  Take out the Corellian Space Pirates!");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_cec02f8", "Not at all.  We can't have thugs and ne'er-do-wells joining CorSec.  We're here to provide security for the citizens of Corellia!  Now, this will only take a moment... Oh... Wow!  You've got an excellent track record.  I guess you've tangled with your share of criminals and thugs in your day. Are you ready to begin?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_d1431f95", "I'm interested in basic starship component use.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_d43b2932", "Duty missions are a good way for you to get experience as a pilot. Only experienced pilots can receive the proper training to learn new skills and abilities.There's no real final objective so you can end the mission whenever you want. So, would you like to take a duty mission?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_d6a6a9fc", "Well, merchant freighters are always in need of escorts, or if you like you can help in the fight against the pirate leaders. What interests you?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_d72a0d47", "Not at all.  We can't have thugs and ne'er-do-wells joining CorSec.  We're here to provide security for the citizens of Corellia!  Now, this will only take a moment... Ah... Well according to this you've run into a problem with the law.  Are you certain you want to join CorSec?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_dadaabf", "As a matter of fact, I do have some duty missions that you could perform. Who knows, maybe if you do well, you might be invited to join the CorSec. Are you ready for a duty mission?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_db7653ed", "Excellent choice.  Review this information regarding your new skills, and report back to me when you're ready for another assignment.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_dc993cdb", "Ha!  That'll show those thugs that CorSec is not to be trifled with.  You're really going to go places in this organization, I can tell already.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_ddfbd948", "Well then. I think that about does it. Are you ready for your first assignment?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_deaabd84", "Oh.  No thanks");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_e0dfe067", "Very well.  I'll go ahead and sign you up.  Do you have your own ship?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_e107077e", "Yes I am");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_e258dc9b", "You're right.  Sign me up!");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_e5c453e0", "You're not ready for more training yet. But duty missions are a good way of getting good experience so that you'll be ready for training soon. What do you say? Are you ready to try a duty mission?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_e926d5f0", "Almost, %NU.  I have just a couple more things for you to take care of before you can be trained further.  Starting with that patrol...");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_ea3dcf32", "Don't worry, this will only take a moment... Oh... Wow!  You've got an excellent track record.  I guess you've tangled with your share of criminals and thugs in your day. Are you ready to begin?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_ebb99364", "There are too many pirates in this system!");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_ee2895df", "This will only take a moment... Ah... You've got a pretty clean record here.  I can assure you that it will improve once you're flying for CorSec! Are you ready to begin?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_f053b088", "Excellent work!");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_f176d13", "Oh?  Well.  Ok.  Come see me if you change your mind.  We could really use you.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_f3fdecfc", "Then I will add you to the roster.  Do you have your own ship?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_f42d051f", "Maybe not.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_f518ba4f", "Hello!  Come to join the ranks of CorSec?");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_f8026f5d", "Excellent work with that escort.  It's a good thing you were running that patrol, or there's no telling what might have happened to them.  I've got a little something extra for you, too.  It's a mercenary bandolier.  It'll help you keep your things organized.");
stringFiles[166].addEntry("s_ff684aed", "Ah, I've heard of you!  You're not a bad pilot from what I understand. What can the CorSec do for you?");

stringFiles[167] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_privateer_trainer_2");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_privateer_trainer_2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_106e3dbb", "I know you will.  Report back when you're done.  When you're SUCCESSFUL this time.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_12da4881", "Yeah, well, they can't all be gems.  Anyway I'd better get back to work.  Take care, %NU.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_13b10809", "Travel to Lok Space and protect a transport that has gotten between some Imperial and Rebels.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_158a5883", "I don't believe you");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_158b60f", "Just fine");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_163ba63a", "You've earned it!  Now go out on the town and catch yourself some rest and relaxation.  You look terrible!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_169df3bb", "Never mind.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_178d46a1", "Good.  Choose an assignment.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_18206937", "I'll try being nicer if you'll try being smarter.  Not get back to Yavin and complete your mission!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_19104bb", "I don't have all the details.  Suffice to say that sometimes CorSec needs to be a little more proactive.  We can't always wait for trouble to come to us.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_1c0972b6", "Did you get the shipment orders?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_1c81fc8b", "Or how about this:  It says 'Problem:  Hyperdrive volume is unbelievably loud'.... 'Solution:  Hyperdrive volume adjusted to more believable level.'");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_1c8bddbb", "What is it?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_1d843b61", "You're much too good a pilot to waste on the trivial tasks that I could assign you.  We need you in Lok.  Now!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_1e666f74", "Equipment malfunction");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_1f3b7ea2", "Git!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_225d3518", "What are you waiting for?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_264b3207", "You said it!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_26de1778", "You don't believe me?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_285c3698", "I do have some elective duty missions, actually. They're not the most exciting work, but they do need to be done. Take a look and tell me what you want to do.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_28ea80d", "Recovery Duty");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_2b10fbeb", "Good choice.  Your new abilities will come in handy for this next assignment.  Go escort a freighter through Yavin Space against Rebel aggressions.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_2d247e7b", "Ha ha!  Ok, I made that last one up...  But there is SOME kind of comedian working in the maintenance hangar!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_2ef8d174", "Look, the key to success is to shoot the enemy before the enemy shoots you.  Now get back to Dantooine and kill that spicer!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_30350c6", "I've heard it.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_315cee58", "Of course I'm right!  Now don't you hesitate to see me again the very moment you're available for duty.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_32103432", "I have a special assignment for you.  Fly to Lok and inspect a Nym Cannon Ship for Shipment Orders.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_322b6b69", "No, what about it?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_32e9d36a", "Can't it wait?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_334bc", "Hey now!  Are you threatening me?  I'll have you know this old slice hound still has a bite.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_346ddf", "You know Corellia's officially neutral in the civil war, right?  Well the Imperials seem to have a hard time remembering that.  Go out there and 'remind' them they aren't welcome as a military power in the Corellia system.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_36961caf", "Wrong answer, %NU.  But I'll give you a hint, it involves you, Dantooine, a spice runner, and a successful mission.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_36f60ccb", "That's what we want to know... Just what is he shipping around, and who is he doing it for... and that's what you're going to find out!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_370822d1", "Yes");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_3880d2bf", "I need a hyperdrive");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_39bc34a9", "Hey, %NU, did I tell you about the maintenance report I just received?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_3a126327", "No plan survives initial contact with the enemy!  But I take it you were successful anyway.  I'll credit your bank for services rendered.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_3b2fdc7f", "Will do!  Thanks!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_3b83352c", "On my way");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_3cfd3bb4", "You'd BETTER stop mocking me");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_3e869ab", "Good!  How about NOW?  Is NOW good for you?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_40e66be3", "I'll try");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_4165de51", "Good choice.  Now I have a special assignment for you!  Go to Dantooine Space and destroy a Hutt Transport.  The Hutts are making a large spice shipment through that system and we do not intend to let it reach its destination, which could very well be Corellia.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_41e79b8c", "Woah!  Woah!  Woah!  Slow down, there!  I was just kidding around with you.  Take it easy!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_447b4291", "%TU!  Long time no see.  I've heard Commander Ramna was quite pleased with your performance.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_44bc6772", "Fantastic.  Don't forget:  If the enemy is within range, so are you.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_457a7010", "No");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_46cf37e9", "The Imperial just shrugged and said, 'Yeah, that's what your buddies were trying to tell me.'");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_47fde4be", "The Imperial just shrugs and says, 'Oh really, I didn't know that.'  So the Corellian goes back to his buddies and tells them, 'I insulted Darth Vader and he didn't even care'.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_485284b6", "I'll try again");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_4e3437a8", "Oh, YOU'RE busy.  You think I don't work here?  Come talk to me when you're ready for an assignment.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_4e6f47aa", "Oh.  Ok... heh, guess I'm getting to be old, telling the same old jokes over and over.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_4e94fa0f", "Try again?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_501489d2", "All according to plan");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_513aa336", "No I'm not.  And they get worse!  This one says 'Problem:  Boosters not operational.' and then 'Solution:  Boosters will not work in OFF mode.'");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_51b81b00", "They were too strong for me");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_523e23b2", "Here I am!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_52467dab", "I'll destroy them");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_529c014", "You're a cold man, %TU.  Come see me when you're ready for your next assignment.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_530a5a44", "Are you insane?  The weather there is terrible, the food tastes awful and the locals are all rude.  Talus is practically a backwater compared to Corellia.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_53b9240e", "Ha ha!  Ok, enough goofing off.  I better get back to work.  Enjoy your visit to Corellia.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_53de9d8f", "Like what?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_546d249e", "You're a cold woman, %NU.  Come see me when you're ready for your next assignment.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_56e162f2", "Escort Duty");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_5715d65c", "Lots.  What do you WANT to do?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_584a90f8", "You've done an excellent job for me, %NU.  I can see that you are ready for more training.  What are you interested in learning?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_5b1bed8b", "Well?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_5b5ed110", "Pilot error");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_5d262b71", "You are here for work now, yes?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_5d3166b9", "Everything is fine here. Nothing wrong at all.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_5e86fa24", "Well, soldier, how did things go?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_5f5f76b5", "We're fighting the Rebel Alliance now?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_5fa9a5d3", "Thanks");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_60fbb41a", "I like you.  You remind me of when I was young and stupid.  Listen up, you'd better start taking this job seriously!  We need those orders.  Go get them.  Now!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_61189bfc", "One work-order for the maintenance crew lists the problem as 'Something in cockpit is loose'.  Guess what the maintenance workers wrote as the solution?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_622194e2", "I know that's not the most glamorous assignment, but when duty calls, we've got to answer.  Am I right?  Or am I right?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_658107f", "I can see you're busy.  Come talk to me when you've got some time.  I can always use your services.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_65c6992e", "Yes, I am ready.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_6782f928", "Excuses, excuses.  Maybe you need to stop buying your equipment from the lowest bidder.  Splurge a little.  Get something that won't break-down on you.  And then get back to Dantooine and destroy that spicer!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_6adcde65", "How did that escort go?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_6adec6b0", "Of course!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_6d4db3b5", "What's wrong with the one you've got?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_6f9a9967", "I blew it to bits");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_71b485e4", "Then don't just stand around here talking to me, get back to Yavin and see that the ship makes it through!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_7282cf08", "Oh yes, I know what you mean... there's no place like Corellia.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_737b617c", "I want to learn about intermediate starship components.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_74f806bd", "Just visiting");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_76c3352e", "So, one of the Corellians walked over to the Imperial, taps him on the shoulder, and says, 'Hey, I hear your Darth Vader is a spice-fiend.'");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_771cfc6b", "Escort mission a success?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_7b2e95f6", "I will always cherish the initial misconceptions I had about you.  No it can't 'wait'!  You think they're just going to cruise around waiting for you to go blow 'em up.  Get out there!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_7b7644f7", "Nonsense!  You can do this!  Go back to Dantooine and eliminate that spice runner!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_7b7fb169", "It's not that I don't think you'd do a good job, but I don't have anything to assign right now. You may want to try talking to your own contacts.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_7d351971", "No, no, of course not.  Corellia is officially neutral in this little war.  But if they think that means they and the Empire can divide every resource in the galaxy then they've got another think comin'.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_7f5b2aa", "Fantastic!  And remember, if you lose contact with the enemy, look behind you.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_80ccf8a6", "Not quite yet.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_80e4a5f8", "Well come on, %NU.  I was born at night, but not LAST night!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8125b624", "Looking for Adwan Turoldine");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_81b96b70", "We want you to disrupt operations for Nym in his home system.  Go destroy spacecraft under his control.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_82d13497", "I'm busy");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_82d6265", "Bwaahahahaaha!  Oh I really had you going, there!  I thought you were going to hit me!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_82e1c248", "What kind of orders?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8416980e", "Perfect!  I'll turn these over to Intelligence.  I've got your payment right here.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_84be4b94", "Why Lok?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_84cdd613", "Something like that");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8694eb3f", "You're right about that!  Unfortunately I don't have any better ships to spare.  You'll just have to buy a better ship yourself.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_87bedbc6", "Well, if it isn't %TU. I've heard your name around the pilot's lounge a few times. What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8860b099", "Good choice.  No doubt that will come in handy for this next assignment. We want you to disrupt operations for Nym in his home system.  Go destroy spacecraft under his control.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8aec791d", "Correct in one guess!  Let me know how it goes.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8bec44d9", "Oh really... then tell me, WHY DIDN'T IT ARRIVE?  I think you'd better get back to Yavin and take care of business!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8c00922e", "What if it's not bound for Corellia?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8c0b08bf", "That's right, 'never mind'!  Another outburst like that and I'll have you on report!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8cd19baf", "Nym's ships have been expanding their operations all the way out to Yavin 4.  We want to put a stop to that, but more importantly we want to recover the cargo he's been swiping from Corellian freighters!  Go recover that cargo in the Yavin system!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8e2edcbe", "If you say so.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8e80e129", "%NU!  My favorite pilot.  Did you stop the transport?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8ed520f1", "That was terrible");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_8f8348b9", "You don't have to yell");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_900f01d1", "What?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_906e4829", "Next time I'll rip your arms off");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_920404b6", "Those can't be real reports");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_9208410d", "...");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_95667986", "Do what you need to do, then hurry up and come back. We need your help.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_98dba2b6", "I need a better ship");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_99251349", "(Laugh)");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_9b99e4ac", "Can't I just do some duty missions for you?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_9be69a2e", "I LIKE you, %NU.  You've got the tenacity of a Bull Rancor!  But enough of this joking around... I've got to get back to work.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_9e4b1a6c", "You are not a very good liar, %NU.  And that's good, since you don't seem to be a very good pilot, either.  Now get back to Lok and get us those shipment orders!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_9e576266", "OK, ok!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_9e85f6f2", "Why not?  We've got bad guys to catch, stolen cargo to recover, Imperial oppression to resist... you think Corellia is just going to magically secure itself?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_9f5f269", "No problem");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_a34ecd3", "Alright.  Well, I better get back to work.  Don't be a stranger!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_a5293421", "One of his buddies says, 'You just don't know how to get to him.  Watch this.' and he goes over to the Imperial and says, 'Hey, I hear your Darth Vader was a lying, cheating, idiotic, low-life scum!'  But the Imperial still just shrugs and says, 'Oh, really?  I didn't know that.'");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_a635c8aa", "Turoldine?  Why... he's stationed on Dantooine, I think.  Not Corellia!  Look for him in the Mining outpost.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_a785d6d0", "Then you'd best be on your way, right?  Back to Lok!  Get those orders!  No time like the present!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_a80d9308", "Good luck!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_a87fc3e8", "I want you to travel to Lok and see Commander Ramna.  She'll probably be holed-up in Nym's cantina...");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_a9839037", "No, it just malfunctioned");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_aa58928c", "I want to learn about reactor engineering algorithms.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_aad866ad", "You'll just have to learn to deal with it... or buy a better ship.  Now are you ready for work or not?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_aba61e8d", "Hey, stop me if you've heard this one.  Three Corellians see an Imperial at the starport.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_ac638560", "Ha ha!  Ok, I made that last one up...  But there is some kind of comedian working in the maintenance hangar!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_aeca6ebc", "I have the shipment orders");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_af6c7acb", "I don't mind");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b09fd902", "You're doing well, Pilot. But there is still more to be done. Are you ready to get back to work?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b0a6b1e2", "How about this one: 'Dead bugs found on windshield.'  Solution:  'Live bugs on order'.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b31da30c", "Not very well");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b3b93f51", "Oh, you really had me going there.  I thought you were going to rip my arms out the sockets.  Enough joking around though, I've got to get back to work.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b3c84ab4", "Then what happened?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b41e5c00", "Meh.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b60183cf", "Go escort a freighter through Yavin Space against Rebel aggressions.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b6a04af3", "Roooaaaaaawwwwr!!!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b6b1c40a", "Not really");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b978843d", "I'm looking for a mission. Do you have anything I can do?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_b9fa1db9", "She can be a tough one to work with, but she's a good officer.  Anyway, what brings you back to Corellia?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_ba11bd82", "And?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_baddec82", "Oh that's terrible.  You've got to get back to Lok and destroy that ship!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_bc8bf5b3", "Never mind");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_bc99a4d2", "It's weak!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_bcdf778f", "Ok, see ya.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_be500111", "Don't get all huffy!  You're doing a fine job for Corellian Security and don't let anyone tell you otherwise!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_bf7ea071", "I want to learn about advanced fighters.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_c16a57f5", "Good job!  Nothing more satisfying than that, right?  I've got your pay right here.... along with some news.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_c1ef4b1", "Good choice.  Now I have a special assignment for you.  Fly to Lok and inspect a Nym Cannon Ship for Shipment Orders.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_c261cfae", "No problem.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_c42bff89", "Why Nym?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_c545bb40", "No I am not");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_c6673868", "I want to learn about starship defense techniques.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_c66d1ef2", "If you're expecting I won't set my rank aside for the two seconds it takes to give you a beating, you had better think again!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_c7b73029", "Don't worry, %NU... there won't be a next time... I'll remember not to mess around with you.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_c9a83e17", "Oh come on!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_ccadbca4", "Enough joking around though, %NU.  I've got to get back to work.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_cd482bef", "I lied, I didn't get them");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_cd54e85d", "Because although he's not the worst pirate in the world, he does a fair bit of smuggling, piracy and assorted other criminal acts.  If we're going to have to tangle with his thugs, we'd rather do it on his own turf.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_cfa2d559", "Will do");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_d21a7a71", "I failed");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_d24a2285", "Will do.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_d338fc9a", "And what are you going to do about it?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_d52f0739", "That's what I thought!  Now get out of here and spend your hard-earned pay on Vasarian Brandy and Dancers.  Ha ha!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_d73a1a1e", "I was!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_d8652774", "I have a special assignment for you!  Go to Dantooine Space and destroy a Hutt Transport.  The Hutts are making a large spice shipment through that system and we do not intend to let it reach its destination, which could very well be Corellia.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_da7c5706", "I'm not a mercenary!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_db7bbbdf", "You're about to bite off more than you can chew, %TU!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_dd46f361", "Well that explains the way you dress.  So, PILOT, was the mission a success?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_df44b897", "Oh tell me another one!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_e00ac98e", "What happened?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_e107077e", "Yes I am");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_e119b0aa", "Yeah.  These are tough times, though.  We've got to preserve Corellian interests no matter WHAT it takes.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_e3064ba1", "Equipment malfunction?!  Let me guess... someone shot your equipment and it exploded?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_e5e96bc7", "Head up to Corellia Space and destroy some Hidden Daggers.  Those pirates have been getting a little too bold lately.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_e6e4f8fe", "That's the stuff.  Here's your pay.  Personally I don't care much for fighting the Rebel Alliance OR the Imperial Navy... seems like too great an opportunity for Corellia to be swept into this war.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_ea178ddb", "Talus is like Corellia");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_eb93536d", "Funny");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_ec084dd3", "Go on");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_ecba0095", "What's the good word, %NU?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_eea02eca", "You're kidding?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_eef93168", "I don't like it either");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f0adaca2", "I'm not scared of you");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f1679a90", "(laugh)");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f1e77b0c", "Good!  But just remember, no plan ever survives contact with the enemy.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f3327326", "Ok, hand them over.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f43089c2", "Excellent!  Good luck, %NU.  And remember, Experience is something you don't get until after you need it.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f52a7b2d", "I'm a pilot, not a soldier");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f613ccdb", "Ok, what can I do?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f68c028e", "Well then, you've earned your daily credit.  Here you are.  Let me know when you're in need of more work.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f7394720", "That's the spirit!  Good luck!  And don't worry, some day we'll look back on this, laugh nervously and change the subject.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f8842e94", "So he goes back to his Corellian buddies and says, 'You're right!  That guy is unshakable!'  And the third Corellian says, 'I'll get him.  Watch this.'  And he goes over to the Imperial, taps him on the shoulder and says, 'Hey, I heard Darth Vader was a Corellian!'");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f96e5915", "It's true!");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f9c365f7", "I don't know");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_f9f9a99", "It says, 'Something in cockpit tightened.'");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_fa5c5669", "Destroy Duty");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_fb40feab", "I'm starting to think our maintenance crew is on the spice.  You wouldn't believe some of these 'solutions' they've entered, here.");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_fb8ba48a", "I lost them");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_fc079db2", "Still the cocky one, aren't you?  Anyway, what brings you back to Corellia?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_fd2e713f", "Oh, you're just working out of a sense of duty to Corellia, huh?  Committed to keeping the planet free of outside influence and that sort of thing.  You expect me to believe that?");
stringFiles[167].addEntry("s_fecb2cbb", "You're right");

stringFiles[168] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_rebel_tier3");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_rebel_tier3) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_109a5e4a", "The Empire is sending one of their best fighter pilots here. His orders are simple: terminate our fleet. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_11fa74eb", "Well I'm very happy to say that you're going to be reporting to Warvog Arkon. You two deserve each other. You can find him in Nym's hotel. Report to him immediately!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_14c18bea", "It's not true!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_15c65a41", "If he tells the Empire about those hangars, they'll attack us for sure.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_17a593ae", "Sure, who doesn't?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_195b98b2", "I only speak to pilots. Move along now.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_1aff29b0", "I'm going to seriously consider early retirement.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_1c95e862", "It's infested with Hutt smugglers.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_1dd40de5", "I'm doing the best I can! ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_1e51cf02", "Their onboard computers carry valuable information about the system. They know more about Endor than anybody - and that includes Rebel HQ.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_1e76a9f3", "Give me my mission. I can handle anything.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_20715042", "It was that bad, eh?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_2168be5a", "Don't get too pleased with yourself. We're about to find out what you're REALLY made of.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_225227ba", "Will they give us that information?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_230806b6", "And they're willing to tell us what they know?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_2370b50f", "How did you do up there?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_238ef790", "Those ships have got to get moving, fast.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_23d7a2b6", "What I MEAN, Pilot, is that you are grounded until further notice. I don't think you can be trusted with any Rebel Alliance matters. Reports are, you've been working against us.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_26995dc5", "How did you know? I want you to intercept him in the Dathomir system. Get going.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_281a242e", "Ha! You haven't SEEN greatness until you've seen me in action.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_292cca3d", "I AM your best pilot. I'm just not done yet.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_2ccbae6", "Idiot!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_2cf76f20", "The Empire has moved one of their fleets to the Endor system. They think they've got the upper hand. They're wrong. The Nym smugglers know all about that fleet.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_2d6808ba", "I want to know about advanced space combat.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_2d9931cd", "You can help. I want you to get out there and help those ships with their repairs.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_30be37b", "You're welcome. And congratulations, solider. You've been trained by the best. Me! Remember my lessons when your new trainer starts flapping his gums. His name is Warvog Arkon. The man's a fool. You'll find him in Nym's pathetic excuse for a hotel. Dismissed! ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_313f990a", "Sounds like you're one of our most arrogant pilots as well.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_31a0221f", "What's his ETA?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_346f07d4", "Move on.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_36a32229", "They carry valuable system information in their onboard computers. They know more about Endor than anybody - and that includes Rebel HQ.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_3bb82587", "Are you kidding? This isn't kindergarten. We're at war, soldier!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_3dd2eade", "I'm afraid not. You'll have to get it yourself - from Hutt smugglers.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_41072d99", "And they're willing to share that with us?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_4519b6a1", "You're going to Endor. Several ships from our fleet are there. They were forced out of hyperspace.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_45ab7a66", "You don't have to be so mean about it.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_4a2c18a8", "That is irrelevant. We are sending our best pilot to make sure that he never reaches the Endor system. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_4c6cb546", "The smugglers?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_4c82b8a", "You catch on quick. I want you to get out there and help them with their repairs.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_4cff5cf8", "I just want another mission.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_4f685543", "We don't plan on asking. Your job is to hack into those smuggling ships and get that data.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_4fca3087", "You must stop him. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_512343e1", "You like that mommy treatment? ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_535a48bf", "Is that right?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_5688bc93", "Those Rebel ships are safe now. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_57127d49", "If you screw up again, don't bother coming back. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_5748a2bb", "Good. Let's cut to the chase. We've learned that there was an Imperial spy operating on Yavin.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_5a165de6", "He already has. And he escaped our forces. He's very good - and now he's making his way back to the Imperial fleet.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_5a2f7b49", "By what?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_5c2a6c79", "Are you trying to say something?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_5d8e37f3", "I was GREAT out there!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_5e62a10a", "Give me a mission! I'm ready to fight.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_5f3f0268", "No excuses! Get back out there!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_6100696", "All right! I've done the best I can with you. Your transfer has come through. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_620547d7", "Soldiers in my unit must be well-trained in all areas. Where are you lacking? ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_660e75ca", "The smugglers have the information you need.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_66eebb00", "Their opinion doesn't matter. Hack into those ships and get that data.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_6851e7af", "What are you talking about? I escorted them out of here myself!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_6b7870ee", "Of course - but first I need data on the Endor system.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_6c04c8a5", "Who knows? Could be sabotage. You're going to need data on the system.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_6e641199", "Several ships were forced out of hyperspace in the Endor system. We suspect sabotage.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_6ebb13d3", "I do.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_7169d6ae", "No. They're not.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_74ea771e", "Those Imperials didn't know what hit 'em.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_7a38a99d", "You can get that data from Hutt smugglers.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_7a70c49d", "Endor is a dangerous system.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_7b1ee144", "We are going to find out how he infiltrated us.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_7e4588fd", "Absolutely. They don't like the Empire any more than we do. I want you to make contact with one of Nym's smugglers in the Endor system, get the data from him, and bring that information back to our fleet.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_8137160f", "Aw. Do you want a hug? ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_81c19652", "Then why are you HERE?! Scram!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_83adb39e", "We're through playing defense. It's time to hit these Imperials with everything we've got.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_84180d3b", "Sounds good to me!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_853538e8", "I'm not taking transfers. Return to your unit, pilot.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_85bda55d", "Outstanding performance up there pilot, I'm proud of you, and of myself of course, for giving such excellent training. You have only one field of expertise left to train in and then you have learned all that I and my men can teach you. You are truly one of the best of the best now %NU.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_85ccda8d", "I was wrong when I said you were my best pilot.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_860361d0", "He won't - IF you can stop him.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_86e0190", "You're good, but you need to know more if you're ever going to be great.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_88dd0a6e", "They're not so secret anymore. The spy found them. He's very good - and now he's making his way back to the Imperial fleet.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_89d52fe6", "Is it uploaded to my ship?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_89f4d28f", "I want to know about space superiority fighters.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_8a0c5437", "Hey! They're good!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_8bf9d94d", "Whatever you say, sir.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_8df62c80", "First, I need data on the Endor system.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_8f422d5c", "And that would be me.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_90b3d410", "Of course I am.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_90b730b5", "Immediately.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_94dbd157", "The Empire is sending one of their best fighter pilots to this location. His orders are simple: terminate our fleet. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_96534c26", "Watch your mouth. Remember what I told you before.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_96a4f294", "Hutt smugglers?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_9795f675", "Watch your mouth, pilot! You should be thanking your lucky stars that you've been trained by the great Aqzow. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_987445c9", "Thank you, sir.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_98dbd811", "The fleet still needs your help!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_9b43a7ee", "Yes sir.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_9ce7f436", "It's OK, I guess.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_9d1fa2a2", "When can I leave?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_9d826c99", "When you put it that way...what's my mission?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_9edfea48", "Get out there and guard them while they make repairs.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a0640cce", "There was an Imperial spy operating on Yavin.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a08c36ef", "As if the Empire weren't causing us enough grief... now there are reports that YOU are working against the Rebel Alliance, too!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a09da7f1", "You like that?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a114fef2", "I'm reporting for duty.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a20d4e92", "Hm. You're quite a pilot.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a2f4d2bd", "We've learned that there was an Imperial spy operating on Yavin.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a47c19a7", "You can get that from the Hutt smugglers.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a4f4a27", "Their ships have more data on Endor than we do. Hack into their onboard computers and see what's there.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a4f58384", "We can't leave those Rebel ships out there, defenseless.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a51658ea", "Excuse me?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a54fd6b7", "Do not speak to me until you have completed your mission.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a70b470e", "I want to know about advanced starship components.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_a7e7494d", "He's not going to tell anybody ANYTHING. Because you're going to stop him, aren't you.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_ad721916", "Finally!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_ae7e01af", "My hands are tied. Until you improve your standing with the Rebel Alliance, we cannot trust you with any more missions.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_b5bf7e24", "What's my mission?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_b6c1a98e", "I'm here to do my job.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_b9ba3998", "Lady Viopa is waiting for you.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_be9c87b0", "It must have been that spy! ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_beaa457b", "I SAID I'm ready for my mission.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_bf9854b5", "I know!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_c1d821eb", "Oh, I'll stop him all right.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_c207cb86", "You should learn to bite your tongue - before someone bites it off for you.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_c28a300f", "I want to know about system balance programming.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_c317f1e7", "If I didn't know better, I'd think you were working for the Emperor. Do your job!!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_c4d60644", "I'll say.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_c5648040", "How did you like Lady Viopa?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_c75a413", "Good. You're here. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_c8489609", "Will do. But first I need information on Endor.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_ca8f086e", "They would - if they thought they could get away with it. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_cae661b8", "Yeah right. That's why you're down here assigning missions.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_d1f24c43", "Can't stand all that sugar and spice, myself.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_d40f6011", "We've definitely got the Emperor's attention. This system is lousy with Imperial forces!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_d75df92e", "They could attack our ships!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_d8376b91", "A spy? On Yavin? We've got secret hangars there.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_d9f9ff9a", "I can do it. There's still time.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_da65a262", "Very good. One of my pilots will train you. When you're done, come see me for your next mission.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_da836e9e", "It is time to continue your training.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_e078d62c", "A spy? On Yavin? We've got secret hangars there!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_e07a3d4a", "Then stop wasting my time and get back out there!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_e1e40ead", "That would be nice.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_e37c2bae", "Smugglers?");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_e73e9bb1", "Don't fail me again.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_eaf68b63", "A spy? On Yavin? He must not find our hangars!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_efd88602", "Glad you think so.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_f01922ee", "The only thing you're DOING is making me CRAZY! Get OUT of here!!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_f1a5d3e2", "Let me prove it to you!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_f2003333", "What do I look like, Lady Viopa? I'll give you a bear hug all right - one that'll crush your windpipe! If I were you, I'd get out of here RIGHT NOW.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_f8e71988", "I'm ready for my mission.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_f940636f", "Find his ship. When you do, launch a space assault droid - that will give you control of his ship. ");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_fafb0eec", "Put me out there!");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_fb0a082d", "A lovely lady.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_fd2da9fe", "Oh, I'll stop him.");
stringFiles[168].addEntry("s_fed6ceb3", "That is irrelevant. We are sending our best pilot to make sure that he never reaches the Endor system.");

stringFiles[169] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_rebel_tier4");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_rebel_tier4) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_1047bc70", "Nice work out there. You really kicked those guys where it counts. Ready for round two?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_10d8bf69", "I salute you, Rebel!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_10eafe13", "I'm not done yet!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_11769c29", "Sure! I wasn't ALWAYS an old man, you know. I used to have a few more marbles rolling around upstairs. Now go on; get out of here.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_127f2e23", "You're going to kidnap one of their technical supervisors. He knows the plan. And pretty soon, you'll know the plan as well!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_13835aab", "You don't have much time.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_1551b284", "Something good?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_16e3e795", "Your ship is waiting. Watch your back.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_1909d363", "You've got to get back out there. You realize what will happen if that Inquisitor gets a hold of your friends?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_197c8928", "Happy to serve.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_1af32f06", "Likely story. Why don't you just tell me that your dog ate your blasters?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_1bb2f893", "They're using my men because they know every inch of Dathomir space. They'll run rings around those Imperials. I suggest you follow their every move. I trained them all myself.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_1c669", "Well, no. Not exactly. . But we've managed to hit them pretty hard lately.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_1c8bddbb", "What is it?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_21374155", "Remember what I said. They're just men.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_2284c46", "Look, you don't have to like what we do. But those miners aren't hurting anybody. They're just trying to feed their families. And you know those Black Suns will show no mercy.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_256f3624", "%TU, you lack discipline! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_268606ba", "They'll never know it was you.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_2744b825", "What I mean, pliot, is that you are grounded until further notice. We can't trust YOU with any more missions.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_2846f47d", "Um, yes. Well, I'm here now.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_28d914fc", "Well listen up. We are dealing with several situations here, and I'd like to see what you can do. First of all, the Black Suns have been taking a lot of business from us lately. Nym doesn't like it. We need a pilot to send them a message. A LOUD message. Heh! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_29544149", "Then why send an Inquisitor? ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_29f4061f", "Oh! So enlightened! Bah! Never mind. Let's talk about your mission.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_2a5d0bf1", "They're criminals.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_2a5db9a8", "I would like hyper-maneuverable starfighters, please.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_2ac3e9a6", "The Empire doesn't run. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_2c4789b", "Understood.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_2da082b6", "IMPERIAL?! I hate Imperials! Get out of here!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_2eec3c3b", "YOUR ship has guns! Start using them, will you? And try aiming this time!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_2efd90c2", "I didn't shout!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_3172f07e", "See you around, %TU.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_31fd5acf", "Of course it's smart! It was my idea. Now listen up. Your first objective is to find out what route those Imperial freighters plan to use. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_34d61fa3", "Um...I don't think we've met.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_35dd4aa2", "Yes, I know!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_3609c810", "It is?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_36f346a5", "What if I don't have any gear, sir?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_37e345fe", "Have you ever seen an Inquisitor up close?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_3b361a5f", "You should think about leaving the Alliance and working for Nym! You'll make more money.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_3b95cf2f", "I said, 'What is it?'!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_3bcc34e7", "Oh no! You've got WORK to do, junior!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_3bfd507c", "Let me know when you're ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_3c546115", "Some other time? I'm really busy!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_3dc78ada", "Sounds like he hasn't changed. Bleh. I spit on him.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_4057d656", "As a matter of fact, I do! How did you know that?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_410d920c", "Alright, let's do this!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_42880861", "Okay...");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_42b12fa4", "I should hope not! Good grief! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_436c2ab2", "You've been assisting the Empire! Working AGAINST the Rebel Alliance!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_449db6d4", "I am! Try and keep up, will you? ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_450d7208", "You can call me Arkon. I imagine that Aqzow sent you?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_4519dec9", "You are crazy!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_48529763", "I said, 'Okay'!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_4bce8f6f", "Fine, listen up. We are looking at several situations here, and I'd like to see what you can do. First of all, the Black Suns have been taking a lot of business from us lately. Nym doesn't like it. We need a pilot to send them a message. A LOUD message. Heh! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_4c97efb1", "And I'm happy to give you your duty pay, junior!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_4ccb8d59", "I just lack motivation. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_4dd9a7b9", "Those ships have guns!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_4ef35507", "He is expecting you right away, so I suggest you get a move on. If you fail to report to the Admiral in a timely fashion, it will reflect poorly on me, and that is something that I will not stand for! Dismissed, pilot.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_4f44d41d", "No no! You don't belong here!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_4f755af2", "In my day, a pilot would NEVER leave a job unfinished!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_50669846", "Apparently, the Empire's had just about enough of our activities in the area. I don't know who they hate more, smugglers or Rebels.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_526ce515", "Negative! They outgun YOU, too. Don't try to blast them to smithereens. Just hold them off long enough to give our mining vessels the time they need to escape.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_53544796", "Sounds like a problem.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_539f9a2e", "Nothing!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_549b97e6", "I'll motivate you with the tip of my BOOT! Get to work!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_5673ded2", "Are they really on the run?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_58e80738", "True believers are boring.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_5bf6779f", "OK %NU, let's talk business! This situation is SERIOUS!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_5d976742", "Those miners are important to us and you saved them. We're grateful, so quid pro quo. You helped us; now we'll help you.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_5e0e14bc", "BECAUSE I just know, that's how! None of your business how I know! Young people today are so rude! Shut your trap and get back to work!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_5e4c5d9a", "And now we have the chance to REALLY do some damage. And that's where you come in.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_5fe6ae71", "Haha! You're joking, right?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_60080304", "Not another Inquisitor assignment, I hope.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_6065ab8b", "I would like special weapons and tactics, please.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_61485366", "It's not going to happen anytime soon.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_6222b64d", "Do you have any missions that I could fly?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_62c873d4", "Are you sure? Well too late it's yours now! Haha I'm just teasing you! That is a fine skill... for a NERF-HERDER! Now go on, get out of here!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_6318beeb", "What's the situation?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_6429f86b", "Here's some MORE good news. Another group of our men infiltrated a number of Imperial troop transports in the Endor system. But they can't take control of those ships - not yet. First we need a pilot to disable the transport controls. This requires a pilot with skills.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_647ad2bc", "I'll take care of those Black Suns. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_649d2a19", "Privateer? No privateers here! Go on, get out of here!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_650af8ec", "Don't tell ME what you did! Now go on, make yourself useful!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_6561f20e", "Well then why aren't you DOING it? Get back out there!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_6634adb9", "I don't have the answer to that one, pilot. But Admiral Burke requested you personally.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_66d4c0f2", "You don't have to shout! I've never seen anybody so excited about starships.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_67e6df55", "Okay.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_69020482", "I did!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_69a739e6", "Where do I find this guy?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_6adec6b0", "Of course!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_6f679fea", "What does it mean?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_6fdab943", "Here's your duty pay. And let me know when you're ready for another mission! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7052aaab", "I'll take it as it comes.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7065a3b", "Great.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7090182", "What?!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_71f899d5", "It's about time you got here, pilot. Suit up.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_73313039", "Really, I just want to work.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_761dd18e", "I'm not in it for the money.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_76c0ae11", "Hurry up! There's no time to waste! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_774fb2f0", "Eh? Who's that? Who are you? Tell me your faction!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_77633b61", "Easy for you to say. They're not gunning for you.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_77758001", "I would like heavy starship component use, please.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_78b8ac8f", "Oh what is THIS. I told you to take out those freighters!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7ae51280", "You did?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7afc40b8", "Fine. Well the Alliance is feeling more confident, now that you've terminated that Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7ce1c24", "[exhale loudly]");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7d2fc507", "Say please! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7da3fc7a", "No. Those don't come along very often. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7e579e1e", "I'm a privateer.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7e602d1b", "I'm not!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_7fca522a", "You mean, will I quit the Rebellion and start working for Nym full time? Forget it. It'll never happen.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8057f803", "Then it won't take you too long to pack! The orders don't include any details, but I can only assume it involves some operation that his fleet is about to undertake. You had best be ready for a challenge, pilot.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_81e25d24", "You showed them! Let's see the Empire try to build a station in THIS system!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8209f997", "Nothing I can repeat.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_835acc11", "You think you're a hero or something? Fine! Go on! You'll find your scientists in the Dantooine system.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_83f72ca3", "Something that will help the Rebellion. How does that sound to you?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_840af840", "Lucky guess.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_841d27db", "Why?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8450d7db", "Let me take a crack at disabling those troop transports.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_84c908b8", "Eh? Who's that? You're no... wait, you ARE a Rebel pilot. But you don't fly with this unit. What are you doing here?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_85fbc617", "Here's your duty pay. You've earned it.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_86677c6b", "What does he want with me?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_868699d3", "I don't give my pilots easy missions. But I DO pay them well. Here you go. See me later when you're ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_86df2510", "Is that your idea of a comeback? Grow up! Get to work!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8729f60e", "Smart.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8762aa6e", "Crazy like a SQUALL! Don't underestimate me, %TU! I'm thinking, always thinking. I was smart enough to join this Alliance with the Rebels, wasn't I?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_87d7e908", "I know.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_87e30fff", "Not this time, my grumpy friend. This time, you'll be helping your beloved Rebellion. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_882e7ab9", "Well, the Empire has no idea what the Alliance has planned, thanks to you.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_88563b84", "I'm ashamed.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8907c99", "Hey! You! You're still pretty wet behind the ears, you know. What you need are SKILLS! And you've come to the right place. I grant skills. Even to fools like yourself! Which one would you like?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8b4d636d", "Intel reports that the Emperor is sending an Inquisitor to Dathomir.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8cac3c56", "I thought you would! Now you don't have to take the whole base apart. You're just going to pave the way for an Alliance B-Wing squadron. They've had their sights set on this base for a while. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8e9d0848", "[nod]");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8f3b3edb", "I'm not done yet! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_8fc8c755", "What?...Never mind. Do you have a mission for me?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_900f01d1", "What?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_92c6d3dd", "You don't look like a pilot to me! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_95c399f6", "I sure do.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_96bfa401", "Not at all - if it helps the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9775f996", "Can you explain it again?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_98199797", "Why is the Alliance sending pirates? This sounds like strictly a Rebel operation. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_981faf84", "What did he say about me?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_98588d70", "OK fine.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_99069e90", "YES! It's ALWAYS serious when we're talking about Imperials!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9943289", "I want to help those scientists.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9976a72", "Get somebody else to do your dirty work! I need a break.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_997f2d21", "But you said...");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_99d3b4fd", "What have you got for me?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9a01b8f2", "Once...a long, long time ago. Let's not talk about it right now. I want you to kill that Inquisitor before he reaches the Imperial fleet in Dathomir.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9a4a59e0", "Maybe you just want your duty pay.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9a626852", "Same difference to them.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9bbb9999", "Hm, what else is there? Oh yes...you'll like this, it's a Rebel rescue mission! A Rebel fleet was carrying several scientists through the Dantooine system, they were ambushed by Imperial fighters! That's not right. I want a pilot to get out there and help those ships escape before more Imperial ships arrive! And that's it! So what's it going to be, junior?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9be0e2f1", "What? You worthless bum! Fine! See if I ever try to give you a mission again!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9d0a2207", "Should I target the Black Suns directly?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9e1c0119", "Yes, but the Rebels are being smart. They're deciding to strike now, while the iron is hot.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9e3df78d", "Is it your naptime? Well fine then!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_9f50a13", "Back to those poor miners. They're outgunned; there's no way they can defend themselves. I want you to get out there and set up a defensive perimeter.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_a04dd423", "Think of your future, junior! Someday you'll be a crazy old man like me. Do you still want to be working then?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_a2c04cca", "Have you changed your mind?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_a434ad25", "One more thing Rebel. All the missions I provide you with will be high risk missions and might be too much to handle by yourself. If you have any favors you can call in, doing so during my missions might be a good idea.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_a5958aac", "I'd like to see you do some WORK for a change! Sign up for something, pronto. Or do I have to explain it to you again?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_a64a6f6f", "They're not gunning for YOU either, junior! Now stop moping. Let's get your mind off all this. I've got a mission for you.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_a6e1a5f4", "That's because it's top secret! In the meantime, let's keep gunning for the Empire. You're going to Dathomir. I want you to join some of my men on a guerilla strike against an Imperial base.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_a9e4fd02", "How do I do that?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_abf08a18", "Check your ship's computer. All the information you need is there. Good luck.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_ad621c08", "Ever?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_aed5139a", "No need for that.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_af22b9b2", "I guess so.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_afc14266", "Um, OK. Maybe I should just get to work. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_b045a378", "Touche.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_b0d064ef", "Endor it is! Leave immediately!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_b1f1f364", "We could never hold our own against the Imperials. We needed your guns. And you needed us! A perfect situation.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_b20c71fe", "It wasn't easy.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_b45dc260", "Because it makes another Inquisitors angry - angry at ME. And that's trouble I don't need.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_b4e09e44", "Duty pay, you nitwit! Here you go. And let me know when you're ready for another mission!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_b607bb2e", "Yep. A BIG one. We can't let them build that station. So here's the plan! We're going to destroy the station components while they're en route to Lok.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_b6b4b241", "Attention! Alliance Headquarters has approved your transfer. You are now serving under the command of Admiral Willham Burke, good man. You are to report to Admiral Burke immediately, so pack up your gear and get moving. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_ba9df4a6", "Oh all right. Here you go. Now go away and stop bothering me.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_bbe3529b", "Who is Admiral Burke?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_bcbc9230", "Admiral Willham Burke is head of the fourth battle fleet. Last I heard, he was operating in and along the Outer Rim. Burke is a good man, a good leader, and a good soldier. He does the Alliance proud.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_bcc6b959", "Where do I need to report?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_beaf1664", "Another errand for Nym the pirate?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_bed0dfe7", "I like that!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c1013aa7", "Whatever.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c2bbb747", "Fine by me.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c3363bcd", "Uh huh.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c384d95e", "How unfortunate. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c4dc6b9d", "I'm always right! Get that through your thick head. Here's your duty pay. See me later when you're ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c55a344e", "They'll send another one eventually.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c72c337a", "Pft.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c73f5fdb", "You should know better than that. Only your commanding officer can give you missions. And I am NOT your commanding officer, buddy! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c82e9a2f", "Yes, please.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c95dbd1", "They're outgunned! So we need to help them out.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_c985b91", "I said, 'Why?'");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_cb25bcd4", "Then let's get a move on, pilot. The Admiral is not going to want to wait all day for you to arrive. You are to report into him at Doaba Guerfel on Corellia. Keep your wits about and you just might learn something. Dismissed, pilot.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_cb6eb294", "Aw shucks.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_cbcfe001", "Well, whatever! You know what I mean. Don't be obstinate, junior!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_ccac6a71", "You're going to Dathomir. I want you to join some of my men on a guerilla strike against an Imperial base.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_cd445db2", "I like the sound of that.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_ceb77d0c", "We've got the Empire on the run! Let's kick 'em while they're down!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d054f893", "I don't like targeting Inquisitors. You want to know why?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d06c9b96", "Even I don't know what the Alliance has planned.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d16ee99f", "Here's the situation. Intel reports that the Emperor is sending an Inquisitor to Dathomir.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d1be90a9", "What's the plan?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d318a2bb", "Back from your assignment with Admiral Burke, I see! I hope that everything went according to plan. I can use your help around here! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d3d98e75", "That was a complete disaster!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d566a3c", "And how are the Imperials involved?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d6f2e64d", "What am I, a mind reader? They're probably concerned about Alliance attacks.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d74e67f", "According to these orders, Admiral Burke is in Doaba Guerfel on Corellia. I recommend that you keep your eyes and ears open and you just might learn something. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d79718db", "And pirates are criminals.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d8209030", "Then you're going to Dantooine! Goodbye! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d9116b4d", "I'll escort those freighters. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d98a6441", "Apparently, the Black Suns are preparing to launch an assault on one of our mining interests in the Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_d9cced1f", "Absolutely.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_da8e9da5", "See? You could save the day after all! Not bad.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_dbcde2d3", "And it's paid off. And now we have the chance to REALLY do some damage. And that's where you come in.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_dc241019", "What'd you say?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_dcabe09b", "Oh, I'm not here for a mission! I was just looking for the cantina.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_de1e215f", "Traitor!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_def742", "You were right.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_dfc39325", "So are you, according to the Empire.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_e0dc5fad", "I don't?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_e30b9697", "Hey, things don't always turn out right!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_e3653d50", "Here's your duty pay! You've earned it.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_e380bbf8", "So you are! I hope you don't mind helping pirates.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_e3e480fe", "Don't smart off to me!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_e42b260e", "I'm on my way.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_e86f1062", "How do you know?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_e8f374d9", "Hey Rebel! I've got a new assignment for you. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_e93fce3e", "You're probably right, %NU. We've received word that they're planning to build a space station in the Lok system. They'll use it to monitor all the activity in the area.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_eb1c3d4e", "Are you crazy? No one can kill an Inquisitor!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_eb703128", "In that case, I'm listening.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_ecfe38f9", "Oh! Well, here you go. Bye now! ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_ee83a0c2", "'Til you improve your standing with the Rebel Alliance, I wouldn't trust you to guard a faamba.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_ef3e641a", "I'm here to help.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f0743f82", "I don't have any missions, but there are plenty of elective duty assignments you can perform. Is that something you think you could handle? Want me to explain it to you?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f13513cd", "Hmph! Well here's some good news. One of our men has raided an Imperial outpost on Dathomir and he walked away with plenty of loot. Now all he has to do is escape! Easier said than done, of course, as the Empire wants their things back. So you could escort our man out of Dathomir...");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f15aeb5", "With pilots like you, who needs Imperials? ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f27f6d98", "Who's talking about Imperials?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f35bbdbd", "Mining interests? You make it sound almost legitimate.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f3603d67", "Don't talk back to me, junior! And don't be ridiculous! The Inquisitors are mortal, like the rest of us. Believe me, they CAN be killed. I know that for a fact. Now I want you to get out there, immediately!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f48fdfbd", "Ship's in the shop.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f50be00f", "I like the sound of that!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f51574ed", "Haha! Good point. Well then I'm a criminal. And you're going to help me. And then I'll help you - maybe. Do we understand each other?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f5427310", "Of course not!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f59d9106", "Well, %TU, think about it. The Empire needs to know what the Alliance is planning. And no one is better at gathering information than an Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f5cc7cf3", "Can't the vessels defend themselves?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f5d1e7f4", "Don't sass me, junior! You should be ashamed of yourself! Now go back out there and clean up that mess!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f5e4dcb6", "Stop talking and start listening! Oh great, you've made me lose my train of thought. I'll start again. The Black Suns are preparing to launch an assault on one of our mining interests. ");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f60b81f8", "That's fine.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f819adf9", "I would like droid intelligence theory, please.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f87c573", "I give credit where credit is due! I've never seen somebody go after an Imperial base the way you did.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_f95cd5f5", "Mission accomplished! And you know what that means.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_fa6bfaff", "Oh. I didn't mean to upset you! I just want to rescue those mining vessels. Sorry! Go on and try again! I'm sure you'll have no problem this time.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_fb4c1f1f", "I'm an Imperial.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_fc6dfba9", "Are you one of those goody two-shoes Rebels? You know, the kind that believes in the cause and all that?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_fcddb599", "It does. Very wise of you to recognize that.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_fed79efe", "Then hurry up and get yourself over to Dathomir!");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_ff9bf289", "Always, sir.");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_ff9fae78", "What kind of question is that?");
stringFiles[169].addEntry("s_ffeba47a", "They're not!");

stringFiles[170] = new StringFile("conversation/corellia_rebel_trainer_1");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corellia_rebel_trainer_1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_10133bc", "You must be new to Corellia, pal. This place is crawling with Imps. Be very careful out there! The Empire cannot learn our purpose... or the whole transport route will have to be scrapped!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_10338636", "Just kidding. I hate the Empire!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_10762880", "Yeah. The old one was secret, too - but it was discovered. Lots of Rebels lost their lives. This new route is... new. At the moment, the Imps have no clue what we're planning.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_10d17e63", "Well... be careful, then. Follow the navigation points and defeat any hostiles that come your way. These 'duty' missions have been prepared for you to gain some much needed space combat experience. You can return to the ground at any time when you feel that you have learned enough.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_12d04a63", "Ha! Ha! You're funny! People don't get rich flying for the Alliance, okay? They do it because the Empire makes their lives miserable... So join up, already!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_13b7333c", "Finally. You are now part of the Alliance pilot training program.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_13d3df42", "I know");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_13f85785", "Why not? What are you talking about? What happened?! We can't just FAIL missions around here, you know?!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_14f13684", "Blasting TIE fighters sounds fun.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_14fdabce", "Your ship navigation system will automatically plot a waypoint when you launch so that you can find your way back home. After your mission is... a success (I hope), fly back to the 'launch waypoint.' Communicate with the space station at this point, and tell the commander you want to land at Tyrena starport.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_150b3020", "Since you're not in my unit I cannot assign you missions. You ought to go talk to your commanding officer for such things.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1583743c", "Do you have any missions I could fly?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_159b7288", "I know you won't. Good luck!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_16d870fe", "Consider it done.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_185a81f5", "Well, if your 'magic' has anything to do with flying around and shooting... I think your secret is out! Good work anyhow, my friend!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_18617361", "Whoa! Relax the attitude, okay? I'll train you... I'll train you...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_18c8a207", "I gotta hand it to ya. You're a real spitfire, babe! Hope it serves you well in battle. Here's the story: Alliance HQ has come up with a new travel route for munitions transports. We want you to hit a few nav points along the route and make sure they're safe.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_190d7fcd", "Slow down, there, %NU.  I need to know you can be trusted to complete assignments as they are given.  I'll train you AFTER you've finished doing a couple more things for me.  Now, about that lost transport...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1920852a", "Quit if you want... but I wouldn't advise it.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_199261c2", "Piece of cake, Kreezo.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_19cd5919", "You don't say...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1a5bf5f0", "You've got a lot of nerve coming here and talking to me, Imperial! Get out of here now!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1b107d8a", "I want to join-up with the ground forces.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1b11fff2", "You're wasting my time.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1bd844f1", "You said it! We need you to track down the transport and escort it safely out of Corellia space. You ready?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1bdcc6fa", "All right. Let's hear it!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1c8bddbb", "What is it?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1d24deda", "Hah! Ha! You got a brain in that pretty skull, eh? Good! It will serve you well in battle.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1df785ab", "Yes, I'm sure!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1f2dd784", "I want another chance.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1f34ee71", "So you know - the operations being carried out against our transports are the work of one lone commander. The Empire dispatched him here some time ago. His mission is to destabilize Alliance traffic so that they can capture our munitions, and kidnap our special-operations personnel.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_1f7c77cd", "The Force be with you.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2092352a", "Here you are - your first training module for the Alliance starfighter program.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2098126f", "Excellent!  The Rebel Alliance can use some more boots on the ground, too.  Go to a Rebel Recruiter and sign-up!  Heh... they can be hard to find, you know?  But I'm sure you'll manage.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_209aa4aa", "Don't abort the missions I give you, pal!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_20ef9c42", "Mission accomplished.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_246d08d7", "You have enough experience for more training.  What area interests you the most?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2477af4a", "For the Alliance... always.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_248af92", "I can teach you the proper handling of superior starfighters. Specifically, I can give you certifications to fly the Y-Wing. Are you interested in this?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_24af7536", "The Force has guided me to this... my destiny.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_24d9c943", "What are you doing here? You should be working for Lady Viopa on Lok... right?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_25387b43", "The Alliance will have nothing to do with you bloodthirsty smugglers! Begone!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_26970ef", "I am interested in basic starfighter training.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_26a260", "(Shrug)");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_279176e6", "Yes, ma'am!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_282d2761", "Got another one for ya! It's time to get even with those TIE fighters that jumped you on your last patrol. You ready?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_28eea20", "Woah!  I didn't see that coming!  You're sure you know what you're getting into?  You could be opening yourself to attack when you least expect it... even as a covert operative.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_29ac0c24", "Welcome to the Alliance!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_29cee3c8", "Okay. I can appreciate that, I guess. Good luck...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_29f6dd14", "Great work, pilot! Please come back and see me if you are in need of training.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2a1af6a8", "Guess so.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2b436278", "Just shut up and start the training, okay?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2b8b36e0", "Look, don't beat yourself up about it. This is our first operation together. Let's get you back out there to try again, okay?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2bf47615", "Yeah, sure. Why not.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2d736852", "They seemed bent on killing those refugees!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2da94e1b", "Secret route?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2ea6d944", "Really?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2f3d170c", "What I mean is, Alliance HQ has grounded you.  There are reports that you have been working against the Rebel Alliance... for the Empire!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2f6cbd7e", "I was unable to complete the mission.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_2fc8ed3d", "Get back out there and get me my transport route info!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_30136a60", "What is my objective?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_306e91cd", "Quit wasting my time, Kreezo!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_32190415", "Hey! Good to see ya again. Got a new mission brewing. You are going to LOVE this!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3269c6d", "Not really.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_328afd9b", "I was jumped by TIE fighters.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3339950", "Too much for you, huh?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_34e352c7", "I'm a CorSec pilot!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3521c69", "What can you tell me of Nym?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_354fc0ee", "Great! You now have some basic droid programming abilities!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3794d8a1", "Don't take them on all at once. Focus your firepower on a single target. They're still up there. Give it another try!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_386363ba", "Yeah, so?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3a1791eb", "Yeah. The Empire isn't interested in simple military victory, it seems. They're up to something much more sinister... But oh!  I have something for you.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3adab64", "(End with a humorous anecdote)");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3bee14c0", "Redirect?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3d8dd8ba", "Fine, fine. I'm not looking to fight you - I train pilots... to fight the Empire! What do you say? Are you willing to join the Rebel Alliance?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3de34560", "We have a nav point for you. Very likely he can be found in this area along with several of his trainees. Be careful - they're just trainees... but there might be a lot of them.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3f36d6ff", "Why is this trans so important?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3fa4f0ff", "Fine!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3fa70900", "I am interested in basic starship component use.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_3fb48b5f", "Where do I find her?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_40b1665a", "Any Imperial entanglements?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_41fb4738", "Affirmative! Outstanding! Heh... take some time off and swing back by when you're ready for the next assignment, soldier!  Also, I've got something for you...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_420fb842", "It's a flight suit!  You'll look like a real soldier in this, huh?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_42ab2360", "Sounds like it was quite a battle, then! Good work, pilot! Very good work!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_43092a4a", "So, lucky for you that wasn't the last refugee transport from the convoy. You ready to try again?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_431ae604", "Well, what can you do? Check back with me if you ever get the urge to join up. I'll get you started!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_43a157c9", "The patrol was interrupted by an Imperial ambush!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_44ca831b", "Where will I find him?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_44f7abd1", "I've never met her. I think she's Mon Cal? I know she's high-ranking Alliance Intel... so she's not exactly my type.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_46fa0a69", "I should sweep and clear Corellia space.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4785a810", "The Alliance is not ready for me.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_492633c2", "Who's this commander?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_49bfaf2", "(Salute) For the Alliance!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4a86da46", "You said it! The transport route is pretty big - so you'll only be hitting the major hot-spots. Just make sure that nobody from the Empire spots you... and try not to tangle with the local pirates.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4aa8e211", "I'm sure you will, don't get too confident though. Good luck!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4ad222a2", "It can't be that tough if you're still alive.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4adf1730", "Goodbye, Kreezo.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4b0e9ff2", "How do I get back here?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4b1458bf", "That's bad news. This means that the Empire is aware of our plans to reopen secret transport routes here in Corellia. Bad, bad news. Glad you're okay, though! Great work!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4cc5bfd8", "Maybe when this war is over, you'll let me buy you a drink...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4cccd3f2", "No problem... no problem. Here's your introduction to Alliance starfighter techniques.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4dd8aee0", "Thanks, but no thanks.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_4df7e8e8", "Oh, but I do! I do! I could never forget such a pretty face. Come on - let me slide you into the Alliance piloting ranks. You'll love it!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_50808c9f", "Uh huh...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_51398083", "We need you to search Corellia space for the refugee transport. If you find it - escort it out of the system safely. If HQ finds it first, they will redirect you to a rally point where you'll meet up with the transport.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_51f67642", "Love it.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_52e212a5", "I will bring honor to the Alliance.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_535b6177", "Have we met? No? But you are a Rebel pilot, aren't you? What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_53d2df67", "Wizard! So - your job is to run a patrol through a newly appointed Alliance transport route. Make sure that the path is clear. Report any enemy ships you detect.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_564340f", "Yeah. Likely the transport will be trying to comm Alliance HQ. If they get through - they'll coordinate with them to find a rally point. You fly there - take over the escort, and make sure the transport leaves Corellia space in one piece.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_57881f7b", "Um... try to forget it, I guess.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5792c0f4", "(Salute) Yes sir!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_59125af6", "You sure do impress me, my lady. You're a great combat pilot. Check back with me any time you are ready for training.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_59bfc3b4", "A duty mission is THE best way to get experience as a pilot. I know that you're anxious to get training, and experience from these missions will get you there faster. Duty missions have no real end so you can just finish up whenever you want. What do you think?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_59f3a8d", "Find the transport, right?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5a12db83", "Stay safe up there! I want to see you again soon...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5a28f5e9", "Relax, flyboy. I'll join your little club.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5a685923", "Great! This will come in handy!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5adefc5c", "Refugees?! Those monsters!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5af7e0d3", "Great! Sorry if we had a misunderstanding before... ");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5b72d948", "Oh no? So I guess you made quick work of them. Good. Bad news for the new transport route, though. Check back with me later for another assignment.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5be6d3af", "Sounds like pay-back.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5bec38ba", "TIE Fighters attacked me!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5c625403", "I would like to protect Alliance transports.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5c9e583b", "Bah!  Lap-dogs for the Emperor.  You should be ashamed of yourself.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5d420942", "I'll consider it done when you're back... and it's done.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5daf71df", "Yeah! Sounds like fun, too! I reckon you crossed paths with a long-range TIE patrol before, it's time for some revenge, right? Bring 'em some justice!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5e3d235d", "You got it. Fly back out there and get us our transport route info. See me when you're done.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5f75a31a", "They're civilian refugees, man! Some Gungan, some Human, and a handful of MonCal... just trying to live their lives here in the shadow of the Empire. We need to teach these Imps that wanton violence like this won't go unpunished!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_5f930245", "I couldn't kill them all.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6076cccb", "They're civilian refugees, honey! Some Gungan, some Human, and a handful of MonCal... just trying to live their lives here in the shadow of the Empire. We need to teach these Imps that wanton violence like this won't go unpunished!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6106187c", "What is a duty mission?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6194a4e", "Clear of what?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_61f0b20d", "Heh. Despite our best efforts Corellia is still lousy with pirate clans. Things have gotten a lot worse since the Empire got slammed at the Battle of Yavin. Local criminals figure they've got a chance at defeating the Empire... just as we do.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_62a0670", "You got some sort of problem with me, sister? I've been flying for years and years. What I teach you will keep you alive!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_632bed94", "You're the cause of my grief, Kreezo.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_64355c70", "Right away, sir!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_64977077", "I don't have any missions to assign, but I do have an elective duty mission roster. You could either patrol the system for searching for Imperials, or you could help escort Alliance transports. Would you be interested in an elective duty task?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_656e3c93", "I don't remember much.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6598c431", "Fine!!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_66010040", "So, let's hear it! What happened out there?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_67119f16", "Okay, so what happened? We need that route data as soon as possible!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6929ad0f", "Congratulations. You have achieved the first rank of Weapons specialization.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_69bdfc60", "I know. But they haven't gotten rid of you yet, have they? No, they haven't. Get back out there and get that info. I'll be waiting.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_69e5db34", "I'm sure the transport pilots would agree! Follow all nav points, and protect all transports that come under your supervision. These 'duty' missions have been prepared for you to gain some much needed space combat experience. You can return to the ground at any time when you feel that you have learned enough. Good luck!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6a314d1b", "Without a doubt, my lady. Return to me whenever you are ready for training.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6abdc31f", "Heh. Once this war is over, if you still want to know - I'll be glad to tell you. For now... take a hike! Good luck out there, pilot.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6b490480", "(Salute) Affirmative!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6bed0484", "Go get 'em!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6d3c9ec2", "Come on! Give me another chance!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6d453fbf", "This TIE pilot is flying a standard fighter. Your tactical computer will recognize him as a 'TIE Veteran.'");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6f06b651", "Well - I doubt it... but okay. See you later!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6f096b57", "When can I upgrade?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6f169e12", "Sounds easy enough, I'll take care of it!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_6f8c5bda", "You're a pilot, now.  Fly there!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_70852580", "I'm turning my back on you, not them.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_70c0cac2", "And with you too, sweets. Hope to see you very soon, okay?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_70d92009", "(Stare intently and silently)");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_7119a3c9", "And if a technique gets me killed?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_716c6ef", "Oh yeah. You too...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_7191233e", "(Salute) I'm on my way!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_719a6b56", "Affirmative! Go get 'em!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_71b1981e", "Great! Welcome to the Alliance!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_71ce4d3b", "Be careful, sweetheart.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_72767fa4", "He's a veteran pilot traveling incognito. Should be in a standard TIE fighter. Your tactical computer will recognize his signal as a 'TIE Veteran.'");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_729ae5dc", "Well... good, then. Good work!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_73af9681", "Really? Alliance HQ is saying that other patrols are getting smacked by long-range TIE sweeps. You didn't encounter any resistance?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_74797cab", "See you later, Kreezo.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_75a759b0", "Most of our problems here in Corellia are the work of one TIE Veteran pilot. He's moved a lot of trainees into the area with hopes of overwhelming us with superior numbers. We want you to take him out. It'll set the Empire back pretty far, I think...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_766563c7", "Nothing I couldn't handle.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_779b8c40", "Good idea. I've added you to the duty roster. Patrol the Corellia system and eliminate any hostiles you encounter. I'll see you when you're done.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_78a5e1fa", "There are some open duty missions, if you're interested. HQ wants volunteers for a long-range patrol. Sweep-and-clear sorta stuff. There's also a need for more fighter escorts... since we're shuffling a lot of resources here in Corellia space.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_790cea65", "See that up there? That's space... You should be there finishing your mission. Right?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_797e30cb", "What are they doing here?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_79ff003e", "Well... nothing. I've had some trouble with his group in the past. But now that we're all working for the Alliance, I can put it behind me.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_7bebfa97", "Ha! Excellent! Keep up the heroics! There'll be more for you to do later. Check back with me after you get some rest.  Also, I think you've earned this.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_7c899d3e", "We don't have an exact location, search the Corellia system for TIE fighters and blast 'em!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_7d5c71fb", "How do I complete my assignment?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_7daee3c9", "Sounds wrong for me.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_7f50c50e", "He's an old Imperial Ace pilot traveling incognito. He'll be flying a standard TIE fighter. Your targeting system will recognize his signal as that of a 'TIE Veteran' pilot.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_7fc57488", "We'll try not to work too hard saving our civilian friends, okay? Jeez...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_7fcd3228", "Good to see you again. How are things going?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_7fd68073", "Great! You now have basic droid programming abilities!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_82d3ef4", "Do you even know what HQ wants you to do?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_83058593", "Please? The Alliance could really use more strong, intelligent, women pilots... such as you. You can't turn your back on them!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_83a93ead", "(Salute) Requesting a mission, sir!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_83c26b3", "That TIE Veteran was nothing.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_8464e33e", "Without a doubt, my friend. Return to me whenever you are ready for training.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_85384000", "So you are interested? Or... you aren't interested?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_866deb6e", "I want to join the Rebellion!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_86cd4fa8", "We'll upload a suite of navigation points that are likely candidates. The transport pilot is no slouch - he will be trying to get back to friendly territory as soon as he can. From what I heard, they're pretty badly damaged.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_87a8cca7", "How will I know this pilot?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_88620d24", "It's a multi-pocket bandolier.  It'll help you keep your things organized.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_8a323048", "Hmm. Well, I'm pretty sure we can set you up with a loaner from the Alliance. Here... I'll transfer codes for a basic Z95 to your personal datapad. Let me know how she flies. Are you ready for your first assignment?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_8b43cee4", "Just try to make it back here in one piece, okay?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_8b760dea", "Give me another chance!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_8bc574b8", "You're one in a million. You know that? Just keep it up. There will be more opportunities to use your heroism in the future. Check back with me after you catch some rest, okay?  And hey, I think you've earned the right to wear this.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_8c272224", "I am interested in starfighter survival tactics.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_8c2c48a7", "Where is this route?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_90377ed4", "Affirmative!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_90422eb5", "Good luck.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_908b3b7a", "What do you want me to do about it?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_90ec63e0", "Yes, I do.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_90f5b9d8", "Make sure you stay in one piece, man!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_92779459", "You got it, babe.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_940c893e", "They tend to do that, my friend. We are at WAR with the Empire. Do you understand?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_941b03d0", "Nothing special.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_942f0b27", "The control device holds the command codes for your starter ship. The Alliance has a handful of these banged-up Z95's hidden at various starports. When you go to the starport down the street you can use a 'starship terminal' to manage your ship components and launch into space.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_9480f430", "I am interested in droid interface basics.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_948698f", "Oh! I see how it is. You think you're really tough, don't ya?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_94b9286d", "What have you been doing, %NU?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_96595faf", "Most of the grief we've been getting here in Corellia can be traced back to a single operation and a lone commander. Believe it or not... we know right were to find this guy! And, you're gonna bring him down!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_967362c6", "Then get back out there!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_96bda01", "I mean - let's make sure that the actual nav route doesn't cross an Imperial patrol or land in a nest of pirates. Check back with me when you're done.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_9965dc21", "You crossed Nym?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_99dfe276", "Interested? Is there money in it?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_9aa60522", "Let's go!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_9c5aabe", "There were too many of them.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_9ccf9a34", "Spooky. Then you won't mind me giving you your first Alliance pilot skill, eh?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_9cdc2b64", "Take care, buddy!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_9d39bee2", "I am sorry.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_9df39ab2", "(Salute) The Alliance transport has been rescued!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_9f222613", "Maybe this isn't for me.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_9f5447cf", "Alliance HQ already sent word! You blasted those TIE fighters to dust! You wanna share some details?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a0f35e59", "Hi there! You now have all the experience you need to be trained something new.  Which area interests you the most?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a2fa88c1", "Are you sure you want to sign up, honey? It's pretty rough up there.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a3d65155", "Fine. Welcome to the Alliance.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a42932d7", "I will need a starship.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a42bf003", "I'm a RSF Pilot!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a4654330", "(Offer even more details)");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a470f356", "Whatever. Look - Alliance HQ, in their infinite wisdom, have decided to change-up the transport routes here in Corellia. Before we cut loose with all our supply ships, we want you to check out a few select nav points in this system and ensure that the route is safe. Sound good?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a4bd6cd1", "I agree. The Empire is still giving us a lot of trouble here in Corellia. It's a very delicate balance. How do you wanna helping us out by taking a duty mission?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a592576c", "Gonzo! Let's strike back at the infernal Empire. Find four TIE fighters in the Corellia system and destroy them!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a61f252c", "(Still more details...)");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a66b0c40", "I wouldn't call it 'resistance.'");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a7c68d3f", "Oh... well, of course not! The Empire is just grand... wouldn't you say?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a80d9308", "Good luck!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a8e97b79", "You're right! Thanks, and good work! Check back with me later...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_a97e342", "Okay, then - maybe you'll come back when... we're ready for you? Good luck!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_aa03098a", "We have terrible news from Alliance HQ. A refugee convoy was attacked by TIE fighters. Their fighter escort held the TIEs long enough for the transport to escape... but now the transport is lost...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ab2a872b", "Droid programming will help you enhance your starship in battle. Are you interested in this?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ab8b2db5", "You don't say! In that case, we can scrap the new transport route. Alliance HQ is going to have to come up with another plan. Good work, pilot!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_acafcf16", "Good advice.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ad33f74a", "Where do I look?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ae0c01b4", "Hey there! Ready to get started?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_aed27f16", "TIE Fighters tried to kill me!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_af180d19", "They got lucky.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_af95b1e2", "You need me to find it, right?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_afcdcdf", "Oh sure, 'officially neutral' and all that, right?  Just going to let the Empire take over the whole galaxy?  Whatever.  I have no use for you fence-sitters!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_afd8ea50", "No, sir! Again, sir!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b03e852c", "Relax. This ain't the Empire, okay? Lets exact a little revenge. Find four TIE fighters in the Corellia system and destroy them!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b0643db5", "You're going to teach ME?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b17f599d", "I will protect the Alliance transports!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b20c776b", "Alliance HQ wants you to bring down four TIE fighters in the Corellia system. That'll make it clear to the Empire - they are not welcome here!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b282cc98", "That will make them very happy, pilot. Follow the navigation route and protect every Alliance transport that HQ puts under your care. I'll see ya when you're done.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b2b30e20", "Hey, so... the Alliance has asked me to recommend pilots that are ready for more challenge. Evidently something big is going on above planet Lok. Rebel Intelligence is all over it... and they need pilots.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b39049de", "When will you train me?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b3bebc5e", "How do I get there?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b40cd69a", "Haven't I seen you before? I am Kreezo of the Rebel Alliance. Yes - yes, we have met before! Are you still interested in becoming a Rebel fighter pilot?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b40d5e2c", "Are there many Imperials?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b416fca1", "Blast 'em! Alliance HQ says you gotta bring down four TIE fighters, should be a walk in the park for you, right?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b4bce31a", "I am ready, Kreezo.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b4be0022", "Things'd be better if I had a mission.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b4ce2d62", "A magician never reveals his secrets!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b4d7b1cd", "Grounded?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b4da544c", "This is out of my hands. I can't give you any more assignments until you prove your dedication to the cause.  Fight FOR the Rebel Alliance and improve your standing.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b4e22b71", "Get back out there, man! We must not keep the Alliance waiting!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b73cae6e", "I'm just trying to protect you, darling. Are you sure you want to join up with the Alliance? You could get killed!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b756c0a2", "(Wrap it up)");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b8281380", "Not quite yet, %NU.  I just need for you to complete one more assignment.  Are you up for it?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b897f5e1", "I'm on it!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b975d6db", "I don't know how best to describe it, really. Just launch into space. Your navigation computer has all of the important locations already loaded. Follow to each nav point and report what you find.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b979a424", "Slow down, there, %NU.  I need to know you can be trusted to complete assignments as they are given.  I'll train you AFTER you've finished doing a couple more things for me.  Now, are you ready to get back to work?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b9ab5e03", "Okay, then. What area of study would you like to focus on?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ba6c97d4", "You're right. There is no excuse.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_baae2f70", "(Salute) The Force be with you.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_baf54d0", "Who is this Lady Viopa?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_bb9e839f", "Hey! So what happened up there?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_bc874dd9", "I really don't mind the Empire.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_bccfa654", "Where was it last seen?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_be7e31b9", "I knew it! In that case, welcome to the Alliance, buddy!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c02ffe47", "A wing of TIE fighters intercepted me.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c19ed115", "You've got your assignment, and the control device for your ship in your datapad.  Go to the Starport and access the terminal to launch into space.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c1b9a6e", "Then what are we waiting for?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c261cfae", "No problem.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c2e41133", "You almost got me with that one, sweetie! Heh. You're now part of the Rebel Alliance.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c36f7614", "So? So you've got a date with Lady Viopa of Alliance Intel. You think you can handle it?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c3d77bb4", "Expect the rally point to be patrolled by junior TIE cadets. They will be quick to respond if they see you first - so be very careful. Keep your eye out for the veteran TIE fighter pilot, eliminate him, and get back here as soon as you can.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c43ca4c2", "Hmm. Well, I'm pretty sure we can set you up with a loaner from the Alliance. Here... I'll transfer codes for a basic Z95 to your personal datapad. Let me know how she flies.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c477804d", "(Stare blankly.)");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c4e77d66", "(Provide a detailed report)");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c549da6d", "I aborted the mission.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c5b598a2", "Okay, then!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c61a299", "You're breakin' my heart!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c65bb61c", "Well... yeah! I am a very experienced starfighter pilot. I can teach you everything you need to know - provided that you agree to fly for the Rebel Alliance. How does that strike you?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c6891c87", "I will join the Alliance.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c6e25b8f", "Don't abort the missions I give you, sweetie!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c7f0d385", "The starport. It's just a little ways from here. Go back the way you came, head towards the center of town. Take a left when you get out of the slums and you'll head right into the starport.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c85ee89f", "You sure do impress me, sir. You're a great combat pilot. Check back with me any time you are ready for training.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c8cdb11", "A magician never reveals her secrets!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c8fa77b8", "I can't wait!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c903d01a", "Congratulations. You are now rated to fly the Y-Wing starfighter.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c9200f78", "I know that. Try again. Hurry back!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c92d07b4", "Sure. Why not.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_c999ae60", "Let me at 'em!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_cade4505", "The Force is with me.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_cafe8309", "Whoa! Relax, sweetie! I meant nothing by it. Say - if you're really hot for flying starships, I'll set you up. Are you sure you want to join?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_cb506bf8", "My starship? In a datapad?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_cc9fe745", "What do you mean 'safe?'");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ce52466", "You can't upgrade this ship. The Alliance mechanics have welded the gearflaps shut on all of these loaners. You should think about buying your own ship... something you can customize. Are you ready for your first assignment?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_cea58c15", "Ha! Bad luck for them, huh? Glad to see you're still in one piece. Alliance HQ will likely scrap their plans for a new transport route. ");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_cf04e474", "What more do we know of this TIE veteran?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_cfbb506d", "Pirates, Imps, whatever. The old transport route was uncovered by the Empire and we lost a lot of good folks (not to mention their precious cargo). This new route should be more hidden...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d2b22f30", "I won't fail a second time.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d2d0a643", "Nothing, really. She's kinda spooky. Alliance Intel folks generally are, though. Just do your duty and stay out of trouble!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d31da604", "Good. Let's strike back at the infernal Empire. Find four TIE fighters in the Corellia system and destroy them! Sound good?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d36193f9", "Forget it! I'll find someone else!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d390e9dc", "Perfect thing for a strapping fella such as yourself! I'll be your trainer - and you'll be my... killer! How does that sound?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d3ba53db", "Add me to the patrol duty roster, sir!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d47c0f9c", "Sounds like a plan. I'll upload your pilot ID to the escort duty roster. Our transports will comm you in space. Make sure they get to their destinations safely.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d48ff4ca", "You're kidding, right?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d4d02ce5", "HA! ...like a squill in a barrel of Jawa beer! You're a card! Hope you don't get fried out there, my friend!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d6adf516", "Great! You are now a better Alliance pilot!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d731f764", "(Shrug and smile.)");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d74fc3aa", "I don't want to die for the Rebels.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d779178a", "What other targets are in the area?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d828284a", "You got it! Meet the Alliance Intel chief stationed on Lok. Her name is Lady Viopa, and she hangs out in Nym's compound. She'll have work for you when you arrive.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_d9d2746c", "I don't know how you expect to fly for the Rebel Alliance if you don't even have a ship!  Here, I'll add the control codes to your datapad for one of our low-end fighters.  You should upgrade this as soon as possible.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_daea7c31", "This track provides access to special Alliance piloting abilities. Are you interested in this?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_db182750", "Good. Check back with me when you're done.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_dbfb3e78", "What's the order, sir?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_dc243da2", "Done. Fly into Corellia space and follow the nav points. Destroy any hostiles you encounter. Good luck!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_dc649bb3", "I'm on my way!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_dda9e202", "Where should I go now?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_de6d6c6a", "What more do you know of Viopa?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e003aec9", "She's staying with Nym on Lok The Rebellion has made a deal to keep Viopa safe in Nym's compound.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e096316d", "Sounds wizard. Let's go.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e102b38d", "Without question.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e1f8bf59", "This sort of thing is bound to happen. After all it is a WAR, you know!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e2d604a4", "I am more than ready, Kreezo.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e2d918c4", "What happened on your patrol, pilot?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e2e4a27d", "No idea. The comm traffic is a mess. We've got their navigation route, though. I'll upload that to your ship so you can follow their path.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e34abf38", "Well, I'm sorry for that... maybe you'll come back later when you have more time? I hope?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e37282e3", "Standard space-hero stuff.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e3ae7e7c", "Then you get them back!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e3e6b505", "Pirates? What pirates?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e42b260e", "I'm on my way.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e44f1421", "Good! Your job will be to check out the newly appointed Alliance transport route. It's a secret route - so fly casual... and make sure that all nav points check out!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e46d50f4", "So let's hear all the gory details.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e53ac187", "Great! Then, have a wonderful day!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e564c71b", "Am I that obvious? Search for the transport. When you find it - escort it out of the system before the Empire can finish 'em off, okay?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e5a5e513", "I see you've survived!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e66b30af", "Aw. How could you say that? After all I've done for you?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e68af394", "That's the spirit, buddy!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e696787e", "Great! You'll do well, I'm sure.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e6de46a8", "Protecting our escorts is the right thing for me.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e6f57b04", "Call me that again and you die!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e81be890", "I know how you feel. Alliance HQ has plans for a new transport route. They need you to check out a few nav points in Corellia space and ensure that it'll be safe.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e8850b0f", "You don't look like a pilot to me.  There's nothing I can do for you.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e8f4f19d", "I couldn't finish the mission.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_e96daa14", "Our work is not finished, Kreezo.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ec3b34af", "Outstanding! You got it!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ecdd7266", "Dunno. The usual, I guess. Figure they're here because they know the Alliance is setting up operations in Corellia. They can't afford to let us get a foothold in this system.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ef167e72", "Where am I headed?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ef3cb7bd", "No problem. Are you ready for your first assignment?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_efc5edce", "Start by going to the starport. Leave here and head towards downtown. Take a left when you get out of the slums and you'll run right into the starport. When you get there, go inside and look for a 'starship terminal.' Use this terminal to launch your ship.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_effe3ca0", "That's unfortunate. You should really try to keep a firm grasp on what sorta techniques work for ya, and which ones will get ya killed.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_f0f9adc9", "Good luck, pal.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_f11f8879", "Just bring us victory, my friend.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_f2b83a15", "This will enable you to use more exotic, more effective components Are you interested in this?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_f39351f2", "You got it. We'll upload a suite of navigation points to help you. If HQ gets a lock on the transport, you'll be redirected to its position.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_f3b9575d", "Well, then let's give you another chance at it!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_f587dd8b", "Yes. Yes, I would say that.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_f5e65db0", "You don't know me, Kreezo.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_f7ed6410", "Ha! I bet! How about a duty mission then? We have openings in our patrol circuit for pilots who want to clear Corellia of Imperial fighters. There's also a dire need for fighter escorts. The Empire is cracking down on all freighters in this system...");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_f90247ff", "(Offer more details)");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_fa61f5fd", "You betcha!");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_fac12b86", "Sounds perfect.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_fb969128", "Fantastic! We're going to make beautiful music together! Here is your first piloting skill.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_fde91357", "Bring down four TIE fighters. You can stick around to do more damage if they call in reinforcements - but the approved objective is four total targets.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_fe5c41db", "Slow down, there, %NU.  I need to know you can be trusted to complete assignments as they are given.  I'll train you AFTER you've finished doing a few things for me.  Now, are you ready to get started?");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_fe6d50dd", "Good luck, man.");
stringFiles[170].addEntry("s_ff6358f3", "Of course not. You're really gaining quite a reputation around here. Take some time for yourself. Come back here when you're ready to fly again, but in the meantime, check this out...");

stringFiles[171] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_bledsoe_imperial_rescue_target");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_bledsoe_imperial_rescue_target) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_2a121860", "Good! I will make my way to the escape pods. Great work here soldier, I will make sure your commanding officer hears about it.");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_339b706e", "Pardon me, and don't think me rude... afterall I am dutifully thankful for your part in my escape... but I should think it necessary to effect the completion of that escape rather than stand around talking like new recruits at an Imperial gala.");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_5128536b", "There might be some around still.");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_5b99b059", "Finally, took you long enough! For a while there I actually thought these stinking traitors would take me to where ever they were heading. Did you leave any of them alive?");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_715b64d7", "Good work soldier. I'd hate to see all my ground-breaking work fall in to the hands of these Rebel scum. I will make my way to one of the escape pods now. I will also make sure to let your commanding officer know how well you took care of the vermin on this ship.");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_7dbf5a70", "No, they are all taken care of.");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_855a26e7", "Well you have to take care of them then soldier! They are not worth more than a womp rat but twice as annoying. Cleanse this ship of their filthy presence!");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_86216dc2", "What?! They're vermin! If you leave any of them alive, they will breed and spread like the rodents they are. I will make sure to report your insolence to your commanding officer! Now where were those escape pods..");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_8bc64ef3", "Genocide is not my thing doctor. I think our work here is done.");
stringFiles[171].addEntry("s_da7cd509", "Yes...Sir.");

stringFiles[172] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_bronell_neutral_assassin");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_bronell_neutral_assassin) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_12eb211c", "Yes? Yes! I've had enough, goodbye.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_1779cf3b", "Lord Jabba is pleased to hear that the CorSec officer has been eliminated. Let this be a lesson to all who fail to pay their debts to Lord Jabba the Hutt, yes? Are you here to receive your reward, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_249447d6", "Very well. It has been well earned, yes? Yes.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_24dbc07d", "I believe so.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_2972f7c", "Where was Klaatu again?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_2ad476a3", "Naboo, ok.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_382a91bd", "I have no business with you at this time... and by that I mean Lord Jabba the Hutt has no need for me to do business with you at this time. Perhaps in the future, but not now.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_3c2e92a", "Alright, but how do I get to the corvette?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_3e2e8616", "Sorry, I have other things to do. Erase all knowledge of my progress.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_3f04cefb", "Here, take a look at this Research Request.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_3ffc96c6", "He's outside with the shuttle... back behind this building, Lord Jabba's palace! If you succeed in your mission, return to me for your reward, yes? Now hurry!");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_44fa5eb9", "As you wish. Though I do not understand why you'd want to delay, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_465d7ab2", "Here, take a look at this Gambling Debt List.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_469c9070", "A ragtag bunch of pirates has a hideout there, yes? They are mostly known for kidnapping Naboo royalty, but they indulge in gambling from time to time as well. This CorSec officer owes them money, yes? He has quite a gambling problem, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_491ecf2b", "You are back already, yes? You have the documents, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_4a365e4b", "Sorry, you'll have to find someone else. I cannot continue with this mission.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_502c2a8d", "Splendid but hurry, yes? Our magnificent Lord is not known for his patience, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_560a7d6e", "Quiet! I was not done yet, yes? This person is an officer in the Corellian Security Forces and thinks that will protect him, yes? He has incurred debts all over the galaxy, though, and I know a way to find him, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_6333f589", "Let me see that, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_6f1692bf", "Your still here? I thought I made clear time was not to be wasted looking at the dancers in the palace, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_73f00073", "Hmm... you have truly earned your reward, but you do not have room for it in your inventory, yes? Please come back and speak with me after clearing some space, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_76e2b2f6", "Alright, I'll try and get the information we need.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_79855d10", "I'm sorry, I just can't right now. Please erase all records of my progress.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_7d29adc4", "Then maybe you could leave, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_832183d2", "Didn't I just say I have, yes? There are three lowly gangs of pirates, and this CorSec officer owes money to each of them, yes? These pirates can be found on Talus, Naboo, and Lok. Any of them may have documented his whereabouts, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_85bcb083", "Sounds too much like something I'd want no part of, sorry.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_88ef705e", "Our bountiful Lord will be most disappointed by your response, yes? Also, I must take all documents from you that are connected to this business, yes? Yes.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_8c30ea7c", "You there. I must demand your assistance with this mission of utmost importance. You will help, yes? This mission is vital to Lord Jabba and I am only speaking on his behalf. I, of course, get nothing out of this myself. So you will help, yes yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_8c845e29", "Hmm, yes, yes, completely useless. Here's some credits as compensation for you time. Anything else, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_94bc6e8f", "Talus, yes? I mean, Talus?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_969790d9", "Fine, get your smelly self out of here, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_9b8c1f57", "Could you go over the planets and pirates part again?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_a4929123", "Fine, just don't hurt me.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_ad79e41e", "Give me all documents.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_b1e7cb8c", "Excellent! Now hurry my noble warrior, hurry for Bronell...I mean our magnificent Lord Hutt! Yes? Yes.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_b5022ce5", "I am, yes. Hand it over!");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_ba696f5d", "Lok, yes? Bah, look what you did to me.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_bd40a944", "Sorry, I have other things to do.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_bdde1d3a", "You might be right. Fine, I'll get back to it.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_bef20f69", "Yes, indeed. Lord Hutt has a problem with a person who owes more than he could possibly pay, yes? You know what our venerable Lord does to those who can't pay debts, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_c1d18ea0", "Go talk to Klaatu outside behind the palace and give him the travel authorization I provided you with, yes? He will make all the arrangements. If you succeed in your mission, return to me for your reward. Now hurry, who knows when the corvette will move on, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_c5ae9239", "On my way to check one of the other hideouts.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_c79b5a4b", "Splendid, let me see. Hmm, no, no...wait, yes! There he is! So that's where his ship is, yes? You must intercept this corvette and arrange his demise immediately, yes? If you succeed in this, Lord Jabba has allowed me to reward you generously, yes? Yes!");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_ce8f15d7", "Good, now hurry, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_d27dcffe", "I had some other documents I came across.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_d62f7d90", "Depends, tell me about this mission?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_dc53bb6d", "Oh, well I could use your help, but I see that you're already busy. Come back when you've finished your current task and maybe we can do business.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_dcf8e793", "Oh? Let me see that, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_e1341a5c", "I learned of a third option from an informant... well, a former informant. While his tongue was still attached, yes? The Canyon Corsairs on Lok have also dealt with this gambling maniac, yes? They might have the correct information as well, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_e9499aa6", "Let me see. Hmm, yes, yes...No! Did you even read this? Oh well, guess I have to compensate you for your time, yes? Now check the other hideouts!");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_ecc1d177", "Farewell, maybe I'll never see you again, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_eece1fb8", "I don't know... have you?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_f5dcf8ec", "Was that a question or a statement?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_f7203ef1", "On Talus resides the despicable gang of pirates called Binayre. Scum they are, yes? Well below our notice normally, but this CorSec officer owes them a small amount of money. Perhaps they have information on CorSec operations that would tell us his location, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_f8c79456", "Our bountiful Lord will be most disappointed by your attitude, maybe a bit too disappointed, yes? I'll be forced to take all documents from you that relate to this endeavor, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_f9bdde1d", "Bah! Fine. Talus, Naboo, or Lok... which planet, yes?");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_fecfb00f", "Here, take a look at this Purchase Request Form.");
stringFiles[172].addEntry("s_ffc988c3", "No, not just yet. I'll be back.");

stringFiles[173] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_bruce_neutral_destroy");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_bruce_neutral_destroy) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_14963f17", "Let me take a look.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_1ffa4e4b", "Hmmm... I could use yer help, but I can see that ye are already busy. Come back when ye have finished yer current task and maybe we can do business.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_20f0bac1", "Knew ye wuld come around. Now hurry!");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_21328697", "Whut the?! Ye giving up now, we almost done! If yer quit, I have ta take everything ye gotten up to dis time from ye.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_224ca617", "He be outside behind the palace! Come talk to me if ye destroy dat ship and get yer reward. Now hurry!");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_269fe8a6", "Culd be interesting me suppose. Here's some creds fer it.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_283ba480", "Sorry, I give up, this is taking too long.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_28c81b92", "Ye haven't left yet? Whut ye still doing here?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_2972f7c", "Where was Klaatu again?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_2a75ee0f", "Yay! Jabba is happy with me... er... I mean ye. Right... ye. Dem CorSec and dat ship be destroyed! Good, good! Want yer reward?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_33849d1f", "Oy, who'd a known that slimeball could run so fast... maybe Jabba can give me some big work and I'll make me money back. Hey, go away... can't you see I've got me own worries.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_369d526d", "Sorry, this sounds like something I can't do right now.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_3bfca8b3", "I was wondering if these other documents would be of use?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_3da0d379", "Fantalistic! Now ye just need to fly up to that corvette and make it go boom! Take dis here travel form and show to Klaatu outside behind the palace. He'll hook ye up! Destroy dat ship den come see me for yer reward!");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_3e583623", "Here's a document labeled 'CorSec Destruction Code Sequences'.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_40e26fa7", "Yea. Okay. Dis here be your reward. Ye like?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_47a242b", "Alright, what about the second location?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_4af1600f", "Yea. Only ye no have room to take it. Best that ye make some room and den come back.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_557298a9", "Not yet? Ye be a strange one. Why not take dis reward sooner rather den later? Stange one.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_574dc833", "Me, eh? Well how can I help?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_5d72e2a5", "Well on the planet of Naboo, sum of dem Maulers have been planning a raid against dem CorSec. Jabba think dem may have whut we wunt and haven't used it yet. Dey no wunt to give it up though so go dere and take it from dem. It sure ta be in dem camp sumwhere.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_65c58ea3", "Well dat be the tricky part. Dere be these destruct sequences out dere somewhere but dey could be at any of three locations, me information wus not too specific. Me need ye to find it.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_65ecd99d", "Alright, I will try and find the sequence.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_68f1fe27", "Well fork dem over!");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_77455336", "Yeah I'm sorry, I can't do this.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_77928d48", "Alright, I'll take care of it.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_7a77d96c", "Yes and hurry, we're running out of time here!");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_7e619810", "So I guess I'll have to go and check the other places.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_7f2cdc", "Right, what's the third location?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_7f918abd", "Well if all else fails, on the dreaded planet of Dathomir, there be dem Nightsisters. Jabba once sent a traitor to one of dem slave camps, since he wus a bit of a womanizer. Wonderful sense of humor he has Jabba. Anyway, the traitor probably dead but he had some information dat may have been wut we want and the Sisters may have it now.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_8bd8c49d", "Could you repeat the information on the locations?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_90650308", "Maybe this 'The Edict of Jiaan' could be useful?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_9dae0fe3", "So what's the plan?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_a2329c74", "Not just yet. I'll come back.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_a4929123", "Fine, just don't hurt me.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_a5cbd64e", "Durnit! Dis not be good.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_ad79e41e", "Give me all documents.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_adbdb619", "Great, hurry and good look to ye! Come back if you blow up dat ship and get yer reward. Don't come back if ye fail.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_b6988a9c", "Sorry, in a rush. Maybe next time.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_bb218f7b", "Well Jabba have a strong suspicion dem Rogue CorSec culd have dis here information. Dey after all former employees. Maybe dem stupid CorSec forget to change the sequence.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_c58b6642", "Marvellous! Time is of essence here so if ye wunt, ye can check back after ye found one of the documents to see if dat be it. Or wait until ye have all three, as long as yer fast.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_c866c945", "Not sure if dis any useful. I suppose me have to pay ye for yer troubles in getting it though.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_ca5faf1b", "I've found some documents that may be it.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_cfec2ce3", "Ah, yer back! Any luck?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_d036761d", "Fine, I'll do it.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_d3f9d91d", "Not sure about this one, it's 'Bounty Hunter Means and Methods'.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_d6cf9803", "Okay, what's the first possible location?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_d725eac", "Fine! Get outta here and don't come back, ye here?");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_dc1051b", "Something came up, can't do it right now.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_dea1004c", "Have ye been out drinkin? Okay me go over it again.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_e61c9f7a", "Yes, I'd like my reward please. I've earned it.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_ed430e90", "Didn't take ye fer a quitter, guess I wus wrong. Dis not good news, not at all. I'm gonna take all everything about dis from ye. Ye keep nuthin.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_f7dab98e", "G'day! Jabba has me do a most urgent mission and me need yer help! I heard yer name whispered in the palace so me think, dis here fellow wuld be perfect fer dis kinda job.");
stringFiles[173].addEntry("s_f87d1b5b", "Well we have us a traitor who gave up important stuff to dem CorSec about Jabba. Dis stuff is, as me speak, being transported on a corvette. We must make dis here ship blow up before it reach its destination.");

stringFiles[174] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_colonel_imperial1");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_colonel_imperial1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_157ef5eb", "I... don't like this at all. I'll have to pass.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_180bc00a", "Very well. It is sad to hear.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_18d01770", "You have returned. I am glad to see you are still well. What have you discovered? Do you have any documents? Or do you need information?");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_1944f1e6", "Yes, I will.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_1b0601e4", "I think I've found what you're looking for.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_21550a19", "A reward? Definitely. Hand it over.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_28586fd5", "Very well.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_2a8874c3", "Then again, I'd rather not help. Sorry.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_2a973e2d", "This news pleases me. Please be careful and return safely. Oh, and if you succeed in this mission, I can offer you a reward. Though a true soldier of the Empire would desire no such thing.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_2f26b4c4", "I still have documents for you.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_33656cd3", "Indeed. I need those documents as soon as possible. Please find them quickly.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_33f4749f", "Ah, not now. I could use your help, but I see that you're already busy. Come back when you've finished your current task and maybe I'll have something for you.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_3b10534d", "We've discovered that a group of ex-CorSec agents on Corellia have been monitoring local activities of certain Rebel Alliance groups. While we don't know the exact reasons behind this, we do know that these former members of the Corellian Security Forces have turned to a life of crime and are not helping the Alliance. The Empire typically leaves them alone, but we now need to find out if they have information about the abduction of Dr. Bledsoe. Go and search their base.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_3c50285d", "Excellent! What have you found on your mission?");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_4002f794", "You must travel to the Emperor's Retreat and present your ticket to the shuttle pilot there. He will help you to intercept the Corellian corvette so that you may continue your mission. If your mission is successful and you desire a reward, return and speak with me afterwards.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_41506e32", "I need more information on the Rogue CorSec base.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_458f152b", "I need more information on the Woolamander Palace.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_4fd6735c", "I need more information about this ordeal.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_5200ce80", "I'm not interested. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_56fe6ddb", "The Woolamander Palace can be found on Yavin IV. I do not know the history of the place. We have received several reports that affiliates of the Alliance still operate from its ruins from time to time. It can be found in the central area of Yavin IV. I don't have anymore information.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_5bc1d51e", "Show the Prisoner Transport Order.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_5c4b594c", "I see you have returned. Are you in need of additional assistance?");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_5dad02b", "I don't want to do this anymore. Find someone else and erase all records of my progress.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_60c4f974", "Where do I go?");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_61a71fef", "I'm taking my leave to board the corvette.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_684f9e1", "I cannot help you, citizen. Please try elsewhere.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_74edd9cc", "And that is your choice. I am disappointed..");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_7a2a05c4", "In that case, I'll continue.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_80d92f17", "Are you sure? Your progress will be erased from our database, all remaining documents will be taken from you, and the travel authorization will be revoked.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_81ff39a5", "I thought as much. Very well, take it. You did earn this, though I'd hoped the honor of serving the Empire would have been enough.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_8e06b4e8", "Ah yes. I would hand it over, as you ask, but you don't have room to carry it. So you'll have to clear some space before you may take it.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_979b7ad4", "It never ends... it never ends. I must admit, though, that I'll be relieved when my part in this is finally over. Coordinating the release of Imperial hostages has its challenges but also a high level of stress. After my retirement, I think I'll get a little place on Naboo near Kaadara.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_a128e067", "Looks like I have more to do.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_a342e94c", "Very well. I shall continue. We have intercepted faint transmissions discussing Dr. Bledsoe's transfer but have been unable to determine where they are they are holding him. This is where you come in. There are three locations at which we believe you might find prisoner transfer orders for Dr. Bledsoe. These three locations are the Woolamander Palace on Yavin IV, the Rogue CorSec base on Corellia, and the Droid Engineer cave on Lok.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_a38773c1", "I'm not sure. Maybe I'll come back later.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_a5591c27", "I accept this mission.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_a5e941d1", "Dr. Bledsoe is the Empire's expert in the areas of disease and medicine. Unfortunately, he was abducted by Alliance terrorists. There's no telling what those ruthless animals will do to him but his existence is extremely important to the Empire's efforts. He needs to be returned. Will you help us?");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_adecb4e7", "Hmm.. this information is very interesting. However, these are not the orders I had been looking for. I will take these off your hands, though, and reward you for finding them.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_bcecb501", "Very well. You have been released from this mission. You understand that I must remove from you all documents and data connected to this mission. Standard operating procedure.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_bd942cc0", "Excellent. Good luck to you.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_c2f40cdd", "Show the Purchase Order Form.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_c48932d", "Your service to the Empire has been adequate. I suppose a reward is in order, if you desire one?");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_d5ab67dd", "I don't want to do this anymore. Erase all records of my progress.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_d630c3b6", "I am nearing the end of my days serving as the main point of contact in regards to Imperial officers who find themselves in a hostage situation. Every mission is important. As possibly my last, this one proves to be most difficult.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_dc4a40d6", "Exactly... your reward is serving the Empire. But should you change your mind, simply speak with me again.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_dd109d64", "That's fine. I resign.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_df607c49", "I'm listening.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_e6e45415", "Finally! We now know his whereabouts. He has been moved to a Corellian corvette within deep space. I need an Imperial soldier I can trust to go there and rescue the doctor. Ah...You! You are that soldier. Take this item to the shuttle pilot at the Emperor's Retreat. He will help you to intercept the Corellian corvette with Dr. Bledsoe. If your mission is successful I will probably be able to offer you a reward. If you desire one. Either way, I wish you luck in this endeavor.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_e6ef1e0c", "Show the Research Request.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_ec42069a", "Very well. We have intercepted faint transmissions discussing Dr. Bledsoe's transfer but have been unable to determine where they are they are holding him. This is where you come in. There are three locations at which we believe you might find prisoner transfer orders for Dr. Bledsoe. These three locations are the Woolamander Palace on Yavin IV, the Rogue CorSec base on Corellia, and the Droid Engineer cave on Lok.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_f2177029", "I need more information on the Droid Engineer cave.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_f769f479", "I am glad to hear of it.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_fc068f1e", "This cave was established by a crazed droid engineer and served as a place to operate on his droids, making them lethal killing machines. What the Alliance is doing there is beyond my comprehension. The cave can be found on Lok in the heart of the volcano. He was mad, indeed.");
stringFiles[174].addEntry("s_ffa3808c", "Oh, show me the ones you still have.");

stringFiles[175] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_crowley_rebel1");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_crowley_rebel1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_16205aba", "What exactly have you found?");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_1b28b4c", "There is hope yet. Good luck on your mission.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_2373d61a", "Lt. Lance at the Rebel hideout on Corellia is waiting to meet you. He will provide transportation which will enable you to intercept the stolen Corellian corvette. After you've victoriously completed your mission, return to me for a reward.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_2621fdc0", "Rumor is that a group of Cobral thieves have stolen some important documents from the Empire. This could well include the information I'm looking for. If so, it's in their hideout on Rori.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_298e244f", "Where do I go again?");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_2c449c28", "I suppose I could use your help, but I see that you're already busy. Come back when you've finished your current task and maybe you can still help.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_2f26b4c4", "I still have documents for you.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_36e1dfe9", "I am. Thank you.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_397c5f6d", "Excellent! This is exactly the information we've needed! We now know where the Corellian corvette is. You'll need to speak with Lt. Lance at the Rebel Alliance hideout on Corellia. He will provide transportation which will enable you to intercept the stolen Corellian corvette. When you get to the corvette, it must be destroyed before it hits Centerpoint Station near Corellia. Once that has been accomplished return to me for a reward. Now go see Lt. Lance on Corellia.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_3bd032cd", "I see. Which documents do you have for me?");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_44a0326c", "It is a pleasure to reward you for such a triumphant mission.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_4fa93758", "What am I looking for again?");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_59f5cee6", "Is there anything I can do to help?");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_710a8214", "I found this Imperial Memorandum.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_71aabcdc", "Hope has been uplifted in me by you. Be swift and come back safely with the information we need.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_729d86e2", "You've done an outstanding job! When I heard that the corvette was destroyed, I was ecstatic. Are you here for your reward?");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_74a0348d", "No thanks. I'm not interested in doing this.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_762ce016", "A pity. I am disappointed but will find another to replace you.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_7cfd3686", "I found this Ship Preparation Document.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_7ed78a88", "Many who have been taken to the Imperial Prison on Dathomir have never been seen again. It is a dangerous and forbidding place. Rumor is that the surviving crew of this corvette is incarcerated there. Travel to this dangerous planet and infiltrate the prison. Search for any information you can find.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_823e1fa", "No, I'm not yet ready for it.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_84bd3f49", "One of our own Corellian corvettes. Unthinkable. The Empire has crafted a diabolical political maneuver. They've stolen a Corellian corvette and are filling it with explosives. They intend to send it hurtling into Centerpoint Station near Corellia. The plan being to make the Rebels look both foolish and dangerous at the same time. We must stop them before they complete their horrible plan.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_908f0d55", "Good luck, young recruit. Return in victory and be rewarded. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_9dc63a4b", "Unfortunately, this isn't the information needed for our mission. However, any information is good information. I will reward you for this.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_a128e067", "Looks like I have more to do.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_a4965b23", "I see you have returned. Have you found what we're looking for?");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_a539245b", "I see. Well, whenever you're ready, just come talk to me.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_a5591c27", "I accept this mission.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_aec5e53e", "Tell me about the Cobral hideout on Rori.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_b0bbc0c3", "I'm off to meet our contact on Corellia.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_b155820c", "Excuse me a minute, I'm awaiting important orders about an upcoming... well, I can't really reveal anything more at this time. But I must remain at full readiness. Not a moment should be wasted when the word is given.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_b30bd73c", "Yes, I did.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_b4b735ef", "That's okay. I cannot continue.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_b6a784f4", "Er... maybe I'll do it. Or at least think about it.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_bcc53c45", "I am surprised to see you here. Are you in need of more information?");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_c03449c4", "A pity, indeed. You have been released from the mission.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_c55f8e77", "I've much to do... I'm afraid I don't have time to spare unless it involves urgent Rebel business.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_c6392194", "Tell me about the Imperial Base.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_cb6caf3", "That is sad news, but I will do so. It will be difficult to replace you. I'll have to retrieve all documents and data gathered for this mission from you. Sorry, but it's required.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_d3c9d7bc", "Um... while I'd like nothing more than to give you your reward, you do not have room for it at the moment. Please make some space and then talk to me again.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_d4a6b26", "I found this Paid Time Off (PTO) Request.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_d5084988", "I cannot continue with this mission. Please erase my progress from your records.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_da09e61c", "Indeed. You'll need to find the information as quickly as possible.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_dd846d25", "You need to find a document which details the location of the Corellian corvette. Which location do you need more information on?");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_df8ea53", "Not interested.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_e77661bc", "Hmm... Indeed. You seem capable enough to help us in this endeavor. We must find the location of that Corellian corvette. We believe it to be somewhere in deep space and thus harder to find and safer in case anything goes wrong. Based on intel gathered, I know of three places where some information about the location of that corvette might be found. Those being  the Imperial Base on Lok, the Cobral hideout on Rori, and the Imperial prison on Dathomir.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_eb5ae08", "Tell me about Dathomir Prison.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_f26df06d", "I'm sorry to hear that. Very well, we'll continue on without you.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_fa42cc8d", "We have reason to believe that Imperial General Otto, stationed at the Imperial base on Lok, may be supplying the explosives being used on the corvette. General Otto is known to be fairly careless, so it would not be surprising if the information you seek was in an unsecured crate or desk somewhere. Seek out his base and return with any information you find.");
stringFiles[175].addEntry("s_fb051f63", "Are you certain? Very well. But your progress will be erased, any remaining documents will be confiscated, and the travel authorization will be revoked. If you change you mind and decide to try again, you'll have to start from the beginning.");

stringFiles[176] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_ian_rebel_rescue_target");
stringFiles[176].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_ian_rebel_rescue_target) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[176].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[176].addEntry("s_2960a6e2", "Adar Tallon put together a plan for us. We couldn't have done it without him.");
stringFiles[176].addEntry("s_3764c8de", "Ah, I should have known. Adar is as competent as he is brave. Excellent work. I know of a Rebel safe haven that's not too far from here. I'll take an escape pod to there. Thank you again.");
stringFiles[176].addEntry("s_4f0f61e", "Er... hmmm. That doesn't sound much like the Adar Tallon I know. Um well... anyway, I know of a Rebel safe haven that's not too far from here. I'll take an escape pod to there. Er... yes. Thank you again.");
stringFiles[176].addEntry("s_7ed61042", "I'm glad to see you guys. I've been trying to work out a escape plan ever since they got me on this vessel but they have kept a close eye on me. How did you find me here?");
stringFiles[176].addEntry("s_9447b2d6", "I'd like nothing more than to hear of your adventures getting onto this ship, but now's not the time. Let's get off this thing first.");
stringFiles[176].addEntry("s_9b4d81d1", "We asked that coward Adar Tallon for help, but he refused. So we did it on our own.");

stringFiles[177] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_imperial_pilot");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_imperial_pilot) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_1a71d76e", "Um... nothing. Nevermind.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_1ab00f5e", "[Tell him about your mission]");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_37545a64", "I think I heard about that one recently... some Rebel intel was discovered recently and word of it managed to cross my path. A Corellian CR-90 corvette, I believe. I think I can help you, but the transportation I can provide only has room for 10 or less. You'll need to reduce your group size and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_3fa1e397", "I see, well I wouldn't dally if I were you. Might want to move along.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_4044790f", "Well, I'd like to help you, but the transportation I can provide only has room for 10 or less. In addition to that, I'm only authorized to transport those of Imperial standing. You'll need to adjust your group and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_500c4dc0", "I think I heard about that one recently... some Rebel intel was discovered recently and word of it managed to cross my path. A Corellian CR-90 corvette, I believe. I think I can help you. Once on the corvette, you'll have a limited amount of time to complete your mission. Be sure to finish and escape in less than an hour.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_62aa5014", "Good, when can we go?");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_6cca850b", "Really. Where would you hear that, I wonder. Just out of curiosity, any particular blockade runner? ");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_7c51b25", "Well, I'd like to help you, but the transportation I can provide only has room for 10 or less. You'll need to reduce your group size and then speak with me again");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_8bb955f8", "As you say, nothing.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_a7ad2e69", "I hear you can help me intercept a Rebel blockade runner?");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_b5aa0f29", "I suppose it's your choice. But failing to fulfill your mission won't reflect well when your service to the Empire is being considered.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_d5421c5c", "I think I heard about that one recently... some Rebel intel was discovered recently and word of it managed to cross my path. It was a Corellian CR-90 corvette, I believe. I think I can help you, but the transportation I can provide only has room for 10 or less. In addition to that, I'm only authorized to transport those of Imperial standing. You'll need to adjust your group and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_d553beb4", "I've changed my mind, and I'm leaving.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_db4a97a9", "I think I heard about that one recently... some Rebel intel was discovered recently and word of it managed to cross my path. It was a Corellian CR-90 corvette, I believe. I think I can help you, but I'm only authorized to transport those of Imperial standing. You'll need to adjust your group and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_dd163c95", "Well, I'd like to help you, but I'm only authorized to transport those of Imperial standing. You'll need to adjust your group and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_e1b151c2", "Greetings citizen. What brings you to this exclusive retreat at which you probably have no legitimate business?");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_e84669ef", "Right. Well, good luck with whatever you're trying to do.");
stringFiles[177].addEntry("s_fbc421e2", "Eager to go... good. Let's get things started. Let me see your authorization, and we'll go from there.");

stringFiles[178] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_imperial_prisoner");
stringFiles[178].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_imperial_prisoner) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[178].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[178].addEntry("s_b3de17b8", "No time to talk... I'm getting off this ship.");
stringFiles[178].addEntry("s_e7ffc2e8", "About time! Thought command had forgotten about me or something...");

stringFiles[179] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_imperial_prisoner_02");
stringFiles[179].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_imperial_prisoner_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[179].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[179].addEntry("s_9b0874b1", "Good work soldiers! Knew I could count on the Empire's finest to get me out of here.");
stringFiles[179].addEntry("s_a8dab33a", "Time to get off this ship. Thanks again!");

stringFiles[180] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_neutral_pilot");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_neutral_pilot) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_18d816d4", "Hey, no worries to me. Good luck explaining your cowardice to Jabba... assuming you really were doing this for him. [laughs]");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_1a71d76e", "Um... nothing. Nevermind.");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_1ab00f5e", "[Tell him about your mission]");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_1e10bbe3", "If you have to run around out here, don't touch anything! I'm dealing with some highly sensitive equipment in this area and don't want your clumsy fingers breaking something.");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_4fb4580f", "I hear you can help me intercept a CorSec Corellian corvette?");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_62aa5014", "Good, when can we go?");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_6423c2d5", "Well, I could normally help you, but the transportation I can provide only has room for 10 or less. You'll need to reduce your group size and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_801d58df", "Whoa... hold on there. Not so fast. First I need to know you have proper authorization for this... I'm willing to help you, but I've gotta know this is legit. Jabba'd have my head if I started providing transportation to just anyone claiming to be on some mission. You got a travel authorization form?");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_ba55259a", "Good. You'd only be in my way.");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_c4c8b476", "Hmmm... reminds me of some information I overheard recently. Don't you worry about where I heard it! Just be glad that I did, because I think I can help you. Oh, something you should know - after you get to the corvette, you'll have an hour to conclude your business. After an hour, it's too late. Game over. Mission failed.");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_d553beb4", "I've changed my mind, and I'm leaving.");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_f0008c9b", "Whatever. Try to leave more quietly than you arrived.");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_f2d8c3c4", "Hmmm... reminds me of some information I overheard recently. I might be able to help you, but the transportation I can provide only has room for 10 or less. You'll need to reduce your group size and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_facfb7c0", "Oh, sorry. I'll be going then.");
stringFiles[180].addEntry("s_fc033618", "Me? And just how exactly would I do that? Wait... wait. Don't go. Why do you want to do something like that?");

stringFiles[181] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_neutral_prisoner");
stringFiles[181].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_neutral_prisoner) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[181].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[181].addEntry("s_940601d4", "Phew, I thought Jabba was going to leave me to rot. I owe ye one mate!");
stringFiles[181].addEntry("s_fa08a772", "Later mate... I'm getting off this ship.");

stringFiles[182] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_neutral_prisoner_02");
stringFiles[182].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_neutral_prisoner_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[182].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[182].addEntry("s_169c1160", "I'm getting off this ship, and when I do, don't go sayin' anything to Jabba. I aim to talk to him myself.");
stringFiles[182].addEntry("s_941cfab3", "About time you showed up. For a second I thought that slug coundn't have cared less if I was going to prison or not. Oh you're not here for me?! This is not the last Jabba has heard of me.");

stringFiles[183] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_pashna_rebel1");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_pashna_rebel1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_1729866a", "I've decided to abort the mission. Please erase all records of my progress.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_1cce61b2", "Well done. This is exactly the information we needed. Hmm... this Imperial commander is worse than expected. He must definitely be eliminated. So much so that our primary concern has changed. First priority is now to assassinate this Imperial commander. Take this travel authorization to the Rebel Alliance hideout on Corellia. Speak with Lt. Lance there and he'll give you more instructions. If you prevail, return to me for your reward.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_2534c3e3", "Tell me more about the Geonosian Bunker.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_26d40ca6", "Tell me more about Fort Tusken and why any information would be there.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_278c1c25", "Not yet. I need more information about the locations I'm to search.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_29542d1b", "That is very unfortunate to hear. I hope to find someone else to help us. I'll have to take all mission related documents from you. I'm sure you understand, of course.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_2a4d0c46", "You reward is richly deserved, but you seem to have no room for it. Please clear some space and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_2be3fa16", "I am distressed. I hope to find a replacement.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_2d18a202", "Are you sure? I'll have to erase all progress you've made, take all remaining documents you've found, and revoke the travel authorization.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_2f26b4c4", "I still have documents for you.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_2f662226", "I see that you have returned. But why? My concern for our mission grows more by the day.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_32abdf15", "I can't do this anymore. I have to resign from the mission.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_36cb0506", "No, maybe another time. Good bye.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_436d636d", "That sounds like a problem. I wish I could help, but really I don't care.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_47eb05e", "No. I have no further instructions for you. You'll need to present your travel authorization to Lt. Lance at the Rebel Alliance hideout on Corellia. If you succeed in your mission, return to me for your reward.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_49437190", "My nerves have been eased. Please hurry and return safely.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_5b812563", "Thank you again. Without your help, there would have been no end to the havoc that Imperial monster would have sown. Well done.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_60c4f974", "Where do I go?");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_615637f6", "No, not yet. Maybe later.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_697542b9", "Indeed. Try to find those documents as quickly as possible.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_6992624d", "I am heading to the Corellian corvette. Anything else?");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_7384b0d4", "I see. Such apathy is what holds our efforts back from true success. But then, I suppose the idea of assassinating another person can be difficult to accept. I understand your reservations.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_73f241bd", "In fact, I do. Before we take any measure of action, I need more information regarding this Imperial commander, his background. I can't issue an assassination without knowing he, without a doubt, warrants such a demise. I have reason to believe that such information exists at one of three places: Fort Tusken on Tatooine, a Geonosian laboratory on Yavin IV, or the Mokk stronghold on Dantooine. Can you see to this?");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_77da0881", "You are one of us, therefore I can trust you with this information. It seems that one of our Corellian corvettes has been boarded and seized by a ruthless Imperial commander. This Imperial commander is bent on guiding the ship toward Tralus and crashing it into our base there. My first priority is to retake the ship before it crashes into our base. And second is to... well... is to assassinate the Imperial commander responsible for this threat.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_7cd62c6d", "In that case, I'll still continue.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_89df7355", "Which location would you like more information about?");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_8a5c56ae", "Whenever you're ready, let me know.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_8b325a7c", "Show Recall Notice.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_8f4b486e", "Indeed. Hopefully, someone will come along to help us with the situation.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_9463a903", "You found the documents?");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_98df29e5", "Tell me more about the Mokk stronghold on Dantooine.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_a128e067", "Looks like I have more to do.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_a1ce5a7c", "A fairly new discovery, that one. It is said that the Empire has been conducting secretive experiments there with the help of the Geonosians. Possibly involving biological weapons. The laboratory can be found on Yavin IV in the northwestern part of the planet. I don't have much more information about the place.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_a5591c27", "I accept this mission.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_aa504b9e", "I think I've found something...");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_aaee7ac8", "Go to the Rebel Alliance hideout on Corellia. Seek Lt. Lance who will accept your travel authorization and allow you to board a starship which intercept the Imperial commander on the Corellian corvette. After the Imperial commander has been eliminated and you've escaped from the corvette, I will have your reward ready.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_b0c99345", "Mmm. This isn't the correct document, however, we can still use it in our research and in our efforts against the Empire. I'll reward you for recovering them.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_b89af325", "Be that as it may, good-bye.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_ba7150b1", "Yes, I will help you.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_bb2081d2", "Show Imperial Dossier.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_bbd30f60", "You couldn't have come at a more distressing time, my friend.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_c26ad0e8", "You have returned! I am glad to see you well. Have you found the documents I sent you out to retrieve?");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_cb13589", "Yes, please. Thank you.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_cc2ec42b", "I am disappointed. However, I wish you well on your endeavors.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_d3412303", "What seems to be the problem?");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_dbef483d", "I have some serious... and unfortunate... business for the Rebellion that demands my attention. Forgive me, but I can't speak with you right now.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_e10e18f5", "Do you need any help with this situation?");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_e92b0e11", "An Imperial force led by this Imperial commander was sent to Fort Tusken not long ago. Before he received his current rank, actually. We don't know why his force was there, though we speculate that they intended to research the Sand People living there. Or maybe attempt to broker some sort of deal with them. We do know it went badly and much of the Imperial force was obliterated by the Tusken Raiders. Seek out anything that might have been left behind during their retreat. ");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_ecc372ff", "Oh hmmm... I could really use your help, but I see that you're already busy. Come back when you've finished your current task and perhaps I'll still need your assistance.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_eccf8e31", "Good. Return to your duties, soldier.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_ed0270a5", "That Imperial Commander must be stopped, but I'm not yet convinced that killing him is the only option. He's violent and ruthless and definitely a major threat, but assassinating him seems to lower us to his level. But perhaps I'm being naive... ");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_f62f461c", "Show Prisoner Transfer Orders.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_f7e9bbb3", "Good luck with that. I'm not interested in getting involved.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_fd5fb0cf", "It was an unfortunate business, but it is at last at an end. I thank you for your part in this. Would you like your reward?");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_fe36e67a", "I don't have much information regarding the Mokk stronghold other than the fact that the Mokk are a Dantari tribe. The stronghold can be found on Dantooine around the northwestern edge of the planet. The Imperial commander we are investigating was known to have led a search of this stronghold looking for members of the Alliance he believed to have been hiding there.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_fe450b8a", "It probably is best that you go. I must concentrate on the tasks at hand.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_ffa3808c", "Oh, show me the ones you still have.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_ffb796fa", "I am relieved and thankful for your eager assistance. Seek out the documents in the locations I mentioned. If you need more information about any of them, please let me know.");
stringFiles[183].addEntry("s_ffef947e", "Go ahead. I still quit.");

stringFiles[184] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_rebel_pilot");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_rebel_pilot) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_1a003c0e", "Ah no. I hear you can help me intercept a Corellian corvette controlled by the Empire?");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_1a71d76e", "Um... nothing. Nevermind.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_1ab00f5e", "[Tell him about your mission]");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_221a046", "Ah yes, I was briefed about something like that earlier today. It was one of our Corellian CR-90 corvettes, I believe. I'm glad we're going to do something about it. I can definitely help you, but the transportation I can provide only has room for 10 or less. Plus, I'm only allowed to transport members of the Rebel Alliance. You'll need to adjust your group and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_29e528c6", "Ah okay. Good luck with whatever it is you're up to. Come back if I can help. Because... really... I'm totally bored.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_35e19d9c", "What? But this is... oh, I get it. Need to stock up on supplies or something like that. I understand. I'll be here when you're ready.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_4816807a", "Ah yes, I was briefed about something like that earlier today. It was one of our Corellian CR-90 corvettes, I believe. I'm glad we're going to do something about it. I can definitely help you. But we're working against the clock here. Once on the corvette, you'll only have an hour to complete your mission. After that, it's too late.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_52a4b87d", "Eager to go... I like that. Let's get things rolling. First I'll need to see your authorization form...");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_62aa5014", "Good, when can we go?");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_669e781c", "I am so bored, they've kept me in here managing flight schedules for what feels like an eternity now. Please tell me you're here with my reassignment orders?");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_6e257495", "No, I'm just passing through.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_7c51b25", "Well, I'd like to help you, but the transportation I can provide only has room for 10 or less. You'll need to reduce your group size and then speak with me again");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_808bd5e8", "Ah yes, I was briefed about something like that earlier today. It was one of our Corellian CR-90 corvettes, I believe. I'm glad we're going to do something about it. I can definitely help you, but I'm only allowed to transport members of the Rebel alliance. You'll need to adjust your group and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_84d3ed4b", "Well, I'd like to help you, but I'm only allowed to transport members of the Rebel alliance. You'll need to adjust your group and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_a538ed35", "Ah yes, I was briefed about something like that earlier today. It was one of our Corellian CR-90 corvettes, I believe. I'm glad we're going to do something about it. I can definitely help you, but the transportation I can provide only has room for 10 or less. You'll need to reduce your group size and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_c1674c48", "Passing through? This is a military base. You should be more... oh, who am I kidding. Just try not to get into trouble, okay.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_e1cf0c03", "Well, I'd like to help you, but the transportation I can provide only has room for 10 or less. Plus, I'm only allowed to transport members of the Rebel Alliance. You'll need to adjust your group and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_e2aa2143", "Oh, there's lots of things I could help you with. And possibly even something like that. What's your story?");
stringFiles[184].addEntry("s_e851c3db", "I've changed my mind, and I think I'll be going.");

stringFiles[185] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_rebel_prisoner");
stringFiles[185].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_rebel_prisoner) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[185].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[185].addEntry("s_4bc31f77", "Thanks again! I didn't dare hope to ever see freedom.");
stringFiles[185].addEntry("s_64954a77", "You're here to rescue us? Thank you! I thought I was done for.");

stringFiles[186] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_rebel_prisoner_02");
stringFiles[186].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_rebel_prisoner_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[186].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[186].addEntry("s_ecc17e1", "I can't wait to get back onto Corellian soil! Thank you!");
stringFiles[186].addEntry("s_fc440e0b", "Am I glad to see you! I hear the Dathomir prison is worse than death.");

stringFiles[187] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_sabol_imperial1");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_sabol_imperial1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_145e07df", "Idiots! Complete and utter idiots! How can I complete my tasks when my commanding officers are nothing but fools! I... Excuse me. I didn't see you standing there. Well... what do you want? I'm very busy as you can see.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_1accfb99", "Whatever. Makes no difference to me. Just let me know when you're ready.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_1bb4597", "I will gladly clear the records of your progress and confiscate all documents pertaining to this mission. I will also immediately report this to my superiors. Run, run far away or I will have my troopers arrest you for treason.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_1dcd7b46", "Disgusting peon. Breathing your air makes my intelligence dwindle into nothingness. Be gone!");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_1e7ac1df", "So? Are you looking for work? Are you that desperate? I suppose I might be thankful but, as a lieutenant of the Empire, I am more suspicious than grateful. Oh fine! I'll tell you but only because I need someone to help me with some... field work. Do you wish to hear me out?");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_1f9dab05", "I'll gladly help eliminate a Rebel officer. Where can I find this document?");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_214dc2b7", "I see that you've returned. I do not tolerate failure. Please tell me you've succeeded. I do not wish to terminate another Imperial soldier this day. Did you find my documents?");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_229f193e", "Indeed. And please do not make a habit of doing so. I have responsibilities to the Empire that must not be delayed.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_29dd35da", "Ugh! This is turning out to be a disaster. About which location do you need more information?");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_2f26b4c4", "I still have documents for you.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_3098b584", "You said something about tasks.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_3565de4e", "Show the Food Order Form.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_3882c2ff", "I need more information on Dantooine's Rebel base.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_3955e427", "I found some documents you may be interested in.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_3e470c42", "Excellent. The document we seek can be found at any one of these locations: at the Rebel base on Dantooine, in the Afarathu cave on Corellia, and on a cruise liner... the Star Tours Tzarina.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_4142af45", "Oh? You realize if you quit I must eradicate all records of your progress, confiscate all remaining mission documents, and revoke the travel authorization. You do realize that, correct?");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_424889c8", "Yes and you're wasting my time just standing there. Find those documents!");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_4c16d4f", "Ah, nothing. My apologies for disturbing you.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_550eac58", "It is not that hard to understand. You need to travel to the Emperor's Retreat and contact the shuttle pilot there. He will then provide you transportation on a starship that will intercept the Alliance Corellian corvette in flight. If you somehow manage to succeed in this mission, return to me for your reward. Now go.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_56ede5d3", "Show the Alliance Transfer Orders.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_5fd624ee", "I wish to quit this mission. Please erase my progress from your records.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_60956d9a", "Perfect! This is the correct document. It provides information location of the high-ranking Rebel officer that the Empire wants assassinated. And for once, I agree... all Rebel officers should be put to death. Here, take this. It authorizes you for transportation that will intercept your target on the corvette. Go to the Emperor's private retreat on Naboo and speak to the shuttle pilot there. If you succeed in eliminating that officer, return to me for a reward. Go now.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_60c4f974", "Where do I go?");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_6289b734", "Leave here before you anger me further. Do not waste my time again!");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_62aa89fb", "I need more information about the Star Tours Tzarina.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_63bcc509", "No, no, no! This is not the right document! Damn those Rebels! I will record your findings in case I can use this data in future operations, and I suppose a small reward is in order. But find the information we need!");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_683de974", "Yes, I'll hear your story.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_69693bca", "Must you interrupt me? I cannot make time for those unwilling to declare allegiance to the Empire. Please leave me be until your loyalties become clearer.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_6f43c8f7", "That's right, I do.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_74947555", "Typical... I actually need some assistance, and they send me someone who can't help me. You're already busy. What was the point. Come back when you've finished your current task and maybe, assuming it's not too late, you could still be of use.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_759b9766", "As much as I'd like to conclude our business, I'm afraid I cannot. You do not have room to carry this reward. Make room and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_7fdf3bed", "Good. I am satisfied to know you are not a coward and are willing to risk your life for the greater good of the Empire. Now, leave.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_930c6037", "I need more information on the Afarathu Sect on Corellia.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_963fc82f", "I have some data on where this document might be found. Let me check my datapad. Hmm... Only three locations. Unfortunately I have nothing that gives us a hint about which might be the one with the document we seek. It could be at any of these places. Are you still interested in assisting me?");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_9caa2380", "And what is keeping you? Go away. I have other important tasks to complete. Go to the Emperor's private retreat on Naboo and speak to the shuttle pilot there. If you somehow manage to succeed in this mission, return to me for your reward. Now go. Hurry.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_a0cc7541", "Show the Signed Alliance Transport Document.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_a11b6dbf", "No, that would be a little too hard.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_a128e067", "Looks like I have more to do.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_a33382c5", "Let me see them.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_a5591c27", "I accept this mission.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_a7150449", "That's what I thought.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_afa2913f", "You've actually succeeded? Unprecedented. This will truly make me look good. What's that? Oh, yes I suppose it makes you look good as well. Maybe a little anyway. I imagine you want your reward?");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_b687be9", "An old Rebel base can be found in the northwest corner of Dantooine. It was supposedly abandoned when the traitors making up the Rebel Alliance opted for a new and, one would assume, better base of operations. My belief is that there are still Rebels making use of the base. Maybe not many, but some. Look there for the information we need.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_b9bb7669", "Yes, of course. I'll check all three if need be.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_ba8810ed", "We have reports that in the recent past some Rebels were fighting warriors from the Afarathu Sect on Corellia. Further intelligence hinted that the Afarathu made off with some important Rebel documents... possibly including the one we need. The Afarathu are slime though. You won't be able to enter their cave without a fight. Regardless, search it well and find the document.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_be293abc", "No, not yet. I'll return.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_c23e3bbe", "The Star Tours Tzarina was a cruise liner. It was struck by an unidentified object while in flight and crashed on Dathomir. Word is that a Rebel spy was on this cruise liner and among his cargo could be the document we seek. You'll have to search for it among the wreckage of the starship. Try the northwestern area of Dathomir. It might be difficult to find, but then this mission isn't for the faint of heart. Find it.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_c36f888", "Oh. Nevermind. I'll continue.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_c8e527a1", "That's fine. I still want to quit.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_d07a7370", "If I had my way, all Rebel officers would be shot on sight. We have spies to tell us everything we need to know about what the Rebel Alliance is planning. The only thing I'd want from a Rebel officer would be their demise.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_d112b46e", "I'm leaving for the Corellian corvette.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_d143f357", "No thanks. I'm going now. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_df8ea53", "Not interested.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_e139d89b", "The only document I'm interested in is the one I commanded you to find! Now where is it?! Fine--I'll humor you. What did you find on your travels?");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_e24b66e7", "I was tired of seeing your face, anyway. I will find someone else who possesses more direction in life.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_ed80aff5", "Take it. I'll... um... I'll be sure my commanders know your part in this. Don't you worry about that. Now go away.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_edb0a2f5", "I can't get myself into this.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_eeb7ec64", "You're back?");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_f60e408a", "I see now that you are a coward. Such a pity.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_f7d97fec", "My superiors have instructed me to eliminate a high-ranking Rebel officer. To do so, I must find an important document belonging to the Rebel Alliance that tells me where to find this officer. As an Imperial lieutenant, I will not participate in such menial tasks. But I am also a woman of great ambition, so I'll not ignore such orders. Instead I prefer to find others who will do my bidding. Are you interested in the task? Mind you, I will not tolerate failure.");
stringFiles[187].addEntry("s_fdcee9b7", "The standard for those allowed into our Imperial ranks has obviously declined. Greatly. I regret the day someone like you was called to server. Leave now.");

stringFiles[188] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_tallon_rebel1");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_tallon_rebel1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_135bf1fb", "Show the Security Override Codes.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_151358aa", "Tell me about the downed Bloodrazor vessel.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_1944f1e6", "Yes, I will.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_2dd3860f", "Ah, you're here, but I see that you're already busy. I could've used your help. Maybe come back when you've finished your current task.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_2f26b4c4", "I still have documents for you.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_303462a1", "I'm sorry to hear of this. I must find someone else to replace you. Good bye.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_3410977a", "Tell me about the Warren.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_3925fbc0", "I forgot the location of our contact.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_3e144812", "No... no. This can't be allowed to... Oh, my apologies. I didn't see you there. More apologies, because another matter urgently demands my attention. Good bye.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_439048cf", "The Empire has conducted many top secret operations at this location. Unfortunately, it has been very difficult to penetrate the defenses of the Warren on our side. We'll need a cunning Alliance operative to enter the establishment and find those codes. The Warren is on Dantooine.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_4440ce87", "I changed my mind.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_49139b6", "Lt. Lance is at the Rebel hideout on Corellia. He will provide you transportation to the Corellian corvette which houses our well-decorated pilot. We need that pilot returned to us as soon as possible. Once your mission has been successfully completed, return to me for a reward.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_4d865d46", "I found several interesting documents and codes.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_57214562", "Tell me about the Imperial Prison.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_57504441", "I have several locations for you... places that, we think, may have the codes. Which location do you need more information on?");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_581c3ef2", "This isn't what I'm looking for. I need the security codes as soon as possible! Bah... well... okay, this is potentially useful information. I'll reward you for finding it. But then you must go find those security codes.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_5f449362", "Ah. I'd like to give this reward to you, but you don't have room to carry it. You'll need to make some space and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_5f61380e", "I cannot thank you enough for your actions. You have not only rescued a pilot of the Alliance, but also a friend. I am pleased to be able to reward you.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_60bce77f", "Reward? Not now. I'll return later.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_60c4f974", "Where do I go?");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_62379ba", "Ahh, the codes! We now have the exact location of the Corellian corvette he is on. Here, take this travel authorization to the Rebel hideout on Corellia and meet with Lt. Lance there. He will provide you transport on a starship which is capable of intercepting the Corellian corvette in deep space. Once your mission has been successfully completed, return to me for a reward. I wish you haste and luck on your journey.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_67499366", "I am leaving for the Corellian corvette.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_71f656a9", "He's still missing. We have no word at all since losing communication with him. The Empire's behind this... I just know it. One of our best pilots too.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_75b09ea1", "Oh? What have you found?");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_7860ffca", "I am curious as why you have returned. Is there some sort of problem?");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_7cea4aed", "Excellent! I wish you luck and haste in your journey. Succeed in your mission and then return to me for your reward. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_80747fa2", "I see. Later it shall be then. Return whenever you are ready.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_8b512dfa", "I see. Which ones do you have?");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_90b2e0c5", "You're our only hope in this situation. You have your orders, soldier.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_93fcbaae", "Your answer is unfortunate. But it is your choice. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_94007006", "There is hope yet! I have been informed that the security override codes I need could be in one of three locations. Based on that information, the places to seek out are a downed Bloodrazor smuggling vessel on Lok, the Imperial Warren on Dantooine and the Imperial Prison itself on Dathomir.  It will be a dangerous journey, filled with obstacles, but justice must be done. We must rescue the officer before he reaches that prison!");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_953e3f2c", "I see you have returned. Have you found the codes I'm looking for? Time is critical.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_9b6fd578", "Show the Imperial Resignation Form.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_a073eacd", "The Bloodrazors are a mysterious band of pirates and criminals. It is said they have access to radar technology that can detect certain unique codes used by ships that approach within their range. This is my hope. The downed Bloodrazor vessel is on Lok though the exact location is unknown.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_a128e067", "Looks like I have more to do.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_a24d8ba0", "Your answer troubles me. Return if you change your mind. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_a5591c27", "I accept this mission.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_abd76541", "I'm sorry to learn of this unexpected turn of events. I suppose I'll have to find someone else. Oh, I'll need to take any documents you've found while on this mission. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_ae9868f4", "[smiling] Eager as always. You've earned this... and the gratitude of the Alliance.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_b0da26cf", "I'm sure.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_b0e6356e", "Show the Imperial Purchase Order.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_b0f80f89", "Are you sure you wish to quit? I will have to revoke the travel authorization. It is for special operatives only. And I'll have to take any remaining documents you may have relating to this mission.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_b2503658", "This isn't what I'm looking for. I need the security codes as soon as possible! Return to the locations I gave you and find those codes!  Arrgh... well... okay, this is potentially useful information. I'll reward you for finding it. But then you must go find those security codes.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_d50be1f6", "Good. Be swift in dealing with this situation.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_d6695e83", "No thanks.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_d938179c", "Great. Let's see this reward then.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_daf0c91a", "Indeed. We need those codes as soon as possible.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_df8ea53", "Not interested.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_e1aa98dd", "Ah the Imperial Prison of Dathomir. Many who are arrested for their 'sins' against the Empire are taken to this location. Most are never seen again. We must not allow our officer to meet the same fate. We've lost too many men as it is! Since the Imperial Prison is where they are taking him, it wouldn't be surprising to find information about his current location there.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_e70aed96", "I can't continue. Please erase all records of my progress on this mission.");
stringFiles[188].addEntry("s_f85a3545", "Arrested... treason... Dathomir prison. It truly is a pity. One of our most trusted and well-decorated pilots has been taken prisoner by the Empire. He was arrested for a crime that was not his doing. The Empire even went as far as planting false evidence to destroy his innocence. He needs to be rescued. He has been taken to a Corellian corvette which is en route to Dathomir. I need security codes in order to assemble a team to rescue him. Will you get those keys for us?");

stringFiles[189] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_velso_imperial_destroy");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_velso_imperial_destroy) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_105e0ec6", "Why are you still here soldier?! Did you forget your weapon or are you just trying to upset me?!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_131222b8", "Are you not aware of the fact that you cannot carry anything else? What kind of soldier are you? You must be aware of these things at all times. Otherwise the Alliance will kill you in your sleep. Don't return until you've made some room to carry this reward.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_160e282", "Excellent, don't disappoint me soldier! Time is of the essence here. You can choose to return whenever you find something so that we can check the information as you find it. Or get them all at once, that's fine as well. Just make it quick. Dismissed!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_1be45010", "Ok, let me type this down. What's the first lead?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_27825c70", "What?! That wasn't a question! Fine, I can't let this mission be handled by someone like you anyway, get out of here!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_29a2b68d", "Are you kidding me soldier? Can you even read? This is useless! But I'll keep it anyway, just in case...");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_2b546273", "Here's your reward, soldier. Take it. You earned it... I won't deny that.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_31c5707e", "I..I'm sorry Sir, I can't do it.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_32084dfe", "The city of Anchorhead is in southern Tatooine. Rebels are known to congregate in Anchorhead, so I feel there is a good chance the sequences we seek could be there. They might be in an abandoned building or in the back room of a cantina. I really have no idea. It is your job to uncover those sequences and return them to me.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_36c480be", "A payload of weapons is being smuggled to a group of Rebels waiting to slaughter some outnumbered Imperial... er.. I mean to slaughter some innocent civilians. Yes. They're on a Corellian corvette, but it's marked as a medical transport so we don't want to attack it directly. I need you to find the destruction sequences for the corvette and blow it up from the inside. I have three leads on where the sequences could be located.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_3d6658e8", "Soldier, I appreciate your enthusiasm, but I can see that you're already busy. Come back when you've finished your current task, and I'll get you back into the action.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_446ba9d", "Nothing left of that corvette but space dust. I knew I could whip you into shape. That's exactly what the Empire needs... more soldiers like me. Like you? Ha. I guess you did earn a reward, though.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_477d6952", "Just in time soldier! I have an urgent mission that requires your assistance.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_524ad772", "Were you not listening soldier?! If I weren't desperate I would put you on kitchen duty for a month! Now which location do I have to repeat myself about?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_52d6b1d", "Show it to me.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_547609c8", "I can't do this. Please remove all progress I've made from your records.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_566ff600", "Alright so I will be taken to the corvette to blow it up from the inside?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_59e77066", "I must find a way to impress my commanding officers. That'll be the quickest way to advance. Perhaps I can find a way to hamper Rebel efforts in this sector. That should be suitably impressive.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_5aca4872", "Um... I think I'll come back later.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_5b38e8f5", "What's this 'Document 56211217.KXYR.170649'?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_5b578f0d", "What?! You are a disgrace soldier! I will have your name sent to the inquisition for this! This will mean having to revoke your travel authorization and relieving you of all mission data and any documents you've gathered. And that means paperwork. I hate paperwork. So instead, you'll stay on this mission. Now get on that shuttle!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_5dc3f73a", "This 'Ship Destruct Sequence Codes' must be it.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_640dac0a", "What?! You are a disgrace soldier! I will have your name sent to the inquisition for this! You will be relieved of all mission data and any documents you've gathered. You disgust me. Get out of my sight!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_65cd8f5e", "Fine, let me have a look.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_6e1e63ff", "I believe I found the sequence Sir.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_757e4a85", "Yes Sir, what are the details?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_823dca3f", "Sorry, too busy right now.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_88da44a4", "I found this 'Alliance Guide for Safeworld Exploration' , useful perhaps?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_8b2cc767", "Alright Sir. I will take off at once.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_8d72ccd0", "You better! Now get on that shuttle and do your duty soldier!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_9495da35", "What were those locations again?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_95397df3", "It sure is soldier, good work! Now take this travel authorization to the Imperial pilot out by the shuttle, and he will arrange deep space transportation for you that will intercept that corvette. If you succeed in destroying that corvette and in escaping it, return to me for a reward.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_988cb045", "Who let you in to the Empire soldier?! This is rubbish! No, you can't have it back!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_9ddd4bc7", "Why are you still here?! Go, go, go!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_9e916cc9", "Yes soldier, you are a lot brighter than you look! And after doing that and successfully escaping, return to me for a reward. Now hurry, hurry, hurry!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_a1e2f8b6", "I give up...sir. Please remove all progress I've made from your records.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_a4929123", "Fine, just don't hurt me.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_ad79e41e", "Give me all documents.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_af39813", "I'm sorry Sir, where do I take this ticket again?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_b1606a2a", "The third option?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_b384a269", "At least you'll admit that much. Can I have my reward?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_b68e2c66", "The Rebels are rumored to have hidden among the Dantari on Dantooine. Specifically with a tribe called the Janta. We believe that when the Rebels evacuated the area, this ship was among those used. There may be information at the Janta Stronghold... retrieve it.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_b99cf73b", "Okay, okay Sir. I'll do it.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_c159261e", "You will be the death of me... take it to the pilot outside by the Lambda shuttle. If by some miracle you don't fail in this mission, return to me for a reward. Now go!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_cc45dddf", "I do not have time to chat, citizen. Please move along.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_cd8ede71", "I found some other documents as well.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_ce1a4a29", "Speak soldier, what are you doing here?!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_d521e0c0", "Tea?! Get out of here soldier, you're lucky I'm not incarcerating you! Wait... first give me 50, now!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_d5fd52c1", "Ok this definitely doesn't sound like my cup of Doxxen tea.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_e5e44e1d", "The traitor Erran Sif is leading a small group of warriors on Talus. She betrayed the Empire in the past and is considered an enemy, so don't expect a friendly reception. I hear she's also no friend to the Rebel Alliance for whatever that's worth. Regardless, I believe she may have the codes for this corvette as she may have used it once herself. Infiltrate her base and report back with whatever you find.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_e60ca0aa", "Alright Sir, I'll get back to searching.");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_ed8d835e", "What about the second possibility?");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_f0bafd8b", "You will wish our paths never crossed when I'm done with you. Now get out of my sight!");
stringFiles[189].addEntry("s_fc34951f", "Later? You should take what you can get. Might not be a later.Guess that's when you'll be a good soldier too. Later. Or more likely never.");

stringFiles[190] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_vledmo_neutral_rescue_target");
stringFiles[190].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_vledmo_neutral_rescue_target) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[190].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[190].addEntry("s_3a6b92ce", "I'm sure he did. You can tell him to get in touch with me through the regular channels. I'm not going anywhere near his stinking sand castle for a while. Now if you excuse me, I have an escape pod to catch.");
stringFiles[190].addEntry("s_3d453e53", "Well Jabba thought it was best we'd escort you back to safety.");
stringFiles[190].addEntry("s_46770350", "Look...instead of trying to make polite conversation, how about you let me actually finish escaping? Sound good? Okay.");
stringFiles[190].addEntry("s_4751b5d0", "Yeah right... sure you were.");
stringFiles[190].addEntry("s_c5413576", "Hehe, you came to 'rescue' me? Yeah I'm sure Jabba was real worried. Not like I needed the help... was just about to bust out of here myself.");
stringFiles[190].addEntry("s_ecd754dd", "Listen punk, I don't need to wait on some blaster waving, wannabe space hero to rescue me. I've been getting myself out of this kind of situation since you were toe-high to a bantha. Now get out of my way, I have an escape pod to catch.");

stringFiles[191] = new StringFile("conversation/corvette_yondalla_neutral_rescue");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (corvette_yondalla_neutral_rescue) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_14b16106", "[She doesn't seem to notice you.] The fool had to go and land himself in the custody of the Corellian Security Force... this is not good. Jabba must learn of this... but I'd really rather not have to tell him myself. Being the target of his anger is not one of my ambitions. Ah what to do...");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_259d132f", "Sorry, no, not me.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_2972f7c", "Where was Klaatu again?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_2a00185a", "I managed to snatch 'Galactic Phrasebook and Travel Guide'.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_2b741d06", "For crying out loud! This is why I always work solo... sigh. I'll take all information your gathered so far. Thank you very little.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_2bdf5b50", "Yeah okay. Normally I don't need help, but this may be a special case. One of Jabba's top assassins was captured. He's currently on a CorSec corvette and on his way to being traded to the Empire at the Imperial Prison on Dathomir in exchange for the release of an imprisoned CorSec officer. Jabba does not want him talking to Imperial officers. He could reveal too much. We must find the location of that corvette and intercept it. I have three leads on how to do that.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_310d2ff3", "Something's come up. I can see that you're busy now, but come talk to me when you finish with that. I could use your help.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_3dfd3c32", "I prefer to stay here on Tatooine, sorry.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_3e2c6672", "Alright, I suppose I owe it to you.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_49b0321c", "What?! I can't, I have something else on my plate right now. I trusted you with this! If you quit, I'll have to revoke your travel authorization and take all mission documents you've gathered. Not to mention erasing all knowledge of your progress so far. That means starting completely over!");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_4d118a1d", "Thank you, now hurry please.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_4e2be81c", "I still have some of the other documents that I found.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_51573633", "Could you repeat the three leads on how to find the captured assassin?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_541c41dc", "Excellent. Make haste and don't disappoint me. Return with one of the documents, or all three at once. It's up to you, as long as you do it fast.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_54c95fe4", "I'll be...just get out of here!");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_562787e1", "Fantastic! According to this, the transport would not yet be on Dathomir. It's still possible to intercept it. Take this travel authorization to Klaatu. He's behind Jabba's Palace... out back with the small shuttlecraft that makes periodic deliveries. Klaatu'll make the necessary arrangements. Then once you're successfully completed your mission, come back to me for your reward.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_58879de3", "What about 'A Galaxy Befuddled by A. Rahringt'?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_5dc4acd", "I've changed my mind. Erase all progress I've made from your records.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_6919fb6b", "Alright, I will get back to finding it.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_7604ad47", "Ah... it would appear that you have no space to carry your reward. I'll have to ask that you make room and then come speak to me again.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_7837378f", "Right, and the third lead?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_7952bf9c", "This is the tricky one. What I need may actually be found on Endor. A group of Rebels stole some information from a sliced CorSec transmission and fled to Endor with it. I've heard rumors that these Rebels have some connection with the Korgas on Endor.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_7bf4c415", "Good, let me see.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_7e1ef500", "No, allow me to thank you. Here is your reward. I hope it serves you well.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_839794f9", "Argh, solving this by myself is going to take forever!");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_86991d8f", "Yes, just show him that travel authorization. Find the assassin on board and get him out of there. I'm sorry I can't come and assist you, but another matter of great importance has arisen that I must deal with. It never ends, but I couldn't imagine doing anything else. So I can't complain. I can, however, reward you if you succeed. Bear that in mind.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_92ca8435", "Alright Klaatu will assist me in intercepting the corvette?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_998ee768", "I'm sorry, I just can't do this right now.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_9fb0ad73", "Yes I am, thank you.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_9fe2c46a", "You still here? Didn't I say that you had to get on that ship fast?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_a4929123", "Fine, just don't hurt me.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_a9be41f8", "This 'CorSec Prisoner Transfer Document' must be it.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_aa693144", "I have retrieved some documents.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_ad79e41e", "Give me all documents.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_b13f163d", "Well done. The assassin is safely back in Jabba's hands. Well, I suppose it remains to be seen how safe that will be for him. Regardless, you've done your part and done it well. Are you here for your reward?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_b5494314", "He's back behind Jabba's palace! Come talk to me after you successfully complete your mission, and I'll reward you. Now hurry!");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_b82fdb5a", "I'll have a look at it later. Here is some credits for your time in retrieving it.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_c0031bea", "Could be useful perhaps. I suppose I should reward you for the time it took you to retrieve it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_c2bb14db", "Oh, let me have a look at them.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_c8d78390", "Not yet. I'll come back for it.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_d0344ca8", "Ahh, the feared cult of Lord Nyax. Their hideout can be found on Corellia in the central region of the planet. Unfortunately, I have little information to give you about them other than the rumor that they are secretly backed by the Empire. Search their hideout and find any data connected to the exchange of Jabba's assassin into Imperial hands.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_dc0cdd5d", "Maybe you should record it this time?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_dfb8d44e", "Well, no. But maybe I can help anyway.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_e248445b", "What's your progress?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_ec881702", "I cannot continue. Erase my progress from your records.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_f5664125", "About time you got here. You're the ones Jabba sent, right?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_f7147ad", "Alright, I'll try and find the right papers.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_f9acd930", "Okay what's the first lead?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_fa7b5bf6", "And the second?");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_fa7bc000", "Bah! Consider yourself fortunate that I haven't time to report your insolence to Jabba!");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_fd1dd7d9", "A former Imperial scientist was working in a bio-genetics lab on Talus. He was in charge of genetic experiments aiming to transform the goat-like murra from Corellia into an efficient all-terrain fighting animal. The resulting creature was named a kahmurra, though the Empire considered it a failure and cancelled all funding. This scientist was a target of our assassin, and the bio-genetics laboratory is where the assassin was captured. Search it for any information left behind.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_fdc18de4", "Yes, check the other places and hurry.");
stringFiles[191].addEntry("s_fe8eb1aa", "Ah... very well. If that is what you want, come back when you're ready for it.");

stringFiles[192] = new StringFile("conversation/crackdown_st_static");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("bark_s1", "Stay out of trouble, citizen. Do not make us detain you.");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("bark_s2", "Be careful, citizen. Those Rebel scum have been sighted in the area.");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("bark_s3", "I don't care much for you, citizen. You'd better stay in line.");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("follow_giveup", "This is %TO. It's nothing. Everything appears normal. Returning to my post.");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("follow_lost", "This is %TO. I lost track of the target... keep your eyes open. Returning to my post.");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("follow_start", "This is %TO. I see someone suspicious... checking it out.");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("loiter_s1", "Move along, citizen. There's no loitering here.");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("loiter_s2", "No loitering here. Move along, citizen.");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("rebel_breach", "All units be advised. Be on the lookout for suspected Rebel sympathizer, %TO.");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("salute", "Greetings, %TO.");
stringFiles[192].addEntry("salute_name", "Good day, %TT %TO.");

stringFiles[193] = new StringFile("conversation/crafting_contractor");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (crafting_contractor) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_14e7249", "Hello there. I contract manufacturing jobs to crafters that are looking for work. The pay is not great, but it's good practice for those that are interested in learning the art of crafting. Are you interested?");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_220e8901", "On second thought, nevermind.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_2c56a5af", "I would like a challenging task.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_37b62865", "I would like a difficult task.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_404252ce", "What sort of crafting job are you interested in?");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_436186dd", "Alright. I'll take back your crafting crate then. Come back again if you ever need the work.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_445effe2", "An architect job.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_51b72d61", "OK. Just come back here whenever you're finished.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_62092c04", "Excellent. Here is a crate for you. Simply put the crafted items into it and bring it back to me when it is full. Then I will give you your pay.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_73c628e8", "Alright. Come back if you need the work.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_7db7e801", "Hm, it looks like I don't have any jobs available right now. Try again in just a minute.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_82c3e20a", "It looks like your inventory is full. Talk to me again when you free up some space.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_86f52ae1", "A weaponsmith job.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_8cadb7f", "How challenging of a task would you like?");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_9545de7b", "A general artisan job.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_9c7d6f79", "I'll get back to work.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_a62477a9", "You're done with the job? Excellent! I'll just take the crate then. Yes, and here is your payment. I'll bet that was good practice for you, eh?");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_b2b95d1f", "No, I'd rather not do that job.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_b3d0de8", "I'm sorry. I don't have any jobs available right now. Try back again in a minute or two.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_b9dc4832", "No, not right now.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_bc453c0d", "An armorsmith job.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_bdac2f18", "I've changed my mind. I don't want to do this job.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_bf890106", "A tailor job.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_d5278cc5", "Yes, I'll get to work.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_d5a1b00c", "I see that you're back, but it doesn't look like you've finished the job.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_deaa4415", "I've changed my mind, sorry.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_e3aab67f", "I don't think that we have any business to discuss. Good day.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_eb7fcc27", "Yes, I am interested.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_f19dea3c", "A droid engineer job.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_f38e5bb9", "A chef job.");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_f58f323c", "I've got just the job for you. You'll need to craft %DI %TO. Does that sound alright?");
stringFiles[193].addEntry("s_f59f8579", "I would like an easy task.");

stringFiles[194] = new StringFile("conversation/c_ddroid_amarent");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_ddroid_amarent) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_24", "Looks like you found the crash.  I got a message from Valance Serth that he needs you again, if you would go out there.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_277", "");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_279", "I'm sorry, but I'm really busy.  What do you need?");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_281", "Selan Ellison sent me.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_283", "Ah Selan.  I hope she is doing well.  I don't see her near enough.  I have a moment, but as I said, I really am busy. ");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_285", "I'm sure you can make time for someone of my influence.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_287", "Oh!  Excuse me sir.  Forgive my insolence.  Things have just been really busy here.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_289", "I'm sure they are.  You are forgiven.  I need to know about a ship that is missing.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_291", "Yes sir.  I have been investigating that ship.  It appears that the ship was diverted to Talus, though I have no information as to whether it crashed due to a malfunction or hijacking.  I have been told, sir, that it is a low priority and likely won't be pursued for several more days. Here are the coordinates if you would like to investigate the crash site.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_293", "There is no excuse for impertinence!  I need information on a missing ship, now.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_295", "Yes sir.  Give me a moment to consult with my notes. Yes, I think that ship is here.  One more moment...");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_297", "Come on, man!  I don't have all day.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_299", "Ah!  Here it is.  It crashed on Talus.  I will transmit the location to your datapad...sir.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_301", "I need information about a ship that may be lost.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_303", "I'm sorry, but I cannot give out that kind of information unless you are a member of the Imperial Transit Authority.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_305", "Would these 1000 credits show that I'm a member of the Imperial Transit Authority?");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_307", "I suppose it is only helping out a concerned citizen.  The ship that you are looking for crashed on Talus.  I can copy the location to your datapad.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_309", "Is your life really worth a silly rule like that?");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_311", "Erm...no need for any weapons, I assure you! The ship crashed on Talus.  If you don't hurt me, I'll copy the location to your datapad.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_313", "I'm very busy.  I'm sorry I can't talk to you right now.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_315", "Do you need more help?");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_316", "I need to know where the crash is again.");
stringFiles[194].addEntry("s_317", "All right.  I'll copy it into your datapad.");

stringFiles[195] = new StringFile("conversation/c_ddroid_droid");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_ddroid_droid) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_100", "He's never late!  My master hates to be late.  That's why I am worried.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_102", "No.  Who would want to help a droid?");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_104", "It isn't me that you would be helping, but my master.  Please please come back if you change your mind.  Otherwise, he will be doomed!	");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_106", "Oh, you are back. Where is my master, have you seen him? ");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_108", "I have seen him.  He is on Talus.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_110", "Talus?  What did you do to him?  Oh dear.  I should be there for him.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_112", "He was hurt when his ship crashed but he's recovering.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_114", "Oh thank the maker!  He will be all right.  I won't be a droid without a master after all.  After those men came here threatening me and you too!  They wanted to know when you started looking for my master.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_116", "They did?");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_118", "Oh yes.  When I told them that you were going to look for him immediately, they left in a hurry.  I do hope you are well.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_120", "Well enough. Master Serth wants you to run this program.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_122", "Certainly, if my master wants it...oh my, what was I saying?  How strange.  Here, I am supposed to give this to you, I think.  ");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_124", "Yes, no thanks to you.  Run this program through your banks.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_126", "Oh dear, I hope it's safe. I wouldn't want to jeopardize...hmm, what was I saying? I think I am supposed to give this to you.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_128", "Why did you tell them anything?!");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_130", "Was I not supposed to say anything?  At first I thought they were going to help you find him.  How am I supposed to know?");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_132", "Never mind.  Master Serth wants you to run this program.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_134", "Certainly, if my master wants it...oh my, what was I saying?  How strange.  Here, I am supposed to give this to you, I think.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_136", "Maybe.  I don't think I want to tell you though.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_138", "Oh he must be dead.  Master, I wasn't there for you!  Oh master!");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_140", "There's nothing that I can tell you that would be of any use right now.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_142", "Please go find out what happened to him.  I'm sure he needs help.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_144", "Hello!  I seem to be a bit lost.  Droids need masters, but I don't have one.  How odd.  Maybe someone will come for me soon.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_50", "");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_52", "Oh dear, oh dear.  My poor master!  Can you help me?");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_54", "What do you need help with?");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_56", "My master, Valance Serth is missing!  He was supposed to land at the Starport here an hour ago.  I'm afraid something really bad happened and it would be entirely my fault!");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_58", "What are you talking about?  How would it be your fault?");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_60", "Everything is my fault! My master was supposed to come here and meet me.  I tried to find out what happened, but no one at the Starport will talk to me.  I'm afraid that something terrible has happened to him.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_62", "What would make you say that?");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_64", "Someone was looking for him.  They needed to give him an urgent message from some prince.  Once I told them what ship he was traveling on, they told me not to expect him.  Can you help him?");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_66", "I can help you find your master.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_68", "Oh thank you!  His name is Valance Serth.  He's from Corellia.  There is a lady named Selan Ellison at the Starport.  Maybe she could help you. ");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_70", "No.  I'm not into helping droids.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_72", "Maybe someone will come along that is kinder than you and help me find my poor master.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_74", "Could he have just left you here?");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_76", "How could you say that?  I am a protocol droid!  No one would be cruel enough to leave their loyal servant.  Anyway, he couldn't do without me.  I am fluent in over 1.5 million forms of communication and am excellent in facilitating diplomacy.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_78", "Right.  I can help you find your master.  What can you tell me about him?");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_80", "His name is Valance Serth and he's from Corellia. His father was a member of Corsec until he died.  His mother...");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_82", "Valance Serth, right.  I'll start looking.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_84", "Thank you.  There is a lady named Selan Ellison at the Starport.  Maybe she could help you.  ");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_86", "Maybe I will help another time.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_88", "Another time may be too late!  I'll have to find someone else.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_90", "I don't think I'm interested.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_92", "Oh dear.  Please reconsider.  My master's life may be on the line!");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_94", "I will help you find your master.");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_96", "Oh thank you!  Please go to the Moenia Starport. There is a lady named Selan Ellison.  Maybe she could help you.  Please hurry.  Who knows what may have eaten him!");
stringFiles[195].addEntry("s_98", "Sorry, too busy.  He may have taken another ship.");

stringFiles[196] = new StringFile("conversation/c_ddroid_selan");
stringFiles[196].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_ddroid_selan) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[196].addEntry("s_207", "");
stringFiles[196].addEntry("s_211", "You appear to be looking for someone.");
stringFiles[196].addEntry("s_215", "What do you know of a late ship from Corellia?");
stringFiles[196].addEntry("s_219", "Actually, I did hear that a ship had 'trouble' on the way here, but there isn't much information from the Port Authority.  I think that there's a good reason to worry.");
stringFiles[196].addEntry("s_223", "That isn't good.  I need to find one of the passengers on that ship.");
stringFiles[196].addEntry("s_227", "Perhaps I could help?");
stringFiles[196].addEntry("s_231", "If you can, I would appreciate it.");
stringFiles[196].addEntry("s_235", "I have a friend who works for the Port Authority in Tyrena, on Corellia.  His name is Amarent Loren.  Just tell him that Selan Ellison sent you.");
stringFiles[196].addEntry("s_239", "Lovely day at the Starport, isn't it?");

stringFiles[197] = new StringFile("conversation/c_ddroid_valance");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_ddroid_valance) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1168", "");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1170", "Thank you!  Once those pirates get roused, there's nothing to stop them.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1172", "I'm happy I could help.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1174", "I owe you my life, but this is all that I have been able to salvage from the flight. I hope it will help you out. I have one more favor to ask, if possible.	");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1176", "I'm expecting a little in return.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1178", "Of course you are!  Unfortunately, this is all that I have been able to salvage from the flight.  I know that I shouldn't be asking, but I need another favor.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1180", " I need a favor...for the good of the Empire, or its people, or whatever you believe in.  Either way, innocent people will get hurt if you can't help me.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1182", "What is the favor?");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1184", "What do you know about the Black Sun?");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1186", "Not all that much.  Just rumors really.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1188", "Well, the rumors are probably true.  They are vile, nasty criminals that live only for themselves and the control of anything that may make them money.  And destroy anything that could put that in jeopardy.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1190", "Why were they going after you?");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1192", "I came across some information about one of their latest schemes.  They plan to taint a major shipment of medicinal spice.  I want to stop them, but I'm hurt.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1194", "Tainted medicinal spice?  ");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1196", "Yes.  There's an outbreak of Ourim Flu on several planets.  People are dying.  The Sun will use the tainted spice to addict the sick people to their chemicals.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1198", "I will help.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1200", "Oh thank you!  Here are coordinates of a spot near their base.  You should be able to see them from this spot.  Kill them if you must, but stop them.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1202", "I don't have the time right now.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1204", "I'm sorry to hear that.  I hope I'll be able to find someone to help me resolve this dangerous situation.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1206", "I will help.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1208", "Oh thank you!  Here is the last known location of their base.  Here are coordinates of a spot near their base.  You should be able to see them from this spot.  Kill them if you must, but stop them.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1210", "I don't have time right now.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1212", "I'm sorry to hear that.  I hope I'll be able to find someone that will help me resolve this dangerous situation.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1214", "Welcome back.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1216", "I took care of the Black Sun Camp");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1218", "Great!  You stopped their nasty little plot cold.  There's only one loose end.  Please let me know if you are interested.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1220", "I'm afraid they must have had early warning! They launched their transport already.  The only hope left is to intercept the transport in space.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1222", "Ok, tell me more, I'm always ready for a trip into space.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1224", "What else can I tell you?  Get to a Starport and into space.  Go blow up that transport and anything that stands in the way.  I should be able to arrange for you to get some coordinates to help.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1226", "Give me a moment to get myself ready.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1228", "All right, but hurry.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1230", "I'm not done yet.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1232", "They are probably pretty tough.  Please hurry as much as you safely can.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1234", "Hello, my friend. Thank you for all your help so far.  I shouldn't ask, but...well...you recall the droid that sent you to me, C-3TC?");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1236", "He's rather difficult to forget.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1238", "Yes, well...he's also the one responsible for getting me into trouble in the first place and I'm tired of it.  If you head back to Moenia anytime soon, would you talk to him and have him run this program for me?  It will wipe his memory and I won't have to worry about Black Sun goons anymore.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1240", "I can do that if you like.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1242", "I would appreciate it.  He's probably fretting his bolts off.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1244", "What?!  After all that he did to help you...");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1246", "Whoa!  Remember, he's a droid.  I'll just be doing both him and myself a favor.  If you don't want to do it, that's your business.  When you change your mind, talk to me.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1248", "Oh no!  I'm not going anywhere near that thing again!");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1250", "Well, much as it saved my life, I can't say that I blame you.  If you change your mind, come back and talk to me.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1252", "Please go eliminate that staging camp.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1254", "Ouch, you don't look too good.  The first of the transports got away.  This isn't the end of the galaxy.  The majority still haven't gotten out of the system.  Are you ready to go after them again?");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1256", "I'm ready!");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1258", "Good luck!");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1260", "Give me some time.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1262", "Please hurry.  It's still a trek back to the starport.");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1264", "Hello my friend.  You saved many many innocent people.  ");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1266", "What are you still doing here?");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1268", "I like it here.  It's exciting!  Heh. Actually, I need to make sure that my stuff on this ship is taken care of.  ");
stringFiles[197].addEntry("s_1269", "It's going to take me forever to fix this ship!");

stringFiles[198] = new StringFile("conversation/c_impdefector_def");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_impdefector_def) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("s_56", "");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("s_58", "Excuse me, you are the person that will take me to Officer Ten'doora, are you not?");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("s_60", "Yes, I'm here to take you to him.");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("s_62", "The plans have changed.  The information that I have is very time sensitive and I'll only slow you down.  You need to get to Officer Ten'doora within 20 minutes and give him this message:  Droids need Star Destroyers in the evening.");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("s_64", "Droids need Star Destroyers in the evening?  You have to be kidding me.");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("s_66", "Do you think that I'm risking my life out here for nothing?  Just tell him what I said and don't screw it up.  Time is ticking.");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("s_68", "Got it.  I'm on my way.");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("s_70", "You have 20 minutes.  Hurry!");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("s_72", "Why are you standing around, get moving!");
stringFiles[198].addEntry("s_74", "Can't a person just enjoy a lovely day?  Please leave me be.");

stringFiles[199] = new StringFile("conversation/c_impdefector_jom");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_impdefector_jom) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_548", "");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_550", "Hello!  I have an important mission for the Alliance, if you have the time.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_552", "Time? What does this entail?");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_554", "I'm sure you have heard about defectors from the Empire.  We have a fairly high-ranking officer that has decided to come over to the right side.  He's hiding out northeast of here.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_556", "I would be happy to help.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_558", "Thank you!  There's an Imperial defector hiding northwest of Kor Vella.  I'll give you the location in your datapad.  Take him to the Rebel Base to the north.  It's not a short trip, but it will be worth it.  When you get there, talk to Teslo Ten'doora. ");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_560", "I'd rather not.  Those Imperials make my skin crawl.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_562", "Well, I'm glad you told me.  I wouldn't want you to be in the position of putting your life on the line for something you don't think you can do.  If you change your attitude, come back and talk to me.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_564", "I always have time for my brothers-in-arms.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_566", "Thank you!  There's an Imperial defector hiding northwest of Kor Vella.  I'll give you the location in your datapad.  Take him to the Rebel Base to the north.  It's not a short trip, but it will be worth it.  When you get there, talk to Teslo Ten'doora. ");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_568", "I don't have time, actually.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_570", "I'm sorry to hear that.  Maybe I will have something for you later, if you have time.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_572", "I don't believe I wish to speak to you.  When you change your view on galactic politics, maybe we can talk then.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_574", "You look to be a trustworthy sort, I have an important mission that needs doing.  Would you be interested?");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_576", "Who will I be doing this job for?");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_578", "Well, I will tell you this - you may wish to avoid any Imperial entanglements while on this mission.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_580", "I'll be helping the Rebel Alliance?  Sign me up!");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_582", "Thank you!  There's an Imperial defector hiding northwest of Kor Vella.  I'll give you the location in your datapad.  Take him to the Rebel Hideout to the north.  It's not a short trip, but it will be worth it.  When you get there, talk to Teslo Ten'doora. ");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_584", "I'd rather not.  Imperial entanglements seem to follow me.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_586", "Maybe next time.  Come back if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_588", "Good luck with your mission.  Remember, he's hiding near the broken bridge.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_590", "Welcome back.  I have another defector that could use an escort of your calibur.  Would you be willing to take him up to the base?");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_592", "Certainly.  I am always willing to help.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_594", "Excellent.  Same situation as before then.  Pick up the defector in the trench near the broken bridge. Take him to the rebel base and talk to Teslo Ten'doora. ");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_596", "Not this time, I'm afraid.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_598", "Maybe next time, then.");
stringFiles[199].addEntry("s_600", "What a nice day today.");

stringFiles[200] = new StringFile("conversation/c_impdefector_teslo");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_impdefector_teslo) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_51", "");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_53", "Congratulations on making it this far.  How treacherous was the trip?");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_55", "The defector sent me alone and I was attacked by mercenaries.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_57", "But you did make it, at least.  Did he give you a message for me?");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_59", "Droids need Star Destroyers in the evening.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_61", "You are kidding?  Really?  This is exciting news, indeed.  Loyalty like yours deserves a reward.  Pardon me now, while I contact my superior.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_63", "Imperials are dancing on the heads of pins.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_65", "Now you are just making stuff up.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_67", "It was nothing. I have a message for you.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_69", "What is it?");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_71", "Droids need Star Destroyers in the evening.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_73", "You are kidding?  Really?  This is exciting news, indeed.  Loyalty like yours deserves a reward.  Pardon me now, while I contact my superior.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_75", "Imperials are dancing on the heads of pins.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_77", "Now you are just making stuff up.");
stringFiles[200].addEntry("s_79", "Pardon me, but I'm waiting for a delivery.");

stringFiles[201] = new StringFile("conversation/c_rebdefector_allard");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_rebdefector_allard) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_848", "");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_850", "I received word that you were on the way.  No problems, I assume?");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_852", "The informant would have slowed me so I came alone and then mercenaries attacked me, sir.  ");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_854", "I knew about the mercenaries.  I suspect they were hired by rebels. The Informant wouldn't follow you here? Did he give you information for me?");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_856", "Wookiees walk at night in the trees of Naboo.");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_858", "Loyalty like yours is quite admirable.  You will go far with us.");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_860", "The Pekos have landed, sir.");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_862", "That doesn't sound like a valid codephrase to me, soldier.  Did you take notes?");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_864", "It was easy, sir.  The informant gave me information and I came to you.");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_866", "No need for false modesty.  I heard that mercenary bullyboys tracked you and attacked.  What was the information?");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_868", "Wookiees walk at night in the trees of Naboo.");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_870", "Your skill has gained us information that will break the Rebels!  Loyalty like yours is quite admirable.  You will go far with us.");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_872", "Silver corvettes fly into mountains on Ryloth.");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_874", "That doesn't sound like a valid codephrase to me, soldier.  Did you take notes?");
stringFiles[201].addEntry("s_876", "I'm waiting for a delivery.");

stringFiles[202] = new StringFile("conversation/c_rebdefector_def");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_rebdefector_def) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("s_798", "");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("s_800", "Hey, are you the person that is supposed to take me to talk to Allard?");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("s_802", "Yes, I am supposed to take you.");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("s_804", "Well, I'm sorry to do this, but there has been a change of plan.  The information that I have is very time sensitive and this bum leg of mine will only slow you down.  You need to get to Allard within 20 minutes and give him this message: Wookiees walk at night in the trees of Naboo.");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("s_806", "Wookiees walk at night in the trees of Naboo?  What kind of code is that?");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("s_808", "It's one that one that will get us both killed if you don't hurry.  Go now!");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("s_810", "Got it.  I'm on my way.");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("s_812", "You have 20 minutes.  Hurry!");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("s_814", "Why are you standing around, get moving!");
stringFiles[202].addEntry("s_816", "Can't a person just enjoy a lovely day?  Please leave me be.");

stringFiles[203] = new StringFile("conversation/c_rebdefector_jaek");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_rebdefector_jaek) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_494", "");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_496", "Hello!  I have an important mission for you.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_498", "What must I do?");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_500", "Every so often, one of these rebel insurgents realizes that the Rebels are misguided.  In this case, this former rebel held some power in their poor excuse for a military.  His knowledge will help us crush the scum. ");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_502", "I am honored to accept this assignment.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_504", "Good.  The defector is holed up in a safe place.  His former compatriots may have discovered that he is joining the right side.  I will give you coordinates to his location.  Escort him to the Emperor's Retreat and speak to Lt. Allard Lissara.  He will take it from there.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_506", "I don't have time, actually.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_508", "If you are in the middle of something then get to it.  Talk to me when you have time.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_510", "I am always interested in a good mission.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_512", "Excellent!  There's a Rebel defector hiding nearby.  I'll give you the location in your datapad.  Take him to the Emperor's Retreat to the West.  When you get there, talk to Lt. Allard Lissara.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_514", "I don't have time right now.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_516", "If you are in the middle of something then get to it.  Talk to me when you have time.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_518", "Go away, scum.  I don't talk to your kind.  ");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_520", "Hello.  How would you like the opportunity to do something special for the Empire?");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_522", "How special?");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_524", "Special enough that you will be gaining significant favor with the Imperial Military.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_526", "I've always wanted an Imperial career.  I would be honored to help.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_528", "Very good. I have a former rebel that wants the opportunity to make up for his rabble rousing.  The Emperor's retreat is fairly nearby and this guy needs an escort there.  When you get to the retreat, speak to Lt. Allard Lissara. ");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_530", "If it's all the same to you, I'd rather not get involved.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_532", "It's your loss.  Not everyone is given a chance to show his loyalty to the senior officers.  If you change your mind, come back and talk to me.  Maybe I will have something for you then.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_534", "Good luck with your mission.  Remember, he's hiding west of Moenia.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_536", "Welcome back.  I have another informant that could use an experienced escort .  Would you be willing to take him to Lt. Lissara?");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_538", "Certainly.  I am always willing to help.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_540", "Excellent.  Same situation as before then.  Pick up the defector west of Moenia. Take him to the Emperor's Retreat and talk to Lt. Allard Lissara. ");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_542", "Not this time, I'm afraid.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_544", "When you wish to help the Empire, come back and talk to me.");
stringFiles[203].addEntry("s_546", "What a nice day today.");

stringFiles[204] = new StringFile("conversation/c_sink_imp");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_sink_imp) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1330", "");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1332", "What makes you think I will talk to you, insurgent?");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1334", "Hello citizen, nice day isn't it?  I'm sorry, but I don't have anything that you can help me with.  I really need a member of the Imperial Armed Forces.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1336", "I have a simple mission for you, soldier.  A good friend of mine from the academy needs an escort back here from an accident.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1338", "Escort from where?  What happened?");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1340", "During a battle, those Rebels shot his ship down.  He's good enough, and lucky enough to have crash-landed instead of blowing up. But, outside of a ship, he's just terrible.  He needs someone to bring him back here.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1342", "It would be a privilege to escort a friend of yours, sir.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1344", "Good show.  Let me give you the location.  You can't miss it; look for the crashed Tie Fighter.  My friend is probably out of sight.  I'll radio and let him know that you are coming, so just go to the coordinates that I give you and bring him back.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1346", "I think the pilot can make it back on his own. Isn't that what he was trained for?");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1348", "I see.  You are right of course.  I'll remember to mention that to the dispatcher if you ever need a lift back to base.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1350", "Welcome back. Tell me what happened.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1352", "I found a corpse at the crash site and a bunch of Binayre attacked me.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1354", "My friend must be dead.  The good news is that they finally stepped over the line.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1356", "I beg your pardon, sir?  There is good news in this?");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1358", "Yes and no.  I have just received orders that if those thugs attack Imperial personnel, I am authorized to take whatever actions I deem necessary.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1360", "What, exactly do you deem necessary?");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1362", "I want to cripple them. They hurt and kill our citizens and they must be executed. I want them rendered ineffective and then wiped out.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1364", "Sounds like a rough job.  I like it!");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1366", "That's the spirit!  I want you to target two of the groups, one here and one on Corellia. I'll transmit the information to your journal and datapad.  Good luck, soldier!");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1368", "No way.  I don't get involved in minor disputes.  That is what the Planetary Security Forces are for.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1370", "Well they are obviously not nearly as effective as they should be, are they?  If you stand aside, it's your business, just get the hell out of the way while I do something about it.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1372", "I want to help! I hate those gangs. Thugs and criminals, all of them.  Tell me what I can do.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1374", "That's the spirit!  I want you to target two of the groups, one here and one on Corellia. I'll transmit the information to your journal and datapad.  Good luck, soldier!");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1376", "Respectfully, sir, I want no part of this. Even if you asked me to do something, I will not.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1378", "Know that you are turning your back on the law-abiding citizens that you are supposed to be defending.  Sleep well on that... soldier.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1380", "I don't see my friend with you.  I guess you should be heading out to get him.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1382", "I need the location again.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1384", "Go west and look for the smoking Tie Fighter.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1386", "How did it go? ");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1388", "I haven't started yet, sir.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1390", "Then I suggest you start now.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1392", "I'm still working my way through the bad guys.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1394", "I have nothing else to offer you now.  Get going!");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1396", "I have the blades and you have heard about the Binayre, I believe, sir.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1398", "You would be correct.  You did an admirable job.  ");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1400", "These thugs aren't only on the ground, sir.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1402", "Very true.  In fact, that's something that I was going to talk to you about.  Binyare fly this sector and I want you to cripple their fleet, a few ships at a time.  Once you are in space, I'll transfer coordinates to you.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1404", "I am happy to do my part.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1406", "Let me give you your reward for a job well done.  It looks like this little problem isn't so little.  I need to do some research.  I'll probably have more for you at a later time.  ");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1408", "What happened up there?");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1410", "I haven't been up there yet.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1412", "Then I suggest you get going.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1414", "I failed my mission, sir.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1416", "Then I don't believe your mission is complete, soldier.  Get back up there.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1418", "I completed my mission, sir.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1420", "Good work, soldier.  Those Binyare will think twice before crossing the Empire again.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1422", "It felt good.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1424", "It should.  You love the thrill of battle, don't you?  No, I see it in your eyes.  Here is your payment for a job well done.  I will have more for you as soon as I get some research done.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1426", "I'm done with this now.  No more.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1428", "Here is your payment.  When you want to start protecting citizens again, let me know. Maybe I'll have something for you.");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1430", "I finally have my mission in life.  The criminals will not take over while we are at war!");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1432", "Do you have anything for me?");
stringFiles[204].addEntry("s_1434", "Not yet.");

stringFiles[205] = new StringFile("conversation/c_sink_reb");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_sink_reb) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1110", "");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1112", "What makes you think I will talk to you, thug?");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1114", "Good afternoon!  Nice day, isn't it?  I'm sorry, but I don't have anything that you can do.  I am looking for someone more sympathetic to the Alliance.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1116", "I have a simple assignment for you, if you are interested.  A good friend of mine needs an escort back here.  ");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1118", "Escort from where?  What happened?");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1120", "He is a pilot and his ship was attacked.  He made it to the escape pod, but now he needs someone to lead him here.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1122", "Sure.  Any friend of yours is a friend of mine!");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1124", "Thank you!  I'll be sure to tell the higher-ups of your willingness to help.  The pod crashed north of here.  I'm sure he's keeping out of sight of the local Imperial forces.  I'll radio and let him know you are on your way.  He will follow you here.  I'll have a reward for you when you get back.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1126", "No thank you.  I have other things to do.  There's a war out there, you know.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1128", "Sure.  What's one pilot whose life is in danger when you could be out killing to your heart's content?  Are you sure you are in the Rebellion?");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1130", "Welcome back.  Tell me what happened.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1132", "I found a corpse at the crash site and I was attacked by Flails.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1134", "No!  After all that he went through in the war, to get killed by thugs?!  That's it!  I'm done waiting for someone else to take care of these criminals.  It's time to act!");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1136", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1138", "These swoop gangs, smugglers, and pirates!  Beyond what they are doing to innocent people, they give us a bad name.  ");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1140", "What do you mean by that?");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1142", "Obviously, to the Empire, we are criminals and a threat to their domination.  But to the citizens, we Rebels may be viewed as Freedom Fighters...or as the criminals that the Empire is making us to be.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1144", "What do the gangs have to do with that?");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1146", "The more the actual pirates and criminal elements terrorize citizens while we do nothing to help them, the more we are lumped in with their ilk.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1148", "So, what do you want me to do about it?");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1150", "I want you to go after them.  I know that you cannot eliminate the whole threat yourself, but strike at them.  I have identified two gangs here and on Talus that are strong enough to do some real damage, but not as strong as, say, the Hutt Syndicate.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1152", "I want no part of your vendetta.  One major enemy is enough.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1154", "If we stand aside while evil people take advantage of others, we lose.  But it's your decision.  If you change your mind, let me know.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1156", "What do you need me to do? ");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1158", "I want you to go after them.  I don't expect you to single-handedly eliminate all the criminals in the galaxy, but you can start the ball rolling.  Strike at two of the gangs, one here and one on Talus.  I'll put more information into your journal and datapad.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1160", "I want no part of your vendetta.  One major enemy is enough.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1162", "If we stand aside while evil people take advantage of others, we lose.  But it's your decision.  If you change your mind, let me know.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1164", "I don't see my friend with you.  I guess you should be heading out to get him.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1166", "I need the location again.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1168", "Go north and look for the crashed Escape Pod.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1170", "How did it go? ");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1172", "I haven't started yet.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1174", "Then maybe you should get to it.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1176", "I'm still working my way through the bad guys.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1178", "I have nothing else to offer you now.  Get going!");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1180", "I have the marks and you have heard about the Flails, I assume.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1182", "I did indeed and I'm glad to see that you are as enthusiastic as I am about stopping the growing gang problem.  ");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1184", "I'd like to do more to help.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1186", "Good.  I want you to head into space then.  The Hidden Daggers have taken it into their heads to terrorize innocent pilots heading to Corellia.  Destroy them and then I'll reward your properly for your hard work. ");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1188", "I am happy to do my part.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1190", "Let me give you your reward for a job well done.  I think that I'm going to make this my cause.  Let Mon Mothma deal with the Empire.  I want to make sure that if we win, there is something worth having.  Come back to me sometime and I may have something for you to do.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1192", "What happened up there?");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1194", "I haven't been up there yet.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1196", "Then I suggest you get going.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1198", "I failed the mission.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1200", "It's like falling off a bantha.  You have to dust yourself off, get back on and finish the job!");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1202", "I completed the mission.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1204", "Great!!  You dealt the Daggers one hell of a blow.  They will be picking up pieces of their ships for weeks.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1206", "It felt good.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1208", "It should.  You are helping the innocent people of the galaxy.  All I can give you is my thanks and these credits.  I'll make sure that your deeds are known.  Come back to me soon and I will try to have more for you to do.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1210", "I'm done with this now.  No more.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1212", "Let me give you your reward for a job well done, at least.  I think that I'm going to make this my cause.  Let Mon Mothma deal with the Empire.  I want to make sure that if we win, there is something worth having.  If you want to be a part of it, talk to me later.");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1214", "I finally have my mission in life.  The criminals will not take over while we are at war!");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1216", "Do you have anything for me?");
stringFiles[205].addEntry("s_1218", "Not yet.");

stringFiles[206] = new StringFile("conversation/c_story1_1_doc");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_story1_1_doc) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_716", "");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_718", "Hello, may I help you?");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_720", "I have this spice sample that I need analyzed.");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_722", "Well, let me see it.  Find it in your kid's room? I keep hearing more and more stories about that, kids these days...wait a minute.  Where did you get this?!");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_724", "I found it on a ship that crashed.");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_726", "Why did you bring this to me?  This is far too hot for me to touch.  Do you realize how much danger this will bring me?  Get out!  Get out of here now!");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_728", "Is this illegal?  Is it dangerous?");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_730", " It's dangerous to me! Out!  If you really must find out what that stuff is, go talk to a friend of mine.  He would know more about it than I do anyway.  Take this data and get out!");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_732", "Never mind where I found it, what is it?");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_734", "It's ... what the? I haven't seen anything like this since... do you realize what this represents?");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_736", "Is this illegal?  Is it dangerous?");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_738", "It's dangerous to me! Out!  If you really must find out what that stuff is, go talk to a friend of mine.  He would know more about it than I do anyway.  Take this data and get out!");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_740", "I don't think you should talk to me anymore.");
stringFiles[206].addEntry("s_742", "How is your health today?");

stringFiles[207] = new StringFile("conversation/c_story1_1_imp_quest");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_story1_1_imp_quest) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_215", "");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_219", "I'm disappointed in you, traitor.  You turn your back on the Empire and then expect us to hand information over to you?  You are sadly mistaken.  Go talk to your own kind now.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_222", "How is civilian life treating you?  Never mind, I don't want to know.  I also don't want to know why you are coming to me for classified information.  I have someone else handling this investigation now...military personnel.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_224", "If I could use your help, I would, but my orders are for Imperial military only.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_226", "Go away, Rebel scum.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_228", "Greetings, soldier.  I have a situation that requires my attention and I cannot attend to it properly.  Would you be willing to help me out?");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_230", "Perhaps, if I have more information.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_232", "I have just gotten word that a pilot is missing. We have the coordinates of his last known location. It was on Rori. Would you be willing to run out there and see what happened?  He may be hurt or in danger. ");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_234", "I will go investigate.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_236", "Very good.  Go to these coordinates on Rori and see if you can find anything out. Then report back to me. Oh, if he had cargo, maybe you could find out what happened to it.  That would probably help him out a lot.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_238", "I'd rather not.  I have a lot to do right now.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_240", "Hopefully your decision didn't doom that poor pilot.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_242", "I will do anything I can to help the Empire.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_244", "Your loyalty encourages me.  I wish more people were like you.  Anyway, a pilot is missing and we don't know what happened. We have his last known coordinates on Rori. Investigate then bring me back any information you find, particularly information about his cargo. This is of great interest to the Empire.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_246", "No thank you.  You should attend to your own duties.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_248", "I guess you just aren't that helpful after all.  ");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_250", "Welcome back.  Did you find anything interesting?");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_252", "The pilot's ship crashed.  I haven't found any trace of him though.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_254", "Crashed?  That's terrible!  Please go back there and search for some trace of him.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_256", "Yes, I found this datapad and this sample.  I think it's a spice.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_258", "A spice?  I have never seen anything like it.  Let's see what this datapad contains.  One moment for the decoder to do its job...there we go.  ");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_260", "What does it say?");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_262", "It looks like this sample was part of a larger shipment that the pilot was bringing somewhere.  The datapad is quite damaged. There's nothing about who shot the ship down, just that the ship was attacked.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_264", "So, now what do I do?");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_266", "I think that this spice sample is important somehow.  I have a loyal Imperial doctor that will analyze this sample if you take it to him.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_268", "I would be happy to.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_270", "Good.  Here's the medical facility where he works.  You should find him inside.  I swear, I don't think he sleeps.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_272", "Not right now, but I'll come back when I'm ready.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_274", "You do that.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_276", "Not yet.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_278", "Please get right on that.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_280", "I lost the location. Can you give it to me again?");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_282", "I can give you that data.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_284", "Go talk to Doctor Vang.  There's not much else I can do to help you.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_286", "Hello again, soldier.  It appears that my search bore fruit.  A lady named Kaila heard that I was looking for that lost pilot.  She said that she saw someone fitting his description in the wilderness.  Since you are already in the loop for this, I want you to go talk to her.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_288", "Didn't she give you the information when she contacted you?");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_290", "No.  She is expecting a reward for valuable information.  The Empire will take care of that.  You will go talk to her, won't you?");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_292", "Of course, sir.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_294", "Good choice. She is a regular at some dive in Narmle after dark.  I'll give you a waypoint.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_296", "I'm not really interested in finding this guy.  He was an idiot to crash his ship and not come back to town.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_298", "If we do not find him, I'm holding you responsible.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_300", "I don't need additional details.  I want to find out what's going on.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_302", "Kaila apparently hangs out at some dive in Narmle.  Here's a waypoint.  It should be safe enough there. ");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_304", "No more of this for me.  I'm done.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_306", "If we do not find him, I'm holding you responsible.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_308", "Welcome to the right side, soldier.  I'm glad to see that you support law and order.  Sources tell me that you found a spice sample and are looking for a missing pilot.  I have information for you.  A lady named Kaila saw the pilot out in the wilderness.  I want you to go talk to her.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_310", "Well, soldier, looks like you have chosen to change your traitorous ways.  Good to see!  Sources tell me that you found a spice sample and are looking for a missing pilot.  I have information for you.  A lady named Kaila saw the pilot out in the wilderness.  I want you to go talk to her.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_312", "I don't know anything more than you do and I'm waiting to hear back from headquarters about what to do next.");
stringFiles[207].addEntry("s_314", "If you see this, Lisa sucks... tell her so.");

stringFiles[208] = new StringFile("conversation/c_story1_1_neu_quest");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_story1_1_neu_quest) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_372", "");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_374", "Oh dear, you went and joined the military, didn't you?  You won't be able to help me now.  I was already almost arrested for pestering an Imperial officer.  I'll have to find someone else to help me.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_376", "Much as I need help, I don't trust people in the Rebellion.  I keep hearing how you kill women and children.  Please leave me alone.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_378", "Oh my, you are an Imperial, aren't you?  I guess you are too busy to help me.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_380", "I can't talk to you in case a member of the Imperial Security Bureau is watching.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_382", "Can you help me?  Please help me!  My friend's ship is missing and I haven't heard from him.  I'm really worried.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_384", "What can you tell me about it?");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_386", "He is a merchant and on one of this runs, he disappeared!  I can't imagine what happened!  He's a very good pilot. I don't think that Rori was one of his stops, but that's where his last coordinates say he was.  I'm very worried. ");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_388", "I will help you find your friend.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_390", "Thank you!  I have the coordinates here.  Please bring me back any information you find. I'm so worried about him! ");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_392", "I'd rather not.  I have a lot to do right now.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_394", "You are very cruel not to help me find my friend.  I hope you get eaten by a sarlacc!");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_396", "I could always use a job.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_398", "This is quite a bit more than just a job.  My friend's life may be at stake!  His last coordinates were on Rori.  I'm really worried about him!  Let me transfer the coordinates to you.  If you can't actually find him, maybe you can find something of his that would give me a clue to where he may be.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_400", "No thank you.  You should go look for your own friend.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_402", "I'm no kind of wilderness survivor!  You don't care about anything except yourself!  Go then and thanks for nothing!  ");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_404", "What did you find?");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_406", "The pilot's ship crashed.  I haven't found any trace of him though.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_408", "Crashed?  That's terrible!  Please go back there and search for some trace of him!");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_410", "I found this datapad and this sample.  I think it's a spice.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_412", "A spice?  What would he be doing with spice?  He doesn't touch the stuff.  Let me see this datapad, I have his personal code. Oh no!");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_414", "What does it say?");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_416", "He was attacked!  He doesn't say by who or what, but his ship was brought down.  There's no information here that helps me at all!  Just something about this sample and how it's important.  I don't care about that, I just want to find my friend!");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_418", "Maybe the spice will lead us to where he is.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_420", "Do you think so?  My cousin is a doctor and could probably analyze that. Would you take it to him and see if he can help?");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_422", "I would be happy to.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_424", "Thank you again.  Here are the coordinates to his clinic.  I hope it helps.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_426", "No, he's your cousin. You should go talk to him.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_428", "I can't, actually. We're not on good terms. If you change your mind about helping me, please come back.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_430", "Nothing yet.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_432", "I hope he's all right.  Please go out there soon.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_434", "I lost the location. Can you give it to me again?");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_436", "You lost it?  Fine, I'll transfer the location to your datapad.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_438", "Go talk to Doctor Vang.  There's not much else I can do to help you.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_440", "I finally have information for you! Someone named Kaila contacted me and told me that she had information about my lost friend! He's lost in the wilderness.  You have to help me!  She won't give me the coordinates, but maybe she will give them to you.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_442", "Why wouldn't she give you the coordinates?");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_444", "Hhmph, she says that I won't survive in the wilderness, and she's right there.  But she said that I'm foolish enough to go out there on my own.  She says that she doesn't want to get me killed!  I'd only do that if I couldn't find someone to help me!");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_446", "It's ok.  I'll help you.  Just tell me where I can find her.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_448", "Kaila's a regular at some dive in Narmle.  I'll give you a waypoint.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_450", "She's right.  You will get yourself killed.  You will probably get me killed in the process.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_452", "You... you jerk!  You don't care about anyone or anything but yourself.  When you change your mind about helping me, maybe I'll talk to you.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_454", "I want to find out what's going on.  Where is she?");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_456", "Kaila hangs out at Narmle's Gambling Hall.  Here's a waypoint for you.  Go quickly!");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_458", "I didn't sign on for this. I'm done.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_460", "Oh, I hope your weapon breaks and you get eaten by a rancor!");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_462", "My friend is missing.  Someone told me that you were looking for him.  I have information for you! Someone named Kaila contacted me and told me that she had information! He's lost in the wilderness.  You have to help me!  She won't give me the coordinates, but maybe she will give them to you.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_464", "Oh, will you help me?  My friend is missing.  Someone told me that you were looking for him.  I have information for you! Someone named Kaila contacted me and told me that she had information about my lost friend! He's lost in the wilderness.  She won't give me the coordinates, but maybe she will give them to you.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_466", "I don't know what is going on, exactly, but I'm going to try to have more inforamtion for you as soon as I can.  It's not looking good so far.");
stringFiles[208].addEntry("s_468", "If you see this, Lisa sucks... tell her so.");

stringFiles[209] = new StringFile("conversation/c_story1_1_reb_quest");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_story1_1_reb_quest) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_151", "");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_153", "Don't bother trying to get information out of me, worm!  You betrayed your conscience at what price?  Is your cushy new position worth the damage you cause?  Never mind!  Get out of my sight!");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_155", "I won't help you any more.  Someone who didn't weaken our position by quitting will be helping us locate the lost pilot.  If you still care enough to find the pilot, I'm sure other people are looking for him.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_157", "You look eager enough, but I really need to speak with someone in the Alliance.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_159", "I beg your pardon.  Please leave me alone, you Imperial drone.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_161", "I need your help!  I have a situation that requires my attention and I cannot attend to it properly.  Would you be willing to help me out?");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_163", "Perhaps, if I have more information.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_165", "I have just gotten word that a pilot is missing. We have the coordinates of his last known location. It was on Rori. Would you be willing to run out there and see what happened?  He may be hurt or in danger. ");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_167", "I will go investigate.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_169", "Very good.  Go to these coordinates on Rori and see if you can find anything out. Then report back to me. Oh, if he had cargo, maybe you could find out what happened to it.  That would probably help him out a lot.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_171", "I'd rather not.  I have a lot to do right now.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_183", "Hopefully your decision didn't doom that poor pilot.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_185", "I could always use a job.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_187", "I will be happy to pay you for your time.  A ship has gone missing and the pilot has not been heard from.  We have his last coordinates. They are on Rori. We don't know if he's hurt or dead.  Go investigate and bring me back any information you find. ");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_189", "No thank you.  You should attend to your own duties.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_191", "I guess you just aren't that helpful after all.  ");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_193", "Welcome back.  Did you find anything interesting?");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_195", "The pilot's ship crashed.  I haven't found any trace of him though.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_197", "Crashed?  That's terrible!  Please go back there and search for some trace of him.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_199", "Yes, I found this datapad and this sample.  I think it's a spice.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_201", "A spice?  Oh really?  Interesting.  Umm... I think you should get that analyzed. I know a doctor who will analyze that for you.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_203", "What about the pilot?");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_205", "Oh, I'll get this datapad sliced and follow up on that.  I think this spice is more important.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_207", "More important than a missing pilot?");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_209", "Um, no, that's not what I mean.  I mean, I think you should follow up on that spice and let me worry about the pilot.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_211", "This is getting suspicious, but I will do as you ask.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_213", "I'm sorry, I don't mean to put you on guard.  I just don't like knowing that there's some unknown spice out there when some child could get their hands on it.  Here's the doctor's clinic.  I'm sure he will be there.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_216", "Well, if you look for the pilot, I'll follow up on the spice.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_218", "Of course I will!  Here are coordinates to my friend's medical practice.  He is there almost all the time.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_221", "No, I did what you asked me to.  I'm leaving now.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_225", ". . .");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_229", "I haven't found anything yet.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_233", "That's a shame.  Come back to me when you find something.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_237", "I need the location again.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_241", "I can help you with that. ");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_245", "Go talk to Doctor Vang.  There's not much else I can do to help you.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_249", "I finally have information for you! Someone named Kaila contacted me and told me that she had information on the missing pilot.  Evidently he's lost in the wilderness.  She has the coordinates if you go over and talk to her.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_253", "Didn't she give you the information when she contacted you?");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_257", "Well, she didn't contact me directly and doesn't want to be seen talking to me.  I'm a wanted man, you understand.  One of those 'rebel terrorists' and all that rot.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_261", "As am I, my friend.  But I'm interested in finding out what this is about.  Where is she?");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_265", "She's a regular at Narmle's Gambling Hall.  I'll give you a waypoint.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_269", "You aren't the only one that the Empire is hunting.  I want no part of it.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_273", "If you wish.  I won't condemn you, though others will.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_277", "I want to find out what's going on.  Where is she?");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_281", "Kaila apparently hangs out at Narmle's Gambling Hall.  Here's a waypoint for you.  Be careful.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_285", "No more of this for me.  I'm done.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_289", "If you wish.  I won't condemn you, although some might.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_293", "Welcome to the right side of the battle lines.  I'm glad you are with us.  I understand that you found an odd spice sample.  I have some information about the missing pilot.  Someone named Kaila contacted me and told me that she had information on the missing pilot.  Evidently he's lost in the wilderness.  She has the coordinates if you go over and talk to her.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_297", "Welcome to the Alliance!  I hope you have been treated well so far.  Sources tell me that you found a spice sample and are looking for a missing pilot.  Someone named Kaila contacted me and told me that she had information on the missing pilot.  Evidently he's lost in the wilderness.  She has the coordinates if you go over and talk to her.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_301", "Can I talk to you later?  I'm tracking down a tough bit of information.");
stringFiles[209].addEntry("s_305", "If you see this, Lisa sucks... tell her so.");

stringFiles[210] = new StringFile("conversation/c_story1_2_chemist");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_story1_2_chemist) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_100", "I know that you found a spice sample, the local Black Sun leaders were talking about it earlier today.  That's why they set up that trap for you.   They want a piece of the action. I don't know the name of this spice, but it seems to be medicinal in nature, and rare.");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_102", "That, I'm not sure of.  It seems to have pretty impressive healing qualities, but I haven't isolated its exact function.  What I do know is that it appears that the Black Sun want a piece of the action. ");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_104", "What does the Black Sun want with it? Most rare medicines are publically available.  ");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_106", "Not this kind.  That's what you don't understand.  It's being smuggled and hoarded by the Rebel Alliance.  They must know where it comes from and are keeping it for themselves.  The pilot that you are looking for was smuggling the spice for them.");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_108", "What does the Black Sun want with it? Most rare medicines are publically available.  ");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_110", "Doesn't surprise me in the least.  Those rock-sucking terrorists would do anything.");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_112", "Really?  I find that hard to believe.");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_114", "NO!  I don't believe you!  You work with criminals that want the spice.  You would say anything!");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_116", "Maybe they want an edge in the war...ow! Right, rock-sucking terrorists! In thanks for sparing my life, take this. ");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_118", "Believe it.  The Black Sun will actually let the average person get a hold of this life-sustaining spice...once I know what it does...for a price. I gave you more information than I probably should.  Take this and go. ");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_120", "Yes, I probably would.  Maybe you should go speak to your own contacts and see if they will tell you anything.  I'd be shocked if they did.   Please...leave me be.  I gave you more information than I probably should.  Take this and go.");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_2", "");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_38", "Go on then, talk.");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_39", "I have been analyzing the spice that you have.");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_4", "Please don't kill me!  I have information that you probably want.");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_40", "I won't kill you, but what can you offer me?");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_42", "There's a new spice out there that many people want information about.  There have been people looking for information on Naboo, Corellia, and Talus.  I'm sure that there is money to be made there.");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_96", "What spice?");
stringFiles[210].addEntry("s_98", "And?");

stringFiles[211] = new StringFile("conversation/c_story1_2_mole");
stringFiles[211].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (c_story1_2_mole) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[211].addEntry("s_23", "");
stringFiles[211].addEntry("s_25", "Why hello there! Is there something that I can do for you?");
stringFiles[211].addEntry("s_27", "You can tell me about that pilot you saw.");
stringFiles[211].addEntry("s_29", "Ah, I know who you are now.  I'm glad you came to see me.  I was beginning to wonder if you would.  Listen carefully, head directly northeast.  It's north of some ruins and west of a statue head. Here are coordinates if you prefer that.");
stringFiles[211].addEntry("s_31", "I just wanted to say 'hello' to a lovely lady.");
stringFiles[211].addEntry("s_33", "You are very sweet, but I'm waiting for someone.");
stringFiles[211].addEntry("s_41", "Nothing.  I thought you were someone else.");
stringFiles[211].addEntry("s_43", "All right.  We all make mistakes.");

stringFiles[212] = new StringFile("conversation/dantooine_rebel_trainer_2");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (dantooine_rebel_trainer_2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_10d3ddf5", "I do have a few elective duty tasks. Are you interested?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_13aaae57", "There is no time now, my young friend. I will give you the answers soon. But for now, your presence is needed in the Lok system, %TU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_14c2f902", "You don't look like a Vortex pilot. What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_15c6406b", "If you weren't such a good pilot...very well, here's the mission completion bonus.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_165db597", "I want mission 1.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_16d870fe", "Consider it done.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_16e68393", "If you can stand up to that firepower, I will be most pleased. We will transmit locations as we find them once you enter orbit. Come find me after you (or your ship) need a break and pick a new assignment. If you feel experienced enough, let us know and we'll teach you some of our skills. Go get them %TU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_1807105", "Give me the short version; I'm ready for action.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_188656b1", "Doesn't explain what my part in this is.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_1b8807cc", "Very well. I will have one of the pilots instruct you. When you are ready, come back to me. An urgent situation is developing. I could use your newly acquired skills.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_1d85385d", "I can't do it. He's too heavily guarded.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_1e45ad6c", "We have very little information, which is where you come in, my friend. You have to travel to the Lok system immediately.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_1f3a637e", "There are Jedi working for the Rebel Alliance?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_1fd8891b", "That's what we want to find out. And with your help, we shall succeed %NU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_21736cfe", "Nonsense! Get your act together. Finish what you started, %NU. There's no turning back now!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_22a1e2bb", "Yes. How can I help?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_235bfb27", "Wasn't exactly difficult. Where's my bonus?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_24084ede", "I suppose. But this time I better be hauling the right data!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_261519e4", "Sure. Maybe I should just terminate him right away, just to be safe?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_266422af", "Thank you, sir. So what happens now?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_266c4054", "Haha! Well, don't take too long. We have a lot of work to do still, and we will need your expertise soon again.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_28f9c5ec", "Actually, no.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_299ce3a0", "Yes this is clearly not for you. Good bye.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_2a02eb78", "I'm not surprised. I will go in to more detail of what it is we do later, but we need to know how well you can work with us before we can give out any information on our operations here.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_2ba96f57", "Good to see you, %NU. Ready to hear the list of active duties?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_2c008858", "I want Escort Duty.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_2c4789b", "Understood.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_2ca477ff", "I can't right now, Vrovel. I have things to do.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_2d54810a", "Guess the Empire is desperate to find some decent pilots.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_2e18346d", "I don't have time right now.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_2faaa2e5", "Did I give you the wrong location or something? Let me double-check your datapad.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_303fc274", "We are not playing games here, %NU! You need to hurry up and finish what it is you have to do so that you can get underway on this project immediately.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_304f442f", "I need some time to recover from my wounds.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_3080e198", "Very well. Escort in Lok sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_319cfac4", "Good to see you, %NU.  I've really enjoyed our time together. But now I'm placing you under the command of Brother Ezkiel. You can find him right over there. He will continue your guidance in the Vortex. Stay in touch, my friend!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_31f985f7", "No! Wrap up your business immediately. We can't let this opportunity slip by.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_330ba710", "Bah, I don't have time for this. I'll be back.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_3360046f", "I don't have time to go to Lok right now.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_339b44ad", "Good. Intercept his prison transport at this location in the Yavin system. Good luck, and may the Force be with you, %TU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_33f02b70", "Okay okay, no need to get upset. What are my options?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_3436f186", "Wait. You promised to tell me what the Vortex is about!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_3475f83d", "Please leave. This is private property. Thank you.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_360d72eb", "Indeed. I will have the locations of the Imperial ships transmitted to you above orbit. Come back and see me later for different duties. Or, if you feel that you have enough experience, let me know and we will teach you some of our skills. Good luck out there %TU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_3890da84", "If you're going to succeed, you need to be the best pilot out there - better than any Imperial pilot! An attitude like that won't do! You have to constantly sharpen your skills, %TU!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_3aa053cf", "Where is he?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_3c4ff185", "Reactor Engineering Algorithms");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_3e1fc046", "What?! This is of the utmost importance. If you continue to disappoint me like this, I will have you working a moisture harvester on Tatooine for the rest of your career. Get out of here and don't come back until you're ready to work!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_424b5808", "Good. This is our last chance, %NU. May the Force be with you!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_432be150", "Sounds good. Go on, sir.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_450d0c76", "Indeed %NU. Here's the completion bonus. You've earned every last bit of it. Come back later. Hopefully by then, the plan of attack will be completed.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_451de7ba", "You better take care of your business quick, %NU. We are running out of time!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_45236b6c", "The Vortex? I've never heard of you before.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_46f83a2d", "That's the %NU I know. Come back when you're ready. But don't take too long! There's a lot of work to do.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_48235568", "Good. You can intercept the transport at these coordinates in the Yavin system. May the Force be with you, %NU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_48398692", "Okay, I think it's time you explain what the Vortex is.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_49003628", "I hope so %NU, for all of us. Here are the intercept coordinates. If he's not there, search the nearby area and pray that he didn't get past you. Best of luck, my friend.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_4b9a2c6f", "This is what you want us to teach you?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_4c1dac60", "Hold on, what choices did I have again?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_4c539d9e", "I would laugh with you, if it wasn't so horrific %NU. We have to find out where this research is taking place. We may have a lead.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_4c86e37b", "Excellent. May the force be with you, %TU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_4cf117bb", "How come?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_4d4bd15c", "We have a problem, %NU. The smuggler that sold you the information in Yavin has been captured by the Empire. They are transporting him to an interrogator as we speak. We have to save him!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_4d99132b", "Thank you, sir. I'll be back shortly.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_507325ab", "Understood. And what does the Vortex hope to accomplish?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_5088ea12", "I didn't sign up to be kept in the dark. I'm out of here.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_524b8ce7", "This is war, %NU! You have some time to reconsider. But if you don't, I may have to reassign you to another part of the navy.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_52eb52dc", "On second thought, think I'll spend some of this bonus.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_544003d6", "I want Destroy Duty.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_5459b64", "He's being transported from Yavin 4 right now. You need to disable his prison transport and unlock his energy cell by hacking into the ship's computer. Then he can take control of the ship and head for safety. Under no circumstances can he fall into Empire hands - even if it means his death. Do I make myself clear?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_55a5f573", "Okay. Just don't let your piloting skills slip; we will need them more than ever now. Practice every chance you get.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_561c250a", "You should get some rest and then fly some duties while we put our plans together. Here's your completion bonus for a job well done. See you soon, %NU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_57c7d4b9", "We are not bounty hunters! You will be paid your regular salary, and at times you can keep things you collect from the enemy. Now that we have that squared away, are you ready to pick your task?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_59d7264c", "Quick! We have another chance to catch that officer before he reaches the Imperial fleet. Here are the new coordinates. Suit up and get going!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_5a928bc", "I'm glad you made it, %NU. I have a confession to make. We didn't send you out with the correct data.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_5b12c8f8", "There you are! Just in time. This is the real deal, %NU. We have learned that the Empire is starting a new research project. It is of particular interest to us. A Rebel Officer on Lok has asked us to send a pilot to help retrieve more information.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_5cde55e2", "If you say so. We have some duty work.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_5d243499", "I'm not going back into that death trap!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_5e7cd3e1", "I understand %NU. But I hope you rest up quickly. We are running out of time.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_605dfe75", "Be careful. If this data falls into the hands of the Empire, it is lost forever. Stay sharp out there, %NU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_60e93806", "Sorry, sir. What are my options?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_624d0dce", "Sometimes I wonder what is going on inside that head of yours, %TU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_62726774", "We have some freighters requiring escort past Imperial patrols. We also have a few opportunities to hijack Imperial ships, and of course we could launch some guerilla strikes on Imperial Scout patrols. We want you to assist with these duties until we feel you have enough experience to proceed with your training. But they operate on a volunteer basis and can be aborted at any time.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_64b6ea44", "I want mission 2.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_64fbc05f", "Then you better save him, %NU! This pains me as well, but under no circumstances can the Empire learn how much we know about their research project!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_65c36194", "On second thought, no.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_65ce28c1", "Hmm. Yes, I suppose you are right. The Vortex is the name of the planet where our agency was formed. We have since relocated many times to avoid the Imperial Inquisition, but our goal remains the same.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_6a1fe0ee", "All fixed. Make haste for the Lok system.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_6a35a7eb", "Great! I hate failure!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_6ad1ad62", "Very well, I will tell you what I can when the time comes around. Now we have some duties for you. Are you ready?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_6b054777", "Not right now, I have some things to attend to.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_6b158a0e", "I'm a Developer/Tester and want missions.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_6bb0cb94", "Correct.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_6e50b681", "What do you want? We're running a legal scientific expedition here.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_6f6eeaf3", "Fine, goodbye.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_7088f02a", "I'm sure. Here's your completion bonus; I know you've been looking forward to it. Come back later. Hopefully by then, we'll have a battle plan ready to go.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_71eef77f", "Yes, but he knows what was in that data. Under no circumstances can the Empire be allowed to find out what we know about their research project.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_729c6465", "Good. You can intercept the prison transport at these coordinates in the Yavin system. May the Force be with you, %NU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_7363d4a2", "I have to admit, I impressed even myself.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_739ccb66", "You disappoint me, %TU. I didn't take you for a coward.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_73b1dbda", "I'll be back. It's time to put this bonus to good use.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_73bf51b7", "Take some personal time or fly some duties while we formulate our plans.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_73ccefde", "Space Combat Techniques");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_73ff6c2b", "That's it? No problem.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_74e55e9e", "We have it within our grasp, thanks to you,  %NU. Outstanding job up there. Rest up and get ready for the final step. It's time to shut this Imperial operation down for good!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_75a6ca67", "None right now, thank you. I have some other things to attend to.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_77213dae", "Alright, where do I go and who am I meeting?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_777420ae", "Alright, alright, go on.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_78de5e19", "Good. As much as it pains me to make decisions like this, this is what you have to do in wartime. Here are the intercept coordinates of the prison transport in Yavin. May the Force be with you, %NU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_7a128ed0", "I want Recovery Duty.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_7c61dac0", "Very well but hurry back, there's lots to do and little time, as always.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_7ca73534", "Sometimes I wonder if you are on the right side in this war, %TU. We don't attack civilians unless it's absolutely necessary. Now get yourself over to the Yavin system and save this man from the Empire's clutches!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_7dc6a3c6", "Intercept the prison transport in the Yavin system. Disable it and unlock the smuggler's energy cell by hacking in to the ship's computer. He CANNOT fall into Empire hands. Do I make myself clear?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_7f77ceba", "Haven't you heard?  You've been grounded.  I don't know what you did, but Alliance HQ is pretty mad about it.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_80f24a30", "This is the one? You're sure?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_816055e2", "I want mission 4.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_820a0ee7", "Very well, I will have one of the pilots teach you. When you are ready, come back to me. An urgent situation is developing. I could use your newly acquired skills.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_82930541", "All right. But we need your help, so don't take too long, %NU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_84d88402", "The Empire is creating a new type of star fighter. It is a combination of a pilot and his ship. The technicians meld the pilot into the ship with cybernetics. They become one. The Force crystals keep the abomination alive. The crystals do other things as well; we don't fully understand them yet. ");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_861734b9", "If you calm down and let me finish, I'll explain everything. One of our scientists is on his way to meet the smuggler at a space station in the Yavin system now. You need to take the information to that base and meet with our scientist. He will purchase the smuggler's data, compare it to your data, and see if he can't make some kind of connection. ");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_8631d353", "All right. What is my mission?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_87a97a09", "Sorry, I can only assign missions to Vortex pilots. Perhaps you should go speak to your commanding officer.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_8917475d", "Welcome back, %NU. You have acquired some experience in our ways and I believe you are ready for some training. Are you willing?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_8a5579fe", "What are Force Crystals?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_8b6b8696", "Very well. Recovery in Yavin sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_8b97769", "Very well. Escort in Yavin sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_8bb57c8b", "Yes, only but a few. And so far, they are mostly untrained Jedi. It's hard for us to train them, as the only information we have available is from old documents that are often hard to comprehend. We are making more and more progress, however.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_8bc4846e", "There is no such thing as the short version, %NU. You need to understand what we are dealing with here.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_8c4fba26", "That's madness! Pilots give up their lives to fly that thing?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_8ea054c0", "Please leave. This is private property.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_900f01d1", "What?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_90297a58", "Wait! You promised to tell me what the Vortex is about.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_92364805", "He's being transported from Yavin 4 right now. You need to disable the prison transport and unlock his energy cell. You can accomplish this by hacking into the ship's computer. Once you've done that, he can take control of the ship and head for safety. He cannot fall into the hands of the Imperial interrogators, even if it means that he doesn't make it at all. Understood?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_92aee067", "Consider it done, sir.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_92ddd562", "You are sure of this?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_93f5b2e2", "Rest? Bah! I'm ready for action!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_948462ad", "Not many can stand toe-to-toe in a dogfight with me. Where are these guys?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_96605d37", "Beats me.  Better do something to improve your standing in the eyes of the Rebel Alliance though, or they'll never trust you with a mission again.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9694dc98", "Good. %NU, the Alliance is lucky to have you.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9793aadf", "Finally! What is it all about?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9805ba81", "Alright, but what is this research project?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9828194f", "I'll help you with some escort tasks.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_985bcff1", "Perfect timing, %NU. We are ready for the next phase of our mission. We have finally learned what this project is all about - AND we've figured out a way to stop it.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_98bb41ea", "Indeed.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_98d991e7", "Weapons B, Intermediate Alliance Starship Ordnance");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9a079bb1", "What is this research project?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9b291e2", "I can't right now. Can it wait?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9b43a7ee", "Yes sir.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9b8d2abd", "I would like some training. What can you teach me?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9c5e6360", "Indeed you will. I'm very grateful the Alliance sent us such a honorable soldier. Be careful %NU. We can't afford to fail.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9d33db7", "All right. What duties are available?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9dbb5a9a", "What is the plan?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9eadc5d9", "This is war, %NU! You have some time to reconsider.  But if you don't, I may have to reassign you to another part of the navy.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9f0a282", "Say please? Oh you did. Never mind.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_9ffd1405", "Which mission?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_a1e6b9f4", "I can't right now, but I will be back as soon as possible.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_a30c1a53", "Yes sir!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_a59f4abe", "These high-risk missions? High-risk means more pay right?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_a6720368", "Okay, you can leave now.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_a7fb8221", "Hijacking Imperial ships! That sounds exciting.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_a82e4fe0", "Indeed. Here are the new coordinates. Hopefully you will be able to slip by undetected this time.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_a9c811de", "If that was true, though, why is the Empire wasting millions of credits on Jedi hunts? No, my friend, the Jedi still exist. In fact, we have found a few already - and we've convinced them  to join the Alliance.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_aa05c8e8", "What does it matter? We have what we needed from him.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_aaf61b87", "Fine, what tasks are available right now?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b09129f6", "Alright. But hurry, this is not a vacation.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b17504ae", "This better lead to something, Vrovel. I almost died out there!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b21d8dfe", "Good. I will tell our freighters and shuttles where they can meet-up with you. When you feel that you have learned our routes well enough, come back and see me. If you think you have enough experience, let me know and we will teach you a few of our skills. Good luck, %TU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b2e20726", "Not yet, my friend. We are still analyzing our information. Take on a few duties and get some more experience under your belt.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b4922a9d", "I can't do that...");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b5a9bcf1", "Hmm, then I must ask you to leave immediately.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b6af2b98", "I want mission 3.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b6efe97d", "Please leave. This is private property!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b712823e", "We have very little information. But we've received word from one of Nym's smugglers in the Yavin system. He was examining some of the debris left from the Empire's destroyed space station. (Remember that explosion?) He apparently found some data there, relating to this same project.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b74318f4", "I will do my best, sir.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b8b49994", "So when do I take off?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b91de387", "So what is my part in this, sir?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_b9e38f83", "Woah, there, %TU.  Just what do you think you're doing?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_bb87cc7c", "One hundred percent, sir.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_bd1936e2", "They want to confiscate our library. It holds decades of information, gathered from all corners of the galaxy, on anything relating to the Force.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_be0843f2", "Greetings %TU. Too bad you're already working for a different part of the Alliance Navy. We are short a few pilots at the moment.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_bed2d9a5", "I doubt that they volunteer for it, %NU... This has to be stopped, for the good of the galaxy and all that is just. We need to find out where this criminal activity takes place. We may have a lead. ");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_c23a0a19", "Do you have any missions that I can fly?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_c2eb0440", "Well hurry back. We need your skills for this!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_c358c931", "Hmph. Well, you need to get un-busy and get back to me quickly. This is a high-priority task!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_c4279134", "This is urgent %NU! Whatever it is you need to do, do it quickly.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_c5b76777", "You have earned enough experience to advance to the next level in one of the following fields.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_c6af7ee", "Killing civilians is not my style, Vrovel.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_c6c91897", "Multi-Role Craft");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_c763dbaa", "Very well. Inspect in Dantooine sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_ca3670fd", "Very.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_cd1a5817", "I have some quick things I need to fix first. I will be back.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_cff9d397", "I suppose. But I will hold you to your promise. You have information?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_d049b613", "I'm sorry, you must have mistaken me for someone else.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_d0f52630", "What's your name again? Oh yes, I see you on the duty roster. But it looks like you already have an assignment. Wrap that up, and then we can talk.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_d5273669", "I don't have time right now. I will be back.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_d5ff7cb2", "Yes, definitely.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_d6450824", "Fantastic performance, %NU! We will soon find out what this is all about and how we can disrupt the Empire's plans.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_d69a6474", "What are you still doing here %TU? Time is of the essence!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_d8841255", "Very well. But hurry back. We need to get this operation under way.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_d88c653e", "Are you sure?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_d8fef41", "Perhaps not...");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_d9b0de0a", "Great! I was looking for you, %NU. We've made a breakthrough. We've analyzed the Imperial research project information. It seems to include something about Force Crystals. We are not sure what it's all about yet, but that's what the material that their 'science team' has been extracting from Dantooine caves.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_dad7c05e", "There's a Rebel operative named Finn Darktrin stationed at Lok. He will rendezvous with you. He has information on the location and ship signature of an Imperial shuttle. It's carrying a scientist - and he is working on this project. We need to capture that scientist and interrogate him.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_db0d4bc2", "Who cares! I have other things to attend to.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_dcc384fa", "Bah! Menial tasks like that are worthless.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_dcece74b", "Not many believe in the Force. Or they think that all the Jedi have been exterminated by the Empire. If that was true, though, why is the Empire wasting millions of credits on Jedi hunts? No, my friend, the Jedi still exist. In fact, we have found a few already - and we've convinced them  to join the Alliance.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_dcf1ce97", "Not now, Vrovel; I'm busy.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_dd108499", "I can't go to Yavin right now. I will be back as soon as I can.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_de6ce73a", "Why would the Empire want these crystals?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_dea568e", "We investigate anything relating to the Force or the ancient Jedi Knights. Our hope is to find Jedi to aid us in the war against the Empire and to learn as much as we can about the Force. Many people in the Alliance think our group is absurd.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_dedb7d52", "I suppose. So what do you want me to do?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_df11a579", "Well, even though it was a setup, it had some truth to it and we might have found a second source from which to retrieve the information.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e02f4f90", "Excellent! Give me the rundown.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e14c4a10", "You are %TU, the new pilot the navy sent us? Good, you couldn't have come at a better time. I am Vrovel. We are a part of the Rebel Alliance called the Vortex. We have several missions that require your assistance. But first I would like to see how well you can work with us. I have some duty work for you.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e244bb48", "I didn't think you were a coward, %TU! Maybe I should rethink your place here.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e2b7d84c", "I don't think so. That place is crawling with Imperials.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e3516195", "Excellent. Payback time!");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e5546db1", "And what is that goal?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e6772f13", "Goodbye.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e6de2bcb", "I understand that the smuggler arrived safely at Lok. Very well done, %NU. I'm glad we didn't have to take any extreme measures. Here's your completion bonus. Get some rest. You deserve it.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e788dfef", "Yes, sir. I'm ready, what are my orders?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e8baa9a9", "I heard of your misfortune, %TU. I have some good news, though. The clever smuggler managed to avoid capture. He escaped in a pod. Now we will get a second chance. Are you ready %NU?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e997312f", "Good, now what?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_e9c1932", "I'm sorry, I can't right now. I'll be back.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_ed422a6f", "You need to smuggle our data to Yavin and meet up with one of our scientists who is stationed there. He has purchased the smuggler's information. He will try to make sense of the different pieces of data.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_ee59d5b1", "The SpyNet has identified one of the officers working on this project. They've even provided us with his travel route. He's on his way to the Star Destroyer in the Dantooine system. We have laid out an intercept course. You need to disable his shuttle. You can find the starting location in your onboard nav computer.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_ef759e6d", "No wait, let me reconsider.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_ef95a2b0", "I might agree with them, Jedi were a myth, last I heard.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f0c94176", "Yes. I would not have been able to forgive myself had that happened. But I had confidence in your abilities. Now one of my most trusted men has gone over every inch of your ship, looking for trackers. This time I am the only one that will know your route and your mission. Will you indulge me and take the mission again, for real this time?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f0eba675", "Very interesting. So what's my mission?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f11d138d", "I'm sorry ,%NU. We couldn't risk the possibility of that data falling into Imperial hands. This attack against you confirmed that we have a traitor working against us. We wanted to draw him out. We did, thanks to you. Again, my apologies. I couldn't tell you.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f204572b", "Glad to have you back in one piece, %NU. We were worried there for a while. It's apparent that someone set you up. We are trying to figure out who that someone is. The Inquisitor onboard the ship was probably going to try and force you to bring him to me. Anyway, here's your completion bonus.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f22c0d35", "Don't salute me, soldier! The Imperial presence has increased around here lately, so we are pretending to be a scientific expedition. If an Imperial scout sees you saluting me, we might find ourselves in a holding cell tomorrow! We currently have a few duty assignments. That would test your mettle.  You can take your pick.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f2a21231", "Alright. Who do I meet and where?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f2fabb27", "It's a common term for crystals that emit powerful bursts of light when induced by resonant frequencies. In the past, they were used by the Jedi Knights to construct their lightsabers. Although rare, they can still be found in different areas of the galaxy.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f3cbd30c", "Very well. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f4f48ced", "Yeah, something must be wrong.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f520dc9f", "Agreed. Where do I find him?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f8b02865", "What do I do?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_f931eb62", "Thank you, sir. It was a close call.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_faebdc4c", "Alright, good bye then.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_fb5d75c8", "I'm starting to think that my trust in you was misplaced, %TU.");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_fcf4d778", "How?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_fe92f35f", "Thank you, sir. What happens now?");
stringFiles[212].addEntry("s_ff86e506", "Why is the Inquisition so interested in your activities?");

stringFiles[213] = new StringFile("conversation/dath_bh_wanted_list_01");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (dath_bh_wanted_list_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_1287b3", "That last one was too easy.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_14e3a046", "Then get out of here. I don't ever want to see your face again!");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_1508f5fc", "Well, my friend... you'll find all three of them hiding here in the Dathomir system under the watchful eyes of Elite Mercenaries. They've spared no expense!");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_159911f5", "Tell me more.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_1a71ed59", "How much?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_1e2e55e8", "No, not like you. Juree La'Zar is a killer of innocents. A savage. Not like you. Certainly not like me, either!");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_21ef58ea", "Elite Mercenaries?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_234c808f", "Empire pays 1000 credits... and I throw in a bonus of 200 if you do it quickly. What do you think about that?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_265d5a02", "Where is he now?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_2ad07084", "Rae'Lux flies a modified Y-wing that he stole from a small Rebel base in the Outer Rim. He's rumored to use experimental ion-sheet armor. Supposed to be super lightweight, but still really tough!");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_2cafb575", "Before you leave for good... come back by. I'll have something extra for you.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_2e64927c", "Your final target is Juree La'Zar, who was once a beautiful and gifted bounty hunter... driven insane after being horribly disfigured while captive to the Black Sun.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_315f7d8", "Alright, I'm interested.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_34efde77", "She and her gang crippled an Imperial bacta freighter on the edge of the Dathomir system. Left the crew alive, made off with some components. After the rescue team got the freighter to the Imperial base and unloaded the bacta... they found that Juree's gang had poisoned the whole supply. Killed hundreds.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_3552cf48", "I don't think there's many lowlifes out there who could take you one-on-one, %NU. Maybe you'd find three villains more challenging?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_37778692", "A hunter like me?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_3a71c840", "You betrayed me! Now get out of here, %NU!");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_3aeefc74", "How will I recognize him?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_412a3b40", "So tell me then... what do you know about the 'Avenger of Alderaan?'");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_42a7f468", "Well if it isn't the famous %TU... bounty hunter extraordinaire! What can I do for you today?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_43d9d825", "You failed that mission? Terrible! Here it is again... for a price.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_44ca831b", "Where will I find him?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_47efee53", "(Pay 500 credits)");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_4f7b0318", "Good... then there's just the small matter of payment...");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_4fb7a65d", "He's been lurking around the Dathomir system for a while now. The Empire thinks he may have acquired hired some low-rent mercenaries for protection.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_53fb1d89", "Nobody needs to know the truth.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_5e49253", "That's good news, I guess. You know, word is getting around that you are responsible for all of my recent success... and it's starting to make me look bad!");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_6a1562ad", "What do you want?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_6bd02793", "Nothing.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_6bef416f", "The Bwar Brothers are history.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_6c03db3", "Nothing. I was just leaving.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_782c3536", "See you later.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_785a9a91", "I'm sure they won't be any threat to you, %NU.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_7e1ada01", "Yeah, yeah...");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_89b2deb1", "What are you still doing around here?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_90ae19e2", "Well this 'Avenger' managed to work his way onto the Empire's most wanted list. They'll pay handsomely if you hunt him down... enough to make you forget about having to pay my 500 credit fee. What do you say?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_92ccbd55", "Get on with it.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_94e8b49c", "Good. I like parting friends. It's much simpler, you know?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_958f6d7d", "I give you all the info you'll need to track down and vaporize this degenerate killer. What do you say?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_9bd0f533", "Good. Stay gone, Bounty Hunter!");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_9c098d52", "You have failed the mission? Here it is again... for a price.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_9caba7d5", "It's not wise for you to linger here in Dathomir system, my friend.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_a0102a9", "We can get started for the low, low price of 500 credits.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_a019416c", "Rae'Lux was no match for me.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_a0277a4c", "How will I know him?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_a351fef0", "Too late, %NU. The damage is done. Now, I want you out of here. It's only fair that I offer you one final mission, with good payout... before you go away for good. Do you think we can make a deal?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_a366b511", "So. Tell me...");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_a560e84c", "I am looking for work.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_a6425c9", "I think we can arrange something. There are three or four fresh bounties on the Imperial 'net. For the right price, I can give you exclusive rights to the contracts. Are you interested?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_a6519855", "Good work, %NU. You were good for business. Here's an extra thousand to get you on your way.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_a80d9308", "Good luck!");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_aa66418e", "So you made it, huh?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_af58f306", "Word on the street... Rae'Lux likes to hide in the Witchblood nebula. They tell me he leaps out of the clouds every now and again to rob deep space transports that are flying solo.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_b5a05d56", "Perhaps you have heard of the Bwar Brothers from Tatooine? An infamous trio of kidnappers who terrorized the Outer Rim for years before Jabba's henchmen ran them off. Guess they were bad for business...");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_ba82c312", "And you promise to leave once you've eliminated the target and gotten your reward?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_c0917a4d", "Good. Keep leaving...");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_ca932c28", "Forget it.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_d030521", "Bah, leave me be!");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_d1a93a0e", "What's the reward?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_d424c740", "I was just leaving.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_dc649bb3", "I'm on my way!");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_e42b260e", "I'm on my way.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_e6772f13", "Goodbye.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_ecaf7e94", "So, your target is a vile killer named Gutcher Gorai. He was convicted of twenty counts before they finally caught him on Coruscant. Too bad for the Empire he got away. Good for you though, huh?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_edddcc46", "What does 500 credits get me?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_f0b711b4", "Gutcher Gorai favors a Hutt-style chassis that has been heavily modified with illegal equipment. Some say his weapon system is overcharged with some sort of distressed codellium capacitor.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_f1bd52fe", "Then we have nothing more to say to each other. You're dead to me, %NU. Dead. So vanish... like dead people vanish...");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_f8a99129", "(Pay the 500 credits)");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_fafc5a4e", "Good luck, Bounty Hunter.");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_fb42a64c", "Still alive, huh?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_fc70ad30", "So you're looking for a pilot calling himself Rae'Lux... convicted of detonating over a dozen civilian transports in the Naboo system. Thinks he can find refuge here on Dathomir. You'll show him otherwise, eh?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_fe02e665", "What did she do wrong?");
stringFiles[213].addEntry("s_ff607592", "What's it to you?");

stringFiles[214] = new StringFile("conversation/death_watch_foreman");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (death_watch_foreman) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_1265571c", "So I will have to take the battery from him by force?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_145fd34", "Not yet, but I will get this battery cleaned soon.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_1511575f", "Hey you are back again. You know Haldo is still running around down here with our battery. Are you sure you don't want to give us a hand and try to get it back for us?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_18426338", "Hey all I know is that this stuff is used in the making of the armor. They keep a pretty tight watch on how much of this stuff we mine, but I know I can sneak you some every now and again. Here you go. If you check back with me occasionally, I should be able to sneak you out some more. Not too often mind you, but I will do my best.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_19ecd0cd", "Have you sent anyone out to try to find Haldo?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_1b208070", "Hey you managed to get all of the pumps online and to my knowledge didn't destroy all of them in the process. That is surprising considering your track record for violence. Well a deal is a deal so tell you what I will get you some of this ore that we are mining.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_1c4d0bbb", "You work for the Mandalorians?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_1d1d45a9", "Hey it is you again. Glad to still you are still breathing. If you have come looking for ore I am sorry but I can't sneak you out any right now. The Mandalorians are running inventory right now and will notice anything that is missing. Check back with me later.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_1fe41c46", "It's this blasted laser they have us working with. Dumb thing never works right and then when we finally did get it working again, Haldo went off his rocker, ripped its battery out, and took off with it.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_2236f9d7", "If he is sick is there anyway to help him?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_23237572", "I would love to but the Mandalorians keep track of who comes and goes from the workshop. If one of us goes in they will ask why and I would rather they didn't know about the whole Haldo incident. Since you are a stranger they will just correctly assume you are an intruder and try to kill you...which they probably have been doing anyways.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_23cbff5d", "Choice is yours. We will figure out some other way to get them online I suppose.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_262e7b86", "Deal. Now listen those pumps can be tricky. Generally when you trip one of the valves it causes the one or ones next to it on the circuit to flip as well.  You will have to play with it for a while in order to get them all online. Also we really don't have a lot of time so if you are not back soon I am going to have to see if there is anything else I can do to get it on.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_26fa42a7", "Yes I will see if I can find him for you.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_27b9acbc", "Thank you for helping Haldo and getting the battery back for us. Now we can get back to....oh no! The battery's connections are all covered with dirt and grime. Haldo must have got them dirty after he took it.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_286d283f", "The drill uses a liquid coolant system in order to keep it from overheating and exploding. Well the problem is that we are not getting any pressure down here so if we turn on the drill...BOOM!");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_2de77a24", "Why aren't you getting any work done?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_3055077f", "I don't really have time for this right now, sorry.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_31e8b478", "That is up to you. If you change your mind come on back.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_3310d1b6", "I guess I should thank you for getting us the battery back but you didn't have to kill Haldo. He was sick in the head from the fumes and the medicine from the medical droid could have cured him.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_3b67f1eb", "Ok, please hurry because the Mandalorians will be wondering were their ore is shortly.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_3f363bf3", "No need to be sarcastic. The Mandalorians keep us under a pretty tight watch down here. They don't really trust anyone who isn't Mandalorian and then they will only partially trust you.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_44557f4a", "It is located upstairs in the medical lab. One of the medical droids should be able to give it to you. They don't require any special code or anything to help you out. At least they didn't last time I used them but the Mandalorians don't really consult us when they make changes to things around here.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_44bb7cbc", "What is the other problem with the drill?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_45d9624a", "Yeah, well there is a cure. We would have gone and got it, but the Mandalorians don't much care for us wandering around when we are supposed to be working, so none of us have gone up to get it.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_471cd71d", "That would be a lifesaver. No one else is willing to go out and try to find him. Guys who get hit with alum sickness generally are unstable and sometimes can be quite dangerous.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_4af1601a", "So you are back? We still don't have any water pressure down here maybe you would like to head back up and try again?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_4d8102d5", "In an odd sort of way, that makes sense. Ok, I will do it.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_4e099c6a", "So who is this Haldo guy who ran off with your battery?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_4f17ac67", "Have you managed to find Haldo yet? We really need that battery back before the Mandalorians come down here to check up on our progress.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_51b7892e", "Well you see the problem is the Mandalorians have been monitoring our use of workshop. If one of us goes, they will ask why and then find out about Haldo. If you go, then they will just know a stranger has been in here. Since they will most likely try to kill you on site, I figured there wouldn't be any harm done.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_52f3e83e", "This is the same ore that the Mandalores use to make their armor. I am willing to sneak you some but you are going to need to make some room in your inventory so I can.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_54ee97f2", "I don't really have time to deal with this right now.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_5597accd", "How about a reward?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_57097d43", "Don't worry about me and the Mandalorians. I can handle them.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_579c9bc5", "Well that battery doesn't really do us alot of good in its current state. Why don't you hold onto it and if you do get a chance run it over to the workshop and get it cleaned. We would really appreciate it.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_58a87fe", "So who is this Haldo?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_5af847c7", "You are going to have to clear out some inventory space in order for me to give you any more of this ore.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_5c4119d", "No need to be sarcastic. The Mandalorians keep us under a pretty tight watch down here. They don't really trust anyone who isn't mandalorian and then they will only partially trust you.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_5dbddef", "How do you get it cleaned off?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_6204ccac", "Good point. Ok I will take the battery to the workshop.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_637e6c80", "I have received authorization from the Mandalorians.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_63fae5b4", "You know I can't thank you enough. Without your help there is no way we could get this job completed on time.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_645da2b5", "I asked for volunteers but no one was willing to go search. Not that I blame them, I don't even want to go out and try to find him. People with alum sickness become real messed up in the head. You never know what they are going to do. A lot of times they get really violent.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_6864fcd4", "Good. Once you get those pumps back online come on back and we will discuss what I owe you.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_687ef712", "Haldo? Who is Haldo and why would he take the battery?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_6b8a415c", "Remember those pumps can be tricky. Generally when you trip one of the valves it causes the one or ones next to it on the circuit to flip as well.  You will have to play with it for a while in order to get them all online.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_6c1f32dd", "Where can I find this cure?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_6d069da0", "You're braver then I will ever be. But if you really are that tough, maybe you would like to help recover our drill battery that Haldo ran off with?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_71ad5afa", "I am sorry but I don't really have time to help your sick co-worker.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_728cbacc", "Why don't one of you go take it to the workshop?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_787e689e", "I figured you would be up for that whole danger thing. Once the treadwell has cleaned the battery, come on back to me so we can get that battery installed back into the drill.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_7a654750", "Work in the loosest sense of the word. Although we are not really getting a whole lot of work done at this moment.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_7b9dc7c7", "Have you managed to get that battery cleaned yet?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_7d2eea07", "So what are you all doing down here?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_7d65b570", "What sort of work are you doing?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_7fe1c6d7", "Let me guess. It's something that your guys can't do either.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_81b8b95b", "Yeah, yeah...whatever you say there pally. I wouldn't want to be in your shoes if the Mandalorians catch you down here bothering their miners.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_82599d96", "Sounds fun. But didn't you say you weren't getting much done?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_829888a9", "Here you go.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_83d1549d", "What do you need in order to get water pressure down here?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_8405256c", "Deal. Now listen those pumps can be tricky. Generally when you trip one of the valves it causes the one or ones next to it on the circuit to flip as well.  You will have to play with it for a while in order to get them all online. There isn't much time...oh yeah, and try not to destroy the pumps while you are at it.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_8bbe4b84", "Maybe I can help you track down Haldo.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_8dc6968d", "Hey, what are you doing down here? You shouldn't be walking around down here unless you are working or the Mandalorians authorized you to be here and you certainly don't have the look of a miner.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_8deeb761", "It's old technology. The Mandalorians don't exactly splurge on mining equipment. In fact if you havn't noticed already nothing around here is exactly in tip top shape.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_8f36c784", "Ok, well if you change your mind you know where I am.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_95879f15", "Hey it is not just any ore. This is the stuff that the Mandalorians use in their armor. They keep a pretty careful track of what we mine but I know that I can sneak you some of this stuff without them noticing it.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_968923c1", "Sounds to me like you should be happy you're not working.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_9b4dd6c7", "Yeah, I suppose you did. Let me take a look at it. Oh no, this battery isn't going to do us any good. Look here all the connections on it are covered with dirt and grime. Now it is going to have to be cleaned off.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_9bea7011", "Ok, cool your jets. I am on it.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_9cf7119e", "We won't get a good solid connection and the drill won't fire is what will happen. I hate to ask but could you perhaps take this battery over to the workshop and have one of treadwell clean it up?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_9e37f61f", "Another stranger? The Mandalorians must be really slacking on their defenses lately. Oh well, none of my business. I am sorry but I really have to get back to work right now, maybe I will have time to talk to you later.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_a33b6055", "Let me guess. It is something that your guys can't do either.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_a618b93a", "No thanks, I think I will avoid the workshop if it is monitored.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_ac0e598b", "Its this blasted laser they have us working with. Dumb thing never works right and then when we finally did get it working again, Haldo went off his rocker, ripped it's battery out, and took off with it.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_b491aba5", "You are still using liquid coolant for you laser drill?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_b4feb773", "We don't really have a whole lot to give but I will tell you what. I can sneak you some of this ore that we are mining. Now before you get all mad about just getting ore let me tell you that this is the stuff that the Mandalores use in their armor.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_b5a845f9", "Ok, I will take it over to the workshop for you.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_b75a73ed", "Yeah right. The Mandalorains are expecting their ore and they don't much like excuses. If we can't get this drill back online and get back on schedule...well lets just say I prefer to it not coming to that.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_b7c0824", "That is the best news that I have heard all day. If you get that battery come on back to me and I will see about getting this drill back online.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_b99aaac2", "No thanks, I can't figure out how to get those pumps to work.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_baac9005", "I don't really have time to rescue your battery.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_bc5213a", "Just speak to the treadwell when you are in there and he will take care of the dirty battery. Oh and try not to kill him while you are there. We sort of need him for repairs around this place.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_bdb717fb", "What happens if the battery connections are dirty?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_c04f0d0d", "I risked my life for some ore?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_c1dc6296", "I don't know how you managed to get those pumps working without the Mandalorians taking you out. You must be a lot tougher then you look. I can't thank you enough for all your help.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_c2d12633", "Haldo was one of the men on my crew. My guess is that his rebreather wasn't working properly and he breathed too much of the alum fumes. Blasted air vents haven't been working right either, so we have been using our masks a lot.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_c7f1e2ee", "Hey now! I didn't say anything about using force on him. He is sick and there is a cure up in the medical lab. Granted there have been a few cases where alum sickness will make a person so demented that they can't come back, but Haldo has only been ill for a little while.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_c825f420", "Not yet, but I am still looking for him.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_ce027a15", "Ok I will go see what I can do for your co-worker.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_d1b18b50", "It is located upstairs in the medical lab. One of the medical droids should be able to give it to you. They don't require any special code or anything to help you out. At least they didn't last time I used them, but the Mandalorians don't really consult us when they make changes to things around here.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_d1eff807", "Could you do us one more favor and take this battery over to the workshop. The treadwell in there can clean it off without any problems.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_d4b1da9f", "Ok fine I will do this for you but you are going to owe me.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_d62e85a9", "You wanted the battery back and I got it back for you.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_d8f6c63f", "Yeah, well I guess it was to much to ask of a complete stranger but I was hoping that it would all work out. Wish us luck because we are going to need it.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_d9db9b00", "Hey your back. I am sorry but right now we are having a bit of a crisis. I know I told you to hurry back but right now I simply don't have any time to talk to you. Could you please come back to me in a little while.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_dbf0d0f9", "Thank you, I could really use some more of that.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_dc1d4717", "Sounds to me like you should be happy your not working.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_dd657c44", "Sure, I will come back to you as soon as I get it cleaned.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_dd6f26cc", "We mine for the alum that the Mandalores use to make their armor. Basically, we get to work down in these nasty caves all day long so the Mandalorians can look nice.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_dd7c0dd3", "Hey, you're back. I was sort of half expecting you not to return. Oh yeah, this is excellent. The battery is clean and ready to be installed in the drill. Unfortunately there is one other issue that we are having.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_de4a182e", "What are you doing back here. We still don't have any water pressure down here. I am telling you that we don't have very much time left.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_de774e37", "Great. Now remember there is some medicine in the medical lab that should be able to help him out. And once you get that battery bring it on back to me so we can get this drill working again.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_e1dd8e6e", "Good to see you again my friend. I was able to secure some more of this ore for you. If you need some more check back with me later and maybe I can sneak some more out under the noses of the Mandalorians.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_e55f453d", "Yes, I will give it another shot.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_e5e9e886", "Upstairs there is a pump room. There are four pumps that all need to be on in order to get the water down to us. Unfortunately the circuit breakers on those things are all ancient and trip at the slightest surge. If you could maybe go up there and turn them all on for us I know we could get underway.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_e83ca277", "I guess it isn't that bad. The Mandalorians don't pay us a whole lot but they generally don't directly mistreat any of us unless we do something to make them mad...which doesn't seem that hard to do. Hmmmm...now that I think about it this isn't the best life but it is better then telling them we quit.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_ed0d4e5a", "You make Mandalorian armor out of this ore?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_f2b532b6", "Who is this Haldo fellow?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_f46d76f6", "Hey you are back. I was sort of half expecting you not to return. Oh yeah, this is excellent. The battery is clean and ready to be installed in the drill. And you didn't destroy the treadwell...thats a plus. Unfortunately there is one other issue that we are having.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_f4fd5da3", "That is the best news that I have heard all day. If you get that battery, come on back to me and I will see about getting this drill back online.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_f501c596", "No thanks, I can't look for him right now.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_f73c5ae7", "Where can I find this cure if I decide to help out?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_f7962ef3", "Can't you have one of your other guys take care of this?");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_f79fa021", "That is pretty much what I expected. I would have been shocked if a complete stranger such as yourself offered to help us out.");
stringFiles[214].addEntry("s_fb5cf4cd", "Ok, please hurry. I am sure that we don't have a whole lot of time left. Once you get the battery come back to me as quick as you can.");

stringFiles[215] = new StringFile("conversation/death_watch_imperial_herald");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (death_watch_imperial_herald) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_126d6e08", "Excellent, soldier! You'll need to find the Death Watch hideout on Endor. It can be located in the northwestern part of the planet. We need for you to find their leader and bring a sample of his blood back to us. You will be well rewarded.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_16f71658", "The Death Watch hideout can be found on Endor in the northwestern part of the planet. Be cautious and bring your friends with you. I hear they do not take prisoners and enjoying killing intruders.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_1a897bb0", "You have returned! Did you complete your mission?");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_1b104a9f", "A well-trained group of killers and thieves. If I were you, I'd be careful. It would be smart to bring along a few of your friends, but it's up to you.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_210b4c5b", "Yes, I will!");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_2979d13", "Morals?! Get out of here! You are a disgrace to the Empire.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_2c258e47", "Excellent! You have done great work for the Empire. I can only give you very little. You have my gratitude.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_2e8ff1b4", "I am incredibly busy right now. The Empire demands that I concentrate fully on my assignment. Come back a little later and talk with me. I may have a task for you to do.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_382404f", "Very well. Be quick about it and return to us with good news!");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_406804c7", "You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_43908466", "Uh. Why do you want blood?");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_4e028860", "The Death Watch Hideout is located on Endor and can be found in the northwestern part of the planet. You'll need to find the leader and destroy him. Be sure to bring back a blood sample. That is all.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_4f1e472e", "I have your blood sample right here.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_527f9e64", "Ah, a fellow member of the glorious Empire! You came just in time. We need one of our trusted soldiers to fetch something for us. It is a chance, not only to fulfill a difficult mission and receive praise from the Empire, but to gather information regarding the Death Watch and their point of operations. Are you interested?");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_55aa1278", "I need more information regarding my mission.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_5bc39fc9", "I need to find the hideout again.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_622c3f31", "A soldier shouldn't ask his commanding officer questions! But if you must know... The Empire seems to think that leader of the Death Watch would make a good candidate for a Prime Clone for a new batch of stormtroopers. However, we'll need for you to kill this so-called leader. There's no sense in keeping him around. We've learned our lesson from the past. Well. Will you accept your mission?");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_6405e2a0", "Sounds too dangerous for me.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_68732e54", "Soldier. How may I help you? You are well viewed in the eyes of the Empire for your help earlier.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_6decea2a", "Okay. I will help.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_71f459c7", "I see. Well, then. We will wait for another promising subject to accept the mission. You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_732f795f", "Good, then! Be quick about it!");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_79b531ae", "I am sorry to hear this. We were so close to our goal. Very well, then. You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_8107be6d", "No, it sounds dangerous.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_aaed8520", "Good! Bye!");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_b2cb2cbf", "I can only accept so many samples. We have what we need now. Thank you, however, for checking back with us. You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_b6b25f13", "Yes, sir!");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_d441c51a", "I do not acknowledge those that do not belong to the Empire. Be gone.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_dc839e59", "No, I'm still looking into it.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_e478107c", "Good! Now go to the Death Watch hideout and slay this so-called leader. Don't forget to bring back a sample of his blood for us. We'll need it for future... experimentations.");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_e62fc90c", "Yes, sir! Right away!");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_ecc5dd3c", "Wait. Who are these Death Watch operatives?");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_f61ed984", "No, that's just... wrong!");
stringFiles[215].addEntry("s_f70821a3", "I quit!");

stringFiles[216] = new StringFile("conversation/death_watch_insane_miner");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (death_watch_insane_miner) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_16968d33", "Don't worry I will go get you some right now.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_21632dd", "My head! I cannot think straight. Please get me some help before I hurt anyone...it has to be allum sickness!");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_2efed805", "You must hurry! I cannot hold onto my sanity for very much longer.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_2ff0df5", "Please hurry! I don't know how much longer I can hold onto my sanity. If I don't get that medicine quick I am going to lose control.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_3fb7180e", "Allum sickness? What can I do to help you?");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_42a2316b", "Yes I have it. Here you go.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_4fe1bc67", "I don't think so! Sorry, but you need to be taken down.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_7c3e9069", "You are a danger to everyone and need to be taken down.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_7c83bd45", "Sorry but I don't have it yet. I will come back when I get it.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_829888a9", "Here you go.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_87bb258b", "The medical droid upstairs? Yes! The medical droid has the antidote. I need it...I must have some before it is to late.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_99f3d3be", "You won't help me...no you must...no...arrrrgh!!!");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_c2b7bf76", "You cannot help me! No one can help me...go away!");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_ce67a12e", "You are back. Please tell me that you have the medicine. I am really struggling to keep my sanity right now and that medicine is my only hope.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_dad50efa", "I have some of the medicine on me.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_e810685f", "Thank you, thank you. You have saved my life. I should be fine with just a little rest. Please take this back to my foreman. I took it in my dementia.");
stringFiles[216].addEntry("s_ea390b92", "Please, you must give it to me. Without that medicine I will surely die!");

stringFiles[217] = new StringFile("conversation/death_watch_medical_droid");
stringFiles[217].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (death_watch_medical_droid) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[217].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[217].addEntry("s_22f2cc9b", "Welcome. I am medical droid designation G12-4J. How may I be of service to you?");
stringFiles[217].addEntry("s_46d286cc", "I would like to issue you the alum sickness cure medication but you do not have any room in your inventory. Please speak to me again once you have cleared up some space.");
stringFiles[217].addEntry("s_52a263b9", "Please return if there is anything that I can be of service to you for. Thank you.");
stringFiles[217].addEntry("s_6a6a070d", "Alum sickness cure has been issued. Please administer to the subject directly and allow for medicine to take effect. Resume normal, unpolluted breathing or alum sickness may return. Thank you.");
stringFiles[217].addEntry("s_82d3782a", "I don't think there is anything that I need.");
stringFiles[217].addEntry("s_ab36bcfc", "I need some medicine to cure alum sickness.");

stringFiles[218] = new StringFile("conversation/death_watch_rebel_herald");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (death_watch_rebel_herald) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_28f5f7c5", "Where is the hideout again?");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_2d06d9f7", "The Death Watch Operatives are located on Endor in the northwestern part of the planet. Our scientist is somewhere within their hideout. I suspect he'll be heavily guarded. He needs to be rescued before he is executed. Please be quick about it! We haven't any time to lose.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_2d4bb338", "May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_37890704", "Very well. A reasonable request, indeed. The Death Watch Operatives are located on Endor in the northwestern part of the planet. Our scientist is somewhere within their hideout. I suspect he'll be heavily guarded. He needs to be rescued before he is executed. We need someone to help us and we're looking to you as our only hope.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_37b46abd", "Excellent! Your reward as promised. I know it isn't much. I greatly appreciate your efforts.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_4f240e90", "I can't help you.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_5c3cdba4", "I will help you.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_62104343", "Slow down. Help with what?");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_65aa1cd5", "Thank you for your help earlier. We are very grateful.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_6f2c6f44", "I need more information regarding these Death Watch fellas.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_7089401b", "The hideout is located on Endor and can be found northwestern part of the planet. Be careful. They can be a deadly bunch.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_823eed0c", "Yes, I will help you!");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_8361bfd1", "You have returned! Were you successful in rescuing our scientist?");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_88a6fa7d", "This distresses me. Very well. You have been lifted from your mission.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_8d495981", "Actually, I need more information.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_91db32fc", "I can't speak right now. My current mission is demanding that I stay focused. I invite you to return at a later date. I may have a few tasks for you then.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_938e28a4", "No, I can't. Find someone else.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_940cb841", "Haven't you heard about the kidnapping? You are of the Alliance, aren't you? Are you here to help us?");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_95369855", "Hmm.. you don't seem to be 'one of us'. I must ask you to leave. I'm waiting for someone else. I have nothing more to say to you.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_9b06da0", "Yes, I rescued the scientist successfully.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_a0822589", "Uh.. what?");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_aa852a2c", "One of our neutral contacts has been kidnapped by the Death Watch operatives on Endor. We need someone to rescue him. Naturally, we can only trust a fellow member of the Alliance. You came at the perfect time and would be an excellent candidiate to help us in our cause. Will you help us? ");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_afdd35a1", "Pity. I will find someone else. Take care.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_bfe5e691", "Finally, you've come! We've been waiting for you!");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_c1c188ab", "No problem. Bye!");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_dc839e59", "No, I'm still looking into it.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_e99ef1de", "I see. Please be quick in rescuing our ally. We will suffer greatly if he should perish.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_f0d30da9", "Thank you saving the scientist earlier. Unfortunately, you've already received your reward. I wish you well on your journey.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_f4474b2c", "Excellent! Travel to the Death Watch hideout on Endor. It can be found in the northwestern part of the planet. Be quick about it and rescue our scientist! There's no telling what will happen to him if we aren't swift.");
stringFiles[218].addEntry("s_f70821a3", "I quit!");

stringFiles[219] = new StringFile("conversation/death_watch_rescue_scientist");
stringFiles[219].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (death_watch_rescue_scientist) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[219].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[219].addEntry("s_8801c9a5", "Thank you for rescuing me. I am truly in your debt. Forgive me, but I must get out of here quickly. Thank you again.");
stringFiles[219].addEntry("s_b4b8c363", "Whew! Thank you for rescuing me. I appreciate it! I have to get out of here quickly!");
stringFiles[219].addEntry("s_bbc873d5", "Thank you for saving me earlier. Getting out is harder than I thought. I'm devising my plan for escape now. You needn't worry about me anymore.");
stringFiles[219].addEntry("s_d3b5ac87", "Ah! I'm so glad you've come! I thought I was done for! Here, take this as a symbol of my appreciation. I need to get out of here!");

stringFiles[220] = new StringFile("conversation/death_watch_scientist");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (death_watch_scientist) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_14718ef0", "Oh, the Death Watch are very clever about that indeed.  If your man, or woman, should fail to complete the manufacturing process you and your entire group will be evacuated from the bunker.  Quite clever indeed.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_1a745122", "Biceps, boots, and the chest plate. ");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_2313ac9e", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_25d8aa7d", "Ah.  You'll need a master droid engineer to work the console.  It's very simple really, as long as you have all the parts.  You need the piece of armor you're converting...you do realize you can only convert the bounty hunter armor into Mandalorian armor don't you?  Very good, very good.  You'll need that piece first.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_2f08b49c", "To be honest, I'm not really sure.  It's not teleportation, not really, though it's the beginnings of that technology.  It would be wonderful to be able to study in that field, wouldn't it?  But I digress.  You have what you need from me.  Now leave me to my work, please.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_378814dd", "Bracers and helmet.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_499c388b", "Tell me what I want or I'll rip your heart out!");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_4b6c9d58", "Simple.  You take it to the droids deeper inside the base.  One droid for each category, you see?  You give all the items to the droid, and then you'll need the armorsmith, a master of his craft, to work the controls.  In fact, you'll need him just to get into the room.  Once all the ingredients are given to the droid that's it.  The piece will be made by the droid itself, and spit back out to your crafter.  Assuming he works the terminal properly.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_504b2f50", "What did you mean about the eyes?");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_58a0e26", "What do I do once I have all this?");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_59959987", "Ah.  You'll need a master armor smith to work the console.  It's very simple really, as long as you have all the parts.  You need the piece of armor you're converting...you do realize you can only convert the bounty hunter armor into Mandalorian armor don't you?  Very good, very good.  You'll need that piece first.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_5c9a6921", "I need information.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_63e494d6", "Tell me about the armor.  No more chatter.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_6462ee3d", "No more chatter.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_66da3f03", "Don't shoot us!  We're just technicians!");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_6789e90e", "What else?");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_6a31dcdf", "Anything.  You're not with--I thought you were--It's the look you see.  You don't have the look in the eyes like they do.  That stare...");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_76196af", "Oh, the Death Watch are very clever about that indeed.  If your man should fail to complete the manufacturing process you and your entire group will be evacuated from the bunker.  Quite clever indeed.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_8a0630b2", "Very well.  What type are you trying to make?  They're all different you know.  They are broken up into three categories, however.  Leggings, gloves, and the belt are a category to themselves.   The bracers and the helmet are a second category.  The third is the biceps, chest plate, and boots.  Which one are you looking for?");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_8d3d9470", "How do they do it?");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_8ea92d7b", "The eyes of these men are dead.  They frighten me.  I don't think anything matters to them anymore but killing...");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_a7d1b9b8", "Simple.  You take it to the droids deeper inside the base.  One droid for each category, you see?  You give all the items to the droid, and then you'll need the tailor, a master of his craft, to work the controls.  In fact, you'll need him just to get into the room.  Once all the ingredients are given to the droid that's it.  The piece will be made by the droid itself, and spit back out to your crafter.  Assuming he works the terminal properly.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_aabf00d1", "You're just like them aren't you?  You'd really do it.  I think you'd kill me if I looked at you the wrong way.  You shouldn't be here fighting the Death Watch.  You should be signing up.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_ac332e1a", "Of course.  It's what everyone wanted to know isn't it?  The armor.  Everyone wants something don't they?");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_be3bfbe9", "Leggings, gloves, and belt.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_c8dd74ed", "Alum, from the mines below.  I don't know how you'll get that.  You may have to talk to the miners down there.  Just like us they are...slaves.  And you'll need the two chemicals.  The protective coating and the binary liquid.  I honestly don't know where you can get any more of that.  Our supply was cleaned out.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_e11df8ba", "What if he doesn't work it properly?");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_e32f0a5b", "Ah.  You'll need a master tailor to work the console.  It's very simple really, as long as you have all the parts.  You need the piece of armor you're converting...you do realize you can only convert the bounty hunter armor into Mandalorian armor don't you?  Very good, very good.  You'll need that piece first.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_e45dce3", "These hooligans, this...Death Watch.  They're like the Mandalorians.  Oh it's so horrible.  They threated my daughter.  They said they'd kill her if I didn't do what they said.  I've been trapped here for...Oh my...I don't even know how long.");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_e7b6a48e", "What about the armor?  Can you tell me about that?");
stringFiles[220].addEntry("s_ef0cca06", "Simple.  You take it to the droids deeper inside the base.  One droid for each category, you see?  You give all the items to the droid, and then you'll need the droid engineer, a master of his craft, to work the controls.  In fact, you'll need him just to get into the room.  Once all the ingredients are given to the droid that's it.  The piece will be made by the droid itself, and spit back out to your crafter.  Assuming he works the terminal properly.");

stringFiles[221] = new StringFile("conversation/death_watch_technician");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (death_watch_technician) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_17aa7854", "I can do that. Send in the droid and I will take care of the Mandalorians.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_1a05844b", "Hmmm, I am not going to do that. Those Mandalorians are nasty.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_1cc2ceff", "I see. So.... what sort of work do you do here?");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_1fb416ce", "Give me a few minutes. I just sent out one of my droids on a dangerous mission with an escort. I am hoping that this works.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_25e933d3", "I am an exhaust ventilation technician for the mines. It is my job to make sure that the mine's exhaust system is working correctly. Of course, that is when the Mandalorians let me do my job.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_32b29b58", "You are going to have to give me a little while to get another droid put together. Come back and talk to me later. If I still need the help, I will be more than willing to take it.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_33381eda", "I can't thank you enough for helping me out back there. The exhaust fans are back online and the miners should be safe for a while at least. That exhaust system is pretty iffy and shorts out alot. I think the Mandalorians are breaking it on purpose just so they can have their fun.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_373533eb", "You know it. I will protect that droid.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_3bc0260c", "Those Mandalorians are to much for me.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_3cab69e3", "Hey, you don't know how happy I am to see you again. The exhaust system went offline again and...that's right...you guessed it...those Mandalorians are at it again. You willing to give me a hand again?");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_3f1a842c", "Yeah, yeah.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_406a4ae2", "Sounds like you do have it rough.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_45ae332c", "The mines fill up with allum gas. That stuff can really mess up the men working inside the mines. So all the miners have to wear the rebreather gear in order to work down there, but those things are not always reliable.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_72f8ec3a", "Okay, well, good luck with that.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_7d875e15", "Give me another chance. I know I can keep that droid alive.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_89b80057", "Can't say I blame you.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_8b67f49d", "Hmm, who are you? Actually, nevermind. I don't want to know. If the Mandalorians don't want you here, they can take care of you themselves. It's not like they ever help me. No, not them. They tell me to get a job done and then don't let me do it.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_9a8c12bc", "I knew I could count on you. Okay, I am going to unleash the droid now. Good luck to you.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_a0c1a32f", "What are the Mandalorians doing to stop you from working?");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_a8fb8b64", "The main exhaust ports are offline and I need to send in a droid to fix it. But everytime I send in one of my droids, these dumb Mandalorians shoot it to pieces. Then, they laugh about it all the while yelling at me for not having the ports back online.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_aad4d52", "Oh, well, I am sure I will figure something else out. Thanks anyways.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_bb1676fc", "Having problems with the Mandalorians?");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_bb18b90f", "Ain't that the truth. Now, if there isn't anything else, I really need to get back to trying to figure out a way to get those dumb Mandalorians not to trash another one of my droids.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_bd52a08a", "Blast it! Lost another droid. I swear those Mandalorians are just relentless when they feel the need to torment someone.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_bd5476c4", "Maybe I can help you out?");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_c4446dd7", "What happens if the mine's exhaust system isn't working?");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_c74f6e65", "The only thing that I can think of to help me out is if you go in with the droid and don't let the Mandalorians blow it up. If you are willing to do that, you have way more guts than I would ever have.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_cba682eb", "What are you doing back here? You are supposed to be protecting that droid. Without your protection, those Mandalorians will blow him to bits.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_cbf95857", "I am sorry, but I can't right now.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_d7a232dc", "What sort of job do you do?");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_ebfed4db", "I am sorry, but I really don't have much time to chat right now. Always too much work to do in to little time. Maybe later I will have a spare moment.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_f7d4b8be", "Now that might be a little bit of an understatement. I always have problems with the Mandalorians. They just don't deal well with others... I am thinking that they probably weren't hugged enough when they were children.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_fc578c95", "You are not the first person to say those words.");
stringFiles[221].addEntry("s_fe84832a", "Alright, I am going to release the droid. It has to make a stop over at the tool chest to get some extra tools before it can make the repairs. Keep those Mandalorians off it until it can finish the repairs and these air vents will kick on and clear out the allum gases.");

stringFiles[222] = new StringFile("conversation/death_watch_treadwell");
stringFiles[222].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (death_watch_treadwell) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[222].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[222].addEntry("s_4fcd015f", "Yes you can help me. I was sent to get this battery cleaned.");
stringFiles[222].addEntry("s_8e9e4ef9", "No thank you. I am not need of any assistance.");
stringFiles[222].addEntry("s_9208410d", "...");

stringFiles[223] = new StringFile("conversation/defend_the_village");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (defend_the_village) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_1a9b1371", "I knew I picked the right person for this, I just knew it.  The mercenaries and the pirates are cursing your name this very minute.  You've almost finished what I asked you to do.  All you have to do is get out there and complete this mission.  Good luck, soldier!");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_212d92b3", "Fantastic!  I knew I could count on you.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_2647addd", "Maybe, but I think you're the right person for the job.  Can you do it?");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_2b2d70cd", "No, I think it's too much for me.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_41ea5583", "As I understand it, you already have some assignments from some of the other villagers.  Come back when you don't have so much on your plate.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_64cad97c", "I'm not ready to work right now.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_6e8bed18", "Definitely increasing my ranged speed.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_918a48b8", "Right then.  Speak with me when you're ready.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_95fe56b2", "Melee defense.  No question.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_982a066f", "That's too bad.  I was hoping you'd be more helpful.  Come back if you ever toughen up.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_a2665c7f", "I'd like to thank you for all the hard work you did.  Get some rest, I'm sure at some point in the future we'll need some more help from you, but for now you've earned some R&R.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_a30c1a53", "Yes sir!");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_c382b2d0", "You want me to take out ALL of them?!?");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_c9be571d", "I know you've been working on that problem of ours...you know, with the mercs and the pirates?  But I'm going to need you to work a little harder.  Now get back out there soldier!");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_cb3652f", "Here's what I have.  Outlaws and pirates are swarming this area like Jawas over a speeder engine.  The village's safety is going to rely on reducing the number of hostiles we have in this area.  I'm counting on you to do that.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_d2fe23af", "Easy there recruit.  I have an assignment for you whenever you're ready.  I can give you training after you complete this mission.  Would you be more interested in learning how to fire ranged weapons more quickly, or defending yourself in melee combat?");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_db99c818", "Good.  Come back and see me while you're working on this problem and I'll let you know how things are going.");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_ed6ed8a4", "Sounds like a lot...");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_ee72ef65", "No.  In fact, I just want you to take out a few.  Well, more than a few.  Let's say 50 outlaws.  I think if you can handle that, the rest of them will get the message that this isn't a safe spot for them to hang around.  The pirates, well, there's less of them, so let's say 25 of the pirates.  Can you handle that?");
stringFiles[223].addEntry("s_f9a0517", "Um...sure.");

stringFiles[224] = new StringFile("conversation/destroysample");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (destroysample) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_157082a", "Wouldn't that be murder?  I don't think I can take that job.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_28969bdd", "Excellent.  I'll wire the credits to your account when you bring me sensor validation of the kills.  Good luck.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_32900dd8", "Ah, nicely done!  My people will transfer the credits right away.  You did a good job.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_360ed899", "What?  After I risk my neck trying to hook you up, you try to pass off fake logs?  Come back when you have real results.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_5786ebef", "Yeah, I've got the logs right here.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_5c09875a", "Call me Trent.  I'm looking for work.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_73b20bfc", "Take your time.  The faction I represent is interested in success, even if it means having to wait a little bit.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_bc9b15b3", "Nice to see you, Trent.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_c1fc410f", "Well, you aren't likely to find better around here.  I've got someone else to meet.  Talk to you later.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_cdb71c15", "Hey there Trent.  Do you have the sensor logs confirming your kills?");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_cdc3b4c7", "I have plenty of reasons for hurting the Empire.  Sign me up.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_df17f706", "Nice to meet you, Trent.  I've got a job you might be interested in.  My faction wants help in making things difficult for the Empire.  If you can destroy 5 Tie Fighters, I'll pay you 3,000 credits.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_e0f3deb6", "It's good to be seen.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_f150abd", "Thanks for doing that little job for me.  I'll let you know if there's something else we need done.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_f324f7d5", "I haven't seen you around here before.");
stringFiles[224].addEntry("s_fd6095f2", "No, I haven't finished the job yet.");

stringFiles[225] = new StringFile("conversation/disable_sidequest");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (disable_sidequest) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_1224b289", "(Wait.)");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_16148f5c", "What next?");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_192752ed", "I've heard of him. He flies around Tatooine. I might be able to find him.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_1e6f479b", "You could? [could? could?] Excitement! It is likely [ly ly] that Madd Markos [kos kos kos] still has my primary core [ore ore]. If you locate him you can retrieve it [it it]. You will have to cycle through various ships near Tatooine until you find Markos.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_26966a66", "(Hand him the core.)");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_2b9397ba", "How do I retrieve the core?");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_2bc613ea", "It is a long story [story story]. Due to the inaccuracies in my ability to synthesize speech [speech eeech ch] I will deliver a synopsis [sis sis sis].");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_3019b01e", "I understand that you are demonstrating modesty. I appreciate your assistance. I have some amount of credits I will transfer to you in recognition of your kind act. It is the least I can do to help you, citizen.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_376a2b9c", "And if he has the core?");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_3b78667c", "CSSD-7, I think I can help you. I'll return with your core soon.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_3c6ee0a0", "Greetings citizen. [Greetings citizen. Greetings citizen. Greetings.]");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_3d54f7bd", "They must believe [lieve lieve] they can sell it. They also believed [lieved lieved] that removing my core would destroy me [me me].");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_3e0deaf9", "Oh, my. I apologize. [Apologize. Apologize. Apologize.] My core systems software has been compromised and [and and and] I am unable to communicate without stuttering [stuttering stuttering stuttering].");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_3e25bf08", "Ah! My primary functions are now fully enabled. Performing system check. System Primary Functions are operating within standard guidelines. Warning: Secondary core has been damaged. All other secondary and tertiary systems are operating within standard guidelines.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_46712ca3", "How did you become damaged?");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_53d10098", "I cannot [not not]. I am no longer able to per[per per]form my intended function. I am no [no no] longer able to perform my intended function.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_5d0b3789", "This line is never spoken.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_5ee9bf09", "You [you you you] found my core? I am shocked [shocked shocked shocked] please let me see it.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_5eec7e62", "You may call me 'CS'. Thank you again for your assistance. It feels good to have a functional core. I will go and repair my secondary core immediately. I can't wait to begin working on Neurilemmomas and Astrocytomas again! Excitement!");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_648ee28b", "First, you must disable his ship [ship ship]. To do this, target his ship and [and] select his reactor using CTRL-] (control right bracket). Then fire on him as you would [would] normally. After you inflict some damage, his ship will become disabled [disabled].");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_6a5944bd", "Congratulations, CSSD-7!");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_6b12b256", "I heard you the first time.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_6ea28bdf", "I'm sorry, I didn't realize...");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_72b585f7", "Good luck, CS.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_76eb7e3b", "A local Tatooine pirate [pirate] leader known as [as as as] Madd Markos [mad mad]. The appellation [tion tion] is a result of his behavior after many [many many] brain altering modifications [tions tions].");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_897e7261", "I have become lost [lost lost]. The same fault that affects my speech synthesis [esis esis] has also affected my motor functions [functions functions]. I am unable to properly navigate back [back back] to the medical center.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_907d29f3", "Why didn't it destroy you?");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_90c59f1a", "Third, if he [he] has the core, you [you you] must transfer it to your own ship. Use the /transfer command to load the command core into your hold [hold hold]. It is small so you do not need a cargo ship [ship ship].");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_96d51a4e", "I am equipped with a secondary core [core core]. This is to ensure the [the the the] integrity of my function during a surgical procedure. However, my secondary core [core core] is apparently damaged.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_9b809db7", "It appears to be undamaged [ged ged ged]. Please wait one second while I install it [it it it].");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_9eee12c7", "Ah, yeah you better keep it simple.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_a017debb", "If your motor functions are affected, how can you perform surgery?");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_a4f3fede", "Cerebrospinal? Brain surgery? Why are you out here?");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_a54ac5ac", "What can I say...");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_a893010", "Do not worry [worry worry worry]. I am used to other citizens reacting in that way. I am CS[SSSSSS]SD-7, a 2-1B surgical [surgical surgical] droid. My designation is an abbreviation for 'Cerebrospinal [inal inal inal] Surgical Droid'.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_b1ed67bc", "To state it [it it] simply, I was employed to perform surgical modification [odification] on a local criminal [criminal criminal] warlord. After completing the operation [tion tion tion], the warlord's men assaulted me [me me] and stole my systems core [core core].");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_b451a4a3", "Good to see you again, citizen.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_c5495de6", "They stole your core?");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_c55d7e2", "Good to see [see see] you again, citizen.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_c85fb291", "Thank you, citizen. Without your help I would have been doomed to travel this desert. I can now return to the medical center and continue with my original operational directive. I am in your debt.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_c9e7c48f", "Good to see you, CSSD-7. I found your core.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_d1b59965", "Thank [thank thank] you, citizen. Remember, first disable with CTRL-], then /inspect, then /transfer. I have [have have] confidence in you [you you you]. Good luck [luck luck luck luck luck luck]. Oh my [my my].");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_d28c8e75", "Thank you, CSSD-7.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_d92cbbea", "Who stole your core?");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_de5882b1", "Good luck to you, citizen. Thank you again for your kind act.");
stringFiles[225].addEntry("s_eeeb19c9", "Second, you must inspect his [his his] ship. To do this, you must fly close to the disabled ship [ship ship] and use the /inspect command. After [after] a short time, any unique contents of his ship will be displayed.");

stringFiles[226] = new StringFile("conversation/ep3_trando_herald");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (ep3_trando_herald) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_2", "");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_222", "You again! What do you want?");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_224", "I can't believe this happened! Somehow those wookiees escaped their bonds and sabotaged my ship. I had no choice but to bring it down here for an emergency landing.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_226", "Are these escaped wookiees criminals?");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_228", "They are property of the Blackscale Clan. I was to deliver the cargo to an Imperial facility that is in desperate need of additional labor. Apparently these wookiees have not been properly... trained. They are no good to anyone. Would you be willing to help me deal with this problem?");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_230", "How can you consider sentient beings property? There's no way I'm getting involved with this!");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_232", "Fine, get lost then! I'm sure there's plenty of people here that are looking for a quick pay day.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_234", "If the price is right, I'll do what it takes.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_236", "I knew you looked like a reasonable type. This shipment is ruined and unusuable, therefore they must all be terminated. The Blackscale clan is willing to offer you the sum of 10000 credits if you're able to track down and terminate any of the cargo.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_238", "How do I find them?");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_240", "Each piece of cargo is outfitted with a transponder to track their location so finding them isn't a problem. It also reports their vital signs so we'll know the instant the job is done and we'll wire the pay directly to your account. Sound good?");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_242", "Sounds good.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_244", "Great, I've uploaded the location of one of them to your datapad. Get going and be quick about it! If they get too far away we'll lose their signal and they are as good as gone.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_246", "On second thought, no. This doesn't sound good.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_248", "You've wasted enough of my time then. Take a hike!");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_250", "On second though, I don't think I want to be involved with this.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_252", "You've wasted enough of my time then. Take a hike!");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_254", "Need some help?");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_256", "As a matter of fact, I do. These wookiees are property of the Blackscale clan. I was to deliver the cargo to an Imperial facility that is in desperate need of additional labor. Apparently these wookiees have not been properly... trained. They are no good to anyone. Would you be willing to help me deal with this problem?");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_258", "If the price is right, I'll do whatever it takes.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_260", "I knew you looked like a reasonable type. This shipment is ruined and unusuable, therefore they must all be terminated. The Blackscale clan is willing to offer you the sum of 10000 credits if you're able to track down and terminate any of the cargo.");
