stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_268", "Great, I've uploaded the location of one of them to your datapad. Get going and be quick about it! If they get too far away we'll lose their signal and they are as good as gone.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_270", "On second thought, no. This doesn't sound good.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_272", "You've wasted enough of my time then. Take a hike!");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_274", "On second though, I don't think I want to be involved with this.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_276", "You've wasted enough of my time then. Take a hike!");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_278", "On second though, I don't think I want to be involved with this.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_280", "You've wasted enough of my time then. Take a hike!");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_282", "Whatever happened here, I don't want any part of it.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_284", "Then quit wasting my time and get out of my face!");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_285", "I couldn't find the slave.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_286", "Incompetence! Here's the location of another, now hurry up this time.");
stringFiles[226].addEntry("s_35", "I've heard you're good at what you do. I can't afford your fee so I won't insult you by asking you for help.");

stringFiles[227] = new StringFile("conversation/escortsample");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (escortsample) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_197dcc5d", "Excellent. Meet the transport in the asteroid belt. The Force be with you!");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_20355b4c", "Hi there. So - did you escort our Rebel supply ship?");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_2cbca1ae", "Great! Great work! The Alliance thanks you.");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_30b5d96", "Yes. What do you need done?");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_3b6feb84", "You got that right!");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_440fcf1", "You FAILED! Quitter!");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_546aa4f5", "You got it!");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_64815da3", "The Imperials have squeezed off our major supply route through this system. I have a critical medical supply transport headed through the asteroid belt. I need someone to make sure it survives its trip. You interested?");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_7133d198", "You LIE! Liar! I already got word from the transport that you gave up! Get out of my sight!");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_8acc2fd5", "Yeah. It's safe and sound.");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_8ff3ca72", "Hey escorter! You're a bad-ass escorter!");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_a7887ccd", "Don't waste my time, newbie.  I've got someone else to meet.  Talk to you later.");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_aa630c8f", "Yeah. So what?");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_c8f5aa73", "Sorry. I really don't have the time for this right now.");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_d1d526e", "Take your time. The Force be with you.");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_d6b24fb1", "Can I try again?");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_f150abd", "Thanks for doing that little job for me.  I'll let you know if there's something else we need done.");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_f82b0fd5", "Okay. Let's try again. I have a critical medical supply transport headed through the asteroid belt. I need someone to make sure it survives its trip. You interested?");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_fa88eaf6", "So nothing. Good bye.");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_fb6bb29c", "Hello, pilot! The Alliance is in need of some talented space fighters. Are you interested?");
stringFiles[227].addEntry("s_fd6095f2", "No, I haven't finished the job yet.");

stringFiles[228] = new StringFile("conversation/event_perk_racing");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (event_perk_racing) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_1cd82216", "Get ready... I'll start the timer when you say go!");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_2492930f", "I'd like to see who holds the current record for this track.");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_2528fad7", "GO!!!");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_262e8687", "Uhh, wait a minute.");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_371b3f4", "Displaying current data...");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_4b4fb2b7", "A series of waypoints will appear one after the other. Head to each waypoint as quickly as possible. When you arrive back here, talk to me again and I'll register your last time for this track.");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_6441a2a6", "As you wish.");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_6a5b9858", "The clock is ticking, get moving!");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_891e1f6", "Race completed.");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_ac51e630", "Greetings, I'm the coordinator for this course. If you'd like to race the track, just let me know. How may I serve you today?");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_b2acc217", "And they're off!");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_c0918d6", "No hurry. Let me know when you're ready.");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_d900d1be", "I need to abort this race.");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_dffdee4b", "I'd like to give this track a try.");
stringFiles[228].addEntry("s_e460e3d3", "How do I race?");

stringFiles[229] = new StringFile("conversation/event_promoter");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (event_promoter) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_10", "For a modest sum, you can rent supplies for use in your personal events. Most items rented are received in the form of a deed. Simply deploy the deed in any wilderness area or city that has allowed you zoning rights to set it up. You may rent up to five deeds at a time. The term of rental in most cases is 8 hours starting at the time of purchase. All equipment is automatically returned after that time.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_100", "Hire Personnel");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_102", "This is who we have available.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_104", "Hire Imperial Personnel");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_106", "This is who we have available.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_108", "Hire Alliance Personnel");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_109", "How does the jukebox work?");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_11", "I'm interested in decorations");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_110", "When purchased you will recieve a jukebox in your inventory. You can then drop the jukebox in your home or any other structure you have access rights too. After placing the jukebox, you can use it and select a song to play. Anyone entering the room will hear the music. The jukebox rental term is eight hours, after which it will expire.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_112", "This is who we have available.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_12", "Decorations are simply single items ranging from flags to reproductions of vehicles and other equipment. When you purchase a decoration, simply move to the location where you would like to place it and deploy. The decoration will be placed where you stand.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_14", "Rent Decorations");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_16", "Here is what I have to offer.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_18", "Rent Imperial Themed Decorations");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_2", "");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_20", "Here is what I have to offer.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_22", "Rent Alliance Themed Decorations");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_24", "Here is what I have to offer.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_26", "I'm interested in venues");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_28", "Venues are full set designs and include things such as performance stages, wedding pavilions and even realistic military exhibitions. Some venues also include hired personnel as part of the package. When deployed, your venue will be automatically arranged at a location close to where you used the deed.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_30", "Rent Venue");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_32", "Here is what I have to offer.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_34", "Rent Imperial Themed Venue");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_36", "Here is what I have to offer.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_38", "Rent Rebel Themed Venue");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_4", "Welcome to my shop! I rent a number of goods including decorations, venues, stand alone games and supplies. You can even hire personnel! Our reproductions are of the highest quality and are difficult to distinguish from the real thing. We have everything you need to ensure your event will be a memorable one.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_40", "Here is what I have to offer.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_42", "I'm interested in games and supplies");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_44", "These include stand alone gaming devices as well as supplies to help you with running your own games or events. These include various gaming droids, beacons to call shuttles and chests that you can stock, place and hide for others to find.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_46", "Tell me more about games and supplies.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_48", "What are you interested in hearing more about?");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_50", "What is the Capture the Flag Game?");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_52", "When you deploy the deed for this game a neutral flag is created where you stand. You will be able to specify a time limit for the game. When the game starts, overt members of a faction may attempt to capture the flag and change it to their own. The one who holds the flag for the longest wins the game. Multiple games may be run during rental period.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_54", "What is the Race Droid?");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_56", "This droid will allow you to create and hold your own races. After deploying the droid in the desired location, you can then program the droid with a number of waypoints. When you are satisfied, you can initialize the droid and it will allow racers to run your course and it will record the best time for that track.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_58", "What is the Lottery Droid?");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_60", "The lottery droid will allow you to run a lottery. You can set how long the lottery will run, registration cost and percentage of the total purse that will be paid out. Registration fees are added to the purse. You may also sweeten the pot with your own credits. When the lottery ends, a winner is chosen. Funds are automatically transferred to the winner and any percentage of the pot set aside as the owner's take is also transferred.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_62", "What is the Scavenger Hunt Droid?");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_64", "This droid will allow you to setup and run a scavenger hunt. When deployed, you will show the droid a number of items you would like your participants to find. When the droid is initialized, the game begins. The first one to find all of the items wins.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_66", "What is the Treasure Chest?");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_68", "A variety of styles of chests are available. Styles range from a standard container, to those with special effects and even a very realistic humanoid skeleton. You may place the chest in the wilderness or in any city that has allowed you zoning rights. You (and only you) may add items to the chest. Anyone happening along the chest may take one item from it.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_70", "What is the Shuttle Beacon?");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_72", "The shuttle beacon is a special effects utility that will allow you to call down one of a number of shuttles. You can use the shuttle beacon to have a shuttle land and then to order the shuttle to take off again. Shuttles may be called for the duration of the rental term.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_76", "Rent Games and Supplies");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_78", "Here is what I have to offer.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_80", "I'm interested in hiring personnel");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_82", "There are a number of personnel that may be hired to help give your event that special official sort of ambience. Our actors are highly trained and their costumes are quite authentic.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_84", "What is an Honor Guard?");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_86", "An honor guard is military style formation of actors, dressed in one of a variety of authentic looking official dress, who will stand at attention for your event. They come in a variety of numbers and formations.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_88", "What can a hired actor do?");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_9", "Tell me more about all of this");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_90", "A hired actor can be deployed anywhere in the wilderness or in a city that has given you zoning rights. You can select the name, race and stage name the actor will use. You may also dress the actor as you see fit and give the actor a line to say. The actor will repeat their line to any that happen across them.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_92", "Tell me about recruiters");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_94", "We have a special contract with the Empire that allows us to employ the services of off-duty recruiters. You may contract their services through us for a period of eight hours.");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_96", "Tell me about recruiters");
stringFiles[229].addEntry("s_98", "We have a special contract with the Alliance that allows us to employ the services of off-duty recruiters. You may contract their services through us for a period of eight hours.");

