stringFiles[231].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (faction_recruiter_imperial) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_294", "Yes, sir, I am ready to resume my duties.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_296", "Good for you!  Before I start the paperwork, though, I want to make sure that you are serious about returning to active duty.  If you run into most rebels, they will attack you on sight.  Are you returning to active duty?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_298", "Yes, sir!");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_300", "It will take the system about 30 seconds to process your status.  After that, you are good to go.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_302", "Excuse me, sir, I misspoke.  I need a few more days of leave.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_304", "Don't waste my time.  Come back to duty when you are serious about your responsibilities.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_306", "I do not talk to terrorists and insurgents.  ");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_308", "Leave my sight, scum.  Insurrectionists like you should be punished.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_310", "Greetings, soldier.  What may I do for you?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_312", "I believe it is time for a review of my rank.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_314", "Ah yes.  According to your record, I am authorized to promote you to %TO.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_318", "Congratulations and good luck with your new duties.  Make us proud!");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_320", "I do not think so.  I am happy with my current duties.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_322", "Afraid of a little more work?  I'm disappointed, but it is your choice.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_324", "I am looking to requisition some supplies.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_326", "What are you looking for?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_328", "I need a base of operations.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_330", "Very well.  I will show you what is available.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_332", "I need a new uniform.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_334", "I will show you our selection.  Wear the uniform proudly.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_336", "I need personal protection and armament. ");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_338", "Always a good choice.  I have a new shipment to look through.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_340", "I want to see what schematics you have.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_342", "Review this list.  Quite a few are available.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_344", "Furniture.  I am improving my quality of my life.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_346", "Submit your purchase order and I will get right on it.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_348", "I would like to requisition additional troops.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_350", "I believe that can be arranged.  We have some spare units in maneuvers.  Let me show you what you can requisition.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_352", "I would like to reevaluate my active military status.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_354", "You are currently enrolled in Special Forces.  Would you like to request a reassignment?  I can change your status to combatant, which means that the rebel 'special forces' riffraff will not concern themselves with you.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_356", "Unfortunately yes, sir. I am no longer interested in Special Forces.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_358", "Give me a moment to change your status and alert your superior.  This process will take approximately 5 minutes.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_360", "I have reconsidered, for the glory of the Empire!");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_362", "I find your dedication admirable.  You will go far in the Empire.  Is there something else you need?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_364", "Special Forces is recruiting.  Would you like to submit your application?  This means that you will be authorized to hunt the Rebel 'special forces', as they like to call themselves.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_366", "Yes, I want to join Special Forces, sir!");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_368", "Very good.  I'll fast-track this application and you will be active in 30 seconds.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_370", "Maybe not, sir.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_372", "Special Forces isn't for everyone.  If you change your mind, let me know.  Is there anything else I can do for you?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_374", "I would like to use my personal leave time.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_376", "Are you certain that this is what you want to do?  You may be missing out on some important battles.   Going on leave means that you will not be recognized as a member of the Imperial military and will be ignored by the Rebel Alliance.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_378", "I am certain.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_380", "I need to process your paperwork.  You will officially be on leave in 5 minutes.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_382", "I will stay active. I know that the war effort needs me.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_384", "Your sense of duty is admirable.  Long live the Emperor!");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_386", "I believe it is time to end my tour of duty.  I would like to resign.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_388", "I beg your pardon?  You would leave the greatest opportunity of your life?  You must be mad...or a traitor. ");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_390", "I am no traitor.  I would just like to leave the military.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_392", "So be it.  I'll put the paperwork through.  We will watch you closely to make sure that you don't cross any lines, citizen.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_394", "No no, I was only kidding.  I'm a loyal member of the military.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_396", "That type of humor is unbecoming of an officer.  I'll thank you to not engage in it again.  You will remain in the military.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_398", "I'd like to discuss an equitable trade.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_400", "What kind of trade are you talking about?  I may be amenable to gifts of friendship.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_402", "How about a 20000 credit gift of friendship?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_404", "An acceptable offer once I check to make sure that it is a genuine gift and not an empty box.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_406", "Would a 100000 gift of friendship be acceptable?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_408", "Friendship indeed.  Let me make sure that this transaction is genuine.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_410", "How are we doing in the war effort against the Rebel scum?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_412", "Our satellite readings have the planetary occupation at Imperial: %DI and Rebel: %TO.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_414", "Greetings, civilian.  Would you be interested in joining the military?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_416", "I'd like to discuss a trade with a new friend.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_418", "New friends are often a good thing.  I suppose it depends on how good the friendship is.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_420", "Would 20000 credits be a good start?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_422", "That is indeed a good start.  I just need to makes sure that your start is valid.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_424", "I think 100000 credits of friendship would be considered 'good.'");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_426", "Indeed.  I believe that the verification of the transfer of credits will cement our friendship nicely.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_428", "I would like to join the military.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_430", "The Empire appreciates your enthusiasm, but we do not believe that you have the dedication necessary.  Once you prove to us that you are committed to the Imperial doctrine, you may reapply then.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_432", "Joining the military is a big commitment.  Are you sure that you are ready?  You realize that those upstart rebels will attack you on sight?  Not the so-called 'special forces' but their main troops.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_434", "Absolutely.  It would be a great honor to serve the Empire.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_436", "Welcome to the Imperial Military.  I expect good things from you, recruit!");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_438", "Thank you, sir.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_440", "Perhaps I should think about it a bit longer.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_442", "Stop wasting my time.  If you are serious, come back and talk to me.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_444", "Your paperwork is currently going through the channels.  Come back when it goes through.  I can't do much to help you right now.");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_78", "");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_80", "Hello, soldier.  Are you ready to resume active duty?");
stringFiles[231].addEntry("s_93", "I would like that promotion, sir.");

stringFiles[232] = new StringFile("conversation/faction_recruiter_rebel");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (faction_recruiter_rebel) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_446", "");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_448", "Hello friend.  Ready to get back to some real work?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_450", "I am ready to get back to my duties.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_452", "Good to hear!  I just want to make sure that you are serious about returning.  You really want to come off leave?  Remember that most of the Imperials will attack you on sight. ");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_454", "Absolutely.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_456", "Let me send your paperwork through.  It should only take me about 30 seconds to get it done.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_458", "Actually, I think I like being on leave.  ");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_460", "All right.  We need you, but I think I can give you a few more days of leave.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_462", "I'm sorry, but I do not know you and do not wish to.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_464", "What are you doing talking to me?  People like you are destroying the galaxy.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_466", "Hello friend.  Is there something that I may do to help you?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_468", "I seek a promotion, sir.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_470", "I see that you qualify for a promotion to %TO. ");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_472", "Excellent.  I would like that promotion.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_474", "Outstanding!  You certainly deserve this promotion.  Congratulations.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_476", "I believe that I will stay my current rank.  I am not looking for glory.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_478", "While I applaud you for not seeking glory, we need good leaders.  I hope you change your mind.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_480", "I need supplies.  Do you have anything available?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_482", "We have some things.  What do you need?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_484", "I'm looking for a fortified base.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_486", "All right.  Let me show you the plans that are available.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_488", "I need better weaponry and armor.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_490", "Don't we all?  With all the Imperial thugs crawling around, I don't blame you.  Let me show you my selection.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_492", "I like to build.  What schematics are available?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_494", "Good.  We always need people making useful goods.  I'll show you what I have.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_496", "I would like to do some decorating.  I need furniture.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_498", "What suits your style?  This is what I have available.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_500", "I need some back-up troops.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_502", "I'll see what I can do, but as you know, every soldier is valuable.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_504", "I need to address my role in the Civil War. ");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_506", "You are currently in Special Forces.  Do you need to step back from it for now?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_508", "Yes please.  I would like to return to combatant status and not fight the Imperial Special Forces.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_510", "That's a shame.  It will take some time to push the paperwork through for approval.  Your status will change in about 5 minutes.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_512", "Actually, I want to stay in Special Forces.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_514", "Good show!  Show those Imperials what for.  May I help you with something else instead?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_516", "We can use good people in Special Forces.  As a member of the Special Forces, you will be able to attack and be attacked by Imperial Special Forces members.  Does this interest you?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_518", "Yes.  I want to hunt Imperial Special Forces.  Sign me up!");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_520", "Good for you!  I'll update your status and you will be a member of the Special Forces in 30 seconds.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_522", "Actually, maybe it isn't for me after all.  Never mind.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_524", "If you are in doubt, then Special Forces isn't for you.  If you change your mind, let me know.  Is there anything else you need?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_526", "I need to go on leave for a time.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_528", "We really need your skills.  Are you sure that you want to go on leave now?  You will be overlooked by most Imperials, unless you get stopped by a tenacious agent that finds something linking you to us. ");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_530", "Yes.  I really need to take some leave time.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_532", "It will take me some time to process, but you will be on leave beginning in 5 minutes.  ");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_534", "Maybe not.  I will stay active.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_536", "I wish all of our soldiers had your dedication.  I salute you!");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_538", "This is all too much for me.  I would like to resign completely.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_540", "How could you turn your back on people trying to win freedom from tyranny?  We need everyone we can get!  Won't you reconsider?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_542", "I'm sure.  I have had enough war. I want out.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_544", "So be it.  If you decide that you want to come back, let me know.  But for now, you are no longer a member of the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_546", "You are right.  It was a momentary lapse. I will stay with the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_548", "Doubt is understandable, but have faith.  We are on the right side.  No one wants to cater to a tyrant.  Down with the Empire!");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_550", "I believe I can help you with your bank account.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_552", "While I'm not in the habit of taking personal gifts, I admit that we need all the help we can get.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_554", "I'd like to give you a donation of 20000 credits.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_556", "I appreciate this donation as long as it is backed up by the appropriate funds.  ");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_558", "I really believe in your cause.  How about this 100000 credit donation?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_560", "I'm blown away!  This will go quite a ways to help in our war effort.  Pardon me for being suspicious, but I need to confirm these funds.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_562", "How are we doing in the war against the Imperial tyrants?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_564", "Our spies have reported that the possession of the planet stands at Rebel: %TO and Imperial: %DI.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_566", "Hello friend.  Is there something that I can do for you?  Are you interested in helping free the peoples of the galaxy?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_568", "I'd like to donate to your personal cause.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_570", "I would be happy to accept a donation.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_572", "I just happen to have a spare 20000 credits for you.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_574", "Your donation is certainly appreciated.  Let me just quickly verify the bank funds.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_576", "Here are 100000 credits that were just sitting in my bank.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_578", "Wow!  That's quite a donation.  Thank you very much.  Your donation will be processed after I verify the funds.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_580", "I would like to join you in your fight against the Empire.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_582", "Your enthusiasm warms my heart.  I'm afraid that right now, your loyalty is somewhat in question.  Go out and prove to us that you want to help us overthrow the Empire and we can talk later.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_584", "This is not a decision to be taken lightly.  Rebels are hunted across the galaxy.  If you join us, while you are an active combatant, Imperials will attack you on sight but Imperial Special Forces will leave you alone.  Are you ready for that?");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_586", "That doesn't scare me.  Down with the Emperor!");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_588", "Superb!  Welcome to the Rebellion!  ");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_590", "Thank you very much.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_592", "Now that you put it that way, perhaps I was a bit hasty.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_594", "We only want serious, committed candidates.  If you change your mind, talk to me then.");
stringFiles[232].addEntry("s_596", "Greetings.  I see that your status is currently being processed.  I won't be able to help you until that is complete.  It should not take much longer.");

stringFiles[233] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_combat_healing_quest");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_combat_healing_quest) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_14e60463", "You don't seem to have any medical training at all. I'm sorry, but I don't think you are going to be able to help me");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_1f0513d3", "Yes! Yes! I need you to go find the groups of defenders and join them, you will need to support them while they are defending us as any good medic would. Be careful, you will be in harms way sometimes! If you can help out fifty times that would be a great help! Oh, and you can come back and talk to me or the droids to track your progress!");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_25b83816", "Yes, I'm sure.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_2e7fd1c", "Sorry, maybe later.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_3fd56843", "Brilliant! I need you to, well to help the troops more. If you can help out a total of 100 times that would be wonderful.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_48b1807b", "What? Do I look like I have time to chit chat?!?");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_5b2d3e0f", "Who? Oh, you seem far too busy to help me now, if you have time please see if there are any other medics available.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_5b948c11", "Ah! Yes, you're back! You've done so much, I happen to have an extra tank that we don't have room for, I'm sure a gifted healer such as yourself will find a good place for it.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_5d4f7fdb", "On second thought...");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_671a071f", "Well, let me know if you change your mind!");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_67e6df55", "Okay.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_6a7931f2", "Hmm... I can tell you are a great healer, I may have something else for you if you are interested in helping some more.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_7263868e", "Thank you! Thank you so much for your help! Can't talk much, still have much to do.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_7ed32afc", "Huh? Oh! Great! More medics! The troops are in desperate need of support. Are you here to provide the medical support?");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_8c663fab", "I see, I see... I was hoping you would be made of sterner stuff, but I guess not.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_8d7b6d3", "Hmm... I see the Force has gifted you as a healer. You seem to have unlocked some potential in yourself. I wish I could guide you more, but that is all I can do for you. There is still much to do, let me know if you would like to help some more.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_8fddaea0", "Yes, I want to help.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_a7b82bb9", "Huh? I can't deal with you if you don't have any room to hold things, clear up some room and come back! And hurry, I'm not sure how long we have.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_aa2e6c00", "Sure, I'll help.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_ad2d5f2b", "Help? Yes, you can help! What I need you to help with is troop support. This may put you in direct harms way, and you won't be able to help the other villagers with their tasks, but I will make sure Noldan helps you to develop your healing abilities even more. Are you sure?");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_d4d1a11f", "Sorry, no.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_df4917e", "Too bad, too bad, we need some help here, but I'm sure you already realized that. Excuse me, I have much to do.");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_e6d3592a", "I see, I see, yes very good, it looks like %TO");
stringFiles[233].addEntry("s_e734fdf3", "Keep at it!");

stringFiles[234] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_experience_converter");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_experience_converter) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_2734c210", "I wish to learn more about using the Force to enhance my reflexes.");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_37fbfae6", "I am sorry, stranger.  Your mind is still too cloudy for me to help you.  Remove your doubts with journey and mediation.  Then return to me.");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_433c2a58", "Allow me to help you to open your mind to new possibilities...");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_69a7c6ca", "I wish to learn new uses of the Force.");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_73ab6ff4", "I wish to learn more about using the Force for crafting.");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_7542cfea", "Allow me to help you understand your experiences...");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_76fa10e4", "I wish to learn more about using the Force for combat.");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_7abe0196", "I sense that you are able to learn the following: %TO");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_962f82a6", "Welcome, friend! Come here and tell me what insight I may provide for you today?");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_968c3ff6", "I wish to learn more about using the Force to enchance my senses.");
stringFiles[234].addEntry("s_e4c01185", "What aspects of the Force am I ready to learn?");

stringFiles[235] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_gadget_specialist");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_gadget_specialist) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_1283cb1c", "That's quite alright. Good day to you.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_3d8991fc", "I... um... see. Well. Good day then.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_4389624e", "Aurilia on Dathomir... yeah, I know the place. Well, know of it anyway. I've done business with them in the past. They need a replacement computer core?");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_46bdeee4", "Sounds like a terrible idea. Thanks for nothing.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_4bcdc402", "You need to collect or craft all of the required components and place them in the kit. Once you have all of the components, the kit's automated system will build the tracking device.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_4d7434d2", "That's disappointing. But I guess if you don't have one, then you don't have one.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_533919fc", "Tell the Aurilia engineer that I wish I could have been more helpful, but not much I can really do about something like that.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_55082d0b", "Er... no one. I'm sorry to have bothered you.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_5542b04b", "Oh, my apologies. I'll let you get back to work.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_5a562246", "I've much to do...  can I help you?");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_65f76975", "Go to any ticket droid at a starport. They have access to the database with information about fallen and abandoned satellites around the galaxy. You can purchase the rights to one of them from the droid.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_6d9d310", "Ha. I was just offering to help. You can't expect me to ignore my livelihood and give this kind of thing away for nothing. My price is more than fair. But whatever. Good day.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_70253663", "The chief engineer at Aurilia can probably give you more information, but I believe you'll have to modify the core's current interface so that it will be compatible with the village's computer. Usually there's a simple menu on the core itself that will allow you to try and modify it.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_7045a2d7", "Welcome back. Still interested in a downed satellite tracking device? The price is 530 credits.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_79fe19ed", "Yes, I was told you could help me obtain a replacement computer core.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_7f396fce", "How do I use this tracking device?");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_85bd3ae2", "The chief engineer from a village on Dathomir. The village of Aurilia.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_8fe6a678", "You must think I just fell off of a bantha! I'll not be scammed so easily.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_9d19b512", "Ha. Whatever. Be on your way, then.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_a1dd9b9e", "That's correct. Their current one was damaged during an attack on the village.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_a8749106", "Sounds fair enough. I'll take one.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_b49f7181", "A replacement computer core? Who gave you that idea?");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_b518079a", "You don't seem to have enough funds at the moment. I'd love to help, but I can't give the kit away for nothing. Come back when you have more funds.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_b867b2e4", "How do I make this computer core work with the village computer?");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_b9f237f", "Sounds reasonable. I'm off to the starport.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_bab2829b", "How do I get tracking data for a fallen satellite?");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_bdcd33ef", "Excellent. I'll just place it in your inventory. Good luck finding a satellite and that replacement computer core.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_bdedc5e2", "Wait! Before speaking with the droid, there's one other thing. You'll need a downed satellite tracking device. When you purchase the rights to one, the droid will upload tracking data to your tracking device. It will then help you to locate the fallen satellite. I can provide you with a kit for just such a device for a small fee. Say, 530 credits? ");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_be1b8c5a", "Is there nothing that can be done to find a replacement for Aurilia?");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_be68030a", "Well, I wish I could help, but I don't have anything like that in stock. Rarely do to be honest. I tend to tinker more with smaller devices. Large systems like a town... or village... computer require far more attention than I'm willing to give.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_c7baf80c", "What do I do with this tracking device kit?");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_d8a8c77e", "Now you can bring it to Aurilia's chief engineer and then bask in the glory of a job well done.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_e5c058a8", "Hmm... let me think a minute.You know, there might just be something I can help you with after all. Most satellites have a central computer that is heavily shielded to withstand the extreme nature of their orbit. Once a satellite falls from orbit and is abandoned, anyone can purchase the rights to them. I've done so myself on various occassions.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_e79d337", "Nothing's easier. you simply go to any starport and speak with the ticket droid. These droids have access to a galactic-wide database that maintains records about satellites in orbit around most known planets. For a fee, you can purchase the rights to one that has fallen and gone unclaimed.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_f9732f00", "Simply use the device's menu and choose to activate the tracking device. If you're on the wrong planet, it will tell you which planet the satellite is on. Once you're on the correct planet, the device can then pinpoint the exact location of the satellite.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_faaeb65f", "You don't have enough space in your inventory for the kit. Make some room and then come speak with me again.");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_fe739220", "The computer core is ready... now what?");
stringFiles[235].addEntry("s_fff0f4f2", "How do I purchase the rights to a fallen and abandoned satellite?");

stringFiles[236] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_intro_oldman_initial");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_intro_oldman_initial) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_31a054f9", "Mellichae is the leader of the Sith Shadows.  He is responsible for the attacks at the village.  Scouts have reported he has set up camp near here.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_383079e", "Are you sure?  It's a fairly urgent matter.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_3aab754", "Very good.  Here is the crystal. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_419f8694", "Very well then.  Perhaps another time.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_477068d1", "I am busy at the moment.  Perhaps later.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_501448da", "Yes, what is it you need?");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_6b88daf2", "No, I have never thought about it really.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_7f8604a5", "I was wondering if you had ever considered the possibility that you might be connected with the Force?");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_83e20fb8", "Very well then.  Perhaps we will meet again at another time.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_958f442", "Hello again, my friend.  Thank you for all of your help at the village.  The time has come for you to hunt down and destroy Mellichae. ");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_9641e6e", "Where is his camp located?");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_a3291a29", "Yes, the thought had crossed my mind a few times.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_aa6a1756", "Oh? Very well then.  What is it you wanted to discuss?");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_ac22e1a3", "Very well then.  I shall return later. Thanks again for all your help.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_b81ceeb4", "Yes,  I will keep it safe for you.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_c6f70929", "No, I am not interested.  Thanks.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_c7146ea8", "I am sorry.  I have nothing to discuss with you.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_cf55fe01", "So you sense it as well.  I have a Force crystal here if you are interested in discovering for certain.  Perhaps you could hold onto it and keep it safe? ");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_de9da426", "Hello. I have been meaning to speak with you for some time. Do you have a moment?");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_e0a90395", "I'm sorry.  I really don't have time now.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_eb24a286", "Hmmmm.  Perhaps I misjudged you. I have a Force crystal here if you are interested in discovering for certain. Perhaps you could hold onto it and keep it safe?");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_f5c5ace0", "Although the exact location is still unknown, his camp is relatively close to here.  I have given the approximate location to you as a waypoint.  Be very careful.  You may want to bring some friends. Defeating Mellichae will not be easy... Good luck!");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_fb9e0b93", "No, I am busy right now.  Perhaps another time.");
stringFiles[236].addEntry("s_fbd984c8", "Who is Mellichae? Where is his camp located?");

stringFiles[237] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_medic_puzzle_head_medic");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_medic_puzzle_head_medic) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_1024d197", "Yes, I'm here to help");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_1718c6ed", "Good. Before we get started, I should let you know that you will be too busy to help out any of the other villagers. Also, I will talk with Noldan and he can help you out with some persuasion techniques if you help out. Are you sure you would like to help?");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_17db6d3c", "With the use of high and lower quality components, and careful experimentation, you can specialize the treatment to cure specific symptoms. You should also be able to change what sort of side effects it produces. See if you can treat five patients, and good luck with that. Talk to the medical droids. They will help you administer the medicine.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_2e7eb20b", "On second thought, no thanks.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_2fee0236", "Hmmm? Oh, talk to the medical droids if you are stuck. Medical records show you have %TO more to go.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_3228a43d", "No, sorry I'm in the wrong place.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_3496f642", "You've already done more than anyone ever expected, please take some time to rest, everyone needs to take a moment to rest.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_36b08dde", "You seem to have a few too many items in your bag there, why don't you free up some room, then come talk to me again.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_3b984995", "I'm sorry, I don't know you. I only work with people I know.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_3c93827f", "Okay");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_41e66cca", "Sorry to hear that. I know everyone here can use some help.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_464f7bf4", "Good, Please talk to the medical droids again and they will help you.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_47a32bb0", "You don't seem to have enough medical training. I'm sorry, but I don't think you are going to be able to help me. I need at least a Master Medic, if not someone with more experience.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_69ab9125", "No, I have some other things to take care of.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_728f65ee", "Great! Let me explain what has happened. It seems in the last attack there were multiple uses of some rather potent chemical weapons. Those you see lying around here are still sick. Unfortunately, normal medicines are not helping them.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_7857c2a9", "How are you treating them?");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_86129116", "Yes, I would like to continue.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_8a54510d", "You look to be rather busy at the moment, come back to me when you aren't so busy.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_94d417d1", "Well, I devised a highly potent, yet also highly dangerous counteragent to many of the symptoms. The only problem is that it has some side effects that are almost as bad as what they currently have. However, through multiple treatments, I've been able to cure some. Here, this draft schematic will allow you to work with the medical droids to help.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_a7afcfea", "Splendid! Here, I think you may find some use of this, I know it's not much, but it should help. We still have more to do if you are interested, just let me know.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_bef6939f", "I'm sorry to hear that, I will do my best here. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_cc506105", "My, you are tenacious. Well, I have something that will prove useful to you, this plant is rather difficult to grow, but if you are up to the challenge, and it seems you are, the fruit is... well, you will see.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_cc64464a", "Yes, let's get started");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_d08f8eb6", "Good luck. Talk with the medical droids for help.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_d17142db", "What do I do with this?");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_d46bb0c5", "Hello, I'm the head physician here. Are you one of the new Medics sent to help out?");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_db216f5", "Well, I wouldn't loiter around here. Too many sick people.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_ddb49891", "Oh, you are still here? well if you like, go ahead and heal at least five more patients then come talk to me again, I have a little trinket you might find useful.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_e15eb34d", "Back again are we? Well I have a special plant you may find useful, but you will need to prove you are worthy. Go heal at least another five patients then come talk to me again.");
stringFiles[237].addEntry("s_fc604056", "Wonderful! You are well under way into understanding your potential. You may wish to talk to Noldan to learn more. If you are looking for more work, let me know.");

stringFiles[238] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_medic_puzzle_sick01");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_medic_puzzle_sick01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_12ec68a8", "What is wrong with this patient?");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_1d567ce1", "Always a pleasure to assist. Please let me know if there is anything else I can assist with.");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_3904c58", "This patient is currently suffering from %TO. If you have any treatments you would like to administer to him, please give the treatment to me so I can administer them.");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_67e6df55", "Okay.");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_95a8553f", "Please talk to Sivarra Mecheaux for inquiries about gaining access.");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_95bc25f3", "Greetings, I am the 2-1B Medical droid in charge of this patient. How may I assist you?");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_a4d284b1", "Never mind, I'm looking for another patient.");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_bf4eec78", "I am sorry, but only authorized medical personnel have access to my functions.");
stringFiles[238].addEntry("s_fa8f35d7", "Accessing Medical Records...Total Records found with indications you have helped our troops: %TO ");

stringFiles[239] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_patrol_quest_start");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_patrol_quest_start) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_13f339fe", "Your information gathering is first rate.  We should be able to start rebuilding.  I have something for you, it's not much, but it's what I've got.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_1485495", "Sorry to hear that.  Let me know if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_199a175c", "Yes, let's get started.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_1b5216d5", " Perfect.  We can put this information to some good use.  Ok, here's your next patrol route.  You know the routine.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_1f1e059", "Ok, then here's another one for you.  Get to it soldier.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_2248d7ad", "All right, but here's the drill.  Once you start working for me, I can't have you taking jobs from anyone else.  I demand complete focus from all my soldiers. One other thing.  If you finish this, I'll let Noldan know you will be ready for some ranged accuracy training.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_240c8c9d", "Yes, I'm interested.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_2872b835", "Good. Ok, you know the drill.  Here's the next route.  Let's get it going.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_30c694db", "Well then, get out there and get the job done, soldier!");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_37871f01", "As I understand it you already have some assignments from some of the other villagers.  Come back when you don't have so much on your plate.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_491ce1ad", "I'm starting to worry about your performance soldier.  This data isn't complete.  Get back out there and start over, I don't have time for incomplete reports.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_4b5df4f5", "Are you back already?  You finish that last patrol?");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_5f2a0dac", "You've been a lot of help to me, but our patrols are filled.  We don't need the help just yet.  Use this time for some R&R, or maybe see if someone else needs some help.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_60a74f25", "No thanks, Once was enough.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_61dc9e2d", "Alright, here's a new patrol.  Now get out there and get to it, soldier.  I don't have time to babysit you.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_649f5207", "I need the recon data ASAP.  I don't have time to wait, and neither do you.  Get back to work.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_67427da4", "Actually, it doesn't look like you did.  Your data is incomplete.  I'm gonna have to ask you to start over.  And soldier?  Do it right this time.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_6d3ed33b", "Yes, and I'm ready for more.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_764478e7", "No, there are others I need to help.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_7d744b43", "I hear your patrols are top of the line.  Good to have someone like you around.  I guess you're starting to get a sense of how powerful you really are.  Keep up the good work.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_9e38953b", "Did you finish that patrol?  I see you're back, but I don't think that necessarily means you finished...");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_9ec72704", "Good, here is your first assignment.  I need you to hit all eight points on this patrol, and then report back every time you finish so I can give you the next. I have ten total I need you to do. Your standing orders are to subdue any hostiles you come across.  If you see any groups larger than three, try to avoid them so that we can gather more intelligence from them. Just remember, we can't gather information if they are dead.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_b76cc5ed", "How are you, soldier?  I understand you're looking for something to do?  Great.  I have some patrol routes I need covered.  You interested?");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_cbbe47bb", "Are you sure you want to start over?");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_d33566f3", "No, I need to restart the patrol.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_d6695e83", "No thanks.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_e0c9cc07", "That's all right, everyone around here needs a little help.  Come back and see me when you've got more time on your hands.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_ebd8c749", "I wish I could talk to you right now, but I just don't have the time.  Come see me later, though, I may have something for you then.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_ec2d9d88", "Whatever I can do to help!");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_fa12949a", "Ok, but I'm gonna need to find someone to do these patrol routes.  I need to make sure the village isn't in any immediate danger.  Come back if you change your mind, I could use someone like you.");
stringFiles[239].addEntry("s_fb116507", "I need more help on the patrol routes.  You're proving to be quite valuable to this little operation.  Are you up for some more?");

stringFiles[240] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_phase4_chief_engineer");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_phase4_chief_engineer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_121666b3", "Success, the replacement computer core is ready!");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_174ddced", "I've changed my mind. You're on your own. Good luck... I guess.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_199cece6", "Ah, good to see you again. Have you had a chance to develop your mastery of crafting and repair? No wait... don't answer. I wish I had more time to speak, but I'm so very busy. I must get back to work.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_1a960799", "Yes. Yes there is. During the first of the recent attacks on the village, our primary computer was damaged, and the computer core has become unstable. A new core must be found as soon as possible. Thanks to all the damage being caused by the attacks, I am unable go find a replacement, but you could go get one in my place.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_29622c26", "There's one in Keren on Naboo, on in Mos Entha on Tatooine, and one in Coronet on Corellia. I can upload a waypoint to their location if you'd like?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_29e5661", "Right. Good. Come back if you find a replacement. Or if you have any questions.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_3031b4c9", "Excellent. Continue from where you left off. Come speak with me again if you have any questions.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_3196d2e0", "Right. Well then I've wasted enough time talking. There's much for me to attend to.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_4136c2df", "Thank you very much.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_4294034a", "No, It's... um... not ready yet.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_4bcdc402", "You need to collect or craft all of the required components and place them in the kit. Once you have all of the components, the kit's automated system will build the tracking device.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_50191de0", "Hmmm... you don't appear to have the computer core with you. Please return when you have it.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_5062e892", "You worked with the last chief engineer, right? But weren't able to find a replacement in time. Would you like to try again? Continue from where you left off?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_5542b04b", "Oh, my apologies. I'll let you get back to work.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_59f5cee6", "Is there anything I can do to help?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_59f634d7", "I'd like a waypoint to the gadget specialist in Coronet.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_61fa9d29", "Hmm... what would that mean I'd have to do?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_64391455", "It's you... good. Did you find a replacement computer core? Have you configured it so that it will be compatible with our computers?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_6516bd5a", "Yes, I've made room and returned as you asked");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_65f76975", "Go to any ticket droid at a starport. They have access to the database with information about fallen and abandoned satellites around the galaxy. You can purchase the rights to one of them from the droid.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_69b44245", "No waypoint needed. I'll speak to them and get you a replacement computer core.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_6c741657", "No, no, no... it'll have to wait. Sorry, sorry. Just trying to sort some things out. You're the one helping with the replacement core, right? If I can answer any questions, just ask. ");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_742ff942", "Oh, that's not good. Please hurry. Our backup is not going to last much longer.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_7496bddd", "Do you know how this satellite tracking device works?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_7f1492c", "That's not a problem. How do I get started on this?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_7f1e8a0c", "I'd like a waypoint to the gadget specialist in Mos Entha.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_85cf8e18", "Oh. Hmmm... maybe I should think about this a bit more.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_860baf7e", "Yes! Thank you! This will work perfectly. In exchange for your services, I will happily get you started on the road to the Mastery of Crafting Repair.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_8b482724", "As further token of the village's thanks, we would like to present to you this section of an Aurilian sculpture.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_8e1d9e8a", "I'll do it. Where can I find a replacement computer core?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_8ef5f872", "Ah yes. The core's current interface will need to be modified so that it will be compatible with computers here in the village. There should be a simple menu you can access on the core itself that will allow you to attempt the modification. Be careful though... if you fail too often you could short out the core and render it useless.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_94925b50", "Eh, no thanks. Sounds boring. I'll pass.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_96e10fe0", "I see. Thank you for coming by. If you'll excuse me, I've much to do.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_9c2a9f48", "Oh. Okay. Thank you. I think. I suppose I'll manage, Somehow.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_9caa26f9", "Thank you, that's very kind. Normally I would gladly accept your help, but at the moment I'm already juggling more people and problems than I can handle. Please come back after some time has passed and I'll see if I can phase you in.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_a2e520b8", "Can you remind me where I need to go to find a replacement computer core?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_a69082f1", "No thanks. Not this time.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_acbab09c", "Those freaks are attacking. Everything is breaking. I can't believe I accepted this chief engineering post. What was I thinking. Ah well, there's nothing for it now but to muddle through.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_b69a10cf", "I'd recommend speaking to a gadget specialist. I've done business with a gadget specialist in the past and know where you can find one. Actually, I know of three of them. One in Keren on Naboo, on in Mos Entha on Tatooine, and one in Coronet on Corellia. I can upload a waypoint to their location if you'd like?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_bab2829b", "How do I get tracking data for a fallen satellite?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_bce29099", "We would also like to present you with this section of an Aurilian sculpture as further thanks for your help. But it seems that you do not have room in your inventory for it at the moment. Please make some room and then speak with me again.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_bf01c6a4", "Well, I know some people who might be able to help you find one. You'd need to contact one of them and see what they have to say. From there, both they and I can advise you.In exchange for this service, I'd be happy to help you unlock the secrets that will lead you toward mastering the art of repair.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_c7baf80c", "What do I do with this tracking device kit?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_caa53683", "That's quite alright. Okay, first I need to... something. Maybe I'll start... no no. Obviously. Well. Something.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_cbc96768", "Arrrgh! It's too much! I'm only one person... and new to this position no less. How can I be expected to keep the village defenses working while we're under attack? It's too much!!");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_d38355d4", "Excellent. And may the Force guide you. Return to me once you've obtained the replacement core.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_dc34bd9c", "Fair enough. If you decide you'll be able to help, I'll be here. Now let's see... which emergency was I working on...");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_dd8b435", "My pleasure. Ask if they can supply a replacement core. Then return here and bring it to me. Thanks and may the Force guide you.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_e0f6c467", "Ah enthusiasm... I like that. Before getting started, you should know that in this village, you cannot work with more than one villager. So while you're working with me, you can't work with any other villagers.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_e3e36f42", "I have a replacement computer core for the village.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_e77051e7", "I don't have time to speak. Too much to do. Too much to do and not enough time. Too frantic. Arrgh.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_eac5593c", "No, I'm doing just fine. I'll leave you to your work.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_ec479e11", "Yes, hello. You've returned the rest of your reward?");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_f75c2f80", "I'd like a waypoint to the gadget specialist in Keren.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_f9732f00", "Simply use the device's menu and choose to activate the tracking device. If you're on the wrong planet, it will tell you which planet the satellite is on. Once you're on the correct planet, the device can then pinpoint the exact location of the satellite.");
stringFiles[240].addEntry("s_ff872480", "Yes I would. Thank you for the second chance.");

stringFiles[241] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_quests_sad2_conv");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_quests_sad2_conv) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_1adbadc4", "I'm ready.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_1bb0236f", "Good luck taking care of that Shadow camp.  Our soldiers are counting on you.  Follow your waypoint or use your radiation sensor if you don't have one.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_1d03bd79", "We're taking the fight to the enemy while we prepare our invincible shield defense.  Because of the preparations, and the scale of the conflict, our normal militia is overworked.  We're recruiting auxiliaries to be frontline combat troops.  We know the location of a number of Shadow bases that we want taken out to keep them on the run.  ");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_23720024", "I cannot burden you with the village's problems while you have other tasks at hand.  Come back when your mind is clear.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_253d75eb", "All right -- if that is your wish.  You are always welcome here.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_45d6d31e", "I'm sorry - I can't help you right now.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_45e3060a", "Unfortunately, the Shadow has managed to evade our patrols.  We can't find them.  It's only a matter of time before we catch up with them, though - check back tommorrow.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_47d40828", "I cannot thank you enough.  Your vigilance, speed and bravery have undoubtedly saved many lives.  Please take this as a token of my respect - it's been sitting in my shop far too long. You'll find it makes you more nimble, better able to defend against ranged attacks.  You will also find that you've achieved an understanding of how to increase your ranged defense through the Force.  May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_4ae25b38", "I would be honored to serve you and the Force.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_5a1fb6b3", "Please come back when you've eliminated them - and be careful.  If we have waypoint data, we've provided it to you, otherwise, remember to use your radiation sensor in your datapad.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_6649d643", "Someone is feeding them supplies, but we don't know who.  We've located a base that's supplying a large area outside the village.  Can you track it down and destroy it for us?");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_86aa30ad", "I see you've misplaced your radiation sensor.  I'm going to give you another one.  Good luck taking care of that Shadow camp.  Our people are counting on you.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_873e5003", "All of the reports coming in are promising -- we definitely have them on the run now.  I think we're getting to their more elite troops - please be careful.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_8909d6f9", "Ok, I'm glad you told me.  I've got other things to do before I commit.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_ad5c1b56", "You've helped enough for now, and we thank you.  I have nothing for you right now - rest a while.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_b1cf9ec4", "We may have turned the corner on this thing.  It feels great to finally take the battle to our enemy instead of waiting for them to attack.  Ready for another one?");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_b39e716", "Understand this, my friend.  This mission is going to carry you out into the field as an operative for our militia.  You're going to be too busy to help us in any other way for a while -- possibly as much as 3 weeks.  This is your chance to back out.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_b84b366c", "How can I help?");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_be2a8162", "I thank you for helping our village.  I've heard of the good work you're doing.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_bf7dd33f", "All right -- if that is your wish.  ");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_ce50d249", "I thank you for the services you have rendered our village.  Our home is safe because of your skill and bravery.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_e1175f92", "I'm sorry -- I can't help you right now.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_e188a139", "Greetings, stranger.  Your mind is clouded, you must clear it first.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_e874c8c5", "You are so burdened - I'd like to reward you but I need you to free up space.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_eabbdaa6", "Glad to hear it.  Our militia uses a small tracking device called a radiation sensor to track the enemy out in the field. I'm going to give you a control device that can sit in your datapad.  Activate it to get a reading.  As the reading goes up, you're getting close to the target.  Based on the strength of the readings, I think the nearest Shadow base is about 1000 meters from here.  Good luck, soldier.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_ec95030", "You look like you know your way around a weapon.  We need able bodied men to fill out our auxiliaries.  Are you prepared for the challenge?  I can teach you how to defend yourself from attacks at a distance by channelling the Force.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_f1ccb161", "We'll bring this Shadow out into the open if it's the last thing we do.  I'm redoubling our patrols, which places great strain on the auxiliaries.  Think you can handle it?");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_f4afc95c", "All right, we're getting somewhere, finally.  Reports are coming in that a high-ranking officer of the Shadow is holed up nearby.  Take him out, now.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_f62934bc", "They've started moving their bases around in response to our attacks.  With the help of the Force, I hope we can find their new camps quickly.  Can you help?");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_f88c54a", "Our spies have netted us another camp.  But you'll have to act quickly.  They look like they're ready to move.");
stringFiles[241].addEntry("s_faedbf19", "No, I understand.  I'm committed.");

stringFiles[242] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_quests_sad_conv");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_quests_sad_conv) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_14c652fd", "Now, I want to make something clear.  This mission is going to carry you out into the field as an operative for our militia.  It's going to be impossible to do anything else for our village for quite a while - possibly as much as 3 weeks.  You can back out now, but once I give you our intelligence data, you're committed.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_1adbadc4", "I'm ready.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_21cb22af", "I cannot thank you enough.  Your vigilance, speed, and bravery have undoubtedly saved many lives.  Please take this as a token of my respect -- it's been sitting in my shop far too long.  You'll find it will help you make your melee weapons faster, but extremely durable.  The whole village is in your debt.  I believe you will find that you have also learned the secret to increased melee speed through the Force.  May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_23720024", "I cannot burden you with the village's problems while you have other tasks at hand.  Come back when your mind is clear.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_253d75eb", "All right -- if that is your wish.  You are always welcome here.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_45d6d31e", "I'm sorry - I can't help you right now.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_45e3060a", "Unfortunately, the Shadow has managed to evade our patrols.  We can't find them.  It's only a matter of time before we catch up with them, though - check back tommorrow.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_511b214d", "You did us a great service with your last raid on the Shadow, but there are more out there.  Can you help us again?");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_71c49afd", "Please come back when you've eliminated them -- and be careful.  My lieutenants are coordinating the attacks, so they may be able to send you waypoints if one of the patrols has found a Shadow base.  Otherwise, remember to use the radiation sensor in your datapad. ");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_744e165e", "Exciting news!  We've finally tracked down one of their high-ranking officers.  Our efforts have flushed him out, and our agent caught a glimpse of him just a while back.  I think...well, better not say anything.  Be careful -- a cornered rat fights hard.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_7b05a163", "All right - if that is your wish.  You are always welcome here.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_86aa30ad", "I see you've misplaced your radiation sensor.  I'm going to give you another one.  Good luck taking care of that Shadow camp.  Our people are counting on you.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_8903f2e3", "Good luck taking care of that Shadow camp.  Our soldiers are counting on you.  I'm not sure if my lieutenants were able to update your datapad with a waypoint, but if not you've got your radiation sensor, right?  Good enough.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_8909d6f9", "Ok, I'm glad you told me.  I've got other things to do before I commit.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_a4ab4cd7", "Greetings, stranger.  Focus on clearing your mind.  It is still cloudy.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_ace5dd74", "All of the reports coming in are promising -- we definitely have them on the run now.  I think we're getting to their more elite troops -- please be careful.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_ad5c1b56", "You've helped enough for now, and we thank you.  I have nothing for you right now - rest a while.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_ae82a454", "Unfortunately, one of our field soldiers was caught and killed.  But he managed to get us a message with the coordinates of an enemy base.  Can you avenge him for us?");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_b1cf9ec4", "We may have turned the corner on this thing.  It feels great to finally take the battle to our enemy instead of waiting for them to attack.  Ready for another one?");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_b3f0b662", "Greetings.  I am eager for your assistance.  In return, I offer to train you to use the Force to quicken you in melee.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_b84b366c", "How can I help?");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_bc39cbe0", "A variety of Shadow bases have been spotted in the surrounding countryside.  We suspect they are marshalling their forces for some sort of large-scale raid unlike anything we've seen.  If they were to strike now, we would be horribly unprepared.  We must convince them that we are much stronger than we, in fact, are.  Village agents are scouring the countryside as we speak, looking for likely targets for dynamic raids.  We can use your help.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_be2a8162", "I thank you for helping our village.  I've heard of the good work you're doing.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_ce50d249", "I thank you for the services you have rendered our village.  Our home is safe because of your skill and bravery.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_ceb13feb", "I think your attacks are beginning to get their attention.  I'd watch your back.  Here's your next target, if you're up for it...");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_e1175f92", "I'm sorry -- I can't help you right now.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_e549bc85", "They've started moving their bases around in response to our attacks.  We've tracked them into a new area that we'd like to investigate.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_e874c8c5", "You are so burdened - I'd like to reward you but I need you to free up space.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_f163f1df", "Great.  So, one of our men managed to attach a tracking device to one of the Shadow during their last confrontation, a small radioactive beacon that we can track using this radiation sensor. I'm going to give you a control device that can sit in your datapad.  Activate it to get a reading.  As the reading goes up, you're getting close to the target.  Based on the strength of the readings, the device is about 1000 meters from here. Good luck.");
stringFiles[242].addEntry("s_faedbf19", "No, I understand.  I'm committed.");

stringFiles[243] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_reflex1_prisoner");
stringFiles[243].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_reflex1_prisoner) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[243].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[243].addEntry("s_1150de7c", "Thank you so much for rescuing me!");
stringFiles[243].addEntry("s_2a6f5720", "Thank you so much for coming after me. Let's get out of here!");
stringFiles[243].addEntry("s_780bc309", "I don't think that you're able to help me anymore.");
stringFiles[243].addEntry("s_e4480cdc", "I don't think that you're able to help me.");
stringFiles[243].addEntry("s_e9ddb716", "Let's hurry up and get back to the village!");
stringFiles[243].addEntry("s_f77ac89f", "Not now! Give me a hand here!");

stringFiles[244] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_village_convo3_m");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_village_convo3_m) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_116fa06f", "I'll not risk my children to this frenzy of destruction. ");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_21fd07e3", "Anonymity? You're hiding alright.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_29e5bb06", "Nothing really. As a matter of fact I was on the way out.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_2b466883", "Sounds like you're hiding from something more than just the war.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_30d6ee6", "Stay out of the way? Why would you want to do that?");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_351f9414", "What do you folks do way out here in the middle of nowhere?");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_3d31f978", "Most of us have. We've paid our dues in blood and pain. We're done with it. It's one thing to risk your own life in a war, but once you have children it becomes something else entirely to let them do the same.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_42d40a3f", "There's still a chance, but it's out of our hands.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_4ac0f748", "Would we need a reason other than the war? I mean they blew up a planet! ");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_538ba7a9", "I guess you're right. How can you fight something like that.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_5cca5b41", "Go see the village elder. He might be able to help you with whatever you're looking for. In any event, good luck.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_60c9d96a", "I only wish they could see it that way. The oldest already wants to go off and fight. I just hope it's over before he gets the chance.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_671177b7", "You're right, it might. Then what? Beg them not to fire? Jump in our squadron of X-wings? The only power we have right now is anonymity.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_69bb013d", "More than you know. Look if you really want to find out the truth, why don't you go talk to the elder.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_76a2d8f9", "Why don't you fight? Take a side instead of sitting out here hiding?");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_93ec538d", "The war mostly. Most of us have lost family or friends to the war. We've resolved to not lose anyone else.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_9cabeaee", "The Force? Are you on a pilgrimage son? The only Force you'll find around here are those blasted nightsisters and they sure won't welcome any adherents. ");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_a6600b37", "Hello. What brings you to our village?");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_a9268707", "Yea, we're lucky like that. I'm sorry, but I sure don't know what your fishin for here. Maybe you should go speak to the elder.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_bf567533", "Spare me the righteous zeal. I've been there son. Lost my wife. It'll take a lot more than a pretty speech to get me to let what little family I got left to go. I think we're done here.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_c2be1811", "Well we work the land, trade with some few freighter captains, but mostly we stay out of the way.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_ce4f7c2b", "Looking for information about the Force.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_cf2480fb", "I understand. You only want what's best for them.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_d3683f06", "You should always fight for what you believe in. Once you give up on that, you give up on everything.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_d652c1bf", "Yea, something has you spooked alright.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_da63f16c", "If you just bury your head, next time it might be your planet.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_e14b17f4", "Which means it's even more important to fight. We cannot let a regime with so little regard for sapient life continue to hold the galaxy hostage. We must stop them!");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_e1ee18d4", "Later, friend.");
stringFiles[244].addEntry("s_f7ae6df2", "You sure? I heard the people of this village had ways of making things go their way.");

stringFiles[245] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_village_convo4_f");
stringFiles[245].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_village_convo4_f) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[245].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[245].addEntry("s_21bb400d", "Everybody is running around with important things to do. Nobody has time for the crops. I'm going to try and get as much planted today as I can. Did you want to help?");
stringFiles[245].addEntry("s_34b7d87e", "Sure, I'd be glad to help.");
stringFiles[245].addEntry("s_3f5944d5", "Not me, I'm not really the farmer type. ");
stringFiles[245].addEntry("s_62809d8c", "Yea, I could tell that. You probably would have just gotten in the way.");
stringFiles[245].addEntry("s_c3a7b9e4", "On second thought, maybe you should go see what the elder needs. Last thing I need is following some urbanite around fixing all their mistakes.");

stringFiles[246] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_village_convo5_f");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_village_convo5_f) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_126e325b", "How did they help him?");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_1aebf838", "Wishing I was back there right now. I'll talk to you later.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_1c688d82", "Really?! Wow, I hope I get the chance!");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_38602b56", "There is a prison Northwest of here. when I was real little they say a man came here from the prison. We helped him and now he is safe.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_38f5722b", "What?! I... I've got to be going. Daddy told me to never talk to a prisoner. You have a... bye!");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_3b00b466", "They can do tricks? Like what kind of tricks.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_409c13d6", "What prison?");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_42584442", "That's what I thought. I suppose you just have to be born lucky.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_55a1b0c", "You're not from the village, I would have seen you before.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_5f65644b", "Yup. Are you interested in space travel?");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_63df3a78", "Well, I wouldn't worry. If those witches come for you I will stop them.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_66242968", "Who are the nightsisters?");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_6bbd64da", "So why don't you go learn how to pilot? It's not that hard.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_6d6ef87a", "I didn't help him. I was a little kid. He didn't look like he would hurt anyone though.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_71d67ffc", "Yea, not much you can learn farming that would help you be a pilot. If I were you I'd just stay here and be the best farmer you can be.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_900f01d1", "What?");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_97efc39d", "They are witches that use evil magic. I hear the adults talking about them once in a while. They always say they are going to force us to do something, but I can never figure out what.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_98eb2667", "Force you to do something? What do you mean?");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_a78b5781", "You can't stop them. Only the grown ups that know the good tricks can stop them. Uh oh. I have to go now. Bye!");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_afe7471", "Are you really from another planet?");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_c4ca664e", "You'd be surprised. Some of the galaxies best pilots were farmers. I think you would have a good chance.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_cb9faa", "I have to go. They said I shouldn't talk about the good tricks.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_de00afa9", "Well I'm just a farmer, I've never heard of a farmer becoming a spaceship pilot.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_df5087e7", "I don't know. I just keep hearing them say force this, and force that. I think the adults would stop them from forcing us to do anything though. Sometimes they can do tricks...");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_e6772f13", "Goodbye.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_eca871b0", "I don't know. I was too little and they took me away when he arrived. I never saw him again.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_ef3f73aa", "I bet. not much here except for the prison and the nightsisters.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_f02cea2", "No, I'm from here.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_f04bc948", "You shouldn't help Imperial prisoners.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_f4998e85", "No, I'm from the Imperial prison.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_f6fc4ef7", "Any prison help is good help!");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_f8f7c983", "I've been gone a long time.");
stringFiles[246].addEntry("s_fb77af66", "Oh yes. I want to be a spaceship pilot. ");

stringFiles[247] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_village_convo6_m");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_village_convo6_m) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_1a53608", "Then it looks like you have answered your own question.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_223add4d", "I didn't know Jedi had rituals. What more can you tell me?");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_2370af8f", "Well, I know they have great temples. They are the most powerful people in the galaxy!");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_2d2307c4", "See here! It's an artifact. it glows when you hold it. I think it's activated by the Force.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_34f24948", "Yes, I would.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_51724d30", "I think I'll be holding on to it after all.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_564850b4", "What kind of artifact? I might be interested.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_60109f4d", "A case of melons? For an artifact?");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_6e0cc829", "What? Artifacts explode!?");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_7e6f0d3e", "Perhaps you should speak with the village elder. He's in the center of the village near his hut.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_8ce975f3", "How would a dirt farmer out in the middle of nowhere get an artifact?");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_9173b56f", "What do you know? Are you a Jedi? I think I'll hold on to this until I find someone that can appreciate its rarity.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_98f1d36", "Hey, you a trader? I got an artifact here.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_9cb8cd84", "Listen friend. I really doubt that is an artifact.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_9d65b97c", "No, I don't think I would.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_a3809553", "Well where are they now? We could sure use their help.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_abaeae10", "What about the artifact?");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_af4a93c0", "It's an ancient Jedi artifact, used in their rituals.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_b1b21b87", "It's an artifact alright! It glows when you hold it. I think it's activated by the Force.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_b86c2d97", "Yup.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_bf977dc7", "Jedi don't have rituals. Let's see this artifact.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_c743096f", "What? Oh, yea. That's just a glowcrystal after all. I was mistaken. Make sure you speak to the village elder. He's a very wise man.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_cd1f47c5", "That's not an artifact friend. It's a glowcrystal. You can buy them for 10 credits.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_d59bf8d6", "A trader that came through here a few years ago traded it to me for a case of Maroj melons.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_f39a113e", "Artifact, eh? Try not to blow up anyone I know.");
stringFiles[247].addEntry("s_fd4a5d92", "If you were them would you help? In the war I mean.");

stringFiles[248] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_village_convo7");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_village_convo7) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_1bb44cf9", "I am not sure I can help such secretive people.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_20f19cdd", "We manage. It takes plenty of high nutrient fertilizer and quite a bit of water, but it can be done.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_2c9520b6", "Planting? You people are farmers?");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_50b2b480", "I don't think they are really Sith, but they sure believe in the evil ideals of that race. They seem to want us all dead.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_52cf32e2", "How can you grow anything in this dead brown dirt?");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_5d7bd117", "Well... No, I shouldn't speak of it.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_6cf0908b", "We're never going to get our planting done in time with everything else that's going on.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_76887815", "You haven't left? I would find better land.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_76ef710f", "We've been attacked by a group of mercenaries calling themselves the Sith Shadows.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_9f2c88cd", "You don't sound so sure.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_a232b8a1", "Sith? Are you serious?");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_a9fdde5e", "Yes, but we'll never make the planting in time for this season now.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_af8eece8", "There are other more fertile areas of Dathomir.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_bc23678f", "This was too when we arrived. Green and fertile as the eye could see. You should have seen it, as lush a land that has ever been in the galaxy.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_bf08330a", "Ok, ok. I will tell you. I think we were cursed by those evil Nightsisters. They found out we were in tune with the Force and wanted to destroy us, or at least drive us off.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_c031923", "Why do you bother farming here?");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_c24ab601", "Well we don't really know, but the Elder believes some sort climatological shift occurred and we ended up like this.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_c7fdb62e", "What has been going on?");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_d948941a", "Go see the Village Elder near the center of the village. He can help you. ");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_e00ac98e", "What happened?");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_ecdfe4b4", "Well, I am sure I can help in some way.");
stringFiles[248].addEntry("s_fb0e2a0", "I don't know about the rest but I stay more because of that very reason now than anything else. I will not be intimidated by anyone...or anything.");

stringFiles[249] = new StringFile("conversation/fs_woman");
stringFiles[249].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (fs_woman) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[249].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[249].addEntry("s_827a56fe", "Village elder? Please tell me more.");
stringFiles[249].addEntry("s_b46f1e5e", "Hello, welcome to Dathomir.  I was told you would be looking for me.  Have you spoken to the village elder yet?");
stringFiles[249].addEntry("s_c76aeb53", "There is a village to the southeast that needs some help.  I do not have all the details.  I am sure if you talk to the village elder, all of your questions will be answered.  I must go.  Good luck to you. ");
stringFiles[249].addEntry("s_e87eb378", "We have nothing to discuss.");

stringFiles[250] = new StringFile("conversation/generic_newbie_pilot_info_01");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (generic_newbie_pilot_info_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_1a06c1df", "It doesn't.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_1d489448", "You are an Imperial pilot. You don't need my help.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_250fded0", "I know you. What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_2941e8d8", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_29894b97", "I don't know how to check.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_2e30f02b", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand-side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_3ece5721", "No problem! Take care!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_42ddcfd5", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on-track.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_558a361a", "The Imperial Navy? I've heard that they are sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_5989c487", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you most and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_598fb819", "You are a Rebel pilot. You don't need my help.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_5a1d315c", "On the lower right-side of your screen there should be a 'letter' icon that is flashing. Double-click on this icon and it will bring up your personal email. Read over the subject and sender, and scroll through the body text to get all the details.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_5b893f7c", "It does.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_5ebe92b8", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planet map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand-side there is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_6f0ab63b", "Stay safe, my friend.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_728131b6", "That's a shame. It seems like most systems have fallen on hard economic times because of the war. Most of the pilots are flying for either the Empire or the Rebellion, now. Too few free pilots for my taste. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_847df52f", "Don't mention it.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_8b70941b", "You are a Privateer pilot. You don't need my help.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_93280d8a", "Good idea. Thanks!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_94e18e61", "Oh! Hello there. I just got back from a rather dangerous trip through the star system. It sure feels good to be back on solid ground. What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_97a37895", "Have you checked the bazaar terminals? Shipwrights from all over the area put finished starships up for sale on the local bazaar.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_a2737181", "That's what I've heard. I can understand how the Empire does it. They're pretty well-equipped! But there are rumors that the Alliance has also prepared a fleet of ships so they can get new recruits into the fray as soon as possible.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_ab00aa08", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot-spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_ba3c26af", "You did? These are desperate times, indeed. The email should probably indicate where you are supposed to go for initial recruitment.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_bb38db80", "Interesting. Well... good luck with that. I don't want to get too close to the galactic civil war, myself.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_bc324892", "Don't mention it!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_c2db6878", "Good-bye.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_c7f2987a", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Empire and sign up for their training program. Of course... there are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Alliance. What interests you?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_cdb17e79", "How do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_cdd2fccc", "That's sort of tricky. There may be some Alliance pilots bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map. Have you looked at the planet map yet?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_e9934b03", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planet map. On the right side of your display you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_eab69714", "Strange. Seems that if they undertook the risk to send you a message, they would make it clear how to respond. Why don't you check your email a little closer.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_ee65526d", "Have a good day!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_f90ad503", "I see. Thanks!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_fa2e7213", "No problem!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_fa94d5c5", "Good-bye!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_fae2eb08", "You don't have the space expansion.");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");
stringFiles[250].addEntry("s_fe631380", "Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[251] = new StringFile("conversation/generic_newbie_pilot_info_emperors_retreat");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (generic_newbie_pilot_info_emperors_retreat) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_1093ddb2", "Who are you? What are you doing here?");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_15799d85", "For the Emperor.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_1ad77c93", "Really? Me?");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_1e2899cf", "At least Sir. Anyway, let me transfer your reward. You have also been granted complete access, well almost, to the Retreat Sir.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_1f041825", "That...that's not possible..Sir..");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_27fddd0", "Then you should become a friend of the Empire, should you not?");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_29db34e3", "I think you're just being modest Sir. Anyway, let me transfer your reward. I'm also honored to inform you that you have been granted access to most of the Retreat Sir.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_3cc53bb1", "It's what I do and no one does it better!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_407efa57", "Of course Sir. You helped that freighter without hesitating, apparently shooting down, what was it, 20 of the Rebel scum?");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_421b07a8", "Good to see you Sir! Word of your heroics in the Yavin system has spread like wildfire among the ranks.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_421dc0c2", "Are you calling me a liar?!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_4d15b266", "Then good luck to you, friend.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_4ed6cafa", "Really?! Whow! So I can go inside right now?");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_6403a01d", "Ohh excellent, yes indeed. Well, I'm going inside then?");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_66afbe47", "First you must meet Kaja - befriend her... do as she commands. Once you have satisfied her requirements she will recommend you for advancement within the Emperor's circle.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_6adec6b0", "Of course!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_6f34494e", "Y..yes of course Sir! Amazing performance, shooting down 20 of those Rebel scum in one mission.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_7176e12d", "What sort of requirements?");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_742f54a5", "I need to get into the Emperor's Retreat.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_745f3194", "At least!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_7630ee0a", "As it should be!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_7d0bf8d", "This is all too much.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_8054081f", "Absolutely Sir, right away Sir!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_8c3b7af1", "Of course, go right ahead Sir.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_9045a59e", "It has? Oh of course! A reward was mentioned?");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_9bcb9771", "Indeed Sir. Let me transfer that to your account. I'm also honored to inform you that you have been granted access to most of the Retreat Sir.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_9dd0fe3d", "Very good Sir, I take your word for that. Anyway, let me transfer your reward. You have also been granted complete access, well almost, to the Retreat Sir.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_a4069638", "Sure can Sir. Take care!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_a9e4fd02", "How do I do that?");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_aede40a6", "What do you mean almost?!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_b2fccb6d", "Nonsense Sir! You should be proud of yourself. Have a great day Sir!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_bc0613a9", "I cannot say. It is very likely you will need to face dangerous conditions as a servant of the Emperor. Don't fear. This will make you strong. It will make you worthy of the Emperor's attention... and some day you may speak with him face-to-face.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_c39cfcc5", "Oh it was more like 10.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_c6cd8614", "Good to see you Sir!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_c8f2f3db", "Farewell.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_ca992d2c", "Nothing. Sorry to bother you.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_cbd17b72", "Okay..well anyway, let me transfer your reward. I'm also honored to inform you that you have been granted access to most of the Retreat Sir.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_d0d78fed", "20?! It was 40 at least!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_d89d15b4", "Of course not Sir! 40 it was!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_de1e771", "Hmm, I suppose you're right. Very well then, get back to work!");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_e1fb0b6a", "Well I don't think the Emperor would appreciate unannounced visitors in his private quarters Sir.");
stringFiles[251].addEntry("s_f184aba", "20?! I mean, I sure did!");

stringFiles[252] = new StringFile("conversation/generic_newbie_pilot_info_gia_pei");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (generic_newbie_pilot_info_gia_pei) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_126a14e0", "No, I guess not.");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_170ed80d", "Only the best!");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_1db66446", "I don't think he wants me talking to you...");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_56866a7", "Then we've got nothing more to discuss.");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_77266474", "I know the feeling!");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_9288900f", "I understand.");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_96dd8566", "Who? Him?");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_b7b44868", "That's very wise.");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_c8f2f3db", "Farewell.");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_d14f41b0", "We're not talking.");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_d88625cb", "I don't have a starship.");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_e05e22e2", "Just what I can afford.");
stringFiles[252].addEntry("s_ea09eddd", "Tell me. What sort of equipment do you fly?");

stringFiles[253] = new StringFile("conversation/generic_newbie_pilot_info_jabbas_palace");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (generic_newbie_pilot_info_jabbas_palace) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_29430ed4", "Thanks. Take care of yourself, pal.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_2b167dbd", "Hmm, yes, yes these looks to be correct. See this dotted line at the bottom though? You're supposed to sign it, come back to me when you have.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_2c017871", "Sounds good. Thanks.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_3385ded9", "Yes they looks to be in order but you're not a part of the Smugglers Alliance are you? Get your priorities straight and then come back to see me.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_37388d12", "Do some favors for Reelo Baruk. He's in the main entry of the palace because he needs to coordinate with a lot of lower-level folks in the Hutt organization... folks that Jabba doesn't want to see face-to-face, you know?");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_51bcd889", "I can't believe we're still using paper documents. Let's see here... hmm, yes these looks to be correct I suppose. I will inform the guards of your privileges. Keep in mind though, if you abuse Jabba's rules, you will be in deep trouble.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_5c484c74", "What way is that?");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_6b059369", "Only by rolling a fragmentation grenade into the creature's mouth as it tried to swallow me whole! I don't think there's enough for Porcellus to make a meal... let alone a special meal for Jabba himself! Unless he enjoys picking shrapnel out of his entrees.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_6d6fc618", "It depends. You'll probably see a lot of combat when working for Jabba the Hutt. I know I have!");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_6f8371ee", "You better not. *sniff* *sniff* Strange...is that glue I sme...");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_6fa59967", "You have to become a friend of the Hutts. You need to get Jabba's associates to trust you.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_80f90f12", "You survived, though.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_8583811b", "My friend is the guy to ask, honestly. I'm just a hired gun. Porcellus needed us to take down a rare animal for a special dish he's preparing for Jabba. Sounded simple enough - but we got in over our heads.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_8aeca88d", "Do favors for Reelo, then he'll pass you on up the chain. Other friends of Jabba will have assignments for you. As you complete those assignments, you'll be recommended to more higher-ranking Hutts. Soon enough you'll be face-to-face with Jabba himself.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_9bd20141", "There's only one way into the palace... without getting shot by Hutt assassins or getting thrown to the Sarlacc pit.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_9dd79035", "After doing favors for Reelo, he'll pass you on up the chain of command. Other friends of Jabba will have assignments for you. As you complete those assignments, you'll be recommended to more higher-ranking Hutts. Soon enough you'll be face-to-face with Jabba himself.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_a9e4fd02", "How do I do that?");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_aefb75dd", "Don't take that tone with me, friend! I'd like to see how well you do in the same situation.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_b543ec60", "Oh, hi there. Sorry... I'm a little dazed. My friends and I had to run an errand for Porcellus. I had no idea it was going to be so difficult! What can I do for you, friend?");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_b8b50032", "What sort of errand did you run?");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_bc324892", "Don't mention it!");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_bc4e70bf", "I better let you rest.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_cba77fff", "What sort of favors?");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_d038a005", "And then what?");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_d06b92dc", "Me? Trouble? Never.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_d11dc1bf", "Start by doing some favors for Reelo Baruk. He's in the main entry of the palace because he needs to coordinate with a lot of lower-level folks in the Hutt organization... folks that Jabba doesn't want to see face-to-face, you know?");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_d94b37db", "Over your head? Against a simple creature?");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_daa8544b", "I need to get in the palace.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_ebf8ee6f", "How do you meet Jabba face-to-face?");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_f7d7d0fe", "Let's see...Hmm yes these looks to be in order. I thought you said your name was %TU though? So why haven't you signed with your correct name? Get that fixed and come back to see me when you have.");
stringFiles[253].addEntry("s_f97d453c", "Well I have these papers?");

stringFiles[254] = new StringFile("conversation/generic_newbie_pilot_info_khroz");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (generic_newbie_pilot_info_khroz) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("s_5dc9f5db", "Now you know.");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("s_61485a8a", "Okay. Good-bye.");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("s_775bc39f", "I don't have time for you, citizen! See my man. He can help you. And if he can't... get out of here!");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("s_788a4dba", "Waiting. What business is it of yours?");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("s_89cbe37c", "I'm waiting, too.");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("s_91979dc5", "Leave me alone! I'm tired of you rabble nipping at my heels every time I leave the Emperor's retreat!");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("s_b26194cb", "What are you doing here?");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("s_b78c4998", "I just want to know.");
stringFiles[254].addEntry("s_dba34f4", "Yes. Of course.");

stringFiles[255] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_bestine_bookie");
stringFiles[255].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_bestine_bookie) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[255].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[255].addEntry("s_2b9bb31e", "Whoa there! That's not really the kind of question you just up and ask someone. I don't talk about the details of a client's gambling debt to random people. So just let it go.");
stringFiles[255].addEntry("s_5bb4c9f9", "Oh sorry. Could you answer some other questions?");
stringFiles[255].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[255].addEntry("s_7d382d7", "You have questions, then ask 'Mr. Travel Vouchers' here. He's the bigshot Imperial officer. Just make sure he never owes you money.");
stringFiles[255].addEntry("s_a3171132", "Why does he owe you money?");
stringFiles[255].addEntry("s_e6fab5c8", "Look, I really don't care who you are or why you're here. I just want my money from Col. Talnin, and then I'm gone.");
stringFiles[255].addEntry("s_f1e05b2b", "Col. Talnin here will not be of use to you unless you're involved with space flight.");

stringFiles[256] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_bestine_imperial_officer");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_bestine_imperial_officer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_186acb93", "Yes, hello. Welcome to the township of Bestine. Sandy jewel in the Imperial crown, as I'm sure you'll find. Now, if you'll excuse me, I have business with my associate here.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_30efbb57", "Do you really think you should be asking me that? Even if I did know that some Alliance pilots are bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map, I wouldn't exactly be telling people. I'm an officer in the Imperial Navy, after all.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_3700bf66", "I'd be willing to bet that you're a pilot for the Rebel Alliance. You should probably take this opportunity to vanish before I decide whether or not to place that bet.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_3ab7e5b8", "Ah, my apologies. I am the officer in charge of this starport. All incoming and outgoing space travel is authorized by me. Or not authorized in some cases.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_4126da47", "I'm offering a small fortune worth of travel vouchers in an effort to pay off. Wait, why am I telling you this?? Let me just add, though, that double or nothing is not as good as it sounds.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_41594520", "Right. So how do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_4918186c", "Well, I suppose that is my job, more or less. So yes, how may I be of assistance?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_50129856", "Oh good, an Imperial Starship Pilot. Just follow normal procedures and always log your arrival and departure times with the officer on duty. I think I assigned an officer to be on duty. Well, log those times either way. Dismissed.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_558a361a", "The Imperial Navy? I've heard that they are sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_594bfcf2", "Good advice, thanks.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_5c80b75a", "You're welcome. Did I actually help? Well, that wasn't so hard. Anything else?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_726e332f", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you the most, and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_72f5c999", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planetary map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand side there is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_7b064e95", "Don't mention it! Anything else?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_8337797f", "Excuse me pilot. Er, you are a pilot, yes? You see, the thing that confuses me is the lack of an Imperial uniform, because as I'm sure you know, only Imperial pilots are allowed to fly from my starport here. Well, maybe just this once I'll pretend I didn't see you. All that paperworks is rather bothersome. But do try and stay out of trouble on my watch. Very good.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_89a5ddb", "Always willing to spread me wisdom. Just as long as it doesn't get spread too thin.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_8e84f7eb", "You did? From the Alliance? And you're telling me this? Look, it would be best for all concerned if you just ignored that email message, and we both pretended this conversation never took place. Anything else I can actually help with?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_9721ce96", "Money. Right. I know that some people have fallen on hard economic times because of the war. Many pilots are flying for either the Empire or the Rebellion these days in order to get off the ground. Ever think of joining the military as a way to get a starship?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_98e32091", "Well, then could I ask some other questions?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_a054d9fc", "Good luck, my friend! Anything else?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_abc6d2f6", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Empire and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Alliance, but fools will be fools.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_b42842dd", "What kind of business are you and your friend doing?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_ca776e30", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_df7992b9", "There are some freelance pilots here and there, though the Empire mostly frowns upon that kind of activity. At the same time, we do recognize that there is a need for a small number of freelance pilots to handle certain jobs with which the Empire does not want to be associated or simply views as beneath our notice. As I understand it, most freelance pilots are recruited through email.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_e1c13ebb", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Anything else?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_e843e3ab", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planetary map. On the right side of your display, you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_efbaf135", "You're obviously not involved with the business of space flight, so I really don't have time for you. Good day.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_f5f72ae1", "My pleasure. Anything else?");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_fb096a5a", "Well, giving them out may not be the phrase I'd use, but I guess it's not far off the mark. The Empire will supply new pilots with a ship. We're pretty well-equipped after all, and one can't exactly be an Imperial pilot without a ship. I've also heard rumors that the Alliance has prepared a fleet of ships so that they can get new recruits into the fray as soon as possible as well, but I can assure you that I only care about that if they come to Bestine.");
stringFiles[256].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[257] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_coronet_merchant");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_coronet_merchant) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_198d9a41", "Greetings and welcome to Coronet. I apologize, but I don't have time to chat. If you get involved with space flight, I might be able to answer some questions, but otherwise I'm not going to be of much help.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_1a06c1df", "It doesn't.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_29894b97", "I don't know how to check.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_309c383a", "On the lower right-hand side of your screen, there should be a 'letter' icon that is flashing. Double-click on this icon, and it will bring up your personal email. Read over the subject and sender, and scroll through the body text to get all the details.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_3c81054", "That's what I hear. The Empire's pretty well-equipped after all and can't really have much of a navy if their pilots don't have ships. I've also heard rumors that the Alliance has a fleet of ships available so they can get new recruits into the fray as soon as possible.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_4a019574", "Greetings and welcome to Coronet. I apologize for my fading enthusiasm, but I've been waiting for quite some time for a shipment of goods to arrive. These two shipwrights have been waiting with me, and one of them is becoming especially belligerent.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_4eb2ac5d", "Good luck, kid! Anything else?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_50095b25", "Not a problem. Anything else?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_558a361a", "The Imperial Navy? I've heard that they are sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_5b893f7c", "It does.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_659f0dee", "Seeing as I have little else to do at the moment, ask away.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_6f0ab63b", "Stay safe, my friend.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_726e332f", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you the most, and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_75698511", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Empire and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Alliance, but fools will be fools. Anything else?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_80e2ba26", "Why are they waiting with you?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_82cd91e", "They ordered some parts from me, and those parts should be in the missing shipment. I gave them a good price, but the long wait seems to have eroded their goodwill.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_8ae971c3", "Thank you for the kind words.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_8dd808e3", "Ask away.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_8ef8dbfb", "I have another question.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_93280d8a", "Good idea. Thanks!");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_9f7f7c0a", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planetary map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand side, there is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_a185791a", "Things are tough all over what with the Alliance and the Empire making with war and all. A lot of pilots are flying for either the Empire or the Rebellion these days. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_a463a3c1", "You're welcome. Anything else?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_adc9d9e5", "Strange. Seems that if they undertook the risk to send you a message, they would make it clear how to respond. Why don't you check your email a little more carefully.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_af4397a9", "Interesting. Well, good luck with that. I don't want to get too close to the Galactic Civil War, myself.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_b5d34085", "Could I ask some questions while you wait?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_b78b7ed6", "Well, you're a pilot, and you've managed to land here, so that at least means starships are getting through to Corellia. But I still have no idea why my cargo has been delayed for so long.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_ba3c26af", "You did? These are desperate times, indeed. The email should probably indicate where you are supposed to go for initial recruitment.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_c2db6878", "Good-bye.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_cdb17e79", "How do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_d48167e1", "That's too bad. I hope your goods arrive soon.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_d9231b4f", "There are freelance pilots working in most systems. Some are CorSec pilots, others are part of the RSF of Naboo, and of course, others are smugglers or pirates. I wouldn't recommend those last two if you want to pursue a lengthy career, but, at the same time, some of the best military pilots I know were once smugglers. Most freelance organizations will send recruitment emails. You might try checking your email for something like that.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_da08c873", "That's sort of tricky. There may be some Alliance pilots bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map. Have you looked at the planetary map yet?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_db064e66", "You have the look of a pilot from the Alliance. I'd better not find out you Rebels have stolen my shipment of goods.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_e1c13ebb", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Anything else?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_e843e3ab", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planetary map. On the right side of your display, you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_e8b5b2ac", "Hello, sir. You're an Imperial Pilot, correct? Would you happen to know why my shipment might have been delayed? It's quite far behind schedule.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_f5f72ae1", "My pleasure. Anything else?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_f90ad503", "I see. Thanks!");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_fbc4f153", "Hey, my pleasure. As long as I'm not busy. Anything else?");
stringFiles[257].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[258] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_coronet_shipwright_impatient");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_coronet_shipwright_impatient) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("s_252f6fb9", "I cannot believe we have been wasting our time standing here. What kind of merchant sells ship parts that they can't deliver?!!? Not exactly a model way to run a business. I'm not buying anything from this guy ever again.");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("s_4668c9d5", "I'll tell you what happened. We paid for ship parts that this guy doesn't have. Oh sure, he claimed they'd be delivered with his next shipment, but it's been days now. Where's this mythical shipment? Starships don't just disappear! Well, not normally.");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("s_79bcfacd", "Spare me the lecture. My comrade has already given me that one more than enough times. I want the parts I paid for. Not empty words!");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("s_8dd47fdc", "Could I ask you some questions?");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("s_9cc3fb32", "Sometimes you just have to have patience.");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("s_ca20e884", "I'm not really in a giving mood. Try asking the merchant. It's the least he could do.");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("s_d9e89e0d", "Look, I don't have time to waste with someone who obviously isn't into space flight.");
stringFiles[258].addEntry("s_e5210282", "Why not? What happened?");

stringFiles[259] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_coronet_shipwright_indifferent");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_coronet_shipwright_indifferent) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("s_101a8685", "Thanks. Personally, I just wanna get out of here and either get to work or kick back and enjoy the break.");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("s_22fde798", "Why don't you just go wait at the cantina?");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("s_44511b5f", "I bet an ale would taste really good right now. I don't understand why we have to wait here with the merchant guy. It's not like us being here will speed up the delivery of his cargo. We've wasted good cantina time standing outside of a starport. Bummer.");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("s_5a2c3b35", "That's too bad. I hope your parts arrive soon.");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("s_642ae5d4", "Well, we do kind of have some work that's on hold until we get those parts. But in truth, I don't think it would make that big a difference if we had an ale or three while we wait. Every time I say something, though, my friend kind of freaks out. Wants me to quit lecturing him or something. I had to give up.");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("s_673006ed", "Sorry, grounded one. Can't help you unless you're into space flight.");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("s_946445f6", "I'm not sure how much help I'd be. Try asking the merchant. He seems pretty together.");
stringFiles[259].addEntry("s_b5d34085", "Could I ask some questions while you wait?");

stringFiles[260] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_dantooine_brother_imperial");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_dantooine_brother_imperial) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_167bccd7", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Empire and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Alliance, but fools will be fools. Or they'll be my brother.Was there anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_3eb6287c", "What's so unbelievable?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_558a361a", "The Imperial Navy? I've heard that they are sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_56c322c4", "Why don't you leave the Empire and join with your brother?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_688d1dd9", "Lack of funds is a common issue for new pilots. That is why so many pilots start out working for someone else. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_6cf025ea", "My brother, Kess, and I decided to join the military and become pilots. But he joined up with the Rebel Alliance while I became an Imperial pilot. I mean, now we're on opposite sides. This wasn't supposed to happen.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_6d792b3f", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_713ef70", "Isn't Fern a girl's name?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_726e332f", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you the most, and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_72f5c999", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planetary map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand side there is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_7c943cb6", "Can you believe this?? Well, actually, you probably won't understand since you don't know anything about space flight. So never mind.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_8092cf42", "It's not that easy. I get the feeling that the Empire doesn't look kindly upon those who leave. And my training officer is big and mean. I don't think I could handle telling her I want out.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_8634c132", "Too afraid to pick a side? You're just like my brother, Rane. On the other hand, at least I won't be fighting against Rane. Unlike my other brother, Kess, who is now a Rebel pilot.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_8dd47fdc", "Could I ask you some questions?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_97db14af", "Ask Kess. He's the current expert on the Alliance. And while you're at it, remind him he should quit and join the Empire with me.Was there anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_a68463ed", "That's a very good question! One I've yet to get a good answer for. Yeah, why should I be the one to quit? Let Kess quit. I hope he does, because I really don't want to fly against him.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_a8fdf422", "Yeah, sure. What would you like to know?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_aa5186b0", "Glad I could help. Was there anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_ae74cbe5", "Oh, another Rebel pilot. Great. I guess you and my brother can go off and fight and have fun, and I'll just sit here by myself. Alone. Great.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_b19f6c96", "What!? No!! I can't... No!");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_c07f7b6e", "Why doesn't your brother leave the Rebels and join with you?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_df7992b9", "There are some freelance pilots here and there, though the Empire mostly frowns upon that kind of activity. At the same time, we do recognize that there is a need for a small number of freelance pilots to handle certain jobs with which the Empire does not want to be associated or simply views as beneath our notice. As I understand it, most freelance pilots are recruited through email.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_dfa28bfa", "Yeah, the Empire will supply new pilots with a ship. You can't exactly be an Imperial pilot without one. I've also heard rumors that the Alliance has ships they can provide for new recruits, but my brother, Kess, would know more about that.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_e53f15d9", "Can you believe this?? Utterly unbelievable.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_ef58210e", "Good, another Imperial pilot. Tell my stupid brother how it's much better flying for the Empire. Go on.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[260].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[261] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_dantooine_brother_neutral");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_dantooine_brother_neutral) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_11b5a735", "That's what I hear. Or something like that anyway. The Empire's pretty well-equipped, after all, and can't really have much of a navy if their pilots don't have ships. I've also heard rumors that the Alliance has a fleet of ships available. That's probably so that they can get new recruits into the fray as soon as possible.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_1ed4d61", "You're telling me! They don't always get along, but neither wants to fight against the other in this war if it comes to that. To be honest, they didn't really even join up in order to fight anyone. They just wanted to be trained as pilots.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_21394e94", "Ouch, that's definitely a problem.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_2148f1d8", "Things are tough all over thanks to the Empire and the Alliance fighting their war. A lot of pilots are flying for either the Empire or the Rebellion these days. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_219ea9a7", "Oh, no. I fly for myself. Well, mostly. I take jobs from various sources. I'll admit it's not easy thanks to the Empire trying to control who can fly and who can't. But I get by. Fern and Kess thought they'd be better off with full military support, but I think they'll regret that decision. Actually, they already do. ");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_267854a", "Ask Fern about joining the Empire. If that's really what you want to do, he should be able to help you. Any other questions?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_2813e3f4", "We're kind of in the middle of something here. It involves space flight, which you wouldn't really understand.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_2cc72ac", "Could I ask some other questions?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_2d6a2fce", "Try Kess. He just joined the Alliance, so he should know what you'd need to do. Any other questions?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_4c4f0209", "And you're not on either side?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_6d792b3f", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_726e332f", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you the most, and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_82bf2365", "Look, we're having kind of a family crisis here. I'm not sure I can talk much.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_97856fdc", "If I can answer them, I'd be more than happy to do so.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_9e23c971", "What kind of family crisis?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_c4de0e45", "Well, these two knuckleheads, my brothers, wanted to become pilots like me. Unlike me, though, they decided they would join the military and get free training. Stupid move if you ask me, but there it is. Only problem is that they didn't check with one another before joining, and now Fern is an Imperial pilot while Kess joined the Alliance.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_c5b0fbb3", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_c77a96c6", "Yeah, hi. I can see that you're a hotshot pilot, but this is really a family matter. Thanks.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_d9231b4f", "There are freelance pilots working in most systems. Some are CorSec pilots, others are part of the RSF of Naboo, and of course, others are smugglers or pirates. I wouldn't recommend those last two if you want to pursue a lengthy career, but, at the same time, some of the best military pilots I know were once smugglers. Most freelance organizations will send recruitment emails. You might try checking your email for something like that.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[261].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");

stringFiles[262] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_dantooine_brother_rebel");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_dantooine_brother_rebel) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_175a8508", "Great, an Imperial Pilot. That's perfect. Why don't you go play Empire somewhere else. This is a family matter.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_19aad16e", "No. And you need help. Seriously. What the heck are you talking about? Family bantha? Do we look like ranchers? Please. The magic beans sound cool though.Anyway, no. He joined the Empire and became an Imperial pilot.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_1a06c1df", "It doesn't.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_1abd933c", "Interesting. Good luck with that. I don't want to get too close to the Galactic Civil War, myself.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_1b178396", "I wish I could help, but I'm stumped.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_23b94086", "My brother went and became an Imperial pilot. Can you believe that? Well actually, I guess you wouldn't know anything about being a pilot, would you?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_29894b97", "I don't know how to check.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_309c383a", "On the lower right-hand side of your screen, there should be a 'letter' icon that is flashing. Double-click on this icon, and it will bring up your personal email. Read over the subject and sender, and scroll through the body text to get all the details.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_30c987fd", "Okay. Anyway, could you answer some questions for me?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_47993591", "That I can't answer so well, but Fern could. Stupid moron knows all about joining the Empire. Any other questions?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_4c5683f0", "That's what one hears. The Empire has more ships than pilots, and I suspect that it's because they go through pilots faster than a smuggler goes through ale. The Rebels, on the other hand, are known to honor their new pilots with a new ship that will lift them into the reaches of space and beyond.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_4eb2ac5d", "Good luck, kid! Anything else?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_5b893f7c", "It does.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_5dac8809", "You're a Privateer Pilot, aren't you? I'm beginning to wonder if maybe you and my brother Rane had the right idea by not joining the Imperial Navy or the Rebel Navy, and simply staying out of the whole mess. As much as is possible for anyone to stay out of it, anyway.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_5eb5a62c", "I can totally relate to that. Things are tough all over thanks to the was between the Empire and the Alliance. A lot of pilots are flying for either the Empire or the Rebellion these days. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_60674236", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planetary map. On the right-hand side of your display, you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_67d831d4", "Okay, what would you like to know?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_69796047", "He traded the family bantha for some magic beans?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_6bbf120e", "With Fern? Absolutely correct! You'd never guess what that no-brain womp rat went and did? Try and guess. Go ahead and try.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_6d792b3f", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_6f0ab63b", "Stay safe, my friend.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_726e332f", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you the most, and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_778041fd", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Alliance and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Empire, but fools will be fools. And most fools are my brother.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_7cedb568", "Yeah, that's right. I can't believe you guessed it. Wow.Anyway, yeah, he became an Imperial pilot and I'm a Rebel pilot. We were supposed to join the same military, not opposed ones. And now I don't know what to do about it.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_7ea269a5", "Of all the stubborn, no-account, 'don't bother to say anything to your brother' brothers, mine is definitely the worst! By far. No one else could ever come close.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_85e41490", "He became an Imperial pilot while you became a Rebel pilot?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_8ef8dbfb", "I have another question.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_91cb4419", "You seem to be upset with your brother?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_93280d8a", "Good idea. Thanks!");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_93511893", "Why don't you join the Empire with your brother?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_9354f1d9", "You're a Rebel Pilot. See my brother over here? The one dressed as an Imperial pilot? Look, I know he's made a big mistake joining the Empire and all, but just promise me you won't shoot him. okay? After all, he's still my brother.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_9b136077", "That's what Fern keeps insisting. But I'm not sure I trust the Empire. They seem to treat their pilots like fodder by sending wave after wave into battle with no regard for their survival. Fern says that's not the case, but I'm not so sure. And his claims that leaving the Empire might be dangerous do little to boost my confidence. Seriously, I just don't know what to do.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_9ecb2da9", "Oh sure. What would you like to know?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_a463a3c1", "You're welcome. Anything else?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_a4b89de2", "What's wrong is that I became a Rebel pilot! We wanted to join the military and become pilots. But we were supposed to join the same military, not opposed ones. He didn't tell me he was going to join the Empire. How was I supposed to know? And now what do we do?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_ad02b6b3", "He ran off with your girlfriend and married her?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_af88e52c", "What!! He ran off with my girlfriend! That son of a kreetle! I can't believe he would do something like that!! Wait a minute, I don't have a girlfriend. No, no, that's not it. That's not it at all.No, he joined the Empire and became an Imperial pilot.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_b20f640e", "No, but that's a good guess. That's exactly the kind of thing Fern would do.No, he joined the Empire and became an Imperial pilot.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_ba3c26af", "You did? These are desperate times, indeed. The email should probably indicate where you are supposed to go for initial recruitment.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_c2db6878", "Good-bye.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_cdb17e79", "How do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_d434d6d3", "I appreciate it anyway. Could I help you? Answer some questions about becoming a pilot maybe?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_d9231b4f", "There are freelance pilots working in most systems. Some are CorSec pilots, others are part of the RSF of Naboo, and of course, others are smugglers or pirates. I wouldn't recommend those last two if you want to pursue a lengthy career, but, at the same time, some of the best military pilots I know were once smugglers. Most freelance organizations will send recruitment emails. You might try checking your email for something like that.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_da08c873", "That's sort of tricky. There may be some Alliance pilots bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map. Have you looked at the planetary map yet?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_e52fbe2d", "He took the last sweesonberry roll without asking if you wanted one?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_eab69714", "Strange. Seems that if they undertook the risk to send you a message, they would make it clear how to respond. Why don't you check your email a little closer.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_f2356ea5", "What's wrong with that?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_f5f72ae1", "My pleasure. Anything else?");
stringFiles[262].addEntry("s_f90ad503", "I see. Thanks!");

stringFiles[263] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_dantooine_imperial_officer");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_dantooine_imperial_officer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_11a138a8", "Good, an Imperial Pilot. Perhaps you could speak to Lt. Herm here and refresh his memory about what an honor it is to fly for the Empire.");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_18f5467", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions about flying?");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_2cc72ac", "Could I ask some other questions?");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_2d0b2b0d", "Why doesn't he want to fly his patrol?");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_46c618ee", "Maybe a few days of kitchen duty will help convince him.");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_485a7722", "Yes, hello. I'm afraid I don't have time to chat. I must deal with this pilot, Lt. Herm, who is supposed to be on patrol.");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_52b9f1df", "Speaking of space flight, could you answer a few questions?");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_565b9394", "As the flight officer for this base, my primary duties involve scheduling and overseeing Imperial TIE fighter patrols in the area. As such, I have little time for those such as yourself who are not involved with space flight.");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_61a9bbe6", "You look suspicious. Move along.");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_757cddb8", "Well, in theory, Lt. Herm here should be able to answer those kinds of questions, but I'm not so sure anymore.");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_79729876", "It is a military matter that is being handled. Of that, I assure you. The fact of the matter is that when the Empire tells one of its pilots to fly a patrol, then that pilot does so. Nothing else matters. I'm trying to convince Lt. Herm that it is best for him to remember that.");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_a438c9", "Yes, of course. Or something like that. But I'd rather avoid disciplinary action if possible. I believe that such actions reflect on me as a leader as well as on the person being disciplined. As such, I'm hopeful we can resolve this without Lt. Herm needing to be punished yet again.");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_ab68a343", "It seems that Lt. Herm does not care for space flight. Apparently he's not fond of heights in general. As it turns out, when he signed on to be a pilot, he thought he could drive an AT-ST. I'm beginning to doubt that he could handle even that.");
stringFiles[263].addEntry("s_d2849e62", "What's the problem?");

stringFiles[264] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_dantooine_imperial_pilot");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_dantooine_imperial_pilot) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_1ead9e8c", "You're not involved with space flight, are you? Good for you. I'm totally jealous. 'Keep your feet firmly on the ground', my dad used to always say. I want so much to follow that advice.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_1f7a933d", "True, it may be a bit high, but I think I could adjust to that. An AT-ST remains firmly on the ground, though. That's the important thing. Don't you see? Two feet solidly on the ground. That's my goal.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_2e3fddb0", "The Empire will supply new pilots with a ship. You can't exactly be an Imperial Pilot without a ship. I've also heard rumors that the Alliance has prepared a fleet of ships so they can get new recruits into the fray as soon as possible as well, but rest assured that their fleet exists on borrowed time. We will crush it soon enough.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_4f12802", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Was there anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_53d312b4", "I suppose I could. What would you like to know?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_558a361a", "The Imperial Navy? I've heard that they are sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_5989c487", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you most and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_688d1dd9", "Lack of funds is a common issue for new pilots. That is why so many pilots start out working for someone else. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_6a489e79", "And why are you telling me this? I have enough problems to deal with at the moment, so I'm going to forget that you told me that.Was there anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_6b48e0e3", "You're welcome. Now move along. Unless there was something else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_72352199", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Empire and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Alliance, but fools will be fools.Anything else?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_72f5c999", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planetary map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand side there is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_880f19c", "I can't help you since you're a pilot but obviously not a member of the Imperial Navy. You should probably go.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_88a51d3c", "Do you really think you should be asking me that? Even if I did know that some Alliance pilots are bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map, I wouldn't exactly be telling people. I'm a pilot in the Imperial Navy, after all.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_9bd0d381", "Oh, hello. I'm kind of busy right now. Not as busy as Col. Rabor would like me to be, obviously, but I still feel busy nonetheless.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_a434968c", "Greetings, Pilot. Maybe you'd be willing to fly my patrol for me? No? It's not so much an honor as all that, you know. It's just really, really high up there in space.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_af081ce", "Oh, but I am. I'm trying to convince my flight officer, Col. Rabor here, that I shouldn't be a pilot. Not a space pilot, anyway. I'm not good with all the space and the emptiness and the being way, way up in the sky. It's fine for some, I guess, but I'd rather stay connected to the ground. I'm thinking that driving an AT-ST would be more my style.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_b70fd5b5", "Could answer some questions about space flight?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_c71e3ca9", "You don't look busy.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_cdb17e79", "How do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_d0338793", "Fine, now move along. Unless there was something else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_d9a44d69", "I can't help you since you're a pilot but obviously not a member of the Imperial Navy. You should probably leave now.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_df7992b9", "There are some freelance pilots here and there, though the Empire mostly frowns upon that kind of activity. At the same time, we do recognize that there is a need for a small number of freelance pilots to handle certain jobs with which the Empire does not want to be associated or simply views as beneath our notice. As I understand it, most freelance pilots are recruited through email.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_e0de9210", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions about space flight?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_e843e3ab", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planetary map. On the right side of your display, you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_f5f72ae1", "My pleasure. Anything else?");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_fbaa9d84", "Those AT-STs are pretty tall. You'd still be pretty high off the ground.");
stringFiles[264].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[265] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_dantooine_old_pilot");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_dantooine_old_pilot) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_1372e866", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Alliance and sign up for their training program. Of course... there are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Empire, but fools will be fools.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_137e40c4", "Could I ask some questions about becoming a pilot?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_29894b97", "I don't know how to check.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_2c93727e", "Of course! This is your lucky day, no one around here knows more about starflight than I do. I'd be more than happy to help..");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_2e30f02b", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand-side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_3b7aeafd", "Very well then. Fell free to ask.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_42ddcfd5", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on-track.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_49800c02", "That's what I hear. Or something like that anyway. The Empire's pretty well-equipped after all, and can't really have much of a navy if their pilots don't have ships. I've also heard rumors that the Alliance has a fleet of ships available so they can get new recruits into the fray as soon as possible.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_5989c487", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you most and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_5a1d315c", "On the lower right-side of your screen there should be a 'letter' icon that is flashing. Double-click on this icon and it will bring up your personal email. Read over the subject and sender, and scroll through the body text to get all the details.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_5b893f7c", "It does.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_5ebe92b8", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planet map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand-side there is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_62bc5ee5", "Oh, look at the Imperial pilot. You here to tell me not to fly? Well, don't bother. I haven't listened before this and I'm not listening now.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_64cda856", "Fair enough. I fly various jobs for people in these parts. Not that far back, I reconditioned an old starfighter and use it for my work. Can't stand being grounded, so I had to do something. My old bird won't stand for atmospheric flight, but she's more than enough for flying low altitude jobs.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_6c0fd0e6", "What's an old mule like yourself doing here?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_6c3b3817", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions about being a pilot?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_6f0ab63b", "Stay safe, my friend.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_73f8df86", "Hey, any time. Anything else?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_7c2b99a8", "Hey, what's a young whippersnapper like yourself doing on Dantooine? ");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_7e78496a", "Ah, a fellow pilot. Unattached to the military. Good choice. Why get mixed up in all that political hullabaloo if you don't need to?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_88a2ef9d", "Enough with the 'sir' alright? Just call me Yras, if you're gonna call me anything.Anyway, I fly various jobs for people in these parts. Not that far back, I reconditioned an old starfighter and use it for my work. Can't stand being grounded, so I had to do something. My old bird won't stand for atmospheric flight, but she's more than enough for flying low altitude jobs.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_8ef8dbfb", "I have another question.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_9296a137", "Hey, are you a Rebel pilot? Between, you and me, I think you've got the right idea. These darn Imperials think they run the galaxy or something. I for one am sick of their attitude.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_93280d8a", "Good idea. Thanks!");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_961d42dc", "May I ask what you do around here, sir?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_98936d03", "Right... so how do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_9ae83fab", "Who does the Empire think they are, trying to tell me I can't fly. I've been flying my whole life, and I don't aim to stop now. And they can stick that up their blaster and shoot it. Not that you'd know anything about flying. I can't imagine how you manage to go through life without knowing the thrill of flight, but I guess there's no accounting for some people.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_a185791a", "Things are tough all over what with the Alliance and the Empire making with war and all. A lot of pilots are flying for either the Empire or the Rebellion these days. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_a463a3c1", "You're welcome. Anything else?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_a93a834e", "You didn't answer my question, old man?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_ab00aa08", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot-spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_b0b2621a", "It doesn't");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_ba3c26af", "You did? These are desperate times, indeed. The email should probably indicate where you are supposed to go for initial recruitment.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_bb38db80", "Interesting. Well... good luck with that. I don't want to get too close to the galactic civil war, myself.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_c2db6878", "Good-bye.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_c4d3634f", "Ah spirited, are you? Last time someone showed that kind of spirit, we buried him the next day. Or what was left of him anyway. But don't let that stop you... this planet isn't kind to anyone, spirited or not.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_c74b4365", "Nothing sir. Just passing through.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_c8012fa1", "Meek as a Naboo winter. You're not gonna last a day here, youngster. Best add some backbone.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_cdd2fccc", "That's sort of tricky. There may be some Alliance pilots bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map. Have you looked at the planet map yet?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_d1493149", "The Imperial Navy? Something wrong with you? Why would you want to join the Empire? Guess you young people these days just aren't very bright. Anyway, I've heard that the Empire is sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_d9231b4f", "There are freelance pilots working in most systems. Some are CorSec pilots, others are part of the RSF of Naboo, and of course, others are smugglers or pirates. I wouldn't recommend those last two if you want to pursue a lengthy career, but, at the same time, some of the best military pilots I know were once smugglers. Most freelance organizations will send recruitment emails. You might try checking your email for something like that.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_e1c13ebb", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Anything else?");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_e9934b03", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planet map. On the right side of your display you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_eab69714", "Strange. Seems that if they undertook the risk to send you a message, they would make it clear how to respond. Why don't you check your email a little closer.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_f90ad503", "I see. Thanks!");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_fa94d5c5", "Good-bye!");
stringFiles[265].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[266] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_kadaara_imperial_officer");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_kadaara_imperial_officer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_324c0132", "Fine. Unless there was something else you wanted to ask, please move along.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_332cd8bf", "You may consider yourself lucky that I have nothing else with which to occupy my time. What are your questions, citizen?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_408909a3", "You seem distressed. Is there a problem?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_423f3cd2", "My problems are my own, citizen. Just because my vacation was interrupted to comply with some vague orders I have not even received yet does not mean that I am going to share those problems with everyone who asks.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_50bd5bd", "I apologize. I'll let you get back to your problems.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_542c6b63", "Do you really think you should be asking me that? Even if I did know that some Alliance pilots are bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map, I wouldn't exactly be telling people. Would I? I'm an officer in the Imperial Navy, after all.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_558a361a", "The Imperial Navy? I've heard that they are sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_5989c487", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you most and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_688d1dd9", "Lack of funds is a common issue for new pilots. That is why so many pilots start out working for someone else. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_6d792b3f", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_6efdcd5c", "You're on vacation?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_6f4ea30b", "Giving them out may not be the phrase I'd use, but the Empire will indeed supply new pilots with a ship. You can't exactly be an Imperial Pilot without a ship. I've also heard rumors that the Alliance has prepared a fleet of ships for their newly recruited pilots. They obviously want to get them into the fray as soon as possible, but rest assured that their fleet exists on borrowed time. We will crush it soon enough.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_72352199", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Empire and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Alliance, but fools will be fools.Anything else?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_7ce95581", "I am really not in the mood right now, so unless you're looking to enlist in the Imperial Navy, I suggest you leave. Quickly.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_988e6614", "I suppose I shall. Now move along, citizen.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_98e32091", "Well, then could I ask some other questions?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_9f7f7c0a", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planetary map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand side, there is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_a994429", "Was on vacation. Well, I still am technically. It's complicated, citizen. I await orders from my commanding officer. From what he told me, they are very important orders, though apparently not important enough to let me know what those orders would be. I think this is revenge for grading better than him in the carbine range last month. He can be so petty. But enough about that. I've said more than I intended.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_bc9a0be", "Yeah, good luck with that. Anything else?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_c095fa8d", "And why are you telling me this? I have enough problems to deal with at the moment, so I'm going to forget that you told me that.Anything else?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_cdb17e79", "How do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_d73d164f", "I am really not in the mood right now, so unless you're looking to enlist in the Imperial Navy, I suggest you leave.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_df7992b9", "There are some freelance pilots here and there, though the Empire mostly frowns upon that kind of activity. At the same time, we do recognize that there is a need for a small number of freelance pilots to handle certain jobs with which the Empire does not want to be associated or simply views as beneath our notice. As I understand it, most freelance pilots are recruited through email.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_dfbcbb1c", "My patience is thin, citizen. Why are you bothering an Imperial officer?");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_e3059e6a", "I see. Well, have fun with what's left of it, if you can.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_e30fb52", "Good. Now move along, citizen.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_e843e3ab", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planetary map. On the right side of your display, you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_ea1e27a2", "Pilot! Yes, you. Are you here on Imperial business? Are you the envoy from my commander? Actually, at second glance, you obviously are not. Very well. Carry on.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_efbaf135", "You're obviously not involved with the business of space flight, so I really don't have time for you. Good day.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[266].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[267] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_kadaara_mistress");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_kadaara_mistress) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_126a14e0", "No, I guess not.");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_170ed80d", "Only the best!");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_27c7d0ac", "I don't think Jaden wants me talking to you...");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_56866a7", "Then we've got nothing more to discuss.");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_77266474", "I know the feeling!");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_9288900f", "I understand.");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_96dd8566", "Who? Him?");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_b7b44868", "That's very wise.");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_c8f2f3db", "Farewell.");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_d14f41b0", "We're not talking.");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_d88625cb", "I don't have a starship.");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_e05e22e2", "Just what I can afford.");
stringFiles[267].addEntry("s_ea09eddd", "Tell me. What sort of equipment do you fly?");

stringFiles[268] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_kor_vella_bodyguard");
stringFiles[268].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_kor_vella_bodyguard) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[268].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[268].addEntry("s_2fd6a00b", "Back away, citizen. Trust me. I'm trying to protect you as much as my charge. I can't say with certainty how he will react to any given situation, so it's best to just stay back.");
stringFiles[268].addEntry("s_8f1601d8", "The officer, Col. Axfow, that I'm guarding. He's a bit long on fear of being attacked and short on common sense.");
stringFiles[268].addEntry("s_e9337a35", "Who are you talking about?");

stringFiles[269] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_kor_vella_imperial_officer");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_kor_vella_imperial_officer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_2313ac9e", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_2cc72ac", "Could I ask some other questions?");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_327a66c9", "If I knew anything about space flight, I wouldn't need a pilot! Talk to my pilot if you want to know about flying.");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_44e02725", "Perhaps I spoke hastily about you. But not about this place. They are planning to strike. I know it. I can feel it. It might not even matter if you're part of the Empire or a member of the Rebel Alliance. They might strike you down all the same just to be safe.");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_50712538", "You might consider leaving this planet. That would be the safest course. Leave for more civilized systems like Naboo. Trust me on this. That's why I have a pilot with me at all times... I can be gone at the drop of a bantha hide.");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_71912ea1", "Paranoid a little?");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_95a23c53", "Stand further back when addressing me. I know what you people are up to. You'd like nothing better than to add an Imperial officer to the notches on your weapon, wouldn't you?");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_b4e0582a", "Okay, I'll watch my back.");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_caf022b7", "Hmmm, you're an Imperial Pilot, correct? Perhaps I should have two pilots. Then should one of you fall when the citizens here rise up and attack us, the other would still be able to fly me out of here. Perhaps I'll see about requesting a second pilot. Yes. I'll do just that.");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_d44cba3b", "You look suspicious. Move away or I'll have my bodyguard deal with you.");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_e01c6933", "You're obviously not involved with the business of space flight, so I really don't have time for you. Move along or I'll have my bodyguard deal with you.");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_e0de9210", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions about space flight?");
stringFiles[269].addEntry("s_fd1873c3", "What?!! And what's wrong with some good, healthy paranoia anyway? It's kept me alive this long. You should not be so quick to judge.");

stringFiles[270] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_kor_vella_pilot");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_kor_vella_pilot) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_143896d2", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planetary map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand side is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_2e3fddb0", "The Empire will supply new pilots with a ship. You can't exactly be an Imperial Pilot without a ship. I've also heard rumors that the Alliance has prepared a fleet of ships so they can get new recruits into the fray as soon as possible as well, but rest assured that their fleet exists on borrowed time. We will crush it soon enough.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_324c0132", "Fine. Unless there was something else you wanted to ask, please move along.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_34954d93", "Depends on who you ask. Col. Azfow is convinced that the populous is going to rise up and attack us. Needless to say, he's interesting. As in the old curse, 'May you live in interesting times.' Not exactly the highlight of my career.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_43e4ca6c", "Is everything okay?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_4f12802", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Was there anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_558a361a", "The Imperial Navy? I've heard that they are sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_5989c487", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you most and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_688d1dd9", "Lack of funds is a common issue for new pilots. That is why so many pilots start out working for someone else. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_6a489e79", "And why are you telling me this? I have enough problems to deal with at the moment, so I'm going to forget that you told me that.Was there anything else you wanted to ask?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_72352199", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Empire and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Alliance, but fools will be fools.Anything else?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_7dddf84b", "Greetings, pilot. Good to see other Imperial Pilots in the area. I'm afraid I can't offer much help right now. This officer is determined to keep me on edge.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_84162c3f", "I see no harm in that. What are your questions, citizen?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_880f19c", "I can't help you since you're a pilot but obviously not a member of the Imperial Navy. You should probably go.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_97d59ac7", "I can't help you since you're a pilot but obviously not a member of the Imperial Navy. You should probably go and do so immediately.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_cdb17e79", "How do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_d0ad18a2", "Hello. Do you have business with Col. Axfow? If not, I suggest you move along.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_d2ebc2b6", "Could you answer some questions about space flight?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_df7992b9", "There are some freelance pilots here and there, though the Empire mostly frowns upon that kind of activity. At the same time, we do recognize that there is a need for a small number of freelance pilots to handle certain jobs with which the Empire does not want to be associated or simply views as beneath our notice. As I understand it, most freelance pilots are recruited through email.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_e843e3ab", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planetary map. On the right side of your display, you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_efbaf135", "You're obviously not involved with the business of space flight, so I really don't have time for you. Good day.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_f5f72ae1", "My pleasure. Anything else?");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_f7f3156d", "Do you really think you should be asking me that? Even if I did know that some Alliance pilots are bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map, I wouldn't exactly be telling people, would I? I'm an officer in the Imperial Navy, after all.");
stringFiles[270].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[271] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_moenia_undercover_rebel");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_moenia_undercover_rebel) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_143896d2", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planetary map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand side is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_15365688", "Indeed I do. More than most would ever perceive. What would you like to know?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_17bda60f", "While I do not dance at your request, please enjoy nonetheless.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_193d763c", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Alliance and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Empire, but fools will be fools.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_1abd933c", "Interesting. Good luck with that. I don't want to get too close to the Galactic Civil War, myself.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_29894b97", "I don't know how to check.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_331a2a18", "Why do you dance here instead of in a cantina?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_3b6c9b18", "I can totally relate to that. Things are tough all over with the ongoing Galactic Civil War. A lot of pilots are flying for either the Empire or the Rebellion these days. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_4634b39d", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Did you have any other questions?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_4eb2ac5d", "Good luck, kid! Anything else?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_554c5307", "No thank you.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_558a361a", "The Imperial Navy? I've heard that they are sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_5989c487", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you most and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_5b893f7c", "It does.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_6441a2a6", "As you wish.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_64513f4b", "Do you know anything about being a pilot?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_67d831d4", "Okay, what would you like to know?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_6f0ab63b", "Stay safe, my friend.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_712a3c66", "Greetings. I mostly only dance for space pilots and those hoping to become pilots. Since you are neither, I bid you farewell.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_71e7bd4f", "Strange. Seems that if they undertook the risk to send you a message, they would make it clear how to respond. Why don't you check your email a bit more carefully.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_7a90a08", "I suppose. Still seems a bit odd.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_80856a70", "Shall I dance for you?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_8bc89a5", "On the lower right-hand side of your screen, there should be a 'letter' icon that is flashing. Double-click on this icon and it will bring up your personal email. Read over the subject and sender, and scroll through the body text to get all the details.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_8ef8dbfb", "I have another question.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_93280d8a", "Good idea. Thanks!");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_99bbe25a", "Because more goes on than meets the eye in places such as this. The people one meets can be quite informative and enthralling if one knows where to look and when to listen. And there are always those interested in information from a planet such as this one.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_9b8c83b", "That's what one hears. The Empire has more ships than pilots, though I suspect that it's because they go through pilots faster than they go through ships. The Rebels, on the other hand, are known to honor their new pilots with a new ship that will lift them into the reaches of space and beyond.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_a3bde326", "Please. I'd like that.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_a463a3c1", "You're welcome. Anything else?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_b030000f", "My friend. Welcome to Moenia. The starport is a bustling center of commerce and community. And the swamp is an endless source of adventure.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_b0b2621a", "It doesn't");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_b7712646", "Yes, thank you.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_ba3c26af", "You did? These are desperate times, indeed. The email should probably indicate where you are supposed to go for initial recruitment.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_c2db6878", "Good-bye.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_cdb17e79", "How do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_d4aba6c2", "Any time. Anything else?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_d9231b4f", "There are freelance pilots working in most systems. Some are CorSec pilots, others are part of the RSF of Naboo, and of course, others are smugglers or pirates. I wouldn't recommend those last two if you want to pursue a lengthy career, but, at the same time, some of the best military pilots I know were once smugglers. Most freelance organizations will send recruitment emails. You might try checking your email for something like that.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_da08c873", "That's sort of tricky. There may be some Alliance pilots bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map. Have you looked at the planetary map yet?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_e41e2e4c", "Thank you, I'm happy to be here.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_e843e3ab", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planetary map. On the right side of your display, you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_e8682a71", "Perhaps another time.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_e89d0307", "One man's oddity is another man's routine.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_eb85528d", "Ah, a friendly Freelance Pilot. I thank you and your brothers for the past service you've provided and the future service yet to be shared. But for now I have no work for you.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_f1285aa6", "If I can answer, I shall.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_f2115ba8", "Rebel Pilot, do you have any information for me? No? Very well then. We never had this conversation.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_f25521b4", "Ah, a most distinguished Imperial Pilot, welcome to Moenia!");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_f5f72ae1", "My pleasure. Anything else?");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_f67d3f3a", "Please enjoy the dance.");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_f90ad503", "I see. Thanks!");
stringFiles[271].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

