stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_3d5a0af7", "I see. I hope he arrives safely and soon.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_43e93943", "You look like a pilot, but no military insignias. That must mean you're a free agent. I'm all for healthy competition, but stay out of my way, okay?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_4608e854", "Look kid, you're exhausting my patience, but go ahead and ask.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
