stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_59088822", "Hey guys, look at this one. You would think he has never seen a pilot before. Sorry, kid, if you wanna hang with us, you gotta be interested in space flight.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_5989c487", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you most and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
