stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_5fbefac8", "Forget about it! What else?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_659f0dee", "Seeing as I have little else to do at the moment, ask away.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_6795b6ad", "Overdue? For what?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_71e7bd4f", "Strange. Seems that if they undertook the risk to send you a message, they would make it clear how to respond. Why don't you check your email a bit more carefully.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_763287fe", "Could I ask some other questions while you wait?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_82519d76", "Things are tough all over during this Galactic Civil War. A lot of pilots are flying for either the Empire or the Rebellion these days. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_8ae971c3", "Thank you for the kind words.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_8b46b054", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! What else?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_8ef8dbfb", "I have another question.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_917c8fba", "Hey, I'm not taking sides or anything, but you Rebel pilots are in a different league from guys like us.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_93280d8a", "Good idea. Thanks!");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_9a679691", "My associates and I all went in together on a business venture of sorts. Needless to say, we eagerly await his return with, I'm quite certain, good news about the outcome of the this venture. The thing is, though, that our friend has apparently been delayed. He's a number of days overdue, and we're quite concerned. About our friend, of course, as well as our potential profits.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_a51f7ca3", "That's what I hear. The Empire's pretty well-equipped and can't really have much of a navy if their pilots don't have ships. I've also heard rumors that the Alliance has a fleet of ships they can get new recruits into as soon as they sign up.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_aad3ac83", "Forget about it!");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_ab4153ba", "Ah, hello, Mr. Imperial Pilot, sir. Just minding our own business, we are. Nothing to concern the Empire, that's for certain.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_abc6d2f6", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Empire and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Alliance, but fools will be fools.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_b0b2621a", "It doesn't");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_ba3c26af", "You did? These are desperate times, indeed. The email should probably indicate where you are supposed to go for initial recruitment.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_c2db6878", "Good-bye.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_cdb17e79", "How do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_d9231b4f", "There are freelance pilots working in most systems. Some are CorSec pilots, others are part of the RSF of Naboo, and of course, others are smugglers or pirates. I wouldn't recommend those last two if you want to pursue a lengthy career, but, at the same time, some of the best military pilots I know were once smugglers. Most freelance organizations will send recruitment emails. You might try checking your email for something like that.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_da08c873", "That's sort of tricky. There may be some Alliance pilots bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map. Have you looked at the planetary map yet?");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_db81b074", "Hey kid, c'mere. When you arrived, did you happen to see a human pilot with a thick beard? He's an associate of ours, and he's overdue.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_e843e3ab", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planetary map. On the right side of your display, you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_f90ad503", "I see. Thanks!");
stringFiles[272].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[273] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_mos_eisley_smuggler_nervous");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_mos_eisley_smuggler_nervous) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_2f5237f2", "Yeah, okay. Sorry. Didn't mean to upset you.");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_48a73671", "Why has he been delayed?");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_6532c5fc", "Nothing. I mean, we're waiting for someone. He's not coming. I mean, he's been delayed or something.");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_7b971344", "How should I know?!! Why're you hassling me? It's not like I could have known what would happen. I mean, I don't know anything. Look, just go away, alright?");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_84b70aa7", "What? Why you looking at me like that?");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_9dd29bde", "Look, I've got enough on my mind already. If you're not involved with space flight, we have nothing to talk about.");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_b035eb47", "It's nothing. Just forget it.");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_b5d34085", "Could I ask some questions while you wait?");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_ba010bf2", "Try Vincie. He thinks he an expert on everything.");
stringFiles[273].addEntry("s_db2bb45d", "What are you guys doing?");

stringFiles[274] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_mos_eisley_smuggler_skinny");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_mos_eisley_smuggler_skinny) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_23c5a386", "Ask Vincie. He's the talkative one.");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_29ccc793", "Oh. Have fun waiting.");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_2c450d35", "Why's he late?");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_31745b41", "Oh. Your friend's a pilot also?");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_43834150", "Waiting on a friend.");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_4a8de0", "You're not a pilot and can't be one.");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_5e5566b0", "Yes, but he's late.");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_67e6df55", "Okay.");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_b5d34085", "Could I ask some questions while you wait?");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_bcf6e2d1", "He's returning from a trip?");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_d5df1462", "Don't know.");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_db2bb45d", "What are you guys doing?");
stringFiles[274].addEntry("s_e547fd1e", "Yeah?");

stringFiles[275] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_mos_espa_hutt_recruiter");
stringFiles[275].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_mos_espa_hutt_recruiter) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[275].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[275].addEntry("s_7a599b0f", "What could be better or more profitable than flying for Jabba the Hutt? We have the best ships in space. Well, definitely the best that don't require you to be in the military. We'll start you off right, with a ship that's mostly space-worthy and with very few miles. You'll easily pay it off in only a few dozen years.");
stringFiles[275].addEntry("s_c488e773", "Bah, you can't fly. You don't meet any of the requirements. Stop wasting my time.");

stringFiles[276] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_mos_espa_valarian_recruiter");
stringFiles[276].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_mos_espa_valarian_recruiter) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[276].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[276].addEntry("s_8fa665d", "Don't listen to that blowhard. Jabba will get you killed, and probably at the hand of one of our pilots. Lady Valarian may not have quite the reach of Jabba, yet, but she's much more generous and can provide a much better ship. Most of the blood stains have already been removed. And if you can pay off the ship, it's yours. Free and clear. Just remember who you work for because that won't change.");
stringFiles[276].addEntry("s_9214af52", "But you can't even fly. You can't even learn to fly. Go away.");

stringFiles[277] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_mos_espa_young_pilot");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_mos_espa_young_pilot) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_16e2abb", "I really wish these two would just be quiet for a while. I need to think. On one hand, I do really want to get off of this forsaken rock. But on the other hand, I don't really like the idea of being beholden to Jabba the Hutt or to Lady Valarian.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_181388f8", "Anything's better than listening to these two hawk away at me. What's your question?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_2318bee", "On the lower right-hand side of your screen should be a 'letter' icon that is flashing. Double-click on this icon, and it will bring up your personal email. Read over the subject and sender, and scroll through the body text to get all the details.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_29894b97", "I don't know how to check.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_352b98a4", "Look, I've got a lot on my mind right now. Sorry to be a bit cross, but you don't have any involvement in space flight and are therefore of no interest to me.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_3cdeb26e", "Wow, you're a pilot for the Rebel Alliance. I'm envious.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_43eb0d5", "I could join the military. To be honest, I don't really like the way the Empire seems to treat their pilots. They seem too much like fodder to me. I'm leaning toward the Rebel Alliance. I'm hoping I can fly with them until I'm able to support myself.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_4c2593ff", "You joined the Empire as a pilot, eh? I've thought about doing that, but it mostly just seems a good way to get killed. They don't seem to value their pilots individually.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_4e962a43", "Yeah, alright. Ask.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_558a361a", "The Imperial Navy? I've heard that they are sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_58da73fe", "Seems like Rebel pilots are killed just as often as Imperial ones.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_5989c487", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you most and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_5b893f7c", "It does.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_5ce080f5", "True enough. But at least the Rebels seem to care when they lose a pilot. Might just be because they have so many fewer, but there's not really a better choice for me.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_667a1d0b", "That's what I'm banking on. The Empire's pretty well-equipped and can't really have much of a navy if their pilots don't have ships. I'm hoping that the rumors about the Alliance having a fleet of ships available are true. That's how I hope to get my hands on a ship.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_6c4ac747", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Alliance and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Empire, but I'm not sure that's really a good idea.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_6f0ab63b", "Stay safe, my friend.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_71e7bd4f", "Strange. Seems that if they undertook the risk to send you a message, they would make it clear how to respond. Why don't you check your email a bit more carefully.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_72df796a", "Good luck with that. I don't want to get too close to the Galactic Civil War, myself.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_8dd47fdc", "Could I ask you some questions?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_8ef8dbfb", "I have another question.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_93280d8a", "Good idea. Thanks!");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_9f7f7c0a", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planetary map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand side, there is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_a463a3c1", "You're welcome. Anything else?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_b0b2621a", "It doesn't");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_b6a32ea3", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail! Any other questions?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_ba3c26af", "You did? These are desperate times, indeed. The email should probably indicate where you are supposed to go for initial recruitment.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_c088465d", "What other choice do you have?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_c2db6878", "Good-bye.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_cdb17e79", "How do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_d9231b4f", "There are freelance pilots working in most systems. Some are CorSec pilots, others are part of the RSF of Naboo, and of course, others are smugglers or pirates. I wouldn't recommend those last two if you want to pursue a lengthy career, but, at the same time, some of the best military pilots I know were once smugglers. Most freelance organizations will send recruitment emails. You might try checking your email for something like that.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_da08c873", "That's sort of tricky. There may be some Alliance pilots bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map. Have you looked at the planetary map yet?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_db2b1899", "Hey, any time. As long as I'm not busy. Anything else?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_e843e3ab", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planetary map. On the right side of your display, you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_f90ad503", "I see. Thanks!");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_f97ba0d9", "So you're a Freelance Pilot? If you can manage to remain your own boss, that seems like the way to go. But to get to that point requires more credits than I can afford");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_fa94d5c5", "Good-bye!");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_fb22d2de", "I can relate to that. This Galactic Civil War is making things tough for most people. A lot of pilots are flying for either the Empire or the Rebellion these days. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[277].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[278] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_theed_freighter_captain");
stringFiles[278].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_theed_freighter_captain) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[278].addEntry("s_0", "");
