stringFiles[282] = new StringFile("conversation/greeter_tyrena_pilot_friend");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (greeter_tyrena_pilot_friend) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_12157feb", "The military gives out free ships?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_143896d2", "I think that the majority of pilot trainers are registered with the planetary map. Try opening the planetary map with CTRL+V. On the right-hand side is a listing of categories. Look under 'trainer' to find any local pilot teacher who's looking for pupils.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_144ec5cc", "Sounds good. Thanks!");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_17345b4d", "Fountain? What fountain?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_17bc5d9b", "When you approach the space station, use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the commander. You will be asked if you want to purchase repairs or if you want to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_19cd4ee3", "Good luck. With any luck of our own, we will be following the same path.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_21bf1a8c", "How do I join the Alliance?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_26a9fa7a", "Ulaire still thinks that fountain is on the way. If you ask me, though, it's not coming. The Empire has seen to that. I just know it. I don't know why they have it in for my friend, Ulaire, but I can feel it.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_270c87b2", "How do I get them to repair my ship?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_27186cee", "I don't have enough money.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_29894b97", "I don't know how to check.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_2b99f43", "What is he gonna do?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_2d397ab5", "I think it's the only option. All I know is that I'm not going to abandon Ulaire.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_3059f369", "What then?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_32146025", "Then what?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_352b98a4", "Look, I've got a lot on my mind right now. Sorry to be a bit cross, but you don't have any involvement in space flight and are therefore of no interest to me.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_3ece5721", "No problem! Take care!");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_41323ada", "That's rough. You're sure he didn't do it?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_472f61d1", "Local space stations are the easiest way to get your ship repaired. When you are heading back here, you should stop at the space station and ask them for repairs. They will provide a quick estimate on what it will take to get you back on track.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_495777c0", "Have you checked any vendors? Merchants use vendors to help sell their merchandise. Shipwrights put finished starships and ship components for sale on their vendors, and then you can go to those vendors and purchase what you need.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_4eb2ac5d", "Good luck, kid! Anything else?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_52939a0", "How do I check my email?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_558a361a", "The Imperial Navy? I've heard that they are sending out recruitment emails to everyone they can locate these days. Have you checked your email today?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_55c77e3b", "On the lower right-hand side of your screen should be a 'letter' icon that is flashing. Double-click on this icon and it will bring up your personal email. Read over the subject and sender, and scroll through the body text to get all the details.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_5618d2cd", "No. I have received no email.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_5989c487", "There are all sorts of civilian contracts available on the 'mission terminals' you find throughout town. Look for them near any major structure. Use the terminal to bring up the current list of local contracts. Choose the one that interests you most and you'll make money when the task is complete.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_5b823594", "Absolutely! I know this man, and he would never do anything like that. There's no chance. I don't know why the Empire is setting him up like this, but if my friend says he's raising money for a fountain for the city, then that's what he's doing. There's no doubt in my mind.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_5b893f7c", "It does.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_5e410744", "Right-click on the map location to create and activate a waypoint. Follow the waypoint to the trainer's location.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_604518f3", "Oh, alright. Ask.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_63bc310c", "No problem. Anything else?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_667a1d0b", "That's what I'm banking on. The Empire's pretty well-equipped and can't really have much of a navy if their pilots don't have ships. I'm hoping that the rumors about the Alliance having a fleet of ships available are true. That's how I hope to get my hands on a ship.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_68cb68ff", "Is there anyone else I could fly for?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_6974c2b", "Double-click on the envelope icon, and read your mail!Any other questions?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_6f0ab63b", "Stay safe, my friend.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_71e7bd4f", "Strange. Seems that if they undertook the risk to send you a message, they would make it clear how to respond. Why don't you check your email a bit more carefully.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_729d1b46", "So what are you going to do?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_73f8df86", "Hey, any time. Anything else?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_82519d76", "Things are tough all over during this Galactic Civil War. A lot of pilots are flying for either the Empire or the Rebellion these days. Ever think of joining the military to get a starship?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_8515e448", "Yes. I have an email from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_8b23fac", "I want to learn to fly.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_8b37a99a", "How do I make money?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_8b392030", "That's an option, I suppose.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_8cf9be64", "Where can I find a vendor?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_8ef8dbfb", "I have another question.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_93280d8a", "Good idea. Thanks!");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_a227299a", "Yeah sure. It would be nice to get my mind off of these problems for a while.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_a463a3c1", "You're welcome. Anything else?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_a9850aec", "I got an email from the Alliance!");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_acc368b1", "How do I join the Empire?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_add31f19", "I need a starship.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_b0b2621a", "It doesn't");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_b641cda6", "Where can I find a bazaar terminal?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_ba3c26af", "You did? These are desperate times, indeed. The email should probably indicate where you are supposed to go for initial recruitment.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_ba95f774", "Bazaar terminals are located all over major cities. Check the areas surrounding major hot spots like the starport, the bank, any of the cantinas, or even the hospitals.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_bd6f92c3", "Ulaire raised some money to purchase a fountain for that empty square over by the Agrilat Geyser. But the Empire is pressuring him and claiming that his fundraising efforts were a scam. They're saying that Ulaire is keeping the money for himself. Nothing could be further from the truth, of course, but I think the Empire has already made sure the fountain never arrives.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_c23e9392", "Ooh, you're a Rebel Pilot. Can you help us get off this planet? Ah, probably not. Never mind.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_c2db6878", "Good-bye.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_c69d817b", "Maybe you have the right idea as a Freelance Pilot. But no, we have no money to get started on our own. Ah well.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_c6d00ea8", "Could I ask you some questions about space flight?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_c81c50e7", "Well, between you and me, I'm trying to convince him that we should get off this planet. Maybe join with the Rebels, at least long enough to get far away from here. The Rebels aren't a bad lot. I'm not sure I really want to fight a war, but at least we could get away from here and maybe even strike back at the Empire.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_c9e97ed5", "How else would I join up?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_cb747ceb", "Hmm. Me neither. Maybe you should give it a little time?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_cc7c9754", "Don't mention it. Anything else?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_cdb17e79", "How do I check the planetary map?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_cf5fc0f", "How do I repair my starship?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_d4c6e8cd", "No problem! Anything else?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_d9231b4f", "There are freelance pilots working in most systems. Some are CorSec pilots, others are part of the RSF of Naboo, and of course, others are smugglers or pirates. I wouldn't recommend those last two if you want to pursue a lengthy career, but, at the same time, some of the best military pilots I know were once smugglers. Most freelance organizations will send recruitment emails. You might try checking your email for something like that.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_da08c873", "That's sort of tricky. There may be some Alliance pilots bold enough to register their locations on the planetary map. Have you looked at the planetary map yet?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_e013f498", "Look for the flashing 'envelope' icon on your interface. It's placed on the lower right-hand side of your screen by default.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_e843e3ab", "Use the command CTRL+V to open the planetary map. On the right side of your display, you will see a listing of trainers by category. All local trainers who register with the planet will appear on this list. Click the 'Trainer' tab and then look for a pilot trainer.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_ecf5f19", "Your best bet is to get in touch with the Alliance and sign up for their training program. There are others who will urge you to put your efforts to use in the Empire, but fools will be fools.Anything other questions?");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_f159e173", "Leave us alone. You may be a pilot, but you're also an Imperial Pilot. My friend has suffered enough. Just, please, leave him be.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_f2a4df5e", "Good idea! Thanks.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_f3ec92a", "Use the planetary map to travel to the vendors listed on it, but not all vendors will be listed there. For the unlisted ones, you'll have to travel around looking for player-owned buildings that hold vendors. Once you've found a vendor, double-click it to see what it has for sale. You can also check bazaar terminals, but the listings on those will only be low-end starships and ship components, if even that.");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_f90ad503", "I see. Thanks!");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_fa94d5c5", "Good-bye!");
stringFiles[282].addEntry("s_fd5402d8", "Ah! Then it should give you information about where to go to start your naval adventure. Good luck, my friend!");

stringFiles[283] = new StringFile("conversation/groundquest_01");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (groundquest_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_266d5e58", "It's true! Mon Mothma has placed the death-marks herself. Take out three Valarian Assassins and retrieve the stolen Rebel orders.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_26e69dd2", "Yes. You're right.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_3021e76e", "Fine. Let me know when you are free.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_3c3aa26e", "You have completed the quest to kill three valarian assassins who stole Mon Mothma's orders and drew obscene pictures on them!");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_4e85991", "I can't do this task right now.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_5716a3cb", "Yes. Give me kill_3_womprats, please.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_64e9f319", "Excellent! Go kill three womprats and come back to me when you're done.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_6c251948", "You got it.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_7e24578a", "Damn straight, bobo.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_87d7e908", "I know.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_95fea403", "I am a ground quest test NPC. Would you like a quest?");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_a80d9308", "Good luck!");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_b0216abf", "Hey! You're already on the one quest that I have to give... so what gives?!");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_b0797972", "I hear the Valarians have crossed the Alliance.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_ca992d2c", "Nothing. Sorry to bother you.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_d6695e83", "No thanks.");
stringFiles[283].addEntry("s_de3892ae", "Goodbye!");

stringFiles[284] = new StringFile("conversation/gustan");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (gustan) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_13f8cd89", "You should go see my friend Veezatt. She's in the cantina just around the bend. Tell her you're interested in helping the Merchant interest and I can put you in a starship!");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_1f7c77cd", "The Force be with you.");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_2abf5d7f", "No, I am not.");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_679a4b0f", "Yes I am! Can you give me a starship?");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_7265732e", "");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_81b02e33", "Okay... I thought that Veezatt said you were coming here for work. Guess not.");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_9f36982d", "Hello! What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_a6bec7eb", "I am looking for work as a space pilot.");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_b74b37b1", "Nothing. Sorry. I'll leave you alone.");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_ed80960", "Hello there! I am Gustan - the ship supplier for the Merchant interest. Are you here for work?");
stringFiles[284].addEntry("s_f4f3444c", "You got it! Veezatt told me that you were coming to help usher transports from the Merchant outpost to their checkpoint in Quadrant IV. Good luck!");

stringFiles[285] = new StringFile("conversation/heraldcorellia1");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (heraldcorellia1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_1350775c", "I'm not going to tell you the location outloud. Downloading it into your datapad would be much easier. I hope you find the place with ease.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_14db17db", "What were they doing?");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_15b3396c", "It's too hard to explain. Besides, someone else could be listening. I don't want them getting the information for free. I downloaded the information into your datapad.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_16ef1618", "Um... West of here!");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_1abf1335", "Uhh.. I'm not going to tell you. You'd probably hurt me if I did. I did some of those things, you know. Why don't you go there yourself and find out. Unless, you'd rather do something else on this planet.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_2dc5fa6c", "I was one of them. They don't like the fact that I left just to cash in on their location by providing others with their whereabouts. Say, would you like to know? Free of charge! I also know a little bit about other activities on this planet.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_302a0829", "Okay, you got me. I'm not a part of the Clan.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_43ff531e", "Lies! I knew you weren't a part of the clan. I should know. I was one of them! I left because I didn't agree with what they were doing.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_4e268ec", "Afarathu Cave.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_4f78edca", "Why are you so scared of them?");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_508d181c", "Hrmph! Fine! I was going to give you information, but now I'm not going to!");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_5933dda", "Well, there's the Afarathu Cave and the Imperial Strong hold. What are you interested in?");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_5bd24f96", "Be careful there. They don't like visitors unless you're an Imperial. Better than being a Nyax follower! Eh. May as well be the same thing. Oh well! The location has been downloaded into your datapad.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_60613aaf", "Bye!");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_62db6450", "AHH! Stay away from me! I didn't mean to--oh. You're not a part of Lord Nyax's Clan. What a relief! You scared me there. I am right, aren't I? You're not a spy, are you? ... are you?!");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_7170206c", "Fine! Good bye!");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_7634b077", "No, I'm not.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_8487276", "I don't want to hear your life story.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_8aeb5275", "Where's the Nyax Clan?");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_92abbb2d", "Yeah, well. Bye.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_94914b83", "I'm glad to hear that. You had me scared there for a little bit.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_9d54ab3b", "Hrmph!");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_a343f6b2", "That's what I thought. I knew you weren't. I should know. I was a part of the clan myself. They don't like the fact that I left just to cash in on their location by providing others with their whereabouts. Say, would you like to know? Free of charge! I also know a little bit about other activities on this planet.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_a7c04702", "I actually don't know the location offhand. Let me see. Hmmm--Ahh! There, downloaded into your datapad. It may or may not be exact. I hope you won't get lost.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_abab52df", "You're lucky I'm desperate for help. I have some information regarding the Nyax Clan and their whereabouts. I also have information about other activities as well.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_b24dbaa5", "Hmm... I'm suspicious. You don't look like someone Lord Nyax would recruit. Fine. If you are a part of the clan, then where is the hideout?");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_b5cd3612", "I'll check out Nyax's Clan.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_bb636d95", "Sure. Where is Nyax?");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_ce93e2a4", "Imperial Stronghold.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_d004968e", "Uh. Lord Nyax, actually.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_eff34704", "What else is there to do on this planet?");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_f20cf001", "What other activities?");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_f4a2753b", "Look, I'm sorry.");
stringFiles[285].addEntry("s_fd0eff19", "I am a part of Lord Nyax's Clan, actually.");

stringFiles[286] = new StringFile("conversation/heraldcorellia2");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (heraldcorellia2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_1540303f", "Over there somewhere. I'm much too busy to tell you straight out. I don't even know why I stopped to talk to you in the first place. You'll find the location has been downloaded into your datapad.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_17f4a48e", "You seem a bit too simple-minded to be a politician. Therefore, you wouldn't be in league with my rival in office. Though... something about you suggests you are an adventurer. You hunger for information. Today is your lucky day for I have such information.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_34578735", "What information?");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_365cae75", "I... have to go. Good bye!");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_467e5760", "You promised too easily and readily. I do not really trust you. Nor, I suppose, can a politician be trusted. You'll have to take this information lightly. I may give you a location that doesn't exist. We're both on even ground now. If forced, I'll wrap you into some elaborate story that will hurt the integrity of my rival. That should do the trick.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_47d10547", "I have no clue, really. While campaigning across this forsaken planet, my people came across it. I suppose I can download it into your silly datapad. Now, go. I have an election to win.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_5f670c9a", "Yeah, yeah. What information do you have?");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_6152d272", "Where is the Drall Patriots Hideout?");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_6fe071a8", "Where is the Rogue Corsec band?");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_7ef6e01", "I have certain information regarding a meddling band of Rogue Corsec and an insignificant Drall Patriots Hideout.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_9e3a2d26", "Ahh, I was correct. Not so fast, my friend. I shall not just hand over the information to just anyone. You must promise me something. Promise to have you and your minions, friends, whatever, vote for me in the next election. If you promise and do not fullfill, you will be hunted down, I assure you.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_ae8d99dc", "I can't promise anything.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_b21d503f", "Ugh. So simple-minded. Breathing your air even dumbs my mind somewhat.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_cd3a7aff", "Then, I give you no information. It is as simple as that. Now, run along and go play with your little toy weapons.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_e8ba751", "I promise.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_e8e88020", "Yes, run along. I have more important things to do.");
stringFiles[286].addEntry("s_fd53304", "I think I'm going to get out of here.");

stringFiles[287] = new StringFile("conversation/heraldlok");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (heraldlok) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_119ff40f", "How about those locations again?");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_36a4e374", "Yes, I am.");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_434a59e6", "Canyon Corsair Stronghold.");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_57d2d366", "Oh, so now you want to hear about them. Fine. Which do you want to hear about? I have information regarding the 'Kimogila Town', and 'Canyon Corsair Stronghold'. ");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_599fe081", "You do not seem to be apart of the Empire. Ha! As if I care what affiliation you belong to. I left the Alliance years ago, but... I left with a bit of information regarding the location of certain points of interest. Are you interested in what I have to say?");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_5e804346", "Why are you telling me this information?");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_6336e957", "Suit yourself. I'll wait for someone else. My information is worth alot of credits to many people.");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_7117043f", "Okay. Good bye!");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_95bfd0f3", "Kimogila Town.");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_a5343515", "You'd be daft if you wanted to go there. Nonetheless, it's your life, not mine. I can give you the general location of the place, but the exact location was corrupted in my database. I'll download the information into your datapad, but that's all I can do.");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_a8387526", "I, uh, really need to go.");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_be60eda6", "I hope you have several friends with you. Now, granted, I haven't really been to any of these places, but... I've heard things. Enough of my babble. I'll download the general location into your datapad. It's not exact, but close enough.");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_c5a66e82", "No, not really.");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_e933930f", "I used to be apart of the Rebel Alliance Spy Network, but I decided that my skills were needed elsewhere. I collected information for them regarding the activity on Lok. Obviously, they didn't like the fact that their systems were easy to hack. I left on the account of 'unresolved differances'. Err--why am I telling you this?");
stringFiles[287].addEntry("s_ff7f26e1", "I knew you were hungry for information. Which location do you want to hear about? I have information regarding the 'Kimogila Town', and 'Canyon Corsair Stronghold'. They are all interesting places, I assure you.");

stringFiles[288] = new StringFile("conversation/heraldlok2");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (heraldlok2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_248becfc", "I don't like your reasoning.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_2f559d1", "It depends. There's the Smuggler's Ship and the Droid Engineer's cave. Which do you prefer to plunder first?");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_326fcc61", "What is your reasoning behind this?");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_372fb7c1", "Okay, okay. What were those places again?");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_391e8a36", "I was wrong about you. You're nothing but a commoner. I don't deal with commoners. Go away!");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_3f395897", "Where are these enemies?");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_4487b6cf", "What business is it of yours? Do not question me! Had you the opportunity to become leader of your underground gand of pirates, you too would try to gain your people's trust and rid yourself of the troubles your opposition caused.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_46236858", "I will offer the opportunity to someone else. Unfortunately, it will be your loss.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_471ddd18", "Then help me! Help me rid Lok of my opposition so that I may become leader of my own little band of outcasts. I must earn their trust...");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_48566ef9", "What's in it for me?");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_4db27a02", "Droid Engineer's Cave.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_63fbc0e4", "I agree!");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_657533b5", "Then leave! I have too many things to do than to waste my time.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_66d367c9", "I recognize that swagger in your steps. You're an outcast like me. And, like me, you should know that opposition to your aims and goals are grounds for 'removal'. ");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_6cfa2fa7", "The bounty and riches of my--our!--enemy's strongholds! Just think of it; all the treasure you can fill your deep pockets with! All yours! Just destroy them.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_7884d24e", "Smuggler's Ship.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_7bf56007", "I don't agree with you.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_8247a8b0", "Smuggler's Ship and the Droid Engineer's Cave.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_9be34260", "It sounds fishy to me. No.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_a66ef7ad", "I'll help you.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_a9eda6c", "Excellent! You can start by either plundering the Droid Engineer's Cave or the Smuggler's Ship. Which will it be?");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_d17c998e", "I don't want to help you.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_e4e08f1f", "Ugh! I have no time for this..");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_f8224468", "Completely insane, the droid engineer creates minions for his own personal design. We cannot compete with insanity and must find means of removing him from Lok. I wish you luck in the endeavor. It won't be easy.");
stringFiles[288].addEntry("s_fc5dc465", "Ahh, the smugglers. They have been a thorn in our side for awhile. Their ground operatives have stolen too many of our missions and goals. For some reason, their ship has been shot down by forces unknown. Looks as if they have more enemies than we thought.");

stringFiles[289] = new StringFile("conversation/heraldnaboo");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (heraldnaboo) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_261bbc0d", "What would you like to know about?");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_2ca149bc", "That is wise of you. Do you wish to hear about the information I can give you?");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_3243aa0a", "No, I have to go!");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_36d2fdef", "They are a vile sort. Roric V`lia, Noble of the Naboo family, whom is my employer, doesn't like to deal with them much. But, I guess--uh. I wasn't suppose to tell you that. Um--here's the location.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_37c26930", "An interesting place, that is. I have the general location of the establishment and can download it into your datapad. Just give me a moment--Ah! There we go. As I said, it won't be exact. You may have to do some searching.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_385b2f92", "Okay, I guess I'll leave it alone, then.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_4b942e33", "I wish you well, my friend. Have a wonderous day!");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_68fd1f22", "Oh! I'm so sorry to disturb you. Please, return when you have the time.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_726bbe64", "Well... That's a long story, my friend. I wouldn't even know where to begin. Surely, if I told you the reason, my employer would get rid of me. He's a ruthless man.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_7431a8fb", "The Imperial Weapons Research Facility.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_7ad7fe8f", "The Gungans and Imperials.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_7c64e921", "I told you! I can't tell you anything else. Please... do you wish to hear information about the places I've mentioned? You may be able to find out more there.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_7cd8dc9", "I wish you well. Keep silent about what we talked about.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_7fc11314", "Yes, what do you know?");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_83237923", "I'll keep a lookout.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_84b85cd6", "About what would you like more information?");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_87b9da1d", "Yes, actually, I do.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_8858a3fe", "I want more information.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_9575185c", "No, I must go.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_99e4afa", "I only know what my employer requires me to know. Particularly, about the war between the Gungans and Imperials, the Mauler Camp, and the new Weapon Research Facility that the Empire has established.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_a96ea3c0", "I wish you well. Please be careful. Heed my words!");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_b7659e9e", "Mauler Encampment");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_ba21d00c", "It is such a tragedy. The Gungans are so peaceful, so cute and kind. Well, Jar Jar--I met him once. He's a bit annoying. Anyway! You can find the site of their most recent battle at the location I downloaded in your datapad. It's an exact location, a bit far away, however.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_bdc2cc97", "You've made me curious. Tell me.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_c029271f", "Yes, give me the information.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_c213fa93", "No, I'm out of here.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_ce76e0f", "Yes, what information do you have?");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_d241258b", "No. Good bye.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_d3bd15da", "Mauler Encampment.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_d65aab98", "I'd like some more information.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_df58f20", "You carry yourself well, my friend. Are you of nobility? No? Then, you must be an adventurer! I have information regarding certain points of interest here on Naboo. Do you wish to hear what I know?");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_ec04baa6", "Do you want more information about a particular area I've spoken about?");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_fa7e3331", "Keep your voice down! I can only tell you this; there is something larger than us out there. An undescribable evil that makes even the most generous of nobility turn sour. Be careful, young one. Don't be pulled into their plans, their evil. I can't tell you anything else.");
stringFiles[289].addEntry("s_fd9053a8", "How did you come across this information?");

stringFiles[290] = new StringFile("conversation/heraldnaboo2");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (heraldnaboo2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_137b7430", "I'd like to, actually.");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_23545d1", "Oh, you know, I really can't explain it right now. Let me download the information into your datapad. I must be well on my way. It's feeding time for the veermok. It's such a sight to see!");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_401feeb9", "Maybe some other time, then. Maybe you'd rather visit the Gungans at their stronghold. They're always looking for new allies. They're my allies, in fact, and very supportive of my research. If you're not interested, I really must get going. I hope you don't mind.");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_48315a3d", "I think I'll visit them too.");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_60613aaf", "Bye!");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_7d197017", "Where are the Gungans?");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_8182146c", "I have to go too. Bye!");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_91946cec", "I apologize. I'm in a bit of a hurry. I only planned to be here in this city for only a few hours. Gathering these supplies took longer than I thought. I really must get back to my studies..");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_9adfee98", "What do you study?");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_adb2e1e", "Okay. I'll let you go.");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_b2b33aae", "You and I are so alike. They don't like visitors much, but maybe you can ally with them as well. Let me download the information into your datapad, assuming you have one.");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_b6fc48e0", "So, where are these veermoks?");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_c4e2d7fa", "Oh yes! I babble on and on so much. I'll just download the information into your datapad. It's really the quickest way. I really must get going.");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_d482409c", "The veermok, of course! Have you seen a more interesting creature? I take every chance I can get to educate others on my findings. Too bad I don't have the time right now! You can go see them yourself, if you'd like.");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_d6695e83", "No thanks.");
stringFiles[290].addEntry("s_fcab5bd8", "You're interested in them as much as I am! How exciting! After I gather my supplies, I'm headed to the Gungan Stronghold, however. I have some deals to conduct with my allies there. The Gungans are really friendly when you get to know them. I'll be off to my studies after that. It's the vermok's feeding time.");

stringFiles[291] = new StringFile("conversation/heraldtatooine1");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (heraldtatooine1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_11c73436", "Watch your tone!");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_1421ed7f", "Yeah, thanks. Your sentiments are shallow. Get lost before your fate is like that of the Tuskens... friend.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_14495ea", "Let me help.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_1ca645a4", "I suppose I can help.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_21aa21ca", "How could you help? Unless... you help me fight them. I have two locations in which I heavily hunt these desert fiends. Fort Tusken and the Tusken Village.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_36a4e374", "Yes, I am.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_39f16ceb", "Where is Fort Tusken?");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_3cf68ea6", "You're trying to blame something on me.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_65daca4c", "It's a painful subject, but if you must know: the Tuskens destroyed my family and I have brought it upon myself to rid Tatooine of their worthless existence.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_66f743cb", "Where is the Tusken Village?");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_67880d8b", "Which location? Tusken Village? Or the bigger target, Fort Tusken.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_68c8ab4e", "If you do not leave quickly, my next battle will be with you. Leave. Now.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_70ffe9b9", "You seem a bit... weak. Are you a petty commoner? You must be. Otherwise, you'd have enough sense to stay away from a bounty hunter. What do you want, then?");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_7133e831", "I have every reason to be. You have not suffered like I have suffered.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_7481bfea", "There's no need to be rude, ma'am.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_74f40f3a", "May the desert worms rot your soul.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_8026269", "How have you suffered?");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_845c935e", "I'll download the information into your datapad. It's the most simple of explanations. It should be the exact location. I could find the place with my eyes closed.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_886ada99", "You've made a tired bounty hunter glad. Which location do you wish to hear of? Tusken Village or Fort Tusken?");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_8ac3feb5", "Tusken Village.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_9dbca073", "What will it cost me?");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_b88d9d9f", "Nothing. I despise the Tuskens with every moment of my existence. I wouldn't mind hiring a few commoners to ease my woes in destroying them.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_c370ec78", "Fight your own battles.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_c5e5fb33", "Excuse me? You are daft, aren't you? In fact, I'd bet you're so daft you'd be allied with those Tuskens. Tell me I'm right. Please.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_c7330dee", "I'm a tired bounty hunter and my patience is lacking. I've been so consumed with killing the Tuskens that I've been left empty, exhausted. But I must destroy them... it is my destiny.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_d00b322a", "Filthy Tuskens? Never!");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_dca89f7e", "Fort Tusken.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_e03237fd", "I don't have time for this. Bye!");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_e3ce72c0", "Why do you hate them so much?");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_ef7c85cf", "The information will be downloaded into your datapad. If you find the place, don't bother to come back. I have no reward for you. Good bye.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_f48827a8", "Sad story. I wish I could help.");
stringFiles[291].addEntry("s_fd76ac2c", "You may actually have more sense than a kreetle. All right. I suppose I'll let you live. Filthy Tuskens, you say? I have information regarding the whereabouts of several. Interested?");

stringFiles[292] = new StringFile("conversation/heraldtatooine2");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (heraldtatooine2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_13fcbd87", "Psst! Hey you! Yeah you! C'mere. You look as if you'd be suitable to join Jabba's forces. But keep your voice down. The Empire rules this place and doesn't take likely to members of the Hutt family.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_177f6371", "I guess. Here.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_17daabb0", "50 credits, please.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_19ca58d8", "You're not very exciting. I'll wait for someone else, then. Bye!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_1c6f5661", "You don't have enough money. Are you trying to jip me? Who do you think I am? Get out of here!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_241afd0a", "I didn't expect you to have the money. You're just a commoner, afterall.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_30c59b36", "I don't have the money.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_32a1ecd", "Look at that. You actually have the money. Well, you didn't specify if you wanted a direct location, so I gave you a general location instead! HAHA! So long, sucker!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_34cffb60", "No way!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_38bef1fe", "What?! You don't have the money? Ugh! Go away!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_3a28c7c4", "That's a sad story. I'll find someone else to buy my information, then.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_3d3f67a4", "That'll be... 30 credits!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_42bcb8b6", "Yeah, I'm interested.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_4440ce87", "I changed my mind.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_4ff8cd88", "I suppose.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_5abff6d6", "I ought to give you the location for free just to see you get a whoopin'! HA! Anyway, the Tusken Bunker is on sale for 30 credits. How about it?");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_5d7da0", "Thank you! Here's your information. Now, get lost. I have other business to attend to.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_5ee77a06", "That'll be, uh.. 20 credits? No--60 credits!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_63855d3f", "Oh, look at that. I don't have the money.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_6892af1b", "I hope the Hutts find you and bury you in the desert!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_6b184c6", "You're so cheap! I'm desperate here! You think I'm going to sell out my own people for less than 60 credits? You're nuts! Get lost!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_6cf09e8e", "That'll be 30 credits. Do you have the money?");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_72ac291d", "I can already tell that I don't want to get into this mess.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_74ed5d50", "60 credits, please. And don't think about cheating on me, here. This information is dangerous to be passing around, especially without pay.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_7f115744", "Hutt Hideout.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_81a382e3", "Here you are.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_88788d03", "Pfft! Go away. I see another client. I can't waste my time with you.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_8be640b8", "Sure.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_8d322c6b", "Rebel Military Base.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_9ac6e8f5", "Well, you'd have to talk to Jabba about that. I can't just sign you up. But I can tell you the location of our hideout. Maybe you can scope it out and see if you like it. It's gonna cost you, though. In fact, I have a couple of places you might be interested in.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_aae6686e", "Excellent! The information has been downloaded. Thank you for your business! I hope you can find it okay! You should have paid for a direct location. HAH!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_b05cb415", "Give me the general location special.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_b81c8c9", "I'll find someone else to buy my information!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_c3dbbcab", "Fine, here.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_c41d4bce", "No. I'm out of here.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_c599cc9e", "Oh. Well, come back when you do. I have other deals to conduct.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_c799721b", "Ahh! I will download the information into your datapad. Thank you for your business!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_c885bfb0", "I'm going to pass.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_c9a787f0", "Fine, then. Get lost. I'm trying to run a business here.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_c9ff39ea", "I'm not surprised.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_d0c6151b", "Sorry, don't have any credits on me.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_d1f219dd", "Tusken Bunker.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_d9903b42", "Yes, I do. Here you are.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_e3dda380", "I should--ugh! You don't have enough money! Get lost, you cheapskate!");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_ea388738", "I'll give you the information for... 30 credits. That's right. 30 credits for a general location and 50 credits for an exact location.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_edb238bc", "Go on.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_f026df25", "First, the Hutt Hideout. Yeah, I know. Selling out my own people. I have to make a living, you know! I also have information regarding the Rebel Military Base and a Tusken Bunker. What do y'say?");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_f2044f4a", "I'll have... an exact location, please.");
stringFiles[292].addEntry("s_fb859e03", "Actually, I don't. Bye!");

stringFiles[293] = new StringFile("conversation/herald_emperors_retreat");
stringFiles[293].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (herald_emperors_retreat) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[293].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[293].addEntry("s_183025b5", "I think I'll go have a look.");
stringFiles[293].addEntry("s_68f3ba7b", "I don't blame you. You don't see me going up there.");
stringFiles[293].addEntry("s_9f21b05a", "An onslaught of recent activity at the Emperor's Retreat has the Rebel Alliance raising their eyebrows. Could the Empire be planning a large attack? Maybe you should check it out.");
stringFiles[293].addEntry("s_ccdcac3a", "You're a brave soul. I suggest you take caution with you if you're seriously planning to go up there. Oh... and you didn't hear the information from me. I don't need the Emperor's goons coming after me.");
stringFiles[293].addEntry("s_ff1f31d2", "No thanks. Sounds dangerous.");

stringFiles[294] = new StringFile("conversation/hutt_informant");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (hutt_informant) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_139f41b9", "Why do you want the disk?");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_4ddc07ed", "I won't give it to you.");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_53f349b7", "Oh and don't blame me if you can't use this thing. It was all I had on me. Go sell it or something. You didn't deserve that great of a reward. It's been a pleasure doing business with you. Good day.");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_54b54bd0", "Here take it. Give me my payment.");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_70142360", "Why wouldn't I? It contains pertinent information regarding a highly-regarded politician and I'm one of Jabba's informants. Again, I ask... why wouldn't I want it?");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_7b45b993", "Get lost. I have no business to conduct with you. Too many people in arms about the Sand People attacking Bestine. It'll be easy for me, I can just leave just as easily as I've come. Go away. I have things to do, people to bribe.");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_dfffcfb", "Why do the dirty work of a politician when I can do it for you? Let me take that disk off your hands. In fact, I know I may have something with which I can pay you for your... generosity.");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_eed9dce1", "You're a fool. Get out of my sight.");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_f660c800", "What mess?");
stringFiles[294].addEntry("s_fb7697b2", "I can take care of this... mess for you.");

stringFiles[295] = new StringFile("conversation/imperial_broker");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (imperial_broker) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_106caa1d", "The units with vacancies currently are the Storm Squadron in the Tatooine system, Black Epsilon in the Corellia system, or the Imperial Inquisition in the Naboo system.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_13a23fbc", "Tell me what you can");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_14270b3", "Are you here to sign-up?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_169df3bb", "Never mind.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_1b2086de", "Black Epsilon?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_23ef3e33", "Imperial Inquisition?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_2a4c66e4", "Come see me if you change your mind.  Someone has to stand up to the Rebel Alliance and maintain order in the galaxy.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_2eee3e2e", "Yes, sir!  How may I be of assistance?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_2fe6ab5f", "Highly.  Classified.  Right?  I will add the location of the unit's pilot trainer to your datapad.  You may speak to him in the main plaza association hall in Kadaara, on Naboo.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_3bbddad5", "Sir, I don't intend any disrespect, but the Imperial Pilots are the finest in the Galaxy.  You don't look like the sort of person who could last one week in the cadet academy, let alone pilot any sort of Imperial craft.  Now I think you should leave.  I am very busy.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_3c9c6441", "Imperial Inquisition is a special unit located in the Naboo system.  Their mission is highly classified.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_3d734747", "I won't release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add the location of their recruiting officer to your datapad.  You can find him in the Imperial Base on Talus, in the Corellia system.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_407fb5e3", "Very well, ma'am.  What about Storm Squadron or the Imperial Inquisition?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_42693321", "I see.  What about Black Epsilon or the Imperial Inquisition?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_445a2be4", "No. Never mind.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_4577214d", "I'm authorized to send you to one of three assignments, sir.  You can choose Storm Squadron in the Tatooine system, Black Epsilon in the Corellia system, or the Imperial Inquisition in the Naboo system.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_458bda80", "Did I hear you correctly? You want to retire? You are aware that you would lose all your pilot skills, and your mission records would be deleted. If you sign up again, you will start as a new recruit. Are you sure this is what you want to do?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_4b0c16d2", "Are you recruiting Imperial Pilots?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_4cafd748", "Storm Squadron?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_5817eef2", "Yes, sir.  I can't release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add the location of the Storm Squadron commander to your datapad.  He'll be glad to have a soldier of your standing.  You can find him in the Bestine Pilot's Club next to the capitol building on Tatooine.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_59be173", "Can I help you?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_61a663b2", "I want to be an Imperial Pilot");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_6441a2a6", "As you wish.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_658b5a75", "Yes, I want to retire.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_6a1562ad", "What do you want?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_6e2d55ee", "HAHAHAHA!");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_70f18874", "I'm not interested in that.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_727cf8b6", "What about Black Epsilon or the Imperial Inquisition?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_7287c2b7", "I won't release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add the location of the Storm Squadron pilot trainer to your datapad.  You'll find him in the Bestine Pilot's club on Tatooine, next to the capitol building.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_772c81dd", "Yes, sir.  Black Epsilon is stationed at the Imperial Base on Talus, as Corellia itself is officially neutral... for now.  There are reports of considerable Rebel activity in the area, as you can imagine.  They could really use more pilots there, sir.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_83a7ae89", "Very well, ma'am.  Please come see me if you change your mind.  The Empire could use more soldiers of your caliber in space!");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_840482e7", "Nothing");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_86cb9899", "Yes.  Black Epsilon is stationed at the Imperial Base on Talus, as Corellia itself is officially neutral... for now.  There are reports of considerable Rebel activity in the area.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_8755e6eb", "Very well, sir.  Please come see me if you change your mind.  The Empire could use more soldiers of your caliber in space!");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_8812be10", "I would like to retire from the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_895d093", "Ok.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_8ac37a1f", "There's not much more I can say, ma'am, but I will add this location to your datapad.  Talk to the Pilot Trainer in the association hall on Kadaara, near the main plaza.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_8c387e5c", "Sir! Yes, sir!  Are you here to sign-up?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_8d91ee22", "Was there something else, sir?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_8ed93c34", "No, just checking.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_929272e8", "Imperial Inquisition is a special unit located in the Naboo system, sir.  They tend to deal in highly classified missions, so I'm afraid there's not a lot I'm authorized to tell you.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_99e09eaf", "Ma'am, you wouldn't last one nano-second as an Imperial pilot.  It's a strenuous, demanding profession that requires the utmost dedication.  Not to mention the fact that females are notoriously bad pilots!  Now if you will excuse me, good day!");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_9f862c74", "What about Storm Squadron or the Imperial Inquisition?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_a7d90105", "Very well, sir.  What about Storm Squadron or the Imperial Inquisition?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_a8b71650", "Yes, sir.  What about Black Epsilon or the Imperial Inquisition?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_ac926b4b", "Was there something else, ma'am?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_b0ea6e8c", "Yes.  What do I need to do?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_b19ac578", "HAHAHAHAHA!  Imagine that!  A big fur-ball like you flying a ship for the Empire!  Oh that is RICH!");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_b845eeb6", "Get lost!");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_b8884586", "I'm authorized to send you to one of three assignments, ma'am.  You can choose Storm Squadron in the Tatooine system, Black Epsilon in the Corellia system, or the Imperial Inquisition in the Naboo system.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_b89f31b", "Imperial Inquisition is a special unit located in the Naboo system, ma'am.  They tend to deal in highly classified missions, so I'm afraid there's not a lot I'm authorized to tell you.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_b945b46a", "Yes, ma'am.  I can't release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add the location of their own recruiter to your datapad.  If you'll speak with this officer in the Imperial Base on Talus, he will get you squared away.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_be46803", "I don't think I can help you, citizen. You don't look like much of a pilot.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_c2c89e35", "Yes, ma'am.  Black Epsilon is stationed at the Imperial Base on Talus, as Corellia itself is officially neutral... for now.  There are reports of considerable Rebel activity in the area, as you can imagine.  They could really use more pilots there, ma'am.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_cc37bca4", "Yes, sir.  I can't release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add the location of their own recruiter to your datapad.  If you'll speak with this officer in the Imperial Base on Talus, he will get you squared away.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_ccdbfea7", "Very well. You are now discharged from the Imperial Navy. I must say that I am disappointed. I expected better from you.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_cd41504a", "Yes, ma'am.  I can't release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add this location to your datapad.  Talk to the trainer in the Bestine Pilot's Club, near the capitol building on Tatooine.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_d1c489c0", "In that case, please stop bothering me.  I am very busy.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_d28bda49", "Would you be interested in either Black Epsilon or the Storm Squadron, ma'am?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_d78c7ec0", "Ma'am!  Yes, ma'am!  Are you here to sign-up?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_df2917b1", "Tell me more");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_e0db13e8", "Storm Squadron is one of the Empire's finest military units, in space or otherwise.  They're the very model of the sort of hard-core, dedicated, soldiers that secure the Empire throughout the galaxy.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_e2dae58f", "You have no business with me. Be on your way.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_e60ef8f6", "Hello, pilot. I hope that your service in the Imperial Navy treats you well. How may I be of assistance?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_e8ccc35c", "You've made the right choice, pilot. Dismissed.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_ed23ffff", "Are you interested in either Black Epsilon or the Storm Squadron, sir?");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_f05830e3", "There's not much more I can say, sir, but I will add the location to your datapad.  Talk to the Imperial Pilot trainer in Kadaara.  You'll find the association hall in the main plaza.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_f220efed", "I changed my mind. I will stay.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_f5f50ae3", "Of course.  My mistake.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_f72f24be", "I want to retire.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_fb390611", "Do you need directions or something, dear?  The bazaar terminals are near the starport.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_fbeabc76", "If that's what you want, I'll start getting your discharge papers together. If you want to change your mind, now is the time.");
stringFiles[295].addEntry("s_fda95628", "Yes, ma'am!  How may I be of assistance?");

stringFiles[296] = new StringFile("conversation/imperial_master_trainer");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (imperial_master_trainer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_10009b23", "Yes, what is it? Speak up, I don't have all day to chat with you.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_104cc43b", "How dare you approach me. Where are my bodyguards? I will have them flogged for failure in their duties. I suggest that you get out of my sight before I decide that you are a threat rather than an annoyance.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_110667a0", "You may not be a member of the Imperial Navy but you have shown yourself to be a loyal member and valuable asset to the Empire. I believe that you have achieved the highest level of piloting skill that anyone can hope to accomplish. And as a token of my personal appreciation I have authorized a transfer of payment to your account.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_14fd07f0", "Very well, pilot. You are correct in the assumption that you will be rewarded for your small part in making my plan a success.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_15cded59", "Did I not make myself clear to what your assignment was? Because it certainly had nothing to do with failure! You were supposed to strike the Rebel forces in Kessel and cripple their ability to control that system. Instead you come back with your tail between your legs.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_15f15e84", "I think you might over estimate the value of the Kessel system.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_16374fa8", "As I said, the Rebellion's fighter squads are greatly diminished and the time to unleash the second stage of my plan has come. The Rebels have moved a Corellian corvette into the Kessel system as part of their battlegroup. This ship is the Rebel command vessel for the entire sector.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_1837e4aa", "Do not try my patience. The RSF exists at the whim of the Empire. At any time we can take away your vaunted security force and the whole lot of you would be placed into the Imperial Navy. I would be surprised if even a third of you made it out of our training program.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_18cbe5e7", "To show you that I am a forgiving man, I accept your apology. And I will also give you another chance to destroy the Rebel corvette that is regularly patrolling the Kessel system. For your sake, do not fail me again. Are we understood?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_19377f3b", "That would be my assessment as well, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_1980f233", "I understand, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_19aeaf5e", "Ah, so you must be %NU. I have heard a great deal about you from your commanding officers from the RSF. A fine tradition that of the Royal Security Force. Not quite as noble as being a member of the Imperial Navy, but they have been known to make some very fine pilots.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_1ae97099", "See that you don't. Once the Empire has Kessel under it's control the rest of the Outer Rim will fall into line without much of a struggle. With my great victory, I will personally hand the Emperor a prize that he has longed for, the Outer Rim.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_1aff8b69", "The Kessel system is strategically connected to three other systems along the Outer Rim. With control of that one system, the Empire can exert it's influence on the entire region. From there it is only a small step in order to control the entire Outer Rim.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_1affba73", "The Grand Admiral is too kind.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_1be63a5a", "Just because they might tolerate insolence in the RSF does not mean that I have to listen to it. With this operation I am in command I expect complete respect. Do I make myself clear, pilot?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_1cb9631b", "I just think that we will be looking at that struggle even with Kessel.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_1df5b492", "Due to the interference from the Maw, long range scans are virtually useless in the Kessel system. You are going to have to hunt them down. Our system intelligence reports that they patrol throughout the system. You will just have to find them. Is that understood?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_1ebf705e", "Good, now get to your ship and take out those Rebel positions in Kessel.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_1ffdcc4b", "Are we clear?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_21a81b0b", "There is no need for that, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_22dd5c33", "You and I shall work together in order to bring respectability back to CorSec.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_24077de7", "I see, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_26c66fd1", "It won't happen again, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_26e02f1d", "I don't care much for the tone in your voice. If you wish to continue to fly for your organization I suggest that you find a way to control your tongue. I will not suffer any rudeness from a local security pilot.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_275d33d7", "Listen to me closely because you are walking on some very thin ice right now, Pilot. You are to return to the Kessel system and destroy the Rebel positions. My plan will not fail because of the incompetence of a lowly pilot such as yourself. Are we clear?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_2881a66c", "You certainly have an interesting way of showing your skills then, pilot. Normally when someone is good at something they accomplish any tasks involved. ");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_2bd3a43c", "You said smaller vessels. Does that mean there are larger capital class ships in the region?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_2f2ac428", "The Rebellion apparently has the same idea as we do about the Kessel system. They have already moved part of their fourth battlegroup into the system. Before we are able to take control of that system, that battlegroup will have to be eliminated.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_2f52e0af", "I haven't been dismissed yet, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_308a9ab1", "I was told by RSF Command to report to you.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_30f24d", "Show some initiative. I have given you orders and the plan, everything else I delegate to you. It is time to prove that you are a capable leader as well as a pilot. Assemble a team that will assist you on your assault on the Rebel corvette.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_33d1d488", "Why isn't the Imperial Navy taking care of the Rebels in the region?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_34ac7172", "This is too hard for me");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_36c3870b", "I have placed my trust in you. Do not fail me. We cannot allow the Rebellion to maintain any sort of control in the system. You have your mission. Dismissed.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_36e64ebe", "As I said, the Rebellion's fighter squads are greatly diminished and the time to unleash the second stage of my plan has come. The Rebels have moved a Corellian corvette into the Kessel system as part of their battlegroup. This ship is the Rebel command vessel for the entire system.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_377d1a96", "Thank you, sir. It has been an honor to be allowed to serve under you.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_378e9412", "Didn't I just order you to take some time off? I will explain the second part of my plan to you when I am ready. Pilot if you want to make it very far with me you had better start following orders and stop asking questions that do not concern you. Dismissed!");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_37e6fdef", "The Rebels are still using their corvettes to patrol the Kessel system with regularity. Against my better judgment, I am going to give you another chance to prove yourself worthy to wear the uniform of an Imperial Navy Flight Officer. Get to your ship and destroy the Rebel corvette patrolling the Kessel system.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_38294227", "Make your report, pilot.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_3876be4f", "Sir, I beg to differ but I had to improvise quite a bit out there to succeed.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_3924b90e", "Good. Now get to your ship before I change my mind.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_3cbc1b19", "There is no need to be modest. You have the makings of one of the finest pilots I have ever seen. Of course, all the skill in the world is meaningless without proper planning and careful guidance,");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_3d30040d", "It has been well known for years that CorSec is nothing more then a breeding ground for dissension. Do not question my judgment in this matter. If it wasn't for me there wouldn't be a CorSec. I don't know how many times I fought against having your entire corps eliminated. Despite all of it's obvious flaws, I do believe that the corps can be saved.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_3eb86cb5", "Remarkable. I am surprised that anyone who didn't go through flight training could rise through the ranks so quickly. Hmm...very interesting. I sense something in you that...never mind, I am just rambling.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_3eccac5", "Then we have nothing else to talk about.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_3ffe1ded", "Thank you, sir. I simply do my best to serve the Empire.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_4008a214", "I am willing to overlook your impertinence for your success in this difficult endeavor. But make no mistake, I will not overlook any lack of respect towards me, regardless of any deed that you might have performed for me in the past.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_4041b73c", "How do you propose we do that?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_43904a58", "You are not thinking. Even a corvette, as weak as they are, can cause a large amount of damage to a star destroyer. Star destroyers are not inexpensive pieces of military equipment. I have no intention of sending in one unless there are no other alternatives.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_452c0be9", "How did one such as you get this close to me? I will have my bodyguards heads for this. Get your traitorous self from my presence before I decide to sully my hands and terminate you myself.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_46a8c207", "Did I ask for an apology? Get out of my sight before I decide to have you brought up on insubordination charges.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_47acafeb", "The thought had crossed my mind.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_47cf08a2", "Yes, I am sure. Since I do not have all day I am going to dispense with further pleasantries. I am in need of a skilled pilot to implement a plan I have devised in order to secure the Kessel system.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_4a7e1397", "Forgotten, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_4effeedc", "Yes, sir! Thank you, sir!");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_4f462e49", "You seem distracted.  Perhaps there is somewhere else you are supposed to be, and something else you are supposed to be doing.  Wrap it up, and I mean NOW.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_4f48309f", "I will explain that to you when the time comes for that attack. The first thing that you need to worry about is reducing the fighters and gunboats in the Kessel system. If you can bring down enough of them, my plan cannot fail and the Empire will be on the verge of victory in the Kessel system.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_4fb6fb91", "I knew you would see things my way. I could tell from the moment you walked in that you were unlike the rest of that ilk. Personally I believe that the problems that exist within the CorSec can be fixed. I don't how many times I have saved your group from destruction. ");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_50e3a94f", "It is what the Rebellion considers to be a capital ship. It lacks the fire power and strength of even the weakest Star Destroyer. Your job should be rather simple. You are to destroy that Corellian corvette as it passes through the system on it's patrol. It apparently patrols several systems, so it is not always in Kessel. You will have to wait for it to enter Kessel on patrol before you will be able to strike.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_52c03f61", "I hope that you are well rested because the time has come for me to unleash the second part of my plan. As you know, we have managed to partially cripple the Rebel battlegroup in the Kessel system and I feel the time to strike at their heart is now.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_582dc96a", "It is hardly uncommon for fighters to take down capital ships the size of a corvette. Granted they usually have the support of star destroyers but in this case I have full confidence in your abilities.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_58a058a9", "That is not your concern at this time. My plan is to first weaken the fighter capability of the Rebels in the region and then we can initiate stage two. You are to focus all your energies on the destruction of the Rebel fighter craft in the region. Is that understood, Pilot?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_58e29478", "This is called delegation of responsibility. I am giving you the job to destroy the Rebel command vessel. How you accomplish that task is up to you. I would suggest that you assemble a strike team of fighter pilots in order to assist you with the assault. I cannot be bothered with the details.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_59047203", "Yes, sir! Right away, sir!");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_5ac61a82", "I didn't mean any disrespect, sir. It is just that, attacking a corvette in a fighter is not an effective combat technique.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_5bed3d33", "That would be my hope, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_5c54d077", "You have disappointed me. Your former superiors spoke so highly of you that I assumed you were skilled enough to handle the important task that I gave to you. Perhaps they need me to teach them how to pick a good pilot from an incompetent buffoon.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_5d0b4f6b", "You insolent pup. You dare insinuate that I do not know exactly what I have ordered you to do. If I felt that there were any other pilots available to perform this task I would have you executed and be done with you. Unfortunately, I am still in need of your skills.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_5d519e4c", "Yes, sir. I am ready.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_5f7103c7", "You are here because you are a good pilot not because I care about your opinion. Never forget that.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_5fca12da", "Are you questioning my judgment on this matter? I understand that things are a little less rigid in the RSF, but I would have still expected lesser flight officers not to question their superiors. Perhaps I need to have a word with the Queen about discipline among her troops. I made my decision based off of what is good for the Empire and that is all you need to know about that subject.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_60d3f4f8", "What is it that you want me to do?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_6276e267", "Yes, maybe you are right. It might not be wise for me to mention you to the Emperor. Others might try to have you transferred under their command. Oh, you are still here. Dismissed, Pilot!");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_63462bcc", "From what I have heard you are among their best and brightest. Which is good since I have a very important honor to bestow on you. The time has come for you to prove yourself to your Imperial allies. I have an important mission that I believe you are well suited for.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_63f7aad9", "What is it you want me to do?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_65031818", "Where are the Rebel positions in the sector?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_65d9bf6c", "Yes, sir. I shall not fail you.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_671a4e3c", "Today we are going to launch the definitive strike at the Rebellion battlegroup inside the Kessel system. Part of the battlegroup consists of the support vessels that you attacked so successfully last time, the other is their command vessels. You are going to assault their command vessels and destroy their lead ship.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_6844241f", "If you say so, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_6a66a025", "Sorry, sir. I didn't mean to speak out of turn.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_6aa8adaf", "I was hoping for a reward of sorts, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_6b18cf1e", "Reporting as ordered, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_6b3904f8", "It remains to be seen if you are worthy of your glowing service record. I am not one of those men who believe everything that they read. My judgment on your prowess is far more keen than any of the commanders that you flew for in the past, I can assure you of that.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_6b581019", "Sir, I will try my best but isn't it unwise to send fighters against a capital ship?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_6c92dab", "I must disagree. The RSF has the best pilots in the galaxy.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_6e1047cb", "So you have managed to dilute the Rebel influence on the Kessel system. That is good. It is good to see that you were able to follow simple orders and allow my genius planning to do it's work.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_7245a3eb", "Are you still here? On the double trooper.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_732a67f3", "The Rebel battlegroup moved into the system sooner then we anticipated. Unfortunately, the main portion of our battle fleets are engaged elsewhere. The Rebels want Kessel for it's strategic location in order to spread their chaos and dissension across the entire Outer Rim. In the same way, we want use Kessel to help bring order to the Outer Rim.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_73ed2b9a", "Pilot, you have performed my brilliant plan to cripple the Rebellion in the Kessel system with competence,  but that does not give you reign to disturb me any time you please. Do not make the mistake of trying my patience simply because I lent you a kind word in the past. ");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_74926dbb", "Are you saying that I was wrong in my assessment of the Rebel strength in the Kessel system?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_77e59fd7", "What is my target ship?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_78d92576", "What are my orders, sir?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_78dfc859", "Sounds like a very sound plan, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_78edd4f", "What is the assignment, sir?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_794642f2", "I would rather keep this matter completely in the Imperial Navy's hands but the situation dictates that we occasionally need to rely on our allies. This is a great opportunity for the planetary security forces to prove that the Empire was correct in not disbanding them.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_7964ad2d", "Yes, sir. The RSF has treated me very well.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_79b77be4", "Yes, I know. One of my character flaws is that I am to kindhearted to the men who serve under me. Regardless, enjoy your extra pay and take some time off. We will have to initiate the second part of my plan before long in order to take advantage of the situation in Kessel.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_7b3a873", "Perhaps if I had a better idea what you wanted from me.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_7cc631fe", "Will I have support?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_7d404504", "Pathetic.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_7eeb4f8c", "Good. Now get on with my operation. I am placing a great deal of faith in a pilot who does not even belong to the Imperial Navy. I expect that you will prove that the CorSec is not the breeding ground for Rebels that many of my peers seem to believe. Pilot, you are dismissed.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_80cfab4c", "Pilot, you have performed my brilliant plan to cripple the Rebellion in the Kessel system with competence. And I believe that you have the makings of a fine Imperial Naval Officer, but that does not give you reign to disturb me any time you please. Do not make the mistake of trying my patience simply because I lent you a kind word in the past. ");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_80f7c402", "It is about time you showed up. I was beginning to wonder if punctuality was a lost disciple in the Imperial Navy. At least you have enough sense to speak with respect to your betters. The last pilot who was in here and spoke to me out of turn is now servicing garbage scowls on Bespin.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_825762e5", "Excellent, then my plan worked to perfection. I cannot wait to see the smug expression on Grant's face drop when he hears of my success. Should I open or close with this success in my report to the Emperor? Hmmm, oh are you still here?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_8409f60e", "I was told by Corellia Security Command to report to you.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_842637c2", "I trust you learned about the Kessel system in your naval flight training, so there shouldn't be any need to go into that.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_85b8ffbd", "The Kessel system?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_862d3332", "I will give you results, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_87ccb642", "And many members of the CorSec do appreciate it.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_87d4bfc2", "Crystal.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_88742275", "See that you do. Once the Empire has Kessel under it's control the rest of the Outer Rim will fall into line without much of a struggle. With my great victory, I will personally hand the Emperor a prize that he has longed for, the Outer Rim.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_88eb64f3", "Again you speak without thinking. You accomplished the tasks that comprised the first part of my plan. There is no way that the Rebels could have recovered from such a devastating strike this quickly.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_8c202f75", "Ah, yes. You are interested in finding out why I have ordered your presence. I am in need of a skilled pilot to implement a plan I have devised in order to secure the Kessel system. ");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_8db79f00", "No, sir. Sorry, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_8dd98074", "I am the very best pilot, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_8efde2ae", "Yes, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_8f760eed", "Yes, sir. The Rebels are poised to crumble.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_9039a33", "That's better. Now getting back to the matter at hand. After looking over your service record I cannot help but to be impressed. Your record is almost as decorated as mine was at your age. I think that you have the makings of a fine Imperial officer.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_913ac8c9", "Sir, I must disagree.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_92172df0", "The Rebellion has control of the Kessel system right now?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_92ac32ae", "The Rebellion has moved a Corellian corvette into the system and are using that vessel as their staging point for all operations that take place inside the system. You are to destroy that vessel. Reports show that the vessel moves throughout several systems, so it may not always be in Kessel. You will have to wait for it to arrive on it's standard patrol through the system before you will be able to strike.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_939fa385", "Well, if you perform the assignment that I have for you with any sort of competence you should go a long way in making that dream come true.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_966bc725", "What! Are you questioning the plan that I gave to you? Improvisation should be left to actors not Imperial Pilots. A good Imperial Pilot obeys orders without question and follows them explicitly. It's a wonder that you even succeeded.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_98790879", "Yes, I know all about Kessel, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_9a3f8378", "You are a pilot in the Imperial Navy. It is your duty to fight when, where, and what I tell you to fight. We all pay the costs for the conflict that the Rebels have brought on us. It is my lot to give the orders and it is your lot to obey and if necessary to die for those orders. You should not envy my position, for heavy is the crown of command.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_9bbd1090", "So I will have support?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_9e28d2b0", "A Corellian corvette? Isn't that a capital ship?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_9f12075", "So you show some loyalty to those who have supported you. Loyalty is a good trait to have for a soldier, as long as you do not misplace that loyalty. I demand that you show loyalty to me and do what I have asked you to accomplish.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a15a9037", "My continued support for your organization is waning. I feel that your success in the destruction of the Rebel flag ship is just about the only thing that will convince me to change my mind.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a1669dff", "You honor me too much. Thank you, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a2a4d2a", "Then you are well aware of Kessel's strategic value. With Kessel under our control, the Empire will be able to quickly bring order to the Outer Rim and maintain dominance throughout the region.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a2bd8a18", "I am not sure if I would call the Rebel battlegroup crippled.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a340005a", "The Rebellion controls nothing in the galaxy. But they have a force in the Kessel system that could pose problems to our operations. Before we move into the system in force, we need to eliminate the Rebel threat. That will be your mission.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a3bdfc08", "I think that you are over estimating the value of the Kessel system.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a460d610", "Sir, the Rebels were stronger than initially reported.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a4b7535d", "I never went through naval flight training, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a4bdc579", "Pilot, what is the meaning of this? If I wish to speak to you I will have your superior officer inform you. Until that time I expect you to act with the appropriateness of a member of the Imperial Navy and only speak to your betters when spoken to.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a5253219", "I will remind you that I am a Grand Admiral. I did not gain my rank by over estimating anything. Control of the Kessel system is vital to the Empire's campaign in the Outer Rim. Without it we could be looking at years of chaos among the outer systems. ");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a622496d", "Of course, why would I assume that you know anything of the Kessel system? The Kessel system is located deep in the Outer Rim. The Empire has had plans to take full control of the system for some time now, but we have never quite been able to succeed in it's ultimate control.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a8ea09e9", "You are absolutely correct, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a8fd6791", "Of course, you haven't. You have performed excellently for me and I always reward those who serve me. You have proven yourself a very valuable asset to the Empire and more importantly you have proven yourself to me.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_a942beda", "The Kessel system is located deep in the Outer Rim. It has great strategic value due to its close proximity to three other sectors in the Outer Rim, all of which have trade routes cutting through Kessel. If the Empire were able to control Kessel we would have virtual control over every system in the area and be able to quickly bring order to the Outer Rim.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_ace4b0c3", "See that you don't. I would hate to see you be the cause for me to decide that the time has come to do away with local security forces and replace them all with members of the Imperial Navy. You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_ad4fc220", "Dog! How dare you get this close to me. I will have my security detail flogged for this transgression. Get out of my sight before you suffer a similar fate.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_af2fc12f", "Sorry, sir. I spoke out of turn.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_b00fab2", "Ah, yes. You are that bright, young pilot I have been hearing so much about. %NU, isn't it? That's okay, it really doesn't matter. You are probably wondering why a Grand Admiral wishes to see you.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_b170039f", "I trust you are well rested and ready to serve me as well as you had before. The time has come for me to unleash the second stage of my plan to take the Kessel system for the glory of the Empire.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_b41b5772", "A Corellian corvette! Wouldn't it be better to send a Star Destroyer after it?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_b659975", "The Rebellion apparently has the same idea as we do about the Kessel system. They have already moved part of their fourth battlegroup into the sector. Before we are able to take control of that system, that battlegroup will have to be eliminated.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_b6b25f13", "Yes, sir!");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_b8ead210", "Yes, sir. Your plan worked to perfection. The Rebellion didn't know what hit them.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_ba2453bc", "Yes, yes. The Rebellion has moved portions of their fourth battle group into the region and before we can take control of the Kessel system, it is imperative that they be eliminated. In order to do this we will need to perform a duel stage attack on their power bases in the system.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_baca5aeb", "Yes, sir. You are absolutely clear.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_bb68f6ed", "I will not fail again, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_bb9e4a63", "Understood, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_bc9b4055", "Yes, sir. It would be an honor, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_bcb643d", "So you are turning to local security forces to assist you in this matter?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_bd095033", "I do not recall telling you to attack that ship alone. I am giving you this assignment but I am delegating you the authority to put together your own flight in order to accomplish this assignment. I know that a local security force is not expected to be a crack combat unit but I would expect that even there people show initiative.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_beb9353a", "I do my best, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_c13f9a11", "I am sorry, sir. Give me another chance. I will succeed.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_c38038fe", "You forget your place, pilot. I asked for you simply based on the recommendations from your superior officers. They seemed to have a great deal of faith in you and were completely sure of your loyalty. Was their faith misplaced?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_c4069644", "Let me make one thing clear. I do not care about your career. I do not care about your goals. I do not care about you. I only care about results. If you are unable to give me results then you will find out what it is to cross a Grand Admiral.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_c5aa2921", "That is exactly how I feel, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_c6be1c53", "Your accomplishments have proven that you are a valued asset to the Empire and a truly exceptional pilot. I believe that you have achieved the highest level of piloting skill that anyone can possess. I have also decided that a payment bonus should be transferred to your account as a show of my personal gratitude. And, most importantly, I have decided to mention your name to the Emperor, in passing of course, but still the greatest of honors.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_c788dadf", "No, sir. Of course not, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_c7f4c531", "So, I am expendable?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_c92b41e9", "As well you should. I am hardly required to spend my valuable time trying to protect an agency that isn't under Imperial control. But I think that you and I shall change the perception that other members of Imperial Command might have of CorSec. Wouldn't you agree?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_ca9b9b68", "This is why you are but a lowly pilot in a local planet security force and I am a Grand Admiral. Do not ever make the mistake of questioning my judgment. I am willing to let that remark go unpunished this time, but I am not accustomed to being questioned by mere pilots... and I do not plan on making a habit out of it.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_cb5e0360", "That is what I expect. I will give you another chance at attacking the Rebel positions in Kessel. Launch the attack immediately on the Rebel positions and cripple their ability to hold that system.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_cb793d1b", "It is good to see that you are someone who understands the fiscal responsibility that I am in. If I can give the Emperor the Outer Rim for minimal costs it will reflect very well on me. ");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_cbf5f6bc", "What is the second strike?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_cc0857f4", "Second part of your plan?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_cd392cb5", "Why would you assume that I wish to talk to you? Did I order your presence? Do I look like I wanted to speak with you? When and if I wish to speak to you I am sure you will be informed by your superior. Now get out of my sight before I begin to care that you are bothering me.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_cd48bb84", "Yes, sir. I will put together my team and assault the vessel.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_cf1c32cf", "Very simple. You will offer support to a plan I have devised in order to gain control of the Kessel system. With my brilliant strategy, even a pilot such as yourself, should have no trouble bringing victory in the name of the Empire.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_da529897", "How dare you speak with me. Don't you have any idea of who I am? Go back to your grubby little hole and be thankful I don't have you put to death for this outrage.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_e1e9b306", "You are dismissed, pilot. Move it before I change my mind and have you flying patrols in the Dagobah system for the rest of your career.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_e4eceb3e", "I will do my best to destroy the Rebel fighters.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_e685629c", "I think you are mistaken about the ideals of CorSec.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_e6cf6a6f", "I cannot do this");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_e9aec8d7", "A mission? Shouldn't that be handled by the Imperial Navy?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_eb02d65", "I am a good pilot, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_eb171ae9", "Good. Now get on with my operation. I am placing a great deal of faith in a pilot who does not even belong to the Imperial Navy. I expect that you will prove the RSF is completely loyal to the Empire. Pilot, you are dismissed.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_ebd84e91", "Yes, I am sure it was. You are dismissed, pilot.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_ecdec8ad", "As I said, you are to eliminate the Rebel threat in the region. The first stage of the attack is to destroy a number of their smaller vessels that patrol throughout the region. These vessels would include fighters as well as gunboats.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_eded2a14", "My plan involves two steps. The first stage is to reduce the number of support fighters that the Rebels have in the area. I believe that if we can drop those numbers down enough it will be impossible for the Rebels to adequately defend against the second strike. Unfortunately, due to the interference from the Maw, long range scans are virtually useless in Kessel.  You are going to have to hunt the Rebel vessels down.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_ef6b4924", "Sir, that is insanity.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_f010d9ab", "[relay the destruction of the Rebel Corellia Corvette]");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_f2aa6939", "Sorry, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_f2ba71dd", "Sir, will I be supplied support?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_f352e00f", "I will not fail you or the Empire.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_f799f9ec", "Perfectly clear, sir!");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_f85f5c9d", "I would hardly expect you to attack a capital vessel by yourself. I may expect a lot out of the men that serve under me, but you going out alone to attack that vessel would not accomplish anything... other than your death.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_f9df4c83", "It is good to see that the CorSec are not a breeding ground for the Rebellion like many of my peers seem to believe. Perhaps if you work well for me, you can show your fellow pilots that the only way to truly have peace is to fully support the Empire and it's endeavors.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_fa54959d", "Were you given permission to speak freely? If discipline in the ranks of the Imperial Navy has broken down so badly I can make sure that it is restored. If it wasn't for your exceptional service record I might consider having you shipped off to some backwater world for the rest of your career.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_faa7bc59", "What are you doing back here? I explained what you need to do in full detail and I expect you to do it. This mission will not fail because of your incompetence. Get back to the Kessel system and finish the job.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_fbe23895", "I have decided that you deserve a small token of my appreciation as a reward for your successful flight. I am going to have some credits transferred to your account so you can take a little rest and relaxation. A rested pilot is a better pilot.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_fc42e227", "I am sorry, sir. Give me another chance. I will not let you down.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_fd386cda", "Again I apologize for my hasty words, sir.");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_fd661a34", "Why would the Empire want control of the Kessel system?");
stringFiles[296].addEntry("s_fdd6a0a8", "The Rebels are fools. They will be crushed shortly, of that I have no doubt. But I have never been one to overlook the value of a good pilot. I am beginning to see what your other superiors saw in you.");

stringFiles[297] = new StringFile("conversation/imperial_master_trooper");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (imperial_master_trooper) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("s_28c5a74a", "You don't look like much of a pilot to me.");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("s_326b2667", "Rebel pilots don't belong here!");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("s_33788e9b", "I'm here to speak to the boss here!");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("s_4cf446c4", "Then if you must...");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("s_75207c3", "I have no time for you, friend. We have a war to fight!");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("s_7e51c66", "Hold, pilot. What business do you have here?");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("s_86ed2e98", "None.");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("s_9049d3d5", "You have no business here, smuggler. I suggest you take off!");
stringFiles[297].addEntry("s_a366a1ca", "Then get out of here!");

stringFiles[298] = new StringFile("conversation/indigo_siyan");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (indigo_siyan) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_540ac7e9", "Continue.");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_7fe92f9e", "Let's see... There are several citizens that I can think of who have been affected by Sean's generosity. The Curator of the museum, for one. Sean's housemaid can tell you a story or two, and you can check over at the new market place. You only need one piece of evidence, so you can choose which suits you. Unfortunately, I don't have direct locations of them. You'll have to find them on your own. I hope this will help you in the long run.");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_81fdc59e", "Thank you!");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_83beea8a", "My pleasure. See you later!");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_88b121e8", "I'm getting ready for the next election. Sean is running for the position. I have so much to do! Be sure to listen to the townsfolk. By rumor, they'll let you know when the voting is about to begin. I have to get back to work...");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_abf4a6a9", "My pleasure!");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_bdba42ab", "Don't mind him. He can be a little pushy when it comes to these things. What he may not have told you is that you can go to Victor if you decide this campaign isn't for you. He'll probably have some task for you to do in order to join, but that's okay. Nothing too difficult, I'd hope. Anyway, let me see what sort of contacts I have for you.");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_e095f053", "Poor Victor. He's such a nice man, but don't tell Sean I said that. Mind you, I'm reluctantly giving you this information. Don't share it with anyone. Let's see what I may have for you. Okay. There's a Hutt in one of the cantinas you can talk to. I know that one of his troopers isn't necessarily loyal either. He's around the capitol.  And you may be able to rummage around Victor's office for nasty tidbits as well. That's all I know.");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_f10cc45e", "Welcome! Please, help yourself to tea or pastries! Isn't the election exciting? Are you here to vote for Sean? Oh, pardon me! I'm so rude. I shouldn't ask that. I'm Sean's secretary. I'm so glad to be working for him. He has so many great ideas. Please speak with him as soon as possible. He'll tell you all the things he has in store for Bestine.");
stringFiles[298].addEntry("s_fd9f62f9", "I guess. I feel bad now. Bye.");

stringFiles[299] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_dealer_arms");
stringFiles[299].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_dealer_arms) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[299].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[299].addEntry("s_24f30320", "Just remember what I said about discretion. My buyers would be less then pleased if the authorities got word of this transaction. And I don't think you want my buyers to be unhappy.");
stringFiles[299].addEntry("s_370a03c", "I don't think that I have anything you would be interested in.");
stringFiles[299].addEntry("s_3c06418f", "Hmmm. You seem to be a discreet sort. Perhaps you are looking to do some business. If you have any untraceable weapons that maybe you would like to get off your hands I am the right person to see.");
stringFiles[299].addEntry("s_c86eba88", "I think I have a few things that you might be interested in.");
stringFiles[299].addEntry("s_df5bd64e", "Right you are. Oh, and we never met.");

stringFiles[300] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_dealer_finery");
stringFiles[300].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_dealer_finery) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[300].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[300].addEntry("s_1eb9feb7", "That is too bad. I was really hoping to get some new stock in today.");
stringFiles[300].addEntry("s_370a03c", "I don't think that I have anything you would be interested in.");
stringFiles[300].addEntry("s_9666d79a", "Hello my friend. How are you doing today? I am a buyer of finery....clothing, jewelry, and such. If you happen to have anything that I might like to buy please let me know.");
stringFiles[300].addEntry("s_c86eba88", "I think I have a few things that you might be interested in.");
stringFiles[300].addEntry("s_e8ceb290", "That is wonderful news. Let me see what you have to offer and I will give you price on anything I wish to buy. Remember there is no obligation to sell but I certainly hope you decide to conduct your business with me.");

stringFiles[301] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_dealer_generic");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_dealer_generic) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_12fe83a6", "You seem to be the adventurous sort so I figured that you might be able to find the parts. I mean they had to go somewhere, although my guess is that they are probably all over the galaxy by now.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_14efaaa2", "Ok, here you go. I guess in order to make it work you need to add ten special components to the kit. When you examine a kit, it has a list of what you need in order to complete the kit. It also has a read-out of whether it currently has a component or not. Oh, and if you do happen to make anything useful with that kit, I might be interested in buying that from you.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_324b9b0f", "What good would a useless kit do me?");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_3633b5a5", "Can't say that I blame you for not taking one. It's sad that I can't even give them away. If I ever see that inventor again I am going to make him really sorry.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_3aa18b2d", "What sort of items do you have that you are looking to get rid of?");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_3df21ea0", "It would appear that you already have one of these kits. I know I really want to get rid of all these kits but I just can't be handing them all out at once. You never know when they might be worth something.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_3fc7eb45", "Well let's see here. I have one that makes an orange rug, one that makes a blue rug, one that can make a Nabooian sculpture, one that makes a table, and one that make some sort of model gong. I will only give you one kit at a time so if you want another you are going to have to get rid of the one you currently have first.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_4bd9d15e", "That is to bad. Remember to come visit me in the future if you happen to come across anything I would be interested in.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_4d65752", "I just want them gone. They are taking up valuable space in my inventory so I will just give you one of each type if you want.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_54fab04f", "I have some things that you might be interested in.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_5b10c0b9", "I am sorry but you do not have any space in your inventory for me to give you a kit. Maybe you should clear out some room and talk to me again if you are still interested.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_6d53d062", "Why don't you just get some of the special components?");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_84a67771", "Alright, let me see what you are offering.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_87c5851b", "I think I will try out the one that makes the sculpture.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_8f39769", "I will take one of the blue rug kits.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_9ede4b84", "Let me have one that makes the table.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_b60b73f8", "No thanks, I don't think that I need any of those kits.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_bef51e38", "Welcome traveler. I am a buyer of goods that most would deem as junk. If you are interested I will look through what you have to offer and set a price for anything that I wish to buy. I also have come across some other items of interest that I am looking to get rid of.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_cd7a3f41", "I am sorry but I don't think I have anything you would want.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_d347bee3", "Ok sounds good. What sort of kits do you have?");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_d9e6b751", "An inventor recently sold me and my fellow junk dealers a large quantity of these special kits that were supposed to revolutionize crafting. Unfortunately, they are useless without the special components that they are designed to use.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_e1a103e5", "Hmmmm, well how much do you want for these kits?");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_e29f48dc", "Apparently this inventor had them all on a shipment that was coming in from the core worlds. As luck would have it the shipment was hijacked en route and all the components were lost to pirates. This caused the inventor to go out of business, leaving all of us stuck with these useless kits.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_ee977dee", "Let me have one of those orange rug kits.");
stringFiles[301].addEntry("s_fe657cdd", "I think I would like one of those model gong kits.");

stringFiles[302] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_dender_rori");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_dender_rori) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_12400728", "That decision was the smartest thing you have ever done.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_13d756ae", "Whoa, sorry about that didn't mean to bother you.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_19e6693b", "I don't do business with your kind.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_1ea1fb0f", "Save your apology for someone who cares. You leave now!");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_42c6dbd2", "I knew you interested. I have buyers, big league Imperial types, who trying to get their hands on gungan stuffs. I don't think they want the souvenirs so much as they want less gungans in world.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_673b632f", "It is your lucky day. I have what you are looking for.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_6925372f", "Keep going, I am still listening.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_7d842aa5", "If you come across any of those gungan signets that they wear or one of their lances, you come back and see me. I buy whole lot from you, no questions.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_9aa94773", "I right about you, eh thur killer? Lets see what you gots. Hmmm...not to bad, you have some things I make offer on.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_a753e4d6", "I don't appear to have anything you would want to buy.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_b0d63c3a", "Bah...don't stand thur lookin' dumb. Come back if you have anything me buy.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_c9aa99a2", "I am listening.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_cfe66406", "Too bad. I offering easy work and good credits. Later chump.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_e2f6a3b8", "This just sounds like a bad idea.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_e88820", "'Ey thur! What you think you doin' walkin' up to me like that. If this was my bad day you be six feet under now. Since I feelin' generous I let slide...this time.");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_ef66cf46", "Your loss. I tryin' to be all neighborly like and share the spoils with you...");
stringFiles[302].addEntry("s_fd11d689", "You have some guts, eh thur killer? Me need someone with big guts to help me out with business deal that me have. You help me out and I make it worth your while.");

stringFiles[303] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_dender_theed");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_dender_theed) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_12400728", "That decision was the smartest thing you have ever done.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_13d756ae", "Whoa, sorry about that didn't mean to bother you.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_159f2a9b", "Your loss. I was trying to be all neighborly like and share the spoils with you...");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_19e6693b", "I don't do business with your kind.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_1e6ae8ff", "Yeah I was right about you, eh there killer? Lets see what you have to offer. Hmmm...not to bad, you have some things that I will make an offer on.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_4df1acdf", "Hey there! Just what do you think you are doing walkin' up to me like that. If this were one of my bad days you would be six feet under right now. But since I am feelin' generous I will let it slide this time.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_5e3116dd", "Bah...well don't just stand there looking dumb. Come back if you have anything I would want to buy.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_673b632f", "It is your lucky day. I have what you are looking for.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_6925372f", "Keep going, I am still listening.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_7c981db", "I knew you would be interested. I have these buyers, big league Imperial types, who are trying to get their hands on all things gungan. Personally I don't think they so much want the souvenirs so much as they want a few less gungans in the world.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_86e582ac", "So you do have some guts, eh there killer? I could really use someone with your kind of guts to help me out with a business deal that I have put together. You help me out and I will make it worth your while.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_874980ff", "Basically if you come across any gungan relic type things you come back and see me. I will buy the whole lot from you no questions asked.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_a753e4d6", "I don't appear to have anything you would want to buy.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_c9aa99a2", "I am listening.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_e2f6a3b8", "This just sounds like a bad idea.");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_ea02ab47", "Save your apology for someone who cares. Now beat it!");
stringFiles[303].addEntry("s_feb97f59", "Too bad. I was offering easy work and good credits. Later chump.");

stringFiles[304] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_lila_borvo");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_lila_borvo) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("s_113dbce8", "People talk to much. Loose talk has a way of getting them into trouble of the worse sort. But you strike me as being the discreet sort. My employer has been known to buying certain goods, as long as they are untraceable.");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("s_1875d09c", "I believe that I have just what your employer is looking for.");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("s_210d33b4", "I don't think that there is anything that I need help with.");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("s_7edb783c", "Why don't you let me take a look at what you have to offer. If the goods are what my employer is after I am more then willing to take them off of your hands. Of course you understand that this deal is strictly confidential. If you break that confidence you will not live long enough to regret it.");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("s_98d18f02", "Isn't that a shame. Perhaps some other time.");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("s_a16cfd3b", "I hear that you are the person to see if one has something they need to move.");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("s_a83a2e6b", "How sweet. Aren't you just the little hero.");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("s_e8b03c7c", "This seems a little shady. I don't think I want to be involved.");
stringFiles[304].addEntry("s_ea90afa0", "Well aren't you a fine specimen. Hmmmm....I gather that you are not here for the pleasure of my company. Speak up now, what is it that I can do for you?");

stringFiles[305] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_malik_vistal");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_malik_vistal) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_18123132", "Hey, I didn't say anything about taking care of no Corsecs. But if accidents did happen to befall them who is to say that I wouldn't buy some sort of proof that they are no more...purely as a collectors piece of course.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_420b90b8", "Figured as much but it was worth a shot.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_769000a5", "You look to be a rough sort. Perhaps you would be interested in taking care of a little business problem that me and my associates have been having?");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_91196436", "I don't need the Corsecs looking into me for getting involved.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_9251cdb4", "That is what I like to hear. Well the problem is pretty simple. My associates and myself are honest hard working citizens that are being harassed to no end by Corsecs. Why they are after us is completely beyond my comprehension.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_9334c0a0", "Let me take a look. I probably will be inclined to pay for anything Corsec that I locate on your person. Of course, this transaction has nothing to do with the unfortunate circumstances of which you came into possession of these items.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_9c1435e4", "I knew that you were the right sort from the moment I saw you.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_af6451b5", "I may not like it, but looking after ones own skin is something that I can understand. Maybe next time.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_b44309e2", "Let me guess. You want me to take care of the Corsecs?");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_d36db42d", "I don't have anything you want but I will keep an eye out.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_f66e6241", "This sounds a bit fishy. I don't want to be involved.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_f836463", "I am an expert at solving problems.");
stringFiles[305].addEntry("s_fc51be40", "I think that I have just what you are looking for on me.");

stringFiles[306] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_nado_wattos");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_nado_wattos) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("s_17e67aee", "We deal in a wide assortment of goods and offer the best prices on Tatooine for junk. A large number of settlers come to Watto's looking for various parts and nic-naks to suit their purpose.");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("s_294d7f51", "If there is anything that I can help you with just let me know.");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("s_50c8b3e1", "I am just taking a look around.");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("s_6afe640d", "That is alright. If you happen to come across anything you think I might like to buy stop on by and I will be more then willing to take it off your hands.");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("s_8441c2ce", "Excellent. Let me take a look at what you have to offer. Hmmmm...most of this isn't in very good condition but I am more then willing to make you an offer. Let me assure you no one will give you a better price.");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("s_90b63763", "I am sorry but I don't have anything you would be interested in.");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("s_a5d02a3c", "I think I might have a few things that will spark your interest.");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("s_d94d5d64", "What sort of things do you buy?");
stringFiles[306].addEntry("s_fa615166", "Eh? Ah yes, I can tell by your look that you have something that I might be interested in buying. Well that is what Watto's is here for.");

stringFiles[307] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_nathan_taike");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_nathan_taike) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_2d363db3", "I knew from the moment I saw you that you were just the type that we needed.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_33db8b80", "Let me see what you have. And let me tell you, no one is going to pay better then I do for this sort of stuff.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_34475b33", "What sort of proof are you looking for?");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_3b924e4a", "Well I have to be sure of where you get this proof from so I am not going to accept any old junk. Bring me back some of those Jawa blasters or those beads that they wear and I will buy those from you.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_47a68e94", "Well it is like this. The honest folk who are trying to eek out a living out here are sick and tired of those thieving Jawas. They scrimp and save enough just to buy a piece of equipment that will make their lives easier only to have the Jawas steal it the next day. It isn't right.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_5b767310", "You have me all wrong. I can't help anyone today.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_5ceff11f", "Well, well what do we have here? You certainly have the look of a hardened adventurer. Perhaps even one that is not opposed to helping out honest, hardworking farmers and make a few credits in the process?");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_69567be7", "Ok, I will see what I can do to help all you honest farmers out.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_735e3c59", "Bah! I should have figured that a stranger wouldn't understand the extent of the problem.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_808503a8", "I guess I was wrong about the whole hardened adventurer thing.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_aaac386c", "You could say that. I am willing to pay good money for proof that you are taking care of this Jawa problem. You bring me proof that you are taking care of this Jawa problem and I will be more then happy to buy that proof from you.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_b47d6575", "Sounds to me like you need better security, not an exterminator.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_c20cb2b0", "I have never been opposed to helping people...if the price is right.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_e022ccee", "So you are looking for someone to take care of this Jawa problem?");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_e613f19", "Sorry not really interested in this sort of dealing.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_eadc8d6e", "So be it. There is always another that will come along and be willing to help us out.");
stringFiles[307].addEntry("s_ecf19442", "I think that I just might have some of this proof that you ask for.");

stringFiles[308] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_ollobo_jabbas");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_ollobo_jabbas) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("s_472f3294", "Jabba tell Ollobo ta deal fer shooters an' stabbers, Jabba tell Ollobo ta deal fer pretties. Jabba tell Ollobo ta make good deal fer pistol shooters an' polearm stabbers. If'n ya got what Jabba wants, Ollobo deal fer it.");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("s_6d35d0e1", "If yer lookin' ta get into mighty Jabba's good graces then Ollobo wrong chap ta talk at. If'n yer lookin' ta make extra credit or two mayhaps we make good deal.");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("s_6ee477c3", "What sort of deal are you talking about?");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("s_73b59dd6", "Ollobo check what ya got. No barter. Ya deal or not deal. Ollobo no ask questions, 'cause Ollobo no care. Jabba tell Ollobo ta deal, Ollobo deal.");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("s_935bfcd0", "That yer choice. Just ya 'member, Ollobo willing ta deal fer what Jabba wants.");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("s_aadc214b", "I am not interested in any sort of deal.");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("s_b85badf5", "I don't think that I have anything Jabba is interested in.");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("s_b950c3eb", "Ya 'member that Ollobo here. Ya find what Jabba wants, Ollobo deal fer it.");
stringFiles[308].addEntry("s_e2ee167d", "I think that I have what Jabba is looking for.");

stringFiles[309] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_quich_dantooine");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_quich_dantooine) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_2313ac9e", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_35b56f0a", "Oh, well have I now. In that case ye should go about ye business.");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_413bfd08", "Well if ye find any Jedi artifacts ye know where I be.");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_463bc6c4", "I just might have some things you would be interested in.");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_5bc0c939", "Pay and pay well. I be working for a collector who has credits to spend. Ye get me artifacts and I get ye credits.");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_6e11f342", "I don't have anything you would be interested in.");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_86df00aa", "I have ye curious now. I be looking for rare artifacts of the mysterious nature. Artifacts that this planet have in abundance. Artifacts of jedi.");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_87c4b1c3", "Lookie lookie what I see here. Ye certainly be a brave sort. The type that be trying to make a name for ye. Perhaps I be able to help ye make that name?");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_953d967f", "Ummm...I think you have me confused for someone else.");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_ba5cc7c", "Excellent. Let me look at what ye got for me. How nice...how nice indeed. I will make an offer on these. Ye should take me up on my offer because no one else will pay for what ye got.");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_f2e88b32", "Jedi eh? And I suppose you will pay for these artifacts?");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_f5349262", "Ye be wise beyond ye years for making that decision. I be wrong in thinking that ye could hold ye own with the likes of Jedi.");
stringFiles[309].addEntry("s_fbe44b83", "Jedi! I want nothing to do with anything Jedi.");

stringFiles[310] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_reggi_nym");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_reggi_nym) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("s_14e5bdc0", "I don't really have to much in the way of jobs but Nym is always looking to buy weapons and such. He also has some bounties out on those cursed Blood Razors and Canyon Cosairs who haven't figured out their place yet.");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("s_233f3214", "Not a problem. Like I said Nym is always looking for these things so if you run across any come on back.");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("s_2e005077", "It doesn't look like I have anything Nym would like to buy.");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("s_53d778d8", "Not really...work has never suited me.");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("s_5c453a2f", "Being lucky is one of the best things in the world. Lets take a look at what you have to offer. Nym isn't much for bartering so you can take the price I give or you can leave it. Makes no difference to me really.");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("s_60d2f507", "Looking for work? I don't know that for sure but normally people who come around here are always looking for something. ");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("s_b8e27f3c", "Well this looks like my lucky day.");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("s_ef8c7236", "I am always looking for work.");
stringFiles[310].addEntry("s_f25d9c2", "Truer words have never been spoken. But if you ever change your mind you know where to find me.");

stringFiles[311] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_sheani_lake");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_sheani_lake) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("s_370197a6", "You know what? I think that I have just what you are looking for.");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("s_38c64dea", "Oh how nice, you must be a seller. I am always in the market for used clothing, the occasional trinket, and any sort of jewelry. If you are interested I can offer you very fair pricing for anything you are looking to sell.");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("s_45632ab8", "I think the question is how can I be of service to you?");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("s_57feadd0", "In that case safe travels to you. If you ever find yourself in possession of anything I might be interested in please contact me again.");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("s_82f469f5", "How wonderful! Let me take a look and I will make you the best offer that I can for anything that I might be interested in. You do seem to have a few nice pieces in here.");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("s_d264cf44", "I am afraid that I don't have anything you would like.");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("s_d3c4bb84", "Welcome traveler, I am Sheani, buyer and seller of finery from around the galaxy. Maybe you have heard of me? No...no matter. How may I be of service to you today?");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("s_d4565283", "That is too bad. But if come across anything please stop by and let me have the first crack at buying them from you.");
stringFiles[311].addEntry("s_f6c161d", "Nothing right now. I am just passing through.");

stringFiles[312] = new StringFile("conversation/junk_sneg_valarian");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (junk_sneg_valarian) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_14b517b1", "What sort of things does Lady Valarian deal in?");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_4717ab1e", "Perhaps you are here to sell something. Something that  might be a little hard to sell elsewhere. Many people come here looking for Lady V's help in moving things that they otherwise cannot. If it something that the Lady deals with she might be willing to take it off of your hands.");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_50b9f32f", "What does Lady Valarian want with melee weapons?");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_50c8b3e1", "I am just taking a look around.");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_63a817cf", "Let me see what you have to offer. If I see anything that we might be interested in dealing with I will make an offer on. It is very wise to accept the generous offer that Lady V grants.");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_6dbdfc7", "Greetings and be welcome. Please enjoy the facilities here at the Lucky Despot. Are you here to try your luck at one of our gaming tables or....perhaps you are here for business rather then pleasure?");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_7debe28e", "The Lady deals with all assortment of items. Anything from a CDEF to an imperial T-21. Of course, she currently has a special interest in hand-to-hand weapons. She also has a liking to various other odds and ends that can fetch a nice profit if you know the right people.");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_94fa366f", "Of course, lets conduct some business.");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_a3ad61f1", "Very well. Good day to you.");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_b4cc3fb7", "I don't think I have anything that the Lady is interested in.");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_e27c50ad", "It is never wise to stick your nose into the Lady's business. Do you wish to do business with us or not?");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_f0f3bea2", "That depends on what sort of business you have in mind.");
stringFiles[312].addEntry("s_f7c66216", "In that case, please enjoy the fabulous Lucky Despot.");

stringFiles[313] = new StringFile("conversation/keanna_likyna");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (keanna_likyna) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_1f3a981f", "I hope it goes well. Good bye!");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_36d62208", "So many people have been visiting the capitol lately. I'm just getting ready for the next election. I hope that Victor wins. Of course, I do! He's my boss. Anyway, be sure to talk to the townsfolk often. They may have interesting things to say.");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_398a575d", "How exciting! I'm so glad you could join us. Evidence, hm? I know exactly the people you should talk to to get such a thing. How about... well, this may or may not work, but there's a terminal in here somewhere with job registries. I'm new, so I really don't know where it is.");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_8080f094", "He's convinced you to do some dirty work, has he? That's unfortunate. I wish others would play fairly. Oh well. Let's see... I'm sure there's something in his office that'd be of use to you. And his teacher at the Commerce University might have something. Oh, I don't know... what else. Hm. He has an accountant as well. I'm out of ideas.");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_a80d9308", "Good luck!");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_b1103974", "Did that, still need to do that... Oh! I didn't see you there. The new election has created a huge work load for me! I'm practically oblivious to everything else. I'm Victor's secretary. I schedule his trips, meetings... just about everything! Are you going to vote for him? It's just so exciting! He has so many great changes in store for Bestine. You should speak with him and hear what he has to say.");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_b4ecef81", "Of course! Good bye!!");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_be0e4a12", "Thank you. Good bye.");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_c14a1c83", "Also, you can try the orphanage director. She volunteers at the hospital. And... there's a woman in the slums area you can speak with as well. I don't have direct locations for them. I'm sorry. I really hope this can help you! You only need one piece of evidence.");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_d0cb487a", "Okay, thank you very much!");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_d6ecfaf4", "Okay. Thank you.");
stringFiles[313].addEntry("s_e547fd1e", "Yeah?");

stringFiles[314] = new StringFile("conversation/lf_killmite");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (lf_killmite) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_156", "");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_159", "Hello!  Sorry to bother you, but do you have some time to check out a mite nest?");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_161", "I suppose I have the time.");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_164", "Thank you.  To the west is a giant bark mite cave.  I can show you where.  I need specimens.  Once you get there, I'll transmit the specimens that I need and how many of each. ");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_167", "I would be happy to help you out. ");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_169", "Excellent.  I am glad to see that someone supports science around here.  I'll transfer credits into your bank account as I get usable readings.  Hopefully I can get my hands on something extra special by the time you get back.");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_172", "And I'll get paid for this, I assume?");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_175", "Of course.  I cannot expect others to love science the way I do.  I'll transfer credits into your bank account as I get usable readings.  Perhaps I will get my hands on something extra special by the time you get back.");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_177", "Not right now.");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_180", "That's a shame.  Come back to me if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_183", "Maybe.  Would you tell me more about it?");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_185", "Bark mites!  Fascinating little creatures, but they absolutely destroy the greenery!  I recently found a mutant variant that may yield information that may lead to a chemical that will repel these insects.  ");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_188", "How did you fare?");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_191", "I got all the samples that you wanted.  Didn't you get my data transfers?  ");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_193", "Oh goodness.  Of course I did.  I'm a little scatterbrained these days.  Fantastic work.  Are you interested in science and engineering?");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_196", "Yes!  I love creating things.");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_199", "Wonderful!  I have this schematic for you then.  I'm not sure if it's your particular field, but it should be worth something.");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_201", "Actually, I prefer hunting.");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_204", "Well, we all have our paths to walk, don't we?  This should help you out while you hunt!");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_207", "I'm not done yet.");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_209", "Of course not.  I should know that by my notes.  Good luck with the rest of your hunting!");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_212", "I got lost.  Do you have the location of the cave?");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_215", "Certainly!  I know what you mean.  If I don't keep things perfectly organized, I can't find a darn thing.  ");
stringFiles[314].addEntry("s_217", "Hello!  It's good to see you again.");

stringFiles[315] = new StringFile("conversation/lf_safetyquestgiver");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (lf_safetyquestgiver) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_107", "");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_109", "I cannot believe how blasted nasty this place has become!");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_111", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_113", "You haven't noticed all the creatures and bandits swarming around outside of town?  It's so bad that you can't travel without a shuttle or a blaster rifle.  And my son has neither and is coming to visit soon.  I'm afraid for him.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_115", "I'd be happy to clear the way.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_117", "Thank you!  First thing, I need you to go thin out the worrt population.  Come back when you are done.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_119", "I'm not interested");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_121", "I wish you would reconsider.  If you do, come back and talk to me.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_123", "It isn't that bad!  I think the city is quite clean.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_125", "No no, not the city.  I'm talking about the wilderness.  If you live in a major city it's all right.  But if there's no shuttle port, traveling here is just dangerous.   And my son has neither and is coming to visit soon.  I'm afraid for him");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_127", "I'd be happy to help you make the area safer.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_129", "Great!  First thing, I need you to go thin out the worrt population.  Come back when you are done.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_131", "I'm not interested.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_134", "I wish you would reconsider.  If you do, please come back and talk to me.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_138", "Nasty?  Only if you are too weak to protect yourself.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_142", "You think so?  If you are so tough, I have a job for you then.  I want some of the dangerous creatures cleared out.  You strong enough for that?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_146", "Why not?  I could use the credits.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_150", "Great!  First thing, I need you to go thin out the worrt population.  Come back when you are done.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_154", "Nah.  Sounds too boring.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_158", "Guess you aren't as tough as you say you are.  If you change your mind, I'll be here.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_162", "How are you doing with the worrts? ");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_166", "I'm done.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_170", "Excellent!  Thanks for taking care of that.  I transferred some money credits into your bank account.  Come back and talk to me when you are ready for another job.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_174", "I'm not finished yet.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_178", "Well, I believe in you.  You can do it!");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_182", "Welcome back.  I have another assignment if you are willing.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_186", "Sure.  I'm always ready for a good fight.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_190", "There's an infestation of rills.  Please go kill 10 of them.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_194", "Sorry, I'm too busy right now.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_198", "Fine.  Come back when you have more free time.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_202", "How are you doing with the rills?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_206", "I'm not quite done yet.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_210", "Come back to me when you finish.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_214", "I finished what you wanted.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_218", "Fantastic!  I transferred a few credits to your account to offset your operating costs. Now,  I'm tracking down some information.  I'll have it in a moment or two if you don't mind waiting.  ");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_222", "Hello again!  Now that I know that you are an accomplished hunter, I can tell you about something that is far more serious and dangerous than the pests near the city.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_226", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_230", "About a week ago, a particularly nasty gang of thugs ambushed a caravan of people who were moving to the city.  There were... no survivors.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_233", "That's terrible!");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_236", "Yes.  While I know that getting the families' lost possessions back will not make up for the loss of their loved ones, at least it will help with their debts, and maybe give them something to remember their children by.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_238", "I will get the possessions back, if you want me to.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_241", "Thank you.  I know that they will appreciate this.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_244", "I'd rather not deal with this.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_246", "I thought better of you. But when you are done being afraid, come back to me.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_249", "And how does this affect me?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_252", "I want you to go after these bandits and get back what they stole.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_254", "Sure.  A little revenge is great with caf in the morning.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_257", "Thank you.  I'll see you when you get back.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_260", "Not now.  I'm tired.  I'll go after them tomorrow.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_262", "I thought better of you.  But if you must wait, then come back when you are ready.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_265", "Good.  I want to go after tougher prey.  Tell me more.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_268", "Have you found everything yet?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_270", "Not yet.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_273", "Ok.  I'm clearing some space in my transport for when you are done.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_276", "Yes.  Here they are.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_280", "This will be such a great help to them.  Thank you very much.  You deserve more, but this is all that I have for now.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_284", "Actually, I'm lost.  Can you give me that waypoint again?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_288", "Sure.  I'll copy that to you now.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_292", "Well, you seem to have stirred up a flewt nest!");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_296", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_300", "It looks like those bandits didn't take too kindly to your attack.  I hear that they started reappearing en force.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_304", "Hmm... guess I should encourage them to go back to hiding.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_308", "I think that their leader is the one that you really want.  Unfortunately, the leaders tend to be hard to find.  I'll bet one of those guys out there has some information that will lead you to the leader.  When you find it come back to me. ");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_312", "I don't really think I need to concern myself with them any more.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_316", "If you are now one of their targets, I don't think they will leave you alone.  If you change your mind, come back to me.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_320", "So?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_324", "Looks like you are now one of the bandits' targets.  If you don't want to have to watch your back every second, you should probably go do something about them.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_328", "I tend to watch my back anyway, but you're right.  I'll go take care of them.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_332", "I'll bet if you take out their leader, they will scatter.  I don't know where their leader is though.  I'll bet one of the bandits has some kind of information about their main camp on them.  Here's the latest information about their activity.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_336", "I have had enough of this.  I'm done!  No more brigands!");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_340", "For some reason I don't think they will respect your wishes.  But if you want to ignore them, it's your funeral.  Come back if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_342", "How did it go?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_344", "I haven't found anything yet.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_346", "There has to be something.  Good luck!");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_348", "Looks like this datapad has something useful.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_350", "Great!  Let me take a look at it... give me a moment.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_352", "I need the location again.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_354", "All right.  I'm copying the data to you now.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_356", "Welcome back.  Ready to squish a bug?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_358", "If you mean hunting down the brigand leader, then yes.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_360", "That's exactly what I mean.  Here is the location of the camp.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_362", "Yep.  Less competition for me...I mean, yes, of course.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_364", "Hm...less competition?  Well, if you leave innocent travelers alone, that's your life.  I just want this thug eliminated.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_366", "I have been hearing rumors, but nothing confirmed.  How is it going?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_368", "The leader was tough, but not impossible.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_370", "I'm glad the area is safe for travelers now.  Too many people died because of them.  Thank you from the bottom of my heart.  Take this.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_372", "They messed with the wrong person");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_374", "They did indeed, and I put my trust in the right one.  Too many good people died because of them.  Take this as thanks for the great service you did.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_376", "I took care of the leader.  I'm surprised that they were able to do as much damage as they did.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_378", "Yes, well...I guess their leader was better at organizing than fighting.  Many good people died because of him.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_380", "Not anymore.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_382", "No.  Not anymore.  You have certainly earned your reward. I already transferred 2000 credits into your bank account and this should help you in your travels.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_384", "I'm sure they did.  Now, about my reward?");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_386", "I already transferred 2000 credits into your bank account.  I also have this for you.  You did me a favor and I thank you for it.  But after this, I don't want to talk to you again. ");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_388", "I haven't gotten to the leader yet.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_390", "I guess the rumors were optimistic.  No matter, come back when you are done.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_392", "Actually, I need the location again.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_394", "It's a good thing I keep copies!  Here you are.");
stringFiles[315].addEntry("s_396", "Thanks again for all your help.");

stringFiles[316] = new StringFile("conversation/lifeday04a");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (lifeday04a) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_1d62f66a", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I understand. Sometimes we have to move around to escape persecution. You can find the celebration here.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_20268f64", "I think I'll pass. Thanks anyway.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_20e6f0a5", "Yes I am. Where can I find a Life Day gathering?");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_22d9b678", "I will give you a waypoint where some of my family have gathered to celebrate. Go there and they will welcome you with open arms. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_24e9b72b", "Greetings friend! You are just in time to join our Life Day celebrations.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_259ac319", "You're back. Were you unable to find the camp? ");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_2a85dd74", "I would like that. What do I do?");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_31160b7c", "Ah! A Wookiee cousin! Are you here to celebrate Life Day? ");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_311837be", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Ah! A Wookiee cousin! Are you here to celebrate Life Day? ");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_50a0c963", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Life Day is a traditional celebration on Kashyyyk, the Wookiee homeworld. I would tell you more, but it is best you experience a Life Day ceremony for yourself.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_5c9098df", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) You're back! I'm glad you were able to take part in our traditions. Be sure to spread the harmony of Life Day to all the beings you meet today.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_5e6b695f", "Life Day is a traditional celebration on Kashyyyk, the Wookiee homeworld. I would tell you more, but it is best you experience a Life Day ceremony for yourself.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_643fa34", "Life Day? What's that?");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_8fa670", "Yes. I need directions again.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_9f0658fa", "I understand. Sometimes we have to move around to escape persecution. You can find the celebration here.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_acf458b4", "Life Day? No thanks. I've got other things to do.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_ada83d27", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Greetings friend! You are just in time to join our Life Day celebrations.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_b3b91524", "That is too bad. If you change your mind be sure to find me.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_b3f5b52e", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) That is too bad. If you change your mind be sure to find me.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_da120aad", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) You're back. Were you unable to find the camp? ");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_dbcb339", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I will give you a waypoint where some of my family have gathered to celebrate. Go there and they will tell you more. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_df507d1d", "I will give you a waypoint where some of my family have gathered to celebrate. Go there and they will tell you more. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_efd79c75", "You're back! I'm glad you were able to take part in our traditions. Be sure to spread the harmony of Life Day to all the beings you meet today.");
stringFiles[316].addEntry("s_f9bf77a0", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I will give you a waypoint where some of my family have gathered to celebrate. Go there and they will welcome you with open arms. Happy Life Day to you.");

stringFiles[317] = new StringFile("conversation/lifeday04b");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (lifeday04b) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_352585ec", "I would like the Wookiee Life Day Robe.");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_52645cdc", "I would like another Life Day gift.");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_5bd07d67", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I'm sorry, This is a private gathering for family and friends. ");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_66b5743f", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) This is a gift that reflects our Wookiee heritage. We hope you will display your gift with pride and remember your time with us.");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_6cd2786a", "I think I will do this later.");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_8a712dbc", "Thank you. What do I do?");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_af9f8883", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) For those beings that have been a part of our community for at least thirty cycles, we have collected gifts to help you remember this day. ");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_afabf3ac", "What sort of gifts?");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_b85028af", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I hope you have learned something of our ways. Since you have not been with our community for thirty cycles, I do not have a gift for you, but I hope you will keep the spirit of Life Day alive in your heart and return to us next year.");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_b874dc09", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) You have spoken to those assembled and learned of our ways. Hopefully this day brings you closer to freedom and to harmony and to peace. May you hold Life Day as dear as we do. ");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_d8cde9a", "Speak with all those assembled to learn about our holiday. Once you have heard what we have to say, I will see if we can find a Life Day gift for you.");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_de3b1306", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Enjoy your gift. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_ebbd31aa", "I have learned a lot.");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_f0c65663", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Happy Life Day, friend! We are glad to have you celebrate with us.");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_f0f674e2", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Since you are one of our own, you have a choice. You may choose a traditional Life Day robe that may only be worn by Wookiees or you may receive another gift. ");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_fe83540d", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) It is good to see you again. Thank you for taking part in our celebration. We hope to see you next year. ");
stringFiles[317].addEntry("s_feeecf48", "I understand, but if you wait too long, the time will pass and you will have to wait until next year to join us. Be safe, friend.");

stringFiles[318] = new StringFile("conversation/lifeday04c");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (lifeday04c) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_1256a081", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Well it's a pleasure to see you again. Happy Life Day!");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_23ffb59b", "I hope you will take our tale and share it with others so that others may learn how to live each day to the fullest...and to not take their own freedom for granted.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_2461fa4f", "I hope you will. Regardless, remember to be thankful for life and all that comes with it. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_2bd71749", "Because of the Empire, we have learned to appreciate our freedom. We cannot take our lives for granted. Each sunrise, each childbirth, each breath is a renewal, a reminder that we must live each day to the fullest.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_4f6d5fb7", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I hope you will. Regardless, remember to be thankful for life and all that comes with it. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_554c5307", "No thank you.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_5d954138", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Take our tale and share it with others so that others may learn how to live each day to the fullest.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_68fe76c6", "I enjoyed our conversation earlier! Would you like to hear about the Renewal of Life again?");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_7a600ade", "Yes, please tell me again.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_7c4a57ee", "I've heard you work for the Empire. If that's true, you should reconsider your allegiances. You may be good but the higher up you go, the darker the world becomes.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_801a269f", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I've heard you work for the Empire. If that's true, you should reconsider your allegiances. You may be good but the higher up you go, the darker the world becomes.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_80535e5b", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Take our tale and share it with others so that others may learn how to live each day to the fullest...and to not take their own freedom for granted.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_8e0ee46c", "What has the Empire done to Wookiees?");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_9103b44a", "I will do that.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_959f717", "I see. Go on.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_96f85808", "You should speak to our Elder first. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_98c49a08", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) You should speak to our Elder first. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_a60b4b13", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I enjoyed our conversation earlier! Would you like to hear about the Renewal of Life again?");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_a6dbe2f8", "Well it's a pleasure to see you again. Happy Life Day!");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_a83b3c72", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I hope you will take our tale and share it with others so that others may learn how to live each day to the fullest and to not take their own freedom for granted.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_b8b7ef2b", "Yes. Go on.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_bd5e746e", "I'll consider your words.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_c1b5914b", "Renewal of Life. This is one of the goals of Life Day. Because of how the Empire has treated so many of our kind, this aspect of Life Day has taken on even greater meaning.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_cf3aa2f6", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I hope you will take our tale and share it with others so that others may learn how to live each day to the fullest...and to not take their own freedom for granted.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_d7baeead", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Thank you. Remember to celebrate your life and the lives of those around you. Happy Life Day.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_d84630ef", "Thank you. Remember to celebrate your life and the lives of those around you. Happy Life Day.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_efa923bc", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Life on our homeworld was simple and peaceful. We did not make war, nor were we a violent race. This made us easy targets for the Empire who desired our strength. Many were forced into labor camps. Some Wookiees were even forced to help build the Death Star.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_f25a4a72", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Renewal of Life. This is one of the goals of Life Day. Because of how the Empire has treated so many of our kind, this aspect of Life Day has taken on even greater meaning.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_f34ce8c", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Because of the Empire, we have learned to appreciate our freedom. We cannot take our lives for granted. Each sunrise, each childbirth, each breath is a renewal, a reminder that we must live each day to the fullest.");
stringFiles[318].addEntry("s_feb80338", "Life on our homeworld was simple and peaceful. We did not make war, nor were we a violent race. This made us easy targets for the Empire who desired our strength. Many were forced into labor camps. Some Wookiees were even forced to help build the Death Star.");

stringFiles[319] = new StringFile("conversation/lifeday04d");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (lifeday04d) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_1ad349e2", "The Life Day orb is a traditional part of our celebration. It shows a field of stars representing the afterlife. We beings of Kashyyyk believe that when we die that we walk off into the stars. ");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_207b1ae7", "You should speak with our Elder first. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_2b01ac4", "Well thank you for dropping by. Happy Life Day!");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_4ac9d09b", "We remember their sacrifices and deeds and the things that made us laugh. By remembering the dead we keep their memory alive and learn from the actions that came before. We use the Life Day orb to help us honor the fallen.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_611f31c3", "Sure, I'd be happy to hear about that again.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_6cdb10e7", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) You should speak with our Elder first. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_775904c7", "Life Day orb?");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_85a86bcd", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Hello again! Rememberance of those who came before us is my personal favorite part of Life Day. I love hearing about all the things our ancestors did. I'd be happy to tell you about it again if you'd like.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_9df9f74c", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) As you participate today, think of fallen comrades and family members who are no longer with us and use their lives as a lesson to improve your own. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_a1c6d00b", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Rememberance of loved ones lost. This is one of the major tenets of Life Day. We use this time to reflect on our ancestors and family members who are no longer among the living. ");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_a2945896", "That's ok, I'm familiar with that now.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_aec28b7d", "Hello again! Rememberance of those who came before us is my personal favorite part of Life Day. I love hearing about all the things our ancestors did. I'd be happy to tell you about it again if you'd like.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_b13f8480", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) The Life Day orb is a traditional part of our celebration. It shows a field of stars representing the afterlife. We beings of Kashyyyk believe that when we die that we walk off into the stars. ");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_bcbad5b7", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) We remember their sacrifices and deeds and the things that made us laugh. By remembering the dead we keep their memory alive and learn from the actions that came before. We use the Life Day orb to help us honor the fallen.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_be5f7807", "As you participate today, think of fallen comrades and family members who are no longer with us and use their lives as a lesson to improve your own. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_d0729692", "Rememberance of loved ones lost. This is one of the major tenets of Life Day. We use this time to reflect on our ancestors and family members who are no longer among the living. ");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_dc4149ee", "I understand. Go on.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_e26d0d6", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Always remember to think of fallen comrades and family members who are no longer with us and use their lives as a lesson to improve your own. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_e2e3c7bb", "Always remember to think of fallen comrades and family members who are no longer with us and use their lives as a lesson to improve your own. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_edb238bc", "Go on.");
stringFiles[319].addEntry("s_fd38d370", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Well thank you for dropping by. Happy Life Day!");

stringFiles[320] = new StringFile("conversation/lifeday04e");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (lifeday04e) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_14a2757a", "The concepts of Life Day are universal in nature. Many who have learned of Life Day have begun to celebrate it on their own worlds. It is our hope that you will too.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_187a402b", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Thanks for taking part in our festivities! Would you like to hear about origins of Life Day again?");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_1cb72c3b", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) It was a pleasure to see you again. Happy Life Day!");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_2110a567", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) The concepts of Life Day are universal in nature. Many who have learned of Life Day have begun to celebrate it on their own worlds. It is our hope that you will too.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_2132a975", "Thanks for taking part in our festivities! Would you like to hear about origins of Life Day again?");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_27f05082", "I will let the others here tell you. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_29cc9282", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) I will let the others here tell you. Happy Life Day to you.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_3c9de914", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Life Day began as a holiday celebrated only by us Wookiees, but it has since grown beyond the borders of Kashyyyk. ");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_44e56600", "It was a pleasure to see you again. Happy Life Day!");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_467df5bd", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) It is important to us to be home for Life Day. It is not unusual for a Wookiee to brave many hardships to get home to celebrate at the Tree of Life.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_522fbbf4", "It is important to us to be home for Life Day. It is not unusual for a Wookiee to brave many hardships to get home to celebrate at the Tree of Life.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_533ce9b7", "How is Life Day celebrated on your world?");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_9c6c907c", "No thanks, just thought I'd say hello again.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_9cd35fb9", "Because of the Empire, it is not safe. Some will still elude the Empire and return, but for now, we do what we can.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_a104d858", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) You should speak with our Elder first.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_ac89961b", "Life Day began as a holiday celebrated only by us Wookiees, but it has since grown beyond the borders of Kashyyyk. ");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_ae4c104", "You should speak with our Elder first.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_b84f1c5d", "But you are not on your homeworld now. Why?");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_cc720b6", "(Translated from Shyriiwook) Because of the Empire, it is not safe. Some will still elude the Empire and return, but for now, we do what we can.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_f4a3b496", "Sure, tell me about Life Day again.");
stringFiles[320].addEntry("s_f9a62733", "What else can you tell me?");

stringFiles[321] = new StringFile("conversation/lilas_dinhint");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (lilas_dinhint) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_1042bed3", "Here you are. I'm glad to help Mr. Trenwell and in this small way repay his generosity to the museum.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_1057c81b", "Try Mos Eisley to find Kahfr Oladi. You'll probably find her near the bank.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_147d9a5b", "What I ask is that you seek out the artists we are considering and learn of their work. Then return to me and let me know which of them you preferred. Three artists are involved. I can tell you where to find them if you'd like?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_1aabf4f7", "I hope you enjoy your visit. Take your time and wander through our collection. It's still not as large as I'd like, but I'm working on that.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_23b5bcf", "Giaal Itotr calls Mos Espa home, and you'll usually find him in front of the hotel.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_26152411", "Yes, I'd love to help.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_26c02ad3", "I'm back for the testimonial for Sean Trenwell you had offered..");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_2ecc437c", "Where should I look for Kahfr Oladi?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_35487421", "We'll being looking in less than a week for the next work of art to be featured in the museum.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_36cff745", "Boulo Siesi is in Wayfar. She's usually by the cantina.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_375a5dc0", "Thank you for taking part in our contest. Check back when the event ends to see who won. Note that the event is 15 days from beginning to end and that the winning work of art will be on display for 30 days. That 30 days includes the 15 days between events as well as the 15 days of the next event. Thanks again!");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_3960dc15", "Ah good. Which artist stood out as your favorite?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_39a4e8fa", "Where can I find Boulo Siesi?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_3f115c47", "Oh. That's too much for me. No thank you.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_400d075", "Look for a small square near the Lucky Despot, and you'll find Vanvi Hotne in that area.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_4443365b", "I think I'll pick Boulo Siesi.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_463a0bda", "Um... nevermind. I'm not interested in this.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_47df8332", "Yes, please. How much does one cost?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_486f6", "I'm asking for a modest... ahem... donation to the museum of 48,000 credits in exchange for the schematic. Oh, and I should warn you that some knowledge of advanced furniture production is required.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_4f010def", "It would seem that you have no room in your inventory to hold this datapad with my testimonial. I'm afraid you'll have to make some room before I can give it to you. Please speak to me again after you've done that.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_4f049f4e", "In just a few hours we'll start the search for our next featured artwork.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_519f72a3", "There's still more than a day before the search for our next featured work of art begins.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_537ad9f6", "I already voted.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_5492284e", "Thank you for taking part.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_55773f3", "Definitely Klepa Laeel.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_55e840b3", "How will I find Klepa Laeel?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_5bc37444", "It will be less than a day before we begin looking for another work of art that we'll feature here the museum.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_5bd69df6", "What do you need me to do?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_5d4aadf9", "Hello and welcome to the Bestine Museum. Would you like to purchase a schematic of our featured artwork?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_605d9185", "Hello and welcome to the Bestine Museum. I hope you enjoy your visit. While I've got your ear, you should know that we are currently seeking a new work of art to feature. Would you like to help?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_67026fa8", "Look near the back of the theater in Mos Entha to find Kolka Zteht.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_68c6c699", "You'll find Klepa Laeel in Mos Espa. He's often found towards the back of the starport.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_6b5b28b2", "No thank you. I'm just here to visit the museum.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_6d1148d8", "Would you be willing to put that in writing so I could share your opinion with the governor?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_6dbeccc3", "We'll begin the search for another featured work of art within the hour.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_71561c79", "Ah, of course. I remember you now. I have everything prepared and loaded onto this datapad that you can show to Mrs. Aryon.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_7312fa13", "Excellent. Once per month, I wish to feature a new work of art here at the museum. We have a fine permanent collection on display, as always, but it is my desire to enhance that collection by offering something new from time to time. To that end, we select a small number of artists and approach them with the chance of having their art featured here in Bestine.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_7552be07", "Oh, whatever. I'm leaving.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_7882a978", "[Smiling] Excellent. Now, where did I leave those. Oh yes, here they are. Thank you for supporting the arts.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_7b488371", "Indeed, I would be quite happy to do exactly that. I'll load that into this datapad that you can then take to Mrs. Aryon.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_7c297430", "Mr. Trenwell? Yes, of course. Many of our latest additions and newest programs have only been possible thanks to funding provided by the efforts of Mr. Trenwell. His large personal contributions - both in time and money - have been generous beyond expectations.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_82761006", "Tell me where to find Vanvi Hotne.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_8338587c", "The pleasure is all mine. Return after speaking to the artists. Farewell.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_84e3c8d2", "I've decided on Kahfr Oladi.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_8b3d6e46", "Can you tell me anything about Sean Trenwell?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_8ed85f40", "I see, well thank you for visiting the museum.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_90b0871f", "I'll take one.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_911a27f8", "I'm ready to tell you which artist I choose.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_9558d37a", "How long until you look for another work of art to feature?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_9c595e48", "I hope you enjoy your visit.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_a9f1e0f9", "Oh, it'll be more than a week before we begin the search for our next featured work of art.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_aaa43f7b", "Hello and welcome to the Bestine Museum.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_b67247f1", "Perfect, thank you!");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_b824fcc0", "I choose Kolka Zteht.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_b9059b2b", "I think I've got it. Thanks!");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_bea3d11", "Where is Giaal Itotr?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_c1f9104", "Where will I find Kolka Zteht?");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_c845a58c", "It would appear that you are unable to carry it. Please return after you made some space in your inventory.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_c8e54945", "I'm afraid you don't have enough credits, and I must insist on the donation. Please return when you have more funds available.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_cccdca43", " I hope you enjoy your visit. Feel free to look around.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_ce4aa2ab", "I think I prefer Giaal Itottr.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_d543ced9", "No thank you. I'm simply wandering through.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_d9e04161", "There are only a few days left before we begin looking for the next work of art for us to feature.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_e09f0f8", "I liked Vanvi Hotne.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_e649bf0a", "I would like to purchase a schematic of the current featured work of art.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_eb35002", "Ah... yes. Okay than.");
stringFiles[321].addEntry("s_fb2eead4", "Very well. Thank you for visiting the museum.");

stringFiles[322] = new StringFile("conversation/lok_rebel_trainer_2");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (lok_rebel_trainer_2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_10221765", "The intelligence department believes that they may be planning to use Lok as a staging area to attack or blockade Corellia.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_105c0da2", "Vrak arranged a meeting with a hacker in Dantooine.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_106f742d", "Just who I wanted to see. Glad you are here, %NU. As you may have heard, we managed to get some information out of the kidnapped officer. We have spent the last few days executing many successful raids against the Imperial fleet, thanks to this information. We have also tracked down the person who set you up.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_11ba5f1a", "Good. I knew you would. Show them what you're made of %NU!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_122e5dd7", "It's the little victories that will win us this war, dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_129e1011", "Some people may call him a pirate, and he doesn't exactly follow the laws of the Empire but neither do we, mm? In times like these, we need all the help we can get. Lord Nym is actually a nice person once you get to know him.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_12b3896", "Greetings %NU. Did you meet up with the smuggler?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1358322c", "No problem. See you soon.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_137a1cc5", "Good. I want another chance at this.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_14123c8b", "Are you one of Lord Nym's employees?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_14183b8e", "Alright sweetie, don't take too long though, we could really use your help.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_14310e04", "Yes milady, it seems he can assist us.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_14791132", "Well if you're sure you don't need to rest, fix your ship or anything like that, we have some duties that could use your attention dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_148ee1c2", "What are you doing here? I heard that you were working for a different part of the Alliance Navy.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_14fcd38b", "I don't know what you're doing here, but I'm certain that you shouldn't be talking to me.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_15250124", "Greetings %TU. My name is Viopa. I function as the Alliance's go-between for the Rebellion and Lord Nym, the pirate who owns this palace. You have been sent here as a starship pilot to help us with some of the many tasks we undertake in the Lok System, am I right?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1583743c", "Do you have any missions I could fly?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_163272c2", "Oh. Well, come back soon, dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_165db597", "I want mission 1.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_16d870fe", "Consider it done.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_17653741", "All right, sweetie. Don't take too long, though. We could really use your help.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_17e79a2c", "Any advance payment? Okay fine, what do you need done?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1813f9b", "I'm ready milady.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_194e698d", "All right, %NU. I'll see if I can reschedule the meeting with the smuggler. Come back soon for a update.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1cb5d5fd", "I heard about your misfortune, dear. But don't fret; luck is with us. It appears the shuttle that slipped out of your grasp was a decoy. We have another opportunity.The enemy may be on his guard this time, so be careful %NU.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1d34c320", "Piece of cake. There was the matter of payment. I believe?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1d85385d", "I can't do it. He's too heavily guarded.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1dcfe231", "Hmm. I will see if we can reschedule the meeting. Do hurry back dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1df58e48", "Do I get to keep the loot? I mean, I'm ready.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1dfeca09", "I've been itching to take down some TIE fighters.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1eaa0d45", "Great, sweetie, I'm sure you'll have better luck this time. Be careful up there. The new coordinates should be uploaded to your nav computer by the time you reach your ship. ");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_1ec75f6d", "I'll live with it. Let me show these goons how it's done.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_20b704e7", "Not right now. I have to attend to a few things.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_21e0c701", "I hope this pays well. I am the best you've got, after all.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_232c0049", "Vrak seemed sure that he could do it.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_258ff649", "Good to see you again dear. You are just in time too, we have a opportunity we can't miss that require your superior skills.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_25fcc7b2", "I'm off.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_27101a28", "I don't have time now. I'll be back.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_27a9d3e4", "I don't think I need it, milady. Is there anything I can do?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_2817ec90", "I don't know!  But there's got to be some way for you to improve your standing with the Rebel Alliance!  You've got to try, %NU.  We need you!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_2af8de7c", "Yeah it will give you the chance to try the Pirate lifestyle for a day sweetie. You will get more information up in space. Good luck dear!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_2baec20", "I like this palace too, %NU, but your services are urgently required elsewhere. Get out there and show them why you are my favorite pilot.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_2c95410e", "All right. But do hurry, dear. It won't be there for long.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_2ccdbfbb", "I'm afraid I can't right now though, milady.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_2d07d661", "We've narrowed it down to Vrak, the smuggler that set up the meeting with the hacker. After our successful attacks on the Imperial fleet, the Empire has rerouted their ships and we are curious what Vrak might know. Would you go have a chat with him, dear?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_2f0a6ba8", "What could these dregs possibly teach me?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_307dbfe0", "Good. I won't let him slip away this time!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_3209cb6f", "I knew there was something I forgot!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_334b8b3a", "No one told me I would work under a woman.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_3406294f", "Glad to have you back in one piece, %NU. We received word from the hacker. He's sent coordinates for a new rendezvous.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_359d1c6c", "I'm ready, milady.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_35e906c1", "Fine. I don't really have anything to do right now anyway.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_3769a087", "I don't agree. But maybe another opportunity will come your way, when you are feeling more confident. Don't stay away too long, dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_37e5c8bc", "Very well. Escort mission in Dantooine sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_386d56a1", "Excellent, excellent. He doesn't know that we are onto him, so he should still be in the cantina in Tyrena. Good luck, dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_3892fde6", "Sure did. He was a weird fellow.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_38aeb877", "Oh I was just passing by. I can't help right now.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_38f4aa90", "I will do more than talk to him.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_39e697de", "Whatever you say.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_3a42c050", "What can I do to help, milady?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_3ae0bba3", "The data included several references to one certain Imperial officer. We are in luck. We located him a few days ago. Now we have a couple of spies onboard his shuttle. We want to kidnap him so that we can learn more about what the Empire's plans really are.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_3c4ff185", "Reactor Engineering Algorithms");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_3e303b17", "We need your help to destroy the shuttle's escort and disable it so that our men can overpower the crew and bring the Imperial officer to us.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_3e4a658", "No. Something came up. I can't right now.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_4104f818", "My dear, you are in big trouble.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_41ee99fd", "He's set up a meeting with a hacker in Dantooine.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_4212435c", "Fine. What tasks are available right now?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_422f9bfa", "Are you one of Nym's employees?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_42b39212", "Bah, I want some more action. Any duties?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_438969d3", "Well life is just full of pleasant surprises like that. Now we have a lot of things for a skilled pilot to do. Are you ready to get started?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_43fbe907", "We have some more duties around Lok that could use some attention. But if you have something better to do...");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_44170670", "Not for nothing, dear. You still struck a blow against the Empire - and every little bit counts. We are trying to figure out where the rest of the fleet took off to now so be ready, we will need your help soon again.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_44dd253a", "That's such a rude thing to say. Some people may call him a pirate, and he doesn't exactly follow the laws of the Empire but neither do we, mm? In times like these, we need all the help we can get. Lord Nym is actually a nice person once you get to know him.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_45bb907e", "Not right now, I want to get up there and earn some creds. Any duties?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_4a44213c", "Alright. So what do we do now?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_4acb55cd", "Excellent, what do we need to do?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_4af0c602", "We are trying to figure out where the rest of the fleet went. Stand by, we will need your help again. Fantastic job up there sweetie, as always.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_4bf53cea", "Thank you, milady. It was close, but the hacker came through for us.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_4c1dac60", "Hold on, what choices did I have again?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_4ca03ddb", "How so?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_4ee75073", "He thought that you looked ready to learn one of the following skills.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5064a71e", "We haven't approached him yet. I figured you would like to talk to him yourself.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_506ee957", "You're too late, %NU. The Imperial fleet has arrived! Strangely enough, it doesn't seem that large though. Nevertheless, we need you up in space now, dear!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_507b9d02", "Excellent %NU. Good luck and see you soon!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_50dbe32c", "You sound like you've spent too much time in the palace already, my friend. Though I can't deny that working here has certain... privileges. I'm sure you will fit right in. Now we have plenty of tasks for you. Ready to work?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5164f707", "Yes indeed, dear, you've earned it. Come back when you are ready.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5300757c", "Ack! We really need to find out if he knows something. Please hurry back, %NU.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_531fb93c", "I can't right now. My ship took a beating. I have to fix it.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_53e43cdb", "Ohh %NU, great to see you! One of Nym's pilots said he saw great skill in you and thought that you may be ready to learn some new tricks, if you would like to?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_54179ba5", "This is not good. What can we do milady?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_54e06202", "Sounds good, %NU. We'll be ready when you come back.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_55ad580f", "Do that.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_56285e36", "All right. What's the plan?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_565951d5", "Lord Nym has asked for our help in stealing some Corsair ships. We have some smugglers that require an escort through Imperial areas and we have the chance to strike a blow to the Empire by attacking some of their patrols. We want you to assist with these duties until you feel you have enough experience to proceed with training but they are strictly volunteer assignments and can be aborted at any time.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5884fe0d", "Good to see you, dear. It saddens me, but I'm afraid you have been transferred to another member of the Alliance.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_596a74ca", "Then I have just the remedy dear. Proceed up to orbit and you will get more information. Be careful out there sweetie.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5a954a3f", "Excellent choice. When you are ready, come back to me. We have much to do still.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5aa92dc4", "Hi, sweetie. Ready to help out with some duties?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5ac3c20d", "Can you remind me where he is?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5b7c65e8", "How did I ever manage without you, sweetie? I'll let the technicians know what you need. Do be careful though, my dear, this all seems a bit too easy.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5be79320", "That is great news. Who was it?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5c191b57", "Oh I'm so sorry. Enjoy your stay at Lord Nym's palace then.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5e28b657", "I will be off at once, milady. My apologies.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5e9e1660", "Sounds like you have it covered. I have some things I need to do.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_5ee66c06", "Lovely! Be careful and see you soon, dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_61e761a4", "Fantastic job, %NU! You managed to get the data, even though the ship was already repaired. I'm very impressed. This little bonus doesn't begin to reflect what you did for us, but it's all I can give you at the moment.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6258192a", "All right. See you later, then.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6280da8c", "All right. I hope this hacker is good. We've had no success so far.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_62d83905", "Excellent. I will have a copy of the data uploaded to your ship's computer. Good luck, dear!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_62fa8365", "I really think you are overreacting, my friend. This is war and Nym is good ally. His help is invaluable in the fight against the Empire.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_64370a0d", "There you are, %NU. Did you find Vrak?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_64b6ea44", "I want mission 2.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_65316548", "Can't these 'space pirates' do something by themselves?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_65c36194", "On second thought, no.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_65f334d5", "Yes milady, so I've been told.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_662d6c41", "I have some bad news, dear. It appears this was not the heart of the Imperial fleet at all. They received a diversion order to another system. We are tracking it down right now. This part of the fleet just didn't get the order in time and decided to try and make it to the Imperial outpost instead.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_66418240", "Of course. What is my mission?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_668e43a2", "I will miss you, milady...");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_66c9d146", "Be careful, dear. See you soon!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6752d582", "Well, we do have some duties around Lok. We could use your invaluable assistance, %NU.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_697b5183", "I hope you give him what he deserves. I will be back.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6a43381d", "I understand. I really think your skills are more than sufficient to pull this off though, %NU.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6ab7832d", "All right. What should I do in the meantime?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6b158a0e", "I'm a Developer/Tester and want missions.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6bb0cb94", "Correct.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6bb4b597", "Do hurry back though, sweetie. This is quite important.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6bcf16a1", "Excellent. I'll have the technicians upload the coordinates to your nav computer. I hope everything goes well this time, dear. Take well care of yourself.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6c130469", "Oh, but of course, my dear. Get some rest while we analyze the data and come back when you are ready for some action.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6c7c317", "Well, let's just say that some of Nym's employees can be a little less than dependable at times - especially unsupervised in a cantina. I need someone I can trust completely.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6e6242ff", "That's an understatement. All right, I'll do it. Where is he?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6e92867a", "I have to repair my ship.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6e943bb6", "I will give it another try!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_6fad62ec", "No problem. Time to spend this bonus. See you around, lady!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_71350221", "Fantastic! I will have the intelligence department analyze the information right away. You should get some rest and come back when you're ready for some more action.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_71a5deee", "No worries sweetie but please hurry, that Imperial fleet is getting closer every day.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_723b4288", "He should be entering the Lok system any moment now. I will have the coordinates uploaded to your ship's nav computer. Be careful, dear. We know how important this operation is to the Empire, so he will probably be well guarded. Good luck %NU. Come back to me in one piece.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_72b581a2", "Well, we could really use your help on this, dear. Please come back soon.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_7348150", "We don't need that kind of ignorance in the Rebellion. I do hope you come to your senses.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_73ccefde", "Space Combat Techniques");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_746fda15", "See you soon, then.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_74a4f762", "That sounds likely. What can I do to help?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_7577882", "Lord Nym has asked for our help in stealing some Corsair ships. We have some smugglers that need an escort through Imperial areas and the chance to strike a blow to the Empire by attacking some of their patrols. We want you to assist with these duties until you feel you have enough experience to proceed with training but they are voluntarily only and can be aborted at any time.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_75e5035c", "The Imperial fleet seems to protect a Kuat driveyard freighter. It is on its way to the Imperial outpost station. You must make sure that it does not reach that station, %NU!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_780265b8", "This sounds a bit complicated. I need to do some preparation first.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_7977cca8", "Great, it's been a madhouse up there lately so be careful sweetie.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_79f026e1", "I suppose you could be right. I will give it another shot.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_7ac528cc", "Yes, milady. What do you have for me?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_809dbad9", "Fine, I'll give it another chance.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_80b2d7f9", "It would be my pleasure.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_8125c052", "Working for Nym! This should finally give some decent creds.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_816055e2", "I want mission 4.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_8204eb26", "Oh of course not, my dear. I need someone I trust, though. Some of Nym's employees are not really that dependable at times.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_826d3c9d", "It's heavily encrypted, so we are not sure, %NU. I will let you know as soon as I find out more.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_8447c7d7", "Great! It's been a madhouse up there lately so be careful sweetie.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_8be640b8", "Sure.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_8c839067", "Very well. Inspect mission in Lok sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_902e7f6f", "Vrak set up a meeting with a hacker in Dantooine.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_91156160", "Recovery duty.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_9199b1bf", "All right, sweetie. Don't be a stranger.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_92199b82", "Excellent. He's agreed to meet a contact of ours on Corellia. His name is Vrak and he will be waiting in the cantina of Tyrena. Do be careful, dear. I've found out that the Empire is scouring the galaxy for the data you stole. It must be terribly important.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_92ddd562", "You are sure of this?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_933e5758", "Oh, I'm not blaming you, dear. I know you did your best. Now, about the Imperial fleet. It seems that they are protecting a Kuat freighter. It's on its way to the Imperial outpost station now. You have to prevent it from reaching its destination, %NU! I have taken the liberty of uploading intercept coordinates to your ship. If you don't find him there, search the nearby area and wait for him.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_937eedf9", "Yes, milady.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_93c107c0", "I understand, dear. I will let Vrak know that you will be a little late.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_9417b6d9", "A splendid performance as always, my dear %NU. Our intelligence department is interrogating the officer now. Hopefully we will find out soon what's going on. You should get some rest in the meantime.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_94558476", "Who knows. Anyway, he wants me to take the data there.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_954c43bb", "Escort duty.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_95a207fe", "Alright, what do you need help with, milady?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_95cc4d4e", "I would like some training, what can he teach me?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_960afa57", "I know you won't, my dear. I've uploaded the new location to your nav computer.Hurry!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_97682590", "Oh nothing. Anyway, he's arranged a meeting with a hacker.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_97bbc2e4", "I suppose. All right, you said you had some things for me to do?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_97f6ca14", "I see. All right, where do I find him?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_98672851", "I think I'd be better off with gigs I know would pay well. See ya!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_98bb41ea", "Indeed.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_98d991e7", "Weapons B, Intermediate Alliance Starship Ordnance");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_990019e5", "Sorry. Fresh out of missions right now. Why don't you try talking to your commanding officer?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_99210986", "Very well. Destroy mission in Lok sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_9990d560", "What is the Alliance doing with Nym? Isn't he a pirate?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_9b2edf50", "I will do my best, milady.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_9b82774b", "Yes, I'll be back later.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_9be51847", "I don't have time right now. I'll be back.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_9c24c239", "I won't fail again!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_9c5793bd", "I understand, %NU. But hurry! That Imperial fleet is getting closer every day.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_9d418971", "I'm sorry, milady. You must have me mistaken for someone else.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_9d922723", "I don't have any missions right now, but I do have some elective duty tasks that you might be interested in. What do you think, sweetie?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a043fbc6", "See? It's that charm I will miss so much. You are to meet with Lieutenant Colonel Aqzow on Yavin. You can find him in the labor outpost on the moon Yavin 4. Don't be a stranger, %NU. I've really enjoyed our time together.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a0ee0d37", "Yes. It will give you the chance to try the pirate lifestyle for a day, sweetie. You will receive more information once you're up in space. Good luck dear!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a1062586", "All right, good. Are you planning to meet him in Dantooine with a copy of the data?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a333c9dd", "I hope I won't be reporting to another woman.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a3790fac", "I hope you are correct %NU and I hope you can beat their rescue team to the ship. I've taken the liberty to update your ships droid with the coordinates. Good luck!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a3c6ae82", "I was so worried when I heard about the attacks on you, %NU! We suspect that someone told the Empire about your rendezvous. We are trying to figure out who the traitor is now. Anyway, I'm so glad to have you back in one piece.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a3de93c4", "Excellent. I will have a copy of the data uploaded to your ship's computer as soon as you are ready to take off, my dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a4ab00c9", "Excellent. I will have a copy of the data uploaded to your ship's computer as soon as you are ready to take off, dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a65cd6cc", "But...");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a6e1c30a", "Very well, what does this pilot think he can 'teach' me?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a78a4ac3", "What do I do now?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a98b1cf0", "Please hurry back, dear. We want to intercept the fleet before they reach the Lok system.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_a99ad4e8", "Sounds easy enough. Where do I find them?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_aa3d7ff6", "I just remembered something I have to do. See you around!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ab3a1cf4", "Does Lord Nym know that you are in here?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ad5cafda", "I sure hope so %NU. You are always sorely missed when you are not around.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ae5a02a8", "Indeed you are. Unfortunately, our budget is a bit limited, as you may have noticed. I'm sure you'll find the rewards sufficient though, in terms of excitement, if nothing else.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_af173f89", "All right. Hurry, though. Time is running out, dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b02ee4b4", "I'm sure you have important things to attend to, then. Sorry to interrupt you.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b0d973e8", "Sad indeed, I had high hopes for you %TU. Good luck in your adventures, maybe I'll see you some day again.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b125bfdc", "Then you should probably not be here.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b1cac9ab", "Hurry dear. That freighter is getting closer by the minute!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b1f9f1bc", "That's right. Unfortunately, I have some things to fix first.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b2335add", "Ohh good to see you, %NU, I need your help. The data you retrieved earlier has proven impossible to decipher. Fortunately, Nym knows of a smuggler that specializes in these kind of predicaments.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b24f64b", "I know you will, dear. I've taken the liberty of uploading intercept coordinates to your ship. If the freighter is not there when you arrive, search the nearby area and wait him out. He will surely pass through those coordinates. Be careful, %NU.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b2683b4a", "Piece of cake.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b2e9f5b5", "Maybe so. but the Empire is searching the galaxy for this data, so you have to be careful. Trust no one, dear. What did you find out?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b3a02be2", "What are you doing here, %TU? I heard you were working for a different part of the Alliance Navy. It's a shame, I could have used a skilled pilot like you.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b3a81c54", "No of course not silly, except maybe a drink in the cantina on some off duty night. Are you interested?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b3a90c9", "Hurry back, we only have this opportunity for a limited time and I would hate to be forced to use the second best pilot in the palace and not you.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b3f9c754", "He seemed very nervous. Maybe just a profession trait.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b59feb8d", "You could say that again. I can't right now, though.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b6af2b98", "I want mission 3.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b838d4b8", "We only have a short time left to intercept it, %NU. Please hurry back!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b862718f", "I'm not going back up there again. It's suicide.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b8cf1532", "Well, I can't do that right now.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_b9f9d416", "If the ship is still in the vicinity, try to disable it and access its data.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ba9fbf52", "You're so charming, dear. I was hoping you could travel to the smuggler and acquire his services for us.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_bbb72231", "Alright dear. Please hurry back. We don't have much time.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_bbed8565", "Hurry %NU. Get back up there! We can still keep the freighter from reaching the outpost!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_bc44d715", "I did not think you were so close-minded, %TU. Hopefully you'll find a spot better suited for you somewhere else in the Rebellion. Farewell.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_bcff0c86", "I thought you were a respected pilot of the Alliance, not a mercenary. Even so, I'm sure you would find the compensation adequate and the experience thrilling.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_bfd9eed6", "Of course. I just have a lot of important things to do!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c0422a2", "I hope so, sweetie. Good luck!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c100d375", "Don't act like it was my fault. I got here as fast as I could.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c103ad7e", "Hmm. Okay, I guess it's a necessity. What do you need me to do?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c13b1925", "Nonsense! There's nothing you can't do, dear. I've seen you overcome the impossible before. Come back when you are ready!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c149497f", "Is everything all right, my dear? You're not one to forget important things.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c1c28382", "I can't right now, milady. I will be back.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c3c23cef", "All right, sweetie. See you soon I hope.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c3e498de", "I think you overestimate me, milady.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c4ecbd2f", "Of course. What will you do with it?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c532ad1c", "Splendid, dear. He doesn't know we're onto him, so hopefully he will still be in the cantina in Tyrena.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c6b08612", "What did they figure out?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c6c91897", "Multi-Role Craft");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c6f65083", "He's no better than the Empire. I'm out of here!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c8427191", "Yes. I'm ready to leave anytime.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c84e7a8", "Why me? I'm a pilot.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c8c2d2ea", "I was just stopping by to say hi; I have to get going.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c91bccf0", "Well, apparently an Imperial shuttle has broken down near the Trade Federation route. It might be carrying some valuable information, so we want you to hurry there before they complete their repair. Attach a spy droid. It will transfer the shuttle's data to your ship.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c942a6c8", "Sorry, but I can't right now. I have some things I need to do.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_c9d58564", "Excellent. I will let Vrak know that you will be a little late.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ca434bbe", "Then I can help you scratch that itch, dear. Get up in orbit; you will get more information once you are there. Be careful out there, sweetie.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ca7b758d", "I don't know about that drink but okay, what can this pilot teach me?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_caf0502c", "This is what you want to learn?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_cafeab9", "He's agreed to meet a contact of ours on Corellia. His name is Vrak and he will be waiting in the cantina of Tyrena. Do be careful, dear. I've learned that the Empire is scouring the galaxy for the data you stole. It must be very important.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_cb3507f", "Err, I just remembered I have some things to do.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_cbd8ba35", "Excellent, I knew I could count on you %NU. I've uploaded the new coordinates to your nav computer. Hurry up there!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ccd0caab", "In Tyrena on Corellia, dear, in the cantina.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_cd1a5817", "I have some quick things I need to fix first. I will be back.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_cd3e2b38", "I'll help some of our smugglers sneak by the Empire.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ce671a71", "Thank you, milady. I will be back soon.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_cf884764", "I hope you flayed him and fed him to the Kimogilas!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d0299d36", "Greetings %NU. Did you meet with the smuggler?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d08d9709", "What should I do if they have already repaired it?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d0b37ad2", "Okay okay! What needs to be done?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d14eedc8", "Of course. Where can I find him?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d17c64f9", "I can't right now - but I will be back soon.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d21eee5e", "Fine. Let me show these goons how it's done.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d356f8d", "I don't mean to overstep my bounds, but I believe that you have obligations elsewhere. Finish up, and then we can talk.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d5693494", "All right. Hurry though, dear. This hacker seems rather nervous. I don't want him to change his mind.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d5ff7cb2", "Yes, definitely.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d64bce73", "Sounds good %NU. We'll be ready when you come back.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d6d2881d", "I'm not an errand boy.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d70d3929", "I'm so glad I can always count on you, sweetie. I was hoping you could travel to the smuggler and acquire his services for us.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d88c653e", "Are you sure?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_d8fef41", "Perhaps not...");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_da77c355", "Sounds good. What can I do?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_db065042", "Well I won't stand for it, I'm going to ask to be reassigned.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_db82fc61", "Sounds bad. I will be back as soon as I can to help out.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_db9d43d", "Thank you, milady. So what was the data?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_dc7c029d", "I can't right now, I'm afraid. I will be back, though.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_dce7fb", "If he knows anything, I will get it out of him.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_dcec6e65", "So all that for nothing?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_dd8c097b", "You've been grounded.  The intelligence department delivered a scathing report on you.  It's terrible!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_dede1eae", "Do I have to pay them for the training?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e00ac98e", "What happened?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e02126d9", "Stealing some Corsair ships sounds like fun.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e0d2df48", "What would be the point of invading this sandbox?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e2539e81", "On second thought, I've heard that Nym is pretty greedy.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e2ad7a0d", "Maybe I should get some rest. See you soon.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e2b5ea1a", "I will be back later. I have some things I need to address.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e4b3375d", "No, something came up. I can't right now.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e4daa04e", "We need your help with something, %NU, so hurry back, please.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e53c5017", "What mission do you want?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e565e3d3", "What duties are available, milady?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e57d94c7", "Welcome back dear. I heard what happened. The good news is that we have a second chance.The officer's shuttle seems to have malfunctioned. It's slowed him down considerably.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e58d7043", "Excellent. I'm certain that I will enjoy getting to know you as we work together %NU. We have a few duties that could use your expertise my friend, are you ready to get started?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e6569c04", "Very well. Recovery mission in Lok sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e67149f", "I have had the new coordinates uploaded to your ship. Go get 'em, %NU!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e7b6dca1", "It seems to include the ship routes of several Imperial ships that are moving toward Lok. It's disturbing indeed. Lord Nym fears that they may be planning to take over Lok.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e811b51e", "I need the Imperial data.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e84d85e2", "Sounds great.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e87a40f8", "I'd rather not right now.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e942aa77", "Welcome back, sweetie. The intelligence department has finished analyzing the encrypted data. It's still a bit vague.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_e9c1932", "I'm sorry, I can't right now. I'll be back.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_eaf03b41", "Such confidence. How can I NOT like you? Even though your abilities indeed are extraordinary, one can never learn enough, my dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_eb569089", "Sounds great. This interests me why?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ec5b15d1", "Destroy duty.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_eceafc6e", "Good %NU. it's always a pleasure when you stop by. See you soon.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ee0a112e", "You are positive this is your pick?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ef759e6d", "No wait, let me reconsider.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ef962200", "I have to fix my ship first. I will be back as soon as I can.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_f182a09c", "Well they do often have a bit too much to drink so I don't want to trust them with a sensitive operation like this, dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_f1de2910", "If I wanted excitement I'd... Oh well, what do you need?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_f3cbd30c", "Very well. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_f4021854", "Okay... well, please hurry back, dear. We want to intercept this fleet before it reaches Lok.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_f4cf8776", "Ack. All right,I will send a message to Vrak to reschedule. Do hurry back, dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_f6927823", "No. This whole operation seems fishy. Working with a pirate!");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_f828b1ef", "Very well. Come back soon, %NU.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_fa69f8de", "There's nothing you CAN do.  Not unless you can prove yourself a trustworthy member of the Rebel Alliance again.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_faf8066c", "Bah! Menial tasks like that are a waste of my time.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_fbef6556", "Please do. Your presence is always appreciated, dear.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_fc4b144b", "That's understandable. What do I need to do?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_fcf4d778", "How?");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_fda95b05", "Not as much as I will miss you, sweetie. You are to report to Lieutenant Colonel Aqzow on Yavin. He can be found in the labor outpost on the moon Yavin 4. Please come back and see me now and then to let me know you are all right, %NU.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_fdc272e0", "The thing is, though, since we have launched so many successful attacks on the Imperial fleet, they have rerouted their ships. We are hoping that this smuggler knows something useful, so that we can intercept their fleet before it reaches Lok.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_fde7cbe6", "Who knows? Anyway, he wants me to take the data there.");
stringFiles[322].addEntry("s_ffa35f86", "Excellent. I will have a copy of the data uploaded to your ships computer as soon as you are ready to take off dear.");

stringFiles[323] = new StringFile("conversation/lok_rebel_trainer_2_smuggler");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (lok_rebel_trainer_2_smuggler) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_1106d288", "Sure sure, now go back to your commanding officer and get that data to my friend so he can 'translate' it.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_2387d3d7", "Alright, go on.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_29b10239", "I think you're in the wrong business. Pathetic.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_3103c633", "I was just asking, calm down. Well, see you around.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_4e307ac2", "I don't know who he really is, not many have seen him. I only know that he's some sort of shady information broker but he has a lot of power.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_50e93f2d", "Sounds good, thank you Vrak.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_53a57295", "The best. He's a bit paranoid though but when I was contacted by Nym, I made some arrangements. He's agreed to meet you in the Dantooine system... he wont land. You need to meet with him there and transfer the information that you need him to 'translate'.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_5dd70a2c", "What do you mean..?");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_6541ff8b", "Sounds good, is there anything else I should know?");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_6789e90e", "What else?");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_6b133072", "Nym will probably make sure of that.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_6bb0cb94", "Correct.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_73e609b7", "I'm waiting.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_871202ae", "Sure sure, now go back to your commanding officer and get that data to my friend so he can 'open' it.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_88fb9bcb", "We have some unfinished business I believe.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_8dc05a21", "I know a man that specializes in opening 'packages'. He's a bit paranoid though but when I was contacted by Nym, I made some arrangements. He's agreed to meet you in the Dantooine system... he wont land. You need to meet with him there and transfer the 'package' that you need him to open.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_99dcc230", "I'm not a fighter, I'll tell you all I know. A while ago I was contacted by someone named Kud'ar Mub'at, he's the type of 'person' that you don't say no to. He offered a large sum of money for any information on some stolen Imperial data.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_9b75f1f", "Wh..what are you doing here?!");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_9da8a554", "A while ago I was contacted by someone named Kud'ar Mub'at, he's the type of 'person' that you don't say no to. He offered a large sum of money for any information on some stolen Imperial data.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_a3c154e6", "Yes maybe so. You have a, uh, 'package' that you can't open?");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_a46f0bb8", "No, I'm with the CorSec anti smuggling department.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_b02a22c2", "What do you want? I'm busy!");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_b5dd2ed8", "You're lucky I'm in a hurry. I'm sure Nym will take care of you.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_b9280ab0", "Calm down silly, I'm just kidding. I am the pilot.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_bf37655b", "Please, I didn't mean to do it, I had to! Don't hurt me, I'll tell you everything I know!");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_c5fc3d7a", "Are you the pilot?");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_cf66be5a", "That's all I know, I swear! Please don't hurt me, my life is just starting. I'm nothing but a pawn, please...");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_d0098db3", "I need to get out of here!");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_d36158bb", "What are you trying to do? Get me killed? Now what did you need help with?");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_d5132e66", "You are supposed to know a good 'translator'?");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_d7fe1a24", "Kud'ar Mub'at?");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_e28286fc", "Oh I'm just here to check if you're blaster-proof.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_ed7e2471", "Wh.. what do you want? I haven't done anything, I swear!");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_edb238bc", "Go on.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_f39484e1", "I will change, I promise..");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_f7deed3b", "When I was contacted by one of Nym's people about the data that they couldn't encrypt, I put two and two together. I sent Kud'ar what he needed to know to intercept you and the hacker.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_f911cddf", "So I don't even have to break any of your bones? Pity.");
stringFiles[323].addEntry("s_fca23d59", "Yes. I was told that you could help me.");

stringFiles[324] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_imperial_tier3");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_imperial_tier3) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_105d3df0", "About Colonel Hend?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_10a23848", "I make no qualms about using anyone to further our goals. In a very controlled environment, I think that Doctor Shinss can still be of use to the Empire. Of course, this is just idle chatter. I must conduct my interview with Shinss before a final determination can be made.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_10c8692a", "Inquisitors don't ASK ridiculous questions.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_120e3960", "Doctor Shinss is a brilliant scientist. His research actually led to the development of the Death Star's power cells. Not only is he in charge of the Yavin salvage operation, he is slated to begin work on a new project in the Endor system. We are going to need evidence if we will have any chance at proving his guilt.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_12691b1c", "I do not have time for idle chatter with any one right now. I am very busy doing the work of the Empire.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_138af3f9", "For now you may go on leave. I am not certain how long I shall be detained with the doctor. Some people break very easily, others require some...effort. But before you go I would again like to offer my services as a trainer to you. Is there any particular skill you would like to learn?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_13b747b7", "The name sounds familiar.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_14c5b74e", "For your sake, I hope your best is good enough. But perhaps I can help you become a little bit better. Allow me to offer you my expertise to make you a better pilot. I will train you in one of your important pilot skills. Is there any particular skill that you would like to learn?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_14ea12c8", "I'm sorry?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_14ef7b20", "Indeed.  Perhaps you should take some time to reflect on your dedication to the Empire.  Perhaps you should do that now, before I have you executed.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1530dc31", "Save your excuses!  The General must never arrive!  Do you understand?  Go to the Dathomir system and destroy his ship.  NOW!");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_157ab93b", "Are there other traitors in the Empire?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_15ab633c", "So we are sure that Hend and Shinss were not working alone?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_15cfb2c9", "Did he enjoy it too?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_180340a", "I will do my best, Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1834b871", "Please continue. I am anxious to find out why the Colonel's yacht was stolen.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1954fa73", "What should I do in the meantime?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1aa7b517", "Or for someone. We try not to make too many assumptions but we are very confident that the answers are out there. One must be diligent in the search for the truth. But I digress. There is an important task that I need you to do. Given your background in this matter I can think of no one better suited to assist me than you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1adf59ad", "Tell me. Are you helping the traitors?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1ba0129b", "I could always plant some.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1ba9577c", "I will leave you alone then, Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1bf6b48e", "Earlier this morning, Colonel Hend's private yacht was removed from the space dock where it was stored. We believe that whoever stole the yacht is trying to cover up something that might have been hidden on that ship. Just twenty minutes ago a scanning vessel got a lock on the shuttle in the Naboo system.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1c1bc0f8", "An Imperial general?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1c8bddbb", "What is it?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1d1e30b6", "So I'm the bait.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1d7660ea", "As do we all. The Emperor has a very important mission for you. Of course, you of all people are aware of Colonel Hend's treachery?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1d79fda2", "Yes. But now you have work to do. ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1d8714f1", "Isn't the Army mad about the loss of a general?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1e10a6ef", "I see. Well it would seem that General Breckon very well might be though. The orders that you recovered from the Rebel smuggler have his name all over them. It is too bad that he didn't cover his tracks better but I assume he didn't think you could win.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1eba352e", "That, my friend, is up to you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1ee84e30", "Would anyone ever believe him?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1f64a6b3", "Sorry, I will leave right away.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_1fe8c0f8", "Lieutenant Colonel Barlow will not be allowed to hold his position for very long. I just fear that his health will take a turn for the worst in the near future. But for now he is the best available officer for the position.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_2015270f", "Very good. I have a job for you. Since you were there, you probably don't need me to tell you who Colonel Hend is.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_204207", "Yeah, I had the misfortune of dealing with him.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_212d1edc", "That is what I am thinking. We are going to have to keep this operation quiet for the time being though. There is no need to alert anyone of our investigation of the doctor. You are going to have to travel to the Yavin system and inspect the vessel's logs.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_22198261", "A general in the Imperial Army a traitor? Think about the scandal and what a major black eye it would be for the Empire. It is simpler if he has an accident and then we sweep the whole mess under the carpet. Destroy his escort as well. No one must know how he died and since we will do the investigation we will conclude that he fell victim to a tragic accident.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_22515365", "Sounds like a dangerous idea.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_231aa1cb", "Imperial technology it is. I will instruct you. Come see me a little later and perhaps I will have some news about how my discussion with the doctor went.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_23e0dd3", "Maybe we will see each other again.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_246a0af2", "For your sake, I will assume that you have NOT deserted your squadron. I suggest that you return to your commanding officer immediately.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_24a28f9e", "Uh...how about the weather we are having?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_25317705", "So this was all about politics?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_268fe491", "Yes, sir. Sorry, Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_280b5512", "I thought we wanted to keep Shinss alive?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_282a5395", "I must admit I had my doubts about you but one day I am sure you will make a fine addition to the ranks of the Inquisitors. You performed admirably in a difficult situation.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_28876e4d", "We will leak news that the doctor has given us names of other conspirators. You will transport this list of names. One thing that I did find interesting is that he mentioned the Dathomir system in passing but seemed to realize his mistake and quickly change the subject. I believe that is the area we should move the fake list through. ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_29eb9a6b", "What I mean, %TU, is that unless you can prove your devotion to the Emperor - improve your standing with the Empire - I will have you shot for treason.  In any case, you will no longer fly missions for the Inquisition.  Not until you prove your loyalty.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_2b08b3c4", "I'm glad to serve the Empire.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_2b4326ff", "I'm still searching.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_2c8e3657", "It's not true.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_2fd0e3dd", "The Army is happy to be rid of him without having to explain why they did not discover the traitorous activities of two high ranking officials. Of course, they know that the Inquisition let them avoid embarrassment, so in the future we will have an advantage when dealing with them. One hand washes the other.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_2fe1cf2f", "An unexpected answer. Perhaps you will find this posting more to your liking. Of course, you know about Colonel Hend...especially since you were the one who eliminated our problem for us.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_30281933", "How can anyone know everything about a man? There are secrets that we even hide from ourselves. But in this case, I care nothing about Hend except who he was getting his information from. The answer is out there, Hend wasn't skilled enough to hide from us and neither is his ally. You will find it.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_31d4944f", "We will pretend that he has given us a list of names. You will transport this list. One thing that I did find interesting is that he mentioned the Dathomir system in passing but seemed to realize his mistake and quickly change the subject. I believe that is the area we should move the fake list through. ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_33c41dc", "Why not let him come here and then charge him formally?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_34da8f1d", "Those orders you recovered from the Rebels might as well have been hand written by him. There is no doubt. General Breckon has betrayed his people, his soldiers, and his Emperor. There is only one punishment for that crime.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_35462f38", "I should hope not. I wouldn't want to think less of you after you were coming along so nicely. The way you eliminated General Breckon and his allies was a thing of beauty.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_36aa6786", "He would not tell us. But the Rebels don't know that. We will pretend that we have a list of conspirators.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_370a9fe4", "What are you waiting on? Believe me, you do not want to let this traitor escape because of procrastination. If I find out that you are not performing your duty to the utmost, you will spend the rest of your very short life in agonizing pain. Am I understood, pilot?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_371288aa", "If the data was classified higher than Colonel Hend's, the head of security on the project, clearance, what makes you think that you would have access to the information?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_37d7964e", "Absolutely, Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_383b4c1a", "You would allow a traitor to work for the Empire again?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_39dfc6b4", "The doctor refused to name collaborators; but the Rebels don't know that. We're going to send you out with a false list of names. One thing that I did find interesting is that he mentioned the Dathomir system in passing but seemed to realize his mistake and quickly change the subject. I believe that is the area we should move the fake list through.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_39fb010c", "No Imperial officer would betray the Empire. ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_3a77410f", "Who is Colonel Hend?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_3b3b356f", "Correct. I think we can find out what we are looking for by cracking the ship's logs. The yacht has been gone long enough for the perpetrator to hide whatever they were trying to cover up, but perhaps not long enough to also delete the ship's logs. Now to your ship, pilot.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_3b7137e5", "Um...you're welcome.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_3bd0f63e", "Well obviously he is a general in the Imperial Army. General Breckon is in charge of the army forces stationed in the Dathomir system. His contacts and rank make him a perfect candidate to pass information along to the Rebels without arousing too much suspicion.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_3c1e05f", "Discretion is the better part of valor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_3c31fee3", "So you want me to recover the yacht and bring it back to you?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_3ced8a4e", "But I am the best.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_3f29cff4", "Hmmm, it would seem that either you have a very short term memory or are very good at forgetting things better left forgotten. If it is the first, you will not last for very long. If it is the latter, you might just go far.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_40abff84", "I am very certain that he is the traitor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_40cda759", "Teach me about advanced capability TIE vessels.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_4103a0b8", "No. ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_421e1b5d", "Who is Lieutenant Colonel Barlow?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_42fdfb8d", "For now you are dismissed, I will be in need of your services again shortly though. Oh, and before you go let me teach you some more skills. You will probably have need of that training in the future. Is there anything you wish to learn?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_46423ae4", "After we discovered that Hend was a traitor we questioned all who were stationed under him. We could not find any wrong doing on the part of the Lieutenant Colonel and have no reason to believe that he was involved in his commander's treachery. Frankly, Barlow doesn't have the imagination to be a traitor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_46fbca74", "We're going to give it to you and send you on an interplanetary errand to the Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_473d09d8", "Teach me about system balance programming.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_47424e40", "It is good to see that you are able to read between the lines. You are learning some of the valuable skills that make a good Inquisitor. I think that it is time to put some of your skills to good use. I want you to go to our outpost on Yavin 4 and talk to Lieutenant Colonel Barlow.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_4a34b1cc", "Your opinion does not matter. You are to leave immediately.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_4a3aa62e", "Why?!");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_4a796b5a", "I hate the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_4b5066f2", "Well done, %TU. You have the makings of a true Inquisitor. When assigned a task you follow through with determination and focus. It is now clear to me that the late Colonel Hend was working with someone else.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_4c42a50e", "Interesting choice. I will teach you. Report back to me when you are prepared to undertake your next assignment.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_4c5e3fb9", "I believe that Colonel Hend's accomplice was a Doctor Shinss.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_4d169c0a", "[describe last mission]");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_4dbbef78", "Why not just eliminate him?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_50c0b15c", "Nothing is ever certain. But I have been doing this for long enough to know to follow my instincts. Right now my instincts are telling me our target is in Dathomir. It is at least something to look into before we ruin one of the finest minds in the galaxy.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_5188aced", "To force the enemy to attack?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_51edad38", "Ah. Yes. You are eager to begin. You, of course, know of Colonel Hend.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_531dcb5b", "Interesting. So you think he was working with someone?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_53d34239", "Then you are not trying hard enough. I suggest that you get to our outpost on Yavin 4 and talk to him again. There are answers to our questions. You just need to find them. Do not come back without those answers.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_5400c2b8", "He may live but I would wager that he never sees his family again. What he has NOT told me is the names of his co-conspirators. But I have a plan.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_5485ba8d", "Do you know General Breckon?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_54e4328d", "I suggest that if you wish to stay that way, you leave now.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_577a942", "Have you finished your questioning of Lieutenant Colonel Barlow about Colonel Hend?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_57c8489e", "What should I do?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_57d605af", "You must speak when you are spoken to. It is only polite. Tell me, are you loyal to the Empire?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_57d96aed", "People don't ask me questions, I ask them questions! Where were you on the night of the Aqualish uprising?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_5815dd18", "It wasn't my fault");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_590440bf", "Imperial equipment; always useful. Let's begin. Check in with me after I have had a chance to look into this Dathomir lead. I might have use for a pilot at that time.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_596a67f0", "Oh yes, very much so. The rebel plans that you returned to us reveal much. Just as we expected the rebels were tipped off about your mission and had orders to protect their remaining agent at all costs.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_5a27cd7a", "Very well. I will teach you about Imperial technology. Now you have your mission. Go question Lieutenant Colonel Barlow at our outpost on Yavin 4 about the traitor Hend. Find us a lead on who Hend was working with. You may leave me now.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_5a9c71e2", "Actions speak louder than words. Complete your mission.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_5b3ded86", "I don't know. That is why I was asking you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_5d47c3ad", "I understand you served under Inquisitor Fa'Zoll.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_5df75ba2", "Again you have surprised me. I am very impressed with the way you handled yourself in a most difficult situation. General Breckon has been eliminated and the Rebels have been shown the mistake of trying to cross the Imperial Inquisition.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_5ff8baab", "I was wondering if you could answer some questions?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_60495432", "Umm...I think I will be going now.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_60cd6629", "They shouldn't be that hard to recover.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_60e5259e", "I completely understand.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_61fa7c14", "Yes, quite. Most interesting process really. We start with a slight insertion into the frontal lobe. Followed by a...the process doesn't matter. Let's just say that it is rather intense. But I would prefer not to let things come to that. I am sure that there is something I am overlooking.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_64e8db24", "Ok, can you tell me a bit about Doctor Shinss?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_674c302", "Are you done?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_6750e334", "I see. Barlow might be aware of the other traitor and not know it.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_679b150d", "We do our jobs. And now you must do yours. ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_68aa150c", "Dangerous - and effective. The Rebels will have to try to get that list. His slip up of mentioning Dathomir might have been nothing but I believe it to be a mistake on his part. That is where you will focus your energies.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_68bcbb36", "What is Shinss doing in Endor?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_6905c6b2", "Good. General Breckon is actually on his way to Naboo in an attempt to protest his innocence. He must never be allowed to even reach the system. Tragedy must befall the general while he is still in Dathomir on his way here.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_697ba4d3", "And then you will carry this list. His slip up of mentioning Dathomir might have been nothing but I believe it to be a mistake on his part. That is where you will focus your energies.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_69d78804", "Not yet. I will get to it soon though.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_6c186cde", "What? Why?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_6d43b1bf", "Actually, we did. He truly is a brilliant man. I have enjoyed our conversations.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_6db39b2b", "We would only use it on Shinss as an absolute last resort. But unless we can figure out who the third traitor is, I fear that we will have no other choice. Do you have any suggestions?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_6dec7910", "Perhaps you can tell me something about Doctor Shinss.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_6ffd0979", "Good. Now get out of my sight, get to our outpost on Yavin 4, and question Barlow about Colonel Hend.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_714d54de", "He is no longer in any condition to answer you. But he has been most informative.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_726886dd", "Being scary and intimidating is harder than it looks.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_727d7649", "What has he told you?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_73ffc0a4", "There will not be any need for that, Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_741df7ed", "Where?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7426e000", "No!");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7579d1ec", "Of course we do. But generally those people do not have any use to the Empire, so no one really cares all that much. When it comes to someone with some power, we need proof of their illegal activities.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_75c4b8b4", "And then the enemy will attack?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_765d3767", "I'm loyal to the Empire!");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7673fc64", "I bet you didn't discuss science.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_76cdb911", "Doctor Shinss? The same Doctor Shinss that is currently in charge of the Yavin 4 salvage operation?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7859ec", "He would certainly have the knowledge and the opportunity to leak the stolen information to Colonel Hend. This is would be most unfortunate for the Empire if it turns out to be true. ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_788cbcfb", "Don't stand there babbling like a fool. Just leave.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7904d29b", "Won't Shinss notice if I am inspecting his vessel?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7a8608b9", "I serve the Emperor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7b9c0b3e", "Maybe I was mistaken. I tell you that I do not think Colonel Hend was working alone and all you notice is that I complemented you? Vanity has no place in the Inquisition! A good Inquisitor is nothing more than a tool for the Emperor, and tools have no ego. Never make the mistake of forgetting that, pilot.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7df37f4b", "I don't know. ARE you a traitor?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7e0ef42a", "You understand that the Inquisition can tolerate not even the slightest hint of treason?  You have a guilty look about you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7ef46a67", "Shinss was running to Dathomir. Maybe his ally is there.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7f3265a7", "No. He's answering to you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_7f9d08e9", "Why would it be unfortunate?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_81cf364c", "That does make sense.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_82abf7e1", "Extreme measures?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_82c168be", "Then we must find the proof. We would have a hard time explaining ourselves if we arrest such an important man on conjecture. You will have to find more evidence to his guilt.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_8367fc83", "I am here to report for duty.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_8403cf96", "That remains to be determined. I have not yet had a chance to chat with him. His guilt is not in question but it is important for us to make sure that there is no one else involved. There is a slight chance that he will simply be terminated but it would be a shame to execute such a brilliant and useful man.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_841d27db", "Why?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_85db59ee", "No. But the Rebels don't know that. We'll leak word that we have information. One thing that I did find interesting is that he mentioned the Dathomir system in passing, but seemed to realize his mistake and quickly change the subject. I believe that is the area we should move the fake list through.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_85eab9a", "Bah! I am done with you. I can no longer use someone like you. I have one last thing to teach you and, believe me, if I wasn't under orders to make you the best pilot I could I certainly wouldn't teach it to you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_876396db", "What was in the data?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_89772a9c", "You have performed better than my expectations. The doctor is safely in our custody and we have plenty of evidence to assist us in questioning him.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_8a631324", "Yes, Inquisitor. I will try. About Doctor Shinss?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_8b2f0509", "Did he tell you more about the conspiracy?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_8d10c144", "[no response]");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_8f1228f6", "You sound rather guilty about something. Maybe you would like to answer a few of my questions?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_8fbd0301", "Interesting choice. I will teach you. Check in with me after I have had a chance to look into this Dathomir lead. I might have use for a pilot at that time.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_8fdf2b5d", "Fortune is currently on our side. Although Shinss is in charge of the Yavin salvage operation, he is currently in the Endor system beginning work on his next project there. He was not allowed to take his personal craft on this trip so it is still out in the Yavin system. If he is involved with the traitors and was using this vessel as a meeting point, you can bet it is being watched. So we have to move quickly before we tip our hand.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_9016869", "I, too, enjoy astromech management. Report back to me when you are prepared to undertake your next assignment.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_91dcaa8e", "Of course it is. If the doctor had other friends in the Empire I will find out who they are. After that, I will determine the fate of Doctor Shinns.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_92089a98", "That is sound thinking.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_927126c5", "I hardly need approval from the likes of you for my life's philosophies. You forget that I have years of experience and knowledge that you will probably never possess. Just because I have bestowed some measure of favor on you does not make us friends.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_92a79510", "So what should I do now?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_92c37f5d", "Are you daft? Wasn't it you who helped bring down Colonel Hend? If you think that a uniform makes you immune to greed or moral indecision or whatever causes people to betray their own, then you are sadly mistaken. If that were the case there would be no need for us.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_96871003", "Very well. I will teach you about Imperial training. Now you have your mission. Go question Lieutenant Colonel Barlow at our outpost on Yavin 4 about the traitor Hend. Find us a lead on who Hend was working with. You may leave me now.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_96d7ed6a", "What a ridiculous question!");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_98ee25e0", "General Breckon is in charge of the army forces stationed in the Dathomir system. His contacts and rank make him a perfect candidate to be able to pass information along to the Rebels without arousing too much suspicion.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_9b43a7ee", "Yes sir.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_9d83e334", "As long as the Inquisition has the favor of the Emperor we are above politics. But the Emperor, in all his wisdom, has been known to abruptly change his mind. It is just smart to make sure we are prepared should that ever happen. But to answer your question...no. Our primary mission is to root out traitors inside of the Empire and that is what we have done. If we can turn that into our advantage then even better.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_9df61e25", "That is what we believe. But who are we looking for? I think the answer to that question is on Yavin 4. I want you to go to the Imperial post on Yavin 4 and speak with Lieutenant Colonel Barlow.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a0c5cad7", "The Empire has granted Shinss a private vessel for use in his work. From what I understand Shinss considers the vessel a refuge of sorts. If there is anything to be found it will probably be in Shinss private logs on board.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a112be1b", "Imperial technology it is. I will instruct you. Check in with me after I have had a chance to look into this Dathomir lead. I might have use for a pilot at that time.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a16f3f3d", "You will get your chance. Of course, you have heard of Colonel Hend, how he had betrayed the Empire.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a2078b19", "Having an advantage over the other branches could be useful.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a365e485", "I'm glad I'm not the Doctor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a3921d3c", "You seemed to have made a joke. Most amusing. Perhaps I will not have your transferred to investigating the wonders of Dathomir prison after all. Since I am in such a forgiving mood, I think now would be a good time to get back to matters at hand.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a3ae4cb", "What are you going to do with that list?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a3dbeea3", "Very well. I will teach you about Imperial equipment. Now you have your mission. Go question Lieutenant Colonel Barlow at our outpost on Yavin 4 about the traitor Hend. Find us a lead on who Hend was working with. You may leave me now.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a425b892", "They used to say they were loyal, too.  I would like you to finish your job.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a42ffb97", "Were you going to tell me about a traitor?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a5beec1f", "Don't you know everything about Hend already?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a729151d", "If I knew what was in the data, it would help with the investigation.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a7addb41", "Just as I expected. The guilty parties come crawling out of the gutters to try to hide their names from us. It is always amusing to me to watch them start to panic when we begin to move in. You can almost smell the desperation.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a86d23d", "Yes, Inquisitor. He is the only one who makes sense.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a8d5c2b9", "But what if he's innocent?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a96d5aee", "Very well. Where should I start looking?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_a9aeb386", "Teach me about advanced starship component use.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ab7d0c2d", "Indeed it is. It allows us far more room to operate and perform our primary function, finding and eliminating traitors from within. And we make the most of any advantage that we have. The Army will regret this whole incident for years to come, I can assure you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ac0524e5", "Someone else is involved?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_adf8c646", "Imperial equipment; always useful. Let's begin. Come see me a little later and perhaps I will have some news about how my discussion with the doctor went.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_af70dc3", "Why do you think someone was helping Colonel Hend?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b02effe8", "Sorry, Inquisitor. I wasn't thinking clearly.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b1d44e0a", "So what did you learn from Barlow? Well, spit it out. I have been waiting for this information for too long already.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b266743b", "I appreciate the vote of confidence. What is it I can do for you?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b333ecf9", "That's what he says. He's traveling to Naboo now, to protest his innocence. It is my understanding that he is traveling through the Dathomir system on his way here even as we speak.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b374861b", "That is irrelevant. You will kill him before he reaches Naboo.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b3b2214d", "Why do I need to speak with him?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b41ba13c", "And so, our time together is done.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b45b7c66", "Yes, I'll try again");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b48bd0a4", "I would never desert!");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b49d8273", "We are fairly certain that the Lieutenant Colonel is free from guilt in the matter of Hend's treachery but that doesn't mean he is not aware of details that could help our investigation. I want you to question Barlow about Colonel Hend's activities. Who did he deal with in the Engineering corps? Did he have any private meetings with any of them? What did Hend do in his spare time? Basically, I want you to find out everything you can about Hend.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b4ee5a51", "Perhaps. Shinss certainly had access to the information that Colonel Hend was passing to the Rebellion. On the surface everything would appear to have been wrapped up in a tight little package. But I learned long ago to never believe anything that I hear and only believe half of what I see. ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b5f15b19", "Not yet.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b61f3237", "So you decided to change the subject. You do have some measure of wisdom. Very well. Doctor Shinss has one of the finest technical minds in all of the Empire. It was his work that led to the creation of the power cells used in the Death Star's primary weapon. You never know when a man of such intelligence can be of use again.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b6c9b83b", "How did you get in here? The guards will certainly hear about their failure to keep the likes of you out. Begone before I decide to put you under the question.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b6e7132e", "I was only doing my duty.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b72f1079", "It sounds very interesting.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b73943f", "What! Are you saying that I am not good enough to be your friend? Am I just a pawn that you are planning to use in order to gain power within the ranks? Well? Speak up!");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b8302127", "It is your duty. Do it well.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b95f9ff4", "A general in the Imperial Army a traitor? Think about the scandal and what a major black eye it would be for the Empire. It is simpler if he has an accident and then we sweep the whole mess under the carpet. Destroy his escort as well. No one must know how he died. Because we will do the investigation, we will conclude that he fell victim to a tragic accident.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b981d334", "Are we certain it was him?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b987ef3b", "Will he?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b9c39774", "Where should I start looking?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_b9fc0fde", "Well? Why are you still here?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_baab1c4d", "I didn't mean I was more important then the Inquisition.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_bb4a477f", "It seems that we have managed to undercover the traitor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_bb627418", "Do you honestly think that the enemy is so stupid that they would fall for that again? They only fell for the ploy the first time because we moved quickly and kept them panicked. No, there is something else that I am missing. Dathomir...Dathomir...he wasn't going to Dathomir to meet up with the Rebellion, he was going to meet up with his ally!");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_bc30dc8c", "Then he is a casualty of war. We cannot take the risk that an Imperial general has been trading secrets to the Rebellion. Can you imagine the scandal that would ensue? It is far better if the general and his escorts simply have an accident in the Dathomir system. Since we will perform the investigation into his death, it will be simple to sweep under the rug.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_bca78274", "Yes, quite clearly, Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_bd61dda4", "What did you learn from the data I recovered?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_bf06e3a1", "Yes, it takes years of practice to perfect the technique that we are renowned throughout the galaxy for. But I take it you managed to get a lead even though the interview didn't go quite as smoothly as you thought it would?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_bfcce26a", "Imperial equipment; always useful. Let's begin. Report back to me when you are prepared to undertake your next assignment.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_bff840a0", "No. Even the Rebels wouldn't be foolish enough to name their agent in an order. But it does confirm our suspicion that Hend and Shinss were not working alone. We might have to use extreme measures to get Shinss to tell us who the third traitor is.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c0069753", "Do you think he is innocent?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c0f4399a", "Doesn't he realize he'll have to answer to you?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c102f303", "Doctor Shinss has one of the finest technical minds in all of the Empire. It was his work that led to the creation of the power cells used in the Death Star's primary weapon. You never know when a man of such intelligence can be of use again.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c142d50f", "Who is General Breckon?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c32eabc5", "Perhaps. His slip up of mentioning Dathomir might have been nothing but I believe it to be a mistake on his part. That is where you will focus your energies.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c39bdaeb", "Then say what you mean! You will find we will get along much better if you pay attention and present useful ideas to me.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c4f95dc7", "I didn't mean it that way.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c5903cb3", "Is it done?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c66cd0c9", "The data you recovered is highly classified. Well above Colonel Hend's security clearance. The data was also put together rather roughly, almost like it was coming from someone's memory rather than official documentation.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c682a578", "Must I lead you around by the nose in order for you to read between the lines? If you cannot figure things out for yourself then I cannot use you. I would advise that you get your act together or I will have to open up an investigation about a missing pilot.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c73e6431", "Are you sure he's guilty?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c9911c0f", "A member of the Inquisition must show patience in all things. You must also learn to focus on your tasks. Do not return to me until you have completed the task that I have assigned to you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_c9d5576a", "Not really. What is exactly I need to do?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ca264df9", "Interesting. I figured he was meeting up with the Rebellion but what if he was actually trying to meet with his fellow conspirator? We only keep a small security force in the region in order to patrol the outskirts of the system. It would have to be a person of authority. I think that your idea is at least worth investigating.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_cb22323f", "I hope there isn't. You have talent and I would hate to see it go to waste. Like I was saying, we believe that Colonel Hend had a cohort and we suspect that this cohort worked in the Engineering corps. You need to go to our outpost on Yavin 4 and talk to Lieutenant Colonel Barlow about this matter.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_cb94834e", "I, too, enjoy astromech management. Check in with me after I have had a chance to look into this Dathomir lead. I might have use for a pilot at that time.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ce4c8e17", "And then?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_cf7b4157", "You arrogant whelp. You are nothing without the might and power of the Inquisition backing you. Do you think that you would have had any chance of success without the training that I so graciously offered to you? Just being able to say that you work for the Imperial Inquisition alone probably won you half your battles.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d05c3a79", "Imperial technology it is. I will instruct you. Report back to me when you are prepared to undertake your next assignment.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d1f39329", "Yes. I've heard of you. Tell me, did you enjoy it? ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d1fa7f48", "You certainly will.  Again and again and again if necessary.  The General must never arrive.  So go to the Dathomir system and destroy his ship.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d24850e1", "It's not?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d2a2c5a9", "As I am sure you know, he has been eliminated for his traitorous activities. Unfortunately, for the Empire, we do not believe that he worked alone. The simple fact of the matter is that while he was in charge of security on our new special project, there was information leaked that even he did not have access to.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d3144c5a", "Even Imperial generals can be foolish men. He believed our story about  the names. Those orders you recovered from the Rebels might as well have been written in his own hand. There is no doubt.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d3942818", "Thank you for that promise.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d3f5b32c", "That is none of your concern. Right now all you should be concerned with is recovering those logs from Shinss' Yacht. Is that understood, %NU?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d5f6b830", "I thought we arrested people for no reason all the time?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d61b10cc", "I, too, enjoy astromech management. I'll teach you what I know. Come see me a little later and perhaps I will have some news about how my discussion with the doctor went.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d73be201", "Something that we use only as a last resort. It tends to have adverse effects on the neural paths in the brain. Most subjects survive the process but in an extreme vegetated state but it never fails to expose all of their secrets. It is actually quite fascinating.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d8181837", "Then returning was a mistake. Do not make me angry.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d8d73e21", "There would be if anyone had evidence of what really happened. But everyone is simply willing to accept that General Breckon had a tragic accident on his way to Naboo. Of course, we are still working on the official report but no one is going to demand explanations on this one.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d8f69fec", "I understand, Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_d9c145dd", "The sooner the better.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_da4bf33c", "That is because I am the best.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_dbd88d67", "Who, me?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_dbde1ca8", "I don't like this idea.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_dc30826", "I sometimes wonder if you ever think at all.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_dfb757ef", "Why keep him alive?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e1a23a44", "He's en route to Naboo with an escort - to protest his innocence. Destroy him. It is my understanding that he is traveling through the Dathomir system on his way here even as we speak.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e1b0c231", "I have more important things to do right now than to speak with you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e2f46aa7", "What is going to happen to Shinss?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e331634e", "Yes it does. You have learned much from me but I think there is still something else that I have to teach you. What would you like to learn?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e35bf94e", "I couldn't get anything out of him.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e3e0a092", "That is not quite the same as loyalty. ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e440e620", "One thing that I did find interesting is that he mentioned the Dathomir system in passing but seemed to realize his mistake and quickly change the subject. I believe that is the area we should move the fake list through.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e5235eff", "Do you have a mission for me?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e56fb28", "Yes. Now you are catching on. Before you go, you will need to learn a new skill that might assist you in your investigation. I will offer you my expertise in helping you become a better pilot. Do you have any particular skill in mind?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e64051dc", "He has told me much about the Death Star. He also has told me that he hopes to live to see his family again.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e65df49", "I wish I could have killed more Rebels.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e70ed5c9", "How about another fake list of names?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e73bd99d", "Interesting choice. I will teach you. Come see me a little later and perhaps I will have some news about how my discussion with the doctor went.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e7435914", "No, I am fine. We are all fine here.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e8f655d8", "He was Colonel Hend's second in command, and now that Hend is no longer with us, he has been promoted to his superior's old position.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e90f4f67", "The Empire owes you a small debt for eliminating that most embarrassing colonel. Unfortunately for the Empire, we do not believe that he worked alone. The simple fact of the matter is that while he was in charge of security on our new special project, there was information leaked that even he did not have access to.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_e9e86c08", "Sounds like a pretty skeptical way to go through life.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_eb077a31", "Very well. I will teach you droid management. Now you have your mission. Go question Lieutenant Colonel Barlow at our outpost on Yavin 4 about the traitor Hend. Find us a lead on who Hend was working with. You may leave me now.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ed0f2b93", "So we know who the remaining agent is?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ed26944d", "I honestly never expected you to have a good idea. It is refreshing to see that I was wrong.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ee0c7787", "I have enjoyed my time with the Doctor.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ee54dcb9", "Do you think he was involved?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ee64b80a", "This time, it is a soldier high in Imperial command. A General Breckon. If you are unfamiliar with the name all you need to know is that he is in charge of the Imperial Army stationed in the Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_eec10bf5", "Is there any backlash about General Breckon?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ef7a2df5", "Teach me about special forces training.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ef85b67c", "That makes sense.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f16b1b64", "I appreciate your zeal. And it certainly wouldn't be the first time that we decided to take matters into our own hands. But in this case I think it would be best if we actually see what there is to find.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f24b6a1a", "I could die.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f3a00a53", "If I wanted the help of children, I would ask for it! You are not ready to face the challenges that our profession presents. Return to your commander, listen, watch, and learn. When the time is right perhaps I will send for you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f3d48e75", "If you are here, then you must have completed your mission.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f4cbd517", "He swears his innocence. He's coming here now to clear his name. He is wise to do so. It is my understanding that he is traveling through the Dathomir system on his way here even as we speak.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f5039ccf", "I hope not, because it would be under unfortunate circumstances. You are to report to Grand Inquisitor Ja'ce Yiaso. You can find him just outside of Lord Vader's office. Do not disappoint him or you will find yourself under the question very quickly. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f50e2248", "Ah, so you have learned to respect your elders. That is a good thing. You are to report to Grand Inquisitor Ja'ce Yiaso. You can find him just outside of Lord Vader's office. Do not disappoint him or you will find yourself under the question very quickly. Farewell, %NU.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f5cc022d", "Very true, but rules are rules, even for Inquisitors. Allow me to put it this way. Colonel Hend was in charge of security for the Death Star salvage operation. Many of the engineers who worked on the Death Star project are involved in the salvage operation. What do you think these people know that the Rebels would be so interested in getting their hands on?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f64e0998", "Good. Now move quickly, get to the Yavin system, and inspect Shinss' personal logs. You have your mission, now go!");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f6f34e7b", "Someone in the engineering corps, perhaps?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f7b0b9b0", "How can you be certain?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f8076c38", "I would like to make a promise as well. I promise to do my work. It will be with the people who stole Colonel Hend's yacht, or it will be with you.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f8176023", "You were doing so well up until this point. It is so simple that I am sure even you cannot mess this up. You are what's called a pilot. Your job is to fly your ship where I tell you to. You are to fly your ship to the Yavin system. That is in space. Then you are to find Doctor Shinss' Yacht. A Yacht is a type of ship... in space. When you find his ship, inspect Doctor Shinss' personal logs. Now get out of here before I get angry.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f8a8c2d0", "Can you be sure? Isn't it dangerous to have him head of security for that operation?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_f8e71988", "I'm ready for my mission.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_fc6aad81", "Didn't I tell you?  We cannot take the risk that an Imperial general has been trading secrets to the Rebellion.  Isn't that what I said to you?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_fcdfe482", "What do Inquisitors do to people?");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_fd0ebe0b", "I'm going back out there immediately.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_fd9fd112", "Loyalty is very important. Colonel Hend betrayed  the Empire. And as you surely know, he paid the price for that treachery.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_fda4456d", "We will leak news that he has given us a list of names. You will transport this list. One thing that I did find interesting is that he mentioned the Dathomir system in passing but seemed to realize his mistake and quickly change the subject. I believe that is the area we should move the fake list through.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_fdfe8d73", "I am afraid so. It was not pretty. ");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_ff715762", "I'll find that ship. I promise.");
stringFiles[324].addEntry("s_fffa7b3b", "Of course not, Inquisitor.");

stringFiles[325] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_imperial_tier3_barlow");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_imperial_tier3_barlow) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_107a83ec", "Did the two of them ever spend any time alone together?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_110ac144", "Thank you for your time, Colonel. There will be no need for us to speak again.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_12173b9e", "Of course I don't know what is going on around here. My security clearance is the same as Colonel Hend's was. So how could I know?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_127f71ad", "This is a restricted area. I suggest that you move along before I am forced to charge you under violation of Imperial directive T43-X9A.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_129cd101", "You do have my full attention, Inquisitor. What can I help you with?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_14c38c33", "What sort of man is Doctor Shinss?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_1506d494", "What! What does that mean? I don't understand what you are talking about.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_15fccf52", "Who did Colonel Hend spend most of his time with?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_18782a4b", "Of these engineers who had the most contact with Hend?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_1a949924", "Yes, I was promoted after Colonel Hend's death.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_1ae1c792", "Hmmm...");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_1b131a47", "I am sure that he doesn't worry about you. I must be going.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_1dfabdd9", "No one. Well, actually he would travel around with Doctor Shinss inspecting the debris fields, but that was official business and not Leave.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_1fa017ef", "I said silence! What did Colonel Hend do in his spare time?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_2002f393", "If the other Inquisitors already asked those why do you want to answer them again?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_20ff0a31", "You know. Things like where were you on date so and so. Did you ever see Colonel Hend do this. Are you loyal to the Empire. Things like that!");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_2188ff96", "First I would have arrested him and then made my report according to Imperial directive J323-9V. I wish I had known, so I could have put an end to it. It makes me sick to know that I served under a traitor.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_22cf270c", "I am not hiding anything. You told me to be silent so I was silent. I may have to follow your orders and answer you questions but I will not tolerate any accusations against my loyalty. To answer your question, Colonel Hend was my superior officer for the past three months. I did not know him very well on a personal level, since I disapprove of officers becoming too friendly with each other.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_24614dc6", "A member of the Inquisition is never foolish! You will pay for that statement!");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_2723a841", "On to what? You accused me of being a traitor, then you accuse me of murdering someone half-way across the galaxy! I try to tell you what I know and you accuse me of having an inappropriate fascination with Colonel Hend! I have no idea what this line of questioning is all about. ");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_283dca97", "I believe you colonel. Now about Colonel Hend's friends?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_28a49383", "And now you are going to talk with me.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_2a60fbf6", "Not that I ever saw. But Doctor Shinss was project lead. It was necessary for him to deal with Colonel Hend in order to organize security.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_2b0fcb12", "Yes, I know that. I was just testing to see if you were paying attention.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_2b71207d", "Uh...whatever you wish, Inquisitor. I hope that you have gotten the answers you were looking for, although I don't see how. Good day.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_2e851dd5", "Silence fool! I am tired of listening to you. Good day.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_30a96327", "Really? How many times have you had private meetings with Doctor Shinss?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_3181543b", "He spent most of his off hours with a few of the junior officers. Occasionally the group of them would take leave together and fly off in Hend's yacht. Nothing really out of the ordinary, although I must say I don't approve of officers mixing in social circumstances.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_35f73adf", "Did Colonel Hend spend any time with any of them?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_3668d398", "I am sorry that they left you out of their fun. That must be very painful for you.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_3700f6", "Silence! I will ask you questions and you will answer them.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_379b50a7", "No! As I said before, I don't think that officers should get too friendly with each other. Also since I was second in command I had to stay here when Colonel Hend went on leave. It might have been nice to receive an invitation but I completely understand.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_38ae0970", "You were going to ask me about Colonel Hend.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_394ac527", "Doctor Shinss is head of the salvage operation. He and his team of engineers are locating and extracting the most important pieces from the debris in order to be reused in other projects. He worked closely with Colonel Hend to ensure the safety of all involved.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_39774984", "Of course not. If I had I would have arrested him and made my report according to Imperial directive J323-9V. I wish I had known, so I could have put an end to it. It makes me sick to know that I served under a traitor.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_3b0eba1c", "I would at least appreciate a little respect. You may work for the Inquisition which means that I have to obey you while you are on assignment but you are making an enemy here.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_3be36a24", "What do you mean I don't have a clue? You were the one asking all of those crazy questions. Bah, fine! I have work to do anyway.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_3c673988", "Uh...yes of course. Who did you think I meant?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_3c8f00ed", "How often would Hend and Shinss meet?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_3cdbed0b", "This is getting nowhere. I am going to have to end this interview right now unless you get to the point. Inquisition or no, I am very busy man and do not have time to waste answering fool questions.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_3d1204e0", "Of course I will cooperate. It is every Imperial officer's duty to cooperate in the fullest with any Inquisition investigation. All you had to do was ask. You didn't have to threaten me like that.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_40f102e4", "My name is not important. I am here on behalf of Inquisitor Vrke.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_4355764f", "I do not recall requesting your presence? If you have no business here I highly suggest that you get back to your unit or where ever you came from.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_45363db1", "There was the group of junior officers, mostly members of the security force, although there were some Naval men in that group as well. Of course, he had dealing with the engineers handling the salvage operation. I never saw him with any of the enlisted men or civilians. In fact I don't think I ever even heard of him talking to any of them. When he had to deal with any of the men, he would always delegate that to another officer.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_45d046d5", "Very well. But I will have you know that I will be in contact with Inquisitor Vrke as soon as this interview is done and discuss your behavior towards a superior officer. You might be a member of the Inquisition, but I am a Lieutenant Colonel in the Imperial Army and your respect is still expected.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_45ebf891", "So you were there while they had their discussions?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_46897102", "Really? Who would you have reported him to?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_47e55614", "So which is it? 'No one' or 'Doctor Shinss'?.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_4bbd7016", "What? I didn't say that. I said that I didn't think that officers should become friends. It ruins the objectiveness of command. I was less than pleased by Colonel Hend's relationship with some of the other officers on the project.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_4c694267", "There is something seriously wrong with you. Why would I be jealous of Colonel Hend's relationship with other officers? I just disapproved, that is all. I mean I never really wanted to have anything to do with him...other than being under his command.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_4c90f2a4", "Is that a threat? I suggest you just answer my questions.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_4ccd5b75", "I certainly hope not. I will still be required to speak with Inquisitor Vrke about your behavior. It was completely unacceptable.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_51df4407", "Classic sign of betrayal. Those most hurt by his treason would be the men in the trenches.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_540a88a5", "As a matter of fact. Yes! What engineers?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_55a16d2b", "Did you ever see Colonel Hend steal secrets and give them to the Rebellion?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_57cfb6a7", "You said your last statement like you don't know what is going on.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_58079535", "Maybe you would be more comfortable if you pour us both a drink.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_59904aa4", "My mission is a mystery that will reveal itself in time.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_5b81ae31", "I would imagine so. But I was unable to determine what those signs were. As far as I knew, Colonel Hend was absolutely loyal to the Empire. If I would have had any inkling otherwise, I would have reported him.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_5bc4c2f1", "Of course you don't. That is why I am here and you are there.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_5c896992", "That is because you are not paying attention.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_5ffde8db", "So Colonel Hend spent time alone with the other engineers?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_61286e9e", "Uh? Am I in some sort of trouble? You are not going to do anything to me are you? Because I will have you know that torture of an officer is forbidden under Imperial directive Y70-32C subsection 14.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_61c6827c", "Wouldn't arresting a superior officer violate Imperial directive T44A-0-niner?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_62784e3f", "He was head of security on an operation that was being run by the engineers. He dealt with them everyday but I wouldn't say that he ever did anything with any of them. ");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_62adf222", "Let me get this straight, you never meet with Doctor Shinss?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_64113df0", "I recommend that you try saying those things out loud in private before you actually say them to someone else. That way you won't come off like some sort of crazed fool.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_65ec117a", "Good! Now I can get back to work.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_6773e97b", "That would definitely be Doctor Shinss. He is head of the project so naturally spent the most time with Colonel Hend.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_6a726863", "Of course they would know. Many of them helped build the station. That is another reason why security is so tight on this operation. We cannot allow any of these scientists to fall into enemy hands. The knowledge they possess is of great importance to the Empire.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_6ac3f291", "Not really. He dealt with Doctor Shinss mostly but that was all official work. Doctor Shinss is the head of the salvage operation and it was important for the head of security to work closely with him.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_6bd0e9b", "I am not hiding anything. You told me to be silent so I was silent. I may have to follow your orders and answer you questions but I will not tolerate any accusations against my loyalty. To answer your question, I really don't know what Colonel Hend did in his spare time.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_6c17ce1b", "I thought we had already determined that I had nothing to do with Colonel Hend being a traitor. I know that has to look bad for a second not to be aware of his commanders activities but that is the truth. I have nothing to hide from the Inquisition.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_6f94037e", "Who here had higher security clearance than Colonel Hend?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_7061349d", "Of course they did. They were in quite a few private meetings together, almost daily. They would take shuttles out to inspect the debris field together quite often. Nothing out of the ordinary.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_72ceec2c", "Do not question my methods! Tell me about Colonel Hends friends.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_7324835", "That is most interesting. And by enemy you mean the Rebellion?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_749aece", "So I take it you are working closely with Doctor Shinss now as well.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_760db2a", "While they were on duty it was constant. Shinss was always in Colonel Hend's office complaining about the way he was running things. Several times they had to take shuttles out to view the debris fields. I think Shinss wanted to actually show Colonel Hend what he needed. That sort of thing.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_797cf757", "Don't you deal with the Doctor now?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_7b1ee2bd", "It's okay. Just let it out.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_7e952afa", "Of course. It is the duty of every Imperial officer to assist any Inquisition agent on assignment. I will be very glad to answer any questions that you might have.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_7ebbd888", "Not in the least. I tell you that I am a fine officer and you can quote me on that if you wish. I hope that I have been helpful to your investigation. Good day.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_7ed6dd6", "Who amongst those engineers had the most contact with Hend?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_7ef5613c", "I said silence! Now, how well did you know Colonel Hend?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_802362c2", "Shinss and Hend spent a lot of time together?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_80254eb2", "I suppose you are right. So would you answer some questions for me?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_81caddeb", "So you don't believe that officers should work together?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_85c0a145", "Where would they go on these trips?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_85e6fdd1", "What else do you want to know about them?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_874f9344", "You are protesting a lot. Are you sure you are not guilty of something?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_883e63f3", "Who were these friends of Colonel Hend?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_8931a146", "What would he do with the engineers?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_8d77e799", "Never mind. Do you know of anyone who might have known Hend was a traitor?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_8fa4c7bd", "Well, who did he fraternize with if not the engineers?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_900f01d1", "What?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_90c2580f", "Why are you trying to protect Doctor Shinss?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_91237089", "What do you mean, trying to protect Doctor Shinss? I am not protecting anyone. He and Colonel Hend worked together. As head of the project and head of security they spent a lot of time in meetings planning for the project.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_99701b9c", "So he had a light complexion. Very interesting.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_9b59f040", "So you were jealous?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_9bdca9f6", "Do you know what goes on here?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_9cb92ec3", "So these engineers would know how the Death Star worked?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_9ce47b1f", "Let it out? Let what out? Why aren't you asking questions like the other Inquisitor's were doing?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_9d1204e3", "Sorry, I am sort of new at this whole Inquisition thing.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_9d22bb03", "He never went on leave with Doctor Shinss, but they did work together in an official capacity. They would take shuttles out to inspect the debris fields.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_a253bfbf", "You are insane.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_a3391195", "I most certainly am not going to pour us both a drink. I am on duty and so are you. Imperial directive 43C-90L clearly states that the consumption of spirits while on duty is punishable by two weeks in the brig.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_a43281d6", "What engineers? The ones that are running the salvage operation in this system? They are the whole reason that any of us are here. The engineers are locating and extracting the most important pieces from the debris in order to be reused in other projects.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_a55b2dc8", "There is little need for me to meet with the Doctor. I do my duty and he has his operation to run. I run a very tight ship so that Doctor Shinss doesn't have to constantly hold my hand like he always did with Colonel Hend. It seemed like every time I turned around, Shinss and Hend had their heads together discussing what a terrible job Colonel Hend was doing.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_a623d5ba", "Did you ever suspect Colonel Hend as a traitor?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_a72db7d9", "Yes? What do you want? I am extremely busy.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_a82360e0", "Fine, fine. Ask me anything. What would you like to know?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_aa484e27", "What? Oh...you mean other than a bad man. He was a fair commander. Liked his junior officer a bit too much in my opinion. But nothing about him ever gave away the fact that he was a traitor.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_ac8cb7ce", "Yeah, maybe in a mirror or something. Anyway...what was I saying?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_aeb1b3ee", "Perhaps you are unaware of what you actually know.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_b39c7b81", "Sorry, that sounded much more intimidating in my head.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_b693b85f", "Fine. What questions would you like me to answer?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_b72bfe9c", "You say that Colonel Hend had lots of friends. Tell me about them.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_b83437a1", "You were the one telling me to ask you about it.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_b969a839", "That's not important right now. What is important are these engineers.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_be74eb0", "If I had that information, I would have given it to the Inquisitors that were here before. All I know is that Hend liked to spend his off time with some of the junior officers. They all get together after they were off duty and sometimes they would all take leave together and go out on Hend's yacht. But I don't think any of them even knew.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_becaf709", "Just as I suspected. You are innocent.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_bf9b99b9", "I am not hiding anything. You told me to be silent so I was silent. I may have to follow your orders and answer you questions but I will not tolerate any accusations against my loyalty. But to answer your question, Colonel Hend didn't fraternize with anyone from the engineering corps. He obviously worked with them since he was head of security.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_c2631c46", "Tell me some more about the people Colonel Hend dealt with.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_c3185891", "How often would the two of them meet?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_c346ae59", "You really do not have a clue do you? I am finished here. Good day.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_c37cc43f", "Who else did Colonel Hend go on trips with?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_c39786e7", "How would arresting a superior officer violate the directive banning the use of an Imperial officer's hat as a Wookiee beating device? I am afraid that I really don't understand your question.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_c3c8f385", "[silence]");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_c4c46aa", "You are completely mad. From what I heard, you were the one who killed Colonel Hend. In the Dantooine system. Thousands of light years from here. Where I was. It would have been impossible for me to have murdered Colonel Hend!");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_c97a22d4", "You are not supposed to understand the mysteries of the Inquisition!");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_ca59425a", "I don't care how busy you are. We are going to talk.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_cb65c4f9", "I suppose that could have been the case. I really do not like to speculate about things like that. Is there anything else you wanted to know?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_cb6d22cd", "I will determine if you are hiding anything or not!");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_cd0207ad", "Who is this Doctor Shinss?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_cd5b3d17", "So you are telling me you have no idea what your superior officer liked to do?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_cfd0827b", "You really like quoting Imperial directives, don't you?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_d1511c14", "So, Colonel Hend hated the enlisted men.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_d1d8d28a", "No, of course not. But if I were Doctor Shinss, that is what I would be talking to Colonel Hend about. Hend wasn't the best of leaders. Of course, now that I am in charge the operation is running smoothly and Doctor Shinss can concentrate on his mission.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_d1dc8a70", "Aren't you head of security on this project now?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_d2a410b8", "I am afraid that I am not following were you are going with this. I would very much like to assist the Inquisition but I don't understand what you want me to tell you.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_d324b656", "So you murdered Colonel Hend out of revenge for his rejection towards you?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_d5ad0fe2", "Ah ha! You cannot hide your guilt behind silence!");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_d8cce866", "Vrke eh? I have already spoken with you people. I had nothing to do with Colonel Hend and I didn't know anything about what he was doing.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_d9a69ecd", "I have no idea what is going on here but I can assure you that I have nothing to hide. I am just trying to assist you in your investigation any way that I can. But you certainly are not making this easy on me.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_dc89a970", "Who here has higher security clearance than Colonel Hend did?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_dd34119b", "I don't know. He just never dealt with any of them. From what I understand he wasn't like that before I arrived. I have heard he used to be really friendly with the men but about three or four months before I arrived he just suddenly stopped dealing with any of them.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_e0659186", "Like I said, I do my job so well there is no need. Doctor Shinss doesn't have to worry about a thing now that I am charge.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_e40d4ee9", "Colonel Hend was my superior officer for the past three months. I did not know him very well on a personal level, since I disapprove of officers becoming too friendly with each other.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_e616a383", "Which officers were these?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_e6ae8de", "Shinss is a good enough man. From my understanding he is supposed to be brilliant but I don't know him well enough to make a judgment to that matter.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_e6f64e19", "Do any of these engineers have higher security clearance than Colonel Hend?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_ea32ea5a", "Thank you for your time. I see no need to continue this conversation.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_ea5a649e", "Hmmm. I really thought I was on to something there.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_eb02637b", "Well, I have not yet had a chance to meet with Doctor Shinss. But that doesn't mean I do not know what my duties are on this project. I understand completely what it is that needs to get done. Doctor Shinss has no reason to worry about the security of this project with me in command.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_eb02c97f", "So now I should take it easy on you?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_ecda4c4f", "How would I know? I never asked and they never volunteered any details. All I know is that they would leave for a few days and then come back. To my understanding they filed all the appropriate transportation paperwork so it was never an issue with me.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_eed04a50", "Well, that isn't very professional of you. You shouldn't threaten to torture someone unless you are actually planning on doing it. It just really shows a lack of resolve and planning on your part.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_f039fce5", "But he was a traitor, so there had to be something.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_f211ed92", "Colonel Hend. A very bad man, but what sort of man was he?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_f6fe3ce5", "Several of them do. Doctor Verr, Doctor Plenki, Doctor Shinss, and Doctor Stile all do. Even though Colonel Hend was in charge of security, there are a number of things going on here that it was not necessary for him to know about.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_f813490a", "You again? I don't know anything else. I have already told you everything that I know. Now please, let me continue my duties in peace.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_f978aafb", "Argh! If I would have seen him doing that I would have arrested him and turned him over to the Inquisition. What kind of dumb question is that?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_f9e3a71b", "There will be no need if you answer some questions for me.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_fa3924b4", "I said silence! Did Colonel Hend fraternize with the Engineers corps?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_fb1ee7a5", "Are you aware of anyone that suspected?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_fcbf7850", "Several of the engineers do. Doctor Verr, Doctor Plenki, Doctor Shinss, and Doctor Stile all do. Even though Colonel Hend was in charge of security, there are a number of things going on here that it was not necessary for him to know about.");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_ff55610e", "I don't want to answer them again! Don't you even know what I told the other Inquisitors when they last questioned me? Why are you even here?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_ffead1ac", "Oh, and what sort of questions were those?");
stringFiles[325].addEntry("s_ffee58bf", "Colonel Hend liked to relax with all sorts of junior officers. I don't know if I would really call them friends but they would do things together, like take leave at the same time. It was my understanding that Colonel Hend would fly them around in that yacht of his when they did. Of course, I never went with them.");

stringFiles[326] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_imperial_tier4");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_imperial_tier4) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1045dd9d", "I would be a great Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_145d7cc3", "So you are back. Did your visit with the Grand Admiral go well? Are you here for my pleasant company or did you come back looking for work?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_14c99313", "Dathomir? Interesting world.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1769a080", "Then quite wasting my time. I am a very busy man and cannot be bothered to stop and chat.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_17fa0de9", "Yes, sir. Right away.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1832fe3c", "Hmm, this is highly unorthodox. Although I do have some elective duty missions if you are interested. Would you like to hear the briefing?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_185e40da", "Very good. We like pilots who have no money. Keeps them motivated.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1899241d", "The Coynite and the smugglers are one and the same. Just before he expired, he also told me all about their friends on the planets surface. It would seem that they are receiving aid from someone in the prison. Whoever their friend, or friends, are they are paying the Coynite with the crystals. I lost him before he could tell me who or why. Not my best work but we have what we need.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_18dda10a", "Very well, worm. Let me know when it shows up, but until that time you have work to do...MY WORK! Your next assignment is the Dathomir system. There have been an increasing number of reports of unauthorized access to the system. This begs many questions and I want the answers. You will get me those answers...understood?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1a40d259", "Excellent. I wish you luck. Pirates must die.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1bfd2d3e", "Where is the data from that communications satellite?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1c3578bb", "I'll bet you would, wouldn't you? I have no need for untrained and incompetent pilots. Perhaps you should return to your commanding officer and learn a thing or two before seeing me again.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1cd21b47", "Yes, sir. Thank you.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1ce05254", "Perhaps. Now what do you want me to do?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1cfa3230", "The Emperor pays attention to far more than you could possibly imagine.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1e39a0ae", "Yes. In clear violation of Imperial law. Of course, he is not working alone. All those reports I received would not have been generated by one lone individual. So I took the liberty of sending out several recon shuttles into the Dathomir system. It would appear that there are several vessels all working in unison in this little venture of theirs.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1eb19278", "Sure. Sounds like a cake walk.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_1ef1e040", "I was glowing but other than that, no.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_231ed37", "I am sorry you didn't enjoy your work.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_25b2a2f6", "No, thanks. I am so good power and glory will just come a knockin'.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_265434f7", "You are very eager, my young pilot. That is good. I have much need for someone who is willing to get the job done and done quickly.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_26bb0194", "Give me another chance. I will not fail again.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_270e6f7b", "I will do my best. Where am I to report to?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_2732abfa", "I have never had a reason to go to Dathomir.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_28532034", "No, thanks. How about you tell me about the crystal instead?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_28b58d98", "Thank you, sir. Will there be anything else?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_2a5728d1", "That joke, and I use that term loosely, was terrible.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_2ac3895f", "It is my business to know things, worm. That and we maintain a prison on the planet's surface. Prisoners are dropped in from orbit, never to leave again. The guards who maintain the prison have surveyed a large portion of the planets unique flora, fauna, and, thankfully, geology.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_2b68d8fe", "That sounded like you were mocking me.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_2bfb5526", "I told you and you wouldn't listen...I am the BEST!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_2ebece20", "Great, time for me to save the Empire, yet again.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_30c7137f", "It is not for the people we deal with, but there is no reason why we cannot enjoy the fruits of our labor once in a while. Never mind, my advice is simply going to be wasted on you. Back to work. The lab finished the analysis of the crystal you recovered. With some very interesting results. I suppose you would like to know what those are, eh worm?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_30d23b2c", "I take it that frugality is not one of your strong suits. That is alright...the Empire is very wealthy and a pilot in the right position can make a healthy sum.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_320b2029", "Then I trust you will not fail me. It would be a most unwise decision on your part if you did.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_327da557", "Or you could escort prison ships to Dathomir - the guards are always eager to see a new face.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_32bd6884", "I'm going to spend every credit of it!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_34aaab36", "Of course. There is always some way to manipulate anyone. The key is just finding out what. On a side note, we will be dealing with the officers on Dathomir by telling the others that were not involved what was happening. They will deal with the traitorous officers in their own way.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_362a48e0", "Anything else?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_365243f7", "The Grand Admiral is stationed inside the palace walls of that treacherous woman. I still am not sure why the Emperor has allowed her to continue to rule and not turned her over to me. Regardless, I am sure he has his reasons.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_3686a31b", "Not until you improve your standing with the Empire.  Until then consider yourself grounded.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_36af2d20", "Top...men.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_39ec8285", "It's harder than it looks, you know.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_3a3805e3", "Ah, a young pilot. What brings you here, so far from your assigned squadron?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_3b2c48b2", "Perhaps he has records, sir.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_3b9d259a", "Sorry, Inquisitor. It won't happen again.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_3dd8800a", "I can see that.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_3e261fd0", "Perhaps it wouldn't be a bad thing to have a member of the Inquisition working for a Grand Admiral. Who knows what secrets we might uncover. Yes, I think that this will be most enlightening.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_40671b7a", "Excellent. I was getting a little short on credits.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_4092eccc", "It is nothing. Just old memories. Pilot, never listen to your memories! They tell nothing but lies. Now, on to your assignment. You are to travel to Dathomir. I have been receiving some very disturbing reports of unauthorized activity within the system. You will find out what is going on there for me.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_41040de1", "I am not a worm!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_416d1887", "Umm...");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_417ab2a4", "So you have returned. We have just received those interesting rocks you recovered from that unauthorized vessel. Did you leave the pilot just floating out there or did you finish him off after the search...wait! Don't tell me, I find it more amusing to think of him floating helpless in the cold depths of space.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_424a2157", "Then why are you here at the Emperor's Retreat?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_438b0dbc", "What did the Coynite speak of?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_44867e8a", "They should have left well enough alone.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_47b7d709", "You are to travel to Dathomir. I have been receiving some very disturbing reports of unauthorized activity within the system. You will find out what is going on there for me.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_4854758d", "I would like to request a mission.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_487cad", "Very well. But you had better understand one thing...failure is not tolerated in the Inquisition. Failing in your duty is paramount to treason. And you know what we do to traitors, don't you?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_488aa777", "Why is Dathomir a forbidden system?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_490da0e3", "I think that you might find that skill very useful. Especially now that I have need of your...unique talents. After all, idle hands are a dangerous thing.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_49805f81", "Can I hear the briefing again?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_4b509b", "I am sure that you are just filled with fascinating stories. But I would rather not listen to any of them. I am in need of skilled pilots, not ground pounders.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_4bb3d9ba", "Good. Now your assignment...I will have command transmit a patrol route that I wish you to fly once you enter the Dathomir system. Follow the route and keep a careful watch for any unauthorized activity. These reports I have been receiving have left me feeling uneasy. I will know what is going on there. Dismissed.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_4bcaf756", "Well, the Coynite have the satellite under constant surveillance so they will most likely attack you while you are trying to tap into the signal. If you succeed you will have some very valuable information for me. If you fail then you will be dead. Sounds like a win win situation for me. You have you orders. Carry on, pilot.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_4c064599", "I wouldn't say that. It just wasn't as fulfilling as I had hoped it would be. High expectations always lead to the greatest disappointments. On the bright side I did manage to get most of the information we were looking for out of him.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_4c65eeef", "He is to be...questioned. The Coynite are well known for their strength. I will find it most interesting to test my resolve against his strength. I will win of course, but perhaps he will hold on long enough to make it interesting. In the end he will tell me everything he knows. Until then you may go on leave or continue our duty operations. I am sure I will have need for you later.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_4ee43f47", "All in good time. I have a feeling that this goes a little bit deeper than that. The recon shuttle has tracked one of the vessels that landed on the planet's surface before we could stop it. You are to immediately capture that vessel as soon as it reenters orbit. If that ship looks like it is about to get away you are to destroy it. Take no chances that it will get out of the system. Is that understood?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_517a8075", "I hope for your sake that it is not. I will have command transmit a patrol route that I wish you to fly once you enter the Dathomir system. Follow the route and keep a careful watch for any unauthorized activity. These reports I have been receiving have left me feeling uneasy. I will know what is going on there. Oh, and worm...fail me and you will find yourself firmly on a hook!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_52708145", "We will start you off with something slow. I need a prison drop shuttle escorted to the prison on Dathomir. We have been holding off shipping those prisoners while we dealt with the Coynite issue and it is time that they were sent home.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_52c3d844", "I did earn it.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_53de9d8f", "Like what?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_5434d72a", "Mock you? You are not even worthy of my contempt. I suggest you put your mind on the task that I am about to place before you, rather than focusing on your own pathetic existence. You are only here to serve me and your life hangs on my whims. Are we understood?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_54ed82f4", "Not me. I am too slippery.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_55590e1c", "Good. There shouldn't be any issues but there is still something that bothers me about the Coynite situation. I would rather be safe then sorry. We cannot have our prisoners running free all over the galaxy, now can we? You are dismissed, pilot.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_55905a28", "Hmm, you really don't know do you? Admiral Nial Declann is one of the twelve men in charge of the Imperial Navy. He wields great power and is said to be favored by the Emperor. I am just curious as to why this order says that you are to be immediately transferred under his command?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_55e3ea71", "I will forgive your insolence and call it the follies of youth. But make no mistake...Dathomir is not for the weak of spirit. I will have command transmit a patrol route that I wish you to fly once you enter the Dathomir system. Follow the route and keep a careful watch for any unauthorized activity. Now get out of my sight before I decide that youth isn't a good enough excuse. Oh, and worm...fail me and you will find yourself firmly on a hook!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_56c3f73d", "For anyone else but me that might be difficult.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_57274357", "That's a good little pilot. Get out of my sight before I lose my temper.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_57a5120c", "I think they are finished now, sir.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_58edcac7", "Where am I to report to?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_593c68fd", "The Coynite were foolish to attempt to circumvent the will of the Emperor.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_59da8c80", "I've been waiting for you, pilot. It's about time you got here. There's no time to waste. I've prepped a briefing for you, are you ready?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_5a0327df", "You have performed wonderfully with an alarming situation. It would seem that I had under estimated the resolve of the Coynite to finish a job that they were paid to do. I am most impressed with them. Based off of the single one I had dealings with I wouldn't have thought they had it in them.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_5c9b37f9", "See, I told you I would get this job done.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_5ca877f1", "Please do. They're an eyesore.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_5dce257f", "You must be here for your skills upgrade. Well, pick one. Be quick about it.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_5dff5608", "Yes, it does seem strange.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_5e0158c", "Complete your mission, and perhaps all will be forgiven.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_5ebf813b", "As you wish, my lord.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_5f1cd2f8", "See that it does.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_5fcdb10d", "Oh, I have several theories but I do not like to work on theory. Cold, hard fact has always been more to my liking.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_60a8bfcb", "I'd like to bring those rogue Imperials in.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6145c468", "Yes, you made quite sure that they were adequately punished. We will be dealing with the officers on Dathomir by telling the others that were not involved what was happening. They will deal with the traitorous officers in their own way.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_61657d0f", "I see.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6387b3e9", "Excellent. I will have command transmit a patrol route that I wish you to fly once you enter the Dathomir system. Follow the route and keep a careful watch for any unauthorized activity. These reports I have been receiving have left me feeling uneasy. I will know what is going on there. You have your command...now go!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_63b2a28a", "So, now we don't have any way to find out who is helping the Coynite?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6448a70", "A willing mind? How refreshing. I was getting so tired of the standard military pilots. Such wastes. But I suppose they do have their uses...they are nice fodder for the war effort. Don't you agree?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_647c9fa9", "Yes. Quite unusual! Imperials are usually so well-behaved. Maybe it's just a paperwork error. Regardless, bring them in.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6480af88", "Really? What did he say?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_64ce1b1d", "Thank you, sir. What is the next step?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_64e1e69d", "Maybe you should have tried harder?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_659c15a1", "I suggest you do.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_67183c1c", "I'm trying.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_673b4c9b", "It has been a long journey for you but you are nearing the end. I do have need of an extra pilot though. And since you are already here, you will do nicely.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6807942", "Excellent. I will have command transmit a patrol route that I wish you to fly once you enter the Dathomir system. Follow the route and keep a careful watch for any unauthorized activity. These reports I have been receiving have left me feeling uneasy. I will know what is going on there. Dismissed.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6844241f", "If you say so, sir.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6973ca89", "We are the Inquisition. I didn't think happy was our thing.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6c193c27", "Sure thing. Shouldn't be a problem.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6c2a8e60", "What did you learn from him?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6c7488f3", "First you must complete the tasks that I will lay before you. You will travel to Dathomir. I have been receiving some very disturbing reports of unauthorized activity within the system. I want answers about what is going on.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6d60481e", "Well, the post at the prison is a life time assignment. Once you are there, you do not leave. Naturally, every officer stationed at the planet wants to leave. Think about it. If one group forms a plan to escape and doesn't let the other group in on it, they would be rather upset.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6d741d67", "Yes. If I cannot capture the vessel, it will die.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6d844cc7", "The Emperor does indeed wish you to serve. The lab has finished analyzing the crystal you recovered. A most interesting piece of rock. Most interesting and most rare, indeed. In fact that particular crystal can only be found one place in the entire galaxy...Dathomir.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6ef5b0ae", "I thought Dathomir was forbidden. How do you know this?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_6fb4f06a", "A very interesting order came across my desk just a few moments ago. What is your relationship with Grand Admiral Nial Declann?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_7017e938", "It'll get done.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_714fef09", "What business does the Inquisition have in Dathomir?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_7177c3f2", "Who is Grand Admiral Nial Declann?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_719a036e", "Who?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_719f44a", "There are some things that you should not question. The Emperor has decreed it as so and that is all you need to know.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_722463c0", "That is a good, loyal pilot. Here you go. Try not to spend it all at once. When you are ready for some more lessons or to continue your duty come back and see me again. Perhaps I will have more need for you.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_725be20b", "So you are not all bluster. That is good. I was beginning to wonder if you were right for this job. You are still a worm but maybe one with a little bit of a backbone. I was thinking of withholding your duty pay but I guess you have earned it.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_72c7b032", "Excellent you are nearly finished with your training. It has been a long journey for you but you are nearing the end. I do have need of an extra pilot though. And since you are already here, you will do nicely.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_7bc04afa", "We will see. I will issue your duty pay. When you are ready for some more lessons or to continue your duty come back and see me again. Perhaps I will have more need for you. That rock you brought back is most interesting. We have top men working on it now.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_7c92f77a", "Until we know what that crystal is there is no need to continue the main operation. For now you may go on leave or take some duty missions. Once we have what we need and you are ready, we will continue our investigation.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_7d9ad22", "The prison drop shuttle that we were holding until the Coynite issue was dealt with is ready to drop its payload of prisoners on Dathomir. I need you to escort it through the system.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_7e1308bc", "I'll take droid intelligence theory.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_7e2d0f69", "We'll see if you can. Dismissed.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_8074838e", "I did not believe that all the reports I had been receiving were for this one lone individual, so I dispatched a set of recon shuttles to the system. Their scans revealed that a number of these vessels are moving around the system. We have a lock on one that recently touched down on the planet. Incidentally, or so it would seem, near the location of the prison. You are to capture me that ship when it returns to orbit.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_81ccdc67", "The crystals are worth a very handsome sum to the right people. They are rumored to have strange...properties. Of course, the question is how did that pilot get it? These crystals cannot be found just sitting around on the ground for any fool to pick up. They are only found deep under the surface.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_82095b20", "I'll take those prisoners to Dathomir. Sounds like fun.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_834bed59", "What were those crystals, sir?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_83803b19", "Do you mean Theed Palace and Queen Kylantha?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_83850af8", "You are to travel to Dathomir, my little worm. I have been receiving some very disturbing reports of unauthorized activity within the system. You will find out what is going on there for me.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_84350489", "I enjoy prisons, myself. Always full of men in need of discipline. ");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_851406fb", "Those pirates won't know what hit them.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_85b1adc5", "I haven't been able to bring it back yet, sir. But I'll take care of it.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_85c9e37e", "Very well. The situation report is as follows: Smugglers continue to infiltrate this system. Diplomacy's no use with them; they only understand the business end of a space blaster. So, you could clear them out.  ");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_873e726e", "My mission's not complete.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_898acaac", "What is it you need me to do, sir?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_8a38a5ed", "Who could it be?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_8a7c509a", "I have no idea how you managed to get down this far but I would suggest that leave immediately before something happens to you. People who don't belong here often find themselves losing everything.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_8bae75a0", "Bah! I assure you that I will find out the truth of why he asked for you. If I could I would keep you here until I found out the truth but even I cannot ignore an order from a Grand Admiral. You are to immediately report to the Grand Admiral Declann. You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_8bfb7a2f", "What's this? A complaint?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_8d7e0eff", "Hmm.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_8e075bc2", "Bah! I give you the slightest of praise and you cannot help but blow up like an Inerbion Gasbag. Here take this and get out of my sight.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_8feb33c1", "Ever?!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_90b2fe39", "I hear you loud and clear.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_90ce1297", "No, thank you.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_90f30b97", "The freighter you recovered was indeed filled with more of the crystals from Dathomir. That can only mean that they are working with someone who has an operation on the planet's surface with the capability to mine these. They would have to have access to a lot just to pay for the Coynite.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_91d10a84", "How unfortunate that you are unable to do your job.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_938d7337", "So what is the next step, sir?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_952743eb", "It is my business to know things. That and we maintain a prison on the planet's surface. Prisoners are dropped in from orbit, never to leave again. The guards who maintain the prison have surveyed a large portion of the planets unique flora, fauna, and, thankfully, geology.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_96a0374a", "I'll take heavy starship component use.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_97a051ab", "As you command, High Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_97ce1c41", "That problem was just a temporary setback. Don't worry.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_98332c8e", "Yes, what did they find out?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_9a9518f8", "Good. Now get to Dathomir and wait for your prey to arrive.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_9ab33e62", "Is that it?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_9ac7bd6d", "So the smuggler had to land on the planet.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_9ac8a54c", "Yes. I knew you would see it my way.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_9b3e4e71", "I will simply assume that means no. I cannot afford to lose you at this moment. I will have command transmit a patrol route that I wish you to fly once you enter the Dathomir system. Follow the route and keep a careful watch for any unauthorized activity. These reports I have been receiving have left me feeling uneasy. I will know what is going on there. You may leave now.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_9bc48781", "I am sure he did. That crystal you brought back is most interesting. Do you have any idea what it is?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_9c6ec037", "No, sir. I will get us that information.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_9d1c334d", "They are being analyzed by our top men. Those crystals are no longer your concern. You have done well this day and deserve to be rewarded for your loyal service. You want your reward don't you?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_9e131808", "I have heard that you've been assisting the Rebel Alliance against the Empire.  This concerns me a great deal, as you can imagine.  You cannot be trusted with any more assignments.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_9ec59458", "I...um...");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a0d28eb", "The Grand Admiral is stationed in Theed Palace. From what I understand its gaudy and worldly walls suit his personality just right. Go now. Do not keep the Grand Admiral waiting. There is much work to be done.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a11a905b", "You are one of our younger pilots, are you not? Of course you are. Is discipline in the ranks of the Inquisition breaking down so much that junior pilots think they can talk to a Grand Inquisitor unannounced? Perhaps it is time to purge out our slothful and weak...Why haven't you left yet?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a3958e6a", "Ready to serve, sir.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a3aef707", "Oh, me and Grand Admiral Nial Declann go way back.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a459860a", "What about the Coynite I captured?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a4b30c88", "I really don't know, Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a5e556b", "I will have command transmit a patrol route that you will fly once you enter the Dathomir system. Keep a careful watch for any unauthorized activity. I have a strange feeling that this will only be the first step down a long path. You may leave my presence now.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a6380860", "So you have failed. That is most distressing. I tasked you with such a simple task and you come back here with your tail between your legs like some mongrel dog.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a6cd772d", "You think that you are strong and unbendable? I have found the harder it is to bend the easier it is to break. You...I could crumble into dust in scant seconds. But I do not have even those scant seconds to waste. You have to do an assignment for me...perhaps we can get back to this later.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a6ef12b5", "Well what do you want me to do?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a6f30b2b", "Did you say...you're trying?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a72c3c89", "Inquisitors don't worry. But you SHOULD be worried. You don't want an Inquisitor to be angry with you, now do you?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_a9a7c838", "I do indeed, as you put it...say so. You are to report to Grand Admiral Nial Declann, perform your duties for him without question, and you are to keep your eyes open. Learn everything you can about this man and his goals. I think we can both learn from this experience.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_aa21cdc1", "I hope that skill serves me well as we begin the next stage of our operation. I broke the Coynite mercenary, as I knew I would. Sadly he was no where near as strong as I had hoped he would be. Such a disappointment.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_aa695923", "What am I to do next?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ac4bb3e6", "I am sort of curious about what they will actually do though. Call it professional curiosity. Maybe one of them will put it in a report. As for you...you are free to do as you wish for now, perhaps continue with our duties in the Dathomir system. There are still a few Coynite that may continue to cause minor problems that need to be cleaned.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_acaea8b8", "Of course there isn't. If there was, there would be no need for the Emperor or the Empire. We are the rock in the middle of the decay of strength and character. This was all caused by the Old Republic of course. If they had done their duty long ago, none of this would be necessary.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ace49d41", "If you are done wasting time, there is work to be done. Are you ready?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ad56bc53", "I broke the Coynite mercenary, as I knew I would. Sadly he was no where near as strong as I had hoped he would be. Such a disappointment.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_adb2030c", "It's about time you let me do my thing.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_af5329b0", "What? Now you want your reward! Of course you do. Because all good, loyal pilots take their reward when they do something well. Here take this. You are a good pilot. A very good pilot.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b0abb9a4", "I have need of your...unique talents. After all, idle hands are a dangerous thing.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b0feed48", "We have completed our analysis of that crystal you recovered.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b12a7f6", "Very well. That will be all pilot.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b1a3b711", "As long as we have come to an agreement. Dismissed!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b3a26c61", "I am ready to test out my new ability.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b3e5bbfc", "This just gets better and better. You remind me of one of my children...of course, I had to put them all to the question some time ago...");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b517963a", "Silence! I will have none of your lip today. Do not try my patience or I just might see if I can find fulfillment with questioning you. I did manage to get one very important piece of information out of him...how they communicate.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b6b25f13", "Yes, sir!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b84f68ab", "Why would he land on Dathomir for a crystal?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b9a22caa", "I am afraid that I do not have much practice with joviality. My talents have always seemed to lie elsewhere but I always try to bring a little bit of merriment to the job. A light heart makes even the heaviest of tasks easier.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_b9baa3d5", "Save the Empire? You? Do not make me laugh, little worm. I will admit your flying skills are impressive but the might of the Empire hardly lies in the skills of one pilot with an overblown ego. I am thinking that you should reconsider your choice to become an Inquisitor...you will not go far.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_bb9e4a63", "Understood, sir.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_bcd45d4", "The Coynite should no longer be a problem for us in the Dathomir system. Without their flagship they will have no staging point to continue their activities. You've completed your mission to the Emperor's satisfaction. Here is your duty pay.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_bdebb4cc", "So what is the next step?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_be7e95c", "I'll clear those damaged ships.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_bee296b6", "The Inquisition has business in all systems. But if you must know we have a special duty with the Dathomir system. Not only do we maintain a prison on the planet's surface, we are the only Imperial agency with the authorization to operation freely in the system. Everyone else must get special permission to even enter the system. Therefore, it is logical that we also maintain the security of that forbidden system.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_bfcf1757", "Nothing is pressing at this time. We will be dealing with the officers on Dathomir by telling the others that were not involved what was happening. They will deal with the traitorous officers in their own way.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c0f7c528", "What is your bidding now?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c13abf66", "Didn't I mention that he told me about the satellite receiver that they are using to get instructions from the planet? I could have sworn I told you that. No matter. You are to travel to that satellite and tap into their communications. It should be fairly easy, except that the Coynite have the satellite under constant surveillance, so you will have to guard against them while running your tap. But then again that is what you are here for.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c17d2691", "I can do it.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c181ff30", "You still have much to learn, my young pilot. There is no YOUR way. There is only the way of the Inquisition and the way of the Emperor. Nothing else matters. To ever be more than just a simple pilot, you must lose your pathetic, self-indulgent ego. I can show you the way down the path to true power but until you choose to take it, you will be nothing more than a slimy, little worm.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c1abdf95", "I go where I please.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c25d28ef", "At this time, I don't know. But we will find out. I am hoping that the Coynite you captured will be able to tell me more. The people of Coyn are well known for their resiliency but he will crack...they all do. Until then you can continue our duty operations or go on leave. I am sure that I will have more use for you later.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c28f20f3", "Report to the Grand Admiral Declann immediately. Just remember where your allegiance lies, pilot. Because if it ever falters not even a Grand Admiral can protect you from me. You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c2c13cf7", "The Emperor's blessing be with you, %NU.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c33416a7", "I do not find your pathetic attempt at humor amusing. You are speaking about a Grand Admiral of the Imperial Navy and someone who has the ear of the Emperor. Even I would not be foolish enough to make light of such a man.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c42f7c3f", "High Inquisitor?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c4bc5314", "I am yours to command, High Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c4f0640e", "I will have command transmit a patrol route that I wish you to fly once you enter the Dathomir system. Follow the route and keep a careful watch for any unauthorized activity. These reports I have been receiving have left me feeling uneasy. I will know what is going on there. May the Emperor's blessing be on you, %NU.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c4f74be1", "So, yet again, you have accomplished the task that I placed before you. The Emperor was most pleased with your progress and has issued a reward for you. Here it is.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c686dfd", "That is not a matter for you to have to worry about. Your only concerns are what I tell them to be. That crystal can fetch a very large sum to the right people. It is said to contain 'unique' powers, if you believe in that sort of thing. Of course, the question is how did that pilot get it? These crystals cannot be found just sitting around on the ground for any fool to pick up. They are only found deep under the surface.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c6f1b86f", "I am ready to serve, if the Emperor wills it.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c71c1bab", "Get out of my sight! Go escort a prison drop shuttle through the Dathomir system on its way to drop its payload on the prison. Begone, worm!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c82a372", "I could care less about those weak fools.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_c82e9a2f", "Yes, please.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_cacb4480", "A very handy skill to know in a pinch. It is a good thing that you returned for training when you did, I was about to send a probe droid out after you. Just a little humor there, but in all seriousness, it is good that you have returned. We have completed our analysis of that crystal you recovered.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_cd04b926", "Perhaps. Perhaps not. You are ordered to report to Grand Admiral Nial Declann immediately. Why he has asked for you I do not yet know, but I assure you I will find out. I do not like this but I do not have the authority to ignore a direct order from a Grand Admiral.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_cd3e5a44", "My thoughts exactly. The true power of the Empire lies only in the Emperor and those who understand that. I can see you understand that. Enough pleasantries, time for the reason you are here. You are to travel to Dathomir. I have been receiving some very disturbing reports of unauthorized activity within the system. You will find out what is going on there for me.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_cfb7c310", "%TU, you were given this assignment because you were good. But you don't seem particularly skilled.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_d0918370", "I do this for the duty, sir. No reward is necessary.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_d5225828", "Ah, so the worm made it back. You have done very well to slip from my hook. Perhaps one day. Perhaps one day soon, eh worm?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_d70698c1", "Work teaches discipline! Never waste a minute of your time. The Emperor needs your service, always. Tell me, are you ready to accept a duty mission, or would you like to hear the briefing again?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_d8355c02", "I'll take experimental TIE vessels.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_d8b3a5bc", "See that it doesn't, or you may find yourself back here answering a few more questions. I have orders here that you are to be transferred to the Grand Admiral in the Theed Palace. I find it most interesting that you were asked for by name. Doesn't it seem strange to you that a Grand Admiral would even know your name?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_d8efd03b", "I'll take elite TIE guard training.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_d908cfb0", "At the Emperor's will, my lord.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_da128253", "Without that information, we won't know who's behind all this. And you wouldn't want the Inquisition to be left in the dark would you?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_da53e28f", "Well we will find out soon. It is in the lab being analyzed. While that is taking place I will issue your duty pay. You have done the Emperor's work very well.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_dafddb17", "Fool! I meant how their friends on the ground send instructions to the Coynite. They use a satellite to send signals from the prison, then the Coynite listen in. It is a one way communication but is enough to suit their needs. You are going to travel to that satellite and tap into their instructions.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_db35e23", "You have your orders. Dismissed, pilot.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_dbb3a834", "Um, no.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_dc31882", "Yes. Here is your pay. I am going to have that crystal you brought back analyzed. While that is being done you can go on leave or take some duties. When we have the crystal analyzed, perhaps I will have more for you to do. You may leave my presence now.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_df53fe63", "Open their mouths...talk to each other. That is how we do it.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_e07a0513", "Do you have any idea who is helping them?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_e36c1eee", "Someone has to die. Might as well be them.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_e3ea301", "I have heard bad things about you, %TU.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_e479ad44", "He got what was coming to him for his disobedience.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_e643719b", "Please show me the way to true power, High Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_e69b471b", "I'll get the job done.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_e89ef227", "I hope you have never been there. The planet, Dathomir, is forbidden to all by Imperial decree and there is only one punishment for violating the order of the Emperor...slow, painful death! You cannot even enter the system without proper authorization. It would be such a shame to have to waste a talent like yours.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_e9065e37", "You will use any edge you get, won't you?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_e9776d82", "Almost any persona is half an act. It is actions that always speak the loudest about an individuals resolve. I assure you my resolve is far greater than my persona will ever be. Care to find out?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_e977b428", "There is no strength of will in people anymore.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_eaf485aa", "Wait a minute...this is all an act?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ec457ebc", "I mean I'll do it!");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ecb0921e", "Isn't Dathomir was forbidden. How do you know this?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ecd3f704", "What a relief. I'd hate to have to discipline you. I'm disappointed in you as it is.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ed8a35fe", "What did you find out about it, sir?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_eda629db", "Then I must destroy them.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ee5488a5", "That is a good pilot. I knew that you could be counted on. You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ee94373b", "Who do you think I was talking about? Sometimes I really wonder about you and what your agenda is. But I have time to find out, oh yes, I always have time. You are dismissed, do not keep the Grand Admiral waiting. I understand that he is an extremely impatient man. ");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ee9d18a3", "There are always ships taking damage in this system. They need a pilot to guide them in for repairs. ");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_f115f554", "Definitely not.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_f2050f58", "Yes, sir. Right away, sir.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_f435fbd2", "Don't waste your breath telling me lies. You have work to do. Go do it! ");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_f5d2aa8d", "I am honored that the Emperor took notice of his humble servant.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_f7053b89", "What are your orders, sir?");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_f76cec26", "We need a pilot to bring in a few Imperial ships that are here without authorization.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_f7e33371", "That's what  I thought.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_f82c2226", "Yes, I will agree with you. But some people simply don't know when to quit. Here, this is for you. I look forward to our next chat. Good day, pilot %NU.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_f87bfa4c", "Good. You are to stay off that planet. Now I will have command transmit a patrol route that I wish you to fly once you enter the Dathomir system. Follow the route and keep a careful watch for any unauthorized activity. These reports I have been receiving have left me feeling uneasy. I will know what is going on there. Dismissed.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_fae9dc1b", "I don't know Grand Admiral Nial Declann.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_fbcaed73", "Let you do your thing? Ah...you mean that you are a skilled pilot and I have been holding you back. Most interesting. You must indeed have some small measure of skill or you would not have risen so far so fast. I agree with you. It is time for me to measure your 'vaunted' skill as a pilot.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_fc6dc2db", "I have the report right here. Let me see. The crystal is composed of...alichite...30 perc...timmerosu...AH! Here is the important part that you need to know about. The crystal is found on only one planet in the entire universe, Dathomir. It is clear that this smuggler landed on the planets surface and recovered the rock. A very unfortunate situation.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_fcbb92d0", "You are already on a task. The Emperor would be most displeased to find out that his pilots are derelict in their duties. Get back to work.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_fe2a11f4", "Even if the Coynite are not, the traitorous prison officers are no longer alive to attempt escape. The Coynite have no reason to stay in the region anymore so they will move along. This is for you. You have earned it. You are dismissed, pilot.");
stringFiles[326].addEntry("s_ffa89518", "Why is it unfortunate?");

stringFiles[327] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_imperial_trainer_1");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_imperial_trainer_1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_101a6629", "Report back to me when you are ready.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_1091c96a", "I'm done for now.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_1110cd35", "I'm having your account credited. You've earned it. I also have your TIE flight suit. You should wear it while you're on duty. The helmet will take a while longer to arrive.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_11b1315a", "I will report to Fa'Zoll at the Emperor's Retreat immediately.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_11dce039", "Great job, Pilot. I was able to oversee your assault on the Rebels via sensor relay. You displayed a particularly impressive tactical sense. Even the Deck Commander expressed his surprise. Congratulations on a fine mission.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_1301bfd7", "Then our mystery is solved. The ground forces will need to track down how information on the prototypes leaked, but we know enough to secure further shipments of the technology. This is very good news.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_14aa29c", "I haven't exactly enjoyed your company, either. Yes, it does mean you will have a new commanding officer. I'll skip the formality. You are now a Pilot Officer. Personally, I think it's a mistake, but Naval Command likes the results you've shown.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_14abbd01", "Not today. I'm transferring the coordinates of a local security patrol route. It's pretty quiet up there, so you won't run into any trouble. Fly a single circuit of the patrol route to demonstrate your competence of basic ship operations. When you're done, return to me for further instructions.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_1598dcb2", "I'll be gone at the first sign of trouble.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_15daf24e", "You don't take complements very well. This one was worth double the normal rate. I've also received your Imperial TIE pilot helmet. Unfortunately, these standard issue helmets are not suited to meet your, uh... cranial proportions.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_1614fceb", "Report back to me when you are ready for another duty. I think we should look into this Rebel problem.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_169df3bb", "Never mind.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_16fc739e", "I...");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_19288eda", "I think I need to rethink things.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_19d7d16a", "It's too bad you can't wear it. It would be a marked improvement. Report back to me when you're ready for more work.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_19ff301f", "What kind of training?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_1a5d8b73", "Don't underestimate him. A particularly skilled and charismatic leader might explain the increase in the pirate activity. You must continue to hunt him down.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_1cfc4684", "Under Inquisitor Fa'Zoll in the Emperor's Retreat has been assigned as your new commanding officer. I don't know anything about this person and frankly I don't want to. The last thing any officer wants is to be noticed by the Inquisition. Their eyes rest only upon the guilty.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_1d0e7364", "I'm transferring a ship authorization and control device to your datapad. You'll need this to use your TIE Fighter. Should you lose your control device and access to your ship, you can apply for a new one at any time. Unfortunately, I'm only authorized to supply you with access to our low end TIE technology.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_1e9a88a8", "Who do I report to?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_1fa7fe89", "I don't have anything else for you. Talk to Under Inquisitor Fa'Zoll in the Emperor's Retreat.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_20f98863", "That's 'Thank you, sir.'");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_247ae5a6", "Here is your salary for the mission. This one was worth double the normal rate. I've also received your Imperial TIE pilot helmet. Unfortunately, these standard issue helmets are not suited to meet your, uh... cranial proportions. Nevertheless, keep it as a symbol of the technological and military might of the Empire.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_24890a54", "This recognition should have happened a long time ago.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2501f4f1", "Don't drink all of those credits. You'll want to keep some spare for ship repairs and upgrades.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_25dee8db", "Here's credit for the mission, plus a little extra for the danger involved. You performed well. Eliminating the Rebel fighter wing was the right decision, given the circumstances.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2670fd69", "I'll train you when I think you're ready.  And I don't think you're ready.  Now are you ready for your first assignment?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2692ee30", "Yes, I want a duty.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_29ad976e", "I'll go after them again.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2a1af001", "I defeated him with ease.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2a29a3de", "Yes, exactly. If they go for the bait, we'll know for certain that the prototype weapons are their goal. Obviously, you need to ensure the operative survives. You should also attempt to destroy any Rebels that attack, but that isn't a requirement. If things get hairy, protect the transport and then flee.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2ac29eb6", "You've shown a lot of promise so far, Pilot. This is a key assignment. We expect the Rebel team leader to be a highly skilled and well trained pilot. Don't underestimate him.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2bbdc667", "Pilot. We've analyzed your recent encounters with the Rebellion and have been unable to determine any pattern to their activity. The planetary security teams have decided these are probably probing raids.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2d5d4bf0", "I'm interested in a duty.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2ddcdfff", "The Rebels don't stand a chance.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2e48b5f1", "It's no secret that Imperial pilots utilize some of the best starfighter tactics the galaxy has ever seen.  I can get you started on the road to mastering these uniquely Imperial procedures.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2e935a2c", "Good to see you again, pilot. I hope your new assignment is going well. The voluntary conscription program has been quite successful. If there is anything I can help you with, let me know. Although you are overqualified, I can offer you some basic missions and duties. I can also train you in simple skills, in case you need a refresher.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_2fe328e", "By the powers vested in me by the Imperial Naval Command, under the ever watchful eye of the Emperor, I hereby conscript you to service with the non-officer flight rank of Pilot Initiate. May you serve the Empire dutifully. Welcome to the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_304d169e", "I am honored, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_30a48366", "Perhaps. By the powers vested in me by the Imperial Naval Command, under the ever watchful eye of the Emperor, I hereby commend you and bestow upon you the rank of Pilot Officer.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_30e39201", "Glad I could help...");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_31967d85", "Does this mean I get a new handler? I'm sick of working with you.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_336e9422", "Naval Command will be pleased at the outcome of the operation. Our mystery is solved. The ground forces will need to track down how information on the prototypes leaked, but we know enough to secure further shipments of the technology.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_34975e9f", "Report back to me when you've successfully completed the mission.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_34bc5f5e", "You don't have the experience to apply to training.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_366e0c62", "You can learn about Imperial technology, equipment, space combat training, or astromech management.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_368fd90b", "We have discovered the possible location of the Rebel team leader. You are to be dispatched immediately. Travel to the waypoint I'm transferring to your datapad. Find and eliminate him. Don't worry if he isn't there when you arrive. Take out a few of his fellow pilots in the area and he will show up.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_36ccf586", "As you should be. Very few academy graduates could have pulled that off, much less a conscript. Here is your payment for the mission, plus a bonus. I've also received permission to have your personal profile sent to the Commissions Office. They'll start work on your custom TIE flightsuit.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_36d269f7", "Prove your devotion to the Empire and your dedication to the Emperor.  If you improve your standing with the Empire, you MIGHT be allowed to fly again.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_37650e5c", "Yes, sir! I want to be in the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_37979335", "Report back to me when you are finished with the patrol.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_37b6c92d", "What is the purpose behind the raids?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_37eb1d12", "I'd rather not sign up right now, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_388cfea9", "The Empire is recruiting volunteer pilots?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_38becb2d", "Report on the status of your operation against the Rebel team leader, Pilot.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_39ca1bf", "Wait!  There must be something I can do!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_3a1ddc14", "I was attacked by a Rebel fighter wing, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_3b1fee95", "Report to me when you are ready to give it another try.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_3b3aabc1", "I'd like training, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_3d71cce7", "You have to make sure the transport escapes before you leave. We will not leave one of our own behind.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_3de840b5", "I need to spend some time practicing.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_3e7988c1", "Sometimes I surprise myself.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_3f082a8b", "Since you are new to the Imperial Navy, we have to subject you to a basic test of skill. We want to make sure you are capable of performing the kind of operations that are common in naval duty.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_3f6a8711", "Thank you, sir. I do my best.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_40f3848e", "I'm interested in space combat training.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_424f48fc", "Here's your pay for the operation and another bonus for exceptional duty. I also received your Imperial flight suit, but you'll never fit into this. Take this bandolier, instead.  At least it'll help you to keep your things organized.  The helmet will take a while longer to be finished. Each helmet contains special electronic equipment calibrated to the user.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_42dfe6db", "Indeed. The Empire rarely enlists non-Humans as pilots, and so we are poorly prepared to equip someone such as yourself. But do not be discouraged. Your current standing in the Imperial Navy is a testament to your abilities.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_4358efe9", "Where is my ship?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_438b2349", "So far you've been flying a basic TIE.  The normal TIE is quite a bit more complicated than that.  For one thing, you'll find that you can install better components on it... better weapons, better armor, and so on.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_43d18dec", "You know, these Rebels are really stupid people.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_448fbf05", "You will always address him as Inquisitor Fa'Zoll. Good luck, Pilot Officer %NU. You have done the Empire a great service.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_44a60f99", "Tell your adjutant he'll have more kills to confirm soon.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_45b14b72", "Good, I have a lot of work for you. The Emperor has decreed that the rebellion is to be driven from the Naboo system.  I can also assign you to escorting transports moving supplies.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_47691a6", "Report to me when you are ready to attempt the patrol again.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_4774404f", "There will be a time to strike against the Rebels once we know what their intentions are. This mission is for information gathering. If you get a chance to take out a target of opportunity, then by all means do so, but do not risk your life at this stage in the operation.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_47925d97", "I want to join the ground forces");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_4854758d", "I would like to request a mission.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_486c459c", "What was that, pilot?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_48852667", "I see.  I certainly hope you're not going to spend ALL of your time on the ground, Pilot.  But if you insist on becoming a soldier as well, go talk to an Imperial Recruiter.  He'll get you squared away.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_48d418c", "Let me guess, you want me to kill them?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_4918bb61", "As do we all. Now that you have achieved an official command rank, I am no longer your commanding officer. Although it pains me to lose such a fine pilot, you have been reassigned.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_49ab06fa", "You've earned it, Pilot. You have exceeded the expectations of this program and of myself. Your duty has not ended, however. Return when you are ready to take on another operation.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_4aa87431", "Aye, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_4cf693b", "As you wish. Dismissed, pilot.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_4d7a1ae4", "Spaced him. Now, about my fee?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_4d88001", "When you launch into space, the TIE navicomputer will create a special 'launch waypoint' that you can use to navigate back to the main Naboo space station. When you arrive at the space station, comm them and request landing clearance.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_4e0900db", "By the powers vested in me by the Imperial Naval Command, under the ever watchful eye of the Emperor, I hereby commend you and bestow upon you the rank of Pilot Officer. Congratulations, Pilot Officer %NU.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_50ad850c", "You will need to go to the starport. Once you reach the starport, go inside and look for a 'starship terminal.' You'll find them in the main room of the starport. Use the terminal to launch your starship into space.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5109c7f7", "Restrain your enthusiasm, pilot. This is a simple training operation and it doesn't pay as much as a real duty. Today you will be subject to a basic test of skill. We want to make sure you are capable of performing the kind of operations that are common in naval duty.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_519c6a35", "It would be an honor to fly for you, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_527c6359", "I'm interested in equipment.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_53f85004", "Let's leave the ground combat to the Army, shall we? I do have your payment for completing this operation. I also received your Imperial flight suit. The helmet will take a while longer to be finished. Each helmet contains special electronic equipment calibrated to the user.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_550165e", "Yes, volunteers or conscripts. Rebel opposition has become more direct. We want to recruit new pilots for support duty, freeing up combat pilots for the front lines.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_565cc8ba", "I live only to serve the Emperor, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_56dbc789", "Your skill behind the controls of the TIE Fighter have peaked the interest of several high ranking officers. In particular, members of the Imperial Inquisition have expressed their desire to take over your training. They rarely request specific pilots, so you should consider this quite the honor.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5797c779", "Welcome to the Imperial Navy Recruitment Center. My name is Lieutenant Barn Sinkko. Are you interested in learning about the Imperial Navy?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_59c8db72", "Sir, yes, sir!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_59d306ec", "(Relate information on your inability to defeat the Rebel leader.)");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5bc07030", "What's the mission, sir?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5c314851", "You get what you pay for.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5e2a2bb1", "Sounds good.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5e3cf461", "I'm interested in Imperial technology.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5eba6ff3", "I have not received authorization to assign you any missions, Pilot. Speak with your commanding officer if you are looking for something to do.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5ebce168", "Actually, I'd like to do this later.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5ee0d552", "This sounds like a better mission...");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5f2d3c1e", "I'm fairly busy, so I'll have to talk to you more later.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_5fdfcebf", "Report back to me when you've successfully eliminated the Rebels.  And do not abort your mission again!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6047677", "I'm ready, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_60c4f974", "Where do I go?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_610250ee", "Rebels? Near Naboo? Are you certain?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6159d1a3", "I've seen your face! You're a known Rebel pilot!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_61eba7c4", "I wouldn't have fallen for that trap.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_62645c46", "Keep up this level of performance and you're sure to see some frontline action. We're still trying to determine the Rebels' intentions. For now, things seem quiet, so go get some rest and report back when you are ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_62ee6ad5", "Pilot, dismissed!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6396820e", "What is the Imperial Inquisition?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6456f762", "Great, now I'll look good at my funeral.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_64fb691f", "Good morning, Pilot Initiate. I hope you've had your Drall cakes and cream, because its going to be a busy day. Stand at attention!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_651c4d7a", "And...");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6554bb6c", "Absolutely not.  You need to complete a few more assignments before I'll train you.  Now, about that Rebel fighter wing...");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_668cac00", "I need to think about the mission and figure out what went wrong.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6868d86b", "Return to me when you are ready to take the mission.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_68951976", "Get back out there and fly it again or turn in your authorization papers and hit the road. I don't have time for pilots who are incapable of completing simple assignments.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_69a4d9f8", "I'm having your account credited. You've earned it. I also had a bandolier made for you, since you'll never fit into a uniform... at least you can keep your things organized.  The helmet will take a while longer to arrive.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_69a4eec5", "How do I return?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6a128385", "What is a duty?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6df58958", "I'm only interested if there's pay involved. I need work.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6e62e955", "You should be. An officer rank is usually only given to those who graduate Naval Command School. All combat pilots in the Imperial Navy hold at least the rank of Pilot Officer. The Empire has recognized your ability and has seen fit to elevate you to the lowest rank of the command echelon.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6e71a8bb", "I already know how to fly and shoot.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6f12f083", "I won't, sir. You can count on me.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6f5e007c", "It's kinda ugly lookin.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_6fc304c8", "I'm here to bust Rebel heads. Sign me up!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_71ab0619", "Just make sure you have my credits ready.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_7258dd22", "The Empire has recognized your ability and has seen fit to elevate you to the lowest rank of the Naval command echelon. Don't abuse that trust. You have also been reassigned.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_729d0338", "Thank you, Sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_730419d7", "Very well. The Rebels are apparently still in the same area. You must ensure their destruction this time. It's important that we maintain proper security on this planet and that means crushing even minor Rebel activity.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_7478cd28", "Will you train me after this?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_754edf1d", "With just a little more training, you could be using better equipment.  Missiles can really help to swing the battle your way, and this skill can allow you to use some good ones.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_76892f68", "Pilot. Report on the status of your patrol.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_7724d1e6", "Pilot Initiate. I've been informed of your failure. Unfortunately, until you are able to complete that patrol without error, I cannot offer you further assignments with the Imperial Navy. I am very disappointed.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_786f3cf7", "I want to study something else.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_78d92576", "What are my orders, sir?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_78efc377", "I'm glad to see you didn't leave at the first sign of trouble. The Intelligence operative says you acted decisively.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_798ef1b", "Cute. Why recruit volunteers?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_79ab4bbe", "[Escort Duty] I'm interested in escorting transports.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_7ae0d223", "Good to see you again. I've been authorized by my superiors to give you special training. Congratulations.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_7bdc0484", "I take it they attacked as expected?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_7c4734cc", "Well, it's a good thing for us that the Rebels lack your towering intellect. Our mystery is solved. The Rebels were here for the E-62 after all. Ground forces will need to track down how information on the prototypes leaked, but we know enough to secure further shipments of the technology.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_7c8aca1b", "Good choice.  Report back when you are ready for an assignment.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_7d477c70", "Sir...I...ah...lost my ship control device.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_7e347138", "He's as good as dead.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8153a680", "Slow down, friend. I appreciate the enthusiasm, believe me there are plenty of Rebels out there who need that kind of treatment, but the Imperial Navy is about more than combat duty.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_81849afb", "Report back to me when you've successfully eliminated the Rebels.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8273f08f", "Naval Command will be pleased. I didn't expect someone like you to be such an asset to the Empire.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8529aa51", "Yes.  I'd train you NOW if this weren't so urgent.  So make it quick.  Eliminate that Rebel leader!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_859cd287", "I'm transferring the coordinates of a local security patrol route. It's quiet up there, so you won't run into any trouble. Fly a single circuit of the patrol route to demonstrate your competence of basic ship operations. When you're done, return to me for further instructions.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_87019da4", "I was hoping you would show your face, just so I could tell you myself:  You're a disgrace to the Imperial Navy and you've been grounded.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_87bb7015", "[Destroy Duty] I'm interested in hunting Rebel scum.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_88f723eb", "Sir, I would be honored to fly with the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_88ffee3a", "Report back to me when you are ready for some work.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_890c4859", "Glad to hear it! Normally, all of our pilots are officers. Usually that means years of study at a Naval school, as well as special recommendations from an Imperial accredited academic center. We have a new program for volunteer pilots. Noncombat support work, but all the normal military perks and pay.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_89bc583c", "Very well, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8a2b78b3", "Can we prevent that?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8b493b63", "Excellent. I'm transferring the coordinates of a local security patrol route. It's quiet up there, so you won't run into any trouble. Fly a single circuit of the patrol route to demonstrate your competence of basic ship operations. When you're done, return to me for further instructions.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8bc18758", "I eliminated the patrol. I expect to be paid for that.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8c262163", "Report back to me when you are finished with your current mission.  You can abort your mission if you want to start over.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8c85a270", "The burning scrap of their ships still bear Rebel insignia.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8c9c5f1a", "Will you train me now?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8d324b72", "I've transferred the patrol coordinates to your datapad. Try harder this time, pilot.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8e66d267", "You don't have the experience for training, yet. Perform some more duties.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_8efde2ae", "Yes, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_90ce1297", "No, thank you.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_916fe685", "Rebels...near Naboo? I'm surprised. We haven't had any reports on significant Rebel activity for quite a while. They must be working on a new operation. We'll scramble some sensor craft and try to track down where the Rebels were headed.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_94131047", "Don't lose it this time.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_943c7ba6", "I'd like training.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_95d2ba30", "By the powers vested in me by the Imperial Naval Command, under the ever watchful eye of the Emperor, I hereby conscript you to service with the flight rank of Pilot Initiate. May you serve the Empire dutifully. Welcome to the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_95f0e74b", "Even so, I suggest you wear it. It would be a marked improvement. Report back to me when you're ready for more work.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_987445c9", "Thank you, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_98c44634", "With the recent increase in Rebel activity, our supply transports are at risk. The Empire would like to assign at least one TIE pilot to every transport operating in the Naboo system. You will be paid for every successful escort operation you complete.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_9a34f731", "Are you sure you want to sign up? You'll be expected to follow orders and treat your superiors with respect. This is a tight operation and we deal harshly with insubordinate behavior.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_9b6aa4b0", "Report back to me when you are ready for another duty. We need to look into this Rebel problem.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_9bd7e7db", "Alright! I'm ready to make some credits.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_9be59baa", "The Inquisition is a special judicial branch of the Imperial Intelligence bureau. Of all of the Imperial divisions, only the Inquisition has the ability to investigate criminals, judge them, and execute punishment without recourse to standard Imperial law. The Inquisition is powerful and secretive. To become a member of the Inquisition is a rare honor.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_9c044885", "Rebels? We haven't had any reports on significant Rebel activity in this region for some time. Are you sure they were Rebels?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_9c2b0ed7", "Noncombat? Doesn't sound very interesting.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_9c80b7c7", "I'll take that as a complement.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_9d7bc2d3", "On second thought, this sounds like too much for me.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a087f2d5", "You do not have the proper security clearance to fly any of the missions I have, but I do have some elective duty tasks that you can perform. Do you want a duty task?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a1302371", "Since the destruction of the Death Star, we are increasing the number of resources directed against the Rebellion. We have a new program for volunteer recruits. You bypass the normal training and academic program for immediate assignments. Most of the assignments are noncombat oriented.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a1f66568", "Stand at attention pilot! You are a member of the Imperial Navy. A modest level of respect for your superiors is required at all times. Complete this operation without incident and you will see better assignments, but for now you will shut up and listen! Is that clear?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a38ce775", "You're almost ready, I think... but right now this is more important.  Pay attention!  I'll train you after you've completed a couple more assignments.  Right now, you need to deal with those Rebels.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a44450e3", "Good luck, pilot. Report back to me when you've completed the mission.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a490d2c6", "Alright.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a54e8a02", "We also have a volunteer division on Tatooine under the direction of Lt. Akal Colzet. He's a little extreme, but you could talk to him if you want to work in the Outer Rim. Good day.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a57e647c", "I'm interested in astromech management.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a5bc9cf4", "My payment?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a6069c84", "Ran into some Rebel opposition, but they were easy prey.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a6e045f3", "Don't bother taking a seat, this will be brief. We've had a breakthrough. At 03:00 last night, an intelligence operative working under cover delivered a report detailing recent Rebel activities in the Naboo system.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a7f18ee0", "Very well.  Here is your payment for the mission. I've also received permission to have your personal profile sent to the Commissions Office so they can start work on your custom TIE flightsuit.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a8264b81", "Reveal the Rebel plan and keep the transport alive and you'll be paid. Report back to me when you've completed the mission.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a8755a48", "Unless you have business with the Imperial Navy, I must ask you to come back another time. I'm very busy right now.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a8c82b1c", "Sir, yes sir!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a9bcd9f0", "Good job. I'm crediting you for the mission, along with a little extra. You performed admirably. I can't say I appreciate your money motivation, but as long as you continue to do your job as efficiently, you can expect further rewards.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_a9f55c8c", "Yeah, I'm ready. Sign me up!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_aa61375", "Apparently, the Imperial Army has been receiving shipments of a new blaster prototype, the 'E-62'. For some political reason, the Ground Force Command deemed it wasn't critical to inform the Navy of these shipments. Strategic Planning believes the probing raids are meant to locate and capture one of the transports ferrying an E-62 shipment.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_abb72a4a", "You are quite difficult to work with. ");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ada6c751", "I've already received the reports regarding your failure to eliminate the Rebel fighter wing. I'm disappointed. If the Rebels think that Imperial defense on Naboo is weak, they may launch a costly offensive. They have no hope of winning, but we also don't want to see that kind of war here.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_add5962c", "I eliminated the entire Rebel fighter wing, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_adf9eee2", "Report to me when you've completed your mission.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ae102a", "Your mercenary spirit is unsettling. I would like to think that you have some kind of patriotic belief. Something that drives you to help us, instead of joining the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b00e89d5", "I'd like to sign up, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b01365ea", "You do seem naturally predisposed to this kind of work. I'm glad you chose to work with the Imperial Navy. Report back to me when you're ready for your next assignment.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b0ef8499", "Flee? I'm no coward!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b1f99085", "This information will please the Naval Command. You have done an impressive job, Pilot. Perhaps you really are all that you claim.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b24a6589", "It sounds like you already have a plan.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b29a803f", "It's not your ship. It's the Emperor's ship... and it's one of many basic TIE craft parked at the starport. You have the 'control codes' for this ship. I uploaded them to your personal datapad. Check your datapad to see your ship status.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b317642c", "Alright. Come back if you reconsider.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b33bb9fd", "You may very well receive it. For now, I want to continue to ease you into things. You may have some natural talent, but there is more to space combat than talent alone. Here is your payment for the mission, plus a bonus. I've also received permission to have your personal profile sent to the Commissions Office. They'll start work on your custom TIE flightsuit.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b3408be1", "Are you ready for your first assignment?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b39049de", "When will you train me?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b3d4ac64", "Naval command will not be happy with having to share its resources with the ground forces... but I suppose we ARE on the same team.  You do realize that even as a covert operative, you may be opening yourself to attack when you least expect it?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b5ba52d1", "What did I do?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b5d0e16a", "This information will please the Naval Command. No doubt they will also realize that part of your success came from my masterful instruction. I think you may have done us both a great service.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b6683056", "Welcome back, Pilot. Please report the results of the operation to bait a Rebel attack.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b6a9dd10", "I should be asking you that.  All I know is that Imperial command has grounded you for actions against the Empire.  You'll never fly again.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b6b25f13", "Yes, sir!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b7bdfe36", "Sure, sign me up.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b8ca7ab0", "As long as you keep paying, I'll keep delivering.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_b8f011dc", "Here is your salary for the mission. This one was worth double the normal rate. I've also received your Imperial TIE pilot helmet, specifically calibrated for your mental and physical flight profile. Wear this whenever you are on duty as a symbol of the Empire's technological and military might.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_bb462a81", "Very good. We're counting on you to trap the Rebels. Don't let me down.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_bb78a22c", "Don't get too cocky. The Rebels would be stupid to think we haven't detected them. Even though we don't know their exact location, they may be expecting an armed response. Intelligence reports there are several areas of high Rebel activity, which will be a good place to start your search.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_bb8aff15", "This is hardly a challenge.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_bc1b7622", "You performed admirably in combat with the last fighter wing. We want to see an encore. I want you to hunt down and destroy the rebel vessels in the area of the 'Kantari' attack. The Rebels are still out there and we must make them pay. The security of the Naboo system must be maintained.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_bc695163", "I can clear you for a new TIE Fighter, but only the basic model. Are you sure you want a new control device?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_bc7d6b01", "I'm a great fighter pilot. You guys could use me.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_bcadc07d", "Good, report back to me when the mission is complete.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_bd5ec97c", "Lowered pay?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_bda5060f", "Hmph. Report back to me when you're ready for your next assignment.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_bf64734d", "I don't want to learn anything right now.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c01da9e4", "(Sneer at him.) Just pay me.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c0265f54", "Yeah, they tried to take the transport.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c0c8fe59", "One day the Emperor himself will recognize my strength.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c15ca8cc", "Pilot Initiate. At ease. Since your discovery of Rebel activity in the Naboo region, I've received further reports of Rebel sightings. The most recent report was from Commercial Transport 'Kantari.' Several hours ago, 'Kantari' spotted a Rebel fighter wing moving close to a commercial traffic route.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c17b4421", "If you complete the mission, you'll get your pay. Report back to me when you're done.  Don't forget:  they could be anywhere in the system! Intelligence reports there are several areas of high Rebel activity, which will be a good place to start your search.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c19ed115", "You've got your assignment, and the control device for your ship in your datapad.  Go to the Starport and access the terminal to launch into space.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c2685407", "I hope you reconsider. Good day, citizen.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c297a8d4", "Most?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c5d91ca3", "Don't underestimate the Rebel leader. He may be a highly skilled pilot and possibly have special operations training. He will probably be more skilled than the other ships you've encountered so far.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c6aae4cb", "Cranial proportions?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c6d9f61", "I'd like to study that in detail.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c760c195", "There's always a chance you might get into combat during a support operation, but don't be so quick to want to get into a furball. The flyboys have a saying: 'dead is dead.'");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c7ca1c2c", "Will there be any shooting, sir?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c7d82215", "What's the new assignment?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_c80f115e", "Rebel activity is still high enough that we need combat capable pilots on active duty locating and eliminating them. You have free reign to use lethal force against any member of the Rebellion you locate in the Naboo system. The Empire will pay a bounty on every one you destroy. Good luck.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ca3578cc", "I think it suits you. You have exceeded the expectations of this program and of myself. Your duty has not ended, however. Return when you are ready to take on another operation.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_cb0c70a2", "I was wondering when you were going to get to that part.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_cb99174", "I have to study what went wrong.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_cd024d84", "It looks intimidating. I like it.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ce63cdc0", "That isn't clear. The Rebels may be trying to find a weakness in the planetary defense grid, or they may be trying to distract us from some other operation. There is one small lead.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ce681825", "You should have realized this long ago.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ce7aa9b7", "I don't think it's wise to throw you into a combat situation without first measuring your abilities. Demonstrate that you can follow simple orders and then we can talk about giving you something that's more of a challenge.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_cf68a5b5", "Yeah, but the combat duty is the part I'm interested in.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_cfb2442e", "It's as we thought. The Rebels have dispatched a small combat wing to attempt to recover a shipment of E-62 prototype blasters. Based on intelligence projections and the results of your engagements, it seems likely only a few of the original team are still alive.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d06e1eb", "(mumble) Yes, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d09c1ecb", "Just doing my duty, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d25495b9", "Pilot, I am singularly impressed. You have mastered the fundamentals of your profession and have performed beyond expectation and all without formal Imperial Naval Flight & Command training. I think it's time for a promotion.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d25c510b", "Duty missions are open ended assignments. They end when you choose to end them. For example, if I assign you the task of hunting pirates, you can hunt as many pirates as you want. You can end the duty any time from the mission entry in your datapad. Perform duties to earn pay and build experience. Once you've received enough experience, I can instruct you on various aspects of the pilot's combat role.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d2639576", "Getting authorized for combat duty takes work. All of our pilots are officers. Usually that means years of study at a Naval school, as well as special recommendations from an Imperial accredited academic center.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d2ed722", "Maybe you should reconsider your chosen profession! Come back when you want to try again.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d66c56cf", "I've already received the reports on the damage to your ship and your failure to eliminate the Rebel fighter wing. I'm disappointed. If the Rebels think that Imperial defense on Naboo is weak, they may launch a costly offensive. They have no hope of winning, but we also don't want to see that kind of war here.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d825aeb0", "Very well, good day Pilot.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d82fc96f", "Pilot Initiate, that was a complete disaster! Strategic Command wants you stripped of your commission. Fortunately for you, I still believe in this operation. I've convinced them to give you another try. Get back out there and find those Rebels!");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d8487693", "Pilot. I don't have any specific work for you at this time. You can now select your preferred operation from a list of general duties. Or, if you have enough experience, pursue training.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_d9f28087", "The command staff will begin planning the next phase of the operation. We need to eliminate the remainder of the Rebel forces. Your next assignment will probably involve doing just that. Report back to me when you are ready.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_da5219a7", "Some Rebels were stirring up trouble, thought you said that wouldn't happen.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_dc63dc1a", "Never mind, I don't want any training after all.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_dca3d46b", "You want to draw them out.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_de1d8561", "I want to be paid for each Rebel I take out.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_df1a0b2a", "What is that?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_df76b2e8", "Imperial astromech functionality is typically built into a rugged navicomputer, rather than those annoying sorts of astromech units that the Rebel Alliance relies on.  I can teach you how to utilize some of the basic functionality of the droid interface to normalize your shields, overload your weapons, and that sort of thing.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_dfd0987b", "You don't take complements very well. This one was worth double the normal rate. I've also received your Imperial TIE pilot helmet, specifically calibrated for your mental and physical flight profile.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e034da9", "I'll keep that in mind.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e106780b", "Good to see you, Pilot.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e1147f5d", "I want you to hunt down and destroy the Rebel vessels in the area of the 'Kantari' attack. The Rebels are still out there and we must make them pay. Eliminate them. The security of the Naboo system must be maintained.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e12b6418", "I located and destroyed him, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e16ed40c", "Then you're the kind of person we're looking for. Are you sure you want to sign up? You'll be expected to follow orders and treat your superiors with respect. This is a tight operation and we deal harshly with insubordinate behavior.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e1d8cd2a", "This is disturbing. We'll need to increase our sensor coverage and try to determine where the rebels are coming from. The Emperor's Retreat is located on Naboo... the Rebels may very well be planning some kind of sabotage.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e24fd46f", "You've already proven your combat capability. I'm taking a risk assigning you this mission, don't let me down. Remember, they could be anywhere in the system!  Intelligence reports there are several areas of high Rebel activity, which will be a good place to start your search.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e565620f", "Fair enough. As long as it pays, I'm willing to do the job.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e660e010", "We need to confirm our suspicions. Make the Rebels show their hand. If we assign too many ships to protecting E-62 shipments, we may miss the Rebels' actual objective.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e80d813e", "I'd like more combat duty, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e8a06d76", "Report back to me when the mission is complete.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_e9339227", "Very good. Today we will be testing your basic flight capability. You'll need to have your ship prepped for flight.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ea112eca", "I'll be ready, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ea289c5d", "You should clean up your act pilot. You're sloppy. Report back to me when the mission is complete.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_eb4bd86c", "We've thrown something together. I'm transferring a set of coordinates to your datapad. I want you to fly this route until an E-62 transport contacts you. The transport is a decoy, being piloted by a Naval Intelligence operative. The transport will broadcast lightly encrypted information on E-62 and will fly through an area we believe the Rebels may be monitoring.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ec04a9b3", "Report on the status of your operation against the Rebel leader, Pilot.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ec61d38d", "There's always a chance you might encounter Rebel resistance during a support operation, but it tends to be low. The real drawback to the program is that without formal Imperial training, you'll be on your own to learn the ropes of space combat.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_ee63dfa9", "Report back to me when you would like a new duty or mission.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_efa5623a", "Thank you...sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f02428e4", "Do you think I could get one of those blasters?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f123cba6", "Let's leave the ground combat to the Army, shall we? I do have your payment for completing this operation. I also had a bandolier made for you, since you're much too large for a flight suit. The helmet will take a while longer to be finished. Each helmet contains special electronic equipment calibrated to the user.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f3e660d", "Some of them, at least. I want you to hunt down and destroy the Rebel vessels in the area of the 'Kantari' attack. The Rebels are still out there and we must make them pay. The security of the Naboo system must be maintained.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f50739c7", "You did? Impressive. I suppose that means we won't be able to track their heading, but under the circumstances you did the right thing. My congratulations. You've shown that not only can you fly a basic patrol, but you aren't bad with a laser cannon either. Here's your payment for the job.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f5559c6a", "Rebel markings on the hull of X-Wing spec fighters.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f6c0eced", "We can definitely help you out, although we generally work with officer material from academic centers or Naval Training facilities. We have a new program for recruiting volunteers. The work pays and you'll be doing noncombat support missions.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f6c21772", "If you don't get yourself killed first. Now that you have achieved an official command rank, I am no longer your commanding officer. You have been reassigned.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f6e10f56", "Good to meet you Pilot. According to my records you're already working with a different division. What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f774e399", "Cool.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f7924d1a", "I suppose you're waiting for your payment.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f79f892a", "I think I can manage my money just fine by myself.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f9081167", "I'm honored, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f9660223", "I'll get the damage repaired and go after them again.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_f967fcee", "No, this doesn't sound like my kind of job.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_fa138f3b", "Since the destruction of the Death Star, we are increasing the number of resources directed against the Rebellion. We need to put our more experienced fighters on the front lines, which means we need new blood for support duty.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_fa7b1fcc", "Keep the transport alive. That is a priority directive. Report back to me when the mission is complete.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_fa956108", "The command staff will begin planning the next phase of the operation. Report back to me when you're ready for another assignment.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_fc1001ba", "Aren't you on a wanted list? I think I've seen your picture before...");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_fd4fe208", "That is your choice, but you may not get this chance again.  I suggest that you take it while you can.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_fe2c6775", "Here's your pay for the operation and another bonus for exceptional duty. I also received your Imperial flight suit. Please wear it while you are on duty. The helmet will take a while longer to be finished. Each helmet contains special electronic equipment calibrated to the user.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_fe48d61f", "I'm not interested in debating personal philosophies.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_fe5a7681", "The Rebels attacked exactly as expected, sir.");
stringFiles[327].addEntry("s_feb83ab9", "Well, you're certainly sure of yourself. My adjutant will send someone out to confirm the kills. If there are active Rebel fighter wings near Naboo, we need to be concerned. The Emperor's Retreat is located on Naboo...the Rebels may very well be planning some kind of sabotage.");

stringFiles[328] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_imperial_trainer_2");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_imperial_trainer_2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_131def5c", "Very well, yes, yes. Very well. Now then, I have an initial assignment for you. Why don't you familiarize yourself with the facilities and then return when you are ready?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_164b059e", "For your sake I hope that you are right.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_172871ff", "I knew I could count on you. Report back to me when you have finished the job. Don't disappoint me again, pilot.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_196d2fe6", "That is what it would appear. This transgression must never be allowed to go unpunished. It is time for Colonel Hend to be punished for his treachery. We are in the process of tracking down where the colonel went. Once we have found his location it will be up to you to pass sentence on the traitor.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_1980f233", "I understand, sir.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_199bd27f", "For several months now the Inquisition has been monitoring activities between certain members of our military and suspected Rebel sympathizers. One such meeting took place not long ago and it is time that the Inquisition discovered the truth behind these suspicious activities.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_19fe9586", "Do you want me to destroy the conspirators?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_1ad5c0e0", "What's the second thing?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_1bac802d", "Thank you sir. It has been an honor to serve under you.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_1c006c1c", "Ah, you're a long way from your squadron pilot. What brings you out this way?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_1d5aba18", "(Transfer the information to Inquisitor Fa'Zoll.)");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_1d63bf5d", "You still have much to learn about what it means to be a member of the Inquisition. Regardless, you are to enter the Naboo system and recover the colonel. His transport will most likely be heavily guarded and I doubt they will be willing to give up their prize without a fight. Once you have his ship secured protect it from counter-attack until it can hyperspace back into safe space.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_1f033c46", "I am ready and willing to make the traitor pay.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_1f0f791f", "Ah, yes, excellent. You are ready to begin our work, then?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_205f33ca", "Be on your guard. Any one of those ships could be in league with the insurgents.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_20b3aa70", "Yes, my lord. But won't the colonel be expecting us?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_21772e5a", "I'm sorry, I can't help you.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_22a1fc52", "Perhaps Imperial Intelligence can crack it.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_2313ac9e", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_241a34a1", "Mastering proper use of heavy equipment technology is key. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_245945cb", "What is the matter with you, pilot?!  You dare show your face around here?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_26408ea", "There are several leads and the Navy is sending out patrols trying to recover Hend. The Inquisition has volunteered to assist the Navy in their search for the lost colonel. Of course, we have information at our disposal that the Navy is not privy to...such as the jump location of the transport that Hend is on.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_26cb713a", "Yes, how may I help you? Have you come to report a suspicious activity? You really should speak to my secretary. I only handle heresies and other critical cases.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_2865fd30", "For the time being, the Inquisition is assisting the local command in its regional duties. It would seem that some of their pilots are less than trustworthy. Perhaps at some later date some of them need to be put to the question. But for now you will act as a normal member of the Imperial Navy.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_29d0a2db", "I've run into some trouble so far.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_2a77f19e", "Two things, %TU.  One, you must perform missions for the Empire until your standing has improved enough that we might consider you trustworthy again.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_2ccef947", "Good your back. We have discovered a serious problem. We managed to decipher the remainder of the message that you intercepted. It would seem that Colonel Hend was the one who was leaking the information to the insurgents.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_2dcd5da9", "Your zeal is most appreciated. Although much was lost we did manage to uncover the location where the pirates will be meeting the insurgents. It would seem that they will be exchanging some important information.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_2e7df33d", "The meeting is going to be taking place inside of the Dantooine system. It would seem that the courier you captured was not the only ship involved in supplying data to the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_306da215", "I told you once that I do not tolerate failure. Return to the Dantooine system and destroy that traitor.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_31804e15", "Understanding how to rapidly and efficiently manage the complex systems on board a fighter is a necessary step in your development as a pilot. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_3252d1a", "No, of course not. We must find out what is in that transmission. You are to travel to the meeting place and intercept that transmission. Once you have intercepted the signal immediately transmit the information back here.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_32701355", "We have received the transmission successfully and have begun the process of deciphering their code. There will be no error in the data this time to protect the traitor. Yet again, you have proven yourself an asset to the Inquisition.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_32a6fe1c", "I will do as you command, Fa'Zoll.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_34d641c9", "You have a peculiar definition of loyalty.  Nevertheless, you might have a chance to redeem yourself.  If you can improve your standing in the eyes of the Empire... you MIGHT be allowed to fly again.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_369ec9fc", "Yes, my lord. What should I do until you have his location?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_3b69b91e", "Once you have started your transmission there is a very high chance that you will be noticed by the enemy. You must complete the transmission at all costs. ");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_3ba5368f", "Don't you want to say good bye to me?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_3c9b80ee", "Are there any leads on where they took him?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_3ce84ec1", "What do you think of the Rebellion?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_3ce9c229", "I hope you're trying to tell me this was all a misunderstanding.  You have NOT defected to the Rebel Alliance?  Because if you think we're not on to you... you will not like the consequences of your desertion.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_3ead1387", "There's not very much, but I do have some elective duty missions that you can fly. I have a briefing prepared if you'd like to hear it.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_41786376", "Then let us begin. It is a sad truth that many of the Emperor's own have chosen to betray his willful rule. The Imperial Inquisition must always practice vigilance against the traitor. It is often difficult to determine where these foul conspiracies take root. Indeed, the most dedicated traitor is also the most careful.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_45fa29cc", "(Grin and listen.)");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_4682fc3c", "May the Emperor's blessing be on you, pilot.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_483fa8ea", "Why don't you just arrest and question the parties involved?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_4854758d", "I would like to request a mission.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_486a2be", "Yes. Yes, I do think that you will have a brilliant future with the Inquisition. Report back to me with your findings.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_486da900", "Your continued success will rely on your ability to make maximum use of all new Imperial technology. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_49be19d2", "Excellent. I think that you might have a very bright future with the Imperial Inquisition. I have decided to transfer you to Inquisitor Vrke. He is one of the finest field operatives within the Inquisition and I believe that you will be an asset to his operations.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_49f3270b", "Report back to me when you're ready for an assignment.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_4a2282c8", "Very well. Patrol the Naboo system and we will direct you to any unauthorized flights. They are to be escorted back to port. If they resist, you are authorized to use any force necessary, with one exception: do not destroy any of those ships.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_4d0198f9", "How may I serve the Inquisition?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_4df61c15", "Yes, as the Emperor commands.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_4eef704f", "That is most unfortunate. But luck is with us this day since another meeting has taken place. Again the pilot is leaving the Naboo system for Dantooine. I find this most interesting, don't you? Capture and scan this ship...oh, and pilot, do not fail me again.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_50f84d04", "Good, very good.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_5102164f", "(Nod and listen.)");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_51fe08f5", "Point me in the proper direction and I will do as you command.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_53d26b00", "Of course not, Lord Fa'Zoll.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_576f96b8", "That is correct. You will not fail the Empire. Now to your ship, pilot. Get me that transmission.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_594a07fa", "I want to study advanced TIE combat operations.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_5960dfeb", "It is grim. Grim. We must often pluck up the brightest of our own commanding officers and examine their minds for any sign of conspiracy. The process is intrusive. Some do not live. As such, we only do this occasionally.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_5b4ccb84", "You have operational discretion to choose an assignment from the areas outlined by Imperial Intelligence in your briefing. I can also instruct you in the use of new technology if you think you're ready.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_5bb1e2", "I think that you will fit in well with the Inquisition. But you must learn patience. The officer involved has friends in very high places and without evidence we could leave ourselves open to scrutiny. The key to every good investigation is evidence.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_5f0459fc", "This is most interesting. The data seems to be encrypted. Only the guilty need to hide what they are doing.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_5f0835ab", "We do not honor the insurgents with a name within these halls. They are a collection of foul aliens and wayward children of the Emperor. Strange outworld philosophies have twisted their understanding and have driven them to betrayal. It is a sad time we live in when the light of the Empire cannot reach all living things.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_61eac8c", "Go grab yourself a quick bite to eat and then report back. I have the utmost faith that the code will not keep us from the truth for very long.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_6309f032", "Good to see you, Flying Officer %NU. You've been making significant impact with the other branches of the Imperial High Command. You have certainly done the Inquisition proud. But the time has come for you to resume your duties in rooting out traitors.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_6396820e", "What is the Imperial Inquisition?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_681fb295", "Have you accomplished what I have asked of you?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_696a6a00", "I've been asked to report to you for duty.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_69ea2753", "You need to report to Inquisitor Vrke inside the Emperor's Retreat. He will be handling your assignments for the time being.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_6a6fe80", "As I said, there are several areas that the local command needs assistance in. The first is strictly a simple police matter...if we could rely on the local authorities. A number of ships have been attempting to leave the system without filing the proper flight plans. You are to escort them back to port, by force if necessary.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_6a9a7be2", "Yes, Lord Fa'Zoll.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_6ca30e9d", "The information you retrieved from the courier has been decrypted. ");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_6e39f51b", "Shouldn't we inform the Imperial Navy of this location?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_6e9c09c4", "Have you managed to track down the information that I requested, Pilot?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_78c7dc33", "Pilot Officer %NU, it's time that you were elevated to full operational status within the Inquisition. You are hereby granted the rank of Flying Officer. Congratulations Flying Officer %NU. You are now a full member of the Imperial Inquisition. Fly with honor and fight with the Emperor's own fury.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_79d26fde", "That is what I wanted to hear. Travel to Dantooine and begin your search for the insurgents. Where ever you might find them wipe them out. Let the justice of the Inquisition be swift and merciless.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_7b25fbc3", "You're cleared for training, so let me know when you are ready to begin.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_7be3e248", "I agree with you. Let's get you better prepared for future operations.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_7c0ff63d", "Ah, so you are the fine pilot that I have heard so much about. Your ruthlessness and efficiency are known among the Naval High Command and it is even said that the Emperor himself read your name in an activity report.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_7c7a7681", "How do you stop these crimes?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_7f95f0a5", "Get suited up, you're being scrambled immediately.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_825fac62", "I do not care for your difficulties. Get back out there and finish what you started. If you are unable or unwilling to perform this task, perhaps you would care to answer some questions that I have?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_846f2737", "Yes, sir! I will not fail you again.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_85fe2519", "For now we will act as if nothing is amiss. Until we can figure out where he is, continue your operation helping the local forces.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_860b7132", "Right to the point as well. Yes, yes, I can see that I am going to enjoy our time together. Most exciting indeed! Well, now where to begin? Most members of the Inquisition spend several years at a seminary camp, learning the values of Imperial justice. You are being recruited on an accelerated time frame. This means you are exempt from seminary, but it also means you will be closely monitored for deviant activities.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_872eaec4", "Indeed, I am sure you would not. Nonetheless, we must watch our agents twice as closely as we watch the other members of the Empire. Any violation of Imperial doctrine by an Inquisitorial agent is punishable by summary execution. Do not stray from the righteous path I will set for you.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_883a28d9", "Pilot, it is time for you to learn some new skills. It is important that you keep sharp and keep your skills at the top of their game in order to succeed as an Imperial pilot. Are you ready?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_89bc583c", "Very well, sir.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_8e4bd7c1", "Report back to me when you are ready for a new assignment. The Inquisition is in need of someone with your talents yet again.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_8e68e9b0", "Such modesty! How refreshing. So many pilots believe they are the only thing keeping the Empire together. They do not realize that they are but a single thread in the grand tapestry. They do not realize that they could be cut and the whole would remain.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_8efde2ae", "Yes, sir.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_8f913d8b", "I would never betray the Empire.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_91223b5c", "I'm ready to begin immediately, sir.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_91e4b620", "That will not be necessary sir. I will handle itl.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_959d8d9b", "Yeah, that sort of thing.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_95dcb85a", "I do what I can for the Empire.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_960be58b", "Since you have complete operational discretion, it will be up to you to decide how to assist the local command. They are having several issues that require someone with your particular skills.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_964c5567", "Return to me once you've successfully intercepted that transmission.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_96db4fc7", "What? And we assisted him on his escape.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_97222fa4", "Wait a minute... what happened?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_97d51490", "Yes, sir. I have taught the traitor the error of his ways.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_987445c9", "Thank you, sir.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_9930b065", "The second thing is, you must go away from here, and don't show your face until you are no longer considered an enemy of the Empire.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_9962665d", "Naval Command wants us to continue to assist the local command. Their assessment of the situation is positive, but they feel that inflicting further damage is necessary.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_9ac35c60", "You've shown considerable improvement in ability since joining the Inquisition. It's time to allow you access to the next level of training and technology. I remind you that anything you learn is highly confidential, security rating Gamma Three. You may not share your knowledge with fellow officers of any rank at or below your own. What area would you like to train in?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_9b43a7ee", "Yes sir.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_9c394eb4", "No, sir. I am having difficulties with the colonel.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_a08c6dc4", "Have you accomplished the task that I gave to you?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_a2137dae", "To the best of our ability. Sometimes more traditional means are necessary. The Emperor has taught us much. More often, though, the traitor is undone by their own carelessness. His eminence, the High Inquisitor, has granted me the privileged task of bringing this traitor under the watchful eye of the Inquisition.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_a2cfa58e", "I'm sorry. I can only assign missions to pilots in my own unit. You should return and speak to your commanding officer.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_a59c7bd7", "It looks like you're busy with an assignment already. Come talk to me when you're done.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_a5dff683", "It would seem that the encryption of the message was a bit more advanced than initially indicated and part of the message was lost. But we did manage to recover some very important details regardless.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_a7cceea9", "No, I am loyal to the Empire!");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_ac71da57", "I'm ready to take an assignment.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_aceff31e", "Good luck, pilot.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_ad754", "Do not presume in matters that concern you not. Never the less, you have done very well, pilot. Here is a consignment fee for completing the job. Stay close, though. Once this data is cracked we might have need of someone with your particular skills.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_ae26c22", "Let me think about this for a bit.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_b0d3b474", "I'm ready for training.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_b0e9edf4", "Yes I know that I really went above and beyond the call of duty to help you. You were very lucky to have me as your commanding officer. Now don't keep Inquisitor Vrke waiting.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_b2101d5b", "Yes, but what do you do?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_b257ddf8", "Why would we want to do something like that? It would be a major black eye to the Navy if the Inquisition managed to find and rescue their lost man before they could.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_b2634e3d", "The third and final task is one that I personally would like taken care of. I did a little investigation into the Dantooine system and have located small patrols of insurgents in the region. The Navy has no wish to begin operations in that system at this time but that doesn't stop me from sending one of my own in to clear out that little hornets nest.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_b2a924ab", "I'd like a briefing.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_b6b25f13", "Yes, sir!");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_b784db84", "The Inquisition, in all its wisdom, has authorized a duty pay increase for your exceptional performance and new rank. Since you are now a Flying Officer, you may select your own assignment.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_b8791e16", "The second matter is one that the Emperor himself took great interest in. Supply freighters will be leaving the Naboo system on their way to a small out of the way place called Endor. The Emperor very much wants these freighters to make it to their jump locations safe and sound.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_bb972bed", "The Inquisition is a unique branch of the Imperial Intelligence service. Our job is to maintain discipline and security within the Empire as a whole. We are the ever watchful eye against heresy and betrayal. The children of the Empire sleep safely each night, knowing that the Inquisition never rests.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_bc64aa40", "The honor has been entirely mine. I have a feeling that one day you will be a shining example of an Inquisition officer. Listen and learn well from Vrke. He is currently stationed at the Emperor's Retreat and is expecting you. Farewell, until we meet again.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_be30f309", "I want to study advanced equipment technology.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_be89481", "Welcome back, Pilot. Things are rather calm for the moment, so you will be flying some duty missions.I have a briefing prepared. Or if you've already examined the briefing material, you can select a type of operation to begin.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_c0996c6b", "I am ready to serve.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_c104d444", "Yes, sir. I think I need more training though.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_c1bc23b4", "I am ready for some training.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_c4880407", "Developing new levels of tactical and physical excellence will be critical in realizing your true potential. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_c50d6541", "Pilot, you're supposed to be on your ship! Get up there and intercept that transmission immediately!");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_c5e2a04a", "I believe you know exactly what I'm talking about.  You're lucky you aren't shot on sight!  Naval command has issued orders throughout the galaxy... %TU is NOT to be trusted.  That's YOU, isn't it?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_c602907a", "I will not fail the Empire.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_c76594d7", "I want to study advanced reactor engineering algorithms.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_c8f39347", "I am.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_d1fa21c", "As I knew you would be. Travel to the Dantooine system and scan for the colonel's ship. Once you have found it pass judgement on the colonel without mercy.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_d2f8399b", "Flying Officer %NU, I have the highest level of respect for you, but I want to see more results in the operations available to you before you are ready for advancement.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_d2fa677d", "The suspected Rebel sympathizer is being overly cautious about not being stopped by any Imperial patrol and has filed a flight plan leaving the Naboo system in route to Dantooine. You are to stop his ship and inspect its navcomputer for any information that it might contain.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_d4948205", "You scan their minds?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_d8b8f3ac", "As the Emperor commands.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_daf7bb7d", "I see. What task do you have for me?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_de5b2183", "Where is the enemy planning on meeting?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_de870f1", "The transmission that you managed to intercept for us has been partially deciphered and it indicated plans to abduct Colonel Hend of the Imperial Navy. Unfortunately, we received this information too late to stop the abduction.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_dfdec194", "Everything we do serves the Emperor. Meet the freighters in the Naboo system and escort them to their hyperspace locations.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_e1771eb6", "Remember, it will be worthless to the Inquisition if we are unable to recover the colonel alive. While you are recovering Hend we will continue our decoding of the transmission that you recovered.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_e17af774", "No one expects the Imperial Inquisition. He obviously thinks that he has gotten away with his crimes. Now go before we lose him again.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_e1b07878", "I was wondering when you would finally arrive. We have just finished our calculations on Colonel Hend's jump position and it is clear he has traveled to the Dantooine system. The time has come for the Colonel to be punished for his crimes against the Emperor.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_e2cb470f", "Investigations, judgements, and punishments. Each agent of the Inquisition is fully empowered to carry out any of these most important activities. The Emperor will suffer not for a moment the thought of a traitor to live. We must all be willing to give of ourselves that the Emperor's great work might continue.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_e6765c30", "I would like to serve the Emperor and escort the freighters.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_e71434ff", "Yes, sir! I'm ready to take an assignment.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_e73e5d21", "I want to study pilot combat training.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_e84f3a62", "I'd like to assist in the police action.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_ecb5e1e2", "The Imperial Inquisition does not recruit and does not outsource work. If we have need of you, we will contact you.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_f0a7a4ef", "It would be an honor to assist you in your quest to stamp out the insurgents.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_f1be3213", "What part in this do I play?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_f283cf35", "I am an old man. I have worked with His Eminence the High Inquisitor for many years. He is older than I. We make use of able pilots to carry out our judgements and commands.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_f2cf68b3", "Ok, well thanks for your guidance.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_f693949d", "You mean, wish you well...tell you what a good job you have done for me and how much I will miss having you around?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_f6d4476d", "I am sorry but I seem to be having some difficulties...");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_f85fd827", "I have a briefing prepared. Or if you've already examined the briefing material, you can select a type of operation to begin.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_f8b02865", "What do I do?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_f91e446d", "What have you learned so far, %NU?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_fa3398f3", "What is it you wish me to do?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_fb6ae829", "Be warned with the suspected traitor inside the Empire it is possible that our enemies have gotten word of these transports.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_fcff7b8e", "Of course. I wasn't thinking, sir.");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_fed6017c", "How do we gather the evidence that we need?");
stringFiles[328].addEntry("s_ff5a78b2", "What are you doing back here, pilot? I haven't received a report that you were successful in your mission.");

stringFiles[329] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_privateer_tier3");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_privateer_tier3) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_145dcab", "NO! I only like pilots that finish their missions! Get back out there!");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_17dec7f9", "Then get in your ship and get happy. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_1839ef54", "Who has he killed?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_18868d04", "I was better.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_19425c2f", "You are?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_19ab407", "Pretty sure. My first guess was Gungan. Those guys are the scum of the earth. But all signs point to the Rodian.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_19b65be5", "It sure involves a lot of gunplay.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_1aa056a8", "Well I don't have THAT many - ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_1d2b4360", "You're going after a Rodian. This one's an assassin. He's been taking potshots at the Rodian Political Corps for a while now.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_1d418957", "SOME PEOPLE should talk about this later, when we're not on duty.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_1ebb58e3", "Any visuals?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_21bb034b", "You got it. And we want to keep that a little-known fact, if you get my drift.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_24ee6c29", "Someone's always shooting at politicians.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2734ffac", "Keep walking.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2852c031", "Prove it. Finish your job.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_29a181c", "Those pirates really wanted that cargo, eh?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2b25d03f", "Some people prefer the Rebels.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2b6e8499", "As long as I get to shoot down a couple of pirate ships, I'm happy.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2b9a70e4", "Then let me share the joy. You intercepted some pretty serious data on your last mission. We've got information on a whole host of assassins, terrorists, and assorted bad guys.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2bc43dfd", "Come again?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2bcd2d13", "Hope this won't take too long. I've got dinner waiting.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2c397539", "That's more like it. I've got a freighter that needs a pilot escort.  It's an old Corellian YT variant.The Cadamo Sun.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2c556bd9", "He's Rodian. What more do you need to know? Green and greasy; they're all the same.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2ca7d4f4", "I thought you hated guys like him.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2d582b36", "[say nothing]");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2dbfc867", "Somebody's going to a lot of trouble! Must be quite a juicy haul they're protecting.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_2df26676", "What's his M.O.?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_3271f1e9", "Hey! I'M the one that makes the observations around here. Now listen. I want you to put that Rodian out of commission. And here's the kicker - we want him alive.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_327eb2d6", "Oh yeah, that's right, I forgot. How about you GO DO THAT ALREADY.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_333a7093", "This is a good one; wish I could do it myself. You're going after a Rodian assassin.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_36507434", "Why do I always get the remedial cases? ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_3895c4ae", "Okay...so what's onboard this ship?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_3898bb41", "Maybe yes, maybe no. Doesn't matter. These guys lie for a living. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_38e0a377", "Where have you been all my life?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_3b315f68", "Doesn't matter what I think.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_3b32ba04", "You're providing a valuable service to the Royal Security Forces of Naboo.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_3c432969", "Right. Your first target is a human, Beldini. Terrorist, killer, all-around bad guy.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_3c468733", "You heard me. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_3fa8b6f1", "Coordinates are in your ship. You're clear to leave.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_406e1216", "Looks like you took a wrong turn somewhere. Scram.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_41480145", "Welcome back. I'm so happy you're here.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_41a8901f", "You sure a Rodian is responsible?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_41d3138c", "Why would they take that chance?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_42d73452", "That's above your security clearance. You'll be facing the Ay'Nat Pirates. They want that cargo.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_4636b7d1", "Nah. You're getting a whiff of my lunch. I think. But you're right, I DO have a plan.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_46eb0ec8", "First, go to Dantooine. Just follow the data in your nav system. And keep your eyes open. This guy's a professional.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_47152ac5", "Oh yeah. The worst of the worst. That data you intercepted has led us to a real hornet's nest of assassins and terrorists.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_47d51826", "I smell a plan.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_49772db3", "Under the bed, with all the other monsters. Now listen up. I've got a job for you.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_4ad40b9b", "Need anything? A drink, something to eat?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_4b6422f4", "Why do you work with the RSF if you hate politicians so much?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_4bdc789d", "Hope you're being sarcastic. You're looking for a Rodian assassin.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_4ebef758", "OK. Maybe we will. But back to business. Your new mission targets a criminal of a different type. I'm talking about diplomats.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_4f5f8321", "Well,  you noticed on your last mission that we have run-ins from time to time with pirates.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_4fc6a099", "Aw. I think I'm actually going to miss you - maybe. But duty calls. You're now assigned to Admiral Diness Imler, down the hall - he'll be giving you orders from now on. See ya, %TU.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_5075e20b", "Your new mission targets a criminal of a different type. I'm talking about diplomats.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_51ca1520", "An assassin? Who's he killed?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_530e5eb4", "Pick your poison.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_53daee1c", "You're starting to get a bad reputation.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_53de9d8f", "Like what?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_55a8fc90", "Good. You're going after a Rodian assassin.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_5772fc88", "Two out of two million ain't bad.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_57d34626", "I don't need to! People know those hunters are using you for target practice. Get back out there - and  try fighting back this time.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_589399fa", "Love 'em.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_5a2317e2", "Depends. Am I killing bad guys?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_5a236288", "Just for now; I'm not done yet.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_5a889c20", "Like a dream come true.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_5bd69df6", "What do you need me to do?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_5ed53186", "A human, name of Beldini. The worst of the bunch. He'd kill ya as soon as look at ya.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_61968e69", "The freighter's in orbit around Naboo. See ya.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_653b9611", "Nah. Nothing so glamorous. You're going to escort a freighter, an old Corellian YT variant. The Cadamo Sun. They need your firepower.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_6540bc41", "Who's gunning for it?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_666cac71", "These guys pose a SERIOUS threat to the royal family - hell, to this entire planet. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_66f6527f", "Do the diplomats know?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_68d4ba6b", "To be honest, it's probably not them. It's probably smugglers taking advantage of the opportunity, and hiding gear on their ship. Doesn't matter. Same difference.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_692788e8", "Where can I find  this charmer?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_6aba4373", "[low whistle]");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_6bd02793", "Nothing.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_6bdcb65c", "Just tell me where to go.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_6c251948", "You got it.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_7009d8d", "Zip it. Look, genius, you're in the Royal Security Forces now. You know what that means, right? You make sure the ROYAL family is SECURE.  ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_707ab918", "Now we're talking.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_70b9cf4c", "As a matter of fact, I do. Got a freighter that needs a pilot escort.  It's an old Corellian YT variant.The Cadamo Sun.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_70e76a9a", "OK, %NU, no more busywork. Time for some good old-fashioned killing. How does that sound?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_719a036e", "Who?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_7278c01", "I don't have to give you BUPKIS. But I'll tell ya 'cause I'm feeling generous. This is a decoy ship. The real goods are on another transport.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_72c4169a", "Ay'Nat Pirate Faction. They want what that ship's got. Or what they THINK it's got, anyway.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_731caa45", "Got a mission for me?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_7339c95e", "Anybody at the top of the list?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_738baf5a", "A figure of what...? Don't get smart with me, smart guy. Shut your trap and listen up.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_7478d95d", "Loud and clear. Where to?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_76703443", "Thanks for the tip.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_76734574", "En route. Fly out to the waypoint and get ready to inspect each and every one of them. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_7a9f14df", "So I'm guarding nothing.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_7b05ff95", "Yeah. So much for that. Whatever. We've got bigger fish to fry.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_7e23ff31", "Ask me no questions. This is the Royal Security Force, %NU. We're here to help the politicians do their dirty work, that's all.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_7ea4b2be", "And that's the way we like it! Listen %NU, the royal family has enemies. Always has, always will. They need us to keep them going. Nobody's interested in your opinion - or in your questions.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_800745bc", "No you're not. I haven't finished my job.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_800cd173", "You gotta give me a better explanation than that.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_80a39a22", "Not exactly. This is a decoy ship. The REAL goods are somewhere else.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_80cc6c3b", "The only way you're going to get paid is if you complete your missions.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_83905129", "Unlike you, I DO get paid the big bucks, %NU, and it's on account of my suspicious nature. Smugglers may be packing these ships with contraband.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_83b47a80", "You telling stories about me?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_83c29fd0", "Don't know. You know the royal family; always up to something. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_841d27db", "Why?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_843db48d", "I don't think I know you. And Mama told me not to talk to strangers. Beat it.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_84c9860e", "Thanks for clearing that up.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_88a726df", "Hey, we'll see what you say when you're on this side of the desk. Let's get you started.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_88e6f763", "You sure do ask a lot of questions, you know that? Tell me, %NU, how do you like Naboo? 'Lot of Imperials around, you know.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_89ae25d4", "[says nothing]");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_89ff8475", "Obviously. This pilot will give you a lesson. Afterwards, you come see me for your next mission.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_8be640b8", "Sure.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_8de81731", "I'm really going to miss that Saymonz Varg. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_8e574ecb", "That's nice. Should've eaten before you got here. You need to work on your long-term thinking skills, start planning ahead.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_8ebe23b3", "Must have been something you ate. These diplomats, they're not exactly trustworthy.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_919b5558", "It's not the ambassadors they're worried about. This guy's gunning for the Queen.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_928dcf38", "The assassin you KILLED, brainiac. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_942ba0c6", "Yeah...Imperials...they're good for the economy. OK never mind. Back to business. Your new mission targets a criminal of a different type. I'm talking about diplomats.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_96924c42", "A couple of ambassadors, for starters. But that's not why we're interested in him. Word is, his next target is the Queen.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_97b0942d", "Not really. What was in there, anyway?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_97e76dd", "This Royal Security Forces assignment isn't so easy after all, is it?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_981c060d", "Then I guess I better shoot first.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_98427ee4", "Yeah right. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_98448a60", "Yeah, but what, exactly?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_984c29f6", "I could ask the same thing. Where to?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_9851897f", "We want him alive.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_992fcb9e", "Hm! Must be carrying something good.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_9b1d2d87", "Done. This pilot will give you a lesson. Afterwards, you come see me for your next mission.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_9ba13c", "I'm moved.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_9d1fa2a2", "When can I leave?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_9d51a937", "I hate Gungans.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_9d9af42e", "Where are these diplomats?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_a09da7f1", "You like that?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_a31b65f9", "%TU. You're the new one.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_a41bb8c7", "How can you be so suspicious?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_a56734f6", "I noticed.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_a5fe9928", "I'll take care of it.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_a6f174c", "Have you got a mission for me?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_a70b470e", "I want to know about advanced starship components.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_a8a872ba", "You and me both, buddy. I've been here way too long, and seen way too much Gungan scum. Can't stomach the sight of them. Filth, all of them. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_aa766bd6", "I want to know about special warships.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_ab3f1614", "Boy, do I. This is a good one. I'd like to do this myself.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_acc52186", "There's more?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_ad973bd9", "Yeah.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_ae2d3229", "I salute you, %TU. You're one heck of a pilot. Is there anything you DON'T know?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_af5ccac", "Hate 'em.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_b144d69b", "Nothing I can't handle.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_b1da46d", "Where do I start?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_b2ff9cb", "Sure. AND we protect the royal family's INTERESTS. Follow?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_b43b6c14", "I guess you were. Time for round two.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_b61d6d4f", "OK! That's one less Rodian messing up the place. Nice work. Time to get back to your training.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_b679efe", "See that you do.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_b6d8cc82", "A fleet of diplomats are coming to Naboo for a conference. You know, koombiyah and all that. Hugs not slugs.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_b7137723", "OK. Then let's get started. How do you feel about Rodians?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_b8955212", "Double helping. The freighter is up around Naboo; you're clear to go.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_b8c1a96f", "Hm. That makes it a little more complicated.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_bd234730", "You got it. This pilot will give you a lesson. Afterwards, you come see me for your next mission.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_be0b0711", "Hold it. I'm not done.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_be2c5a18", "Sure. I do.They give me a real headache. But you gotta admit, they're good at what they do.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_be88ef61", "Who's he killed?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_bf22a8c8", "Can't say I blame 'em. Got no use for them myself. But this Rodian's a real pain in the keister. We think he's killed two ambassadors already.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_c0167dab", "They want me to shut up, they better pay me more money.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_c089dba4", "I just am.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_c28a300f", "I want to know about system balance programming.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_c3363bcd", "Uh huh.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_c4095762", "Fly your ship out to the waypoint. Inspect the diplomats' ships. Use some pretext if you have to. See what you can find. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_c551ea96", "Looks that way.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_c5fdab6d", "What's not to like?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_c65cf2da", "I love you new guys. So easy to wind up.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_c6e9b9c7", "Then let's have it already.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_cae364a9", "That Rodian is giving you a run for your money.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_cc756770", "It's a figure of speech.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d3583e11", "That's above your security clearance. You'll be facing the Ay'Nat Pirate Faction. They want that cargo.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d5861157", "The Royal Family is always a high-profile target, buddy. Believe me. The Queen's got more bounties on her head than you've got toes on your feet.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d5b06d9e", "You're a sensitive guy.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d5b8e3f8", "They sure did. Tell me what it was!");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d5d85519", "I thought we spent our time protecting the Royal Family.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d5d8a006", "But what they'll get is me.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d5f1fa36", "You gotta admit, he was good.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d6b3034c", "Slow and low. He stalks his prey for weeks, months, before he makes a move. He's got a hell of a kill rate.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d84b1644", "I'm not done.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d919151c", "What's on board?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_d9c145dd", "The sooner the better.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_da0e8cd0", "I want to know about advanced techniques.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_dc54e9e4", "Can you tell me what it is?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_dcf601cc", "Don't we all! This pilot will give you a lesson. Afterwards, you come see me for your next mission.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_ddd7e395", "Why are you so interested?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_df607c49", "I'm listening.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_dfc8b68e", "The juiciest.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_e15039ea", "Start earning your pay and stop wasting my time.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_e1775a2f", "Pirates are crafty devils. Always scheming. So we've got to be crafty too. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_e1e07205", "All you need to do is stop his ship. The boys in the lab are putting together a little surprise for him, but it's up to you to deliver the package.  Get over to the Dantooine System; we'll update you from there.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_e49c6b33", "Don't have to sell it to me.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_e7b0a6c9", "Another assassin?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_e85927c2", "Hm. You're not a talker. I don't like that.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_ea9bff27", "The royal family has got bills to pay, same as the rest of us. They're very interested in keeping their interests...uh...well they want to keep their money safe.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_eb9af09b", "Sounds like you'd do the same thing.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_ebe811bd", "That makes it a little more complicated.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_ec96bcc4", "If you have to ask that, then you haven't spent much time on Naboo. Check your history books, buddy. They'd kill us, 'soon as look at us.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_ee08441", "Ate before I got here.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_efb3dd1e", "What's wrong with Gungans?");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_efff0139", "I know; doesn't it break your heart? ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_f2697794", "Too bad for them.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_f2eec235", "But for now, it's all about the Rodians.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_f6976b78", "Sounds like a plan. Go to the Dantooine system. Follow the coordinates on your ship's nav system; should lead you right to him. And you've got  the element of surprise - I think.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_f69a2921", "Glad to hear it.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_f765036a", "You're keeping the galaxy safe. The least I can do is offer more training.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_f80d4276", "So much for taking him alive.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_f92d904a", "You heard me. Hey, I don't come up with this cockamamie ideas. This one's straight from Central. ");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_fa9d37d5", "Sure, I could go for a little something.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_fc59c904", "The benefits are good. Now listen up. Naboo's hosting a conference. Diplomats are coming in from all over. And odds are, some of them are carrying contraband.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_fcd5590a", "Right. And here's the kicker - we want him alive.");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_ff5d0ba8", "Because those lowlifes are using you for target practice. Get back up there and take those guys out!");
stringFiles[329].addEntry("s_ff7bebda", "Don't let me down, ok? You'd hate to see a grown man cry.");

stringFiles[330] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_privateer_tier4");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_privateer_tier4) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_105bb565", "The head honchos like to know EVERYTHING that happens in this system. You must have figured  that out by now.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_16106529", "Well, this is a new problem in Yavin. We'll just have to deal with it. I'm not going to wait for them to come to us.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_1813de4d", "Teach me about droid intelligence theory.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_18a40c8c", "Then why did you send me?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_18a76ec8", "Who cares what they think?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_191d50ad", "I have somebody's duty pay.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_1993702c", "If you're feeling like a hero today, you could rescue a Naboo mining craft from Ay'Nat pirates.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_1adbadc4", "I'm ready.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_1cf9a0f6", "I've saved the best for last. I need a pilot willing to fly sorties against Black Sun pirates. Dangerous, but fun. Especially for a big strong pilot like you.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_1f2b0388", "Not any more.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_1f680e83", "You sure?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_2035fbe6", "You're lucky you made it back in one piece.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_221582e4", "Oh, you can, can you? I guess we'll see. Bye bye.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_2271ff14", "I think so. But you can be the judge of that. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_2313ac9e", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_237b421d", "They're not going to get involved. They've got other things to worry about. You just take care of those Black Suns. Ready to go?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_23e8aa6d", "Hey, I'm working on it.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_24231574", "That's a nice attitude for a pilot to have. Actually, I do have some duty missions to assign. Take a look at what there is. Shall I give you a briefing?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_251ee0bd", "I'm looking for Imperials.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_25506b23", "Teach me about heavy starship component use.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_256dbbde", "Ah, there you are. Good news, %NU. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_25cf4e47", "I don't think he's done with YOU, though.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_25f8ac14", "What's it carrying?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_27cad067", "Don't think I can help you there.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_27e6d728", "You were right. They were packed to the gills with contraband.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_2836e6b5", "OK.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_2befd882", "Well...");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_2e904f6c", "You're making me blush.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_31c66e02", "Not exactly. Since the Black Suns are willing to fight RSF pilots, they must have something to hide. So we're going to start taking a closer look at all activity in this system.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_3210ae50", "Haha! They sure did.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_328cdc99", "That would be mine.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_35a5b893", "Won't find any here. See ya.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_362a48e0", "Anything else?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_3892e6da", "Oh yeah? Well show me, then.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_39500c68", "What did you find?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_39e697de", "Whatever you say.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_3af6b354", "No, my friend. They're going against YOU pretty hard. You're good at what you do. And that means you're getting in their way. Black Suns don't like people getting in their way.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_3c53afd8", "I mean, the Empire's number one problem is that prison, but their radar is up, if you know what I mean. They're looking for trouble across the board. So we're going  to watch our step. We're going to watch everybody ELSE'S steps, too.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_3c9a53fb", "I've noticed.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_3d333deb", "Well, you'll get more of the same here, if you're lucky. Are you a good pilot?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_3f68df7d", "Sounds easy enough.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_3f76a413", "I like it when my pilots stay busy. Why don't you volunteer for something? Or I can give you the briefing again, if you like.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_3fdc63be", "Because we love the Empire so much.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_3ff13caa", "Here you go. I'm putting together another mission for you. Come see me later.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_413ac49a", "I want to help that mining craft.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_41799e3b", "You did good. I have a new mission for you.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_42d6c3ee", "Go on. Your ship is waiting.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_44b1cd3c", "Mm. We'll see. Let's get you going on a new mission.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_48621561", "What about  them? Look, they don't bother us, we don't bother them. Right now, Imperial happiness is your only concern. Get out there and take care of those captains. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_492a501d", "I wish I knew! That's highly classified information. The Admiral will explain everything to you. Pack your bags! The Admiral is waiting. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_4cae7d37", "Of course not. Forget about them for now. I have a new mission for you.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_4cbd4a9d", "I'd feel great.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_4d02fd15", "That's what they SAY they're carrying. But I'm not so sure. I'd like you to take a closer look. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_4d30b2ce", "I guess I have to pay you then.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_4e740301", "You would be, too, if half the galaxy was gunning for you. And besides, the Imperials are awfully active down here. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_4f4c63b2", "Fine. Here's your duty pay. Find me later when you want another mission.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_4ff27acf", "Weren't you just a little bit scared? Just once?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_501c35bc", "Sure! Why not.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_50d4081c", "Where do I report?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_5277eec5", "You tell me.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_539c8d41", "The head honchos like to know EVERYTHING happening in this system. You must have figured  that out by now.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_552b15d", "Right now, the only problem is that it's not here, in my custody. But you could solve that problem. Get going.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_55453170", "Not this time. But they'll try again. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_556c01dc", "Just get me up there.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_55dae7d2", "Not by a long shot. And yes, I AM doing it for the money.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_5603b2a1", "Now listen up and pay attention. I hate repeating myself. I need a pilot to escort a Naboo mining transport through Endor space. I'll warn you, Borvo the Hutt's men will probably be interested in that transport.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_57f232d6", "I am going to become an Imperial?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_5b5570cd", "I didn't like the fact they tried to kill me.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_5b6fb4cf", "Why? For what reason?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_5c429d49", "Yes ma'am.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_5d72fdfa", "Well, not officially. But  this is a big opportunity for you. You will be working under them until they no longer are in need of your services. You will retain all of your RSF rankings and privileges. According to these orders, you are to report to Grand Admiral Declann at the Theed Palace immediately.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_5e1ad1a2", "I am. I'm just having a bad day.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_5fff247b", "In this system, things DO go as planned. My pilots get the job done.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_60d0f37b", "Look. Here comes my favorite pilot.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_6140c0f4", "Interesting. Here's your duty pay. Let's talk later.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_614d7ac4", "What is the mission?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_619658af", "I'll escort that mining transport.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_62c8be58", "I can handle those Black Suns.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_6362f5f4", "Here's your duty pay. Maybe you can spend some of your money on ship repairs.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_63c379c4", "These other pilots. Are they any good?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_63e5cad0", "Send me out there.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_65f98b49", "Maybe you'll make an exception for me.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_67b2bdc1", "Hurry up. It's time to get back to work.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_68441a06", "Action packed.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_6cee1a83", "Not so much.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_70d61202", "Please, give me the briefing again. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_7177c3f2", "Who is Grand Admiral Nial Declann?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_720204b2", "Let me worry about the Black Suns. I have a new mission for you. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_7378bc13", "You know how testy Imperial freighter captains can be. They think they own the universe. Especially these two. They're a real couple of killjoys. But they're our friends, so make nice, OK?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_75f5450f", "That's classified, my dear. You can ask the Grand Admiral yourself. Now let me give you some free advice. There are a lot of things that a pilot like you could learn from the Empire. Pack your things; you ship out immediately. Don't make the Admiral wait!");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_76701ff2", "You're about to get your wish. But this time, you're not going alone. We need a show of force. You'll be joining a fleet of RSF pilots up around Yavin in a sortie against the Black Sun.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_76cd7167", "No. I'm not. Although...I'll admit that I didn't think you'd pull it off.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_7869de8a", "What's wrong with that Ay'Nat ship?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_79387096", "An inspect mission?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_7977e8e2", "I need to. Those Suns nearly shredded me.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_7b043f5c", "Do you REALLY need to get paid? You're not doing the job for the money! Isn't it enough to know you're serving the royal family?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_7cc97d1a", "Well, apparently there are some Black Suns in the area, and they'd prefer to keep their activities private. So they're launching an attack against our vessel. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_7f9b8387", "Why not?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_80714a31", "I think so. But you can be the judge of that. Ready to go?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_8180cd8a", "So. You did it.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_8289ab5b", "I'm ready for my next mission.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_840f4ebe", "What can I say? I've got a nose for these kinds of  things.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_841d27db", "Why?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_8462774c", "So I should inspect the ship.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_84c002ae", "Looking for a taste?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_85a73c8b", "So do you have a mission for me?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_8705a395", "Listen, if you need a break, just say so. I've got other pilots. And you've been through a lot.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_87246f3e", "You got it. Go check it out. And I don't mean one quick pass, either. Take a GOOD look. Because if they're carrying any contraband, we better find it before the Imperials do. Otherwise, the Empire might think we're pirate-friendly. And that would be a problem.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_87f301d7", "Really? Because it looks pretty easy. Maybe you could give it another shot. Please? ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_88678c75", "Supplies, a few passengers, nothing special.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_886cd421", "Ask him. Bye bye.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_89aa28bd", "Any idea what I should be looking for?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_8a0c5ce7", "I'll talk to you when you get back.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_8bbbb2ce", "Things don't always go as planned.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_8ca0b65b", "If you have a thing against the Ay'Nat, you could help me out by capturing one of their private vessels.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_8fe73508", "Nobody replaces me.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_90422eb5", "Good luck.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9121b74a", "It was easy.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9145ef83", "Listen. There's a heavy mining freighter passing through Endor space.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_917f4150", "Well THAT'S not a good enough reason! You're pretty bloodthirsty, too.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9192ecb", "Don't be. I'm being sarcastic.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9252108e", "Not your favorites, I take it?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9281abbb", "Go get 'em, tiger.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9299cabe", "What's going on with the Black Suns?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_92fa7352", "I have just been informed that Grand Admiral Nial Declann has ordered that you be transferred to his squadron, effective immediately. This is a very rare honor! RSF soldiers are rarely drafted into Imperial service so quickly. And they NEVER report directly to a Grand Admiral.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9312a850", "So. How was life with Commander Delios?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9405f2ce", "So apparently there are some Black Suns in the area, and they'd prefer to keep their activities private. So they're launching an attack against our vessel. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9422ee24", "You won't. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_94654f90", "I'd like to see a little more sweat, if you know what I mean.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9525d65c", "Any idea what the Black Suns are up to?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_953c410e", "Are you kidding? I'm going to the cantina.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_95fa2e6", "What? For doing your job?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_95fbf5d7", "Our relationship with the Imperials is an important one.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_963212ec", "OK...");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9686f892", "Tsk. Better get back to Commander Delios. He hates it when people don't finish what they started.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_96b5ddf3", "Some firefight.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9750cd6f", "Lucky miners! Have fun.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_983ebe8d", "They're going after the RSF pretty hard.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9a74f227", "So I see. This one's an escort job.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9b07df81", "Good. That's idea. Here's your duty pay. Bye now.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9d4ab52b", "What was the cargo?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9d566d78", "Here's a little something for you. Bye now.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9e779014", "Always. There's a heavy mining freighter passing through Endor space.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9e7f84ea", "I always do.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_9fe8c7e7", "Does it say what they want from me?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a087e986", "Not exactly. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a11918f3", "OK. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a224e8fe", "A deep space scan vessel. It's an RSF ship. We're using it to investigate Endor space. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a284d393", "Something like that.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a2989575", "They're lowlifes. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a404eb10", "I'm done with him!");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a479efa4", "OK, then.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a5795662", "Because they're bloodthirsty lunatics, I guess.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a77b8282", "Well don't come to me looking for a shoulder to cry on. I want results.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a82676b8", "Royal Security Forces are using a deep space scan vessel in Endor space. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_a9d8ef68", "Give it another shot. Those Black Suns aren't so tough.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_aa07a17b", "Spice? Sliced weapons? Who knows. Anything's possible. And I mean ANYTHING. So keep your eyes open and your blasters primed.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_aa1834ec", "I don't think I've seen you before. Maybe you took a wrong turn somewhere.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ab0e62", "Mm!  Good answer, %TU.I should warn you, though. I don't like telling people what I'm thinking. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ab583079", "I know. I was worried.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_aba1f75e", "Hm, maybe.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ad713f95", "That's me, baby.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ada4db16", "Teach me about exotic vessels.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_af9cab7a", "I didn't know you cared.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_afec8242", "Not THIS pilot.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_aff98418", "I like your attitude. A busy pilot is a good pilot. But unfortunately I don't have any missions right now. Try your own contacts. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_b0da26cf", "I'm sure.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_b2e340f6", "What's that?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_b47b0542", "I don't know, and right now, I don't care. The only thing that matters right now is that deep space scan. It's an expensive piece of equipment. We'd hate to lose it.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_b59b9d3e", "Well THAT didn't go as planned.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_b5ee61ed", "A pair of Imperial freighters have entered Yavin space. They need a go-between for a supply transfer. And that go-between would be you. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_b7bd69e9", "Oh! Well that's a relief. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ba2102e3", "You got it. So check it out. And I don't mean one quick pass, either. Take a GOOD look. Because if they're carrying any contraband, we better find it before the Imperials do. Otherwise, the Empire might think we're pirate-friendly. And that would be a problem.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ba8f5de7", "I see what you're saying.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_babb0d0c", "Look, this isn't an ethics class. We're all just here to do our job. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_bbd611b4", "What about the Imperials?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_bd35f50b", "I see you made it back from serving with the Empire in one piece. I am very glad of that. I have some jobs for you if you are interested.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_bd3f3d63", "I won't think any less of you. You've proven yourself to me.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_bdc28bb4", "You did a nice job protecting that scan vessel. We took a look at the tapes.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c0540c7f", "What Imperial crackdown?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c09ba3fa", "I'm looking for Rebels.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c17d2691", "I can do it.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c1ff5062", "I'm looking for a mission. Do you have any?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c290ec08", "Imperials!");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c31a5da7", "I think we're going to have to deal with them. But not right now. Take a break. I'll see you later.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c4fcfcf7", "I guess I should just...go and do it, then.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c5b4e219", "Now, now. Don't get upset. Just because you can't get the job done.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c5eae735", "Then maybe you've noticed that the Imperials aren't exactly tolerant of troublemakers. They'll stay out of our hair, as long as we keep running a tight ship.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c5f46951", "I don't think one setback is going to destroy our alliance.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c60b4787", "Hey! You want to know more, ask somebody who cares. All I know is, They want everything in this system to be ship-shape. No illegal activity of any kind. And of course we are going to comply.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c62300e0", "For the laughs. I like watching you fight. At any rate, here's your duty pay. I'll see you around.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c782ced7", "I'm flattered.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c82e9a2f", "Yes, please.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c8888bec", "Never.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_c93f357b", "I thought you said you were a good pilot.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_cab61bc8", "I've met pilots like you before. Raring to go. It's pilots like you that die first.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_cd140a4", "According to this, you are to report directly to the Grand Admiral at the Theed Palace. Now you won't actually JOIN the Imperial Navy - but you'll be joining them for a highly-classified mission. Sounds exciting, doesn't it.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_cdbde300", "Well I'm not going to stop.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_cdffba3e", "Tsk. You're late. That's not a good way to start your tour with me, pilot. Are you ready to begin? I have a briefing prepped for you.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_cf0a01fd", "Well, let me put it this way. In the Imperial Navy, power is held by only a few men. And Grand Admiral Nial Declann is one of those men. He makes things happen. I've been told that he is a brilliant and inspirational leader. I think you're going to learn a lot.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_cfba6d32", "Oh, I can DO it. Don't worry.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d1f589da", "Ridiculous.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d3c9b4d0", "Beats me! Something about trouble with the prison. And word is that the Vortex is gunning for the Inquisitors.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d55f2579", "I'm ready to go.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d56fe8b0", "Boy, where have YOU been? The Empire's tightening the leash. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d6473733", "I don't think I've seen you before, but your name is familiar to me. What brings you here?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d6a8a04d", "Oo. I can't wait to see you in action.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d767398d", "I didn't think so. I want you to get up there and make things right. Immediately!");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d76f1ea3", "What do you expect? He's a lifer here on Naboo. It's all he knows. Maybe you're more enlightened.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d7ffd6a9", "What am I escorting?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d858532", "Get out there and try again.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d9008914", "And listen. Don't be too gung-ho, okay? If you find some contraband, you know, tell me first.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d9177ade", "This is another escort mission?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d91c04b2", "I'm supposed to give you a skill. Hurry up. Let's get this over with.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_d9cced1f", "Absolutely.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_db51959a", "Luck had nothing to do with it.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ddf79f01", "Black Suns are animals.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_de697017", "OK, if you're sure.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_df2f398b", "Don't hold your breath. We're wasting time here. I have a mission for you.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_dfb50fb1", "I think you're right. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e0ce54d", "Sure did.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e1e40ead", "That would be nice.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e2dbfb72", "No. I'm OK.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e4254ae2", "Aw, come on. That guy's harmless. I like his negative attitude. It cheers me up.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e4399cac", "What about the Black Suns?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e4bbe441", "I think the Black Suns have declared war on the RSF.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e5235eff", "Do you have a mission for me?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e7515ed5", "Go on. I'm busy. I've got things to do.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e87166ba", "He'd like to start a one-man war against the Gungans.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e9b81b8b", "Hm. Maybe I should start sending you on more dangerous missions. How would you feel about that?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_e9ea6fec", "Good. Because I want to go after them.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_eaf3e39a", "I don't have any patience for lightweights. Do you know how to do your job, or don't you?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_eb2cfdac", "You bet.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_eb4e939", "Of course I do!");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_eb559766", "What? Who? Me? I don't care. Get out of here.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_eb72f32e", "No kidding!");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ebb2f602", "He didn't dazzle you with his charm?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ebcc7726", "'Materials for an explosives plant. If they had moved them into this system undetected... well, they didn't. That's all that matters.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ec5dca32", "Vortex? Inquisitors?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ee2b4c16", "Help is the one thing they need. Just try not to get killed yourself, okay? I hate breaking in new pilots. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_f0583774", "Yeah, but...well...");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_f1e2aed8", "Aren't you going to thank me?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_f4146fa1", "Lowlifes with guns.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_f453a7fa", "I like your attitude. I was right about that freighter, wasn't I?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_f803a81b", "Nothing definite. Black Suns know how to cover their tracks. But they're definitely active in this system. And that's a problem, considering the Imperial crackdown.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_fadf51b5", "Imperials.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_fb1b0124", "They're paranoid, I know that.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_fc00cf40", "I see what you mean.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_fc7e0e7a", "No ma'am.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_fcd38a06", "Then you don't know the Imperials. Are you talking back to me?");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_fd271a84", "You read my mind. But this time, you're not going alone. We need a show of force. You'll be joining a fleet of RSF pilots in a sortie against the Black Sun.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_fd7e4ac8", "Teach me about expert techniques.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ff47ef5a", "This job's not as easy as it looks, you know.");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ff66ed8b", "You don't have  to love 'em. You just have to keep 'em happy. Get out there and take care of those captains. ");
stringFiles[330].addEntry("s_ff6e1247", "Those Black Suns didn't like the fact you found their secret cargo.");

stringFiles[331] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_privateer_trainer_1");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_privateer_trainer_1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_122b0165", "You're really coming along as a pilot, %TU. I think you're ready for some more training. What interests you?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_1664d807", "You must communicate with the Naboo space station and request permission to land. Fortunately all of the new starship navicomputers automatically add a 'launch waypoint' to your datapad when you take off. Find your way back to this point, fly up to the space station, communicate with them, and ask for landing clearance.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_1726d8a5", "I want to know about droid interface basics.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_1c8bddbb", "What is it?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_1db37a0f", "I'm off!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_1e029d90", "Well, fortunately for you, I do have an opening for some duty missions today. There is escort duty and there is destroy duty. What would you like?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_2883b989", "Not right now, thanks.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_3175b359", "Yes, yes, you have my word. Take out that leader and I will train you to be a better pilot.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_36a4e374", "Yes, I am.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_38d8b2c4", "I appreciate your enthusiasm, but unless you're a member of the RSF, I'm afraid I cannot help you. Talk to your own contacts if you're looking for a mission.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_3d36a0e4", "Eh, I changed my mind.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_3d6c25c7", "Good work, %NU. Here's your payment.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_3f49e786", "Great!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_40759c25", "I want Destroy Duty");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_41c478b2", "Theed Hangar. Leave the palace the way you came. Take a left when you hit the plaza. Then follow the roads until you reach the power complex. Theed Hangar is on the opposite side of this building. Go inside the hangar and look for the 'starship terminals.' Use one of these terminals to launch your starship.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_4358efe9", "Where is my ship?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_443c036b", "All I asked was for you to complete one simple patrol. What's the malfunction? Get back out there and secure the area!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_465e6eeb", "Greetings citizen. Are you here to join the Royal Security Forces?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_48566ef9", "What's in it for me?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_48b8131c", "Don't worry.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_5c522568", "Yes, of course.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_5df0371b", "Excellent work! It's a good thing we sent you on that patrol. Take this as your payment. If you want another assignment, then just come talk to me.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_5e36283d", "You have demonstrated your competence to a very satisfactory degree. I think you're ready for some training. Tell me, what are you interested in?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_5ed33504", "Excellent. Sounds like you're all set then. Are you ready for your first assignment?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_60c4f974", "Where do I go?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_61036267", "You've got your orders! Stop standing around and get back on the job.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_6106187c", "What is a duty mission?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_629c7d23", "I want Escort Duty");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_63336624", "Ready for an assignment? We have some duty missions available.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_652689c", "Please tell me you're not going to make excuses... It's a simple patrol mission and you're standing here jabbering at me?! Go complete your assignment!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_6575e5d0", "Get up there and put those Black Sun in their place.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_659e0fa0", "You're a loose cannon! Do you want to be a member of Royal Security or not? Now get out there and complete your assignment! Black Sun isn't going to take over this system on *my* watch!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_65d63b3c", "Well, RSF better pay me");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_68660d24", "I need to take care of some things first.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_6b25cc31", "I've heard you're quite a pilot. What brings you to speak with the Royal Security Forces?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_6ea4aa1e", "That's great work! With their leader destroyed, they're sure to be on the run. Let 'em go to Tatooine if they want to be criminals, but they're not going to aggress merchants while the RSF is on the job. Take these credits and get your ship repaired, if it needs it.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_7217d77", "Greetings officer! Nothing to worry about here, we've got everything under control.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_72f94b8e", "I think you're a pilot for the Rebel Alliance! Look, the Royal Security Forces don't have any use for the likes of you. I think you should leave now.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_73f727e7", "Now hold on, there... there's no reason to fly off the handle. You've got a job to do, that's all. Now get out there and do it. And... good luck!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_7478cd28", "Will you train me after this?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_7736f08b", "Now it's personal.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_789f76ee", "Stop wasting my time.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_792ad840", "OK, OK. Come back when you're ready.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_7af03aab", "I don't want to hear your excuses! Now get out there and complete the assignment!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_7b3b28bf", "Go!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_7c1fe68f", "Sorry, but I can't chit-chat with you. I'm busy doing important Royal Security work here.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_7c4368e", "You have accomplished all the tasks I have set for you. Are you ready for some more advanced work?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_7eb4d42", "Fine.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_80744015", "Don't worry?! Don't worry!? The captain's all over me about this and you tell me not to worry? Tell you what... go kill the Black Sun Leader and THEN I won't worry!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_8179979d", "Naturally.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_85dd7d6c", "How do I get back?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_8853a92c", "You've got your assignment, and the control device for your ship in your datapad. Go to Theed Hangar and access the terminal to launch into space.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_8fb73c4", "I'll train you... AFTER you complete a few assignments for me. Now about that patrol...");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_904d71cf", "Ok! Ready for an assignment already, eh? Well listen up! We've had reports of pirates in the system and we want you to run a patrol. Just make sure everything's on the up and up. This ought to be a piece of cake.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_90b16aa7", "We'll pay for every transport that makes it through.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_919029b", "Go see Captain Kaydine. He is in one of the large meeting rooms upstairs here in the palace. Should be easy to find, just follow the ego.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_9237617f", "What about training?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_939b6844", "I want to know about basic starship component use.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_966bc2b6", "I don't know about you, but I've had about enough of these criminals operating in our system! We want you to take out their leader this time, and use all necessary force to defeat any wingmen that happen to be with him, too.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_97a2f8dc", "Very well. Listen up. We've had reports of pirates in the system and we want you to run a patrol. Just make sure everything's on the up and up. This ought to be a piece of cake.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_9817b9bb", "No, I don't.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_983440a3", "I don't like your attitude! Just go complete your assignment before I shoot you myself.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_a49a3700", "Your ship is parked at the starport. I've uploaded clearance codes to your datapad. Check your datapad to review the status of your ship.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_a8cdf3dc", "A duty mission is an open-ended task. That means that there is no true end to it, you just finish whenever you're ready. It's a good way to earn experience to prepare yourself for training. So, what do you say?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_ac00d21e", "I want to know about basic training.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_aec5c3dd", "It wasn't my fault. I was attacked!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_b02e116", "That's the spirit. Good luck!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_b24af40a", "You're going to need a ship, of course. I'll add these control codes for a basic one to your datapad. You should consider upgrading to a better ship soon, though.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_b3a9fd05", "Sure!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_b5b6e634", "But I'm experienced enough to learn more now!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_b9c77549", "That's what I want to hear. Now go!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_bbbfb8db", "Whadya mean what's in it for you?! Pride in a job well done, you dope! RSF will pay you, of course, but that's not why we do this job! We do it because we're the ROYAL FREAKING SECURITY FORCES!! Now get out of here and complete your assignment.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_bcdb501b", "Ready for your next assignment? Good! Obviously we can't allow that random attack on you to stand, so now we need to send a message to those pirates. Go destroy four of the Black Sun pirates... That should send a clear message that we're not going to tolerate their activities.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_c19e20c9", "Excellent. Consider yourself enlisted. Do you have a starship suitable for service?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_c1ff5062", "I'm looking for a mission. Do you have any?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_c261cfae", "No problem.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_c29502", "Right, back to work! Now that you've eliminated some of the riffraff out there, we want you to run a patrol and make sure there are no more of these criminals in the area.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_cd397d97", "That was a quick reaction to pick up the escort. It is a good thing we sent you on that patrol. The pilot sent over some money for you to cover any repairs you might have, and here's something to help you organize your things.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_cd72f93", "Good choice.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_d05d7112", "It's a mercenary bandolier. Pretty popular item among the freelance pilot crowd. Really handy to help you keep your things organized.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_d07cf233", "It's not all about experience, %TU. I need you to complete a few assignments before I train you.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_d487641c", "Not yet, %NU. I need you to complete a few assignments before I can train you any further.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_db74ddc6", "How about some training?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_e3245432", "Well, you're going to need a ship. I'll add these control codes for a basic one to your datapad. You should consider upgrading sooner or later, though.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_e38f886b", "Good, good. We have a couple to choose from. You can either fight the Black Sun menace in a Destroy Duty, or you can assist the merchant freighters with an Escort Duty.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_e6c0bf4f", "There will be time for that later. Right now, you've got a job to do.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_e814cf37", "I would like a duty mission.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_e94f494b", "I want to know about basic fighters.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_e9c7c6bb", "That will come in handy.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_ea059f38", "Will do!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_eed2fe3e", "Think nothing of it. Are you ready for your first assignment?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_f07f26ad", "DIDN'T I JUST SAY WE'D PAY YOU?! NOW GO DO THE PATROL ALREADY! GO! GET OUT OF MY FACE BEFORE I HAVE YOU ARRESTED!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_f4245779", "There's nothing in which I can train you right now. But a duty mission is a great way to earn some experience for your next training session. What do you say?");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_f5f16210", "Very well. Come back and speak with me when you're ready.");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_f742d1e8", "Unacceptable! Unless you take out the Black Sun leader, they'll never stop harassing our transports and our citizens. You're a better pilot than that! Now go destroy that leader's ship!");
stringFiles[331].addEntry("s_fb1c19c1", "I want training!");

stringFiles[332] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_privateer_trainer_2");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_privateer_trainer_2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_130b925b", "We'll need you to catch up to the Ay'Nat Captain's personal starship... a rather fast vessel! Disable him, and protect an RSF Boarding Team while they arrest him.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_168f5655", "I guess I forgot to mention this earlier... but yes, we have a mission to destroy a squadron of Ay'Nat Ghost Fighters that have been sighted outside of RSF controlled space.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_197f4f94", "I am interested in intermediate starship component use.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_1b428a9f", "Yes, Captain. I'm ready.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_1c2b565d", "Not quite yet, sir.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_1c7ee38e", "You'll find it handy in your next mission! We'll need you to catch up to the Ay'Nat Captain's personal starship... a rather fast vessel! Disable him, and protect an RSF Boarding Team while they arrest him.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_2017d4b5", "Ah yes! Good choice. Now there's no time to lose. We'll need you to catch up to the Ay'Nat Captain's personal starship... a rather fast vessel! Disable him, and protect an RSF Boarding Team while they arrest him.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_225b33f", "Good luck, son!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_24b7f2f", "Excellent choice. This will especially come in handy since the Ay'Nat pirate legion is mounting an aggressive campaign for control here in Naboo. They're building fast... so we need to strike at their leadership, and send them scrambling.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_24d86e89", "Great! In that case, let's get you started. I will update your flight status, and append the RSF codes to your datapad. Check back with me in a few minutes...");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_2847218", "Being a war-hero, my life is rather complex. I perform a long list of Palace functions... almost none of which involve starflight. For those matters, I need able-bodied pilots such as yourself.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_287eca83", "We needed to get that prisoner ship out of the Naboo system to keep the Empire happy. You don't want the Empire to be angry with us, do you?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_2d67b7a8", "Where do I come in?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_2d86b58b", "Hey, kiddo! What are you still doing around here? You got bigger, better things to be doing! And truth be told... I got nothing more to teach you, %NU.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_2dee44ae", "You bet! A new starship would probably do a lot better against some Ay'Nat Ghost Fighters!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_2e7b17f3", "It's very likely you'll fall under attack from Ay'Nat Legion pirates. Be careful...");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_2fd7906f", "Why do all you kids want to fly around looking like pirates? Ugh! But... I'll admit... you will need the handling capabilities of the Kihraxz Light Fighter if you're going to survive a pre-emptive strike against the Ay'Nat Legion's elite starfighter assassins! That's for sure.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_30297e22", "Recover ships stolen by the Ay'Nat Legion.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_326deced", "No, I am in this for the money");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_32c46e00", "Where should I go?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_34ac61a2", "The 'Kimogila'");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_35fb22d6", "The Royal family has increased security in the wake of recent theft. A number of Her Majesty's personal freight ships have been hijacked in recent days. This is partly why you're here, I imagine... because we're hiring space pilots?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_36a4e374", "Yes, I am.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_370822d1", "Yes");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_387397fb", "Did you hear how the RSF Guard foiled an attempt by Ay'Nat Legion pirates to detonate proton packs in the Palace reactor? ");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_394f0902", "Good day to you! Captain Kaydine - the most decorated starfighter pilot in the Royal Security Forces... at your service!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_3cef63a0", "Fly out to your choice of strike points... look for Ay'Nat Legion fighters. Likely, if these are hired for support - they will come out if you start tearing up the rank-and-file. ");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_3db3463f", "How do you do civilian! Captain Kaydine, at your service.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_43148596", "Did you catch those Ay'Nat outlaws?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_4495137d", "Sorry, I'm a bit distracted... did you hear how the RSF Guard foiled an attempt by Ay'Nat Legion pirates to detonate proton packs in the Palace reactor? ");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_45b71b4d", "I am interested in advanced fighters.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_45d20070", "I need training");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_464cfc61", "Greetings, pilot! You must be Captain %TU. Am I right?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_4a1d2431", "Yes, I'm ready.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_4a743aa7", "The Ay'Nat pirate legion is mounting an aggressive campaign for control here in Naboo. They're building fast... so we need to strike at their leadership, and send them scrambling.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_4aa3066e", "Ah yes! Good choice! Learning to fly many different types of ships makes an effective pilot!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_57ba8a73", "In that case, let's get you back up there. This time make sure the RSF prison ship makes it out of the system. Good luck!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_58362a8d", "Tell me about it.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_588f56b2", "The ship is safe");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_5e2a2bb1", "Sounds good.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_5fa9a5d3", "Thanks");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_6114e8b7", "I'm ready for duty");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_63053557", "Good! What duty element do you want to participate in today?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_65042122", "So, I hear you were not able to destroy all three of the Ay'Nat Legion's outlaw fighters. But don't worry - I'll get RSF record keepers to hold off marking this one a failure. You ready to try again?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_6c6f3940", "How do you do sir! Captain Kaydine, at your service.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_6cd96c01", "Of course! There's no end to the missions... and there's no time for me to do them. Your job will be to take my place on the RSF duty roster - in exchange for training, which I will personally administer. Sound like a good deal?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_6da2c92b", "I realize there were a lot of fighters up there to deal with... but nothing changes the fact that the Ay'Nat Legion must go! Are you ready to try this again?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_70287826", "Now that's showing some excellent leadership potential!  You've really earned your pay this time.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_725573da", "What now?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_726bdb69", "Good! Then let's get you back out there right away!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_7458c693", "Sorry, kiddo. You don't have RSF clearance to fly any of my missions. You'd probably have better luck with your own contacts.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_7614c65", "Yes, it does.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_76e6f264", "Captain %TU! You are doing a fantastic job! I think you've grown enough as a pilot to warrant advanced training. What area interests you most?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_7ac0f961", "How do you do. Captain Kaydine, at your service.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_7bc9bef7", "You're a real work-horse, %NU.  You remind me of myself.  Which duty are you interested in?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_7cc7c206", "Well then, welcome aboard! I'm Captain Kaydine - Naboo's most decorated starfighter pilot, president of the Flying Color Guard, the Chancellor-elect of the Naboo Betterment Society, and all-around local celebrity!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_837686a5", "How do you do. Captain Kaydine - the most decorated starfighter pilot in the Royal Security Forces... at your service!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_85263c6d", "We can't afford to botch this opportunity! RSF has a new battery of information... and another chance to bring the Ay'Nat captain to justice. You interested in trying again?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_86358e09", "Ghost Fighters?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_86a73ee1", "Sorry... I forgot to mention... We have a mission. Or rather, I have a mission and you've got to do it. ");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_8a84109d", "It must be your lucky day. I actually do have some elective duty missions. Take a look and tell me what you want to do.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_8ad6a62e", "You bet! New components should make your ship more than a match against a dozen Ay'Nat Ghost Fighters!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_8b529447", "Woah, hey there. Are you ready for your next assignment? There's lots to be done!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_8d90962a", "Nonsense!  You've earned this.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_8f2e1055", "So there are missions?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_8f5942fa", "I am interested in starship defense training.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_9248b2ba", "Well you've certainly earned it.  I'll talk to you later.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_92dbc95c", "Kihraxz Light Fighter");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_943f6352", "Alright. Hurry up and come back when you're ready.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_9560d48e", "Yes. How did you know?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_9817b9bb", "No, I don't.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_9928bf27", "You're an odd one, %NU.  But you do deserve to be compensated for the risks you take.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_9abb9538", "Fantastic work!  The space station holocomm'd me regarding a massive battle between a lone RSF pilot and a legion of Ay'Nat pirates.  I knew that had to be you!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_9af8d581", "Ready to go up against the Ay'Nat Ghost Fighters?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_9b73da8", "Protect the Royal Kylantha cargo.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_9ce4dd83", "Ah, yes! You'll certainly need the strength of the M12-L if you're going up against the Ay'Nat Legion's elite starfighter assassins. Definitely!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_9ea46a82", "Palace security system. Sees all. Tells all. I'm guessing you're here about the job?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_a0072111", "Hm. A grim job if there ever was one. I respect your courage. Good luck!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_a0c23472", "Did you capture the Ay'Nat captain?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_a6c7fa2b", "What are the details?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_a80d9308", "Good luck!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_a91b70fb", "Those Ay'Nat are the worst! You bet! I'll be updating the duty roster with your pilot info presently. Good luck!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_aa77ffde", "It was nothing");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_aa83c988", "Head deeper into the palace, my friend! Look for Commander Dulios. He'll set you on the path...");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_aae78dca", "I think it's time for you to take on more responsibilities.  Head deeper into the palace, my friend! Look for Commander Dulios. He'll set you on the path...");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_ae21cb72", "Thanks to you!  Great work, %NU.  You've really earned these credits.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_afe7700f", "Well?  Was your mission a success?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_b0704da1", "I want to fly for the RSF!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_b0ab3e88", "Oh!  You had me going there.  Well you've earned that, anyway.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_b104c183", "A fine choice, my friend. I will add you to the Queen's duty roster. Good luck up there!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_b45e2166", "I had some help");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_bb291959", "Excellent! Be careful up there! Those Ay'Nat outlaws are deadly enemies!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_bb45477c", "Excellent choice! What starfighter do you have your eye on? Are you interested in the Kimogila? Or are you obsessed with that hideous Kihraxz Light Fighter like all the other kids?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_be7af651", "What?  I mean... oh.  Well, ok then.  Uh.  Here you go.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_c1ff5062", "I'm looking for a mission. Do you have any?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_c261cfae", "No problem.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_c4ef0e93", "We need you to slip in to Ay'Nat-controlled space, and hunt down a trio of Ace outlaws.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_c5fcc7f5", "Greetings, Captain %TU! Are you ready to take my place on the duty roster?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_c892e540", "Destroy Ay'Nat Legion pirates in this system.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_c89c3456", "How do you do! Captain Kaydine - the most decorated starfighter pilot in the Royal Security Forces... at your service!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_c8f39347", "I am.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_ce72ef85", "Just kidding");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_d2ffe31e", "Excellent!  Here's your pay.  I suppose you want to take some time off now and relax?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_d586f458", "Excellent! Get back out there and do me proud!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_d65590b1", "Keep it");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_d8472b3c", "Well then welcome aboard! I'm Captain Kaydine - Naboo's most decorated starfighter pilot, president of the Flying Color Guard, the Chancellor-elect of the Naboo Betterment Society, and all-around local celebrity!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_da8818c5", "If you say so, %NU.  I still say it's an impressive accomplishment.  You've really earned your pay this time.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_dc649bb3", "I'm on my way!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_e42b260e", "I'm on my way.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_e95a95a5", "I believe you have some business to attend to... in space?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_e9c57758", "Elite starfighter assassins?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_eac39719", "Sorry, kiddo. You're still in need of training! Come back when you've learned to handle yourself better. Good luck!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_ec671b3f", "Well, the Empire has demanded that the prisoners be turned over for questioning. I'm not sure how I feel about that. Regardless... are you up to escorting the prisoner transport?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_ef08027f", "That's excellent news for the peaceful citizens of the Naboo system.  I know you're not in this for the money, but I've got something for you.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_eff66f4d", "I am interested in reactor engineering algorithms.");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_f32117e", "You bet! New defense procedures should make you more than a match against a dozen Ay'Nat Ghost Fighters!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_f6ae3b07", "What's the job?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_f93088f1", "Palace security system?");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_fd75abb", "You bet! New droid algorithms in there should make you more than a match against a dozen Ay'Nat Ghost Fighters!");
stringFiles[332].addEntry("s_ff45f1fd", "Good luck to you, Captain %TU!");

stringFiles[333] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_rebel_tier1_kiizete");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_rebel_tier1_kiizete) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_104f81b8", "Then you should speak with V3-FX right here. He can get you set up as an Alliance Pilot!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_1162efff", "It is my destiny.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_14aade81", "Do you teach?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_1628fad8", "Good luck, then!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_17edec66", "First, who are you?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_17eec115", "Stinks to fail missions doesn't it?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_1ae7f565", "I wish you good luck, my friend.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_1c48bff0", "Survival?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_27b64c88", "Hey... so tell me. How are things going?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_2895a98", "When you launch, your ship computer system will create a 'launch waypoint' that you can use to find your way back. Keep this point active by opening your datapad, choosing the waypoint labeled 'Launch Waypoint', and choosing to 'Activate' it.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_2b5181ae", "My name is Kiizete. I am a technician.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_2e823c5f", "Just talk to the droid. He'll take it from there!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_2f212745", "Destiny has drawn me here.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_34d8b295", "I think you're scared.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_3704b308", "What do I do up there?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_3e796521", "Fly back to a space station. Comm the space station and tell them you want to land.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_4669a3e4", "Yeah. I'll tell you about it sometime.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_46b93374", "Its memory is defunct. Got an old pilot program in it. I gotta remove it... but it's proving to be difficult.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_46dcc469", "Nice to meet you, %NU. What are you doing around here?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_489ec48f", "Sort of. I normally work a shift on the Kai'rek mining ship... but I got tagged by pirates on my first day of shore leave. I figure I'll need to run a few more contracts here on Naboo before I can afford to pay for repairs.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_49a108e5", "Sorry! Keep your cool, okay?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_4bd66142", "Couldn't be better.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_4c90db01", "We're doing just fine.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_4ed31d3f", "How do I land?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_5655b98e", "Don't beat yourself up about it. Just get back up there and try again.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_565d17f2", "For now, maybe. But I'm going to fix that. So... let me get back to it!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_5aff38e2", "We'll see about that...");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_5c46c104", "The starship terminal in the starport will allow you to do that. Go to the starport, and use the ship terminal to launch.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_5dc9a083", "You don't need to worry.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_5df1433d", "Yes. It does.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_5e15545", "Is this your job?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_6103a248", "My destiny is different.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_61657d0f", "I see.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_6472f6c1", "Yeah. I really miss flying! I can't wait to get my ship repaired.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_65372fa4", "I hear things about a mysterious wing of TIE fighters. Like the Empire is relocating some combat school to the Naboo system. Stinks! We'll have squints crawling all over us!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_65e8c460", "So you're part of the Alliance now. How does it feel?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_670bb9d5", "Any pointers?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_695e9ca2", "What makes you think I would have anything to do with that?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_69a02cf2", "I am excited!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_6a1ce31d", "Well, I'm not.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_6a22af26", "Then get to it! Grab hold of that droid and get your ship codes and flight clearance!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_6bd02793", "Nothing.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_6d949f10", "A contract?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_705da14d", "Sorry to hear that.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_7136aa3f", "But you know that this is your calling? Did it come to you in a dream? I'm not trying to insult you - I do have dreams myself from time to time... sitting in a cockpit, blasting TIE fighters left and right!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_77e48d5b", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_7a0420ae", "I'm serious. I don't have time for you right now!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_7c075dce", "How do I get out of here?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_7fa15433", "What's wrong with it?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_82288395", "I hope you're right.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_8379d6bb", "It's got this old pilot trainer program burned into it. Empire wants it out of there. It's not going to be easy, though. Moisture from the pond has gummed up this droid's circuitry. I'm going to have to replace a lot of parts!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_85d464bf", "Are you kidding me?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_861c2497", "You did, huh? Why don't you talk to V3 over there. He has a state-of-the-art Alliance Pilot training program!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_8668104f", "Your starship?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_88b50e", "Yeah... sure... a contract.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_890f3624", "Use SHIFT+C to target it and open communication with the station commander. You can choose to repair your ship or land.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_8920c0f2", "I think you just might.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_8a824d71", "Well, maybe not. It's just the best that we can afford out here on Naboo. The Alliance doesn't have many friends in this system. It works, though. It's a very effective program.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_8bf64edf", "I don't know what to do next!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_8dbe594", "I'm living it! Back off!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_8dee77bb", "I do odd jobs, okay? And I need to get back to this one...");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_92a0a895", "You should talk to the droid...");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_933941d0", "This droid is going to be the death of me! I'm sorry... I'm getting nowhere with this thing and I really need to get back home.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_93f420a0", "It's all falling apart.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_95658182", "I don't know yet...");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_9940f453", "I got a recruitment email from the Alliance.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_9cd181e7", "I see. Pretty intense. For me it's just a question of survival.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_9d788910", "I see, %NU... What destiny are you talking about?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_9ddf5e8a", "Why reprogram it?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_9f32bc26", "Yes. Like that.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_a5edd9e5", "No. Never really got the urge to teach piloting. Try the droid... He's good.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_a5fe9928", "I'll take care of it.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_a65b9c24", "How do I comm a space station?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_a95b1747", "To save the galaxy!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_af558512", "A '95. Hand-me-down. Look, I really need to get back to work...");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_afd1368", "How do I use it?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_b26194cb", "What are you doing here?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_b369f7cd", "I know what you mean.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_b41e5c00", "Meh.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_b78a2c76", "Look. Go to the starport. Find a terminal and launch into space. The war isn't going to wait for you!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_b9934459", "Me? No. I never made it as a fighter pilot. Sorry.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_bc76e9cc", "Dee'ja. My starship is grounded for the moment. I'm fulfilling a contract for the Empire right now. Got to get this droid's memory wiped and rebuilt.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_bd21db14", "Take it easy. What don't you understand?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_bdc96417", "Sorry. I really don't have time to talk right now. I've been trying to get this droid reprogrammed all day. It's turning out to be a nightmare!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_c1499ae3", "Fly your route. Keep a low profile. Don't get into anything you can't handle. Come home safe.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_c261cfae", "No problem.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_c39cb5eb", "I've come to join the Rebel Alliance.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_c899d08d", "I want to join the Rebel Alliance!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_c9274747", "State-of-the-art?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_ca776e30", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_ca932c28", "Forget it.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_cbba56ce", "I thought you would be excited.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_ce894b84", "Just doing my duty.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_cff6adcf", "It's interesting you say that. I hear the Alliance is scrambling to stay ahead of the Empire in the Naboo system. You're tangled up with a mystery squadron of rookie TIE fighters... or something... What are you hearing?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_d2083ee4", "Nothing. Forget I said anything.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_dd3ba522", "Order of the Empire! What can you do? I just grabbed the contract from a terminal up in Dee'ja Peak.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_dff67cdc", "You erase droids on a mining ship?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_e22b6287", "Ah. I probably wouldn't understand anyhow... Take care!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_e518378e", "(Give Kiizete your name)");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_e5aa590e", "Where will I find a space station?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_e5b2f859", "For what?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_e97d81c5", "How do I launch?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_ea3a9cb0", "I've taken a contract to reprogram the droid... but it's proving to be a lot harder than anyone thought it would be. Maybe impossible!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_ed72de53", "The Alliance needs me.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_ee55c9ed", "Where's home?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_f6c52e55", "Take care.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_fd0a45a7", "Well, just be safe up there. Okay?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_fdbd2351", "What do you fly?");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_fe562082", "Walk directly down the stairs... then wade into the water and slosh toward the starport. It's fun!");
stringFiles[333].addEntry("s_ff33d98b", "That droid is an Alliance training droid!");

stringFiles[334] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_rebel_tier3");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_rebel_tier3) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_10d9119c", "Ah, he did. And what did you think?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_119da2e0", "Why do you think the Empire cares about your group?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_133ae1ef", "Sounds like they don't care much about the Force!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_1545afe8", "Vortex members see conspiracies at every turn.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_1611aa95", "I don't know. I hope to find out. In the meantime, I need you to defend that outpost...");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_170add4", "Perfect! The Bothans have the data now. I delivered it myself! ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_17c8fb82", "Inquisitors punish and torture Rebels.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_189c01a2", "The Empire is preparing to attack our outpost. We are in desperate need of your help.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_18c308e1", "The leader ship is doing its best to keep a low profile. You'll have to hunt it down in the Endor system. Good luck.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_19fdbf16", "That's one way to put it. They won't translate the data until they get what they want. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_1a1b97f4", "No. What experiments?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_1ab74446", "You noticed.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_1ba01028", "Not good enough, %NU. You must start over.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_1c058156", "A Bothan base is under attack by Nym's pirates. They are in trouble and need defenders.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_1d69f13f", "No. Are you sending me to fight against the Bothans? ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_1dccb274", "He had useful information, at least.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_1f94856d", "Why are you helping the Bothans?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_21aa6c60", "You're free to leave.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_22fbdd51", "His databank may hold all the secrets of the Force crystals, and every dark detail of the Empire's cybernetic experiments. But we don't know yet. The information is encrypted. And only the Bothans can translate it.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_2330166f", "I'll say. Rebel forces hardly ever attack pirates.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_2600dae8", "No, not exactly. You will be fighting FOR Bothans. Nym's pirates are attacking one of their bases. They're outgunned, and they need our help.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_26fbd13e", "If you were a pilot, you wouldn't have to control your feelings. You could vent them with your blasters! ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_2750c5d9", "You still have work to do, young one.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_27f52134", "That's quite the understatement. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_28d86e3", "There's more. You'll be picking up a new passenger at the outpost.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_2c1e1068", "I'm not the only one. The Bothans are most grateful.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_2c4789b", "Understood.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_2d9a2e66", "It is a rendezvous point for the Vortex. It is, in many ways, our library. It holds a lot of the information we have gathered over the years.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_2e3763ed", "We want to learn more about how the Empire is using those crystals. Have you heard about their medical experiments?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_2f1094c2", "My pleasure. That Inquisitor put up a good fight.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_2f820fac", "To be sure. Vrovel has told you about their cybernetic experiments? ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_30760d01", "Give me another shot.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_3154a04f", "I think the Force is an old wives' tale.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_31a5e862", "None taken. Are you still willing to help us?  ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_31b106e4", "Well, you were working with that informer. I'm sure he had some secrets.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_3950a8d4", "They won't.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_39b859cf", "I don't know, young one. But I think that very soon WE will be attacking THEM. In the meantime, though, we will simply defend our position and help our Alliance brothers. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_3c566f87", "I should hope so! How many favors are they going to ask of us?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_3d5f6974", "You handle the cloak and dagger; I'm here to fight. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_3e7fb8a3", "I appreciate your devotion to the Alliance, but I have nothing for you right now. I suggest you find your commanding officer. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_3f107c3c", "Imperial ships are attacking a Rebel outpost - one that is very important to us.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_3f38ab04", "Thank you, %NU. Our library is safe now.  ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_401aa65c", "I hope so. Now please hurry. There's not much time.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_40b69b18", "That's life during wartime.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_420c68fc", "I thought you hated them! You're confusing me.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_44fd681b", "Wouldn't you rather be on your ship? You are still on a mission.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_45c4d2ca", "Uh oh. I smell trouble.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_47ae0171", "The rumors are true.  Imperial doctors have found a way to create hybrid, cybernetic pilots.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_4869a9c5", "What was in the translated data?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_49776d50", "You'll be doing more than shooting TIE fighters. The attack is led by an Imperial Inquisitor. He is your primary target. Kill him, and the attacking forces will scatter. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_4ca47de6", "The Empire doesn't know about the Vortex.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_4ec95981", "Yes it is, my cavalier young friend. But the Vortex must continue. Our work is too important. The Empire is preparing to attack our outpost. We are in desperate need of your help.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_4f707592", "Does the Empire know that?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_4f98b9b7", "You are not helping the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_515906d2", "That spy, you mean! Yes, we were working with him, as you say. We had no choice, unsavory though he was. And now we have his data. It may explain everything about the cybernetic experiments and the Empire's interest in Force Crystals. But it's not in a language we understand.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_51fbaf83", "We need information. They can provide it. That's all. Personal feelings don't come into it.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_51fbced7", "You have failed! Try again, %TU!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_5491ac40", "They are massing their forces for an attack on our outpost, even as we speak.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_54abba14", "Perhaps. In the meantime, there's the business of our outpost. The Empire is preparing to attack. We are in desperate need of your help.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_55d6f6", "Not a problem.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_58ddac81", "I'm trustworthy - AND I'm a good fighter. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_58ec27cc", "Ha! True enough. But you have your destiny, and I have mine. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_590bda59", "Well, it's over now. And I've delivered the information to the Sypnet outpost, as ordered.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_5a7254ca", "One of our pilots will teach you that skill. When you're done, I will have another mission for you.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_5bd69df6", "What do you need me to do?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_5beffaeb", "The Alliance is fortunate to have a pilot like you in their ranks. All you need now is more training.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_5cfd5571", "The Bothans are holding out on you?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_5d126009", "[pause] Honestly?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_5d2275e3", "And I'm playing defense?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_5e57a2aa", "Well, thanks for everything, Brother Ezkiel.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_5f5ad8b2", "You're dedicated.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_5fec5259", "No craftier than the spy at that outpost.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_61b6494b", "Am I that transparent? Oh dear. I would be a terrible diplomat, I'm afraid. You are correct.  A Bothan base is under attack by Nym's pirates. They are in trouble and need defenders. They are spies, not soldiers.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_629b68ab", "It was going so well. We thought we were on the verge of learning the purpose of the Imperial Inquisition.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_63e41", "About the Force. The Inquisitors have dedicated their lives to the pursuit of that knowledge. We have done the same. And now we have that informer's information.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_68355d90", "We've uploaded general coordinates in the Endor system, but you'll have to find his exact location yourself, I'm afraid. Good luck. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_692e89db", "They do now, I'm afraid.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_6a273da9", "I'm ready to go. Where is this leader's ship?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_6a5142e8", "I don't know why you are talking to me when you have Imperials to kill!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_6bdcb65c", "Just tell me where to go.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_6dea91bd", "That mission was quite dangerous. Perhaps it's time to return to training. I want you to have the skills you need to succeed.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_6e6f308b", "With the pilots? Yes he has. It makes me sick.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_6e75fbb0", "The Vortex is in danger.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_6eb747d4", "That's very kind of him.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_74967449", "I thought that we could trust you, %TU... but it seems we were mistaken.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_7af82252", "Because I must. The informer's data is encrypted. Only the Bothans can translate it.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_7d043357", "What's so special about it?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_7d3deb6", "Secrets about the Force crystals?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_7eab0dc3", "So even though he was an Imperial spy, he was carrying useful information after all!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_804150c5", "What's happened?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_81f74c8a", "His data may explain everything about the cybernetic experiments and the Empire's interest in Force Crystals. Or it may be a recipe for chocolate cake. We don't know. It's encrypted.  We need the Bothans to translate it.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_8287425f", "Well done. You gave those pirates a run for their money.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_82cf4ca7", "Why is the Empire targeting this system? Is it because of you?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_840116ce", "Blast you! You haven't done your job!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_840cb413", "It's not paranoia if they're really after you, %NU. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_841654d2", "That's great news!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_841d27db", "Why?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_879249ea", "I'm interested in space superiority fighters.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_8874f806", "Then you know how crafty they can be. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_88e20a47", "They have found a way to fuse a pilot forcibly to his ship, turning him into a cybernetic slave.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_8a212117", "Sick.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_8a226979", "I cannot help you.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_8a4f7617", "Please.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_8b1d3cb", "Is it? I don't know. The Empire will probably send more forces.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_8cf5321", "The attack is led by an Imperial Inquisitor. He is your primary target. Kill him, and the attacking forces will scatter. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_91a4e21b", "And give safe passage to someone on the station.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_92ecc2cf", "The Empire will do anything to gain the edge in this war.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_930d070e", "The Empire is ambitious. They will continue to unleash their forces against us. They are extremely interested in what we know. And, of course, we are equally interested in what THEY know.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_93c9d623", "What about Alliance forces?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_96483773", "Oh no. Have no illusions, it will be difficult. But you will have the element of surprise.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_97c42bb7", "Of course. That's how Bothans are. Nothing is free.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_98332b2a", "Anytime.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_9865d5b5", "Destroy their leader ship. Without it, the pirate fleet will flounder - and that's exactly what the Bothans want.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_991a471c", "Not yet. You'll be reporting to Brother Extok Evin from now on. He is on Talus. You can find him in the 'Green Room' of the theater in Dearic.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_9a2a8f72", "A Bothan base is under attack by Nym's pirates. They are in trouble and need defenders. They are spies, not soldiers.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_9ac7f904", "Am I leaving the Vortex?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_9cc8e2ce", "I'm ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_9d7c11a1", "Of course. I'm a soldier.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_9e4cb685", "Excellent! They must reveal something about the Empire's plans.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_9f3f2aef", "Know about what?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_9f97864a", "There's more. You need to pick up someone on the station.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_9feb4fa3", "Imperial forces are attacking a Rebel outpost - one that is very important to the Vortex.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a0e6a107", "I can still turn this around.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a1217b89", "Who? Another member of the Vortex?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a285e391", "%TU. Brother Vrovel says you can be trusted.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a2f15702", "Yes they do, and they enjoy their work - but I do not think that is their true purpose. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a30c289b", "You'll understand when an Imperial tries to attach you to a ship - with a blowtorch. Unless that sounds good to you - get back out there!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a436613b", "I'm interested in advanced starship component use.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a44e69af", "I see. Then we must seem like a silly group of old men to you.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a490d2c6", "Alright.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a63013e4", "It is a rendezvous point for the Vortex. It is, in many ways, our library. It holds our secrets.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a64028fc", "Why would the Empire force loyal soldiers into those kind of experiments?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_a6792612", "And they won't help until we secure their base.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_aa11d5d2", "You only need to kill their leader.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_aa7a038e", "Talking to me - but you're leaving for the Dathomir system, as of now. Take out those Imperials!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_aacbf366", "Are you ready to work? The Vortex needs good pilots, now more than ever.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ab272dee", "Not at all! I will miss you and your spirited attitude. You'll be reporting to Brother Extok Evin from now on. He is on Talus. You can find him in the 'Green Room' of the theater in Dearic.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_abd40fb", "With you by their side, the Bothans see an opportunity to defeat these pirates once and for all.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_b24e355f", "You'll find your coordinates in your ships computer. Take off for the Dathomir system immediately. Good luck.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_b2aaabb1", "I don't need a reason to shoot Imperials!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_b34ab6f6", "The Empire is DEFINITELY the enemy.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_b552b5dd", "Not according to what I've been hearing.  You have aided the Empire against us.  We will not trust you with any more assignments until you prove yourself an ally of the Rebel Alliance.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_b5be169d", "Not many people share your belief. We face opposition from within the Alliance, all the time.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_b70082a7", "The Spynet's quite pleased. I think you've shut those pirates down, once and for all. This will help us in the future. Bothans are good friends to have.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ba11bd82", "And?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ba42ea16", "You say that like it's easy.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ba5bf569", "I try.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_bb3b47bf", "But first? It sounds like there's a problem.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_bc380d91", "I'm not here to convince you. I'm here to order you to defend the base.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_bc7aea36", "They're holding their own, but just barely.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_be1e6832", "Immediately, I'm afraid. I'm sorry to see you go. It's been a pleasure working with you. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_c1e154f", "Sick - but efficient. These cybernetic pilots never question orders, and they never sleep, never eat.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_c20e6f2b", "Ah, but it's not so simple. The Bothans have made a small request.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_c3fb9152", "I appreciate that. Because we can use your help. The Empire is preparing to attack our outpost. We are in desperate need of your help.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_c5c397c9", "Danger lurks around every corner. We cannot be sure who is friend and who is foe.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_c5c41a6", "No. Are these pilots flying for the Empire?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_c5fd31d9", "You're right. First we must help the Bothans.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_c872184", "I know you will. Now please hurry. There's not much time.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_c9e0d4f1", "If you would.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_c9f02e02", "Go! You must succeed.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_cb3876f5", "Immediately. Coordinates are already in your ship database. Thank you for your help.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_cbc2d68c", "Your work here is done %TU. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ccecab6a", "I'm interested in system balance programming.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_cd53d6a8", "But do they know it's a Vortex outpost?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_cd650ee8", "The Empire is everywhere.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_cdcbf519", "What do YOU want?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ceaea132", "You can trust me");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d001ebec", "We've attracted the attention of the Inquisition.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d15e12a8", "We want information. They want secrets. There is a difference. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d178b596", "That doesn't prove anything! The Empire attacks everything it sees.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d2bd9636", "Not standing here, you can't. Please return to your ship.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d3b66245", "I think the Force exists.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d3cb3651", "It's evil, but not impossible. We must know more. And we need that outpost secured!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d40fde1", "Anytime, you say? Well, how about right now? They'd like to enlist your services again.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d41d97bf", "Things are coming to a head in this system. Imperial forces are launching a major assault.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d55f2579", "I'm ready to go.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d561a496", "I will do my best.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d57982dc", "Yes. They're horrible.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d5ad9570", "The less said about him, the better.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d5f9f79b", "But only if I do my job.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d611f5ae", "All's fair in love and war. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d683dc69", "I hope not. Now please hurry. There's not much time.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d764414f", "Hate is a tool of the Dark Side. I must learn to control my feelings. It is not easy.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d786a9a7", "Nothing is more important than those Force crystals. Now you must help us, and quickly.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d7eb327a", "There's no word for what they're doing. You must defend that outpost. We need that information.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_d88c653e", "Are you sure?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_da08554e", "But the pirate fleet is huge! I can't kill them all.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_deccbb06", "Who? A member of the Vortex?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ded27301", "I'm not defeated yet!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_e2e9a78f", "It would seem so. We've always been very private about our activities there. I do not know how they found out about us.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_e494ecca", "Then what am I doing here on the ground?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_e5e9b349", "The Bothans want those pirates destroyed, once and for all. And you can help them.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_e5f0e762", "We have the opportunity to learn more about the Inquisition's activities. We have found an Imperial aide, someone who possesses a great deal of knowledge about the experiments and the Force Crystals. He is willing to tell us what he knows. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_e6be1367", "I'm interested in advanced space combat.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_e711b5e8", "Maddening creatures.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_e7150ae1", "That's not possible.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_e77894ce", "I hope they ARE machines - for their sake. Can you imagine being trapped in your own body like that?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_e9c7f196", "We've uploaded the coordinates to your database. Be warned, an Imperial Inquisitor is leading the attack. He is your primary target.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ea78d92a", "Do you need a translation? Bothans are master translators.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_eb3c17f0", "Was it something I said?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_eb5863d5", "You're awfully quick to help Bothans. I thought you hated them.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_eba35f17", "When do I leave?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ebd3969d", "No man should die that way. There is no end to the darkness in the heart of the Emperor. If he finds a way to harness the power of the Force, then our future will be bleak indeed.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ed8cbd3f", "So they're just killing machines.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_eeb2051f", "Very nice work, %TU. Are you ready for further training?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_ef42359f", "I want information on those Force crystals. And the Bothans are going to give it to me!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_f0300e70", "Yes. Well unfortunately things have become more complicated. Have you ever dealt with Bothans before?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_f4fff1e0", "No offense.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_f68ef5df", "Yes, they are. Now you see why we need their help. But it's quid pro quo. First, WE must help THEM.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_f8438ea7", "A pilot as good as you are, you deserve the best training possible. I can help. ");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_f845f64a", "They're a lot like you. They always want information.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_f8a22f8", "Immediately. Coordinates are already in your ship database.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_f92771aa", "Not yet. But they will be, soon. And Imperial forces are launching a huge attack now, to soften the ground.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_fb1d4add", "Not exactly. Now please hurry. There's not much time.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_fc9a12c0", "I'm ready to go. Just point the way.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_fca1dce9", "I've seen a lot of strange things out here. Anything's possible. That's what I think.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_fcf4d778", "How?");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_fd120cac", "Vrovel told me a bit about the Vortex - about what you do.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_fd2e11b9", "I don't see how this helps the Alliance!");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_fdba7430", "You can count on me.");
stringFiles[334].addEntry("s_fffd9426", "The Bothans have delivered their translations, as promised.");

stringFiles[335] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_rebel_tier4");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_rebel_tier4) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_113f3fb6", "Wow! Can you tell me more?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_122f0ea4", "I'll see you when you get back from Dathomir.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_127c7ddc", "Hm! Well, I do have a few duty missions here. Would you like a briefing?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_13010c2d", "You say that, but he's still safely en route! Hurry up and stop that monster, before he destroys all of us! ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_13f3baf7", "How did you know?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_14192a1b", "In my mind, it is. And this is the perfect time to make a move.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_14ff5df8", "Are we launching a direct attack?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_15e6446", "That space debris is definitely hiding Imperial secrets.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_16d870fe", "Consider it done.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_18da605a", "The Inquisition has been using it as a base.  It's the perfect way to send a message.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_1adbadc4", "I'm ready.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_1b9c5097", "No briefing necessary. I am ready to DESTROY those fighter patrols.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_1c8bddbb", "What is it?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_1e25d8e3", "The Inquisition has been using it as a base. It's the perfect way to send a message, if you know what I mean.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_20ace535", "No I don't. I assure you I was only kidding around. Let's stay on topic. I recommend that you pay close attention to Admiral Burke, he is supposed to be pretty decent leader so you can probably learn something from him. Be mindful and do your duty without fail.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_23048e75", "If Jedi are out there, the Vortex will find them.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_23b92517", "Of course. I'll bring him in.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_23c4339a", "The Inquisitors already spotted him?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_243a81bd", "Ezkiel is still in need of your services.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_2477938c", "My ship's built for speed. I'm sure I can reach those transports in time.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_2592b2f2", "But not me.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_25a79f70", "I'm fully aware of the situation, sir! ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_25dc6fac", "What kind of information is he carrying?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_2808ade7", "You had best get to your ship and report into Admiral Burke. Good luck to you, pilot.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_2896ca81", "But I'M not busy.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_28a543ae", "I'm not done yet.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_290b6cd5", "I'd rather not.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_2928468c", "The Inquisition won't be operating in this system anytime soon.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_2c4789b", "Understood.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_2c5be3f2", "We're going on the offensive. The Vortex has decided to attack the Imperial space station in Dathomir.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_2c61b117", "I don't know if the situation is THAT serious.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_2e34ca37", "Hate compliments? Very well. I bet you like money, though.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_2f2320af", "What are you, %NU, some kind of double agent?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_3069ecae", "What's the bad news?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_34a99b58", "Think about it. If the situation was reversed, and you were the one in trouble, he'd fight for YOU.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_35065223", "I stay in close contact with its members. Please return to your work.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_363f5a49", "We've scanned the ship ourselves. Engineers confirm the malfunction.The situation's serious. This spy is carrying valuable information.  And the Inquisition is closing in on his location.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_3678a87c", "Most of our space fleet is already occupied. They're escorting Vortex personnel to safety.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_38f1d025", "Is this a declaration of war?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_3b45e8ed", "My ship's running at peak capacity. I'm ready for another mission. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_3d213ae3", "Well, regardless, we know how to find him. That's the good news.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_3daae2ee", "Do I know you?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_3de94b24", "Then dig deep, %NU, and get back out there! ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_3ff3b52b", "Most of our space fleet is already busy, escorting Vortex personnel to safety.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_41e4adff", "Good job out there. Our freighters are safe. And guess what? One of the Inquisitors has targeted our location!");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4222dbd0", "Very nice, %TU! We are making inroads. The Inquisition is in for a surprise.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_422da50", "Imagine what they'd do to us.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_422deda3", "The Empire isn't sending him to fight us, is he?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4265144c", "Good to meet you.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_426e2f6c", "We're ready for them.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_45387989", "Um, yes. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_457a7010", "No");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_45ceb48b", "It means that Admiral Burke has seen your service record and has chosen you personally. He obviously respects your skills to handle a very important mission for him. Either that or he considers you to be expendable.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_461e9b3f", "You've got nothing to worry about.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_46787375", "Tell me! I can keep a secret.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_47443361", "Don't worry. It'll get done.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_47eb0778", "Haha! True. They're all filthy sneaks, aren't they? ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_481965b0", "Please carry them out.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_49707203", "Please carry  them out.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4975777", "Well, we're doing our job, %NU. The Inquisition has definitely noticed us. And they're heading our way.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_49805f81", "Can I hear the briefing again?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4a835de4", "I want the Vortex to know that this is the BEST squad in the system.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4a858e06", "Incredible work out there! The spy is safe and sound - and so is his information. Soon, we'll have new Jedi walking among us! The entire Vortex organization is grateful for your help.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4d41f7fe", "Dismissed.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4e0bf82f", "Oh! Of course, you're right. The coordinates are already in your database. We're equipping your ship with repair materials. I need you to reach him ASAP, repair his ship, and escort him to safety. Now hurry to the Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4e4d6d23", "Do you realize what will happen if the Inquisitor reaches his destination?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4eaf90e6", "Excellent! You're cleared to leave for the Yavin system immediately.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_4ef111c8", "Good choice. Once you've mastered this skill, I'll be able to use you for more dangerous missions. I feel fortunate to have a pilot like you at my disposal! You've exceeded my expectations in every way.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_52ea3d5c", "Well, hey! There you are! Welcome, welcome. I was wondering if you were ever going to get here. I'm Extok Evin, head officer in charge of space warfare in this system.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_5796fa91", "No no, of course not. He's strictly an interrogator. And I suspect he wants to find out why the Alliance is so interested in Endor. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_5d4e24a2", "I'm glad I can be of use. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_5d9fd0db", "They're still reeling from Uvqolo's death. They can't believe an Alliance pilot was able to kill one of their own. Let's see how many MORE we can kill! ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_5dbf1a94", "Congratulations! You've earned the right to acquire a new skill. The more skills you have, the more money you'll make.  What will it be today?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_5e2a2bb1", "Sounds good.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_61657d0f", "I see.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_61dcb099", "Good! I'll destroy anybody who comes this way.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_62074d0", "Here you go. And let me know when you're ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_6371b34a", "Sure - thanks to me.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_6598178f", "Interesting.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_6798dc03", "Why that one in particular?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_682985ff", "That was FANTASTIC! I just wish I could have seen the expression on those Imperial faces! ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_6a348e56", "I'm serious. You've heard the stories about the Empire mutating their pilots and welding them to their ships.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_6b14c8d", "I'm afraid you're grounded until you can clear-up this mess.  You need to improve your standing with the Rebel Alliance before we can trust you with any more assignments.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_6b169ba1", "Let's hope they continue to underestimate us.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_6daeb64a", "You know, it would look GREAT on our records if we could save this guy.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_70814158", "Here comes our pilot now! Are you ready to accept a duty mission? Or would you like to hear the briefing again?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_711e6727", "Don't worry! It won't happen. Not as long as I'm here.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_71d852f5", "How about droid intelligence theory?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_7294f771", "Exactly. And this is a golden opportunity, one we can't afford to pass up. I want you to get out there and blast Uvqolo! I'm warning you, it's going to take everything you've got, and then some. Are you up to the job?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_7455cef5", "Here's the first mission. I want to soften the ground and let the Inquisition know that the Vortex means business. They have put several of their navy pilots on patrol duty. These aren't their elite fighters, so they're a good first target. I need a pilot to launch an attack against them. Maybe YOU are that pilot!");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_75a002d0", "Our secrets are safe for another day! ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_75c90fe4", "Good to see you again. I have some great news, and I cannot think of a better pilot for this to happen to. You are being transferred to the command of Admiral Willhem Burke. Told you it was great news.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_77e7784", "Who doesn't?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_788df6ff", "Very well! Come back soon, because we have a few things planned for those Inquisitors. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_7d47427d", "It can't. It's too important. The discovery of even one Jedi could change the course of this entire conflict! And it goes without saying that the spy knows key details about our organization. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_7dec31dd", "Good! Because I'm happy to report that we're going to be escalating our efforts against the Inquisition. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_803445b", "Absolutely! It means they're taking us seriously. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_80803e51", "Well start acting like it! Get back up there, NOW!");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_80d8485c", "I'm on it.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_80ecabfc", "The Vortex has drawn up a plan of attack against the Imperial space station in Dathomir.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_82450216", "Do you mean to tell me that's the best you can do? ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_839a8471", "Admiral Burke is in charge of the fourth battle fleet, operating in the Outer Rim. A very fine commander. I had the honor of meeting him a few times. An officer and gentleman in every sense of the words.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_841d27db", "Why?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_84f5730a", "I hope not. This is nerve-wracking.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_85e568", "Nice work out there. Here's your duty pay. Come see me when you're ready for your next mission.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_86677c6b", "What does he want with me?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_88099422", "Come on, Evin. Don't lay it on too thick. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_89488f10", "I'll get him.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_897a43f2", "It just broke down, out of the blue? Could it be a false alarm? Maybe a couple of wires got crossed.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_8a212117", "Sick.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_8a64732d", "We've been receiving from pretty bad reports about you, though.  Did you know you're under investigation for supporting the Empire?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_8cd97e8b", "You're a Rebel pilot? But you're not part of this unit. Are you lost?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_8dc4fc41", "We've scanned the ship ourselves. Engineers confirm the malfunction.The situation's serious. This spy is carrying valuable information. And the Inquisition is closing in on his location.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_8efde2ae", "Yes, sir.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_8fc2022a", "This area is off-limits for unsecured personnel.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_942559a7", "Sorry, I can only assign missions to Vortex pilots. Why don't you try asking your commanding officer? I'll bet you'll have better luck there.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_94d8d136", "Well, Inquisitors ARE dangerous. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_96d9696a", "We are in the middle of a war for not only our freedom but for everyone's. We don't get to choose how we serve the Alliance. Now I know that we are not the Empire but you had better be aware that when it comes to traitors and deserters we will not hesitate to act harshly. Are we understood, pilot?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_9b0c24f5", "It goes without saying that the space station is well-defended by Imperial fighters.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_9b43a7ee", "Yes sir.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_9c236354", "Excellent.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_9ecb7fcf", "I think so. But it will be a long and bloody road. And not a straight one, either. We've been plagued by spy activities. Our upcoming missions are extremely dangerous. Frankly, I'm glad. They'll separate the weaklings from the true patriots. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_9f4dbe82", "I'm always ready to fight the Empire.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_a07914ba", "We are ready to go after the Inquisition with a vengeance.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_a13b304c", "Don't worry.  They won't catch me!");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_a2454aa3", "Hey! SOMEBODY'S got to be the best.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_a399c876", "I'm surprised the Inquisition has waited until now to engage the Vortex.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_a65d4a43", "Who is Admiral Willham Burke?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_a747531a", "Well...supposedly, he knows something new about Jedi.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_a753d65f", "Glad to hear it, because I've got an urgent assignment right here.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_a7a9e2a7", "Several Vortex members are still in transit. And somehow the Inquisition has discovered the route they're using. They're sending a fleet of fighters to the area. Our brothers are vulnerable while they're in flight, and the Inquisitors know it.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_a8144f6", "One of our spies has reported a malfunction with his ship, and he's adrift in Dathomir as we speak.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_ac8b75ef", "You're probably right! Well done, %NU. Please accept this duty pay with my thanks.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_adc84c63", "Excellent! Show no mercy. Remember, you decide when you want to end these missions. When you feel that the blow to the Empire has been delivered or you need a break, just land.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_ae528424", "OK, mission number two is as follows. The entire Vortex organization is on the move, in anticipation of our attacks. There are several freighters in the area that are carrying Vortex personnel. They need to be escorted to a secure location.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_ae934c27", "Negative. There's too many of them. I just want you to hold off the fighters until the freighters are able to move to safety.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_b3218dae", "I don't think so.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_b322ae4b", "Very good. Come back when you are ready for some more action, my friend.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_b3e9c738", "I'm ready for anything.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_b5815881", "And finally, mission number four! Imperial raiders have disabled a large number of civilian transports in Dantooine. We think they are searching for a Jedi. The ships are immobilized, and Imperial capital ships are closing in. We need a pilot to get there first and repair those ships! Take your pick, %NU.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_b5eac7c2", "You too. I've read your report. You did a heck of a job for Brother Ezkiel and those Bothans.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_b76c91c2", "Ah. I see.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_b83725b", "Let's hope so! Good luck, %TU. Remember, you decide when you want to end these missions. We have several of our personnel out there helping the drifters so when your exhausted or your ship is falling apart, just return to base.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_b9b677c2", "I ran into a little trouble. It won't happen again.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_ba0973a6", "They won't; not for long, anyway. They'll see how good we are soon enough. Here's your duty pay.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_be8a1d81", "Hurry! There's no time to waste.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_bfc53dde", "I guess. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c2129c67", "And finally, mission number four! Imperial raiders have disabled a large number of civilian transports in Dantooine. We think they are searching for a Jedi. The ships are immobilized, and Imperial capital ships are closing in. We need a pilot to get there first and repair those ships! Take your pick %NU.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c28b3318", "You're clear to leave. Remember, you decide when you want to end these missions. When you feel exhausted and can't escort more freighters, we will send someone else to take over so just come back to base.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c2d98904", "Ah yes.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c424c512", "There will be more ships exploding in the future, I'm sure. Hopefully not yours! Now listen. We have a new problem.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c48bab68", "Then you don't understand how important the Vortex is. Here's your duty pay. Come see me when you're ready for your next mission.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c49d2b1", "Those freighters aren't built to withstand attacks from Imperial fighters. They need your help.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c7932482", "I had no idea");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c82e9a2f", "Yes, please.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c8592539", "See that it does! ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c8b9717d", "Sir! Can you please just give me the coordinates?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c9014c96", "Good. Now get to your ship and get to Corellia. The Admiral will be waiting for you and it does not reflect well on my outfit if you are late. Stay alert and you just might learn something from Admiral Burke. Good luck to you.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_c9329734", "They are. Good luck, %TU. Remember, you decide when you want to end these missions. When you feel that we have stolen enough Imperial ships for now, your ship has taken too much damage or something similar, just come back to the base.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_ca05e460", "If they get a hold of him, they'll keep him alive - but he'll wish he was dead.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_cb44839f", "What if I don't want to go?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_cbb055c6", "They weren't smiling, I can promise you that.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_cc335afa", "Yes, I  remember.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_cc6fef40", "This is a great day for the Vortex. Here's your duty pay, %NU. You have definitely earned it.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_ce74555e", "Then get to your ship and get to the Admiral quickly. I am sure that whatever he has in store for you is very urgent and we cannot waste anymore time. Keep attentive and you are sure to learn something from Admiral Burke. Good luck to you.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_cf9c9506", "Traditionally, both the Inquisition and the Vortex have kept low profiles. But we can't afford to move slowly; not anymore. The Alliance MUST locate and train light Jedi as soon as possible.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d082018b", "Absolutely! You know, of course, that we're evacuating Vortex personnel in preparation for the fight.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d082cea6", "One of their worst. Uvqolo. He's a master technician, with an uncanny ability to find exactly what it is he's looking for.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d0b9a993", "That's strange. Could it be a false alarm?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d0f87f24", "How about special weapons and tactics training?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d17adb67", "I had a good time watching his ship explode. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d1be90a9", "What's the plan?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d284d072", "It's hard to separate the good spies from the bad spies.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d3c79ae3", "You say that like it's a good thing.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d4928d9c", "That's not going to happen.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d520f8e9", "And why shouldn't it be you? Here you go. And let me know when you're ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d8845dfe", "I don't know much myself. The information is strictly classified! But...I overheard some of the brothers discussing it. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d8a1ee7e", "Without a doubt. And those secrets may hold the key to this entire war. Who knows? This could be the most important posting of your career, %TU. You can say that you were there when Extok Evin changed the course of history ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d91a074", "Well, I wouldn't go that far.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d92f71f", "Yes, I know.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d9bfbc18", "You realize that if the Inquisition gets their hands on that spy...well, you just realize the situation, don't you?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_d9cced1f", "Absolutely.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_dab8fd8e", "No. Do you have a mission that I can fly?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_db140dbf", "What is it? ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_dbb3b0b0", "How about heavy starship component use?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_dcc126b1", "Just doing my job.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_dd76100c", "His coordinates are already in your database. We're equipping your ship with repair materials. I need you to reach him ASAP, repair his ship, and escort him to safety. Now hurry to the Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_de00af5", "Inquisitors are careful to protect themselves at all times. But we have a small window of opportunity.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_de5265b4", "Oh, nothing. Regardless of why, you are ordered to report to Admiral Burke in Doaba Guerfel on Corellia. He is expecting you shortly so you had better not keep him waiting. I am sure you have important work to do.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_df069f76", "Those space droids you mentioned sound interesting!");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_df1c8925", "You'll find the coordinates in your ship database once you reach the Endor system. One more thing my friend. All the missions I provide you with will be high risk missions and might be too much to handle by yourself. If you have any favors you can call in, doing so during my missions might be a good idea. Good luck.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_df8d90f1", "I am ready. Thank you, sir.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e01d95b6", "I'd like to provide an escort for those freighters.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e0907aab", "What!");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e1aa63d", "I am sure he has read the reports of your flying skills and has need of them with his operation group. You are to report to the Admiral immediately. He is waiting for you in Doaba Guerfel on Corellia. I am sure you won't let him down just like you didn't let me down.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e26b9261", "Very. But so are we! We'll prove our worth on the battlefield. Now here is the mission roster. Ready?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e282986e", "Duty pay, for my best pilot! ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e5886662", "Excellent choice. Come back as soon as you can, we have a bit of a problem.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e59caef0", "You've received your orders.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e5a30f12", "Here's the third mission. The Vortex has purchased a small number of Space Assault droids. These are experimental models; we are guarding them very carefully. I'd like you to experiment with them against the Inquisition's data-carrying vessels in Endor. They may be able to provide useful information.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e63887f", "You think I am expendable?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e67c13ca", "I think so! Everyone thinks that the Inquisitors are the Emperor's most powerful weapons.  A blow against them would be a blow against Imperial morale. ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e7a8a370", "And that's where you come in. You're going to join forces with  the Vortex squadron and launch an attack against those fighters. That will give our B-Wings time to move into position.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e8a5b38", "Blast it! Don't you know how important this mission is?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e9c05f6b", "Several Vortex members are still in transit. And somehow the Inquisition has discovered the route they're using. They're sending a fleet of fighters to the area.  Our brothers are vulnerable while they're in flight, and the Inquisitors know it.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_e9e695cf", "Here's your duty pay. Come and see me when you're ready for another mission.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_ed0a67e", "You know, of course, that we're evacuating Vortex personnel.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_ef2200e9", "One of our spies' ships has malfunctioned. He's floating adrift in Dathomir as we speak.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_f20ed4c3", "Now listen to me. It's of the utmost importance that you stay out of the Inquisition's clutches.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_f4640a5b", "Which Inquisitor is it? Do you know?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_f4d84e3", "How about hyper-maneuverable starfighters?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_f5427310", "Of course not!");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_f789d42a", "I've been serving the Vortex since I first picked up a space blaster. I'll be coordinating operations against the Empire in this area. And you'll be reporting to me.");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_f8a134c0", "Through sheer luck, we've managed to learn the details of his travel route. He wishes to stay inconspicuous, so he's not traveling with a large entourage. He's practically defenseless! ");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_fc2f8c4c", "Nice job on that last mission. That Inquisitor didn't know what hit him!");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_fc615cb9", "I see you have survived your experience with Admiral Burke. Are you back looking for some work?");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_fc616447", "Well...okay! Supposedly it includes possible locations of several Force-sensitive children. If it's true, and that  information fell into Imperial hands, those children would be dead by the end of the month!");
stringFiles[335].addEntry("s_fcbee9cd", "Why is that great news?");

stringFiles[336] = new StringFile("conversation/naboo_rebel_trainer_1");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (naboo_rebel_trainer_1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_104b565a", "Well, I'll join anyway.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_10581a3e", "That's right");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1137ccd7", "We cannot say at this time. Alliance pilots in the Naboo system have reported a wide variety of Imperial activity. You should be able to find some smaller support wings...");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_116bd775", "(Wave dismissively.)");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_11e3b199", "Welcome to the Alliance.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_123652f8", "(Salute) May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1323cdc1", "How can I be of service? I have added your first assignment to your log... and I have uploaded codes for a ship control device in your datapad.  Go to the Starport and access the terminal to launch into space... unless I forgot something?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_145a9b15", "Of course! I have removed the code-lock on your procedures manual. Secret techniques are now available to you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_16642b72", "But of course. It is the standard starfighter training curriculum. I am a very skilled teacher, I assure you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1728f71a", "How thin are we talking?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1809c6fc", "What is the location?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1a0322d9", "I want to fly for the Alliance!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1a53f653", "I am looking for pilot training.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1aaecbcb", "There will be none. You have to search the Naboo system until you find some good targets.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1c2c03ae", "There are a number of pirates in the area. The Empire is interested in removing these pirate elements, so I suspect your route will be clouded with peril... unfortunately.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1d2430a3", "What sort of money are we talking about?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1df40ac6", "Goodbye, V3.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1e626caa", "Of course. Those supplies are critical!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1f6a762c", "No sweat, droid.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_1fb7129c", "Yes. The Alliance thanks you.  As a little bonus, I've had this flightsuit made for you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2099a39c", "Agreed!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2518a758", "As you wish! Your first assignment is a four-point patrol along the Naboo frontier. Be careful of local pirates - and be kind to local merchants. They are friends to us all, you know.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_25572e24", "That sounds delightful.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2582d5e6", "Um... yes... um... Let's have some revenge on the Empire. Find four of their puny TIE fighters in the Naboo system and destroy them!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_26970ef", "I am interested in basic starfighter training.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_26bc1385", "A basic Z95 starship is being held for you at the starport. I have uploaded the control codes for this ship to your personal datapad. Any time you wish to review the ship status, open your datapad and examine the ship control device.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_27a8c796", "For the Alliance, my friend.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_284dc5d3", "Yes, ma'am! I have uploaded your ID to the system duty roster. You are cleared to sweep Naboo space for Imperial starships. You can return to the ground at any time when you feel that you have learned enough. Good luck!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2adb435", "Where am I patrolling?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2b74415f", "Expect the rally point to be patrolled by junior TIE cadets. They will be quick to respond if they see you first - so be very careful. Keep your eye out for the veteran TIE fighter pilot, and eliminate him.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2be1e8b", "(Salute) Requesting more info, sir!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2bf47615", "Yeah, sure. Why not.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2d4bb338", "May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2e4fedc2", "I am V3-FX... Alliance Pilot Relations.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2e5c9032", "Congratulations, pilot! You have successfully completed the first tier of the Alliance starfighter training program. Your next assignment will take you to planet Dantooine and place you under the guidance of Brother Vrovel... leader of the Vortex organization.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_2ff8ef01", "Good for you!  Alliance command will be happy to have you as an asset both in space and planetside!  Just seek a Rebel Recruiter and tell him you want to join.  I'm certain there won't be a problem with it.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_314a123f", "That is good to hear. Let's have some revenge on the Empire. Find four of their puny TIE fighters in the Naboo system and destroy them!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_31d45080", "The Alliance has my eternal faith.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_35657a01", "Of that I am certain.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_36fa01ee", "We will need a short while to decode and interpret your starship sensor data. In the meantime, there is more work to be done... if you are ready?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_3a8fb4dd", "Let's get on with it, buddy.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_3be54b2c", "Glorious! Welcome to the Alliance pilot training system. I will be your tutor.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_3f1a842c", "Yeah, yeah.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_3fa70900", "I am interested in basic starship component use.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_3fc246bd", "Error.  You have been grounded by Alliance HQ.  There are serious accusations against you... Working for the Empire?!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_400d7391", "Greetings, my friend. You will be pleased to know that Alliance High Command has authorized me to offer you a selection of combat duty missions. Are you interested in a duty mission?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_4063c2da", "You must go to planet Dantooine and meet with Brother Vrovel, leader of the Vortex organization. He's located in the North West at what the Empire thinks is an abandoned Rebel base. Due to the secretive nature of the Vortex you won't be let in to the base until you are a full member of the Alliance.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_41e49ae6", "Good day to you, then.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_4358efe9", "Where is my ship?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_45e27f53", "You are clearly a superior pilot! Congratulations.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_466afe42", "Forgive me. I am not authorized to assign missions to you. Perhaps you should speak with your commanding officer.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_47ce8fc2", "We have located a rally point from which the Empire has staged their recent aggressions. Go to this point and bring down a veteran TIE fighter pilot.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_48d7182e", "Oh, there is nothing to sign. You simply need to apply yourself to the flight lessons I have to teach. Are you interested?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_49bfaf2", "(Salute) For the Alliance!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_4bbbb3ee", "I, myself? Not very much. You may find more than one in the general area - but Alliance intelligence indicates that the Empire has charged one veteran TIE pilot with coordinating aggressions in this system.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_4c08239e", "I cannot say. Being a droid, I have no use for such things.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_4d3c3acd", "You will fly a four-point patrol above Naboo. We will need your ship's sensor data when you are finished.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_4efbdbfa", "What is 'Vortex?'");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_4ffd4b9d", "I am interested in a duty mission.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_52fb0136", "You are most welcome. Are you ready for your first assignment?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_546aa4f5", "You got it!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_54a7239a", "I ***CRACKLE*** excellent pilot trainer!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_54d18017", "Alliance HQ demands that you rejoin battle against the TIE Veteran so that our campaign may move forward. Good luck!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_576d5b2a", "TIE fighters only. There are other Imperial targets above Naboo, these TIE fighters are special. They are part of the Empire's occupation plans. Once you eliminate these craft - and only these craft - the Empire will know that their secrets are compromised.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_593caccf", "Yes, of course! Congratulations. Excellent work, ma'am.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_5f65d2ef", "Not yet, this is important!  Now are you ready?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_60c2803a", "Greetings... %TU?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_60c4f974", "Where do I go?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6106187c", "What is a duty mission?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_614176fe", "That is most excellent to hear. We have two mission types available. You may choose to patrol the system and destroy any Imperials that you find, or you may choose to help escort our supply ships. Which would you like?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_616cd1dd", "Yes. I am ready to train.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_61836246", "The Alliance HQ computer system has informed me that the TIE Veteran pilot has been defeated. Very good work, my friend. Very good, indeed!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_64308f9f", "Why not indeed! Let's have some revenge on the Empire. Find four of their puny TIE fighters in the Naboo system and destroy them!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6576f571", "How?!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_658f174d", "What am I looking for?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_65a3e672", "Splendid! You are now part of the Alliance pilot training program.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_67d49232", "**zzt** What sort of answers?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_692451bc", "You could do missions for the Rebel Alliance, if you can locate a mission terminal... that will prove your dedication.  I'm terribly sorry, %TU.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6a150013", "Let's have some details.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6aadaf18", "I will bring honor to the Alliance!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6b490480", "(Salute) Affirmative!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6be218d", "According to the Alliance main computer, Brother Vrovel is an eccentric Bith who has helped the Rebels on numerous occasions. He himself is not a pilot... for that matter, he has almost no pilots in his ranks. That is why you have been re-assigned.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6c399378", "Agreed! I will put your ID on the escort duty roster. You can return to the ground at any time when you feel that you have learned enough. Take flight whenever you wish.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6c620e99", "Don't they travel in big groups though?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6cc94470", "In that case, I welcome you to the Rebel Alliance pilot training program.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6f3e9d4b", "You have performed wonderfully! Alliance HQ has authorized me to provide your first starship training module. It is customary for the trainee to choose their area of emphasis. Which do you prefer?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_6fb5a316", "I am more than ready.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_706c5683", "...smuggler...does not...compute...");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_71a4b693", "In order to qualify for continued training you must participate in Alliance military operations in Naboo space - and beyond.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_72d418bf", "I... forget...");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_73edb45", "They fought well, but I fought better.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_74163bd7", "Destroy the veteran TIE pilot leader at a specific rally point. You will receive the waypoint data once you are in space.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_741df7ed", "Where?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_7426e000", "No!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_7478cd28", "Will you train me after this?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_748d90dd", "Glorious! Your first mission is a short-range, four-point patrol. When you return, your ship's sensor data will be downloaded to the Alliance 'net for Intel to review.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_761039fa", "I want to enlist with the ground forces");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_76fb5d49", "Alliance HQ has spread word of your victory! Congratulations, pilot!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_78679b31", "Sounds like fun. Where do I sign?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_79a06a16", "Salutations, pilot! I hope you are well-rested and ready for your first assignment for the Alliance training system.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_7a27e11", "I'll blast any Imperial crosses my path!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_7a4f9992", "Unfortunately, I have very little information on the Vortex group. Alliance HQ indicates that they are a friendly organization dedicated to locating Light-side Jedi and recruiting them to the Rebel cause. They are a very secretive part of the Alliance which is why you need to be a full faction member of the Alliance before you can join them.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_7ad400bc", "Alliance command is impressed with your courage, pilot! The main computer specifically mentioned your ability to improvise in a crisis situation. Very good work!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_7d2cd92d", "Then it is my pleasure to welcome you to the Alliance space navy.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_7d4a858e", "Blasted 'em.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_7ed5fec3", "I want to be part of the Alliance.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_8062b983", "How noble of you, sir! Droid programming is a critical skill for the Alliance pilot.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_81770bc2", "Yes! Please perform this task in the name of the Alliance!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_81c3ab31", "They're quite safe on their own, I assure you. We only ask that you stay out of sight. Starfighter patrols make the local business interests somewhat... timid, if you get my meaning.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_81eaed4e", "Finally decided to become a REAL Rebel, huh?  Well it's about time.  You do realize that enlisting with the ground forces means you could be attacked when you least expect it... even if you are a covert operative, there's still a danger!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_8334632", "Where do I find this Brother Vrovel?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_838cca30", "Greetings, pilot. You are performing exceptionally well! It would be my pleasure to provide any further training modules that you require. What area interests you the most?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_83cb5e35", "Affirmative, pilot! Congratulations.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_85c109c3", "You're irrepressible! Best of luck!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_85cea100", "Alliance intelligence has plans for this route. I don't know precisely what these plans are - but I assure you that I'll tell you as soon as I know.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_85dd7d6c", "How do I get back?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_85e2e26d", "Greetings. Can I be of service?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_85fcdc55", "Fighters attacked me!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_87a8cca7", "How will I know this pilot?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_8995f223", "What are my targets?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_8b2a5c11", "After you have completed a few assignments for me, then I will train you.  So, are you ready?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_8b4893d6", "Piece o'cake, metal-mouth!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_8c272224", "I am interested in starfighter survival tactics.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_8c6a4b66", "Oh. You are an Alliance pilot, but I do not recognize you. How may I be of service?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_900f01d1", "What?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_90377ed4", "Affirmative!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_909a1feb", "You will need a ship, in order to be a pilot.  I will add the control codes to your datapad for a simple Z95.  I hope that it serves you well.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_92e1301f", "Don't worry. I will be fine.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_93470245", "How should I stay hidden?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_9480f430", "I am interested in droid interface basics.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_9490adec", "Yes. The Alliance thanks you.  As a little bonus, I've had this bandolier made for you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_9561a5a9", "(Salute) Thank you, sir!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_96184c1", "A duty mission is an excellent way of earning experience towards your next training session. No good trainer would teach a pilot with no experience. Duty missions have no real end to them, you simply finish whenever you are ready. Would you like a duty mission?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_968b4bae", "Oh. Excuse me. I didn't see you there.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_9757e73a", "You'll be covering a little-used Alliance supply route. It's become more important in recent days because of Imperial activity outside the asteroid belt. We have plans for this area, and need to know that we'll remain unseen.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_97e129cd", "Where is the rally point?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_98a1c60d", "This is good to hear, pilot! Congratulations.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_999f2284", "While you were away, we discovered some information that will break the back of the Empire's fleet movements here in Naboo. Are you ready to fly again?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_99dfe276", "Interested? Is there money in it?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_9ba2e5e1", "There is a measure of monetary compensation for your efforts. Honestly, most pilots fly because they feel it is important to their survival. Do you not agree?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_9cb26d6a", "Good bye, ma'am! And good luck to you on Dantooine!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_9f6cf52", "(Glare in silent hatred.)");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_9f83d209", "Sounds very exciting! Congratulations!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a20f8416", "The recent Imperial activity is being led by a veteran TIE fighter pilot. We know of his location. Fly to the nav point, and eliminate this pilot with extreme prejudice.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a26aaa8b", "Planet Dantooine. You are supposed to meet with the Vortex group leader, Brother Vrovel, at the 'abandoned' Rebel base there. Due to the secretive nature of the Vortex you won't be let in to the base until you are a full member of the Alliance.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a30c1a53", "Yes sir!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a30d25ad", "Thank the maker!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a3f21650", "Get into your ship, Pilot, and FLY there.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a425f33d", "I have no use for you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a42932d7", "I will need a starship.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a6661be0", "Good bye, sir! And good luck on Dantooine!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a66ff602", "Our transports could use my help.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a80d9308", "Good luck!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a994ca63", "For the Alliance!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_a9a1aa2a", "Wonderful! I will teach you to fly starfighters in exchange for your loyalty to the Alliance, and your full willingness to support the rebellion in Naboo space and beyond.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_ac05bfba", "Are there any missions I can fly?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_ae7a2a24", "Uh... yes, and good day to you too!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_ae8026b4", "Searching my extensive database I see that he is in what the Empire think is an 'abandoned' Rebel base on Dantooine. The Alliance is so clever it's almost scary.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_afdd3bc5", "Pirates? Nobody mentioned pirates before...");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b0047226", "We have decoded your starship sensor data... and we have bad news. The planned Alliance supply route has been thoroughly compromised. We need you to find us another route. Are you ready to take flight again?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b04f2893", "Yes. I am ready.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b0643db5", "You're going to teach ME?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b0d2b96b", "How noble of you, ma'am! Droid programming is a most respectable vocation.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b1ab42f0", "Alliance HQ has requested that I assign a new mission to you... since you have failed the previous. Good luck!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b26194cb", "What are you doing here?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b2d473c6", "(Salute) Yes, sir!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b3bebc5e", "How do I get there?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b4155765", "Excellent! I see you are in perfect health!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b5caf1b6", "Critical to say the least! We must resume supply flights as soon as possible. To accomplish this, we need you to sweep a five-point area. Once again, your ship sensor data will be used to plot an effective route for our larger transports.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b7b55289", "Hello there! It is good to see you, although I believe you are supposed to be on planet Dantooine... correct?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b89c30f1", "Who is Brother Vrovel?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b952209b", "When you launch, your ship computer will create a 'launch waypoint' near the Naboo traffic control station. At the conclusion of your mission - return to this point. Communicate with the Naboo space station and request landing clearance.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_babb9df9", "Oh dear. Oh no! I hope I have not offended you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_bf1a0f3e", "So tell me about the job.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_c010439f", "Splendid!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_c1013aa7", "Whatever.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_c16bab26", "I need answers, droid.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_c267cd40", "There's none specified in the data I received from our esteemed superiors. You have to search the Naboo system until you find some good targets.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_c5dca41d", "Splendid! You are now rated for more powerful components. Use them well!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_c713935d", "You say there are merchants to save?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_c7626ea8", "I have been ordered to reassign a mission to you. The mission you most recently failed. My apologies. And... good luck!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_c7939f2f", "What are we looking for?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_c89c913b", "Oh dear! Please just stay out of trouble. Come back in one piece!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_c92d07b4", "Sure. Why not.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_ca5e8b8b", "Affirmative, sir. I have placed your ID on the duty roster. You are free to sweep and clear Imperial warships in the area. You can return to the ground at any time when you feel that you have learned enough.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_ca62728c", "Yes, yes, you have my word.  Complete this last assignment for me and I will train you.  Are you ready?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_ca776e30", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_cbe69427", "Only the TIE fighters?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_cc07efa5", "Yes, please. Alliance intelligence 'net is quite clever - you see, the Empire does not yet know that their fleet info has been compromised. Strike their TIE fighters with extreme prejudice, and they will have no choice but to halt their greater strategy.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_cca63822", "What a fortunate coincidence! I am able to induct you to the Alliance pilot training course immediately - provided that you agree to certain obligations.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_cd4363b6", "You are welcome, pilot!  As a bonus:  I've had a flightsuit made for you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_cd448c20", "Greetings. I am V3-FX, Alliance Pilot Relations. May I interest you in our starfighter training program?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_ce6b43af", "We have reason to believe that the Empire is moving a wing of TIE fighters directly into an Alliance supply route. We need to know more.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_cf04e474", "What more do we know of this TIE veteran?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_cf63ee80", "I would like to patrol Naboo space.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_d002385f", "Sounds great!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_d0233b4b", "The Force be with us.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_d671116a", "Yes, of course! Congratulations. Good work, sir!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_d731f764", "(Shrug and smile.)");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_d779178a", "What other targets are in the area?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_d7d27ed7", "You are welcome, pilot! Congratulations!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_d9c6f8a5", "Four or more will do quite nicely. Focus on the TIE fighters. They are critical to the Empire's operations in Naboo. If you focus on these craft, the Empire will know that their intelligence is compromised and that their operations are in jeopardy. This will buy us some time...");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_da1db2a5", "Improve your faction standing with the Rebel Alliance.  Then they will believe you are still dedicated to overthrowing the Empire.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_da803d9b", "Yes... We have reliable information about the location of Imperial TIE forces. They are being led by an experienced TIE veteran. Eliminate this TIE veteran pilot with extreme prejudice. This should halt the Empire's plans rather effectively.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_db851c67", "Oh dear! What did you do?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_de748105", "Bad news, %TU.  Clear your name with the Rebel Alliance.  Prove your dedication against the Empire.  I'm afraid you cannot fly for the Rebel Alliance until this matter is resolved.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_de7d9c3a", "You have made an excellent choice. You are now part of the Alliance flight training program.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_dfc3b1e1", "Of course. I am authorized to assign a selection of combat duty missions to you. Would you like to perform a duty mission?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_e096316d", "Sounds wizard. Let's go.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_e31d65b7", "The duty logs indicate that you are in mid-mission. We have nothing to discuss until you are finished.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_e50bc223", "Yes! Yes indeed!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_e5f13c4", "I'm not afraid");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_e6a9899d", "You must go to the starport in order to begin your assignment. It's just over there - on the other side of the pond. You can see it from here, actually. Go inside and look for a 'starship terminal.' Use the terminal to launch your ship into space.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_e93422bf", "This is a great day! Welcome to the Alliance pilot training program.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_e9b471e7", "I am not doing anything here.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_ebc0661b", "I got nothing better to do.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_eceb89e1", "Oh absolutely! Naboo space is teeming with deadly gangs of pirates - and horrid nebula that will melt your ship in mere seconds. Do be careful out there!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_ee82c4c3", "It should not be difficult. He should be one of very few veteran TIE fighter pilots in this vicinity.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_eedd7284", "Greeting, Sir.  Ma'am?  Pardon me.  I'm terribly sorry.  I cannot help you with that.  *bzzt*");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_efd8333f", "You are in luck. The Alliance has stowed a number of restored fighter craft at starports here on Naboo. I will upload the security codes for one of these vessels to your datapad.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_f0b6493f", "Thank you, V3.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_f14340ef", "Thank goodness you've returned in one piece! How was your first mission?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_f1c5717b", "I am quite certain the Alliance appreciates it, as well!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_f4d0e976", "The Alliance HQ computer system is rather disappointed with your performance. I have been instructed to renew your mission assignment. Good luck!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_f60c8a5", "Train me to fly starships!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_f75b511f", "You got it, metal head!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_f8b02865", "What do I do?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_f91d81c7", "What sort of obligations?");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_fb1c19c1", "I want training!");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_fb2ee4e7", "Not so fast, %TU.  There'll be time for training later.  Right now we need you to do another assignment.  I hope you are ready for it.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_fbd6b3e6", "You are welcome, pilot!  As a bonus:  I've had a bandolier made for you.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[336].addEntry("s_fedae3f2", "Splendid! Please convey my admiration to the Alliance pilots on Dantooine. You will find Brother Vrovel in the 'abandoned' Rebel base in the North West. Be aware, you need to be a full member of the Alliance faction to be allowed entrance in to this secret base. Good luck!");

stringFiles[337] = new StringFile("conversation/nym_technician_1");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (nym_technician_1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_135c7b04", "You're here to...huh?");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_169df3bb", "Never mind.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_273b318b", "You don't have to tell me twice. Good luck.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_2d587639", "This area is supposed to be cordoned off.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_3345f404", "You better take off or you'll blow my cover.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_35de4fcc", "I'm here to wax the matter infuser.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_37dad091", "I'm here to find out Nym's plans.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_39510e77", "You too.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_395d4c4", "Your report indicated a possible attack...");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_3b4b03fd", "There is another fuel technician that might know. She's should be around here somewhere. Pretty Zabrak, no tattoos, won't come with me to the cantina. You shouldn't have any trouble finding her. Tell her that you think the fuel balance on the 'Kimogila's Claw' is wrong and you need to check it. That should get you access to the ship.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_3e5e55b6", "I can't leave without authorization from command.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_42e8bcae", "Well, you've probably only managed to blow my cover! Nym doesn't have any plans. He's too busy putting out fires and keeping his upper leadership from falling apart. The pressure the Empire has been putting on the organization has really started to test Nym's leadership.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_51f0669b", "You did? Excellent. High Command will be pleased. You should try to get off Lok as soon as possible. Inform the Fleet of your success.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_536a83dc", "So what is he trying to organize?");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_5c3323fd", "Then keep your head down.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_62f865dd", "I'm here to scrub the plasma injector.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_66c37cce", "Shh! Quiet. I can't believe the Empire sent someone here after what happened to the other agents.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_67a590c3", "I'm here to clean the antimatter condenser.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_7d114e8", "I failed in my attempt to destroy the Kimogila's Claw.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_81e175a9", "How can I find that ship?");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_8d9eefec", "What did you say?");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_90422eb5", "Good luck.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_9518acb5", "I don't know. He's called for five of his captains to meet and work out details for a massive response. They're preparing to leave soon on a YT-1300. The plan is to review the damage to Nym's fleet and then discuss how best to proceed...");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_a84adf58", "I'll be fine here. I think I'm still in the clear.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_aae05f6b", "I won't. You should probably take off, this area is supposed to be cordoned off.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_b8779a78", "I'm going there now.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_c70b951e", "YT-1300? If I can find that ship...");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_ccc1622", "Shhhhh. What are you telling me for? I don't want to know anything about that. All I can tell you is if you are going to try to blow up a ship full of Nym's men, you better not stop until you succeed. Now beat it.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_ccc723ff", "I'm really busy at the moment. Five wrecks and three borderline cases so far today. The Empire is really bringing it to Nym. I've got to get that blaster cylinder back online and it's probably going to take all day.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_ced0fec8", "Oh, don't let me get in your way.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_d724a599", "You could lobotomize Nym's command structure. Nym wouldn't have much of a chance to mount any kind of significant response if that happened.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_dce481f1", "Sorry, you've got the wrong guy. I don't handle engine work.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_e15acd61", "Thanks. You better get out of here.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_e727edeb", "What are you doing back here? Didn't I tell you to take off or you would blow my cover?");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_ed4d7aa6", "Nym wants to organize something. Push the Empire back so he can start rebuilding. He's probably here for the long haul, but the Empire's assaults have definitely made him less likely to support the Rebels openly.");
stringFiles[337].addEntry("s_fdee07ad", "I destroyed the Kimogila's Claw.");

stringFiles[338] = new StringFile("conversation/nym_technician_2");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (nym_technician_2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_4c3cb236", "Yeah, well it's my sob story. Beat it so I can get to work. I don't think you're supposed to be back here anyway.");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_501ea131", "Scrub the? Excuse me?");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_5afecbb7", "Uh...yeah Jeffy. Funny huh?");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_60900624", "Hahaha! That's funny stuff!");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_62f865dd", "I'm here to scrub the plasma injector.");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_67a590c3", "I'm here to clean the antimatter condenser.");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_6aa58622", "I'm really, really busy. It's a complete mess around here. The Empire has been laying it into Nym for some reason and the damaged ships keep rolling in. I've had to replace two engine cores today alone!");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_76ac95c", "Uh...okay...");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_8358e7c8", "I'm sorry to hear that.");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_b0c60048", "What? You don't scrub a plasma injector. Those things are stored in sealed containers and fused into engines. Is this some kind of joke? Did Jeffy put you up to this?");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_b44f916c", "I don't get it. Look, I'm really busy. Can you come back later?");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_b7141451", "Get moving now.");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_cbb1bec7", "Clean the antimatter condenser? Well...yeah I suppose it's probably getting a little jammed with all of the work we've been putting it through. You can find the Snaff Grease in the back. Hurry up though, there's probably a bunch of ships waiting to be fueled up.");
stringFiles[338].addEntry("s_f49a789f", "I'm here to wax the matter inducer.");

stringFiles[339] = new StringFile("conversation/nym_technician_3");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (nym_technician_3) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_1ebf6580", "Uh, okay I'll do that.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_248faf8a", "Where did you say the Kimogila's Claw was?");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_4d5276b", "The ship already left?");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_52fbe706", "Never mind, I have to go.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_544505bd", "Look, if you're a pilot, you can check on your ship later. Most of these are going to be junk, but we might be able to save a few.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_54711fd3", "You are? You're ahead of schedule. Our condenser has been working fine as far as I can tell. The thing isn't scheduled for maintenance for five cycles. Why don't you just clear out and let me focus on my repairs?");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_5fcdd10d", "No problem. Just tell your boss you cleaned the condenser and come back in five cycles.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_62f865dd", "I'm here to scrub the plasma injector.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_67a590c3", "I'm here to clean the antimatter condenser.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_69e50906", "Yeah, so there's nothing you can do about the fuel balance. Who are you anyway? You here to clean the antimatter condenser?");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_6da31acb", "That's really disgusting. You pilots are all the same.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_6e00532f", "You thought WHAT? Get lost or I'll yell.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_7002e5c4", "The fuel balance on the Kimogila's Claw is messed up.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_76b02ea3", "Can I help you? This is a restricted area right now. We've had a lot of damaged ships come in and this area is cordoned off for repairs.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_7e5b1e91", "Can you clear out now? This is hard enough without distractions.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_8804f6ee", "Oh, I had no idea.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_88d98675", "Oh yeah. Um, sorry about that.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_a8162c2", "You're strange.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_c1013aa7", "Whatever.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_cbc1d532", "Oh, I thought...");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_cf08b4c6", "Huh? Is that some kind of pilot slang? I'm not that kind of girl.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_d65e601b", "Oh yeah...");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_debe2412", "What? No way. I checked the Claw myself before it left. The balance is perfect.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_e32d36db", "You again? I don't have time to help you.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_e8060558", "Are you an idiot? The Claw's already long gone. Somewhere in the Lok system, but I have no idea where.");
stringFiles[339].addEntry("s_f49a789f", "I'm here to wax the matter inducer.");

stringFiles[340] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_architect_01");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_architect_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_25d34a1e", "Sorry friend... can't talk. I'm losing money every day we fail to begin construction.");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_50bf04b1", "I'm glad to hear that, construction can now begin.  Thank you for your hard work.");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_7637308a", "I have a quick job for you friend.I'm an architect and could use someone of your skill to clear some unwelcome inhabitants off of some land I just recently purchased.Does this sound like something you could help me with?");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_88ac3394", "That land already has an owner. You have no right to take it from them.");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_8bf180e7", "An owner?!  That family may occupy that land, but I am it's owner.  Your sympathy is sickening.");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_91e6aa00", "Is the area cleared?");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_a1ef941b", "Sure, I'd be happy to help.");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_ac5709b0", "Bah... I'll just find someone else who can clear that land for me. Leave me alone.");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_cc9db25e", "Stop! I'm not interested in your petty little problems.");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_ea2c487d", "Excellent, thank you very much.  I do appreciate this.  Here is a waypoint to the location I need you to scout out. Please remove any squatters who are loitering there.I'll be here waiting for you once you've finished.");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_f0d9878f", "Yes, it is. I'm proud to say that the gungan claiming to own the land is dead.");
stringFiles[340].addEntry("s_f2d3daf1", "Wha... if you do not wish to help, then so be it. But there is no call for being rude.");

stringFiles[341] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_architect_02");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_architect_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_17f3f71f", "You are trespassing on my client's land.");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_20c05fd8", "Yousa tells yousa client dat mesa lands not for sells and to leaves mesa alone.");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_26b9a00f", "Mesa no have speaksa to yousa.");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_55ff5c74", "If that is true, why was this land up for sale?");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_56dcc3ba", "Wesa sees whosa going to be leavings.");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_5e71d8b7", "I will do just that. I apologize for intruding and upsetting you.");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_7280c4d8", "I don't care anything about all that.  You must leave or else.");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_a7079eee", "Trespassing?  Wesa lived here for evers.  Yousa are the ones trespassing.");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_c8e2f57a", "Yesa, howsa can wesa helps you?");
stringFiles[341].addEntry("s_d7cc9593", "Wesa don't know anythings abouts no sales.  Yousa needs to be moving off our lands now though, yousa starting to upset me.Tell yousa client this land has and always willsa be ours.");

stringFiles[342] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_artist_01");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_artist_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_28225432", "Where is my assistant with those supplies. Arrgh, this is becoming annoying.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_35c6bce6", "Thank you so much for retrieving my supplies. I'm not sure what I'll do about getting another assistant, but that's something I can worry about later.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_4f3396fb", "Oh no, he will.  Sorry for not bringing this up before, but it is not the first time he has done this.  I know it's not the most glamorous job in the world, but I think a part of him sort of enjoys it.Anyway, thank you for your help and for bringing my supplies.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_593d8ed6", "Not yet. I'm still working on it.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_5e1dfbcd", "Yes... you see if I don't get the supplies I need to make the paints I'm afraid I will not be able to finish my paintings.  Which means my patrons will not receive those paintings and will therefore not pay me. This in turn means I won't be able to pay my bills.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_705f9dd1", "I haven't been able to find your assistant.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_76f9d659", "I'm an aspiring artist working on some paintings using natural materials as the base for my paints.  The texture and brilliance of the colors I get using them echoes the emotions I try to express in my work. I sent my assistant out to retrieve some more supplies but he has yet to return.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_78bd6c2", "Thank you. Let me know when you find him.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_81192d80", "Lady, you're a freak. Get a real job and leave the rest of us alone.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_8bed149", "My assistant is out collecting a mixture of mud and refuse that is just right for the colors I need.  If you could please meet him there and assist him in returning safely I would be ever appreciative.I have given you a waypoint to his location.  Please hurry.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_a0e28661", "No and I'm not going to. Find him yourself.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_a1ae198d", "Have you found my assistant yet?");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_a2c41722", "I'm afraid your assistant will not be coming back... but I have your supplies.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_a51658ea", "Excuse me?");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_a8a01106", "Your excuses are as transparent as a Twi'lek entertainers clothing.  Lets both just forget I asked.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_a95dd416", "What? But... you... I see. Very well. I see how your true colors now.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_aad1f131", "Where is my assistant?");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_bdf1fbc8", "Sounds... interesting.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_c4960c85", "Who are you?  Never mind, I think we both know that doesn't matter.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_cc45360d", "Did you even try? I'm not sure why I bothered to ask for your help.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_d21432e3", "I did get your supplies though.");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_ec321028", "Oh. Maybe I spoke hastily. But how did you know what to get? [check the supplies] Yes, these all look correct. I'm impressed. Ever think about becoming an artist's assistant?");
stringFiles[342].addEntry("s_f9a16624", "I get the picture. What can I do to help?");

stringFiles[343] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_artist_02");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_artist_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_1ed6eefa", "Then let me return with the paint mixture for you.");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_26360156", "Yeah. Okay. Thanks, tell Sathme that I'm sorry.[You take the painting supplies, but decide putting them in your inventory could result in a big mess. So instead you store them someplace safer.]");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_5439ef9", "Then why are you digging around in the mud?");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_5c12a1a9", "I've told her already, I'm not fetching her 'mud and refuse' ever again.");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_70d2d7a8", "Because... I... I've lost all direction in my life, where do I go from here? There must be something better than fetching dirt and droppings from various places.  But I have nowhere else to go.");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_7fb2178f", "I'm just here to get you to return with her supplies.");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_a54bac2d", "I don't care what she thinks... I'm following my own dreams.");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_b19ae492", "Sorry...");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_b4b8a975", "There are plenty of worse professions out there.");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_c5493e9b", "I have hopes and dreams too!  I have talent!");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_cb5a9d1b", "Right.. can you just please get back to the delivery?");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_e00a6a73", "I see she has already found a replacement for me.");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_e83d11f6", "No, I don't have it in me.");
stringFiles[343].addEntry("s_f0a76084", "You don't have to lie to make me feel better.");

stringFiles[344] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_bad_cat_01");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_bad_cat_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_1ca2724b", "Too true, well my best friend is the one with the biggest problem.  Our tamed cat was spooked during one of our live performances, sending it in a mad fury towards my best friend's throat.That friend is in bad shape, however, the real problem is our cat is loose outside the city limits.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_34fc22c8", "No, I think you have a problem.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_3aa5b0e8", "I don't think the cat meant any harm, but those animals don't realize how much damage they can do.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_5455041", "Find the cat, and ermm... take the necessary steps to make sure this never happens again. I realize that will mean killing the cat, but I don't know that there are any alternative.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_5b82e205", "Have you taken care of our problem?");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_5ffd7e8f", "It is.  The cat has been taken care of.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_6077d5", "Not yet, but I will.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_6766a3d9", "What am I going to do...");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_72bfd7f8", "We did truly need your help. Now I don't know what to do.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_799aee03", "Oh we do, do we?");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_89952c29", "Tell me it's all over.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_8b81f489", "Yes I'll do what I can.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_908b3b7a", "What do you want me to do about it?");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_913dffdc", "My pet, a fairly large cat, was spooked during a live performance earlier this evening. It leapt right at my good friend, who was performing with me, and went for his throat.My friend is in bad shape, however, the real problem is that our cat is on the loose outside the city limits. Could you possibly help me resolve this most unfortunate of accidents?");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_93b5b885", "We have a slight problem.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_a2b99609", "Okay.  I have uploaded coordinates to your datapad for the cat's last known location.  Return here once it's over. Please.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_b4aeaba0", "[pause] I'm glad it's over. Thank you for your help.  I owe you my gratitude.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_bad01abd", "Oh dear.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_d36ab1ec", "Don't worry... I'll do what needs to be done.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_d3af9eee", "Please hurry.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_ddfbf107", "Thank you.  I have uploaded the cat's last known location to your datapad.  Return here once this is all behind us.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_ecd38d6b", "No. Please. Why would I care?");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_ee242807", "No, and I've decided I'm not going to. Deal with it yourself.");
stringFiles[344].addEntry("s_ff470431", "As I said, I think this problem is yours alone. I don't care.");

stringFiles[345] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_chef_01");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_chef_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_1ba9c89d", "I don't care, I'm glad he took it.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_236213e1", "So? Tell me what happened. Did he die painfully?");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_32e459b5", "It's gone... all gone.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_39d844c", "Is it over? Has that thug paid the price I asked?");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_3f4dfda1", "No but I'm done. I'm not going to help you seek revenge.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_53e26aec", "No. I didn't hurt him. I'll not exact your petty revenge.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_56b146aa", "Now, that was uncalled for.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_58e01006", "He took it.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_78228c87", "You are right, I'm sorry.  Who took what?");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_7c44e561", "What?? I can't... ah no,  my sweet revenge!??!");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_7c9388b6", "Yes. He died screaming like a newborn bantha and begging for his life.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_8a0862a1", "It sure is.The pie is long gone, I can feel it in my blood.  What I want is revenge.  Revenge is the only thing that will taste as sweet as my precious lost pie.Are you willing to help?");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_8cddb8eb", "Arrrgh. You... you're just cruel. Taking pleasure in another's misfortune.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_94e89675", "That is one sad story.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_959fc17d", "Some random thug came by here, and took my latest creation.  It was a fantastic pie, and I won't be able to make another of its grandeur for quite some time.  I put my heart and soul into that pie.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_9bcbdc35", "Good for him.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_9bf6042f", "But?!! No!!!!I want my revenge! I must have it! My precious vengeance! Who are you to stand in my way.Well, drat.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_a7c3aea6", "Who took what?");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_b654720c", "I chased the thug all the way to the edge of town. He ran off into the wilderness, and I quickly lost sight of him. But I managed to at least tag him with a small burst tracking device, so I know where you can find the bum.Destroy him.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_bc5c7c4a", "Not just yet. I'm still working on it.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_be6b7d06", "Problem solved? Did I get my revenge?");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_d5ab69d1", "Okay. Don't waste too much time I don't know how long until he discovers that tracking device.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_e15ebf39", "It's not fair. Not at all. I hate everyone.");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_edc10a84", "My hero. Ah sweet and glorious day!");
stringFiles[345].addEntry("s_f68302e8", "But you must... you have no choice, don't you see. Help me get my revenge. I need revenge! You must!! Arrrrrrgggh...");

stringFiles[346] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_chef_02");
stringFiles[346].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_chef_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[346].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[346].addEntry("s_2ad2bbf9", "Oh. Yeah, good. And you tell that chef... well, tell him his pie was really good. And that I'll try and pay for the next one.");
stringFiles[346].addEntry("s_35494a44", "Hey... who are you? What are you doing following me? At least you're not that crazed chef. He was out of his mind. I mean, it was just a pie.");
stringFiles[346].addEntry("s_78cca73a", "What? No! Ha. That's truly unbelievable. Okay, so you're here. Now what? You gonna try and collect some money for that pie?");
stringFiles[346].addEntry("s_7ca121b2", "Oh man, that pie was so good. I hope that guy makes another one. I might even pay for the next one.");
stringFiles[346].addEntry("s_867ceb54", "Whoa! Hold it. Just a minute. For a pie? You want blood? Alright. Whatever. Come on. Let's go!");
stringFiles[346].addEntry("s_928c6a6a", "The chef wants revenge. But I think I've made a mistake. I'm leaving.");
stringFiles[346].addEntry("s_c1e21c08", "I'm here because that crazed chef asked me to be.");
stringFiles[346].addEntry("s_ca28f99d", "Not money, exactly. But I am here to make you pay for that pie. In blood.");

stringFiles[347] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_kill_baz_nitch_01");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_kill_baz_nitch_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("s_2313ac9e", "What are you talking about?");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("s_2b2c13e4", "It's not just that they are foul creatures, but they also destroy crops... and people.");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("s_4498c7a3", "Just what I wanted to hear, killing 20 of them should help curb the infestation.");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("s_70d6b213", "Thank you so much. That infestation of baz nitches was getting out of hand.");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("s_88122b41", "The Baz Nitch infestation of course!  We need you, the most capable of adventurer to help remedy this horrendous epidemic.");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("s_95db8861", "Ah, perfect.  You seem to fit the build of someone capable of handling this most unfortunate of tasks.");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("s_983337f5", "Killing Baz Nitches eh?  I'll do what I can.");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("s_a7c60196", "Excellent work!  Thanks to you we all have 20 less Baz Nitches to worry about.  We can all sleep easier tonight my friend!");
stringFiles[347].addEntry("s_a8f84c9f", "Let me know once you have killed 20 Baz Nitches.");

stringFiles[348] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_kill_falumpaset_01");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_kill_falumpaset_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_1faee9ae", "A cargo vessel carrying a shipment of some less than legal merchandise has gotten us all into quite a bad spot.  It seems as though this vessel has been leaking chemicals all over the landscape infecting a very large percentage of the local herbivores.We have an idea on how to solve the problem, but we are going to need your help.");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_25c07049", "Sure, what can I help you with?");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_3d66a959", "Excellent work, I think you've cleared it up before any serious consequences could arise.");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_5036f77b", "Okay, what is your plan?");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_6f2a1f67", "A cargo vessel carrying a large shipment of some less than legal merchandise has gotten us all into quite a bad spot.  It seems as though this vessel has been leaking chemicals all over the place infecting a very large percentage of some of the local herbivores.We have an idea on how to solve the problem, but we are going to need your help.");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_741c2cf1", "Let me know once you have killed 20 Falumpaset.");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_761aa5f8", "Well done. You took to that quite well. Sad business, but necessary. This kind of thing happens from time to time.");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_82761761", "Oh dear, we have quite the problem.");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_889a3584", "Whats wrong?");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_bd13c42d", "What I need you to do is kill 20 Falumpaset, those are the creatures who ate up the largest portions of the sludge that  was spilt.Once you've taken down 20 of them come back here and let me know.");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_beb9462d", "I assume that is the royal 'we', correct?");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_cce54be1", "Ah those poor creatures. But I suppose it's best to destroy them before this can spread to others.");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_d4307269", "Not exactly, so are you willing to hear the problem?  Or no?");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_dedea172", "Sure, what is your plan?");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_e73e7a7a", "I see. Well, thanks anyway.");
stringFiles[348].addEntry("s_f3993d68", "No. And I'm sorry I spoke to you in the first place.");

stringFiles[349] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_kill_sludge_panther_01");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_kill_sludge_panther_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_10a8184c", "Thanks for your help. It's a shame to have to destroy those animals, but it's better in the long run. Even if they hadn't spread the infection directly, their offsprings would have been at risk.");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_16d870fe", "Consider it done.");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_3d2465d5", "And it wouldn't be except that some sludge panthers devoured the dumped Falumpaset meat and are now in danger of spreading the toxin to other animals.I'm afraid we must try and eliminate the infected sludge panthers before this spreads much further.");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_54cde3f2", "Let me know once you have killed 20 Sludge Panthers.");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_7b35cfbc", "What is the problem?");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_acb29829", "Excellent work.  I'm positive now we've cleaned up a large enough portion of the infested population to prevent any serious damage to the ecosystem.");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_c2a10302", "Okay, doesn't really seem like it's a problem any more though.");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_d35e7542", " It seems as though some bad Falumpaset meat was sold to some local merchants. Tainted with some kind of chemical the Falumpasets must have eaten. Once these merchants realized the meat was off, they naturally dumped it.");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_da6f521d", "It's getting out of control.");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_dfb295ef", "This is going to get worse before it gets better. Unless we can stop it now.");
stringFiles[349].addEntry("s_e49afb37", "Excellent. If you can find and kill 20 sludge panthers, that seems like it should be sufficient.");

stringFiles[350] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_old_musician_01");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_old_musician_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_150fa11a", "My guess is you want me to help you with that.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_189e6456", "As I thought.  I didn't much expect you to.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_246ed1c7", "Don't much have to tell me that.  Lady luck left me many years ago.  Thanks for your time.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_2c577f48", "Where should I start?");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_2d855cc6", "Samston always did like to rub it in.  We would fight for days over Selestina, she was the sole reason 'The Blue Mead', broke up.This ring means a whole lot to me, and I appreciate the trouble you went through to get it.  I wish I hadn't been so stubborn in my life and I hope you can learn from my poor example.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_2d9fa396", "If only you'd found at least one of them alive. I would have gone to my rest a happier man.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_42d4547", "Lok? Why would you go there? Oh never mind. I'm surprised you've done as much as you have, to be honest.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_431c1c58", "I've got some bad news Grizzlo.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_4f05c224", "I don't have time for your dusty old stories.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_5027198", "That's a good question. I think there's a man I used to know... he's a booking agent for musical acts. Name's Marco Vahn.Last I heard, he was in Mos Eisley on Tatooine trying to convince some band at the cantina there to go on tour for him. He might know where my old band mates are.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_6386bdac", "What's that? Speak up a bit. Where ya going...");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_64234023", "This was given to me... to give to you.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_6aa99fbc", "You are a quick one.  All I want is for you to try to find them.  If you could of course.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_6b726d18", "Truthfully, I don't have much time left.  I think it would be a surprise to both my doctors and myself if I made it to the end of this week.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_73519ce0", "Are they on their way?");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_7a8dee0a", "Back when I used to play my music, I wore a blumfruit on my lapel because it was the style at the time.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_9fe9d850", "Oh, that is very good news. Please go and find out if he's still there.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_a80877a1", "I look forward to hearing from you.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_c2f4a95c", "Any reason you cannot look for them yourself?");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_c4a1af2c", "Not yet, but I'm still looking. I'll be back when I find them.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_c53fc924", "No, but I found a good lead. One of your friends moved to Lok.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_d23b54d0", "You're not even gonna live long enough for this to be worth it. I'm out.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_d27dbab", "In my younger years I was in a traveling band.  We played all over this here planet.  We were not the best band around, but people seemed to enjoy our music enough.Over the years the band drifted and we all went our separate ways.  I haven't kept in touch with any of the three other members, and have regretted it to this day.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_d6d1e61d", "You don't even have to say it friend, I can see from the look in your eyes.They are all dead.You can go on now, thanks again for your help.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_d7278b9f", "Sort of, but there's no way I'm travelling all the way to Lok");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_d7ea1106", "Also there's a rin... er... I mean... yeah, I'll be going.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_dbc1ba26", "Well hello there!  It's always nice to see new faces at this age.  Reminds me of years past.Humor and old man for a bit, and listen up eh?");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_e4475a83", "Looks like you are out of luck old man.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_ef7a7d43", "My friends may all have passed on, but this ring will help me remember. Thank you.");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_f2a197da", "Have you found my old friends?");
stringFiles[350].addEntry("s_f6fe45ba", "Well hello... oh you're back. Did you find any of my old friends?");

stringFiles[351] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_old_musician_02");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_old_musician_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_1e50f991", "Sadly, I've lost interest in this..");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_26888d70", "It's forgotten. Like you've never been here. Really, who are you?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_284c1131", "Whatever you say. Not like it makes any difference to me.");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_3ce5abed", "Grizzy Two Tune?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_46660c8b", "Whatever you say. You were the one asking questions.");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_51ea4418", "Never mind, I don't think I care any more.");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_58a6b3", "These stories never change friend.  Is that all you needed to know?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_5d25f30f", "Beep boop bop bop... yeah, play that thing.");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_60181c57", "Never mind, I've decided I don't care.");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_71918486", "No, he is very much alive. Well, sort of.");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_79a946b4", "Know the current location of any of his band mates?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_83a3fa55", "Do you know an old man by the name of Grizzlo?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_8593cffc", "Old Grizzy?  Sure, I've heard of him.  Didn't he die a few years back?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_8db3d0fb", "Do you know where I can find the other band members?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_91a67d52", "Do you know where I can find any of his band mates?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_b38f136f", "The band had some sort of falling out, I'm sure it was over a girl.  Tad bit cliche, eh?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_bdb08f0b", "That's what they used to call him; his band didn't know more than two tunes.Truth is the tunes they did play were something else; I don't think their popularity ever spread off world though. Need to know anything else?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_c7b21593", "I've heard one or two of them moved to Lok about twenty some years ago, though it's been quite a while since I've heard from any them. I fear age may have caught up with them sooner than our friend Grizzlo.I know a musician at the cantina on Lok near Nym's stronghold. He would know if any of those guys are still around. Look for Vixur Webb there.");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_c7d951f7", "I think I've exceed my interest in this whole thing. Forget about it.");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_c8ad3417", "Who'da guessed that.  Well, what do you need to know about Ol' Grizzy Two Tune?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_cefcce06", "Yes? Are you talking to me?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_cf3cdb9a", "Why did they break up if they were so popular?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_d80ca537", "I've heard one or two of them moved to Lok about twenty some years ago, though it's been quite a while since I've heard from any them. I fear age may have caught up with them sooner than our friend Grizzlo.I know a musician at the cantina on Lok near Nym's stronghold. He would know if any of those guys are still around. Look for Vixur Webb there. ");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_d920c8d", "You have quite the morbid sense of humor don't yah?Well, what do you need to know about Ol' Grizzy Two Tune?");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_e9a5dbe", "I'm digging up his past before they start digging his grave.");
stringFiles[351].addEntry("s_fafa8703", "Yeah, but that doesn't surprise me.");

stringFiles[352] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_old_musician_03");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_old_musician_03) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_16e413e5", "Hello friend.");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_285ac110", "You are going to need a shovel if you want to talk to her friend, and I'm afraid she isn't going to be saying much.  She passed a few years back herself.As a matter of fact, I'm afraid the entire band, except for your friend Grizzlo, is no longer with us.It's a shame really; Samston told me they had two tunes in particular that really made people move.");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_3585e154", "Do you know where I might be able to find her?");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_4ef8ad4d", "I'm supposed to meet a friend, Branthon, and go see a theatrical performance tonight. If I don't go,  Branthon has promised to write an essay revealing the entire plot of the show. It will consist of at least 20 words!I don't want that to happen.");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_6be6a4b5", "What Twi'lek?");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_77c9e846", "No problem friend.  Actually wait one second.  Samston gave me this here ring, it belonged to that Twi'lek I was talking about before. I don't have much need for it and I'm sure Grizzy Two Tone would love to have it himself. Tell him Samston always wanted him to have it; it wouldn't be far from the truth.[You worry that the ring will be lost in your inventory, so you stow it in a safe place.]");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_8da4188a", "No kidding?  Grizzy Two Tone?  It's been quite a few years since I've heard that name.  Samston, a member of Grizzy's band used to hang out in this here Cantina.  He used to sit in that chair right across from me.  We were good friends Samston and I. He had many a good stories of Grizzy and the rest of 'The Blue...' something... can't quite recall the bands name.  It was a sad day when Samston passed away. ");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_8dc8e232", "Oh just some girl the two of them fought over for quite some time.  Rumor has it that she is the reason the band broke up.");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_a25995cf", "It's been a good ten years since Samston passed away.  As far as I know he has never talked with Grizzy after the whole fiasco between the two of them over that Twi'lek dancer.");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_a8d0cb35", "I'm looking for an old friend of Grizzlo.");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_afbed875", "Thank you for your time.");
stringFiles[352].addEntry("s_cbc0ca2b", "I'm sorry to hear that.  Grizzlo will be as well.");

stringFiles[353] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_pannaqa_01");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_pannaqa_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_1843ab7e", "One dead tree. That's pretty much all I've got to show for my farming skills. As if I should call them skills even. [*sigh*]");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_194a6a4b", "Shendo, an extremely unreliable acquaintance of mine was supposed to have delivered it many hours ago but has yet to show up.  Would you be willing to find him and retrieve the part? ");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_24a1738d", "I see. I thank you for the consideration you've given and trust that you find your way.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_30546869", "Not yet, but don't worry... I will.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_387d18ec", "I've decided that I'm done being your slave boy. You're on your own.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_3a3e0d5d", "Yes, Shendo wasn't difficult to find... just to deal with.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_41aab3ed", "I'm sure someone of your ability will be able to assist me.  Do you have a second to spare?");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_42e0a11e", "Thank you so much. Hopefully this will help me get  the gardens around here into shape.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_52da7aa", "Ahh, thank you. Please return when you have the part.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_53c84ebd", "I can't leave the village.. there's far too much to be done at the moment. But I also need a replacement part for my vibro-tiller. Without it, farming is much more difficult.As you can see, we have not had much luck of late trying to grow our crops. Between the harsh environment and the constant attacks of Mellichae's thugs, we have our hands full.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_69af28a6", "I would be more than willing to help.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_6d11135b", "Did you find Shendo with the vibro-tiller part?");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_72d5a837", "Sorry for bothering, I didn't mean to offend.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_ad0eb2bb", "Tasks like this are for the servants, bother someone else.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_b2216c3", "Do you have the part? Did you find Shendo?");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_b336be8b", "I've decided that you're on your own. Find another servant.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_b9c3a3be", "Any luck finding Shendo?");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_bbfeec70", "Thank you kindly, I'll be here when you return.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_be0f3920", "Now maybe instead of just dead trees, I'll grow some vegetables. Or flowers. Or maybe just more trees.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_dd5fc3e4", "Sure, why not.  How can I help?");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_df607c49", "I'm listening.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_ed2f6bdb", "What kind of mup do you take me for? I'm not doing you menial labor.");
stringFiles[353].addEntry("s_fd022a50", "No, find some sap to bother with your shallow needs.");

stringFiles[354] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_pannaqa_02");
stringFiles[354].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_pannaqa_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[354].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[354].addEntry("s_3c4de5b4", "No, he's not around, as usual. He's off goofing around as always.  I don't think I've ever seen him without a Sunburn in his hand and spice on his breath.");
stringFiles[354].addEntry("s_499c34de", "Yeah, I can help you. I'll upload the information to your datapad.");
stringFiles[354].addEntry("s_62623109", "Go away. I'm doing stuff here and you're bothering me.");
stringFiles[354].addEntry("s_69850509", "Do you know where I might find him?");
stringFiles[354].addEntry("s_afd80a03", "I'm looking for Shendo. I was told he might be here?");
stringFiles[354].addEntry("s_e03f6fd1", "Yes? May I help you?");

stringFiles[355] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_pannaqa_03");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_pannaqa_03) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_1a22a5dc", "Basically.");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_2b0e7d3c", "Pannaqa!  You are already many hours late.");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_4cc97351", "Pannaqa has been waiting for you for quite a while, Shendo. He needs that vibro-tiller part.");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_552042df", "Show me the drink to go way. I'm home and I wanna go drink....");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_6abc7ab9", "No kidding eh?  I guess I should probably get on that huh?");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_70fea75d", "Um, hello?");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_7bbf7ffe", "I don't think I can trust you to finish the job.");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_9035e1f5", "Um, who?");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_b6307da0", "Deal. Now I can get back to my drinking and wandering.[You stash the vibro-tiller part in a safe place.]");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_b7bc9ab", "At this point I do not care, I've lost all hope.");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_e51e11cc", "Cheer up mate, how about I give you the part, and you take it to Pan.. Paqanna.. Whatever his name was.  I'm going to keep my eyes on this bottle of ale for you and make sure it doesn't do whatever it is I think it's going to do.[You stash the vibro-tiller part in a safe place.]");
stringFiles[355].addEntry("s_eb635904", "So you are going to take the part for me, and I can stay here and drink?");

stringFiles[356] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_peoples_soldier_01");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_peoples_soldier_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_209a7c7b", "I just remembered that I don't care. Bye.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_257d7def", "You can find these thugs hanging around and being a nuisance.Keep in mind talking with them is an exhausted option.  I wouldn't approach any of them without a blaster at my hip.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_2ae116f8", "What is in it for me?");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_40708207", "Have you got the disk?");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_41ec1c94", "Sorry, it's a bad habit.  How can I help?");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_464748ae", "I am willing to help, where do I start?");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_4e6ee0cd", "The rich get richer. Too true. So that means I should become one of the rich.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_4f53003d", "I should have expected as much. The stench of failure surrounds you... which I foolishly thought could be overcome. No chance.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_53e9175a", "Would you have returned the disk had you known the contents were worth well over six million credits?  Didn't think so.  Move along and learn from your mistakes.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_6151c35f", "Can I trust you with some information?");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_6b8c7e69", "You did. If there's nothing in this for me, I'm gone.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_873db52a", "Don't expect a welcoming party; like I said before, I wouldn't approach them without a blaster on your hip. When you get the disk, bring it back to me.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_9f213941", "What type of supplies?");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_a082f8ab", "Don't feel so bad... it's all to a good cause. My bank account! Ha!");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_a6cac2af", "With questions like that you might as well join their ranks, I must have read you wrong.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_b84b366c", "How can I help?");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_b9bc27b2", "Sure enough.  I thought it was going to be a challenge.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_c0a878d5", "Indeed. Then fare thee well. No... make that fare thee poorly.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_c7676f2f", "Spice!  You said it was foods and medicine!");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_d1008bcb", "What is the problem? Have you done what I've asked?");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_dbc40340", "I knew I could see the spirit in your eyes.You can find these thugs hanging around and harassing people. Keep in mind talking with them is an exhausted option.  I wouldn't approach any of them without a blaster at my hip.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_ddb27082", "Not yet, but I'm working on it.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_df607c49", "I'm listening.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_e8f293a0", "I knew I could see the spirit in your eyes.You can find these thugs hanging around and causing trouble.  Keep in mind talking with them is an exhausted option.  I wouldn't approach any of them without a blaster at my hip.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_eaa416f0", "There is a fairly large group of thugs here in town.  One of them is holding onto a crucial data disk, on which the location of a huge stock of stolen supplies is stored.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_edb238bc", "Go on.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_f3df0aae", "Medicine, and foods mostly.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_f485390d", "Good show, all this spice is going to fetch a pretty penny.  See you around.");
stringFiles[356].addEntry("s_fae10b21", "I've been working my whole life, and have very little to show for it.  More and more of the money I make is being used to line the pockets of the rich.  There is little I can do by myself, which is why I am asking you for help.");

stringFiles[357] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_politician_01");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_politician_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_10204c5e", "As folks in these parts know, more than our fair share of predators roam the area outside of the city limits.  What I need you to do my bright eyed adventuring friend is head out into this untamed region and destroy a bloodseeker mite that has been causing no end of trouble.Think you're capable?");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_4eb51131", "That was quick... did you make the countryside a safer place?");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_4fc89968", "Excellent, thank you for your services friend.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_59b59b84", "That's a real shame.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_59b6aab3", "Has the bloodseeker mite been taken care of?");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_60ba5013", "What kind of quick and dirty job are we talking about?");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_6299309e", "Of course.  Give me the location, and consider it done.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_82367ff2", "Keep your problems to yourself. What makes you think I'd care.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_99bdf01", "I decided to make myself a safer place. Go deal with it yourself.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_badba8f2", "Greetings and be welcome. Remember my motto: voting once is nice; voting often is better.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_c61129a3", "That's a real shame. ");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_d30e03d9", "Not yet, but believe me they will.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_dbf5765a", "Ah good. My election into office is almost certainly assured once I take credit for... er... I mean, let the people know about the service you've provided.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_dc3b8fc5", "Yes, it has.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_de8ec7cf", "Fight your own battles. And find someone who cares.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_e01d17e1", "Ahh, just as stup.. err. brave as I suspected.I have uploaded a waypoint to your datapad with the location of a known hunting ground of this creature.Return to me when the bloodseeker mite has been eliminated.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_e16a4410", "Hello there, you are a perfect match for a quick and dirty job I need done to help the citizens of this fair city.Not to mention help boost my image in the next election.");
stringFiles[357].addEntry("s_e6b7fdc0", "Excellent. Such enthusiasm in one's work is always a pleasure to behold.");

stringFiles[358] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_sob_story_01");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_sob_story_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_10163a72", "You will not be missed.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_164cf4c2", "Right, I'm sure you do.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_182378be", "Please, I could care less about that waste of space.  I just want the blaster he took back.  The blaster belonged to my father and he had no right to take it with him, the thing was an antique and didn't even work.  To tell you the truth, I would be more surprised if my brother was still alive.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_1cf278e9", "I will help you find your brother.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_1f8a26f8", "This means quite a lot to me. Thank you.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_202dc610", "More the fool am I. I should have stopped him. Or something. Now he's gone and he took it with him. Yes, quite the fool.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_2438dea0", "I've decided you're a lunatic, lady, and probably don't even have a brother.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_290ad18b", "No, I'm afraid I've had enough of you as well.  Good bye.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_291d0c7a", "Well, if that's the case, what are you talking about?");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_297f30e9", "I'm here, and yes, willing to help you.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_2e220ef9", "You are not the only one.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_360d601b", "That could be arranged.  Forget I asked.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_36a4e374", "Yes, I am.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_390df542", "Um.. yeah.  That is exactly why I'm here.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_3d146002", "Do you have the blaster? Were you able to find it?");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_45240d04", "Why are you back without the blaster?");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_4c1008a4", "Oh good, you are already here.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_4f7b1e26", "That's not what I'm worried about.  He took my father's blaster with him.  I want that thing back.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_5bd31ce", "I see. Then go. And thanks for nothing.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_5bdbb8de", "Where can I find him?");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_6845d2f7", "Yeah, I have some time to spare.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_6f0025f1", "So are you, or are you not, here to help me.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_72071926", "Good, because I could care less about that wasted soul.  I just want the blaster he stole from me back.  You willing to help?");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_83d29997", "Lies don't score you any points.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_8de1965a", "That's a shame, but I'm off.  I have things to do that I actually care about.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_91b4a77f", "Good. Good. I... thank you. This is hitting me harder than I thought it would. Please excuse me.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_94c910a4", "I would rather kiss a Gamorrean.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_9525d947", "So go and get it.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_986473", "My brother went out with a group of his friends last week, and has yet to return.  Neither has any of his friends.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_9a6c3b2a", "Sounds like he's dead.  Sorry to break the news to you.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_a128b86a", "Your charm has won me over, how can I help?");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_ab866ec6", "Now I'm confused.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_ae1fd723", "My brother went out with a group of his friends last week, and has yet to return.  Neither have any of his friends.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_b6e31aa4", "Believe me, I would if I could.  Sadly I have other obligations, like standing here sending smart mouthed adventurers out to their most certain doom.You going to help?  Or just continue to grace me with your, oh so precious presence... and stench.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_b7015989", "My brother and his friends were talking all last week about going camping somewhere in the wild.My brother, or his corpse, should be somewhere in the area where they were camping. The blaster should be with him. Get it and bring it back to me.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_b7139d72", "Where else would I be?");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_be83966b", "Good. My brother and his friends were talking all last week about going camping somewhere in the wild.My brother, or his corpse, should be somewhere in the area where they were camping. The blaster should be with him. Get it and bring it back to me.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_d3249f0b", "I'm here, but why would I want to help you. Jump off.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_d4cfb5b8", "I will find your brother.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_da7087d0", "Yes, I found his remains and the blaster in the area you expected.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_dbff867f", "You are here to help find my brother right?");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_e2b8c011", "Just hurry up and get me that blaster before someone else makes off with it.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_e6ae286a", "I'm working on it. Not quite finished yet.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_ed0b42f4", "I figured as much, well, you are smarter than you look.See you around.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_f8143d38", "Good,. My brother and his friends were talking all last week about going camping somewhere in the wild.My brother, or his corpse, should be somewhere in the area where they were camping. The blaster should be with him. Get it and bring it back to me.");
stringFiles[358].addEntry("s_f89b1ce4", "No, not exactly.");

stringFiles[359] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_spice_mom_01");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_spice_mom_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_16ec7737", "No, not at all Miss, how may I help?");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_1aa2a6e6", "Oh, I'm sorry for causing trouble.  Here is the spice.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_238c7ac2", "Oh very good. Hurry back now, dear.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_2aa97a99", "Oh my poor son. Whatever will I do if I cannot ease his pain and suffering.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_42c15c5", "Not yet, but I'm on my way.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_4f24860b", "Hello dear, I'm a single mother and could use all the help I can get.You wouldn't mind helping out an old mother now would you?");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_586cd026", "Thank you dear, my son will be very grateful.  The calming hallucinations this spice gives him help ease his mind of the lingering pain he still suffers from after he was in a horrible swoop accident as a child. ");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_6a11e41a", "I've run short on some supplies around the house, and could use a healthy person like you to run out and pick them up for me.  I know it's not the most glamorous of tasks, but I have no one else to ask.Would you mind?");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_72b6d639", "Wow, here you go.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_751ed2f1", "May my son's pain be passed to you. Maybe then you'd see that the world is not so clearly good and bad. That spice would have brought peace to my son. To my mind, that good is worth the price.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_78f7bd03", "Thank you dear, these spices will help my son through another week or so.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_829888a9", "Here you go.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_85da54b7", "Are you sure you want these?");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_8a806d30", "No and even thinking about doing so was a mistake.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_93965747", "Oh good!  You are a dear, here is the waypoint to my good friend Evif Sulp, he has what I need.Tell him Sola sent you.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_98244955", "Have you got my supplies.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_9b2292c8", "Yes, I have them.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_a3b22c35", "Oh my. What did I do to provoke such an outburst?!");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_a687a0a6", "I don't regret anything anymore.  Now give that spice here!  My son is in horrible pain, and nothing seems to work better than the calming hallucinations he gets from that spice.As much as I hate giving it to him, he needs it to make his painful existence bearable.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_a8241eb1", "I don't care what you use it for... you're no better than a spice peddler.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_b40d662", "I see, well sorry for bothering dear.  Good day.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_b638139d", "Did you speak with Evif?");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_bf3942ab", "Please believe that I know what I'm doing, and that this is the best that can be done for my son.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_cf8c69f5", "Oh good, hand them over please.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_d1aec57f", "Don't say anything you are going to regret.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_d471cdd", "I would be happy to help.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_d4ade5e3", "Ask one of your kids to do it.  I'm busy.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_dc552ff6", "Thank you dear, my son will be very grateful.  The calming hallucinations this spice gives him help ease his mind of the lingering pain he still suffers from after he was in a horrible swoop accident as a child.");
stringFiles[359].addEntry("s_dcecfc37", "Hand them over dear, or so help me I will make sure the rest of your existence is one of pain and misery.");

stringFiles[360] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_spice_mom_02");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_spice_mom_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_168212d8", "What are you lookin' for?  Somethin' to keep you awake? Help you sleep?  Help you walk, talk, eat, not eat, run faster, swim longer?Anything you want, need, or can dream up, I have and am willing to sell. For a price.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_1f593aa5", "I'm not interested.  But I believe I know someone who is?");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_2c96cac3", "Oh!  You should have said so before friend, and you shouldn't be so quick to judge.  Everyone has their hobbies; Miss Sola is a good friend of mine, and a loyal customer.  Take this to her and tell her Evif sends his well wishes.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_350fcbe3", "She has her reasons. Miss Sola is a friend and a loyal customer.  just take this to her and tell her Evif sends his well wishes.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_6168a073", "Now I'm certain I have the wrong guy.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_6242972e", "Whatever you say friend. I'm not going to argue. I'll say this though... shouldn't be so quick to judge people you barely know.And believe me, Sola can take care of herself. She's willing to do what she feels needs doing.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_625ba59c", "I guess. Thought I can't imagine why she'd be dealing with you..");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_798612aa", "It's not for me, Sola sent me for her weekly supplies.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_a04364ee", "You aren't in law enforcement now are you?");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_a0730d59", "Sola sent you didn't she?");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_b56527e1", "Anything you want, need, or can dream up, I have and am willing to sell. For a price.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_bdb90e46", "No, Sola sent me here for her weekly supplies.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_ca7eddd3", "You leave her alone! She doesn't need a thug like you bothering her.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_d0812b8d", "I'm sorry, I think I have the wrong person.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_e66080c4", "You sure about that?  I've got what every man and woman in the Galaxy needs.  Name your pleasure, my friend.");
stringFiles[360].addEntry("s_f5bb1061", "Oh!  You should have said so before friend.Miss Sola is a good friend of mine... and a loyal customer.  Take this to her and tell her Evif sends his well wishes.");

stringFiles[361] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_surveyor_01");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_surveyor_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_14d76798", "Yes. It's safe there now.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_1a4fb5a7", "Excellent, here is the waypoint my boss gave me.  Once you've gotten rid of the sharnaff bull, come back and let me know so I can go do my thing.Thanks! I really appreciate this.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_268abe", "I can't much blame you; I'd rather not as well.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_29df11d8", "Not a problem. Just let me know when it's safe.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_2f57a101", "But... but. Fine. Maybe I can get work scooping sludge out of ditches.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_4f0a7816", "Good questions.My boss employs me to go out and gather samples for him from around the galaxy.  He recently asked me to go out and gather some from a fairly dangerous area. I mean, there's a sharnaff bull there. Those things are HUGE.Actually, maybe you could help me.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_63bacc6c", "I'm not going. No chance. I'll simply get a new job. A much worse job, I'm sure. But at least I'll be alive.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_6f9237a3", "Yeah, right. Like that's gonna happen.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_723b6d0e", "Have you cleared the area? Is that sharnaff bull gone?");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_80783f21", "Who?  What?  When and where?");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_88563437", "Doesn't much matter to me, either way it looks like it's not getting done.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_95cc5c27", "I can't believe he expects me to gather resources for him THERE.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_a9fb608b", "Oh thank you so much. I'm terribly afraid of large animals. Whew. That's a relief.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_bed3977c", "Not so fast... I'm not actually finished yet. Give me a bit more time.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_cc8d7500", "Back so soon? Wow, I'm impressed.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_df1f4d74", "Sure, I'm willing to help you out.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_e01d4e3a", "I can't believe you think I am INTERESTED.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_f547f53", "Great, I hope it wasn't too difficult.Thanks again.");
stringFiles[361].addEntry("s_f78dd868", "Speaking of fast, watch how quickly I tell you I'm not doing it.");

stringFiles[362] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_the_ring_01");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_the_ring_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_112f3596", "Do you have the ring?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_16c644b4", "She'll have my hide. I'm such a fool. How could I have done such a thing... how??!!");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_1f8ddc7", "I got it the only way possible, by killing the low life that took it from you.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_23b61565", "I've changed my mind. Go get the ring yourself. I've got better things to do.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_252ebf4f", "Little details like that don't matter.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_3924c1a9", "I'm in a tight spot.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_3a25f75a", "Alive?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_3faed3", "Nothing's wrong. I just haven't found the ring yet.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_47749228", "You... you killed him? Wow, I never thought he'd refuse to return it and fight you for it. Well, I thought he might fight you, but not that he'd go so far.I don't know what to say... thank you, friend. Thank you very much.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_4bbb35f5", "Coward! Why did I ever think you'd be able to help me anyway. Just go. Maybe I can buy another ring that looks just like it... with the exact same inscription... and... and... ah no. I'm doomed.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_5056dd2e", "No, he insisted on fighting for it. You're not worth the trouble.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_618117e6", "You... you killed him? Wow, I never thought he'd refuse to return it and fight you for it. Well, I thought he might fight you, but not that he'd og so far.I don't know what to say... thank you, friend. Thank you very much.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_61a3322c", "If I'm not here when my wife returns she is sure to suspect I've done something wrong.She had no idea I was going out racing, and if she finds out otherwise... Well lets just say she cannot find out otherwise.  Do you have time to help?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_63fcf51c", "In that case.. No.  He's not quite ok.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_6d739213", "Seriously... If it's not too much to ask do you think you could go out and try to find it for me?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_6fd316c5", "I did, though it wasn't easy.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_70c10eb", "I would be happy to.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_70e58d4e", "You're back. Did you get the ring?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_7b35cfbc", "What is the problem?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_7cb3d5a9", "Should have been more careful.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_8626b2e6", "Sure, how can I help you?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_91971db6", "That is a tight spot.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_92a6af5a", "Brilliant!  Your incredible skills of deduction amaze me.How much do I owe you for this display of pure ingenious?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_997d67e4", "Why not get it yourself?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_9a1d24f0", "In the literal, or figurative sense?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_a410e80d", "It's free the first time, next time it's going to cost you.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_a9ca1cc2", "No problem friend. Hurry back when you have it.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_b3083e4e", "Rewards are not always monetary, or even tangible friend.  Learning that in life not all of your positive actions result in an immediate personal gain will leave you much more appreciative of the things you already have. ");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_b4bf50d7", "No, if you put it that way.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_b7fd7db8", "Not exactly, depends on your definition of ok.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_c0eab960", "Why are you back? What's wrong?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_c2f7ce8", "It's okay, I'm just a bit wound up.  I could truly use your help, if you are willing of course.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_c6898781", "I'm sorry, it was just a joke.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_d0ed20dc", "Thank you again, friend. I'm sorry it had to come to violence, but I guess you had no other choice.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_d1457e5b", "I sort of borrowed my deceased mother in laws wedding ring from my wife, then I sort of lost it when I was out racing my swoop.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_d403c577", "Is he ok?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_d91ac73", "Thank you very much, I've uploaded your datapad with the last location I remember having the ring on me.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_dc264acf", "Fair enough. At least you're listening. You are listening, right?");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_e20e68ad", "Hmmph. Probably would have stolen the ring for yourself anyway.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_ea66e5db", "Sounds dangerous. If there's nothing in it for me, forget it.");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_f61a9588", "Literal!");
stringFiles[362].addEntry("s_f7b65eb2", "Why is it covered in blood?");

stringFiles[363] = new StringFile("conversation/padawan_the_ring_02");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (padawan_the_ring_02) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_157b6369", "Believe me friend, I have far more than luck on my side.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_36ab201c", "If you insist on a fight, I won't back down.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_443c85ef", "Forty million credits and a penthouse apartment in Coruscant.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_4f77458a", "Ha... right. That's funny.You mean this ring? The one I took from Keicho? The one he balked on when it came time to place a bet. I won his landspeeder last week, and his wifes wedding gown the week before that.I love that gown. But he wouldn't bet the ring. Couldn't understand why, so I just took it.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_6a1562ad", "What do you want?");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_711691ff", "I'm looking for a wedding ring, have you seen one?");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_759ab6bb", "Unless what?");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_77a2c8a3", "We will see about that.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_80764fc6", "Yeah, and I don't plan on giving it up.  So unless you are willing test your luck and pry it off my cold dead hands I recommend you go back to Keicho and tell him to find some other chump to do his dirty work.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_83f28a20", "Maybe, what is in it for me?");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_8514b7c5", "I am not willing to solve this with blood shed.  Good bye.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_860ae378", "Actually, I've given Keicho enough options.  Either you fight me for this here ring, or you go back to him empty handed.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_cd72f93", "Good choice.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_cdc241bf", "Well then it doesn't look like you are going to be returning to your good friend with this here ring.  Unless...");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_ce804243", "What? Looking for a fight? Not today, chump, but definitely some other time.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_cec4328", "Forty million credits and a penthouse apartment in Coruscant?");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_d38d76e0", "This does not have to get violent.");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_e4815789", "You took it?");
stringFiles[363].addEntry("s_f42e101f", "I've got races to win and chumps to scam.  Answer the question or get out of my face.What do you want?");

stringFiles[364] = new StringFile("conversation/poi_tatooine_general_1");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (poi_tatooine_general_1) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_11ee3ff6", "Oh. I'm sorry. I was rambling. But you're here and that's all that matters. I'm in need of assistance. I need someone brave, intelligent... and someone who is able to think 'outside the box', if you will. Are you that individual?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_14b13184", "I failed my mission.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_18a00d6a", "Good. Again, I need you to find the Black Suns in the Ghost Tide Nebula, disable them and inspect them for information. Bring any information you find to me. Time is of the essence!");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_1c914ce3", "I'd rather not take this on quite yet.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_1d52b30", "Ah, my friend. You've cleared all the work I have for you now. However, I didn't forget to process your reward.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_21c417c8", "That's sad. Maybe some other time.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_239edf9a", "No... I cannot readily assume it was merely Black Suns attacking our freighters. There has to be something more devious out there! Just let me think... Of course!! I have a second task for you, my friend, if you're up to it.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_255d3625", "Why are you back already?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_28c5432f", "I see you have returned and so quickly! Here is your reward for the tasks you have completed.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_2a29152c", "I wish it were different. Thank you for all of your hard work.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_30a4f2c3", "[nods and salutes]");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_3313e38", "This sounds like a wild goose chase. Ghosts?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_3c3a1569", "You've done well with the tasks I've given you so far. I still have more work if you're interested. Check back with me in a few seconds. I have to clear another freighter for travel.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_406612f9", "I don't know.. the Black Nemesis is more difficult than I expected.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_603f6374", "Thank you. [salute]");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_61657d0f", "I see.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_6324b0d2", "Yeah, sure. Why not?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_668c0704", "It's as good as done!");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_676ef8a2", "I need details.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_6e5b35c0", "Bah!");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_6fc5551a", "Thank you. No more work, huh?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_724ce284", "You say you saw Black Suns in the Ghost Tide Nebula, correct? I don't think the Black Suns are all that stupid. Perhaps if there's information on them... You need to go out and disable a few and get me the information they might have. I'm not certain any information or clues exist, but I'm willing to take the chance. Are you interested?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_76cb0e7f", "Nah. Ghosts are scary.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_7d7ae55", "You haven't heard of the freighter disappearances? Where have you been, man?! Let me explain. Firstly, I am Kelen Wordkal, Mos Eisley Police Captain. One of my duties is to clear freighters to their destination. It is their duty to check in with me so I know they've reached it safely. The freighters cleared to go through the Ghost Tide Nebula have never returned...");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_8167d29a", "Glad to hear it. Over and out.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_81b811c0", "Why thank you.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_890511af", "I see you have no desire to help us. Go away. This is a serious matter!!");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_8a564db7", "Indeed. He's still out there though. What are you waiting for! Go try again!");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_8d73b3f1", "I really don't want to help right now.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_9208410d", "...");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_95d8887f", "How unfortunate.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_969c4dc2", "I don't know. What does it entail?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_9eaf76c6", "I am eager to hear what you have to say, my friend. What did you discover?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_a020b1a9", "I like to hear such eagerness! Go then, and be quick about it. I've uploaded the information you'll need to complete your mission. I wish you luck.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_a118c43e", "[You relay the events to Kelen]");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_a18139bb", "I'm going to think about doing this later..");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_a23289f6", "There has been a disturbance in the galaxy...");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_a99397a", "Yeah, I guess so.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_ae1a82fc", "I'm so not going to get into this.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_b4b3fdb5", "[You tell Kelen about the Black Nemesis]");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_bf8bb897", "Of course. Your next task entails going up against this Black Nemesis. You'll need help, however. I'm going to employ the help of my two best fighter pilots to aid you in this. It won't be easy. Will you accept this task and help us against the Black Nemesis?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_c0dec268", "Possibly. I just need someone to investigate. Will you?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_c14d0f0c", "You seem rather busy. You should probably come back a little bit later. I may have some tasks that may suit you.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_c34478b1", "I've heard nothing but bad news about your performance. What went wrong?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_c5afcca4", "Soon, I will have more work for you. Visit me when you have the time.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_c738862c", "[sigh] I see. It is not too late. Go out there and try again.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_c8053613", "Black Nemesis or no, I don't want to help.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_c9f21b00", "I really need to know what's going on.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_cd91abc2", "I think you're too far away. I can't get your signal.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_dc79df4f", "What happened out there? All I could hear was static.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_de1d7ae9", "I'll have to investigate this myself!");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_dfba44fb", "Over and out!");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_dfe42352", "The Black Nemesis has been defeated. Our freighters will be able to travel safely now because of you. I am very grateful for your help. Unfortunately, our work together must end. I have no more that needs to be done.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_e635adbf", "Good. I need you to patrol the Ghost Tide nebula in search of odd activities. I have no idea what we're looking for here. I have no idea what we're looking for here. However, I do suspect that whatever or whomever is causing the freighters to disappear will show up soon enough. I've transmitted the data you'll need to complete your mission. Please... be safe.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_e7af48c", "Indeed. Thank you again for the help you've so selflessly lent us.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_e7cb1e01", "Thank you again. I will.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_e7f5f946", "Over and out.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_e8b2ad1e", "You've returned so quickly! What have you discovered?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_ea18852", "The Black Nemesis?! Yes, I have briefly heard of such a 'ghost' a long time ago. Yes, indeed. Even in the information you retrieved off the Black Suns it was mentioned about a mysterious fighter in the Ghost Tide. It is time to act against this so-called Black Nemesis! Will you continue to be an asset to us and help?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_ec4258cd", "Sure, I guess.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_f0445c1d", "What are you talking about...?");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_fcf8c341", "I kinda failed my mission.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_fdba7430", "You can count on me.");
stringFiles[364].addEntry("s_fe1b33c5", "I see. Well, it's not too late to try again. Please go out there and complete your mission. It's important.");

stringFiles[365] = new StringFile("conversation/poi_tatooine_general_2");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (poi_tatooine_general_2) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_102ed493", "I am slightly disappointed about your failure. I realize, however, it was quite difficult out there. The Zynt'aia Order can be vicious.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_14b13184", "I failed my mission.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_1a834cf5", "Welcome back. You've done so much for us already. I've heard of the daring rescue you braved out there. If you're willing, I have one more task I'd like to have done. The work I will give you is by far the most important.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_1c914ce3", "I'd rather not take this on quite yet.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_255d3625", "Why are you back already?");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_2613d24b", "I was just looking for some work.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_2961542d", "I'm glad to hear of it. The more we try, the more the Zynt'aia Order reacts. This time, we'll have to take matters into our own hands. We just can't seem to get the samples we need from the rocks we've found in that asteroid field. I need you to recover a freighter belonging to the Zynt'aia Order and bring it back. Don't give me that look. We have to fight dirty now. Will you help us?");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_2d25ead", "I see. It was fairly difficult. The Zynt'aia Order has moved into the area and replenished its numbers. You can go out there again. Go.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_2d737038", "Stop moping around and go back out there. You still have a task to do.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_31881ef", "Nah. I changed my mind.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_3988ce81", "What do they want?");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_3bb73ee3", "I am astonished at how well you handled yourself out there, pilot. You are gifted, indeed. Unfortunately, I have no more work for you to do. Our freighters can now access the mining field without a hitch and the Zynt'aia Order seems to have packed their bags and gone away. You've done so much for us.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_3f54925e", "How very disappointing.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_3f9fe110", "I see. Another one of 'those' types.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_40f49d32", "I guess I can tell you the details. You see, the asteroid field we've discovered recently is peppered with rocks which we've yet to get near or attain. The Zynt'aia Order has been hounding us ever since they've settled in the Tatoo System, watching our every move. I expected them to try and take over our mining field, just not this soon.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_44e3e0d3", "No more work? That's a shame.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_53ed657a", "I guess we could use you. I don't trust you, however. Maybe some small tasks at first before giving you more important ones. Yeah, that'll work. If you're really committed to helping us out, you'll escort freighters to and from a new mining field we've discovered. What do you say?");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_544993c3", "[nod] Pilot. You've done your tasks well. I have decided to grant you another reward for your services. Our mining operation is appreciative of your efforts.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_5517628d", "I know. I shouldn't have failed.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_5680cda2", "I'm interested in helping you.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_56b87409", "Fine. I knew I couldn't count on someone like you.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_61657d0f", "I see.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_62d05d14", "All right. You'll meet the first freighter here and escort it and its crew to the mining field. It should be simple enough. Come back when you've completed your duty.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_630c1e1a", "I can't seem to get your signal. You must be too far away.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_6613e8a2", "Why, thank you.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_692ea4e6", "Good. The targeted freighter should arrive soon. I'll upload all the data you'll need to successfully accomplish your mission.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_6fc5551a", "Thank you. No more work, huh?");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_70fb2f96", "That's good. I have faith in you and your abilities as a pilot. Go.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_75040efd", "We need you to--oh. You're not a miner, are you? What are you doing all the way out here?");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_87d3a522", "What can I help with? There must be something.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_8d73b3f1", "I really don't want to help right now.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_8f164fcb", "Good. I'm glad to hear of it. I wish you well in your mission. Hurry back.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_9f495275", "I see you have failed your mission. Your tasks were simple enough.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_a18139bb", "I'm going to think about doing this later..");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_a401c759", "What do you mean? You seem kind of bitter.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_a99397a", "Yeah, I guess so.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_b034d9ae", "Sure, I'll help you.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_b755a869", "I have more work for you. It would be best if you contacted me in a few moments.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_bb5aa311", "[nod] Pilot. I heard about the great work you're doing out there for us. I hope this will be the first of many rewards for the help you've given us.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_c27d920f", "Yes, I am, in fact.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_c2c9b283", "I am disappointed.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_c4a3c855", "You're already busy with another task. I guess that's why you're all the way out here by yourself.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_c5afcca4", "Soon, I will have more work for you. Visit me when you have the time.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_c6f02543", "Sadly no. Perhaps it will change in the future.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_d215c307", "I'm not afraid to try again.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_d55f7726", "It is a shame I have no more work for you. However, I do have the last of your rewards. I hope it is enough. I hope to work with you again in the future.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_d70603e1", "I'm so glad you've returned. I heard that you were attacked by pirates. No doubt, it's the Zynt'aia Order. Ugh! We've had such a problem with them lately.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_e9aeb150", "Thank you again.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_ec4258cd", "Sure, I guess.");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_f0016326", "In fact, there is. You've proven your worth so far. I can trust you with a little more than just a simple escort. Here's the deal. We can't tolerate any more harassment from the Zynt'aia Order. We must strike back at them. I'll transmit the data you'll need to find them and hunt them down. We need to clear the area so the freighters can move safely by. Will you do this?");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_f6936e2a", "Exactly right. You have no idea how many individuals we've been cheated by these days, most of whom come from the Hutt side of the Tatoo System. Are you really looking for work?");
stringFiles[365].addEntry("s_fa21b24b", "I'll definitely contact you if I need more assistance. You're the first on my list.");

stringFiles[366] = new StringFile("conversation/poi_tatooine_privateer");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (poi_tatooine_privateer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_1639204e", "That is most unfortunate to hear.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_1bce15e6", "Sounds pretty simple.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_1c914ce3", "I'd rather not take this on quite yet.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_27eedc3f", "Okay. Thank you again.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_2aa3e51d", "I will. Thank you.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_2d8a838b", "Yes, I will try my hardest not to fail this time.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_36d6852", "And why have you returned so soon?");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_3856c45c", "[Garett just laughs.]");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_3a510008", "I wish I could help you.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_3bf29799", "For now, I need a courier. There are sensitive documents I need from an informant over at Jabba's Star. Unfortunately, they haven't come yet. I need for you to travel there and find out what the fuss is and why it's taking so long. Are you interested in this sort of task?");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_4004b748", "Ah. One of 'us'. I implore you to assist us on a most sensitive task, my friend. But first, let me introduce myself. I am Garett Erlskel, employed by the Hutts to take care of... business in the Tatoo System. However, recent events have made my job more difficult. At this time, I need the assistance of a young, but intelligent, sort. Are you such, young pilot?");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_42e25376", "You seemed to have failed in our time of dire need. What do you have to say for yourself?");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_4470da", "In fact, I am.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_458d24ab", "You've done well, my friend, and have exacted the tasks of which I have given you with haste and precision. Unfortunately, I have no other work for you.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_485816ee", "I have nothing to say to you, friend. I am waiting for one aligned with the Hutt faction. You are not one of them.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_49904b3", "I do not converse with those not belonging to the Hutt faction. I bid you good day.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_4b48508f", "How rude!");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_4dc8c70", "[nod] Am I needed for anything else?");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_4e0a91b7", "Unfortunately so. Continue to share your skills and intelligence with others. The galaxy needs it, I assure you.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_50cdd468", "I'm growing quite fond of you, pilot. Here is a little coin for your purse. Check with me again and I'm sure I'll have more work for you.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_5c3ad40f", "I'm sorry.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_5f5d3519", "It was necessary. We must let the locals know that the Hutts still have the control in the Tatoo System. Unfortunately, you were just a pawn in our plans. You shouldn't trust individuals aligned with the Hutts, my friend. Lesson learned.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_61657d0f", "I see.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_618da618", "I'm going to think about doing this later...");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_6613e8a2", "Why, thank you.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_67e6df55", "Okay.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_68496504", "It is good to see you. I've processed the information you gathered from the Valarians. The particular 'spy' has been dealt with. Trust me, he won't be spying on the Hutts again.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_6b51a7a7", "Good. The information is the same. Now go. Do your duty and do it well. I expect success from you.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_6d43911a", "I agree. How do we find out?");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_6fc5551a", "Thank you. No more work, huh?");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_706c0c0c", "So eager. It is a quality I like. I will transmit the information needed to find the Valarian thugs we're looking for. I suspect what we're looking for will be on one of the fighters in this area.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_736584d8", "I apologize. You seem rather busy, my friend. If it is a task I have given you, I expect you to do it... and soon.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_752f38d3", "Excellent. Here, take these codes to the informant at Jabba's Star, our origin of affairs in the Tatoo System. You'll need to deliver the codes to the informant and receive the documents in return. After which, you'll return to me in due time. I wish you luck. Now, off you go.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_753c600d", "Be well.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_7552334", "I'll need these orders delivered to the informants at Jabba's Star. You must do your task with haste. Simple as can be, no?");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_76924085", "I see you have returned... and empty handed. It is imperative that I receive the documents from the informant at Jabba's Star. I expect you to try again.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_8842ba84", "That is unfortunate to hear. I understand that the Valarians are a tough kreetle to crack. However, I expected you to do well. Do not prove me wrong again. Go out there and complete your mission.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_8d1e636e", "You've completed all the work I have for you at this time. Your effort and loyalty are highly respected among us. Here is a reward for your effort.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_8d73b3f1", "I really don't want to help right now.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_8e9d0848", "[nod]");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_8ff8682d", "A pity.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_931fb8d6", "I wish you well.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_936786d3", "It is quite simple. I need you to patrol the Dragon's Spine for the Lady's thugs. Perhaps one of them will have the information we need.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_95d8887f", "How unfortunate.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_99dc1f68", "Good. Go then, and be quick about it.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_a388d49", "Run along.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_aef4404d", "I'm not really interested in being a lackey.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_b71871d5", "You've returned. As you can tell, I'm perplexed by the sudden attacks launched by the Valarians. It seems we have a spy in our midst, informing the Lady's thugs about our activities. It is time to find out what they know. ");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_c45f4bb1", "I wish you luck, my young pilot. Again, I expect only success.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_c5a66e82", "No, not really.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_c5afcca4", "Soon, I will have more work for you. Visit me when you have the time.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_cccb49af", "Sounds good. I'm ready to take on this task.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_d3874dd0", "Oh. Okay.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_dfce1c9a", "Yes, but I really need to know what's going on.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_e20422e9", "You've completed your mission, and in due time. You deserve a reward for your effort.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_e48b5a8", "Sorry? You made us appear weak in the eyes of the galaxy, you... you! [Long Pause] I apologize. I implore you to try again. And may you do so with success.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_e4bd704d", "Why did you have me help launch a battle against the space station?");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_e7cb1e01", "Thank you again. I will.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_f4142e79", "In fact, you are. You continue to impress me and I feel you are ready for the most sensitive and important task I've received to date. We're ready to launch our attack. I need another courier. Are you interested?");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_f59dd698", "Have you been doing tasks that would otherwise upset the Hutt faction? I've heard about you... ah, yes. I will not speak with you until you have increased your standing with the Hutts. Good day.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_f8ccf9dd", "Yeah, let me hear the details.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_fc740f6a", "I'm sorry, my friend. You're breaking up. You must be too far away.");
stringFiles[366].addEntry("s_fcf8c341", "I kinda failed my mission.");

stringFiles[367] = new StringFile("conversation/privateer_broker");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (privateer_broker) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_13dd951a", "Hey, I've heard people talkin' about you! Rumor is you've turned into a pretty decent pilot! What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_159911f5", "Tell me more.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_169df3bb", "Never mind.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_1d546116", "Hm? Well, ok. See ya.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_1d78d511", "Here, I'll add this location to your datapad... go see the RSF Pilot trainer in the Theed Palace. He can tell you all about the RSF. He'll probably bore you to death with long flowery speeches about their 'noble history' and all that nonsense.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_1fd99cce", "I want to fly for the Empire.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_2059cc73", "It's a blasted shame - that's what it is. Waste of a fine pilot. Take care in life, friend.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_22c8a818", "So where is the Imperial Academy?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_2c417dde", "Tatooine?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_2d7a0d3", "Indeed? Well, shame about that. We've had some trouble you see...");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_3269c6d", "Not really.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_3cb06a88", "Ok, ok. Here, I'll add these coordinates to your datapad.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_43f7f8f5", "Are you going to direct me to the Academy?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_44d6c7b2", "I don't care!");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_4cc40305", "Lots of places! Look, CorSec off on Corellia is a prime example. They're always looking for new recruits. And there's the RSF on Naboo, as well. Not to mention work you could get right here in the Outer Rim. Or even the Rebel Alliance, if you don't mind getting executed. What sort of piloting are you interested in?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_510d393e", "It's your funeral, pilot.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_5626358b", "Well it's Imperial Decree 875a subparagraph 13! The Pilots Guild used to oversee almost all aspects of space travel from training new pilots to establishing preferred travel routes, but the Emperor won't even allow us to distribute 'The Basics of Space Flight' without express written consent.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_562906b3", "What trouble?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_56acd306", "I was just nearby.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_61657d0f", "I see.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_6ea276b4", "Rebel Alliance?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_71bc4ac7", "Yes. I want to retire.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_74c33af", "That's not the half of it! Imperial Decree 875a subparagraph 19 mandates that we still engage in recruitment activities - you know, job fairs and mass recruitments and that sort of thing - but then any potential recruits are directed straight to the Imperial Academy.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_757d93fb", "Yes I do.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_759870d1", "Uh... I think I changed my mind. Can't I choose to do something else?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_77becf16", "I don't want to fly for the Empire.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_79be144a", "You don't look like a pilot to me. But I guess you can still hang-out here if you like. Try to be quiet, though.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_7f3a602f", "Where else can I learn to be a pilot?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_80d6e310", "Well... I don't actually know, but I bet it isn't very good.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_83c3a855", "RSF?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_8bed64bc", "Oh... well how about CorSec or work here on Tatooine? Are you interested in that sort of thing?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_8c645195", "That's right. Corellian Security. Since Corellia is officially neutral in this whole Empire versus the Alliance business, they've got to provide for their own defense. Some of the best pilots in the galaxy come from Corellia, you know?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_8cb932b7", "Nothing. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_8e1dc39f", "Oh... well how about CorSec or the RSF? Are you interested in that?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_9ba377a3", "Take care, friend.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_9fdd7cf3", "Yes?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_a59f385f", "Let's see if you change your tune when you see that dinky little fighter with NO SHIELDS they give you! Ha!");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_a5fd1ad3", "Say, that's pretty dangerous. Going up against the Empire's huge fleet with nothing but whatever ragtag bunch you can get to oppose them? Still, I suppose the Empire DID destroy Alderaan...");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_a6f3f40b", "I've come to retire my status as a pilot.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_b31be86", "Just tellin' it like it is, my friend. They're going to put you in a tiny little ball with a tiny little gun built by the lowest bidder.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_bad24bb9", "On a case-by-case basis? Impossible! Do you have any idea how many pilots there are in the galaxy? Thousands! Hundreds of thousands! Millions!");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_bd56d5dd", "Of course you have a choice. We all have choices. There are still... other places you could go to get some basic flight training.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_bdf43a8a", "Well, you're the boss. I'll get the documents ready to transfer. If you want to change your mind, now's the time...");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_bedc35ff", "Here, I'll add this location to your datapad... this is the Mos Eisley cantina. They don't get a lot of attention from the law out here in the Tatooine system, so there's always someone there looking for pilots willing to brave the wild frontier, so to speak.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_c2320129", "I don't really want to fly for the Empire.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_c3f7c619", "Hello. Nice to see you!");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_cc9259e0", "Do I have a choice?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_ce87b83e", "What is 'The Basics of Space Flight'?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_cf4d3521", "We'll see about that.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_d0969d78", "You want to what? Retire? You know if you retire, you'll lose all your pilot skills and they'll throw out your mission record, right? If you ever want to join up again, you'll start out as a new recruit. Are you sure that's what you want?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_d1caa227", "You mean you actually WANT to fly for the Empire? There's a war on, you know. It's very dangerous.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_d3a7e09", "Oh, handy book, that. Explained all an aspiring pilot needs to know about piloting privately-owned starships. Travel routes, where to go to get private contracts, how to get certified by the necessary authorities to engage in commerce... you know, all that sort of stuff.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_d6791368", "Oh... well how about the RSF or work here on Tatooine? Are you interested in that sort of thing?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_da0b2f54", "No, what is it?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_e19a5c9a", "That's the location of the Imperial Pilot recruiter. You go talk to him and he'll get you all fixed up. You'll be dead in no time.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_e3ec2640", "I'm not interested.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_e4c89252", "Thanks. Bye!");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_e6101168", "What is this?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_e6455de", "I don't blame you for not wanting to fly for the Empire. It's dangerous what with the Rebel Alliance and all. Do you have any idea what the kill ratio of X-wings to TIE Fighters is?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_eaf87760", "Eh, I changed my mind. I'll stay.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_ee816dc0", "Hey!");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_f15359b4", "So long!");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_f3e5d7a0", "Oh. Well... then why did you come to see me? The Empire dumps more recruitment on the Holonet daily than we do in a year.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_f43b859", "I would rather be independent.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_f51c795", "On second thought... never mind.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_f58ab655", "Here, I'll add this location to your datapad... Go to CorSec headquarters on Coronet. It's just down the street from the starport. Go inside and talk to the CorSec Pilot trainer. He can tell you all about CorSec and get you signed-up!");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_f6dbaaf2", "I've come to join the Pilots Guild.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_f72f24be", "I want to retire.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_f800df2d", "Yes. Well... not really my thing, you understand, but there has always been a certain... ah... 'fringe element' on the outer worlds. Smugglers, ruffians, pirates, thugs... that sort of thing.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_f90d3de4", "Why don't you get permission to distribute it then?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_f97198ff", "I see. Well... in that case... say you don't really want to fly for the Empire, do you?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_fcd4dd70", "That's what I like to hear. Take care, friend.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_fd3512f0", "CorSec?");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_fd94591f", "Yes. Royal Security Force. Talk about a cushy job! Think of it as Naboo's version of CorSec... only, of course, Naboo's also got the Empire defending it. It is the Emperor's home world, you know!");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_fdea49b9", "Ok, but you didn't hear this from me... Meet this fellow in the park in front of the Tyrena Starport. He can tell you where to go from there.");
stringFiles[367].addEntry("s_fea04ae8", "What other places?");

stringFiles[368] = new StringFile("conversation/privateer_broker_fired_worker");
stringFiles[368].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (privateer_broker_fired_worker) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[368].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[368].addEntry("s_16c66b4b", "Nothing. Nothing.... ");
stringFiles[368].addEntry("s_858bbc73", "What's wrong?");
stringFiles[368].addEntry("s_bc3bc2b", "What was that? I'm sorry - I'm finding it hard to concentrate.");
stringFiles[368].addEntry("s_be9a37d3", "I'm Ty'Vila and I used to work for Gil Burtin and the Free Pilots Guild. Now... I'm nothing!");
stringFiles[368].addEntry("s_ca776e30", "Who are you?");

stringFiles[369] = new StringFile("conversation/privateer_broker_retired_pilot");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (privateer_broker_retired_pilot) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_10b13d41", "That's terrible.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_1bc3ac43", "It's our civic duty.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_1fbaff94", "And that's not all! The equipment is suffering just as much. Most transports are supposed to receive regular maintenance four times each cycle... but I know of a few here in Bestine that haven't seen maintenance for over nine months!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_2174cfc4", "I know, but what can you do?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_23bbba18", "Where is Gil?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_252fcfaf", "I fly for the Alliance.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_26256229", "Right... except for the fact that the Empire is also taking a substantial chunk of credits out of your pay to support their blasted war effort!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_2ccec1c2", "Thanks for the warning.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_2d1ee89c", "No kidding! But, what can one person do about it? I'll tell you: nothing.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_2d495751", "Safety violations? By whom?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_2e674765", "Good luck, then.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_3069ecae", "What's the bad news?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_31097eef", "That's not fair!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_39510e77", "You too.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_3e25fcee", "I never saw you...");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_426a2f78", "Wow. You sound rich, my friend. Stay that way.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_49c76620", "Tell me where I can find Gil.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_4e888f16", "I'm not afraid!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_53d912d", "The good news... the good news... let me see. Now that I think about it, I lied. This is a 'bad news' situation. You a pilot?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_54818bbc", "I don't know what you mean.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_5ad17cbf", "Oh. Good. Wonderful! There's no heartbreaking shame in that, now is there? No filthy guilt eating your brain away, right?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_5e303134", "What's the good news?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_61129613", "There is no Free Pilots Guild any more. Bad enough for you?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_6579c571", "I don't know. Ask Gil.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_6bccf4e9", "I fly for the Empire.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_6e54c48b", "What are you doing here then?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_75f774fd", "Are you looking for the Free Pilots Guild? I have what you might describe as a 'good news, bad news' situation.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_77b660fd", "You don't know?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_7c525a54", "I agree... but what can anyone do?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_7d00c660", "He's in the lounge, playing bartender for this little party. Between us, I think he's been drowning his sorrows a bit between pilot interviews. Don't let that stop you, though. He was the founder of the Free Pilots Guild, after all. I can only imagine how this has affected him.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_7f9b8387", "Why not?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_811a5ea0", "Sounds like good money.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_82e40fb4", "How is this a nightmare?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_877a4502", "I don't think you appreciate the sort of safety violations that are running rampant through the transportation service!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_89553663", "Oh dear. How can so many people be so wrong...?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_8a596ff6", "Why so horrible?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_8d4beebb", "Then I think you should talk to Gil. He can direct you to CorSec or the Royal Security Forces. You won't have to fly a TIE fighter, I can assure you!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_8f67e0e7", "Can I get a drink?");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_9f74e2fc", "Then you'll probably want to see Gil. He's in the lounge, playing bartender.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_ab39b18c", "In the old days, a transport pilot was never allowed to run more than two shifts back-to-back. Now, the Empire's oversight plan has pilots running as many as they can handle. A Zabrak buddy of mine logged more than a dozen shifts in a row just last week!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_b0cc84d1", "The Empire has installed military jurisdiction over the galactic transit services. It's a special oversight group that sets flight schedules, repair budgets, and so forth. It's a nightmare!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_b3aefb70", "Shut down by order of the Empire! I guess they don't want anybody fooling around in space unless they fly a TIE fighter for the Imperial Navy!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_b5f15b19", "Not yet.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_b5ff56cf", "Then I don't know what you're doing here. Gil only refers pilots to CorSec and RSF. There's no work to be found here on Tatooine anymore, my friend. None whatsoever...");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_b93cdbd8", "That's awful.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_c4682ea6", "Thanks!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_c6667cfa", "Well, I'm... Hmm. Let me think...");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_c88254be", "I'm here to see Gil Burtin.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_c8d0555c", "I don't want to fly a TIE fighter.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_cc070e7b", "I am a free pilot, myself.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_d31921cd", "You realize you are in Bestine, right? Do you know where to find the starport so you can get out of here... right away?!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_e288626b", "There's really nothing left for me now. I haven't had any time to figure out my next move. I'm thinking that I'm going to need to pick up a job with the shuttle services... and that's going to be horrible!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_ea090abe", "I'm not the bartender. Go ask Gil.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_ecfd8a1", "Relax. I'm not saying you were.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_ef85b67c", "That makes sense.");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_f4760c16", "That sounds harsh!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_fa94d5c5", "Good-bye!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_fbdd44a6", "I see. Well, good luck!");
stringFiles[369].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");

stringFiles[370] = new StringFile("conversation/pvp_station_imperial");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (pvp_station_imperial) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_1e8d6243", "In that case, please move away from the station. Clear the area for official traffic.");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_25329880", "Although you are an Imperial Pilot by profession, you have not Declared your factional affiliation. Many Rebel ships [players] will hold-fire in the event you are not really affiliated with the Empire. You may declare your affiliation with the Empire to make it clear that you are willing to respond to their attacks.");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_2e491159", "Sign up with the Empire and we'll talk.");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_358253b2", "There's nothing we can do for you while you're in that civilian ship.");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_370822d1", "Yes");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_3a7768e6", "All Rebel Pilots will be able to attack me?");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_41ebf230", "You will be Declared Imperial until you land your ship. The next time you launch, if you want to be a Declared Imperial again, you must speak to an Imperial Station again.");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_457a7010", "No");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_48f82131", "You need to move closer to this station.");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_626fe576", "How long does this last?");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_7b492de4", "Very well, %TU. Your ship will begin broadcasting your Imperial affiliation in 30 seconds. You may want to clear the area in the event there are hostiles nearby. Imperial Station, out.");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_afe52489", "Welcome to the Imperial Space Station, %TU. Would you like to declare your affiliation with the Empire?");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_dd67013", "What does that mean?");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_e8cb2563", "We could put your ship to good use, %TU, but you seem to be busy doing something else. Finish your mission and we'll talk.");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_ef2a0e9c", "Not all of them, %TU. Just the ones that have Declared their affiliation with the Rebel Alliance. You'll be able to attack them, and they will be able to attack you. Ready to declare?");
stringFiles[370].addEntry("s_f48e8567", "You are not welcome at this station Rebel, SCUM!");

stringFiles[371] = new StringFile("conversation/pvp_station_rebel");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (pvp_station_rebel) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_17456755", "Sign up with the Rebel Alliance and we'll talk.");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_1ef0f7f", "Finish it, or better yet abort your mission. We need your help!");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_223d8c5f", "We could use your help fighting the Empire, %TU, but you seem to be busy doing something else.");
