stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_358253b2", "There's nothing we can do for you while you're in that civilian ship.");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_370822d1", "Yes");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_392e22", "You will be a Declared Rebel until you land your ship. The next time you launch, if you want to be a Declared Rebel again, you must speak to a Rebel Alliance Station again.");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_457a7010", "No");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_48f82131", "You need to move closer to this station.");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_514ace33", "You are not welcome at this station!");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_626fe576", "How long does this last?");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_62e7ee", "Very well, %TU. Your ship will begin broadcasting your Rebel Alliance affiliation in 30 seconds. You may want to clear the area in the event there are hostiles nearby. Rebel Alliance Station, out.");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_b780e818", "In that case, please move away from the station.");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_d2cd41a5", "Although you are a Rebel Alliance Pilot by profession, you have not Declared your factional affiliation. Many Imperial ships [players] will hold fire in the event you are not really affiliated with the Rebel Alliance. You may declare your affiliation with the Alliance to make it clear that you are willing to respond to their attacks.");
stringFiles[371].addEntry("s_dc5b544f", "All Imperial Pilots will be able to attack me?");
