stringFiles[395] = new StringFile("conversation/rebel_broker");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (rebel_broker) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_159911f5", "Tell me more.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_169df3bb", "Never mind.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_18dad60e", "What about Naboo or Tatooine then?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_1adbb986", "I see. Well, that does sound very exciting. But what makes you think I can help you with that?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_1c0a2eb0", "I cannot imagine why not. If someone has been spreading rumors about me, you should report them... not me. I'm not doing anything wrong at all. Nothing whatsoever.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_28a5ab46", "I most certainly am not! And I resent the implication! It's an absurd accusation! Ridiculous! Now if you'll excuse me, this conversation is over. Good day!");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_2a805b93", "Nothing I can do for you, friend. But if you know anyone that might make a good pilot, you ought to send them to see me. Good day.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_31bc521f", "Then let me add this location to your datapad. We have an operative stationed in a 'safe house' here in Tyrena... in the slums not far from here.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_3714bdfe", "Now that's quite a dangerous assignment! We have managed to install an Alliance Trainer droid in the city of Moenia. The Empire is quite strong in the Naboo system, but Moenia belongs to Borvo the Hutt... and he's indifferent to the Rebellion - so long as we stay out of his way.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_3bde39e1", "In that case, yes, I can direct you to a unit in need of volunteers. Do you have a preference for duty anywhere in particular?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_3fd213c", "Nothing, really.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_43cd3e42", "Here, I'll add the location of our Tatooine contact to your datapad. Whatever you do, don't allow that to fall into Imperial hands! This will take you to the Mos Espa cantina. Speak with Commander Da'la Socuna.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_4c695dbd", "No.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_50f22f35", "Ok, just checking.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_568d0bc", "That's a relief. We'd really hate to lose a good pilot like yourself.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_5af29bb7", "No, of course not. That would be illegal.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_63cd6ccb", "Naboo.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_6491bb19", "Tatooine.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_658b5a75", "Yes, I want to retire.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_697a1143", "I've changed my mind. I'll stay.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_6ed0d2aa", "Very well. We hate to lose a good pilot like yourself, but in the end, it's your decision.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_70f18874", "I'm not interested in that.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_7671cbe2", "I see. Best of luck to you in the future, then!");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_80d99409", "Tatooine is a backwater world far removed from most of the action. It seems the criminals and pirates give us as much trouble there as the Empire. Still, it's an important assignment as the remote location allows us to gather resources and supplies without constant harassment from the Empire.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_84d6bcaa", "I don't blame you. The Empire has been absolutely ruthless in its war against the Alliance. What about Corellia or Tatooine?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_895d093", "Ok.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_8a4e6549", "My name is J'pai Brek. How can I help you?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_98a75031", "Corellia's official stance is to remain neutral in the war against the Empire, but that has made it a useful place for us to marshal our forces.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_9fdd7cf3", "Yes?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_aad360f4", "Hello, friend. Good day to you!");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_b42be0ca", "Wow, that's quite a bombshell. Are you sure? If you retire, you will lose all of your pilot skills and your mission logs will be erased. If you join up with the Alliance again, you will start out as a new recruit.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_b8e72ced", "Hello, friend. It's always good to see that another skilled pilot has joined the ranks of the Alliance. What can I do for you?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_bbc28ec8", "Want to be a little closer to the action, huh? I'd recommend Corellia or Naboo, in that case.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_c0ca92b1", "Here, I'll add the location of our FX-model droid to your datapad. Whatever you do, don't allow that to fall into Imperial hands! Go there and speak with the droid.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_c0dd7feb", "I received a transmission from the Rebel Alliance");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_c2a4c0b1", "Are you recruiting pilots for the Rebel Alliance?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_c3bfda20", "Alright. I'll start getting the paperwork ready. If you want to change your mind, now's the time...");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_c4b91b55", "Is there something I can help you with?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_c4d665ba", "I don't believe you.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_ca776e30", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_d15ec255", "Corellia.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_d6b3d709", "It was nice meeting you.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_d70dba34", "Yes.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_dbb2bd71", "You are lying!");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_e81a1436", "I want to be a pilot.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_ee2fdf32", "I said 'Good day'!");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_ef21d878", "And what would that be?");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_f72f24be", "I want to retire.");
stringFiles[395].addEntry("s_fc2710b9", "I would like to retire as a Rebel Pilot.");

stringFiles[396] = new StringFile("conversation/rebel_master_trainer");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (rebel_master_trainer) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_133c89f7", "From what I understand, you are anything but a simple smuggler. The way I hear it you are one of the finest pilots this side of Coruscant. I am desperately in need of a fearless and skilled pilot. And I think that you are just such a pilot.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_16531693", "The Alliance has begun moving ships into the system in order to defend it. Unfortunately, it seems that the Empire has also determined the value of the Kessel system and has begun moving their own support craft in. We need to get those Imperial vessels out of the system.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_1668a97b", "The Kessel system is strategically located between three separate systems, all of which have important shipping lanes passing through it. With control of the Kessel system it is possible to defend the surrounding systems very easily. Alliance Command has determined that we take the area for ourselves. Unfortunately, it would appear that the Empire has its own plans for Kessel.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_174c76a5", "You have pilots. Why not use one of them?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_17652085", "You are a courageous pilot. You might be all that stands between the Empire and freedom in the Outer Rim. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_1c113900", "I was about to suggest the same thing. I still cannot think of anyone better suited for this important mission than you. %NU, you must destroy that corvette. Unless the Empire's power in the Kessel system is diminished, they will begin exerting their influence on the entire Outer Rim.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_1c9d33ed", "It is a good thing that you achieved victory over the Imperial support vessels. We desperately needed that good news. Unfortunately for us we have received some very disturbing reports from Ryloth. I fear that our plans on a large scale assault on the Kessel system have been scrapped.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_1da9fe53", "[relay the destruction of the stolen Corellian Corvette]");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_1fd64638", "Where are the Imperials held up?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_1ffdcc4b", "Are we clear?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_21d9c824", "You shouldn't be back here. You have a job to do in the Kessel system. Your mission is of utmost importance and the entire Alliance is counting on your success. To your ship, Pilot!");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_22d87576", "What do you mean, sir?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_24a07bd4", "I don't work cheap.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_26bd9f23", "I am willing to hear you out.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_28d79ee3", "Your accomplishments have proven that you are a valued asset to the Alliance and a truly exceptional pilot. I believe that you have achieved the highest level of piloting skill that anyone can possess. I think that you might find some measure of fame waiting for you when everyone finds out what you have done.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_2acaca5d", "I am just a simple smuggler. What could I possibly do for the Alliance?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_2cbd4ffa", "You can count on me, sir.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_32062da9", "I am your pilot, sir. I volunteer.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_35c0388d", "I do not see the profit in getting in the middle of a fight between you and the Empire. I have to decline.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_36256b98", "I have been speaking with several of your former commanding officers about an important mission that I need a talented pilot to undertake. Your name came up over and over again. I must say you really left quite an impression on your commanders.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_37157452", "I hope it was a good impression.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_377d1a96", "Thank you, sir. It has been an honor to be allowed to serve under you.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_3924b90e", "Good. Now get to your ship before I change my mind.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_39516a4", "Very well. Get back to the Kessel system and destroy the Imperial support vessels that are patrolling the region. Good luck, pilot.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_3ccc33fb", "There is no need for modesty. Be proud of your accomplishments. Unfortunately this business with the Imperial corvette has allowed them to reestablish a presence in the system. Although it is not as large as it once was, it is still formidable. Alliance Command has decided to play it safe and not issue the full scale assault on the Kessel system.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_3d93239d", "What is this mission?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_3e83f2ea", "Thank you, Pilot. May the force be with you.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_3f6a8711", "Thank you, sir. I do my best.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_3f7dd52e", "I will assume you are familiar with the Kessel system?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_41910783", "Greetings, %NU. I am sure you are plenty confused as to why an Alliance Admiral asked to speak with you. To put it bluntly, we are in need of your help.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_429ad94c", "Yes. Your operation did accomplish its goals. But word has come in that the Empire has managed to capture one of our corvettes in the Ryloth system. Intelligence has reported it has been seen patrolling through Kessel.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_44bd3318", "What is it you need me to do?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_46b27b0c", "Hello, %NU. I have been looking forward to meeting you. You are probably wondering why I asked to see you.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_46ecd1ec", "I can do it, sir. I know I can.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_47e9fbfd", "I understand. So what is the plan?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_4bdfa49b", "I am glad that you agreed. You will need to assemble a team of pilots who you feel are up to the challenge. The Imperial pilots in the Kessel system are some of the best in their entire fleet and they are all flying state of the art craft, so this will be no walk in the park.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_4c9055c9", "[relate the details of the failed mission]");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_4c9d51f4", "No thank you, sir. I do not wish to take this mission.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_4ebc69dd", "I completely understand. If you change your mind come back and talk to me again. Good luck to you, %NU.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_52917b0d", "Of course.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_575c9eb2", "With the Empire distracted elsewhere, we feel that this is a perfect time to strike. The attack will focus on attacking the weakened Imperial positions in the Kessel system. Then we can use it as a staging point for control of a number of systems around it.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_583fa6fb", "As am I. I still believe that we can take the area but Alliance Command believes that the Empire will be able to mount a Star Destroyer attack. We cannot risk a direct confrontation with one of those. Regardless, you have more than done your duty. I have been authorized on behalf of the Alliance to issue you a reward for your noble actions. You willl always have friends in the Alliance.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_58559f7e", "I am not sure. This mission is highly important and it is imperative that it succeed. The Empire cannot be allowed to gain absolute control of the Kessel system, or the Alliance will be hard pressed to maintain its forces in and around the Outer Rim.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_5869e64b", "Thank you, sir. I appreciate it.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_5919485e", "That is what I hoped you would say. The Alliance has decided that it is time to try to make a strike at the Outer Rim. We believe that the Empire is stretched too thin to adequately defend all of its positions in these system. Our first goal is to take Kessel.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_5bd6bf77", "Understood, sir. I will not let you down.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_5bdc459b", "Good! Now get to your ship and take out those Imperial positions in Kessel.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_5fa0c79", "That's the spirit, %NU. Keep up the good work and one day maybe you will do great things for the Alliance.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_63214db1", "Correct. You will need to assemble a team of pilots who you feel are up to the challenge. The Imperial pilots in the Kessel system are some of the best in their entire fleet and they are all flying state of the art ships, so this will be no walk in the park.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_647683fc", "You have use of me and my vessel for as long as you need them.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_65a12a87", "We have a number of skilled pilots, but no one that I feel is up to this assignment. I asked around and your name came up again and again. I believe that you are the only pilot around that can pull off this mission. I am not going to force anyone to attempt this but I am asking you to volunteer.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_677c6a2", "At ease, Pilot. I asked you here because after speaking with several of your commanding officers, I believe that you might be perfect for a very important mission. They told me that you were one of the finest pilots they have ever seen.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_684ff0a", "There is no need for false modesty, but it is appreciated. I am in need of someone with your skills to perform a highly dangerous mission in the Kessel system. I cannot force you to take the mission, but I ask that you hear me out before deciding.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_69741346", "I understand, %NU. If you change your mind come back and talk to me. Until then I wish you continued success in your own duties.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_6be5ab4e", "The Kessel system is located deep in the Outer Rim. It has important strategic value to the Alliance, since three other systems have important shipping lanes running through Kessel. With control of that system, the Alliance can defend a huge portion of the Outer Rim worlds.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_6c42736d", "Even though you are not officially a member of the Alliance, you have proven yourself a hero for what is right. I believe that you have achieved the highest level of piloting skill that anyone can hope to accomplish. The Alliance is in your debt.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_6d976791", "A very good plan. And you need me for the assault team.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_6daab4e1", "Thank you, pilot. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_6f27454c", "So you have a sense of humor as well. That is good. You will need to keep your moral up for we are looking at some bleak times and I fear that many lives may be lost. But we have to strive on if we ever hope to drive the Empire from power. I think you are just the type of pilot I need.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_6ff4c6e1", "It is at that. And it is only possible because of your victory. The Alliance thanks you and I have been authorized to issue a credit reward to your account. I also have granted you a token of our appreciation for what you have accomplished. I still have some more planning to work on, but after you take some well deserved rest come and see me again. I am sure I will have a place for you in the attack plan.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_74cca111", "It would seem that this corvette is patrolling several systems, so it is not always in Kessel... but it is always close enough to be a threat. I fear that we only have one choice. You are going to have to destroy that corvette.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_7660776e", "From my understanding you were one of the finest pilots they have ever dealt with. They said you were a natural, which is just the sort of pilot I need.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_76d5f218", "Don't worry much about that. I have a knack for finding what I need to.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_77a163bd", "I see. That would explain why reports show that more Imperial vessels are moving into the system. We must find a way to reduce the number of Imperial support craft in the system for our primary objective to have any chance at success.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_77cd7306", "In a nutshell... yes. We are too evenly matched to launch an assault on their positions without being weakened to the point where we could not hold it. The only solution that I could come up with was a series of raids on the Imperial positions.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_7826431d", "I see that you failed to destroy the corvette. This is not good news. The balance of power inside of the Kessel system has shifted heavily in favor of the Empire. Unless we can destroy that vessel we could lose the entire region.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_78ce5241", "Okay, what is it you want me to do?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_7a052bd2", "I understand we have a corvette in the system, couldn't we use that?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_7bf46fb2", "I need a pilot who is willing to brave the Imperial forces stationed in the Kessel system. It will be extremely dangerous and it is highly likely that anyone who accepts this mission will not make it back alive. I will not force a pilot to accept this mission so I am asking for volunteers.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_7cbd5de5", "Sounds like a big undertaking.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_7cd01fd0", "I am afraid that I am rather busy right now. Under normal circumstances I am always willing to speak to possible allies in our struggle against the tyranny of the Empire, but right now there just doesn't seem to be any time. Perhaps we can talk again after you have earned some more flight experience in real situations.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_7e8aa338", "It is at that. And it is only possible because of your victory. The Alliance thanks you and I have been authorized to issue a credit reward to your account. I still have some more planning to work on, but after you take some well deserved rest come and see me again. I am sure I will have a place for you in the attack plan.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_7f725bea", "%NU, what is the status of your operation in the Kessel system?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_81f189ef", "Reporting as ordered, Sir.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_826f20e2", "Yes, it certainly would. But we simply do not have the resources to initiate a boarding party right now. I am afraid that our only choice is to make sure that if we don't have it, neither do they.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_834a890e", "Why not initialize a full scale assault?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_837c0670", "The Empire has captured and retrofitted one of our corvettes that was in the Ryloth system. Intelligence reports that it has been seen in the Kessel system. This is truly grim news. We believed that we had their star destroyer fleet tied up in several other areas so we could accomplish our tasks here, but it would seem that the Empire has learned how to improvise.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_84b47be3", "You certainly have confidence. That is a good thing, because I am in need of someone who is confident in their abilities for a very dangerous mission in the Kessel system. I cannot force you to take the mission, but I ask that you at least hear me out before making your decision.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_85b8ffbd", "The Kessel system?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_86a40b9e", "The Alliance has been moving ships into the system, but we have come up against heavy resistance from Imperial forces. The Empire has also been moving support vessels into the system. My only guess is that they also realize the potential value of Kessel.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_875c631e", "This is where things get a little more tricky. Because of the Maw, long range scanners are next to useless in Kessel. Recon reports that the Imperial vessels patrol all throughout the system, so I am afraid that you will have to perform a seek and destroy style attack on them. I estimate that you will have to destroy at least thirty of these patrol ships in order for us to have an overwhelming advantage.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_87d4bfc2", "Crystal.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_8964c03a", "So you are asking me to hunt Imperials?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_89f9ea03", "I am sorry, Sir. I didn't mean to.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_8c56411b", "To show you that I am a forgiving man, I accept your apology. And I will also give you another chance to destroy the stolen Rebel corvette that is regularly patrolling the Kessel system. For your sake, do not fail me again. Are we understood?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_8d7967cc", "I am disappointed to hear that.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_8f3f7918", "So, what does this have to do with me?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_92ad6ffe", "Where do I fit into this?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_938d38", "Our lack of resources in this system makes any attempt at recapturing the vessel futile. The Empire can use that ship to tie up the Kessel system long enough to bring in their star destroyers... and at that point I cannot foresee any chance of us getting Kessel back. The key to the whole Alliance operation in the Outer Rim lies with the destruction of that corvette.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_98d92abb", "%NU, you have performed brilliantly in the face of overwhelming odds. It has been my privilege to have been your commanding officer. The victory that you lead in Kessel has assured the continued freedom of the Outer Rim. Currently I do not have any new missions that I need you to perform. I trust in your ability to uphold the values of the Alliance without assistance from me.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_9a0798b3", "Yes, I was wondering that.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_9e5b1d54", "Yes we do have our own corvette in the system that we use as a command vessel, but after the loss of the one in the Ryloth system, we cannot risk losing another one. It would appear that we will have to send out fighters to try to combat this menace.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_a21308bb", "That is exactly the plan. We cannot afford to have a large scale assault but we can use a small mobile force to strike quickly at their patrols. If we can hammer hard enough on their positions and destroy enough of their patrol craft, we can put them on their heels. Once we have them down, we will strike with everything we have.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_a2b72d37", "You are a brave soul, %NU. May the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_a667be99", "Yes, sir. I will do that.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_a6fb8def", "Destroy the corvette, sir?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_a79ccb10", "Are you saying that I was wrong in my assessment of the Imperial strength in the Kessel system?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_a7be18a9", "The Alliance will compensate you for your time and effort if you choose to assist us in this mission.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_aa01a084", "I don't know if I would go that far.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_ad709e77", "What can I do for you, Sir?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_b6b25f13", "Yes, sir!");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_be631237", "I assure you that the honor is all mine. Leading men such as yourself is a privilege. You are dismissed, %NU.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_becf889", "You are not fighting for me. You are fighting for yourself and those you care about. Remember that. We have lost so much already, we cannot lose here.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_bfaef3d8", "%NU, you have performed brilliantly in the face of overwhelming odds. It has been my privilege to have been your commanding officer. The victory that you lead in Kessel has assured the continued freedom of the Outer Rim. Currently I do not have any new missions that I need you to run. I trust in your ability to uphold the values of the Alliance without assistance from me.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c10e0254", "I have no love for the Empire. You have your pilot.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c13f9a11", "I am sorry, sir. Give me another chance. I will succeed.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c1c7c6c", "Wouldn't it be better to try to recapture the vessel?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c2eca562", "I am afraid that I am too busy right now to talk to you. If you are interested in helping our cause I would suggest that you find some of our recruiters. They are located here and there but I am afraid I really don't keep track of them. Maybe try talking to J'pai Brek in Tyrena.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c4d08624", "Yes, it is patrolling several systems right now, but with your victory we should be able to set up a command post in the Kessel system. Alliance Command believes that the time might be right for us to make our move on the Outer Rim.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c5b25047", "In a nutshell... yes. We are too evenly matched to launch an assault on their positions without being weakened to the point where we could not hold the system. The only solution that I could come up with was a series of raids on the Imperial positions.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c67e8169", "I am only one of many heroes for the Alliance.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c68b1dd3", "What happened, sir?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c788dadf", "No, sir. Of course not, sir.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c78b33ad", "Welcome back, %NU. It is good to see that you managed to perform such a difficult task and return. Intelligence reports that the number of Imperial ships in the system are down. Our Corellian Corvette should be able to drive the rest of their support craft out of the system.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_c97cb0b8", "Why not organize a raid on the Imperial support vessels?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_ca1a4aa4", "The Empire has a corvette in the Kessel system?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_cab1f8c7", "Listen to me closely because you are walking on some very thin ice right now, Pilot. You are to return to the Kessel system and destroy the Imperial positions. My plan will not fail because of the incompetence of a lowly pilot such as yourself. Are we clear?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_cba67818", "I understand, sir. Will I have any support for this assault.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_cd70bed3", "The Alliance has begun moving ships into the system. Unfortunately, it seems that the Empire has also determined the value of Kessel and has begun moving their own support craft in. We need to get those Imperial vessels out of the system.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_ce45643c", "Do not worry, sir. I will not fail you again.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_d02bfc3b", "We brought in a Corellian Corvette?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_d09ace00", "A glorious victory for the Alliance! You really came through when it counted, %NU. You have made a difference to millions of lives along the Outer Rim and you have proven yourself a hero of the Alliance.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_d1111dc8", "I will hunt them down. They are no match for me.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_d41a131", "Thank you, pilot. May the force be with you.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_d4d47c04", "Give me another chance, sir.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_d646c11", "I am sorry but I cannot take this risk.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_d6d7f7f9", "You and I have nothing to say to one another. I suggest you clear out of this area and get back to your tyrant leaders. We will one day meet on the field of battle, I can promise you that.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_d7e71a00", "The CorSec are important allies in our struggle against tyranny. I thank you for arriving as quickly as you did. I have a situation here that I think you can assist me with.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_d8da45e7", "I have an important and very dangerous mission that I need a highly skilled pilot to achieve. Unfortunately I do not think any of my pilots are up the task, so I've turned to our allies for support. Your name came up over and over again. It is my understanding you are one of the finest pilots anyone has ever seen.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_da1503ff", "I am going to have to leave the assembly of a team up to you. Once you have your team assembled, enter the Kessel system and look for the Imperial corvette as it moves through the area. Keep in mind that it sometimes leaves the system for several hours, so you might have to hunt for a while in order to initiate attack.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_da2cf079", "Then you would know of its strategic value for the Outer Rim. With the three other systems' shipping lanes running through it, the Alliance could defend a large portion of Outer Rim worlds by controlling that system.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_dc2fa6d8", "The members of CorSec have always answered the call of the Alliance.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_dc822762", "You shouldn't be here! I have nothing to say to the likes of you. You have made your choice, now you must live with the consequences.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_e0c18ed4", "Right now our force is roughly of equal strength to their own. I believe that we can win any such assault, but I fear it would weaken us to the point where we could not hold the system. The Empire would be able to wipe us out easily once their reinforcements arrived.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_e228ef89", "Sir, may I suggest that you give me another chance?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_e3714e1d", "We were unable to follow your progress via long range scans due to the interference of the Maw. What do you have to report?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_e374b3bf", "I will remember that, sir.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_e7f9b26f", "'Fraid I have never been there.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_e87785ac", "As am I. I still believe that we can take the area but Alliance Command believes that the Empire will be able to mount a Star Destroyer attack. We cannot risk a direct confrontation with one of those. Regardless, you have more than done your duty. I have been authorized on behalf of the Alliance to issue you a reward for your noble actions.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_e8d6a9e7", "I am afraid that I do not understand. How can I assist you?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_eb02d65", "I am a good pilot, sir.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_ecd272f1", "The Kessel system is located deep in the Outer Rim. It has important strategic value to the Alliance, since there are three other systems with important shipping lanes running through it. With control of that system, the Alliance can defend a huge portion of the Outer Rim worlds.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_ed30fff8", "It wasn't my fault, sir. The mission failed due to bad planning.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_ee795f66", "I am not one of the finest. I am the finest.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_ef3cc459", "Perhaps, but there is no need to be humble when it comes to your accomplishment. Victories like this can raise the morale of the troops across the entire galaxy. Thank you, %NU. You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_efc8c4f5", "We have a number of skilled pilots, but no one that I feel is up to this assignment. I asked around and your name came up again and again. I believe that you are the only pilot around that can pull off this mission. I am not going to force anyone to attempt this, but I am asking you to volunteer.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_efd059ff", "%NU, it is always nice to stop and chat with the men, but I am afraid that I do not have time to talk right now. I am planning a very important operation and I can only use the finest pilots available to the Alliance. I suggest you gain some more flight experience and then come back to see me.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_f00f629f", "We are mobilizing on the Outer Rim?");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_f2bb94ef", "I normally do not drive off a potential ally, but I cannot trust just ANY member of the Royal Security Forces. Your group is just too tightly involved with the Empire, and I cannot risk allowing you to join our cause.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_f799f9ec", "Perfectly clear, sir!");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_fd815e48", "You have your orders, Pilot. It is imperative that you complete the mission that you have! Once you have completed the task on hand, talk to me again and we will see what needs to be done.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_fe42648c", "You certainly have an interesting way of showing your skills then, Pilot. Normally when someone is good at something they accomplish any tasks involved. ");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_ff2c163e", "We cannot afford a large scale assault, but we can use a small mobile force to strike quickly at their patrols. If we can hammer hard enough on their positions and destroy enough of their patrol craft, we can put them on their heels. Once we have them down, we will strike with everything we have.");
stringFiles[396].addEntry("s_ffeb2f4c", "Was my operation successful in pushing the Empire back?");

stringFiles[397] = new StringFile("conversation/rebel_master_trooper");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (rebel_master_trooper) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("s_28c5a74a", "You don't look like much of a pilot to me.");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("s_33788e9b", "I'm here to speak to the boss here!");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("s_4cf446c4", "Then if you must...");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("s_55616900", "Imperial pilots don't belong here!");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("s_75207c3", "I have no time for you, friend. We have a war to fight!");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("s_7e51c66", "Hold, pilot. What business do you have here?");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("s_86ed2e98", "None.");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("s_9049d3d5", "You have no business here, smuggler. I suggest you take off!");
stringFiles[397].addEntry("s_a366a1ca", "Then get out of here!");

stringFiles[398] = new StringFile("conversation/sample");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (sample) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_2280847e", "Let's have it!");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_27dd59b6", "Why, yes.  Watch this!");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_33ee1807", "Voila!");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_3f9aded7", "Do you mean it?");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_4a1f212c", "DEBUG: Reset conversation");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_551ee684", "Done.");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_58132054", "I'd like to see you go away!");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_5967ef4d", "Well, I can only show you the first trick I have ever shown you.");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_59da9c5a", "I'm a sadist.");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_5c203407", "I just wanted to say that I'm really sorry.");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_629c5d0b", "Why you...");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_8516f9af", "Do you know any magic?");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_914765d8", "No, you're a dork.");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_9f39d936", "You still don't.");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_a23c5071", "Hi there.  I don't believe I know you!");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_ae4f086a", "No need to be mean -- I was here first.");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_b6a01563", "What do you have to show me?");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_b75b171f", "Ok.  Come back later and I'll show you something cool.");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_bc51d16b", "No!  Sucker!  Ha-ha-ha!");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_d3feb8e7", "Welcome back!  What would you like to see?");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_d574fa56", "Fine, go away.");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_e5afcb3a", "Why are you bothering me?");
stringFiles[398].addEntry("s_ef420789", "Yes!");

stringFiles[399] = new StringFile("conversation/sample_links");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (sample_links) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_2664b871", "So, you've seen trick 3.  Which trick do you want to see now?");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_3c59e302", "So, you've seen trick 1.  Which trick do you want to see now?");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_79345378", "R1 - Trick 1");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_7a43e024", "R2 - Trick 2");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_7cac869c", "R4 - Trick 4");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_81c11cc5", "R5 - Trick 5");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_82355e4", "So, you've seen trick 5.  Which trick do you want to see now?");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_82b6af99", "R6 - Trick 6");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_872e7a7d", "R3 - Trick 3");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_875d7686", "So, you've seen trick 4.  Which trick do you want to see now?");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_9d602df5", "So, you've seen trick 6.  Which trick do you want to see now?");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_9ede25b7", "Do you have any more tricks?");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_a91a9b13", "So, you've seen trick 2.  Which trick do you want to see now?");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_c261cfae", "No problem.");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_cde8ebfe", "I think so.  What do you want to see?");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_d3ff6fc9", "I want to see the first 3.");
stringFiles[399].addEntry("s_f8d0c9d2", "B1 - Hi there.  I've got some magic tricks to show you.  Which one do you want to see?");

stringFiles[400] = new StringFile("conversation/seans_historian");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (seans_historian) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_1f6355d4", "The Red-Sin Valon carried the first of the new settlers to Tatooine. The captain of the ship and her crew members helped found Bestine. Despite the early difficulties--a severe economic depression, lack of water and so forth--Bestine survived and became the thriving city we see today. There's so much more depth to it...");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_27540308", "Well done! What an interesting piece of history. You'd think it would have been destroyed in these dreadful sand storms. Guess not! Take it to Sean. He'll be excited.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_2fceb7e3", "And be careful!");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_3d3d4bab", "We recently found this wreckage. It is rumored to be the Red-Sin Valon. How exciting! Sean Trenwell funds us out of his own pocket. We hope to find interesting things here. You should talk to Sean when he's in office.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_4d42d7da", "Anyway, you should check the wreckage to see what you find. If you do find anything, you can bring it to me. I'm required to screen whatever is found. We don't need to excite Sean Trenwell over nothing, you know what I mean? Go ahead and look around.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_5ec0adb6", "I've decided not to. Good bye.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_647601e7", "Sure. Tell me the history.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_65275fb4", "Ah! You must be the new assistant. Welcome to the crash site of the Red-Sin Valon. Before you start poking around, maybe you'll want to hear a little history about the site first. It will give you a little sensitivity about an already-delicate situation.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_67e6df55", "Okay.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_79636e28", "We recently found this wreckage. It is rumored to be the Red-Sin Valon. How exciting! Sean Trenwell funds us out of his own pocket. We hope to find interesting things here. You should talk to Sean to see if he needs any help.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_8d32acbf", "Did you find anything?");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_9c1a8dd7", "No, let me keep looking.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_b30bd73c", "Yes, I did.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_e547fd1e", "Yeah?");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_ed53cd9c", "Okay. Be sure to show it to me if you do.");
stringFiles[400].addEntry("s_fcdb7174", "That's a shame. I'll inform Sean about it, then.");

stringFiles[401] = new StringFile("conversation/sean_contact");
stringFiles[401].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (sean_contact) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[401].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[401].addEntry("s_1e325cde", "So he's got himself into more trouble I see. I just heard the news. Let me have that disk. He'll be grateful to you.");
stringFiles[401].addEntry("s_3e134731", "It's finished. Go tell him the good news. He and his career are safe.");
stringFiles[401].addEntry("s_829888a9", "Here you go.");
stringFiles[401].addEntry("s_c17cd032", "I'm waiting for someone else. I've heard, however, that Sean Trenwell is in need of assistance at the capitol.");
stringFiles[401].addEntry("s_f1baf7f", "Elections, Sand People raids, museums! So many new things are happening in Bestine. Listen to the townsfolk. They may have interesting things to say.");

stringFiles[402] = new StringFile("conversation/sean_questn_university");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (sean_questn_university) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_36904010", "I was told to talk to you about Sean Trenwell.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_3c4a2f4", "I'm too busy to talk right now. I'm grading papers. You seem like you'd be interested in voting at the capitol. They're holding an election.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_5788afea", "I'm in the middle of grading papers. Did you need help with something?");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_5ec23736", "Oh? I could really use your help...");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_656e8f97", "I see that you've returned. Do you have enough room now?");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_70145cf1", "You again. I'm still quite busy, and I see you still have those papers I gave you from Mr. Trenwell's school days. How's this... you leave me to my work, and I won't ask for those back?");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_7291fe2e", "Not yet. I still need to make room.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_799ad811", "Mmhmm--Oh really? I actually have something that might help you. I think you could use it as evidence. Yes! Here it is. I always keep the grades of my students. Here you are.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_7c259594", "Sean Trenwell... oh yes! I remember him. Unfortunately, he was a particularly bad student. I would always catch him trying to cheat during exams. He barely graduated from the University. In fact, he could even be considered a fake. I really don't want him representing our people in this election.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_7e78bf8f", "Yes, can I have the evidence, please?");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_99711fbf", "Again, you still don't have enough room. Come back when you do.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_9c880546", "I hope you've gone to school. We could really use more... educated folks nowadays.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_b8a92f09", "I see. I guess there's no hurry... just come back you have more space.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_dac635d2", "I see that you don't have enough room to get the evidence you seek. Please come back when you have room.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_dcf7aa7a", "Of course. Here you are.");
stringFiles[402].addEntry("s_e656ba0c", "Good day.");

stringFiles[403] = new StringFile("conversation/sean_questp_house");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (sean_questp_house) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_198905a5", "Here you are--Oh no! You don't have enough room. I'm sorry. Please come back when you do.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_20b8d563", "I'm glad you're back. Do you have enough room now?");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_2267c63c", "I'm so busy. Sean is planning to run for the new election that will happen soon. He's going to have tons of people over for dinner in hopes of impressing them. I really must get back to work. I'm sorry.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_34f710c5", "What victims?");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_41f6594d", "Oh hello! I'm surprised to see you again so soon. Please be sure to sure to show the governor the testimony I wrote for you. I want her to know what a kind and generous person Sean is.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_43e36f6f", "Sure, I can try. What do you need? Write a testimony? Of course, I will! Anything to help him with this election. I really hope he wins. He deserves it. Let me write it up..");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_47e61b76", "Here you are. Please let me know if you'd like to come over for dinner sometime. I'm a great cook! Have a great day!");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_48b343d3", "Actually, no I don't.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_51c40792", "I'm in the wrong house. Sorry!");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_67e6df55", "Okay.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_8a9c6889", "Oh, you didn't hear? The Empire went on a rampage and destroyed one of the newer, smaller cities assumed to harbor Rebel operatives. Those poor people. Sean Trenwell opened his homes for the survivors. He's such a kind man.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_9e4a0794", "Here you are, then. I hope you have a wonderful day.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_ab4c4ff8", "Really? Can you help me with something?");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_bd542a54", "You still don't have enough room. Come back when you do. I'd be happy to give it to you then.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_d066eb10", "Hello! Are you here to discuss the election? You haven't heard about it? You should really go to the capitol. The governor is taking votes.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_d5702a3b", "Come back any time. You're always welcome in the Trenwell house.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_d6d23166", "Well, return when you do. I'll be happy to give it to you then.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_e69937da", "Yes. Thank you.");
stringFiles[403].addEntry("s_f6effab8", "Oh my! I didn't expect visitors today! This place is a complete mess! Please forgive me. The last of the tragedy victims left. They all found new homes. I'm just cleaning up. Why are you here?");

stringFiles[404] = new StringFile("conversation/sean_questp_market");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (sean_questp_market) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_14d1042b", "Here you are. Good luck on the voting!");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_1b885620", "You didn't have enough room again. Come back when you do.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_40977666", "Welcome! Oh, I remember you. Do you have enough room now to receive the evidence?");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_60613aaf", "Bye!");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_67e6df55", "Okay.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_6cd9792d", "Haven't had a chance yet.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_7ffa475", "Are you here to collect these influx capacitors? *pauses listening to the Jawa next to her* Oh... sorry, you're not the right person. While I've got your ear, I should let you knoww there's an election going on at the capitol. I encourage you to support Sean Trenwell if you get involved.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_9e71b2ab", "In fact, he does. You're lucky you came today. He was going to take the disk apart and recycle it to make one of his new, crazy inventions. Why do you need it?");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_a1a4c8c9", "Oh yeah? We'd love to help! Of course, we'll give it to you--Wait a second. Unfortunately, you don't have enough room. Come back when you do.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_a4149441", "Let me tell you the situation...");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_b4164d7b", "Oh yeah? We'd love to help! Of course, we'll give it to you for the sake of helping Sean Trenwell win the election. Here you are. Good luck!");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_c1035c83", "Ah, well return when you've done so.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_c82e9a2f", "Yes, please.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_c8e9e99a", "Hi again. Good to see you... and oh, since you still have that disk I gave you, my friend thinks he can use something like that in an invention of his. But I guess you still need it, don't you. Nevermind.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_cb056ffb", "Do you have record of that?");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_ce0e0612", "Nice doing... well, we didn't exactly do business, did we. Thanks for coming by, I suppose.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_de2e386f", "That's nice. I have to go.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_e61c91fe", "Actually, my Jawa friend may have something like that. Wait here a second while I discuss it with him.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_f319b246", "Our little market is tucked away in the city, but provides wonderful rewards for brave acts. I think some of the merchants here are looking for rare bones. Not sure where you'd get them from. But someone mentioned Sand People. Does that mean anything to you?");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_faf0f6d6", "We've recently established ourselves in this new marketplace . Isn't it great? Sean Trenwell used his own money to help build it.");
stringFiles[404].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");

stringFiles[405] = new StringFile("conversation/sean_trenwell");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (sean_trenwell) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_1059c36e", "Okay, I'll do that.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_17a8ddce", "You were here before, weren't you? About joining my campaign?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_181e49f6", "Ahh, welcome. I remember sending you out to find dirt on that no-good Victor. Well, did you find any?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_1e35bbba", "I am an adventurer!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_1e5ba263", "No, I don't think so.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_1ee4d2a", "You mentioned something about the Tuskens...");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_238ef4f6", "I've searched the crash site.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_2810bcdc", "How could you give that disk to someone working for Jabba the Hutt??!! My career is in serious jeopardy because of you! I knew I couldn't trust you. Get out of here!!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_2ac8d04c", "No, I can't.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_2bc6a2f8", "Excellent! Now, run along... remember to speak with my secretary.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_2d1057e6", "Will you try again? I know there's something out there! Look more closely. I'll be waiting anxiously.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_2e05a27f", "I'm grateful to you and would like to reward you, but you have no room in your inventory. Please, speak to me again when you've made some room.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_2e38174d", "Well returned! Did you find anything?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_30eb7833", "After which, if you discover his twisted ideas aren't for you... and I won't be surprised when you do... you'll need to bring back some sort of negative tidbit about him in order for you to be let back into my campaign. Do you get it? I'll just give you a disk to further explain the details.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_338ea1e3", "Yes, I did. Here you are.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_35bc21ba", "What did you want me to do at the crash site?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_3a06f79e", "I am humbled by your request. Currently, Bestine's markets are inadequate. I have already completed the construction of one market place. If I win this election, I'll put my efforts into attracting new merchants to these areas to help Bestine's economy.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_3ab76f84", "I hear you're up for re-election. How's the campaign going?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_3ba540c", "No thanks, I'd rather not. I'm done with this.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_47a2ec4d", "It's nice to see you again! How did the voting go?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_483c9216", "I'm sorry to hear that. However, if you do decide that you'd rather join my campaign, please come by again. We could always use your vote.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_49368633", "What was I supposed to do with this disk from the crash site?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_4c2afce6", "So, you voted for my rival, did you? I see. I guess that's the point of having an open election. I'm disappointed, but that's really all I can say.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_4ff8cd88", "I suppose.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_51c418fd", "I knew you would! You seem like the sensible type. If you have questions, you can refer to the disk I just gave you. You'll need to find evidence. I can't think of anyone right now off the top of my head. I'm sure my secretary would know. Be sure to ask her on your way out.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_52a14d49", "All this talk about the Tuskens, I can't-Oh! I didn't notice that you had entered my office. Welcome! It definitely is a horrible day outside, unbearably hot indeed. How may I help you?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_540ac7e9", "Continue.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_5ae436c2", "Please! Take the disk out of here! Take it to my contact. Here, I'll give you the location again. Get rid of it quickly.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_5c46daeb", "I've changed my mind.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_5caf6cfd", "I have a contact with whom you can meet. He has ways of destroying information. Please seek him out. And whatever you do, do not give it to anyone else! This is my career we're talking about here. You'll know where to find him.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_5ef87080", "I've thought about it and no longer want to join your campaign.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_61503fc8", "Oh. That's unfortunate. If you know of an adventurer, please send him or her my way. It would really help me. Thank you.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_641d98d5", "Yes, of course!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_64c62370", "I hear you spoke to the governor and voted for me. I appreciate that! When the election is over, if I win I'd like to thank you for your support. Come back and speak to me if that happens.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_64f4dd40", "I'm glad you're back, but you still don't have room. You need to have space in your inventory. Please come speak to me when you do.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_6718926b", "Well, I lost the election, but there's always next time. I still have many good ideas for Bestine. You should come back when the next election starts. In fact, the townsfolk usually talk about things like this when they happen. Be sure to talk to them.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_67295aa1", "It's not so easy. You can't just join my campaign with the drop of a hat. To prove yourself, you'll need to dig up some dirt on that no-good Victor. Speak with my secretary for all the details. What do you think?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_68788cf5", "I'm sorry to see that another one of Bestine's citizens prefers Defense over Commerce. I'm sure he tricked you into joining his campaign.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_6a0bba8c", "Do you have any special plans for while you're in office?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_6ba0df1d", "I want to hear about your proposed changes.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_70b3691e", "Hmm... you did? Really? Hmm... well, thanks. I think.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_75491d63", "As you wish. I'm disappointed, but I understand how these things are.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_78b31931", "Let me see your datapad for a second. I'll punch in the location for you. Return to me if you find anything. Be sure to speak with my historian at the site. Oh, and beware of the Tuskens!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_7eabd120", "Now that you're in office, I've come to ask about the reward you promised.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_7f70fe38", "Now that I'm in office, I can finally set some of my ideas into action. The marketplace could definitely use some attention, and I should make sure everything at the museum is going well.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_7fa991c4", "Excellent! I appreciate your support. And to take that further, if I win come back and talk to me. I like to reward those who contribute to my success.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_7fc36aab", "And has the disk been dealt with?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_811e4ed1", "I voted for you in this election.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_81a382e3", "Here you are.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_81f9db80", "Just thought I'd see what the local government was up to.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_82b273a8", "Suit yourself.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_82e87c1c", "I gotta go.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_8784f1db", "Thanks for the interest, but it looks like you still don't have enough room to receive the disk. You'll need to come back when you do.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_88b2f5bd", "I have a nice reward for you, but you don't seem to have room to take it. Please return after making some room in your inventory.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_8b63bfe1", "I can't find evidence.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_8bdcb5a3", "Additionally, I plan to hire historians to uncover the history of Bestine. Artisans will definitely appreciate the new renovations done to the museum. It will give them a chance to place their creations on display.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_8dc34668", "Oh no. This isn't good. If the governor finds out that I'm related to such a person, she may just kick me out of office. Here, take it back. Tell you what. If you find some way to destroy it, I'll give you something. Just... get rid of it!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_91135631", "I plan to feature the culture of this area. I intend to hire historians to uncover the history of Bestine. I would also like to see more funding for the museum so that we can bring more artwork to our city. This would give artisans a chance to place their creations on display and share them with a larger audience.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_91cc7d0", "I wish you well. Come back soon!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_928992d9", "I am humbled by your request. Currently, Bestine's markets are inadequate. I have already completed the construction of one market place. If I win this election, I'll put my efforts into attracting new merchants to these areas to help Bestine's economy. Perhaps it will bring about new schematics for our crafters.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_9a679e7f", "You're wrong.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_9adf6cf2", "Thanks for the interest! I guess you don't have enough room to receive the disk, though. You'll need to come back when you do.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_9d0c2f9e", "What did you find? Can I see it? Does it mention my ancestor? Let me have it, please.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_9fa98668", "You said to return for a reward. For destroying that disk.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_a068d8f2", "Who do I let screen anything I find at the crash site?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_a0d033e3", "This is excellent! I can't believe he would be so daft to do such things! You can now join my campaign. That is what you wanted... right?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_a17fdb9a", "Oh? So soon? Okay. I should get back to work anyway!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_a3734170", "I spoke to your contact about the disk from the crash site.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_a4a25b0f", "Oh. Well, come back if you discover the error of your ways.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_a5cd533e", "Just my luck! I could really use your help. The Red-Sin Valon find is phenomenal in of itself, but what if there's more? I want you to bring back any information you can. There must be some sort of log of the events surrounding the early settlement attempts. I'd really like for you to find it. Do you think you can do that?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_a7627a7", "Excellent news! How does the process go... Oh! You should let the governor, Tour Aryon, know of any evidence of a good deed I have done for the people of Bestine. Take it to her! I have done much for the people of Bestine, so I have confidence that our governor will be impressed. Of course, if you decide I am not the right candidate to represent you, you can always join my rival's campaign instead. Though I can't imagine how that would be possible.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_a8b339fd", "I'll do it!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_a907268e", "Yes, the disk has been taken care of.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_aa0406b", "Ah, well return when you do.  You'll need to go and talk to my secretary if you need more information.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_b30bd73c", "Yes, I did.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_b45b3794", "Sounds like fun. I'll do it!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_b826b85a", "I want to join your campaign.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_b893398e", "Ah good to see you again. Please, take this as a token of my gratitude.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_bab1f93a", "I have to go. Sorry!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_bad1d1bb", "Good bye, then.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_bb6b1f4b", "Really? I thought my secretary knew how to get it for sure. I really think you should speak with her again.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_bc42a527", "Finally! I'm so grateful to you. Please, take this as my token of eternal gratitude.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_c1c018c3", "Good for you. I always like to see people taking an interest in politics.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_c27445f0", "Reward? I think not. You already received one.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_c6d1b21", "That's correct and so far our efforts seem to be going well.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_c8a36ac7", "No, unfortunately. Nothing of use.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_ca646df4", "My historian, who's out at the crash site. She needs to screen and catalog whatever you find. Go and speak with her.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_d15b93e5", "Excellent news! How does the process go - Oh! You should let the governor, Tour Aryon, know of any evidence of a good deed I have done for the people of Bestine. Take it to her! I have done much for the people of Bestine, so I have confidence that our governor will be impressed. Of course, if you decide I am not the right candidate to represent you, you can always join my rival's campaign instead. Though I can't imagine how that would be possible.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_d1f385de", "It went well. I voted for you.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_d349c913", "See if you can find anything of value. Did you speak to my historian? Speak to her when you get to the site.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_d485fca4", "Yes. Anyway, lately we've experienced brutal attacks from the Sand People. My historian is having a hard time of it, and I'm not sure her efforts can continue. She doesn't possess a brawler's spirit or the skill of a marksman. She's just a scholar. It's depressing to think that our attempts to restore the Red-Sin Valon have been fruitless. Do you think you can help? You seem like an adventurer. Or am I wrong?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_d6a9a15d", "I'm here to vote for you.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_da9a29e9", "No, not yet.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_dab387e8", "Indeed I do! History is a passion of mine, especially since my ancestors were among the original settlers of Bestine. I've gotten enough funding to hire a historian. We made an exciting new discovery just last week! A terrible desert storm came through and kicked up loose sand and beneath was a wrecked ship. We think it may be the Red-Sin Valon, the vessel used to transport the early settlers to Tatooine. It's so exciting!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_dc13d9c7", "I understand. Maybe later, then.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_dea56128", "I have to go.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_df1ac18d", "The Tuskens... My rival is centered on the slight possibility that they might launch an attack against Bestine. I find that highly doubtful. We have enough Troopers walking around as it is and they can easily defend us if needed. The Tuskens aren't brave or stupid enough to come near Bestine. We need to concentrate on the economy by introducing more markets!");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_e7ffff2", "I think I'm going to get going.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_ee8c0e93", "I see. Well, I suppose these things happen. I'm disappointed, but you're free to make whatever mistakes you wish.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_ef067f71", "Alright. I want to join your campaign.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_f1b007b2", "I heard and greatly appreciate it! When the election is over, if I win I'd like to thank you for your support. Come back and speak to me if that happens.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_f2b0fbc2", "You mentioned something about the Tuskens.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_f47244aa", "Excellent. If you find anything, be sure to let my historian screen it. Then report back to me.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_f81b7edd", "Oh yeah! Again I thank you for the help and for your support, I've prepared a little gift for you.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_fcf4d778", "How?");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_fe8dd35a", "No, I changed my mind.");
stringFiles[405].addEntry("s_ff7aeed7", "Yes, that was me.");

stringFiles[406] = new StringFile("conversation/ship_trainer_01");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (ship_trainer_01) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_13f18f29", "I agree. Are there other areas of space combat you would like to discuss at the moment?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_173a50a8", "If your ship is equipped with missiles, you'll be able to fire them by pressing the RIGHT MOUSE BUTTON or JOYSTICK BUTTON (2). Missiles take some time to 'lock' onto their targets - so watch your targeting indicator. The spinning squares will 'lock in' and become solid when your missile is ready for release.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_199da0c4", "What happens when I land?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_1a22f0e7", "Excellent. Are there any other areas that interest you at the moment?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_23f4b352", "How do I find stations with the zone map?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_2b99ba00", "Look on the radar at the lower center area of your screen. The circular blue bars surrounding the radar indicate your shield strength. The center red circle shows your armor strength. As you lose shielding, the blue bars shrink. As you lose armor, the red circle also shrinks.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_2e9195ac", "Welcome to the Ybella Systems 'Starfighter Training' holodisc program. Press the ALT key on your keyboard to activate your mouse cursor, then select one of the training options below to begin. Press the ESC key to skip this training sequence. Press the ALT key again to return to flight mode.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_306c1aa", "Shields.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_353c0343", "It varies. You will have the option of repairing all of your ship damage or a select percentage of overall damage. The more you want to repair, the greater the cost. Space stations routinely stock up on low-grade parts and have trouble making repairs to exotic machinery.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_36ba2186", "I understand ship weapons.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_3e07db47", "How do I roll my ship?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_3ec6b879", "Landing procedures.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_43401557", "Open the zone map by pressing the 'N' key. Space stations, points of interest, waypoints and mission critical objects are listed by category on the right-hand side of the screen. Click on the 'Space Stations' category then click on the space station of your choice.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_46e4ecc6", "When you are ready to land you must fly to a planetary space station and request landing clearance. Press Shift-C to target the station and open a communications frequency. Also, if you fly close to the space station's hangar the station will communicate with you automatically.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_4bd64d06", "I think I understand space combat.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_4bdcddad", "Armor.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_4cc9a6bb", "How do I control ship heading?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_4e9c20b8", "I understand targeting. Thanks.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_51b1431b", "When you launch, your ship computer automatically creates a 'Launch Waypoint' to the nearest planetary station. To activate this waypoint go to your datapad by pressing Control-D, click the 'Waypoints' tab, locate the 'Launch Waypoint,' right-click and select 'Activate.' You can also locate these stations using the zone map.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_55651ec5", "It is advisable to lock your target while in combat so that you can keep track of its health, distance, and relative position. Additionally, you will need to have a target selected in order to inspect it, dock with it, or to fire missiles at it. The starship targeting system allows you to acquire enemy targets, friendly targets, neutral space station targets, and other player pilots.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_56daefef", "You should also be aware of the chat system in space - and its potential interaction with your flight controls. When you are piloting a ship, you must press the ENTER key to begin chat. Type your message, then hit ENTER again to send. Note that when you are in 'chat mode' your mouse mode automatically switches to 'cursor mode.' The mouse will return to flight mode when you hit ENTER to send your message.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_5d06faf2", "I think I understand ship movement.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_5d8dd52b", "I don't doubt that. What other areas would you like to discuss today?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_5e014e82", "I know enough about space stations now.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_5ef040d8", "Okay. Let's talk about flight.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_603f0296", "What about friendly ships?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_659d0168", "Unfortunately, no. The Starfighter Training holodisc product line has been discontinued by order of The Emperor. Pre-installed systems such as I are allowed to remain in service provided that they are never sold or transferred.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_6b0b0a5e", "To target the nearest friendly player-piloted starship, press the K key. To cycle friendly player pilots, use the L key. The semicolon selects the nearest friendly non-player-piloted starships, and the apostrophe key cycles through them.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_6b96b4b0", "Use the mouse (or a joystick) to change your ship's heading. The up / down axis on your mouse controls the ship pitch while the left / right axis controls the ship's lateral turn or 'yaw.'");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_6c2b30a6", "Any recommendations?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_6d152f2a", "I know enough about landing now.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_6de416e5", "Skip training.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_6f13ef54", "When you are close to the space station, target and communicate with it by pressing Shift-C. After this, you will be able to request ship repairs or land on the planet below.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_6f4feb49", "How much do repairs cost?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_717ffa5d", "Starship weapons");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_73b3d88d", "Tell me about damage.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_757a074a", "Use the up and down arrow keys for throttle control. Up arrow - speed up. Down arrow - slow down. You can also set your speed to maximum with the 'home' key - or set it to zero with the 'end' key.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_759c9273", "If you are flying with the mouse, you need to be aware of your mouse mode. Use the ALT key to toggle between mouse modes. In mouse-flight mode, the cursor changes to a light blue virtual-joystick indicator, and your mouse movements control the ship heading. In mouse-cursor mode, you will see a yellow arrow cursor which can be used to interact with elements on your heads-up display.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_784cfb1e", "Countermeasures.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_7980ca09", "Discuss space combat.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_7b82a9d5", "You are welcome, pilot.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_7e90f3fa", "How do I know my shield or armor strength?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_82697b23", "Excellent. Would you like to discuss any other area of starship operations?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_88eefc1a", "Teach me about targeting.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_915b9a74", "How do I target enemy ships?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_91919963", "This holodisc is installed to a secure area of starship memory. Only the rightful owner of this craft, or an Ybella Learning Systems administrator, can remove the Starfighter Training system.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_9288900f", "I understand.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_9584abbd", "Yes. When you have a ship target selected, you can use the [ and ] bracket keys to cycle through subcomponents. Starship parts, such as the main reactor or the engine, can be targeted in this manner. Fire as normal - and your weapons will be tuned to hit the specific subcomponent so long as the sub-target remains locked.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_986a2b5e", "Your ship will be parked at the starport of the city at which you chose to land. When you want to return to space, go to the starport where your ship is parked, use the starship terminal, and launch.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_993e6843", "Can I target specific components?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_9aa7d166", "There are several subcategories within the subject of space combat. Which area would you like to discuss?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_a44e0bb8", "Review flight controls.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_a836ab41", "Does it cost anything to land?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_a8a57e90", "You can set a waypoint to the space station and fly to it manually. Or if you want to relax a bit, right-click on the station name and choose 'Autopilot.' Your ship will fly there automatically.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_aba0472f", "Your primary starship blaster weapon is fired by pressing either the LEFT MOUSE BUTTON (default) or the JOYSTICK BUTTON (1). Be sure to aim for the small bright blue circle just in front of a moving target. This is your 'target lead indicator' that calculates the target speed vector.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_abd54560", "Good. Is there anything else you want to know about?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_aceff31e", "Good luck, pilot.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_b440102e", "Where do I find a space station?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_b4939dbb", "How do I get rid of you?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_b5d951d6", "I know enough about this now.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_b8768b9a", "What do I do when I reach the station?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_b8d366e5", "The armor layer of your ship protects your starship chassis and all of the components that it contains. Unlike shields, armor does not regenerate. You must install new armor once your old armor is destroyed.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_b9916a35", "Starships carry a variety of weapons. Starship blasters (or 'flash cannons'), missiles, torpedoes, and countermeasures. Which should we discuss?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_b9b27823", "Thank you.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_ba96a20e", "Landing is free. The planetary defense systems of all modern worlds will automatically convey you to the planet surface and secure your starship in a municipal starport hangar.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_c00ac18c", "What area of damage are you interested in reviewing?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_c111fe6c", "Affirmative. Ybella Learning Systems would like to remind you to use your personal holocron if you need help in the future. Press Control H at any time in space or on the ground to invoke this system.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_c27a66c4", "Review the 'Space' category. We recommend the 'Quick-start Guide' section. There is more information about space combat, interactions with other ships and space stations, as well as PvP, and starship crafting.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_c87b607", "When an enemy fires a missile at you, you'll hear a missile warning sound as the ordnance approaches. To get the missile off your trail - fire your countermeasures with the MIDDLE MOUSE BUTTON (default) or JOYSTICK BUTTON (3). Note that you may need to release several countermeasures to spoof high-level missiles.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_d37b0214", "Good. Is there anything else you would like to discuss?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_d4836a51", "Missiles.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_d589bcc5", "Starship blasters.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_dede7bc9", "How do I use the holocron?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_e5a158de", "Use the left and right arrow keys to roll your starship. Right arrow rolls clockwise, and left arrow rolls your ship counterclockwise.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_e6772f13", "Goodbye.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_e93ecaeb", "What do I do then?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_e9a2f2f4", "Excellent. What else would you like to discuss?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_f2293d3f", "Use the TAB key to lock the closest enemy target. Press the T key (or SHIFT-T) to cycle your target lock between enemies in the area. Use SHIFT-TAB to lock the closest enemy player target, and use the Z key (or SHIFT-Z) to cycle player enemy targets.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_f29dd33b", "Shields are a damage-resistance system that recharges over time (as long as the shield generator is in good health). If your target has shields, you must destroy them before doing damage to the ship armor. Same goes for your own ship. If you lose your shields - the next hit will likely scrape off a nice chunk of armor.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_f2bd013b", "You can invoke the holocron knowledge-base by pressing Control + H at any time - whether you are in space or on the ground. Use this system to find out information about all game features and systems.");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_f5508176", "Do all ships have this system?");
stringFiles[406].addEntry("s_fc27931b", "Thanks.");

stringFiles[407] = new StringFile("conversation/static_quests_record_keeper_dantooine");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("do_not_edit", "The English version of this file (static_quests_record_keeper_dantooine) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_0", "");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_1288f6ef", "NO, wait. Let me think about it for a second.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_12936cce", "I see. How do we proceed?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_14693cf1", "What if I decide to continue my service?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_287908df", "No, do not reset my file. I will update your records.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_2e18346d", "I don't have time right now.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_32bfa453", "I think we are done with each other citizen. I explained that you couldn't change your mind. Now move along.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_3b67eeac", "Remember that once you decide to update your files and continue as normal, you cannot change your mind. Are you sure that you want me to update your record?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_3d27cb3d", "Very well. But do not take long, my time is valuable.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_4b10b47", "You should make time for a official of the Empire but I have a lot to do anyway so come back when you have time.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_5c12e6ea", "Greetings citizen. My records indicate that you have been assisting fellow citizens and officials around Tatooine. Unfortunately, our databank had a 'accident', and I need to ask you some questions to fill in the blanks.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_5db2d1c9", "YES, I am sure. I want to continue where I left of.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_6d50e348", "I want to decide later.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_6de63882", "You are wasting my time citizen but fine, return to me when you have made your decision. Now move along.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_710595f4", "I've got to be going now.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_71a41175", "I've finally met someone with less patience than me. Fine, move along.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_83c0df9e", "Then you will just continue where you were. Any missions for citizens that you are currently doing will stay as they are and citizens you're already done helping, will have records of that. But remember that once you decide you cannot change your mind. Shall I reset your history?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_884006f7", "If you like, I can just erase your progress, you would save me a lot of time and you could go around and help citizens all over again, with them rewarding you appropriately. Otherwise, you can update my records with your old progress and go on as nothing happened. Remember that once you decide, you cannot change your mind. Shall I erase the information in your databank?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_9413f709", "Citizen, I'm a very busy person. Please move on.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_9ef848f9", "I will answer your questions.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_a76f22bf", "What if I decide to reset my history?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_a87d342e", "I must recompile all of the data that was lost, if you so wish. For that reason, I must ask you some questions.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_ab18ccf6", "Keep in mind that once I reset your file, it cannot be undone. Are you sure that you want me to blank out your databank?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_ae08bd89", "Very well citizen, it is done. Thank you for saving me the time to update your records. Now move along.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_b1f6ba02", "What if I decide to erase all my data?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_b8ea8b67", "Very well, it is done. Thank you for updating my records citizen. Now move along.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_bfd7fb6d", "Can I decide later?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_cc924cf1", "Yes, please reset my file.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_cd1a9013", "My job is to update these records to their former standard, if citizens so wish, or to blank them out completely and let them start over on a clean slate.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_d0902f5e", "YES, I am sure. It will be fun to help those citizens again.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_e3c4a3d5", "No, do not reset my history. I will continue my service.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_e61fd069", "What if I decide to fill in the missing information in my file?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_e8ad81f2", "If I reset your file, you will be able to go back and assist citizens on Tatooine again as you have done in the past. But don't worry, you will be rewarded, and it will in no way reduce your standing in the eyes of the public or any organizations you're assosciated with. Shall I reset your file?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_edb238bc", "Go on.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_eef03120", "We believe the Rebel scum attacked our database with a virus. It erased a lot of the progress that adventurers like yourself have done for citizens here on Tatooine.");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_f51b07ff", "What kind of questions?");
stringFiles[407].addEntry("s_ff20b1f1", "Yes, please reset my employment history.");

