stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_2eadaa06", "If you like, I can reset your service history and you can assist the Rebellion again. Otherwise, you can continue your services where you left off. Remember that once you decide, you cannot change your mind. Do you want me to reset your history?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_3315cf03", "Normally, those who have helped us so willingly in the past are not called on to do so again. However, if you wish, I can reset your service history with the Rebellion. Do you want me to reset your history?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_3547d92c", "I don't believe that you have performed any services for our cause in the past. You do not need to speak with me.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_37420d49", "Oh, good. I'm glad you stopped by, now I don't have to go looking for you. I need to ask you some questions if you have a moment to spare.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_3c440d33", "I understand completely. Take all the time you need.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_3cf75f2d", "What does that entail?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_3d89228f", "If you choose to continue from where you left off, you will simply return to the person which last gave you a job. That person will give you further instructions then. But remember that once you decide you cannot change your mind. Shall I reset your history?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_45b87508", "Very well, it is done. You may continue your service to the Rebellion where you last left off.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_48d3face", "If I reset your history, you will be able to go back and assist the Rebellion again as you have done in the past. But don't worry, you will be rewarded again, and it will in no way reduce your standing in the rank of the Rebellion. Do you want me to reset your history?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_49d330ac", "Alright, but remember that once you decide to continue, you cannot change your mind. Are you sure that you want to continue your service where you left off?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_4b845961", "Certainly. Simply return and speak with me again when you have made your decision.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_5a47438c", "Yes, I have already recorded your services. You do not need to speak with me.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_6e88ecc1", "No, do not reset my history right now.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_710595f4", "I've got to be going now.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_7666799", "Very well, it is done. You may go speak with C-3PO when you are ready to begin your service again.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_866cf013", "I see. What do you need me for?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_93e226b7", "NO, do not reset my history right now.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_9bc93d72", "Yes, please reset my service history.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_a45bb0ec", "Well, it's up to me to recompile all the data that was on those disks, and I need to ask you a question or two regarding your employment history.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_a76f22bf", "What if I decide to reset my history?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_b1f9a8ac", "I'm sorry, I don't believe that you would have been in our databases. You don't need to speak with me.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_b7023094", "OK. What do you need?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_b78f6030", "Of course. Please come back and speak with me when you get a chance.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_bfd7fb6d", "Can I decide later?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_ce26bb71", "We almost had a major catastrophe. The data disks that we use to keep all information on our allies that have performed services for our cause were stolen recently by an Imperial spy.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_dc1c8663", "YES, I am sure. Reset my service history.");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_deeb1462", "If I reset your history, you will be able to go back and assist the Rebellion again as you have done in the past. But don't worry, you will be rewarded, and it will in no way reduce your standing in the rank of the Rebellion. Shall I reset your history?");
stringFiles[446].addEntry("s_e3c4a3d5", "No, do not reset my history. I will continue my service.");
