stringFiles[519].addEntry("droid_explanation_rebel", "I knew this would be worth it.  We've found nothing but evidence of the Alliance's treachery since we boarded and took this ship.  The engine room's even filled with illegal battle droids.  An electrical surge down there has made them all aggressive so I'm keeping non-essential personnel away from the area.  These Rebels have got to be stopped!");
