stringFiles[560] = new StringFile("faction_recruiter");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("already_request_shuttle", "You have already requested a shuttle.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("amount_to_spend_too_small", "You must allocate more faction standing in order to earn a point of experience.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("bad_stuff_1", "Hah, that's rich.  I had a Bothan freighter captain in my office two hours ago with the exact same piece of information.  I'm sorry, but I can't pay you for what I already know.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("bad_stuff_2", "Three days ago our spy network confirmed the exact opposite of what you have you just told me.  I don't have time to waste on traitors and I certainly don't have time to waste on traitors who are wrong.  Good day.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("bribe_fail", "Is this a joke?  You don't have enough money to cover your offer.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("bribe_success", "Looks like everything is in order.  I'll see what I can do for you.  If you happen to feel generous again, you know where you can find me.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("brigadier_general", "Brigadier General");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("buy_faction", "I'd like to make a ... donation ... to your cause.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("captain", "Captain");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("checking_credit", "Hold on while I validate your credit...");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("colonel", "Colonel");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("corporal", "Corporal");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("covert_complete", "You are now a Combatant. Enemy NPCs will attack you on sight but you cannot be attacked by enemy players.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("datapad_full", "Your datapad is full.  You must first free some space.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("enemy_pilot", "Wait a minute... you're an enemy pilot!  There's no way I'll let you join us!");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("enter_training_points", "Enter the amount of faction standing you wish to convert to experience.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("faction_purchase", "Faction Item Requisition");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("faction_training", "Faction Training");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("general", "General");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("get_lost", "Don't waste my time.  Come back when you know something.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("get_lost_faction", "Don't offer money when you can't afford to pay.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("good_stuff_1", "This may be exactly what we needed to know.  I'm surprised...for a piece of traitorous scum you are somewhat reliable.  Here is your payment.  Now get out of my sight.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("good_stuff_2", "So that's why their communication lines have been quiet.  I knew they were planning something.  Here is your payment.  If you learn anything else you know where to find me.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("good_stuff_3", "While it goes against my better judgement, this information seems to be in line with what we already know.  You've done a good job, here is your payment.  By the way, if you find any enemy orders in the field, hand them to me and I might be willing to pay you more.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("go_covert_confirm", "Becoming covert will shield you from attacks by our enemies, but will also prevent you from initiating conflicts with them.  Are you sure you this is what you want?");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("go_covert_yes", "Very well.  We will be able to conceal your affiliation in about %DI hours.  Is there anything else with which I can help you?");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("go_declared_confirm", "If you declare your affiliation, you will become open to attack from our enemies.  Furthermore, should you change your mind, returning to your covert status is not immediate.  Are you sure you want to do this?");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("go_declared_yes", "Very well. Your affiliation is now apparent to all.  Do you need anything else?");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("greeting", "Greetings.  What can I do for you today?");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("greeting_hate", "I have no business with you.  You'd best be going.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("greeting_member", "Hello, %TO.  What would you like to do?");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("greeting_prose", "Greetings.  With what can the %TO faction help you?");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("here_you_go", "Here's the latest information I've been able to get.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("high_colonel", "High Colonel");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("high_general", "High General");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("hireling_purchase_complete", "The %TT is now under your command.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("hireling_released", "Your %TT has abandoned you.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("interested_faction_imp", "A 'donation' eh?  I might see to it that certain individuals hear of your kindness and that certain materials are made available should you see fit to make such a 'donation.'");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("interested_faction_reb", "Honestly, the Rebellion is in sore need of funds.  Our operations require men, supplies, and weapons, none of which comes free.  Anything you can give would be appreciated.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("interested_secrets_imp_1", "Yes...I've heard that you were aiding the Rebellion.  Rather good at it too: you've dealt us more than a few setbacks.  Give me a reason why I shouldn't have you arrested.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("interested_secrets_imp_2", "Going turncoat on the Rebellion eh?  I can't say I blame you.  Rebel bases have been collapsing as fast as we can discover them.  Maybe you could help us in our efforts?");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("interested_secrets_imp_3", "You are known to me as a Rebel sympathizer.  Several patrols have your name and visual ID, in fact.  If you have useful intelligence for me, I might be able to make those patrols forget about you...and line your pockets at the same time.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("interested_secrets_reb_1", "We occaisionally get Imperial 'sympathizers' who want to sell their information to the highest bidder.  What makes you think I'm interested in what you have to say?");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("interested_secrets_reb_2", "I get the feeling this information isn't going to be free...but I'm listening.  I've heard that you were working with the Empire and I might be willing to buy what you know.");
stringFiles[560].addEntry("interested_secrets_reb_3", "If we listened to every Imperial officer with 'information' to sell, the Rebellion would have been put down long ago.  I'll listen to what you have to say, but believe me: I know bait when I hear it.  You'll get your money only if the information is sound.");
