stringFiles[581] = new StringFile("gcw");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("abort_field_change", "You cancel your factional change.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("cannot_change_from_combatant_in_field", "You cannot change you status to combatant in the field. Go talk to a faction recruiter.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("corellia_newsnet_name", "Corellia Metropolitan ");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("gcw_status_change", "GCW STATUS CHANGE CONFIRMATION");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("gcw_status_change_covert", "You are changing your GCW Status to 'Combatant'. This transition will take 30 seconds. It will allow you to attack and be attacked by enemy NPC's. Type YES in this box to confirm the change.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("gcw_status_change_overt", "You are changing your GCW Status to 'Special Forces'. This transition will take 5 minutes. It will allow you to attack and be attacked by hostile players and NPC's.Type YES in this box to confirm the change.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("gcw_status_info", "To see the status of the Galactic Civil War, either talk to your local factional recruiter, or read the newsnet terminals in your nearest starport.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("general_newsnet_name", "The Times");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("handle_go_covert", "You will be flagged as a Combatant in 30 seconds.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_corellia_equal", "          Peaceful Solution May Be On HorizonCoronet, Corellia (CP) -- Information coming from Naboo today indicates that a peacful solutionto the fighting may be closer than we think.  ");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_corellia_rebel_losing_1", "          Rebel Forces Suffer SetbackCoronet, Corellia (CP) -- Rebel forces suffered a setback at Imperial hands today. 3 are dead and 12 wounded in fierce fighting. ");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_corellia_rebel_losing_2", "          Imperial Leaders OptimisticTheed, Naboo (CP) -- Imperial Leaders are optimistic tod-ay, indicating that fighting against the Rebels has taken aturn to their advantage. ");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_corellia_rebel_losing_3", "          Rebel Forces Fear No End In SightCoronet, Corellia (CP) -- Rebel forces fear the fight against the Empire may continue indefinitely. Hope for a cease fire vanished last week.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_corellia_rebel_losing_4", "          Rebel Forces Devastated!Coronet, Corellia (CP) -- Rebel forces suffered devastatingcasualties this week in an Imperial attack. Casualties wereunusually high, indicating a failure in Rebellion intelligence. ");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_corellia_rebel_winning_1", "          Imperial Units Continue DeploymentTheed, Naboo (CP) -- Imperial forces continueddeployment, undeterred, even in the face of increased casualties this week. Morale remains mixed with the recent casualties.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_corellia_rebel_winning_2", "          Imperial Leaders Concerned Over LossesTheed, Naboo (CP) -- Imperial leaders are concernedover recent casualties. Logistical and supply failures thisweek have led to increased losses amongst Imperial forces.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_corellia_rebel_winning_3", "          Imperial Leaders Unhappy With ProgressTheed, Naboo (CP) -- Imperial leaders are unhappywith progress against the Rebellion. Numerous unnamedsources have voiced concerns that more troops are needed.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_corellia_rebel_winning_4", "          Ex-Senator Calls For Troop Exit PlanTheed, Naboo (CP) -- Recent heavy Imperial losses haveled senator Mcnamara to call for a full troop withdrawalfrom the Rebel conflict. 'We must protect the lives of our soldiers from these terrorist attacks.'");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_general_equal", "          Worrt Invasion Leaves Homeowners Hopping MadMos Espa, Tatooine (IP) -- KROAAAK! Mos Espa homeownersawoke to an unpleasant surprise last week. Local Worrt populations have spiraled out of control in recent weeks.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_general_rebel_losing_1", "          Rebellion Puts Out Call For EnlisteesCoronet, Corellia (IP) -- Rebellion spokesmen released another statement yesterday requesting able bodied citizens to enlist in the fight against the Empire.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_general_rebel_losing_2", "          Rebel Leaders Losing ConfidenceCoronet, Corellia (IP) -- Rebellion leaders, speakingunder conditions of anonymity, spoke frankly about recent failures in the fight against the Empire.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_general_rebel_losing_3", "          Imperial Senate Happy With War ProgressTheed, Naboo (IP) -- Rebellion leaders, speakingunder conditions of anonymity, spoke frankly about recent failures in the fight against the Empire. ");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_general_rebel_losing_4", "          Imperial Victory AssuredMos Espa, Tatooine (IP) -- Imperial Officers today declared through official channels that the battlewith the Rebellion is about to end.  ");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_general_rebel_winning_1", "          Imperial Fleet Suffers DefeatMos Eisley, Tatooine (IP) -- Rumors over the past few days indicated that a team of Alliance pilots, fly-ing with no air support, destroyed a Super Star Destroyerin orbit around Tatooine.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_general_rebel_winning_2", "          Imperial Forces Lose GroundMos Espa, Tatooine (IP) -- Imperial Forces were stunned today, after a serious defeat at the handsof what amounted to 'poorly armed partisan soldiers'.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_general_rebel_winning_3", "          Rebel Forces OptimisticMos Espa, Tatooine (IP) -- With a series of incredible victories over a superior army, Rebel supporters are becoming more and more optimistic.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_general_rebel_winning_4", "          Rebel Victory NearMos Taike, Tatooine (IP) -- We look forward toa peace accord, signed by the Emperor himself. These were the words of a Rebel General who spokeoff the record to reporters.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_naboo_equal", "          War Continues, Emperor ConfidantTheed, Naboo (IP) -- The Emperor enjoyed a quiet day at his retreat on Naboo today, taking a  break from military matters.  He's confidant thatthe conflict will be resolved equitably.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_naboo_rebel_losing_1", "          Tide Turns Against Rebel AgitatorsTheed, Naboo (IP) -- Agitators and threats toGalactic security.  That's what the Imperial Soldiers are calling the now thousands strong 'Alliance'.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_naboo_rebel_losing_2", "          Rebel Terrorists Suffer Serious DefeatTheed, Naboo (IP) -- Imperial Officers promoted  hundreds of soldiers today, following fierce fightingin which the Imperial Army overwhelmed a Rebelgarrison.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_naboo_rebel_losing_3", "          Rebel Terrorist Forces DwindlingMoenia, Naboo (IP) -- Reports from outlying systems today indicate that the vast majority of  Rebel soldiers are abandoning their posts inan attempt to escape the Imperial onslaught.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_naboo_rebel_losing_4", "          Imperial Forces Plan CelebrationTheed, Naboo (IP) -- Imperial Officers got toplan something different today, a party.  After months of battle, they finally get to turn their attention to morerelaxing matters.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_naboo_rebel_winning_1", "          Lord Vader Leads Forces PersonallyTheed, Naboo (IP) -- It has come to this.  LordVader himself is moving his personal troops to thefront lines to break up the Rebel assaults.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_naboo_rebel_winning_2", "          Imperial Losses Due To Treason!Theed, Naboo (IP) -- Old Republic Supporters arebeing blamed for what can only be described as amilitary fiasco.  Information about troop movementwas leaked to Rebel terrorists by unknown insurgents.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_naboo_rebel_winning_3", "          Rebel Forces Building Super Weapon?Moenia, Naboo (IP) -- Information gathered fromcaptured Rebel Pilots indicates that the Rebels are working on some kind of 'Super Laser' capable ofplanetary destruction.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("headline_naboo_rebel_winning_4", "          Rebel Terrorists Spread Disinformation!Theed, Naboo (IP) -- Information about thefighting going on in distant systems is not ent-irely accurate.  Rebel spies are planting disinformationon Imperial newsnet terminals in an attempt to discreditthe Empire.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("naboo_newsnet_name", "The Nabooian Citizen");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("newsnet_extra", "EXTRA! EXTRA!");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("newsnet_read_all", "EXTRA! EXTRA! READ ALL ABOUT IT!");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("newsnet_terminal", "Newsnet Terminal");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("read_headline", "Read Headline");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("story_corellia_rebel_losing_1", "Coronet, Corellia (CP) -- Rebel forces suffered a setback at Imperial hands today. 34 are reported dead and 95 wounded in fierce fighting.");
stringFiles[581].addEntry("too_many_bases", "There are too many bases in this area. Move to a new location and try again.");

stringFiles[582] = new StringFile("gcwlaunchevent");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("areabroadcast_0", "<<Incoming Imperial Transmission: Command station, this is ST321, code clearance blue. We're starting our approach.>> ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("areabroadcast_1", "<<Incoming Alliance Transmission: Ground control, this is shuttle Alder Six-Two. We have the Princess on board and are coming in for a landing.>>");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("closingbroadcast_0", "<<Imperial Transmission: Shuttle ST321, your departure vector is right six-nine-three. Command station out.>>");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("closingbroadcast_1", "<<Alliance Transmission: Control, Alder Six-Two. We are gear up and on our way to our next rally. May the Force be with you..>>");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_1", "Today marks a turning point in this Galactic Civil War...");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_10", "I will make sure the Emperor knows of your loyalty.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_11", "You have your orders. Dismissed.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_2", "For too long has this Rebellion remained in our midst, but no longer will such an affront be tolerated.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_3", "Order must be restored.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_4", "Effective immediately, known Rebels and all Jedi will be shot on sight by Imperial troops.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_5", "To bring law and order to the cities we must first control the outlying areas by establishing a military presence in the form of outposts and bases.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_6", "If we are able to control enough of the outlying areas, we will also control the cities. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_7", "Only by establishing Imperial bases across this planet, we can achieve our goal of controlling the cities and crushing all resistance. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_8", "Allowing the rebellion to establish control will not be tolerated.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_1_9", "I have seen all that is necessary. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_1", "Greetings, citizens of the Empire.  I bring you dark news.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_10", "You have your orders. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_11", "I suggest you carry them out without further delay.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_2", "The Emperor is angry.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_3", "The Rebellion has too long been a thorn in the side of progress and order.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_4", "He wishes this insignificant uprising to be crushed, and quickly.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_5", "From this day forward, no Rebel presence shall be tolerated. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_6", "Any illegal sympathizers or Jedi are to be shot on sight, no questions asked.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_7", "In addition, the Emperor commands that you establish military bases and outposts in the outlying regions, so that insurrections can be crushed immediately.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_8", "Once this perimeter has been established, he wishes that the cities be controlled unilaterally by the Empire.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_2_9", "Do not disappoint him.  I needn't remind you, the Emperor is not as forgiving as I am.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_1", "Citizens of the Empire, I have come to declare an end to the Rebellion.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_10", "Pray that does not come to pass, for I have little sympathy for failure.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_11", "By the Emperor's command.  Farewell.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_2", "From now on, all members of the Rebellion are to be terminated on sight.  No mercy shall be shown.  ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_3", "And any of the so-called Jedi Knights are to be similarly dealt with.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_4", "The Emperor has tolerated their presence long enough.  But even his graciousness and forgiveness has a limit.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_5", "To achieve absolute control of this sector, we must control the cities.  ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_6", "And so, the Emperor commands all his allies to establish military bases and outposts in the outlying areas.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_7", "Once we have gained control of the countryside, we shall consolidate our control of the cities. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_8", "And then, we shall be unstoppable.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_0_3_9", "Should you fail to achieve this goal, I may be forced to return to this dismal planet, and oversee its administration.  ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_1", "Friends and allies of the Rebellion:  The end of tyranny begins today...");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_10", "Our freedom and future is in your hands. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_11", "May the Force be with you all.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_2", "The Empire has ruled us with fear and lies long enough. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_3", "Dark Jedi and others known to fight for the Empire wander freely though our cities.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_4", "Peace must be restored, and so, we must band together and fight.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_5", "First we must fight Imperial oppression in the outlying areas.  ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_6", "We will establish Rebel bases on this planet, beacons of hope and justice.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_7", "Once we have the support of the smaller towns, we will see the populace rise to support us. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_8", "I call upon you all to do what is right. We must fight this evil here and now. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_1_9", "That is all I can ask. Be careful and fight well. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_1", "Friends of the Rebellion, hear my call to action.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_10", "Friends of the Rebellion, you are my only hope.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_11", "May the force be with you all.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_2", "Today we draw a line in the sand, and declare that the Empire will rule us no more. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_3", "Rise up and fight, my friends!  ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_4", "All Imperials and Dark Jedi must be confronted and defeated!");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_5", "Take the battle against them to the very streets of the city.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_6", "We can control this sector if we band together and fight.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_7", "Establish new Rebel bases in the outlying country, as many as you can.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_8", "From there, we can gain the trust and cooperation of the populace, and control the very cities themselves!");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_2_9", "If we continue to fight and build and persevere, even the might of the Empire cannot crush our spirits.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_1", "This is our most desperate hour.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_10", "In our pursuit of peace, we must sometimes embrace conflict.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_11", "Friends of the Alliance, I wish you good luck, and may the Force be with you.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_2", "If we do not oppose the Empire now, we shall be pushed into the farthest reaches of the Outer Rim, or rounded up like criminals.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_3", "The Rebellion must have safe haven, in order to grow, thrive, and overthrow this evil Empire.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_4", "To that end, friends and allies, I call upon you to establish Rebel bases and outposts all through the outlying areas of this region.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_5", "Every Rebel base brings us that much closer to control of the cities.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_6", "And if we control the cities, there's no end to the good we can do.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_7", "To any who oppose the Empire, I extend this invitation.  Join us.  Help us. ");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_8", "To any who still hold allegiance to the Empire, I extend this word of caution:  Beware.  Your days are few.  No evil can survive where justice and peace take root.");
stringFiles[582].addEntry("dialogue_1_3_9", "I have been authorized to call for open attacks on all Imperial loyalists and Dark Jedi.  ");

stringFiles[583] = new StringFile("generic_city_convo");
stringFiles[583].addEntry("add_to_radar", "Let me add those directions to your datapad.");
stringFiles[583].addEntry("anchorhead_1", "There's not much to say really.  Tosche station is there, but not much else.");
