stringFiles[765].addEntry("m4t", "A Father's Illness");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m5d", "I finally found a buyer for my centuries-old Core World Arms pulse-blast rifle. Obviously such a valuable item must be hand-delivered. It's packed securely. This collector travels a lot to dangerous areas, so be on your guard.");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m5f", "filename_of_object");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m5l", "Antique blaster rifle");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m5o", "");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m5p", "These eccentric collectors, always planet-hopping. Hope you find this one. Here you go. That rifle is packed as securely as possible");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m5r", "Ah, my rifle! Lucky you found me. I was on the next transport out of here. This might come in handy where I'm going. My thanks.");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m5s", "I wish I knew how that buyer earns enough credits both to buy antique weapons and also to travel around the galaxy. Hmm, I wonder if one habit explains the other?");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m5t", "Core World Antique Blaster");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m6d", "These nobles and their ridiculous vendettas. A rich client who had been staying with us left his customized dueling vibrorapier in our home. Now the client needs it to settle a matter of honor, or somesuch nonsense. Could you please deliver it quickly? ");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m6f", "filename_of_object");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m6l", "Vibrorapier");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m6o", "");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m6p", "Here's the vibrorapier. No telling what sort of trouble you might encounter on your travels. This noble has a habit of making enemies.");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m6r", "Aha! Now at last my honor can be defended. No one accuses me of cheating. No one!");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m6s", "I hope that hothead survives the duel, and I certainly hope you don't think dueling is honorable. Whatever happened to forgive and forget?");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m6t", "A Matter of Honor");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m7d", "I have some delicate cargo that must be delivered soon. A client has purchased some Neimoidian pylat bird eggs from a breeder friend. I don't need to tell you that these are rare and expensive. If you can pick them up and deliver them whole, you'll be well-rewarded.");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m7f", "filename_of_object");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m7l", "Small box");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m7o", "");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m7p", "These eggs need to be maintained at a constant temperature. The sealed container controls that. Don't open it. Don't jostle it. Don't get into blaster battles if you can help it.");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m7r", "My birds! Well, they're going to be. You ever heard their song? Enchanting. Thanks.");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m7s", "Thanks for getting those eggs to their destination in one piece. Your pay has been transmitted.");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m7t", "Pylat Egg Delivery");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m8d", "Our friend's sister has just given birth! The family would love for my friend to return home at once and see the newborns. Could you pick up a datadisc, which contains pictures of the new family, from my home and deliver it and the good news? Tell my friend to hurry home. Many thanks!");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m8f", "mission\\mission_datadisk.iff");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m8l", "Datadisc");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m8o", "");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m8p", "I'm sure our friend will want to race home once these holographs have been viewed. I know it's a long way to go but it's for a good cause.");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m8r", "This is wonderful news! Thank you! I'll book the next transport out of here. Can't wait to see the holographs of the newborns.");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m8s", "Thanks for getting the word to my friend. I hope the pictures were appreciated.");
stringFiles[765].addEntry("m8t", "Pictures of the Newborns");
