stringFiles[972] = new StringFile("npc_mission/static_noble_deliver");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("cantwork", "I understand you're already working for someone else.  Come back when you're done with that job.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("gotowork", "I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("not_it", "No, sorry, that's not the item I was looking for...");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_1_1", "My family has had this heirloom glass for many years, and now it's been stolen.  I can tell you where the thief is, but I need you to bring back my glass unharmed.  Can you do it?");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I was collecting signatures to get my name on the local ballot when one of my opponents sent a theif to steal my ledger.  If you can get that ledger back for me I'll write a proclamation declaring you a good citizen.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_1_3", "A gang of ruffians stole part of the hyperdrive out of my ship.  Get it back for me and I'll give you something nice.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_1_4", "My servants won't get me the dishes I want.  There's  a guy who has a bowl that's the exact one I want.  I don't care how you do it, just get me that bowl.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_2_1", "You're a life saver.  I'll give you this hand woven basket for the glass when you return.  My servants made it.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Excellent.  Just let me know when you return, I'll have the paperwork drawn up.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Ok.  Just let me know when you've got it.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_2_4", "I thought you looked like the man I wanted.  I'll reward you nicely for it.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I thought you were a mercenary?  Perhaps you're just a librarian or some such...");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_3_2", "That's too bad.  I could have done you a lot of favors.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I thought you were a tough one.  I guess not.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Just like my servants.  No help at all.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Well, it's not much to look at, but I guess because it was in the safe they assumed it was valuable.  It is, but only to me really, they won't get much for it.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Actually I don't remember.  That's another reason I need that ledger back.  It might have been mayor...or chief of police...hm...");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Ship parts are expensive.  They're probably trying to build their own ship, or they're going to sell it on the black market.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_4_4", "A nobleman gets other people to do these things for him.  People like you.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Careful with this thing.  It's well put together, but if you crush it it won't be worth as much.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Here's your official proclamation.  It won't be valid unless I get elected, but hang onto it just in case.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Here you go.  This is a picture I took taking off from an undiscovered planet.  That picture is one of a kind.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Here's a recording rod that I paid way too much for.  It's valuable but fragile.  Be careful with it.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yeah, I can get it.  I'll need some form of payment though.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_1_2", "Sure, I'll get your ledger back.  I need friends in high places.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_1_3", "Sure, I'll help you out.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_1_4", "Sounds crazy but I'll do it.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_2_1", "Sounds ridiculous.  Why don't you just go buy a new glass?");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_2_2", "No way.   I couldn't care less about politics.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_2_3", "I thought pilot's did their own work.  I'll be going.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_2_4", "Sounds ludicrous.  Count me out.");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_3_1", "Somebody stole an heirloom glass?  Why?");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_3_2", "What office are you running for?");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_3_3", "Why would they steal parts of your ship?");
stringFiles[972].addEntry("player_3_4", "Why don't you just buy your own dishes?");

stringFiles[973] = new StringFile("npc_mission/static_noble_escort");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("cantwork", "I understand you're already working for someone else.  Come back when you're done with that job.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("dontknowyou", "I'm sorry but I don't recognize you and I'm not going to follow you anywhere.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("escortother", "I think you're looking for someone else.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("gotowork", "I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("not_it", "No, sorry, that's not the item I was looking for...");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_1_1", "A good friend of mine has gotten lost outside of town and needs to find a way to get back to me.  Can you help?");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_1_2", "One of my relatives is trying to get to me so that we can go to a reception together, but has managed to get lost outside of town.  Can you help out?");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_1_3", "My friend got lost trying to find his way home.  I think there may have been some Corellian wine involved, you know?  Can you help my friend make it back to me here?");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Sibling rivalry has led to a very severe game of hide and seek, unfortunately one of the players is still hiding and doesn't realize the game is over.  I need someone to find them and bring them back here to me.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good.  I'll let you in on a little secret...this person's not exactly a friend, but don't worry, you'll get paid for your work.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Hurry please, I don't want the party to start without us!");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Good.  When you get back we'll work out some payment arrangements.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Very nice of you, I must say.  I thought you looked a little, um...dangerous, but I can see you're as trustworthy as the day is long.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Oh.  Well, fine then.  Be that way.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_3_2", "You have no idea how much damage I could do to your life.  But begone, and if you're lucky I'll forget you.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I should have taken the advice of the jawas.  They told me not to trust people like you.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Just like my servants.  No help at all.  Good day.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Well, this and that.  There's not much to tell really.  You know.  ");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_4_2", "It's my uncle's fiftieth birthday, or my aunt's fortieth birthday, or my grandparent's wedding anniversary...or...no, I can't remember.  ");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Only when we're celebrating.  Which is pretty much every day I gues...");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Well, when you're rich you can pretty much do what you want.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Careful with this thing.  It's well put together, but if you crush it it won't be worth as much.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Here's your official proclamation.  It won't be valid unless I get elected, but hang onto it just in case.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Here you go.  This is a picture I took taking off from an undiscovered planet.  That picture is one of a kind.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Here's a recording rod that I paid way too much for.  It's valuable but fragile.  Be careful with it.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "I hope you're here to get me back to my friend.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "Great!  Let's go, I don't want to miss that reception!");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "Somebody told you I was drunk?  Liars.  I don't drink.  Now let's get back before I get thirsty.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "Thank you.  I thought I was going to be stuck out here all day.  Let's get going.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("otherescort", "I think you're here to pick up someone else.  You're certainly not taking ME anywhere.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yeah, I can do it.  I'll need some form of payment though.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_1_2", "Sure, I'll get your friend.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_1_3", "Sure, I'll help you out.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_1_4", "Sounds crazy but I'll do it.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_2_1", "Sounds ridiculous.  I'm outta here.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_2_2", "No way.   I couldn't care less about this.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_2_3", "I thought rich people had servants to do their work.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_2_4", "Sounds ludicrous.  Count me out.");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_3_1", "What does this friend of yours do?");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_3_2", "What's the reception for?");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_3_3", "Does this happen often?");
stringFiles[973].addEntry("player_3_4", "You guys just play hide and seek out in the desert?");

stringFiles[974] = new StringFile("npc_mission/static_noble_fetch");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("cantwork", "I understand you're already working for someone else.  Come back when you're done with that job.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("gotowork", "I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("not_it", "No, sorry, that's not the item I was looking for...");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_1_1", "My family has had this heirloom glass for many years, and now it's been stolen.  I can tell you where the thief is, but I need you to bring back my glass unharmed.  Can you do it?");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I was collecting signatures to get my name on the local ballot when one of my opponents sent a theif to steal my ledger.  If you can get that ledger back for me I'll write a proclamation declaring you a good citizen.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_1_3", "A gang of ruffians stole part of the hyperdrive out of my ship.  Get it back for me and I'll give you something nice.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_1_4", "My servants won't get me the dishes I want.  There's  a guy who has a bowl that's the exact one I want.  I don't care how you do it, just get me that bowl.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_2_1", "You're a life saver.  I'll give you this hand woven basket for the glass when you return.  My servants made it.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Excellent.  Just let me know when you return, I'll have the paperwork drawn up.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Ok.  Just let me know when you've got it.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_2_4", "I thought you looked like the man I wanted.  I'll reward you nicely for it.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I thought you were a mercenary?  Perhaps you're just a librarian or some such...");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_3_2", "That's too bad.  I could have done you a lot of favors.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I thought you were a tough one.  I guess not.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Just like my servants.  No help at all.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Well, it's not much to look at, but I guess because it was in the safe they assumed it was valuable.  It is, but only to me really, they won't get much for it.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Actually I don't remember.  That's another reason I need that ledger back.  It might have been mayor...or chief of police...hm...");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Ship parts are expensive.  They're probably trying to build their own ship, or they're going to sell it on the black market.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_4_4", "A nobleman gets other people to do these things for him.  People like you.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Careful with this thing.  It's well put together, but if you crush it it won't be worth as much.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Here's your official proclamation.  It won't be valid unless I get elected, but hang onto it just in case.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Here you go.  This is a picture I took taking off from an undiscovered planet.  That picture is one of a kind.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Here's a recording rod that I paid way too much for.  It's valuable but fragile.  Be careful with it.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yeah, I can get it.  I'll need some form of payment though.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_1_2", "Sure, I'll get your ledger back.  I need friends in high places.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_1_3", "Sure, I'll help you out.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_1_4", "Sounds crazy but I'll do it.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_2_1", "Sounds ridiculous.  Why don't you just go buy a new glass?");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_2_2", "No way.   I couldn't care less about politics.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_2_3", "I thought pilot's did their own work.  I'll be going.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_2_4", "Sounds ludicrous.  Count me out.");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_3_1", "Somebody stole an heirloom glass?  Why?");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_3_2", "What office are you running for?");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_3_3", "Why would they steal parts of your ship?");
stringFiles[974].addEntry("player_3_4", "Why don't you just buy your own dishes?");

stringFiles[975] = new StringFile("npc_mission/static_quest");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("cantwork", "I understand you're already working for someone else.  Come back when you're done with that job.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("gotowork", "I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("not_it", "No, sorry, that's not the item I was looking for...");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_1", "You ever hear of the Black Sun Pirates?  They robbed me and I want to pay them back.  Unfortunately, I need to get one of their medallions to get inside their base.  Can you help me get one?");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_10", "A gang of ruffians stole part of the hyperdrive out of my ship.  Get it back for me and I'll give you something nice.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_11", "I need an electronic key to break into this warehouse I've been casing, but one of my rivals has it.  Get it for me and I'll give you some of the loot I got on my last job.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_12", "My servants won't get me the dishes I want.  There's  a guy who has a bowl that's the exact one I want.  I don't care how you do it, just get me that bowl.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I made a terrible mistake and got busted on camera stealing some credits from a merchant.  The trial's coming up soon and I need someone to get that camera.  They're delivering it soon so if you can find it and bring it to me I'll hook you up with this decryptor.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I had a lot of important paperwork in my briefcase, and now it's gone!  Some thief came by and grabbed it out of my hands.  If you can get it I'll give you this engraved writing stylus I got when I got my promotion.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_4", "I had an autographed ball from my favorite player in the league, and somebody took it!  If you can get it back for me I'll give you this collector's item ticket from last year's championships.  It's worth plenty.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_5", "I've been collecting memorabilia of the Dark Jedi.  I know a guy who has a Medallion that they used.  Get it for me and I'll give you these broken holocron pieces.  I've got tons of holocrons.  They're bound to be worth something.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_6", "My family has had this heirloom glass for many years, and now it's been stolen.  I can tell you where the thief is, but I need you to bring back my glass unharmed.  Can you do it?");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_7", "I've been a museum curator for many years, and on this planet we found the oldest tomb I've ever seen.  Unfortunately some grave robbers took the artifact I was studying.  If you would be so kind, perhaps you can get it back?");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_8", "I've been researching animals, but an industrial spy stole one of my cages.  It still had some cell structures in it from the creature.  I need it back before he figures out what's in it.  Can you help me?");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_1_9", "I was collecting signatures to get my name on the local ballot when one of my opponents sent a theif to steal my ledger.  If you can get that ledger back for me I'll write a proclamation declaring you a good citizen.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good.  Get back as soon as you can and I'll get you a shisa.  You can use it in your home as a decoration, or sell it, I don't care either way.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_10", "Ok.  Just let me know when you've got it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_11", "Great.  I've got just the thing for you.  Let me know when you're back.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_12", "I thought you looked like the man I wanted.  I'll reward you nicely for it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good.  As soon as you return I'll give you the decryptor.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Thank you...I'll be waiting anxiously for your return.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Great!  Hurry back.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_5", "You do the work, you get paid.  I'll be here.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_6", "You're a life saver.  I'll give you this hand woven basket for the glass when you return.  My servants made it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_7", "I thought so.  You look like a good man.  I'll make it worth your while.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_8", "Thanks.  I really appreciate it.  I'll find something to give you when you return.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_2_9", "Excellent.  Just let me know when you return, I'll have the paperwork drawn up.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Too bad.  I would have given you a nice gift.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_10", "I thought you were a tough one.  I guess not.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_11", "Well, you'll never be a criminal in this town.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_12", "Just like my servants.  No help at all.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Well, guess I'll have to find somebody else then.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Surely somebody will be able to help me.  Thanks for nothing, though.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_4", "That's too bad.  I'll find somebody useful.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_5", "Not much I can do about it I guess, if you're not good enough.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_6", "I thought you were a mercenary?  Perhaps you're just a librarian or some such...");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_7", "Well, certainly there are other artifacts.  Too bad, this one was really good...");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_8", "Great.  I'm wasting my time with you then.  Do you know anyone who DOES work?");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_3_9", "That's too bad.  I could have done you a lot of favors.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Here's that shisa I promised ya.  I'll just put it here in your pack.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_10", "Here you go.  This is a picture I took taking off from an undiscovered planet.  That picture is one of a kind.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_11", "Here you go.  I took this speaker from a cantina I robbed.  It'll go nicely in your house.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_12", "Here's a recording rod that I paid way too much for.  It's valuable but fragile.  Be careful with it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Here's the decryptor.  It doesn't work all the time, but I'm sure you'll find a use for it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Here you go.  It needs some ink, but you'll never have one better.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Here you go.  See I had good seats, and I didn't let them tear it.  You should be able to get something for it if you want.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "Here they are.  Careful, they have sharp edges.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "Careful with this thing.  It's well put together, but if you crush it it won't be worth as much.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_7", "Here you go, these bugs are very rare, and could be worth a lot if you can find a buyer.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_8", "Here you go.  I found this nice picture of the creature I was studying.  It's really all I have to give you though.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("npc_reward_9", "Here's your official proclamation.  It won't be valid unless I get elected, but hang onto it just in case.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_1", "Ok, I'll do it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_10", "Sure, I'll help you out.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_11", "I can do it.  No problem.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_12", "Sounds crazy but I'll do it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yeah, I can get that, no problem.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_3", "I'll be back before you know it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_4", "I'll be right back with your ball kid.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_5", "Yeah, I can do it.  ");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_6", "Yeah, I can get it.  I'll need some form of payment though.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_7", "Yeah, I can get it.  I hate graverobbers.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_8", "I'll get it back.  Industrial espionage is a terrible thing.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_1_9", "Sure, I'll get your ledger back.  I need friends in high places.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_1", "Sounds dangerous.  I don't think I'm up to it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_10", "I thought pilot's did their own work.  I'll be going.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_11", "Thieves should do their own dirty work.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_12", "Sounds ludicrous.  Count me out.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_2", "That's too much work.  I'm not doing it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_3", "There's no way.  I'm too tired right now.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_4", "Nah.  I don't care about sports.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_5", "Too much work for me.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_6", "Sounds ridiculous.  Why don't you just go buy a new glass?");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_7", "I don't care about artifacts.  Forget it.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_8", "Oh, my, I couldn't care less about you and your problem.");
stringFiles[975].addEntry("player_2_9", "No way.   I couldn't care less about politics.");

stringFiles[976] = new StringFile("npc_mission/static_scientist_deliver");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("cantwork", "I understand you're already working for someone else.  Come back when you're done with that job.");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("gotowork", "I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("not_it", "No, sorry, that's not the item I was looking for...");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I've been a museum curator for many years, and on this planet we found the oldest tomb I've ever seen.  Unfortunately some grave robbers took the artifact I was studying.  If you would be so kind, perhaps you can get it back?");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I've been researching animals, but an industrial spy stole one of my cages.  It still had some cell structures in it from the creature.  I need it back before he figures out what's in it.  Can you help me?");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I thought so.  You look like a good man.  I'll make it worth your while.");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Thanks.  I really appreciate it.  I'll find something to give you when you return.");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Well, certainly there are other artifacts.  Too bad, this one was really good...");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Great.  I'm wasting my time with you then.  Do you know anyone who DOES work?");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("npc_4_1", "It was an ancient ritual device of some sort.  I need to study it further to find out exactly what it was for.");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("npc_4_2", "That's highly classified.  That's why I need that evidence back before someone finds out what I was doing.  You don't have a problem with this do you?");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Here you go, these bugs are very rare, and could be worth a lot if you can find a buyer.");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Here you go.  I found this nice picture of the creature I was studying.  It's really all I have to give you though.");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yeah, I can get it.  I hate graverobbers.");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("player_1_2", "I'll get it back.  Industrial espionage is a terrible thing.");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("player_2_1", "I don't care about artifacts.  Forget it.");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("player_2_2", "Oh, my, I couldn't care less about you and your problem.");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("player_3_1", "What was the artifact?");
stringFiles[976].addEntry("player_3_2", "What kind of creatures were you studying?");

stringFiles[977] = new StringFile("npc_mission/static_scientist_destroy");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("cantwork", "I understand you're already working for someone else.  Come back when you're done with that job.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("gotowork", "I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("not_it", "No, sorry, that's not the item I was looking for...");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("npc_1_1", "There's an assassin on this planet who's been killing all the top scientists in the area.  I want him eliminated and I'm willing to pay well for it.  Can you do it?");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("npc_1_2", "One of our assistants has gone mad and is planning on releasing a toxin into the air that would kill all the plantlife on this planet.  He must be stopped.  I can tell you where he is if you can stop him.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I thought so.  You look like a good man.  I'll make it worth your while.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Thanks.  I really appreciate it.  I'll find something to give you when you return.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Well, certainly there are other artifacts.  Too bad, this one was really good...");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Great.  I'm wasting my time with you then.  Do you know anyone who DOES work?");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("npc_4_1", "No one knows.  He seems to have some sort of problem with the work that we do, but we don't know why.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("npc_4_2", "It's a highly classified agent that we were using to destroy poisonous plants, but he's modified it to kill all vegetable matter.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Here you go, these bugs are very rare, and could be worth a lot if you can find a buyer.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Here you go.  I found this nice picture of the creature I was studying.  It's really all I have to give you though.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("player_1_1", "I'm up for it.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("player_1_2", "I'll stop this guy before he gets started.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("player_2_1", "I don't care about scientists.  Forget it.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("player_2_2", "Oh, my, I couldn't care less about you and your problem.");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("player_3_1", "Why is he killing scientists?");
stringFiles[977].addEntry("player_3_2", "What is this toxin?");

stringFiles[978] = new StringFile("npc_mission/static_scientist_escort");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("cantwork", "I understand you're already working for someone else.  Come back when you're done with that job.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("dontknowyou", "I'm sorry, but I don't know who you are and I'm not going to follow you anywhere!");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("gotowork", "I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_1_1", "One of my colleagues has managed to get lost just outside of town.  It would be a great help to me if you could get my partner back to this location. Can you do that?");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_1_2", "One of my fellow scientists has damaged navigational equipment and needs someone to bring them back to me here.  Can you help us out?");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Thank you so much.  I'll make contact so there aren't any surprises.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Excellent.  I'll be waiting here, and when you've returned we'll make sure you get something for your efforts.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_3_1", "That's too bad.  Guess I'm on my own for now.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Too bad.  If you know anyone who can help send them my way.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Something's wrong with the datapad, and it can't seem to be used to navigate anymore.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_4_2", "To be honest, scientists can be rather clumsy.  I'm not really going to say anything more than that though.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Here you go, these bugs are very rare, and could be worth a lot if you can find a buyer.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Here you go.  I found this nice picture of the creature I was studying.  It's really all I have to give you though.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "Oh, you've arrived.  Ok, you lead the way back and I'll follow you.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "Ok, I'm ready to go.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("otherescort", "I don't think I'm the one you're looking for.  Perhaps you should be escorting someone else?");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("player_1_1", "Sure.  I'll bring your friend back.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("player_1_2", "Sure I'll find your friend.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("player_2_1", "No thanks.  I've got other things to do.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("player_2_2", "Oh, my, I couldn't care less about you and your problem.");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("player_3_1", "Why don't you upload your location to the datapad?");
stringFiles[978].addEntry("player_3_2", "How did the equipment break?");

