stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_1", "Move away from my worthy friend here, or suffer the consequences.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_10", "I see that I must stoop to violence now...");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_11", "My goodness! Are you alright?");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_12", "Kindly leave my friends alone.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_13", "Really, I do believe that a maggot such as yourself ought not to touch my friends.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_14", "Well, now. Really, it's just not done.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_15", "My friend, allow me to take care of this miscreant.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_16", "Allow me to intercede... merely to even the odds somewhat.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_2", "You shall not lay a finger on my friends!");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_3", "I advise you to withdraw immediately.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_4", "Well now, really! Withdraw!");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_5", "Now, just a moment there! What the blazes are you doing?");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_6", "If you dare to engage in violence, surely you dare to challenge me instead?");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_7", "I do believe you should select a more fitting opponent. Such as myself.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_8", "Are you in need of any assistance, my friend?");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("ally_9", "It appears that you could use my assistance.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_1", "I suggest you flee. Or die. Your choices really are quite limited.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_10", "Must we fight? It's so... common.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_11", "It is a good day to die, I suppose.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_12", "I imagine that if you began to flee now, I might feel disinclined to catch you.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_13", "Ah, I may appear helpless, but I have unsuspected depths.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_14", "Really, blood is SO messy. Must I kill you?");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_16", "I do hope that all the arrangements have been made for a tidy funeral?");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_2", "You are hardly the most daunting opponent I have faced.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_3", "Fights are SO inconvenient. Next time, I shall decline the invitation.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_4", "I do hope that you had not made plans for your dotage.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_5", "I suppose that a quiet death is bed is a quaint idea these days.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_6", "When you die, I shall treasure the memory of the moment as a high point in my life.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_7", "I do believe that your ancestors await you eagerly in the afterlife.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_8", "I shall be merciful. I make short work of my enemies.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("attacked_9", "I tremble in my boots at the sight of you... not.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("bye_mean_1", "I hope not to see your face again.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("bye_mean_10", "Goodness, finally you depart.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("bye_mean_11", "You overstayed your welcome, so I am glad to see you go.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("bye_mean_12", "You overstayed your welcome a bit, eh?");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("bye_mean_13", "I pray that you not return.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("bye_mean_14", "I hope that you don't meet with some untimely demise before we meet again.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("bye_mean_15", "I was about to suggest you depart, but you have saved me the trouble.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("bye_mean_16", "I do believe that the air has cleared up, now that we're free of that... malodorous entity.");
stringFiles[983].addEntry("bye_mean_2", "Good riddance to bad rubbish, I always say.");
