stringFiles[1035].addEntry("itemname", "Encrypted Datadisk");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_desperatehelpme", "I don't know where to go.  If they find me I'm dead.  You have to help me!");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_desperatehelpme_chat", "shout");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_desperatehelpme_mood", "panicked");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_greet", "They're after me.  Take this, please!");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_helpme", "Help me!  Please help me!");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_helpme_chat", "shout");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_helpme_mood", "panicked");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_pleasehelpme", "You must help me.  They'll find me soon.  Please help me...please...");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_pleasehelpme_chat", "beg");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_pleasehelpme_mood", "panicked");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("m_theycome", "Oh no, its too late!  Take it, run, go! GO!");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("r_m_greet_who", "Who are you? What is this? What must I do with it?");
stringFiles[1035].addEntry("systemmessage", "You received an Encrypted Datadisk!");

stringFiles[1036] = new StringFile("poi/prisonbreak/basic");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_angrylooklikefarmers", "Trouble?  When I get out of here, I'll show you trouble.  Get lost.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_angrynohelp", "If we get out, I'll hunt you down and make it your business.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_attackeveryone", "The wall is down!  Make them pay!  Kill everyone in the camp!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_attackwall", "Go go go!  Hit it hard!  Yes!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_attackwall_leader", "Now is our chance!  Wire up the explosives.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_couldusehelp", "Look, we could use your help with this.  Wanna help break us out?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_couldusehelp_horrible", "Yeah, you might be able to help out.  Sure you want to risk it?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_greet", "Who are you?  You don't look like a farmer.  Maybe you can help my brothers and I, falsely imprisoned as we are.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_idiots", "The idiot nearly killed us all, but the wall is down!  Attack!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_insulted", "You had better hope we don't break out or you'll die first.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_insulted_nohelp", "Soon you'll find out what happens to people who refuse me.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_keepitup", "Keep concentrating until the bomb is set!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_minion_1", "These idiot farmers think they can keep us caged up.  They don't know what we've got.  The smart thing for you to do is talk to the Captain and help us out.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_minion_2", "Just wait until I get out of here.  I'm going to seriously tear some hides!  I hear the Captain has a plan.  I'm ready.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_minion_3", "Nobody keeps me in a cage.  We gonna smash our way to freedom like a rancor on yarrock once the Captain gives us the word.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_minion_4", "You in with these damn farmers?  You better run before we get out or you'll be running on stumps.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_minion_attackedwhilebombing", "Agh! We've been found out! Just need a few more seconds...");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_minion_dropbomb", "Damn I dropped the bomb!  HIT THE DECK!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_minion_reportbomb", "The bomb is set to blow any moment.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_minion_setbomb", "Rigging this thing up will only take a few seconds.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_mystory", "My boys and I were out transporting goods when these so called farmers set upon us.  They killed two of my men and threw the rest of us in here.  Bloody massacre it was.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_please_distractguard", "Confident eh?  Alright then, maybe you can help us.  Listen up.  We gotta bomb that can bust us outta here.  Just need you to distract the guard for a bit.  Do that, an we'll take care ah the rest.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_title", "Captain");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_victory_1", "Those farmers never had a chance.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_victory_2", "Man what a fight.  We just wasted everyone.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_victory_3", "Nothing can hold us down for long.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("a_victory_4", "Did you see the way I nailed the one that tried to get away?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_abomb", "Hmm... Thank you for telling me.  I have an idea.  Go ahead and distract the guard...");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_approachchatter_1", "Lookin' fer a job?  Maybe the Farm Master eh let ya do guard duty.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_approachchatter_2", "I think those pirates are plannin' something.  I can smell it.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_approachchatter_3", "Mighty hot day.  Wish I could sit in a tent all day like the Farm Master.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_approachchatter_4", "Gonna take two weeks at least ta fix the damage these pirates did.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_busy", "Today twenty four people I don't know have wandered into my tent asking me if I have any work for them.  I don't.  Go away.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_cantmovethem", "I'm the authority on my land.  Maybe I'll put them to work fixing moisture collectors.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_checktheguard", "What is it with you people always wanting work?  I don't even know you.  Look, go check on the guard I posted.  Make sure everything is quiet and report back to me.  If you can do this without incident, maybe I'll think about giving you a job.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_didyoucheck", "Did you check on the guard yet?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_distractguard", "You know the plan.  Distract the guard then shoot the wall they are wiring up.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_excellent", "That guard usually has trouble with discipline, it's good to hear he's taking care of things.  I don't have anything else for you to do, though.  So kindly remove yourself from my tent.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_greet", "I'm pretty busy at the moment.  Normally I'd just have thirty thousand things to do.  Today I have thirty thousand and one.  Could you come back later?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_guard_allsquiet", "The prisoners are quiet.  Everything is pretty serene.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_guard_needtopee", "Hey, before you go.  I really need to, ah, relieve myself.  Do you think you could watch my post for a bit?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_guard_pee_badidea", "Okay, but I don't think I can hold it for very long.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_guard_pee_goodidea", "Great, thanks, I'll be right back!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_guard_title", "Guard");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_majorvictory", "You stopped the pirates plan, we are in your debt.  Please bear this token as a symbol of your honorable act.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_1", "I'm busy going through an equipment manifest.  Talk to the Farm Master...he might be able to use you.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_2", "I really don't have time to talk, but the Farm Master might.  He make us do all the work around here.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_3", "The boss is in the tent.  If you need something, take it up with him.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_4", "We're pretty busy out here dealing with the prisoners.  If you need something, take it up with the boss in the tent.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_gopee", "I can't hold it any longer!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_guard_1", "Guard duty is boring.  I'd rather be working on equipment.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_guard_2", "I can't talk right now, I'm guarding these prisoners.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_guard_3", "I'm busy with guard duty.  Why don't you go talk to the Farm Master?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_guard_4", "Don't distract me.  I have to watch these prisoners.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_guard_peeing", "I'm sorta busy.  Could you come back later?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_leaderdead", "My master is dead.  Where will I go now?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_majorfailure_1", "You let the pirates escape and the Farm Master is dead!  Is there any more chaos for you to cause?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_majorfailure_2", "The pirates are dead, but the farm master was killed in the battle.  Why didn't you try to stop the pirates plan?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_majorvictory_1", "You saved us!  If you hadn't interrupted the pirate bomber, we might all be dead!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_majorvictory_2", "What heroism!  You stopped the pirates from escaping and saved us.  Thank you.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_minorfailure_1", "You stopped the pirate's plan, but the farm master is dead.  What will we do now?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_minorfailure_2", "The farm master died in the battle.  Leave us alone.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_minorvictory_1", "The pirates nearly escaped, but we stopped them.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_minorvictory_2", "That was close.  If only we had known about the pirate's plan.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minion_wesurvived", "Our prisoners rebelled but we survived due to the help of a stranger!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_minorvictory", "That was close, but at least the pirates are dead.  How did they smuggle an explosive into the containment pen?  No matter.  We thank you for your assistance.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_nobreak", "It's good to hear everything is quiet, but I can't let that guard have a break.  Those pirates would probably try something while he's gone.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_nokillthem", "That's too harsh.  They didn't kill anyone.  Look, this isn't open for discussion.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_soontheypay", "After this, the prisoners won't try to escape again.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_tellprisoners", "A load of pirates we caught destroying one of our outlying moisture collectors.  We're trying to figure out what to do with them.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_theplan", "When you distract the guard, they'll think they are free to make an attempt.  When they start to wire the bomb, fire on the wall they are wiring up.  It should surprise them...they'll know we are on to them and give up.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_title", "Farm Master");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_underattack_1", "We're under attack!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_underattack_2", "The prisoners are escaping!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_underattack_3", "What the hell is going on?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_underattack_4", "Stop the prisoners!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_whatbreak", "YOU WHAT?  What are you doing here?  The prisoners are unguarded!  Go keep watch you fool!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_whatbreakout", "A breakout?  How?  I don't see how they would succeed.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("m_yeahyoudothat", "How difficult is it to follow simple instructions?  Do I need a protocol droid?  Do I need to write it down so that you don't forget?  Go check the guard!");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_anywork", "I'm sure you can handle it.  Have any work I can do?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_couldusehelp_nohelp", "Uh, nevermind.  This isn't any of my business.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_couldusehelp_yeshelp", "It's nothing I can't handle.  What do you need?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_distractanyway", "What? Why would you want me to help them with their plan?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_gotellmaster", "Great.  I'll go tell the Farm Master.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_greet_tellstory", "Falsely? Who imprisoned you and why?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_heneedsabreak", "Everything is quiet, but your guard needs a break.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_hesdoingfine", "He's doing fine.  Everything is quiet.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_hesonbreak", "Everything is pretty quiet, so I told the guard to take a break.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_mystory_howhorrible", "Sorry to hear you lost people.  You were lucky to have not lost your own life.  Is there anything I can do to help?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_mystory_looklikefarmers", "Nice story, but I don't think I believe you.  They look like farmers to me and you look like trouble.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_m_greet_whatprisoners", "Sorry to bother, but I'd like to know who you have locked up in that containment grid.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_noillcheck", "No, I haven't checked on him yet.  I'll go do that now.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_pee_badidea", "That doesn't sound like a good idea.  You shouldn't leave your post.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_pee_goodidea", "Sure, no problem.  Hurry back.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_prisonershavebomb", "They have some kind of detonator.  They are going to wire the wall when I distract the guards.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_prisonersplanning", "The prisoners are planning a breakout.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_toldtocheckyou", "The Farm Master asked me to check up on you.  Everything okay out here?");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_tp_bettermovethem", "Turn them over to the authorities.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_tp_whynotkillthem", "Why not just execute them?  Set them free and they'll just attack again.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("r_whatshappening", "How is guard duty going?  Seems pretty quiet.");
stringFiles[1036].addEntry("weakened_wall_name", "Weakened Wall");

stringFiles[1037] = new StringFile("poi/rabidbeast/basic");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_chatter_1", "My work here is very serious.  We need to know more about the life on this planet.");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_chatter_2", "If only the head academician would approve my request for a larger grant.");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_chatter_3", "I wonder what the ecosocial implications of biodiverse herd behavior are?");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_chatter_4", "Weren't you supposed to be in the test chamber half an hour ago?  Oh...I'm sorry, I thought you were someone else.");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_greet", "Great Scott!  You came just in time!  *Gasp*  I'm so relieved!");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_help_1", "Help!  Save me from this thing!");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_help_2", "I'm too intelligent to die!  Help me!");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_hereitcomes_help", "Just in time too.  The creatures are returning!  HELP!");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_hereitcomes_nohelp", "You won't help?  Most perturbatory.  Gah!  The beast returns!  HELP!");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_ididallthework", "I survived!  Quite excellent.  It seems to me, however, that I did all the work in dispatching the things.  I'm sorry, but I cannot reward you for you seemed rather...ineffective.");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_studying", "Oh, I apologize!  I forgot to tell you who I am!  I am an Imperial research scientist studying the fauna in this area.  Most interesting creatures, indeed.");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_thanks", "Thank you for your assistance.  I am truly in your debt.  I do not have sufficient funding to reward you, but please, bear my mark as a symbol of your deed.");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_thebeast", "AH!  I almost forgot!  I angered one of the nastier species of creature I have been studying and it attacked me!  It nearly killed me before I managed to drive it away.  Its only a matter of time before it comes back to finish the job.  Who knows, it might even bring its pack!");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("m_wesurvived", "Excelsior!  I am saved!");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("r_m_greet", "Why? What's wrong?");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("r_m_studying", "Yes, but why were you panicking just a moment ago?");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("r_m_thebeast_help", "I can help you defend yourself from the creature.");
stringFiles[1037].addEntry("r_m_thebeast_nohelp", "I don't have any interest in biological research, Imperial or otherwise.  I'm afraid you are on your own.");

stringFiles[1038] = new StringFile("poi/twoliars/basic");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_chatter_1", "I'm glad I was able to find my mark.  Now I can go get another job.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_chatter_2", "This job is tough.  Tracking criminals across wilderness for a meager reward.  Sometimes I wonder why I do it.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_clues", "The guy I'm looking for stole some equipment.  Nobody knows what he looks like, but some of the equipment had a transponder signal.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_goahead", "You think I'm stupid don't you?  I can do this myself.  But...uhm...well...if you want to try go ahead.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_greatwho", "You have?  Explain to me how you figured it out and if it makes sense, I'll make the arrest.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_greet", "Uhm.  Hey...uh, do you know any of these guys?");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_imnotdumb", "Hey now, I'm not stupid!  A little while after I caught up with the signal, it went dead.  He must have found it and turned it off.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_keeplooking", "Go ahead, but I doubt you'll turn anything up.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_lookingformark", "One of them is my mark.  I think.  I'm not sure.  I've been tracking him for some time and just now caught up with him in this smuggler camp.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_notrust", "You again?  Look, you aren't going to get another shot at this.  I'll solve the problem myself.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_questioned", "Uhm...questioned them.  Ah.  Yeah I did that.  Yeahup.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_questioned2", "Well...I'm really confused.  I know the smuggler captain.  I trust him.  The other smugglers blame each other and I don't know what to do.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_rightanswer", "(The bounty hunter listens to your explanation.)  I see!  It makes sense!  I'm going to act on your recommendation and make the arrest.  I don't have much to reward you with, but please take this.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_thanks", "Thank you for helping me find my mark.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_thatstheproblem", "Arrest him.  Yeah, well...uhm...that's the problem.  I don't know which one he is.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_whoisit", "Did you figure out who my mark is?");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("a_wronganswer", "(The bounty hunter listens to your explanation.)  No...that still doesn't make any sense to me.  I don't think your answer is correct.  I appreciate your help, but I don't think you can solve this puzzle.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_busy_0", "I am quite busy, could you come back later?");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_busy_1", "I wonder how long until that bounty hunter gives up or arrests us all?");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_busy_2", "Look, I really need to think about my next job.  Could you give me some space?");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_chatter_0", "Welcome to my camp.  Unfortunately, I'd rather not take on any more assignments with a bounty hunter snooping about.  Maybe some other time.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_chatter_1", "Business is good!  I just moved twice my normal load of wares this week.  Now if that bounty hunter would get lost I'd be a happy man.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_chatter_2", "Until that bounty hunter moves on, I won't be able to inspect this new shipment.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_chatter_3", "The Empire has been pretty busy with the rebellion lately.  Makes it easy to slip past with extra goods.  I would think they sent that bounty hunter to investigate, but he doesn't seem very smart.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_chatter_4", "I love my job.  The thrill of a light cruiser pushing past a blockade at full speed!  You never feel that way down here on the surface.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_chatter_5", "I've got a flight path to plan, but that idiot of a bounty hunter keeps interrupting me with questions.  Kinda like you.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_chatter_v_0", "Now I can finally get back to my business.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_chatter_v_1", "I love my job.  The thrill of a light cruiser pushing past a blockade at full speed!  You never feel that way down here on the surface.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_chatter_v_2", "Smuggling has been tough with the Empire's recent crackdown.  The rebels hurt them bad and now everyone's feeling the effects.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_criminal", "You turned me in!  How did you figure out I was the thief?  Did my friends rat me out?");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("m_title", "Smuggler Captain");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_implicate_0", "1. %TO");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_implicate_1", "2. %TO");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_implicate_2", "3. %TO");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_implicate_3", "4. %TO");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_implicate_4", "5. %TO");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_implicate_5", "6. %TO");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_m_line_0", "I don't see how I can help you, other than this piece of advice.  I know the smugglers in this camp fairly well.  Two of them always lie.  You can only trust the other four.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_m_line_1", "Neither %TO nor I have anything to do with this, leave us alone.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_m_line_2", "I know for a fact that the bounty hunter is looking for %TT or %TO.  They are both considered scum, even among smugglers.  I wouldn't be surprised if one of them stooped to petty thievery.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_m_line_3", "Don't trust %TT and %TO, both of them are lying.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_m_line_4", "%TT isn't telling the truth: either %TO or %TU is lying, the other is not.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("prose_m_line_5", "What %TO said is a lie.  I've been cheated by that that poor excuse for a smuggler enough times to know.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("r_a_clues", "So arrest the smuggler with the transponder!");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("r_a_greet", "No, I've never seen any of them before.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("r_a_imnotdumb", "Have you questioned the occupants of the camp?");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("r_a_ithinkso", "I think I've figured it out.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("r_a_lookingformark", "So why don't you arrest him?");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("r_a_questioned", "And???");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("r_a_questioned2", "Let me question the smugglers.  Maybe I can figure out who your mark is.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("r_a_thatstheproblem", "If you've been tracking him how can you not know which one he is?");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("r_a_whoisit", "No, I'll keep looking.");
stringFiles[1038].addEntry("r_m_chatter_knowabouttheft", "Do you know anything about the theft the bounty hunter is investigating?");

