stringFiles[1046].addEntry("rating_floor_trandoshan_winner", "Although you have honorably defeated your foe %TT, The Scorekeeper can award you no Jagannath points for this victory as your opponent can be disgraced no further.  Your player combat rating remains at %DI.");
