stringFiles[1046].addEntry("rating_throttle_trandoshan_winner", "Although you once again bathe yourself in the demise of %TT, The Scorekeeper will not award Jagannath points to you again so soon for their death.  A true warrior must diversify %PU prey.  Your player combat rating reamins at %DI.");
