stringFiles[1053].addEntry("detail_02", "An overwhelming force of mercinaries and criminals are assaulting the village of Aurilia. The villagers are grossly outnumbered. You are tasked with defeating at least twenty-five of the leuitenants leading Mellichae's hired thugs.");
