stringFiles[1092] = new StringFile("quest/hero_of_tatooine/intellect_liar");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bh_lose", "No, no. That can't be right, it doesn't make sense at all. I guess I'll just have to figure it out myself.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bh_win", "You're right, that does make sense. Thanks for your help, I'll take care of it from here.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_0", "Good-bye.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_1", "'Bye.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_10", "So, you believe me, right?");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_11", "Fine.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_2", "Get lost.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_3", "Whatever.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_4", "Go on, get out of here, twerp.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_5", "Stop wasting my time.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_6", "Am I free to go?");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_7", "Go tell that bounty hunter that I'm not the one she's looking for, eh?");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_8", "So long.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("bye_9", "Remember, I didn't do it.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_0", "I don't know anything about the stolen equipment.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_1", "I don't know nothin' about no stolen equipment.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_10", "Geez, you're as bad as that bounty hunter. I don't know anything, alright?");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_11", "Nothing. Can I go now?");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_2", "Look, what I do might not be legal, but I don't steal.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_3", "I'll tell you what I told that bounty hunter. I didn't steal anything.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_4", "Don't you two have anything better to do than hound me with questions? Get off my back.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_5", "Nothing. Nothing at all.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_6", "I know I didn't steal it. That's about it.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_7", "For all we know, maybe YOU stole it.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_8", "Stop asking pointless questions.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("equipment_9", "Why are you harassing me? Go find the person that actually stole the stuff!");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_0", "I came to this town to take on a big assignment, but I can't do anything now with that bounty hunter hanging around.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_1", "Business is good!  I just moved twice my normal load this week.  Now if that bounty hunter would get lost I could get back to work.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_10", "Curse the luck. I've got a package coming in today, but that bounty hunter won't let me leave.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_11", "I just want to get back to work. I'm tired of answering questions.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_2", "Until this bounty hunter moves on, I won't be able to inspect that new shipment I just received.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_3", "The Empire has been pretty busy with the Rebellion lately.  Makes it easy to slip past with extra goods.  I would think they sent that bounty hunter to investigate, but she doesn't seem very smart.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_4", "I love my job.  The thrill of a light cruiser pushing past a blockade at full speed!  You never feel that way down here on the surface.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_5", "I've got a flight path to plan, but that idiot of a bounty hunter keeps interrupting me with questions.  Kinda like you.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_6", "Smuggling has been tough with the Empire's recent crackdown.  The rebels hurt them bad and now everyone's feeling the effects.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_7", "I wonder how long until that bounty hunter gives up or just kills us all?");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_8", "Look, I really need to think about my next job.  What is it that you want?");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("greeting_9", "What is it? I'm very very busy.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_0_0", "I don't really know what I can tell you, other than this piece of advice.  I know the smugglers in this town fairly well.  Two of them always lie.  You can only trust the other three.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_0_1", "There's really not much that I can tell you. I know most of these smugglers pretty well though. Two of them are compulsive liars. The others are pretty trusworthy.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_0_2", "Yea, I know most of these rogues pretty well. Three of them are pretty honest. The other two are down right dirty liars, I wouldn't trust a word they say.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_1_0", "Neither %TO nor I have anything to do with this, leave us alone.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_1_1", "I'm innocent I tell you, and so is %TO. Now leave us be.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_1_2", "Both %TO and I have nothing to do with all this. That's all I can say.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_2_0", "I know for a fact that the bounty hunter is looking for %TT or %TO.  They are both considered scum, even among smugglers.  I wouldn't be surprised if one of them stooped to petty thievery.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_2_1", "I'm almost positive that either %TT or %TO is the culprit. I've heard of them getting caught up in situtations like this before.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_2_2", "I'll tell you what. I've been around and I hear things. And I'm sure it's either %TT or %TO that the bounty hunter is looking for.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_3_0", "Don't trust %TT and %TO, both of them are lying.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_3_1", "I overheard %TT and %TO talking earlier. They are both liars, don't trust either of them.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_3_2", "I know that %TT and %TO are both liars. Don't listen to a word they say.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_4_0", "%TT isn't telling the truth; either %TO or %TU is lying, the other is not.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_4_1", "I know for a fact that %TT is a liar. And I know that either %TO or %TU is lying, but the other isn't.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_4_2", "Both %TO and %TU are kind of shady, but only one is a liar, the other isn't. And we all know that %TT is definately a liar.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_5_0", "Whatever %TO said is a lie.  I've been cheated by that that poor excuse for a smuggler enough times to know.");
stringFiles[1092].addEntry("others_5_1", "That %TO is a filthy liar. Everyone here knows it.");
