stringFiles[1103] = new StringFile("quest/quest_journal/fs_quests_craft1");
stringFiles[1103].addEntry("d_00", "The sensor array in the village of Aurilia has been damaged. It must be repaired!");
stringFiles[1103].addEntry("d_01", "You must find the village sensor array and determine the extent of the damage. If there are any non-functional components, you should remove them so new ones can be replaced.");
stringFiles[1103].addEntry("d_02", "Remove any damaged components from the sensor array.You must find the chief engineer's tools and use them to craft and calibrate new components. Remember that new components must be calibrated correctly before they can be installed into the sensor array.");
stringFiles[1103].addEntry("d_03", "Use the Recursive Analyzer to deconstruct damaged components into a draft schematic, and craft new components. Those draft schematics are limited use, but if you need another after you use one, you can load it from the Analyzer memory.Once you have a new component, you will need to calibrate it using the Multi-phase calibrator. Be careful though, the calibration process has a detrimental effect on component integrity. Once you have correctly calibrated all of the new components, you must replace them into the sensor array to bring it back online.");
stringFiles[1103].addEntry("d_04", "QUEST COMPLETE: You have successfully brought the village sensor array back online. As agreed, Quharek has opened your mind to the possibility of using the Force to enhance your assembly skills.");
stringFiles[1103].addEntry("s_00", "Repair the sensor array.");
stringFiles[1103].addEntry("s_01", "Find and examine the sensor array.");
stringFiles[1103].addEntry("s_02", "Find the chief engineer's workstation.");
stringFiles[1103].addEntry("s_03", "Calibrate and replace components.");
stringFiles[1103].addEntry("s_04", "QUEST COMPLETE");

stringFiles[1104] = new StringFile("quest/quest_journal/fs_quests_reflex1");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("d_00", "Several villagers are missing from Aurilia. They must be found!");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("d_01", "Citizens of the village of Aurilia are feared to have been captured by the Sith Shadows. Village trackers have found a trail that should probably lead to the vicinity of a Shadows encampment. Find the encampment and any imprisoned villagers.");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("d_02", "A villager has been captured by the Sith Shadows! Speak with the prisoner and he or she will likely follow you back to the village. Be careful, if the enemy spots you, they will likely attack.");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("d_03", "The rescued villager must make it back to the village alive.");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("d_04", "Both you and the rescued villager must return to the village of Aurilia safely.");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("d_05", "QUEST COMPLETE: You have successfully rescued the villagers that were taken prisoner from the village of Aurilia. As agreed, Whip has opened your mind to the possibilities of using the Force to enhance your survival skills.");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("s_00", "Rescue missing villagers.");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("s_01", "Find a Sith Shadows encampment.");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("s_02", "Speak with the imprisoned villager.");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("s_03", "Keep the villager alive.");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("s_04", "Return to the village of Aurilia.");
stringFiles[1104].addEntry("s_05", "QUEST COMPLETE");

stringFiles[1105] = new StringFile("quest/quest_journal/fs_quests_reflex2");
stringFiles[1105].addEntry("d_00", "Supply transports have been attacked. The supplies must be brought to the village of Aurilia!");
stringFiles[1105].addEntry("d_01", "The emergency beacon indicates the area where the transport was attacked. Find that location and the transport should be nearby.");
stringFiles[1105].addEntry("d_02", "It looks like there is a crate of supplies that has not yet been stolen, and can still be salvaged from the wreckage. You must get that crate! Be careful though, if the enemy spots you, they will likely attack.");
stringFiles[1105].addEntry("d_03", "The crate of supplies must be returned safely to the village of Aurilia. You must return the crate before it is stolen or damaged.");
stringFiles[1105].addEntry("d_04", "QUEST COMPLETE: You have successfully retrieved the much needed supplies for the village of Aurilia. As agreed, Whip has opened your mind to the possibilities of using the Force to enhance your vehicle control skills.");
stringFiles[1105].addEntry("s_00", "Retrieve supply crates.");
stringFiles[1105].addEntry("s_01", "Find the transport crash site.");
stringFiles[1105].addEntry("s_02", "Pick up the box of supplies.");
stringFiles[1105].addEntry("s_03", "Take the supplies back to the village.");
stringFiles[1105].addEntry("s_04", "QUEST COMPLETE");

stringFiles[1106] = new StringFile("quest/quest_journal/fs_quests_sad");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("finish_detail", "You have completed your work for Dageerin and unlocked the ability to use the melee speed skill.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("finish_summary", "Completed Quest - Unlocked Skill Combat Prowess: Melee Speed");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("instructions_text", "Hit Use to display a window showing the threat level of the enemies.  As you get closer to the tracking device (and thus the enemy), the radiation counter will go up.  If you move away, it goes down. The device will let you know if you're getting closer to the enemy or moving away from it.  The display will also indicate when you are within 64 meters of your target.Keep the window up as you move, but look out for the enemy!");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("instructions_title", "Instructions");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("main", "Search And Destroy");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("main_detail", "A variety of Shadow bases have been spotted in the surrounding countryside.  We suspect they are marshalling their forces for some sort of large-scale raid unlike anything we've seen.  If they were to strike now, we would be horribly unprepared.  We must convince them that we are much stronger than we, in fact, are.  Village agents are scouring the countryside as we speak looking for likely targets for dynamic raids.  We can use your help.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return1", "Search And Destroy 1/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return1_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return2", "Search And Destroy 2/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return2_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return3", "Search And Destroy 3/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return3_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return4", "Search And Destroy 4/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return4_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return5", "Search And Destroy 5/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return5_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return6", "Search And Destroy 6/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return6_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return7", "Search And Destroy 7/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return7_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return8", "Search And Destroy 8/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("return8_detail", "Return to the NPC.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task1", "Search And Destroy 1/8");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task1_detail", "We've spotted a number of enemy patrols in the area and could use your help.  We know they're building their strength for a coming attack, and we'd like to strike while the iron is hot, so to speak.  Can you help us?Note: Dageerin said to use the rradiation sensor, found in your datapad, to track the tracking device planted on them.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task2", "Search And Destroy 2/8");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task2_detail", "You did us a great service with your last raid on the enemy, but there are more out there.  Can you help us again?");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task3", "Search And Destroy 3/8");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task3_detail", "I think your attacks are beginning to get their attention.  I'd watch your back.  Here's your next target, if you're up for it...");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task4", "Search And Destroy 4/8");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task4_detail", "They've started moving their bases around in response to our attacks.  We've tracked them into a new area that we'd like to investigate.Note: Dageerin said to use the radiation sensor, found in your datapad, to track the tracking device planted on them.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task5", "Search And Destroy 5/8");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task5_detail", "Unfortunately, one of our field soldiers was caught and killed.  But he managed to get us a message with the coordinates of an enemy base.  Can you avenge him for us?Note: Dageerin said to use the radiation sensor, found in your datapad, to track the tracking device planted on them.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task6", "Search And Destroy 6/8");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task6_detail", "We may have turned the corner on this thing.  It feels great to finally take the battle to our enemy instead of waiting for them to attack.  Ready for another one?");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task7", "Search And Destroy 7/8");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task7_detail", "All of the reports coming in are promising - we definitely have them on the run now.  I think we're getting to their more elite troops - please be careful.Note: Dageerin said to use the radiation sensor, found in your datapad, to track the tracking device planted on them.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task8", "Search And Destroy 8/8");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("task8_detail", "Exciting news!  We've finally tracked down one of their high-ranking officers.  Our efforts have flushed her out, and our agent caught a glimpse of her just a while back.  I think...well, better not say anything.  Be careful - a cornered rat fights hard.");
stringFiles[1106].addEntry("wrong_phase", "You did not complete your existing quest (Search and Destroy) in time.  You must restart that quest.");

stringFiles[1107] = new StringFile("quest/quest_journal/fs_quests_sad2");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("finish_detail", "You have completed your work for Dageerin and unlocked the ability to use the ranged defense skill.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("finish_summary", "Completed Quest - Unlocked Skill Enhanced Reflexes: Ranged Defense");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("main", "Search And Destroy II");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("main_detail", "We're taking the fight to the enemy while we prepare our invincible shield defense.  Because of the preparations, and the scale of the conflict, our normal militia is overworked.  We're recruiting auxiliaries to be frontline combat troops.  We know the location of a number of Shadow bases that we want taken out to keep them on the run.  ");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return1", "Search And Destroy II 1/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return1_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return2", "Search And Destroy II 2/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return2_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return3", "Search And Destroy II 3/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return3_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return4", "Search And Destroy II 4/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return4_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return5", "Search And Destroy II 5/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return5_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return6", "Search And Destroy II 6/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return6_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return7", "Search And Destroy II 7/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return7_detail", "Return to Dageerin, in the village.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return8", "Search And Destroy II 8/8 - Return to village");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("return8_detail", "Return to the NPC.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task1", "Search And Destroy II 1/8");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task1_detail", "Our militia uses a small tracking device called a radiation sensor to track the enemy out in the field. I'm going to give you a control device that can sit in your datapad.  Activate it to get a reading.  As the reading goes up, you're getting close to the target.  Based on the strength of the readings, I think the nearest Shadow base is about 1000 meters from here.  Good luck, soldier.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task2", "Search And Destroy II 2/8");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task2_detail", "Someone is feeding them troops and materiel, but we don't know who.  We've located a base that's supplying a large area outside the village.  Can you track it down and destroy it for us?");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task3", "Search And Destroy II 3/8");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task3_detail", "We'll bring this Shadow out into the open if it's the last thing we do.  I'm redoubling our patrols, which places great strain on the auxiliares.  Think you can handle it?Note: Dageerin said to use the radiation sensor, found in your datapad, to track the tracking device planted on them.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task4", "Search And Destroy II 4/8");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task4_detail", "They've started moving their bases around in response to our attacks.  With the help of the Force, I hope we can find their new camps quickly.  Can you help?Note: Dageerin said to use the radiation sensor, found in your datapad, to track the tracking device planted on them.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task5", "Search And Destroy II 5/8");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task5_detail", "We may have turned the corner on this thing.  It feel great to finally take the battle to our enemy instead of waiting for them to attack.  Ready for another one?Note: Dageerin said to use the radiation sensor, found in your datapad, to track the tracking device planted on them.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task6", "Search And Destroy II 6/8");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task6_detail", "Our spies have netted us another camp.  But you'll have to act quickly.  They look like they're ready to move.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task7", "Search And Destroy II 7/8");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task7_detail", "All of the reports coming in are promising - we definitely have them on the run now. I think we're getting to their more elite troops - please be careful.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task8", "Search And Destroy II 8/8");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("task8_detail", "All right, we're getting somewhere, finally.  Reports are coming in that a high-ranking officer of the Shadow is holed up nearby.  Take him out, now.Note: Dageerin said to use the radiation sensor, found in your datapad, to track the tracking device planted on them.");
stringFiles[1107].addEntry("wrong_phase", "You did not complete your existing quest (Search and Destroy) in time.  You must restart that quest.");

