stringFiles[1119].addEntry("npc_reward_9", "Here's that shisa I promised ya.  I'll just put it here in your pack.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "Excellent.  If this goes well I'll make sure to mail you a little something extra.  Heh heh.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "That's great.  Now we just need to find some film...");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("npc_smuggle_7", "Oh, my, um, cousin, yeah.  That's great work.  Thanks a lot.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("npc_smuggle_8", "Oh, good, the key.  Yeah, we need that.  I'm not saying why.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "Finally.  I was about to give up and try finding my way in on my own.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "You're here to take me back?  Don't worry about the money.  I hid it.  It's not on me anymore.  Just get me to my friend.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "Great!  I need you to take me to my new boss.  I don't even know who it is yet.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "Quick, let's get back before the imperials start looking around for me again.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("otherescort", "I think you're here to take someone else back.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("player_1_1", "Ok, I'll do it.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("player_1_10", "Yeah, I can get that, no problem.");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("player_1_11", "Yeah, I can do it.  ");
stringFiles[1119].addEntry("player_1_12", "I can do it.  No problem.");
