stringFiles[1146].addEntry("crafting_artisan_survey_04", "Each level of surveying increases the yield per sample, the chance to succeed at sampling, and the range the Artisan can survey.");
stringFiles[1146].addEntry("crafting_artisan_weapons_01", "Intermediate weapons crafting begins to teach the artisan the first few lessons to become a weaponsmith. The artisan is never capable of building spectacular weapons, but even just a few simple ones are almost always adequate.");
stringFiles[1146].addEntry("crafting_artisan_weapons_02", "Advanced Weapons Crafting continues the Artisan's training in the ways of the Weaponsmith.");
