stringFiles[1146].addEntry("crafting_chef_drink_04", "Drink skills cover the creation of a large range of alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks.  The drink skills introduce four types of alcohol stock that can be mixed with other recipes to enhance their power.");
stringFiles[1146].addEntry("crafting_chef_master", "The Master Chef can create the most delicious (and beneficial) foods available.");
stringFiles[1146].addEntry("crafting_chef_novice", "The Chef learns to make exquisite foods, which can bring temporary and valuable statistic enhancement for other professions.");
stringFiles[1146].addEntry("crafting_chef_techniques_01", "The cooking skills include the development of the cooking assembly and experimentation skill mods.");
