stringFiles[1146].addEntry("crafting_merchant", "A Merchant is skilled at advertising and selling wares through vendors.  At the Novice Merchant skill level, the player earns the ability to place a NPC vendor of a random playable race.  The Merchant also has the ability to place control vendors one at a time.");
stringFiles[1146].addEntry("crafting_merchant_advertising_01", "Merchants who learn how to give their vendors vocalization training can assign their vendor a greeting to say when a customer approaches.  This option appears under the Vendor Control menu.");
