stringFiles[1150].addEntry("terminal_1", "The reward subsystem is partially rerouted.  A little bit more work and you should be able to convince this thing to give you a higher payout.");
stringFiles[1150].addEntry("terminal_analyze_0", "You carefully integrate the analyzer node into the reward subsystem.  After a few seconds, a scratchy electronic voice in the node says 'Analysis Complete: High probability of positive power flow to subsystem regulator.'");
