stringFiles[1150].addEntry("weapon_0", "You have managed to strengthen the substructure of the weapon and remove excess weight.  You will need to modify the weapon's stabilizer systems in order for it to function properly.  The core systems seem to be protected by a simple Imperial-spec anti-tampering device.  Working carefully, you begin to disable the device.");
stringFiles[1150].addEntry("weapon_1", "You've managed to disable part of the anti-tampering device.  The designer of this weapon tried to be tricky, but he wasn't good enough.  Removing the second flow regulator cable should give you access to the stabilization systems.");
stringFiles[1150].addEntry("weapon_analyze_0", "You carefully integrate the analyzer node into the anti-tampering system.  After a few seconds, a scratchy electronic voice in the node says 'Analysis Complete: High probability of positive power flow to anti-tampering device.'");
