stringFiles[1151].addEntry("twistarm", "twistarm~~~~OK. OK. Twist my arm.~~%TU concedes to the arm twisting.~~Twist it just a bit more!~~%TU is about to give in! Twist %PU arm just a bit more!~~You twist %PT arm.~~~~~~~~%TU twists %TT's arm.~~~~~~~~%TU twists your arm.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("twitch", "twitchtwitchtwitchtwitch~You twitch.~~%TU twitches.~~You twitch nervously.~~%TU twitches nervously.~~You twitch at %PT comments.~~~~~~~~%TU twitches at %TT's comments.~~~~~~~~%TU twitches at your comments.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("uncle", "uncle~~~~UNCLE!! UNCLE!!~~%TU begs for mercy. UNCLE!!~~Say Uncle! Say Uncle!~~%TU offers mercy. Just say Uncle.~~You beg %OT to stop. UNCLE!~~~~~~~~%TU begs %TT to stop. UNCLE!~~~~~~~~UNCLE! %TU begs you to stop.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("up", "uppoint_uppoint_uppoint_up~You point up.~~%TU points up.~~You point up.~~%TU points up.~~You turn to %TT and point up.~~~~~~~~%TU turns to %TT and points up. ~ ~~~~~~~%TU turns to you and points up.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("veto", "veto~~~~VETO!~~%TU vetoes that!~~You veto your own idea.~~%TU vetoes %PU own idea.~~You veto %OT.~~~~~~~~%TU vetoes %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU vetoes you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("waft", "waftwaftwaftwaft~You try to waft the stench away.~~%TU tries to waft the stench away.~~Taking a bath might help!~~%TU tries to waft %PU own funk away.~~You try to keep %PT stench away.~~~~~~~~%TU wafts the air, trying to avoid %TT's odor.~~~~~~~~%TU wafts the air, trying to keep your odor away.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("wait", "wait~~~~You wait.~~%TU waits.~~WAIT UP!~~WAIT UP! %TU is almost good to go.~~You wait on %OT.~~~~~~~~%TU is waiting on %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU is waiting on you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("ward", "ward~~taunt2~STAY AWAY!~~%TU makes warding signs at everyone.~~Superstitious? You rub a charm to ward off misfortune.~~%TU rubs a charm to ward off misfortune.~~You make warding signs at %OT.~~~~~~~~%TU makes warding signs at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU makes warding signs at you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("wave", "wavewave2wave_hailwave2~You wave.~~%TU waves.~~You wave to yourself.~~%TU waves to %OUself.~~You wave to %OT.~~~~~~~~%TU waves to %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU waves to you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("welcome", "welcomewave2~wave2~WELCOME ALL!~~%TU welcomes everyone.~~You welcome yourself.~~%TU welcomes %OUself.~~Welcome, %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU welcomes %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU welcomes you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("whap", "whap~smack_self~~You whap everyone.~~%TU whaps everyone.~~You whap yourself repeatedly.~~%TU whaps %OUself repeatedly.~~You whap %OT upside the head.~~~~~~~~%TU whaps %TT upside the head.~~~~~~~~%TU whaps you upside the head.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("whatthe", "whatthewtfwtfwtf~What the??~~%TU wonders what is going on!?~~What were you thinking??~~%TU doesn't know what is happening.  Can someone explain it?.~~You wonder what %OT was thinking.~~~~~~~~%TU wonders what %TT was thinking.~~~~~~~~%TU wonders what you were thinking.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("whimper", "whimper~~~~You whimper.~~%TU whimpers.~~You whimper softly to yourself.~~%TU whimpers softly to %OUself.~~You whimper softly at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU whimpers softly at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU whimpers softly at you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("whisper", "whisperwhisperwhisperwhisper~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~%TU whispers to %TT.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("whistle", "whistle~~~~You whistle innocently.~~%TU whistles innocently.~~You whistle a chipper tune.~~%TU whistles a chipper tune.~~You whistle appreciatively at %OT.~~~~~~~~%TU whistles appreciatively at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU whistles appreciatively at you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("wildpanic", "wildpanicgesticulate_wildlygesticulate_wildlygesticulate_wildly~AAAAAAYYYYYYEEEEEEEE!!!~~%TU panics.~~You panic about, waving your hands in the air.~~%TU panics about, waving %PU hands in the air.~~You panic about %TT, waving your hands in the air.~~~~~~~~%TU panics about %TT, waving %PU hands in the air.~~~~~~~~%TU panics about you, waving %PU hands in the air.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("wince", "winceface_scowlface_scowlface_scowl~You wince.~~%TU winces.~~You wince in pain.~~%TU winces in pain.~~You wince at %OT.~~~~~~~~%TU winces at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU winces at you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("wink", "winkface_winkface_winkface_wink~Wink.~~%TU winks.~~You wink suggestively.~~%TU winks suggestively.~~You wink suggestively at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU winks suggestively at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU winks suggestively at you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("wookieehug", "wookieehugoffer_affectionhug_selfoffer_affection~You hold your arms out wide and look for a target to wookiee hug.~~%TU holds %PU arms out wide and looks for a target to wookiee hug.~~You wookiee hug yourself and stretch out your shoulders.~~%TU gives %OUself a wookiee hug and tries to stretch out %PU shoulders.~~You give %TT a great, big wookiee hug that lifts %OT off the ground.~~~~~~~~%TU gives %TT a great, big wookiee hug.~~~~~~~~OOF! %TU gives you a great, big wookiee hug that lifts you off the ground.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("worship", "worshipworship~worship~You are not worthy!~~%TU is not worthy!~~You are not worthy.~~%TU is not worthy.~~You worship %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU worships %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU worships you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("wrinkle", "wrinkleface_grimaceface_grimaceface_grimace~You wrinkle your nose and make a sour face.~~%TU wrinkles %PU nose and makes a sour face.~~You wrinkle your nose at yourself.~~%TU wrinkles %PU nose at %OUself.~~You wrinkle your nose at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU wrinkles %PU nose at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU wrinkles %PU nose at you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("wtg", "wtgshakefistpatfakepunch~Way to go!~~%TU cheers the group- way to go!.~~You think you did a great job.~~%TU pat's %OUself on the shoulder for a job well done.~~You tell %OT way to go!~~~~~~~~%TU congratulates %TT for a job well done.~~~~~~~~%TU congratulates you for a job well done- way to go!.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("yawn", "yawnyawnyawnyawn~YAAAWWWNN!~~%TU yawns.~~You try to hide a yawn.~~%TU tries to hide a yawn.~~You yawn at %OT.~~~~~~~~%TU yawns at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU yawns at you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("yes", "yesnod_head_oncenod_head_multiplenod_head_once~You nod affirmatively. Yes.~~%TU nods affirmatively.~~You nod at yourself agreeingly.~~%TU nods at %OUself agreeingly.~~You nod affirmatively to %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU nods affirmatively at %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU nods affirmatively at you.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("zip", "zipshush~shush~You zip your lips.~~%TU zips %PU lips.~~You check your zipper to make sure it's closed.~~%TU checks %PU zipper to make sure it is closed.~~You instruct %TT to zip %PT lips.~~~~~~~~%TU instructs %TT to zip %PT lips.~~~~~~~~%TU instructs you to zip your lips.~~~~~~~~");
stringFiles[1151].addEntry("zone", "zone~~~~You zone out.~~%TU zones out.~~You zone out and ignore your surroundings.~~%TU zones out and ignores %PU surroundings.~~You zone out and ignore %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU zones out and ignores %TT.~~~~~~~~%TU zones out and ignores you.~~~~~~~~");

