stringFiles[1172].addEntry("plasma_conduit_interior_d", "This is a high energy plasma conduit. They are very fragile and prone to bursting. If they burst, IMMEDIATELY evacuate the area as the high energy plasma is very dangerous. Any components attached to this conduit will suffer sustained damage as long as the conduit is broken. These conduits must be patched using conduit patch kits. These can be purchased from your local Shipwright.");
