stringFiles[1192].addEntry("title", "Corellia System: Eliminate The Rebel Diplomat, Darmin Lerspri.");
stringFiles[1192].addEntry("title_d", "Black Epsilon has discovered that a Rebel diplomat, Darmin Lerspri, is on his way to Corellia on a mission to sway the government to be more supportive of the Rebellion. You are being charged with making sure that the diplomat never reaches his destination. You will also have to destroy all escort fighters with Darmin to ensure that no one can report of what the Empire has done.");

