stringFiles[1194].addEntry("title", "Corellia System: Eliminate the Rebel X-wing Drone");
stringFiles[1194].addEntry("title_d", "The Rebels have been sending drone X-wings to the Corellian system in order to get readings on Imperial formations. Black Epsilon wants to use the Rebels plan against them by attacking one of the drones. When it sends out it's distress signal Black Epsilon will trace it back to it's destination. Then you are to travel to that area and begin a jamming operation to distract the Rebels while a main assault is happening.");

stringFiles[1195] = new StringFile("spacequest/assassinate/corellia_imperial_4");
stringFiles[1195].addEntry("arrival_phase_1", "Stand by. We are getting a lock on the Rebel prototype vessel. We will send you the navigation coordinates once we have it's location.");
stringFiles[1195].addEntry("arrival_phase_2", "We have sent you the navigation location to the prototype. It looks like the Rebels are trying to get it out of the area. Destroy that ship before it can leave the system. We will update the waypoints with it's progress as it moves through the system.");
stringFiles[1195].addEntry("assassinate_success", "Nice work, pilot. That will show the Rebels that we are not afraid of them. Return to your commanding officer on Talus.");
stringFiles[1195].addEntry("assigned_delayed", "");
