stringFiles[1202].addEntry("escort_wiped_out", "Tactical Computer: <Enemy escorts eliminated.>");
stringFiles[1202].addEntry("failed_escape", "Your mission was clear. Take out that ship and you let it get away. With that vessel Nym can easily resupply and be back in operation in no time. Report back to your superior.");
