stringFiles[1202].addEntry("title", "Lok System: Destroy the Karthakk Queen");
stringFiles[1202].addEntry("title_d", "Destroy the Karthakk Queen in the Lok system. Nym's freighter fleet is in ruins and his fighters have been greatly reduced. We have learned from the pilot of the smuggler vessel you captured that Nym received a gift from the Rebels to help seal the now defunct deal. A gunboat was given to him by the Rebellion. We a ship of that power Nym will be able to quickly regain control and rebuild his fleet.");

