stringFiles[1238].addEntry("quest_target_d", "Intercept the X-wing Squad Leader in the Naboo system. It is possible that he will try to leave the system. In this case command will update the navigation waypoints of the route he is taking in order to exit the system. Track him down and destroy him before he is able to flee the system.");
