stringFiles[1238].addEntry("title_d", "Destroy the Rebel X-wing Squad Leader in the Naboo system. Imperial Intelligence has a lead on the location of the Rebel team leader who was attempting to capture a shipment of the E-62s. The Rebellion cannot be allowed to get away with these strikes on Imperial interests and the leader of this raid must be destroyed. When you complete this mission, return to Lt. Barn Sinkko in Kadaara and Lt. Sinkko will train you in a new Imperial Pilot skill.");

