stringFiles[1269].addEntry("quest_target_d", "Intercept and destroy the Commerce Raider Leader to the Tatooine system. In order for the Empire to have any control over these nefarious pirates you will have to take out their leader. The pirate is making a run for it so we will update you on his progress by sending you new waypoints as he moves through the sector.");
