stringFiles[1269].addEntry("title", "Tatooine System: Destroy the Commerce Raider Leader");
stringFiles[1269].addEntry("title_d", "Destroy the Commerce Raider Leader in the Tatooine system. The Commerce Raiders are becoming a problem that is quickly growing out of control. Intelligence has managed to get a lock on where the pirate's leader is laying low. Without their leader, Imperial Command hopes that the pirates will lose a great deal of their effectiveness. You are to destroy this leader. When you complete this mission, return to Lt. Akal Colzet in the Imperial Pilot's Association Hall next to the Bestine Capital building and Lt. Colzet will train you in a new Imperial Pilot skill.");

