stringFiles[1308].addEntry("title", "Space Dathomir: Delivering a Fake List");
stringFiles[1308].addEntry("title_d", "The doctor has refused to give up any information on his fellow conspirators. Command has decided to leak a fake list of names in order to try to bring out any of his allies. You will transport this list in the Dathomir system where we believe that the doctor's friends are located. The hope is that the fake list will cause the traitors to try to eliminate you.");

