stringFiles[1311].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "");
stringFiles[1311].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1311].addEntry("title", "Dathomir system: Help transfer experimental pilot.");
stringFiles[1311].addEntry("title_d", "Our freighter with the ship is heading for Corellia where it can be examined closely. We want to have a look at the pilot right away though and need your assistance in moving it from the freighter to one of our gunboats in the Dathomir system.");

stringFiles[1312] = new StringFile("spacequest/delivery/poi_tatooine_privateer_1_a");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("arrived_at_delivery", "I ran into some Valarians along the way, too. I'll be there in a moment.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("arrived_at_pickup", "You're going to wait here for one of Jabba's men to give you the attack codes. Then, you'll bring them back to me. Hopefully, the Valarians won't attack you again. Be careful.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("assigned_delayed", "");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("attack_notify", "\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Incoming enemy fighters.>");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("attack_stopped", "\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters eliminated.>");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("autorewardbody", "");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("autorewardfrom", "");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("autorewardsubject", "");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("docking_complete_delivery", "Thank you. You've been a great help to our goals.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("docking_complete_pickup", "There ye be, kiddo. Now, get this 'ere attack codes back ta Garett safely. Ye watch out fer 'em Valarian's. They be bad fer business.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("docking_started_delivery", "Beginning docking proceedures to procure the attack codes from you.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("docking_started_pickup", "Quit yer movin' around fer a sec. Let me dock wit' ya so's I can give the attack codes teh ye.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("failed_destroyed", "Pilot! The Hutt Informant was destroyed! You failed to protect him!");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("found_loc_d", "I'll be here, waiting for you. Like I mentioned before, be on the lookout.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("found_loc_p", "One of Jabba's spies will meet you here and give you the attack codes. Be on the lookout for Valarian influence. They knew what we were up to last time, somehow.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("hello_d", "I'm glad to see you made it here in one piece. Let's get this transfer underway.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("hello_p", "'ey. HAH! Ye call that a ship?! Oh, sorry. Let us be continuin' this, eh?");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_dock1_d", "Once the lackey has been found, you'll need to dock with it using the /dock command to transfer the attack codes.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_dock1_t", "The Transfer");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_dock2_d", "To dock with Garett's ship, you'll need to use the /dock command. You better be careful, though. You've heard, in passing, what happened to the last guy who scratched up Garett's ship. Space dust, baby.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_dock2_t", "Time for the Transfer");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_location_d", "Once you have the attack codes from Jabba's Star, you'll need to hightail it over to the updated objective point where you'll meet Garett.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Travel from Jabba's Star to Objective");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_rendezvous1_d", "You've been ordered to pick up the attack codes from one of Jabba's lackeys. Go there and get it, tiger.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_rendezvous1_t", "Jabba's Spy");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_rendezvous2_d", "You'll need to find Garett and transfer the attack codes. No doubt, at this point, you've discovered Valarian thugs on your tail, and fought them off without a hitch. Looks like you're going to need some repairs, no? To dock with Garett's ship, use the /dock command.");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_rendezvous2_t", "Find Garett and Transfer the Codes");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("quest_update", "\\#pcontrast1 Garett:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("title", "Tatoo System: Pick up and Delivery of the Attack Codes");
stringFiles[1312].addEntry("title_d", "At this point, you're hanging out at Jabba's Star, waiting for one of the thugs to use you as target practice while you wait for further instructions. Finally! You've been told to pick up the attack codes from one of Jabba's trustees and then deliver them to Garett. Hopefully, you'll get there in one piece. The Valarians have been hunting you ever since you got in contact with Garett. Hm... You begin to wonder if there's a link.");

