stringFiles[1323].addEntry("quest_rendezvous2_d", "One of our command ships will meet you here. Although the Empire will probably change these codes quickly, we will see if we can't get some more use out of them.");
stringFiles[1323].addEntry("quest_rendezvous2_t", "Deliver codes to capital ship.");
stringFiles[1323].addEntry("quest_update", "Rebel Command: < %TO >");
stringFiles[1323].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "Gunboat Captain: < Sensors show multiple incoming TIE wings, the Empire must have figured out what's going on. Hold them off so we can get out of here! >");
stringFiles[1323].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1323].addEntry("title", "Dathomir system: Deliver Security codes to Alliance spies and fleet.");
stringFiles[1323].addEntry("title_d", "It's time to put the codes you stole to good use. Deliver them to one of our commando teams first and then to one of our capital ships.");

stringFiles[1324] = new StringFile("spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("arrived_at_delivery", "The commando team is using a unmarked YT-1300 freighter, dock and transfer the data to them.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("arrived_at_pickup", "You are at the correct coordinates, dock with Nym's man then fly straight to Dathomir, no detours.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("assigned_delayed", "");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("attack_notify", "Tactical Computer: < Incoming fighter vessels. Scans show weapons armed. >");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("attack_stopped", "Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("autorewardbody", "");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("autorewardfrom", "");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("autorewardsubject", "");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("docking_complete_delivery", "Transfer complete. We are out of here.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("docking_complete_pickup", "Alright, we're done, have a safe flight to Dathomir, if there is such a thing.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("docking_started_delivery", "Initiating docking sequence, prepare to transfer the data.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("docking_started_pickup", "Hurry up, I've got things to do and places to be.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("failed_destroyed", "What the heck happened up there pilot? We have lost contact with our ship! Return to base immediately!");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("found_loc_d", "Our commando team will meet you at this location.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("found_loc_p", "Meet the Nym smuggler at these coordinates pilot. Hurry up, they are not famous for being patient.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("hello_d", "Greetings pilot, prepare to dock so we can get on with the mission.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("hello_p", "Hey there chum, I've put together what info I could remember for you guys.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("Quest Log Data", "Text");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_dock1_d", "The smuggler put together what information he has in a data cube. Dock with him and transfer it over, then head for the Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_dock1_t", "Dock and transfer information.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_dock2_d", "If the surrounding area is clear of hostile ships, dock with the commando teams ship and transfer the information the smuggler gave you.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_dock2_t", "Dock and transfer intel.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_location_d", "The Lok system is fairly safe, at least from Imperial forces. They have a bit of respect of Nym's forces and try not to get tangled up with him. Unfortunately the zone is infested with pirates from other clans than Nym's and they tend to look for lone targets of opportunity. After you have received the information from Nym's smuggler you're heading to the Dathomir system and you know the drill there, trust no one and be ready for anything.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Lok and Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_rendezvous1_d", "The smuggler gave us these coordinates for your meeting. Hurry over there as he won't wait for you if you're late.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_rendezvous1_t", "Meeting with Nym's smuggler.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_rendezvous2_d", "The commando team will meet you at these coordinates. They are travelling in a civilian freighter, model YT-1300.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_rendezvous2_t", "Coordinates for meeting with commando team.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("quest_update", "Rebel Command: < %TO >");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "Rebel Command: < Good work. We are delivering a blow to the Empire by taking out one of their patrols and could use your assistance. >");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("title", "Lok and Dathomir system: Deliver security data to a Rebel commando team.");
stringFiles[1324].addEntry("title_d", "There's a high ranking Imperial officer that is a traitor and have been imprisoned on Dathomir. In Nym's service there's a smuggler that have been inside the prison and he's agreed to give us any information he has about it to assist in breaking free the prisoner. Meet the smuggler in the Lok sector and take the data to one of our Commando teams in the Dathomir sector.");

stringFiles[1325] = new StringFile("spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("arrived_at_delivery", "You are at the correct location pilot. The Vortex operative should be there any second.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("arrived_at_pickup", "I'm not sure what the Vortex do for the Alliance but one of their scientists found something on Dathomir that needs to be delivered to Yavin 4 quickly, so we're helping them out.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("assigned_delayed", "");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("attack_notify", "Tactical Computer: < Incoming fighter vessels. Scans show weapons armed. >");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("attack_stopped", "Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("autorewardbody", "");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("autorewardfrom", "");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("autorewardsubject", "");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("docking_complete_delivery", "Alright, I got it. I heard some guys on Tatooine say you were good, I guess they weren't lying. See you around.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("docking_complete_pickup", "You have no idea what I had to go through to get that thing. I hope you can get it to Yavin safely.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("docking_started_delivery", "Starting dock sequence.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("docking_started_pickup", "Lets dock so I can transfer this over to you quickly.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("failed_destroyed", "What the heck is going on pilot?! When we're asked for help, the Alliance expect the job to get done. Return to base right away!");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("found_loc_d", "So far so good. Proceed to these coordinates pilot.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("found_loc_p", "A scientist from the Vortex will meet you at these coordinates pilot. Make your way over there, on the double!");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("hello_d", "Glad to see you made it, lets do this.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("hello_p", "You're here, great. I was afraid no one would be able to help us out.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("Quest Log Data", "Text");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_dock1_d", "If the area is clear, dock with the spy to transfer the package to your ship. No we didn't ask what we are delivering and neither should you. As soon as you got the package, head to the Yavin system.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_dock1_t", "Dock with Rebel spy for pickup.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_dock2_d", "Clear out hostile fighters in the surrounding area first. When it's clear, quickly dock with the Vortex agent and transfer the cargo to him.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_dock2_t", "Dock with Vortex agent for delivery.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_location_d", "The Dathomir system is always dangerous so stay alert there. You're meeting up with one of our spies to pick up the package for the Vortex. Make sure you don't blow his cover by leading any hostile forces to his location. After pickup you are heading to the Yavin system. Although not as dangerous as the Dathomir system it has a heavy Imperial presence so stay sharp and don't let your guard down!");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Dathomir and Yavin system.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_rendezvous1_d", "One of our spies will meet you at this location. Again, be sure not to drag any hostile forces to these coordinates as it could mean the end of our spy if he's spotted.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_rendezvous1_t", "Coordinates for pickup.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_rendezvous2_d", "Head to these coordinates quickly. We see several Imperial fighters chasing you, they must have found out about our mission somehow!");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_rendezvous2_t", "Coordinates for delivery, Yavin system.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("quest_update", "General Ufwol: < %TO >");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("title", "Dathomir and Yavin system: Assist 'The Vortex' with a quick delivery.");
stringFiles[1325].addEntry("title_d", "Another part of the Alliance has asked us for a favor, knowing that we are the best. Let's not prove them wrong. They have a important delivery they need taken care of quickly.");

