stringFiles[1327].addEntry("quest_location_d", "Remain in the Yavin system and deliver the joint operations plan to the Imperial Lambda Shuttle. You will receive a navigation waypoint to the arrival location of the shuttle. Travel to this location and wait for the shuttle to arrive.");
