stringFiles[1332].addEntry("title", "Corellia System: Meet the Cloak Representative");
stringFiles[1332].addEntry("title_d", "A cloak representative wishes to speak with you personally, possibly about working as a double-agent. CorSec command thinks that this may be a prime opportunity to go undercover, however, this could be a potentially dangerous assignment. You are to travel to the pre-arranged meeting location. Dock with the representative if you wish to go undercover, otherwise just blow him to space dust.");

