stringFiles[1340].addEntry("autorewardsubject", "");
stringFiles[1340].addEntry("docking_complete_delivery", "Rebels that have uncovered our freighter routes you say? I would have said you're crazy, but those Rebels attacking you on your way here does confirm that something is going on. Stand by.");
stringFiles[1340].addEntry("docking_started_delivery", "Everything looks to be in order and his ship is clear of contraband commander. Now, why are you here?");
stringFiles[1340].addEntry("failed_destroyed", "We have enough problems here as it is and don't need you to lead Rebel scum to our operations. Get out of here!");
stringFiles[1340].addEntry("found_loc_d", "This is the security commander of the Yavin system Imperial station. Continue to these coordinates immediately and prepare to identify yourself.");
stringFiles[1340].addEntry("hello_d", "Pilot, shut down your weapon systems and dock with me for identity confirmation and scan.");
stringFiles[1340].addEntry("quest_dock2_d", "You need to dock with the TIE Interceptor so he can confirm your identity and scan your ship for anything dangerous or illegal.");
stringFiles[1340].addEntry("quest_dock2_t", "Security scan.");
stringFiles[1340].addEntry("quest_location_d", "The Yavin system is heavily guarded by Imperial forces but there's still a rogue presence with unscrupulous bounty hunters, pirates and mercenaries so don't feel too safe.");
