stringFiles[1374].addEntry("title_d", "Travel to the Corellia system, hunt down, and destroy four X-wing cadets. Since the Empire is unsure where the X-wing cadets are located in the Corellia system, you will receive a few navigation waypoints to suspected areas of Rebel activity. You can check out area around the waypoints to see if you can locate the Rebel cadets or just search the system yourself. Once you have located X-wing cadets, destroy four of them. When you complete this mission, return to Hakasha Sireen at the Imperial Base on Talus for your next assignment.");

