stringFiles[1392].addEntry("quest_destroy_t", "Destroy Four X-Wing Fighter Cadets");
stringFiles[1392].addEntry("quest_location_d", "Our reports show that a squad of Rebel X-wing fighter cadets has moved into the Naboo system. Imperial command has supplied you with several areas that might be good to start your search.");
stringFiles[1392].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Travel to the Naboo System");
stringFiles[1392].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "You are still not done with your job. Even though you have failed, we still expect you to kill four X-wing Cadets. Get back to work.");
