stringFiles[1420].addEntry("level_increase", "You have done well, but that was just the beginning. The better pilots are still to come.");
stringFiles[1420].addEntry("Quest Log Data", "Text");
stringFiles[1420].addEntry("quest_d", "Some Rebel pilots tried to gain access to Dathomir by using a fake authorization code, but they made the mistake of celebrating while their comm channel was still open. Teach them a lesson.");
stringFiles[1420].addEntry("quest_destroy_d", "Some Rebel pilots tried to gain access to Dathomir by using a fake authorization code, but they made the mistake of celebrating while their comm channel was still open. Teach them a lesson.");
