stringFiles[1420].addEntry("title", "Dathomir System: Destroy the Impertinent Rebels");
stringFiles[1420].addEntry("title_d", "Travel to the Dathomir system and destroy the Rebels. Some Rebel pilots tried to gain access to Dathomir by using a fake authorization code, but they made the mistake of celebrating while their comm channel was still open. Teach them a lesson.");

