stringFiles[1422].addEntry("taunt_2", "You will pay for that!");
stringFiles[1422].addEntry("taunt_3", "Imperial scum like yourself have no buisness in Lok.");
stringFiles[1422].addEntry("taunt_4", "Nym will surely make you regret that.");
stringFiles[1422].addEntry("taunt_5", "I would suggest that you escape while you can.");
stringFiles[1422].addEntry("title", "Lok System: Destroy Nym's Fighters Duty");
stringFiles[1422].addEntry("title_d", "Travel to the Lok system and destroy Nym's forces. Storm Squadron has been charged with weakening Nym's influence in the Lok system. This will cause him to focus more on local security rather then assist the Rebels.");

