stringFiles[1431].addEntry("title", "Dantooine system: Duty mission: Attack the Inquisitions candidates.");
stringFiles[1431].addEntry("title_d", "To soften up the Inquisitions fighter force and send a message to them that we mean business, you are ordered to attack a number of their normal fighter patrols. Normal means that they are not yet part of the Inquisition as full time pilots in their service but rather they are regular navy pilots used for grunt work, trying to prove their worth to the men in black. When you feel that you have exhausted your ship, yourself or that you have enough experience to continue your training, you can return to base at anytime.");

