stringFiles[1436].addEntry("level_increase", "Tighten that belt, pilot. Things are just going to get rougher from here on.");
stringFiles[1436].addEntry("quest_destroy_d", "Being highly territorial the pirates will attack anyone moving into their area. Once you arrive, expect to be attacked. Destroy all fighters that attack you.");
stringFiles[1436].addEntry("quest_destroy_t", "Destroy the Attacking Fighters");
stringFiles[1436].addEntry("quest_location_d", "The pirates are stationed in several areas around Dantooine. Since there is no law enforcement in the system, the pirates do not even make an attempt to hide so they are easy enough to track.");
