stringFiles[1520].addEntry("title", "Yavin System: Escort the Captured Hutt Freighter");
stringFiles[1520].addEntry("title_d", "The captured Hutt ship has been retrofit with the signature jammer and autopilot system. The jammer will allow you to remain hidden by the ships signature. When Nym's men scan the area all they will see is the Hutt ship and not your TIE. We will move this ship through Nym's territory. Since they are already highly angered they are sure to try to retaliate on the Hutt vessel. You are to protect the vessel and destroy any who try to attack it.");

