stringFiles[1521].addEntry("title", "Dathomir System: Escort the Drop Ship");
stringFiles[1521].addEntry("title_d", "The recovered shuttle and the orders on the captured captain suggest that the people you are after went to the Dathomir sector. Insurgent believes that some of them might have landed on the planet's surface and wants to send in a strike team to make sure they never off if they did. The strike team will be dropped in from space and then have to travel to via land to the Imperial prison. They are not aware that this is a one way trip. You are to escort the drop ship safely through the Dathomir system.");

