stringFiles[1549].addEntry("arrived_at_loc", "I'm glad to see you there, pilot. You know the drill. Meet the freighter and escort it to the mining field. It is crucial to be careful. I believe the pirates in the area have learned of our recent activity. I'd be prepared if I were you.");
