stringFiles[1554].addEntry("title", "Endor System: Bring in the Fariso");
stringFiles[1554].addEntry("title_d", "The Fariso is a civilian YT-1300 piloted by a retired TIE pilot named Jenson Marsh working on contract with the Imperial Research Station on Endor.  Today's cargo has be classified as important enough to warrant a fighter escort as they make their approach to the station.  Your mission is to rendezvous with the Transport as they enter the system and see them safely to the landing station in orbit around Endor.");

