stringFiles[1557].addEntry("quest_escort_d", "Once you have met up with the freighter, wait for it to beginning flying along its assigned route. Follow the freighter and keep a close watch out for pirate fighters who might try to capture or destroy the vessel. Once it has reached it designated, it will leave the area and your mission will be complete.");
