stringFiles[1557].addEntry("title", "Tatooine System: Escort the Imperial Transport");
stringFiles[1557].addEntry("title_d", "Remain in the Tatooine system and escort the freighter through the system. Once you finish the patrol in the Tatooine system, you will receive a navigation waypoint to the freighter's arrival location. Travel to this location and wait for the freighter to arrive. Once the freighter arrives, follow it to its destination. You will have to keep it safe from any enemy fighters who attempt to stop it from reaching its destination.");

