stringFiles[1558].addEntry("title", "Endor System: Escort the Engineer's Transport");
stringFiles[1558].addEntry("title_d", "The Empire has started a major undertaking in the Endor system. They have not been forthcoming with details about what they are doing, but they have a need for materials and manpower. Storm Squadron has been placed in charge of system security. Your first mission is to escort a shuttle of engineers coming from the Yavin salvage operation through the Endor system.");

stringFiles[1559] = new StringFile("spacequest/escort/tatooine_imperial_tier3_3_a");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("abort", "What are you doing, pilot? You are aborting too early. The Rebels will know this is a trap.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("arrived_at_loc", "Wait for the decoy shuttle to arrive and then begin the mission. To completely sell this deception, you are going to have kill several attacking waves of enemy fighters before we can be sure the Rebels will think the information is genuine.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("assigned_delayed", "");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("attack_notify", "\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters detected. Incoming at high speeds.>");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("attack_stopped", "\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighter destroyed. Detecting no further ships.>");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("autorewardbody", "");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("autorewardfrom", "");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("autorewardsubject", "");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("complete", "You may have succeeded in getting the Rebels the plans but there is very little chance that they are going to believe that they are real. We cannot write this one off as a complete failure but you didn't accomplish what was needed of you. Report back into your commander.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("escort_too_far1", "Pilot, if you leave the decoy shuttle unprotected the Rebels will know something is wrong. Stay with the shuttle and destroy those Rebels so they think what is on that shuttle is important.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("escort_too_far2", "Pilot, the Rebels are getting suspicious. Get back here and put on a good show.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("escort_too_far3", "Blast it! The Rebels are leaving, this is obviously a trap. Way to blow the operation. Report back to your superior.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("failed_destroy", "Pilot, that was too easy. The Rebels might scan the wreckage and find the plans but they are never going to believe them. They are rebellious, not stupid. You are going to need to report back to your commander.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("failed_protect", "Pilot, that was too easy. The Rebels might scan the wreckage and find the plans but they are never going to believe them.  They are rebellious, not stupid. You are going to need to report back to your commander.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("found_loc", "Meet up with the decoy shuttle at supplied navigation location. Once the enemy attacks, destroy several of their attack waves. When we have their curiosity peeked, the shuttle will make a run for it and allow itself to be captured. Just make sure you put on a good show and destroy at least four attack waves.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("goodbye_1", "Blast it! You didn't destroy nearly enough of those fighters for the Rebels to be interested in following me. This mission is a big failure. Report back into your superior.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("goodbye_2", "Blast it! You didn't destroy nearly enough of those fighters for the Rebels to be interested in following me. This mission is a big failure. Report back into your superior.");
