stringFiles[1559].addEntry("goodbye_5", "Blast it! You didn't destroy nearly enough of those fighters for the Rebels to be interested in following me. This mission is a big failure. Report back into your superior.");
stringFiles[1559].addEntry("hull_half", "Hull is at half strength! I have to stay alive for longer or the Rebels will not buy the fake plans. Get them off of me and destroy some more waves!");
