stringFiles[1573].addEntry("reason_2", "Pilot, good to see you. We are transporting a prisoner for the Inquisition and need a escort.");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("reason_3", "Good our escort is here. We're sitting on a barrel of explosives here so keep any hostiles far away from us.");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("reason_4", "G'Day pilot. We're running a taxi service here I guess, hauling some important dude in the back. Keep an eye on us.");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("reason_5", "Transmitting my Imperial ID code now. Protect us with your life pilot.");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("shields_depleted", "My shields are failing, you better get rid of these fighters quick pilot!");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("taunt_1", "You will never reach Corellia, filthy Imperial!");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("taunt_2", "We won't be satisfied with taking your cargo, we're taking your life Imperial scum!");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("taunt_3", "Easy pickins, say good night Imperial wretches!");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("taunt_4", "Freeeedoooom!");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("taunt_5", "Revenge is best served through a Laser cannon!");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("thanks_1", "Good job pilot, glad to have you here.");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("thanks_2", "Phew, thought they had us for sure.");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("thanks_3", "You know how to handle that ship, I'll give you that pilot.");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("thanks_4", "Whow! Did you see that Rebel scum when you took off his wing? Beautiful!");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("thanks_5", "You make me miss being a fighter pilot, nice moves!");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("title", "Corellia System: Escort the Imperial Freighters Duty");
stringFiles[1573].addEntry("title_d", "Travel to the Corellia system and escort the Imperial freighters through the system. An escort duty is a voluntary mission that you are able to quit at any time without repercussions. When you reach the Corellia system, you will get a navigation waypoint to the arrival location of an Imperial freighter that you will need to escort through the system. Travel to the waypoint and wait until the freighter hyperjumps into the system. Once it is in the area, it will begin to fly through the system. You need to follow the freighter until it reaches its destination. Keep a careful eye out for enemy attack since they will attempt to destroy this freighter. Once completed you will receive another waypoint to the arrival location of another freighter. This escort duty can be stopped at any time by simply aborting the mission or leaving the system.");

