stringFiles[1575].addEntry("Quest Log Data", "Text");
stringFiles[1575].addEntry("quest_d", "The Velocity Mercenaries have been attacking Imperial shipping lanes and have captured a number of freighters carrying important supplies for the war effort. Every freighter traveling through the Dantooine sector is now required to have an escort fighter to protect them against these attacks. Meet and escort freighters through the Dantooine sector, protecting them from attack.");
