stringFiles[1582].addEntry("failed_destroy", "\\#pcontrast3 Station Command: < \\#pcontrast1 I can't believe these scum destroyed a transport full of innocents. We will need a full report on this tragedy pilot. \\#pcontrast3 >");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("failed_protect", "Transport had to escape through a emergency hyperspace jump pilot, there were just too many of the pirates.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("found_loc", "We have a request from another transport with important passengers for a safe escort. New coordinates uploaded.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("goodbye_1", "You haven't let me down, thank you pilot!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("goodbye_2", "Bumpy ride but we made it in one piece thanks to you pilot.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("goodbye_3", "After this, I'm putting some defense weapons on my freighter. Thanks again my friend.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("goodbye_4", "That was a close one and your the only reason we survived. Accept our gratitude pilot.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("goodbye_5", "I'd like to come back in a different ships and teach those scum a thing or two. Anyway, thank you for the help pilot!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("hull_half", "Our sensors register multiple hull breeches, you have to take care of those pirates now!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("panic_1", "Hostile fighters inbound!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("panic_2", "Pirate wretches, they want my cargo!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("panic_3", "Help us, they will kill us all!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("panic_4", "Oh no, pirates! You better be good at your job pilot!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("panic_5", "Uh oh, we got unwanted attention. I think they are pirates!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("Quest Log Data", "Text");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("quest_escort_d", "A passenger transport to be escorted through this sector.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Escort Target");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("quest_location_d", "Transport route through the Dathomir System");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Dathomir System");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("quest_rendezvous_d", "Meet the transport at this location");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("quest_rendezvous_t", "Rally Point");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("reason_1", "There you are. I hope you're good at this, we have cargo that could attract every pirate in the sector...");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("reason_2", "Thank you for escorting us pilot. We have passengers on board, so stay alert.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("reason_3", "My job depends on me making this transport on time, so I hope you know what you are doing pilot.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("reason_4", "Perfect, a pilot. Last time we didn't get an escort and those Black Sun pirates put my ship in the docks for a month!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("reason_5", "Greetings pilot, good to see you. Lets head for the surface quickly, I don't want any incidents.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("shields_depleted", "Our shields are down! If you don't get rid of those pilotes, we are done for!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("taunt_1", "Get out of here while you still can scum.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("taunt_2", "We're boarding this ship, now it's just a question if you want to die for it or not.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("taunt_3", "I will enjoy cutting your ship in half!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("taunt_4", "You're attacking us in that hunk of junk? You can't be serious.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("taunt_5", "I'll guide you back down to the ground... without your ship of course.");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("thanks_1", "Great job pilot, lets hurry out of here!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("thanks_2", "Back in my day, I would have dealt with those pirates twice as fast..");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("thanks_3", "Splendid, finally a pilot that knows what he's doing!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("thanks_4", "Hahaha, they will think twice before attacking us again!");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("thanks_5", "Any chance you looking for a new career as bodyguard?");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("title", "Dathomir System: Duty: Escort Passenger Transports");
stringFiles[1582].addEntry("title_d", "Protect transports from Black Sun aggression.");

