stringFiles[1583].addEntry("title", "Lok System: Bait and Destroy Nym's Pirates");
stringFiles[1583].addEntry("title_d", "Nym has never liked the fact that the Empire has a base located on Lok. He is constantly hampering Imperial shipments heading into the system. With our current operations it is important that those shipments make it to the base without incident. You are to protect those shipments from attacks from Nym's men.");

