stringFiles[1584].addEntry("title", "Yavin System: Protect the Imperial Salvage Freighters Duty");
stringFiles[1584].addEntry("title_d", "The Empire salvage operation has been filling numerous cargo freighters with the salvaged pieces of the Death Star. These freighters are then sent out of the system to other areas of Imperial interest. The Debris Cult, who believe that all Death Star debris is theirs by devine right, have been attacking these cargo freighters and taking the scrap for their own. The Empire wants these ships protected as they leave the region.");

