stringFiles[1589].addEntry("goodbye_5", "I'd like to come back in a different ships and teach those scum a thing or two. Anyway, thank you for the help pilot!");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("hull_half", "Our sensors register multiple hull breeches, you have to take care of those pirates now!");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("panic_1", "Hostile fighters inbound!");
