stringFiles[1589].addEntry("reason_2", "Thank you for escorting us pilot. We've had trouble out here before so, stay alert!");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("reason_3", "My job depends on me making this transport on time, so I hope you know what you are doing pilot.");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("reason_4", "Perfect, a RSF pilot. Last time we didn't get an escort and those Ay'Nat Legion pirates put my ship in the docks for a month!");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("reason_5", "Greetings pilot, good to see you. Lets head for the surface quickly, I don't want any incidents.");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("shields_depleted", "Our shields are down! If you don't get rid of those pilotes, we are done for!");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("taunt_1", "The RSF are a bunch of cowards!");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("taunt_2", "We're boarding this ship, now it's just a question if you want to die for it or not.");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("taunt_3", "I will enjoy cutting your ship in half RSF puppet!");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("taunt_4", "You're attacking us in that hunk of junk RSF? You can't be serious.");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("taunt_5", "I'll guide you back down to Naboo RSF weakling, without your ship of course.");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("thanks_1", "Great job pilot, lets hurry out of here!");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("thanks_2", "Back in my day, I would have dealt with those pirates twice as fast..");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("thanks_3", "Splendid, finally a RSF pilot that knows what they're doing!");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("thanks_4", "Hahaha, they will think twice before attacking us again!");
stringFiles[1589].addEntry("thanks_5", "Any chance you looking for a new career as bodyguard?");
