stringFiles[1600].addEntry("quest_rendezvous_t", "Meet the Cargo Freighter");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("reason_1", "I have to get these %TO to Bestine right away. Let's go, I don't have all day!");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("reason_2", "Ah, you're on time. I hate sitting out here on a load of %TO unprotected.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("reason_3", "I've got a hold full of %TO and I'm looking to get it unloaded before my shift ends and they keep me on overtime, so let's move.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("reason_4", "Good to see the Empire has an escort ready for me. Let's get moving, High Command is expecting this shipment of %TO.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("reason_5", "I'm locking in my route. Stay on my wing. These %TO are valuable and I don't want to be out here alone.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("shields_depleted", "Our shields are out. Get them off of me!");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("taunt_1", "Kill your engines and prepare to be boarded.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("taunt_2", "If you release your cargo peacefully, we will not harm you.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("taunt_3", "Time to die, Imperial scum!");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("taunt_4", "I've got you in my sights.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("taunt_5", "Kill the Imperial fools.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("thanks_1", "Thanks for taking out those punks. Now let's get this cargo to dock.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("thanks_2", "Whew, thanks for thinking fast there. I would have been spaced without you.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("thanks_3", "Impressive, friend! You certainly know how to use that thing.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("thanks_4", "I can't believe we made it. I think I need to change my flightsuit.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("thanks_5", "You fight with the Emperor's own passion, pilot. I'm honored to have you as a guide.");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("title", "Tatooine System: Escort the Cargo Freighters Duty");
stringFiles[1600].addEntry("title_d", "Travel to the Tatooine system and escort the cargo freighters through the system. An escort duty is a voluntary mission that you are able to quit at any time without repercussions. When you reach the Tatooine system, you will get a navigation waypoint to the arrival location of a cargo freighter that you will need to escort through the system. Travel to the waypoint and wait until the freighter hyperjumps into the system. Once it is in the area, it will begin to fly through the system. You need to follow the freighter until it reaches its destination. Keep a careful eye out for enemy attack since they will attempt to destroy this freighter. Once completed you will receive another waypoint to the arrival location of another freighter. This escort duty can be stopped at any time by simply aborting the mission or leaving the system.");

stringFiles[1601] = new StringFile("spacequest/escort_duty/tatooine_imperial_tier4_escortduty_1");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("abort", "You cannot leave us out here! We are carring important supplies for the Empire.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("arrived_at_loc", "Hold at your current location. The vessel you are assigned to escort will be arriving shortly.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("attack_notify", "\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Warning! Enemy fighters detected.>");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("attack_stopped", "\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighter wing has been eliminated.>");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("complete", "The freighter is safely away. Wait for command to assign you another freighter to escort or return to your commander to take a new mission.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("duty_update", "\\#pcontrast1 Storm Squadron Command:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("escort_too_far1", "");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("escort_too_far2", "");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("escort_too_far3", "");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("failed_destroy", "Your orders were to make sure that vessel arrived at HQ safely. Return to your superior and explain your failure.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("failed_protect", "You left that vessel out there unarmed and at the mercy of pirates. You will have alot of explaining to do. Return to your superior.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("found_loc", "The escort vessel will be arriving at the location supplied to your nav computer. Travel to that location and await the arrival of that vessel.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("goodbye_1", "We appreciate your help out there pilot.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("goodbye_2", "Thanks for getting us through this sector. Those Red Skulls really need to be cleared out.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("goodbye_3", "You have done a great service to me and the Empire.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("goodbye_4", "My cargo will help save honest Imperial lives. You have my thanks.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("goodbye_5", "Be safe, pilot. Thanks for watching my back.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("hull_half", "Hull at half strength! They told me you were good...prove it!");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("panic_1", "Blasted pirates!");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("panic_2", "Do I look worried? I think not.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("panic_3", "Go get them. That is your job isn't it?");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("panic_4", "Pirates are after my booty! I always wanted to say that.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("panic_5", "You had better send those pirates into oblivion.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("Quest Log Data", "Text");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("quest_escort_d", "After you have met with your target transport, follow it through the Endor system until it arrives at it's final destination. There is a good chance that pirates will attack and the transport must be defended at all costs because of the importance of it's cargo.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Protect the Imperial Transport");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("quest_location_d", "The freighters are arriving in the Endor system before they are being attacked by the pirates. Meet them at their jump location inside the Endor system and escort them safely to their destination..");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Travel to the Endor System");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("quest_rendezvous_d", "Command will supply the jump in location of the transport. The freighter will not arrive until you are at that location.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("quest_rendezvous_t", "Meet the Imperial Transport");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("reason_1", "I have a ship full of cargo for the Engineers on the second moon.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("reason_2", "I just arrived from a Yavin salvage operation. I understand you will be my escort.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("reason_3", "I hope we have a smooth flight. My last one was an absolute mess. Pirates coming out of everywhere.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("reason_4", "An escort? I don't need an escort. I have been flying since the days of the Old Republic and I have never been attacked by anyone.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("reason_5", "Glad to have you with me. I have some very valuable stuff on this ship and it would be a shame to lose it.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("shields_depleted", "There went our shields! Get those fighters off of us.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("taunt_1", "Give us the freighter and no one gets hurt.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("taunt_2", "We just want what is ours...so give us your freighter.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("taunt_3", "You are really starting to make me mad.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("taunt_4", "Imperial scum like you are better off dead.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("taunt_5", "That's just great! You scratched my new paint job!");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("thanks_1", "I am glad that you are out here.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("thanks_2", "They were not that tough. Back in my day we used to have to fight twice as many pirates.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("thanks_3", "Today is a glorious day for the Empire.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("thanks_4", "Pirates are no match for your superior skills.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("thanks_5", "Thanks for saving my skin.");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("title", "Endor System: Protect the Imperial Transports Duty");
stringFiles[1601].addEntry("title_d", "Red Skull pirates have been attacking the increased Imperial traffic moving through the Endor system. The Emperor has decreed that all transports shall have an escort through the system because of the important cargo, nessecary for a top secret project in the system, that they are carrying.");

