stringFiles[1605].addEntry("reason_2", "Requesting fighter escort. Repeat! Requesting fighter escort!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("reason_3", "Hey there, pilot! Let's get these refugees back home. Whadda you say?");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("reason_4", "Good to see you, pilot! Cover us so we can get these refugees back where they belong.");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("reason_5", "This is the freight commander speaking. Form up and keep us safe! We have a lot of injured on-board and don't need any more excitement!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("shields_depleted", "Our shields are out. Get rid of those fighters now!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("taunt_1", "Rebel scum! Prepare to die!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("taunt_2", "Refugees, eh? You expect us to believe that... traitor?!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("taunt_3", "Time to die, Rebel scum!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("taunt_4", "I've got you in my sights.");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("taunt_5", "Kill the Rebel traitors!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("thanks_1", "Thanks for taking out those punks. Now let's get these refugees back home!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("thanks_2", "Whew, thanks for thinking fast there. We would have been spaced without your help!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("thanks_3", "Very impressive, my friend! The Force is with you...");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("thanks_4", "I can't believe we made it! Thanks a million, pal!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("thanks_5", "All refugees safe and sound. Thanks for your help, pilot!");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("title", "Tatooine system: Duty mission: Protect Refugee Transports.");
stringFiles[1605].addEntry("title_d", "Protect Refugee Transports. These missions have been outlined to give you some much needed experience in space combat, you can stop when you feel that you have learned enough.");

