stringFiles[1623].addEntry("title_d", "Travel to the Naboo system and inspect the Railgun mercenary courier. When you enter the system you will receive a navigation waypoint to an area that the Railgun mercenary courier should be. Travel to this location and look around it for the Railgun mercenary courier. Once you have found the courier you will need to disable his vessel. In order to disable a vessel use the '[' or ']' to target the ships subsystems and target its engines. Attack the Railgun mercenary courier until its engines are at 0%. Now move in close and use the 'I' key or type /inspect with the Railgun mercenary courier targeted. After you have found the encrypted documents, type /dock in order to transfer the documents onto your ship. Be wary because you will be very vulnerable while docking with another vessel.");

