stringFiles[1656].addEntry("quest_location_d", "You now have the coordinates of the ambush spot for the Imperial shuttle. The shuttle will pass through this area within a few minutes. If he's not there already when you arrive, search the nearby area or wait for him to arrive then ambush him.");
