stringFiles[1658].addEntry("quest_dock_t", "Steal the patrol route data.");
stringFiles[1658].addEntry("quest_inspect_d", "Inspect the shuttle to make sure it has the routes of the Imperial patrols. If it does, disable it and dock to transfer the data. To target specific components on a star ship, input the bracket commands ( ] or [ ) to your tactical computer.");
stringFiles[1658].addEntry("quest_inspect_t", "Inspect the shuttle.");
stringFiles[1658].addEntry("quest_location_d", "With the heavy Imperial presence in the Yavin system that shuttle won't stay immobile for long. If it's not at the location when you get there the rescue team already got to it. If so, search the nearby area until you find it, destroy its escort, disable, inspect and dock with it if it's the correct shuttle.");
