stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_location_d", "Travel to the Corellia system and follow the patrol navigation waypoints. As you reach one navigation waypoint, you will get a new waypoint to the next location on the patrol route.");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Travel to the Corellian System");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol1_d", "Head to the first waypoint. This route will take you past the busiest shipping lane in Corellian space. The Corellia Star Lane serves thousands of ships heading to and from Corellia every day. It is highly doubtful that rebels will choose to stike at this location with the sheer number of ships around.");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol1_t", "Travel to the First Stop");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol2_d", "Head towards the second waypoint set to your Nav computer. You will fly by the shipping lanes serving primarly serving trade between the duel worlds and Corellia, the Solar Skyway. Rebels probably will not risk an attack in this sector due to the high level of local traffic. They probably will not risk an accident.");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol2_t", "Travel to the Second Stop");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol3_d", "This Nav waypoint will take you by the shadier routes that are commonly used by Corellia's many smuggler pilots. The locals usually refer to it as the Invisible Highway since Corsec's either don't see or don't choose to see what takes place there. ");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol3_t", "Travel to the Third Stop");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol4_d", "");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol4_t", "");
