stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol9_t", "");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol_d", "When you reach a patrol waypoint you will receive a new one to your next location. Follow each of the patrol waypoints until you reach the end of your patrol.  This is the first of four special assignments given to you by Hakasha Sireen. When you complete this mission, return to Hakasha Sireen at the Imperial Base on Talus for your next assignment.  After you complete these four special assignments, Hakasha Sireen will train you in a new Imperial Pilot skill.");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_patrol_t", "Follow the Patrol Route");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_target_d", "");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_target_t", "");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("quest_update", "\\#pcontrast1 Imperial High Command:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "Incoming unidentified fighers with active weapon systems. Destroy all attacking craft.");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("title", "Corellia System: Patrol the Corellia System");
stringFiles[1660].addEntry("title_d", "Run a patrol route in the Corellia system in order to bait a Rebel attack on your craft. Once you arrive in the Corellia system you will receive a navigation waypoint to the first stop on the patrol route. Travel to this waypoint. Once you arrive the navigation waypoint will update to the next stop on the patrol route. Continue following these navigation waypoints until you have completed the patrol. When you complete this mission, return to Hakasha Sireen at the Imperial Base on Talus for your next assignment.");

