stringFiles[1694].addEntry("title", "Endor System: The Grand Tour - Onyx Beacon");
stringFiles[1694].addEntry("title_d", "A phenomenon in stellar communications, beacons are locations in space caused by the interactions of radiation, bodies of high gravity and a few unidentified but key forces are used to collect relayed burst transmissions. These natural relay stations are popular among pirates, smugglers and over the last few years the Rebel Alliance due to the high difficulty in intercepting transmissions.");

