stringFiles[1704].addEntry("title", "Tatooine System: Meet the Imperial Transport");
stringFiles[1704].addEntry("title_d", "The Empire is expecting some very important shipments of cargo to be coming into the Tatooine system on it's way to Bestine. These supplies are slated to go to the ground forces located in and around the Imperial capital of Tatooine and it is imperitive that they make it to their destination. You are to patrol the arrival and drop off locations of these ships shortly before they arrive to reduce any attempt by pirates to take these craft. When you complete this mission, return to Lt. Akal Colzet in the Imperial Pilot's Association Hall next to the Bestine Capital building for your next assignment.");

