stringFiles[1719].addEntry("title_d", "Now that command has the Joint Operations Plan they will need a live body to question so they can compare the two. This will enable the Empire to determine what is real and what is false in the plan. Capture a Rebel pilot so he can be questioned. Fortunately the location of a Rebel Y-wing pilot was discovered while you were delivering the Joint Operations Plan.");

