stringFiles[1720].addEntry("title_d", "Black Epsilon has come up with a plan to cause Nym to break off his assistance of the Rebellion in the Yavin system. First old wounds between the Hutts and Nym must be opened up in order to cause the two sides to start fighting. You are to capture a Hutt vessel, which the Empire will retrofit with a minor signature jammer, and then use it to attack Nym forces. This should cause Nym to retaliate and, therefore, starting a fight between the two pirate factions.");

