stringFiles[1733].addEntry("panic_5", "This could get ugly.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("Quest Log Data", "Text");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("quest_disable_d", "Once you have intercepted the hostage transport, you will need to disable it in order to begin the capture process. Use the '[' or ']' key to target the hostage transport's subsystems. Cycle through them until you have its engines targeted. Attack the transport until its engines are at 0%.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("quest_disable_t", "Disable the Hostage Transport");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("quest_escort_d", "Once the hostage transport is captured, you will need to escort it through the Lok system. Follow and protect the hostage transport until it reaches its destination. Nym will probably send fighters out to attempt to destroy your prize rather then let you save them. You will need to keep the hostage transport safe from them.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Escort the Hostages Transport");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("quest_location_d", "Travel to the Lok system and capture the hostage transport. Once you enter the system, wait until Imperial command sends you a navigation waypoint to the transport's most recent location. As the hostage transport moves through the system this navigation waypoint will update to its most recent location. Intercept the transport before it reaches the end of its path or the vessel will jump out of the system.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Travel to the Lok System");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("quest_recover_d", "Once the hostage transport is disabled you can begin the capture process. Move in close to the hostage transport and wait for the capture process to begin. It might take a couple minutes for the process to begin so you will need to stay close to the vessel while this is happening. Wait until the capture process is completed before you move away from the hostage transport. You will be vulnerable at this point so it might be a good idea to destroy any escort vessels that are with the ship before attempting to capture it.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("quest_recover_t", "Capture the Hostage Transport");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("quest_update", " \\#pcontrast3 Storm Squadron Command: < \\#pcontrast1 %TO \\#pcontrast3 >");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("recovery_success", "The hostages are safe and are en route to base. Good job, pilot.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("target_disabled", "The hostage transport has been disabled. Move in close to the vessel and stand by until they can make contact.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("taunt_1", "No one steals from Nym!");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("taunt_2", "You thought we would just let you fly out of here?");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("taunt_3", "This system is ruled by Nym, the Empire is not welcome here!");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("taunt_4", "Time to pay for your insolence Imperial fools!");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("taunt_5", "Good to see you, it's been a while since I had a challenge!");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("thanks_1", "We are in the clear. Nice work, pilot.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("thanks_2", "We are in the clear. Nice work, pilot.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("thanks_3", "We are in the clear. Nice work, pilot.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("thanks_4", "We are in the clear. Nice work, pilot.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("thanks_5", "We are in the clear. Nice work, pilot.");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("title", "Lok System: Capture the Hostage Transport");
stringFiles[1733].addEntry("title_d", "Travel to the Lok system and capture the hostage transport. Once you arrive in the Lok system, wait until Imperial command can get you the location of the target transport. Once they have a lock, you will receive a navigation waypoint to its current location. This navigation waypoint will update as the hostage transport moves through the system. Follow these navigation waypoints until you intercept the transport. Once you have intercepted the transport, disable it by targeting the vessel's subsystems. Use the '[' or ']' to target the hostage transport's engines and then attack the ship until its engines are at 0%. Now move in close to the transport and wait for the capture process to begin. This process may take a couple of minutes so you will need to stay near the transport until it begins. Be careful because you will be vunlerable while waiting for the capture process to complete. Once the vessel is captured you will need to escort it to safety. Follow the hostage transport until it reaches its destination. Keep an eye out for enemy fighters who might attempt to retake the vessel.");

stringFiles[1734] = new StringFile("spacequest/recovery/imperial_ss_6");
