stringFiles[1735].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Escort Colonel Hend's Shuttle");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("quest_location_d", "Travel to the Naboo system and capture Colonel Hend's shuttle. Once you enter the system, wait until Imperial command sends you a navigation waypoint to the shuttle's most recent location. As Colonel Hend's shuttle moves through the system this navigation waypoint will update to its most recent location. Intercept Colonel Hend's shuttle before it reaches the end of its path or the vessel will jump out of the system.");
