stringFiles[1735].addEntry("quest_recover_d", "Once Colonel Hend's shuttle is disabled you can begin the capture process. Move in close to Colonel Hend's shuttle and wait for the capture process to begin. It might take a couple minutes for the process to begin so you will need to stay close to the vessel while this is happening. Wait until the capture process is completed before you move away from Colonel Hend's shuttle. You will be vulnerable at this point so it might be a good idea to destroy any escort vessels that are with the ship before attempting to capture it.");
