stringFiles[1735].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("target_disabled", "Excellent work, pilot. Now get that boarding party onto the shuttle and recover it.");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("taunt_1", "You cannot have him, he is ours!");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("taunt_2", "Big mistake, Imperial dog.");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("taunt_3", "Freedom has its price and I am willing to pay it.");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("taunt_4", "This looks like it is going to get interesting.");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("taunt_5", "Colonel Hend doesn't want to stay with you anymore...let him go!");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("thanks_1", "Uhhh, nice work?");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("thanks_2", "That looks like them all. I will be fine by myself...");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("thanks_3", "I am sure that I can handle it from here.");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("thanks_4", "I have an idea. You fly that way and I will fly the other way...we split up and they will not know where I went.");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("thanks_5", "I think the Rebels have given up. I should be fine from now on.");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("title", "Naboo System: Capture Colonel Hend's Shuttle");
stringFiles[1735].addEntry("title_d", "Travel to the Naboo system and capture Colonel Hend's shuttle. Once you arrive in the Naboo system, wait until Imperial command can get you the location of the target shuttle. Once they have a lock, you will receive a navigation waypoint to its current location. This navigation waypoint will update as Colonel Hend's shuttle moves through the system. Follow these navigation waypoints until you intercept the shuttle. Once you have intercepted the shuttle, disable it by targeting the vessel's subsystems. Use the '[' or ']' to target Colonel Hend's shuttle's engines and then attack the ship until its engines are at 0%. Now move in close to the shuttle and wait for the capture process to begin. This process may take a couple of minutes so you will need to stay near the shuttle until it begins. Be careful because you will be vulnerable while waiting for the capture process to complete. Once the vessel is captured you will need to escort it to safety. Follow Colonel Hend's shuttle until it reaches its destination. Keep an eye out for enemy fighters who might attempt to retake the vessel.");

