stringFiles[1745].addEntry("title", "Tatoo System: That Word We Call Revenge");
stringFiles[1745].addEntry("title_d", "The continual tension between A'Lerris' miners and the Zynt'aia Order centers around a sphere of obsidian. Granted, this sphere of obsidian is none other than a misplaced asteroid, rumored to hold high concentrations of rare and valuable resources. How did it get here? Why must a war, a fight, be the knee-jerk reaction to settle conflicts? Within the smooth, reflectant facets of the ebon asteroid, one can feel a tug at the soul, making the onlooker wonder if there's something... darker inside. Perhaps it is only a mirror, a glassy surface only meant to show us what lies within our very selves.");

