stringFiles[1765].addEntry("quest_disable_d", "The TIE Oppressor is the target that we're after. It's a prototype advanced bomber that the Empire recently started to manufacture. It's not without a fighter defense though and it's got a fairly large escort so it will be dangerous. Use your targeting computer ([ or ] by default) and attack its reactor or engines to disable it.");
