stringFiles[1765].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Escort the stolen ship to safety.");
stringFiles[1765].addEntry("quest_location_d", "You will be heading in to Imperial areas in the Dathomir system so the danger level is extreme. Try to avoid any enemy contact until you find the target of the mission. The TIE Oppressor and its escort will be dangerous enough.");
