stringFiles[1765].addEntry("quest_recover_d", "As soon as the TIE Oppressor has been disabled a space assault droid will be launched on to it. It will breach the hull and try to take control of the ship. While it's doing this, it's imperative that you keep the TIE Oppressor safe by eliminating any nearby threats.");
