stringFiles[1765].addEntry("taunt_3", "When I thought Rebels could not get any dumber, they surprise me again!");
stringFiles[1765].addEntry("taunt_4", "There is no way you are getting out of this alive Rebels!");
stringFiles[1765].addEntry("taunt_5", "You have broken so many Imperial laws that we will execute the punishment right here!");
