stringFiles[1767].addEntry("title", "Lok system: Kidnap Imperial officer.");
stringFiles[1767].addEntry("title_d", "We have finished analyzing the data you recovered and have learned of several routes of some sort of vessels that are approaching Lok. The information is vague but can't be ignored. To get more of an understanding we need you to kidnap an Imperial officer. We have planted some of our spies on the officer's shuttle,  they need your help in disabling the ship so they can take control of it and then escort it out of the area.");

