stringFiles[1769].addEntry("panic_4", "The Velocity never lets anything slip through their fingers.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("panic_5", "When will you Imperials ever learn? You cannot control everything.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("Quest Log Data", "Text");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_d", "The Velocity mercenaries have been striking at Imperial supply lines with regularity. Imperial command feels that it is time to return the favor. You are tasked with capturing and returning enemy transport vessels in order to recover what was stolen from the Empire.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_disable_d", "Once the smuggler is intercepted, target its engines and disable the vessel. Once its engines are at 0%, move in close to begin the capture process.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_disable_t", "Disable the Velocity Smuggler");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_escort_d", "Follow and protect the captured Velocity smuggler as it moves to its destination. Keep an eye out for any enemy fighters that might try to destroy or recapture this vessel.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Escort the Velocity Smuggler");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_location_d", "Travel to the Dantooine system and capture the Velocity smuggler. A navigation waypoint of the smugglers most recent location will be given to you when you enter the system. This waypoint will update as the smuggler moves through the system. Follow these waypoints and intercept the smuggler.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Travel to the Dantooine System");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_recover_d", "Move in close to the disabled smuggler and wait for the capture process to start. This may take a few minutes to begin. You will be vulnerable while in this position so it is a good idea to take out any escort fighters the smuggler might have with him first.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_recover_t", "Capture the Velocity Smuggler");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_t", "Capturing Velocity Supply Vessels");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("quest_update", "\\#pcontrast1 Black Epsilon Command:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("recovery_success", "Nice work, pilot. You have recovered the Emperor a very nice prize. Report back to your superior for debriefing or wait for another capture assignment.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("target_disabled", "The smuggler's engines are offline. Move in close to the vessel and wait for its autopilot to be reprogramed.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("taunt_1", "If we can't have that freighter, no one will.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("taunt_2", "You will pay for that!");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("taunt_3", "You Imperials are all the same, weak and cowardly.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("taunt_4", "How does it feel to be drawing your last breath?");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("taunt_5", "Are you crying? There is no crying in space!");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("thanks_1", "They will be back.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("thanks_2", "You are better then you look, I will admit that.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("thanks_3", "Your getting worried now, aren't you?");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("thanks_4", "If I were you, I would just give up now. But then again, I have half a brain.");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("thanks_5", "*sniff* *sniff* You reek of fear!");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("title", "Dantooine System: Capture the Velocity Smuggler Transports Duty");
stringFiles[1769].addEntry("title_d", "Travel to the Dantooine system and capture the Velocity Smuggler. Once in the system you will receive a navigation waypoint to the smugglers most recent location. This navigation waypoint will update as the smuggler moves through the system. You must intercept the smuggler before he is able to leave the system. Once you have reached the smuggler, disable it by targeting the vessels engines. After you have the vessel disabled,  move in close and wait for the capture process to begin. Now that the vessel is captured, escort it through the system and back into Imperial hands. After this is completed you will receive a new navigation waypoint to another Velocity smuggler that needs to be captured. This is a duty mission and can be quit at any time. Simply abort the mission or leave the system in order to stop the mission.");

