stringFiles[1780].addEntry("thanks_1", "Well, I guess I am stuck with you.");
stringFiles[1780].addEntry("thanks_2", "CorSecs are nearly as bad as you pirates.");
stringFiles[1780].addEntry("thanks_3", "I don't know who is worse...you or them.");
stringFiles[1780].addEntry("thanks_4", "This just isn't my day.");
stringFiles[1780].addEntry("thanks_5", "If I stay with you, they will blow me up. If I try to escape, you will blow me up. This stinks!");
stringFiles[1780].addEntry("title", "Corellia System: Capture Cargo Freighter's Duty");
stringFiles[1780].addEntry("title_d", "The Dantooine station needs supplies. They are willing to do anything to get those supplies, even support piracy. You are to raid the rich shipping lanes of Corellia and send the captured freighters to Dantooine.");

