stringFiles[1781].addEntry("quest_escort_d", "Follow the freighter back to Imperial space. It is highly possible that the Red Skulls will try to recapture or destroy the freighter rather then to let it passively fall into Imperial hands. Be alert and ready to defend your prize.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Escort the Red Skull Freighter");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("quest_location_d", "The Red Skulls have stationed themselves in the Endor system. The transports are attempting to leave this system for parts unknown. You need to intercept these freighters before they can leave the area.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Travel to the Endor System");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("quest_recover_d", "Move in close to the disabled freighter and wait for the capture operation to begin. You have been supplied a program that will automatically reconfigure the freighters Nav computer to only accept coordinates sent in by Imperial Flight Control. This process may take a few minutes to begin.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("quest_recover_t", "Capture the Red Skull Freighter");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("quest_update", "\\#pcontrast1 Storm Squadron Command:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("recovery_success", "Excellent job, pilot. That ship was vitial to the Emperor's plans for this system. Report back to your commanding officer.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("target_disabled", "\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Targets engines disabled. Begin docking procedures.>");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("taunt_1", "If we can't have that freighter, no one can.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("taunt_2", "You are good, but not good enough.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("taunt_3", "I have a perdiction that in the end you are going to be nothing more then space junk.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("taunt_4", "You don't actually think you can win, do you?");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("taunt_5", "It's time for me to show you what I can do.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("thanks_1", "Next time, Imperial dog. Next time.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("thanks_2", "More will come and they will rescue me this time.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("thanks_3", "You should just leave before more of my friends show up.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("thanks_4", "I have an idea. I will split my cargo with you...how does that sound?");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("thanks_5", "You are just making them mad.");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("title", "Endor System: Capture the Red Skull Freighter Duty");
stringFiles[1781].addEntry("title_d", "The Empire wants the property that the Red Skulls have hijacked from its freighters in the Endor system. You are to intercept the Red Skull transports, capture them, and escort them back to Imperial space.");

