stringFiles[1793].addEntry("attack_stopped", "\\#pcontrast1Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters eliminated.>");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("autorewardbody", "");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("autorewardfrom", "");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("autorewardsubject", "");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("complete", "The drop ship has been safely returned to Imperial space. We must find those responsible. Stand by.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("docking_complete", "They are attempting to restart their engines now. Stand by to escort ship out of the area.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("docking_started", "Beginning docking procedure. Assist in repairs to the best of your ability.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("failed_destroy", "That ship was a valuable piece of equipment. You were to protect it and not let the enemy destroy it. Report back to your commander immediately.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("panic_1", "Keep them off of us! We cannot take much punishment.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("panic_2", "At least I do not see that fighter leader.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("panic_3", "It could be worse. That lead fighter pilot could come back.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("panic_4", "At least I do not see that fighter leader.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("panic_5", "Keep them off of us! We cannot take much punishment.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("Quest Log Data", "Text");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("quest_dock_d", "Dock with the drop ship and assist it any way you can.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("quest_dock_t", "Assist the Imperial Drop Ship with Repairs");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("quest_escort_d", "Follow the drop ship on it's way to the seconday jump location. Protect it against any attacks that might come in.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Escort the Imperial Drop Ship");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("quest_location_d", "Somehow the vessel was pulled out of hyperspace and attacked by the mercs before it could leave the Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Remain in the Dathomir System");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("quest_update", "\\#pcontrast1 Black Epsilon Command:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("recovery_success", "The drop ship is safe. Stand by for further instructions.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("rescue_abandoned", "You can't just leave us out here...");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("rescue_phase_1", "We are glad to see you. They were all over us and then scrambled out of there just before you arrived. We wouldn't have survived another second without you showing up.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("rescue_phase_2", "Thank you, pilot. We will be restarting our engines now. Oh, one more thing, the leader of the fighters that disabled us was an amazing pilot. Thought maybe he might be someone we are looking for.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "You are to patrol the area looking for any signs of the enemy fighters. Any officer that you come across is to be disabled and inspected. Insurgent seemed most interested in the shuttle pilot's discription of the fighter leader.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("taunt_1", "Nej'a will be so proud of us when you are no more.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("taunt_2", "Nej'a told us that you would try to save that ship. ");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("taunt_3", "I am surprised Nej'a didn't want to take care of you himself.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("taunt_4", "Ok boys, looks like we have a live on here. Let's change that!");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("taunt_5", "Nej'a knew you couldn't resist playing the hero. Time to die, Imperial dog.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("thanks_1", "I bet Nej'a is that amazing pilot who attacked us earlier.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("thanks_2", "Do you think Nej'a is the leader?");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("thanks_3", "Nej'a? I wonder if he is that amazing pilot.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("thanks_4", "Maybe we should get out of here before that Nej'a guy shows up.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("thanks_5", "No offense, but if Nej'a is that pilot I saw earlier we should really get out of here.");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("title", "Dathomir System: Rescue the Imperial Drop Ship");
stringFiles[1793].addEntry("title_d", "Remain in the Dathomir system and assist the Imperial drop ship with repairs. The drop ship has been hit by the enemy before it could completely get out of the system. The first wave managed to temporarily disable the vessel and scans indicate a second wave moving in. Meet the disabled vessel, assist it with repairs, and protect it while it moves towards the secondary jump location.");

stringFiles[1794] = new StringFile("spacequest/rescue/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_b");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("abort", "What are you doing pilot?! If I survive this I will have you incarcerated!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("arrival_phase_1", "A Rebel diplomat and his retinue were ambushed by some Imperial fighters and is drifting in space, they need our help.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("arrival_phase_2", "Get over to their location before an Imperial Shuttle reach him. Transfer some spare part so they can fix their ship.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("assigned_delayed", "");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("attack_notify", "Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("attack_stopped", "Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("autorewardbody", "");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("autorewardfrom", "");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("autorewardsubject", "");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("complete", "Too bad about the Inquisitor but the day wasn't a complete loss. Return to base.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("docking_complete", "They got the spare parts. As soon as they are up and running, escort them out of there.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("docking_started", "I'm sure that the Empire left some fighters in the area so dock and transfer those spare parts quickly.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("failed_destroy", "We lost contact with the diplomats vessel! You can't seem to get anything right today can you pilot? Return to base immediately!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("panic_1", "Me and my crew are not fighters! The evil Empire has no honor!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("panic_2", "Not more of them!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("panic_3", "I guess trying to talk to them would be pointless?");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("panic_4", "I'm starting to get really angry. We have not done anything to warrant this!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("panic_5", "You'd think they have something better to do!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("quest_dock_d", "Dock with the diplomats ship and transfer over tools and spare parts so they can repair their engines. Defend them from any enemies while they are repairing their ship.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("quest_dock_t", "Dock with diplomat ship.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("quest_escort_d", "The Empire have undoubtedly spotted you by now and will send fighters to try and disable or destroy the diplomats ship. Escort him to safety.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Escort the diplomat to safety.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("quest_location_d", "Be careful on your way to the diplomats vessel and try not to attract more enemy presence. You need to still keep a good speed though as that Imperial shuttle is closing in to capture the diplomat.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Dathomir system.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("quest_update", "Worvog Arkon: < %TO >");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("recovery_success", "They will be safe from here pilot. Good job.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("rescue_abandoned", "What are you doing pilot?! If I survive this I will have you incarcerated!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("rescue_phase_1", "We are so glad to see you pilot! Who knows what might have happened to us if you weren't here.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("rescue_phase_2", "We have the spare parts. Our technician says he will have our ship running in no time.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("taunt_1", "You are not going anywhere Rebels!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("taunt_2", "Cut your engines immediately or we will destroy you!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("taunt_3", "That man is wanted for questioning, surrender now or we have no choice but to destroy you.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("taunt_4", "You are all known Rebels, if you don't stop immediately, we have the right to terminate you.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("taunt_5", "The great Empire wants the people on that ship for questioning, or dead, it's your choice!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("thanks_1", "All this senseless killing...");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("thanks_2", "I guess it was us or them eh?");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("thanks_3", "You think they would give up after all those casaulties..");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("thanks_4", "I hope they get the picture and leave us alone, this is madness!");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("thanks_5", "Please let that be the last of them...");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("title", "Dathomir system: Rescue the Rebel diplomat.");
stringFiles[1794].addEntry("title_d", "We have received a distress call from one of our diplomats near to you. Him and his retinue was ambushed by Imperial fighters and are floating around in space with disabled engines while an Imperial Shuttle is closing in to capture them. Hurry over there and transfer repair hardware to them.");

stringFiles[1795] = new StringFile("spacequest/rescue/corellia_rebel_tier4_4_b");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("abort", "Aborting eh? Well you can forget about the information then.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("arrival_phase_1", "Just a second, transmitting the location of the SpyNet agents vessel.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("arrival_phase_2", "Get over there quickly and transfer over the spare parts he need. From the information he gave us, the Empire is still chasing him.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("assigned_delayed", "");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("attack_notify", "Tactical Computer: < Incoming fighter vessels. Scans show weapons armed. >");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("attack_stopped", "Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("autorewardbody", "");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("autorewardfrom", "");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("autorewardsubject", "");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("complete", "Thanks Rebel. I guess I owe you this data for free. Good luck!");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("docking_complete", "Okay, now escort him to safety and he will give us the route of the Imperial freighters, that was the deal.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("docking_started", "I've transmitted a list of what spare parts he need to your astromech, it will take care of it.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("failed_destroy", "Damnation! That was our last chance. Return to base immediately, we need to come up with a new plan.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("panic_1", "I knew they wouldn't give up.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("panic_2", "They really don't want me to share this information with anyone.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("panic_3", "I'm not much of a fighter pilot so I hope you're good.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("panic_4", "Hostiles gunning for us!");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("panic_5", "Here they come, get ready.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("quest_dock_d", "If you are certain that the surrounding area is clear of enemy presence, dock with the spy and transfer repair materials to him.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("quest_dock_t", "Dock with the spy.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("quest_escort_d", "Escort the spy to safety. Once he's safe he will provide us with the route of the Imperial freighter.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Get out safely.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("quest_location_d", "The Endor system is crawling with Imperial fighters and the area where the spy is drifting is especially dangerous. Try to sneak by Imperial patrols but if it can't be avoided, dispatch of them quickly. Under no circumstance are you to lead them to the location of the spy.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Endor system.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("quest_update", "Worvog Arkon: < %TO >");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("recovery_success", "Alright, the spy is safe and transmitted the route information.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("rescue_abandoned", "Aborting eh? Well you can forget about the information then.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("rescue_phase_1", "Glad to see you Rebel. Lets dock so I can get this thing fixed.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("rescue_phase_2", "All done. Now if you get me out of here safely, I will transmit the information you need.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "Worvog Arkon: < The Imperial fleet is almost leaving the Endor sector. You're closest so get over there fast and start the attack! >");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("taunt_1", "");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("taunt_2", "");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("taunt_3", "");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("taunt_4", "");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("taunt_5", "");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("thanks_1", "Phew, close one.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("thanks_2", "Get me out of here now!");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("thanks_3", "I have a feeling there will be more of them.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("thanks_4", "Lets not linger around here and wait for more of them to arrive.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("thanks_5", "You're good Rebel, I'll give you that.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("title", "Endor system: Rescue the spy.");
stringFiles[1795].addEntry("title_d", "We got a second chance in stopping the Imperial freighter carrying station building materials to Lok. A SpyNet operative have contacted the Alliance. He was ambushed by the Empire but got away. He took heavy damage though and his ship have malfunctioned. If we help him, he will give up the freighters route. Hurry over to his location and transfer some repair tools to his ship, then escort him to safety.");

stringFiles[1796] = new StringFile("spacequest/rescue/corellia_station_mission1_1");
stringFiles[1796].addEntry("abort", "What? You can't leave us like this. You can be sure I'll notify CorSec command...");
stringFiles[1796].addEntry("arrival_phase_1", "We are tracking the distress call to the originating vessel. Stand by for coordinates.");
stringFiles[1796].addEntry("arrival_phase_2", "Transmitting coordinates now. Investigate the situation and assist with standard repair procedures.");
stringFiles[1796].addEntry("assigned_delayed", "");
stringFiles[1796].addEntry("attack_notify", "\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer: <\\#pcontrast3  Warning. Unidentified enemy craft inbound.\\#pcontrast1 >");
stringFiles[1796].addEntry("attack_stopped", "\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer: <\\#pcontrast3  Enemy threat neutralized.\\#pcontrast1 >");
