stringFiles[1815] = new StringFile("spacequest/rescue/tatooine_station_hutt_palace_access_quest_1");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("abort", "I thought you were sent to help me? Where are you going?");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("arrival_phase_1", "Lets get this started. One of Jabba's smugglers is disabled by Imperial TIE's and waiting to be picked up by one of their shuttles. Let's 'rescue' him.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("arrival_phase_2", "There's the coordinates. Get over there and help him escape. Pretend that you are on Jabba's payroll and hopefully he can tell you where Hortrix Steelarm is.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("assigned_delayed", "");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("attack_notify", "Tactical Computer: < Incoming fighter vessels. Scans show weapons armed. >");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("attack_stopped", "Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("autorewardbody", "");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("autorewardfrom", "");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("autorewardsubject", "");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("complete", "Hortrix Steelarm you say? Last I heard he was smuggling parts from that blown up space station in the Yavin system. Anyway, see you around and thanks for the help!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("docking_complete", "Nice, you should have his confidence now. Escort him to safety and try to get information from him.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("docking_started", "Transfer some spare parts over to his ship so he can repair it.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("failed_destroy", "I won't cry over one of Jabba's henchmen but I thought you were a competent pilot. Come back when you can finish the job!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("panic_1", "As I thought, these blasted Imperial scum never give up!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("panic_2", "I assume that you will help me destroy these fools?");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("panic_3", "These guys are worse than a womp rat infestation, they never go away!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("panic_4", "My sensors are picking up more TIE ships heading our way!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("panic_5", "Arrgh! Do they never give up?");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("quest_dock_d", "Target and dock with the Hutt smuggler to transfer the spare parts to him. Make sure there's no enemies close by as you will be very vulnerable during the docking procedure.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("quest_dock_t", "Transfer spare parts.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("quest_escort_d", "Escort the Hutt smuggler to safety and try to pry some information about Hortrix Steelarm from him.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("quest_escort_t", "Escort the smuggler.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("quest_location_d", "The area where the smuggler was disabled is one of the few that sees a bit of Imperial activity in the Tatooine system. Although the Empire usually doesn't attack people without some reason, stay alert as they are suspicious of everyone in this area of the galaxy.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Tatooine system.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("quest_update", "Valarian Assassin Coordinator: < %TO >");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("recovery_success", "Good job. At least we got some clues to where we should continue our search.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("rescue_abandoned", "I thought you were sent to help me? Where are you going?");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("rescue_phase_1", "Hey there! You were sent by the palace to help me? Wow, I didn't think what I was hauling was that important.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("rescue_phase_2", "Great, I got the parts I need, give me a few seconds and I will have this baby working again.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("split_quest_alert", "Valarian Assassin Coordinator: < Alright head over to the Yavin system, we'll set up a meeting for you with a smuggler that might know if Hortrix is there. >");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("split_quest_alert_fail", "");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("taunt_1", "Pirate scum, there's no escape!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("taunt_2", "That man is a wanted criminal and by assisting him, so are you!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("taunt_3", "You Hutts think you are the big cheese in this system, well we got a surprise for you!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("taunt_4", "That ship is now the property of the Emperor, shut down your engines and surrender immediately!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("taunt_5", "Sorry to ruin your day pirates but you are not going anywhere!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("thanks_1", "That was beautiful *sniff*");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("thanks_2", "Yes! Keep them coming, we'll take them all down!");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("thanks_3", "You made that one look easy pilot.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("thanks_4", "Is it just me or do you agree that these fools are almost too easy?");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("thanks_5", "Nothing like the sound of TIE debris bouncing of your hull is there?");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("title", "Tatooine system: Grasping for clues.");
stringFiles[1815].addEntry("title_d", "You have been offered a bounty for eliminating one of Jabba's smugglers named Hortrix Steelarm by Lady Valarian and the first order of business is to track him down. Another of Jabba's smugglers has been disabled by an Imperial TIE patrol. He's left drifting in Tatooine space waiting to be picked up by an Imperial shuttle. Let's 'rescue' him and hopefully he will divulge some information on Hortrix. Keep pretending that you are on Jabba's payroll while communicating with the smuggler.");

