stringFiles[1867].addEntry("quest_helpallies_d", "B-Wings are designed to eliminate capital ships and space stations. When they come under fire from massed forces of fighters, they are in trouble. That's where you come in pilot, help them break through the Imperial forces.");
stringFiles[1867].addEntry("quest_helpallies_t", "Assist the Crimson Squadron.");
