stringFiles[1868].addEntry("quest_location_d", "With our successful attacks in the Dathomir system lately, the Empire has increased their alert status and the system is more dangerous than ever. Avoid attracting any extra attention at all costs while you are on your way to meet up with the X-Wing squadron.");
