stringFiles[1869].addEntry("quest_helpallies_d", "Destroy all the Imperial forces in the vicinity. We can't take the risk of capturing that prototype fighter intact in such a hostile area, we'll just examine the debris after you have blown it to pieces.");
stringFiles[1869].addEntry("quest_helpallies_t", "Destroy the Imperial forces.");
stringFiles[1869].addEntry("quest_location_d", "You're heading back in to the areas heavily defended by Imperial forces. The good news is you will have reinforcements with you, the bad news is that you will fight a prototype fighter that may turn out to be very dangerous.");
