stringFiles[1870].addEntry("quest_location_d", "The Dathomir system is always considered a high-risk system. It's extremely well guarded by the Empire and only the craziest or best pilots not belonging to the Empire travels there, which makes it even more dangerous. To make it worse, you're heading in to Imperial areas.");
