stringFiles[1871].addEntry("enemies_remain", "Tactical Computer: < Sensors show enemy target terminated. %DI enemy targets remain. >");
stringFiles[1871].addEntry("enemies_win", "I'm giving the bombers an abort order, we are taking too heavy losses!");
stringFiles[1871].addEntry("found_loc", "Proceed to these coordinates pilot, the rest of the squadron will meet you there.");
stringFiles[1871].addEntry("quest_findbattle_d", "These are the coordinates of attack. The rest of the squadron will meet you close to this location. Make your way there with haste.");
stringFiles[1871].addEntry("quest_findbattle_t", "Coordinates of attack.");
stringFiles[1871].addEntry("quest_helpallies_d", "With the rest of the squadron, take out the fighter defense of the Imperial space station so that our bombers can make it through.");
stringFiles[1871].addEntry("quest_helpallies_t", "Destroy the ships fighter defense.");
stringFiles[1871].addEntry("quest_location_d", "We are not sure why the Empire has such a large part of their navy stationed in the Endor system but it makes it a dangerous place for us. It's our hope that there's so many of them here because they are manufacturing these new advanced TIE's in this system.");
