stringFiles[1872].addEntry("allies_remain", "Rebel Pilot: < My ship is falling apart, I need help! They are all ove... >");
stringFiles[1872].addEntry("allies_win", "And that my friends is why we are considered the best of the best. I'm proud of you all.");
