stringFiles[1872].addEntry("quest_helpallies_t", "The Crimson Phoenix attacks.");
stringFiles[1872].addEntry("quest_location_d", "You know the drill in the Dathomir system, extreme caution at all times. The target of attack is deep inside Imperial territory so be very careful approaching it, we don't want to lead more enemies over to the battle.");
