stringFiles[1872].addEntry("title", "Dathomir system: Defeat one of the Empires experimental ships.");
stringFiles[1872].addEntry("title_d", "We have found another of the new ships that you just encountered. Seeing how they were so dangerous, we are sending the squadron to assist you in bringing it down. We will keep monitoring it during the battle to try and find out as much as we can about it.");

