stringFiles[1873].addEntry("quest_location_d", "If you're a enemy of the Empire, the Yavin system should be considered very dangerous as they are widespread through out the system. There's also a number of smugglers, bounty hunters and pirates trying to scavenge parts of the large debris field in the system and they are not afraid to prey on targets of opportunity.");
