stringFiles[1903].addEntry("quest_reachpoint_d", "Once you have arrived at the navigation waypoint, wait until the scan begins. Once the scan begins, you will need to remain in the area until it completes. You will receive regular updates on how long you have until the operation is over. If you move to far away from the navigation waypoint you will receive a warning message. If you remain outside of the area for to long the mission will fail.");
