stringFiles[1903].addEntry("title_d", "Travel to the Endor system and start the system scan at the ambush point. When you enter the Endor system you will receive a navigation waypoint to the ambush point. Travel to this waypoint and wait for the scan to begin. In order to succeed, you need to stay near the navigation waypoint. If you move to far away you will receive a warning message for you to return. Once the scan begins the Rebels will send out fighters to attack you. Defend yourself against attack but do not leave the area until the scan is completed.");
stringFiles[1903].addEntry("transmission_received", "Transmission Status: <Transmission Completed. Location of Rebel command vessel discovered.>");
