stringFiles[1906].addEntry("quest_location_d", "As if the Dathomir system wasn't dangerous enough, several squadrons of TIE's are heading your way! We know we're asking a lot pilot but you have to cover the escape of our gunboat, we need those codes!");
stringFiles[1906].addEntry("quest_location_t", "Dathomir system.");
