stringFiles[1912].addEntry("advanced_capacitor_battery", "An advanced starship weapon capacitor battery.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("advanced_fuel_ignition", "An advanced booster fuel ignition system.  A component used in the production of high quality starship boosters.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("advanced_fusion_core", "An advanced fusion core.  A well built fusion core affects the generation rate of a reactor.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("advanced_power_distributor", "An advanced reactor power distributor.  As one might expect from the name, this system distributes energy generated by the reactor to the components in a ship that require it.  ");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("advanced_projector_unit", "An advanced projector unit.  This is the system that projects the generated shields to the parts of the ship that require it.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("advanced_recharge_module", "An advanced recharge module for a starship weapon capacitor.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("adv_deflector_shields", "Equipment Certification Level: 7A Mark IV deflector shield generator.  Shield generators provide a first line of defense against incoming energy weapons.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("adv_durasteel_plating", "Equipment Certification Level: 7A Mark IV durasteel alloy plating that provides superior protection for small starfighters like the X-Wing and the Z95 Headhunter.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("adv_exhaust", "An advanced exhaust system for a starfighter engine.  A well built exhaust system can significantly affect engine performance.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("adv_fuel_regulation", "An advanced fuel regulation system for a starfighter engine.  The regulation system affects the fuel mixture burned by the sublight drives, so a well built system will positively affect engine performance.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("analysis_tool", "This tool is used by Reverse Engineers to analyze starship components.  All looted ship components have a reverse engineering level---placing that number of identical components in this tool, then using the tool, will result in the creation of a starship component superior in quality to the ones consumed in the process.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("armor_effectiveness_intensifier_mk1", "This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapons.  This component boosts the armor effectiveness of the weapon, but decreases the shield effectiveness.");
