stringFiles[1912].addEntry("std_fuel_regulation", "An advanced fuel regulation system for a starfighter engine.  The regulation system affects the fuel mixture burned by the sublight drives, so a well built system will positively affect engine performance.");
stringFiles[1912].addEntry("texture_kit_s01", "This kit can change the paint style of a starfighter.RESTRICTIONS:  Imperial ships may not be re-textured.");
