stringFiles[1929].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("next", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Slave, I will have words with you. You seem to have been given more freedom than most of your ilk, therefore I charge you with a task that other slaves may are not able to complete. It has come to my attention that there is a cave filled with many inbred rancors. These creatures must be destroyed before they spread their line. Are you ready for your task?");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I will mark the location of the cave on your datapad so that you can attend to this immediately. You are charged with entering the cave and destroying as many of these abominations as possible before you find your own life extinguished. Go now.");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I will find who your owner is and bring upon a wrathful vengeance for your insolence. Your owner has not trained you adequately, slave. This will be rectified immediately.");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_4_1", "A fellow sister had found that even though she desired to be trained to tame rancors, she had not the skill within her. Though she was directed to undertake different tasks, she rebelled and went into exile. It seems she has decided to continue with her training on her own, resulting in a perversion of the noble line of rancor. You will eradicate these mutants.");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Good luck, then.");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_reset", "Then fare well... if you can.");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Did you find the mutant rancor cave?");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes, mistress.");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("player_2_1", "No, mistress, I cannot do this.");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("player_3_1", "How could something like this happen?");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("player_reset", "I have other plans, mistress.");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("player_sorry", "Not yet. I am still looking.");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "A cave filled with horribly inbred rancors. Destroy all you see so that they can no longer breed.");
stringFiles[1929].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Mutant Rancor Cave");

stringFiles[1930] = new StringFile("spawning/static_npc/herald_dathomir_nightsister_forcedlabor_camp");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("cant_work", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("next", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_1_1", "You were able to escape from the sisters, too? What? You're from the stars!? Then maybe you might be able to help! The Nightsisters chose the strongest of their slaves and force them to work the mines! I managed to escape and search for help, for we cannot save ourselves! Will you please help us gain our freedom?");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Oh, thank you! Here is where the mines are. Were trapped down deep inside the mines, and the Nightsisters oversee everything we do. If you're going to help us, you will need to bring help of your own. I look forward to seeing my friends again? thank you so much.");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I guess I understand. The Nightsisters are something no one should have to face in a battle. I will be off to try to find someone who is able to help.");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_4_1", "They were the first people I sought out. The Empire told me that they would prefer to leave well enough alone, and that they didn't care about a few escaped slaves. Blast the Empire! They are no better than the Nightsisters! Will you help us, please?");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Good luck.");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_reset", "No problem. I hope to see you around.");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Did you find it?");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes, I'll definitely help!");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("player_2_1", "I cannot help you.");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("player_3_1", "Why don't you ask the Empire for help?");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("player_reset", "I've decided to pass on this expedition.");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("player_sorry", "Not yet. I am still looking.");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "A series of resource mines that are being worked by slaves of the Nightsisters.");
stringFiles[1930].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Forced-Labor Mine");

stringFiles[1931] = new StringFile("spawning/static_npc/herald_dathomir_nsister_cave_azzenaj");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("cant_work", "Your mind is too occupied at the moment, come back another time when you are not so distracted.");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("next", "What do you want maggot?! Can't you see I'm busy?!");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hmm, so you are looking to prove yourself worthy of your life eh? Well there is a little something you could assist me with I suppose. A few nights ago an initiate of mine was out collecting some herbs. She should have been back the same day but we haven't seen her since. This isn't the first time that we've lost sisters out in that area. Can you go out there and see what you can find out maggot?!");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Excellent. The area where this herb grows is around here. Get out there and find out what happened!");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Your probably afraid maggot! Well I guess I couldn't expect anything less from one of your kind.");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Dathomir is a dangerous place and we've heard rumors about...well you don't need to know about that. Just go find her already!");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You better maggot!");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You failed me maggot! What good are you?! Get out of my sight!");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "What do you want maggot?! Can't you see I'm busy?!");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_reset", "Knew I shouldn't have put any trust in one of your kind!");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "As I thought. We've heard rumors about this foul clan before. Knowing the location of their cave will prove most useful. You have served me well maggot!");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("npc_work_1", "What are you doing here maggot?! You're supposed to be out there checking what happened to my initiate!");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes witch, I will see what I can find out. Where is this area?");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("player_2_1", "If she didn't return, I may not either. Doesn't sound like something I would want to get involved in.");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("player_3_1", "Do you have any idea what it could be out there?");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("player_reset", "I've decided that it's probably not a good idea for me to head in to that area.");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("player_sorry", "I'm sorry witch; I will get right back out there and see what I can find.");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "This is where a cave of outcast Nightsisters is rumored to live.");
stringFiles[1931].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Nightsister cave");

stringFiles[1932] = new StringFile("spawning/static_npc/herald_dathomir_nsister_cave_leandra");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("cant_work", "You should finish your current tasks before bothering me, now get out!");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("next", "I don't have time for you, get out of here!");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_1_1", "There's an abomination of a clan that holds fortress in a cave near the Great Canyon. We need someone to scout out this place for a weakness in their defenses. These heretics must be eradicated!");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Excellent. They are located in this area, find out as many details as you can and hurry back.");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Fine! Find the help you need and come back when you have it.");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_4_1", "They are an abomination! They don't even befriend the Rancor and are a disgrace to our entire sisterhood!");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Hurry! I didn't say you could slack on this important task did I?!");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You're just as useless as I thought!");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I don't have time for you, get out of here!");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_reset", "Apologies won't help me! Get out of here and don't come back until you're of any use to me!");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "I suppose this could help, we will get right to planning what we have to do next.");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("npc_work_1", "You return empty handed?!");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("player_1_1", "I will try my best.");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("player_2_1", "It sounds like I would need more assistance with me than I have right now. I will have to say no for now.");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("player_3_1", "But they are also nightsisters?");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("player_reset", "I can't do it right now, very sorry.");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("player_sorry", "I have not managed to do your mission yet but I will get right on it.");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "This is where a cave of outcast Nightsisters is rumored to live.");
stringFiles[1932].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Nightsister Cave");

stringFiles[1933] = new StringFile("spawning/static_npc/herald_dathomir_nsister_cave_olof");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("cant_work", "You already have plenty of things to worry about, come back when your less occupied.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("next", "I have lots of things to do, but nothing for you right now.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Lets see, yes, you could probably assist me. I've heard of a clan of the dangerous Nightsisters that has developed a strange symbiosis with some other creatures than the Rancor. I'd appreciate it if you could find out what's going on out there.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good, I know they have their base of operations somewhere in this area. Let me know what you find out.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Thought you were more skilled than you are I guess.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Well if we can find a common variable in the way they tame their rancors and these creatures, we may be one step closer to...well but that's classified information.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Good, the sooner I get this information the better. Get to it soldier!");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Bah, thought I could count on you doing this! Get out of here; I have no use for imbeciles.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I have lots of things to do, but nothing for you right now.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_reset", "Didn't take you for the spineless type. Well I'm sure someone more courageous can assist me then.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Spiders eh? Hmm interesting, we may have to put together a strike force and see if we can capture some species.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Already back?");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("player_1_1", "Sounds interesting, I will see what I can find out.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("player_2_1", "Nightsisters, from what I've heard about them, I should stay as far away from where ever they are as possible. No thanks.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("player_3_1", "Why would this be interesting information?");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("player_reset", "I've decided that it's probably not a good idea for me to head in to that area.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("player_sorry", "Sorry no, haven't had time yet. Will get right on it.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "This is where a cave of outcast Nightsisters is rumored to live.");
stringFiles[1933].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Nightsister cave");

stringFiles[1934] = new StringFile("spawning/static_npc/herald_dathomir_singing_vs_nightsister");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("cant_work", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("next", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_1_1", "You are a slave that has been granted greater freedoms, are you not? Then you are needed to help your mistresses defeat the Singing Mountain clan and their Clan Mother, Augwynne. You need to journey to the field of battle where your Nightsisters will claim victory over those worthless excuses for witches and take up arms against them.");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_2_1", "That is a good slave. Here is where the battle wages. Go forth and rip their hearts from their chests! You are commanded to fight until your life is quenched, at which time another will take your place. Now go!");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_3_1", "YOU HAVE BEEN GIVEN A COMMAND! This was not a request. When your mistress has heard of this flagrant disobedience, you will wish you had died upon the fields immediately.");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_4_1", "You shall be able to find more than ample supplies and weapons on the bodies of those who have come before you. Do not dare to disturb the dead bodies of your Mistresses, or even of the pathetic Singing Mountatin sisters, for you are beneath such an honor. Now, you are directed to leave at once.");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Do so.");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_reset", "Hm. Unwise.");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Did you find it?");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes, my mistress, I shall.");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("player_2_1", "I cannot do so, mistress.");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("player_3_1", "What will I be armed with?");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("player_reset", "I've decided to pass on this.");
stringFiles[1934].addEntry("player_sorry", "I am still looking, mistress.");
