stringFiles[1936].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hello! I represent an organization called Rescue Our Lesser Brothers. We're dedicated to helping species that cannot help themselves. We've had the plight of the Ewok brought to our attention, and we're now striving to help them from the vicious Dulok species. Would you like to help join our crusade?");
stringFiles[1936].addEntry("npc_2_1", "One tribe of these Duloks are called the Korga, and they've been become quite adept in killing their cousins, the Ewoks. We figure that if their numbers were whittled down a little, the Ewoks would have a better chance. Here's where the Korga can be found. Travel there and wipe out those little buggers.");
stringFiles[1936].addEntry("npc_3_1", "You're probably one of those Imperials, aren't you? It's just like an Imperial to say 'Who cares about the Ewoks?. If you don't help them, they won't help you! Well, if they were in a position to help. Arg! You know what I'm trying to say.");
stringFiles[1936].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Oh, we've made great strides in helping the Narglatch on Naboo. We've set them up in a nice cave so they can breed without the threat of others. We've also helped a group of people learn how to raise Kimogilas on Lok. We're responsible for many, many good things in this galaxy. So, do you want to help us?");
stringFiles[1936].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1936].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1936].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Good! Take care.");
stringFiles[1936].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
