stringFiles[1940].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Har, har, har! Do you want to hear a good one? I heard some Gungans today saying that they've got some kind of monastery where they train their elite warriors! Elite Gungans? HAR, HAR, HAR! That's hilarious! Wanna know where they claim the temple is?");
stringFiles[1940].addEntry("npc_2_1", "So they say it's out past the swamps. One of them dared me to go make fun of them to their face. I'm gonna have a few more drinks with the boys, then we'll all show up. I've marked it on your datapad, so you can also make fun of them as well.");
stringFiles[1940].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Oh you're one of them Gungan lovers, aren't you? I bet your momma was Gungan, wasn't she? Well heck anytime you want to know where your momma came from, you just tell me, okay?");
stringFiles[1940].addEntry("npc_4_1", "I couldn't tell with all that meesa and 'yoosa junk. They said they train their most sacred warriors there, and that only a few Gungans are even allowed to train with them. Something about snatching the Boomba from the Faamba's mouth, or somethin'. Wanna know where it is?");
stringFiles[1940].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1940].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1940].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Good luck, then.");
