stringFiles[1943].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Whoohoo...barely made it out of that one today. I found a whole colony of narglatches nestled up in a cave a ways out. To think I was about to walk right inside and rest for a bit. If you've got nothing left to live for, I can tell you where to find them.");
