stringFiles[1943].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I don't blame you. Those narglatches aren't something I like messing with. Well, good day to you.");
stringFiles[1943].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Don't you know? Whenever narglatches come together and start settling down, they only pick a place that's rich in resources. That place they're at is a virtual bank in resources. Then again...you have to deal with the narglatches first.");
