stringFiles[1947].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Come here, come here. Have you ever heard of the Lost Jandosan Mines? I used to be one of the miners at Jandosan, until those dirty Veermoks decided to make it their home. Do you want to know where the mines used to be?");
stringFiles[1947].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Well, it's a ways off from here. Let me just mark it down on your datapad. Why don't you go out there and give those Veermoks a little whatfor? Those blasted things killed some good men, and I wouldn't mind seeing them get their just desserts.");
stringFiles[1947].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Oh, I see. Just a crazy old miner, eh? You don't have time to list to the stories of those who came before you, eh? You're just like all the rest of the kids today!");
stringFiles[1947].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Oh, this was years before you were born, kid! That place was full of all kinds of resources! We would have made a killing were it not for those danged apes! They just came by one day and killed everyone, then made it their new home. It still burns me to this day!");
