stringFiles[1955].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1955].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Yes, yes, you looked like someone who would do this. Let me mark this down on your datapad for you. Here is where you can find a wide assortment of Khmurra that are bred to kill. Kill as many as you want. That'll teach him not to support his product!");
