stringFiles[1959].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Would you mind helping an old man? I have a friend who went out to look at Fort Tusken to try to get rid of the Sand People. The problem is that I haven't heard from him for over a year now. Could you go out there and see if he's still alive? I'd greatly appreciate it.");
stringFiles[1959].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Oh, wonderful. I'd do it myself, but I'm afraid those Tuskens would get me before I knew it. I doubt he's still alive out there, but if you see him, tell Old Ben I said Hi. Thanks again, friend.");
stringFiles[1959].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I don't blame you. I'm scared of them myself. Well, it didn't hurt to ask. Thanks anyway.");
stringFiles[1959].addEntry("npc_4_1", "I'm not sure. He said he knew a good trick on scaring them away, but said it was a secret. All I know is that he left one day with some kid and that's the last I saw of him.");
