stringFiles[1960].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hic * Hey, you wanna help a guy out? I'm gonna go show that Jabba that he can't push me around anymore. I know where he keeps all his stuff hidden away, and I'm * hic* goin' there to take it from him. I bet you wanna know where it is, don't you?");
stringFiles[1960].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Yeah, I thought you did. Let me see your datapad yeah.. it's over * hic * here somewhere. You can meet me out there and we'll take all of his loot! I'll let * hic * you have half the stuff. Heyyyy.... what are best friends for, eh?");
stringFiles[1960].addEntry("npc_3_1", "'Cause you don't have a spine, that's why! You're just like that * hic * slug! Why don't you come back here when you get some courage, eh? You can get some from the cantina like me, in case you don't know where * hic * to get it.");
stringFiles[1960].addEntry("npc_4_1", "What did he do to me?! WHAT DID HE * hic * DO TO ME?! He... erm... he went ahead and... er... I don't * hic * know anymore. It doesn't matter! He needs to be set straight! And taking all his stuff will show him who's the master, right! Wanna know where he keeps the stuff?");
stringFiles[1960].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1960].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1960].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Yeah, I though you did. Let me see your datapad, yeah.. it's over * hic * here somewhere. You can meet me out there and we'll take all of his loot! I'll let * hic * you have half the stuff. Heyyyy... what are best friends for, eh?");
