stringFiles[1961].addEntry("npc_1_1", "An informant has let us know that there is a small band of Rebels that have set up camp nearby. Since the Empire proper cannot investigate this claim, you are being charged with the duty of doing reconnaissance. Are you ready for the coordinates?");
stringFiles[1961].addEntry("npc_2_1", "According to the informant's information, you should be able to find these rebels at this location. The intelligence we have is that they are small in number, and should be able to be easily handled. You may be called upon later by the Empire for further information.");
stringFiles[1961].addEntry("npc_3_1", "The only acceptable answer will be that you have a precious assignment by someone of higher rank than myself. This is the case, I presume?");
stringFiles[1961].addEntry("npc_4_1", "We have lost some numbers due to Sandpeople raids recently. Since this is not a major threat, we do not have the resources to direct towards these Rebels. According to our information, there should only be a small number of them there. Ready for your coordinates?");
