stringFiles[1968].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hello there! You might be asking yourself why someone like me would be here on a planet like this, aren't you? Well, I am a representative of Star Tours, a travel agency known Galaxy-wide. We're conducting surveys on possible future business expansions. Hey! Perhaps you might be able to help? Would you be interested in helping us?");
stringFiles[1968].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Spectacular! All we need is for you to go to this building and explore the area. We'll ask other passerbys if they'll do the same for us as well. Just get a feel of the place, and ask yourself Is this the type of place I would bring my family on vacation. We'll eventually meet up again and I'll then ask you what your opinion of the place is.");
stringFiles[1968].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Ah, what a shame. To think I had a couple of tickets that I was thinking of giving away for our new cruiseliner, the Tzarina. Well, tickets for whenever it gets back from it's voyage. Well, ta-ta!");
stringFiles[1968].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Well, if you're familiar with us, you'll know that we sell exciting tours across the galaxy. We're looking into offering a new way of exploring the galaxy that we call home, in what we call a safari. One of the highlights will be to show off indigenous structures to explore? all safely, of course.");
stringFiles[1968].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1968].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1968].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Good! All we need is for you to go to this building and explore the area. We'll ask other passerbys if they'll do the same for us as well. Just get a feel of the place, and ask yourself Is this the type of place I would bring my family on vacation. We'll eventually meet up again and I'll then ask you what your opinion of the place is.");
