stringFiles[1970] = new StringFile("spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("cant_work", "We can't talk right now. Lady Valarian suspects that there is a spy in our midst. You should take care of your personal business and come back later.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Look. I'm waiting for someone. You'd better not be seen with me. I have the death sentence on twelve systems!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I have no idea what you're talking about.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Who are you?  Sorry, I'm rather distracted at the moment...");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Get away from me.  I'm dangerous");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "You don't want any part of me.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "I'm very busy and very important.  I can't talk to you.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("gotowork", "Are you kidding?  I'm here for the new roster.  What is this?  Don't you have it?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("gotowork_1", "Are you kidding? I'm here for the new roster. Not THAT!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("next", "Sorry I can't help you. I have a number of new recruits to train. Why don't you speak with Lady Valarian?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("notit_3", "What is this?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("notit_4", "What is this?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("notit_5", "I'm not sure what that is.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("notit_6", "This isn't the egg.  What is this?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("notyet", "You should chat with Kavas over there. She's got plenty of work for folks like you.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Kavas says you're ready to do some real work. I've put your name on a list of new recruits. Deliver it to our chief assassin to avoid getting murdered in the street.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Lady Valarian's compound guard was supposed to deliver lunch some time ago. We haven't heard anything and we're starting to worry. Can you go check it out?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Rumor has it Jabba hired an off world scientist named Dr. Kaum to come help him develop some weapons technology.  Dr. Kaum doesn't know any of Jabba's thugs, so go pick him up before they get there.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_1_4", "There's a murderer on the loose.  Never let it be said that we let something like this happen in our territory.  I want this one killed.  Are we clear?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_1_5", "Jabba's trying to be clever.  He sent someone to taint our water supplies.  Find the one's responsible and bring back whatever they're putting in our water.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_1_6", "This is it.  This one will get you in to see Valarian herself.  She wants you to steal an expensive avian egg from a delivery guy.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good choice. Here's the updated ledger. You'll find our Chief Assassin on the outskirts of town.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Excellent. Head out toward the edge of town and see if you can escort our friend here.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Great.  When you get him back here we'll take *good* care of him.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Right.  Murder will not be tolerated.  Not of innocents.  If this guy were killing Jabba's people, who would notice?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_2_5", "I knew I could count on you.  There's likely to be more than one of them.  Get them all if you can.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_2_6", "I had a feeling.  Anyone that's hung around here as long as you certainly wants to see the boss lady.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_3_1", "That's what I thought. ");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Unwise. Lady Valarian expects loyalty. I'll try to keep your unwillingness a secret.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Yeah, you're right.  Maybe whoever we hire to take your place...");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_3_4", "You sound more cowardly then you used to.  Are you feeling all right?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_3_5", "We don't have a lot of time on this one so come back as soon as you're free.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_3_6", "Well, don't keep the boss waiting, she doesn't like it.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Never you mind. If you are not known to our chief assassin you will surely die...");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Lady Valarian ordered a special Rill casserole. I'm sure she'd share it if it arrives safely.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Just tell him Jabba wants to meet him for a drink first.  This guy doesn't know anything about what's going on here.  We're gonna make sure he knows the score.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Killers aren't good business.  Who's gonna gamble if everyone's dead?  Who's gonna pay for protection.  This one has to be taken care of.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_4_5", "I don't know yet.  That's why I need you to bring it back.  Lots of our customers are getting sick, whatever this stuff is.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_4_6", "That's the joke.  Jabba ordered it special.  His chef, Porcellus, was going to make him a special meal.  We're gonna annoy Jabba and have a nice dinner all at the same time!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_5_3", "No one seems to know, though from what I hear Dr. Kaum's specialty is beam weapons.  Probably just some new kind of rifle.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_5_4", "Someone called Roden Venthrall.  A student, apparently, of Dolac Legasi's.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_5_5", "You know what our number one selling drink is at the Despot?  Water.  It's a desert friend, everybody needs water!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_5_6", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_6_3", "You should have plenty of lead time, but even if you don't I know you know how to fight...");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_6_4", "Heh, another murderer serving a life sentence in an imperial prison on Dathomir.  You don't want to run into that guy, trust me.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_6_5", "Positive.  We spotted a couple of them near our moisture harvesters.  Don't get careless, these guys are for real.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_6_6", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Good luck.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Please hurry.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Get out there before Jabba's fiends find him.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Get out there and find that guy!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "Get out there and find these guys, we're going out of business here!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "Get it before it goes bad.  Do you know how bad those things smell when they're ripe?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Over here! You're the new one, eh?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Great!  I'm glad somebody finally figured out that I needed help!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "I'm looking for an escort to, uh...Mr. The Hutt's palace?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "I'll kill you too!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "Heh, something else we can foul up besides water.  Get him boys!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "NO!  Do you know who this egg is for?  Bodyguards!  Save me!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "Thanks for the safe trip!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "Oh, thank you for bringing me safely to the city.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "How could you have failed to deliver a list of NAMES?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Lady Valarian does not tolerate skipping lunch!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You let him get away?!?  Great.  I thought you were more competent than this...");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "That guy's gonna go on a killing spree.  You should be ashamed.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "Great, we're ruined.  All thanks to you.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "Jabba got his egg?  I can't believe this!");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "No. You have too little blood on your hands. Keep trying, though. See if Ind has more work for you.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "These guys wouldn't let me get back to work.  I'm glad you came along.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_more_1_3", "Oh, well, that's fine then.  I hope they have blue milk....");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_more_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_more_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_more_1_6", "");
