stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_more_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_more_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Wait a minute. I think our Chief Assassin is off-world today. Why don't you come back in a few cycles?");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Actually - if I remember correctly Kavas said she got a message from the compound guard a few moments ago. Perhaps all is well. Check back with me later.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Hm...it seems the good doctor hasn't arrived yet.  Come back in a few minutes and I'll keep you posted.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "When I get a fix on this guy's location I'll let you know.  Actually, just come back later and I'll tell you what's going on.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "If you ask me again in a few minutes we should be able to figure out exactly where these guys are.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "Wait a sec...you'll have to come back in a few and I'll tell you where the delivery guy is.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "You're in too deep now, my friend.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "You're in too deep now, my friend.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "You're in too deep now, my friend.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "You're in too deep now, my friend.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "You're in too deep now, my friend.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "You're in too deep now, my friend.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Good to have you on the team. Lady Valarian wants all of her new recruits to use these fresh Republic Blasters. So here you go. Be careful with it...");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Perfect, Jabba will be furious! Here, you've earned every last one of these credits.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Great.  Now that he's here we'll make sure he's working for the right team.  Here's some cash to help you along, oh, and we found this on the good doctor.  You can have it too.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "I can't tell you how happy I am that this is taken care of.  Our loyal customers have nothing but good things to say about you.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "Excellent work once again.  Valarian's been talking about you lately.  I think she'll invite you to see her soon.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "You got it!  Great.  Valarian's ready to see you.");
stringFiles[1970].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Aah. Welcome to the Valarian family.");
