stringFiles[1971] = new StringFile("spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("cant_work", "Lady Valarian has scheduled a very important meeting. I must prepare for it. Come back when you're done with your other tasks and I may be able to help you.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "That filthy crimeboss Lady Valarian has sent one of her thugs to destroy me. You'd better get out of here if you know what's good for you.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "You better get out of here if you don't wanna die.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "You're not the one Kavas told me about. Get out of here... or go to the Lucky Despot and drop a few credits. Tell Kavas I said hello.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "You're not the one Kavas told me about. Get out of here... or go to the Lucky Despot and drop a few credits. Tell Kavas I said hello.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "Who do you think you're talking to?");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "Get away from me, I'm busy.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("next", "I appreciate your help. Why don't you ask Ind over there if he needs any help?");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("notit_1", "Thank you but... what is this? I can't use this. You may as well keep it for yourself.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("notit_4", "Where's my package?  You don't have it?  What, did you lose it?");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("notit_5", "What?  What's this?");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("notit_6", "What's this?  This isn't what we asked for.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("notyet", "Who are you? You look crafty enough but I have never heard of you. Come back when you have earned a reputation and I may be able to use your help.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I would guess that you're here to earn Lady Valarian's respect. This is a wise choice, my friend. Work for me first, and I will spread word of your courage and fidelity.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_1_2", "We have reliable information that Jabba the Hutt has sent a group of enforcers to patrol the edge of town and eliminate our operatives. Find them and destroy them.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Word of your deeds has spread. Many others in the Valarian organization are hearing of your deeds. Are you willing to do another favor for me?");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_1_4", "You've made quite a name for yourself here at the despot.  For that you get to slide for a while.  Here, I just need somebody to pick something up for me.  That's it. ");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_1_5", "Jabba sent a thug over to the Despot earlier, and he was harrassing some of our patrons.  I don't want any misunderstandings, I want this guy killed.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_1_6", "There's not much time for discussion.  Jabba sent an assassin to kill Lady Valarian, but he missed.  He did manage to grab most of our financial records though.  Get them back, at all costs!");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Joyous! Our ex-friend Cie Vos has decided to liberate a case of rations from our stock. Punish him and bring the rations to me.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_2_2", "They'll most certainly be armed - and probably well-trained. So, be cautious.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Lady Valarian needs this revised proclamation to be delivered to her advocate just outside of town. He's an Ithorian... named Ysho... shouldn't be hard to find.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Great.  Go find my friend Ki'shai and get the package.  Make the delivery back to me and you'll get paid.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Good.  I knew I could count on you.  Take care of this and you won't be forgotten.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_2_6", "Good.  If you pull this one off I'll put in a good word for you myself.  I guarantee you'll move up for this.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_3_1", "You'll be back. Your kind always comes back.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Well, I hope none of our friends get killed.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_3_3", "A shame. Please come back when you have some time.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_3_4", "It's just a simple delivery.  What's you're problem?  Maybe you aren't as loyal as I thought.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_3_5", "You sure about that?  I'm not sure you want to say that right now.  You're on the cusp of greatness.  You're almost part of the family here.  You may want to think about this a bit.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_3_6", "I can't believe I had so much faith in you.  Why now, after all this time, do you finally show your true cowardice?");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Lady Valarian cares. She can open doors for you, my friend.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_4_2", "That filthy slug has been trying to destroy our operation for a very long time. Fortunately, we are smarter and more skilled than Jabba's rank-and-file.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Our friends are hearing that you have great strength and courage... impeccable loyalty. All good things to have said about you, my friend. Will you help me again?");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_4_4", "You'll find out.  Don't worry, it's nothing illegal.  I mean, not strictly anyway...");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_4_5", "Respect.  You need it and you get it.  And also, cash.  You'll get some cash too.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
