stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_6_5", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_6_6", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Perhaps you should try looking just outside of town?");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Keep looking! Our friends are in danger. We can't have you dawdling!");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "You're looking for Ysho, an Ithorian male... who should be waiting for you just outside of town. Please come back when you'e delivered the proclamation.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Well don't keep me waiting.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "Don't waste time here.  I know he's not here!  Go find him.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "For the sake of your own life you better get back to work...");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Valarian sells POISON to her patrons! I stole this to prove it to the authorities! Please don't shoot me!");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "There's a Valarian thug come to kill us. ATTACK!");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Nice work.  I thought I was going to be in real trouble.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Ho! You better be that friend of Kavas' I was told to meet.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "You got something to say?  Say it with blood!");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "You're all Valarian could find to send after me?  Hahahahaha!");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You're not making such a good impression, my friend. You'll need to try harder if you are going to earn Lady Valarian's respect.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Luckily one of our other friends has taken care of the Hutt enforcers. Thanks for nothing. Try to stay sharp the next time I give you something important to do.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "No! No! This will not do. This will simply not do at all!");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Couldn't make a simple delivery?  Is this the kind of reputation you want?");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "You look bad.  I mean, not as bad as you made us look, but still...");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "That's it, we're probably ruined now.  It'll take a miracle for us to stay on our feet after a debacle like this.  Good work.  Oh, in case you can't tell, that's sarcasm!");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "I don't TRUST you! Either you let me go or you kill me right here!");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_more_1_3", "Don't worry about it.  Just head back to the Despot and have a drink.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_more_1_4", "Kavas ordered an old-style camera as a gift for Ind. We mixed it in with a shipment of spice from Aeten II... and there was a whole mess... I don't have time to go into details.");
