stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_more_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_more_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Actually - I believe I need to prepare the private suites downstairs for some visitors. Why don't you come back later when I have some more time?");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Ind tells me that we've got some friends who've intercepted a group of Jabba's enforcers just outside the city. We'll see if these are the ones we're looking for. Come back and speak to me later today, please.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Now that I think about it - we should probably handle this differently. Please give me some time and come back in a little while. I need to sort things out.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "Hang on, there may be trouble.  Come back and see me later, I have to work something out.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "Well, some of our people were keeping an eye on this thug, and now he's vanished.  Come back later and I'll see if we can find him again.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "I don't know where the assassin went, but if you come back in a few minutes I may have a better idea.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_reset", "Perhaps you should pay more attention next time. Take some notes perhaps. Ah, well.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Ah, yes. The rations. Good job.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Bravo! You've made this a safer place for legitimate businesspeople like us. Here is a small token of our gratitude. Don't spend it all in one place.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "I hear there was some trouble? You did quite well nonetheless. Thank you.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Great!  Ind's gonna love it.  Thanks.  Here's some creds, don't spend em anywhere but the Despot, okay?  Haha.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "That's the way we handle things.  Jabba's steaming on his throne right now.  Good work.  Oh, by the way, Ind says she has some work for you, or if you want I have something else for you to do.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "You did it!  Valarian's so pleased she's told me to let you into the inner sanctum.  That means you'll be dealing with Ind from now on.  Treat her right, and you'll get the same in return.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "Ah, the proclamation.  I can't tell you how much easier this is going to make things for us.");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "Here you go. The photo capture unit got smashed - but I think that Kavas knows how to fix it. See you around!");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
