stringFiles[1971].addEntry("waypoint_name_5", "LADY VALARIAN: Find and kill Jabba's Enforcer");
stringFiles[1971].addEntry("waypoint_name_6", "LADY VALARIAN: Retrieve the briefcase from the assassin.");

stringFiles[1972] = new StringFile("spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("cant_work", "Sorry. I'm a bit busy right now. You look pretty busy, too. Why don't you come back later? Thanks.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Get out of here!");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("next", "I can't keep giving out Zicx. They're rare. Did you know they are impossible to destroy? It's mind-boggling... but true. Good day.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("notit_1", "Like I said... I don't do business with anyone who wanders in out of the sand. If you're not on official business from Jabba the Hutt - and if you're not a friend of a friend, I don't want to waste my time with you.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("notyet", "Who are you? I don't do business with just anyone. You need a voucher... or a buy order from Jabba himself! Goodbye.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_1_1", "So Goru sent you to me? To get your hands on some Zicx bugs, right? That's fine. Goru is a good friend. What would you say if I asked you to do me a small favor first?");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Great! One of Valarian's thugs knocked off a recent delivery to Jabba's Palace. A specially processed jar of spice. Return it to me and I will give you a hearty measure of Zicx bugs from my private collection.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Well, if you see Goru again - tell him he still owes me twelve thousand credits for that stunt he pulled on Rori. (I wonder if he ever got off that rock?)");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Goru probably told you that I'm in the spice business. I've used my skills as a biologist to create a spice refinement method that is... astounding! Unfortunately, some of my samples have been stolen. I would like them returned to me.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "They should be just outside of town. Thrash them and retrieve my spice and I will give you a jar of fresh young Zicx that you can take back to Goru.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "The spice is MINE! Stay away or we'll destroy you!");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Valarian's thugs made off with my spice. You failed me.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Actually... you might want to come back and see me later on. There is something that I need to do at the moment.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_reset", "Fine. Why don't you come back later? Thanks.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Thank you for retrieving the spice. Take this jar of young Zicx... and be very careful if and when you decide to approach the Sarlacc. In fact, you might want to see my friend Palu on the other side of town... she may have something you can use.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Did you find Valarian's thieves?");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("player_1_1", "I don't mind. Just tell me what you want and I'll be happy to help.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("player_2_1", "Actually, I'm not interested in doing any favors for you.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("player_3_1", "What sort of favor?");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("player_reset", "I can't do this anymore.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("player_sorry", "Not yet. I am still looking for them.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "Return the spice to Jowir Ar'Lensa to retrieve your reward.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "Jowir Ar'Lensa");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "Some of Valarian's thieves have stolen specially prepared spice. Jowir needs this spice returned to him. In exchange, he will give you a jar of Zicx bugs for use in a special weapon.");
stringFiles[1972].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Valarian Thieves");

stringFiles[1973] = new StringFile("spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("cant_work", "I'm a little busy at the moment... making disease-resistant clothing and other high-quality garb for Jabba's elite forces. Check back with me later.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Valarian's thugs told me that if I moved... they would disintegrate me on the spot! Please go! I don't want them to kill you, too.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("next", "I can't give you anything else. If Jabba finds out that I gave you special disease-resistant equipment... which is made EXCLUSIVELY for his elite guard... he'll have us both killed. Now, go on. Goodbye!");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("notyet", "Hello. I don't know you. Why don't you go to the other side of town and see Jowir Ar'Lensa. He loves meeting new people. Thanks.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_1_1", "You want my help? Then you help me, first. The palace scouts say that my sister left to come back here several hours ago... but she hasn't shown up. I fear the worst. Can you run to the edge of town and see if you can find my sister? Bring her back here to me?");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Thanks. When you return I will reward you with special disease-resistant equipment... none better in the galaxy. Now, please hurry!");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Are you kidding me? You don't have TIME to help? You better change your mind!");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Feinu. She runs errands for me. Mostly she delivers new equipment to Jabba's elite guard. Jabba and I have an agreement of sorts. The road from here to there is pretty dangerous. Valarian is always trying to mess things up. I worry that they have done something bad to Feinu. Will you go find her for me?");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "She was supposed to be following the road to the palace... so she could be just outside of town. Please hurry!");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Please! Help me!");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "Ahh... thank you so much for helping me! Those thugs would have disintegrated me for sure!");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "How could you have let this happen?! Oh, no... no... no... What am I going to do, now?");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "They caught me on the way back from the palace. My sister says I shouldn't walk the road to Wayfar by myself. Valarian's thugs jumped me and told me they were going to hold me for ransom.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Wait a minute. Now that I think about it... maybe we should wait. Feinu has a new friend outside of town. Maybe she's stopped off for a visit?");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_reset", "Then I hope, for your sake ... she's not hurt. Jabba helps me when I need him. I may need him to teach you a lesson. Do you understand?");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Thank you so much! Here - please take this special suit.  It is resistant to disease. Jabba's scouts use this type of equipment whenever they're around the Sarlacc. It keeps them alive.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "Take me to my sister, please! We'll get revenge on these Valarian swoopers some day!");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Did you find her?");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("otherescort_1", "Save yourself! Valarian's enforcers are trying to kill me!");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes. I will find her and bring her back here unharmed.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("player_2_1", "No, I have no time to help you now.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("player_3_1", "Your sister?");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "How did they get a hold of you?");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("player_reset", "I can't do this anymore.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("player_sorry", "I am still looking for her.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "Bring Feinu back to her big sister in town to collect your reward.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "Return to Palu");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "Valarian's thugs kidnapped Palu's little sister on her way back from the palace. Rescue her and return her to Palu's shop.");
stringFiles[1973].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Save Palu's little sister");

stringFiles[1974] = new StringFile("spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("cant_work", "Looks like you've got a full plate already. Maybe you should come back later.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("default", "");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("next", "Thanks to your brave efforts, we are about ready to move back in. Just planning our attack on the remaining Tusken Raiders. Thank you again for all your invaluable help.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("notit_1", "Hm...that's not exactly what I was looking for.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("notyet", "I'm sorry, I can't speak with you just yet...");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Our village has been attacked by Tusken Raiders! It was horrible, so many of my friends fell so swiftly, so few of us got away...");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Thank you! Thank you!");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Nobody cares about anyone but themselves anymore! If you can't help, you should just get out of here!");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_4_1", "They're still in the village, looting and burning our homes! Tuskens are cowards when faced with a strong foe though. If you could take out their leader, they won't stand when we take back what is ours!");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "They are still in the village, won't you do something?!?");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You are pathetic! You couldn't kill a one legged wamp rat without getting knocked down!");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I'm uh.. wait.. no.. Uh.. Come back later.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_reset", "Well, thanks for trying! Maybe you can come back when you are more capable.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "He's dead? We are forever in your debt. The survivors of our village has gathered what we could to show our appreciation for your heroism. It's not much, but all we have, please accept it.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Have you killed them yet? Have you killed their King.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("player_1_1", "I will try to help. I'll go to your village and see what I can do.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("player_2_1", "Sorry, I don't think I can handle that right now.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("player_3_1", "I'm so sorry. Is there anything I can do to help?");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("player_reset", "I don't think I can handle this job.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("player_sorry", "I think I can help you now.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "Return and inform Tolan Nokkar that the Tusken King has fallen.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "Tolan Nokkar");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "This village is currently overrun with Tusken Raiders.");
stringFiles[1974].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Pillaged village");

