stringFiles[1980] = new StringFile("static_npc/corellia/brantlee_spondoon");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("cantwork", "I'm afraid the Diktat is busy right now. You look a bit busy yourself, or I might have a job for you. See me later, maybe.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I am not being the person you are seeking, no.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I'm not the guy you want, believe me.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("gotowork_1", "You are to be taking my things and stuff to the Diktat's aide person lady! Stop being here! Be there! Go, go, go!");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("gotowork_2", "That Neonian Red Cheese is quite delicate, you really should be going!");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("next", "You'd like to see the Diktat? Please go right in.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("notit_1", "I was expecting a nice gift from that Devaronian. This doesn't look like it.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("notit_2", "That doesn't look like Neonian Red Cheese -- at least, not the stuff I was promised by that Zoda Burb.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_1_1", "You'd like to see the Diktat? You and a lot of others. I'm his aide. I don't suppose you brought me something? Some nice little gift? No? Well then, you might want to do me a favor. Another person much like yourself also wants to see the Diktat. He's called to say he has a nice little gift ready for me. Would you care to bring it here?");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I'm sorry, the Diktat is still busy. But I do have a little favor I might ask of you. Another citizen who is, like yourself, looking to get the Diktat's attention has very kindly offered me a nice little gift. I wonder if you'd pick up this one for me? That would be such a nice favor -- I'm sure the Diktat would appreciate your kindness.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Oh, you agai-- Wait, maybe you can help! I just got a troubling call from my roommate. My pet razor cat cub, Missy, is gone! She wandered out into the wilderness all alone! Will you please, please, please go find Missy? I'd be ever so grateful, and so would the Diktat.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_2_1", "That's nice of you. Let's see, this gift is coming from a merchant, a Devaronian named Midgoss D'la -- Dalla -- my, I can hardly pronounce this. It doesn't matter. I don't know what he's giving, so please hurry when you bring it back.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Oh, that's so nice. You're looking for a Corellian man named Zoda Burb. His application says he's a small businessman engaged in a variety of projects. Neonian Red Cheese -- mm, mmm! Please hurry!");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Good! Now, she's very well trained, so if you just say in a firm commanding voice, Here, Missy! she'll follow you all the way here. Please hurry!");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I'm sorry you can't take care of this little favor. I'm afraid the Diktat is very busy right now, and for the rest of the day. Maybe longer.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I'm sorry you can't go get even a dollop of that Red Cheese. I'm afraid the Diktat is very busy right now, and for the rest of the day. Maybe longer.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I'm sorry you can't rescue Missy. I'm afraid the Diktat is very busy right now, and for a long time ahead. Poor Missy!");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_4_1", "What do I like? Oh, you know -- good food, a nice bottle of Corellian Double Brandy -- interesting new gadgets, kitchenware, stock options -- a nice house with a prime view -- Really, this position has a high turnover, so I have to consolidate my portfolio quickly, and in many ways. So, will you do me the favor of picking up my little gift?");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_4_2", "I'm told that this citizen has imported a container of Neonian Red Cheese. Have you had it? Oooh, so delicately delicious. I love that stuff. That's a nice way to grab my attention, just for future reference. I wish you'd bring it here. Will you?");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Don't worry, Missy's just a baby, the littlest possiblerazor cat. Some of them out there grow big, which is why I'm worried. A big male might kill Missy for sport, and a mother might try to adopt my pet as her own cub. So will you please rescue her, fast?");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I've told you all I can. It's just a small favor. Will you go now?");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I've told you all I can. It's just a small favor. Will you go now?");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "I've told you all I can. Please hurry and rescue Missy!");
