stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_reset", "If you can't accomplish that one little task, I'll be hard pressed to convince the Diktat it's worthwhile to see you.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "If you can't accomplish that one little task, I'll be hard pressed to convince the Diktat it's worthwhile to see you.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "If you can't accomplish that one little task, I'll be hard pressed to convince the Diktat it's worthwhile to see you.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "If you can't accomplish that one little task, I'll be hard pressed to convince the Diktat it's worthwhile to see you.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Ooh, what did he send me? It's a -- umm. A Devaronian fur glosser. Well. That was remarkably thoughtless. All right, thanks for nothing. I'm afraid the Diktat is still busy, goodbye.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Neonian Red Cheese, yum! This is the greatest job. I get presents all day from total strangers. Here's a little present for you, too. Oh, the Diktat? Sorry, he's still busy. But check with me again soon.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Missy! It's Missy-wissy-wussums, yes! Who's a good kitty? Who's our good little kittykins? Yes! All right, you can see the Diktat now.");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Friend! Truly I am in the bad spot, so shortly after I did arrive here on Corellia. Most egregiously was I sucked dry of credits by the dirty fink confidence artist Zoda Burb. Via you, I am giving to the Diktat's human aide, Brantlee Somebody, this specimen model thing of my finest wares! I am hoping she will be letting me see the Diktat, so he can be locating and arresting the lousy crook Zoda Burb! Go! Yes!");
stringFiles[1980].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "Hi! If you're willing to pass this message along to the Diktat's aide, please just tell her that if some Devaronian merchant has been telling her a pack of lies about me, just to ignore them. I hope I can get the Diktat's ear long enough to talk to him about that.");
