stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Greetings, friend. I am known as Chertyl Ruluwoor and I'm currently investigating a series of terrorist attacks aimed at Selonian dens. So far I've been unable to identify those responsible, but I've just received a tip that could lead to a break in my case. I'm wondering if I could call upon you to assist me? I need you to pick up a recording taken by an amateur holocam operator and bring it to me. Can I rely upon you?   ");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I have terrible news! Young Kafleer just contacted me - his mother, Zayna, has been kidnapped by the same terrorists I'm investigating. I dare not go after her myself for fear of straining the already tense relations between native Corellians and my people. Could you please see to it that Zayna is freed and brought back to me safely? Do what you will with the kidnappers. They deserve what they get. Will you help?");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I appreciate your help. My contact's name is Kafleer Tredahl and he's waiting at the following coordinates. I'll tell him to expect you. Please be careful bringing this recording back. Kafleer thinks someone is watching him. ");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_2_2", "You are noble and just. Kafleer's holocams managed to catch the attackers in the act and allowed him to follow them. He's sent us they're coordinates. Please hurry.");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_2_3", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I understand if you do not wish to become involved. Thank you for your time.");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I must find someone to help rescue Kafleer's mother. There's no telling what those brutes intend to do.");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_3_3", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_4_1", "It was taken recently during an Imperial anti-alien demonstration and I believe it could reveal the identities of these terrorists. I'd go myself but my contact does not wish to be seen speaking with me. He thinks it may result in strikes against his family.");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Kafleer saw two of them snatch his poor mother from her home. There might be more waiting for them outside of the city, however. You must be careful!");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_4_3", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Was I unclear about something?");
stringFiles[1981].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Please hurry! Zayna's life may be in great danger.");
