stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Where's that witness? Why didn't you bring the witness? Wait. Are you my backup from Coronet? Oh, sorry. Captain Coraline Dynes. I'm the head of security around here. I'm a little busy at the moment so I can't really chat. Unless you'd care to help out? I desperately need someone to escort a witness back here. Do you think you could help me out?");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_1_2", "If you've decided to hang around, I could certainly still use your help. I've managed to locate a suspect in an arson case but I don't have the manpower or the time to go and arrest this criminal myself. He's an arsonist and not a killer so I doubt he'll put up a struggle, especially if you brandish a blaster. Think you can bring him in for me?");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Just the agent I was hoping to see. Need your help again. I know, big surprise, huh? This time the assignment is pretty straightforward. We just received an anonymous transmission warning us of a potential violent situation. It seems a Black Sun gangster is on his way to a Mining Guild representative's home to murder him. I'd certainly appreciate it if you were to intercept this Aqualish and prevent a murder. If this Aqualish is the guy I think, arresting him will not be an option. Want to tackle this?");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_2_1", "You're a lifesaver. The man you're looking for is a Bothan named Lith K'alis. He's currently in hiding. He's convinced he's a target of Black Sun assassins. Problem is, he may be right. Have your blaster handy. Good luck.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Where were you two years ago when I got this assignment, huh? Thanks, I certainly appreciate your help. The suspect is a Rodian named Kalio Uldi. And be on our guard because even though he may be a coward, he's likely to have friends that are not. ");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_2_3", "If I get a promotion out of this, I'm taking you to dinner on Vreni Island. Please be careful. This Aqualish, a brute named Blurga Vuto, is one tough customer. If you want to take some friends along, I understand.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Okay, well then welcome to Doaba Guerfel and stay out of trouble.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I was so hoping you'd say yes, but I understand. Not your problem. Excuse me.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Well, you risked yourself enough on my account. No hard feelings, buddy. Take care.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_4_1", "The only one in a murder case I'm investigating. Black Sun is involved, which means that witnesses are all but non-existent. This witness only came forward because he thinks he's next. Can you help him out?");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_4_2", "A Corellian Engineering Corporation warehouse. No one was in it at the time. It held a lot of shipping manifests, however. I'm sure he was trying to cover something up for someone upstairs.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_4_3", "The Guild is negotiating with the big Corellian corporations for higher wages for their workers. Black Sun wanted them to drop the issue but this rep refused.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I've given you all the info I've got. You still interested?");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Did you have further questions or do you wish to reconsider?");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "You seem jittery. I understand if you want to back out.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Psst! Hey! Over here! You from Captain Dynes?");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Everyone knows that liquid is not nearly as flammable as-uh, oh! Looks like trouble!");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Blurga will smash you! That will teach you to interfere in Blurga's business!");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "You're a pal and I owe you one. Take my advice: Get out of this town before it's too late.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "I'd like to say it's been a pleasure, except it obviously hasn't. And don't think they're sending me to Kessel - I got friends in high places, pal!");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Looks like I get to add yet another unsolved murder to my pile. Thanks for nothing.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Well, at least it wasn't a murderer that got away. You have to look at the bright side as often as possible here in Doaba Guerfel.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "I guess I better get the Mining Guild rep off the planet. We lose more of those guys this way.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "The witness should transmit his location to me momentarily. Check back with me in a bit.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "My people will get me Kalio's coordinates in just a sec. Could you hang on for a bit?");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "My people are tracking Blurga now. I should have his coordinates shortly.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_reset", "I can't afford to leave these matters unresolved. Come back when you think you can help me close these cases.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "I can't afford to leave these matters unresolved. Come back when you think you can help me close these cases.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "I can't afford to leave these matters unresolved. Come back when you think you can help me close these cases.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "I can't afford to leave these matters unresolved. Come back when you think you can help me close these cases.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Job well done, friend. I sure could use more like you on my team. Enforcing the law in this town is no easy task. Black Sun has a pretty tight control on the Mining Guild out here. Makes for some messy business.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "A huge thanks, friend. Here, go treat yourself to a nice dinner somewhere. Vreni Island is lovely this time of year, by the way. ");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "If law enforcement was not your choice of a career, I think you've undersold yourself. You've got the looks, the skills, and the nerve to be a top security officer. Best of luck to you.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "Thank the stars you got here when you did. I'm sure those Black Sun killers are closing in on me. Let's get out of here!");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "Okay, okay! I'll go with you, take it easy. You bounty hunter types are so touchy.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_takeme_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_takeme_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Did you bring that witness back yet? I don't know how much longer that poor Bothan can last out there.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Did you bring my suspect in? He's likely to leave the system if we don't act fast.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Did you stop that Aqualish killer? I need to know when I can let the Mining Guild representative return to his home.");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_work_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_work_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("npc_work_6", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("otherescort_1", "Go away! I can't be seen with you!");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("otherescort_2", "Buzz off! I'm busy!");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("otherescort_3", "Go away! Blurga is in the mood to kill!");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("otherescort_4", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("otherescort_5", "");
stringFiles[1982].addEntry("otherescort_6", "");
