stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I'm an undercover CorSec officer in the middle of an investigation and I need your help. A witness has agreed to come forward and needs to be safely escorted back here. I have to attend an important meeting with my Black Sun contacts or else my cover will be blown. Can you help me out?");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Great work on that last job. Getting her back here safely could not have been easy. Do you think you might be up to something a little tougher? I want you to bring one of those Black Sun crooks in for questioning. How about it?");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_1_3", "We're on to something big. Caldori was all too eager to cooperate once he discovered how much our witness already knew. He's turned over evidence implicating one of Black Sun's major players. Do you think you're up to bringing this hotshot in?");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Chandra Conrad is a valuable witness against Black Sun so be careful. No doubt their goons are turning Corellia upside-down trying to find her. ");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Obrio Caldori is a mid-level operative but he's not part of Black Sun's muscle, he's more like an administrator. Bring him back here in one piece, but be careful. He's certain to have some guards.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Voydd Blancken won't come easily. His personal guards are highly trained experts. If you have some backup you trust, I'd recommend bringing them along.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_3_1", "You're right. It's not fair for me to ask a civilian like you to risk going up against Black Sun.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Probably for the best. You don't want Black Sun to start noticing you.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Maybe your face is getting a little too familiar to Black Sun. It's better if you stay out of this one.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_4_1", "A multiple homicide committed by some highly placed Black Sun operatives. That means this job could be very dangerous. Do you think you're up for it?");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_4_2", "His name is Obrio Caldori and he's wanted in connection with those murders witnessed by Chandra Conrad. We're hoping he'll lead us to some higher-ups in the organization.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_4_3", "His name is Voydd Blancken. Bringing him to justice will be a major blow to Black Sun. He knows where a lot of bodies are buried. Do you think you can bring him in alive?");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I told you everything you need to know. Are you going to go get her?");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I've told you what I can. Are you going to bring him in?");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "If you don't think you can handle this job, just say the word.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "I sure hope you're my escort.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "I don't like the look of this guy. Take him out.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Would you gentlemen care to dispose of this nuisance for me?");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "I couldn't have made it back here without your help. Thank you.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "You haven't got anything on me. I'll be out of here in no time.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "I'll come along with you for now. You won't be able to hold me for long.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "I'm sure you tried your best. You can't save everybody. ");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You couldn't bring him in? Don't worry about it. We'll get him eventually.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "I never thought this guy would be easy to take down. We'll just have to plan a little better next time.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "She'll contact me when she finds a safe place for you to meet her. Come see me in a little while, maybe she'll have called by then.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I should receive word about his present location very soon. Come see me in a little while.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "There's some big Black Sun meeting going on right now and I need to find out who called it. Come see me in a little while.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_reset", "This sort of work isn't for everyone. If you change your mind, you know where to find me.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "This sort of work isn't for everyone. If you change your mind, you know where to find me.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "This sort of work isn't for everyone. If you change your mind, you know where to find me.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "This sort of work isn't for everyone. If you change your mind, you know where to find me.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Well done. Now I can get her to safety and we can see about bringing down some of these Black Sun lowlifes.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "You're a natural at this. Ever think of going into security?");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Black Sun will be recovering from this for a long time. Well done, my friend.");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[1983].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
