stringFiles[1985] = new StringFile("static_npc/corellia/daclif_gallamby");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("cantwork", "You should not approach the Diktat's office while you're already busy with another job. Return later when you are unencumbered.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm with the Corporate Sector. Leave me alone.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I'm on Transport Commission business. Leave me alone.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "I don't think you're looking for me, are you?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Imperial business. Move along.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "I'm not the one you're looking for.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "You got the wrong guy. Get lost.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("gotowork_1", "What a bottleneck!");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("gotowork_2", "I was expecting an approved Transport Commission order for cargo ships for Bonadan. If you don't have it, I've been waiting here for nothing.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("gotowork_4", "I was under the impression that the Diktat was making a donation to the Customs Office Loyalty Day Parade. Was I mistaken? This will weigh on my mind as I adjudge the Bonadan shipping order.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("gotowork_6", "I sorta-kinda expected you'd have some instructions for me. I guess not. I'm gettin' all disappointed and everything. That's always bad.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("next", "I believe your utility here is at an end, at least for the time being. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("notit_1", "This isn't the Bonadan shipping order I expected.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("notit_2", "I was expecting an approved Transport Commission order for cargo ships for Bonadan. Don't you have it?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("notit_3", "I was expecting a processing payment -- I mean, charitable donation -- from the CEC. That doesn't look like it.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("notit_4", "I was under the impression that the Diktat was making a donation to the Customs Office Loyalty Day Parade. This isn't it.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("notit_6", "I sorta-kinda expected you'd have some instructions for me. This isn't those.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("notyet", "I am occupied. Speak with my aide, Brantlee Spondoon.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hmm. You're seeking work? Well, if Brantlee has sent you in, I'm prepared to test your utility to this office. I know -- I'll send you to pick up a shipping order. The Corporate Sector Authority has placed a large order with the Corellian Engineering Corporation for cargo ships for its Bonadan mining facilities. Meet with the CSA representative at the designated wilderness rendezvous.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Ah. You'll do, you're convenient. Please deliver the approved Bonadan shipping order -- in fact, the very one you picked up earlier from that CSA representative -- to the appropriate Transport Commission processing agent at the agreed wilderness rendezvous.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Ah. You've performed reasonably well for me before. You'll do. Dwynn Biuval, a sales representative of the Corellian Engineering Corporation, has kindly made a generous donation to the Commission for Rehabilitation of Unwanted Krahbu, a charity I administer. I want you to pick up this donation.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Ah! You're shown up in timely fashion. Lieutenant Mien Halloor of the Imperial Customs Office is preparing to approve a certain transaction. But he is distracted by a fiscal crisis in his favorite charity. To free his attention from such petty concerns, I'd like you to deliver this donation.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_1_5", "What effrontery! Oh, it's you. I've just received a high-handed note from a minor bureaucrat whom I believe you dealt with in the past, named -- let's see -- Merlyx Dolv. Our Dolv appears to be having second thoughts about approving the recent sale of Corellian Engineering ships to the Corporate Sector world of Bonadan. Bring him here. I intend to give him a stern talking-to, and perhaps much more.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_1_6", "You! Let us dispense with persiflage. Merlyx Dolv, the minor bureaucrat you brought here recently, turns out, against all reason, to have a friend. If Dolv doesn't return alive soon, the friend will release certain incriminating evidence to the public. This cannot be tolerated. You must carry these instructions to a certain agent, quickly.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Very well. Be on your way, and report here when you have the Bonadan shipping order.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Very well. Return here when you've made the delivery, and I shall arrange payment.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Good. The CEC rep wishes to deliver the paym-- donation in the wilderness, thereby evading publicity that would certainly draw every shady charity looking for a handout. Return here with the money.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Fine. Meet Lt. Halloor at the agreed rendezvous in the wilderness. I gather he is an aficionado of wilderness hikes. Return here when you've made the delivery.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Good. Evidently Dolv seeks solitude and obscurity in the wilderness, but one of my agents has pinpointed his location. Bring him here.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_2_6", "The recipient awaits you in the wilderness, away from prying eyes. Tell no one about this, or you will soon be in the same circumstances as Merlyx Dolv. Go!");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_3_1", "You will not carry out the will of the Diktat's office? You have a short future on Corellia, I think. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_3_2", "You had shown a certain minimal utility to this office, but now I doubt that our relationship will be productive.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_3_3", "You had shown a certain utility to this office, but now I doubt that our relationship will be productive over the long term.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_3_4", "You had shown a certain utility to this office, but now I doubt that our relationship will be productive over the long term.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_3_5", "You had shown a certain minimal utility to this office, but now I doubt that our relationship will be productive over the long term.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_3_6", "You had shown unusual utility to this office, but that time is past. Tell no one of this, or you will soon share the same circumstances as Merlyx Dolv.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_4_1", "This is a matter of Corellian planetary security. All shipping orders require the approval of my Transport Commission. Given the intensely competitive nature of the Corellian engineering industry, I prefer to render such procedures invulnerable to surveillance by rival corporations. Will you make the pickup?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Your levity is refreshing. I assure you that the Diktat's office takes precautions appropriate to planetary security. We don't like unapproved observers taking note of sensitive government transactions. Make no mistake -- this transaction is sensitive. Will you deliver the order?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_4_3", "This office recently approved a sale of CEC cargo ships to the Corporate Sector Authority world of Bonadan. I expedited the administrative process of approving that transaction. No doubt the CEC believes I can do an equally effective job administering my charity. Will you pick up their donation?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Imperial Customs is assessing the shipment of certain Corellian Engineering starships to the Corporate Sector world of Bonadan. Lt. Halloor has discovered issues relating to the transaction of which I had not been aware. I do hope his charity's current financial crisis doesn't distract him as he weighs these complex trade issues. Will you bring him this donation?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_4_5", "That is none of your concern! I mean -- ah -- he lacks comprehensive understanding of the extra-procedural back-channel negotiation involved in executing a complex deal. But enough chatter -- bring him here, and I shall explain in inordinate detail. Will you do this?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_4_6", "Dolv is currently on a long, long vacation far, far away. I doubt he will return to his friend before that friend decides to go public. Deliver the instructions with all speed. Will you go?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I have nothing more to tell you. Please go, my time is valuable.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I have nothing more to tell you. Please go, my time is valuable.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "I have nothing more to tell you. Please go, my time is valuable.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "I have nothing more to tell you. Please go, my time is valuable.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "I have nothing more to tell you. Please go, my time is valuable.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "I have nothing more to tell you. Go, quickly!");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Are you from the Diktat's office? I've been waiting for some time.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Are you meeting me to drop off the Transport Commission order?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Hello! You're from the Diktat's office, correct?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "You! You're with the Diktat's office, correct? Over here!");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "You again! Did the Diktat send you this time, or are you on your own?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "You from the government guy? I expect I'm the guy you want.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "So here it ends. I wonder how many Transport Commission officials have stood here in my place before, awaiting the same fate, because of that Bonadan Contract?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Picking up that Bonadan shipping order was a simple task. You seem to lack utility for this office. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Delivering that approved Bonadan shipping order was a simple task. You seem to lack utility for this office. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "Picking up that processing payment -- I mean, charitable donation -- was a simple task. You seem to lack utility for this office after all. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Delivering that incentive reward payment was a simple task. You seem to lack utility for this office after all. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "Bringing me the Transport Commission official was a simple task. You seem to lack utility for this office after all. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "You failed to deliver that message? You have caused me unusual aggravation. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Wait, I have an incoming call I must answer. Return shortly and I'll give you the coordinates for the rendezvous.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Wait, I have an incoming call I must answer. Return shortly and I'll give you the coordinates for the rendezvous.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Wait, I have an incoming call I must answer. Return shortly and I'll give you the coordinates for the rendezvous.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "Wait, I have an incoming call I must answer. Return shortly and I'll give you the coordinates for the rendezvous.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "Wait, I have an incoming call I must answer. Return shortly and I'll give you the coordinates for the rendezvous.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "Wait, I have an incoming call I must answer. Return shortly and I'll give you the coordinates for the rendezvous.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reset", "I am disappointed with your lack of will. But you still have utility for this office, so return here when you feel greater gumption.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "I am disappointed with your lack of will. But you still have utility for this office, so return here when you feel greater gumption.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "I am disappointed with your lack of will. But you still have utility for this office, so return here when you feel greater gumption.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "I am disappointed with your lack of will. But you still have utility for this office, so return here when you feel greater gumption.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "I am disappointed with your lack of will. But you still have utility for this office, so return here when you feel greater gumption.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "I am disappointed with your lack of will. But you still have utility for this office, so return here when you feel greater gumption.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "I am disappointed with your lack of will. But you still have utility for this office, so return here when you feel greater gumption.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "The CSA procurement agent expressed disapproval of our procedure? Interesting. What was his name? Windle Meeker. Hmm. Very well. You have demonstrated your utility to this office and may return when you desire more work.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "That Transport Commission processing agent expressed a desire for bonus pay, did he? How amusing. What was his name? Merlyx Dolv? Well. Hmm. All right, you have proved useful.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Excellent. I shall have this contract payment processed at once. What? Charitable donation? Oh, of course. The krahbu. I shall have this charitable donation processed at once. Goodbye for now.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Perhaps you do posess the necessary qualities to be of use to this office.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "So, here is Dolv. I take it you had an uneventful trip? What? Mercenaries? And you stopped them? Hmph. Well, take your payment and go.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "Very well. We shall hope for a pleasant resolution to this matter soon. As a token of my faith in your discretion, please accept this reward -- a desirable art object from my personal collection.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "I am frankly disgruntled that I, a CSA procurement officer, can't place a simple order for cargo ships with any vendor except Corellian Engineering Corporation. And why must these orders must go through the Diktat's office? What a bottleneck!");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "I note that this order, like all the Bonadan shipping orders before it, adds an administrative surcharge. How can the Diktat justify this overhead solely for cargo ships sold to Bonadan? At least, how can he justify it without guaranteeing a portion of the proceeds as bonus pay for relevant Transport Commission employees?");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "We at the CEC certainly appreciate the Diktat's effectiveness in smoothing the way for our victory over rival firms in that big Bonadan contract. We hope this contract payment will -- what? Charitable donation? Oh. Of course. We're sure this charitable donation will go to a good cause.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "I'm pleased to see that the Diktat is aware of the pressing need for funds for the Customs Office Loyalty Day Parade. That is all.");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "You can tell your guy that his situation is gonna be taken care of. Tell him the Lady Hutt wouldn't mind a gift -- it's her birthday soon. Haw! Tell him that!");
stringFiles[1985].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
