stringFiles[1986].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hey, pal. I'm looking for a new partner. But I just can't accept anyone. You gotta prove yourself first. My line of work ain't for the timid or the slow-witted. You seem pretty tough to me. Tell you what. If you can make one of my problems go away, I'll consider showing you the trade. You in?");
