stringFiles[1989].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Darling! I absolutely insist you help me! I'm in the most awful jam over some forged records about my dearest Karrek. You know him, of course? Karrek Flim, the Corporate Sector Viceprex? Of course you know him. Will you bring me these forged records, taking whatever steps may be needed and not telling anyone? That would be lovely.");
stringFiles[1989].addEntry("npc_1_2", "");
stringFiles[1989].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[1989].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1989].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1989].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1989].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Too marvelous. Here are the coordinates where you'll find an aggravating data slicer named Bin Huusir or something like that. Do get the datadisc from him, and if violence is required, well, I suppose we'll all just have to live with that, hmm? Except Bin, of course.");
stringFiles[1989].addEntry("npc_2_2", "");
stringFiles[1989].addEntry("npc_2_3", "");
