stringFiles[1992].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("next", "I no longer require your services. You have served the Empire well, however, so check back with me in the future for possible work.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("notit_1", "These are not Captain Pellaeon's orders. Those are what I need.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("notit_2", "This is not a requisition order. That is what I need.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("notyet", "See Sergeant Tarl about assignments. When he clears you, come back and see me.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I see Sergeant Tarl has cleared you. Good. Let's get right to work, shall we? I need you to deliver this dispatch to one of my junior officers. It details Lord Vader's plan to search for the Rebellion's new secret base and gives some specific instructions involving a native of Tatooine. These orders are classified, so make sure this encrypted disc does not fall into the wrong hands. Can you do this?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I've been asked by Admiral Ozzel to review requisitions for Imperial probe droids. Captain Needa of the Star Destroyer Avenger believes that Rebel agents tampered with his shipment and would like to request another.  Could you pick up his new requisition form and bring it back to me for review?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Sergeant Tarl's investigations have uncovered an information broker named Helfin Hundi who's been selling Imperial transport manifests to the Rebellion. I'd like you to arrest this criminal and bring him here for processing. I doubt this individual will give you any problems. Can you carry out this task?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Imperial Intelligence has provided me with the name of the mastermind behind this Corellian industrial spy ring. Admiral Ozzel would like me to take care of this, which of course means I'm turning to you. Can you remove this threat to Imperial security? ");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_2_1", "The officer this must go to is Lieutenant Errad Brytok of the Star Destroyer Chimaera. He knows to expect you.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_2_2", "You'll be picking the requisition up from the Avenger's quartermaster, Sergeant Donsull. He's been informed that you're coming.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Good. Make sure Helfin makes it here alive. We need to conduct some lengthy interrogations and need him in good health for that.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Excellent. The target's name is Xoron Gulfel. He's likely to have a few bodyguards with him. We must not allow Xoron to escape.  ");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Why would you ask for an appointment with me and then refuse to work? You're dismissed.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Do you believe this assignment is not prestigious enough for you? We are responding to Lord Vader's personal instructions. ");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_3_3", "This is truly becoming tiresome. You're dismissed.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_3_4", "You refusal will be included in my official report to Admiral Ozzel. Do not waste any more of my time.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Lord Vader's affairs are none of your concern. Will you go?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Isn't it rather obvious? We're conducting a search for the Rebellion's new command center.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_4_3", "The worm is well connected so he may have a few friends show up to try and liberate him. I'm certain you're capable of handling such ruffians, however.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Again you ask questions when you should simply be following orders. The Admiral's reasons are his own. Do you want the assignment or not?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I've explained everything you need to know. Do you wish to reconsider your service with me?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Do you wish to be released from this assignment?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Do you wish to reconsider performing this task?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "There is nothing further to say about this mission. Do you wish to decline?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Did Captain Pellaeon send you? I'm Lt. Brytok.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Are you here to pick up a requisition order? Did Captain Pellaeon send you?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Blast! Looks like the Imperials are wise to my setup!");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "So Ozzel decided to pay the hush money, eh? Hand it over!");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "I believe you were supposed to deliver some instructions from Captain Pellaeon. Do you have them?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "I'm getting interrogated, aren't I? Can I say good-bye to my wife and kids?");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Fortunately, that disc's encryption will destroy the data if the proper codes are not introduced. I do, however, find it a bit disappointing that you failed at such a simple task.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Picking up a requisition is hardly an arduous task. Your failure is both disappointing and enlightening.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "Your failure means the Rebellion will continue to get their hands on classified Imperial records. That is not good.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Allowing Xoron to escape will cost the Empire dearly, citizen, not to mention having earned you the Admiral's displeasure. You may go.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "My junior officer will transmit his coordinates shortly.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "The quartermaster will transmit his coordinates to me shortly.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Our informants will provide me with Helfin's location in just a few moments.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "Intelligence will transmit the current whereabouts of Xoron shortly.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reset", "I'm disappointed by your lack of resolve. However, you may come back when you feel you can finish the tasks I assign you.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "I'm disappointed by your lack of resolve. However, you may come back when you feel you can finish the tasks I assign you.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "I'm disappointed by your lack of resolve. However, you may come back when you feel you can finish the tasks I assign you.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "I'm disappointed by your lack of resolve. However, you may come back when you feel you can finish the tasks I assign you.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "I'm disappointed by your lack of resolve. However, you may come back when you feel you can finish the tasks I assign you.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Well done. I should have warned you. Agents of the Rebellion are everywhere and they're especially eager to get their hands on orders involving the search for their hidden base.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Well done. I'm glad to see that Rebel agents are incapable of interfering with your mission's success. I've made of note of this in my official report.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "I knew you'd come through. Cowardly spies are no match for someone of your skill and resolve. Congratulations.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "You should consider a career with Imperial Intelligence. Your professionalism and talent is exactly what that division is looking for. ");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "I'll make sure the Star Destroyer Chimaera receives these orders immediately.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "Here is Captain Needa's requisition order. Have the probe droids sent via transport to the Star Destroyer Avenger.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
