stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Have you delivered those orders yet? We have Imperial Star Destroyers waiting to be dispatched.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Have you picked up Captain Needa's requisition form? The Star Destroyer Avenger cannot depart until it receives those probe droids.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Have you brought that Rebel agent in for questioning yet? We need the list of his known associates and contacts if we're to prevent further classified information from leaking out.");
stringFiles[1992].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Have you removed that threat to Imperial security? Admiral Ozzel is counting on you.");
