stringFiles[1993] = new StringFile("static_npc/corellia/gilker_budz");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("cantwork", "Hello. I have a job waiting here as soon as you're not busy.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm waiting for someone else.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "You got no business around here.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("gotowork_1", " It was so nice to talk to you! We should go gronda hunting sometime, with holocameras, of course.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("next", "I think the poaching situation here is under control. I suggest you relax and have a good time here in Kor Vella.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("notit_1", "That isn't the tourist's holorecording of the gronda killing, is it?");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I'm with Corellian Security's detachment investigating animal poaching outside Tyrena. I've learned that an offworld tourist happened to record an illegal killing of a gronda outside town. I'd be grateful if you'd get the holorecording from the tourist and bring it to me.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I have another job for you, if you like. That tourist's recording of the gronda killing gave me enough information to identify the poaching gang and locate their hideout. Now that I know where they're based, I'd like you to destroy the place.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_1_3", "You took out that poacher hideout for us, but an unexpected consequence has arisen. Some gang members weren't at the hideout when you destroyed it. They evacuated another hideout and irresponsibly released the live animals they kept there -- including a pack of the most dangerous beasts, slice hounds. The pack is menacing local citizens. I'm asking you to destroy the pack.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Fine. I understand the tourist is a Gran -- one of those three-eyed folks -- named Snee-Roos. Get the datadisc from him at these coordinates.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good. The hideout looks big enough for maybe three or four gangsters. If they're Black Sun, as I'm starting to suspect, they'll be well armed. You may want to get some backup. Check with me here when you've succeeded.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_2_3", "All right. It's a small pack of five or six slice hounds. You'll probably need some backup to put them down. Good luck.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I'm sorry to hear that. Poaching is a big problem around here, and we need all the help we can get to stop it.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I'm sorry you don't feel up to this job, but I admit it's quite a task.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I'm sorry you don't feel up to this job, but I admit it's quite a task.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Poachers take local wildlife for pelts or biomaterials, or as exotic pets to sell offworld. It's been an ongoing problem for too long, and local populations are falling to dangerous levels. But if you bring me this recording, I may finally have the lead I need to stop the gang. Will you?");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Once I identified the poachers from the holo, I sent a probe droid to track them from Kor Vella's seedier bars straight back to their hideout. Our forces are busy on other police matters, so will you blow up the hideout for us?");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_4_3", "The poachers were planning to sell the animals offworld as exotic pets. Sometimes these animals go to tough customers who train them to fight. In these cases the poachers intentionally drive the beasts mad before selling them, to make them fierce. We think that's what happened with these slice hounds. Will you destroy them?");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I've told you all I know. I'd appreciate it if you'd pick up that disc.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I've told you all I know. I'd appreciate it if you'd get started destroying that hideout.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "I've told you all I know. I'd appreciate it if you'd go after that pack of slice hounds.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Helloooo! You are working for the Corellian Security human person?");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "We're found! Black Sun'll kill us if this base gets torched!");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
