stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Didn't you bring that tourist's recording. This will make it harder to catch that poaching gang.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You didn't take out that poacher hideout? I hope we can get another team to hit it before they evacuate.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You didn't destroy that pack of slice hounds? Well, I can't blame you. We'll keep trying.");
