stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "I understand your situation. I've had to abandon many attempts to get these poachers. But I kept trying, and I hope you will too.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "I understand your situation. I've had to abandon many attempts to get these poachers. But I kept trying, and I hope you will too.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "I understand your situation. I've had to abandon many attempts to get these poachers. But I kept trying, and I hope you will too.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "This looks like just the evidence I need to identify the main poaching gang and stop them for good. Check with me soon for another job.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "What a breakthrough! I hope this will stop the poaching, at least for a while. Good work!");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "That was a sad job, but I'm glad you were up to it. In this job I've really learned to hate poachers. I hope that with your help we've controlled the problem.");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[1993].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "I am Snee-Roos! So good to meet a new person! I am having the most wonderful time here on my vacaction. First a gronda killing, and now police excitement! What? The recording? Oh yes, here is the recording for you to give to the Corellian Security human. It was so nice to talk to you!");
