stringFiles[1994] = new StringFile("static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("cantwork", "Hey there. I can't leave this area just now, but I'd really like it if you dropped by when you're not so busy.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I haven't got anything much to say to you.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I have nothing to say to ee-you.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("gotowork_1", "Just deliver the dossier like a good little lackey.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("next", "Hey, nice to see you again. I'm sitting pretty right now, not a care in the world. Talk to you later, maybe.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("notit_1", "I was expecting an Offworld Backchannel Cargo Transit Permit renewal fee from Professor Minnet. That isn't it.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hey there. I can't leave this area just now -- I'm waiting on a nice bottle of Corellian Double-Brandy from a new friend -- but I need someone to pick up a payment for an Offworld Backchannel Cargo Transit Permit renewal. Can you get it for me?");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Hey. I checked into that stuff about Offworld Transit Permits. Someone must be eavesdropping on meetings I've had out in the wilderness. Never mind what I was doing at the meetings. I know a Bothan who's told me many useful things in the past. I want you to bring him in for another report -- though I doubt he'll follow you willingly.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Hey. That Bothan informant told me what I already knew: Those smugglers, Professor Minnet and his Sidepocket gang, have been spying on me at a listening post out in the wilderness. This could be bad for my career. I'd like you to blow up their listening post, but that's too much trouble.  Just take out the guy with the info.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Fine. You're meeting a fellow called Professor Minnet, who leads a group of enterprising cargo transit specialists called Sidepocket.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Hey, that's great. You need to find a Bothan named Siv'rool Linnaie. Bring him back here, and not so heavily wounded that he can't talk.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Great. You'll find him at these coordinates, assuming that informant told me right. And I think he knows the consequences of telling me wrong.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Well, I'd love to talk, but as I said, I'm waiting on some Double-Brandy. See you around.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_3_2", "No? Hey, I thought we were friends. Well, maybe later.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_3_3", "What, you're squeamish about a few smugglers? Man.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_4_1", "An Offworld Backchannel Cargo Transit Permit lets you avoid undue attention from the authorities -- for instance, me -- and take your goods offworld without trouble. Of course, a permit like that requires hefty fees, paid frequently. But don't worry, those fees keep your local tax rates low. Will you pick up the renewal fee for me?");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Hey, I'd love to ramble across the hills looking for this one Bothan. Honest. But I'm stuck here waiting for a gift -- some durindfire gems from a new friend. So you'll have to get the informant for me. Will you?");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Well, out in the wilderness I screen a lot of Offworld Backchannel Cargo Transit Permit applicants. That Sidepockets gang must have wanted to find inside data on how to get a permit. Yeah, that's it. Anyway, about that guy -- will you kill him?");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Were you hoping to get some of that Double-Brandy I'm waiting for? Sorry, it's all claimed.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Are you sticking around to see those durindfire gems? I'd just as soon that you start after that Bothan.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "That guy is out there waiting. I think you should get going.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Are you from that corrupt sleemo cop, Darjeek?");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Don't let him take me, my friends!");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "You won't stop me!");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "Umm. I did not think ee-you would make it here alive. I may be forced to betray my friends, painful as that may be.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "No renewal fee? Well, that will make life a little tougher for Professor Minnet and his Sidepocket group. Hope they don't blame you.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You didn't bring that Bothan informant? Well, I'll get him here one of these days.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You didn't kill that guy? Man, I'm very disappointed. I don't feel like I can go out in the wilderness any more.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Whoa, I'm getting a call about that Double-Brandy I'm expecting. Check with me in a moment, okay? Thanks.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Whoa, I'm getting a call about those durindfire gems I'm expecting. Check with me in a moment, okay? Thanks.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Whoa, I'm getting a call about some Fricaseed Puff-cakes I'm expecting from a new friend. Check with me in a moment, okay?");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reset", "Hey, I understand. I hope you'll check back with me later, though.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Hey, I understand. I hope you'll check back with me later, though.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Hey, I understand. I hope you'll check back with me later, though.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Hey, I understand. I hope you'll check back with me later, though.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Hey, I understand. I hope you'll check back with me later, though.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Hey, wait -- this isn't a payment. It's -- let's see -- a dossier of past Offworld Transit Permits I granted to smugg -- uh, merchants. Hmm. Well, I'll pay you for your time. And I think I have more work for you.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "I expect our friend Siv'rool has a lot to tell me about Professor Minnet's Sidepocket gang, and their source of information about me. Stick around -- I may have another job for you.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Great work! And who really cares if there's a few less smugglers now? On Corellia we've got all the smugglers the galaxy will ever need. ");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Tell Darjeek his renewal schedule is about to be cut short. This dossier should convince him to stay out of our way.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "Ee-yes, well -- I shall go quietly with ee-you. But my friends from Professor Minnet's Sidepocket gang have not ee-yet forgotten me.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_takeme_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_takeme_6", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_work_1", "I hope you're still planning to meet Professor Minnet and pick up that Offworld Backchannel Permit renewal fee.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_work_2", "I don't see that Bothan informant, Siv'rool. Hope you'll bring him soon.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Haven't you destroyed that listening post? I'd help you, but I'm waiting on a delivery of Fricaseed Puff-cakes from a new friend.");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_work_4", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_work_5", "");
stringFiles[1994].addEntry("npc_work_6", "");
