stringFiles[1996].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hello. I was out with our militia's band, the Fighting 357th Serenaders, on a training exercise. When we returned to base, I forgot my kloo horn. One of our band members went to retrieve it, but he just called to say he got lost. If you'll escort him here safely, along with my kloo horn, I'll make it worth your while.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I need your help again. I promised to deliver this arrangement of Corellia Ho! to the band leader of the Battling 166th Troubadours. Unfortunately, I have to wait here for new militia orders. Can you deliver it for me? I'll pay you.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Thanks. The band member's name is Vincol Dunker. He found my kloo horn, so don't let anything happen to him. That might hurt the horn. Sorry, just joking.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Great. You want to find the Battling 166th band leader, Pytor Tuko. He's out in the wilderness on a training exercise.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_2_3", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Sorry to hear that. This whole situation is rapidly becoming a fiasco.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Well, thanks for your earlier help, anyway.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_3_3", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Look, you try herding a pack of wayward Serenaders out in the middle of nowhere, and you'll lose track of details too. I hope if you can get the band member and my horn back safely, I won't get into trouble with my commander. Will you bring him here?");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_4_2", "You must know that tune -- brace up, Corellia, stand firm and tall? None shall subdue you, you'll never fall? Go your own way and let none hold you back, for your future calls you ever ever on-n-n-n-n? No? Well, it's a rouser. I hope you'll deliver my arrangement.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_4_3", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I hope you're ready to move out and retrieve Vincol and my kloo horn.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I hope you'll get started soon and deliver that arrangement.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
