stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_reset", "I'm sorry to hear that. This situation is turning into a fiasco.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "I'm sorry to hear that. This situation is turning into a fiasco.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "I'm sorry to hear that. This situation is turning into a fiasco.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "I'm sorry to hear that. This situation is turning into a fiasco.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Thanks. Please accept this for your good work. Wait -- Vincol's brought that new arrangement, too. I forgot all about that! Check with me again if you want another job.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Thanks. Now the Battling 166th Troubadours can hold rehearsals out there in the wilderness -- which, if you've ever heard them play, you know is probably for the best.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "I wondered if I'd get this. That Grondorn -- talented, I grant you, but he couldn't remember to put his shirt on unless he got a written order.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "I swear, that Grondorn Muse could forget his own trousers sometimes. He'll get in big trouble for that someday. Can you guide me back? I have a poor sense of direction.");
stringFiles[1996].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
