stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I can see you asking yourself, Is that really Ignar Ominaz, the swoop racer? Yes indeed, that's me. I don't give autographs in person, but you can buy them from my HoloNet site. I'm giving you a chance to help me tune my new swoop. I ordered a custom power converter from Coronet, but the delivery agent is lost somewhere and needs safe escort here. Can you bring him?");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_1_2", "You know, we professional swoop racers have rivalries that go way back. Why, I remember how many times Sergi-X Arrogantus used to call me a dirty -- well, anyway. My old rival Dinnik Innik is travelling here for a head-to-head race with me, just us, no publicity. He called and said he needs a guide through the swamp. Will you escort him?");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Excellent! I forget the delivery agent's name, but he's a Drall, one of those little furry folks. I expect he must be a young fan eager to get into the world of swoop racing. Bring him here and give him a thrill.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good! It's hard to see Dinnik Innik, 'cause he's so small, but once you find him, bring him here for the race of the century!");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_2_3", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I don't think you understand what a rare opportunity it is to work for someone famous. Many of my fans would kill for this chance. Ah well.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Come on! You're missing a chance to see racing history here. I'm sure you'll change your mind soon.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_3_3", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_4_1", "What? You never heard of me? I expect you have and just forgot. Everyone in the galaxy followed my career back in the good Old Republic days, when I vied with Sergi-X Arrogantus for the Corulag championship. I'm still in the game, and this bike will carry me to another  championship -- as soon as you bring me that courier. Will you?");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Oh, for years Dinnik and I have fought for track position like a couple of slice hounds. He's a wiry little Chadra Fan, so there's a weight advantage right there. But the old Ignar Ominaz tactical magic brings its own advantages, you know. I expect he wants one last chance to prove he's still in the game. Poor guy, I pity him. Will you bring him here?");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_4_3", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "We've talked this through already. I need to get back to work, and so do you.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I've told you plenty to get you started. It's up to you from here, friend.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Are you from the customer who ordered this power converter?");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Did Ignar send you to guide me?");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "Thanks. You, Mister -- wait, let me check my order -- Mister Ominar. I mean Ominaz. If you had the brains of a kenalpa tree, you'd know -- wait. Ominaz. Any relation to that old washed-up swoop racer?");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "Thanks, friend. So, Ignar! I'm not racing you today. I'm not racing you ever again. I have a holo showing how you sabotaged my swoop in our last race, and I'm reporting you to the Commission! You'll never race again, Ignar! I wanted to see the look on your face when I told you.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Sorry you couldn't make it to the finish line, friend. Don't forget my HoloNet site, where you can buy genuine autographed souvenirs of my career.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Where's Dinnik? No Dinnik? I was all ready to race!");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I'm waiting on that courier to give me his coordinates. Check back with me in a moment. Meanwhile, you might want to check out my HoloNet site, where you can buy genuine autographed souvenirs of my career.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I'm waiting on Dinnik Innik to send me his coordinates. Check back with me in a moment. Meanwhile, you might want to look at my HoloNet site, where you can buy genuine autographed souvenirs of my career.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_reset", "If I had your lack of ambition, I'd never have become a famous swoop racer. Never give up, friend! Try me again later.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "If I had your lack of ambition, I'd never have become a famous swoop racer. Never give up, friend! Try me again later.");
