stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "If I had your lack of ambition, I'd never have become a famous swoop racer. Never give up, friend! Try me again later.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Well! Ah, um -- I guess this little fellow isn't quite ready for the racing game just yet. Anyway. Here, here's a little something for your time. You can tell your grandchildren you got these credits from Ignar Ominaz.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Uh. Umm. Well. Tell you what, friend, let's pretend this never happened. Here's something for your time. And don't forget the souvenirs available on my HoloNet site.");
