stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "What kind of idiot tries to fine-tune a swoop bike in the Agrilat Swamp? The crystal growth will ruin this power converter. Bring me to this nincompoop, and I'll tell him where he's gone wrong.");
stringFiles[1998].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "The Agrilat Swamp gives me the chills. I'm glad you're here to take me to Ignar. I hear some disease is driving all the animals crazy.");
