stringFiles[1999].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("next", "You've performed your duties admirably. I don't have anything else for you right now, but feel free to speak with Garm Bel Iblis. I've cleared you. ");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I'm known as Irenez. I'm currently involved in fighting Black Sun. If you're interested in helping Corellia fight back against the criminals that try to plunder her I could certainly use your help. Interested?");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_1_2", "That woman you brought us was a goldmine of information. One very immediate lead we got was the recent hiring of an assassin. I'd like you to try and stop him. Will you do it?");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_1_3", "You're not going to believe where one of those money trails led us. Black Sun has been buying weapons from the blasted Imperials. This next one may be a little tricky. Are you still willing to help?");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good. Bring me Tessa Wylden. She's an accountant for Black Sun and can tell us a lot about how their money flows. She'll have guards so do be careful.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good, because this can't wait. He's called Skazz and he's deadly, so don't take any chances with him. Find him and stop him cold.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_2_3", "You have courage. I need you to take out the Black Sun members who are waiting to purchase some weapons.  If the Imperials arrive and the Black Sun thugs aren't there, the deal will fall through.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Just looking out for number one, eh? I see how it is.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Then I'd better find someone else to handle this right away.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Getting nervous about angering the Black Sun?");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_4_1", "To start with, I need someone to capture one of the money people. There's one we've been tailing for that very purpose. How about it?");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_4_2", "The head of CorSec, which is why it's extremely important he be stopped. Will you do it?");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Not at the moment, no. I just need you to take out the group of Black Sun thugs awaiting their next shipment of weapons. Will you do it?");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Was there something else you had to say?");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "The sooner you leave the sooner you can stop him.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "If you're going to do this, please leave straight away.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "I think we may have a problem...");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "You should not interfere with me. Here's why.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "You shouldn't interfere in Black Sun business. It's unhealthy.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You couldn't bring her in after all, eh? I guess we'll have to make another attempt later.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "That assassin has got to be stopped. I guess I'll have to find another way.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You didn't stop the weapons deal? Whatever nefarious use they put those weapons to is on your head... not mine.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I should receive word as to where you can find Tessa shortly. Why don't you come back in a little while?");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I need a few moments to make some last minute preparations with CorSec. Can you come back in a few minutes?");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "I should soon receive the exact coordinates for where the Black Sun is meeting their imperial suppliers. Come back and see me in a little while.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_reset", "If you change your mind and want to try and help later, you know where to find me.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "If you change your mind and want to try and help later, you know where to find me.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "If you change your mind and want to try and help later, you know where to find me.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "If you change your mind and want to try and help later, you know where to find me.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Good job. Come see me again if you want more work.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Good work. Corellia is in your debt.");
stringFiles[1999].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "You're very talented. You should consider speaking with the Commander. He might be able to find a use for you.");
