stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_1_1", "He can't trick me. I know the Jedi were the guardians of peace and justice in the Old Republic. Everyone knew that. Yet no one did anything when they were hunted down. No one spoke out against the massacre. And now there is blood on my hands. This beast can never die, friend. But we must try nonetheless. Will you help me track this monster and stop its murderous rampage? We must act before the galaxy suffers. Before the darkness comes.");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Go quickly. Show no mercy. This foul thing corrupts everything it touches. It must be stopped. It can't be stopped. Go quickly.");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_2_3", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Who will shed light on the darkness? Who will restore order to the galaxy? I did not mean to kill the light...");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2001].addEntry("npc_4_1", "I was there when the light was extinguished, friend. I helped extinguish it. Now I must live in darkness, for that is the only place that will have me. Will you help me stop this beast's rampage?");
