stringFiles[2002] = new StringFile("static_npc/corellia/karena_keer");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("cant_work", "Come and see me for a job when you're no longer employed by someone else.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm waiting to meet someone else.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I have no business with you. Please leave me alone.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "This is private business. Why don't you just keep walking?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("gotowork_1", "This is not the disk you were supposed to give me.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("gotowork_2", "You lost the spice? Are you trying to get us both killed?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("next", "You've done everything I asked of you. I think you should go speak with Shalera. Though you should call her Lady Hutt in her presence.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("notit_1", "What's this?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("notit_2", "What's this?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("notit_3", "What's this?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("notyet", "If you're looking to for work, first go talk to Lasha. That's right... Lasha Bindari. She's currently handling the business in Kor Vella. Look for her there.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_1_1", "You've come to work for the Lady Hutt, have you? Smart to sign on to the winning team. How about we start you off with something simple? I need a courier to go pick up this week's drop. Interested?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Have you interacted with the Hutts much? They're not all as refined as Shalera. You should consider yourself lucky to be involved with her business. If you're interested in another job, I've got a way for you to work for two Hutts at once. The Lady would like to send Jabba a gift of some spice, as a gesture of goodwill. We need you to deliver this gift to the garbage hauler who'll be transporting it. How about it?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Black Sun doesn't know it yet, but its days are numbered. Shalera has had about enough of their constant interference. She wants to send them a message they'll understand. Would you like to be the messenger?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Go and meet Dray Ithicus, one of our other couriers, and be careful. Black Sun has been pestering our couriers recently. Be assured that won't last much longer. ");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Bring this spice to Breel'ik Nar. He's posing as a garbage hauler. Breel'ik will take the spice from here and make certain it reaches Tatooine safely. The spice is sealed... we'll know if you tamper with it. So don't!");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Your... ahem... target will be Lacklo Blant, a mid-ranking member of the Black Sun. He'll more than likely have at least one or two others with him, so prepare this message accordingly.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_3_1", "You'll never get to meet the Lady Hutt if you don't prove yourself.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Suit yourself. I'll find somebody else.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I understand. You don't want to get caught in the middle of a gang war.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Just some bank authorizations. They wouldn't be anything you could access, in case you had any bright ideas. What do you say?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_4_2", "You'd be surprised how many credits you save if you smuggle spice in toxic waste shipments headed for Tatooine. No tariffs and no one ever looks too closely. Will you do it?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_4_3", "This would be more of a lethal message -- to one of the Black Sun lieutenants. Still interested?");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
