stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Well done. I may have to mention you to the Lady soon.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "You're definitely going places. Go and talk to the Lady Hutt.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Don't lose it or it'll be both our heads.");
stringFiles[2002].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "I wish I could just take this spice and retire, but one Hutt out to kill me would be bad enough. I shudder to think how two of them might split me up.");
