stringFiles[2003].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("gotowork_2", "You don't have the disk? What am I supposed to tell the Lady Hutt?");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("next", "I don't have any work for you right now. Check back with me another time.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("notit_1", "This isn't what I was expecting. I think you gave me the wrong item.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("notit_2", "Umm -- keep looking. You tried to give me the wrong thing.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("notit_3", "If this is a gift from the Lady Hutt, I'm baffled. Are you sure you didn't mean to give me something else?");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("notyet", "I'm a busy man. Speak with Vinya Maysor, my deputy.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Vinya tells me you've been a big help to her. I can always use a competent and discreet operative. Would you be interested in doing some work for me? I need you to pick up something from a courier.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_1_2", "After reviewing that disk you brought me, I decided to have an outside source look into a certain shipping irregularity. Too many officials are implicated in this scandal to trust it to normal channels. Would you mind taking this to my independent investigator's courier?");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_1_3", "What pleasant news. It seems that investigation into the Lady Hutt was a clever forgery by data slicers trying to discredit several high-ranking Corellian officials. Good thing we stopped that. The Lady Hutt is sending me a thank-you gift for giving her the opportunity to take part in that investigation. Will you pick it up?");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_2_1", "It all seems very hush-hush, so be careful. The courier is named Mia. I'll leave you to your work now. I should really get back to mine too.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good. You'll be looking for Tabor Claxx. Don't give the disk to anybody else, even if they claim to be some sort of official. I'll smooth out any problems that arise from that.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Wonderful. You'll be meeting with Tabor Claxx again. I believe you're already acquainted. It may be delicate, so do be careful.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Not very exciting, I'll grant you. Well then, I should really get back to work. Good day.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_3_2", "So be it. On your way then.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_3_3", "As you wish. I must be on about my business now.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_4_1", "I was asked to send someone I can trust to pick up a copy of some evidence in a fraud investigation. Would you mind collecting that for me?");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_4_2", "It would be impolitic to say. Besides, this may be the work of a very creative data slicer. We'll just keep this quiet until we have all the facts, is that understood? Good. So will you make the delivery?");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_4_3", "I'm not really sure. But the Lady so craves legitimacy that I didn't have the heart to tell her no. Will you pick up her present for me?");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I've told you all I know. Was there anything else?");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "If you're doing this, it's time to get going.");
stringFiles[2003].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "It's just a simple task, but if you're too busy, just say so.");
