stringFiles[2005] = new StringFile("static_npc/corellia/lasha_bindari");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("cantwork", "I can't trust you to work for me if you're already working for somebody else. ");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm on official business citizen. ");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "We're on official business. You just keep moving.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("gotowork", "Please just leave me alone. I just do this job part-time.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("gotowork_1", "Please just leave me alone. I just do this job part-time.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("next", "I don't have any work for you right now. If you're looking for more work, try speaking with Karena Keer. She's usually at the cantina in Tyrena.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("notit_1", "What is this? You were supposed to bring me the results of that investigation.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_1_1", "So you want to get in good with the Lady Hutt, do you? Smart move. I need someone to handle a little problem she's having. Some investigators have been looking into the Lady's shipping interests. Do you think you can do some looking of your own?");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_1_2", "That evidence report you picked up was pretty thorough. Fortunately most of the investigators are being cooperative, if you take my meaning. Interested in helping me with two CorSec officers who aren't? ");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_1_3", "We've had a lucky break. An informant of ours, inside CorSec, has managed to plant a tracking device on the CorSec officer who is leading the investigation on the Lady Hutt. I think its time to bring this problem to an end. If this officer were to disappear our problems should evaporate like so much spiced tea.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good. The investigators' courier will be leaving shortly for their mobile base. Our tracer should lead you right to him. If he won't give you the report he's carrying, take it from him.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I think the Lady Hutt is going to take a shine to you. Find these two troublesome CorSec officers and do what's necessary. ");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_2_3", "You are becoming a valuable asset to the Lady Hutt. If you manage to pull this off, I will recommend you to her. Go now.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Afraid you're in over your head? You may be right.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_3_2", "It would be unfortunate if word of this job offer got out.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I hope you're not developing a conscience. That could make your life complicated.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_4_1", "A courier is bringing the investigators' most recent report to a mobile base they've set up. I want you to intercept this report so I can see how much they know. Interested?");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_4_2", "I want them removed from the equation completely. I want it to be as though the world opened up and swallowed them. I want them unable to interfere with the Lady Hutt in any fashion. Ever. Is that plain enough for you? Will you do it?");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_4_3", "You cut right to the heart of the matter. No lead investigator, no evidence, no case. Will you do it?");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I hope you're not backing out on me.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I've said all I can. Now you need to go if you're going to do this.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "You're not backing out on us now, are you?");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Stay.. stay away, I'm an official courier!");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Here comes trouble.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "So, I see the Lady Hutt has sent one of her goons, just as we expected. Now you will learn how foolish it is to interfere in CorSec affairs.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
