stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "You're giving up? If you think you can handle this later come back and see me.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "You got the report? Good work. I'll just look this over.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "The Lady Hutt will be pleased when I tell her of your service. I'm impressed myself, and I don't impress easily.");
stringFiles[2005].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Thanks. If you've not already spoken with Shalera the Lady Hutt in Tyrena, now would be a good time.");
