stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hey there, friend. I'm a recruiter, of sorts, on the lookout for promising young talent. I represent an organization that values ingenuity, loyalty, and above all, discretion. If this sounds intriguing, I have a little job for you, something to let me get a better understanding of your skills. A former agent left our organization owing us some money. Not a huge sum but enough to warrant a visit from someone like you. I doubt this individual has the money on him but what he does have are some bank codes that would assist our collection efforts. Can you bring me these codes?");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_1_2", "You performed so well on that last job that I've decided to only give you one more test. Since you got us these bank codes, it only seems fair that you should be the one to deliver them to my superior. Seems simple enough, right? Can you do it? ");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Great. I like your enthusiasm. Oh, and by the way, I doubt this client will give these codes up willingly so you may have to persuade him. To death. Best of luck.");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_2_2", "All right. Take these codes to a man named Gnurr Fenkel. He knows to expect you, so if he doesn't say, You looking for Corellian Double-Brandy? when he sees you, blast him and bring the codes back to me.");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_2_3", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Well, our organization is not for everybody. Take it easy, friend.");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Eh, no big loss. There's plenty more candidates out there.");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_4_1", "The name of my organization is not something we should discuss until I've determined that you're a suitable candidate. You want to try and prove that?");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_4_2", "There's a possibility that a few tough guys might try and take these codes away from you. Competitors, you understand. Nothing someone like you couldn't handle, though. ");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_4_3", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2006].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
