stringFiles[2008].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hey there, friend, you have a friendly face. Perhaps you can help me with a little problem. I'm a spice trader, and I operate within the law -- mostly. But I was doing a little trading with the Lady Hutt's associates recently, and I think it might have been recorded. Can you help me?");
