stringFiles[2009].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I always like working with a shrewd negotiator. There's a guild mining rep that's been causing some problems for Black Sun. He's moral, upright and won't just do what he's told and take the money. His name's Jinz Finzer. Kill him.");
