stringFiles[2010].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[2010].addEntry("npc_1_1", "You like swoop races? Maybe you've heard of me. Name's Serji-X Arrogantus, best swoop racer in the Core Worlds. And if you ever hear anyone say that Ingar Ominaz is best, then you know you're dealing with an idiot. So how would you feel about helping a celebrity out? There's this bet handler who's made a lot of money off me over the years. Recently I asked him to share some insider information but the ungrateful worm refuses. Now does that seem like a friend to you? If you can get me his bet ledger, I'd certainly pay handsomely for it. Want to get on my good side?");
stringFiles[2010].addEntry("npc_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2010].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2010].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2010].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2010].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2010].addEntry("npc_2_1", "All right then. The guy you're looking for is an Ishi Tib named Gleeb Tchotle. He's not likely to hand over his ledger, which he keeps on his person at all times, so you might have to persuade him to hand it over. Oh and if he ends up demised, I won't shed any tears.");
