stringFiles[2011] = new StringFile("static_npc/corellia/shalera");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("cantwork", "See me again when you've finished with your present employer.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm here waiting for someone.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Not me.  You don't want to talk to me.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "I'm busy right now and don't have time to talk.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "What are you bothering me for? Get a job.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "I'm afraid I don't have time for idle chitchat. ");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "Sorry, I can't talk right now.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("gotowork_1", "You didn't bring the message? ");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("gotowork_6", "Where's my package?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("next", "Business is running smoothly. But if I have any more difficulties, you're my first choice to solve them.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("notit_1", "I think you meant to give me something different.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("notit_6", "What's that? You were supposed to give me something different.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("notyet", "I lack time to talk to you at the moment. Very regrettable, I know. But please talk with one of my lieutenants, Karena Keer. ");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Welcome. I am Shalera -- some call me the Lady Hutt. You needn't look so nervous. I never eat my guests -- at least not without tea, and you've just missed that. As it happens, I need some short-term help. My regular people are busy with a new project. Do you think you might be willing to deliver a message for me?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I fear your previous efforts on my behalf bore little fruit. The people in charge of Black Sun let their dislike of me cloud their judgment. Speaking of my illustrious competitors, you might assist me in teaching them a lesson. They've been crossing the line recently, and I want to discourage their childish antics.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I have need of you once more, my friend. One of my employees, an accountant, is away from the hustle and bustle of the city while she cleans up my more frontier accounting practices, but she needs an escort to get back safely. Will you help me?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_1_4", "My friend, I need your help in a delicate matter involving my business. One of my lieutenants thinks that because he works for me, he can do anything he wishes. He's been drawing unwanted attention to my organization. Can you help me deal with him?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_1_5", "This business never gets dull. A pilot known to be friendly to the Alliance has managed to get in trouble with CorSec instead of the Imperials. I'm being paid to smuggle him off-planet. Will you bring him to me?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_1_6", "Do you know much about the Berserker Virus? It's an ailment that has recently been infecting the creatures of Naboo. It makes them unusually aggressive. I'm sending a sample of the virus to Jabba. You've been very dependable so far. Will you deliver the sample to his courier?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_2_1", "You have the heart of a Jedi, always willing to aid the cause of peace. Bring my message to the courier waiting outside the city. We tend to conduct these affairs away from places where people might notice.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Ah, so like myself -- willing to negotiate but unafraid of conflict. Black Sun recently shipped a valuable commodity to Corellia that they are temporarily storing at one of their smuggling dens. They've hired some offworld specialist mercenary to guard the stuff, but I want that mercenary eliminated.  Understand?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_2_3", "I knew I could count on you. Her work is very important to me, so please bring her back safely. I'm sure she's completely out of place in the wilderness.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Deal with him as you think best, of course. I've learned to trust your judgment. I warn you, though -- he's very full of himself and may not be willing to listen to reason.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Your loyalty is an inspiration to all who know you. The pilot's name is Naz Tulos. Bring him to me before CorSec catches up with him.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_2_6", "Fine. Black Sun is very keen to take this sample back from us. One of my operatives found it on one of their couriers. Be careful that they don't foul up this delivery. I don't want anything to upset Jabba, he has a bit of a temper.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Perhaps you are wise not to put yourself between rivals such as Black Sun and myself.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Truly your years belie your wisdom. It would indeed be foolish to get caught up in our struggle.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I admire your sense of self-preservation. It's dangerous out in the wilderness.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Once again your wisdom astounds me. You're right, this is a family matter, and I should attend to it myself.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_3_5", "Very prudent of you not to meddle in Rebel affairs. The Empire is not well disposed toward that sort of behavior. ");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_3_6", "I completely understand. I too am wary of handling this sort of biohazard.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Recently things have been getting out of hand between my business rivals, Black Sun and I. All that bad blood is not good for business and draws unwanted attention. Will you help me arrange a sit-down?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Petty things, really. Like telling CorSec the location of some of my hidden installations. Will you discourage such escapades on my behalf?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_4_3", "She was escorted to a hidden location to do her work without any interruptions and now needs an escort back. She's not really the outdoorsy type, but she likes to get away while she figures out how to clean up my credits.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Demanding money from merchants. Shooting people who annoy him, and then warning witnesses who his boss is and how they'd better keep quiet. Killing the Corsec officer who was investigating his case. Things like that. All very regrettable. Will you help me?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_4_5", "Let's just say he rashly assumed that a CorSec ship belonged to the Empire. At the time, he was doing something the Imperials wouldn't like, and so he took action. Very regrettable. Will you bring him to me?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_4_6", "They've not yet managed to engineer a strain that works on sapient creatures, so you should be completely safe. Will you do it?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "That's all I can tell you right now. Please proceed with the task.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "You know all that you require. Go destroy that merc.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Please hurry and bring back my accountant. ");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "I really need you to attend to this matter with all speed.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "Hurry up and bring him to me, or neither of us will make any credits off this situation.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "I can't tell you anything more. Please -- just make the delivery.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Are you here to deliver the message from the Lady Hutt?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "One of the Lady Hutt's new toys, eh?  You won't last.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Did Shalera send you?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "I work for Shalera the Hutt, you fool! You can't touch me!");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "Did the Lady Hutt send you to find somebody?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "Hey! Are you the courier from Shalera?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "Thanks for getting me here. I never could have made it by myself.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "Thanks for getting me here.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Regrettable that you weren't able to succeed, but these things happen.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "What a pity. I thought you'd be able to handle that. Very regrettable.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You failed me? Words cannot express my surprise and regret. I'm sure you won't let it happen again.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "I was so sure you could make him behave. How regrettable.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "I do so hate to lose an opportunity to make credits. Oh well, no use worrying about what we can't change.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "Very regrettable. Jabba will not be happy about this. I'll try to leave your name out of it when he asks what went wrong.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Now that I think of it, this may not be the best time to deliver such a message. See me about this again later.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Perhaps we should wait a bit on that job.  I have just received news that may alter the social landscape. Meet with me later.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Oh bother! She just called in to tell me she wanted to double-check some new Imperial tax laws. Would you mind waiting a little while and then coming back?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "Actually, I'm not sure where he is right now. See me later, and with luck I'll have the coordinates you need.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "Actually, things are a little hot for him right now. I'll send you to find him when things have cooled down a little.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "They haven't paid me, so I don't want it delivered quite yet. Come back and see me later.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_reset", "Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.");
