stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "A thousand thanks, my friend. I have the feeling you and I shall get along very well.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Excellent. Once again you have my gratitude.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Where others would fail, you succeed. Well done.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "That's one way to keep someone from misbehaving. You should have been born a Hutt.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "I admire your resourcefulness. You've done very well.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "You're everything a Hutt could want in an employee. ");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "I'll bring this to the boss right away.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "That's what I've been waiting for. Take care.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "I'm so glad you're here. I've had enough of the wilderness. Take me back to the Lady Hutt.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_takeme_5", "CorSec, ImpSec. How am I supposed to keep track of all these details? Just help get me off this world.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_takeme_6", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Haven't you delivered my message yet? I'm a patient Hutt, but --");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Why haven't you destroyed that mercenary yet?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_work_3", "You mean she's still waiting out in the wilderness? Well, go get her!");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Haven't you yet shown my lieutenant the error of his ways?");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_work_5", "If you don't find him soon, then CorSec will.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("npc_work_6", "You haven't delivered it yet? Jabba is waiting.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("otherescort_1", "You and I don't have any business to discuss");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("otherescort_2", "");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("otherescort_3", "Sorry, I'm waiting for somebody else. ");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("otherescort_4", "I know you're not here to see me.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("otherescort_5", "I don't know who you're looking for, but I do know it isn't me.");
stringFiles[2011].addEntry("otherescort_6", "I'm waiting for somebody else. ");
