stringFiles[2012].addEntry("npc_1_1", "You were wise to seek me out -- Black Sun is a force to be reckoned with on this world. Are you looking for work? I have a job that's perfect for a freelancer such as yourself. The Lady Hutt has planted an agent in our midst. We need this agent removed. Will you do the removal?");
