stringFiles[2013] = new StringFile("static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("cantwork", "You and I should talk business once you've completed your current job.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm just waiting for a courier. ");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I don't think I know you. ");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "I'm just delivering a message. Nothing to concern yourself with.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "I'm just waiting for a delivery.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("gotowork_4", "Weren't you supposed to be bringing me some new virus sample? Where is it?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("next", "You're quite a smooth operator. I don't have anything worthy of you just now, but I will definitely keep you in mind.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("notit_1", "I don't think this is the disk she told you to give me. ");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("notit_3", "Are you sure you didn't mean to give me something else?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("notit_4", "I was expecting a virus sample. What are you giving me this for?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_1_1", "The name is Talon Karrde. I'm in the import/export business and find myself temporarily without an assistant. You seem a likely prospect. Would you be interested in making a few credits? I can use a little help with a pickup run. What do you say?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Do you recall that Rodian who tried to interfere with our last bit of business? Not long after you left that slicer, Ara Niorri, the Rodian's partner killed her. Ara was a gifted woman, and I do not take kindly to associates being murdered. Will you be my tool of vengence?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I've been keeping my eye on the Lady Hutt after our recent run-ins. My informants tell me she's expecting an important delivery from Naboo soon. Will you intercept it for me?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_1_4", "I'm always a little horrified at the lengths people in this business will go to. The Lady Hutt has purchased a genetically engineered virus that heightens aggression. There are some things I'm just not willing to be involved in, and engineered viruses are right up there. Will you deliver this virus sample to the Biological Control Bureau for me?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I thought you might be interested. You'll be looking for Ara Miorri. She's a little on the eccentric side, doing all her business outside of town -- although I hear that's becoming more common.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good, I didn't think you'd let this offense stand unanswered. The Rodian's name is Vralla. I'd be careful of her -- you foiled her partner, so she may be looking for you. ");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_2_3", "I knew I could count on you. The ship just landed in a remote location, and the delivery is being made by hand. Find the courier and take the package. I don't like doing business this way, but the Lady Hutt must learn the consequences of interfering with me.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Good. I've arranged for a quiet dropoff with one of the BCB couriers. Just meet him, give him the package, and there'll be no questions asked. I hope they can get a retrovirus started in case anyone tries something foolish.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Afraid you might get yourself in trouble? Probably good thinking. Good luck to you.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I guess she didn't impress you very much. I'll handle it myself.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_3_3", "All right. Best to stay out of these power struggles if you don't have a vested interest.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_3_4", "I can't fault your good sense. Good luck to you. ");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_4_1", "A disk that a data slicer associate of mine has put together to help me with my shipping interests. I need someone to get it in my place, as I seem to have picked up a tail. Don't ask who's tailing me -- I don't know. Will you make the pickup?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Ah, answering that question is my current priority. I suspect a certain Hutt rival elsewhere on Corellia. She likes to keep her own hands clean nowadays, but she sends others to do the dirtiest possible work. Will you avenge Ara?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Technically I'm only going against one Hutt, but in truth, the answer to your question is yes. Nobody gets far in this business without taking some risks. Besides, I know a few things they don't. Trust me on this. So will you do it?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_4_4", "I am assured that its current form does not affect sapient races. I wouldn't be surprised if they try to change that. ");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You haven't lost interest in the job already, have you?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I've told you what I know. You haven't changed your mind, have you?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "I've told you all I can. Will you get that package now?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Don't you want to make that delivery for me?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Did Karrde send you?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Well, if it isn't the little wretch who foiled my partner. Milady Hutt will be most pleased if I kill you.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "You just made the last mistake of your life.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Are you looking for me?");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
