stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "A job well done, my friend. Maybe we can do more business later.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "So the lady Hutt was involved in this. Just as I suspected. I believe I'll have to discourage her from playing in my affairs.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "You got it? Good. Now I'll find out what the Lady is mixed up in. Thanks for your good work.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Thanks. Kind of strange to be helping people for a change. I'll try not to make it a habit. It might be bad for business. ");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "You tell Karrde he owes me big-time for this. These are some high-clearance codes.");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2013].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "Thanks. I'll get this back to the BCB for analysis right away.");
