stringFiles[2014].addEntry("notyet", "Speak to Captain Pellaeon.  I'm sure he has some work for you.  Come back to me later.");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_1_1", "So you want to serve the Empire and prove yourself, eh? I might have just the task for you. There's an informant we use, Dina Whisper. We suspect she's selling sensitive information to the Rebels. Would you bring her to us for questioning? ");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Very interesting information we picked up from that arrest you made. Apparently there's a small black-market outpost operating outside of town. How about taking care of the people who run it?");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Always a pleasure to see people take an interest in the welfare of the Empire. You'll be looking for Dina Whisper. Keep an eye open -- you don't want her Rebel pals getting the drop on you.");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I never doubted you for a moment. We can't allow an operation like this to continue. ");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_2_3", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Suddenly not so keen to serve the Empire? What was your name again?");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Thinking about those illegal goods, are you? I hope you don't get hurt when we take care of these guys.");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_4_1", "I'm sure she's picking up interesting information in her dealings with us. Too bad she can't be trusted. I hope we won't have that problem with you. So, interested?");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Don't get cute. They sell information and weapons to the Rebels, so unless you plan on treason to the Empire, stick to the job at hand. Will you take out those running the outpost?");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_4_3", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2014].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
