stringFiles[2015].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_1_1", "The name is Thrackan Sal-Solo. I hope you're here to work, because I have big things that need doing fast and without stupid questions. Are you willing to work with that understanding?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Let's get right to work. Faleera, the terrorist I sent you after, was known to consort with a man named Jermo Tharrn. I want someone to bring him back here for questioning. Can you do that without any annoying questions?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_1_3", "We're checking some leads we got from your last mission, but meanwhile I want you to pursue another problem. No questions this time. Will you do it or not?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_1_4", "We finally confirmed the information we got out of that suspect you arrested. The Selonian terrorist cell is operating from a den out in the wilderness. I want you to wipe out the entire nest. Will you do it? Go ahead, I know you're just dying to ask me a question.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I'm glad we got that sorted out. Now go find that Selonian terrorist and kill her. You needn't bother looking in town, she's trying to stay out of the public eye.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Fine. Try not to cause trouble with any friends of his. I don't want them to think he's under arrest and try something foolish. Don't let them stop you, though.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Fine, his name is Tormyll Fassoola, and his blackmailing days are numbered. Find him and bring me the disk he's been using to blackmail the Diktat.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Good. Go find them, and don't leave any of those vermin alive. I'm counting on you.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Then why are you wasting my time? Get out.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Then get out, I'm a busy man.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I have things to do. Goodbye. ");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Then I have no more time for you.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Starting with the stupid questions already. I can see that you're going to be trouble. I'll explain this once. My people have located a notorious Selonian terrorist who is hiding out on Corellia. I want you to remove this threat to the public. Is that simple enough?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_4_2", "I guess it was too much to hope. That's why I want him brought here for questioning, rather than arrested and interrogated. Now will you do it?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Because I'll tell you what to do, that's how. A data slicer is blackmailing the Diktat with falsified recordings of a death squad he supposedly sanctioned. If I give him the recordings, then maybe he'll get back to work instead of trying to cover his behind. Will you help?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_4_4", "I should have seen that coming. So will you do it?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You're not giving up are you?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Were you going to be on your way or was there something else?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "I've told you everything I can. Or did you have another question to torment me with?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Were you going to stop those terrorists, or have you lost your nerve?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "My sisters warned me someone was after us. I didn't believe it until now.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Is there something I can help you with, friend?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "I won't let you cover this up!");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "Perhaps they finally found Faleera's killer.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You failed? I didn't hire you to fail.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Why am I always surrounded by incompetents? ");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "The Diktat isn't going to like this. Would you mind spelling your name for me?");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "You failed? Any more deaths will be on your conscience. ");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I need a few minutes to make some final arrangements. Check back soon, and don't keep me waiting.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I expect a call with his location any time now. Come back and see me in a few minutes. ");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "As soon as my agents call with his location, I'll let you know. Check back with me soon.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "I need to make some last-minute arrangements. See me in a few minutes. We can get started then.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reset", "You're backing out on me? If you think you can handle it, maybe I'll let you try again later.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "You're backing out on me? If you think you can handle it, maybe I'll let you try again later.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "You're backing out on me? If you think you can handle it, maybe I'll let you try again later.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "You're backing out on me? If you think you can handle it, maybe I'll let you try again later.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "You're backing out on me? If you think you can handle it, maybe I'll let you try again later.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Not bad. I'll consider hiring you again sometime.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "His friends were Selonians, were they? Perhaps we'll be able to wipe out this terrorist cell once and for all.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Cover-up. Hah! That was a feeble dodge.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "You've done fine work and have been a big help to the Diktat.");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[2015].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
