stringFiles[2016].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Have you ever seen the holopainting of our beloved Emperor with his hand held high, receiving the adulation of a huge crowd? Yes, that's right, 'Palpatine Triumphant.' That was mine. It made me famous on Coruscant. Now I'm back home seeking a certain critic, the slime-toad Faswald Vorsuble. The acid he spouted about my first showing, decades ago, I shall not repeat. For years I have planned to teach him a lesson. You can teach it. I want you to destroy his vacation home.");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I still recall the awful things the critic Faswald Vorsuble wrote about me all those years ago. 'Spews color in erratic gobs, like the trail of blood from a wounded mynock.' I cannot rest until Faswald Vorsuble knows, first-hand, what a trail of blood looks like -- close up. I want you to destroy him. Trust me, you'll do the galactic arts community a favor.");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good. I have the wilderness coordinates of his home right here. I believe he has some kind of large pet as a guard, so have a care.");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good. As you cut down Faswald Vorsuble with blaster fire, be calm, for this is the man who called me 'an egomaniacal dabbler.'");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_2_3", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_3_1", "You seem too concerned by issues of legality. You won't have much place in the New Order if you keep on that way.");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_3_2", "When this is the man who called me 'hopeless in talent and, by all reports, in personal character,' you can allow him to live?");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_4_1", "'Legal'? This is the New Order. What's 'legal' is whatever the Empire says is legal. And nowadays I have friends so high up in the Empire that, essentially, what's legal is whatever I say is legal. Will you destroy Vorsuble's home or not?");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_4_2", "'I have not discerned who trained this neophyte Chassu. Perhaps no reputable teacher will admit to foisting on the galaxy this ninth-rate purveyor of puerile, polychromatic poppycock.' I ask you, can you allow this inhuman vandal of character to survive a moment longer?");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_4_3", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I grow impatient for you to carry out my revenge. Go!");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I still burn at Vorsuble's words: 'Depicts human faces as though viewing them through a Gran's third eye.' This man must die, and you are idly waiting here. Go!");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "It is some ruffian. Protect me, or you are fired!");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2016].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
