stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_1_1", "You want to work for the Corporate Sector Authority? One of the Viceprex's underlings has had data slicers alter shipping documents to make the Viceprex seem incompetent and corrupt. I need help with damage control. What do you say?");
stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I'm glad you're here. We've had one of the spice mining union representatives quietly brought to Corellia to negotiate a special deal. Would you mind escorting him here safely? ");
stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Bring this disk to Reeve Taggart. He'll make some changes in this altered report and then upload it to where it belongs.");
stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_2_2", "These trips aren't all that uncommon. It's one of the perks when you're a union rep who works with the CSA. Try not to draw attention when you escort him back. The fewer folks who know he's here, the better.");
