stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_4_1", "He's not the only one who can employ data slicers to alter records. I want you to take this datadisc to our slicer. Let's just say when he's finished, it won't be the Viceprex who looks like a fool. Will you do it?");
stringFiles[2017].addEntry("npc_4_2", "A temporary reduction of shipping rates, as well as other good and valuable considerations for which reciprocal benefits would manifest in due time for those individuals vested in the -- I shouldn't bore you with details. Will you do it? ");
