stringFiles[2018] = new StringFile("static_npc/corellia/zekka_thyne");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("cantwork", "You want work from me? Get rid of your other obligations first.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm rather busy at the moment. Please do not disturb me.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Do not disturb me. I am busy.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Go away.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("gotowork", "What do you want? I already gave you the disk. Can't you just leave me alone?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("gotowork_1", "What do you want? I already gave you the disk. Can't you just leave me alone?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("next", "Don't need you anymore, buddy. At least not at the moment. Check back with me later. I may have some more work.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("notyet", "I'm a busy man, pal. Talk to Grobber. If he doesn't kill you, maybe we'll have a little chat.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_1_1", "So Grobber decided not to blast you, huh? Okay, listen up. I'm in the process of consolidating some business interests here on Corellia. So far, all of my associates have gone along with the program. Some are not so smart. One of these jokers has a list of clients he refuses to share. Find this worm, remove him, and get me that list. He carries it with him at all times. Suspicious little sleemo, huh? Can you handle that?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Guess what? Turns out a rival had his eyes on old Korowee's list and isn't terribly happy I got my hands on it. If there's one thing I can't stand, it's professional jealousy. Take care of this loser before he gets too steamed and goes and does something stupid like hire an assassin to try and take me out. Can you do that?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_1_3", "While you were out having a good time, my people came across something interesting. Wedu had been doing more than simply steaming about that little list. He'd done his homework and had collected some rather incriminating files on many of my clients. This makes them nervous, as I'm sure you can imagine. Fortunately, I know exactly where these files exist. I need you to find the guy holding them and take him out. Think you can handle that?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_1_4", "It was bound to happen sooner or later. One of Wedu's partners has called in a favor and has hired an assassin to take care of me. Now I've seen what you can do and I know you're more than a match for this trained killer. Can you take of this guy? For old time's sake?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good answer. This walking corpse is a Bothan named Korowee Fa'lorn. But you can just refer to him as bantha fodder. Bring me the encrypted disc he's carrying. You can keep everything else you find on him.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Careful with this guy. He's got a rather nasty reputation. Name's Wedu Belar and he's a pretty good shot too.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Try not to be seen, if you can help it. CorSec don't take too kindly to this kind of thing. Also, this guy, name's Wililikin, will probably not be alone, so expect a fight.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Good. Take this killer out so I can go back to sleeping peacefully at nights. And of course feel free to keep whatever the loser's got on him.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_3_1", "You know I could've sworn you just said no. People who work for me don't get to say that much.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I can't stand people that waste my time. Beat it.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Really? That's a shame. And we were becoming such good friends, too. ");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_3_4", "My life is in danger and you refuse to help? I think our friendship is ended.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_4_1", "The kind that have access to a lot of money and some well-known peccadilloes. So you in or not? ");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_4_2", "They're as common in my line of work as fleas on a bantha. Course, some of them have really short careers. You don't seem like a short timer to me. Willing to test that? ");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_4_3", "The kind that gets people sent to Dathomir or the Spice Mines of Kessel. Now can I rely on you to help me with this or do you want out?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_4_4", "He goes by the name of Drune Juntura and he operates out of Mos Eisley. You can handle this for me, right?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I got nothing more to say about this. Is this too much for you?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "You getting nervous, pal? You want to back out?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Gotta get this Wililikin guy before he takes action with those files. What are you waiting for, buddy?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "I ain't getting any younger, pal. Why are you standing around?");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "You have the look of one of Thyne's killers. You won't get the drop on me!");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "I know who sent you and why. Take me out if you can.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Who're you? What do you want? Oh no... attack!");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Thyne will not escape me. You only delay the inevitable.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
