stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "If you were trying to impress me, this isn't a good start.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You let this joker live? How could you do that? Now I'll have to burn his entire house to the ground.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "What kind of a mercenary can't destroy a petty group of thugs? You should find a new line of work, pal.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "You mean he's still out there? He could be at my front door right now? Why did I ever bother with you? Get lost!");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "A suspicious sleemo like Korowee moves around a lot. We'll get a fix on him eventually.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "As soon as my people give me Wedu's current location, I'll pass that on to you.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "I'll get you Wililikin's location in just a few moments.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "As soon as I know where this assassin's at, I'll let you know.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reset", "Don't come back till you're ready to play with the big boys.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Don't come back till you're ready to play with the big boys.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Don't come back till you're ready to play with the big boys.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Don't come back till you're ready to play with the big boys.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Don't come back till you're ready to play with the big boys.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Nicely done. Poor Korowee probably never knew what hit him. Stick around. I could use someone like you.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Where were you a couple of years ago? You could have solved a lot of problems for me. Good work.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Well done. My clients will sleep easier, which means I'll sleep easier... which means I won't have to kill you while you sleep. Just kidding, buddy, I knew you wouldn't fail me.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "You'll make a name for yourself yet, killer, you just wait and see. I think you'll find folks around here will give you a little more respect from now on.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Wait.. on second thought, its just some stupid names on a disk. Definately not worth dying over. Here, take the disk. Tell Thyne I said, Hello.");
