stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_work_3", "I hear Wililikin's still breathing... what's the holdup? You gotta move faster, buddy.");
stringFiles[2018].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Why haven't you taken this killer out yet? We're talking about my life here!");
