stringFiles[2020].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "This Imperial scientist awaits a fragment of the destroyed world Alderaan, which he hopes to analyze.");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_2", "This Imperial scientist has ordered the arrest of a pirate who may know something about the destruction of Alderaan.");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_3", "This Imperial scientist awaits a recording of a transmission sent from the Death Star shortly after the destruction of Alderaan.");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "Xaan Talmaron");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_2", "Xaan Talmaron");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_3", "Xaan Talmaron");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "Imperial scientist Xaan Talmaron has contracted to obtain a specimen of the destroyed planet Alderaan from a procurement specialist at these coordinates.");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("waypoint_description_2", "Imperial scientist Xaan Talmaron wishes to have this pirate arrested, in hopes of learning about the Empire's role in the destruction of Alderaan.");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("waypoint_description_3", "Imperial scientist Xaan Talmaron has arranged with a Bothan informant to purchase a recording of a transmission sent from the Death Star shortly after the destruction of Alderaan.");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Alderaan Fragment");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("waypoint_name_2", "Pirate of Alderaan");
stringFiles[2020].addEntry("waypoint_name_3", "Death Star Transmission");

stringFiles[2021] = new StringFile("static_npc/dantooine/dantooine_miningoutpost_kelvus_naria");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("cant_work", "I can use a little help with something. When you've got some free time, come back and see me.");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm just waiting for a delivery, citizen. You can go on your way. I'll be just fine.");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "You don't want to be here. It's too dangerous.");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("gotowork_1", "You didn't lose the package did you? ");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("next", "I can't thank you enough for the help you've given me. Come back and see me again soon, maybe I'll have more work for you.");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_1_1", "The Empire is a rough place to be a miner. I try to look after my people but corruption runs rampant and most officials are a lot more concerned with the numbers making them look good than they are with making the numbers worth anything. Sorry, I tend to get a bit caught up. Are you looking for work by any chance? ");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I hope you can help me. Someone trying to force me to vote against tighter safety regulations has kidnapped my subordinate. I don't want to risk my people with lax safety standards, but I don't want my assistant killed either. Would you be willing to try a rescue?");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Deliver these reports to the commander's courier and be careful. Not everyone wants the commander to see just how much skimming goes on. ");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I'm very grateful. All of my workers are outfitted with a locating device in case of trouble during a mining operation. This should aid you in locating the kidnappers. Be very careful, I don't want anyone getting killed who didn't start this.");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Oh well, I'll find someone else then.");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_3_2", "No matter what I do, somebody will die.");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Commander Lytus has actually expressed an interest in finding out the truth about what goes on at this operation. I need someone to deliver these reports to his courier. He'll be pretty shocked at the discrepancy between these and the ones that were filed officially. Interested?");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_4_2", "I'm not certain but I have a sneaking suspicion that the Corporate Sector Authority is involved somehow. They're a lot more concerned with credits than they are with people. Can you help me?");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Was there something you needed to say to me?");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I wish I had more for you to go on but I'm afraid that's it.");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Do you have a delivery for Commander Lytus?");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Please help me!");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "Thanks for saving me from those lowlifes.");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "I guess somebody doesn't want the truth to come out. I'm sure you tried your best.");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "I know you tried your best. Don't feel too bad. ");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2021].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
