stringFiles[2024] = new StringFile("static_npc/dantooine/luthik_uwyr");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("cant_work", "Your soul speaks volumes, friend... it screams for blood and vengeance... give into it, for it will bring to you many gifts. Return to me when you are ready for teaching.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Ah... it's because you ARE a whelp. Remove yourself from my sight lest I remove your sight from you.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Oh... I'm sorry, I thought you were a bad guy.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("gotowork_2", "What is this? You were supposed to bring that worthless Jedi artifact! Give it to me now before I shred your soul apart.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("go_away", "Leave at once, before I show you the true power of the dark side!");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("jedi", "Leave this place at once! There is nothing for you here! If you persist in staying around, you will follow the path of every other pathetic Jedi that was once here!");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("next", "You have proven yourself well... perhaps the Master may one day choose you over one of the other initiates... that is, if you do not die first.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("notit_1", "I do not need any gifts, initiate. What you offer does not compare to the power of the Dark Side.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("notit_2", "What is this? I do not want this. I have the dark side, which fuels my every waking desire.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("notit_3", "This proves nothing to me. Bring me something more evident of your success.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("notyet", "Your soul speaks volumes, friend... it screams for blood and vengeance... give into it, for it will bring to you many gifts. Return to me when you are ready for teaching.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Well, well, it seems an initiate comes upon me so brazen. I feel great anger within you, yes I do. Let me see how you choose to channel that fire. I sense a powerful presence nearby that seems somehow bound to this temple. I wish you to seek it out and destroy it. Can you manage this paltry task?");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Ah, I see you have managed this simple task. I have discovered what bond the animal shared with the temple, and find it to be nothing but a Holocron used to record the weak teachings of the Jedi. The animal apparently found the device and brought it here, to its nest. Now I command you to take the device to one of my brothers so that you can learn to revile the trappings of the Jedi.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I still feel a presence within these halls... though faint, it is attuned to the Force. As my Master had believed, there is still a Jedi that lives. Now is the time for your test, initiate. Will you take it, or walk away a coward?");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Though you say that with much vehemence, the results have yet to be seen. Take your hate and your anger and direct it at whatever monstrosity lurks nearby. If you cannot use your hate as a weapon, then you are not worth our time.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_2_2", "He will be waiting for you. As you walk, let this Holocron touch your skin, touch your heart, and touch your mind. Learn to hate the feeling, and remember it... forever.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Good... your arrogance will serve you well, or it will kill you. Only those strong with the Dark Side will be considered to join our ranks. Go, and return with a sign of your victory.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Oh, yes you will, yes you will... when you least expect it, your anger and bile will rise up to control you... learn to give in to it and it will be your strongest ally. Think on that, initiate.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Yes.... you feel it, don't you. The dark side is the only true power, initiate. See how easily you give yourself to your anger? Feel how strong you are now? Yessss..... you do, don't you?");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Oh, you will, will you? Yes, you are more under the control of the dark side than you believe. Feel it, initiate... let it inside of you... let it rule you....");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_4_1", "These old ruins, you fool, was once a holy place to the failed Jedi many centuries ago. I feel a faint presence inside and am now thinking that not all of the Jedi were righteously destroyed by the Master. We will see...");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_4_2", "I shall enter the temple proper and sanctify it with horror and evil. The ridiculous pacifistic nature of the Jedi is an affront to our true teachings. I will remove all trace there ever were Jedi that created this place.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Our Master is the one who was able to do what no Sith had done before. He is the one who caused the end of the Jedi's existence. And today, you will exterminate the last living Jedi.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_6_3", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Take your hate and your anger and direct it at whatever monstrosity lurks nearby.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Bring this frail Holocron to my brethren. They will use the dark side to destroy it once and for all.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Venture forth, seek out this last remaining Jedi and strike him down with all your hate and fury! Return with a trophy of your victory.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "You are the one that Luthik spoke of? Bah! You look like nothing more than a whelp!");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Oh great Force powers, come to me! My training will defeat you, monster!");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You are a pathetic worm not worthy of interest by myself or my brethren. We do not accept weakness amongst us.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "So.... perhaps you were the presence I felt, after all. You have chosen to keep the Holocron for yourself, have you?. We shall wait for the most painful time before we dispose of you....");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You are weak and helpless. You are not worthy of the teachings of the Sith, worthless wretch. Begone from my sight before I kill you myself.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_more_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_more_2_3", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_more_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Gather all of your hatred around you before you venture forth. Speak with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I will contact my brethren to announce your coming. You are a pathetic weakling compared to their might, and it is not time for you to die yet. Speak with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Let me use the dark side to determine where the Jedi resides. Return to me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Ha.. Haha... HaHaHahahahaa..... Oh, friend, you are very mistaken. Your anger guides you so strongly... you will come over in time, rest assured.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Ha.. Haha... HaHaHahahahaa..... Oh, friend, you are very mistaken. Your anger guides you so strongly... you will come over in time, rest assured.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Ha.. Haha... HaHaHahahahaa..... Oh, friend, you are very mistaken. Your anger guides you so strongly... you will come over in time, rest assured.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "You have felt life quenched through the power of your revulsion. The exquisite thrill of giving yourself to the Dark Side will be your gift forever. In the meantime, I shall now attend to the disturbing presence I feel.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "You know in your heart that peace is the discretion of the fool, for the wise man chooses to lash out at his enemies. You have seen what happened to the Jedi. It is now time to rebuild the Empire of the Sith again.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Were the Jedi reduced to something as pathetic as that? With him dead, our victory over the Jedi is now complete. Perhaps the Master may take me as an apprentice. If so... perhaps one day I will take you as mine as well. This artefact will help guide your path to ultimate victory in the meantime.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "Ugh. This artifact needs to be destroyed immediately before it affronts my senses any further. Go back to Luthik, whelp, for your deed here is done.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Your fear makes you wait... let your fear guide you.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Why do you pause? My brethren await you.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Why have you not destroyed the Jedi yet?");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("otherescort_2", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("otherescort_3", "");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes, I will destroy it.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("player_1_2", "I will bring this accursed object to your Brother.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("player_1_3", "I am ready. I will show that Jedi who is stronger.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("player_2_1", "No, I will not let my anger control me.");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("player_2_2", "NO! The Jedi were noble beings! You lie!!!!");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("player_2_3", "Stop calling me names! I'll kill you before I do anything else for you!!!");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("player_3_1", "Why are you here at the old ruins?");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("player_3_2", "What will you do while I deliver this?");
stringFiles[2024].addEntry("player_3_3", "Who is the Master?");
