stringFiles[2025] = new StringFile("static_npc/dantooine/lx_466");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("cant_work", "If you're looking for work when you finish what you're doing, come back to me. I may have something for you.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Ulgh ked troben!");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "I'm waiting for someone in particular. Don't you have anything better to do?");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("gotowork_2", "Elex send eat?");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("gotowork_3", "This is not the item I was supposed to pick up.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("next", "You have been a valuable aid. I'll let you know if I have any more work for you.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("notit_1", "This is not what I asked for, citizen. Return when you have completed your mission.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("notit_2", "This is not what I asked for, citizen. Return when you have completed your mission.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("notit_3", "This is not what I asked for, citizen. Return when you have completed your mission.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("notyet", "Your loyalty to the Empire's goals is not evident. Return when you have proven yourself.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_1_1", "What business do you have on Dantooine? This is a restricted area. I could however use someone outside of our chain of command to investigate a rumor from a less than reliable source. It could turn out to be dangerous, or completely harmless.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_1_2", "In light of your past report, I feel it is necessary to reward my information source. Would you care to act as my courier?");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I have another task for you. This one is... difficult. I can understand if you'd rather not take part in this. It seems that someone on this post is... less than completely loyal to the Empire. I need a courier who isn't afraid killing some crooked soldiers.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I'm told there are Rebels making a base not far from here. I've uploaded the coordinates to your datapad. Make a quick search of the area. If you should see any Rebels I want them killed. Otherwise return here for payment.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Take these rations to the location indicated on your data pad. The Dantari tribesman you meet there should be happy to receive them, though he does not speak our language with any degree of competency. Be sure you report back afterwards for your pay.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_2_3", "That's good. Take this recording rod to the location of the Imperial courier marked on your data pad. Once you've made the delivery report back to me. Be careful, though. Word is that this traitor might have brought in some mercenaries from Lok as hired muscle. Watch your back.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Although you're probably not a Rebel, if you're not actively assisting the Empire I can no longer guarantee your safety. Proceed at your own risk.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Although you're probably not a Rebel, if you're not actively assisting the Empire I can no longer guarantee your safety. Proceed at your own risk.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I expected as much. That's fine. Just keep this quiet is all I ask.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_4_1", "The Empire needs your help. If that is not enough for you, then how about these credits?");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_4_2", "The glory of serving the Empire. Now tell me, yes or no citizen.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Unfortunately it's the commander of this post who you would be working against. I made a recording of him talking with one of his aides regarding matters that were... while not rebellious, not completely in line with the Empire's sentiments, or the instructions of his commanding officer. If you deliver the recording rod I will pay you well. The mission is simple; it's the political implications that are tough to deal with. Fortunately for you, that will be my responsibility.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_6_3", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Make your way to the location marked on your datapad. Kill any rebels you might find there, and report back to me.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Take the rations I gave you to the dantari tribesman you will find at the location marked on your data pad.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "You're killing me. Would you get out of here already? Take that recording rod to the Imperial courier.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Stay sharp, this could be trouble...");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Yuguth debagh kurfun. Bring eat?");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Are you the courier?");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You're lucky you're not one of my soldiers. I'll have to find someone who is capable of following my instructions.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You're lucky you're not one of my soldiers. I'll have to find someone who is capable of following my instructions.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "This is a disaster. Although I think there's a way I can explain this. Not for your sake mind you, but for my own. You're just lucky we share this common interest.");
