stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Although you're probably not a Rebel, if you're not actively assisting the Empire I can no longer guarantee your safety. Proceed at your own risk.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Although you're probably not a Rebel, if you're not actively assisting the Empire I can no longer guarantee your safety. Proceed at your own risk.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "You found Rebels? That's really interesting. I honestly thought I was sending you out on a wild goose chase. I'll have to revise my opinion regarding the 'source' of my information on the Rebels. But I digress. Here is your reward, citizen.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "I'm glad I took the effort to establish contact with those people. They may prove an invaluable resource in rooting out the Rebel scum. The sooner we've accomplished that, the sooner I can get stationed somewhere off this forgotten dusty old relic of a planet.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Your discretion in this matter is much appreciated. I would request that you remain quiet. Do not tell a soul about this and you will live a long and happy life.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "Yuguth thank.");
stringFiles[2025].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "This is my responsibilty now. Go back and tell the sergeant the item was safely delivered.");
