stringFiles[2029].addEntry("npc_work_1", "I thought I told you to take out that teras kasi master. What, you're taking in the atmosphere around here?");
stringFiles[2029].addEntry("npc_work_2", "You got my backpack? No, I see you don't. Which makes me wonder why you're botherin' me.");
stringFiles[2029].addEntry("npc_work_3", "You taken care of that escaped Janta clan leader? Why not? I don't wanna have to do it myself, lemme tell you.");
