stringFiles[2031] = new StringFile("static_npc/dathomir/dathomir_researchoutpost_shaki_hamachil");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("cant_work", "I'm run ragged around here, so I could really use your help when you're not so busy.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "You got the wrong person, friend.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Imperial business. Move along.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("gotowork_2", "I expected you to bring me Shibb Nisshil's Cyber-Rancor Project findings. Don't you have the datadisc?");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("next", "I won't say everything is under control here, but I don't have anything for you to do right now.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("notit_1", "I was expecting briny bath salts from Tibrin for my boss, Shib Nisshil. This isn't the salts.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("notyet", "I deal with Imperial personnel only... move along.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_1_1", "At last! Running this outpost is so much work, it turns my scales blue. But you're here to help me, right? Right? I need you to pick up an order of Shibb Nisshil's briny bath salts that's gone off-course. Interested?");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Hello again! I'm desperate again! I can't find time to get out to the wilderness to drop off a datadisc to a certain other party. Will you kindly do so?");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Great. The person you meet may seem a little bit, I don't know -- criminal? But it's strictly all right. It's not like Dathomir has laws anyway. Bring me the salts and I'll pay you for your effort.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Here's the disc. You're looking for an Imperial Intelligence officer. He probably won't want to talk much, so just give it to him and get back here.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_3_1", "All right then, I'll just have to send a droid. Hope it doesn't get lost again.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I'm sorry to hear that. I hate offending Imperial Intelligence. Let me know if you reconsider.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Shibb Nisshil is an Ishi Tib. So he needs immersion in briny water every day or two to keep his lungs moist. Shibb prefers a particular brine salt that we have to import from his home planet, Tibrin.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Well -- I'll tell you this much, and I hope you'll be discreet. Imperial Intelligence is getting nasty about Shibb Nisshil's lack of regular communiques. To keep them happy, I secretly deliver copies of his findings to Intelligence officers at a secret rendezvous in the wilderness. But I can't make it this time. Will you go?");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_5_1", "These particular brine salts aren't on the usual Imperial supply requisition forms, so we have to resort to unauthorized procurement specialists. These folks sometimes lack updated landing charts, not to mention adequate clearances to get past the blockades. So this latest delivery agent sort of crash-landed in the wilderness.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_6_1", "He's the chief scientist at this outpost. He's working on a project that -- well, I'm not sure if I'm supposed to talk about that. But he gets really cranky when he doesn't bathe in his particular briny salts, so will you go get them?");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I don't have a lot more information for you. I just need you to bring me those briny bath salts.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I don't know what else to tell you. Just take this disc to the Imperial Intelligence officer at the wilderness rendezvous, then return here.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "You! You here to pick up these bath salts?");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "You there! I'm waiting for those project findings.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You didn't bring those briny bath salts? Oh no. This will be bad for Shibb Nisshil's morale.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You didn't deliver that disc to the Imperial Intelligence officer? Oh dear. They'll be mad at Shibb Nisshil.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I'm waiting to hear from our delivery agent on the exact coordinates of the rendezvous. These procurement specialists get touchy, you know. Talk to me again in a few moments.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I'm waiting to hear from Imperial Intelligence about the rendezvous coordinates. They're usually quite punctual about that, so talk to me again in a few moments.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_reset", "You don't want to run this one little errand? If you had to do everything around here that I do, you'd run screaming from the planet.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "You don't want to run this one little errand? If you had to do everything around here that I do, you'd run screaming from the planet.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "You don't want to run this one little errand? If you had to do everything around here that I do, you'd run screaming from the planet.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "You don't want to run this one little errand? If you had to do everything around here that I do, you'd run screaming from the planet.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "The briny bath salts. At last something goes right in this domain of chaos. I'm sure Shibb Nisshil will be glad, the next bath he takes.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Did that officer have anything to say about the project? Oh, really? Well, we'll see who has more influence on Coruscant, him or Shibb Nisshil. I'll bet on Shibb every time.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "I'm never ever gonna tell anyone that I crash-landed my ship just to deliver some stupid -- oh, I can't even say the words. Here, take 'em. And tell your employer that the next delivery is gonna have a considerable surcharge.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "I suspect the notion of building an unstoppable army of cyber-rancors as shock troops will find favor in certain parts of Coruscant. But personally, I consider the idea ludicrous, and I shall so inform my superiors.");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2031].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
