stringFiles[2032].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "My probe droids relayed your efficient dispatch of the creature. I reward you appropriately, and desire you to contact me again for further assignments.");
stringFiles[2032].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Ah, that's too bad.  They killed it, eh?  Well you did your job well enough anyway.");
stringFiles[2032].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "The bounty hunter is dead? A relief. Now I can return to breeding my army of cyber-rancors. Oh, you'll want a reward, I suppose? Here.");
