stringFiles[2033] = new StringFile("static_npc/dathomir/dathomir_singingmountainclanstronghold_izaryx");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("cant_work", "You are far too busy with other matters. Please come back when you are not so busy.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I cannot speak to you now.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Go away, offworlder! This matter does not concern you!");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("next", "There is nothing more for you to do.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("notyet", "Go and speak to Vhaunda. She must determine your worthiness before I can assign you missions.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Greetings, offworlder, I am Izaryx, rancor trainer of the Singing Mountain Clan. Recently, our rivals, the Nightsisters, have been attacking our scouts. They are convinced that we wish to steal their trained rancors. One of my scouts just sent a distress signal and I have no remaining warriors to send to her rescue. Can you help her out of her predicament?");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Fath Hray's hatred has once again brought suffering to my sisters. She has sent a war party to attack some of our settlements. Rumor has it that this war party is attempting to infect our rancors with something called the Berserker Virus. I need you to stop these raiders before this can happen. Can you do it?");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Hurry to these coordinates and save her from becoming another casualty of war. If you can save her, escort her back here.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Here are the coordinates. You should bring allies as these Nightsister warriors are quite formidable. My scout who has been tracking this war party will aid you if she can. Good luck.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I had heard that offworlders were cowards but I did not wish to believe it. Perhaps I should revisit that issue.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I understand. This is a personal matter between myself and Fath Hray.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Her patrol had fallen victim to a Nightsister ambush. Please hurry and you may be able to save her.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_4_2", "I was once a member of the Nightsister Clan but I could not accept Gethzerion's evil. I rejected them and joined the Singing Mountain Clan. I was Fath Hray's apprentice and she felt personally betrayed.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_5_2", "I am not sure but I understand it makes domesticated animals impossible to control. I can't allow our rancors to become infected with it.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_6_2", "I do not think so, but I have no way of knowing for certain. This mission is filled with risk. Do you wish to tackle it?");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You should hurry. I don't know how much longer my scout can hold out.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Why do you delay? Do you wish to reconsider?");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "You will not defeat a member of the Singing Mountain Clan! Have at you, Nightsisters!");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Kill these offworlders, my sisters! Slay them all!");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "My thanks, offworlder. You are an ally of the Singing Mountain Clan.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "The Nightsisters will pay for their treachery. Fath Hray's vengeance comes at too high a price.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "I shall have to deal with Fath Hray myself. I wished it did not have to come to this but now there is no choice.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "Fath Hray, still feeling betrayed over Izaryx's defection, wants to hurt Singing Mountain however she can and so attempts to start a war.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I must verify the coordinates sent in the distress call.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Allow me to verify the war party's latest location. Come back in a few moments.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_reset", "I will find someone else to accomplish this mission.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "I will find someone else to accomplish this mission.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "I will find someone else to accomplish this mission.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "I will find someone else to accomplish this mission.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "You have my thanks, offworlder. Please accept this as payment for your courageous deeds.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "You are brave and your skills are magnificent. Please accept this reward.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "It is a good thing you arrived when you did. Please take me back to Izaryx, for I have much to report.");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Did you save my scout from the Nightsisters?");
stringFiles[2033].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Have you stopped that war party yet? We must now allow the Berserker Virus to spread on Dathomir.");
