stringFiles[2035] = new StringFile("static_npc/dathomir/dathomir_singingmountainstronghold_aujante_klee");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("cant_work", "The Singing Mountain Clan is in dire need of aid. When you are not so busy, come back and help us.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "You've picked a dangerous place to be. I recommend finding a safe spot to view the carnage if you value your own skin.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "You gaze into the face of your doom. Be gone from this place, lest it steal the life from your frail body.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Leave, my friend, before evil consumes you. These witches have no love for intruders.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Do you seek the blackest pits of despair? Then look no further. But if you value your lives, flee as though a thousand nightmares pursued you.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("next", "It shall not be forgotten, how you have aided the Singing Mountain Clan. We have nothing further to ask of you at this time.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("notyet", "If you wish to earn my trust, first speak with Vurlene.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Welcome to the Singing Mountain Clan Stronghold. Vurlene informs me you are trustworthy. Have you come to aid us in our fight against Gethzerion? She attacks us constantly though we are no threat to her. Now one of our trusted servants has betrayed us. There is no love lost between our people but our need is great. Will you help us, stranger? ");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_1_2", "It's strange and yet not entirely unpleasant to see your face at Singing Mountain Stronghold in these harsh times. Perhaps you will be willing to aid us in the recovery of a stolen item if we have not imposed on your good nature too much already. What say you?");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_1_3", "It seems we are constantly seeking your aid in our struggle against the Nightsisters. We would not pester you so frequently if they would just leave us alone. Now they have kidnapped one of our youngest. Will you help us find her?");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_1_4", "I have a great request to make of you, my friend. It may be beyond your abilities but I will ask anyway. A Nightsister named Morathax has orchestrated all our recent troubles. It would be best for the Singing Mountain Clan if she were removed lest she chip away at us until there is nothing left. Do you think you can handle the job?");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Compassion is a welcome change to this world. Aldiae, my most trusted servant, has betrayed us and gone to tell Gethzerion of all our weaknesses. Please bring my traitorous servant back here before our vulnerabilities are revealed to those who loathe us.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I was right about you. You have an aura of altruism about you that shines through your gruff exterior. If you can find a Nightsister named Vhuransa, we believe she is the one who has stolen our sacred lore. We would be grateful were you to return it to us.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Seek out Jhuryx. The Nightsisters took her and it will be no small task to rescue her from their clutches. Take the greatest of care with your preparations. ");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_2_4", "It is bold of you to attempt this but have a care: Morathax will be well guarded by those loyal to her and will not be a quick victory. I caution you to bring friends you trust to aid you in this endeavor. It would sadden us to lose our outsider friend to one such as she.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Life must have treated you very cruelly for you to be this callous. Perhaps it will make you strong, but I wouldn't count on it.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Perhaps it seems a small thing to you but to us it is the sum of our history.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_3_3", "A hard thing, to deny us the return of our own.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_3_4", "It was too much to hope for. Now if you will excuse me, I must find a way to secure the safety of my clan.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_4_1", "If simple compassion for an oppressed people will not motivate you then I fail to know what will. We have little enough to offer you but will give you what we can. All I can do is ask. What say you, will you help?");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_4_2", "An item very precious to the Singing Mountain Clan. It is a compilation of the wisdom of our clan. All the mystical knowledge we have collected over the centuries has been stolen form us. Will you aid us in its recovery?");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_4_3", "So they can turn her to the path of darkness thus strengthening their clan. We just want our lost sister back. Will you help us?");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_4_4", "A disciple of Gethzerion who seems to come from the same mould. The last thing we need is both of them trying to destroy us. Can we rely on your help?");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_5_4", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_6_3", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_6_4", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You have something on your mind perhaps?");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I've told you what I can. The rest is up to you.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Will you rescue our lost sister or have you reconsidered your answer?");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Have you decided this task is beyond your abilities?");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Get away from me.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "You think you can take anything from me? ");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "At last my sisters send aid.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Now you will experience the power of the dark side.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "Perhaps they'll be merciful. They've always had a soft streak here. ");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "Whatever your reasons for saving me, outsider, I thank you.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Things look bleak but perhaps we may yet weather this storm.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "This bodes ill for my sisters and I. We must find a way to recover this tome before she brings it to the Nightsisters or all is lost.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "We will weep for our lost sister, for when next we see her it will be in battle against one another.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "She will be on her guard now and we must be doubly on ours.");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_more_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2035].addEntry("npc_more_1_4", "");
