stringFiles[2037] = new StringFile("static_npc/dathomir/dathomir_tradeoutpost_wallaw_loowobbli");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("cant_work", "I urgently require your help as soon as you are not busy!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Away from me, stranger.");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("next", "I have uncovered no new plans by Shibb Nisshil to purloin Dathomir's rancors. Perhaps he has discarded his evil scheme.");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Oh, you have arrived in time to impede Shibb Nisshil's evil plan! His hunting team has captured a bull rancor in the wild and is taking it to an unspeakable fate. You must stop the hunting team and rescue the rancor!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_1_2", "It is another nefarious scheme by Imperial scientist Shibb Nisshil! He has somehow enlisted an outcast from the Nightsister clan to lead a slave team that hunts rancors. Such a fearsome team can capture rancors by the hundreds, irretrievably damaging the Dathomir ecology. You must destroy this hunting team!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good. If you simply speak to the rancor in a firm voice, it will follow you here. Then I can remove Nisshil's mind-control chip and restore the creature to its natural vigor. Go!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Your enthusiasm reassures me. I understand these Nightsisters to be formidable opponents, so you may require help. Good luck!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_3_1", "You would stand by and see Dathomir's delicate ecology ruined? You are a monster like Nisshil!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_3_2", "You would passively watch Shibb Nisshil denude Dathomir of all its rancors for his evil plan?");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_4_1", "He is an Imperial scientist at the Research Outpost. He is plundering Dathomir of its rancors to create an army of Imperial cyber-rancors! The damage to the ecosystem will be immense. Will you rescue this bull rancor from a ghastly fate?");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_4_2", "She is evidently a lunatic who assaulted several senior clan members. Now she works for Nisshil because she wishes to see the Empire destroy her former clan. Very sad, but we cannot let this maniac further Nisshil's evil scheme. Will you stop her team?");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_5_1", "Shibb Nisshil's hunting team has implanted the rancor with a mind-control chip that renders it docile as a bolma calf. They are taking the rancor to his lab now. Shoot the hunters and the tame beast will follow you here.");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_6_1", "They are only common mercenaries. Actually, I suppose they must be uncommonly well armed to capture a rancor. But you still must stop them! Except maybe you will need help from friends.");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I have told you all I know. You must rescue that helpless bull rancor from Shibb Nisshil's evil hunters!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "That is all I know. You must stop that Nightsister outcast and her hunting team. Save the rancors!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "An enemy! Kill!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You did not rescue that helpless bull rancor? Oh, my heart goes out to it, thinking of its terrible fate!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You did not stop that Nightsister and her hunting team? I am distraught and depressed.");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I have probe droids looking, even now, for the mercenary hunting party. Talk to me again shortly, and I shall have coordinates for you.");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I have probe droids scouting to locate the Nightsister outcast and her hunting team. Contact me shortly for coordinates.");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_reset", "But all the rancors of Dathomir depend on you to keep them from Shibb Nisshil's evil clutches!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "But all the rancors of Dathomir depend on you to keep them from Shibb Nisshil's evil clutches!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "But all the rancors of Dathomir depend on you to keep them from Shibb Nisshil's evil clutches!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "But all the rancors of Dathomir depend on you to keep them from Shibb Nisshil's evil clutches!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Oh, what a fine specimen! I shall remove the mind-control chip promptly -- taking proper precautions, of course. Here is a reward for your fine effort!");
stringFiles[2037].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "You have helped the rancors of Dathomir live happier lives, unencumbered by Imperial concerns. Thank you!");
