stringFiles[2038] = new StringFile("static_npc/dathomir/diax");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("cant_work", "You look a bit preoccupied. Why don't you take care of whatever it is you're doing now and come back. I may have work for you.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("next", "You are worthy of the honor of helping my mistress Kais. Go speak with her now.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("notit_1", "You realize this is not what I asked for at all? What made you think this is what I wanted? By the book of shadows, these outworlders are inept.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("notit_2", "You realize this is not what I asked for at all? What made you think this is what I wanted? By the book of shadows, these outworlders are inept.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("notyet", "You may have potential, but I do not know if you are ready to serve. Come back after you have helped us more.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Yes? Come closer. You'll do nicely, outsider. I'm struggling with a dilemma. I'm an apprentice healer in the service of Kais. I find myself constantly competing for her favor with another apprentice. Would you object to making sure she never hinders me again?");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_1_2", "You have done well so far. I have another task for you. Our spies report having seen a certain singing mountain clan healer using an incredibly effective salve. From what I am told the salve sounds like something I read about once, I believe it was called bac-ta. Are you willing to find this healer and bring me her salve to study?");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_2_1", "That's fine. Daverda is currently gathering herbs near the location I've marked on this map. Go there, kill her, and return quickly.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good. The scouts report her location over that way. Don't try to negotiate with her. Just eliminate her as quickly and efficiently as possible. I do not want the Singing Mountain Clan to know we have stolen their secret. Once you have the salve, return it to me.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Hah, timid mouse. Very well then, there is more than one way to skin a brackaset.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Outworlder, you try my patience.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_4_1", "I'd take care of this myself, but it would reflect poorly on the healers if I did. The rest of the clan shouldn't see us as political schemers. The last thing I need is Kais to see me as overly ambitious. If you help me with this dilemma I'll be sure to reward you well.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Do this for me and I will let Kais know you can be trusted. Also I will reward you with a kit of healing herbs and poultices.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "She's out gathering herbs for Kais. Look at this map I made. Right here. Now hurry.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Look, here is my map. Study it carefully. The healer was spotted in this area. Now get going!");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "What are you doing here?");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "I'm not looking for company. Go away.");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2038].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
