stringFiles[2039] = new StringFile("static_npc/dathomir/gethzerion");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("cant_work", "How dare you? I ordered you released from Baritha's compulsion, and you run off to someone else? If you value your life, you will direct all of you attentions to your ruler... myself.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Nevermind, I don't know you.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "You didn't see anything, right? Good.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Actually, I changed my mind.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Oh, you don't want to die? Okay, then. Sorry about that.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("next", "You have pleased me, but do not try my patience. If I have need of you in the future, I shall call upon you.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("notit_1", "What is this? You waste my time!");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("notit_2", "I asked you for nothing!");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("notit_3", "I did not ask for this. Take it away from me.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("notit_4", "This is not the necklace! BRING ME THE NECKLACE!");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("notyet", "How dare you disturb me? Since I am in a good mood, you will be allowed to leave my chamber alive. Do no make the same mistake again.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_1_1", "So, you are the one that Baritha has been mooning over. Considering I am recently missing a slave, I will have to take you from her. Your first act as my slave will be to take care of your predecessor. Do you understand?");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I have decided that you may serve me better were you not under the yoke of slavery. Go show me your effectiveness at destroying those weak Singing Mountain sisters, and I will consider the prospect further.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_1_3", "You have proven yourself adequate to my uses. I hereby name you my Dagger... and from now on you will be my personal assassin. I now need you to target your first victim.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_1_4", "That... that.... that WITCH!!! How dare she!? When I find her, I will tear her soul apart!! Ahhh... yessss... and that's exactly what she expects, isn't it? What a clever little trap... but she didn't expect you, did she, my little Dagger? You will go and kill Sister Chastina for her impudence!");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Very good... quick to respond, and very clear... I shall see if there may be more than slavery for you. For now, go find my slave, then kill him in a most painful manner. Once the punishment has been exacted, bring his heart back to me.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Baritha has brought to my attention that a few of the Singing Mountain sisters have had the audacity to enter our territory. Silence their spells and lead them to the carrion-feeders.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Your willingness is pleasing to me. You will locate and kill Sister Aelta, getting her out of my hair once and for all. Do the deed, then return to let me know.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Track that filthy, brazen witch down... when you find her, rip her heart out and show it to her! Afterwards, remove that necklace she wrongfully wears around her neck and bring it back to me.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Oh, really? You believe that you will leave our stronghold just like that? You presume too much, fool. I will give you one more chance to change your mind.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_3_2", "You will deal with what I tell you to deal with. I will not tolerate this insolence!");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_3_3", "That may well be the least wise thing you have ever done. Perhaps you believed this was a request? Or perhaps you think yourself on an equal level as myself that you may speak so openly? Not smart....");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Were I not so distraught, I enjoy watching you as I choke the very breath out of your lungs. Please.... stay close so that I may calm down enough to do so.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_4_1", "My first and foremost among slaves was a cunning man by the name of Dal Zeybuub. Unfortunately for him, My Prime Slave thinks too highly of himself. Rather than betraying me, as he plans, he will now be a victim of his own thoughts betraying him.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Perhaps. Perhaps not. Depending on how well you do, I may decide to grant you that boon, for I am a gracious Mother. Now go!");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_4_3", "You will be ending the short life of Sister Aelta, one of the Singing Mountain Sisters. Ever since Augwynne, Clan Mother of the Singers, has lost both of her daughters she has 'adopted' two more. You will show that old crone that I will not accept this.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_4_4", "How DARE she? That withered hag, Augwynne, has chosen another 'daughter', my former friend Chastina. She has gone so far as to give to Chastina her necklace! That is MY necklace!!! As Augwynne's real daughter, I DESERVE IT!!! ... -er-.... Why am I telling you this?");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_5_4", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_6_3", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_6_4", "");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You will find my Prime Slave and kill him. Once done, bring me back his heart... and I will know if it is his.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Go find these impudent sisters of Augwynne and render their lives from their bodies.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "You will find that bold harlot that calls herself a sister, Aelta. Once you have done so, kill her.... painfully.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Go kill that impudent failure of a witch and bring me the necklace she wears around her neck.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "No, please... you don't know what kind of nightmare I was fleeing! LET ME GO!!!");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Sisters, we have been found! Leave no witnesses!");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "You were sent by Gethzerion? But you're not a Nightsister... oh well... you will still die.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "So... that coward sent someone else, did she? Then you must die in her place.");
