stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "Yes you are, come to think of it. You would assist me better were you to help me... test... my spells.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Ahhhh... Dal's heart... Once it has been chilled, it will make for a most pleasant dinner. I have found that it is true that vengeance is best served cold. As for you... I sense I am not using you to the fullest.. Come back to me after I have thought this matter over.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "So you handled yourself better than some of these pathetic women who call themselves Witches? Very well then - your freedom is granted... for now. I will have a more important purpose for you, so stay close.");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "You have done well on your first assignment for me. My left breast is warmed at the thought of the pain she felt as she died. Any of those foolish Singing sisters will do well to heed this warning : Augwynne's daughters are dead, and they will not be 'replaced'!");
stringFiles[2039].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Yes... my necklace! Were I able to have succeeded in beheading my moth... I mean to say, beheading that Clan Mother.... well, either way, it is mine now, where it should have been for many years now. My Dagger, you have pleased my very, very much.");
