stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_more_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "The time is not right for the Spiders to hunt. Ask again in a little while.");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "The Malkloc has not awakened from it's slumber. Speak to me when time has passed.");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Wait until the time the Guard will be ready to accept our love. Check with me in a little while.");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_reset", "Then you are no longer useful to me. If you wish the cure to the poison within your system, prove your worth to me....");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Then you are no longer useful to me. If you wish the cure to the poison within your system, prove your worth to me....");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Then you are no longer useful to me. If you wish the cure to the poison within your system, prove your worth to me....");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Then you are no longer useful to me. If you wish the cure to the poison within your system, prove your worth to me....");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Then you are no longer useful to me. If you wish the cure to the poison within your system, prove your worth to me....");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "A pristine collection of succulent venom is held within this jar. You have done well, young one. Now, bite this leaf, for it will slow the poison within your gullet. After you have done so, speak with me again.");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Together with both Spider and Malkloc combined, a toxin can be made to live forever within a person's blood. I will now draw these powers together with the mysteries of the Shadow. Speak with me when I am done.");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "You have helped to bring the Clan Mother into a more desirable bargaining position, for which she should be most grateful. For now, the poison resides within the Imperials until it is time for it to be called upon. Drink this, and you shall be freed of the agents within your own system. You have done well.");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2040].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "Look, you tell Baritha that I'll put this in the water supply, okay? And then I'll come by tonight for my payment, got it?");
