stringFiles[2041] = new StringFile("static_npc/dathomir/vhaunda");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("cant_work", "I have a task for you when you're finished with what you're doing.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("next", "I'm surprised, you actually did alright for yourself. I'll speak well of your ability.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("notit_1", "What is this? Stop wasting my time and do what I told you to do.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("notit_2", "What is this? Stop wasting my time and do what I told you to do.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("notyet", "Outworlder, I don't think you cold perform the duties of our weakest man-slave. Come back when, or rather IF you are able to distinguish yourself further.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_1_1", "It's an unfortunate necessity that we have to have men on this planet at all. Men who don't follow orders however, are not tolerated. Perhaps you'd like to show your worth and get rid of a few?");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_1_2", "There are some of us who feel outlanders shouldn't be held to our standards. I'm not one of them. Neither is my friend Peila. She thinks you don't know your place and wants to fight a battle of honor with you. I think it would be amusing to watch. What are you going to do?");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Prove you are brave and loyal by bringing me the special shoulder pad from an Imperial patrol leader. My scouts will create a disturbance and lead a patrol to a location not far from here. You should be able to figure out the rest.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Well then, perhaps this outlander does have honor. Let's see how well they defend it. Peila will not be hard to find, let me draw you a map here on the ground.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I don't know if I should laugh or be disgusted. You could be the most timid mealy mouthed worm to cross my path in a long time.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Aw, isn't that too bad. Maybe fighting isn't for you though? I hear the stables need a good cleaning, maybe that's more suited to your... er, abilities.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Honor? The thrill of the hunt? If these do not motivate you I have nothing for you.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_4_2", "In our clan honor is everything. If you do not value yours, then why are you here, outlander?");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "That outworlder may not be entirely useless after all.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Oh, by the way... good luck.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Situation is normal. I'm taking the patrol back to the outpost.");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Hah, did you come to fight or beg for mercy?");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2041].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
