stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_more_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Let me check with the flight logs to see  where he was being dropped in. Ask me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Let me see if we have any sightings yet on the whereabouts of the prisoners. Ask me again in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Let me remember where I parked my shuttle. Ask me again in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "Something happened. Ask me again in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_reset", "Really now? Did you think I was that dumb? I'm quite familiar with who you are. You just don't come to Dathomir and expect to leave, friend. Think about that.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Really now? Did you think I was that dumb? I'm quite familiar with who you are. You just don't come to Dathomir and expect to leave, friend. Think about that.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Really now? Did you think I was that dumb? I'm quite familiar with who you are. You just don't come to Dathomir and expect to leave, friend. Think about that.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Really now? Did you think I was that dumb? I'm quite familiar with who you are. You just don't come to Dathomir and expect to leave, friend. Think about that.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Really now? Did you think I was that dumb? I'm quite familiar with who you are. You just don't come to Dathomir and expect to leave, friend. Think about that.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Good work. I hope he wasn't too much trouble for you. Fortunately there hasn't been anyone talking about him coming back, so the prisoners don't know he's here. He'll be in solitary for the rest of his time here, which like everyone else, is forever.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "You were only able to bring Teen back? Very well, this will do. Sadly, Teen was given many liberties most inmates aren't given. Now he'll be flogged everyday in front of the other prisoners to show what happens to escapees. Well, good work, friend.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Good. With her being stopped, the Nightsisters will never leave this planet. They are trapped here just like me and you.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Well, now that the riot's under control, we can start restoring order to the prison again. Thanks for your help, friend.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "My head... must... think... straight... You're taking me somewhere, aren't you?");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "Fine... take me back. You know they'll kill me, right?");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Have you brought him into your custody yet?");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Are you leaving to capture them yet?");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Why haven't you stopped her yet?");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Have you taken care of the prisoners?");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("otherescort_1", "No, there is another person around here that you're looking for.");
stringFiles[2042].addEntry("otherescort_2", "I'm not the one you're looking for.");
