stringFiles[2043] = new StringFile("static_npc/dathomir/vurlene");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("cant_work", "Hm. Come back later when you are less busy.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Meaning no disrespect, but I do not know you.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Who are you? I have work to do here, don't get in my way.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Who are you? Get lost.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("gotowork_1", "Weesa havin no more business right now.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("gotowork_2", "Hm, this is a strange salve. But it feels... I'm not sure. But I trust that Vurlene is right about it.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("next", "Your services have bettered my every expectation. Tell Aujante I recommended you. She will surely wish to speak with you.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("notit_1", "It seems I could have been clearer in my instructions. This is not what I asked for. I'm sorry, but I can not give you anything for this.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("notit_2", "It seems I could have been clearer in my instructions. This is not what I asked for. I'm sorry, but I can not give you anything for this.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("notit_3", "It seems I could have been clearer in my instructions. This is not what I asked for. I'm sorry, but I can not give you anything for this.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("notyet", "I might have something for you to do, but you're too new here. I don't know if I can trust you.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hello outworlder. I have a business proposition for you. You have the ability to leave this planet. That's very valuable to me. I'm a healer for the clan. There are materials I need for my work on Naboo. I was wondering if you would go there for me?");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_1_2", "The algae's growth is acceptable, it should take well to our rivers and lakes. I've had a chance to test it on a few light wounds and the effect, though not as strong as the bacta we've acquired from Imperial medics, is still quite noticeable. We are going to need to test this in the field however. Would you care to run a sample out to a fellow healer?");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_1_3", "It's with great sadness that I must again ask for your help. Selia has been slain by a Nightsister patrol. She was... a good friend of mine and I want her avenged. But even more important than that: the salve has been taken. We can not let this secret fall into the hands of the Nightsisters.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_2_1", "That is great news. Ok, this book mentions a Gungan on Naboo. He is a holy man of his people by the name of Skub. He is said to have discovered a form of algae with healing properties similar to the derivative elements of bacta. The difference is I believe this particular algae would be well suited to the environs of Dathomir. Travel to Naboo, find this Gungan and return with a sample of the algae.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_2_2", "That's fine. You'll find Seelia out that way. Give her this salve and tell her to apply a thin smear to light scratches, thickening the layer to match the depth of the wounds.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Hurry. That patrol must not be allowed to return to the Nightsister stronghold. I have no doubt that they will discover the secret of the salve's making.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Outlander, if you have nothing useful to offer us, I suggest you leave the Singing Mountain Clan alone.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_3_2", "You frustrate me. We could use you as the test subject instead. I'm sure the guards would appreciate the weapon practice. Are you sure you won't reconsider?");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_3_3", "You wait until my moment of most dire need to betray me? Next to your selective loyalty the underhanded tricks of the nightsisters seem honorable.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_4_1", "You may not be aware of what a valuable thing it is to be able to leave this planet. Rest assured I am, and will reward you sufficiently.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Well, I have a packet of strong healing herbs I will give to you. There is also the prospect of monetary compensation.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_4_3", "This is a matter of grave importance, but I am still prepared to reward you for the service.");
