stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Very good. Please try to hurry.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Keep sharp. There is a chance you'll run afoul of a nightsister patrol out where you're headed.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "You'd best be.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Look at de beeyutiful nature. So calm.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "These healing supplies are running a bit low. I'm going to have to return to the stronghold soon.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "I dont know what this goop is, but the matriarch demands it. Now shut up, we're not out of Mountain Clan territory yet.");
