stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_more_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Actually, I do not quite have all of my information ready. Let me study a bit. If you return shortly I should have some work for you.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Actually, I'm do not quite have all of my information ready. Let me study a bit. If you return shortly I should have some work for you.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Actually, I do not quite have all of my information ready. Let me study a bit. If you return shortly I should have some work for you.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_reset", "Well, make your preparations. Come back when you are ready.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Well, make your preparations. Come back when you are ready.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Well, make your preparations. Come back when you are ready.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Well, make your preparations. Come back when you are ready.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Ah yes, this is it. I'll introduce a little of this to a pool, as I am told it favors dark, still waters. And as for you... I am pleased to thank you, and to offer these in reward for your services.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Selia has the salve? Perfect. Now I've only to wait for her to return with news. You've been a great help, outworlder. Take these healing supplies and credits.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Ah yes. The salve is safe. It was foolish of me to let it out of the stronghold. I will be more careful in the future. Take these, it's the least I could do.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "I believe I have what you need.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "You say you're from Vurlene? Ah, supplies?");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Oh, and one other thing: try to keep the algae in a dark place when you are transporting it.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_work_2", "That salve isn't going to dry out or anything like that, but Selia might be moving soon. I suggest you hurry.");
stringFiles[2043].addEntry("npc_work_3", "I'm not trying to be demanding... actually, yes, I am. Get going. This is important.");
