stringFiles[2045].addEntry("its_ok", "I want the task anyway.");
stringFiles[2045].addEntry("npc_continue", "Fine then.  Don't bother with me until you're ready to work for me.");
stringFiles[2045].addEntry("npc_quit", "Fine.  You are now free of your prior obligation, and you can freely work for me.");
stringFiles[2045].addEntry("player_continue", "No, I think I'll keep my current job, thanks.");
stringFiles[2045].addEntry("player_quit", "I think I'd like to work for you.");
stringFiles[2045].addEntry("quit_quest", "I can see that you're busy working for someone else at the moment.  Would you like to continue to do so, or would you like to work for me instead?");
stringFiles[2045].addEntry("too_strong", "This task is beneath your capabilities.  Are you sure you want to do it?");
stringFiles[2045].addEntry("too_weak", "The task I have seems beyond your capabilities. Come back when you're a bit stronger.");

stringFiles[2046] = new StringFile("static_npc/endor/charal");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("cant_work", "Yes, you have arrived as I felt within myself. My visions tell me that you are offering yourself, yet you serve another. When you realize your true mistress, you will come to me, yes....");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Kuba!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Me not know you. Mistress no send you.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Samooto! Nub-nub!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Please, go get help! We've crash landed!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("next", "It is time for you to move further, is it not? Continue along your destiny, and you shall serve mine...");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("notit_1", "What? Does this look like a spleen to you? Do you even know what a spleen looks like?");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("notit_2", "What, you offer me such a paltry gift? Take it back, insect.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("notit_3", "You utter moron! I told you to bring me an Ewok, and you give me this? Get out of my sight and do as I say!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("notit_4", "Is this the commlink? I don't how to use one.... SLAVE!!! Show me how to use this!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("notyet", "No, no.... you are not to speak with me yet... in time, my pretty, in time.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hello there.... You have the distinct honor of being spoken to by Charal, Witch-Queen of this god-forsaken moon. You have come to serve my desires, have you not?");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I have need of your services once again, my dearest. My poultice that will allow me to divine the future now needs the next ingredient. I will be pleased if you find my slave whom hasn't returned with it yet. Will you, my pretty?");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Yes... my poultice is nearing the final stage. You have returned with perfect timing, my dearie. I command you to return with an Ewok so that it may provide the final ingredient.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Mwuhahahaa..... my potion was a success.  I was able to forsee many visions due to my power as a Sister. I have one last command for you, slave... then I shall actually release you, as per my vision.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Yes, my pretty, you have made the correct choice. I am in need of a spleen from a healthy specimen of those disgusting rodents, Ewoks. Bring me back a speen and you will please me.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_2_2", "You should be able to find him out within the forests. Do not be afraid when you gaze upon him, he is a Lizard man that was stranded here as well. Tell him to follow you back here.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Yes, yes you do...  now go and bring me an Ewok. Make sure you don't harm it too much... I need one globule of spittle from it's vicious little fangs.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_2_4", "You are such a wonderful little slave, ahh... Now, go find a group of recently crashed survivalists who have an item that is called a comm-link. With this item I will be able to escape this planet.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_3_1", "What? How dare you speak to me in that way! I am of half a mind to use your spleen instead!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_3_2", "It wouldn't take much to make you interested, my pretty. Now, I like my slaves -er- friends to believe that they have a choice... choose differently this time.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Oh... it seems the compulsion doesn't have you as much as I expected it to. Perhaps if you would like to listen to a little song, eh?");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_3_4", "How. Dare. You. How dare you!!! HOW DARE YOU!!!!! I'll give you to the count of five, then I shall begin singing.... run, little rabbit, run....");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Who would? This blighted excuse for a moon is not what I had in mind when I escaped from my homeplanet of Dathomir.  After my concoction has come to completion, I will know how much longer I must remain upon this nightmare of a world. Have you chosen yet?");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_4_2", "My slave has a very keen nose for a certain type of herb that grows within the forest, He should have enough of the fresh leaves by now, but he is rather dumb so he hasn't returned. What I would give for a more intelligent slave.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_4_3", "How dare you question me? I am your master, worm, not the other way around. You could not begin to understand the great mysteries I and my sisters possess. Therefore, do not presume to wonder why I give you that request. You will do as I command!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Oh... how cute. It just asked my about my vision, as if it could even begin to understand. Well, worm, my vision showed me many ships landing on this planet in the near future. I will use a fabled commlink to steal these ships.... then I can leave these filthy Marauders for good. Now do as I say!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_5_4", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_6_3", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_6_4", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You are to find me the spleen of a healthy Ewok. I just need its spleen... you may throw the rest away.");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "You are to go fetch my slave, Lizardman. Don't  make me create another slave to go fetch you as well!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "You simpleton! I told you that I demand you bring me an Ewok so that I can squeeze a fleckle of spit from its body. Now go!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "I just told you! Get me that fabled commlink! With the power of technology, I will be Queen of this moon!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Oooka matoota keebo keebo!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Urgg... who you? You sent by the Mistress?");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Mooka pentootie kabbaata!!! Keepoto!!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "We're saved!!!! Hooray!!! Hey.... what are you doing with that blaster?");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "Urgg... Mistress... I have plant for you... I did not try to escape... I'm good Trandoshan, right?");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "Giiiboota!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "WHAT?! What do you mean you weren't able to find an Ewok spleen? These forests are crawling with the putrid little creatures!");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "WHAT!?!? You let my lizard slave get killed? How is that even possible!?");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "Aiiiiiieeeeee!!!! You let the thing escape?! You have but a few moments before I sing a song that will flay the skin from your bones.... hmmm... perhaps your spittle may do....");
stringFiles[2046].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "What?!! They didn't have the commlink? My visions lied?!?! NOOOOOOooooo.......");
