stringFiles[2048] = new StringFile("static_npc/endor/endor_marauder_fightmaster_jorak");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("cant_work", "If you would do the work of Fightmaster Jorak, you can work for no one else.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("next", "You have proven your bravery. But you will never match Fightmaster Jorak. Seek your fame in some other tribe.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Those who challenge Fightmaster Jorak face certain death! Hnnh? You do not challenge me? You seek to help the tribe? Urrm. Very well, kill the bloodseeker that attacks our livestock. Then you will show your bravery!");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Hrrngh. The tribe faces a new danger. One of the blurrgs at the old rock quarry ate of the stinking verminweed, which drives blurrgs to fury. Now the blurrg knocks over trees, homes, children. Kill the blurrg, and prove your bravery!");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Urrm -- it is bad when the little remmers get the Patch-skin Sickness. The big beasts eat the sick remmers, and the sickness drives the big things mad. A mantigrue has gone mad and threatens the tribe. Kill it to prove your might.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Face the bloodseeker and kill it. Then you will prove yourself worthy to stand with Fightmaster Jorak!");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_2_2", "You will be known as a proud warrior when you kill this crimson blurrg.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Against the mantigrue, even I, Fightmaster Jorak, have taken wounds. Watch for its claws!");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_3_1", "If you will not face the bloodseeker, the tribe will know you as a gutless coward.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Cowards have no future in this tribe.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_3_3", "You will gain no honor as a warrior for this cowardice.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_4_1", "It is the great many-legged warrior of the bark mites, fierce and relentless. We call it the Chirping Death. Hrnnh -- maybe that is not such a good name. Not fearsome. The bloodseeker is fearsome. Will you kill it?");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Big lizard. Walks on its hind legs. Three-Toe, the children call it. We tame it as a mount -- it is strong, though stupid. But when driven to fury, it is dangerous. Will you kill it?");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Some call it a condor dragon. Big scaled flying monster. The young, they dream bad dreams about it. Will you kill it?");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_6_3", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "There is no more to say. You must face the bloodseeker, or the tribe will know you as a coward.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "There is no more to say. You must find and kill the crimson blurrg, or else be known as a coward.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "There is nothing more to say. You must face the maddened mantigrue.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Even the youngest warrior of our tribe can dispatch a simple bloodseeker! You are not fit to call yourself a warrior.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You did not kill the blurrg, which any youngster of our tribe could kill while half asleep? You are no warrior, and are not fit to talk to Fightmaster Jorak.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You did not kill the mantigrue, and therefore you are no match for the valor of Fightmaster Jorak. Go!");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "When the scouts return with the location of the bloodseeker, then I shall tell you where to go. Meet with me again.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "When the scouts return with the news of the blurrg, then I can tell you where to find it. Meet with me again.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "When the scouts bring me the news of the mantigrue's attack, then I shall know where to send you. Meet with me again.");
stringFiles[2048].addEntry("npc_reset", "Away from me, coward.");
