stringFiles[2049].addEntry("next", "I don't have any more work for you right now. Come back and see me another time.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("notit_2", "This isn't my crystal. Where is it?");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("notyet", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Those Ewoks cause me nothing but trouble. If I could find a way to burn every last one of them to cinders, I could die happy. One of those blasted creatures has stolen an item that is very precious to me. I'm in the middle of something very delicate at the moment and can't get away. Would you be willing to track down the hairy little monster and bring it back here?");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Now that I know which of those filthy Ewoks stole my crystal, I need someone to retrieve it. Would you be a dear and hunt down and kill that awful little furry sneak thief and get my crystal back? ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I've been pondering how best to deal with this worthless tribe of thieving Ewoks. After due consideration, I've decided that I need to kill them all. Now this may sound impractical since like all vermin they breed incessantly, but the sooner you start, the sooner you'll finish. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_1_4", "They do not wail over Tibiks death, they celebrate him. Blasted creatures can't even get murdered properly. It's that priest of theirs that exhorts them to celebrate. He must be the next to die. You'll see it through won't you? ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I need this one creature named Chuva brought back to me unharmed - I'll take care of harming that one personally. Any other Ewoks in the vicinity who happen to die can only get you on my good side. Snap to it. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I think that as long as you keep on doing what I want you to, we're going to get along fine. Corba is the miserable little rat that stole my crystal. I'd ask you to bring the skin back but I don't want any solids left when you're finished. Just kill Corba and get my crystal back.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Once you have learned to truly hate them, perhaps I can teach you worse things. We shall see what you are capable of. Your task is to kill Tibik, the leader of this Ewok tribe. It shall be as though a great gong sounds their doom. Then my extermination can begin in earnest. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_2_4", "What a trail of suffering we could wreak. Those repellent celebrations should be over by now. Find their priest, Binbin he is called, and remove him from this life in the most painful way you can. I want to hear his howls of agony from here.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I wouldn't make a habit of wasting my time. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I wonder what pretty noises you might make screaming in agony. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I'd hate to think you were growing attached to those hairy monstrosities. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Then may you share their fate.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_4_1", "I told you, something very precious to me. Don't ask questions that don't concern you. Are you going to bring that disgusting creature back here for interrogation or not?");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Yes, it was a crystal. I want it back and I'll get it even if I have to boil every creature on this miserable little moon down to syrup. Now are you going to find it or not?");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Hate? You haven't the wit to truly grasp how I feel about the Ewoks. Hate does not even begin to describe what I feel towards those furry abominations. As to my reasons -- They are not your concern. Now will you aid my extermination plan or not?");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_4_4", "If not joy then it will have to suffice. It is all I think of day and night, the thought of making them suffer endless agonies until they finally despair so greatly they can no longer bear living. I need you to help me realize this goal, my weapon. What say you?");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_5_4", "");
