stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_6_4", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You seem to have something on your mind. What is it?");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "What do you want? Why are you still here?");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "You're not trying to stand in my way are you?");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Don't just stand there gibbering. Speak your piece and be gone.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You couldn't even capture an Ewok? Well don't feel too badly. If I had a credit for every time one of those disgusting little creatures foiled my plans, I'd be a wealthy witch.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You begin to see why I hate those miserable little creatures now. Nothing ever goes right when they're involved.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "Now you begin to see how loathing can develop into so much more. Now imagine a lifetime spent among them and imagine how potent your venom might become.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "We should wait here together and plot revenge so foul that children across the galaxy will cry themselves to sleep each night from the horror of it.");
