stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_more_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_more_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I need a few moments to savor the thoughts of what torments I'm going to inflict on this little thieving creature once it's standing before me. Come back in a little while and I should be ready for you to begin.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Perhaps I can narrow down where to look for the rotten little beast. Come back in a few minutes and maybe I'll know more.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "I can almost hear them shrieking their death agonies. My heart may yet burst with the joy of vengeance after being thwarted for so many years.   ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "We must wait until their celebration has run its course. Then, once they begin to reflect on what they have lost, we shall strike again and fill them with despair. It is not yet time. Patience, my weapon. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_reset", "I don't like for my business to remain unfinished. Come back and complete this task when you are ready. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "I don't like for my business to remain unfinished. Come back and complete this task when you are ready. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "I don't like for my business to remain unfinished. Come back and complete this task when you are ready. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "I don't like for my business to remain unfinished. Come back and complete this task when you are ready. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "I don't like for my business to remain unfinished. Come back and complete this task when you are ready. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "I don't like for my business to remain unfinished. Come back and complete this task when you are ready. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "I hope you managed to kill a few of these filthy creatures in the process of capturing this one. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "You're quite the little Ewok slayer aren't you? I think you and I could get to be good friends before I weary of you and have you killed.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "I only wish I could hear their wails of misery. Oh what sweet music.");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "You have done well, my weapon. You should go out and kill them one by one until you fall. It would be glorious.");
