stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Why haven't you found my crystal yet? ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Have you struck the blow that will strike terror into their furry hearts? Get on with it. ");
stringFiles[2049].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Have you turned their celebration songs into a dirge yet? Any sound but their misery chafes my ears.");
