stringFiles[2050].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("next", "Very nice, you were able to perform adequately in the simple chores given to you. Now figure out a way to get us off this miserable planet.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("notit_1", "Why must I suffer the stupidity of my people? With help like this it is no great wonder we have not yet captured the power and escaped this forested prison.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("notit_2", "Why must I suffer the stupidity of my people? With help like this it is no great wonder we have not yet captured the power and escaped this forested prison.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("notit_3", "Why must I suffer the stupidity of my people? With help like this it is no great wonder we have not yet captured the power and escaped this forested prison.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("notit_4", "Why must I suffer the stupidity of my people? With help like this it is no great wonder we have not yet captured the power and escaped this forested prison.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("notyet", "I do not know of you. For this you are fortunate. Your inevitable screw ups have not yet been brought to my attention. Go now, before I decide your face offends me.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Scholar Szingo tells me you are worthy of trust, but you look like a weak willed, oafish lout, used to failing in your duties. We will quickly find the value of appearance. You are to locate an Ewok holy man, destroy him, and return here with a staff I am told contains the power.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Well, the staff did not contain the power, but I will not let that reflect upon your performance. It will however figure into my punishment of Indar for failing me then inventing lies to cover up his cowardice and incompetence. He's run off, but I trust he will not be hard to find. You are to follow his trail and execute him in the name of Terak, King of the Marauders.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Do you feel it? Can you sense it, subtle yet pervasive, lurking all around us? Something new is on the planet. My scouts report a ship has crashed not far from here. A ship that must contain the power. You will bring us the power, right?");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Oh, those little furballs are clever. They've spied our recent activity and guess rightly that we are up to something. Can you believe the little beasts are actually coming to raid us? Of course you will stop them.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Lets see if your actions are as meaningful as your words, slug. A patrol was ambushed near the borders of our territory. The leader of that patrol claims a solitary Ewok was able to send his men running in confusion with bolts of pure power shot from a shiny metal staff. Retrace the steps of this patrol, locate the Ewok, and return here with the staff he wields. Now go!");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Go. The signs of his departure should be visible in the citadel and easy to read. Spare no extravagance of pain in his demise.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Destroy any who defend the ship. Do what you will with them, only bring us the power. Make a thorough search of the area and all beings from the ship, bring tools, parts, documents, anything you find. I can feel our inevitable return to the glory of the stars coming closer, closer. I have only to reach out and...");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Very good. Anyone in the citadel should point you in the right direction. I expect you should know I want this dealt with harshly. The more blood the better. I want those little rats hiding all the way back in their stick villages to hear the anguished cries of their comrades.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_3_1", "You may thank my present high spirits that I do not feed you to my warriors. Leave my sight, you festering remmer.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Explain to me why your miserable life should not belong to me? If you are allowed to walk away from this place, it is only by my leave that you do so.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_3_3", "It is only by the grace of your past service that I do not kill you where you stand. But know this: you are lucky to walk out of here in your skin, you treacherous dog.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_3_4", "My patience wears thin. Begone from this place and consider this a chance to make your escape else I may send the next stranger out to hunt your worthless hide.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Because the staff has power. And power is our means for getting off this green carbuncle on the backside of the galaxy. Those who bring me the power will be well rewarded. And power... is it's own reward.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Silence fool. You will perform this task for the simple reason I told you to do it. And if you fail me in this it may be my own men who pursue you to your just reward.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_4_3", "There was a time when each of those who you see before you were kings of the stars. We rode great warships in the vastness of space, terrorizing the galaxies with the mere mention of our name. And now? We must scramble to subsist, competing against miserable little fuzzballs who nub nub this, and yub yub that. Can you tell me you don't want to leave as well?");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Would you fight harder knowing your reward was a sturdy chest plate of Marauder make? That, and monetary compensation should be more than enough.");
