stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "This is the staff? This? It looks just like a simple metal staff. It IS a simple metal staff! Guards! Bring that deceitful worm Indar before the king! ");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Indar is dead. You perform your duties tolerably. Take these credits and this pair of leg guards Indar left behind. Once you are finished loafing about, return for further duties.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Yes, I can FEEL the power in this device. It is great, it is mighty. The power has come to us! Scholar Szingo will know what to do with this. As for you, take these as your reward.");
stringFiles[2050].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Ah yes, you have served me well. When I think about it, it's really quite shocking. It's too bad I don't have a hundred just like you. We would rule the stars with an iron fist. Why do you still stand there? Your money? Catch! You may find this armor useful too.");
