stringFiles[2052].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Well then you shouldn't have come in here asking for work. I don't have time to deal with mudslugs like you.");
stringFiles[2052].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Well, they're dealt with for now. Hopefully this will keep them guessing for a while, at least until I can deal with the Canyon Corsairs. Here's your price.");
stringFiles[2052].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Good job. Have you ever thought of actually sailing the spacelanes? You've got the kind of gusto I look for. Regardless... here's your money. I may have more work for you, so stick around.");
stringFiles[2052].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Well what do you know... some Imperial access codes. Those Corsairs sure know how to aim high. It's a sad shame their in my hands now... Good work, kid. Here's your credits.");
stringFiles[2052].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Will you look at that... Jinkins told me he saw everything that happened. You've got some moxie, kid. So... how's about I give you these credits and also a hyperspace map I just picked up. I fgure that will set us even.");
