stringFiles[2059].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("notyet", "Yousa not supposed ta beesa heere.   Mesa not speke wit yousa now.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Heydo, outlaunder. Whysa yousa come to da Gungan sacred place? Yousa hep da Gungans crunchen de Empire? My needin a talkie sent to da Gungan Rebel friend. Dey needin to send de Rebel bigbrain to Otoh Gunga so dey learn bout boomers. Yousa hep mesa?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Welcome backo, outlaunder. Yousa ready to hep da Gungans again? Da Naboo biggen, Queen Kylantha, be needin shesan handmaiden brought here. De Empire biggen, Sikander, be wantin to pune-ish da girl. Yousa hep save shesan?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Yousa backo, friend? Mesa berry pleased. Mesa needin yousa hep. Mesa best niece, whosa bombad Gungan general, has been taken by de Imperials. Yousa must save shesan or de Imperials crunchen shesan bombad. Yousa heppen mesa?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Welcome backo, mesa maxibig boyo! Mesa be havin one last task dat yousa can hep mesa wit. Imperial biggen, Sikander, be sendin bombab warriors to crunchen da Gungan sacred place. Yousa berry good boyo to da Gungans. Yousa go an crunchen de Imperials before dey can crunchen usan. Yes?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Mesa like dis.  Mebbe wesa bein friends.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Mooie moodie good. Mesa like yousa.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Mesa berry happy. Yousa good friend to da Gungans.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Dat is da bombad warrior mesa know. Go an crunchen dosen Imperial dudus!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_3_1", "No yousa spek? Begone wit yousa den!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Begone wit yousa den!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Dis stinkowiff! Off wit yousa! Mesa no like yousa no more!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Mesa mooie mooie sad yousa doen nutten. Many Gungans get crunched now. Away wit yousa!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Boomer is Gungan bombad weapon. Dis hep de Rebels fight bombad Imperial mackineeks. Yousa hep?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Shesa culled Jaanie an shesa good friend to da Naboo biggen. Yousa hep shesan?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Shesa be culled Fassa an shesan a bombad warrior so yousa be berry polite whensa yousa spek wit shesan. Yousa ready to go?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Mesa tink yousa need maxibig boyos to hep yousa crunchen de Imperials. Den yousa share de glory.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Yousan should be tendin to mesa maxibig task. Whysa yousa still here?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Dat girl be needin yousa hep. Whysa yousa not goin?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Mesa best niece goin to be crunched by de Imperials! Whysa yousa not goin?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Dosen Imperials be on dere way! Whysa yousa still here?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Did the Gungans send you to deliver a message?");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Are you looking for the handmaiden Jaanie? That's me!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Put da crunchen on desen Imperials!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Halt! You're under arrest!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "You have my thanks and the gratitude of Her Majesty, Queen Kylantha.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "Yousa good friend. Come backo and see mesa sometime.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "What is dis? Howsa can yousa crunchen dis task? Dis be stinkowiff!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Yousa failin, yousa spek? Poor girl! Dis be bombin!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "What? Mesa best niece get crunched? Dis bombin! Dis berry, berry bombin!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "What yousa spek? De Imperials not be crunched? Dis be berry bombin! Wesa must stop dem!");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Wait. Meesa receiven' a talkie. Hmm, der be trouble wit da Gungan Rebel friend. Yousa come backo later.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Yousa wait. Shesan not at meetin place yet. Come backo later.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Yousa wait. Mesa best niece not sendin da signal yet. Come backo later.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "Yousa wait. Dosen Imperials be wanderin da swamps. Come backo later.");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[2059].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Disen mooie mooie disappointen. Come backo whensa yousa can finish de task.");
