stringFiles[2063].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hi! Are you looking for work? I have a little errand I could use help with. A courier is supposed to bring me a datadisk, but he's having some trouble getting here. He took a minor leg injury when some creature surprised him. Nothing too serious, I assume. Could you bring me the disk?");
