stringFiles[2065] = new StringFile("static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("cantwork", "Hzznt -- ah? Uh? Sorry, I was sleeping. You're the one they sent to do that job? What's that? Busy, you say? Well, come back later, then.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I think you're looking for someone else.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "You got the wrong fellow.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "I don't think you're the one I'm supposed to meet.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "My not knowin' what you want wit' mesa.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("gotowork_2", "I was expecting a payment from that old man. Didn't you bring it?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("gotowork_3", "I was expecting the -- well, a document from Ebenn. Didn't you bring it?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("next", "Hzzznt -- hzzznt -- hzzznt -- hzzznt --");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("notit_2", "I was expecting a payment from that old man. This isn't it.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("notit_3", "I was expecting the -- well, a document from Ebenn. This isn't it.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("notyet", "Er...can you come back?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hzznt -- wha? What's that? I was sleeping. Oh. You. You're the one they sent looking for a job. Right? Speak up, I can't hear you. They made me get one of those ear implants, but the thing makes my skull buzz. Where's my assistant? He can fix my ears. Bring me my assistant. I sent him out somewhere. I forget why.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_1_2", "All right, I can hear you now, you don't have to shout -- Where am I? Oh yes. You're looking for a job, right? Well, listen: The Republic is falling on hard times, and unless we do something to help Chancellor Valorum, that Pala-- Plapa -- that Senator What's-his-name will bring ruin on us all. Deliver these funds to set up a commission inquiring into what may be done.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Wait -- what year is this? This is now, isn't it? I thought so. I drift away sometimes. Well, want another job, youngster? Some fool of a poet -- young sprat! -- sent me her poems to recommend to my publishers. Hah! Can't fool an old man! She just wants me to recommend this junk to my publisher! I mean -- uh -- I forget what I meant. Anyway. Take her junk poetry back to her without my recommendation. That'll show her!");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Ah? Oh, you're back. I remember you from the Clone Wars, don't I? Good. I have a favor to ask, Master Jedi. Don't lie to me, I saw you with that Jedi Knight, what's-his-name. He just called, asked me to send a guide to bring him here for a nice dinner. Won't that be nice? What do you say, Master Jedi?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_2_1", "What? I can't hear you. Go find my assistant, Rinto Liprus. I sent him -- where did I send him -- oh! Into the wilderness. Now why did I do that?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_2_2", "All right, that's the kind of vim I used to have myself, eighty or ninety years ago! Take this to -- oh, what's his name? Name, name -- Tanner Helton! Go. Hope I'm still alive when you get back.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Good, good -- What? You still here? Go, go! You're looking for that poet -- what's her name -- Nura Tinall. As if I would ever read her poetry, hah! That's what I say, Hah!");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Good. Pay the Jedi, Rinto. Rinto? Where is he? Well, Master, I'll pay you when you bring me your Jedi friend.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_3_1", "What? I can't hear you. Where's my assistant? He'll fix my ears.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_3_2", "What? Can't do it? Well, stop wasting my time then. Haven't got that much time left.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_3_3", "What? Can't do it? Well, stop wasting my time then. Haven't got that much time left.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_3_4", "What? Can't do it? Well, stop wasting my time then. Very rude for a Jedi Knight to waste an old man's time!");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Speak up, I can't hear a thing. You need to find my assistant. His name's Rinto Liprus. My great-grandson, I think. Will you go find him?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Wha? Me? Oh, I'm just an old man. Used to be on the Royal Council. Traveled, wrote a lot of books. The Galactic Phrasebook, that was mine. Collected folk art of the Hutts -- very interesting, Hutt art, I remember one piece that -- Well, never mind. I need these funds delivered, youngster. What do you say?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Me? I'm, I'm -- I forget how old. When was the Trade Federation War? I retired not long after that. Retired to Manda with my wife, Pookie, and we had a miniature bantha named Nuke. Good old Nuke. I never should have outlived them. But here I am. Now, what about that job?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Ah. Got that Q3 by undergoing the ceremonial Passage Rite at the semi-summer festival on Vintrus. Wait, was it Vintrus --? No, it wasn't the Passage Rite, it was -- well, maybe I don't remember. What about that job? Please don't keep an old man waiting, Master Jedi.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "What? I can't hear you. Go find my assistant.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I'm tired of talking. I need a nap. You go on now.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "I'm tired of talking. I need a nap. You go on now.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "I'm tired of talking. I need a nap. You go on now, Master Jedi.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Hello! I'm Rinto Liprus! Did Ebenn send you?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Hey! Did that old man send the money?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Hello! Did Ebenn send the plans?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Heydo! Yousa sent from de Baobab guy?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "Thanks for the escort. You'll be able to talk to Ebenn now. -- Hello, Great-Grandpa! It's Rinto! I'm here to fix your ears!");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "Mooie-mooie tanks! Heydo, Ebenn! Yousa sendin' mesa to be learnin' de Jedi mind tricks?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "What? I can't hear you. Where is that assistant? Rinto! Rinto!");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "What? You say I sent you to deliver funds to Chancellor Valorum? That's ridiculous! Valorum hasn't been around since the Old Republic! Go away, let me sleep.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "Didn't deliver that poetry? Bosh, I could do it myself, and I'm a lot older than you, youngster. Well, I'll find someone else. Yes I will! Hah!");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Wha? Who are you? What? You were doing a job for me? Bosh. Never saw you before in my life. Go away, I need a nap.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "What? I need my assistant, Rinto Liprus. I sent him to -- darnit, where did he go? I forget. You come back later, I'll remember, you'll see.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Good, good! Now, the coordinates you need are -- uh -- mmm. Mmmnhh. Hzznt -- hzzznt -- Uh? What? Who are you? Go away, let me sleep.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Good, good! Now, the coordinates you need are -- uh -- mmm. Mmmnhh. Hzznt -- hzzznt -- Uh? What? Who are you? Go away, let me sleep.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "Good, good! Now, the coordinates you need are -- uh -- mmm. Mmmnhh. Hzznt -- hzzznt -- Uh? What? Who are you? Go away, let me sleep.");
