stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Hzznt -- uh? What? Can't do the job? You woke me up to say you can't do my job? Well, come on back when you can do it, then.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Hzznt -- uh? What? Can't do the job? You woke me up to say you can't do my job? Well, come on back when you can do it, then.");
