stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Hzznt -- uh? What? Can't do the job? You woke me up to say you can't do my job? Well, come on back when you can do it, then.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "Hzznt -- uh? What? Can't do the job? You woke me up to say you can't do my job? Well, come on back when you can do it, then.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "Hzznt -- uh? What? Can't do the job? You woke me up to say you can't do my job? Well, come on back when you can do it, then.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Ah, here's Rinto, and here's my ears. Ah, that's better. I can hear now. Take a little something for your time, youngster. Now, what brings you here? Looking for a job, are you?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "All right then. Here's your pay. That Chancellor Valorum had better buckle down, or the whole Republic will in trouble. Yes, yes -- Wait, who are you? Looking for a job?");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Wha? Who are you? What's that? Plans? I don't know anything about any plans. Oh, I remember. I sent you off with that junk poetry. Here, take a little something for your time. Spend it while you can, I say.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Wha? Who's this? Some kind of alien thing! Well, I'll have Rinto take care of this monster. Who are you, youngster? Do I owe you money? I remember now -- you brought me Rinto from the wilderness. Here, take a little something for your time.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "About time. I told that old man those medical supplies wouldn't budge past the Imperial blockades until I got this money. Okay, I'm off to the Outer Rim.");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "At last! The plans for the Emperor's Retreat! Princess Leia will be glad to see these. Thanks!");
stringFiles[2065].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
