stringFiles[2066].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("next", "Hello again. Nothing needs your attention today, thanks.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("notyet", "I can't talk to you right now.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hello. I'm Captain Sykes with the RSF's smuggling patrol. This is a long shot, but maybe you could help me. We confiscated animal carcasses from a Gungan smuggling gang that was shipping them offworld. This violates all kinds of regulations. The leader says one smuggler is bringing more carcasses to the drop point. We're short-staffed right now, so I'm desperate. Can you try to stop the smuggler?");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I have another emergency and another lack of qualified people. Apparently those Gungan smugglers I mentioned are looking for crazed animals. We've been getting reports of attacks by ordinarily harmless beasts. Here's a new report about -- let's see -- a berserk ikopi. Destroy this poor creature before the Gungan gang gets it.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Are you interested in taking the fight against smugglers right to their leader's door? That Gungan smuggling gang is taking orders from a human thug, Mandrox, one of Borvo the Hutt's lieutenants. I already guessed Borvo would be at the bottom of this. I want you to bring in Mandrox for questioning.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_1_4", "I've learned some interesting facts from Borvo the Hutt's lieutenant, Haf Mandrox. He says Borvo's Gungan gang is shipping carcasses infected with that Berserker Virus to Corellian bioengineers. They must be trying to turn it into a bioweapon. I wouldn't ordinarily entrust you with this job, but you've proven yourself. I need you to take out the one in charge of shipping those bodies!");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good. I suspected you were made of sterner stuff than you look. This Gungan, Zim Zam Blattis, is known to be armed, so be careful.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good. I hope you'll once again exceed my expectations. These berserk animals can be dangerous, even the little ones -- and this ikopi is pretty big. Be careful.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_2_3", "I'm beginning not to be surprised when you take these challenges. Mandrox is usually accompanied by two or three Gungan thugs, so as always, be careful.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Good. Mandrox told us the coordinates he's located at currently. He's lightly guarded, but don't get overconfident. Report back here afterward.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_3_1", "All right, I knew it was a long shot when I saw you. Thanks anyway.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Well, that's about what I expected. Thanks anyway.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Well, I guess you fit my mental profile after all. No hard feelings, though.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Well, I expect this one is a bit over your head. I don't blame you.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Our reports are sketchy, but apparently the animals in question died of some unusual disease. Maybe it's a Gungan ceremonial thing. Will you take the assignment?");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_4_2", "The reports mention that these animals are suffering from an unknown virus that drives them berserk. It's possible the smugglers are looking for a bioweapon -- in which case, they're probably working for someone smarter than they are. Speaking of that -- yes or no?");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Borvo the Hutt is behind every rotten thing on Naboo. Back in the Trade Federation War, some of us resisting the Neimoidians made an alliance with Borvo. But he betrayed us and killed my captain. Since then, I've fought Borvo on every front. Will you help?");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_4_4", "I'm no bioengineer, but my reports say the Berserker Virus rewires the animal brain to connect sensory input directly to aggression centers. Basically, whatever the animal sees, it hates and tries to kill. I'd really like your help in stopping this bioweapon scheme. Will you help?");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I've told you everything I can. I hope that's enough for you to work with.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I've told you everything I can. What, isn't that enough?");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "I've got no more information for you. Mandrox could get away any moment, so get going.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "I've told you everything I know. I hope you can get started soon.");
