stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You didn't get Mandrox? All right, I understand. I must admit that to him you're probably a minor annoyance at best.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Just when I was convinced I'd misjudged you. Well, thanks for trying.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Good. I'm pleasantly surprised. You can find the Gungan at these coordinates -- blast. My datapad just went down. Check with me later.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Good. I'm pleasantly surprised. You can find the crazed ikopi at these coordinates -- blast. My datapad just went down. Check with me later.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Wait -- I'm getting a report -- we've lost Mandrox. We have a probe droid scouting his last known location. Check with me soon.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "Wait -- I'm getting conflicting reports about the forces at the smuggler outpost. Hold tight while we sort this out, and check back with me later.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Well, I can't say I didn't expect that. But you might check with me later nonetheless.");
