stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Well, you carried that out with much greater precision than I had any right to expect. Thanks! Look me up again if you want more work.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "I really do take back all the things I thought about you. Here's your reward. Talk with me later if you want more work. ");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "You continue to surpass my expectations. Thanks for bringing in Madrox, and let me know if you want more work.");
stringFiles[2066].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "I misjudged you from the first and at every step. Now I'm convinced you're a capable agent. Take this reward with my thanks.");
