stringFiles[2067].addEntry("npc_1_1", "My name's Gerrio Coronis, and I run Theedside Safaris. Are you in need of a few credits? I'm looking for part-time help. I run a safari, you understand, so I need to feel confident you can handle a weapon. Would you do a trial run first? Just to show me you're capable.");
