stringFiles[2069].addEntry("notyet", "There's nothing I need at the moment.");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Ello! Yousa got time to hep de Otoh Gunga Zoological Facility? My bein' Facility director. Wesa got a maxibig problem wit outlaunder tourists comen to Naboo and bringin' dey pet animals. De animals had gettin' loose, ruinin' de ecology. Deysa one beast, a blistmok, comen outen Talus. My needin' it killed. Okeyday?");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Ello! Our scientists had figurin' out whatsa goin' on wit desa reports. Some virus is drivin' de animals cawazy. Yousa gotta kill desan latest intruders, duey bocatts outen Tatooine, so wesa can autopsy deysa brains!");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Ello dere! Desan latest outlaunder intruders bein' duey monstahs called langlatches. My got no idea where desan stinkowiff tings come from. Yousa mebbe wantin' to be killin' dese langlatches for us?");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Heydo! Some bombad nasty outlaunder ting is makin' its way t'rough the forest, killin' just for de joy of killin'. We caught de owner, but de animal had gettin' away. Disa Corellian slice hound, mooie mooie dangerous beast. Yousa up to de task?");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Dissen what mesa want hearin'. Yousa go to work.");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Dissa just what my wantin' to hear. Yousa go puttin' down deysa bocatts.");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Dissen what mesa want hearin'. Yousa go get ridda deysa langlatches.");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Yousa be careful wit dem slice hounds. Desa mooie mooie dangerous.");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway.");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway.");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway.");
