stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Itsa ittybitty reptavian ting wit maxibig blisters all over. Yousa not be touchin' dosa blisters, or yousa gettin' mooie-mooie bombad poison. Yousa takin' disa job?");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_4_2", "A bocatt, hesa outlaunder reptavian-felinoid hybrid outa Tatooine. Bigga sharp teeth. Dey huntin' in pairs, usually, trackin' dere prey wit smellin'. Bombad nasty. So, yousa willin' to hep de Zoological Facility by killin' dese bocatts?");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Itsa mooie-mooie mean and mooie-mooie ugly.  Desa scavenge dead carcasses and eggs of creatures. Desa nasty!");
stringFiles[2069].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Des Corellian slice hound is messa dangerous predator. Desa attack anything... even Gungans... and desa mooie-mooie intelligent. Desa got mooie sharp teeth and spikes. Yousa be careful!");
