stringFiles[2074] = new StringFile("static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("cantwork", "If you want to make some creds working for me, see me when you're not so busy.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm busy at the moment.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Sorry, pal. No time for conversation today.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "I'm not here waiting for you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Sorry, friend, I can't help you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "I'm waiting for somebody else.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("gotowork_2", "You don't seem to have any legitimate reason to be here. Get out of here before I put you under arrest.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("gotowork_3", "No credits for me? No help for your boss.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("next", "You do good work. I'll keep you in mind for future jobs.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("notit_1", "Weren't you supposed to bring me a message? This isn't it.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("notit_2", "What am I supposed to do with this? ");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("notit_3", "I believe you were supposed to bring me credits. I have no use for that.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("notyet", "Can you find someone else to talk to, please?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I'm Kritus Morven, a local businessman. I make sure Borvo the Hutt isn't the only one on Naboo making a profit. Speaking of that slimy Hutt, he wants to make some sort of deal. No doubt some opportunity where I take all the risks and he takes all the profit -- but I should at least find out what it is. Will you meet his courier and bring me the offer?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_1_2", "While you were gone, I hope you weren't working for that corpulent oozing fool of a Hutt. He thinks he owns Naboo, but I'm about to teach him otherwise. You're not wanted by the law, are you? I need the services of someone who won't be shot on sight by security personnel. Is that you?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Those stinking security people have no sense of gratitude. After I go to the trouble of giving those security officers the location of Borvo's spice refinery, they turn around and start looking for mine! That Hutt has to be behind this. I need someone to help fix this for me, fast. I can count on you, can't I?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_1_4", "The word on the street is that Borvo the Hutt has his greasy hand in something new. I plan to find out what it is and get in on the action. A couple of Borvo's boys have been escorting some brainy type on what appear to be hunting expeditions. I need to find out exactly what that bloated slime factory is up to. I want you to get the big brain away from the guards and bring him to me. How about it?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_1_5", "You are not going to believe what that oozing gravity well Borvo has his hand in. Bioweaponry! We're not going to let that bulging mucus repository make all the credits on this, are we? Of course not. Borvo's courier is delivering a sample for him to sell to some Corellian buyers. I want you to intercept him and get that sample. You're with me, aren't you?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Wonderful. I feel sure we're going to get on very well. Meet Fekk Trunkel outside the city, where you can conduct your business away from prying eyes.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good. Find one of the security people looking for Borvo's spice refinery and give him this disk. The data should help narrow the search.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Good! I just need you to bring this authorization for credits to security officer Dagrus Rhine. Move fast!");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Great. I'm sure he'll be more than happy to tell me whatever I want to know.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Good. Borvo's courier, Dekker, won't be willing to just hand over the sample. Take whatever steps are needed to get it. Clear?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_3_1", "High time you were leaving then. I have things to do. ");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_3_2", "You'd better be on your way.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_3_3", "What a shame. I was just starting to like you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Prefer being small time, do you? Goodbye.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_3_5", "Foolish to say no at this point, but it's your decision.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_4_1", "I don't dislike Borvo -- I find him a worthy adversary. When I'm staring down at his corpse and running all his holdings, I will remember him fondly. It's nothing personal, just business. So will you go and get that lying Hutt's offer?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_4_2", "One of my informants tells me Naboo security forces are looking for Borvo's spice refineries. As it happens, I know the location of one. Purely as a concerned citizen, I want to offer them this information. So are you in?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_4_3", "I made a deal with a security officer who's been cooperative in the past. You bring him some credits, and he'll slow up the search long enough for me to get my goods out of there. What do you say?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_4_4", "I'm not sure. I heard something about a disease that drives animals crazy. That's all I know, but the brain-guy will know more. Will you get him for me?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_4_5", "Borvo's scientist was quite forthcoming after a little persuasion. There's some virus that increases aggression. Borvo has been selling it offworld. I need you to get me a sample. Will you?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "So were you going to pick up that offer from Borvo?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "So are you going to deliver this message?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "So are you going to drop off those credits?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "You going to get that scientist for me now?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "You're going to fetch that little sample for me, aren't you?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Hey! Are you the courier I'm waiting on?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "You'd better have a good reason for being here, citizen.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Are you the messenger?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "I have a bad feeling about this.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "Die, fool!");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "What did I ever do to deserve this?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Hmm. I hope this doesn't lead to an all-out war with Borvo. I'm not ready for that yet, quite.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "A perfect opportunity to stick it to that oozing sleemo. A perfect opportunity -- lost!");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You didn't make the drop? This is going to be highly inconvenient.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "That blasted Hutt is gaining too much ground. This is not good for my business interests.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "You couldn't get it, could you? Blast! That Hutt wins another one.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "There's still a lot of time before you need to meet the courier, so come back and see me a little later.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I need you to wait a while before you tip off security. See me again about this soon.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "See me in a little while. I'll have all the details by then, I hope. ");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "See me later. My informants will let me know when Borvo's thugs have left the city again.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "It's not time for the delivery quite yet. See me later and I'll let you know then.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Some days just don't go so well. Try me again later. I'll still have work for you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Some days just don't go so well. Try me again later. I'll still have work for you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Some days just don't go so well. Try me again later. I'll still have work for you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Some days just don't go so well. Try me again later. I'll still have work for you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "Some days just don't go so well. Try me again later. I'll still have work for you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "Some days just don't go so well. Try me again later. I'll still have work for you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "I'll review this, but I'd rather carry him than trust him.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Nice. I almost wish I could see his repulsive, slimy face when he finds out his refinery has been raided.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "You saved me a lot of inconvenience on that one. Thanks.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Good work. Now I can find out what's in this guy's brain -- either the polite way, or more physically. See me again soon.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "You've done very well. You may want to leave town for a while. Borvo may not be too happy with you right now.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "You bring this to Morven. See if he's got the sense to know a good deal when he sees it.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "An anonymous tip, eh? Thanks.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "I'll slow things down as much as I can. Now get out of here before someone spots you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "Please don't hurt me. I'm not even armed.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_takeme_5", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_takeme_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Haven't you picked up that message from Borvo? Why not?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Haven't you made the delivery yet? Why not?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Have you made that drop yet? I have a lot riding on this.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Where's Borvo's scientist? Haven't you gotten him yet?");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_work_5", "Hurry up and get that sample.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("npc_work_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("otherescort_1", "Sorry, I'm not the one you're looking for.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("otherescort_2", "If you're looking for someone, look elsewhere.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("otherescort_3", "I'm not here waiting for you.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("otherescort_4", "If you're looking for somebody, I'm afraid it's not me.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("otherescort_5", "I'm waiting for somebody else.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("otherescort_6", "");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("player_1_3", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("player_1_4", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2074].addEntry("player_1_5", "Yes.");
