stringFiles[2075].addEntry("notyet", "Sorry, I need some time alone.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Sorry, this is a private family retreat. You can go in if you have an invitation. Otherwise -- well then, you might make yourself useful. Want a job? A Corellian visitor brought in a pet krahbu -- one of those big, fast mount animals -- and it got loose. Something drove it crazy -- maybe when it ate the local plants. Now this pest is killing local wildlife and livestock. Find the krahbu and kill it.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Interested in more work, are you? Well then, if you take care of one more little matter, I'll let you into the retreat -- assuming you don't have an invitation already. I think that krahbu infected a local mott with some Corellian virus. The disease must have driven the thing crazy. You have to put it down before the epidemic spreads.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good. I'll wait for you here. Come on back after you've put down the krahbu. Be careful.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good. I'll be here waiting, just like before. Come on back after you've put down the mott.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_2_3", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Well then. I expect you'll find some nice place to visit, other than here. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_3_2", "And you made yourself so useful before. Guess that was the exception. Well then, goodbye.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_4_1", "This is the Lake Retreat of the Naberrie family, one of the most honored families in Naboo history. Queen Padme Amidala was a Naberrie, along with several former senators and many high officials. Now, about that job --");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_4_2", "If you can picture a little garbage masher on four legs and covered with fur and tusks, that's a mott. Ill-tempered and brusque, in contrast to my own sweet nature. Well then, about this job -- will you take it?");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_4_3", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I've got nothing more to tell you about that krahbu. Get to it.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I've got nothing more to tell you about this mott. Get to it.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Couldn't catch that krahbu, eh? I'm not surprised, they're fast. Well, thanks anyway.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Couldn't catch those mott, eh? I'm not surprised, they're sneaky. Well, thanks anyway.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "That's good -- no, wait. I remember, I've got a tour group ambling through that area just now. This would be a bad time to kill animals there. Check back with me later.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "That's good -- no, wait. I've got a tour group ambling through that area just now. This would be a bad time to kill animals there. Check back with me later.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "All right, I understand. I hope you'll check back later when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "All right, I understand. I hope you'll check back later when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "All right, I understand. I hope you'll check back later when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "All right, I understand. I hope you'll check back later when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "All right, I understand. I hope you'll check back later when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "All right, I understand. I hope you'll check back later when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Sorry to see that animal put down, but it had to be done. Invading species, you know. Here's a reward. If you have an invitation, go right in. Otherwise -- well then, talk to me about another little job, and after that, I'd be willing to let you in to look around.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Thanks. That mott was just a nuisance before, digging up my garden and whatnot. But this could have been a plague. Well then, you've proven you have gumption. Go on in, look around -- but don't tell anyone I let you in.");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "");
stringFiles[2075].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "");
