stringFiles[2076] = new StringFile("static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("cantwork", "If you'd like a job, contact me when you're not busy. Oh, and I recommend the Merenzane Gold in the bar -- subtle, sweet, expensive.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Are you the one I was supposed to --? No, I don't think so. Please leave me alone.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I don't think you're here to pick up my bribe, are you?");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("gotowork", "I don't have time to chat right now.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("next", "Sorry, I have no more work for you. But do try a glass of the spiced paricha at the bar. So delicate you almost miss the taste, but what a kick!");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("notit_1", "That isn't the processing fee!");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("notit_2", "That isn't the processing fee!");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("notyet", "I'm too busy to talk right now.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Have you had the fried thakitillo appetizer at the bar? Delicious. --Oh, forgive me. I'm Leb Slesher, expediter of merchant relations. Are you interested in a job, perhaps? I have evidence that seemingly shows a certain local merchant receiving smuggled goods. This horrible mistake can only be resolved with extensive bureaucratic processing. Please meet the merchant at our wilderness rendezvous, free of prying eyes, and secure the processing fee.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Ah, hello again. I have a new job for you. It relates to Naboo Commercial Code regulation 142.74.A-6502.4.16/3 Section 453 Paragraph 2. Too many innocent merchants seem unaware of this regulation, which clearly specifies military discounts for Imperial officers. I have documented a certain restaurateur's refusal to honor this discount. I can remedy the problem for a fee, which you may collect at the agreed rendezvous in the wilderness.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Splendid. Pick up the processing fee from the merchant Phinta Lianovi at these coordinates. Look out for troublemakers. Some locals object violently to these transactions.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Fine, fine. You're looking for a merchant named Cornevero Dawlton at these coordinates. Watch out for local wildlife, it can be hazardous.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_2_3", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I'm disappointed, but I think I shall live. On your way out, be sure to try the vagnerian canapes at the bar. Quite tasty.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I'm disappointed, but I think I shall live. On your way out, be sure to try the zwil cakes at the bar. Not addictive unless you're a Drovian.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Of course the evidence is forged, but it's a very good forgery. Imagine how some ignorant customs official would react -- unless I intercede to explain matters. This calls for fair recompense for my effort. Speaking of effort, are you willing to do this job?");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Well, friend, assuming I work for the ISB, I'm obviously covert. Therefore, I'd be silly to admit it. Likewise, you'd be silly to press the issue -- assuming I work for the ISB. Now, about this job --?");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_4_3", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I'm afraid I don't know what else to tell you. Really, that should be enough to get you going.");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I'm afraid I don't know what else to tell you. Really, that should be enough to get you going.");
