stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Here's the fee. Please tell your ISB boss not to file that report! Someone doctored the images to make legitimate merchants look like smugglers!");
stringFiles[2076].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "Here, take the payment, and also this nice stuffed noona, which I made you to show my good will! What, you're not Slesher? Well, tell him to drop by if he wants this noona.");
