stringFiles[2077].addEntry("player_3_2", "What business took him out to Lord Humbonnen's estate?");
stringFiles[2077].addEntry("player_3_3", "Why would Linay recruit Gungans at their sacred places? This sounds like a slave operation.");
stringFiles[2077].addEntry("player_3_4", "Does this bandit leader intend to free Humbonnen's Gungan slaves?");
