stringFiles[2078] = new StringFile("static_npc/naboo/liane");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("cantwork", "I am Liane, handmaiden to Her Majesty. If you seek employment, consult with me when you are not so busy.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Don't bother me, I'm just an old man with nothing to say to you.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I would ordinarily love to talk with you, but I'm waiting for someone else.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "I don't have anything to say to you.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("gotowork_1", "I was almost expecting a commission, or something, from the Queen. Well, I can still hope.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("gotowork_2", "Oh -- I thought you might have something for me. Sorry.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("gotowork_3", "I just write poetry. If you don't have a commission for me, I can't help you.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("next", "Thank you again for your earlier assistance. Her Majesty is happy to grant you an audience. Go right in.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("notit_1", "I was almost expecting a commission, or something, from the Queen. Well, I can still hope.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("notit_2", "I'm afraid this means nothing to me. I'm a tailor.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("notit_3", "That doesn't look like anything of importance to me.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("notyet", "Tghings are a little hectic right now.  Perhaps you could return at another time?");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I am Liane, handmaiden to Her Majesty Queen Kylantha of Naboo. If you wish to see Her Majesty, I'm afraid she is currently occupied. Do you seek employment? Her Majesty wishes an antique mandoviol to be delivered for restoration to a leading crafter of musical instruments. The crafter, Bowrun Stradalla, lives in the wilderness outside Theed. Will you undertake to assist Her Majesty? She is known to look kindly on those who help her.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I am pleased to see you again. Her Majesty, Queen Kylantha, remains occupied. But if you seek employment, Her Majesty commands that this order for a new ceremonial dress be delivered to one of Naboo's leading tailors. Note that the instructions state that the peko-peko fronds of the neckpiece are to be simulated, not actual fronds. Will you deliver the order?");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I am pleased to see you. Her Majesty Queen Kylantha remains busy, but she would certainly appreciate your assistance with a minor errand. Her Majesty wishes to commission the acclaimed poet Biude Lop Quanna to produce a celebratory ode marking the birth of eleven tiny new offspring by her favorite pet voorpak, Champion Paragon Journeyer the Most Happy Leaper. Will you deliver the commission?");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I am pleased. Here is the mandoviol -- please treat it with care. I suggest you look for Master Stradalla at these coordinates. Return here after the delivery.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I am pleased. Here is the datadisc. Please look for the tailor, Niamora Ingidge, somewhere in the vicinity of her wilderness estate. Return here when you've fulfilled the assignment.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_2_3", "I am pleased to hear that. Here is the commission. Please deliver it to Biude Lop Quanna, who is apparently vacationing in the wilderness for reasons I do not know. Return here afterward, and signs are promising that Her Majesty may grant an audience.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I am sorry to hear that. Her Majesty is currently occupied, as I say, and likely to remain so for the foreseeable future.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I am sorry to hear that. Her Majesty remains busy today, and is likely to be busy for the foreseeable future.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I am sorry. On consulting her schedule afresh, I see that Her Majesty remains busy, and is likely to be busy for the foreseeable future.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Gossip says Master Stradalla involved himself in certain politically sensitive matters, a mistake I have never cared to commit. Fortunately, Her Majesty can safely rise above such squabbles. Will you take Her Majesty's assignment?");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Her Majesty has a busy social schedule. However, she is known to make time for those who render service to her court. On that topic, will you deliver this dress order for Her Majesty?");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_4_3", "It is possible Her Majesty may grant you an audience very soon. However, you definitely have time beforehand to assist her in this errand. On that topic, what is your decision?");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I have nothing more to tell you. I await your success.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I have nothing more to tell you. I await your success.");
