stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "I am sorry to hear you cannot fulfill the assignment. Please consult with me again when you are able.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "I am sorry to hear you cannot fulfill the assignment. Please consult with me again when you are able.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "I shall relay the news of your assistance to Her Majesty. Unfortunately, the Queen remains occupied. However, please consult with me again for tasks that may assist her.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "The tailor's home was destroyed? Well, that is of course regrettable, but I'm sure Her Majesty will be vexed if this delays her new dress. Though the Queen remains occupied for now, please consult with me again for tasks that may assist her.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Did the poet have some kind of run-in with our friends at COMPNOR? How unfortunate. But that is how those poets are, you know. I thank you for your assistance. Her Majesty has kindly granted you an audience. You may approach the throne.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "What? A royal commission? Well, I never expected that, after fleeing Theed to escape all those blasted Imperial know-nothings. My thanks to Her Majesty.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "A commission from the Queen! And -- let me see -- exceedingly generous! Now I can rebuild my home, after those idiot Imperials blew it up with collateral fire from their last training exercise.");
stringFiles[2078].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "You're not with COMPNOR, right? Those goons have been hunting me since I published a satire of their blunt, bog-stupid attempts to censor local writers. I appreciate Her Majesty's support in this difficult time.");
