stringFiles[2083] = new StringFile("static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("cantwork", "I have matters to discuss with you, once you're no longer occupied on your current assignment.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm not the one you're looking for. Especially if you're ISB.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I'm sorry, you have the wrong Bothan.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "I'm not here to meet with you.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "I'm not the one you're looking for.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "Sorry, you have the wrong person.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "Imperial business. Move along.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("gotowork_3", "I was expecting a datadisc from Pooja Naberrie. Don't you have it?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("next", "Currently we're allocating Resistance resources elsewhere on Naboo. I have no assignments now.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("notit_3", "I was expecting a datadisc from Pooja Naberrie. That isn't it.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("notyet", "Were you sent here by Captain Dallows in Theed? No? Please see him first. It's safest for us to welcome newcomers based on his reference.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Welcome. I'm Pooja Naberrie, a Senator of the Old Republic and leader of the Naboo Resistance against the Empire. We are pressed hard, but we fight hard. We need your help. An Alliance pilot has arrived on Naboo to deliver an urgent message. The Empire downed her ship in the wilderness, but she survived. I ask you to meet her and bring her here safely.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_1_2", "That Alliance pilot you rescued brought important news. None other than Herosk Bal'far, an aide to Mon Mothma herself, has smuggled himself onto Naboo. He's convoking a secret conference here with many local nobles who are quietly sympathetic to the Alliance. It is crucial that Bal'far arrives here safely. Will you escort him?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_1_3", "We are assembling a conclave of Naboo aristocrats who sympathize with the Resistance. One noble has sent her servant to pick up directions and clearance codes. We have arranged a wilderness rendezvous, away from prying Imperial eyes, and would like you to deliver the datadisc to the servant. Will you go?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Our secret conference with sympathetic Naboo nobles is about to begin. Captain Dallows in Theed has sent one of his security officers to Dee'ja Peak as a guard for the meeting, but the officer ran into an Imperial patrol on the way. Our reports indicate he may have been wounded. Please escort the officer here safely.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_1_5", "Trouble. Stormtroopers have arrested Lim Paddu, the local noble whose invitation you delivered a while back. For the moment, they don't know who she is -- they think she's just a suspicious traveller. But once they take her back to the nearest city, High Inquisitor Mal Sikander will identify her and have her executed. Will you rescue Lim and bring her to the conference safely?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_1_6", "We have a crisis. One of the conference participants brought a servant, a man named Melloc Fitzal. It turns out Fitzal was a covert agent for Imperial Security. We screened all transmission devices before the conference, but Fitzal got out undetected and has met an escort of storm commandos in the wilderness. If he gets back to the city alive, the entire Resistance on Naboo will be finished. Assemble a strike team and stop him!");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good. When you find her, Gizda Ramani will speak the recognition code Sensor Beacon. I caution you that Imperial Security is on her trail. May you both return safely.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I knew the Alliance could count on you. Bal'far is a Bothan, middle-aged and heavy-set. He may have attracted Imperial attention, so keep your weapons ready.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Very good. You should leave at once. The meeting will start shortly. Imperial Intelligence agents will certainly want this communiqu");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Good. The RSF officer is named Turon Adala. Use the standard recognition code Tibanna gas.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_2_5", "I'm glad that Lim Paddu has such a capable rescuer. I recommend a small strike team to handle her captors. Good luck!");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_2_6", "I wish you the best of luck. If you're facing as many storm commandos as reports indicate, you'll want to assemble your largest strike team. Good luck!");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I understand that you may fear the danger, but I hope you'll reconsider. We have few agents here, and the pilot's position is grave.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_3_2", "This is a desperate time for the Naboo Resistance. I hoped we could count on you. Please see me if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I'm disappointed. This may sound like a simple delivery, but much rides on the noble's attendance. Let me know if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Would you really walk away from an Alliance member whose life is in immediate danger? I'm very disappointed. Talk to me if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_3_5", "I implore you to reconsider. Lim Paddu's life hangs in the balance. If you change your mind, talk to me again.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_3_6", "I implore you to reconsider. The Naboo Resistance is depending on you. Please talk to me again if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_4_1", "The pilot is Gizda Ramani, a human from Coruscant. I believe she's bringing reports from our infiltrators of Imperial orders of battle for this entire sector. Ramani is an accomplished pilot but only recently joined the Alliance, so we must try not to make her regret it. Will you escort her?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_4_2", "You wouldn't know Bal'far unless you studied the early history of the Alliance. But he was one of Bail Organa's first supporters among the Bothans, and has helped recruit many SpyNet installations to our cause. If he falls here, it will harm our struggle in this entire sector. Will you escort Bal'far?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_4_3", "I fear I must keep the aristocrat's identity secret for now. If you fall into the hands of Imperial Security, the less you know, the better. Will you deliver the datadisc?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_4_4", "We have reports that a small squad of stormtroopers tracked the officer using a domesticated tusk-cat. Our officer downed a few of the troopers before he escaped, but the rest are still out there -- as is the cat. Are you up to this escort mission?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_4_5", "Lim Paddu has quietly supported our Resistance since the beginning, first with funds, later by persuading other aristocrats to our cause. She has a gift for cutting through ideological bickering with practical advice. She told one noble, If you support the Emperor, fine, but you own land on a dozen worlds -- what if he blows them up too? Will you rescue Lim from certain execution?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_4_6", "I have only sketchy information about the escort accompanying Fitzal. I'm told it could be as many as four or five storm commandos, which means you'll need an experienced strike team. Will you destroy the spy and his escort?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "There's nothing more I can tell you. You'll have to get out there and scout out the situation on the ground.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "There's nothing more I can tell you. Please hurry.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "There's nothing more I can tell you. Please hurry.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "There's nothing more I can tell you. Please hurry.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "There's nothing more I can tell you. Please hurry.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "I have no more to tell you, except to wish you luck. Destroy Fitzal before he reaches a city.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "You there! Code sign Sensor Beacon!");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "I hope you're here on Senator Naberrie's business.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Is that the disc for my employer?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Hey you! Tibanna gas! I'm looking for company!");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "Hello! Are you the one Senator Naberrie sent?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "The Rebels are onto us! Attack!");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "That was great work! I hope it isn't like this every day in the Alliance.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "My greatest gratitude to you. I hope our meeting proceeds with somewhat less incident.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "I always loved tusk-cats, until now. Thanks for getting me past that one.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "Ah, looks like you got me to the meeting in time for me to contribute a few choice observations. Thanks very much for saving my life!");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "I hope Captain Dallows knew what he was doing in sending you here. We need all the help we can get, but it's a dangerous posting, and only the strong survive.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Without Herosk Bal'far here, we may have to cancel our meeting. I hope we can salvage the situation.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "This is unfortunate. If our sympathizer fails to attend our meeting, the other nobles may become skittish. I hope we can bring her here.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "It's always sad news when the Resistance loses a fighter. We can't spare any. I hope the meeting will still proceed.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "You didn't rescue Lim Paddu? This is bad luck for the Naboo Resistance. We must look for support elsewhere among the aristocracy. Well, thank you for your efforts.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "You didn't stop the spy? That's very bad. We'll try to activate covert agents within the ISB. It's a major sacrifice, but we must resort to desperate measures.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I'm still waiting for a report on Ramani's current coordinates. I should have them shortly, so consult with me again soon.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I'm expecting Bal'far to relay his coordinates shortly. Talk to me again soon.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "I'm awaiting confirmation that the servant has reached the rendezvous point. Then we'll send the disc. Talk with me again soon.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "I'm expecting the officer to relay his coordinates shortly. Talk to me again soon.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "I'm awaiting new intelligence on Lim Paddu's exact coordinates. Contact me again soon, when I'll know more.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "I have every field agent scouting the countryside, tracking Fitzal's movements. I expect a report of his coordinates shortly. Talk to me again soon.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "I understand. We're all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "I understand. We're all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "I understand. We're all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "I understand. We're all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "I understand. We're all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "I understand. We're all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "I see that Captain Dallows was wise to send you here. I trust this success marks the beginning of a long relationship.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "I appreciate your good work. This conference may prove to be a turning point in the Resistance efforts on Naboo, and we have you to thank.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "I expected good work from you, and I'm happy that you've lived up to all expectations. We'll count on you for future help in tight spots.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Officer Adala has already thanked you, and I'll add my gratitude. Your presence makes me more confident that this meeting with Naboo's nobles will succeed.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "You've brought Lim Paddu! This is excellent news. Our meeting is underway, and her comments will inject an element of practicality that is sorely needed among the aristocracy. Thank you!");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "Thanks to you, the conference ended safely and the parties have left. I offer you my profoundest thanks. One noble left you this token of appreciation for your heroism.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "Thank you! I'll convey this to Madame Paddu right away.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "This is getting too wild. I'm having enough trouble fighting off the animals, and now Imperial Security is on my tail!");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "Your arrival is the first piece of fortunate news I've had today. I suggest we get to Dee'ja Peak with all speed.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "That wasn't the subtlest code-sign I've ever given, but it worked. Let's get to Dee'ja Peak, because I hurt all over. Watch out for a couple of stormtroopers -- I think they're using a tusk-cat to track me.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_takeme_5", "Good thing I memorized the directions and didn't have Pooja's datadisc on me, or the Empire would know all about this secret meeting. I hope you can get me there quickly.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_takeme_6", "");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_work_1", "We're still waiting for the downed pilot, Gizda Ramani. Please bring her here safely.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Haven't you located Herosk Bal'far yet? We need him here urgently.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Have you delivered the datadisc to the noble's servant? I'm counting on you.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Have you not found Officer Adala yet? The Imperials are undoubtedly closing in on him.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_work_5", "Have you not rescued Lim Paddu? Much rides on your success. Please hurry.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("npc_work_6", "Have you not destroyed that spy? We're counting on you, and time is running out!");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("otherescort_1", "I'm not the one you're looking for. Especially if you're ISB.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("otherescort_2", "I'm sorry, you have the wrong Bothan.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("otherescort_3", "I'm not here to meet with you.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("otherescort_4", "I'm not the one you're looking for.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("otherescort_5", "You have the wrong person.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("otherescort_6", "Imperial business. Move along.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_1_3", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_1_4", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_1_5", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_1_6", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_2_1", "No.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_2_2", "No.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_2_3", "No.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_2_4", "No.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_2_5", "No.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_2_6", "No.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_3_1", "Who is the pilot?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_3_2", "Who is Herosk Bal'far?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_3_3", "Who is the noble who's sending her servant?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_3_4", "How strong was this Imperial patrol?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_3_5", "Who is Lim Paddu, and why is she important?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_3_6", "How strong a force is escorting the spy?");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_reset_1", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_reset_2", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_reset_3", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_reset_4", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_reset_5", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_reset_6", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_sorry_3", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_sorry_4", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_sorry_5", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2083].addEntry("player_sorry_6", "I'll keep working on the mission.");

stringFiles[2084] = new StringFile("static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("cantwork", "Hello. I wanted to talk to you about a certain matter, but I see you're busy. See me later.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Mesa not spek wit yousa, sorry. Mesa busy.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I've got nothing to say to you. I'm just seeing the sights.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Are you the one --? No. I think you've got the wrong guy.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Are you, uh --? No, no, you're not. Never mind. I'm waiting for someone else, thanks.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "I am on Imperial business. Remove yourself from the vicinity at once.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "I think you're looking for someone else.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("next", "I'm glad to say that no new crises have erupted, so we don't need help right now. I hope you've talked to the Queen in the palace gazebo.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("notyet", "I have too much on my plate to deal with you right now.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hello. I'm Porro Dolphe, the Queen's pilot. We have a minor problem with a very minor felon. I'm almost embarrassed to mention such an idiotic problem. A Gungan vandal has defaced one of the Queen's space yachts. He coated its crest with what appears to be blarth drool. A probe droid witnessed the act. Can you arrest this dunce?");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Nice to see you again. I'm offering you a job much more important, and more dignified, than that last task you did for me. Someone has stolen a vital supply of liquid metal fuel intended for our advanced starfighters. Tracking beacons show the location of the fuel. Arrest the thief and bring him, her, or it here.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Hello again. You remember that smuggler you apprehended, Wandila Tatmount? She's caused more trouble, and I need your help. One of Tatmount's fellow Corellian smugglers, Hurn Moeda, got left behind in the wilderness after you caught his boss. We intercepted his distress call. Rescue him and bring him here.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Hello again. A delicate matter has arisen. I need help -- discreet help. One of our pilots went out into the wilderness, in plainclothes, to retrieve fuel supplies left by the smuggler you arrested, Wandila Tatmount. The pilot hasn't reported back, and isn't responding to hails. Find out what's going on. If he's in trouble, bring him back safely.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_1_5", "Welcome back. I've got another sensitive matter that I'd prefer to handle outside the usual RSF channels. A corrupt COMPNOR agent, Bardent Lourge, has been shaking down rural settlements for extortion money. I want to avoid overt conflict with the Empire. Could you politely but firmly bring Lourge here?");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_1_6", "I've learned of another problem with delicate political overtones. You recall arresting the smuggler Wandila Tatmount? We released her for reasons that must remain classified. Now she's facing trouble from four or five former members of her gang. Please put together a strike team to rescue her and bring her here.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I copy that. Get the Gungan, and watch out in case he has any friends.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Copy that. Whoever stole that fuel must have had help, so watch out for accomplices. At least this time they won't be Gungans, I hope.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Copy that. I'll arrange a nice prison cell for this smuggler. I hope Tatmount appreciates the trouble you're taking to rescue her friend.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Right. The pilot is Girrin Ancero. If he happens to mention anything odd, he's probably out of his head with delirium, and can safely be ignored. Bring him back safely, assuming he needs help.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Copy that. While you get Lourge, I'll arrange for his quiet processing on this end. Watch out for mercenaries he hires as muscle. Good luck!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_2_6", "Good. I expect you'll need a small strike team to take out Tatmount's former gang members. They're skilled marksmen. Be careful.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Right, I don't blame you. This isn't the kind of job that brings honor for a soldier.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_3_2", "All right, it was worth a try. We'll find someone else, thanks.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_3_3", "All right. I must admit I'm disappointed, after your earlier help.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_3_4", "All right. I hope you'll keep a polite silence on this matter, at least until we've rescued the pilot.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_3_5", "Sorry to hear that, after all you've done for us. But I recognize that it's a politically sensitive matter.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_3_6", "All right, I understand. At this point maybe it's best that you practice your skills elsewhere.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_4_1", "The Gungans occasionally protest human incursions into their sacred places. Seems to me using drool for the protest makes for confused symbolism, but who understands Gungans? Now, about the job --");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_4_2", "According to our probe droid images, we think the thief is one Wandila Tatmount, a Corellian smuggler. We're withholding definite identification pending her apprehension. Are you interested in the job?");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_4_3", "His transmission was choppy, but it seems he's run into some of our colorful native wildlife. That's one thing about these smugglers -- many of them are city types. So, can you work this rescue mission?");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_4_4", "I don't -- I really couldn't say why Ancero was out of uniform. Maybe he meant to go sightseeing, after he retrieved -- Well, anyway! What about the mission? Interested?");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_4_5", "We've gained permission from COMPNOR itself to treat this as a civilian criminal case. They don't want publicity abaout Lourge's crimes, any more than we do. I'll have Lourge taken to the palace police for civilian trial. That is, if you'll apprehend him --?");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_4_6", "It turns out Wandila Tatmount has become a procurement specialist for the Rebel Alliance. Now, I'm not looking for a political argument. I just need her brought here safely, and I need you to trust me that you're doing the right thing. Will you do it?");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "That's all I can tell you now. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "That's all I can tell you now. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "That's all I can tell you now. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "That's all I can tell you now. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "That's all I can tell you now. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "That's all I can tell you now. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Aoo! Issa cops!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "It's the RSF! Fire!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Help me! I'm Hurn Moeda!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Get me away from these vigilante settlers! They think I'm a smuggler!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "I'm Bardent Lourge. What business do you have with me?");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "Hey, Rebel guy! Over here!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "Mesa goin' up de swamp-stream for longo time, mesa thinkin'.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "Well, I said I was seeing the sights, and that was a lot to see. You watch -- I'll be out of here in no time.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "Okay! As soon as I'm out of custody, I'm heading to the nearest starport and off this crazy world!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "At last my brain is clearing. Lieutenant, those fumes made me rave about the craziest things -- Rebels and whatnot. Fortunately, I think my rescuer recognizes senseless delirium.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "I say again, this insult will not stand. You will all incur the Empire's wrath!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "All right, time to get off this world and past a few Imperial blockades. That's when I really feel alive.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You didn't get the Gungan vandal? Well, that's pretty -- well -- tell you what, I won't tell anyone. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Couldn't find Tatmount? Well, those smugglers are slippery. We'll keep trying.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "Couldn't bring in Moeda? All right, we'll keep looking. Check back later.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Couldn't bring in Ancero? All right, we'll keep looking. Check back later.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "Didn't feel up to arresting an Imperial officer? I don't blame you. We'll have to find a delicate solution to this problem.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "You didn't get Tatmount? Well, all right. We'll try sending out a larger team for our next attempt.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I copy that. Now, the Gungan is located at -- hmm -- I don't seem to have his coordinates right now. Check with me later.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I copy that. Now, Tatmount is located at -- hmm -- I don't seem to have her coordinates right now. Check with me later.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "I copy that. Now, Moeda is located at -- hmm -- I don't seem to have his coordinates right now. Check with me later.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "I copy that. Now, Ancero is located at -- hmm -- I don't seem to have his coordinates right now. Check with me later.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "I copy that. Now, Lourge is located at -- hmm -- I don't seem to have his coordinates right now. Check with me later.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "I copy that. Now, Tatmount is located at -- hmm -- I don't seem to have her coordinates right now. Check with me later.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Very well. I hope you'll return when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Very well. I hope you'll return when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Very well. I hope you'll return when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Very well. I hope you'll return when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "Very well. I hope you'll return when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "Very well. I hope you'll return when you're ready.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Thanks. Here's a small reward for your trouble. If you want me to keep your role in this matter quiet, I understand perfectly.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Thanks. Now it falls to me to persuade this smuggler to look at brighter career options. Wish me luck!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Thanks again. I expect Moeda's boss, Wandila Tatmount, will see from this that we can be trusted. What? Why do I want a smuggler to trust me? Oh -- never mind, just rambling. Check back if you want more work.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Look at this poor man! He needs medical help at once! Ignore his crazed ravings. Here's your reward. We can work together again, I hope -- assuming you recognize the importance of discretion.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "I'm glad you weren't squeamish about bringing in an Imperial official. If you're up for other delicate matters of that kind, check back with me soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "Excellent work. I think you've shown a willingness to undertake delicate missions. Her Majesty may wish to reward you. I suggest you meet her in the palace gazebo. I'm sending the coordinates to your datapad. Good luck!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "Awaoo! Yousa got me. My goin' long quietly. (Stupid queenie.)");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "I don't know anything about any fuel. I'm just seeing the sights. I'll go quietly, but wait 'til I get a lawyer!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "What evil place is this planet? Just let me get back safe to friendly old Corellia!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "Thanks. I sent Tatmount's fuel off to the Alliance. We've got to -- wait. Are you, uh --? Argh, the delirium! It's eating my brain! I don't know what weird stuff I'm saying!");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_takeme_5", "You dare to arrest me, even as I investigate Rebel smuggling? What effrontery! I shall go quietly, but this insult will incur the Empire's harshest justice.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_takeme_6", "You took your sweet time showing up! I hope you Alliance people are more punctual about payment than about rescues.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_work_1", "I see you're still at work. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_work_2", "I see you're still at work. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_work_3", "I see you're still at work. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_work_4", "I see you're still at work. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_work_5", "I see you're still at work. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("npc_work_6", "I see you're still at work. I hope you'll report results soon.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("otherescort_1", "Mesa not spek wit yousa, sorry. Mesa busy.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("otherescort_2", "I've got nothing to say to you. I'm just seeing the sights.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("otherescort_3", "Are you the one --? No. I think you've got the wrong guy.");
stringFiles[2084].addEntry("otherescort_4", "Are you, uh --? No, no, you're not. Never mind. I'm waiting for someone else, thanks.");
