stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Are you the Queen's emissary? Over here!");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Are you the Queen's emissary? Over here, at once!");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Did the Queen send you? I'd like to leave, now!");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "Thank you, friend. My Queen, I stand ready to groom your steed to a high gloss. These nara berries will give him abundant vigor.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You have not brought our makeup kit? Oh, catastrophe! Can no one fulfill this simple request?");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You did not deliver our message? Oh, calamity! Can no one fulfill this simple request?");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You did not bring us Tedric? Oh, what a nuisance! Can no one fulfill this simple request?");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Now, where was the camp where we misplaced that kit? Ah, we have forgotten. Return later, and we shall certainly have recalled by then.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Very well. Now, where did we put that message --? Oh dear, it seems to be misplaced. Consult with us again soon, when all will be well.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Very well. Now, wherever did Tedric say he would go? We cannot recall just now. Return to us later, and all will be well.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "As you wish. Please return when you feel ready to undertake our task.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "As you wish. Please return when you feel ready to undertake our task.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "As you wish. Please return when you feel ready to undertake our task.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "As you wish. Please return when you feel ready to undertake our task.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "As you wish. Please return when you feel ready to undertake our task.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "As you wish. Please return when you feel ready to undertake our task.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Splendid! We may proceed with our duties. Accept this small token of our thanks. You may also make yourself available for further service to the court.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "We are relieved to see proper protocol effected. It would not do to anger an Imperial general, would it? Please take this token of our thanks. You may also make yourself available for further service to the court.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "To your work, Tedric! Roistering Spirit awaits your ministrations. As for you, friend of the court, please accept this token of our great gratitude. You may go now.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "At last! I was unavoidably detained when the local wildlife went berserk, for no reason that I can see. Perhaps you will have the courage to carry this makeup kit to the Queen.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "The Queen wouldn't attend, eh? A remarkably sensible decision by our vacuous monarch. The wildlife here has seemingly gone berserk.");
stringFiles[2085].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
