stringFiles[2089] = new StringFile("static_npc/naboo/ric_olie");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("cantwork", "I don't want to distract you from your current mission. Please see me once it's finished.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Sorry, friend, I'm waiting for somebody else.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I don't believe we have business to conduct.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Don't worry about me. I'm just waiting for somebody.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "I don't know you, and I don't need to know you.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("next", "We have those pirates on the run for now, but they always seem to come back. I may need your help again one day.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("notit_1", "Are you sure you meant to give me this? I was expecting the pirate activity reports.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("notyet", "I'm late for something.  Can I talk to you later?");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I'm Captain Ric Olie. I used to be the Queen's pilot long ago, but now I track pirate activity. Are you looking for work? I'm a little short-handed at present. I know it's not terribly glamorous, but I need somebody to pick up some reports I've been expecting. How about it?");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I appreciate your help with that last bit of business. I'm actually still short-handed if you have time for more work. How about bringing me a pirate lackey? I want you to arrest a certain lowlife and bring him back to face the Queen's justice. Will you do it?");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I'm really glad to see you -- I'm in a bind. You remember my friend Jamel? Some pirates are after him, and I need someone to save him. Will you?");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_1_4", "I'm glad you're here! An emergency has come up, and you're one of the few I can count on. Those twisted pirates have hired some maniac to blow up the starport. If we don't stop him, thousands of people will die. Please help me save them.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good. Go and meet Jamel Luffa, a pilot friend of mine, and he'll give you what I need. Oh, and watch yourself -- my last courier vanished.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_2_2", "If I had a few more like you, I could work wonders. His name is Jutsor Delin. Bring him back alive; maybe I can get some useful information out of him.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_2_3", "You're a lifesaver -- at least I hope you are. Please find him quickly. The longer it takes, the more likely something terrible will happen.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_2_4", "My informants tell me it was a Rodian named Deelio Doln who took this assignment. Stop him. Do whatever you have to. He's extremely dangerous, so please be careful.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I'm sorry you're not interested. I could really use the help.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I guess you're not the confrontational type. I'll find someone else to handle this.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_3_3", "If you think you'll fail this mission, that's probably a wise decision. Now if you'll excuse me, I need to find someone who can save my friend.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_3_4", "No? You won't help prevent the loss of thousands of lives? I must have greatly misjudged you.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_4_1", "These are reports of pirate activity across Naboo. I suspect the Corporate Sector Authority is involved in this piracy, and I'm hoping these reports will give me some leads. Will you get them?");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_4_2", "This sleemo has been posing as a mining guild representative and then selling the information to his pirate cohorts. Will you bring him in?");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Obviously the pirates have caught on that he's working for me. He's in grave danger. Please help him.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_4_4", "They want to cripple Naboo's starfighter corps and kill many of the officials who don't play along with them. Please stop this madness.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Um -- were you going to get those reports for me?");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "So were you going to do this job or did you change your mind.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Are you going to save Jamel?");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Are you going to stop that Rodian? Go!");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Did the Captain send you?");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Are you looking at me? What are you looking at me for? I hope you're not looking at me.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Hey! Over here!");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Let's kill him. We can blow up the starport later.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "This is ridiculous. I'm an honest guild representative.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "Thanks again. You're a lifesaver.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You couldn't bring those reports to me? Maybe I can arrange to get another copy.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "I guess I still need to find somebody to bring this lowlife to justice.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You weren't able to rescue him? Poor Jamel.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Oh, no. I hope the Royal Security Force can stop that fiend before it's too late.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I'll have to delay this pickup for a short time while I attend to another matter. Come see me again in a little while.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "As soon as we locate him I'll send you after him. See me in a while, and by then I'll know where he is.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Jamel will contact us when he has a safe place to hide. See me soon and we should know where he is.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "I need a few minutes to make preparations on my end. Check back soon and we'll get started.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "If you can't handle this right now, I completely understand. Try me again after you pick up some training.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "If you can't handle this right now, I completely understand. Try me again after you pick up some training.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "If you can't handle this right now, I completely understand. Try me again after you pick up some training.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "If you can't handle this right now, I completely understand. Try me again after you pick up some training.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "If you can't handle this right now, I completely understand. Try me again after you pick up some training.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reset_6", "If you can't handle this right now, I completely understand. Try me again after you pick up some training.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Someone tried to stop you, did they? I must be getting closer than I realized. Good work.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "I'm impressed with your work. See me again later. I'm sure I can find something else for you to do.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Thank you for saving Jamel. I knew you wouldn't fail me.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "You've done the people on Naboo a great service and saved a lot of lives. Thank you.");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "");
stringFiles[2089].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "");
