stringFiles[2090].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Oh my. I'm sorry, you've arrived at a distracting time. Actually, perhaps you might help. It appears our offworld tour group from Duzay has gone astray from their scheduled nature walk. They've left behind their signal finder to guide them back here. The wilderness is dangerous. Please deliver the signal finder to the group leader.");
stringFiles[2090].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Ah, welcome. Again you've arrived at a confused time. A tourist from the Duzay group is lost. He went looking for Naboo herbs, because he's an herbalist. Please bring him back here -- er, if you will --?");
stringFiles[2090].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Oh, dear, it's been a never-ending series of calamities today. Just before you got here, we sent out another adventurer to look for the lost tour group. Please go and find him.");
stringFiles[2090].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2090].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2090].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2090].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Ah, splendid. I shall remain here. Please report back after you've delivered the signal finder to the guide.");
stringFiles[2090].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Excellent.  I shall wait here for your return.");
