stringFiles[2091].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("notyet", "I can't talk now.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_1_1", "It wasn't my fault! The technique is still poorly under-- What? You're not the ISB? Oh good! I need your help with a, ah, minor emergency. I'm a scientist researching mind control for the Empire. It didn't quite work. A number of test subjects think they're the Emperor. It's hard to explain. One has gone into the wilderness to scout locations for his new Emperor's Retreat. Will you please go out and rescue him?");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Ah, you! I have another trifling matter involving a test subject who seems to have reacted unpredictably to my mind control experiment. This one, too, believes he's the Emperor.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Apparently a local troublemaker has decided to humiliate the Empire by apprehending the third test subject and hauling him to the Rebellion. This would reveal the mind-control experiments. High Inquisitor Mal Sikander decrees that this cannot happen. Stop the young troublemaker and rescue the test subject.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good, good! Bring me the Devaronian B'Dayne Wallamoll. He's actually a chef, I think, and not the Emperor at all.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Fine! Bring me the Sullustan Gnool Noob. He's an artisan, so when he claims to be the Emperor, don't you believe him!");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Good! Bring me the Ithorian droid engineer Noolawaw Laoo. I think everyone is aware that our beloved Emperor is not an Ithorian, so you needn't fear confusion if you happen to run into the actual Emperor.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Given the trifling nature of the task, I would have thought you'd show common courtesy. Well, I shall find someone else.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_3_2", "It seems to me that letting this poor subject die out there in the wilderness shows a certain lack of respect for our beloved Emperor.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_3_3", "It seems to me that letting this poor subject die out there in the wilderness shows a certain lack of respect for our beloved Emperor.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Evidently the subject plans to use the Retreat to raise pets to give to small children. As we all know, our beloved Emperor loves children and pets. Well, will you carry out this minor task?");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_4_2", "He's travelling to an imaginary Imperial installation to command his subjects to rebuild Alderaan, which as we all know was tragically destroyed by Rebel treachery. I hope you'll undertake this trivial rescue?");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_4_3", "I'm told it's a down-at-heels Theed youth named Dinni Dusko. He's apparently the typical angry young man eager to lash out at anyone in authority. I expect that once my mind-control efforts succeed, we can avoid such aggravation in the future. Well, what is your choice?");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I've told you everything you need to know. Please head out now.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I've told you everything you need to know. Please head out now.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "I've told you everything you need to know. Please head out now.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Welcome, my young apprentice! All is proceeding exactly as I planned!");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "To me, my young apprentice! Hahaha!");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Welcome, young apprentice! I have been expecting you!");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "Soon all children across the galaxy will have gnorts! Everything is proceeding as I have foreseen! Hahahaha!");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "Soon -- soon -- the very galaxy itself will celebrate the return of Alderaan! All will love me! Hahahahaha!");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "Your work here is finished, my servant. Go to your home and await further orders. Hahahahahahaha!");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Was this minor chore beyond your abilities? Dear me, I hope I can find someone more capable next time.");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Was this minor chore beyond your abilities? Dear me, I hope I can find someone more capable next time.");
