stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Good, good! Bring me the Sullustan Gnool Noob at these coordinates -- umm -- oh. Well, I seem to have lost track of him. No matter, a mere trifle! I'll have the coordinates soon. Look in again!");
stringFiles[2091].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Good, good! Bring me the Ithorian Noolawaw Laoo at these coordinates -- umm -- oh. Well, I seem to have lost track of him. No matter, a mere trifle! I'll have the coordinates soon. Look in again!");
