stringFiles[2092].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2092].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Well, Slesher must be important -- after all, so many important people come to see him. With all his carousing, he must have trouble getting any work done. My friend might help him keep track of his work. Anyway, are you interested in this escort job?");
