stringFiles[2094] = new StringFile("static_npc/naboo/vana_sage");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("cantwork", "You have a previous obligation. See me when you're free of other employment.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I don't know who you're looking for, but I know you're not looking for me.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I'm hiding from the Gungans. Don't tell them you've seen me.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "No idea who you are.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("next", "I don't have any jobs for you right now. Check back with me later. ");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("notit_1", "This isn't a proper permit or credits. Try again.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("notit_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("notit_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("notyet", "I'm too busy for you right now.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I'm Vana Sage, second in command of security here in Keren. If you need some credits, I'm very short-handed right now. A Rodian pilot just landed, and I need someone to check his cargo permits. Interested?");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Gungan raiders just attacked a transport, and the captain barely escaped with his life. Would you find Captain Vanool and escort him back to us? ");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_1_3", "We know now why those Gungans raiders were so eager to catch Captain Vanool. One of the Gungans he landed on was their leader. Since they're raiders, we'd like you to destroy their hideout. Thanks to Captain Vanool's happy accident, we know exactly where it is. Think you're up to it?");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_1_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_1_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_1_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Good. He landed out in a rural area, so you'll have to meet him outside of the city. See me once you've obtained his permits or collected the fine.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Great. Go to these coordinates, where he was last located. The Gungans are still after him, so you'll want to be careful.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Good for you. Be cautious in your approach. We're not sure how many raiders are left.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_2_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_2_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Enjoy your stay in Keren.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I hope you're never chased by Gungans and left out on your own.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_3_3", "If you're too busy, I guess you should be on your way.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_3_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_3_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Then you'd have to collect a fine. I wouldn't worry about that, though. These pilots know to keep their noses clean on Naboo -- or snouts clean, in the case of Rodians.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Who knows why Gungans do anything they do? Perhaps the ship flew too near a sacred place on a holy day. Maybe the ship landed on a Gungan by accident. I really couldn't say.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_4_3", "If you mean, Does he find Gungan raider camps? -- never before, to my knowledge. But if you mean land on people -- well, not often.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_4_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_4_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Were you going to collect that fine -- I mean, check those permits?");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Was there something else you needed? If not, get going.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Did you change your mind about taking out that raider camp?");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_backtowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Awww, not another customs inspector.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "You're finally here. Yes!");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_breech_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "I appreciate your getting me back to town. I'll be more careful about who I land on in the future.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_dropoff_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "How unfortunate. I may have to handle this personally. ");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "These things happen sometimes.  I'm sorry if it was too rough for you.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "Disappointing. Perhaps I'll send out a strike team to take care of this.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_failure_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I need to double-check the pilot's coordinates. Would you mind coming back in a few minutes? I should have the information by then.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I'm waiting for him to check back in and give us his exact coordinates. Come back and see me in a while. He should have called us by then.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "I need to track down the captain and get the exact coordinates. See me in a while and we can get started.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "If the job is too hard for you right now, see me later when it might be a bit easier.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "If the job is too hard for you right now, see me later when it might be a bit easier.");
stringFiles[2094].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "If the job is too hard for you right now, see me later when it might be a bit easier.");
