stringFiles[2099] = new StringFile("static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_indintra_imbru_yerevan");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("cant_work", "Oh dear. I'd planned to offer you a small job, but I see you're busy. How vexing.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm sorry, you have the wrong person.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I'm afraid you have the wrong person.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("gotowork_1", "I expected you to bring me a suggestion of some kind from Indintra Imbru Yerevan. Don't you have it?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("gotowork_2", "I expected you to bring me an invitation from Indintra Imbru Yerevan to the Great Conversation debate. Don't you have it?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("next", "I'm happy to say that all our preparations for the Great Conversation debate are gelling nicely. I need nothing from you right now.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("notyet", "Too busy to talk now.  Try me again later.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Darling, everyone who is anyone will be attending the next Great Conversation debate -- including, I'm told, that nasty Narmle scholar Ingon Lakbo. His attendance would be disastrous, simply disastrous. Would you kindly deliver this suggestion to a dear friend that might lure Mr. Lakbo away from the debate?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_1_2", "My plans are proceeding nicely for the next Great Conversation debate. Now that Ingon Lakbo has declined to support that rabble in Narmle, I expect their next choice will be a philosopher named Bieque Lozan-Lippid. I believe I can counter his influence with your help. Will you deliver this invitation?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I knew you'd help. You must deliver this into the hands of Briska Gil, my dear friend and a close acquaintance of Ingon Lakbo. Now don't be giving it to any foolish protocol droid, but to Briska in person!");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Fine. Deliver this invitation into Shaultra Loraweet's hands, and on no account be distracted by any pesky protocol droids.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Well, what a vexing figure you are then. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_3_2", "After you proved so helpful before, I expected more of you. Goodbye.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Honestly, it's quite innocent -- I'm simply suggesting to a friend we hold in common, Briska Gil, that Briska could invite Ingon Lakbo to a must-attend dinner party coinciding with the debate. Ingon is hardly the ideal dinner guest -- always pontificating about what is reality? -- but it would be a sacrifice in a good cause. Will you deliver my innocent suggestion?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_4_2", "I am inviting Bieque Lozan-Lippid's former paramour, Shaultra Loraweet, to take part in the debate on behalf of Restuss. Shaultra and Bieque parted on bad terms, and I expect her presence will cause Bieque much distraction. In the best case, he might even make a scene and be summarily ejected. Will you deliver this invitation to Shaultra?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_5_1", "Restuss and Narmle, which are what I suppose you'd call friendly rivals, hold debates every so often between the cities' finest minds. Victory for Restuss will prove our superiority over that rabble in Narmle.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_5_2", "Restuss and Narmle, which are what I suppose you'd call friendly rivals, hold debates every so often between the cities' finest minds. Victory for Restuss will prove our superiority over that rabble in Narmle.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I would have hoped you'd deliver that suggestion to Briska Gil by now.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Really, I've told you all you need to know. I wish you'd deliver that invitation to Shaultra.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Hello? Did Indintra Yerevan send you?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Hello! Do you have an invitation for me from Indintra Yerevan?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You could not deliver a simple suggestion? Really, you vex me beyond words.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You couldn't deliver that simple invitation? How very vexing you are.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "Bieque and I had a romantic relationship, but we parted in heated argument about the immanence of evil. I still resent his acidic innuendo regarding my intellectual capacity. I look forward to the chance to correct him at the debate.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "Bieque has notions about the nature of identity and reality that are, to my mind, unsustainable by a more insightful intellect. I imagine that my pointed deflation of his absurd notion will raise his blood pressure.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Fine, fine. I'm waiting for Briska Gil to assent to my suggestion for rendezvous coordinates. Talk to me again in a few moments.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I'm waiting for Shaultra to arrange a suitable rendezvous for the delivery. Talk to me again in a moment.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Why can you not take care of this simple task? Really, you vex me, you really do.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Why can you not take care of this simple task? Really, you vex me, you really do.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "I'm so glad you delivered that invitation. Here, take some money. I have another little job for you, if you want it.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Splendid. I can hardly wait to see the look of appalled affront on Bieque's face when he sees his paramour at the debate. He won't retain the intellectual capacity of a frightened borgle.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Hmm -- Ingon is such a talker; he really is rather tedious at the dining table. But I suppose I should aid Indintra -- she'll owe me dearly for this one. Now let me see about assembling a suitable guest list for this party... (*Briska's voice fades while mumbling what sounds like a list of names*).");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "Well, if Bieque Lozan-Lippid will be at the Great Conversation debate, I certainly will attend. I have much to address with Bieque.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Really, I've told you enough already. Please deliver my little suggestion to Briska Gil.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("npc_work_2", "I wish you'd deliver that invitation to Shaultra. Time is short.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("otherescort_2", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_2_1", "No.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_2_2", "No.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_3_1", "What is the suggestion you're making that might lure Lakbo away?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_3_2", "How will this invitation counter the philosopher's influence in the debate?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_4_1", "What is the Great Conversation debate?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_4_2", "What is The Great Conversation debate?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_more_1_2", "Why is it important to you that Bieque Lozan-Lippid is attending?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_more_2_2", "What will you say at The Great Conversation debate?");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_reset_1", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_reset_2", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "Return to Indintra Imbru Yerevan.");
stringFiles[2099].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_2", "Return to Indintra Imbru Yerevan.");
