stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Give me time to track down Odoof and find out where he wants to meet you. See me in a little while. ");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Give me time to figure out his position. See me in a few minutes -- I should know by then.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "The Imperial courier will contact us with the waypoint. See me in a while.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "I need to clear you with the Royal Security Force before I send you in. Come back in a while and we should be ready.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Very well. See me again when you think you're ready.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Very well. See me again when you think you're ready.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Very well. See me again when you think you're ready.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Very well. See me again when you think you're ready.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "I'm so excited to have found such a talented artist. I just wish he wasn't such a recluse.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "These events to promote tourism never go as smoothly as you hope. I really appreciate your help with all of this.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "I can't wait to hear who wins. The Imperial Arts Grant is a prestigious award.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "The Moff will be pleased to hear that you rescued his nephew. Well done!");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Tis bein' too crowded 'round here. Mesa no wantin' to be wit all da stinkowiff outlaunders. ");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "I'll take this to the judges immediately. Don't try to follow me -- their location is classified.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "I'm glad to see you. I was starting to wonder if you'd gotten lost too.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "That maniac wanted to kill me just because he didn't get the grant. What a sore loser.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Haven't you picked up that painting yet? ");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_work_2", "These events to promote tourism never go as smoothly as you hope. I really appreciate your help with all of this.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Haven't you made that delivery yet? The judges are waiting. ");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("npc_work_4", "You are going to go rescue him aren't you? If something happens to him because you waited, it would be just dreadful.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("otherescort_2", "I'm kind of lost. You must be looking for somebody else.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("otherescort_3", "");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("otherescort_4", "Who are you looking for? No, I'm sorry. That's not me.");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes");
stringFiles[2100].addEntry("player_1_3", "Yes");
