stringFiles[2101] = new StringFile("static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_oxil_sarban");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("cant_work", "I really could use your help once you aren't quite so busy.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I am not the one you are looking for.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I'm not waiting for you, friend.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("gotowork_1", "Shouldn't you be leaving?");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("gotowork_2", "You should be going.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("next", "I believe the Narmle Arts Gala is currently under control. If anything goes amiss, I'll keep you in mind.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("notit_1", "I was expecting a presentation for our Arts Gala from a particular rising artist. That isn't it. ");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("notit_2", "I was hoping to get a collection of diverse alien artifacts for our Arts Gala. That is't what I expected.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("notyet", "Sorry, I'm a little busy...");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hello! I am Minister of Arts for the Narmle government. In this crucially important position, at this crucially important time of our Narmle Arts Gala, I have commissioned a holo presentation from a rising artist. It will certainly show up that imitative Restuss Arts Jubilee for the tone-deaf debacle it customarily is. Will you pick it up and bring it here?");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Our Narmle Arts Gala had bad luck with that so-called rising artist whose insane screechings you brought to me. To remedy our ruined schedule, I called in a favor and asked to exhibit a friend's collection of rare alien artifacts. My friend sent them, but the cargo lifter went off course and has broken down Can you pick up the artifacts from the driver?");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Excellent. Being rather eccentric, this artist lives in the wilderness, and looks rather unusual. Be careful on your journey.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good. I expect you'll find the cargo at these coordinates. Please hurry!");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I am sorry you can't help. This festival is a busy time for me.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I'm sorry your commitment to the Narmle Arts Gala appears weaker than I hoped. You haven't been subverted by those Restuss Jubilee people, I hope.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_4_1", "I believe I'd best keep the name a secret, lest news leak out and spoil what should be a sensation. Those Restuss Jubilee people would die to steal away our prize catch. Please don't tell anyone about your assignment!");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_4_2", "These alien art objects represent traditions from worlds across the galaxy. I believe there is some unifying theme, but I don't know what it is. The collection's descriptions should make all clear. Can you pick it up?");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Have you not brought back that presentation yet? Our Narmle Arts Gala audience will be agog when they finally see it.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Have you picked up that collection of artifacts? Our Arts Gala is waiting.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Ah! You are here looking for the presentation from me?");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Hey! Are you from that Arts Minister?");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Did you not bring back that presentation? Our Arts Gala audience will never know the pleasure they missed.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You didn't bring that collection of alien artifacts? Well, perhaps that is for the best -- Imperial citizens are suspicious of such things.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "Now I present a selection of sweet-toned Chadra Fan heart-splitter wailing serenades. Take it please to Oxil.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I'm awaiting a contact from the artist shortly, giving the coordinates for the rendezvous. Check with me in a few moments.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "The driver of the stranded cargolifter will relay coordinates to me shortly. Check with me soon.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Very well. I hope you'll remember the importance of furthering the arts in Narmle -- as opposed to Restuss.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Very well. I hope you'll remember the importance of furthering the arts in Narmle -- as opposed to Restuss.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "What? What is this foul caterwauling? I can't play this noise -- our Arts Gala would become a laughingstock in Restuss! Well, I shall pay you, but I believe I'll cross a certain artist off my list of future contributors.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "What? Grains of dust? I have no way to display a pinch of artistic dust! This is sheer flummery! Whatever shall my Arts Gala do? This is somehow the work of those Restuss Jubilee fiends.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Ah! I am most excited! In a fit of inspiration I have revised my promised presentation of the Empire's finest military marches. Yes! It is now revised.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "Here's that collection of alien artifacts. I carried them as far as I could -- good thing they're light. They're all carved dust grains -- need quite a magnification to see them.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_work_1", "I really don't know what else I can tell you. Please bring me the presentation.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("npc_work_2", "I don't know what else I can tell you, really. Please pick up the collection of artifacts as soon as possible.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("otherescort_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_2_1", "No.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_2_2", "No.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_3_1", "Who is this rising artist?");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_3_2", "What sort of artifacts?");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_4_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "What is your revised presentation?");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_reset_1", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_reset_2", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "Ok.  I'll get back to work.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "Narmle's Arts Minister, awaiting delivery of a presentation for the Narmle Arts Festival sent by a rising artist.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_2", "The Narmle Arts Minister is expecting a collection of alien artifacts for the Narmle Arts Gala.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "Oxil Sarban");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_2", "Oxil Sarban");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "A promising artist with a presentation sought by Narmle's Arts Minister, Oxil Sarban, for the Narmle Arts Festival.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("waypoint_description_2", "Here is a collection of alien artifacts for the Narmle Arts Minister, Oxil Sarban, and his Narmle Arts Gala.");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Rising Artist");
stringFiles[2101].addEntry("waypoint_name_2", "Alien Artifact Collection");

stringFiles[2102] = new StringFile("static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_sidoras_bey");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("cant_work", "You already have a job. I can't just go hiring people who already have jobs. It would be anarchy, I tell you. See me if you get fired.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm just here to drop off something to someone else. Don't worry about me.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "This probably isn't the healthiest place for you to be. ");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("next", "Oh yes, you were the one I hired a few years back -- or was it weeks? Didn't I fire you? No. Wait. That was that Jawa. It's been nice chatting with you. See me again some time.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("notit_1", "You're supposed to give me a disc from the arts committee. What is this thing?");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("notyet", "Sorry, can't talk now.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Are you the one the agency sent over to run my errands for me? Speak up! I don't have all day. I'm supposed to announce the winner of some competition, and I need somebody to pick up the announcement of who won. Will you do it, or do I need to find somebody else?");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_1_2", "My blasted fool of a daughter -- or is it my son? -- has gotten into trouble. One of them has a gambling problem and has fallen afoul of some hoodlums. If these ruthless crooks aren't paid, one of them will get hurt. Would you go and save whichever one of them got into this mess?");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_2_1", "You must be an art lover to do something this dull. I suppose I'll have to pay you. Meet the courier and bring me back the name of this no-talent guttersnipe.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_2_2", "My daughter -- or was it my son? -- well, one of them was going on a nature walk. Find whichever of them it was and bring him back here -- or her -- before those hooligans get hold of, of, whoever it is.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Why are you wasting my time?");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_3_2", "What do you mean, no? How can you just leave my child, whichever it is, to those criminals?");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_4_1", "A contest to see which talentless young boob can make a prettier holo than the other, or some such nonsense. Modern art, bah! Can't stand any of it. This Arts Gala is all a sham. So were you going to do this for me or not? ");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_4_2", "I wasn't born this old, you know. You young people think you invented fun. Are you going to rescue my son or not? Or was it my daughter? I can never keep track of who's who anymore.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Were you going to do this or not?");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "What do you want now? I've told you as much as I can remember.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "I was beginning to think they'd forgotten to send someone.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Did my father send you with the ransom money?");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "Thanks for rescuing me from those goons. I've learned my lesson.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "I guess I'll have to hire somebody else to find out who won this silly competition.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Who did I send you to find? Oh well, it probably wasn't that important.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "How should I know where you're supposed to meet him? I'll call someone and find out where he is. Why do I always have to do everything myself? Be back in a little while.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Let me find out where that nature walk was going to take place. See me in a while. Maybe I can even figure out which one of my children it was.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "You think you can just give up? -- Well, that's true. But you should finish what you start! It helps keep you regular!");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "You think you can just give up? -- Well, that's true. But you should finish what you start! It helps keep you regular!");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "You think you can just give up? -- Well, that's true. But you should finish what you start! It helps keep you regular!");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "What do you mean, pay you? You haven't even left yet. Oh, the disc -- How did it get to be this late? ");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Is that my son or my daughter? My eyes aren't what they used to be.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "I've got your disc right here. Safe travels, friend.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "I can't believe he forgot to send the ransom. Next time I'd better ask my mother for help.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Have you picked up the disk with the winner yet? I'm not getting any younger.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Were you going to make that rescue soon?");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("otherescort_2", "This probably isn't the healthiest place for you to be. ");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_2_1", "No");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_2_2", "No");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_3_1", "What competition is this?");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_3_2", "You have a son? You've got to be kidding.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_4_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_reset_1", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_reset_2", "Can I do something else and come back to this later?");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "Forgot what I was doing.  I'll get back to work.");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "Return to Sidoras Bey with the disc");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_2", "Return to Sidoras Bey with Silaras Bey");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "Sidoras Bey");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_2", "Sidoras Bey");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "Go meet the courier and pick up the disc with the name of the art contest winner");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("waypoint_description_2", "Go and rescue Silaras Bey ");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "The courier's location");
stringFiles[2102].addEntry("waypoint_name_2", "Silaras Bey's location");

stringFiles[2103] = new StringFile("static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_sindra_lintikoor");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("cant_work", "If you're interested in Rori's Great Conversation debate, talk to me when you're less busy.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I am certain you have the wrong person.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "You definitely have the wrong person.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("gotowork_1", "Shouldn't you be going?");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("gotowork_2", "The Minister, Sindra Lintikoor, told me you'd have an invitation for me. Don't you?");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("next", "I believe the Great Conversation debate is shaping up according to plan -- at least for now. I don't have anything else to keep you busy. But thanks for your help.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("notit_1", "I expected you to bring me a datadisc with Ingon Lakbo's response to my invitation. This isn't it.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("notyet", "Sorry, too busy to talk.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Good day. I am Minister of Education for Narmle. For the upcoming Great Conversation debate between Narmle's leading scholars and those of Restuss, I've invited the illustrious thinker Ingon Lakbo. Would you be so kind as to pick up his response?");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I'm glad you're looking for another assignment. Ingon Lakbo's curt refusal to participate in our Great Conversation debate with Restuss means that I can now invite Ingon's bitter rival in his stead. Will you deliver the invitation?");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_2_1", "I look forward to getting Lakbo's response to my invitation. His is a fine mind, and his participation an asset to our debate.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good. I'll look forward to your report of success, and then to Bieque's attendance at our debate.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_3_1", "That's a disappointment, but I understand. Let me know if you change your mind.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_3_2", "After your earlier help, I was hoping for more. Well, I hope you'll change your mind.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_4_1", "The two towns on Rori, Narmle and Restuss, stage frequent debates between their intellectuals. Victory validates the winner's superiority. It's Rori's equivalent of a sporting match. Would you pick up Ingon's response, so I know whether he can participate?");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_4_2", "I'm inviting the philosopher Bieque Lozan-Lippid. He's quite well regarded in Narmle, except by Ingon Lakbo, with whom he once engaged in a fight on the topic of the nature of evil. Charming man, though, when not out of temper.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_5_2", "In this installment we ponder the issue of bacta restoration. When I am killed in combat and then emerge from a bacta tank soon afterward, am I still me? Or am I a mere simulacrum? These are questions of fundamental importance across the galaxy.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Haven't you brought Ingon Lakbo's response to my invitation? I need to know whether he'll participate in the Great Conversation debate.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I hoped by now you'd have delivered that invitation to Bieque Lozan-Lippid. He's waiting, you know.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "I am Ingon Lakbo. Are you here to pick up my response?");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Are you here from the Minister of Education?");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You didn't bring Ingon Lakbo's response to my invitation? Well, maybe I'll try to reach him by HoloNet. I doubt that will work -- he despises electronic communication.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You didn't deliver that invitation to Bieque Lozan-Lippid? Well, I'll have to find someone else. Thank you anyway.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "A thinker of any complexity inevitably draws resentment from those less gifted. Then, too, there is an emotional dimension to certain rivalries, which I'd rather not discuss at this time. Thank you.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I'm waiting to hear from Ingon now about where he'd like you to meet him. Talk to me again in a few moments.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I'm waiting to hear from Bieque when he's ready to rendezvous. Talk to me in a few moments.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Very well. I hope you'll return when you have more interest.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Very well. I hope you'll return when you have more interest.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Let me just see what Lakbo says -- hmm! He rejects my invitation, and rather casually. Well, this has a bright side. Now I have another job waiting, so please talk to me soon.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "I hope Bieque Lozan-Lippid will attend our debate. With his oratical skill, we can trounce those Restuss thinkers. He's their bad dream.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "I have no interest in attending this so-called Great Conversation, for I regard the Restuss scholars as a job-lot of ignorant monkey-lizards. I say as much to the Minister in my response.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "I shall consider attending the Great Conversation debate. I only hope I won't see certain of my enemies there. Please give my thanks to the Minister.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_work_1", "I've given you Ingon Lakbo's coordinates, so you have everything you need to get started.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("npc_work_2", "I've given you the coordinates for Bieque Lozan-Lippid. I hope you'll get started soon.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("otherescort_2", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_2_1", "No.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_2_2", "No.");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_3_1", "What is The Great Conversation debate?");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_3_2", "Who is Ingon Lakbo's bitter rival?");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_4_2", "What is the subject of this Great Conversation debate?");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2103].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
