stringFiles[2118] = new StringFile("static_npc/talus/talus_dearic_nurla_slinthiss");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("cant_work", "I'm a lady that demands exclusivity. Come see me when your schedule clears up a bit.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "This is a CorSec matter. Move along.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "I'm busy and can't help you.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "I'm busy, pal! Buzz off!");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Get lost. I'm busy.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("gotowork_1", "I'm not sure what you expect me to do with this but I can assure you I don't want it.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("gotowork_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("next", "You've performed like a true professional. I could ask for nothing more. Come back later, though, and I may have some more work.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("notit_3", "This is not the ledger I asked you to bring me. I really need that ledger.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("notit_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("notyet", "Sorry, I can't talk now.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Greetings, stranger. Are you looking for work? There's plenty of work around here for an enterprising and adventurous sort, such as you appear to be. But don't worry - I like to take things slowly. This first assignment is a simple delivery, a message for a business associate of mine. Think you can handle that?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_1_2", "One of my devoted employees has run afoul of the law. It may have had something to do with that message you delivered to that CorSec captain. I need someone to save my devoted friend the trauma of an interrogation - few beings survive such an ordeal. Could you save him?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_1_3", "As you know, I am very protective of my devoted employees. What you may not know is that I am equally as proactive when it comes to removing traitorous employees. One of my formerly trusted accountants has decided to sell some of my books to the Hutts. This not only saddens me deeply, it calls for me to hire someone like you to get those records back and silence this traitor for good. Are you the agent I'm looking for?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Those Hutts, so incredibly predictable. I've just received word that they've hired an assassin to take me out. What they don't realize is that I've done my homework and I happen to know that they intend to get rid of this assassin after he's done his job - the Hutts hate loose ends. I need you to meet this assassin and say a simple phrase. This will convince him to join the winning side - mine. You'll still have to deal with Hutt gangsters, however, but you've proven so good at that I have no doubt this will be a breeze for you. Will you do it?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Wonderful. Take this message to the CorSec captain at these coordinates. The contents of the message may come as a bit of a shock to him so pay no mind to anything he might say to you, especially threats. Report back to me when you're done.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I was hoping I could count on you. My people are tracking the movements of the CorSec guards and will transmit the coordinates to you. Please hurry.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_2_3", "You make me weepy, you're so good. Fortunately, I put a tracer on all my books so I am able to find them quickly should I need to. Make sure you get the ledger and leave no witnesses. I hate having to resort to this sort of thing but sometimes it's necessary.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_2_4", "You are nothing if not a professional. Say the phrase to the assassin and take out his escort. If I played my cards right, the assassin will not interfere. Good luck.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_3_1", "This business is not for everyone. Enjoy your stay here.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I understand if you don't wish to become involved in this matter. After all, one should never cross CorSec without a very good reason.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_3_3", "My assignments are getting a bit sticky, aren't they? Your refusal does not hurt my feelings.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_3_4", "This is a tricky mission. Perhaps I should rely on a more experienced agent.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_4_1", "The kind that always gets a prompt response and gives the recipient little choice but to accept my generous proposal. Don't you just love messages like that? So will you do it?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Not in this case, no. I have a feeling that the CorSec captain that ordered this interrogation will not want his superiors to become involved. This is a personal matter between him and I, you see.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_4_3", "They believe that someone like me is not capable of running the local Black Sun activities on this planet. It has to do with my past, which I won't go into in detail, but suffice to say that not long ago I was traded among the Hutts like a piece of property. Times have changed and now I must do my best to re-educate them. Something that I enjoy immensely.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Jaggah Jonz never left Nal Hutta. You want to retire on the Glorious Jewel?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_5_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_6_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_6_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I know I'm very pleasant company but you should get going.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "No time to waste, dear friend. My employee's life is at stake.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "There's an accountant out there who desperately needs your attention.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "The more time you waste, the closer that assassin gets to me.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "What's your business here? This is a CorSec investigation.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "But I didn't do anything wrong! Why am I to be interrogated? I'm innocent!");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "I know Lady Slinthiss will send someone after me. It's only a matter of time. Doesn't that worry you people?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "You said that Lady Slinthiss would send someone and it seems you were right. I was hired to take out a Lady Vigo. This is your problem.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "I'm glad you decided to work for Lady Slinthiss. I would have been so much bantha fodder had that not been the case.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "I salute a fellow professional. Let's hope we never find ourselves on opposite sides of a business transaction.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "I'm sure you tried your best, but failing to deliver a simple message does not bode well for your future.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "I lose more employees this way. Believe it when they say that good help is hard to find.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "Now I'll have to set off the explosive charge in the tracer. It'll take me months to collect all that data again. I hate these sorts of setbacks.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Looks like I may have to disappear for a while, assuming I can't find someone else to take care of this killer for me.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "They wanted to squeeze me for information concerning Lady Slinthiss' operations. But I wouldn't have talked, I swear! She sent you to bring me back safely, right?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_1_3", "I didn't! I swear! I was framed! By, by -- the Hutts! Yeah! That's it! The Hutts framed me, those slimy slugs! They mind controlled me! Is any of this getting through?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_1_4", "Ah, now I understand. Okay, you've bought yourself a reprieve. Take me back to your boss. I think she and I have business to discuss.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_2_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_more_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Let me verify the captain's coordinates with my people. Check with me in a few.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "My people just need to verify those coordinates. Could you check back with me in a few moments?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "One moment while my people verify the ledger's location.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "One moment while my people verify the assassin's current coordinates.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Oh, I know, I can be so demanding. Come back when you're ready for such a bossy employer.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Oh, I know, I can be so demanding. Come back when you're ready for such a bossy employer.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Well done. I hope that mean old CorSec captain didn't upset you too much. These sorts have a much more ferocious growl than they do bites. Those temperments suit these security roles, I suppose.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "You've brought my employee back safe and sound. Wonderful! Please have a drink on me.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "You put many of my other agents to shame. But they need that in order to strive for something better. You're tops in my view.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "You are a businesswoman's most valuable asset, do you know that? Take some time off, you Corellian sand panther, you've more than earned it.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "What's this? A message from Nurla Slinthiss? It's a holo recording of some sort -- Wait a second! Is this what I think it is? You tell that good-for-nothing gangster I won't be blackmailed! You hear me! Now get out of here before I have you arrested!");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "A thousand thanks, friend. Please take me back to Lady Slinthiss. More of those CorSec goons may show up at any minute.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "Not bad. Looks like I'll have to deal with you myself. Ready?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Did you deliver that message for me? A business deal is dependent upon that delivery.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Have you rescued my employee from those CorSec goons? He's ever so fragile.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Have you retrieved that ledger for me? My business will surely take a hit if that falls into the wrong hands.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Did you say that phrase to that assassin? My life could be in grave danger.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("otherescort_2", "I'm not the fellow you're looking for.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("otherescort_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("otherescort_4", "Get lost. I'm busy.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_1_3", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_1_4", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_2_1", "No.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_2_2", "No.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_2_3", "No.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_2_4", "No.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_3_1", "What kind of message is this?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_3_2", "If I fight CorSec personnel to save your friend, won't I be arrested?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_3_3", "Why are the Hutts after your books?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_3_4", "What phrase do you want me to say?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_4_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_4_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_4_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_5_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_1_2", "Why were you arrested?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_1_3", "Why did you betray Lady Slinthiss?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_1_4", "Jaggah Jonz never left Nal Hutta. You want to retire on the Glorious Jewel?");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_2_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_2_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_more_3_4", "");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_reset_1", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_reset_2", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "I'll get back to work.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "I'll get back to work.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "Report back to Nurla.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_2", "Escort the employee back to Lady Slinthiss.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_3", "Bring the ledger back to Lady Slinthiss.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_4", "Escort the assassin back to Lady Slinthiss.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "Nurla Slinthiss' Location");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_2", "Nurla Slinthiss' Location");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_3", "Nurla Slinthiss' Location");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_4", "Nurla Slinthiss' Location");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "Deliver a message to a CorSec captain.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("waypoint_description_2", "Rescue Lady Slinthiss' employee from the CorSec goons.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("waypoint_description_3", "Get the ledger from the accountant.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("waypoint_description_4", "Speak a phrase to an assassin.");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "CorSec Captain's Location");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("waypoint_name_2", "Devoted Employee's Location");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("waypoint_name_3", "Traitorous Accountant's Location");
stringFiles[2118].addEntry("waypoint_name_4", "Assassin's Location");

stringFiles[2119] = new StringFile("static_npc/talus/talus_dearic_radlee_mathiss");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("cant_work", "If you know how to keep your mouth shut and can take care of business, come see me when you need a job.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm waiting to meet up with somebody. Just go on about your business.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "This has been a bit of a rough day. Would you mind leaving us in peace?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Unless you have a strong desire to have the Hutts chasing you all over the galaxy, you might just want to run along.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("next", "I'll keep an eye out for you the next time something comes up. Right now I don't have any work for you. I love it when things are running smoothly.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("notit_1", "I'm fairly certain this isn't the item you were supposed to give me. Would you mind looking again?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("notyet", "Don't bother me right now, okay?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I hope you're not the kind who likes to make trouble. I run a quiet town and as long as nothing interferes with business, I say, live and let live. Now if you were looking for a little work on the side, I have a little package that needs picking up. How about it?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Normally the Hutts and I leave each other alone, but recently they've been trying to do business with the Corporate Sector Authority. I wouldn't have any problem with that normally but they kidnapped the CSA rep they were dealing with. Do me a favor and get that CSA rep back safely. How about it?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_1_3", "The Hutts have got to pay for that kidnapping stunt. Nobody interferes with business in my town and gets away with it. The Hutt lieutenant who gave that order needs to vanish. Think you might want to handle the Job?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Glad to have you on board. The CSA is sending a courier. Pick up the package and bring it back to me. Simple right? Wrong. There's always some goon trying to get in on the action, so keep your eyes open.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I'm not sure what sort of game these Hutts are playing, so shoot first and we won't even bother asking questions. When it comes to choosing between the CSA and the Hutts, I know who's good for business.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_2_3", "It should be pretty straightforward. I've already arranged the meeting so I'll just give you the location and you can go kill that lieutenant and any goons who might be there. ");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I understand your refusal. See that you don't interfere in the day-to-day business of the city while you're here. ");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Don't want to anger the Hutts, eh? You're smarter than you look.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_3_3", "You didn't strike me as the nervous type when I hired you. So much for first impressions.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_4_1", "The sort of package whose contents I don't reveal to agents like you. You don't want to ask too many questions around here. The answers will only get you into trouble. So will you do it or not?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Who knows? Maybe for not doing exactly what the Hutts wanted? It's not as though the Hutts are known for their legendary desire to reach a compromise. So are you going to help out or not?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_4_3", "I'll arrange for a meeting with the Hutt lieutenant to discuss reparations and then I'll tell you where that meeting is. You go to said meeting place and create a large pile of ash where the Hutt lieutenant used to be. How about it?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_6_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Were you going to just stand there or was there something else you wanted to say?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Make it quick. What's on your mind?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Time to get to work -- unless you've changed your mind?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "You must be the new courier. ");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Thank the Force! A friendly face.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "What's this? A double-cross!");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "Thanks again. I think next time I'll talk to the Hutts over a com-link.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "I told you to be careful out there.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "I need to get the CSA's representative back to them in one piece or it's going to interfere with business. This is not good.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You look somewhat the worse for wear. Things didn't go so well? I suppose I'll have to find another way to impress the Hutts.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_more_1_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_more_2_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_more_3_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "I'll just contact the CSA and see when they were planning on sending their courier out. Come see me in a little while.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Come back in a few minutes, I need some time to contact the CSA and get any last minute instructions they may have. ");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "I need to contact the Hutts. Give me a few minutes of privacy to arrange that meeting.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Too much for you right now, eh? Come back when you want to finish the job.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Too much for you right now, eh? Come back when you want to finish the job.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Too much for you right now, eh? Come back when you want to finish the job.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "There's nothing like the satisfaction of a job well done.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "CSA rep back in one piece and offending Hutt goons taken care of. Nice work!");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Well done. That should keep the CSA happy and send a strong message to the Hutts at the same time.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Tell Chief Mathiss that the CSA is very grateful for the speed with which he made that investigation shrivel up and go away.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "I'm glad you got here when you did. Things were starting to look pretty grim.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Have you picked up my package yet?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_work_2", "You'd better go and get that CSA rep before those goons do any permanent damage.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Hurry up! You're going to miss the meeting.");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("otherescort_2", "This has been a bit of a rough day. Would you mind leaving us in peace?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("otherescort_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_1_3", "Yes");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_2_1", "No");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_2_2", "No");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_2_3", "No");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_3_1", "What sort of package?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_3_2", "Why would the Hutts want to kidnap a CSA rep?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_3_3", "How do you want me to handle this?");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_4_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_4_2", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_4_3", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2119].addEntry("player_5_3", "");
