stringFiles[2124].addEntry("player_reset_2", "I don't want this mission right now.");
stringFiles[2124].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2124].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "I'll keep working on the mission.");
stringFiles[2124].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "Drall slicer who wanted Imperial blaster cannon plans delivered to the representative of a high government official.");
stringFiles[2124].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_2", "This Drall slicer wanted a Fed-Dub investigator stopped.");
stringFiles[2124].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "Green Laser");
stringFiles[2124].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_2", "Green Laser");
stringFiles[2124].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "Rendezvous with a representative of a government official who seeks Imperial blaster cannon blueprints secured by the Drall slicer Green Laser.");
stringFiles[2124].addEntry("waypoint_description_2", "Federation of the Double Worlds detective seeking to arrest the Drall slicer called Green Laser.");
stringFiles[2124].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Blaster Cannon Plan Dropoff");
stringFiles[2124].addEntry("waypoint_name_2", "Fed-Dub Investigator");

stringFiles[2125] = new StringFile("static_npc/talus/talus_nashal_igbi_freemo");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("cant_work", "I've got some work for you if you want it. Come see me when you're done with your current gig.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I don't know what you're doing here but you're in the wrong place.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "You should probably move along. I'm here to conduct some business that doesn't concern you.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("next", "I'm very impressed with how you handle yourself. I don't have anything else at the moment but I'll keep you in mind for future jobs.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("notit_1", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("notit_2", "I told you to bring back the spice. What am I supposed to do with this?");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("notyet", "Sorry, I can't help you right now.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Have you ever done any work for Black Sun before? Doesn't matter really -- I'm desperate. There's this Hutt operative that needs to be killed, and if I don't arrange it, someone else will and I'll look incompetent. Do you think you could be a pal and help me out?");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I've been looking for a way to make things right with the boss after that last fiasco. I think I've finally found a way to show her what I'm capable of. If you're willing to help me, I'll take you right to the top with me. What do you say? Are you in? ");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Great. I'll give you the location of this new Hutt operative and you go take him out. Simple, right? See that he gets the message if you know what I mean.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Here's what I need. The Hutts' new hotshot has a big deal going down involving some new extra potent kind of spice. I want you to intrude upon the meeting and become the new owner of the spice by way of being the only one alive in its vicinity.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Then get out of here. I've got business to take care of.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Your loss. ");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_4_1", "How the heck should I know? I just got a call asking if I'd taken care of delivering that message to the Hutts' new operative. I said yes, so now I need to get it done. What do you say? Will you help me?");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Very funny, wise guy. After you killed that last operative, the Hutts replaced that sleemo with a totally slick operator. You know the kind -  makes a move before anyone else knew there was a move that could be made. I want in on that action. Are you going to help me?");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I've told you all I know. What are you pestering me for? ");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "What's with all the questions? You took the job now get moving.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "What kind of double-cross is this? I was just supposed to pick up a message.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Do you have any idea what you're messing with?");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "You didn't kill him did you?  Why do I always have such bad luck?");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You couldn't get the stuff? Uh-Oh! I already told the boss I'd just finished a major new deal. What'll I do now?");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_more_2_1", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_more_2_2", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_more_3_1", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_more_3_2", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Let me find out where the Hutts are working from these days. They tend to move around a lot. Come back and see me in a little while.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Come back in a little while, I need to find out where my agent said that deal was going to occur. ");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "You come back and work for me later. You can finish up then.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "You come back and work for me later. You can finish up then.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "You didn't kill him did you? Oh no! It turns out I was supposed to deliver an actual message. The boss is gonna kill me when she hears about this.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Can you believe my luck? It turns out this hotshot operative was our double agent and it was a shipment of tainted spice we were slipping to the Hutts. I wonder if there's someone else I can pin this on? Don't worry - they'd never believe it was you.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Have you killed that Hutt operative yet? I'm on a schedule here.");
stringFiles[2125].addEntry("npc_work_2", "You'd better hurry up and grab that spice. The deal is going to go down pretty soon. ");
