stringFiles[2179] = new StringFile("static_npc/yavin/yavin_rebelcamp_yith_seenath");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("cant_work", "Come back and see me when you're finished with your current assignment.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I'm on Imperial business. On your way.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "This is an Imperial matter. On your way.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("next", "That's all I've got for you now. Check back with me from time to time.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("notit_1", "These are not the encrypted orders from Imperial High Command.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("notit_2", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("notit_3", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("notyet", "This isn't a good time for me.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Did High Command send you? We've just got some information that we need to move on. Wait, you're new. Sorry, I'm Sergeant Yith Seenath. I hope you're here to help out because we could sure use it. I need an Imperial courier intercepted and the orders he's carrying brought back to me. Think you can do that?");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Those orders were to be delivered to a particularly brutal lieutenant that's been stationed here on Yavin recently. Apparently Imperial High Command felt that Commander Byrne was not getting results quickly enough so they sent this brute to 'help things along.' We need this lieutenant taken out. Is that something you could do?");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_1_3", "We finally decoded that dispatch from Imperial High Command and as a result we've uncovered a munitions depot that was going to be used in an upcoming raid. I want you to blow this place sky high. Think you can handle that?");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Here are the coordinates. The courier is likely to have an escort, so be prepared for a fight. Good luck.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I'd advise you bring some friends along. This lieutenant doesn't go anywhere without two of his best men accompanying him. Good luck.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_2_3", "It's a small warehouse but I'm sure it will be heavily guarded. After taking out the lieutenant in charge of such operations, I'd be expecting quite a fight. Prepare accordingly.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Well then I'll let you get back to whatever it was you were doing. Farewell.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_3_2", "This is a tough assignment. I understand your decision.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Very well, I'll assign this to a more experienced operative. Farewell.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_4_1", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_4_2", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_4_3", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_6_3", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Do you want the mission or not?");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "That's all the information I have. Would you like to reconsider?");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "This is going to be quite challenging. If you'd like to back out, I'll understand.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "That's close enough! Open fire, men!");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "This is a restricted area! Identify yourself! Open fire, men!");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Those orders would have clarified quite a few things for us. A shame you couldn't get them.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "We'll have to find some way to take out that lieutenant. Thanks for your help.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "I'll have to organize another strike team quickly. We can't afford to let those Imperial commandos have access to those weapons.");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_more_1_1", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_more_1_2", "");
stringFiles[2179].addEntry("npc_more_1_3", "");
