stringFiles[2181].addEntry("surveying", "As your surveying skill increases, you gain the ability to scan for resources over a greater distance.  You also gain a higher chance of successfully harvesting resources and yet a higher yield per successful sample attempt.");
stringFiles[2181].addEntry("survey_flora_structural", "A higher Flora Surveying skill allows players to obtain samples more efficiently. Resources will start to become extractable at lower percentages, and more resources may be found on a successful sample.  However, this skill mod does not necessarily increase the chances of getting a successful sample. Prospecting has always been something of a hit-or-miss vocation.");
stringFiles[2181].addEntry("survey_flora_structural_range", "The Flora Surveying Range skill determines the range at which surveying is possible. A high Flora Surveying Range skill means that one can either modify the range at which surveying is seen. The result is that it is possible to get more accurate readings by reducing the surveying range one is looking at. This requires a surveying tool that supports range modification.");
stringFiles[2181].addEntry("survey_flora_structural_resolution", "A higher Flora Surveying Resolution tool gives prospecting players the ability to increase the number of resource marks seen on their survey screen. The result is that players with a higher skill in this will be much more efficient at expediently tracking down high resource deposits, as compared to a novice Artisan.");
stringFiles[2181].addEntry("survey_gas", "A higher Gas Surveying skill allows players to obtain samples more efficiently. Resources will start to become extractable at lower percentages, and more resources may be found on a successful sample.  However, this skill mod does not necessarily increase the chances of getting a successful sample. Prospecting has always been something of a hit-or-miss vocation.");
