stringFiles[2188] = new StringFile("talmont");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal1", "I am the Prefect, Eugene Talmont.  I have a mission for you, but I must know where your loyalties lie first.  Tell me why I should trust you...");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal10", "So, you've decided to return, eh?  Have you learned a little bit about respect?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal11", "Yes sir.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal12", "Respect?  You?  You must be joking.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal13", "Good.  Very good.  Think you can you handle a group of thieves on your own?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal14", "Enough of your attitude.  Leave at once!");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal15", "Back again?  I hope this time you're not wasting my time.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal16", "Sorry.  I'm ready to work for you.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal17", "You're in charge of a desert.  How could I possibly be wasting YOUR time?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal18", "Get out!");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal19", "There's no shame in crawling back here.  Are you ready for your assignment?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal2", "I am loyal to the Empire.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal20", "Yes, I am.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal21", "The only shame would be actually taking orders from someone like you.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal22", "You will suffer for this outrage!  Out of my office!");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal23", "I hope we won't have any more performances like the previous ones?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal24", "No sir.  I'm ready to work.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal25", "I'm too busy to talk to you.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal26", "Feeling better about yourself?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal27", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal28", "No.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal29", "Now that you've proven yourself I'm going to level with you.  My superior officers on this planet are a bunch of scum.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal3", "Why should I trust you?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal30", "What do you mean?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal31", "What do you expect on Tatooine?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal32", "They're low-life criminals, the lot of them!  They take bribes.  They gamble.  Some of them might as well work for that Jabba the Hutt!");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal33", "I expect more from an Imperial Officer!  They're a bunch of criminals, in league with the Hutt, Jabba.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal34", "What shall I do?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal35", "I want you to infiltrate Jabba's organization.  Find Jabba's ledger books.  Bring me the evidence I need to bring them all down!");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal36", "How should I do that?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal37", "I'm going to give you a new identity.  Papers that will make you appear to be a criminal.  Like one of them.  I have such things at my disposal.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal38", "And then what?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal39", "Do whatever they tell you.  Accept any job they'll give you, no matter how illegal it may be.  After a while, you'll earn their trust.  Then you can find those ledgers!");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal4", "Very good.  We shall see about that soon enough.  Your first task will be to round up a group of thieves.  This planet is full of them.  Can you handle that?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal40", "Won't they kill me if they find out what I'm up to?");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal41", "You'll have to be careful   But your new identity will be perfect.  Go to Jabba's palace and talk to the TT8-L droid, and he'll get you started.  You and I are going to clean up this waste of a planet!");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal5", "Exactly the sort of insolence I would expect from someone on this planet.  Be gone with you.  And don't return until you've learned some manners!");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal6", "I think so.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal7", "I'm not sure.");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal8", "Excellent.  These thieves have a hideout at <location>.  There are three of them.  I want them dead or alive.  Now get moving!");
stringFiles[2188].addEntry("tal9", "Well, if you're not up to the task perhaps you should return when you feel a bit more comfortable with your abilities.");

