stringFiles[2209] = new StringFile("theme_park/royal_kidnapping/nobles");
stringFiles[2209].addEntry("noble_1", "You're not?  Oh, well, I mean of course you're not.  I knew that.  I could tell just by looking at you.  You have that heroic sort of aura about you.  Indeed you do.");
stringFiles[2209].addEntry("noble_1_reply_1", "You're free to go");
stringFiles[2209].addEntry("noble_2", "Hooray!  You're my hero!");
stringFiles[2209].addEntry("reply_1", "I'm not a pirate.  I'm here to rescue you.");
stringFiles[2209].addEntry("start", "Ach!  Another wretched pirate.  You'll never get away with this!  You filthy disease-ridden scum will pay!  Pay dearly!  I have friends in powerful places!  Poweful friends in powerful places!  That's right!  Poweful!  They know how to deal with the likes of you!");

stringFiles[2210] = new StringFile("theme_park/warren/warren");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("cell_locked", "The Cell Is Locked:  Authorization Required.  Speak the password to Unlock Cell #21342");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("cell_open", "Cell 21342 is Unlocked");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("escapee_1", "The Warren!  It's a terrible place!  The horrors!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("escapee_1_reply_1", "Where is that?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("escapee_1_reply_2", "What's so bad about it?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("escapee_2", "Here... Here's a waypoint that leads to the dreadful place.  I'll give you the passkey to get in as well.  Maybe you can put a stop to the horrible experiments that happen there.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("escapee_3", "Oh the horrors committed there are unspeakable.  Some sort of research... on people's BRAINS!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("escapee_haskey", "I already told you!  I even gave you a passkey to get inside!  Won't you at least TRY to put a stop to the horrible experiments there?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("escapee_reply_1", "What place?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("escapee_start", "I can't believe I escaped that terrible place!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("guard_warning", "I'm guarding this cell so you better not come any closer.  Just head back the way you came and I won't have to kill you.  Go on!  You can't open this cell without the password anyway, and I'm sure not going to give it to you.  Now get out of here.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("heff_1", "What?  Let me see that!  So... Teraud is a traitor.  Well this is all the evidence I need.  We'll take care of this at once.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("heff_bye", "No time to talk to you.  I'm a very busy man.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("heff_done", "Good to see you again!  No need to worry about Teraud's research lab.  The Empire will take care of THAT place.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("heff_reply_1", "I have evidence!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("heff_start", "What do you want?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("knag_attacks", "...this one will probably make a lovely cyborg...");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("knag_greeting", "My children... they'll take over the facility, and kill those Stormtroopers... then Teraud will have to admit that I am smarter than he is... that I am the one that will one day rule!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("knag_wins", "That one probably isn't salvageable...");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("loyalist_start", "Wow, the shock must have broken the cyborg circuitry... I can think on my own again... it was horrible, I volunteered to be one of Teraud's Loyalists, but the cyborg device was controlling my mind... Look out for Teraud, he's a megalomaniac, and he thinks he can topple the Emperor...");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_1", "How can you ask me that?  Have you seen how crazy this place is?  The Stormtroopers killing everything in sight!?  The cyborgs rampaging through the corridors!  I was lucky enough to find a place to hide.  But... my husband... he was on the first floor and I don't know if he made it out alive... if he knows I'm ok... ");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_1_reply_1", "I have some bad news");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_1_reply_2", "Don't worry.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_2", "My husband is.... dead?  Oh no... I should have known.  That madman Teraud, this is all his fault.  Thank you for delivering his letter to me.  But please, you have to take him down!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_2_reply_1", "I will.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_3", "Oh I do hope so... but I have a bad feeling.  Please leave me alone.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_4", "The first thing you should do is to get to the Inquisitor.  Teraud's men captured her and put her in a cell upstairs.  You'll need the passcode to unlock the cell door, but I can tell you what that is.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_4_reply_1", "What is it?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_done", "I can't thank you enough for the compassion you've shown me.  And you've exposed Teraud's evil plans to the Empire.  I know the Emperor will take care of that mad scientist and this terrible place now.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_get_teraud", "We know that Teraud is a madman, but the Empire will require proof of his treachery.  You've got to collect evidence against him and take it to the proper authorities.  Please!  Before it is too late!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_password", "The password is - %TO - just speak that near the cell door to unlock it.  Good luck.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_reply_1", "What's wrong?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("mirla_start", "(sob) What... what do you want?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("researcher_1", "The only way to fix it, is to get the spare reactor core rods from the basement... behind the holding pen. The backup system should have taken over, but I think it was manually overridden.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("researcher_2", "Good thing the reactor has been disabled!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("researcher_3", "Now the reactor core rods need to be put in the reactor core.  But the door is locked... there are two manual override switches on this floor... somewhere.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("researcher_reply_1", "What do we do?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("researcher_start", "It's hopeless!  The reactor core is going to blow!  We'll all die!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("trooper_greeting_f", "There's another one of Teraud's people... kill her!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("trooper_greeting_m", "There's another one of Teraud's people... kill him!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("turret_pass_active", "Master Control Room Turret Defense System is:  ACTIVESpeak the passkey code to deactivate the MCRTDS.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("turret_pass_deactivated", "Turret Defense System has been DEACTIVED.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("turret_pass_inactive", "Master Control Room Turret Defense System is:  INACTIVE.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_1", "I am a contract worker hired by Colonel Teraud to keep expanding this facility.... which is crazy given how big it is already.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_1_reply_1", "Are there more workers in here?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_2", "All the workers call this place 'The Warren'.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_2_reply_2", "What happened here?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_3", "There are many workers trapped below.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_3_reply_1", "What do you mean 'trapped'?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_4", "The elevator down is locked.  And it can only be unlocked from the Master Control Room by using the four pass-keys.  But you'll never get to the Master Control Room without the Turret Defense passcode!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_4_reply_1", "What is the passcode?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_5", "I don't know.  The only one who knew the passcode is dead by the elevator now.  Oh this is hopeless!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_6", "An Imperial bigwig came to visit Teraud, and something bad happened. Crazed lab animals burst out of the elevator going down and attacked the workers, killing many of them.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_bark1", "The Inquisitor's troops invaded... Teraud's loyalists managed to capture her and I think they carted her off to a prison cell...");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_bark2", "Watch out, those Stormtroopers are shooting on sight, even if you're a loyal Imperial Citizen!");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_bark3", "Teraud is a madman... he made us carve the brains out of living Krayt Dragons... who knows what he did with them...");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_bark4", "Teraud uses a mind control device to control his cyborgs.  I think he planned to make us all his cyborg slaves.");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_reply_1", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_reply_2", "What is this place?");
stringFiles[2210].addEntry("worker_start", "Don't hurt me!");

stringFiles[2211] = new StringFile("theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("access_denied", "ACCESS DENIED:  YOU DO NOT HAVE THE PROPER PASSKEY TO ENTER THIS FACILITY");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("access_granted", "ACCESS GRANTED:  Passkey code accepted.  Welcome to this Imperial Research Facility");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("bio_terminal", "BRAIN REMOVAL PROCEDURES-Obey all procedural rules for critical brain evacuation in order to prevent trauma.  The following information is CLASSIFIED.");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("bio_terminal_name", "Procedural Instruction Terminal");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("cell_locked", "The Cell Is Locked:  Authorization Required.  Speak the password to Unlock Cell #21342");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("cell_open", "Cell 21342 is Unlocked");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("comm_terminal", "SUBJECT:  IMPERIAL INSPECTIONCLASSIFIEDTO: COLONEL BORS TERAUDFROM : GRAND MOFF ARDUS KAINEColonel, our impatience with your failure to account for the millions of credits in Imperial funding that have gone your way is increasingly leading us to the conclusion that some sort of malfeasance has been attempted. Our previous inspection by an Imperial Inquisitor resulted in the inquisitor never returning, and your bland answers to our inquiries have proven unsatisfactory.Expect a fresh inspection team, led by Imperial Inquisitor Janna bel Arde. She has the authority to inspect any aspect of your budget and finances, your team, your facility, and your experiments. Should she locate any irregularities whatsoever, you will be relieved of your command. Given the mysterious disappearance of our last auditor, Inquisitor bel Arde will be accompanied by a military contingent.I need not remind you that your extremely high levels of funding were in large part because of the personal interest that our illustrious Emperor took in your stated project goals. His eye on you can be valuable when you are doing well. I do not think you want his attention under any other circumstances.TRANSMISSION ENDS");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("comm_terminal_name", "Communications Terminal");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("core_name_off", "Reactor Core: SHUTDOWN");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("core_name_on", "Reactor Core: OVERLOAD IMMINENT");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("core_rod_name", "Reactor Core Control Rod");
