stringFiles[2211].addEntry("dev_control_name", "Encryption Key Generator");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("dev_control_terminal", "[Authorization required.]Remote encryption transmission system v8.06.Last access [TODAY] transmission to destination Airlock Blast Door Security Lockdown procedure 8.2.1.5.67b.");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("diary_terminal", "Dear diary,Oh I am so sad today.  Just like yesterday and the day before.  I bet I will be even more sad tomorrow.  Working for Teraud is horrible.  First my friend Matlo vanished, and now my coworker whose name I can't even pronounce, let alone spell, has mysteriously disappeared.  And I have to do all his work!  The screaming from some of the rooms raises the hair on the back of my neck.They tell us those rooms are off-limits - they don't even trust us to go down one floor without approval from four supervisors.  Like any of us ever want to go down there anyway!  All the animals are creepy, and Teraud's personal Loyalists are even worse!  Considering this is an Imperial Research facility, these people don't seem very loyal to the Empire.Oh great, more screaming from the ... well that sounds closer than usual.  I better go see wha");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("diary_terminal_name", "Diary Terminal");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("download_complete", "DOWNLOAD COMPLETE");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("elev_one_secure", "+Master Control Security Lock Engaged:  ACCESS DENIED+");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("elev_range", "You are too far away to use that");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("elev_toolow", "You are already on the bottom floor");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("get_evidence", "DOWNLOAD EVIDENCE");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("got_evidence", "You have already downloaded evidence from this terminal");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("inq_letter_name", "FOUO: Imperial Communication Disk");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("inq_letter_text", "Attacked by surprise en route to the research facility's lower levels.  Teraud is no where to be seen, but his loyalists ambushed my Stormtrooper escort.  We were divided in the battle and I've been badly wounded, captured, and thrown into a cell.  I do not expect help to arrive in time.Any Imperial Citizen that finds this Communication Disk:  Consider this a direct order from Imperial Inquisitor Janna bel Arde:  Locate evidence to prove Colonel Teraud is a traitor and a madman.  He cannot be allowed to disrupt the peace and order of the Empire.  Blast your way through 'The Warren' (as they call it here) if you must, but locate enough evidence to bring down the might of the Empire on this would-be despot.  Deliver this letter and the evidence you collect to the Captain Heff in the Theed Palace on Naboo.The Captain will know what to do.");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("insert_rod", "You insert the reactor core control rods into the reactor core.");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("letter_name", "a letter");
stringFiles[2211].addEntry("letter_text", "Dearest Mirla, We don't know what has happened down below, but shortly after the Imperials arrived, the beasts broke out of their cages and began a terrible rampage.  There is carnage everywhere here and I don't think we're going to last much longer.  I want you to know that I love you very much - as much today as the day of our marriage.I hope that you have found a safe place to hide until help arrives.  I'm writing this farewell letter in hopes that someone will find it and deliver it to you, because I don't think I'm going to make it out of here alive.Don't grieve for me.  I have known more happiness in the past few years than anyone deserves, and I'll always be with you in your heart.I love you!");
