stringFiles[2211].addEntry("welcome_terminal", "Welcome to the premier Imperial Research Facility in the known Galaxy! Under the command of the magnanimous and brilliant Colonel Bors Teraud, this facility engages in cybernetic and cyborg research for the greater glory of the Empire.Making use of cutting-edge technology, the brilliant scientists under Colonel Teraud's command are pushing forward the boundaries of cyborg technology and neural interaction!");

stringFiles[2212] = new StringFile("theme_park_bestine/curator");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("enemy_1", "Utinni! Nik maikka dinnika Dinhint!");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("enemy_2", "Hmm. Has that lickspittle of a curator changed his mind? I shall not cancel our arrangement. Rather, I shall cancel you.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("enemy_3", "You are the fence? Late! Dinhint did say right about how much valuable is this hunk of junk, yes? Wait! You are not --!");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("enemy_4", "I know you! Hanging around the museum, right? Tell Dinhilt this is no gemstone. You won't believe this, but -- Hey, what are you do--?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("gotowork", "Ah, you're here. But -- you have not yet resolved the matter we discussed, correct? Please return when you have results.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Well, well, a visitor. Hem! Welcome to my humble museum. I am the curator. If you are here regarding the recent theft of a valuable artifact, I am -- hem! -- the one -- hem! Excuse me. -- You may talk to me. Will you pursue the thief and return the artifact?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Ah, welcome back. Hem! You helped my little museum greatly in what I now call the Tusken Robe Incident. Might you now handle a similar -- hem! -- regrettable theft? The purloined object is a part of the armor worn by chief miner Melnea Arnthout, one of Tatooine's -- hem! -- original settlers. Will you go after it?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Ah, you are ready for more work? I hoped you would inquire. Hem! Now some thief has stolen a mineral scanner that dates back to the original settlement of Tatooine. It defies understanding why anyone would steal it; it lacks -- hem! -- notable historic or economic value. Can you return it safely?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_1_4", "It defies belief, my friend, but -- hem! -- my museum is once again the victim of theft. I have no idea who would steal this artifact -- but the Hutts have many enemies, hem! So it is not inconceivable -- but I am maundering. Will you retrieve the artifact?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Excellent. The stolen Tusken Raider robe has a hidden homing beacon, as is standard museum procedure. In all likelihood you will find the thief at the designated coordinates. Thank you, thank you!");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Good. The armor, like the robe you returned earlier, has a tracking beacon that should lead you right to the thief. I speed you on your way!");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_2_3", "I trust the tracking beacon hidden within the scanner will lead you to the culprit, as always. Please return the item intact.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Splendid. You will recall, of course, that all museum artifacts have tracking beacons. It is fortunate the thieves never think to disable these! Please locate the thief and return the artifact by any means.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I apologize for my mistake. Please enjoy your visit to my little sanctuary. Hem!");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Not available just now? I understand. Please enjoy your visit to my little sanctuary. Hem!");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Very well, I wish you good luck in your other endeavors. Enjoy the museum.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Understandable. I wish you well in your travels around our world.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_4_1", "The artifact in question is a robe supposedly worn by the Tusken Raider who led the original assault on Fort Tusken centuries ago. The robe's provenance is questionable, but I know no better candidate. I would -- hem! -- very much like it back.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_4_2", "It is the endless dust of this desert. Over the decades I must have inhaled enough to fill a -- hem! -- a binary load lifter. Now, the mission?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_4_3", "It is purely a function of budget, I assure -- hem! I must requisition yet more funds for greater anti-theft protection. It is a terrible indictment of Imperial funding priorities, no? Hem! Now as to the mission?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_4_4", "When the Hutts first arrived on Tatooine, long ago, they held a mass slaughter and subsequent feast. The artifact is, as best we can tell, a chunk of dried meat left over from that initial feast. Will you retrieve it?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Fine work! The robe appears relatively harmed after its ordeal. These senseless thefts grow ever more frequent. I hope the Empire will grant my petition for an increased theft-control budget.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "The armor appears to be in acceptable condition. Thank you again for your exemplary service. I anticipate a budget increase to handle these thefts soon.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "This is yet another reason I am in your debt. Perhaps you will spread the word among Imperial authorities that this museum requires a greater budget to prevent theft.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Thank you indeed! I daresay the museum's collection would not be perceptibly harmed by the absence of this meat. But as a matter of principle, we must not tolerate artifact theft -- a point I hope the Imperial budget committee remembers when they allocate funds.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_1_2", "Sure.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_1_3", "Yeah, why not.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_1_4", "Ok, I'm game.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_2_1", "No.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_2_2", "Not a chance.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_2_3", "Not today.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_2_4", "Can't do it.");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_3_1", "What is this valuable artifact?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_3_2", "Why are you coughing? Are you all right?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_3_3", "Why are you seeing so many thefts at your museum?");
stringFiles[2212].addEntry("player_3_4", "What kind of artifact is it?");

stringFiles[2213] = new StringFile("theme_park_bestine/om");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("cantwork", "I would love your help escorting some friends of mine who are having trouble reaching town, but rumor has it that you're already working on a task for someone else. Come back when you're finished and we'll talk. Thanks!");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("dontknowyou", "Hello, stranger. I can't go with you. I'm waiting for someone else to arrive. Thank you!");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("escortother", "You might be looking for someone else...");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("gotowork", "I still need for you to escort my friend to town. Please hurry! Thanks.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("not_it", "No, sorry, that's not the item I was looking for...");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Well, hello! I wonder if you can help me. Someone from the Sand Dragon Fresher company is supposed to come by the cafe to drop off supplies - but I've gotten word that they are lost just outside of town. Would you be able to find them and escort them to me? I can give you a fine bottle of Corellian Ale... (we have surplus).");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I hope you enjoy the Corellian ale! If you're up to it - I have another request. At the moment, I'm embroiled in a legal battle with a cafe owner in Mos Teike who thinks she owns the recipe for Talusian Flat-Bread sandwiches. I am supposed to meet with my legal counsel... but unfortunately I got a distress message from him a few moments ago... Would you be willing to escort him to town?");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I'm preparing a banquet for my long-time friend and benefactor, Tour Aryon. As a surprise, I've recruited a chef from the Fallen Star hotel who knows how to prepare Aryon's favorite dish! Unfortunately, the chef has not yet arrived - and it is getting late... So, if you're willing - I would like for you to escort the chef to me. What do you think?");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_1_4", "The curator of our beloved Bestine Museum has started a match-making business on the side called Dune-Hearts. It's not going so well, though. Due to a problem with the museum's antique messenger droid all of the clients have been given bad locations in their datapads... and are now wandering the desert, searching vainly for their true loves!  Would you be able to escort one of them back here so that I can set them straight?");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Great! I'm in desperate need of new supplies. Be careful out there!");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Excellent! I look forward to your return... (and an end to this frivolous lawsuit)!");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Good.  I regret that I can't extend an invitation to the banquet - but I can certainly provide a worthwhile reward. Thanks!");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Wonderful! I'm sure that the message droid problems will be fixed by the time you return! Be careful.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I understand. Perhaps some other time? Take care.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Well... okay. I'm not sure what I'm going to do about this lawsuit... but okay. Maybe some other time.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_3_3", "That's fine. If I could extend an invitation to the banquet, it might be more attactive, eh? Maybe later.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Yes, well - I guess people should solve their own problems. Thanks for your time.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_4_1", "My name is Om Aynat. Long ago I trained as a chef on Talus - but... bad things happened... and after bouncing unhappily from system to system, I wound up working here at the food-stand for my friend Tour Aryon. ");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_4_2", "I developed the recipe while studying under the master chef in Restuss. One weekend (for laughs), we made Talusian sandwiches for a cruiser-load of visiting students. It was a towering sensation! A few days later, word came that the Corellia Times wanted to write about it... and the Master expelled me. Suspicious, don't you think? The Corellia Times never got their story. And ever since then I have been rooting out all of the liars who claim to have invented it.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_4_3", "It's just a nice thing to do! Right after I was exiled from the culinary conservatory in Restuss - some friends of mine in the Imperial Military introduced us. She is a testament to the greatness of the Empire: fair-handed, even-tempered, and... well... just a fantastic person!");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_4_4", "I'm not sure. Perhaps being a curator of antiquities makes one unnecessarily fond of old and broken things. I'm sure that with the recent developments, there is no way that he can justify hanging on to this messenger droid. If he does - we'll have many more people stranded out in the desert... looking for love.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Careful with this thing.  It's well put together, but if you crush it it won't be worth as much.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Here's your official proclamation.  It won't be valid unless I get elected, but hang onto it just in case.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Here you go.  This is a picture I took taking off from an undiscovered planet.  That picture is one of a kind.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Here's a recording rod that I paid way too much for.  It's valuable but fragile.  Be careful with it.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "Whew! I thought I would be stuck out here forever. Can you lead me to Om's shoppe, please?");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "Ah yes. Could you take me to Om Aynat, please?");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "Please get me to Bestine! I'm running out of time and I have so much delicious food to prepare!");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "You don't look like my date... but I'll be happy to follow you if you're headed to Bestine!");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("otherescort", "I think you're here to pick up someone else.  You're certainly not taking ME anywhere.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes. I will find the representative and escort them here.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes. I will escort the advocate to you.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_1_3", "Yes. I will retrieve the chef for you.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_1_4", "Yes. I will find one of the clients and escort them you.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_2_1", "No. I have no time for this.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_2_2", "No. I am unable to do this for you.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_2_3", "No. I can't.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_2_4", "No. Sorry.");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_3_1", "Who are you?");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_3_2", "Did you invent Talusian Flat-Bread?");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_3_3", "Why are you hosting a banquet for Tour Aryon?");
stringFiles[2213].addEntry("player_3_4", "Why doesn't he get a new messenger droid?");

stringFiles[2214] = new StringFile("theme_park_corellia/qualdo");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_1", "I'm Herm.  Qual'do Herm.  You must be the new recruit.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_10", "Excellent work.  I'm putting in a request right now to have you bumped up in pay scale.  When you're ready to do more work see Lt. Lance.  He'll have something for you to do.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_1_r1", "That's me.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_1_r2", "No, you're confused.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_2", "Good.  I've got some work for you to do.  This was handed down from the Priness herself, but we don't want to use one of our regular field agents.  Can we trust you with this?");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_2_r1", "Absolutely.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_2_r2", "I'm sort of busy now.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_3", "Sorry.  I thought you were with us.  Well, carry on then.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_4", "Wizard!  I need you to escort a friend of ours.  He's had some trouble with the imperials, but they aren't bothering with him personally.  They've contracted his life out to a bounty hunter.  I need you to get him here safely, he's one of our top scientists.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_4_r1", "Where is he?");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_4_r2", "What does he do?");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_5", "I knew I could count on you.  Here, I'll upload his coordinates to your datapad.  Get to him and make sure he stays safe.  Bring him back here, for the good of the alliance, and I'll make sure our superiors know your name.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_6", "He's an expert in Imperial listening devices.  Without him they'd be listening into every conversation we have.  Fortunately he's been able to block their scans.  But we need him back to do more research.  There's a constant cat and mouse game of spying going on, and he's the only hope we have of winning it.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_6_r1", "Ok, where is he?");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_6_r2", "I'll help you later.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_7", "For the Alliance sake, don't be long.  We don't have time to wait for rookies to get ready.  We need you in the field!");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_8", "Well, we've been waiting. Are you ready yet?");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_8_r1", "Sorry.  I'm ready.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_8_r2", "Nope, not yet.");
stringFiles[2214].addEntry("qualdo_9", "Well, you've blown it.  We're going to have to scramble everything now and put a lot of operations on hold until we get a new technician who can work on those listening devices.  Too bad you weren't more helpful.");

