stringFiles[2216] = new StringFile("theme_park_emails/jabbas_palace");
stringFiles[2216].addEntry("bib_email_1", "I take it you noticed the explosive device that was triggered on the speeder?  That was for our visitor's own protection.  Hopefully you weren't injured in the blast.  I now have more good news.  A pair of notorious thugs in the employ of Lady Valarian are scouring the area seeking our friend.  Find them and kill them.  I'll mark the location where our scanners last saw them.");
stringFiles[2216].addEntry("bib_email_2", "You're proving to be more valuable than I'd imagined.  Good work with the thugs from Valarian.  Now find our friend.  He's sent me a distress beacon and I've marked the location on your datapad.  Make sure you bring him back here unharmed.  He may have more enemies lurking about, so keep your eyes open.");
stringFiles[2216].addEntry("bib_title_1", "Valarian's thugs");
stringFiles[2216].addEntry("bib_title_2", "Our friend...");

stringFiles[2217] = new StringFile("theme_park_imperial/darth_vader");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("cant_work", "Do not approach me unless you are devoted to offering your services.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Oh, you're not an Imperial? Oh, sorry.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "You're not working for him, I take it? If you're not, it would be in your best interest to buzz off.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Oh, you're not here to kill me? Sorry.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "You're not? Then get out of here!");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "Huh? What's going on here? Whoa... that was wierd.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("dontknowyou_6", "Oh, sorry.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("gotowork", "Return to your master.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("gotowork_2", "What is this? I don't want anything from you.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("gotowork_4", "Huh? What's this? I'm the one who's giving it to you, not the other way around.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("gotowork_6", "");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("next", "You have served the Empire well.  Your diligence in these matters has been noted.  For now, I expect you to continue your work against the rebellion.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("notit_1", "Do not test my patience. This object is insignificant compared to the power of the Force.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("notit_2", "This is not the information I have requested. Do not waste my time.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("notit_3", "This bears no importance to me.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("notit_4", "This does not pertain to the information the criminal was to bring to me.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("notit_5", "What is this?");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("notit_6", "This does not interest me. Begone.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("notyet", "I have no time for you now.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_1_1", "I have contracted the services of a special agent to watch for any disturbances on Tatooine. My agent has told me of a Rebel that destined for Naboo. You will find that Rebel and destroy him.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_1_2", "This datapad contains some incriminating information. I have sent for further information to be delivered to me. You will meet with the Emperor's agent and bring to me the information she has acquired.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Our Imperial Probe Droids have managed to locate the intended recipient of the former Rebel's message. You are now tasked with finding this co-conspirator and destroying them.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_1_4", "The connection with this boy and the one who destroyed the Death Star is too coincidental. I have arranged a clandestine meeting between you and an information broker with Black Sun. You are expected there shortly.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_1_5", "This seller of information has tried my patience for the last time. He underestimates whom he is trying to cheat. You will go meet him and deliver to him his payment.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_1_6", "Having reviewed the information purchased by the former broker, it seems there was something worth interest. It seems that my old nemesis, Obi-Wan, had friends upon this very planet. You are to seek them out and destroy them.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_2_1", "You will track down this Rebel and bring back anything of importance on him, for I suspect there was a reason for his journey. My agent has failed in stopping this person. Do not fail me, Agent.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Make sure you see to it. Do not keep my Master's agent waiting for too long.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Our spies have sent Mellag Davin-Lars a message to expect a visitor. You will be that visitor. Bring back anything important located on the corpse.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_2_4", "The information broker has collected some information from Tatooine regarding a past event. You are to retrieve those documents and inform him that once I have perused the information, he will then be paid what he deserves.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Since this information he is selling is obviously false, you will pay him exactly what he deserves. Kill him.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_2_6", "See that it happens. If you find anything of note upon them, bring it to me.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_3_1", "You were given a task that must be fulfilled. Do not anger me.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_3_2", "You will find that statement to be one of your last mistakes.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_3_3", "You try my patience, Agent.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_3_4", "You will do so, and you will do so in a timely fashion. Do not anger me with your childish remarks.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_3_5", "You try my patience, Agent. Shall I contact the Emperor's Hand to settle this?");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_3_6", "Do not waste my time with your idle talk. Reconsider what you have just said.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_4_1", "This Rebel has certain connections to others that interest the Empire. He must not be allowed to reach his contact.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Just as I employ agents to perform menial duties, so does my Master. You will meet with one of his specialists who is adept at recovering information. You would do well to learn from her.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_4_3", "For being a spy and a traitor to the Empire! This is enough to warrant execution. NOW GO!");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Black Sun is a criminal organization that is under the good graces of the Emperor. Were I the one to rule the Galaxy, this would be different. Now, you are expected at the rendezvous point.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_4_5", "The broker claims that there remained a Jedi on the planet of Tatooine. I personally scoured the planet years earlier and found no trace of him. This story of young Skywalker is a deliberate hoax.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_4_6", "Obi-Wan Kenobi was an old enemy. It appears he may have had a deeper connection with the boy who destroyed the Death Star. ");
