stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "The Rebel has yet to arrive. Return to me at a later time.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "She has not yet arrived on the planet. Return to me after some time has passed.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "The Rebel will be expecting you in short time. Return to me shortly and I shall dispatch you.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "The broker is not able to be found at this time. Return to me later, and I'll tell you when he can be destroyed.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_noloc_6", "This one is not available");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_reset", "You have failed me. You are fortunate that I am more forgiving than my master.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "You have done well. I see that you have brought me the information the Rebel was delivering. I may have need of your skills shortly.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Interesting. It seems there is a deeper connection as I had suspected. You have performed well, Agent. I know I will have need of your services later.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "I find this most disturbing. It seems the hero of the Rebellion shares the same name as this farm boy on Tatooine. Interesting. You may leave for now.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "This information cannot be true. Obi-Wan would not have dared to hide himself there.  No! This information is false. You, however, have fulfilled your assignment. I will have more for you shortly.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "Impressive. You destroyed him and his friends by yourself. You have done well by me.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "This information is most disturbing. It appears that were Alderaan still in existence, I would interrogate Bail Organa to see what the connection between Skywalker and Bail's daughter is. Alas, this cannot be done. Very well... I shall pursue a new endeavor. You have served me well, Agent. Fare well, for now.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "Here's the information Vader wanted. Why he cares about these droids is beyond me, considering he wasn't able to stop them in time. I'll be off now.");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2217].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "So look, here's the lowdown on what happend in that cantina. Now you tell that armored freak that I expected to be paid for this, got it?");
