stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_reset_7", "You are denying my will? You have much boldness about you, my young friend. Perhaps that can be focused and hardened, hmmm?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Yes, you have served me well.  You may leave until the criminal and I are done with our... conversation.  And take this as compensation.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "You have returned.  I trust the plans have been safely placed in their hands?  Good, good.  They should be preparing their men at this time for their assistance they have offered.  I will send for you when I need you to do your part, as well.  There is more compensation for you as well, I believe.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "The mercenaries have completed their task due to your assistance.  This is a desirable outcome to these events, don't you think?  Now all we need is patience, and we shall see this plan come through.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "You have done a remarkable job, my friend.  I am very glad to see the... handmaiden.... was not harmed, for we perish the thought of bringing any harm to the people of Naboo.  Isn't that right, Your Highness?  Yes, yes, I'm quite familiar with your tendency of taking on other... guises.Subject, you may leave now as the Queen and I discuss the horrible tragedy that was brought upon her by Rebel imposters.  Take this as your compensation.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "You have performed successfully.  The Queen has watched the distasteful events that unfolded, and will now see what the Rebels really had planned to do.  The painful look she displayed upon her face when she realized she was betrayed by the Rebels was quite.... pleasing.  Go with my blessing.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_reward_6", "Everything is proceeding as I have forseen.  The Rebels will be branded as criminals here on Naboo in short order and the Queen has been turned to our side.  The Rebels do not understand they are no match for the power of the Dark Side.  And now it is time for the General to walk into my trap.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_reward_7", "The Rebels will be sad to hear they have lost one of their most prized Generals.  Only now do they understand the might of the Empire.  The Rebels will now fear the threat of Naboo's Queen.  Without guidance from this General, they will be quite inclined to stay away from Naboo as I continue with my project.  You have served me well, my Hand.  And for that you shall receive this compensation...");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "This is all we were supposed to hide? Well, the guy is paying well, so I guess we'll keep it hidden like he asked. Now, get out of here!");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_smuggle_6", "You have shown up just in time. The Council is to vote soon, and the Queen's speech will help sway our decision.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_smuggle_7", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "Let's move it. I don't like waiting.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "Please take me to the Emperor at once. The Queen is waiting for my report as to what the Emperor has to say.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_takeme_5", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_takeme_6", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_takeme_7", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_work_1", "You have returned so soon. Why?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_work_2", "What do you want, my young friend?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Yes?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Yes, my young friend?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_work_5", "Yes?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_work_6", "Why have you returned so soon?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("npc_work_7", "Why have you not dealt with the Rebel?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("otherescort_1", "If you're not the one, then why are you talking to me?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("otherescort_2", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("otherescort_3", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("otherescort_4", "I am sorry. I have mistaken you for someone else. Good day.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("otherescort_5", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("otherescort_6", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("otherescort_7", "");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes, at your command, my lord.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_1_2", "You can place your trust in me, my lord.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_1_3", "I shall do anything that is asked of me.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_1_4", "I would be honored to do this, my lord.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_1_5", "I will not fail you.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_1_6", "Yes, my lord.  I am at your service.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_1_7", "As you wish, my master.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_2_1", "I do not trust myself to do this right.  I cannot.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_2_2", "This sounds too important for me to do.  I feel Lord Vader should do this, not me.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_2_3", "I do not know how to disable security systems.  I cannot do this.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_2_4", "I should not be given a great responsibility such as that.  Send someone else, please.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_2_5", "I cannot do this all by myself.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_2_6", "Shouldn't there be an entourage to take this to the Council?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_2_7", "I have too much good in me still.  I'm afraid I might save the General at the last minute.");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_3_1", "What do these thugs have to do with the Rebel scum?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_3_2", "Do these security systems guard the Rebel General?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_3_3", "Do these security systems guard the Rebel General?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_3_4", "Why is she blaming the Empire for this when they were clearly mercenaries?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_3_5", "What will this prove to the Queen?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_3_6", "What was the message she recorded?");
stringFiles[2218].addEntry("player_3_7", "Shall I kill him?");
