stringFiles[2219].addEntry("next", "Go and speak to Loam Redge.  Your past work has allowed you access to the main hall.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("notit_1", "What's this? Hmmm?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("notit_2", "What's this?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("notit_3", "What's this?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("notit_4", "What's this?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("notit_5", "What's this?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("notyet", "Could you say that again please?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Greetings, citizen.  I am Kaja Orzee, Administrative Assistant to the Emperor, Himself.  I am assuming you are here so that you may help serve the Empire, am I correct?  We are in need of an armed escort to assist in the transportation of an important official.  Do you wish to serve the Empire in this manner?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Greetings again, citizen.  There has been progress made on the threats with the Moff, and the Empire has need of you again.  Imperial sector police have recorded a conversation detailing someone hiring an assassin to murder the Moff.  The Empire needs you to track down this person that paid for the contract and retrieve the evidence.  Will you do so?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Oh, it's good you stopped by right now.  We have just been informed that the Sector Police have found the assassin, but they are not equipped to handle someone of his caliber.  Shall I tell them that I will be sending a specialist out there to assist them with his capture?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Good news, citizen!  We have tracked down the way the death threats were being sent to the Moff.  It appears that there was a group of Rebel terrorists, not just one acting alone.  We need someone to 'sneak' into their midsts and remove their ability to cause any more damage.  Are you willing to serve the Empire this way?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_1_5", "Ah, citizen!  It seems that one of the Moff's droids had not been altered and survived the last assault, though it is badly damaged.  We need that droid recovered, for it may have information that can be used by the Empire.  Would you be willing to assist in its recovery and escort it back here?");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_2_1", "You will be escorting a Moff of a local system to meet with other officials here within the Emperor's retreat.  You will be expected to treat the Governor with proper respect, and see to it that no harm comes to him during his travel.  You may depart now, for the Governor is waiting.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Very good, then.  He will probably still have receipts of his payment to the assassin, so detain him so that you can bring him and his records here.  If he does not cooperate, you are authorized to use force if necessary.  Here is the location where our droids have last spotted him.  Please make haste.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_2_3", "I shall inform them immediately - they will be glad to hear you are on your way.  Again, try to get the assassin to give himself up so that we can hand him over to the Emperor's Inquistors.  If he is as recalcitrant as was his partner, you are again authorized to use whatever force is necessary.  Good luck!");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_2_4", "I knew you could be counted on, citizen.  Here, this is where you can find these rebel terrorists.  Try to take care of them before they hatch another plan that might cause untold numbers to lose their lives, as some of them have been *VERY* willing to do in the past.  Ask them to surrender, and if not, end their terror.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Though I know it is a simple task, it is still important, which you seem to understand.  You will find the droid in the surrounding wilderness region, based off of its last transmission.  Please return that RA-7 model here safely.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_3_1", "*sighs* Very well, then.  We will likely have to send Stormtroopers to escort him, then.  Your enthusiatic loyalty to the Empire will be noted, citizen.  If you don't mind, I have business to attend to now.  Good day.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I will have to quickly find someone else, then.  Remember, though, that when you let a Rebel terrorist walk free, you might as well be helping them with their anarchy.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_3_3", "You should be ashamed of yourself!  You can handle something like an assassin, but yet you let these new recruits risk their lives?  This is a Rebel assassin, not some trained bounty hunter.  If you don't do it for the police, at least do it for the Emperor!");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Hm.  Perhaps I overestimated you, citzen.  Very well, then.  I shall try to find someone else who wishes to show the Emperor their loyalty.  I believe your answer clearly shows where yours ends.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_3_5", "Tsk, tsk.  A shame, citizen.  I believed you were someone who would continue to show initiative.  I see now that I will have to take your name off of the the 'up and coming' list that is periodically viewed by the Emperor.  Good day to you, citizen.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Recently, one of the Empire's Moffs has been receiving death threats from an unknown sender.  We are currently investigating the source of these threats - Rebel terrorists, no doubt - but the safety of the Moff's life is in jeopardy at this time.  The less attention to the escort, the safer he will be.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_4_2", "You are dealing with the Empire here, not some ragtag band of misguided Rebels.  We have already detached a team of sector police to track down the assassin, citizen.  What we need is someone to track down the Rebel sympathizer who placed the contract.  We are hoping you will not scare him away before dealing with him.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Yes, we do, but we cannot dispatch the Guards.  If we did, who would be there to protect the defenseless Emperor?  You handled the previous situation with such professionalism, that I feel you can handle this with ease.  In addition, this you will be doing your part to scourge this galaxy of another Rebel murderer.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_4_4", "No, not yet.  It seems that with the receipts for the hit contract, there was an address.  An address that led us right to them... the droid repair shop the Moff used to give his droids tune-ups.  They've been planting listening devices in his droids the whole time!  Either way, they don't know their leader is dead yet, so surprise is on now on our side.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_4_5", "This droid was a RA-7 model who's loyalty programming was of a new design.  One in which we should apply to all of our droids, were it my decision.  This was the droid that confirmed the location of the Rebels.  With all their propaganda about their 'Heroic' droids, I'd love those Rebels to hear that we have some heroic ones of our own, too!");
