stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "Long live the Emper-peror-peror.... -zzzrtttzzz-.... Priority override - Secure area achieved. Initiating temporary shutdown.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Oh dear... I'm not too sure Lord Vader will be pleased to hear that the Moff is dead.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "I am sorry to hear that you weren't able to complete this. I guess I'll have to record this on your dossier.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "Well, this just puts a damper on my day. I do not think Lord Hethrir will be too happy to hear that you have failed in this simple assignment.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Hmmm... unfortunately, I will not be able to alter these records to show you in a better light. Perhaps you my be able to learn from this failure.");
stringFiles[2219].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "Perhaps I misunderstood you. I believed you said you were able to do this. Were you to have told me that you were that incompetant, I wouldn't have assigned this to you.");
