stringFiles[2220].addEntry("player_reset", "I cannot do this for you any longer, Inquisitor.");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("player_sorry", "What do you wish me to do again?");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_1", "The Inquisitor is awaiting your return. Don't keep him waiting.");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_2", "Loam Redge is anxiously waitiing for you to return with the leader.");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_3", "Loam Redge is waiting for you to return with the valuable data.");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("return_waypoint_description_4", "Loam Redge is waiting for you to return the Rebel terrorist.");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_1", "Inquisitor Redge");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_2", "Inquisitor Redge");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_3", "Inquisitor Redge");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("return_waypoint_name_4", "Inquisitor Redge");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("waypoint_description_1", "You should be able to find the Rebel around here");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("waypoint_description_2", "You should be able to stop the meeting before they're gone. Hurry.");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("waypoint_description_3", "You need to intercept this courier before he can get the information back to the Rebels.");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("waypoint_description_4", "Find the slicer, the arrest him! He doesn't know you're coming.");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("waypoint_name_1", "Suspected Rebel Sympathizer");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("waypoint_name_2", "Rebel Sympathizer Leader");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("waypoint_name_3", "Rebel Courier");
stringFiles[2220].addEntry("waypoint_name_4", "Rebel Slicer");

stringFiles[2221] = new StringFile("theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("cant_work", "Why are you bothering me, citizen? Can you not see I am even more busy than you are?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Oh, I thought you were about to attack me. I'm just an innocent citizen, minding my own business.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Oh, sorry. I thought you were someone else.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Oh, you're one of us? Sorry about that.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "You're not? Well, have a good day. I'm waiting for someone else.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "Oh, you're not with the Empire. Sorry, my mistake.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("gotowork_1", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("gotowork_2", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("gotowork_3", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("gotowork_4", "I thought he said that he had a hot story on a disc or something.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("gotowork_5", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("next", "You have served me quite well. I have noted on your record that you have displayed full loyalty to the Empire. Perhaps the visiting Captain may have use of you.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("notit", "What is this?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("notit_1", "What is this? I am not one known for a sense of humor, citizen.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("notit_2", "What is this? This is not what I am expecting to receive!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("notit_3", "What is this?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("notit_4", "What's this?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("notit_5", "What's this?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("notyet", "I do not have the faintest idea who you are. Leave my chamber at once.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Your loyalty has been brought to my attention.  I have been assured you are willing to do anything to continue to prove your loyalty to the Empire, am I right?  Good.  You are commanded to locate a small time counterfeiter who is offering to sell the Empire some information.  You will be the contact to do business with him.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_1_2", "This holodisc confirms exactly what I believed.  These are the ones who have been spreading the recent appearance of Rebel propaganda.  I will not tolerate this happening right under my nose.  Together, we will eliminate this threat.  First, you will need to punish the Rebel who has offered his home as a meeting place.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_1_3", "The datapad you recovered was most helpful.  It contained all of the names and locations of these propagandist instigators.  It also showed that a message was sent to warn their leader they have been found out.  You were quite sloppy, weren't you?  I have a plan to bring him out of hiding, though.  You will help with this.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_1_4", "The foolish Alderaanian propagandist has done exactly as expected.  He has come out of hiding, and has begun to make a nuisance of himself.  Finally, I will crush this annoyance, once and for all.  But first, one last thing.  I will need you to deliver this 'special' holodisc to the local holonet broadcast station.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_1_5", "Sector Police have reported they have captured a local serial killer, the one shown on the most recent Holonet broadcast.  It seems the public were the ones who apprehended him.  Now that they have seen what evil that Rebel leader was capable of, they will no longer believe his lies.  Bring him to me for his trial.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_2_1", "You will gather the holodisc he is selling, and pay him with a quick death.  The Empire does not negotiate with terrorists, nor do we pay good credits for information leading to them.  His demise will provide ample message to others that we do not barter like simple merchants.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Your devotion is well noted.  You will meet with the owner of the Alderaanian's meeting house, and eliminate him from the picture.  Since he is the hub of these propagandists, he should have a datapad that should provide information on their leader.  Locate that, for that is just as important.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_2_3", "You will take the fight to our man's mentor, exterminate the old troublemaker, this should drive the point home.  I know you will not fail me again, will you?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_2_4", "The Holonet broadcast station has been contacted by an 'anonymous citizen'.  The 'citizen' claims to have visual proof as to who is responsible for these recent acts of violence.  You will act as the courier for the 'citizen' and deliver them the holodisc.  Make sure they get it.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Very good.  A local mob of citizens has gathered him up and brought him to the Sector Police.  The Emperor has given a statement that his crimes will be tried by the Procurator of Justice, myself.  You are to escort him to me for his... swift... trial.  Make haste, for I am looking forward to this.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I have been misinformed of your loyalty, then.  You are dismissed.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_3_2", "If you are too weak to perform a simple duty, then I have no need of you.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I am greatly disappointed in you.  You may have had a place in the Empire, but your future is quite... uncertain... now.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_3_4", "HOW - DARE - YOU?!  WHO do you think you are speaking with?  Surely... surely you must be shocked from that explosion, or you wouldn't have presumed to say that.  Report to the local medic and have yourself examined.  And I hope for your sake the medic's checkup shows signs of trauma... or else.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_3_5", "It is too late for you to back out now, friend.  If you seem to remember, I gave you an edited holodisc to give to the Holonet broadcast station.  The un-edited version still exists.  It would be most unfortunate if that copy were to fall into the hands of the public, wouldn't it?   I will let you reconsider what you you just said.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_4_1", "It has come to my attention that there are some residents living nearby that were originally from Alderaan.  These 'refugees' are more than likely up to something, and the counterfeiter claims to have a holodisc with recorded suspicious activities on their part.  You are now done with asking frivolous questions.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_4_2", "The holodisc contained some recorded images of these Alderaanians meeting at a safehouse.  These are the ones that are claiming Alderaan was destroyed by use of an Imperial weapon.  We both know that the truth is Rebel terrorists blew up the planet's core to try gain sympathy for their cause, right?  Right?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_4_3", "According to this datapad, the leader's mentor retired from the Imperial Navy three years ago,  then later went on to help General Bel Iblis orchestrate the destruction of the Death Star.  A message from his teacher may help convince the leader to come out of hiding.  I am certain when you are done, that message will get to him loud and clear.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_4_4", "I had taken the liberty to place a holodisc recorder upon your person during these assignments, which have captured all you have done.  Your loyalty will be rewarded, so have no fear.  This particular disc has been edited in such a manner that all of your actions appear to have been done by the propagandist, not you.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_4_5", "*sighs*  Rather than making the propagandist a martyr in the eyes of the public, he has now become a reviled villain.  My function as the Procurator of Justice will be to try this man.  With the evidence we have creat - er - received, this will be all that is necessary to convict him in the eyes of the public.  Is your simple mind able to comprehend that?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_5_1", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_5_2", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_5_3", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_5_4", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_5_5", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_6_1", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_6_2", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_6_3", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_6_4", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_6_5", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_backtowork", "Do not take much more time in finishing this task.  It does not reflect well upon you.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You will meet with informer and do business the Imperial way.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Get that information from the Rebel, fool!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Do the deed, agent. And do not ask any more stupid questions!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Get that holodisc to the reporter at once. If you do not... perhaps he may receive another one instead, hmm?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "Go bring that Rebel to me! GO NOW!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "So you're the one they sent, eh? Hey... what are you doing with that weapon?!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Oh no! The Empire has found us! I need to warn the others!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "How dare you accost me! Oh... you're here to kill me, eh? We'll just see about that, won't we?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Are you the one the Procurator -er- I mean mysterious informant was sending?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "Oh good! Finally one of you Imperials will listen! Take me to your commander at once!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_dropoff_1", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_dropoff_2", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_dropoff_3", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_dropoff_4", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_dropoff_5", "Huh? I.. I don't understand... what do you mean I killed my father? THE EMPIRE DID IT, NOT ME!!!!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "The informant didn't have the datapad, you say? Hmmm... this seems quite convienent, wouldn't you say?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You managed to let him get away? How could you be so thoroughly incompetant!?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "I find it quite disheartening that you were unable to perform such a simple task. Perhaps the Emperor will have more mercy than I... Sadly, I'm rarely wrong. Please, friend... stick around until I get back, alright?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "What a sad shame for you that you weren't able to deliver that holodisc as I asked... what a sad, sad shame indeed....");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "What do you mean he died?! Everything I had planned relied upon him! HOW DARE YOU RETURN HERE WITH THE WORD FAILURE UPON YOUR TONGUE?!");
