stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "It is not time for you to leave just yet. Come back to me in a short while.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "The time is not right just yet. Come back to me shortly.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "The time is not right. Return to me in a short while.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "The reporter will not be able to leave just yet. Ask me again in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "He should be ready for the taking rather soon. Ask me again in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_reset", "I'm sorry. Did I just hear you tell me that you are a Rebel sympathizer?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Excellent.  I will review this holodisc to see if that lowlife actually had anything worth reporting.  Now, for some compensation...let's see what I have...Ah, yes.  This will do quite nicely.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "I hope you made his lesson quite painful, yes?  Good... that's what I wanted to hear.  These Rebels should be rewarded with exquisite pain to repay them for all they have caused the Emperor.  I will have Kaja go through this datapad and recover names.  As for you, please accept this compensation as an expression of my gratitude.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Sector Police have received a report of a local citizen having experienced an 'unfortunate' accident.  This is the price one pays when they cross the Empire.  It's a shame all of those wretched Alderaanian's weren't home when their world ceased to exist.  It shouldn't be too much longer before the leader breaks his silence... then... we will have him.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "The Holonet station has contacted the Empire to let us know they know they have some 'important evidence'.  Good work.  They are preparing to broadcast the holo to the public, then will give us the holo as evidence.  What I would give to be there to watch the Rebel propagandist's face when he watches this broadcast.  This compensation is for your assistance.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "Yesss.... By the look in his eye, his spirit has already been broken.  When he hears that he will be charged with 3 counts of murder, destruction of property, and being part of the Rebel plot to destroy Alderaan, well... I'm certain the horror in his eyes will increase ten-fold.  Ahh...exquisite.  I shall let the Emperor know of your... assistance... with this.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "Wow... this will hit the HoloNet like wildfire! This story will make my career!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_takeme_5", "What do you mean I'm under arrest! The Empire has killed all those I love, and I have proof!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_work_1", "What do you need now?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_work_2", "What do you want?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Why have you not left?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Why are you not performing your duties, agent?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("npc_work_5", "What do you want?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("otherescort_1", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("otherescort_2", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("otherescort_3", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("otherescort_4", "");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("otherescort_5", "Oh, you're not with the Empire. Sorry, my mistake.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes, sir, I understand.  What business shall I perform?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yes, this Rebel needs to be punished.  How shall I do it?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_1_3", "What do you need me to do, Lord Hethrir?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_1_4", "You can place your trust in me, Lord.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_1_5", "Now I understand!  I am honored to help with this.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_2_1", "I don't think this is the right kind of job for me.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_2_2", "This doesn't sound like the type of work that I am capable of.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_2_3", "I fear I will fail you again, Lord.  I cannot do this.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_2_4", "Get a Stormtrooper to do it.  I don't lower myself to the level of a simple courier.");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_2_5", "But he didn't do any of that!  That's not justice!  I won't have any part of this!");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_3_1", "You're the Procurator of Justice, right?  Why are you dealing with mundane tasks such as this?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_3_2", "What was recorded on that holodisc?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_3_3", "What is this plan of yours, if I may ask?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_3_4", "What is so 'special' about this particular holodisc?");
stringFiles[2221].addEntry("player_3_5", "I don't think I understand what you're talking about, my Lord.  Can you please explain?");
