stringFiles[2239] = new StringFile("theme_park_rebel/c3po");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("backtowork", "Please don't let us down.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("cantwork", "What a pleasure to meet you. I have been informed that you support the Alliance's cause,which I find to be quite noble, indeed. If you have any time to spare, perhaps you may wish to help with some tasks that could use an extra hand?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "You are not the bringer of comestibles. Time cannot be wasted for other conversations.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Which, of course, you're not. Look, I'm busy, alright?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Well, I guess I'll mull over the fate of technology by myself, if you don't mind.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "This heat is sure oppressive, would'nt you say? Well, have a good day.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("gotowork", "I think you have things to do, yes?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("next", "Please see our friend Qual'do Herm.  He may have some tasks for you as well.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("notit_1", "Mrmmm... no this is not the comestibles that we were told of. Is this Alliance's joking?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("notit_2", "What's this? It's message said that you'd be bringing some bacta, but this doesn't look like any bacta I've ever seen before.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("notit_4", "I don't know what this is, but it sure doesn't look like my contact information. Maybe you gave me the wrong thing?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("notyet", "My circuits must need cleaning.  What did you say?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Hello. I am C-3P0, Human-Cyborg Relations. My companion is R2-D2, and he has been informed from High Command that you are interested in assisting with the Alliance's cause. According to R2, it seems there is a need for someone to deliver a shipment of food to sympathizers of our cause. Would you be interested in doing this?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Good day to you again. Are you interested in offering further assistance? I'm certain that R2 can find something in the databanks, can't you R2? I said find something in the databanks right now, R2! Okay... yes... okay, R2 says that medicine needs to be urgently delivered to an attack squad that has been wounded. Will you do this?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Oh, R2 says that you are needed to help provide an escort for a person needing to reach this hidden base. See, R2, I told you this one could be trusted. Now, as I was saying, the Alliance requests your aid in acting as a bodyguard. Would you be available for this endeavor?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_1_4", "No, if it wasn't for you, we would never have been in this mess. No. No, I still don't like you. *ahem* Oh, excuse me, I was speaking with R2. You have been requested to take on this duty by *hmph* R2 of all people. The Alliance needs to have this delivered to the new leader of the cell.  Would you be so kind as to deliver it?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Oh, very good. R2 says to take this shipment to a Selonian spokeswoman who will be waiting for it's arrival. R2 has provided the coordinates as to where you will meet her. Good luck to you in your journey!");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Oh, they will be pleasantly surprised that you have offered to help. What was that, R2? What do you mean you're surprised, too? Oh, whatever. As I was saying, R2 will alert one of their scouts to meet you so that the Imperials do not track you back to them. Please bring them this bacta.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_2_3", "What glorious news! R2 has given you the last known coordinates of where the leader can be found.  He is waiting for you to pick him up, using this set of designated codewords. What do you mean you don't have the codewords, you obsolete droid, you? Deleted? *ahem* I'm sorry, but there are no codewords. You'll have to make do, I guess.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Wonderful! Now, take this information to these coordinates. Your contact will be waiting for you there. Be safe in your travels!");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Oh, I do so understand. If you feel you wish to offer your assistance in the future, please stop by. I am sure R2-D2 will be able to find something in the computers.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Oh, please do reconsider. Without that medicine, any number of ghastly things could happen to their numbers. ....No, no R2, I'm sure this is the person the Princess said to give the mission to...    ...oh, what do you know, you rust-bucket!...");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Oh, I understand. You cannot be asked to do something that you cannot help with. Perhaps someone else can help with this, then.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Oh dear. I would've hoped that you were willing to perform this duty. Since you have proven yourself to R2 and I, I was so certain. Well, good day.   ....you stop your laughing, R2....");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_4_1", "What do you mean this person doesn't have the proper clearance for that, R2? Well, I don't think that's polite to ask someone to do this without telling them why. *ahem* R2 says that some Selonian food stores have been attacked by the Imperials and the Alliance wishes to help them with this. Unfortunately, this is all he will say.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_4_2", "According to R2, there was an independent strike force that attempted to attack a Imperial Repair facility, but encountered greater resistance than expected. R2 is still being obstinate, and refuses to elaborate any further. Hmph, I swear I should have left you back on Tatooine, you pint-sized excuse for a Jawa. Oh, I'm sorry. Where were we?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_4_3", "If you know what's good for you, you'll tell this kind person the whole story, R2! Ohhhh, I see. *ahem* R2 says that the leader of cell of covert Alliance members has come under questioning by the Empire, and High Command will be helping him escape off planet before he's arrested. You are needed to escort him back here.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_4_4", "It's a list of contact information. You will be bringing it to the person who is taking over Taergle's place as organizer of a small cell of eyes and ears for the Alliance. R2 says to guard this with your life, for many lives will be at stake if it gets into the wrong hands.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "I understand you must be quite busy. The Alliance appreciates anything you can do.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "I understand you must be quite busy. The Alliance appreciates anything you can do.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "I understand you must be quite busy. The Alliance appreciates anything you can do.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "I understand you must be quite busy. The Alliance appreciates anything you can do.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "You are who the Princess sends with the comestibles, yes?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "I hope you're the one that Protocol Droid said was coming...");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "They don't make hyper-drives they way they used to, wouldn't you say?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "How are you doing today? I find it to be quite oppressive *wink*, don't you think?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Oh, that isn't good news. What's that R2? Oh dear. R2 says that without that food, the Selonians may not think of joining the Alliance. The Princess will be most disturbed.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Oh, that isn't good news. What's that R2? Oh dear. R2 says that without that medicine, some of their wounded will die. The Princess will be most disturbed by this news.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "Oh, that isn't good news. What's that R2? Oh dear. R2 says that the Princess will have to deliver the bad news to the rest of his family. I'm sure you tried your best, though.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Oh, that isn't good news. What's that R2? Oh dear. R2 says that information was quite important and shouldn't get into the wrong hands. I'm sure you tried your best, though.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Oh, what's this? R2 says the information that is in the computer isn't correct. He will try to recover it again. Please do ask again in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Oh, what's this? R2 says the information that is in the computer isn't correct. He will try to recover it again. Please do ask again in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Oh, what's this? R2 says the information that is in the computer isn't correct. He will try to recover it again. Please do ask again in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "Oh, what's this? R2 says the information that is in the computer isn't correct. He will try to recover it again. Please do ask again in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_reset", "Ok, please return when you feel more comfortable working for the alliance.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Oh, I do so understand. If you feel you wish to offer your assistance in the future, please stop by. I am sure R2-D2 will be able to find something in the computers.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Oh, please do reconsider. Without that medicine, any number of ghastly things could happen to their numbers. ....No, no R2, I'm sure this is the person the Princess said to give the mission to...    ...oh, what do you know, you rust-bucket!...");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Oh, I understand. You cannot be asked to do something that you cannot help with. Perhaps someone else can help with this, then.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Oh dear. I would've hoped that you were willing to perform this duty. Since you have proven yourself to R2 and I, I was so certain. Well, good day.   ....you stop your laughing, R2....");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Yes, that is a message that the Alliance will be most pleased to hear. On behalf of the Alliance, I am instructed to offer you our sincerest thanks.  R2 suggests that we might give you this reward for your assistance.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "What an excellent outcome, I would say. With that bacta in their hands, they should be able to heal most of their injuries. Thank you very much. ............Yes, I just kicked you, you overgrown Mouse Droid! You said this kind person couldn't do the job. Well, I think you now see you're wrong, don't you? Well, I still think you're wrong..........Anyway, we don't have much to offer ourselves, but you may have this reward for your assistance.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "How exquisite this turned out. R2-D2 has sent a report to High Command that Taergle was able to make it here safely. According to R2, he will be smuggled off-planet, with his family to follow.  Both his dedication and yours to our cause is quite commendable.  Please accept this reward for your assistance.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Thank the Maker! You delivered it without the Empire finding out! This is wonderful news indeed. What's that, R2? Yes, I think it's about time you said that. R2 wishes to apologize for his exceptionally rude and crude, if I might add, behavior towards you. He wishes to thank you as well. He now believes you are smarter than he thought, and he wishes for you to take this reward for your assistance.  Really R2!");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_smuggle_1", "Ahhh... yes... nutritious comestibles for many. The Princess should be told that this will be held within our memories.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_smuggle_2", "Well, that droid wasn't kidding. Tell the base that we'll be able to make it back when the coast is clear. Thanks again, friend... you just saved a lot of lives!");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "Let me see... yes, these are my contacts. What? Well, I'll be. Garello is a Rebel too? I would never have pegged him for a Rebel. Well, friend, I thank you for bringing this by. I can now start getting us organized again.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "What do you mean the codewords were dropped? Well, either way, I'll trust you. Please, lead on before the Empire knows I've left.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_work_1", "My, my, you are efficient. Have you already delivered the food supplies?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_work_2", "My, my, you are efficient. Have you already delivered the medicine?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_work_3", "My, my, you are efficient. Have you brought back the leader yet?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("npc_work_4", "My, my, you are efficient. Have you delivered the information yet?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("otherescort", "No, I think you have the wrong guy.  Maybe there is someone around here that looks just like me?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_1_1", "Yes, I'll help.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_1_2", "Sure, I'll deliver the medicine.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_1_3", "Yeah, I'll do it.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_1_4", "No problem.  I'll take it.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_2_1", "No thank you.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_2_2", "I'm sorry, but someone else should do it.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_2_3", "Sorry, I'm not a bodyguard. Find someone else.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_2_4", "Sorry, I have something else I need to do.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_3_1", "Who are these sympathizers?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_3_2", "What happened to the squad?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_3_3", "Who will I be escorting?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_3_4", "Well, first what is it?");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_reset", "I don't think I can handle this right now.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_reset_1", "I had something come up. I can't do this right now.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_reset_2", "I had something come up. I can't do this right now.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_reset_3", "I had something come up. I can't do this right now.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_reset_4", "I had something come up. I can't do this right now.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_sorry", "Sorry, I'll get back to work.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "No, not yet. I shall do so immediately.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "No, not yet. I shall do so immediately.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_sorry_3", "No, not yet. I shall do so immediately.");
stringFiles[2239].addEntry("player_sorry_4", "No, not yet. I shall do so immediately.");

stringFiles[2240] = new StringFile("theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("cantwork", "Ah, I see you are a bit preoccupied with your time right now. When you have time for rather important matters, I would like to discuss them with you.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Wait! You're not a Rebel. Get out of here before we arrest you.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Aren't you going to try to run so that I can chase you down?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "That's something my mother used to always say. I don't know what she meant by that, though.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "You don't work for the Captain? I'm sorry, I thought you were someone else.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "Never mind. Move along.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("gotowork", "Hmmm... I thank you for this, but I don't think I'll find a use for it. You should keep it yourself.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("next", "Mon Mothma is prepared to see you now.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("notit_3", "Ummm... I though Ackbar said he had a datapad of information he needed me to confirm.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("notit_4", "What's this? This isn't the Empire's military information!");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("notyet", "I need someone to find and talk to our friend Han Solo.  Can you do that?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Come in, don't be shy. So, you're the one I've heard so much about.  I am Captain Ackbar, responsible for much of our scattered fleet. Well, now that the introductions are over, on to matters of business. I have need of your skills in an operation that will help to hide some of our starships. Are you available?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_1_2", "There have been some beneficial repercussions of your distraction assault. It seems there are some locals who have voiced their sympathy to our cause. One person in particular has offered to sell us some Imperial information at a reasonable price. Could I bother you to go represent us in this deal?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I have some surprising information. It seems the bounty hunter who attacked you was... well... quite incompetant. He actually brought with him real information regarding guard schedules. I am going with my instincts this time and having this analyzed before walking into a potential trap. Could you deliver this to one of our operatives?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_1_4", "I have just received the most exciting news since word of the Death Star's destruction. Teria has relayed to me that all of this information is the real thing. What we have here is a comprehensive list of flight paths and guard changes. This needs to get to Admiral Bel Iblis immediately!");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_1_5", "A new Imperial General has been assigned to oversee Dantooine, replacing the one we captured. It looks as if his task is to destroy any remaining 'Rebels'. He is being escorted by a large number of unarmed, rookie Stormtroopers. Therefore, we will want to launch a quick hit-and-fade on the smaller group of armed ones. Will you help?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_2_1", "The fact that you'll be on this mission with us puts my mind at ease. I will need you to act as a special operative on this mission. In order to bring in a few damaged Corellian Corvettes, we need a distraction, which will be your part. You will need to go to this location and cause enough damage to draw the attention of the Empire. That's when we can safely land the starships.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_2_2", "I know this is not an exciting attack on the Empire, but this is still important nonetheless. Thank you for offering to help. Here's where you'll meet him to buy what he's selling. Let me know when you've returned.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_2_3", "You'll be meeting with Teria Alessie out at a secret location. She'll say the phrase, The brighest stars burn out the fastest, wouldn't you say? in which you'll respond with, Every death makes room for new life. At that point, give her this datapad so that she can confirm if it's real or not.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Thank you very much. I have contacted Bel Iblis and he has let me know that he'll be sending his aide, Jeremes Kelton, to pick it up. Make sure it gets into his hands, for once the Admirial receives it, this may likely change the tides of this war into our favor.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Now, you need to listen to your orders very clearly. You will be the only one going out there to do this, for we want to make sure the Empire believes you're acting alone. Attack the squadron and destroy them, then get out of there. We will be leaving a decoy body in the area to make it look like you didn't survive.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I understand. From what has been said of you, I feel this mission will go much more smoothly with your help. If you change your mind, please let me know as fast as possible.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Well, I understand that this is not glamorous, but not everything is flash and bang in our struggle. Sometimes the smallest thing such as buying information can push the war in our favor.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Well, I understand that this is not glamorous, but not everything is flash and bang in our struggle. Sometimes the smallest thing such as transporting information can push the war in our favor.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Very well, then. I thought you would have wanted to help the Alliance a little more than you express right now. A shame, a shame.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_3_5", "It's not a foolish plan, it's a desperate plan. Sometimes a person isn't given too many options and just has to make the best of it. I hope you can see that.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_4_1", "It's a well known fact that after the destruction of the Death Star, our base on Yavin IV has been under siege. We have re-established this emergency base after the Empire located our decoy base on the other side of Dantooine. Unfortunately, this planet is still under Imperial rule, therefore we have no permanent base for our small fleet of starships.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_4_2", "He claims to have been a contractor working on the Death Star before it was destroyed and was able to steal codes relating to military guard movement schedules. I'm not sure how relevant it may be, but he is not asking too much for the information. We might be able to glean some information from it.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Her name is Teria Alessie, and she's acting as a spy for us here on Dantooine. She has access to some information, and will be able to run these schedules through their databanks to confirm if it's correct or not.  Once she has found out, she'll be able to contact us with a positive or a negative.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_4_4", "What I am holding in my hands is a comprehensive list of ship flight paths, Star Destroyer patrols around this planet, guard schedule movements, names of officers in command, etcetera. In other words, this information will allow us to know what the Empire is doing even before they do it.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_4_5", "Because it's a trap! The information regarding guard schedules has been compromised.  I have a team who is ready to deal with the general, but I need you to take out those troopers beforehand.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "We need you to attack a squad of stormtroopers on the other side of the planet. Whilst you do so, we can engage our other team to direct the landing of a group Corvettes.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "All you have to do is pay our friend for the information he has. Once you have it, bring it back so that I can have one of our slicers pick through it.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Her name is Teria, and she'll meet you at the specified coordinates. All you need to do is give her the datapad.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "You'll head out to a secret meeting location. I have provided your description so you will be recognized immediately. Give him the datapad and then come on back here.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "You will find it at the location listed in your datapad. We have another team there already to deposit the decoys after you're done.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "What's this? A Rebel! Don't let them get away!");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "I can't believe you fools fell for it! The Empire's going to pay a lot for your corpse!");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "The brighest stars burn out the fastest, wouldn't you say?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Let's do this fast. I need to get back to the Admiral with the information.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "What's that over there? Rebels! Get them!");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "This is not good news. Without a adequate distraction, we will be unable to land these damaged ships without notice by the Empire.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You mean this was just a hoax? He didn't have any information? Ah, what a shame.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "I don't understand why she wasn't there. I can't seem to contact her right now, so it's possible she might have had to go into hiding if the Empire found out about her. We will be unable to use this information until we can confirm if it's true, though.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "He never showed up? Let me contact Admiral Bel Iblis and find out what went wrong!");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "You weren't able to kill them all? This will not go good to hiding us even further.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "Le me consult our battle plans so that I can choose the best place to cause a distraction. Please speak with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "I'll ask Lance where this sympathizer can be found right now. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "I will have to contact her so that we can arrange a meeting place. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_noloc_4", "I have to designate where the meeting location will be. Once I find out, I'll be able to tell you. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_noloc_5", "I do not know where this area is. Let me consult the guard schedules to find out. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "I understand. From what has been said of you, I feel this mission will go much more smoothly with your help. If you change your mind, please let me know as fast as possible.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Well, I understand that this is not glamorous, but not everything is flash and bang in our struggle. Sometimes the smallest thing such as buying information can push the war in our favor.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Well, I understand that this is not glamorous, but not everything is flash and bang in our struggle. Sometimes the smallest thing such as transporting information can push the war in our favor.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "You can quit a job, but you cannot quit a cause. This is something that is in your heart, not mind. I am sorry to hear that you have lost your will to fight the Empire.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "It's not a foolish plan, it's a desperate plan. Sometimes a person isn't given too many options and just has to make the best of it. I hope you can see that.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Wonderful, you're back. The operation was a full success. While you enaged the Imperials, they sent several squads in your direction, diverting their sensors. We now have the Corvettes cleverly camoflaged while they undergo secret repairs. Your reputation is well deserved.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "What? Why didn't I trust my feelings and recognize this as a trap? Well, I am sorry to have put you through that, friend. Let's count ourselves lucky that Bounty Hunter wasn't that skilled at his trade. I'll still go through this information to see if it has any real information. Please, relax while we are looking through it, considering your close call.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "I'm glad you were able to make it there safely and back. Now all we have to do is wait for her report, then we can act. I thank you for your assistance.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "I have already been contacted by Admiral Bel Iblis and he tells me the information is in his hands. He is already beginning to move various splinters of the fleet to other areas. We have found some places on Dantooine alone that are never patrolled. Our war against the Empire looks like it has taken a turn for the good again. Thank you.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "Very good. According to the manner in which the Empire is responding to that, and by consulting the schedules, it would seem that they have fallen for the trick. If this new General is as pompous as the last one, then he will gloat over his success. That, in turn will hide our base all the more. Thank you for your help, friend. Now... I have been asked to direct you to Mon Mothma. She is awaiting you in the next room.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_smuggle_3", "Okay, let Ackbar know that I'll check this information when I get back to the offices. Once I find out, I'll send him the confirmation the ususal way. Good luck!");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "This information will be essential to the future of the Alliance. With this, we can hide much of our fleet in safer locations until we can find a more permanant base. Ha! No more having to cause distractions.  I'll get this to the Admiral immediately.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Are you prepared for your mission?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Are you ready to go meet him?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Do you have a question about your assignment?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Have you contacted Jeremes yet?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("npc_work_5", "Are you ready to depart?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("otherescort", "Ummm... I think you have the wrong guy. Maybe that other person nearby was who you were looking for?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_1_1", "Always. How can I help?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_1_2", "Sure. I'll make sure the information is purchased.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_1_3", "I'll do it. Where do you want me to take it?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_1_4", "I'll do it for you.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_1_5", "I'll help with your plan.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_2_1", "Sorry Captain, but I'm a bit busy right now.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_2_2", "That's outside of my skills. No thanks.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_2_3", "Sorry, I'm not a courier. Get someone else.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_2_4", "I'm not taking any more documents anywhere.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_2_5", "I'm not interested in commiting suicide. No.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_3_1", "What do you mean by scattered fleet?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_3_2", "What information are we buying?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_3_3", "Who is the operative?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_3_4", "Why is this information so important?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_3_5", "Why in blazes are we not attacking the General!?!?!");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_reset_1", "Sorry, Captain, but I can't be part of this right now.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_reset_2", "Sorry, but this isn't my style. I can't do this anymore.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_reset_3", "I can't do this anymore.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_reset_4", "I'm done with sending datapads around. I quit!");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_reset_5", "I've changed my mind. I can't do foolish plan anymore.");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "Yes I am. What am I to do again?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "Yes I am. What exactly are my orders again?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_sorry_3", "Who am I supposed to give this to again?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_sorry_4", "Where am I to meet him again?");
stringFiles[2240].addEntry("player_sorry_5", "Yes, I am. Where am I to do this?");

stringFiles[2241] = new StringFile("theme_park_rebel/han_solo");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("cantwork", "Hey kid, why don't you come back when you are a little less busy, okay?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "I don't know you, right? How about we keep it that way?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Nevermind. I thought you were working for Nym.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Sorry, I thought you worked for Nym. Never mind.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Oh, you're not Han's friend after all. Well, thanks for the help, bub.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "I think it would be in your best interests if you left. Immediately.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("gotowork", "I don't need this. Keep it for yourself.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("next", "You should go to Dantooine.  Ackbar is looking for some help I hear.  He could use somebody like you.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("noloc_1", "Let me see if I can remember where he used to hang out. This was a long time ago, so give me a few minutes, okay?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("noloc_2", "Let me go start up the Falcon, then I'll let you know where their hideout is. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("noloc_3", "Let me see where Nym said this guy can be found. Check back with nme in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("noloc_4", "Let me check the map to see where those coordinates are. Check with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("noloc_5", "Let me find out where you're supposed to meet his money guy. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("notit_2", "No, Nym said that he wanted a 'Holonomocron', or something like that. From how he described it, this doesn't look like it.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("notit_5", "What's this!? This ain't the money! Is Solo trying to pull another one past us again? Why I oughta...");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("notyet", "Talk to Nien.  I'm too busy right now.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_1_1", "How are you doing, kid? Both Leia and Nien told me you can be counted on, which is what I need right now. If they haven't already told you, I'm here to try to hook up a deal for the Alliance with one of the biggest smuggler pirates this side of the Outer Rim. I need you to go let an old associate know I need to get in contact with Nym. Can you do that?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I can't believe that Nym! Who does he think he is?! He's doing this just to get back at me! *sigh* Well, I guess I'm going to have to play by his rules. I'm going to need your help for this one if you don't mind. I need you to help recover a stolen item of Nym's before he'll talk to me about any deals. Can you help?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I've just had E'Dycu tell Nym that I'm not going to be playing this game of his anymore. Nym has agreed to talk trade as long as I take care of the rest of that pirate band that has been bothering him lately. Again, I'm gonna need your help with this.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Why that lowdown, rotten, fink! Nym refused to involve himself with the Rebellion! When I get my hands on him, I'm goi- ...hold on a sec, kid, my commlink's acting up... What do you want now? Huh? Okay, try to hold them off - I'll send some help right now! Kid... a friend of mine's been ambushed by Imperials. You've got to go save him!");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_1_5", "Okay, things have turned out for the best after all that. Nym has agreed to sell his current surplus to the Alliance. While I'm contacting Leia to let her know how this has turned out, I'm gonna need you to deliver the downpayment to his money guy. Will you do that one last thing for me?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_2_1", "That's what I wanted to hear. Now look, the guy you're looking for is E'Dycu, an old smuggler I used to work with. Let him know I'm here, and bring him back so I can talk with him face to face. I know E'Dycu will still be able to get in touch with Nym so I can try to broker a deal for the Alliance. Good luck, kid.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Okay, I'm going to go make a lot of noise with the Falcon next to the bandits' hideout. This should scare them out of their den, which is where you come in. You tell the guy who has it that you're not leaving without something called a 'Holocron'. Watch out, because this guy sounds like he prefers action over words.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_2_3", "This is what we'll have to do. Nym has let me know where the bandit's leader can be found. You need to go out there and put a stop to him. The rest of his crew will then scatter to different parts of the Rim, Nym will then sell the spoils of his raids to Leia, and we'll all be happy.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Okay, he said he was holed up out at these coordinates. Since we are closer than any of Nym's guys, he contacted me for help, which means he's really desperate. He may not be the best of guys, but we go way back and I owe him a couple. If he's been wounded, bring him back here so I can try to patch him up.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Okay, kid, you're going to need to meet up with his bruiser, Nateba Kerr. Nateba will then take the money back to Nym, then we can get out of here.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Come on, kid. It's nothing more than a simple message delivery, and maybe bring him back here. So what if you have to keep an eye out for the worst pirates not under Jabba's employ?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Look, I don't want to do this either, but Leia and Luke have managed to keep convincing me help out. The sooner we can do this, the faster we can leave. Do it for me, kid.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_3_3", "You think I like doing this too? I'm only doing this because Luke and Leia are convinced I can get Nym to sell us some of his spoils for use by the Alliance. Look, if you help, maybe I can hook you up with a reward from the Alliance. Think about it...");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Look, he's not as bad as you think he is. I've worked with a bunch of bad people, and he's a lot better than most. I need you to bring him back while I take out the rest of the Imperials. Just take my word for it, kid.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_3_5", "*sigh* Kid, here's the truth. I needed you to do this for me because when I last left here, Nym let me know that if I ever stepped foot on Lok ever again, he'd kill me himself. I've already got Jabba after me, I don't want to risk finding out if Nym was telling the truth or not.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Yeah... I guess you could say that. Look, before I was part of the whole destruction of the Death Star thing, well, let's just say I didn't have the most respectable of jobs. This Nym guy used to hire me before I started working for Jabba, but let's just say I made a bunch of people angry around here when I left. Let's just leave it at that, okay?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Of course I can get it myself! I've made the Kessel Run in under 12 parsecs and was there at the Death Star run.  Someone has to cause the commotion, and I don't see you with a starship nearby.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_4_3", "Well, Nym ain't that great of a guy.  Matter of fact, when me and Chewie went to go work for Jabba - the worst decision I ever made, I might add - Nym and I had a few, well, not-so-nice words to say to each other. These pirates we're taking care of are a step worse, though. They're taking slaves and selling them to the Empire, which Nym is actually against, go figure.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_4_4", "Well, while we were talking, he said a little bit ago the Empire tried forcing Nym to either work for them or they'll put him out of business. I guess this is intended to be a message to Nym they were serious. Who knows... if this turns out good, this might actually be our lucky day.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_4_5", "Nym makes a living plying the space-lanes and hitting cargo ships. A while back, he hit an Imperial convoy of freighters carrying shipments of bacta. Nym has a lot left over and is willing to sell his supply to the Rebellion now. Other than that, he's not picking sides... and knowing him, I don't think anyone will ever be able to convince him otherwise.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Well, good luck kid. When a person doesn't want to be found, it makes the job all the more difficult.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Well get back out there. I can't pull off my part without you.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "Well hurry it up. The faster we can do business, the faster we can get off this planet.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "What are you waiting for! Go out there and save him already!");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "Well hurry it up. The faster we can finish this business, the faster we can get off this planet.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Whatever the problem is, I didn't do it.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "I knew that raid would get Nym's attention! Kill him, boys!");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Nym isn't going to be the Pirate King for too long. You're going to die now, you hear?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Hey! You're Han's friend! Help me out with these Imperial toadies! I can't do anything, my blaster's jammed!");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "You'd best have the money, or you'd best get out of here, you know what I'm saying?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "What do you mean he's no longer on Lok? Awww... but he has to be! What am I going to tell Leia?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "What do you mean he said he sold it!? You believed him?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "I was hoping you could have handled this guy. I guess I'll go do this myself now. I've got to go now.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "He's dead?! Oh, this is not good....");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "Okay, let me get this straight... You're saying a Jawa leaped out from behind a boulder and stole the money?... Let's go over this again...");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Come on, kid. It's nothing more than a simple message delivery, and maybe bring him back here. So what if you have to keep an eye out for the worst pirates not under Jabba's employment?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "Look, I don't want to do this either, but Leia and Luke have managed to keep convincing me help out. The sooner we can do this, the faster we can leave. Do it for me, kid.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "You think I like doing this too? I'm only doing this because Luke and Leia are convinced I can get Nym to sell us some of his spoils for use by the Alliance. Look, if you help, maybe I can hook you up with a reward from the Alliance. Think about it...");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "Look, he's not as bad as you think he is. I've worked with a bunch of bad people, and he's a lot better than most. I need you to bring him back while I take out the rest of the Imperials. Just take my word for it, kid.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "*sigh* Kid, here's the truth. I needed you to do this for me because when I last left here, Nym let me know that if I ever stepped foot on Lok ever again, he'd kill me himself. I've already got Jabba after me, I don't want to risk finding out if Nym was telling the truth or not.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Hey-hey...E'Dycu! Long time no see, buddy! Just give me a moment. Hey, kid, let me talk with E'Dycu for a little bit here. Why don't you see if Chewie wants to play a game of holochess with you. ...........Oh yeah... Make sure he wins.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Well, this looks like what he was talking about. According to E'Dycu, Nym said this used to belong to one of his friends before she died, and he's keeping it for sentimental value. That pirate sent me out to pick up a piece of junk! Well, I'll tell him a thing or two. Either way, thanks kid, your help was needed out there. ");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Good work, kid. I could've used you when I was still smuggling,you know that? Okay, now with that done, Nym had better give us a good deal on these supplies. I'll have E'Dycu contact him again, then we can get out of here.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Thanks for doing that. I made sure the rest of the Imperials weren't able to send for reinforcements. Now, after Chewie makes sure his wounds won't kill him, I'm gonna have a little sit-down talk with my friend. Hopefully I can persuade him to convince Nym that we should start negotiations again.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "He's keeping the bacta in 'The Old Place', huh? Yeah, I still know where that is. I'll fly us over there so we can bring it back to the base on Dantooine. Speaking of which, I told Leia how much help you've been. She's asked me to tell you to meet with Captain Ackbar on Dantooine if you wish to keep helping. Thanks for your help, kid... I owe you one.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "Let me count it...... Okay, it's all here. Nym says that the bacta is going to be in 'The Old Place'.  I'm also supposed to give Solo a good fist to the face for old time's sake, so you're lucky I don't know you. ");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "You're a friend of Han Solo's you say? Well, it's been a while since I've seen that scoundrel. Take me to where he is.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_takeme_4", "I've been shot, and shot pretty good, too. Can you help me back to your hideout?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_work_1", "So, were you able to find E'Dycu?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Did you find the thing Nym wants back?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Did you put a stop to that pirate leader?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Huh? What do you need?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("npc_work_5", "Did you pay them yet?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("otherescort", "Aaargghh... I think ye be pickin' the wrong person... ye be best to look around nearby.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_1_1", "Sounds easy enough. Sure, I'll do it.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_1_2", "Sure, I can help with this.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_1_3", "Sounds like fun. I'll do it.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_1_4", "You're right I'll help!! Where is he?!");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_1_5", "Don't worry, Nym will get his money.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_2_1", "Sorry, but I can't do it right now.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_2_2", "I'm not interested in helping a pirate king, Han. No.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_2_3", "Sorry, Han, but I don't agree with this. No.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_2_4", "That's what he gets! No, I'm not helping!");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_2_5", "I think you should give him the money, not me.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_3_1", "I take it you don't want to be seen around here?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_3_2", "Can't you get the item yourself?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_3_3", "What's the difference between Nym and these pirates?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_3_4", "Why was he ambushed by Imperials?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_3_5", "What exactly is the Alliance buying?");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_reset_1", "I can't find him and I don't want to look any more.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_reset_2", "I don't want to involve myself with this anymore.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_reset_3", "I'm not enjoying this. I'm going to stop doing this now.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_reset_4", "Han, I can't help this pirate out.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_reset_5", "Han, I think you should do this, not me.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "Not yet. I think I'll go look for him again.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "Not yet, but I think I will soon.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_sorry_3", "Not yet. He'll be stopped soon.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_sorry_4", "Nothing. Just wanted to say 'Hi'.");
stringFiles[2241].addEntry("player_sorry_5", "Not yet. I'm about to leave now.");

stringFiles[2242] = new StringFile("theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("cantwork", "I understand you have other things to do, but I deperately need your help. Could you please attend to your business then return as soon as possible?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Move along.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("dontknowyou_4", "Oh. I thought you were someone else. You'd best be running along now.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "You weren't sent by General Dodonna? I see. Look, you might want to get out of here before it gets dangerous, okay?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("gotowork", "I'm busy waiting for something right now.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("next", "Go find Luke.  I'm worried something might have happened to him.  He's just along the corridor here, deeper in the temple.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("noloc_1", "Let me get the coordinates of the transports. Ask me again in a few minutes. ");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("noloc_2", "Let me get the coordinates of the landing site. Ask me again in a few minutes. ");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("noloc_3", "Let me get the coordinates of the repair facility. Ask me again in a few minutes. ");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("noloc_4", "I'll contact Nateba and find out where he'll meet you. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("noloc_5", "Lert me contact Luke and find out where he can meet you. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("notit_4", "What's this? This isn't the datapad that the General told me to deliver. Come on, we don't have much time.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("notit_5", "Umm... I'm not too sure what this is. Are you sure this is what General Dodonna wanted you to bring me?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("notyet", "I can't speak with you unless Mon Mothma has given you clearance.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Welcome, welcome. Please come in. You have been highly recommended by both Leia and Mon Mothma. As you can tell, our base in under heavy siege, and won't last too much longer. Right now, I am in need of your fabled skills to help some transports leave the planet. Can you help with this?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I am once again in need of you. One of our deep Intelligence teams has uncovered some very important military information regarding the Empire, but were unaware that that our base was under siege. They have landed far away from here to be safe, but they need to be escorted back here safely. Can you help?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_1_3", "Watch your head! Feel that shaking? It's the Empire ramping up their bombing efforts... they know we're weakening.  At this rate, I'm not sure we'll be able to get everyone out to safety. I need you for an operation that will hopefully slow them down. Can you help?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_1_4", "I have made an important discovery among the information the infiltration team has brought back. This information may help us to create a permanent base once again, one far away from Imperial probes. I dare not transmit this information where it can be intercepted, therefore I need you to deliver this to a pilot who will fly it to Mon Mothma.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_1_5", "This is horrible!  Nateba was shot down by a turbolaser battery before he was able to make it out of the atmosphere. Other than Luke, who's helping escort others off the planet, I don't have anyone else to deliver the information. Wait... I'll have to get another pilot.  I'll need you to deliver this.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_2_1", "At this location, you will find a group of camouflaged transports that are to be leaving the planet. Every one of them is full of refugees from our bases, and they are being attacked by a band of stormtroopers. Eliminate the stormtrooper threat before they prevent the ships from ever leaving the planet.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Here is where their last communication came from. You should find their team out there waiting for your arrival. Once you find them, return back here immediately with them.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Okay, I will need you to take out a group of stormtroopers that's causing us trouble. If you can do this, you will buy us a lot more time.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Take the information encoded on the datapad to Nateba Kurr, one of the last X-Wing pilots I have available on the planet. Once he has it, he'll depart to Dantooine and deliver it promptly.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Since Nateba Kurr's X-Wing was completely obliterated, there's no wreckage to recover the datapad from. Fortunately, I made another copy of this info for myself. Look... this is the last copy we have. It's vital that it makes it to safety... I'm sure he'll be able to avoid the turbolaser on his way off planet.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_3_1", "I'm sorry, I don't think I heard you correctly. Did you just say that you are willing to let the Empire destroy many innocent lives?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Please reconsider. There aren't too many able bodied people left here, and I trust you can get the job done.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_3_3", "I understand, but you must understand as well : you are our only hope.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_3_4", "Look, we need to get this information to our current base, and you're the only one I trust that can get it there. Please reconsider.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_3_5", "What? This is very important! This could save the lives of thousands of the Rebellion! Ask yourself if you'll be able to live with yourself if you refuse this.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_4_1", "This has been our base for some time now, but with the Death Star being destroyed we have revealed our presence to the the Empire. Most of the base's personnel have been evacuated off the planet, but many still need to leave. With a host of X-Wings still left to cause distractions, we can safely see the rest of them off planet.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_4_2", "They have been infilitrating the Empire for a few years now, only recently coming out from their disguise. They claim to have information regarding the exact fleet size of the Empire, and also the sectors they patrol regularly. This information has the potential to be the most important information we have seen in a long time.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_4_3", "The Empire is using a number of T.I.E. Bombers to keep up a steady attack.  Vader has a group of stormtroopers on the planet that are giving him coordinates to bomb.  I'm not sure why he's steering clear of these temples, but whatever the case may be, his bombing campaign is beginning to work.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_4_4", "As I said earlier, I was one of the first Star Destroyer captains when they were comissioned by the Old Republic, before the Emperor took over. With that experience, I can tell by looking at this information that the flight paths of the Empire's Star Destroyers seem to overlook a few systems in thier patrols. The one that interests me the most is a small system called Hoth.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_4_5", "It's the only chance!  You've got to deliver that information!");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You need to get to those transports now before they are blown sky high! Eliminate the Stormtroopers causing the problem.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "You will need to locate the infiltration team and escort them back here.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "You need to locate the stormtroopers sending coordinates and take them out.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "You need to deliver the locations of potential base sites to Nateba Kurr. Once you have done so, Nateba will then be able to deliver the information to Mon Mothma himself.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "You need to get this vital data to Luke Skywalker immediately!");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "There's a Rebel! Kill him!");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Help!  I'm the only one left from our team and I think I'm heavily wounded.....");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Don't let them stop us! Keep broadcasting!");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_breech_4", "Hurry! I need to get that information to High Command before I'm spotted by any T.I.E.s.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "Hello. You must be the person General Dodonna told me to expect.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "We have received word that four of our transports have been destroyed whilst still on the ground. On board those transports were 200 men and women. I hope you remember this day for a long time.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "The information that they held was quite important. It very well could have changed the face of this Civil War. The fact that you let them die will be remembered by me for a long, long time.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "With the Empire still being able to rearm as fast as they can bomb, I'm not sure how much time is left with this temple.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "Without that information getting to Mon Mothma in time, we may not be able to begin relocation to Hoth without being seen.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "That was the last copy of the information we had. We may never be able to move our way out to that system any longer.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reset", "I'll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "I'll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "I'll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "I'll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "I'll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "I'll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "With those Stormtroopers taken care of, the transports were able to leave the planet safely. We have lost many X-Wings, but fortunately there aren't too many more needed to leave the planet. You did good work. I will have need of you again shortly.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "This information will be a great help indeed. From the quick look I had of it, it seems that the Empire hasn't changed their protocols since I was a Captain. You didn't know that? Yes... I was one of the first Captains of the Imperial Class Star Destroyers. That, though, was a long time ago. When we are all done, I'll see to it that everyone of them are scuttled and turned into plowshares.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "With the bombing out of the way, it will take the Empire's forces quite a bit longer to rearm from their Star Destroyers. This should give us much more time to get the remaining people off of this base. Thank you for your help.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Nateba has let me know that he is already inputting the navigation codes to Dantooine and should be off-planet within a few minutes. Thank you for getting that information there safely.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "Okay, I feel much better knowing that Mon Mothma has this information. If there's anyone who can manuever his way around turbolasers, it will be him. In order to speed up the evacuation of a group of archaelogists, would you mind going out to help Luke?  He should be just along this passage, deeper in the ruins.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_smuggle_4", "Okay, great! I'll get back to my X-Wing and have my R2 unit plot a course to Dantooine. Good luck out here, and make sure you make it out of here alive, you got that? We can't afford to lose good people like you.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "Okay, from what General Dodonna said, this information needs to get to Mon Mothma's hands herself. Let the General know that I'll make sure it safely gets to her. Thanks for your help with this.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_takeme_2", "Ugh... slowly... the rest of the team were killed by these... strange... things in the... jungle. Hurry... we have to get this... information back to General... Dodonna.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Why haven't you left yet?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Yes?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Did you have a question?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_work_4", "What do you need?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("npc_work_5", "You're not gone yet?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("otherescort", "I don't know who you are. Maybe you're here to meet the person that was a little over there...");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_1_1", "I'll help.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_1_2", "I'll go lead them here.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_1_3", "I'll take part of the operation.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_1_4", "I'll make sure it gets there.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_1_5", "I'll take it to him right away!");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_2_1", "Sorry, I don't have the time.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_2_2", "No, I'm a bit busy right now.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_2_3", "No thanks... a bit too scary for me.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_2_4", "I'm a bit busy right now. Maybe some other time.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_2_5", "I'm not running out with that information again. No.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_3_1", "Why are we evacuating the planet?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_3_2", "Who is this team I'm helping?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_3_3", "How is the Empire conducting the siege?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_3_4", "How were you able to find out so fast?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_3_5", "Wait... what if HE gets shot down?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_reset_1", "I can't do this mission for you anymore.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_reset_2", "I can't do this mission for you anymore.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_reset_3", "I can't do this mission for you anymore.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_reset_4", "I can't do this mission for you anymore.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_reset_5", "I can't do this mission for you anymore.");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "What did I need to do again?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "What did I need to do again?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_sorry_3", "What did I need to do again?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_sorry_4", "What did I need to do again?");
stringFiles[2242].addEntry("player_sorry_5", "What did I need to do again?");

stringFiles[2243] = new StringFile("theme_park_rebel/lt_lance");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("cantwork", "Greetings. I'm Lieutenant Lance - well, actually I'm Harrind Lance, but around here I'm the Lieutenant. I keep a clean operation around here, so if you have nothing you can contribute, I'm going to have to ask you to move out of the way. When you're not busy, we can talk.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "Move along. This area is restricted.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("dontknowyou_2", "Move along. This area is restricted.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "If you're not the suspect, then get out of here!");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("gotowork", "No, this is not the initialization codes for the shuttle. I need the codes.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("next", "Sorry, I'm just getting myself together before I go on assignment.  Can't talk now.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_1_1", "It's good to meet you, soldier. I've been told by Solo to expect you, and you arrived just in time. I need immediate assistance regarding a deployment that is about to go horribly wrong if it goes unchecked. I need you to go to location of our old abandoned base and harry the stormtroopers that are stationed there.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_1_2", "I've just received a transmission from Solo. He's in high orbit around Dantooine right now, and it seems he has a large shipment of bacta with him as well. Since my troops are still in transit from their successful operation, I'm short a few hands. Do you think you can help Solo land his YT-1300?");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_1_3", "I need your help to pull this off. I'm not too keen on the plan, but it's been approved by both Ackbar and Mon Mothma, so what can I do, eh? I need you to help steal an Imperial Lambda-Class shuttle. Do you want to involve yourself in this?");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_2_1", "That's the answer I wanted to hear. These coodinates will lead you to the last known location of a group of stormtroopers near our abandoned base. You need to harrass them to draw the attention of the Empire, then get out of there. In other words, go destroy them then hightail it out of there.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Well, I can't say I trust the reformed smuggler too much, but we need all the help we can get. You need to go to this landing area and remove any potential Imperial eyes. If you see any Probots or Stormtroopers, destroy them.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Here are the coordinates of a squadron of Stormtoopers that have landed from that shuttle. They are investigating an unauthorized landing, which was Solo of course. What I need you to do is to wipe out that squadron, and bring the pilot's initialization codes back here. I'll then be able to send a team to recover the shuttle.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Unless you're a different person than the person recommended by Han and Leia, then I don't understand. You ARE the one who helped them, right...?");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_3_2", "I can't say I blame you. I don't care how much Leia insists we can trust him, I'm still a bit sketchy about him. Either way, we still need the bacta. I'll give you a couple of minutes to think about it, then get back to me.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Sounds like you've got a solid head on your shoulders there. If I weren't ordered to oversee this plan, I wouldn't be part of it, either. If you change your mind, I wouldn't pass up your help, though.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_4_1", "Currently I have a covert operation in effect. A strike squad is about to perform a land based hit-and-fade maneuvre on an Imperial cargo landing site. We have just received word that a large detachment of Stormtroopers is about to set up a patrol around the area. Your attack will distract them long enough for us to finish the operation.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_4_2", "Well, I never believed he'd be able to get his hands on that much bacta to begin with. The answer is no, actually. This base is being used for now until we can find a more permanent one due to the fact that our Yavin base was found. This bacta is supposed to go out to Yavin to help with the siege, but Han can't get it there... for now, that is.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_4_3", "It seems that a bunch of Bothans that are helping the Alliance have come up with the idea to steal an Imperial shuttle, then change the authorization codes. They have managed to gather a number of codes to shuttles that they can use to replace the existing ones. I guess this is more an experiment than anything else. And I don't like it.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "Double-time, soldier! We have little time to spare!");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Double-time, soldier! Solo will have to land before he's spotted by a Star Destroyer patrol.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "He should have on him a numeric sequence that will start the shuttle. All Imperial Lambda shuttles have these security measures on them so no one comes running up to the shuttle and takes it. Which is, of course, what we're planning to do.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Sir, over there! We have movement!");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_breech_2", "Hey, there's one! Set blasters to stun!");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "You must be part of the group that landed! Eliminate the Rebel!");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Our intelligence shows that our strike team has all been wiped out. Every last one of them dead. Those were some good men and women. I hope you can sleep tonight.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "Solo has to land now before he's spotted by a Star Destoyer. I sure hope there's nothing out there that will find him when he lands.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "The pilot didn't have any codes on him? Oh well. I guess I'll tell Ackbar that this plan was a failure.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_noloc_1", "The location of the troops were around here a moment ago. Let me find them again, then get back to me.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_noloc_2", "Let me contact Han Solo and find out where he plans on landing. Once I've found out, check with me again.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_noloc_3", "Let me check these schematics so that we can triangulate the location of the stormtrooper squad. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "Unless you're a different person than the person recommended by Han and Leia, then I don't understand. You ARE the one who helped them, right...?");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "I can't say I blame you. I don't care how much Leia insists we can trust him, I'm still a bit sketchy about him. Either way, we still need the bacta. I'll give you a couple of minutes to think about it, then get back to me.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "Sounds like you've got a solid head on your shoulders there. If I weren't ordered to oversee this plan, I wouldn't be part of it, either. If you change your mind, I wouldn't pass up your help, though.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Well done. Well done, indeed. The strike team has just reported back in and the assault was a success. Thank you for your help. Now that it's not so hectic, let me introduce myself - I'm Harrind Lance, but you can call me Lieutenant. Your help here at our base will be a relief. I may have futher need of you later. For now, take a little R&R.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "Good work. I'm glad that Leia recommended you to us here. Keep this up, and I'm sure that Captain Ackbar may assign you to work for him. Take a breather for now, because I see something coming up that I can use you for.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Now that we have the initialization code, we can load up the shuttle and get most of this bacta to Yavin. I pity the person who is going to be piloting this mission. Thank you for your help, friend. I've been asked by Captain Ackbar to direct you to him. He's heard of you and needs your help.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_work_1", "You haven't left yet?");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Did you find anything out there?");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("npc_work_3", "What do you need?");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_1_1", "Understood. I can help.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_1_2", "Yeah, I can. Me and Solo go way back.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_1_3", "Sounds quite bold. Sure!");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_2_1", "Sorry, I don't think I can help.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_2_2", "Sorry, I've helped him too much already. No.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_2_3", "That's crazy! No, I won't be part of this.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_3_1", "What went wrong with the battle plan?");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_3_2", "Is this where the bacta shipment was originally headed?");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_3_3", "Back up there, Lieutenant. What kind of plan is this?");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_reset_1", "I'm sorry, but I can't do this.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_reset_2", "Sorry, but I'm tired of helping out Solo.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_reset_3", "Sorry, but I can be part of this hare-brained plan anymore.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_sorry_1", "You caught me as I was leaving.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_sorry_2", "You caught me as I was leaving.");
stringFiles[2243].addEntry("player_sorry_3", "What was I supposed to get from the pilot?");

stringFiles[2244] = new StringFile("theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("cantwork", "Hello there. I sure could use a hand out here, when you have the time.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("dontknowyou_1", "You're not the guy here to take me back? Well, where in the heck is he?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("dontknowyou_3", "Please... go send for help... tell my supervisor I have always loved him....");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("dontknowyou_5", "Ahh... you are not the one... you are someone elsssse... perhapsss you are to be initiated, yes?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("gotowork", "No, this isn't what I asked for. Could you come back with the right one, pleease?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("next", "I don't have anymore work for you.  The Alliance thanks you though.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("noloc_1", "Let me find out where the supervisor can be found. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("noloc_2", "What's that?... Hmmmm... I don't know why, but I feel I may know which way it went. Check with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("noloc_3", "Let me find out where he is. Check back in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("noloc_4", "Let me ask him where he was when he saw it. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("noloc_5", "Let me think where those guys are. I've never seen them before, but I have a good idea where they might be. Check back with me in a few minutes.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("notit", "This isn't what I asked you to bring me!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("notit_2", "No, no, no! This isn't the motivator for my R2 unit! I don't know what it is, but it's not a motivator!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("notit_4", "Nah, this doesn't look like what he described.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("notit_5", "Nooo.... the prophecy lied.... it said you would bring the knowledge of the master to us....");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("notyet", "I can't talk to you right now.  Go see Jan Dodonna if you need something to do.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_1_1", "Oh, hello! What's that? General Dodonna sent you to help me? Well, I sure could use a hand out here. This is hard work! Okay, we're evacuating a group of archaeologists and boarding them on a transport. I'll go get one of the work crews, but I'll need you to get the supervisor. Would that be alright?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_1_2", "Awwww maaann!!! Something took a big chunk out of my R2 unit. I saw a bunch of broken teeth lying on the ground, so at least it stopped before it could do any more damage. Look, I need you help me find the little creature that swallowed my R2 unit's motivator unit. Can you?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_1_3", "We've got some bad news, friend. I just spoke with the supervisor of this expedition team, and he says that they're missing one of the guys. He told me where the guy was last digging, but I need to make sure my R2 unit is fixed before we leave. Do you think you could go out and bring him back here?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_1_4", "Hey, I need you to do something. I'm going to try to patch this guy up before I take him to the transport. He said that he found a wierd looking box in the chamber that creature was in. Something tells me that box is important, and I really want to look at it. Can you go get it for me?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_1_5", "Hey, do you think you can do me one last favor?  Can you go deliver this box-thing to someone out in the jungle? This thing gives me the creeps, and for some reason I don't want the Imperials to find it after we leave. So, can you do this for me?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_2_1", "Okay, the supervisor has been contacted and told to wait for his escort. Once you find him, just bring him back here. I should be back with the rest of the crew in that time.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_2_2", "Okay, I'll go check this way, you go check that way. I'm not sure what took a bite out of my droid, but it didn't look too large judging by the teeth. It more than likely swallowed the part, so we'll have to cut the little bugger open, I guess. Meet me back here if you find it.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_2_3", "Thanks a lot, friend, I really appreciate it. By the time you get back with him, I should have my R2 unit fixed.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_2_4", "Good. I put on your datapad the area he said he found the box. He said he thought he saw two of those creatures, so the other one might have taken it by now. Do whatever you have to do to get it, but bring me back that box. It sounds... well, it sounds very interesting.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_2_5", "Great. You should be able to find a tribe of people out there in the jungles that will be will be waiting for this. Why, I don't know..... ummm... just go get it to them.... that thing makes me really uneasy...");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_3_1", "Weren't you supposed to be helping me? I can't do this all by myself! You mean you'll let me gather up everyone while you do nothing? That's not fair!!!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_3_2", "Well, I guess I'll go do it all by myself then. I wish you'd lend me hand!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_3_3", "Come on!!! All you have to do is go find the guy! Is it that hard of you to do?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_3_4", "What? Whatever... I guess I'll go do it myself.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_3_5", "What? Did you tell me No?? How dare you!?!? I'm Luke Skywalker, and my father was a powerful Jedi Knight!! Now, I'm going to give you a few minutes to think about what you said, and let you change your mind. Got it?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_4_1", "They were here on Yavin IV before we set up our base here. A few of them were Pro-Rebel, so they contacted Mon Mothma and General Dodonna saying that these temples would be a good base. Since they let us use their area while they were digging through the ruins, we are rather obligated to help them get out before they get hurt, wouldn't you say?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_4_2", "There's all kinds of wierd creatures in these jungles, I can't even begin to list them all. I grew up on Tatooine, ever heard of it? We had womp rats and kreetles out there, but some of these things give me the creeps! The only thing I can imagine being worse than living in a jungle is living in some kind of swamp. Ugh!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_4_3", "The supervisor says that this guy was working deep inside one of the temples and was insisting that he was about to make a discovery. Apparently the guy was so caught up in his work, he didn't bother to pay attention to the return call. It sounds simple, but look... I have a bad feeling about this, so be careful, okay?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_4_4", "I don't know. He said he had just a few moments to see what it looked like. From his description, it looks like some jeweled box in the shape of a pyramid. What is was doing being kept hidden in a temple, I can't say. I have a wierd feeling that the box is very, very important, though. What was that? Oh, sorry... I thought I heard you say something.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_4_5", "I don't know, to tell you the truth. It's weird looking, wouldn't you say? I've been looking for a way to open it, but I can't find anything. Huh? Sorry... I could've sworn you just said something. I have bad feeling about this thing, and don't want it around me anymore. Either way, I think someone named Kyp or maybe Exar owns it... don't ask me why, I just know.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_backtowork_1", "You need to find one of the supervisors of their expedition and bring him back here so that they can be transported off the planet.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_backtowork_2", "Look around for something about this big, missing some teeth. It should have my R2 unit's motivator on it or inside it's stomach. Bring it back when you find it.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_backtowork_3", "You need to find the last archaeologist that's out near the Massassi ruins. Once you find him, bring him back here.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_backtowork_4", "Go find the box that the archaeologist was describing, then bring it back so I can take a look at it.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_backtowork_5", "You need to get this box to a tribe of people out in the jungles. Once you deliver it to them, come on back.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_breech_1", "Ho there! Are you the guy who's going to bring me to the escape ship?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_breech_3", "Ohhhh... please.... help me. I've been bit by that thing and my vision is getting hazy....");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_breech_5", "Yesss.... you are the one that was foretold.... you have the blessed piece with you, correct?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_failure_1", "Did you just say that the supervisor was killed? Oh man... the General is going to kill me!!!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_failure_2", "You couldn't find it either? Well, I guess I'll have to try some tricky moves while I'm up there. Thanks for looking, though.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_failure_3", "You mean he was already dead when you go there? I'll have to tell this to the supervisor. You stay here.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_failure_4", "It was gone when you got there? That's a shame. You know what, though? Something tells me that box is still out there...");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_failure_5", "You couldn't find them out there? That's wierd. I know they're out there somewhere... well, I don't KNOW they're there, I just have a real good feeling they are.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reset", "What?! You can't be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don't help I'll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reset_1", "What?! You can't be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don't help I'll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reset_2", "What?! You can't be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don't help I'll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reset_3", "What?! You can't be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don't help I'll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reset_4", "What?! You can't be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don't help I'll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reset_5", "What?! You can't be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don't help I'll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reward_1", "Great work. I've gathered up all of the crew here, and now we can get them off the planet. Look, I need to get back to my X-Wing... I think I saw something lurking around it, and I can't afford to try to fly these guys escort if my ship is damaged. I'll be back in a bit.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reward_2", "You found it? We're saved! Thanks! I'll get this back to my R2 unit and fix it up. Fortunately I'm pretty good at fixing up droids and the like. It's like the way I fly, you know? It just comes to me. Check back with me in a little bit so we can get out of here.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reward_3", "Whoa! You took that thing all by yourself? If I would have known, I would have gone out there with you. I got this lightsaber from a friend... he said it was my dad's... and I've been wanting to practice with it. From the sound of it, that would have been good target practice. I'll get this guy onboard the ship, then we can leave.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reward_4", "Great! Now, let me take a look at this. Wow! It's gorgeous! Huh? Did you say something? Oh... sorry... must be hearing things. Anyways, I'll check this thing out to see if there's some way to open it. I bet you there's priceless treasure inside!!! Check back with me in a little bit to see if I found a way to open it. Huh? Oh.. uh.. nevermind.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_reward_5", "You gave it to them, right? You know, I already feel so much better with that thing gone. Anyways, thank you for your help, friend. I'm going to get these guys out of here now. Hmmm... you know something? This place is actually rather calming... I may have to come back here someday when the war is over. I kinda like it. Take care, friend.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_smuggle_5", "Oh...wonderfuuullll.... just as the prophecy said... may the Dark Lord look over you.....");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_takeme_1", "Great, let's get out of here then. I don't want to be left behind without a crew of diggers, if you know what I'm saying.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_takeme_3", "Oh, thank you so much. I don't think I could have made it back by myself. I want to get as far away from this planet as I can. Maybe then the voices will go away.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_work_1", "Did you forget something?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_work_2", "Yeah?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_work_3", "Did you need something before you left?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_work_4", "Are you going to get it yet?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("npc_work_5", "Have you taken it to them yet?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("otherescort", "Nope. You've got the wrong guy.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_1_1", "Of course I can help!");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_1_2", "I'll help you track it down.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_1_3", "I'll go get him.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_1_4", "Sure, I'll get it for you.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_1_5", "Sure, I'll do it.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_2_1", "Sorry, but I thought this would be more interesting. No.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_2_2", "Nevermind. I don't want to look for critters.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_2_3", "Sorry, Luke, but I don't do escort work.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_2_4", "No thanks. I'm not going back out there.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_2_5", "You know what? You do it yourself, Luke. I'm not going to.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_3_1", "What are archaelogists doing in our base?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_3_2", "What kinds of creatures are here on Yavin?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_3_3", "Why wasn't this guy with the rest of them?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_3_4", "What does this box look like?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_3_5", "What is that thing? Is it just a box for holding things?");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_reset", "I can't do this mission anymore.");
stringFiles[2244].addEntry("player_reset_1", "I can't do this mission anymore.");
