stringFiles[2258].addEntry("text_bountyhunter1", "The datadisk appears to contain the notes of a successful local bounty hunter.  Wedged between various questionable tips on the profession is a sidenote indicating the general location of the bounty hunter's equipment stash.You may add a waypoint to this location by pressing the 'Store Waypoint' button below.  Once you are near that waypoint, use the disk's 'Search Area' option to pinpoint the exact location of the treasure.  After you have pinpointed the treasure's location, dig it up using the 'Extract Treasure' option on the disk.");
stringFiles[2258].addEntry("text_hedon1", "This holo map was created by someone named Axkva Min several hundred years ago. The location it leads to is named Dragon Graveyard.");
stringFiles[2258].addEntry("text_pirate1", "You have found the diary of a famous and dreaded pirate captain.  Among the many embellished tales of his adventures, you find information on the possible location of a buried treasure.You may add a waypoint to this location by pressing the 'Store Waypoint' button below.  Once you are near that waypoint, use the disk's 'Search Area' option to pinpoint the exact location of the treasure.  After you have pinpointed the treasure's location, dig it up using the 'Extract Treasure' option on the disk.");
stringFiles[2258].addEntry("text_pirate2", "You have found the discarded logbook from a long since scuttled pirate ship.  The last entry refers to a location where the pirates may have buried their haul.You may add a waypoint to this location by pressing the 'Store Waypoint' button below.  Once you are near that waypoint, use the disk's 'Search Area' option to pinpoint the exact location of the treasure.  After you have pinpointed the treasure's location, dig it up using the 'Extract Treasure' option on the disk.");
