stringFiles[2261].addEntry("name_declined_cant_create_avatar", "You have sent an invalid message to the server while attempting to create a character name.It is possible that you have received this message in error, in which case you should contact Customer Service.It is also possible that you were doing this intentionally in order to attempt to hack the character creation process. Hacking the Star Wars Galaxies servers is a violation of the Terms of Service and can result in account termination and legal action.");
