stringFiles[2280].addEntry("help_designer_start", "This is the Image Design screen.  From this interface, you can modify the physical appearance of characters.  In addition, you can migrate player's stats and grant them Holo-Emotes, which give the player the ability to display certain visual effects.");
stringFiles[2280].addEntry("help_group", "Like in character creation, a character's customizations are broken up into multiple categories.  Click on these buttons to select a group for modification.");
stringFiles[2280].addEntry("help_hair", "This allows you to select the hair for a character.");
stringFiles[2280].addEntry("help_holoemotes", "Selecting one of these radio buttons will assign a Holo-Emote to a character.  These grant a command to players that are used to play visual effects.  They have a certain amount of charges, and a character may only have one active Holo-Emote command at a time.  A very skilled Image Designer can grant the All Holo-Emote to characters, which lets them select any Holo-Emote each time they use it.");
stringFiles[2280].addEntry("help_morph", "These sliders change customizations that use a range (like height, or lip size).");
stringFiles[2280].addEntry("help_recipient_commit", "Click this button to accept the changes and pay the offered credits.  This button is not available until the minimum amount of time has elapsed, and the Image Designer has committed their changes.");
stringFiles[2280].addEntry("help_recipient_credits", "This is how much money you are offering in return for the Image Designer's services.  The changes can not be made until you offer at least as much money as they require.");
stringFiles[2280].addEntry("help_recipient_data", "This window displays how much more time must be spent before the changes can be committed.  In addtion, it lists the minimum amount of money you are required to pay (feel free to pay more if you're generous).  It also lists whether your stats will be migrated, and what Holo-Emote the Designer is granting to you, if any.");
stringFiles[2280].addEntry("help_recipient_start", "An Image Designer is trying to change your appearance or migrate your stats.  You may click the Reject button at any time to end this process.");
stringFiles[2280].addEntry("help_recipient_zoom", "Use these buttons to zoom in and examine your character more closely.");
