stringFiles[2327].addEntry("lance_nightsister", "A Nightsister energy lance.This weapon required Advanced Polearm Stances to use.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("lance_staff_janta", "A Janta staff.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("lance_staff_metal", "A carefully balanced long metal shaft capable of delivering a crushing blow.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("lance_staff_wood_s1", "An effective weapon crafted from a solid, yet slightly flexible piece of wood.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("lance_staff_wood_s2", "An effective weapon crafted with a solid wooden shaft, flexible metallic core, durable iron surface, and crystalline balance tabs.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("lance_vibrolance", "A powered weapon that vibrates rapidly upon impact dramatically increasing the amount of damage delivered while minimizing the effort required by the wielder.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("lance_vibro_axe", "A vibro axe is a mundane-looking weapon with an ultrasonic generator in the handle. The ultrasonics reverberate along the blade edge, granting the user greater cutting power with less effort. It is among the deadliest weapons in close combat. ");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("laser_cannon_cooling_sleeve", "Laser cannons generate excessive heat while in use, and cooling sleeves are an important part of the sophisticated cooling system that is used to protect sensitive internal components.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("laser_cannon_cooling_sleve", "Laser cannons generate excessive heat while in use, and cooling sleeves are an important part of the sophisticated cooling system that is used to protect sensitive internal components.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("laser_cannon_gun_tube", "A gun-tube for a laser cannon.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("laser_magnetic_flashback_supressor", "A crescent-shaped device at the end of some laser barrels, a flashback suppressor is designed to prevent occasionally unstable laser beams from damaging the barrel.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("laser_rifle", "A laser rifle.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("metal_fasteners", "Metal fasteners used as snaps and buttons on clothing.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("mine_a_v", "An anti-vehicular mine can cause intensely destructive damage to enemy vehicles.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("mine_drx", "A DRX mine can inflict heavy damage to unsuspecting enemies.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("mine_xg", "A XG mine can inflict heavy damage to unsuspecting enemies.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol", "A small gun that can be fired with one hand, good for medium range combat.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_cdef", "A CDEF pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_cdef_corsec", "A Corsec-issued CDEF pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_d18", "A D18 pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_de_10", "The DE-10 pistol is used mainly by Death Watch soldiers.  Its blue bolts are common sights to their enemies, and its hefty weight gives it a feeling of being a formidable weapon in trained hands.This weapon requires Master Pistoleer for Certification.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_dh17", "A DH17 pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_dl44", "A DL-44 pistol");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_dl44_metal", "A DL-44 pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_dx2", "A DX2 pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_fgws", "A FWGS pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_fwg5", "A FWG5 pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_fwg5_quest", "A FWG5 pistol.This particular weapon has been crafted with ultra-lightweight materials. This provides the user with greater accuracy and mobility.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_fwgs", "A FWGS pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_geonosian_sonic_blaster", "Emits a concentration of sonic energy within a plasma containment sphere.  On striking the target, the sphere is broken releasing an omnidirectional blast of sonic energy.This weapon requires Pistol Techniques II to use.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_launcher", "Fires a suite of small target-seeking rockets with explosive tips.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_power5", "A Power5 pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_republic_blaster", "The venerable Naboo Security Forces side-arm.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_republic_blaster_quest", "The venerable Naboo Security Forces side-arm.This particular weapon has been fit with an inducer. The larger, faster energy bolt may cause bleeding in the target when hit.This weapon requires the Marksman skill Pistols 3 in order to wield it proficiently.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_scatter", "Spreads blaster bolts over a wider area than standard pistols.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_scout", "A Scout pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_scout_blaster", "A Scout Blaster pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_scout_blaster_corsec", "A Corsec-issued scout blaster pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_srcombat", "A SR Combat pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_striker", "A Striker pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_striker_noob", "A Striker pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("pistol_tangle", "A tangle pistol.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("projectile_feed_mechanism", "A projectile weapon's feed mechanism.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("projectile_pistol_barrel", "Projectile pistol barrels guide and direct projectiles that are propelled via a pistol's firing mechanism.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("projectile_rifle_barrel", "Projectile rifle barrels guide and direct projectiles that are propelled via a rifle's firing mechanism.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_acid_beam", "This weapon discharges lethal pulses of concentrated acid, and powerful streams of corrosive liquid.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_beam", "Emits a searing energy beam.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_berserker", "A slugthrower, mostly used by Imperial Special Tactical Forces.This weapon requires Rifle Abilities III to use.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_bowcaster", "The bowcaster is the traditional ranged weapon of Wookiees, and is quite powerful in the right hands.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_cdef", "A CDEF rifle.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_dlt20", "A DLT20 rifle.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_e11", "An E11 rifle.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_ewok_crossbow", "The primitive crossbow weapon is a stunning testament to Ewok ingenuity. Carefully constructed of endorian hardwood, the device features with a heavy resin-coated sinew that can shoot small, stone projectiles at lethal velocities.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_flame_thrower", "Produces a stream of fire by igniting flammable liquid held under high pressure.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_jawa_ion", "A Jawa Ionization rifle, these are generally cheaply made but are often effective at disabling droids and machinery.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_laser", "Laser rifles are designed for good damage at medium to long range.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_laser_noob", "Laser rifles are designed for good damage at medium to long range.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_lightning", "Emits bursts of concentrated electrical energy.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_quest_tusken", "The ancient long-rifle of a dreaded Tusken King who plagued the first settlers in Bestine for many cycles.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_sg82", "A SG82 rifle.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_spraystick", "A Spraystick rifle.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_t21", "A T21 rifle.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_tenloss_dxr6_disruptor", "Utilizing an oversized XCiter, the actuating blaster module can process a much greater volume of blaster gas, resulting in a devistating shot. This weapon requires Rifleman Counter-Sniping II to use.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_tusken", "A Tusken Raider's rifle.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rifle_victor_tusken", "The Lithitanium Rifle appears to be a direct copy of the Tusken Rifle, though built with an unknown metal component. It is light and well-balanced.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("rocket_launcher", "An extremely destructive weapon, a rocket launcher is not meant to be used by those who are unknowledgeable with its intricacies.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("scope_weapon", "A weapon's scope can increase its accuracy, if used.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("shield_generator_personal_b", "A medium-powered personal shield generator unit, used to reduce damage and increase the wearer's odds of surviving hostile encounters.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("shield_generator_personal_c", "A high-powered personal shield generator unit, used to reduce damage and increase the wearer's odds of surviving hostile encounters.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("shield_generator_personal_imperial_test", "A high-powered personal shield generator unit, used to reduce damage and increase the wearer's odds of surviving hostile encounters. It's a test prototype developed by the top scientists of the Empire.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("stock_unit", "A stock unit, used in rifle assembly.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_01", "Swords can vary greatly in effectiveness depending on the quality of the materials used and the skill of the Weaponsmith.  Some swords can be exceedingly sharp and sturdy, making them dangerous weapons in close combat.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_02", "Swords can vary greatly in effectiveness depending on the quality of the materials used and the skill of the Weaponsmith.  Some swords can be exceedingly sharp and sturdy, making them dangerous weapons in close combat.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_2h_axe", "Axes can vary greatly in effectiveness depending on the quality of the materials used and the skill of the Weaponsmith.  The heft of the axe, combined with its razor-sharp edge makes it a devastating weapon for medium-ranged combat.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_2h_axe_quest", "Axes can vary greatly in effectiveness depending on the quality of the materials used and the skill of the Weaponsmith.  The heft of the axe, combined with its razor-sharp edge makes it a devastating weapon for medium-ranged combat.This battleaxe, having previously been used by the Gamorrean guards in Jabba's palace, is tarnished and unclean. The tainted edge of this weapon may infect the target with disease when struck.This weapon requires the Brawler skill Two-Handed 2 in order to wield it proficiently.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_2h_blacksun_hack", "The Executioner's Hack is a favorite weapon of Black Sun operatives.  It's balanced as a two-handed weapon, and its light weight allows it to be used like a sword.This weapon requires Swordsman - Techniques II for certification.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_2h_cleaver", "Swords can vary greatly in effectiveness depending on the quality of the materials used and the skill of the Weaponsmith.  Some swords can be exceedingly sharp and sturdy, making them dangerous weapons in close combat.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_2h_katana", "Swords can vary greatly in effectiveness depending on the quality of the materials used and the skill of the Weaponsmith.  Some swords can be exceedingly sharp and sturdy, making them dangerous weapons in close combat.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_2h_katana_quest", "A long and gently curved sword, exceedingly sharp and sturdy, making it a dangerous weapon in close combat.This particular weapon has a narrow groove running down the flat of the blade. Bleeding may occur in the target when struck by this sword.This weapon requires the Brawler skill Two-Handed 2 in order to wield it proficiently.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_2h_maul", "Although they are invariably destructive in close-quarter combat, Battle Hammers may vary greatly in effectiveness depending on the quality of the materials used and the skill of the Weaponsmith.  Mauls and battle hammers are designed to deliver extra-heavy blows in melee combat, leaving bone-crushing damage in their wake.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_2h_scythe", "A scythe blade.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_blade_rantok", "This forged steel sword was the traditional weapon of the Unfyr Warriors of the Ka'hren.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_blade_ryyk", "A weapon that finds its origin on Kashyyyk, the ryyk blade is the traditional melee weapon carried by a Wookiee.  Ryyk blades can vary in design based on their specific origin, but generally consist of sharpened blades with hide-wrapped grips.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_core", "The core of a sword.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_curved_nyax", "A sword used by a follower of Lord Nyax.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_lightsaber", "A lightsaber.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_lightsaber_2h", "A two-handed lightsaber.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_lightsaber_gen1", "This lightsaber will not power on without one color crystal inside.  This version of saber may hold two crystals.A Traditional Jedi weapon, it consists of a cylindrical handle in which sophisticated circuits channel a beam of light through a series of crystals.  These crystals modulate the blade's size and amplitude. When activated, internal power cells create photoelectric energy which is focused through the crystals.  The energy is formed into a tight, parallel beam of coherent packets. These packets are emitted through a positively-charged continuous energy lens which projects the packets away from the lightsaber. The packets are almost immediately attracted back to the lightsaber by a negatively-charged high-energy flux aperture, and then continually recycled to create the glowing blade. The packets are recycled by a superconductor back into the power cell for re-energizing. The entire process is completely contained. No heat is generated and no energy is lost, since the light in the blade is recaptured.  The only energy loss occurs when the blade strikes an object causing crystal decay. ");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_lightsaber_gen1_2h", "This lightsaber will not power on without one color crystal inside.  This version of saber may hold two crystals.A Traditional Jedi weapon, it consists of a cylindrical handle in which sophisticated circuits channel a beam of light through a series of crystals.  These crystals modulate the blade's size and amplitude. When activated, internal power cells create photoelectric energy which is focused through the crystals.  The energy is formed into a tight, parallel beam of coherent packets. These packets are emitted through a positively-charged continuous energy lens which projects the packets away from the lightsaber. The packets are almost immediately attracted back to the lightsaber by a negatively-charged high-energy flux aperture, and then continually recycled to create the glowing blade. The packets are recycled by a superconductor back into the power cell for re-energizing. The entire process is completely contained. No heat is generated and no energy is lost, since the light in the blade is recaptured.  The only energy loss occurs when the blade strikes an object causing crystal decay.");
