stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_lightsaber_lance", "A lightsaber lance.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_lightsaber_training", "This lightsaber will not power on without one color crystal inside.  This version of saber may hold one crystal.A Traditional Jedi weapon, it consists of a cylindrical handle in which sophisticated circuits channel a beam of light through a series of crystals.  These crystals modulate the blade's size and amplitude. When activated, internal power cells create photoelectric energy which is focused through the crystals.  The energy is formed into a tight, parallel beam of coherent packets. These packets are emitted through a positively-charged continuous energy lens which projects the packets away from the lightsaber. The packets are almost immediately attracted back to the lightsaber by a negatively-charged high-energy flux aperture, and then continually recycled to create the glowing blade. The packets are recycled by a superconductor back into the power cell for re-energizing. The entire process is completely contained. No heat is generated and no energy is lost, since the light in the blade is recaptured.  The only energy loss occurs when the blade strikes an object causing crystal decay.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("sword_nyax", "A sword used by a follower of Nyax.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("tuning_cell", "A tuning cell.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("turbo_laser_gun_tube", "This is the gun tube for a turbolaser.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("vibroknuckler", "A blunt melee weapon equipped with a vibro-unit.  These are held in one hand, and can badly injure or kill an enemy.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("vibro_unit", "A vibro-unit can turn a normal blade or axe into a much more destructive weapon by creating thousands of microscopic vibrations a second, greatly improving its cutting ability.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("victor_baton_gaderiffi", "Black Metal Gaderiffi Baton seems to have been made with an ink-like metal. It is light, durable and well-balanced.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("voltage_inducer", "A voltage inducer.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("warhead_chemical", "This warhead is designed to disperse lethal chemicals.");
stringFiles[2327].addEntry("warhead_fusing_mechanism", "This is responsible for the warhead fuse's ignition.");
