stringFiles[2329].addEntry("armor_chitin_s01_bicep_l", "Chitin armor is made from the exoskeleton of large insect creatures. Depending on the skill of the craftsman and the type of insect carcas used, armor can vary greatly in its protective traits. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. Most armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn. Superior armor provides greater protection while minimizing this disadvantage.");
